window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"[ASAP] 使用 Nax+2ySn4–yS8·3H2O (NMS-7) 从酸性介质中选择性去除铅和镉的非常规机制","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14558","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Metal sulfide ion exchangers (MSIEs) are promising sorbents for the selective removal of toxic heavy metals from water, yet their ion exchange mechanisms in acidic media remain poorly understood. Here we revisit the layered MSIE Na2Sn2.5S6·3H2O (NMS-7), establish its true composition and structure by MicroED and complementary spectroscopy, and contrast it with the related but nonexchanging phase Na4Sn2S6. NMS-7 combines accessible Na+ sites in a SnS2-derived framework with interlayer water, enabling rapid chemisorptive uptake of Pb2+ and Cd2+, with equilibrium reached within 20 min and capacities of 382 and 217 mg/g at pH ≈ 5, consistent with an ideal 2Na+/M2+ exchange stoichiometry. The material maintains high removal efficiencies across a broad pH window and in complex matrices, while the protonated solid acid H2Sn2.5S6 (HMS-7) formed in strong acid, exhibits reduced, incomplete exchange. PXRD, S/TEM, solid state NMR, and Pb L3-edge EXAFS reveals that Pb and Cd uptake in acidic media does not proceed by classical intercalation but through an inhomogeneous mechanism where protonated and metal-rich domains coexist within the same crystallites; in particular, atomically resolved HRTEM directly images nanoscale banded contrast associated with alternating metal rich and metal poor regions, while EXAFS analysis reveal two distinct first shell Pb-S coordination environments distinct from bulk PbS. Our findings define NMS-7 as a structurally well-defined, high-performance sorbent and show that local probes are essential to resolve coupled protonation and metal exchange governing soft divalent cation behavior in layered MSIEs.","tp":"重金属去除","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"金属硫化物离子交换剂是选择性去除水中有毒重金属的 promising 吸附剂，但在酸性介质中的机制尚不清晰。研究通过MicroED和光谱技术确定了层状材料NMS-7的真实组成与结构，揭示其SnS₂衍生框架中的可及Na⁺位点和层间水共同促进了Pb²⁺和Cd²⁺的高效选择性去除，为废水处理吸附剂设计提供了新见解。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 基于Hammett常数工程化苯甲酸衍生物调控空穴收集单分子层用于倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04072","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿空穴传输层","kp":["空穴收集层[反式钙钛矿电池]: Hammett常数工程化苯甲酸衍生物"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Tuning Hole-Collecting Monolayers with Hammett Constant-Engineered Benzoic Acid Derivatives for Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells"},{"t":"[ASAP] 化学燃料自催化和界面重塑驱动的凝聚层瞬时区室化","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18600","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Membraneless organelles (MLOs) exhibit hierarchical and dynamic architectures essential for cellular regulation, yet recreating such structural complexity synthetically remains a fundamental challenge. Here, we introduce a chemically fueled dissipative reaction network that programs the hierarchical evolution of coacervate droplets through coupled reactions, assembly, and interfacial editing. The system is built on a thiol-thioester exchange that autocatalytically generates surfactant micelles, which subsequently undergo electrostatic complexation to form liquid-like coacervates. A subsequent thiol-disulfide cascade produces an asymmetric aromatic surfactant (6) that selectively enriches at droplet interfaces via cation-π and π-π interactions. This interfacial adsorption triggers symmetry breaking and cavity nucleation within the droplets. Subsequent interfacial softening, fusion-driven reorganization, and kinetic trapping yield stable multicompartmental architectures, while hydrolysis-mediated dissipation ensures system reversibility. Our work establishes a minimal yet programmable chemical platform that integrates autocatalysis, liquid-liquid phase separation (LLPS), and interfacial remodeling to achieve spatiotemporal control over condensate morphology. Beyond offering a mechanistic model for dissipative phase separation, this system provides a versatile strategy to couple reaction networks with self-assembly, paving the way toward adaptive soft materials with life-like organizational complexity.","tp":"凝聚层区室化","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究者构建了一种化学燃料驱动的耗散反应网络，通过耦合反应、组装和界面编辑，编程控制凝聚层液滴的层级演化。该系统基于硫醇-硫酯交换反应自催化生成表面活性剂胶束，实现了无膜细胞器（MLOs）动态层级结构的合成模拟，为合成生物学中瞬时区室化提供了全新范式。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过分子尺度距离调控实现厚度不敏感阴极界面层用于高效有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16273","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["阴极界面层[有机太阳能电池]: 分子尺度距离调控,厚度不敏感"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过分子尺度距离调控开发了一种厚度不敏感的阴极界面层，用于高效有机太阳能电池。有机太阳能电池中，阴极界面层通常对厚度极其敏感，过厚会导致串联电阻增大和效率下降，这严重制约了大规模卷对卷印刷工艺的应用。该工作通过精确设计界面层分子的空间排列和距离调控，使界面层在较宽厚度范围内保持高效电荷提取能力，有效解决了厚度敏感性问题，为实现大面积、高效率有机太阳能电池的工业化制备提供了关键突破。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Thickness-Insensitive Cathode Interlayer via Molecular-Scale Distance Regulation for Efficient Organic Solar Cells","b":"Cathode interlayers (CILs) are critical for optimizing the performance of organic solar cells (OSCs). However, the development of thickness-insensitive cathode interlayer materials (CIMs) suitable for large-scale printing remains an urgent yet underexplored challenge. In this work, we present a molecular-scale distance regulation strategy to design efficient CIMs by precisely tuning the flexible conjugation-break spacer lengths between n-type organic semiconducting units. Using this approach, we synthesized three CIMs (P3, P6, and P9) with trimethylene, hexamethylene, and nonamethylene spacers linking the 4,5,9,10-pyrene diimide (PyDI) acceptor units. Among them, P6 demonstrates optimal π-π stacking, efficient Br- doping, and enhanced conductivity, leading to improved charge collection and exciton utilization. As a result, P6-based binary and ternary OSCs achieved remarkably high power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 19.90 and 20.04%, respectively. Importantly, P6 exhibits excellent batch-to-batch consistency (<1.5% PCE variation across molecular weights of 6.9-33.8 kDa), outstanding thickness tolerance (retaining 80% PCE at 133 nm), and scalability (17.26% PCE for a 1.05 cm2 device and 15.12% PCE for a 13.5 cm2 module). This facile approach for designing high-performance thickness-insensitive CIMs paves the way for the industrial-scale production of efficient OSCs."},{"t":"[ASAP] 机器学习引导M-N-C单原子电催化剂配位工程实现高效氧还原","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20189","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子ORR电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[ORR]: M-N-C单原子,机器学习指导配位工程"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用机器学习指导M–N–C单原子电催化剂的配位工程，实现优异的氧还原反应（ORR）性能。单原子催化剂因其最大原子利用率和可调控活性位点成为电催化领域热点。研究者构建了机器学习模型关联金属中心配位环境与催化活性，高通量筛选并预测最优配位构型，实验验证了预测催化剂在ORR中的出色活性和稳定性。该方法将数据驱动的材料发现与实验验证相结合，显著加速了高效燃料电池和金属-空气电池电催化剂的研发进程。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Machine Learning-Guided Coordination Engineering of M–N–C Single-Atom Electrocatalysts for Superior Oxygen Reduction","b":"Precisely tailoring metal-nitrogen-carbon (M-N-C) single-atom catalysts (SACs) with high catalytic activity and selectivity for specific chemical reactions remains challenging due to the lack of a qualitative descriptor between their catalytic properties and coordination geometries. Herein, we bridge this gap by integrating density functional theory (DFT) calculations with machine learning (ML) algorithms to deconvolute the electrocatalytic oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) activity of M-N-C SACs across various possible coordination configurations. By correlating the theoretical overpotentials with structural features, an interpretable descriptor simultaneously reflecting the coordination number and the metal-support interaction is identified. This descriptor not only reliably describes the ORR performance trends across diverse metal centers in SACs but also provides a general guideline for engineering coordination geometry to optimize catalytic performance. Guided by these insights, the predicted Cu-SAC featuring low-coordinated Cu-N3 moieties is synthesized, delivering remarkable ORR activity compared with the conventional Cu-N4 sites while maintaining robust structural stability under prolonged electrochemical operation. This study highlights the exceptional potential of interpretable ML combined with theoretical and experimental strategies in elucidating complex structure-property relationships in SACs and accelerating the development of next-generation electrocatalysts for sustainable and efficient energy conversion."},{"t":"[ASAP] 螺联吡啶配体远程区域控制：铱催化芳烃间位选择性C-H硅基化","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21089","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱催化C-H硅烷化","kp":["催化剂[C-H硅烷化]: 铱+螺联吡啶配体","选择性[芳烃C-H]: 间位选择性"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究实现了铱催化的芳烃间位选择性C–H硅烷化反应，通过螺环双吡啶配体实现的远程区域控制策略。芳烃C–H键官能化通常优先发生在邻位和对位，间位选择性是一大挑战。该工作设计了新型螺环双吡啶配体，通过铱催化剂与配体协同作用实现远程控制，使硅基化反应高选择性地发生在间位。该反应提供了合成芳基硅烷的高效新路径，芳基硅烷在药物合成和材料科学中有广泛应用，该成果丰富了C–H键活化和远程催化控制的工具箱。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Iridium-Catalyzed meta-Selective C–H Silylation of Arenes Enabled by Remote Regiocontrol with a Spirobipyridine Ligand","b":"Organosilicon derivatives are important compounds in industry and valuable synthetic intermediates in organic synthesis. Direct introduction of the silicon functionality is an attractive, straightforward synthetic approach to these compounds; however, previously reported catalytic silylation of arenes has suffered from poor site-selectivity. We report that an iridium catalyst in combination with a spirobipyridine ligand selectively silylates mono- and disubstituted arenes at the meta position relative to the larger substituent. The catalyst recognizes the shape of the organic substrate through remote steric interactions to control the site-selectivity, applicable to a variety of functional groups."},{"t":"[ASAP] 利用多核固态核磁共振波谱鉴定胶体氧化锌纳米晶体的表面氢官能团","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15840","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The surface hydrogen species of zinc oxide (ZnO) nanocrystals, including hydroxyl groups and water, play critical roles in determining their chemical reactivity, colloidal stability, and optoelectronic properties. However, direct structural identification of these surface species remains challenging due to their complex nature and surface disorder of the nanocrystals. Here, we present a comprehensive analysis of surface functionalities on sol-gel synthesized ZnO nanocrystals using advanced multinuclear and multidimensional solid-state nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy, combined with density functional theory (DFT) theoretical calculations. By employing 1H, 7Li, 13C, 17O, and 31P NMR, alongside the use of deuterated precursors, 17O isotope labeling, probe molecules, defect analysis, and electron paramagnetic resonance (EPR) spectroscopy, we resolve and assign eight distinct hydrogen species, including acetate and lithium acetate ligands, chemisorbed and physisorbed water, terminal hydroxyls (OHT), tribridged hydroxyls (μ3-OH), and defect-associated hydroxyls. Furthermore, 1H-1H homonuclear correlation SSNMR experiments elucidate the crystal facet selectivity and spatial interactions of these surface hydrogen species. Our study establishes an in-depth understanding of the rich surface hydrogen landscape on ZnO nanocrystals and offers a framework for the rational design and functional tuning of ZnO-based nanomaterials.","tp":"氧化锌表征","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"ZnO纳米晶表面氢物种（包括羟基和水）对化学反应性、胶体稳定性和光电性质具有关键影响，但直接结构鉴定因表面无序性而极具挑战。研究利用先进的多核固态核磁共振波谱对溶胶-凝胶合成的ZnO纳米晶体表面官能团进行了全面分析，为精确表征纳米材料表面化学提供了重要方法学进展。"},{"t":"[尽快]逆合成分析中多个局部计算模型的开发：(−)-脱氧柠檬苦素的全合成","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21055","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"This work describes the development of a de novo strategy to access the A,D-seco limonoids utilizing robust synthetic operations allowing for the synthesis of a characteristic member, deoxylimonin. The retrosynthetic strategy uses resilient chemistry for the assemblage of a key carbocyclic tricycle in only 8 synthetic maneuvers. This intermediate is then amalgamated through a modern variation on the classic combination of ring cleavage and formation using an oxy-Michael reaction as a key synthetic operation. Two discrete local computational models were developed and rapidly integrated into the design stages of retrosynthetic analysis, illustrating how multiple local models augment the intersection of transform-based and structure-goal-based approaches.","tp":"全合成策略","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"该工作报道了一种从头设计的合成策略来构建A,D-断环柠檬苦素类化合物，以脱氧柠檬苦素为代表产物。逆合成分析采用稳健化学操作，仅需8步即可组装关键碳环三环中间体，随后通过氧-Michael反应等关键步骤完成环断裂与形成的现代变体，实现了复杂天然产物的高效全合成。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 对“飞秒时间分辨库仑爆炸探测的氨二聚体阳离子的构象敏感核动力学”的修正","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c00593","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"[ASAP] 限域手性Pd(II)催化剂实现烯烃对映选择性分子内氨基烷基化：一步构建手性N-稠合双环骨架","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18705","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钯催化","kp":["催化剂[对映选择性氨基烷基化]: 限域手性Pd(II)","产物[一步合成]: 手性N-稠合双环"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用限域手性Pd(II)催化剂实现了烯烃的对映选择性分子内氨基烷基化反应，一步构建手性N-稠合双环骨架。手性含氮双环结构广泛存在于生物活性天然产物和药物分子中，其高效构建是有机合成的重要挑战。该工作设计了具有手性微环境的限域钯催化剂，通过精确的空间限域效应控制反应的区域选择性和对映选择性，高效合成了多种手性N-稠合杂双环化合物。该方法步骤经济、立体控制优异，为复杂含氮杂环药物中间体的合成提供了实用工具。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Confined Chiral Pd(II) Catalyst-Enabled Enantioselective Intramolecular Aminoalkylation of Alkenes: One-Step Construction of Chiral N-Fused Bicyclic Skeletons","b":"Highly enantioselective intramolecular aminoalkylation of unactivated alkenes has been accomplished for the first time through the development of a novel category of confined chiral Pd(II) catalysts consisting of two axially chiral picolinic acid ligands. A variety of polycyclic compounds, featuring a saturated chiral N-fused 6/5 or 7/5 bicyclic skeleton, were synthesized in moderate to good yields with excellent enantiomeric ratios (up to 99.5:0.5) through the formation of both a C-N bond and a C-C bond in a single synthetic step."},{"t":"[ASAP] 可调节凝聚层基质模拟胚胎细胞外基质 (ECM) 生物物理线索来调节干细胞命运","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16913","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"During early embryogenesis, the uterine environment undergoes marked biophysical changes that guide the embryonic cell fate. However, replicating these stage-specific cues in vitro remains challenging. Herein, we introduce a gelatin-based coacervate matrix with phase-transition-mediated tunable mechanics to recapitulate the biophysical cues of pre- and peri-implantation stages. Driven by reversible hydrophobic interactions, liquid-liquid phase separation produces coacervates with ultradynamic structures that enable dramatic volume expansion during cell proliferation in preimplantation stage. Furthermore, the liquid-like coacervate emulates the loosely organized immature extracellular matrix (ECM) of the uterine fluid environment, providing moderate cell-matrix interactions that preserve stemness. Additionally, the coacervate-solution transition allows the efficient harvesting of highly viable embryonic stem cell colonies. Moreover, upon stiffening through the coacervate-hydrogel transition, the matrix promotes peri-implantation-like invasive behaviors, including enhanced cell-matrix adhesion and secretion of ECM-degrading enzymes. These findings establish the biomimetic coacervate matrix as a versatile platform for clonal growth, stemness maintenance, and lineage initiation, offering new opportunities for developmental modeling and therapeutic applications.","tp":"干细胞基质","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"胚胎早期发育中子宫环境经历显著的生物物理变化以引导胚胎细胞命运，但在体外复制这些阶段性线索仍具挑战。研究引入一种基于明胶的凝聚层基质，通过相变介导的可调控力学性能模拟着床前和着床期的生物物理线索。可逆疏水相互作用驱动的液-液相分离产生超动态凝聚层，为干细胞命运调控提供了新型仿生平台。"},{"t":"果蝇腺胃缺乏干细胞，但通过内复制介导的细胞生长来补偿与年龄相关的细胞损失","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68876-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The Drosophila proventriculus is a bulb-shaped structure at the juncture of the foregut and the midgut, which plays important roles in ingestion, peritrophic membrane synthesis, and the immune response to oral pathogens. A previous study identified a population of cells in the proventriculus which incorporate bromodeoxyuridine (BrdU), a marker of DNA synthesis, and proposed that these cycling cells are multipotent stem cells that replace dying cells elsewhere in the tissue. Here, we re-investigate these cycling cells and find that they do not undergo mitosis, do not generate clonal lineages, and do not proliferate in response to tissue damage, and are therefore not stem cells. Instead, we find that these cells continually endocycle throughout the fly’s life, increasing their ploidy and size, while at the same time cells in this tissue are lost into the gut lumen as the fly ages. Functionally, these cells play a critical role in the synthesis of peritrophic membrane components, and we show that when their endocycling is experimentally increased or decreased, there is a concomitant change in ploidy, tissue size, and peritrophic membrane synthesis. Further, we show that inhibition of endocycling makes flies more susceptible to orally infectious bacteria. Altogether, we show that continual endocycling of these cells is critical for maintaining tissue size and function in the face of cell loss due to aging or tissue damage."},{"t":"抑制氢转移与芳构化反应实现聚乙烯高效光热转化为平台烯烃","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519453?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯光热回收","kp":["回收路径[聚乙烯]: 光热催化转化为平台烯烃","副反应抑制[PE回收]: 抑制氢转移和芳构化"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究报道了一种高效光热催化回收聚乙烯（PE）的新策略，通过抑制氢转移和芳构化副反应，将PE高选择性地转化为平台烯烃。传统聚烯烃热解产物复杂、选择性低，该工作通过精准调控催化剂和反应条件，有效遏制了不期望的副反应路径，大幅提升了目标烯烃的产率与选择性。该技术为废弃塑料的化学升级回收提供了潜在的闭环碳循环方案，对解决塑料污染和碳资源利用具有战略意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Suppressing Hydrogen Transfer and Aromatization Reactions Enables Efficient Photothermal Recycling of Polyethylene into Platform Olefins","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The recycling of polyethylene (PE) into highly selective platform olefins holds great promise as a potential closed‐loop recycling route that minimizes dependence on the petrochemical industries, whereas the selectivity of olefins is mainly limited by two side reactions: hydrogen transfer and aromatization. Herein, we present a photothermal recycling pathway that effectively converts various types of PE into highly selective olefins using ZnCrO\n                    x\n                    /HZSM‐5 composite catalyst, with efficaciously suppressing both side reactions. The inclusion of ZnCrO\n                    x\n                    modifies catalyst acidity to inhibit the hydrogen transfer reaction, while jointly establishing an intra‐catalyst spatial temperature gradient through distinct photothermal responses between ZnCrO\n                    x\n                    and HZSM‐5 whereby the endothermic aromatization can be suppressed. This strategy achieves an impressive selectivity of 75.4% for C\n                    2\n                    –C\n                    5\n                    hydrocarbons, with 84.7% of them being C\n                    2\n                    –C\n                    5\n                    olefins, in the photothermal recycling of low‐density PE (LDPE) under atmospheric pressure using Xe lamp irradiation. Further, the demonstrated universality across various PE feedstocks (e.g., high‐density PE and commercial LDPE bags) and concentrated sunlight operation highlights a solar‐powered plastic‐to‐olefin platform with industrial viability."},{"t":"熵驱动自组装构建应力均质化空间结构实现高性能持久锂提取","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525797123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"盐湖提锂","kp":["材料[电化学提锂]: LiMn₂O₄(LMO)","退化原因[LMO循环]: 各向异性体积变化致应力积累","应力均化策略[提锂]: 熵驱动两亲性自组装"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种基于熵驱动自组装的应力均匀化空间结构，用于高性能、长寿命的电化学锂提取。从盐湖卤水中高效提锂是能源转型的关键环节，但现有电化学提锂方法面临结构稳定性差、循环寿命短等瓶颈。该工作利用熵驱动自组装构建均匀化的三维架构，有效分散机械应力，显著提升了锂离子选择性提取的容量保持率和耐久性，为大规模可持续锂资源开发提供了新材料设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Stress-homogenized spatial architectures via entropy-driven self-assembly enabling high-performance and durable lithium extraction","b":"The global transition to sustainable energy demands efficient lithium extraction from brines. While electrochemical lithium extraction using LiMn\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (LMO) holds great promise, its practical application is hindered by mechanical degradation caused by anisotropic volume changes and stress accumulation during cycling. Herein, we present an entropy-driven amphiphilic self-assembly strategy that engineers stress-homogenized multilayer core–shell architectures, which innovatively mitigates stress accumulation by tuning the internal geometric structure to optimize stress–strain behavior, thereby synergistically enhancing ion distribution, transport kinetics, and electrochemical stability. This hierarchical interlayer architecture ensures uniform Li\n                    +\n                    distribution and redistributes internal stresses, mitigating localized stress concentrations and lattice expansion to preserve structural integrity throughout cycling. The optimized LMO establishes a dual benchmark for both capacity and cycling stability in hybrid capacitive deionization, achieving a remarkable lithium extraction capacity of 4.78 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    with 96% retention over 100 cycles, outperforming both its unoptimized counterpart and other reported materials of the same type. Finite element simulations further elucidate a 48% reduction in maximum stress compared to disordered counterparts, underscoring the critical coupling between ion diffusion and stress evolution. This paradigm provides a pathway for developing advanced materials with intrinsically stable architectures for sustainable lithium extraction."},{"t":"低缺陷浓度单晶BaxSr1-xTaO2N固溶体光催化剂用于太阳能驱动水分解","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68848-9","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","kp":["晶体质量[BaxSr1-xTaO2N]: 单晶低缺陷浓度","光吸收范围[BaxSr1-xTaO2N]: >600nm"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了单晶态Ba_xSr_1-xTaO2N固溶体型钙钛矿氮氧化物光催化剂，具有低缺陷浓度，用于太阳能驱动水分解制氢。钽基氮氧化物因带隙适中被认为是水分解的理想候选材料，但多晶样品中大量晶界缺陷限制了催化效率。通过单晶固溶体策略有效降低缺陷态密度，减少了光生载流子的复合损失，显著提升了光催化全分解水性能。该工作为高效太阳能制氢材料的缺陷工程提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution photocatalyst with low defect concentrations for solar-driven water splitting","b":"Perovskite-type tantalum-based oxynitride photocatalysts are promising candidates for water splitting due to their suitable band positions and extended light absorption beyond 600 nm. However, their associated photocatalytic activities and quantum yields remain relatively low. Here, we show that a nano-sized single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution perovskite photocatalyst exhibits state-of-the-art activity in separate oxygen and hydrogen evolution half-reactions. The improved performance is attributed to the nanoscale particle sizes, as well as the reduced defect densities achieved by using a mixed precursor comprising TaS2 and Ta3N5. The half-reaction activities can be modulated by applying a post-synthetic high-temperature treatment. Assessments of charge carrier dynamics, in conjunction with a mechanistic kinetic model, reveal that exponential-tail trap states are formed during this post-treatment. Such trap states, present on the photocatalyst surface, facilitate participation of holes during the oxygen evolution reaction. The development of such solid-solution photocatalysts broadens the range of potential materials for solar-driven hydrogen production. In addition, the present findings are expected to enable the selective tuning of bifunctional photocatalysts for either the hydrogen or oxygen evolution reaction.","aip":1},{"t":"有序异质界面实现温度不敏感的超高储能多层陶瓷电容器","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520618?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"陶瓷储能电容器","kp":["异质界面策略[无铅MLCC]: 嵌入平行Al₂O₃片层","目标性能[MLCC]: 高储能密度+优异热稳定性"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过构建有序异质界面，实现了兼具高储能密度和优异热稳定性的无铅多层陶瓷电容器（MLCC）。无铅陶瓷电容器在高温环境下同时满足高储能密度和温度稳定性是长期挑战。该工作利用有序异质界面调控极化行为，使材料在宽温域内保持稳定的介电响应和击穿强度，实现了超高的能量存储密度。该成果对极端环境下的电子器件、脉冲功率系统和新能源装备具有重要应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Ordered Heterogeneous Interfaces Enable Temperature‐Insensitive and Ultrahigh‐Energy‐Storage Multilayer Ceramic Capacitors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving both high energy storage density and excellent thermal stability in lead‐free multilayer ceramic capacitors (MLCCs) has long been a critical challenge for advanced electronic systems. To address this issue, we propose an innovative strategy to simultaneously improve both properties by constructing ordered heterogeneous interfaces through embedding parallel‐aligned Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    plates in 0.6SrTiO\n                    3\n                    ‐0.4Bi\n                    0.5\n                    Na\n                    0.5\n                    TiO\n                    3\n                    (0.6ST‐0.4BNT) lead‐free ceramics. This approach effectively suppresses the charge carrier injection and transport, yielding an ultrahigh recoverable energy storage density of 16.0 J cm\n                    −3\n                    with a giant breakdown strength of 1140 kV cm\n                    −1\n                    in Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    modified 0.6ST‐0.4BNT based MLCCs, which outperforms most state‐of‐the‐art dielectric ceramics. Furthermore, the MLCCs exhibit superior thermal stability with variation less than 3% across a broad temperature range of 20–160 °C. The overall superior performance underscores the potential of the ordered heterogeneous interface engineering in advancing the thermally stable high‐density energy storage materials for next‐generation MLCC applications."},{"t":"守门人 InvE 的寡聚组装协调鼠伤寒沙门氏菌的分级 III 型蛋白分泌","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530441123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Type III secretion systems (T3SS) are critical virulence machines in many Gram-negative bacteria, enabling hierarchical secretion of translocases followed by effectors. In the\n                    \n                      Salmonella enterica\n                    \n                    serovar Typhimurium SPI-1 T3SS, the regulatory protein InvE (SctW) enforces this order. Here, we show that InvE assembles into tetramers and higher-order oligomers and that oligomerization is essential for function. A 2.4 Å cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structure reveals a tetramer built as a dimer of antiparallel dimers. Photocrosslinking maps one set of residues to the interdimer seams in this tetramer, while crosslinks from additional sites suggest lateral docking between dimers in alternative registries in vivo. Blue-native electrophoresis and SEC–MALS detect native high-molecular-weight species consistent with such assemblies. DNA-PAINT superresolution microscopy confirms the presence of higher-order InvE oligomers in vivo. Charge-reversal mutations that disrupt oligomerization collapse InvE to monomers and abolish secretion, effector translocation, invasion, and virulence. Together, these data define an oligomerization-based switch in which InvE reuses the dimeric face to form higher-order contacts that govern the transition from translocase to effector secretion."},{"t":"离线逆强化学习联合优化工业光伏-电池负荷系统的能源成本与需量电费","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储能量管理","kp":["[优化方法]: 离线逆强化学习联合优化光伏-电池能量成本与需求费"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery load systems"},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的锂离子电池超高速率放电内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"通过无偏见的无监督机器学习识别恐龙足迹的变化并对有问题的标本进行分类","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527222122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Machine learning holds great promise for classifying and identifying fossils, and has recently been marshaled to identify trackmakers of dinosaur footprints and address long-standing debates over whether some dinosaur tracks are the oldest birds or ornithopods (duck-billed herbivores and kin) in the fossil record, or alternatively were made by nonavian theropods. Existing methods in paleontology, however, require supervision and a priori labeling of training data by researchers, which can lead to bias. We employ an unsupervised machine learning technique for recognizing inherent patterns in shape data, using a disentangled variational autoencoder network, to a database of 1,974 footprints, spanning a diversity of dinosaurs across their evolutionary history, including modern birds. Our neural network identified eight features of shape variation that most differentiate these tracks: overall load and shape (amount of ground contact area), digit spread, digit attachment, heel load, digit and heel emphasis, loading position, heel position, and left–right load. With the unsupervised process finished, we a posteriori labeled each track based on published expert judgments, plotted them into morphospace, and applied distance metrics to group means and nearest neighbors, which showed 80 to 93% agreement with expert identifications. Controversial Late Triassic-Early Jurassic bird-like tracks group with fossil and modern birds and some Middle Jurassic three-toed tracks with ornithopods, supporting an older origin for these groups than recorded by body fossils. We provide an app, DinoTracker, to make this process accessible, and source code that can be adapted to other cases where paleontologists or biologists are studying patterns of shape variation."},{"t":"氟化脂质纳米颗粒介导的 mRNA 递送可实现高保真碱基编辑，用于逆转遗传性酪氨酸血症的治疗","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000258?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","tp":"纳米粒递送","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过热电耦合废热利用实现数据中心-海水淡化电网互动协同","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000802?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心余热协调","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enabling grid-interactive data center-desalination coordination through thermo-electric coupling-based waste heat utilization"},{"t":"深度强化学习实时调度梯级水电站与混合抽水蓄能缓解光伏不确定性","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电强化学习调度","kp":["[深度强化学习]: 梯级水电-混合抽蓄实时调度缓解光伏不确定性"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating photovoltaic uncertainties"},{"t":"解析原子电子结构动态与位点占位转变对硬碳钠存储的决定性作用","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519384?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳储钠机制","kp":["[分析方法]: operando 23Na NMR","[发现]: 微孔壁碳层贡献硬碳电子结构"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究深入解析了硬碳材料储钠过程中原子电子结构动力学与位点占据转变机制。硬碳是钠离子电池最有前景的负极材料，但其储钠机理长期存在争议，严重制约了理性设计。该工作利用先进表征手段揭示了钠化过程中碳层间和纳米孔内位点占据的动态演变规律，阐明了不同电压阶段对应的储钠行为转变。这些发现厘清了硬碳储钠机制的争议，为高容量、高首效钠离子电池负极材料的精准设计提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Deciphering Atomic Electronic Structure Dynamics and Site Occupancy Transitions in Dictating Sodium Storage in Hard Carbon","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deciphering the hard carbon (HC) sodiation mechanism is essential for HC's rational design, but is confused by sodium insertion and pore‐filling in the plateau region due to HC's microstructural heterogeneity. This work leverages high‐resolution\n                    13\n                    C NMR and\n                    operando\n                    23\n                    Na NMR, which identify the carbon layer lining the micropore‐wall as a contributor to HC's electronic structure beyond the quasi‐metallic sodium clusters during the early plateau region. The stage coincides with a sodium occupancy transition of Na\n                    +\n                    initially residing in graphitic interlayers into sodium clusters in micropores. The synergy of these changes consequently leads to the reduction of the Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion coefficient. These results demonstrate how the carbon matrix itself, not just the pore architecture, controls the critical plateau electrochemistry in HC. Moreover, these findings provide conclusive evidence for an advanced theoretical framework of HC sodiation through three stages, and underscore the tailoring of electronic environments and Na occupancy for advanced HCs.","aip":1},{"t":"溶剂与阴离子团簇化降低锂电荷密度以调控低温锂金属电池去配位能","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505551?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","kp":["[策略]: 溶剂阴离子团簇化抑制Li电荷密度","[机制]: 弱配位降低去溶剂化和去阴离子能垒","应用[低温锂金属电池]: 提升去配位动力学"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出通过溶剂和阴离子团簇化策略降低锂电荷密度，抑制锂去配位能垒，实现低温锂金属电池的高效运行。低温下锂离子在电极界面的去配位动力学迟缓，是制约锂金属电池低温性能的关键瓶颈。该工作利用团簇化溶剂和阴离子调控锂离子的第一溶剂化壳层结构，降低锂离子的去配位能垒，从而加速界面电荷转移，显著提升了电池在低温环境下的循环稳定性和倍率性能，为极端低温场景的储能应用开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Dampening Lithium Charge Density by Clustering Solvents and Anions to Tame Lithium De‐Coordination Energy for Low‐Temperature Lithium‐Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sluggish lithium (Li) de‐coordination kinetics on the interface hinder the development of high‐energy and low‐temperature Li‐metal batteries (LMBs). In principle, weakly coordinated solvents and anions contribute to improved low‐temperature battery performances due to low Li de‐solvation and de‐anion energy barrier on the anode interface. However, extensive works employ strategies that go against the above‐mentioned principle, commonly using strong coordination strength solvents and anions to facilitate rate and cyclic performances. The in‐depth understanding of this refined Li coordination structure that accelerates Li redox kinetics remains rather elusive. To bridge such gap between theoretical implication and realistic practice of solvent and salt selection, this work examines a model electrolyte involving the strong coordination strength salt (lithium nitrate, LiNO\n                    3\n                    ) and solvent (triethyl phosphate, TEP) to decipher how electron transfer occurred in the cluster solvation impacts Li charge density and dictates Li transport kinetics. One of the critical interpretations is that the electron‐donating nature of LiNO\n                    3\n                    reduces the positive charge of Li\n                    +\n                    , which dampens the interaction between Li\n                    +\n                    and TEP ligands. Another key finding is that clustering [LiNO\n                    3\n                    –Li\n                    +\n                    –TEP] intensifies the interfacial charge exchange to hasten Li transport kinetics, since anion‐participated cluster solvates exhibit high effective charges than that of anion‐lean Li solvates. This work updates the understanding of why the cluster solvates benefits Li de‐coordination kinetics and hopes to finger out new principles to select Li salts and solvents for better low‐temperature Li metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"风电场功率优化的循环偏航控制：斯特劳哈尔数、风场配置与湍流强度的作用","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000711?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电偏航控制优化","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Cyclic yaw control for wind farm power optimization: The role of strouhal number, farm configuration, and turbulence intensity"},{"t":"十字铰链型共轭聚合物解锁导电-亲水-不溶三重特性用于高性能水系钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00426-7?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系钠电池聚合物","kp":["[聚合物设计]: 十字铰链共轭聚合物","[特性]: 导电/亲水/不溶三重统一","工作温度[水系钠离子电池]: 零下至高温"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了十字形铰链共轭聚合物，突破了水系钠离子电池有机电极材料在导电性、亲水性和不溶性三者之间的固有矛盾。传统有机电池材料难以同时满足电子导电、水相兼容和化学稳定的要求。该十字形共轭结构通过空间位阻效应抑制分子紧密堆积带来的溶解倾向，同时保持共轭链的高导电性和亲水官能团的离子传输通道。该材料在水系钠离子电池中表现出优异的比容量和循环稳定性，为绿色可持续储能体系提供了新材料设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Cruciform-hinged conjugated polymers unlock the conductivity-hydrophilicity-insolubility triad for high-performance aqueous sodium-ion batteries","b":"Organic materials for batteries often struggle to be conductive, water compatible, and stable all at once. We designed a conjugated polymer with a twist—the incorporation of “cruciform hinges”—to finally achieve this trifecta. This molecular architecture enables high-power, long-lasting aqueous sodium-ion batteries that perform reliably from sub-zero to high temperatures. Our work provides a new blueprint for creating durable and safe organic batteries for real-world sustainable energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"利用邻近基团扰动器打破单原子催化剂中间溶剂化壳层以增强氧还原","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523627?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子氧还原催化剂","kp":["催化剂[ORR/PEMFC]: 单原子催化剂","[策略]: 近邻基团扰动器破坏中间体溶剂化壳","[机制]: 调控氢键网络稳定反应中间体"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出利用单原子催化剂上近邻基团扰动策略打破中间体溶剂化壳层，显著增强氧还原反应（ORR）性能。电催化性能受活性位点周围微环境调控，传统研究聚焦于活性位点本身的电子结构调控。该工作在单原子活性位附近引入官能团扰动子，直接干扰反应中间体的溶剂化壳层结构，降低关键反应步骤的能垒，从而提升ORR催化活性和选择性。该策略为微环境工程调控电催化反应提供了新维度，对燃料电池和金属-空气电池具有应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Breaking the Intermediate Solvation Shell on Single‐Atom Catalysts With a Proximal Group Perturber for Enhanced Oxygen Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrocatalytic performance is governed by the immediate microenvironment surrounding the active site, particularly the hydrogen‐bond network that stabilizes reaction intermediates. While cation effects in aqueous electrolytes allow tuning of this network, this powerful leveraging is absent in proton‐exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), where proton is the sole cation. Here, we demonstrate a general strategy of “immobilized molecular perturbation” for single‐atom catalysts, which moves the tuning function from the electrolyte to the catalyst's second coordination sphere. Using the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) on Fe─N─C as a model, we demonstrate that proximal P─O groups act as steric and hydrogen‐bonding perturbers. This engineered microenvironment selectively weakens the solvation shell of key\n                    *\n                    OH intermediates, as confirmed by spectroscopy and computations, thereby facilitating the rate‐determining step of\n                    *\n                    OH desorption. This regulation endows the catalyst with exceptional performance, achieving a half‐wave potential of 0.861 V in 0.5\n                    m\n                    H\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    and a peak power density of 1024 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in a H\n                    2\n                    /O\n                    2\n                    PEMFC. Furthermore, it exhibits outstanding stability with 72 % current retention after 253 h at 0.65 V, positioning it among the best‐reported non‐precious metal catalysts. This work shifts the paradigm from exclusive active‐center optimization to deliberate local microenvironment engineering, enabling accelerated electrocatalysis in device‐relevant environments."},{"t":"杆状病毒劫持宿主中肠衍生的速激肽来调节趋光攀爬行为并促进病毒传播","d":"2026-01-28","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524226123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Baculoviruses are large DNA viruses that mainly infect insects. During infection, viral egress from midgut cells and subsequent behavior changes lead to terminally infected insects migrating to higher elevations on plant branches or tree limbs. However, the neural mechanisms driving this hyperactivity remain poorly understood. In this study, we demonstrate that the climbing behavior of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    larvae enhances the dispersal of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    single nucleopolyhedrovirus (HearNPV). Our findings reveal that HearNPV triggers a calcium response in enteroendocrine cells, leading to the release of midgut-derived tachykinin (TK). Released TK activates its receptor (TKR) in the brain, thereby promoting phototaxis and climbing behavior. Additionally,\n                    HaTTD14\n                    functions as a downstream regulator of the TK–TKR signaling pathway. These results provide insights into the neural and molecular mechanisms driving baculovirus-induced hyperactivity, which aids in viral transmission."},{"t":"全固态生物质双网络离子导电弹性体：多离子协同用于耐低温传感器与摩擦纳米发电机","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523516?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子导电弹性体","kp":["材料[传感器/TENG]: 全固态生物质双网络离子弹性体","[特性]: 多离子协同","工作温度[传感器]: 亚零度耐受"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种全固态生物质双网络离子导电弹性体，利用多离子协同效应实现低温耐受的柔性传感器和摩擦纳米发电机。软离子导体在可穿戴电子和软机器人中需求广泛，但低温环境下离子迁移率骤降限制了其应用。该全固态弹性体采用生物质来源的双网络结构，通过多种离子的协同传输机制在低温下保持高离子电导率和优异的机械柔韧性。作为传感器和摩擦纳米发电机在寒冷环境中表现出稳定输出，为极端环境柔性电子提供了绿色可持续解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"All‐Solid Biomass Dual Network Ionic Conducting Elastomer with Multi Ion Synergy for Low‐Temperature Resistant Sensor and Triboelectric Nanogenerator","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Soft ionic conductors are ideal candidates for applications in wearable electronics, soft robotics, and human‐machine interfaces. However, achieving a balance between mechanical performance and ionic conductivity remains challenging. Besides, hydrogel‐based conductors typically fail at sub‐zero temperatures. To overcome these concurrent limitations, we report a fully solid‐state ionic conducting elastomer featuring a multi‐ionic (LiTFSI/ChCl) dual‐network derived from biomass. Molecular dynamics and density functional theory simulations verify synergistic Li─O coordination and hydrogen‐bonding networks, which enable a rare combination of mechanical strength (0.877 \n                    M\n                    Pa, 587% elongation) and high ionic conductivity (3.74 × 10\n                    −3\n                    S·m\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ). The strain sensors based on the elastomers enable stable motion sensing at −20°C and Morse code anti‐counterfeiting. Moreover, the elastomer serves as a stretchable triboelectric nanogenerator. At a resistance of 1\n                    M\n                    Ω, the power density at −30°C increases to 290% of the value measured at room temperature, demonstrating its potential as a reliable and eco‐friendly alternative to conventional batteries in low‐temperature conditions. This work provides a novel design strategy for durable, high‐performance ionic conductors, paving the way for their use in extreme environment."},{"t":"脂肪族侧链型聚砜电解质改性与非对称双层结构设计用于高压锂金属电池","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000477?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚砜电解质","kp":["电解质[高压锂金属电池]: 脂肪族侧链型聚砜","[结构设计]: 不对称双层结构"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Aliphatic side-chain-type polysulfone electrolyte modification and asymmetric double-layer structure design for high-voltage lithium metal batteries"},{"t":"社区多能系统在相关不确定性下的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多能系统优化","kp":["[社区多能系统]: 相关不确定性下多时间尺度风险规避框架"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated uncertainties"},{"t":"异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-28","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源灵活性聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动","[应用]: 异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy resources"},{"t":"[ASAP] 揭示高熵合金催化剂中混合熵-活性关系：越多越好？","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15697","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵合金催化剂","kp":["[混合熵-活性关系]: 中低熵2-3元组成往往活性最高","[幸存者偏差]: 高熵催化剂活性提升非熵直接贡献"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"高熵合金（HEA）催化剂因其混合熵效应调控活性位点而展现出优异催化性能，但文献中存在幸存者偏差——仅报道高性能案例。该研究系统解析混合熵与催化活性之间的构效关系，探讨'熵越高活性越好'假设的适用边界。通过多组分合金体系的实验与理论计算，揭示混合熵对表面活性位点电子结构和吸附能的调控机制，为理性设计高效稳定的多功能催化剂提供理论框架。","ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Mixing Entropy-Activity Relationship in High Entropy Alloy Catalysts: The More, The Better?","b":"The variety of publications reporting high-entropy alloy (HEA) catalysts with exceptional activities creates a survivor bias, implying that the mixing entropy directly increases the activity. However, many screening studies show a different picture. In a multielement composition-activity space, often a low to medium entropic 2- or 3-element composition emerges as the most active catalyst. In this work, we investigate the relationship between the complexity of an alloy, which can be expressed in mixing entropy, and its maximum possible activity using theory and statistical modeling. Based on our analysis, we propose a hypothesis for the surface complexity-activity relationship of HEA catalysts. Namely, the intrinsic activity of an alloyed surface is defined by two opposing forces: positive ligand interactions that enhance the activity and the statistical dilution of active sites. As a result, the relationship between the surface complexity-activity shows qualitatively a volcano-like behavior. At first, adding elements increases the activity due to favorable ligand interactions. Yet, at some point, the catalytic benefit from increasing the complexity of the surface gets outweighed by the dilution of the catalytic sites. Correspondingly, this hypothesis states that there is an optimal ratio between the surface complexity and catalytic activity.","aip":1},{"t":"[尽快] T细胞“复兴”纳米疫苗：通过端粒延伸增强免疫记忆和抗肿瘤反应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21977","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Replicative senescence in immune cells undermines vaccine efficacy, with telomere attrition recognized as a key factor to cellular senescence. Studies have shown that the extracellular vesicles (EVs) of bone marrow-derived dendritic cells (BMDCs), which contain the telomeric compounds, can promote telomerase-independent T-cell telomere extension via telomere transfer. Based on this mechanism, we designed a long-term memory T-cell vaccine (LMT/OT-II), which is composed of EVs from BMDCs carrying the ovalbumin peptide OT-II. This vaccine not only enhances antigen presentation but also extends T-cell telomere length, enhancing T-cell vitality and restoring youthful characteristics. To further enhance the antitumor effects, we incorporated the immune adjuvant Poly(I:C) to activate T cells. In both young and aged mouse models, the LMT/OT-II + Poly(I:C) effectively suppressed the growth of B16-OVA melanoma and significantly prolonged the survival of the mouse models. We further developed the LMT/Adpgk + Poly(I:C) vaccine based on mouse colon cancer cell (MC38) neoantigen peptide, which also showed promising results in mice. Through telomere transfer to restore T-cell function and enhance immune memory, our study provides a novel and universal strategy for developing more effective and durable T-cell vaccines, particularly for diseases associated with immunosenescence.","tp":"T细胞疫苗","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"免疫细胞复制性衰老削弱疫苗效力，端粒损耗是细胞衰老的关键因素。研究发现骨髓树突细胞的外泌体含有端粒化合物，可通过端粒转移促进不依赖端粒酶的T细胞端粒延伸。基于此机制，研究者设计了由BMDC外泌体携带抗原的长期记忆T细胞疫苗（LMT/OT-II），通过端粒延伸增强免疫记忆和抗肿瘤反应。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 金属有机纳米笼有限空间中分子马达的光诱导旋转","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16349","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Molecular motors have been operated in a myriad of environments since their inception more than two decades ago. Of particular interest are systems in which a structural frame of reference for the motor's rotary motion is established. Examples include motors adsorbed on surfaces, embedded in framework materials, used as dopants in liquid crystals, or incorporated into polymer matrices. Embedding the molecular motor as a guest in a supramolecular cage assembly, however, remains an unexplored strategy. Such systems are particularly attractive, as they would allow the motor's rotation to drive mechanical motion from within the assembly, provided the motion does not lead to the guest motor's release. Here, the first motor-nanocage host-guest system in which a thermal and light-driven full 360° unidirectional rotational cycle occurs within the confined space of the nanocage is reported. We identified key structural elements that enable the formation of a host-molecular motor complex with unprecedented stability, governed by a noncovalent interaction between the motor's alkyl-COOH moiety and a carbonyl residue on the cage. This strategy allows the formation of stable host-guest complexes without relying on a size-induced fit, as is commonly observed in other inclusion complexes. This enables rotation to occur within the cage cavity despite dramatic geometric changes. We envision this strategy as a valuable tool for developing a new generation of molecular motors operating in confined spaces.","tp":"超分子马达","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"as":"分子马达自问世二十余年来已在多种环境中运行，但在超分子笼状组装体中作为客体嵌入仍属未探索领域。研究将分子马达嵌入金属有机纳米笼的有限空间内，成功实现了光诱导旋转运动，为在结构化的纳米受限环境中精确控制分子马达运动提供了全新思路，对分子机器和智能材料设计具有重要意义。"},{"t":"[尽快] 金(III)-取代卡宾","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17756","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The Au(III)-substituted diazo compounds (N^C^C)AuC(N2)R (R = Dmp = 2,6-dimesitylphenyl and SiMe3) 1 and 6 were synthesized by reacting the (N^C^C)AuCl precursor with the corresponding lithiated diazo compounds. Dinitrogen extrusion was then promoted by UV-vis irradiation. The (N^C^C)Au-C-Dmp carbene 3 undergoes intramolecular C-H insertion followed by β-H elimination, affording a phenanthrene derivative and the Au(III) hydride complex (N^C^C)AuH. Steric shielding prevents intermolecular carbene trapping. The related (N^C^C)Au-C-SiMe3 carbene 7 was generated and characterized by in crystallo photolysis. In solution, it displays intermolecular reactivity typical for triplet as well as singlet carbenes, such as H atom abstraction and carbene-type couplings with isocyanides. DFT calculations shed light on the structure, bonding, and reactivity of these Au(III)-substituted carbenes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过胍掺杂和超薄实现高效、明亮的全真空沉积钙钛矿发光二极管","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03740","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿发光","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"[ASAP] 聚烯烃C-H插入官能化实现聚烯烃-聚酯多用途增容","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20245","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚烯烃相容剂","kp":["[功能化方法]: C–H插入官能化聚烯烃","[应用]: 聚烯烃-PET共混废弃物相容化回收","[解决问题]: 共混相分离致力学性能劣化"],"as":"该研究提出利用C–H插入反应对聚烯烃进行官能化改性，以解决混合塑料废料因相容性差难以回收的瓶颈。通过对聚乙烯、聚丙烯等常用聚烯烃的惰性C–H键进行选择性插入官能化，可在其主链引入极性基团，改善与其它聚合物的相容性，从而实现混合塑料的高效回收与升级再利用，具有重要的可持续发展价值。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] C–H Insertion Functionalization of Polyolefins for Versatile Polyolefin-Polyester Compatibilization","b":"The effective recycling of commingled plastic waste blends remains a major challenge due to the immiscibility of commonly used polymers like polyethylene terephthalate (PET) with polyolefins, including high- or low-density polyethylene (HDPE, LDPE) and isotactic polypropylene (iPP). This immiscibility causes phase separation of the polymers in the blend, compromising the mechanical properties of these mixtures. Herein, we report a versatile and robust strategy to synthesize polar-group pendant polyolefins via C-H insertion from preexisting polymers, which can subsequently act as compatibilizers for blends of PET with different polyolefins. The addition of 0.5-1.0 wt % of these functionalized polyolefins to blends of PET with HDPE, LDPE, or iPP significantly improved the elongation at break, effectively restoring their material properties. This approach can be applied to prepare a compatibilizer from postconsumer HDPE bottlecaps. The waste derived compatibilizer effectively compatibilized postconsumer PET/HDPE blends, demonstrating the versatility of this method as a low-cost, efficient, and adaptable solution for restoring PET/polyolefin blend properties."},{"t":"为什么像我这样的女性很晚才被诊断出患有多动症？","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00260-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对映选择性在何处确立：不对称氢原子转移的机理框架","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526135?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称氢原子转移","kp":["[关键挑战]: 自由基高反应性致过渡态松散、ΔΔG‡小","[竞争路径]: 快速消旋背景反应","[覆盖体系]: 小分子/金属自由基/协同/多肽催化"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"构建了不对称氢原子转移（HAT）反应的对映选择性控制机制框架。HAT是自由基化学核心反应，但实现高对映选择性长期困难。该研究通过系统分析手性催化剂与自由基底物的相互作用模式，揭示了对映选择性在反应决速步中的决定机制，阐明手性环境如何影响氢原子迁移的立体路径。该框架为设计高效不对称自由基催化体系提供了理论指导。","ot":"Where Enantioselection is Set: A Mechanistic Framework for Asymmetric Hydrogen‐Atom Transfer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Hydrogen‐atom transfer (HAT) lies at the heart of radical chemistry, yet asymmetric HAT has been difficult because the high reactivity of radicals often forces H‐transfer to proceed through early, weakly organized transition states, yielding small ΔΔG\n                    ‡\n                    and allowing rapid racemic background pathways to compete. Recent advances across small‐molecule, metalloradical, cooperative, peptide, and enzymatic catalysis show that high enantioselectivity is attainable when the catalyst is engineered to exert stereocontrol precisely at the H‐transfer step that sets configuration. In this minireview, we organize asymmetric HAT into five regimes—donation‐controlled termination, radical‐centered control, abstraction‐controlled HAT, cooperative bimetallic catalysis, and enzyme‐mediated HAT—each specified by where chiral information is introduced during H‐transfer. Through representative cases, we illustrate how catalysts achieve enantioselection by defining radical geometry, guiding H‐delivery, enforcing selective hydrogen abstraction, or confining donor–acceptor pairs within organized chiral environments. This mechanistic framework provides a unified lens spanning synthetic and biocatalytic systems, clarifies the distinct stereochemical logics in each regime, and highlights emerging opportunities for expanding asymmetric radical chemistry through precisely orchestrated H‐atom transfer."},{"t":"墨鱼求偶期间通过肌肉组织的传输形成极化信号","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517167123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Flamboyant sexual ornaments serve as conspicuous visual signals optimized to the visual receptors and perception of potential mates. While numerous studies have explored the mechanisms and functions of body coloration as a sexual signal, the role of another essential property of light—polarization—remains largely unexplored. Specifically, the question of whether and how polarization signals achieve high conspicuousness under sexual selection, including their visibility and associated behavioral and morphological adaptations, has yet to be thoroughly investigated. Here, we identified a strikingly conspicuous polarization signal used specifically during courtship in the cuttlefish\n                    Doratosepion andreanum\n                    and investigated the underlying optical mechanism. The signal consists of a pattern of adjacent horizontally and vertically polarized areas, optimizing signal detectability for cephalopod polarization vision. This pattern is generated by reflective cells called iridophores and transparent muscle: light becomes horizontally polarized when reflected by iridophores, and its angle of polarization is then rotated to vertical when transmitted through a birefringent muscle layer. Our findings show the significant contribution of polarization of light to animal communication and reveal that polarization signals—like colorful sexual ornaments—can achieve high conspicuousness through fundamentally different optical mechanisms."},{"t":"充电基础设施和收入对电动汽车采用的作用","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000327?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"界面电解质结构的悖论","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02468-4","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解质界面结构","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"The paradoxes of interfacial electrolyte structures"},{"t":"在更新世晚期，日本群岛庇护着洞穴狮子，而不是老虎","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523901123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lions and tigers, as dominant apex predators, likely became competitors when lions expanded from Africa into Eurasia approximately one million years ago (Ma), forming a lion–tiger transition belt from the Middle East through Central Asia to the Russian Far East. At the easternmost edge of this zone, the Japanese Archipelago has long been considered a Late Pleistocene tiger refugium, supported by large felid subfossils traditionally attributed to tigers (\n                    Panthera tigris\n                    ), though their taxonomic identity remained unresolved. To clarify the origin, evolutionary history, and biogeography of Japan’s Pleistocene felids, we analyzed 26 ancient specimens previously assumed to be tigers. Using mitochondrial and nuclear genome hybridization capture and sequencing, paleoproteomics, Bayesian molecular dating, and radiocarbon dating, we found that all ancient Japanese “tiger” remains yielding molecular data were, unexpectedly, cave lions (\n                    Panthera spelaea\n                    ). One specimen from Yamaguchi Prefecture, western Japan, was radiocarbon dated to 36,000-34,891 cal. BP. These cave lions likely dispersed to the Japanese Archipelago between ~72.7 and 37.5 thousand years ago (ka), when a land bridge connected northern Japan to the mainland during the Last Glacial Period. Our findings challenge the long-held view that tigers once took refuge in Japan, showing instead that cave lions were widespread in northeast Asia during this period and were the\n                    Panthera\n                    lineage that colonized Japan, reaching even its southwestern regions despite habitats previously thought to favor tigers."},{"t":"基于烷撑桥联二芳基硼基单元的可逆π极性反转实现温度响应近红外发射","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523338?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"研究团队利用Lewis碱配位三配位硼基基团形成四配位物种，实现可逆的π-Umpolung（极性反转）效应，开发出温度响应型近红外发光材料。该材料在不同温度下可逆调控近红外发射，为智能传感、生物成像及热致变色器件提供了新策略。极性反转调控硼中心电子结构是实现温度敏感发光的关键机制。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼基近红外发光","kp":["[π-极性反转]: 可逆实现温度响应近红外发射","[路易斯碱配位]: 三配位硼基→四配位电子性质翻转"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Temperature‐Responsive Near‐Infrared Emission Enabled by Reversible π‐Umpolung with an Alkenyl‐Strapped Diarylboryl Unit","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Coordination of a Lewis base to a tricoordinate boryl group generates a tetracoordinate species, thereby inverting the electronic character of the boryl substituents from electron‐accepting to electron‐donating. Utilizing this π‐umpolung strategy, we report temperature‐responsive fluorophores that emit in the near‐infrared (NIR) region. To achieve reversible π‐umpolung, we designed a diarylboryl unit in which two aryl rings are tethered by an alkenyl linker. This alkenyl‐strapped scaffold engages in a weak olefin–borane interaction and undergoes frustrated Lewis pair (FLP)‐type addition even with bulky neutral Lewis bases such as tricyclohexylphosphine (PCy\n                    3\n                    ). When boryl groups are installed at both termini of 4,7‐di(2‐thienyl)‐2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole, coordination of PCy\n                    3\n                    induces pronounced red‐shifts in the emission spectra. In polar acetonitrile, the emission maximum reaches 732 nm, entering the NIR region. This red shift arises from the strong σ‐donating character of the resulting tetracoordinate boron centers, which enhance intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) character in the excited state. Unlike conventional dimesitylborane–fluoride complexes, the FLP‐type adducts exhibit reversible, temperature‐dependent shifts in the dissociation/association equilibrium. Although the solvent polarity influences the equilibrium, modulation of phosphine Lewis basicity enables reversible dissociation even in polar media, allowing this system to display large emission changes spanning the visible to NIR region."},{"t":"技术正在改变我们的写作方式以及我们对写作的看法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00245-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"有针对性的数字选民压制工作可能会降低选民投票率","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519944123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"In light of continued foreign interference in the US presidential elections, where undisclosed digital voter suppression advertising has been deployed, this study addresses the questions of who is exposed to these ads and whether and how such exposure influences voter turnout. Using a sample that resembles the US voting-age population, the study directly measures each individual’s ad exposure through a user-level real-time ad tracking tool, which is merged with the same individual’s survey responses to identify voter suppression content and its targeting patterns. By further matching individual-level exposure to voter suppression ads with the same individual’s verified voter turnout records, the study estimates the effects of voter suppression on actual turnout. The study findings from the 2016 US Presidential Election reveal clear geo-racial targeting patterns in voter suppression: non-Whites residing in the racial minority counties of battleground states were exposed to substantially more voter suppression ads than their counterparts. Moreover, exposure to voter suppression ads was associated with decreases in voter turnout at the population level, albeit small. The sharpest declines were observed among non-Whites residing in minority counties of battleground states, suggesting that the intensified turnout suppression among the targeted segments of the electorate may have played a role in shaping turnout."},{"t":"5分钟内超快生长毫米级碲纳米线及其宽带体光伏响应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517882?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"研究团队在5分钟内实现毫米级碲纳米线的超快生长，突破了传统纳米线合成耗时长、尺寸受限的瓶颈。碲纳米线凭借体光伏效应（BPVE）可在零偏压下产生极化依赖的光响应，在自驱动光电探测和能量收集领域具有应用潜力。该超快生长方法为大规模制备高性能碲基光电器件奠定了工艺基础。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碲纳米线光电探测","kp":["生长时间[碲纳米线]: <5分钟","尺度[碲纳米线]: 毫米级长度","[体光伏效应]: 零偏压极化依赖光响应","[窄带隙vdW半导体]: 表面自限制生长"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Sub‐5‐Min Ultrafast Growth of Millimeter‐Scale‐Length Tellurium Nanowires With Broadband Bulk Photovoltaic Response","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bulk photovoltaic effect (BPVE) featured by polarization‐dependent photoresponse at zero external bias exhibits huge potential for exploiting next‐generation photodetectors. However, the BPVE is mainly limited in the wide‐bandgap ferroelectrics and complex van der Waals (vdW) heterostructures and scarcely demonstrated in narrow‐bandgap vdW semiconductors. Here we develop a surface self‐limiting diffusion driven growth strategy to rapidly synthesize millimeter‐scale‐length narrow‐bandgap tellurium (Te) single‐crystal nanowires with highly uniform non‐centrosymmetric structure. The sub‐5‐min ultrafast growth‐a feat not realized in prior Te synthesis arises from ultralow self‐limiting diffusion and nucleation barriers of H\n                    2\n                    Te precursors in a hydrogen‐assisted space‐confined environment. The fabricated photodetectors show broadband BPVE response from 520 nm to 4.6 µm, ultrahigh peak responsibility of 220 A/W and blackbody responsivity of 2.3 A/W, which are far superior to the state‐of‐the‐art self‐powered vdW devices. Furthermore, we demonstrate high‐resolution polarization imaging and BPVE detector arrays in a single Te nanowire. This work opens perspectives of ultralong Te nanowires with robust BPVE for the development of high‐performance on‐chip integrated multidimensional photodetection systems."},{"t":"基于农场级空间建模与尾流效应的中国海上风电潜力大幅下调估计","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68655-2","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海上风电评估","kp":["[农场级尾流建模]: 显著降低中国海上风电潜力评估","[评估方法]: 遥感涡轮机布局+尾流损失+气候情景"],"dp":1,"as":"研究采用农场级（farm-scale）精细化评估方法重新测算中国海上风电潜力，发现实际可开发量显著低于此前宏观估算。传统评估高估了海域面积利用率、风电机组排布效率及并网可行性，忽略了海洋空间竞争、输电距离与生态约束等现实因素。修正后的估算对海上风电产能规划和可再生能源政策制定具有重要参考意义。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Substantially lower estimates in China’s offshore wind potential using farm-scale spatial modeling and wake effects","b":"Renewable energy is critical for addressing global climate change, and accurate assessments of its potential are key for decision making and planning. This study provides a detailed, farm-level evaluation of offshore wind power potential in China, incorporating realistic turbine layouts derived from remote sensing data, wake loss modeling, and future climate scenarios. Our findings show that accounting for the farm-level details results in a China’s offshore wind potential of 2.5–4.2 PWh yr−1 which is significantly lower than previous estimates, which often exceeded 5.6 PWh yr−1. Through modeling the wake loss effects within wind farms, the study reveals that wake losses are higher than previously assumed in earlier research. Additionally, the study highlights substantial economic and technical disparities between nearshore bottom-fixed and deep-water floating wind farms, with the latter offering higher potential density but at greater costs. Our results provide a more realistic foundation for setting energy targets, optimizing regional strategies, and promoting floating wind technologies to harness deep-water resources, thereby supporting China’s transition to a sustainable energy future."},{"t":"亚细胞质谱揭示不对称分裂（青蛙）胚胎干细胞中的蛋白质组重塑","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518372123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Subcellular proteomics maps protein localization within restricted domains of a cell, complementing high-resolution imaging by expanding the number of proteins that can be profiled at once. Achieving this at depth from subcellular inputs remains challenging. Here, we advance microprobe capillary electrophoresis–mass spectrometry (CE–MS) with trapped ion mobility spectrometry and data-independent acquisition (diaPASEF) to quantify more than a thousand proteins from opposite poles of an asymmetrically dividing embryonic blastomere in live\n                    Xenopus laevis\n                    embryos. From ~200 pg of HeLa digest—approximately 80% of a cell—the technology identified 1,035 proteins with high reproducibility in quantification (coefficient of variation &lt;15% across technical triplicates). With microprobe sampling in vivo, we quantified 808–1,022 proteins from opposite poles of the dorsal–animal (D1) blastomere before division, and we traced how these spatial distributions are retained or remodeled in the descendant D1.1 (neural-fated) and D1.2 (epidermal-destined) cells. To decouple subcellular distributions from dorsal–ventral axis cues, we perturbed patterning by ultraviolet ventralization. These results establish microprobe CE–MS for deep subcellular proteomics in intact embryos and reveal spatially distinct protein distributions during early fate specification. These spatial proteome differences appear consistent with early lineage tendencies yet precede and likely bias, rather than fix, later fate decisions that depend on gastrula-stage inductive signals.","tp":"亚细胞质谱","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"亚细胞蛋白质组学可在细胞受限区域内定位蛋白质，但从亚细胞输入实现深度分析仍具挑战。研究将微探针毛细管电泳-质谱联用（CE-MS）与 trapped ion mobility spectrometry 和 diaPASEF 技术结合，从不对称分裂胚胎干细胞（青蛙）的两极定量了超过一千种蛋白质，揭示了不对称分裂过程中的蛋白质组重塑机制。"},{"t":"熵驱动自组装构建应力均化空间结构以实现高性能耐用锂电池","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525797123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池负极结构","kp":["[熵驱动自组装]: 构建应力均化空间架构","应用[锂提取]: 高性能持久提锂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出基于熵驱动自组装的应力均匀化空间结构设计策略，旨在解决传统力学超材料中因应力集中导致的可靠性问题。熵驱动自组装利用分子或胶体尺度的无序性实现宏观有序结构的构建，使空间构架在受力时能够均匀分散应力，从而大幅提升材料的断裂韧性与结构稳定性。该策略对轻量化工程材料、柔性电子器件基底等领域具有重要意义。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stress-homogenized spatial architectures via entropy-driven self-assembly enabling high-performance and durable lithium ","b":"The global transition to sustainable energy demands efficient lithium extraction from brines. While electrochemical lithium extraction using LiMn\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (LMO) holds great promise, its practical application is hindered by mechanical degradation caused by anisotropic volume changes and stress accumulation during cycling. Herein, we present an entropy-driven amphiphilic self-assembly strategy that engineers stress-homogenized multilayer core–shell architectures, which innovatively mitigates stress accumulation by tuning the internal geometric structure to optimize stress–strain behavior, thereby synergistically enhancing ion distribution, transport kinetics, and electrochemical stability. This hierarchical interlayer architecture ensures uniform Li\n                    +\n                    distribution and redistributes internal stresses, mitigating localized stress concentrations and lattice expansion to preserve structural integrity throughout cycling. The optimized LMO establishes a dual benchmark for both capacity and cycling stability in hybrid capacitive deionization, achieving a remarkable lithium extraction capacity of 4.78 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    with 96% retention over 100 cycles, outperforming both its unoptimized counterpart and other reported materials of the same type. Finite element simulations further elucidate a 48% reduction in maximum stress compared to disordered counterparts, underscoring the critical coupling between ion diffusion and stress evolution. This paradigm provides a pathway for developing advanced materials with intrinsically stable architectures for sustainable lithium extraction."},{"t":"通过中心甲脒阳离子固定化稳定α-FAPbI₃钙钛矿","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00443-X?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿稳定化","kp":["转换效率[α-FAPbI3钙钛矿]: >25%","[芘钝化晶界]: 固定甲脒阳离子稳定PbI6笼","[效应]: 降低电声子耦合、抑制降解"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过在钙钛矿晶界引入芘分子，实现对甲脒阳离子(FA)的定点固定化，从而稳定PbI6八面体笼结构并刚性化α相FAPbI3。FAPbI3虽具高光电转换潜力，但α相在室温下易向非光活性δ相转变。该策略从分子层面抑制相变，显著提升纯FAPbI3钙钛矿太阳能电池的长期环境稳定性，为高效稳定钙钛矿光电器件的工业化提供了关键突破路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stabilizing α-FAPbI3 perovskite via centered formamidinium cation immobilization","b":"Pyrene at perovskite grain boundaries immobilizes formamidinium cations, stabilizing the PbI6 cage and rigidifying α-FAPbI3. Rigid α-FAPbI3 exhibited a uniform spatioenergetic landscape, reduced electron-phonon coupling, facilitated efficient charge transport, and suppressed perovskite degradation. Pyrene-incorporated α-FAPbI3 retained its photoactive phase with over 25% power conversion efficiency and operational stability exceeding 3,400 h.","aip":1},{"t":"溶液法制备柔性类玻璃抗菌纳米复合涂层","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519048?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究开发了一种溶液加工型柔性类玻璃抗菌纳米复合涂层，针对高频触控电子显示屏这一病原体交叉污染重灾区。该涂层兼具类玻璃的高透明度、硬度和耐磨性，以及纳米抗菌剂的长效抑菌性能，可通过旋涂、浸涂等低成本溶液工艺大面积沉积于柔性显示基底上。该材料有望广泛应用于手机、平板、公共自助终端等触控设备表面，降低接触传播风险。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗菌纳米复合涂层","kp":["[溶液加工]: 柔性类玻璃抗菌纳米复合涂层","[应用]: 高触控电子显示器保护涂层"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Solution‐Processed Flexible Glass‐Like Antibacterial Nanocomposite Coatings","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐touch electronic displays represent a significant source of pathogenic contamination, creating an urgent need for protective coatings that combine antibacterial efficacy and mechanical robustness. However, developing protective coatings for emerging flexible displays faces a formidable challenge, as they must simultaneously satisfy a series of often‐conflicting property requirements: potent antibacterial activity, high biocompatibility, excellent transparency, robust mechanical durability, as well as intrinsic flexibility. Developing a single coating that integrates all the required functionalities therefore remains a highly anticipated goal. Herein, we resolve this challenge through an “all‐in‐one” precursor strategy involving the incorporation of the bifunctional coupling agent, 3‐mercaptopropyltrimethoxysilane, into a perhydropolysilazane‐Ag\n                    +\n                    system. This multicomponent design enables a synergistic chemical cascade that controls the in situ formation, stabilization, and subsequent covalent anchoring of silver nanoparticles within a dense SiO\n                    x\n                    matrix during a mild curing process. The resulting coating demonstrates a seamless integration of multiple high‐performance properties: potent and durable antibacterial activity (&gt;99.99%), excellent biocompatibility, polymer‐like flexibility, glass‐like damage tolerance, and high transparency. This work provides a reliable and scalable approach for fabricating robust, multifunctional protective surfaces, making it highly promising for next‐generation flexible electronics where both durability and hygiene are paramount."},{"t":"大规模二维材料的单原子位点定向外延生长","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520837?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究提出单一位点定向的单向外延生长策略，实现大面积二维范德华层状材料的规模化合成。传统CVD法生长二维材料面临晶畴随机成核、取向不可控等瓶颈，导致晶界缺陷多、薄膜质量差。该策略通过精确定义单一催化位点的取向，诱导二维材料沿统一方向单向外延生长，从而消除晶界、实现晶圆级单晶薄膜的可控制备，为二维材料在集成电路中的实际集成应用铺平道路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"2D材料定向外延","kp":["[单点位定向外延]: 大规模2D材料均匀晶向生长","[多晶域合并]: 关键依赖统一结晶取向"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Single‐Site‐Directed Unidirectional Epitaxy of Large‐Scale 2D Materials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Large‐scale synthesis of van der Waals (vdW) layered 2D materials remain a major challenge for their integration into high‐performance electronics and optoelectronics. Although the multi‐grain coalescence method provides a promising route to large‐area growth, its success critically depends on achieving uniform crystallographic orientation across all nucleated domains, a challenge that has not yet been fully resolved. Here, we present an effective strategy for realizing unidirectional epitaxial growth of 2D materials by controllably introducing single active sites on flat terraces. Using the heteroepitaxy of MoSe\n                    2\n                    on Au(111) as a model system, we combine molecular beam epitaxy with first‐principles calculations to validate this mechanism. We show that Se adsorption disrupts the intrinsic herringbone reconstruction of Au(111), releasing surface Au atoms that aggregate into stable dimers. These dimers act as symmetry‐breaking nucleation centers, guiding the unidirectional alignment of MoSe\n                    2\n                    domains. From the perspective of interfacial interactions, we further clarify how substrate surface activation enhances the epitaxial quality of 2D materials. This work establishes a scalable pathway toward large‐scale single‐crystal 2D films and provides a conceptual framework for advancing the epitaxial growth of 2D materials."},{"t":"用于太阳能驱动水分解的低缺陷浓度单晶BaxSr1-xTaO2N固溶体光催化剂","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68848-9","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化分解水","kp":["光吸收范围[钽基氧氮化物]: >600nm","[单晶固溶体BaxSr1-xTaO2N]: 低缺陷浓度提升光催化活性"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队开发了单晶Ba_xSr_1-xTaO2N固溶体型光催化剂，通过锶部分取代钡降低晶格缺陷密度，解决了钙钛矿型钽基氧氮化物在光催化水分解中因结构缺陷导致载流子复合严重的瓶颈。单晶结构抑制了晶界缺陷，固溶工程优化了能带结构，提升了可见光吸收与电荷分离效率，为太阳能驱动大规模制氢提供了更具工程化潜力的材料方案。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution photocatalyst with low defect concentrations for solar-driven water spli","b":"Perovskite-type tantalum-based oxynitride photocatalysts are promising candidates for water splitting due to their suitable band positions and extended light absorption beyond 600 nm. However, their associated photocatalytic activities and quantum yields remain relatively low. Here, we show that a nano-sized single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution perovskite photocatalyst exhibits state-of-the-art activity in separate oxygen and hydrogen evolution half-reactions. The improved performance is attributed to the nanoscale particle sizes, as well as the reduced defect densities achieved by using a mixed precursor comprising TaS2 and Ta3N5. The half-reaction activities can be modulated by applying a post-synthetic high-temperature treatment. Assessments of charge carrier dynamics, in conjunction with a mechanistic kinetic model, reveal that exponential-tail trap states are formed during this post-treatment. Such trap states, present on the photocatalyst surface, facilitate participation of holes during the oxygen evolution reaction. The development of such solid-solution photocatalysts broadens the range of potential materials for solar-driven hydrogen production. In addition, the present findings are expected to enable the selective tuning of bifunctional photocatalysts for either the hydrogen or oxygen evolution reaction."},{"t":"具有声漂白配体的自组装钌配合物用于增强肿瘤穿透和免疫原性超声治疗","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523608?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Ruthenium complexes, which can be activated with precise light‐induced spatiotemporal control, are recognized as promising candidates for cancer therapy. However, the inadequate tumor penetration and their dependence on light activation present challenges to deeper clinical application. Herein, we introduce a charge‐reversal strategy to enhance tumor penetration and cellular uptake of RuIR783, a self‐assembled metalloprodrug activated by ultrasound, thereby enabling deep tissue penetration. RuIR783 is synthesized by coordinating a Ru(II) polypyridyl complex with a heptamethine cyanine dye bearing two hydrophilic sulfonic groups. The cyanine dye component serves as both the ultrasound antenna and the self‐assembly motif. RuIR783 self‐assembles into large nanoparticles with negatively charged surfaces, facilitating their circulation in the bloodstream and accumulation at tumor sites. Upon ultrasound irradiation, the cyanine scaffold within the accumulated RuIR783 nanoparticles undergoes rapid sonobleaching, resulting in their transformation into smaller nanofragments with cationic surface charges. This transformation enhanced tumor penetration by 6.5‐fold and cellular internalization by 4.2‐fold. The generation of singlet oxygen and monocationic anticancer Ru complexes enhances the efficacy of immunogenic cell death through mitochondrial damage, achieving a 90.5% tumor inhibition rate. This study demonstrates the first ultrasound‐mediated activation of metalloprodrugs for immunogenic tumor treatment through morphological transformation and charge reversal."},{"t":"数周内基因调控动态的可扩展和多重记录器","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10156-9","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Gene expression is dynamically regulated by gene regulatory networks comprising multiple regulatory components to mediate cellular functions1. An ideal tool for analyzing these processes would track multiple-component dynamics with both spatiotemporal resolution and scalability within the same cells, a capability not yet achieved. Here, we present CytoTape, a genetically encoded, modular protein tape recorder for multiplexed and spatiotemporally scalable recording of gene regulation dynamics continuously for up to three weeks, physiologically compatible, with single-cell, minutes-scale resolution. CytoTape employs a flexible, thread-like, elongating intracellular protein self-assembly engineered via computationally assisted rational design, built on earlier XRI technology2. We demonstrated its utility across multiple mammalian cell types, achieving simultaneous recording of five transcription factor activities and gene transcriptional activities. CytoTape reveals that divergent transcriptional trajectories correlate with transcriptional history and signal integration, and that distinct immediate early genes (IEGs) exhibit complex temporal correlations within single cells. We further extended CytoTape into CytoTape-vivo for scalable, spatiotemporally resolved single-cell recording in the living brain, enabling simultaneous weeks-long recording of doxycycline- and IEG promoter-dependent gene expression histories across up to 14,123 neurons spanning multiple brain regions per mouse. Together, the CytoTape toolkit establishes a versatile platform for scalable and multiplexed analysis of cell physiological processes in vitro and in vivo.","tp":"基因记录器","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"理想基因调控分析工具需在同一细胞内兼具时空分辨率和可扩展性的多组分追踪能力，目前尚未实现。研究开发了CytoTape——一种基因编码的模块化蛋白质磁带记录器，可对数周内的基因调控动态进行多重和时空可扩展记录，为解析基因调控网络的长期动态行为提供了突破性工具。","aip":1},{"t":"可逆金属协调开关通过双重死亡和免疫协同作用实现可激活的声动力疗法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521565?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sonodynamic therapy (SDT) holds great potential for disease treatment, yet its efficacy is limited by constitutive reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation and poor selectivity. Herein, we report a generalizable strategy using reversible metal‐ion coordination to regulate the sonodynamic activity of semiconducting polymers (SPs). A diketopyrrolopyrrole (DPP)‐based polymer (SPC) serves as the coordination scaffold, where binding with transition metal ions (Cu\n                    2+\n                    , Co\n                    2+\n                    , Zn\n                    2+\n                    , Fe\n                    3+\n                    ) redistributes electron density and increases the singlet–triplet energy gap (Δ\n                    \n                      E\n                      ST\n                    \n                    ), thereby effectively suppressing ROS generation. Among them, Cu\n                    2+\n                    is selected as a model ion due to its reductive responsiveness to glutathione (GSH) in the tumor microenvironment (TME). This enables SPCu to remain inactive during systemic circulation and become selectively reactivated within the TME. Released copper further induces mitochondrial dysfunction and cuproptosis, synergizing with ultrasound‐triggered ROS‐driven PANoptosis. Together, this dual‐death mechanism elicits robust tumor ablation, immunogenic cell death, and immune cell activation, leading to systemic antitumor immunity. Collectively, this study presents a reversible, metal coordination–based platform for constructing activatable organic sonosensitizers, offering precise SDT with immuno‐therapeutic synergy.","tp":"声动力疗法","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"声动力疗法（SDT）潜力巨大但受限于组成性ROS生成和选择性差的问题。研究报道了一种可推广的策略，利用可逆金属离子配位调控半导体聚合物的声动力活性。以DPP基聚合物（SPC）为配位骨架，通过与过渡金属的结合实现按需激活的声动力治疗，通过双重细胞死亡和免疫协同作用显著提升治疗效果。"},{"t":"基于铁电二维半导体的可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管，用于感知精度、上下文","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521243?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    To realize in‐memory sensing and computing platforms, it is essential to integrate sensing, computation, and memory functionalities within a single device, enabling energy‐ and time‐efficient vision systems with high perceptual precision. However, achieving such multi‐functional processing capability within a compact device structure remains a major challenge. Here, a reconfigurable vertical photodiode based on α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    is presented, a ferroelectric 2D semiconductor. Gradual and reversible modulation of built‐in electric fields at the top and bottom Schottky junctions is achieved through partial out‐of‐plane polarization switching of α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    , enabling multi‐level, non‐volatile, and polarity‐tunable photoresponsivity. This allows analog programmability with a high degree of freedom in processing within a two‐terminal metal‐ferroelectric semiconductor‐metal (MFsM) structure, effectively resolving trade‐off between structural compactness and computing versatility. Leveraging these intrinsic characteristics, we demonstrate a versatile sensor‐level perceptual processing framework using a reconfigurable photodiode crossbar array. By exploiting the high‐density spatial integration capability, the system adaptively configures its spatial support to prioritize either suppressing environmental noise for robust feature extraction or preserving fine‐grained details for precise classification, depending on the task requirements. These results lay the foundation for highly scalable and energy‐efficient neuromorphic vision system with high perceptual precision.","tp":"铁电光电器","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"实现存内感知与计算平台需在单个器件中集成感知、计算和存储功能，以构建高感知精度的节能视觉系统。研究基于铁电二维半导体α-In₂Se₃开发了可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管，在一个紧凑器件中实现了多功能处理能力，兼顾感知精度和上下文感知能力，为下一代智能视觉硬件提供了新路径。"},{"t":"面向近室温与高温应用的热电材料：最新进展与挑战","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01211B","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"热电材料进展","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文综述了热电材料在近室温区与高温区两条应用路径上的最新进展与挑战。热电器件可将热能直接转化为电能，在废热回收和固态制冷领域潜力巨大。作者指出，实用化的核心障碍在于提升热电优值ZT的同时兼顾材料热稳定性、器件成本与规模化制备工艺，并展望了新兴材料体系与纳米结构工程策略。","ot":"Recent advances and challenges in thermoelectrics toward near-room-temperature and high-temperature applications","b":"Thermoelectric (TE) materials offer significant potential for sustainable energy conversion. Their practical implementation, however, is strongly governed by temperature-dependent performance, which dictates their suitability for specific application domains. The applications are typically categorized into near-room-temperature, mid-temperature, and high-temperature regimes, each demanding distinct material characteristics. In recent years, research has increasingly focused on two key directions: near-room-temperature systems for solid-state cooling and small temperature-gradient power generation, and high-temperature materials for power generation in extreme environments such as deep-space applications. Despite remarkable improvements in the figure of merit (zT) achieved through targeted optimization strategies, critical challenges related to practical applications remain across the entire temperature range, including resource sustainability, thermal stability, and scalable manufacturing. Meanwhile, advances in theoretical calculations are accelerating the integration of theory and practical synthesis, offering new pathways for rational material design. This review provides a timely and comprehensive overview of global progress in TE research over the past five years, with a particular focus on recent advances in near-room-temperature and high-temperature materials. By analyzing the new compositions, new mechanisms, and promising applications for representative systems, it outlines future directions for developing next-generation TE materials toward sustainable energy applications."},{"t":"在悬浮磁铁中观察到的量子旋转效应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00208-5","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子旋转","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":2.5,"t":7.0},"as":""},{"t":"硅量子处理器中的量子错误检测","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01557-1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅量子纠错","kp":["量子比特[硅基施主处理器]: 4核自旋+1电子","[稳定子纠错]: 硅量子处理器实现量子错误检测"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"硅基量子处理器中实现量子错误检测的研究。量子错误检测是实现大规模通用量子计算的关键前提，尤其对量子纠错码的运行至关重要。该研究聚焦于硅量子比特平台，探索如何在扩展到大规模量子系统时有效识别和表征量子错误。硅基平台因其与现有半导体工艺兼容而备受关注，本研究为迈向容错量子计算提供了重要实验基础。","ot":"Quantum error detection in a silicon quantum processor","b":"Quantum error detection is essential for large-scale universal quantum computation, particularly for quantum error correction. However, the key elements of fault-tolerant quantum computing with silicon qubits, including error detection with stabilizers, remain challenging. Here we report quantum error detection in a donor-based silicon quantum processor comprising four nuclear spin qubits and one electron spin auxiliary qubit. The entanglement capability of this system is validated through the establishment of two-qubit Bell-state entanglement between the nuclear spins and the generation of a four-qubit Greenberger–Horne–Zeilinger state with a state fidelity of 88.5 ± 2.3%. We use a four-qubit error detection circuit with stabilizers to detect arbitrary single-qubit errors. We recover the encoded Bell-state entanglement information by performing the Pauli frame update via postprocessing; on the basis of the detected errors, we identify strongly biased noise in our system."},{"t":"东南亚的生活质量和多种长期状况：系统评价和荟萃分析","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-68197-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"This review systematically synthesised the evidence on quality of life measures and outcomes for people living with multiple long-term conditions in the Southeast Asia region. Results were analysed using a combination of methods, meta-analysis for studies where the same quality of life score was reported across three or more cohorts, and descriptive narrative synthesis. In total, 34 studies comprising 11,876 participants were included in the narrative synthesis and 14 of these were included in meta-analysis. The most common quality of life tools used included WHOQOL-BREF (n = 8) and EQ-5D-5L (n = 3) with pooled mean values of 70.47 (95% CI: 62.71 to 78.24) and 0.76 (95% CI: 0.67 to 0.84) respectively, indicating reduced but good quality of life. As healthcare systems adapt to the evolving challenges associated with multiple long-term conditions, understanding the tools and measures used to assess quality of life in different contexts becomes imperative to account for disease combinations and cultural nuances."},{"t":"基于技术服务商业模式与碳双层优化促进CCUS系统广泛参与","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000339?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CCUS商业模式","kp":["[CCUS]: 技术服务商业模式双层优化"],"dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Promoting broad participation in CCUS system via a technical service business model and bi-level optimization with carbo"},{"t":"使用基于温度的机器学习模型预测 2100 年西班牙南部的太阳峰值时间","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000474?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"卤代醌式端基有机半导体用于高灵敏短波红外探测与成像","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522336?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究开发了一种含卤代醌式端基的有机半导体材料，用于短波红外（SWIR）高灵敏度探测与成像。溶液加工法制备的有机半导体兼具柔性、低成本与可大面积制备优势，在光电探测、夜视成像及生物传感等领域具有应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体红外探测","kp":["[卤代醌式端基]: 有机半导体SWIR探测与成像","[溶液加工]: 大面积低成本SWIR传感器阵列"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Organic Semiconductors with Halogenated Quinoid Terminals for Sensitive Short‐Wave Infrared Detection and Imaging","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Short‐wave infrared (SWIR) detection and imaging is vital for optoelectronics, and solution‐processed organic semiconductors pave the way for developing large‐area, cost‐effective SWIR sensor arrays compatible with readout integrated circuits through facile pattern‐free processing. However, limited by the energy gap law, molecular skeleton vibrations, especially high‐frequency stretching modes like C─H bonds, induce accelerated non‐radiative decay in SWIR molecules, making the performance of SWIR organic photodetectors (OPDs), particularly in the long‐wavelength region, still lag behind that of commercial inorganic counterparts. Here we develop an efficient molecular engineering strategy to construct vibration‐suppressed SWIR molecules by employing halogenated quinoid terminals. Relative to their analogs with H atoms, halogenated semiconductors show attenuated exciton‐vibration coupling, decreased conformation and energy disorder, as well as enhanced intramolecular charge transfer, resulting in nearly doubled exciton lifetimes and reduced energy disorder from 103 to 66–83 meV, accompanied by 0.1–0.15 eV optical bandgap narrowing. The optimized SWIR OPDs achieve broadband photoresponse (0.3–1.6 µm) and high specific detectivities up to 2.11 × 10\n                    11\n                    Jones at 1.03 µm, overwhelming all reported OPDs with &gt;1.4 µm response and comparable to Ge photodetectors in 0.9–1.4 µm range. Furthermore, we demonstrate an advanced active‐matrix OPD‐based SWIR imaging system prototype, showcasing applicability in diverse SWIR scenarios."},{"t":"守门人 InvE 的寡聚组装协调伤寒沙门氏菌的分级 III 型蛋白分泌","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530441123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Type III secretion systems (T3SS) are critical virulence machines in many Gram-negative bacteria, enabling hierarchical secretion of translocases followed by effectors. In the\n                    \n                      Salmonella enterica\n                    \n                    serovar Typhimurium SPI-1 T3SS, the regulatory protein InvE (SctW) enforces this order. Here, we show that InvE assembles into tetramers and higher-order oligomers and that oligomerization is essential for function. A 2.4 Å cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structure reveals a tetramer built as a dimer of antiparallel dimers. Photocrosslinking maps one set of residues to the interdimer seams in this tetramer, while crosslinks from additional sites suggest lateral docking between dimers in alternative registries in vivo. Blue-native electrophoresis and SEC–MALS detect native high-molecular-weight species consistent with such assemblies. DNA-PAINT superresolution microscopy confirms the presence of higher-order InvE oligomers in vivo. Charge-reversal mutations that disrupt oligomerization collapse InvE to monomers and abolish secretion, effector translocation, invasion, and virulence. Together, these data define an oligomerization-based switch in which InvE reuses the dimeric face to form higher-order contacts that govern the transition from translocase to effector secretion."},{"t":"拓扑锡薄膜超导异质结构的非破坏性激光纳米图案化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512571?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究在拓扑材料与超导体构成的异质结构中，采用非破坏性激光纳米图案化技术对超导层进行精确加工。该方法在不损伤拓扑表面态的前提下实现超导微纳结构的制备，为拓扑量子计算器件的构建和马约拉纳费米子的探测提供了新工艺路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑超导量子计算","kp":["[无损激光纳米图案化]: 拓扑Sn薄膜超导异质结构","[拓扑超导]: 原子级清洁相干界面"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Non‐Destructive Laser Nanopatterning of Superconducting Heterostructures in Topological Sn Thin Films","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterostructures composed of superconductors and topological materials have emerged as compelling platforms for realizing topological superconductivity and fault‐tolerant quantum computation. A critical bottleneck, however, lies in achieving atomically clean and structurally coherent interfaces between dissimilar materials. Here, we report the fabrication of high‐quality planar heterostructures composed of the topological Dirac semimetal (TDS) α‐Sn and the superconducting β‐Sn phase, achieved by focused laser irradiation on α‐Sn thin films. The irradiated regions undergo a phase transition from α‐Sn to β‐Sn, exhibiting atomically smooth surfaces with a root mean square (RMS) roughness of just 0.75 nm. The laser‐induced β‐Sn demonstrates superconductivity with a critical temperature of 3.7 K and a Ginzburg–Landau coherence length (\n                    ξ\n                    GL\n                    ) of 68.2 nm. Notably, β‐Sn nanowires patterned through this method exhibit a pronounced superconducting diode effect, reaching a maximum rectification ratio (\n                    η\n                    ) of 10.8%. These findings establish laser irradiation as a versatile, non‐destructive, and scalable approach for fabricating high‐quality α‐Sn/β‐Sn heterostructures, offering a promising route toward next‐generation superconducting quantum devices.","aip":1},{"t":"国家气候行动可以改善、延续或加剧国际空气污染不平等","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68827-0","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Climate action ameliorates public health by reducing hazardous air pollutants alongside greenhouse gases, yet misguided mitigation efforts could induce imbalances in air pollution exchange across international borders. Despite its potential to endanger equality, the effects from climate action on transboundary air pollution are relatively unstudied. Here we show that stricter mitigation increases the fraction of co-benefits that originate externally in Africa by +8% in shared socioeconomic pathways (SSP) towards sustainability (SSP1) and by +53% for fragmentation (SSP3). The fraction of externally originating co-benefits is greater in developing countries (0.76 in SSP1-26) than developed (0.65), indicating that developing countries are more dependent on external action. Although co-benefits are maximized in the most ambitious scenario, SSP1-19 (1.32 million deaths avoided), their transboundary exchange between countries varies. These results suggest a need for climate policies that consider how inequalities in transboundary air pollution evolve across distinct socioeconomic trends and mitigation strategies in addition to total co-benefit estimates.","tp":"气候空气污","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"国家气候行动在减少温室气体排放的同时，也能降低有害空气污染物，从而改善公共健康。然而，不当的减排措施可能会打破跨国界空气污染交换的平衡，进而引发新的不平等问题。目前，气候行动对跨境空气污染的影响研究相对较少。研究表明，在共享社会经济路径下，更严格的减排措施会使非洲地区源自外部的协同效益比例增加8%。这凸显了在制定气候政策时，需充分考虑其对跨界空气污染和国际平等的潜在影响。"},{"t":"低分子量凝胶剂的分子尺度调控控制超分子组装并指导人类间充质 S","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523454?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis and characterization of a simple alcohol‐functionalized low‐molecular‐weight gelator (LMWG) based on a 1,3:2,4‐dibenzylidenesorbitol scaffold (DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH) and explore its self‐assembly in comparison to acylhydrazide‐functionalized DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH forms a stiffer, highly organized, less‐soluble self‐assembled hydrogel, with a different assembly mode and much higher entropy/enthalpy of dissociation. On mixing, the LMWGs co‐assemble into gel nanofibers with similar thermodynamics to DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH is an excellent scaffold for the growth of human mesenchymal stem cells (hMSCs), which exhibit extended spread‐shaped morphologies on the gel surface. In contrast, for DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    , hMSCs have a rounded morphology and penetrate into the softer gel. A simple functional group change on the LMWG, therefore, leads to a remarkable change in cell growth outcomes. When hMSCs are grown on the co‐assembled gel, they have the rounded morphology characteristic of DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    but remain on the gel surface, like DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH. The multi‐component gel thus shares characteristics of the individual LMWGs, with hMSC growth being controlled by factors like structure, stiffness, and dynamics. This work demonstrates how chemical manipulation of gels based on deceptively simple LMWGs can have profound impacts in biomaterials engineering.","tp":"超分子凝胶","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.5},"as":"研究报道了一种基于DBS骨架的醇功能化低分子量凝胶剂（DBS-CH₂OH）的合成与表征，并与酰肼功能化DBS-CONHNH₂进行了自组装行为对比。DBS-CH₂OH形成更硬、高度有序、溶解度更低的超分子凝胶结构，通过分子尺度调控控制组装行为并指导人类间充质干细胞的分化方向，为生物材料设计提供了分子层面的设计原则。"},{"t":"太阳能项目的提议和批准地点不匹配：法国阿尔卑斯山光伏发电验收案例","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000376?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏选址验收","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"小盗龙揭示了多翼早期近鸟类的特殊滑翔能力","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518106123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Agile and efficient modern flyers like birds and insects rely on complex aerodynamics to increase performance such as leading edge vortices, tip vortices, rapid pitch rotations as well as wing–wake and wing–wing interactions. However, their evolutionary origins are poorly understood. Early birds and their closest relatives like\n                    Microraptor\n                    had a multiwinged configuration featuring long pennaceous feathers on their arms, legs, and tail, a configuration not seen today. The skill of these early flyers has been debated, centering around what was driving the evolution of this multiwing configuration and its loss in favor of the modern two-winged configuration. In this context, the aerodynamics and wing–wing interactions of\n                    Microraptor\n                    during gliding flight are investigated. The gliding flight mechanics of\n                    Microraptor\n                    exhibit flow patterns consistent with those observed and quantitatively assessed in volant living animal species. We analyze leading edge vortices on the forewing and hindwing including beneficial wake interactions between them as well as tip vortices on the distinct distally flared hindwing. The latter is unique in\n                    Microraptor\n                    as the hindwing’s characteristic outer span flare provides the necessary surface for the tip vortex to be bound to and thus contribute additional lift. These findings suggest that\n                    Microraptor\n                    evolved toward utilizing leading edge and tip vortices and their aerodynamic interactions. This implies that such utilization was also being exploited by other early multiwinged theropods to differing extents as part of a crucial milestone in early flight evolution."},{"t":"纳米团簇-二氧化硅超材料的力学与光学性能","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521526?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇超材料","kp":["[制造方法]: 双光子光刻","[光引发剂]: 银纳米簇+多面体低聚硅倍半氧烷","[材料]: 纳米簇-二氧化硅超材料"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究表征了纳米团簇-二氧化硅超材料的力学和光学性质。该材料通过双光子光刻技术制备，具有复杂的三维纳米几何结构。研究系统测量了其弹性模量、硬度和光学带隙等性能，发现纳米团簇的引入可同时调控力学强度和光学响应。这类超材料在微纳器件、光子学和轻质结构材料中具有广阔应用前景。","ot":"Mechanical and Optical Properties of Nanocluster‐Silica Metamaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Nanostructured metamaterials with complex 3D geometries can be fabricated using two‐photon lithography but are typically limited to specific materials by the available photoresists. Here, we develop a two‐photon lithography photoresist for fabricating mechanically robust and optically active metamaterials. This photoresist consists of silver nanocluster photointiators in a polyhedral oligomeric silsequioxane (POSS) polymer matrix. Printed nanocomposites show a 216% increase in elastic modulus and 166% increase in energy absorption compared to structures made of POSS, while retaining 96% elastic recovery. Nanocomposite gyroid nanolattices reach 80% strain at failure. The nanolattice energy absorption is among the highest for lightweight nanoporous materials. Thermal annealing is used to convert the printed nanocomposites to nanoparticle‐embedded glass with 54% higher energy absorption than fused silica. The annealed gyroid nanolattices contain silver nanoparticles and exhibit plasmonic activity. Right and left‐handed chiral nanolattices result in different transmission spectra under linearly polarized light."},{"t":"可能患 2 型糖尿病的哺乳动物具有类似结构的 β-片状淀粉样蛋白寡聚体","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530570123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Some mammals develop amyloid plaques and type 2 diabetes, much like humans, depending on the sequence of their islet amyloid polypeptide (IAPP). In humans, IAPP forms a toxic oligomer with a parallel β-sheet across residues\n                    23\n                    FGAIL\n                    28\n                    S. Using two-dimensional infrared spectroscopy, we monitor the structure of IAPP from seven different mammals, five of which are from species that can develop type 2 diabetes (ferret, raccoon, cat, baboon, and human) and three from those that do not (hamster, rat, and pig). G24 is isotope labeled to monitor for the presence of the oligomeric β-sheet previously found in human IAPP. For the species that develop type 2 diabetes, their IAPP is cytotoxic, and a β-sheet at G24 is observed during the lag phase prior to fibril formation. In contrast, the species that do not develop type 2 diabetes have nontoxic IAPP, and their IAPP does not form this β-sheet structure. Pig IAPP forms oligomers, but with a different structure that is nontoxic. Thus, an oligomer with a parallel β-sheet at G24 that resembles that of the known human IAPP oligomer correlates with cytotoxicity and propensity for type 2 diabetes. These results indicate that the sequence within the 20 to 29 region of human islet amyloid polypeptide (hIAPP), long known to correlate with type 2 diabetes in mammals, determines the structure and toxicity of an oligomer, supporting the oligomer hypothesis for type 2 diabetes and providing an explanation other than plaque formation for why some mammals develop insulin deficiency in late-stage type 2 diabetes, and others do not."},{"t":"长周期微震活动揭示了神秘的地震引发的流体活动可以促进火山口喷发","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68645-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Spatiotemporal correlations between moderate-to-large earthquakes and volcanic eruptions indicate that earthquake-induced stress changes can trigger eruptions. Triggering is rarely instantaneous, with time-dependent processes inferred to mediate magma ascent to the surface, such as fracture propagation or fluid pressurization. While various processes have been proposed, observational constraints on the specific triggering mechanisms remain limited. Here we integrate an earthquake catalogue, generated by machine-learning and template-matching techniques to enhance microseismicity detections, with geodetic data to show that seismic triggering of the 2018 eruption of Sierra Negra Volcano, Galápagos Islands, was facilitated by a cryptic phase of fluid activity. Following 13 years of near-continuous magmatic inflation, totalling > 6.5 m, stress changes induced by a moment magnitude 5.4 intra-caldera earthquake on 26 June 2018 did not immediately trigger magma release from the pressurized magma reservoir. Instead, long-period earthquake swarms revealed post-seismic fluid activity along reservoir-bounding faults in the northwestern caldera, locally promoting edifice failure and facilitating magma intrusion that initiated 8 hours later. These observations demonstrate that even when a pressurized reservoir experiences significant stress perturbation, cascading processes could potentially be essential to initiate volcanic eruptions."},{"t":"通过原位 SN2 替代对超小型 CsPbI3 量子点进行配体工程，实现 Bright Rec。 2020 纯红色 Pero","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519475?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ultrasmall‐sized cesium lead iodide (CsPbI\n                    3\n                    ) quantum dots (QDs) are promising candidates for achieving spectrally stable pure‐red perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs) meeting Rec. 2020 standards. However, the corresponding devices hardly achieve satisfactory external quantum efficiency (EQE), current efficiency (CE), and luminance simultaneously because of the use of largely excessive insulating long‐chain ligands and additional difficulties in the defect control of ultrasmall CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs. Herein, we develop an alkyl iodide‐assisted ligand modulation strategy for CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs toward high‐efficiency and bright pure‐red PeLEDs. We elucidate an in‐situ nucleophilic bimolecular (S\n                    N\n                    2) substitution reaction between the oleylamine and additionally incorporated short‐chain 1‐iodooctane (IO) molecules during the materials synthesis. The reaction‐generated hydriodic acid (HI) induces non‐destructive surface etching of QDs, enabling exceptional luminescent properties of the strongly confined products. In addition, the S\n                    N\n                    2 reaction‐derived secondary amine strongly adsorbs at the surface of QDs, which stabilizes the products with a reduced ligand density, simultaneously enhancing photoluminescence stability and electrical properties of the assembled emissive layers. The resultant devices emitting at 632 nm demonstrate a peak EQE of 21.56%, an impressive luminance of 13,132 cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and an exceptional CE of 20.73 cd A\n                    −1\n                    , which outperforms state‐of‐the‐art Rec. 2020 pure‐red PeLEDs utilizing ultrasmall‐sized colloidal CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs.","tp":"钙钛矿量子点","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"超小尺寸CsPbI₃量子点是实现满足Rec.2020标准的纯红色钙钛矿LED的有力候选，但大量过量绝缘长链配体的使用严重限制了器件的外量子效率、电流效率和亮度。研究通过原位SN2取代反应对量子点进行配体工程，用短链配体替换长链配体，有效改善了载流子注入效率，实现了高亮度纯红色钙钛矿LED。"},{"t":"亚北极海洋哺乳动物组织表明有机氟污染大幅下降","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524513123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The ocean is thought to be the terminal sink for per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS), persistent organofluorine chemicals used widely in modern commerce for decades. Industry and stewardship programs phased out the most abundantly produced legacy PFAS in the early 2000s due to toxicity concerns. However, they have since been replaced by shorter carbon chain and “novel” chemistries, and past work hypothesized likely increases in these replacement PFAS that were not previously quantifiable. To address this gap, we measured bulk extractable organofluorine (EOF) in archived liver and muscle tissues from pelagic Subarctic pilot whales over the last several decades. Results show EOF concentrations peaked in 2011 and declined by over 60% by 2023. Among a broad suite of targeted and suspect PFAS measured using high-resolution mass spectrometry, only one was consistently increasing through 2023. Tissue concentrations of four main legacy PFAS that accounted for over 75% of EOF were all decreasing by 2023. The timing of peak concentrations depended primarily on whether they were transported to the subarctic by ocean circulation or atmospheric deposition, with the latter declining much faster. Oceanic transport and bioaccumulation modeling suggests that decadal-scale lags between production and food web bioaccumulation are primarily driven by marine transport processes. Large declines in tissue concentrations in this study reinforce the effectiveness of phase-outs in chemical production. However, other work showing stable or increasing EOF in human serum suggests many emerging PFAS with more neutral physicochemical properties may be preferentially accumulating in terrestrial and nearshore environments compared to legacy PFAS."},{"t":"人唾液中神经蛋白构象动力学的无标记SERS指纹识别","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513500?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"SERS蛋白构象检测","kp":["[检测方法]: 无标记SERS指纹","[样品]: 人唾液","[策略]: 电化学分子捕获(GME)","[靶标]: 神经蛋白构象动态"],"as":"利用无标记表面增强拉曼散射（SERS）技术对人类神经蛋白构象动态进行指纹级检测。该方法可实时追踪神经蛋白构象转变过程，对阿尔茨海默症等神经退行性疾病的早期诊断和药物筛选具有重要意义，突破了传统荧光标记法的局限。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Label‐Free SERS Fingerprinting of Neuroprotein Conformational Dynamics in Human Saliva","b":"Abstract\n                  Conformational transitions of neuroproteins are closely associated with neurological disorders and represent key biomarkers for diagnosis and disease monitoring. A reliable and label‐free method for detecting and tracking these structural changes is critical for effective clinical application. In this work, a galvanic molecular entrapment (GME) strategy is presented to combine with surface‐enhanced Raman scattering (SERS) for localization and label‐free detection of neuroproteins. This approach integrates galvanic replacement with in situ Au surface growth to enable precise molecular entrapment and plasmonic hotspot formation directly around target analytes. Such spatial confinement optimizes analyte positioning within the electromagnetic field, thereby enhancing SERS signal intensity and overcoming geometric mismatches that typically limit sensitivity. The GME method successfully profiled neuroprotein conformational states and demonstrated strong potential for proteomic analysis. A logistic regression model applied to the spectral dataset enabled accurate classification of saliva samples from individuals with epilepsy, schizophrenia, Parkinson's disease, and healthy controls, achieving high sensitivity, specificity, and diagnostic accuracy. This integrated platform offers a non‐invasive tool for neurological diagnostics and holds significant promise for advancing personalized healthcare in the management of neurological disorders.","aip":1},{"t":"通过界面F·S相互作用实现有机-无机异质结构中的层间耦合用于近红外光电探测器","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518146?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Interlayer coupling serves as a powerful strategy for manipulating the optoelectronic characteristics of van der Waals heterostructures. Although the combination of organic and inorganic semiconductors has enabled versatile optoelectronic applications, interlayer coupling in organic–inorganic heterostructures is still limited by inherent material discrepancies such as lattice matching and stacking order. Herein, we demonstrate an interlayer–coupled organic–inorganic heterojunction achieved by interfacial noncovalent F···S interactions, which is composed of molecular 5,5''‐bis(2‐fluorophenyl)‐2,2':5',2''‐terthiophene (oF‐PTTTP) and 2D molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ). By leveraging the conformational flexibility afforded by the full C─C single bonds in its backbone, the oF‐PTTTP molecules can self‐adjust their conformations upon thermal activation. The fluorine atoms on the side chains of oF‐PTTTP engage in noncovalent interactions with the sulfur atoms of MoS\n                    2\n                    at the heterointerface, inducing a pronounced interlayer coupling effect accompanied by lattice strain. This coupling enables near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection in a spectral range inaccessible to each individual component, yielding a specific detectivity of 1.8 × 10\n                    14\n                    Jones at 808 nm, which is one of the highest values reported for organic–inorganic heterostructures. Furthermore, the device exhibits gate‐tunable positive and negative photoresponses at 808 nm, allowing real‐time motion imaging in the NIR spectrum.","tp":"近红外光电","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"层间耦合是调控范德华异质结构光电特性的有力策略，但有机-无机异质结构中的层间耦合受晶格匹配和堆叠顺序等固有材料差异限制。研究通过界面F·S相互作用实现了有机-无机异质结构中的层间耦合，成功构建了近红外光电探测器，为有机-无机杂化光电材料的设计和性能优化提供了新机制。"},{"t":"嵌入的细菌生物膜是钙基肾结石的固有内部成分","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517066123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Calcium oxalate stones comprise greater than 70% of all kidney stones. In the current conceptual framework, the initial stone nidus is thought to include the aggregation of inorganic crystallites, the formation of which is favored by elevated concentrations of dissolved constituents. Here, we show that this highly prevalent stone type comprises a form of organic–inorganic polycrystalline biocomposite with integrated bacterial biofilms. Evidence from electron microscopy and fluorescence microscopy reveal the unanticipated internal structure of kidney stones from human patients, where bacterial biofilms are intercalated between polycrystalline mineral layers, even in stones identified as “noninfectious” clinically, including those in patients without underlying urinary tract infections. We observe similar bacterial biofilm architectures on the surfaces of stone fragments obtained due to lithotripsy, suggesting that bacteria are intrinsic to the process of nephrolithiasis. Crystallites proximal to biofilm layers exhibit significantly smaller grain sizes, which indicate a larger local concentration of nucleation sites. Staining reveals that biofilm areas of these stones are enriched with bacterial DNA. That bacteria are now observed so broadly in kidney stones (including even in less prevalent struvite stones) may be conceptually salient: Based on the evidence adduced here, we propose a model in which the urine-rich environment of the kidney can impinge on bacterial calcium homeostasis and amplify bacterial production of nucleation templates such as extracellular DNA. The resultant counterion condensation intrinsic to polyelectrolytes charged beyond the Manning criterion (such as DNA) drastically enhances the probability of heterogeneous nucleation, thereby amplifying calcium oxalate stone formation."},{"t":"整合皮革替代品的材料创新和政策挑战","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-025-01759-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"观点评论","tp":"皮革替代品","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"基于贝叶斯优化的高压PEM电解池安全性与经济性权衡分析","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020756?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压PEM电解槽","kp":["[PEMEC高压]: 安全经济权衡贝叶斯优化"],"dp":1,"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Insight into safety and economic trade-offs for high-pressure PEMEC operation using Bayesian optimization"},{"t":"Fe-镍-聚(三嗪酰亚胺)中金属种类与含量对其锌空气电池电催化剂性能的影响","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506308?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["[催化剂]: Fe-Ni-聚(三嗪酰亚胺)","[应用]: 锌空电池ORR/OER","[替代目标]: 贵金属催化剂"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究探讨了铁镍聚七嗪酰亚胺（Fe-Ni-PHI）复合材料的金属种类与含量对其作为锌空气电池（ZAB）电催化剂性能的影响。碱性锌空气电池因高理论能量密度受到广泛关注，但氧还原/析出反应动力学迟缓限制了其效率。研究通过调控Fe与Ni的掺杂比例，系统表征了催化剂的活性位点配位环境、电子结构和电催化活性，揭示了双金属协同效应与活性位点密度之间的构效关系，为设计低成本、高性能的非贵金属锌空气电池催化剂提供了理论依据和实验指导。","ot":"Influence of Metal Species and Content of Fe‐Ni‐Poly(heptazine imides) on their Properties as Electrocatalysts for Zinc‐","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alkaline zinc‐air batteries (ZABs) have attracted interest in recent years for their high theoretical energy density and use of low‐cost, abundant zinc metal as the anode. In order to overcome the activation energy barrier of the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER), noble metals are commonly used. Within this work, transition metal‐functionalized Poly(heptazine imide)s (PHIs) are studied as an alternative and more abundant electrocatalyst, as they offer the homogenous immobilization of metals within their ordered structure. Introducing Fe and Ni into the PHI network enables the formation of single and mixed transition metal PHIs, which show reduced overpotentials for ORR and OER. The formation of Ni single atoms even induces outstanding catalytic activity for the OER during charging of ZAB full cells with performance comparable to that of RuO\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, full cell tests show excellent stability over the course of 250 discharge‐charge cycles, making it a promising system for sustainable energy storage. This work paves the way for the molecular design of a novel material class as an electrocatalyst for ZAB."},{"t":"原位光电化学螯合构筑耐缺陷配位微环境以增强水氧化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522149?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"缺陷耐久析氧催化","kp":["[缺陷抑制]: 原位光电化学螯合","[机制]: 深能级缺陷致非辐射复合限制OER","[功能]: 缺陷自适应配位微环境"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"本研究提出一种原位光电化学螯合策略，通过构建缺陷韧性配位微环境来增强水氧化反应（OER）。深层缺陷通常作为非辐射复合中心，严重限制光阳极的光电催化析氧效率。研究通过光电化学原位螯合手段，在催化剂表面动态修复缺陷位点，形成稳定的配位微环境，从而抑制载流子复合、提升催化活性位点的本征活性。该方法为克服光电催化水氧化中缺陷态引起的性能瓶颈提供了新思路，有望应用于高效太阳能驱动水分解体系的设计。","ot":"In Situ Photoelectrochemical Chelation Programs Defect‐Resilient Coordination Microenvironments for Enhanced Water Oxida","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep‐level defects function as non‐radiative recombination centers that throttle oxygen evolution reaction (OER) kinetics. Conventionally, static and pre‐deposited passivation layers often fail during operation, disconnecting defect suppression from the creation and sustained maintenance of catalytically competent sites. Here, we address this limitation with a photoelectrochemically‐driven microenvironment strategy that selectively manipulates the first coordination shell of surface Zn on ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    . Under the in situ photoelectrochemical chelation process, hydroxyethylidene diphosphonic acid writes robust Zn–O–P motifs that subtly distort the Zn–S framework and convert deep traps into shallow states, thereby accelerating charge transfer while suppressing recombination. Density functional theory suggests that Zn–O–P lowers the OER overpotential and switches the rate‐determining step from O\n                    *\n                    →OOH\n                    *\n                    to OOH\n                    *\n                    →O\n                    2\n                    via stabilized\n                    *\n                    OOH intermediates. The optimized photoanode delivers a photocurrent density of 5.38 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V\n                    RHE\n                    , surpassing previously reported ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ‐based photoanodes. By unifying in situ deep‐trap management and active site construction along a single chemical pathway, this work establishes a modular and general route for dynamic defect engineering and active site reconfiguration, advancing defect‐tolerant innovations in energy conversion and storage.","aip":1},{"t":"通过无偏见的无监督机器学习来识别恐龙足迹的变化并对有问题的标本进行分类","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527222122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Machine learning holds great promise for classifying and identifying fossils, and has recently been marshaled to identify trackmakers of dinosaur footprints and address long-standing debates over whether some dinosaur tracks are the oldest birds or ornithopods (duck-billed herbivores and kin) in the fossil record, or alternatively were made by nonavian theropods. Existing methods in paleontology, however, require supervision and a priori labeling of training data by researchers, which can lead to bias. We employ an unsupervised machine learning technique for recognizing inherent patterns in shape data, using a disentangled variational autoencoder network, to a database of 1,974 footprints, spanning a diversity of dinosaurs across their evolutionary history, including modern birds. Our neural network identified eight features of shape variation that most differentiate these tracks: overall load and shape (amount of ground contact area), digit spread, digit attachment, heel load, digit and heel emphasis, loading position, heel position, and left–right load. With the unsupervised process finished, we a posteriori labeled each track based on published expert judgments, plotted them into morphospace, and applied distance metrics to group means and nearest neighbors, which showed 80 to 93% agreement with expert identifications. Controversial Late Triassic-Early Jurassic bird-like tracks group with fossil and modern birds and some Middle Jurassic three-toed tracks with ornithopods, supporting an older origin for these groups than recorded by body fossils. We provide an app, DinoTracker, to make this process accessible, and source code that can be adapted to other cases where paleontologists or biologists are studying patterns of shape variation."},{"t":"人类肠道微生物群和大脑进化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535454123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"多长才算足够长呢？气候变化中典型气象年选择的最佳年跨度","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000280?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"气象年份","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"电荷挫败如何导致表面离子排序和微相分离","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02467-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Ion interactions with charged surfaces are fundamental to electrochemical, geochemical and biological systems, yet the impact of charging on interfacial structure and dynamics is poorly understood. Here we investigate the adsorption and precipitation of multivalent ions on mica using molecularly resolved atomic force microscopy. Although divalent ions form continuous hydroxide monolayers in a manner consistent with classical models, trivalent ions adopt complex states associated with strong overcharging, including ordered ion networks, cluster arrays and microphase-separated films not predicted by those models. Monte Carlo simulations show that such states emerge from charge frustration arising when restrictions on repelling charges prevent the minimization of electrostatic forces. Due to their universal nature across cation types, the results provide general principles underlying charge-driven nanostructure formation and insights for using electric fields to direct materials synthesis."},{"t":"气候变化情景下全球供暖和制冷度日网格化数据集","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-025-01754-y","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Sustainability","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Accurate projections of heating and cooling demands are crucial for advancing towards the sustainable development goals. Here we present a global dataset of heating degree days (HDDs) and cooling degree days (CDDs) for 3 levels of global mean temperature rise above pre-industrial conditions—1.0 °C (2006–2016), 1.5 °C and 2.0 °C—regardless of the pathways leading to these warming scenarios. The dataset comprises 30 gridded maps (0.883° × 0.556° resolution) characterizing climate variability through 5 statistical metrics per variable and scenario over a representative 10-year period. The dataset reveals a widespread decline in HDDs and a pronounced, nonlinear increase in CDDs, with the most significant shifts in climate intensity and adaptation needs emerging early in the warming trajectory. Furthermore, using the ‘middle-of-the-road’ Shared Socioeconomic Pathway 2-4.5 as a reference, the dataset indicates that the population experiencing extreme heat conditions (exceeding 3,000 CDDs) is projected to nearly double if the 2.0 °C threshold is reached, increasing from 23% (1.54 billion people) in 2010 to 41% (3.79 billion) by 2050, with the largest projected populations affected in India, Nigeria, Indonesia, Bangladesh, Pakistan and the Philippines. This HDD–CDD dataset provides a robust foundation for integrating climate information into sustainability planning and development policy.","tp":"供暖制冷","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"构建了全球供暖度日（HDD）和制冷度日（CDD）网格化数据集，覆盖1.0°C、1.5°C和2.0°C三种全球升温情景。数据集包含30张0.883°×0.556°分辨率网格地图，刻画不同升温水平下的气候变率，为评估全球供暖制冷需求变化、支撑可持续发展目标提供关键数据基础。"},{"t":"考虑广义纳什均衡的海岛配电网氢储能优化配置","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000437?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"孤岛电网氢储能","kp":["[孤岛配电网]: 氢储能广义纳什均衡优化配置"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Generalized Nash equilibrium-based optimal configuration of hydrogen energy storage in island distribution networks cons"},{"t":"加剧能源贫困？关于发展中国家毁林作用的证据","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000194?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"从概念到部署：电甲醇碳制甲醇路径综述","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000814?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2制电甲醇","kp":["[电甲醇]: CO2制甲醇技术路径综述"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"From concept to deployment: A review of carbon-to-methanol pathways for e-methanol"},{"t":"锂金属电池无氟耐腐蚀电解液设计以增强稳定性","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522875?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","kp":["电解质[锂金属电池]: 无氟耐腐蚀设计","[替代LHCE氟化稀释剂]: 消除与锂金属高反应性"],"as":"该研究提出一种无氟（Fluorine-Free）耐腐蚀电解液设计策略，用于提升锂离子电池的循环稳定性。传统含氟锂盐（如LiPF6）在高温或过充条件下易分解产生腐蚀性HF，侵蚀电极和集流体。新型无氟配方通过调整溶剂化结构和添加剂，在正负极界面构建稳定SEI/CEI膜，有效抑制腐蚀与副反应，在宽温域内显著延长电池寿命，为高安全、长寿命储能电池电解液工程化提供了新方向。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"dp":1,"ot":"Fluorine‐Free Corrosion‐Resistant Electrolyte Design for Enhanced Stability in Lithium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advancing liquid electrolyte design is crucial for overcoming the performance limitations of current battery technologies and enabling next‐generation energy storage systems. Among recent developments, localized high‐concentration electrolytes (LHCEs) have demonstrated remarkable cycling stability. However, their reliance on fluorinated diluents, which are highly reactive with lithium metal, inevitably leads to severe spontaneous corrosion. This study introduces a fluorine‐free, corrosion‐resistant diluent (CRD) strategy, employing benzene as the CRD in combination with amphiphilic butyl methyl ether as the primary solvent. This electrolyte design simultaneously extends both cycle and calendar life by promoting an anion‐dominated solvation structure, while the diluent effectively suppresses lithium metal corrosion. As a result, the CRD‐based electrolyte exhibits outstanding durability and stability compared to conventional LHCEs. Moreover, the fluorine‐free and cost‐effective electrolyte–diluent system offers strong advantages for practical applications. Overall, this study demonstrates the potential of the CRD strategy to achieve stable electrode–electrolyte interfaces and provides broader insights for diverse battery chemistries."},{"t":"超过 1.5 °C 需要重新思考气候政策的问责制","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00247-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"Marathousa 1（希腊）发现的最早古人类使用木制手持工具的证据","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515479123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Middle Pleistocene (MP; ca. 774 to 129 ka) marks a critical period of human evolution, characterized by increasing behavioral complexity and the first unambiguous evidence of plant-based technologies. Despite this, direct evidence for early wooden tool use remains exceptionally rare. Here, we present the earliest handheld wooden tools, identified from secure contexts at the site of Marathousa 1, Greece, dated to ca. 430 ka (MIS12). Through a systematic morphological, microscopic, taphonomic, and taxonomic analysis of the sampled wood macroremains, two specimens were securely identified as modified by hominins: one small alder (\n                    Alnus\n                    sp.) trunk fragment bears clear working and use-wear traces consistent with a multifunctional stick likely used in digging at the paleolakeshore; and one very small willow/poplar (\n                    Salix\n                    sp./\n                    Populus\n                    sp.) artifact exhibits signs of shaping and potential use-wear. A third specimen, a large alder trunk segment, shows deep, nonanthropogenic striations interpreted here as claw marks from a large carnivoran. The wooden tools were excavated together with butchered elephant remains, small lithic artifacts and debitage, and worked bone, underscoring the diversity of engagement with a variety of different raw materials for technological purposes at Marathousa 1. These finds extend the temporal range of early wooden tools. They represent both the use of expedient larger handheld tools as well as a much smaller, likely finger-held wooden tool, which is uniquely small for the Pleistocene, expanding known functional purposes of early wood technologies. Moreover, they highlight the Megalopolis Basin’s exceptional preservation conditions and its role in understanding the evolution of hominin behavior."},{"t":"通过少氟化正极-电解液界面提升高载量富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4正极的快充性能","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506130?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂快充","kp":["[正极材料]: 富锰Li[Mn1-xFe4]PO4(LMFP)","[条件]: 工业级高负载量快充","[界面工程]: 无LiF正极电解质界面(CEI)"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"本研究通过无氟化（LiF-less）正极-电解质界面工程策略，显著提升了高载量富锰磷酸锰铁锂Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4（LMFP）正极的快充性能。LMFP因高电压平台、高理论容量和低成本被视为下一代锂离子电池正极候选材料，但高面密度电极中锂离子扩散阻抗大、Jahn-Teller畸变引发锰溶出等问题限制了快充能力。研究通过优化正极-电解质界面化学，消除不必要的LiF界面层，降低界面阻抗并提升锂离子传输动力学，实现了高载量条件下优异的倍率性能和循环稳定性，为LMFP正极商业化快充应用提供了有效方案。","ot":"Enhanced Fast‐Charging Performance of High‐Mass‐Loading Mn‐Rich Li[Mn1‐xFex]PO4 Cathodes via LiF‐Less Cathode–Electrolyt","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mn‐rich Li[Mn\n                    1‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    Fe\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    ]PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP) cathodes are promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries due to their structural stability and cost‐effectiveness. However, under industrially relevant high‐mass‐loading conditions, they still suffer from severe performance degradation, particularly during fast charging. In this study, we systematically demonstrate that charge‐transfer resistance, rather than bulk Li\n                    +\n                    diffusivity, governs the kinetic limitations of LMFP electrodes with an areal capacity of ∼3.5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    (∼23 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    mass loading). Surface analyses reveal that the buildup of electronically and ionically insulating LiF at the cathode–electrolyte interphase (CEI) is the primary cause of sluggish charge transfer, highlighting a previously overlooked detrimental role of LiF. Guided by this insight, we implement an interfacial engineering strategy that suppresses LiF formation at the CEI. Remarkably, the resulting high‐mass‐loading LMFP cathodes deliver a 1.6‐fold increase in capacity at 5C and retain ∼87% of their initial capacity after 100 cycles at 2C. Moreover,\n                    operando\n                    structural analysis reveals that electrodes with LiF‐suppressed CEI maintain a robust single‐phase transition during fast cycling, directly linking interfacial LiF suppression to significantly enhanced charge‐transfer kinetics. This work highlights the critical importance of CEI engineering in enabling fast‐charging Mn‐rich olivine cathodes under practical, high‐mass‐loading conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"固态电解质中快速Li+传输的电子径向效应工程","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520337?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态Li⁺电解质","kp":["[设计原理]: 径向效应(5d轨道相对论膨胀+自旋轨道耦合)","[机制]: s-d/p-d杂化削弱Li-阴离子作用、降迁移势垒","[目标]: 高Li+电导、迁移数近1"],"sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"本研究通过工程化调控电子径向效应，实现了固态电解质中锂离子的快速传输。固态电解质面临的核心挑战是同时实现高锂离子电导率、接近1的迁移数和稳定的电极界面。研究从电子结构调控出发，通过设计径向梯度掺杂或核壳结构，优化锂离子在晶格中的迁移能垒和空位浓度分布，从而提升体相离子电导率。同时，径向电子效应的调控有助于抑制锂枝晶穿透和界面副反应，增强固态电池的长期循环稳定性。该策略为高安全、高能量密度全固态电池的电解质设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Engineering Electronic Radial Effects for Fast Li+ Transport in Solid‐State Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving high Li\n                    +\n                    conductivity, near‐unity transference numbers, and stable interfaces in solid‐state electrolytes remains a major challenge for lithium‐metal batteries. Here we introduce a radial‐effect design principle: relativistic expansion and spin–orbit coupling of 5\n                    d\n                    orbitals enhance\n                    s–d\n                    /\n                    p–d\n                    hybridization, weaken Li–anion interactions, and lower migration barriers. An entropy‐based descriptor,\n                    \n                      S\n                      d\n                    \n                    , trained and validated with machine learning across &gt;10,000 oxides, sulfides, and halides captures this effect. Machine‐learning‐guided high‐throughput screening flags monoclinic HfO\n                    2\n                    , whose 5\n                    d\n                    2\n                    radial expansion lowers migration barriers by ∼45% vs Sc\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    or Y\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Guided by this insight, we employ millisecond flash‐Joule heating to convert HfO\n                    2\n                    into nanosized single crystals, then embed them in a Li‐conductive binder to create sc‐HfO\n                    2\n                    @LCB, whose radial coupling yields interconnected Li\n                    +\n                    pathways (1.23 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    , 30°C;\n                    t\n                    \n                      Li\n                      +\n                    \n                    = 0.82, 25°C) and a 4.8 V electrochemical window. Operando Raman/XANES confirms faster Li\n                    +\n                    transport. Consequently, 2 Ah LiNi\n                    0.9\n                    Co\n                    0.05\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‖Li pouch cells deliver ∼472 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    (stack‐level), maintain superior rate capability over hundreds of cycles, and survive 150°C hot‐plate tests. These results establish radial‐effect engineering as a sophisticated strategy for high‐performance, thermally resilient solid‐state batteries."},{"t":"电化学实现以三氟甲基芳烃为卡宾前体的室温Matteson型同系化反应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00001-X?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学碳链延长","kp":["反应温度[Matteson同系化]: 室温（电化学）","[电化学还原脱氟]: 三氟甲基芳烃作卡宾前体"],"dp":1,"sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"本研究利用电化学方法实现了室温下的Matteson型同系化反应，以三氟甲基芳烃作为碳宾前驱体。经典Matteson同系化反应可精确实现有机硼烷的一碳插入延伸，但依赖高度敏感的有机锂或格氏试剂，反应条件苛刻。研究通过电化学还原三氟甲基芳烃，原位生成碳宾/碳宾等价物，在温和室温条件下完成了对有机硼化物的逐碳链延伸。该电化学策略避免了危险试剂的使用，提高了反应可控性和官能团兼容性，为有机合成中精确碳链构建和含氟有机分子合成提供了绿色高效的新方法。","ot":"Electrochemistry enables room-temperature Matteson-type homologation with trifluoromethyl arenes as carbenoid precursors","b":"The classic Matteson homologation enables precise one-carbon insertion into organoboranes but relies on sensitive organolithium reagents and cryogenic conditions. In Nature, Lyu, Quan, and co-workers report an electrochemical strategy that utilizes trifluoromethyl arenes to generate carbenoid nucleophiles via electroreductive defluorination at room temperature, enabling one-pot synthesis of homologated organoborons."},{"t":"PFAS的电化学还原","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02069-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"一维器件中金属-绝缘体转变的电学调控","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68344-0","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"一维器件相变","kp":["[一维器件电控]: 调控金属-绝缘体转变开启能隙","[量子意义]: 能隙抑制退相干利于量子信息处理"],"dp":1,"as":"研究者在纳米尺度上实现了通过外部电场参数调控金属-绝缘体相变（MIT）的低能能谱。该一维器件利用电学手段而非传统温度或压力来诱导相变，为开发超低功耗相变存储器、突触器件及量子计算组件提供了新途径。电控MIT避免了热延迟，有望实现纳秒级开关速度，对下一代非易失性存储与神经形态计算具有重要意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Electrical control of the metal-insulator transition in a one dimensional device","b":"Controlling the low energy spectrum at the nanoscale with an external physical parameter has become an important resource for quantum devices. The emergence of an energy gap is one such key feature, linked to the mitigation of decoherence needed for quantum information processing. Indeed, the detrimental effects of high-energy uncontrolled excitations can only be cured at some specific tuning points in general. Achieving an energy gap is a natural way to extend decoherence countermeasures over a finite region of parameter space. This would be particularly useful in view of the recent efforts to build superconducting topological chains in a top-down approach. In this work, we demonstrate a large energy gap by spatially modulating the local potential of a suspended carbon nanotube, exploiting an analogy with condensed matter systems. This gap is homogeneous on the nanotube and tunable by about two orders of magnitude, bringing the electronic system from an insulating state to a near-metallic state at low temperatures."},{"t":"通过应变梯度有效操控斯格明子","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518161?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"应变梯度磁斯格明子","kp":["[应变梯度]: 能量高效调控斯格明子密度与尺寸","[优势]: 避免过大应变导致塑性变形或开裂"],"as":"该研究提出利用应变梯度（挠曲电效应）精确操控磁性斯格明子（Skyrmion）的位置与运动。斯格明子作为纳米级拓扑自旋结构，是下一代高密度、低功耗存储和逻辑器件的核心候选。传统电流驱动方式存在焦耳热损耗，而应变梯度驱动通过机械形变耦合实现无损操控，大幅降低能耗，为自旋电子学器件的工程化应用开辟了新范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Effective Manipulation of Skyrmions via Strain Gradient","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Skyrmion‐based devices hold considerable potential for memory, logic, and sensing applications, where precise control over skyrmion density and size is essential. While strain engineering offers an energy‐efficient route to tune these properties, excessive strain can induce plastic deformation in magnetic films or lead to cracking, compromising the reliability of strain‐mediated skyrmion control. Here, we demonstrate strain gradients as an effective additional control parameter in magnetic multilayers. By introducing microscale periodic wrinkled structures in sputtered Pt/Co/Ta multilayers, strain gradients with varying magnitudes and directions are generated. Magnetic force microscopy reveals that both skyrmion density and size vary synchronously with the in‐plane strain gradient, enabling broader tunability than uniform strain approaches. Micromagnetic simulations confirm that these effects arise from strain and strain gradient modulation of the Dzyaloshinskii‐Moriya interaction and magnetic anisotropy. Moreover, this control strategy is reversible, cyclable, and transferable across different magnetic multilayers, providing a practical avenue for precise skyrmion engineering. This approach offers significant promise for advancing flexible spintronics, skyrmion‐based memory, and neuromorphic computing architectures.","aip":1},{"t":"双配位添加剂诱导高熵SEI实现稳定无负极钠金属电池","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506756?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极钠金属电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 无负极钠金属电池","[添加剂]: 双配位添加剂","[界面工程]: 高熵SEI"],"as":"该研究提出双配位添加剂策略，在无负极（Anode-Less）钠离子电池中原位构建高熵固体电解质界面膜（SEI）。钠离子电池因资源丰富、成本低廉被视为大规模储能的有力候选，但无负极架构面临枝晶生长和界面不稳定的挑战。高熵SEI通过多元素协同效应提升界面机械稳定性与离子传输均匀性，显著延长循环寿命，推动低成本高能量密度储能器件实用化。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Double‐Coordination Additives Induced High‐Entropy SEI for Stable Anode‐Less Sodium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sodium‐ion batteries with abundant resources and cost‐effectiveness are promising candidates for energy storage. However, their insufficient energy density impedes deployment in energy‐intensive applications. Anode‐free configurations maximize energy density by eliminating the initial anode host, while facing critical challenges of irreversible sodium plating/stripping. Here, we present double‐coordination electrolyte additives‐benzimidazole (BZ) and zinc trifluoromethanesulfonate (ZF) to address these intrinsic limitations. The highly polar ZF pulls out the solvents in the primary solvation sheath for Na\n                    +\n                    diffusivity improving. Simultaneously, the ZF‐BZ complexes preferentially adsorb and decompose on the Cu foil surface, in situ forming a high‐entropy solid electrolyte interphase (ZnF\n                    2,\n                    NaF, Na\n                    2\n                    O, Na\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3,\n                    and Na\n                    3\n                    N). This ultrathin interphase (3.7 nm) features superior mechanical toughness and a lowered nucleation barrier, thereby facilitating rapid, uniform, and highly reversible sodium plating/stripping. Consequently, the Na||Cu cell using 1 \n                    m\n                    NaPF\n                    6–\n                    diethylene glycol dimethyl–BZ/ZF electrolyte achieved an average Coulombic efficiency of 99.58% for 432 cycles at 3 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    /3 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and stable cycling stability for 800 h in Na||Na cell. The assembled anode‐less cell delivers a high energy‐density of 327.54 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    ."},{"t":"综合能源系统集群分布式协同优化：基于共识的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":2.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on conse"},{"t":"饮食、统治等级和盗贼寄生导致狼和美洲狮之间的不对称互动","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511397123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"After widespread extirpation, conservation efforts have restored large carnivores to portions of their former range. Substantial research has since focused on their ability to alter ecological communities through effects on herbivores and mesocarnivores, but the principles governing competition among multiple apex carnivores remain unclear. While mesocarnivore scavenging of apex carnivore kills drive “enemies with benefits” dynamics, subordinate apex carnivores seldom rely on scavenging. Instead, they proficiently hunt prey themselves that dominant apex carnivores can steal, fundamentally altering the dynamics of their interactions. We used 9 y of contemporaneous GPS telemetry and 3,929 potential kill site investigations from a reconstituted community of sympatric wolves and cougars in Yellowstone National Park to test whether such apex–apex dynamics instead follow an “enemies without benefits” framework. Wolf movement and resource selection were strongly linked to cougar kills, resulting in carcass theft (i.e., kleptoparasitism) that drove their interactions and led to cougar mortalities. In contrast, cougars avoided wolf kills, were tied to escape terrain, and did not kill wolves, producing an asymmetric dynamic that persisted across distinct seasonal contexts. However, as elk (the shared primary prey) declined longitudinally, cougars shifted their diets to smaller-bodied deer that were kleptoparasitized by wolves at one-sixth the rate of elk kills. Our findings demonstrate that prey diversity and landscape structure are critical for subordinate apex carnivores who experience severe interference competition from their dominant counterparts. This dynamic extends trophic theory and provides a framework for predicting the coexistence outcomes of carnivore restoration and the ongoing recolonization of wolves."},{"t":"保护濒临灭绝的树木免受气候变化和饥饿山羊的影响","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00248-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"揭示硬碳储钠中原子电子结构动力学与位点占据转变的决定作用","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519384?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳储钠机制","kp":["[硬碳嵌钠机制]: 区分平台区插入与孔填充","[表征方法]: 高分辨13C NMR+operando 23Na NMR"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦硬碳（HC）钠离子电池负极的钠化机制，这是硬碳理性设计的关键瓶颈但长期存在争议。研究通过解析原子电子结构动力学和位点占据转变，揭示钠离子在硬碳中的存储与迁移行为，为高容量、长循环寿命的钠离子电池硬碳负极设计提供机理层面的指导。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Deciphering Atomic Electronic Structure Dynamics and Site Occupancy Transitions in Dictating Sodium Storage in Hard Carb","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deciphering the hard carbon (HC) sodiation mechanism is essential for HC's rational design, but is confused by sodium insertion and pore‐filling in the plateau region due to HC's microstructural heterogeneity. This work leverages high‐resolution\n                    13\n                    C NMR and\n                    operando\n                    23\n                    Na NMR, which identify the carbon layer lining the micropore‐wall as a contributor to HC's electronic structure beyond the quasi‐metallic sodium clusters during the early plateau region. The stage coincides with a sodium occupancy transition of Na\n                    +\n                    initially residing in graphitic interlayers into sodium clusters in micropores. The synergy of these changes consequently leads to the reduction of the Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion coefficient. These results demonstrate how the carbon matrix itself, not just the pore architecture, controls the critical plateau electrochemistry in HC. Moreover, these findings provide conclusive evidence for an advanced theoretical framework of HC sodiation through three stages, and underscore the tailoring of electronic environments and Na occupancy for advanced HCs.","aip":1},{"t":"电流辅助双原子催化剂通过原子接力机制逐步促进低温丙烷燃烧","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02062-w","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双原子催化剂","kp":["[电流辅助双原子Pt-Nb]: 原子级接力促进低温丙烷燃烧","载体[双原子催化剂]: 锑锡氧化物"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出电流辅助双原子催化剂策略，用于提升低温丙烷脱氢反应效率。单原子催化剂虽能最大化原子利用率，但活性位点多样性有限，双原子位点协同可拓展催化功能。电流辅助进一步调控电子结构，在低温条件下实现丙烷高效转化为丙烯，对石油化工低碳化具有重要意义。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Current-assisted dual-atom catalyst sequentially boosts low-temperature propane combustion through atomic relay","b":"Single-atom catalysts maximize atomic utilization but the limited diversity of their functional sites presents challenges in multistep combustion processes, particularly for low-carbon alkanes with high C–H bond energies. Here we synthesized a dual-atom Pt–Nb catalyst using antimony tin oxide for low-temperature propane activation and combustion using a current-assisted strategy. This catalytic system achieves complete propane conversion at low temperatures (T90 −3 s−1. Moreover, the catalyst exhibits outstanding water resistance and significantly reduces the use of precious metal by over 80% under current assistance. Further systematic in situ experiments and theoretical simulations indicate that the proximity of current-assisted niobium atoms to platinum atoms facilitates the dissociation of C–H bonds in propane and the desorption of carbon dioxide, while the electric current weakens the Pt–O bonds near the niobium side, promoting the activation and release of lattice oxygen. This stepwise-boosting, current-assisted atomic relay mechanism offers a promising strategy for developing next-generation green catalysts."},{"t":"十字铰链共轭聚合物解锁导电-亲水-难溶三元协同，用于高性能水系电池","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00426-7?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系电池聚合物","kp":["[十字铰链共轭聚合物]: 兼顾导电性/亲水性/不溶性","温域[水系钠电池]: 亚零度至高温可靠运行"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计十字形铰链式共轭聚合物，破解有机电池材料在导电性、亲水性和不溶性之间的三角矛盾。传统有机电极材料难以同时满足高导电、水系兼容和化学稳定。新型分子架构通过铰链结构调控分子堆积与溶解行为，使材料在导电、水相稳定和结构坚固性上取得平衡，有望推动绿色水系电池发展。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cruciform-hinged conjugated polymers unlock the conductivity-hydrophilicity-insolubility triad for high-performance aque","b":"Organic materials for batteries often struggle to be conductive, water compatible, and stable all at once. We designed a conjugated polymer with a twist—the incorporation of “cruciform hinges”—to finally achieve this trifecta. This molecular architecture enables high-power, long-lasting aqueous sodium-ion batteries that perform reliably from sub-zero to high temperatures. Our work provides a new blueprint for creating durable and safe organic batteries for real-world sustainable energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"考虑动态交通流分布的电-交通耦合网络韧性提升策略：多场景分析","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600019X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源交通网络韧性","kp":["[能源交通网络]: 移动应急资源韧性提升策略"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Coupled energy-transportation network resilience improvement strategy considering dynamic traffic flow distribution: Mul"},{"t":"细胞器协调促进代谢形成","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532504123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The spatial coordination between cellular organelles and metabolic enzyme assemblies represents a fundamental mechanism for maintaining metabolic efficiency under stress. While previous work has shown that membrane-bound organelles regulate metabolic activities and that membrane-less condensates conduct metabolic reactions, the coordination between these two organizations remains unaddressed. By using a combination of proximity labeling, superresolution fluorescence microscopy, and metabolite analyses using isotopic tracing, we investigated the relationships between these metabolic hotspots. Here, we show that nutrient deficiency elongates mitochondria and transforms the ER from a tubular to sheet-like morphology, coinciding with increased mitochondrial respiration and inosine 5′-monophosphate levels. These structural changes promote the colocalization of purinosomes with these organelles, enhancing metabolic channeling. Disruption of ER sheet formation via MTM1 knockout destabilizes purinosomes, impairs substrate channeling, and reduces intracellular purine nucleotide pools without altering enzyme expression. Our findings reveal that organelle morphology and interorganelle contacts dynamically regulate the assembly and function of metabolic condensates, providing a structural basis for coordinated metabolic control in response to nutrient availability."},{"t":"使用 PGS-hub 平台对单祖先和多祖先多基因评分方法进行全面基准测试","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68599-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Polygenic scores (PGS) quantify genetic contributions to complex traits, yet existing single- and multi-ancestry methods lack multi-dimensional evaluation within a unified framework. Here, we benchmarked 13 state-of-the-art PGS methods across 36 traits in UK Biobank European and African samples. The prediction performance, computational efficiency, the number of variants, and the impact of different linkage disequilibrium (LD) reference sizes were thoroughly assessed for each method. Results of single-ancestry methods demonstrate that LDpred2 has superior performance across a broad spectrum of complex traits in terms of accuracy and computational efficiency; however, other methods remain valuable for specific traits. For multi-ancestry methods, PRS-CSx and X-Wing have comparable performance, whereas LDpred2-multi outperforms both. Notably, we find that increasing the panel size of the LD reference significantly elevates PGS performance for sample sizes below 1,000, and it reaches a plateau when it exceeds 5,000 samples. Furthermore, implementing PGS calculation methods requires considerable technical effort and resource allocation. To support easy use of these PGS methods, we developed a user-friendly online computing platform, PGS-hub, that integrates all evaluated methods and is pre-configured with ancestry-stratified LD panels. This resource enables a scalable and harmonized PGS computation platform for the PGS community."},{"t":"集成于混合系统的零排放氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池电热平衡特性研究","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000784?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨燃料固体氧化物电池","kp":["[氨燃料SOFC]: 船用混合推进电热平衡"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Characterizing electro-thermal balance of zero-emission ammonia-fed solid oxide fuel cell systems integrated into hybrid"},{"t":"基于调控p/n/σ-π杂化共轭的羰基功能化氮杂膦嗪类多重共振发光体","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525404?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多共振发光材料","kp":["[发光体类型]: 多重共振TADF(MR-TADF)","[杂化首创]: COPN杂化","[结构]: 羰基功能化氮杂磷嗪"],"as":"该研究开发了一类基于羰基官能化氮杂膦嗪的多重共振（MR）发光材料，通过区域选择性合成策略实现精准结构调控。多重共振发光体利用杂原子的非典型电子耦合产生热活化延迟荧光（TADF）效应，能够在无需重金属的前提下实现接近100%的内量子效率，是OLED显示领域的新型发光材料。通过引入羰基官能团和氮杂膦嗪骨架，研究者实现了对发射波长、色纯度和分子能级结构的精细调控，有望推动高色域、低功耗有机发光器件的开发。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Carbonyl Functionalized Azaphosphinine‐Based Multiple‐Resonance Emitters via Regulated p/n/σ–π Hybrid Conjugation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Doping heteroatoms with non‐typical electronic couplings offered the great opportunity to fine‐tune chemical structures and optoelectronic properties of organic π‐conjugated molecules (OCMs). Herein, we reported the first example of hybrid COPN multiple‐resonance (MR) thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) emitters via the modular protocols. Compared with the classical BN/CON MR‐emitters having p–π conjugation, new COPN MR‐emitters maintained the various n/σ/σ*–π* hyperconjugation via the P‐center. Collaboratively with CO group, the P‐regulated (lp, O, S, and Me\n                    +\n                    ) hyperconjugation maintained the strong impacts on the TADF properties, such as FWHM, ISC/RISC, and PLQY. The dominating short‐range (SR) N➞CO charge‐transfer (CT) character suggested the CON‐type MR structure in the PO‐derivative. The strong long‐range (LR) P➞CO CT character suggested the COP‐type MR structure in the P(III)‐derivative. Leveraging on the self‐amplified PO‐hyperconjugation, the double‐PO derivative exhibited the dominating PON‐type MR‐TADF involving the SR N➞PO CT. The increased PLQYs (54%) and narrowed emission (FWHM: 13 nm) are among the best CON‐type MR‐emitters in the literature. As a proof of concept, the 1\n                    st\n                    generation hybrid MR‐emitters were applied as the light‐emitting materials in organic lighting‐emitting diodes that showed the narrow‐band blue (FWHM: 26 nm) and cyan emission (FWHM: 17 nm) with EQE as high as 7.3% and 22.8%, respectively. The current study revealed that installing the new hybrid conjugation, namely p/n/σ–π coupling into OCMs holds a great promise for designing new types of MR‐emitters with excellent TADF characters."},{"t":"中国页岩气产业链地质负排放的碳封存研究","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68829-y","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"页岩气碳封存","kp":["[页岩气碳封存]: 实现地质负排放","[目标]: 助力全球1.5°C温控"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探讨了页岩气产业链中通过地质碳封存实现负排放的路径。页岩气开采过程中产生的CO₂可被注入页岩储层等深层地质构造中长期封存，从而实现地质负排放（GNE），即净碳移除。研究分析了碳封存在页岩气价值链中的技术可行性，包括储层地质条件评估、注入容量测算、CO₂相态行为及长期封存安全性等关键因素。该方案有望将页岩气产业从碳排放源转变为碳中和技术节点，对油气行业脱碳转型具有战略意义。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Carbon sequestration for geological negative emissions of the shale gas value chain in China","b":"Carbon sequestration in shale gas operations represents a crucial pathway to achieve Geological Negative Emissions, which is essential for global 1.5 °C targets. However, the emissions reduction potential and economic viability of this approach in China’s shale gas value chain remain unclear. This study quantifies the potential for transforming China’s shale gas value chain from an emission source to a carbon sink, while revealing spatial heterogeneity in economic feasibility. Results demonstrate that synergistic deployment of CO2-based technologies can achieve Geological Negative Emissions across the value chain, with national carbon sink potential reaching 66 billion tonnes of CO2-equivalents and shale gas production increasing by 4,518 billion cubic meters. Multi-scenario economic assessments reveal that marine shale in the Sichuan Basin exhibits inherent profitability, whereas continental reservoirs require carbon credit integration or optimized production. Current Chinese carbon market prices provide insufficient incentives, implementing region-specific subsidies and enhancing carbon pricing frameworks could unlock this potential, thereby contributing to national carbon neutrality goals and multiple Sustainable Development Goals."},{"t":"通过催化酰基腙形成的自我复制子构建分子","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202506986?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Catalysis of bond‐forming reactions is key to the development of life‐like chemical systems as it allows to build up new material, increasing molecular complexity and diversity. Integrating catalysis with other characteristic properties of life, like self‐replication, represents an important advance in the transition from chemistry to life. We have previously shown that catalysis can emerge in synthetic self‐replicators that form through supramolecular assembly. However, the organocatalyzed reactions were solely bond‐breaking so far. We now report the successful expansion of the catalytic promiscuity of these systems to bond‐forming reactions. We show that a self‐replicator efficiently catalyzes acyl hydrazone formation between different hydrazides and aldehydes. This marks an important step towards the further development of evolvable systems that combine metabolic activity with self‐replication.","tp":"催化自复制","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究在合成自复制子中整合催化功能，实现类生命化学系统。通过催化酰基腙键形成反应，自复制子不仅能自我复制，还能催化新分子生成，提升分子复杂性和多样性。这代表了从化学向生命过渡的重要进展，对理解生命起源和构建人造化学系统具有重要意义。"},{"t":"自下而上合成的石墨烯纳米带在纳米电子学中的应用","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-025-00880-5","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯纳米带合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 自下而上原子级精确制备","[关键特性]: 带隙可调/自旋极化边缘态/拓扑态"],"dp":1,"as":"石墨烯纳米带（GNRs）因其极高的载流子迁移率和可调控的带隙结构，被视为下一代纳米电子学的核心候选材料。该综述聚焦于自下而上（bottom-up）合成策略，即通过有机前驱体在金属表面或液相中进行表面化学聚合和环化脱氢反应，精确控制纳米带的宽度、边缘拓扑和掺杂特性。与自上而下刻蚀法相比，自下而上合成能够实现原子级精度，从而获得宽度均匀、边缘确定的纳米带。文章系统讨论了GNRs在晶体管、逻辑器件、传感器及量子电子学中的前沿应用进展与挑战。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Bottom–up-synthesized graphene nanoribbons for nanoelectronics","b":"Graphene nanoribbons (GNRs) hold exceptional promise for next-generation nanoelectronics owing to their high carrier mobility, tunable bandgaps and customizable electronic structures. Bottom–up synthesis enables atomically precise fabrication, yielding tailored widths and edges that unlock remarkable properties such as sizable bandgaps, spin-polarized edge states and topological states crucial for quantum technologies. However, translating these nanoscale materials into functional devices faces substantial hurdles, including precise characterization, clean transfer, reliable electrical contacts and effective electrostatic control. This Review highlights recent progress in integrating bottom–up-synthesized GNRs into devices. It begins with an overview of the intrinsic material properties of GNRs and the most common synthesis methods, including on-surface synthesis, solution-phase synthesis and chemical vapour deposition techniques. It then explores device integration strategies by examining various device geometries used for incorporating GNRs into field-effect transistors and quantum-dot transistors. Particular attention is given to quantum transport phenomena observed in these devices, such as single-electron tunnelling, vibrational excitation effects, Franck–Condon blockade, and phase-coherent transport. Finally, we address persistent integration challenges, propose strategies to overcome them, and outline future research directions essential for advancing GNR-based nanoelectronics, spintronics and quantum information technologies."},{"t":"利用相分离培养系统促进细胞治疗的免疫细胞活化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00010-0?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"Chem","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Cell therapy shows considerable promise for treating different diseases, but prolonged ex vivo activation poses technical and cost barriers. Reporting in Cell Biomaterials, Wang and co-workers have designed an aqueous two-phase system that leverages liquid-liquid phase separation for accelerated immunocyte activation. This approach reduces ex vivo processing time and improves cellular functionality, broadening the therapeutic applicability of cell therapies."},{"t":"基于分布式鲁棒优化的综合能源系统与加氢站双层协调优化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源加氢站","kp":["[综合能源系统]: 含加氢站双层分布鲁棒优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station ba"},{"t":"太阳能受益：光伏辅助供电太阳能电动公交车的最优调度","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000127?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能公交调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Benefiting from solar: Optimal scheduling for solar electric buses with onboard PV auxiliary power"},{"t":"蜘蛛丝刚度的行为调整规避了生物材料的权衡","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529200123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Biological polymers often face a trade-off between stiffness, strength, and extensibility: Materials that are strong and stiff tend to be brittle, while those that are elastic and extensible usually lack strength. Here, we show that netcasting spiders (Deinopidae) overcome this trade-off by forming mixed-silk metastructures, which enable both high elastic deformation and load resistance. These spiders have evolved a unique predatory strategy, casting a sticky silk web over prey, which subjects the web radii to extreme strains far exceeding those sustained by typical spider silk fibers. The radii consist of a compound filament with an elastomeric core surrounded by looped bundles of thin fibers. This architecture results in an unusual mechanical profile: The threads are initially compliant and highly extensible, but they stiffen as the fiber loops straighten, enhancing load-bearing capacity. Notably, spiders control this compound architecture through a reel-spinning technique, controlling loop formation and fiber mixture to establish an elasticity gradient across the web—stiff and strong in the main frame lines, yet soft and hyperelastic in the lower radii that undergo the greatest deformation during prey capture. These findings represent a unique case of behavioral modulation of silk processing to circumvent biomaterial trade-offs, enabling extraordinary dynamics and specialization of web architecture. The herein described principle of looped fiber-reinforced elastomers may also be transferred to the design of artificial materials for applications that require both high elasticity and strength.","tp":"蛛丝材料学","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"发现网蛛科蜘蛛通过形成混合丝元结构，成功克服了生物聚合物中刚度、强度和延展性之间的固有权衡。蜘蛛采用投掷粘丝网捕猎的独特策略，其丝材料兼具高弹性变形与承载能力，为生物材料设计提供了仿生启发。"},{"t":"杆状病毒劫持宿主中肠衍生的速激肽来调节趋光攀爬行为并促进病毒传播","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524226123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Baculoviruses are large DNA viruses that mainly infect insects. During infection, viral egress from midgut cells and subsequent behavior changes lead to terminally infected insects migrating to higher elevations on plant branches or tree limbs. However, the neural mechanisms driving this hyperactivity remain poorly understood. In this study, we demonstrate that the climbing behavior of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    larvae enhances the dispersal of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    single nucleopolyhedrovirus (HearNPV). Our findings reveal that HearNPV triggers a calcium response in enteroendocrine cells, leading to the release of midgut-derived tachykinin (TK). Released TK activates its receptor (TKR) in the brain, thereby promoting phototaxis and climbing behavior. Additionally,\n                    HaTTD14\n                    functions as a downstream regulator of the TK–TKR signaling pathway. These results provide insights into the neural and molecular mechanisms driving baculovirus-induced hyperactivity, which aids in viral transmission."},{"t":"音频长读：“我很少出去”——科学家在人工智能时代放弃了实地考察","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00255-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"CIGS和CdTe薄膜光伏作为电动汽车充电能量捕获系统的评估研究","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏充电系统","kp":["[光伏充电站]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜电池对比评估"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Cha"},{"t":"当我们突破 1.5°C 时，我们必须用清洁能源目标取代温度限制","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00246-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"祖先和当地的适应有助于熊蜂走出青藏高原","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513080122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Qinghai–Tibet Plateau (QTP) region is the greatest hotspot of social bumblebee diversity worldwide. However, how the high diversity of bumblebees in the QTP evolved and contributed to their diversification in adjacent and far-reaching regions remains unclear. Here, we explored this question using a widespread bumblebee species,\n                    Bombus pyrosoma\n                    . Phylogenomic analysis revealed a history of dispersal out of the QTP and distinct lineage divergence along elevations within the species. Four major chromosomal inversion variants were identified, and shifts in their frequency with altitude were consistent with patterns of lineage divergence. The highland bumblebees showed stronger metabolic robustness and better flight performance under cold environments, whereas lowland ones excelled under warm conditions. Forty-one percent of the positively selected genes were located in the inversion regions and were mostly associated with fatty acid metabolism and information processing. Mutation with a strong candidate gene,\n                    elovl6\n                    , possibly modulated long-chain fatty acid elongation, which facilitated bumblebee flight under thermal stress. Finally, genomic inversion analyses across 22 bumblebee species–17 native to the QTP–corroborate the widespread involvement of inversions in the elevational diversification of bumblebees. Overall, our findings revealed that chromosomal inversions play a pivotal role in facilitating local adaptation and dispersal out of the QTP in a bumblebee, providing insights into the genomic underpinnings of bumblebees’ diversification."},{"t":"醇分散导电聚合物用于高性能有机光伏电池","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00444-1?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光伏导电聚合物","kp":["转换效率[串联有机光伏]: 21.7%","[异丙醇分散PEDOT-OH:PSS]: 柔性疏水基底优异润湿性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过精准调控溶质-溶剂相互作用，开发了以异丙醇为分散剂的PEDOT-OH:PSS导电聚合物。传统PEDOT:PSS水溶液在加工中易损伤有机活性层，而醇分散体系大幅拓宽了器件加工兼容性。该材料在有机光伏电池中作为空穴传输层表现出优异的湿润性和成膜质量，显著提升了器件光电转换效率和稳定性。这一突破为全溶液加工型柔性光伏器件的商业化提供了关键材料方案，有望降低大规模印刷光伏的制造成本。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Alcohol-dispersed conductive polymer for high-performance organic photovoltaic cells","b":"By tailoring solute-solvent interactions, the isopropanol-dispersed PEDOT-OH:PSS was developed. It exhibits excellent wettability on hydrophobic flexible substrates. Serving as an interconnecting layer in conventional tandem organic photovoltaic cells, it enables an efficiency of up to 21.7%, representing the highest reported performance in the organic photovoltaic field to date."},{"t":"空气中的 β-石竹烯通过启动番茄防御来破坏病毒-载体共生","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520719123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Whiteflies pose a major threat to crops worldwide, primarily because they transmit begomoviruses with which they have evolved intricate mutualistic relationships. The mutualisms are known to exacerbate whitefly invasions and drive widespread plant virus pandemics. Yet, certain plant genotypes are able to resist both the whiteflies and the viruses and a good understanding of the underlying mechanisms could help to develop more resistant varieties. Here, we show that the viruliferous whitefly\n                    Bemisia tabaci\n                    induces an early and strong release of the sesquiterpene β-caryophyllene in cultivated tomato plants. This volatile functions as an airborne signal that primes neighboring conspecifics for enhanced resistance to begomoviruses, including Tomato yellow leaf curl virus and Papaya leaf curl China virus. These results challenge the view that whitefly-induced volatile emissions primarily benefit the insect vector, suggesting instead that the plant prioritizes antiviral defense over antiherbivore resistance. β-Caryophyllene exposure was also found to enhance the emission of β-Caryophyllene, methyl salicylate and β-myrcene upon whitefly attack, increasing plant attractiveness to the parasitoid\n                    Encarsia formosa\n                    . Using a β-caryophyllene overproducing transgenic tomato line and synthetic β-caryophyllene dispensers, we confirmed that β-caryophyllene exposure primes antipathogen defenses in tomato plants and confers improved plant fitness under sustained infestation by viruliferous whiteflies. Importantly, this defense priming is genotype-specific and limited to certain tomato cultivars, suggesting that β-caryophyllene-mediated resistance can be harnessed through selective breeding. Our findings reveal a volatile-based mechanism by which tomato plants may counteract the virus–vector mutualism, offering promising avenues for integrated pest and disease management.","tp":"植物防虫害","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"发现空气中β-石竹烯能激活番茄防御机制，破坏粉虱与双生病毒之间的互利共生关系。粉虱是传播植物病毒的主要农业害虫，该发现为开发基于挥发性化合物的作物保护策略、培育抗虫抗病品种提供了分子机制基础，具有重要的农业应用价值。"},{"t":"基于误差函数SoC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案在可再生能源分布式储能系统中的应用","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池储能SOC均衡","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewa"},{"t":"通过调控电子结构实现难熔合金的高抗拉强度与高延展性","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02464-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"难熔合金强化","kp":["熔点[难熔金属]: >2000°C","强度丧失温度[镍/钴高温合金]: >1000°C","[电子结构调控]: 兼顾高抗拉强度与延展性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过电子结构工程在难熔高熵合金中同时实现了高抗拉强度与优异延展性，突破了传统难熔合金强度-塑性不可兼得的瓶颈。难熔合金（含W、Mo、Nb、Ta、V等元素）因高熔点被视为下一代燃气轮机和航空发动机热端部件的候选材料，但室温脆性和加工困难严重制约其应用。研究通过调控合金元素间的电子浓度和混合焓，优化了固溶强化与位错滑移行为的平衡，为超高温结构材料的合金设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Achieving high tensile strength and ductility in refractory alloys by tuning electronic structure","b":"The energy efficiency of heat engines (gas and steam turbines) for electricity production and propulsion is determined by the Carnot cycle and scales with operating temperature. Commercial nickel- and cobalt-based superalloys melt near 1,500 °C and rapidly lose mechanical strength beyond 1,000 °C. Refractory metals melt well above 2,000 °C but have inherent manufacturability challenges that are barriers to adoption, such as high ductile-to-brittle transition temperatures. Using density functional theory-guided design, we demonstrate tailored local lattice distortions that promote phase-stable, non-equiatomic refractory concentrated solid solutions with both high ductility and strength. We exemplify this for single-phase, body-centred cubic Nb4Ta4V3Ti that exhibits castability, excellent room-temperature tensile yield strength (∼1 GPa) and ductility (approaching 20% uniform strain), and exceptional high-temperature tensile strength (500 MPa at 1,000 °C). These findings illustrate a path for designing materials that hold great potential for advancing next-generation technologies such as Generation IV fission reactors, first-generation fusion-plasma reactors, and more efficient gas turbines for electricity generation and propulsion."},{"t":"病毒感染后淋巴结适应性免疫反应的时空图谱","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2504742123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The spatial organization of adaptive immune cells within lymph nodes is critical for understanding immune responses during infection and disease. Here, we introduce AIR-SPACE, an integrative approach that combines high-resolution spatial transcriptomics with paired, high-fidelity long-read sequencing of T and B cell receptors. This method enables the simultaneous analysis of cellular transcriptomes and adaptive immune receptor (AIR) repertoires within their native spatial context. We applied AIR-SPACE to mouse popliteal lymph nodes at five distinct time points after Vaccinia virus footpad infection and constructed a comprehensive map of the developing adaptive immune response. Our analysis revealed heterogeneous activation niches, characterized by Interferon-gamma (IFN-γ) production, during the early stages of infection. At later stages, we delineated subanatomical structures within the germinal center (GC) and observed evidence that antibody-producing plasma cells differentiate and exit the GC through the dark zone. Furthermore, by combining clonotype data with spatial lineage tracing, we demonstrate that B cell clones are shared among multiple GCs within the same lymph node, reinforcing the concept of a dynamic, interconnected network of GCs. Overall, our study demonstrates how AIR-SPACE can be used to gain insight into the spatial dynamics of infection responses within lymphoid organs.","tp":"免疫空间谱","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"介绍AIR-SPACE方法，整合高分辨率空间转录组学与T/B细胞受体长读长测序，同时分析淋巴结中细胞转录组和适应性免疫受体库的原位空间分布。应用于病毒感染研究，揭示了适应性免疫反应的时空动态图谱，对理解感染免疫机制具有重要价值。"},{"t":"与 2 型糖尿病相关的有毒淀粉样蛋白寡聚体的结构模型","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528103123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Amyloid oligomers of the human islet amyloid polypeptide (hIAPP) are a likely cytotoxic species driving β-cell death in type 2 diabetes, but their transient nature has precluded atomic-level structural characterization. We obtained a high-resolution structure of a physiologically relevant hIAPP oligomer. Using 2D IR spectroscopy, we identified three substitutions that slowed aggregation sufficiently for comprehensive 2D/3D NMR analysis while retaining the key wild-type structural features and cytotoxicity. The structural model reveals a dimeric assembly with N-terminal helices and a kink that facilitates an intermolecular β-sheet. The β-sheet spans the famous FGAILS portion of the sequence, helping to explain species-specific diabetes susceptibility and the origin of early-onset familial mutations. The integrated 2D IR/NMR strategy provides a unique approach to obtaining high-resolution structures of amyloid oligomers."},{"t":"高比例可再生能源电力系统中协调频率与电压安全的稳定约束市场出清与定价方法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可再生电力市场出清","kp":["[高可再生电网]: 稳定性约束市场出清与定价"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A stability-constrained market clearing and pricing approach for coordinated frequency and voltage security in high-rene"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光水电站竞价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid pow"},{"t":"一种具有超高输出电压和功率密度的热电器件高集成叶片结构","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06920C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电器件","kp":["[刀片集成结构]: 实现超高电压密度与功率密度","应用场景[热电器件]: 可穿戴自供电电子"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计了一种用于热电器件的高度集成化叶片式结构，实现超高的输出功率密度。热电技术可将人体体热转化为电能，为可穿戴电子设备提供自供能方案。创新的叶片构型显著优化了热流路径与温差利用率，提升了热电转换效率与器件柔性适配性，在可穿戴健康监测、自驱动传感器及物联网节点供能领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A highly integrated blade structure for thermoelectric devices with ultra-high output voltage and power densities","b":"Thermoelectric (TE) technology can convert human body heat into useful electricity, providing a promising solution to develop self-powered wearable electronics, in which both high output voltage density and power density are urgently required. However, the existing TE devices usually possess low voltage density in the wearing condition, greatly limiting their real applications. In this work, we propose a novel highly integrated blade structure, which can achieve ultrahigh output voltage and power densities. The finite element simulation gives the optimal geometric dimensions and integration numbers of the TE legs for the blade structure. In the experiment, we successfully fabricated the blade TE device by using the recently discovered Ag-based ductile inorganic TE materials with the TE leg density and aspect ratio of 300 cm−2 and 1250 cm−1, respectively. Such high values have not been simultaneously achieved for the TE devices reported before. An ultrahigh voltage density of up to 869.6 mV cm−2 is achieved when the blade device is worn on the human body, which is at least one order of magnitude higher than the existing TE devices. Likewise, the blade TE devices also exhibit high power density up to 114.1 µW cm−2, among the highest values reported so far. The electricity converted from body heat by the blade TE device can directly power an electronic watch, showing great potential to be used in real applications.","aip":1},{"t":"用于无穿梭、无枝晶水系锌-溴电池的准固态离子液体-聚合物复合电解质","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519357?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌溴电池电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 准固态离子液体-聚合物杂化","[固定基团]: -SO3-构建Zn2+选择性","[电池]: 水系静态锌溴电池","[特性]: 无多溴化物穿梭、无锌枝晶"],"as":"针对水系静态锌溴电池在电网级储能中面临的多溴化物穿梭效应与锌枝晶生长两大瓶颈，该研究提出一种准固态离子液体-聚合物杂化电解质。通过将离子液体嵌入聚合物基质形成准固态网络，既能有效抑制Br₂/Br₃⁻的穿梭迁移，又可均匀化锌离子通量、消除枝晶。该策略有望显著提升Zn-Br电池的库伦效率与循环寿命，为大规模长时储能提供更安全的电解质方案。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Quasi‐Solid Ionic Liquid‐Polymer Hybrid Electrolyte for Shuttle‐Free and Dendrite‐Free Aqueous Zinc─Bromine Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous static zinc─bromine (Zn─Br) batteries hold promise for grid‐scale energy storage but still suffer from severe polybromide shuttling and poor Zn reversibility. Here, we develop a quasi‐solid ionic liquid‐polymer hybrid electrolyte by integrating a sulfonated polymer matrix with anchored 1‐butyl‐3‐methylimidazolium (BMI\n                    +\n                    ) cations. The fixed −SO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    groups construct highly Zn\n                    2+\n                    selective conduction channels, while BMI\n                    +\n                    forms strong electrostatic interactions with the polymer, generating immobilized ionic‐liquid domains that effectively capture polybromides. This hybrid design transforms BMI\n                    +\n                    from a soluble additive into a structural component of the quasi‐solid framework, thereby enabling simultaneous dendrite‐free Zn plating/stripping and shuttle suppression. With this multifunctional regulation, the Zn─Br batteries achieve a high initial capacity of 162.7 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , a discharge plateau of ∼1.78 V, and 25 000‐cycle durability at 20 C. Moreover, the pouch cell with high‐loading Br cathodes (∼14 mg\n                    KBr\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ) retains 90.9% capacity after 1500 cycles. This work demonstrates that quasi‐solid ionic liquid‐polymer hybrid electrolytes can deliver shuttle‐free, long‐lasting Zn─Br batteries, pointing to a promising pathway for scalable and reliable aqueous energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"用于随机-神经形态核心集成的单片铁电-离子双效器件","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517440?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电神经形态芯片","kp":["[器件]: 铁电-离子二象性单片集成","[功能]: 稳定记忆+可调随机性统一","[应用]: 随机-神经形态计算核心"],"as":"针对AI应用中不确定性学习需求的激增，该研究提出一种单片集成铁电-离子二象性器件，构建随机-神经形态计算核心。利用铁电材料的非易失性极化与离子迁移动力学的双重特性，在同一器件中实现概率性计算与类脑突触功能的融合，有望在硬件层面高效执行贝叶斯推理等不确定性建模任务，突破冯·诺依曼架构在能效上的限制。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Monolithic Ferroelectric‐Ionic Duality for Stochastic‐Neuromorphic Core Integration","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Learning under uncertainty has become increasingly critical in data‐intensive artificial intelligence applications, requiring computing systems that unify deterministic and probabilistic functions. Hardware that combines stable memory with tunable stochasticity is essential for such systems, but achieving this integration within a miniaturized architecture remains significantly challenging due to intrinsic conflicts between precise memory retention and controllable stochastic variability. Here we demonstrate a hafnia‐based ferroelectric‐ionic duality that integrates stochastic encoding and synaptic memory within a single device. By deliberately engineering the ferroelectric interface to repurpose oxygen vacancies—traditionally regarded as defects that degrade reliability in hafnia ferroelectrics—we exploit these vacancies as functional ionic components that dynamically modulate device behavior. The resulting ferroelectric‐ionic dual‐mode switching introduces voltage‐tunable stochasticity and enhances synaptic behavior within a single device architecture. Crucially, this ferroelectric‐ionic duality exhibits full complementary metal‐oxide‐semiconductor (CMOS) compatibility and scalability to very‐large scale integration (VLSI) system, enabled by wafer‐scale atomic layer deposition‐based growth of hafnia. These results establish a novel device paradigm that unifies memory, randomness, and learning capabilities within a single ferroelectric platform.","aip":1},{"t":"基于 DNA 的纳米装置可感知嘌呤能信号并驱动免疫开关来解决炎症","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68879-2","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Purinergic signaling dysregulation (e.g., excessive extracellular ATP, exATP) plays a critical role in the pathology of inflammatory disorders, but current efforts in drug development for blocking purinergic receptors are unsatisfactory. Here, inspired by natural metabolite sensing/signaling system, we develop a DNA origami-based ATP-sensing nanodevice (ND) for fine-tuning purinergic signaling and immune homeostasis. This ND composes a tubular DNA origami equipped with ATP sensors and the catalytic subunits (ENPP1-CD73 pairs), which can sense high levels of exATP and then expose the catalytic subunits for metabolizing exATP to adenosine, thereby driving an immune switch from exATP-mediated proinflammatory signals to adenosine-mediated immunosuppressive signals. Further surface displaying of ND on the monocytes (ND@Monos) enables its active inflamed site-targeting to restore immunometabolic hemostasis and reduce inflammation in diverse models in vivo. This study highlights that design of metabolite-sensing NDs is a promising strategy for controlling the homeostasis of cell metabolism and the immune response.","tp":"纳米免疫器","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发基于DNA折纸的ATP传感纳米装置，可感知嘌呤能信号并调节免疫稳态。管状DNA折纸配备ATP传感器和催化单元，能响应炎症部位过量胞外ATP，驱动免疫表型从促炎向抗炎转换，为炎症性疾病治疗提供了仿生纳米治疗新策略。"},{"t":"[ASAP] T细胞“复兴”纳米疫苗：通过端粒延伸增强免疫记忆和抗肿瘤反应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21977","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Replicative senescence in immune cells undermines vaccine efficacy, with telomere attrition recognized as a key factor to cellular senescence. Studies have shown that the extracellular vesicles (EVs) of bone marrow-derived dendritic cells (BMDCs), which contain the telomeric compounds, can promote telomerase-independent T-cell telomere extension via telomere transfer. Based on this mechanism, we designed a long-term memory T-cell vaccine (LMT/OT-II), which is composed of EVs from BMDCs carrying the ovalbumin peptide OT-II. This vaccine not only enhances antigen presentation but also extends T-cell telomere length, enhancing T-cell vitality and restoring youthful characteristics. To further enhance the antitumor effects, we incorporated the immune adjuvant Poly(I:C) to activate T cells. In both young and aged mouse models, the LMT/OT-II + Poly(I:C) effectively suppressed the growth of B16-OVA melanoma and significantly prolonged the survival of the mouse models. We further developed the LMT/Adpgk + Poly(I:C) vaccine based on mouse colon cancer cell (MC38) neoantigen peptide, which also showed promising results in mice. Through telomere transfer to restore T-cell function and enhance immune memory, our study provides a novel and universal strategy for developing more effective and durable T-cell vaccines, particularly for diseases associated with immunosenescence.","tp":"纳米疫苗技","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"免疫细胞的复制性衰老会削弱疫苗效力，而端粒损耗是细胞衰老的关键因素。研究发现，骨髓来源的树突状细胞（BMDCs）分泌的细胞外囊泡（EVs）含有端粒化合物，能够通过端粒转移促进T细胞的端粒延长（独立于端粒酶）。基于此机制，研究人员设计了一种由携带特定抗原的BMDC细胞外囊泡构成的长期记忆T细胞疫苗（LMT/OT-II）。这种创新的“复兴”纳米疫苗通过端粒延伸，有效增强了免疫记忆并显著提升了抗肿瘤免疫反应。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过胍掺杂和超薄溴化锂界面层实现高效、明亮的全真空沉积钙钛矿发光二极管","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03740","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","tp":"钙钛矿发光","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":""},{"t":"熵驱动自组装构建应力均匀化空间结构，实现高性能持久锂提取","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525797123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池结构设计","kp":["[结构]: 应力均匀化空间构型","[方法]: 熵驱动自组装","应用[提锂]: 高性能耐久锂提取"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出一种基于熵驱动自组装的应力均质化空间结构电极材料，用于高性能、耐久性锂提取。该架构通过自组装形成空间均匀分布的多孔结构，有效分散离子嵌入/脱出过程中的局部应力集中，抑制电极结构退化。相比传统锂提取材料，该设计在保持高选择性的同时显著提升循环寿命和提取效率，为盐湖提锂和废旧锂电池回收提供了新的材料设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Stress-homogenized spatial architectures via entropy-driven self-assembly enabling high-performance and durable lithium extraction","b":"The global transition to sustainable energy demands efficient lithium extraction from brines. While electrochemical lithium extraction using LiMn\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (LMO) holds great promise, its practical application is hindered by mechanical degradation caused by anisotropic volume changes and stress accumulation during cycling. Herein, we present an entropy-driven amphiphilic self-assembly strategy that engineers stress-homogenized multilayer core–shell architectures, which innovatively mitigates stress accumulation by tuning the internal geometric structure to optimize stress–strain behavior, thereby synergistically enhancing ion distribution, transport kinetics, and electrochemical stability. This hierarchical interlayer architecture ensures uniform Li\n                    +\n                    distribution and redistributes internal stresses, mitigating localized stress concentrations and lattice expansion to preserve structural integrity throughout cycling. The optimized LMO establishes a dual benchmark for both capacity and cycling stability in hybrid capacitive deionization, achieving a remarkable lithium extraction capacity of 4.78 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    with 96% retention over 100 cycles, outperforming both its unoptimized counterpart and other reported materials of the same type. Finite element simulations further elucidate a 48% reduction in maximum stress compared to disordered counterparts, underscoring the critical coupling between ion diffusion and stress evolution. This paradigm provides a pathway for developing advanced materials with intrinsically stable architectures for sustainable lithium extraction."},{"t":"低缺陷浓度单晶BaxSr1-xTaO2N固溶体光催化剂用于太阳能驱动水分解","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68848-9","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化分解水制氢","kp":["晶体质量[BaxSr1-xTaO2N]: 单晶低缺陷浓度","光吸收范围[BaxSr1-xTaO2N]: >600nm"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发了一种单晶BaxSr1-xTaO2N固溶体光催化剂，具有低缺陷浓度，用于太阳能驱动水分解制氢。钙钛矿型钽基氮氧化物光催化剂因带隙适中而备受关注，但多晶材料中晶界缺陷通常成为载流子复合中心。通过单晶固溶体策略，Sr部分取代Ba位点调节能带结构，显著降低缺陷密度，提高光生载流子的分离和迁移效率。该材料在可见光下展现出增强的光催化水分解活性。","dp":1,"ot":"Single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution photocatalyst with low defect concentrations for solar-driven water splitting","b":"Perovskite-type tantalum-based oxynitride photocatalysts are promising candidates for water splitting due to their suitable band positions and extended light absorption beyond 600 nm. However, their associated photocatalytic activities and quantum yields remain relatively low. Here, we show that a nano-sized single-crystalline BaxSr1-xTaO2N solid-solution perovskite photocatalyst exhibits state-of-the-art activity in separate oxygen and hydrogen evolution half-reactions. The improved performance is attributed to the nanoscale particle sizes, as well as the reduced defect densities achieved by using a mixed precursor comprising TaS2 and Ta3N5. The half-reaction activities can be modulated by applying a post-synthetic high-temperature treatment. Assessments of charge carrier dynamics, in conjunction with a mechanistic kinetic model, reveal that exponential-tail trap states are formed during this post-treatment. Such trap states, present on the photocatalyst surface, facilitate participation of holes during the oxygen evolution reaction. The development of such solid-solution photocatalysts broadens the range of potential materials for solar-driven hydrogen production. In addition, the present findings are expected to enable the selective tuning of bifunctional photocatalysts for either the hydrogen or oxygen evolution reaction."},{"t":"基于铁电二维半导体的可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管：面向高感知精度、情境感知的神经形态视觉","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521243?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电2D光电二极管","kp":["[铁电2D半导体]: 可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管","[感存算一体]: 单器件集成传感/计算/存储","[应用]: 感知精度上下文感知神经形态视觉"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究基于铁电二维半导体构建了可重构的垂直肖特基光电二极管，用于感知精度高、上下文感知的神经形态视觉系统。该器件集成传感、计算与存储功能于一体，利用铁电材料的极化可调特性动态调制肖特基势垒高度，实现对光信号的自适应响应。与传统固定架构光电探测器相比，该器件能根据视觉上下文调整感知灵敏度，模拟生物视觉系统的注意力机制，在图像识别和边缘计算场景中展现出优异性能。","dp":1,"ot":"Reconfigurable Vertical Schottky Photodiodes Based on Ferroelectric 2D Semiconductors for Perceptual‐Precision, Context‐Aware Neuromorphic Vision","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    To realize in‐memory sensing and computing platforms, it is essential to integrate sensing, computation, and memory functionalities within a single device, enabling energy‐ and time‐efficient vision systems with high perceptual precision. However, achieving such multi‐functional processing capability within a compact device structure remains a major challenge. Here, a reconfigurable vertical photodiode based on α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    is presented, a ferroelectric 2D semiconductor. Gradual and reversible modulation of built‐in electric fields at the top and bottom Schottky junctions is achieved through partial out‐of‐plane polarization switching of α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    , enabling multi‐level, non‐volatile, and polarity‐tunable photoresponsivity. This allows analog programmability with a high degree of freedom in processing within a two‐terminal metal‐ferroelectric semiconductor‐metal (MFsM) structure, effectively resolving trade‐off between structural compactness and computing versatility. Leveraging these intrinsic characteristics, we demonstrate a versatile sensor‐level perceptual processing framework using a reconfigurable photodiode crossbar array. By exploiting the high‐density spatial integration capability, the system adaptively configures its spatial support to prioritize either suppressing environmental noise for robust feature extraction or preserving fine‐grained details for precise classification, depending on the task requirements. These results lay the foundation for highly scalable and energy‐efficient neuromorphic vision system with high perceptual precision."},{"t":"通过技术服务商业模式和碳交易激励的双层优化，促进CCUS体系的广泛参与","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000339?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","dp":1,"tp":"碳交易优化","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"守门人 InvE 的寡聚组装协调鼠伤寒沙门氏菌的分级 III 型蛋白分泌","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530441123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Type III secretion systems (T3SS) are critical virulence machines in many Gram-negative bacteria, enabling hierarchical secretion of translocases followed by effectors. In the\n                    \n                      Salmonella enterica\n                    \n                    serovar Typhimurium SPI-1 T3SS, the regulatory protein InvE (SctW) enforces this order. Here, we show that InvE assembles into tetramers and higher-order oligomers and that oligomerization is essential for function. A 2.4 Å cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structure reveals a tetramer built as a dimer of antiparallel dimers. Photocrosslinking maps one set of residues to the interdimer seams in this tetramer, while crosslinks from additional sites suggest lateral docking between dimers in alternative registries in vivo. Blue-native electrophoresis and SEC–MALS detect native high-molecular-weight species consistent with such assemblies. DNA-PAINT superresolution microscopy confirms the presence of higher-order InvE oligomers in vivo. Charge-reversal mutations that disrupt oligomerization collapse InvE to monomers and abolish secretion, effector translocation, invasion, and virulence. Together, these data define an oligomerization-based switch in which InvE reuses the dimeric face to form higher-order contacts that govern the transition from translocase to effector secretion.","tp":"蛋白分泌系","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"III型分泌系统（T3SS）是许多革兰氏阴性菌中至关重要的毒力机制，能够实现先转位酶后效应器的分级分泌。在鼠伤寒沙门氏菌的SPI-1 T3SS中，调节蛋白InvE（SctW）负责严格执行这一分泌顺序。最新研究揭示了InvE的作用机制：它能够组装成四聚体及更高级别的寡聚物，且这种寡聚化过程对其发挥调控功能至关重要。该发现为理解细菌致病机制及分级蛋白分泌的分子基础提供了重要见解。"},{"t":"低分子量凝胶剂的分子尺度调节控制超分子组装并指导人间充质干细胞生长","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523454?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis and characterization of a simple alcohol‐functionalized low‐molecular‐weight gelator (LMWG) based on a 1,3:2,4‐dibenzylidenesorbitol scaffold (DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH) and explore its self‐assembly in comparison to acylhydrazide‐functionalized DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH forms a stiffer, highly organized, less‐soluble self‐assembled hydrogel, with a different assembly mode and much higher entropy/enthalpy of dissociation. On mixing, the LMWGs co‐assemble into gel nanofibers with similar thermodynamics to DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH is an excellent scaffold for the growth of human mesenchymal stem cells (hMSCs), which exhibit extended spread‐shaped morphologies on the gel surface. In contrast, for DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    , hMSCs have a rounded morphology and penetrate into the softer gel. A simple functional group change on the LMWG, therefore, leads to a remarkable change in cell growth outcomes. When hMSCs are grown on the co‐assembled gel, they have the rounded morphology characteristic of DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    but remain on the gel surface, like DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH. The multi‐component gel thus shares characteristics of the individual LMWGs, with hMSC growth being controlled by factors like structure, stiffness, and dynamics. This work demonstrates how chemical manipulation of gels based on deceptively simple LMWGs can have profound impacts in biomaterials engineering.","tp":"超分子组装","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"合成了一种基于1,3:2,4-二亚苄基山梨醇骨架的醇功能化低分子量凝胶剂（DBS-CH2OH），研究了其与酰肼功能化衍生物在超分子自组装方面的差异。DBS-CH2OH形成更硬、更有序的凝胶网络，能够调控人间充质干细胞的生长行为，在组织工程领域具有应用潜力。"},{"t":"原位SN2取代配体工程调控超小CsPbI3量子点，实现高电流效率的明亮Rec.2020纯红钙钛矿LED","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519475?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿量子点LED","kp":["[原位SN2取代配体工程]: 超小CsPbI3量子点","[纯红钙钛矿LED]: 符合Rec.2020标准"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究通过原位SN2取代反应配体工程，制备超小尺寸CsPbI3量子点，实现符合Rec.2020标准纯红光的钙钛矿LED。超小量子点尺寸有效调控带隙实现纯红光发射，配体工程优化表面钝化与电荷传输，显著提升电流效率。该策略解决了纯红光钙钛矿LED发光效率和色纯度难以兼顾的瓶颈，对超高清显示应用具有重要意义。","ot":"Ligand Engineering of Ultrasmall CsPbI3 Quantum Dots via In Situ SN2 Substitution Enables Bright Rec. 2020 Pure‐Red Perovskite LEDs with Exceptional Current Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ultrasmall‐sized cesium lead iodide (CsPbI\n                    3\n                    ) quantum dots (QDs) are promising candidates for achieving spectrally stable pure‐red perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs) meeting Rec. 2020 standards. However, the corresponding devices hardly achieve satisfactory external quantum efficiency (EQE), current efficiency (CE), and luminance simultaneously because of the use of largely excessive insulating long‐chain ligands and additional difficulties in the defect control of ultrasmall CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs. Herein, we develop an alkyl iodide‐assisted ligand modulation strategy for CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs toward high‐efficiency and bright pure‐red PeLEDs. We elucidate an in‐situ nucleophilic bimolecular (S\n                    N\n                    2) substitution reaction between the oleylamine and additionally incorporated short‐chain 1‐iodooctane (IO) molecules during the materials synthesis. The reaction‐generated hydriodic acid (HI) induces non‐destructive surface etching of QDs, enabling exceptional luminescent properties of the strongly confined products. In addition, the S\n                    N\n                    2 reaction‐derived secondary amine strongly adsorbs at the surface of QDs, which stabilizes the products with a reduced ligand density, simultaneously enhancing photoluminescence stability and electrical properties of the assembled emissive layers. The resultant devices emitting at 632 nm demonstrate a peak EQE of 21.56%, an impressive luminance of 13,132 cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and an exceptional CE of 20.73 cd A\n                    −1\n                    , which outperforms state‐of‐the‐art Rec. 2020 pure‐red PeLEDs utilizing ultrasmall‐sized colloidal CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs."},{"t":"通过界面F···S相互作用实现有机-无机异质结构层间耦合：用于近红外光电探测与实时运动识别","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518146?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机无机异质结光电探测","kp":["[界面F···S相互作用]: 有机-无机异质结构层间耦合","[应用]: 近红外光电探测与实时运动识别"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究利用界面F···S相互作用实现有机-无机异质结构的层间耦合，用于近红外光电探测和实时动作识别。层间耦合策略有效调控范德华异质结的光电特性，增强近红外光响应性能。器件在实时动作识别中展现了优异的响应速度和灵敏度，为柔性可穿戴光电器件和智能感知系统的开发提供了新思路。","ot":"Interlayer Coupling in Organic‐Inorganic Heterostructures via Interfacial F···S Interactions for Near‐Infrared Photodetection and Real‐Time Motion Recognition","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Interlayer coupling serves as a powerful strategy for manipulating the optoelectronic characteristics of van der Waals heterostructures. Although the combination of organic and inorganic semiconductors has enabled versatile optoelectronic applications, interlayer coupling in organic–inorganic heterostructures is still limited by inherent material discrepancies such as lattice matching and stacking order. Herein, we demonstrate an interlayer–coupled organic–inorganic heterojunction achieved by interfacial noncovalent F···S interactions, which is composed of molecular 5,5''‐bis(2‐fluorophenyl)‐2,2':5',2''‐terthiophene (oF‐PTTTP) and 2D molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ). By leveraging the conformational flexibility afforded by the full C─C single bonds in its backbone, the oF‐PTTTP molecules can self‐adjust their conformations upon thermal activation. The fluorine atoms on the side chains of oF‐PTTTP engage in noncovalent interactions with the sulfur atoms of MoS\n                    2\n                    at the heterointerface, inducing a pronounced interlayer coupling effect accompanied by lattice strain. This coupling enables near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection in a spectral range inaccessible to each individual component, yielding a specific detectivity of 1.8 × 10\n                    14\n                    Jones at 808 nm, which is one of the highest values reported for organic–inorganic heterostructures. Furthermore, the device exhibits gate‐tunable positive and negative photoresponses at 808 nm, allowing real‐time motion imaging in the NIR spectrum."},{"t":"Fe-镍-聚(七嗪亚胺)中金属种类与含量对其作为锌空电池电催化剂性能的影响","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506308?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池电催化","kp":["催化剂[碱性锌空电池]: Fe-Ni-聚三嗪酰亚胺","[反应]: ORR/OER双功能电催化"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究考察了Fe-Ni-聚三嗪酰亚胺中金属种类和含量对锌空气电池电催化性能的影响。碱性锌空气电池因高理论能量密度受到关注，催化剂的金属组分调控是优化ORR/OER双功能活性的关键。研究发现不同Fe/Ni比例显著影响催化剂的电导率、活性位点密度和稳定性，为合理设计高效双功能电催化剂提供了组分优化指导。","ot":"Influence of Metal Species and Content of Fe‐Ni‐Poly(heptazine imides) on their Properties as Electrocatalysts for Zinc‐Air Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alkaline zinc‐air batteries (ZABs) have attracted interest in recent years for their high theoretical energy density and use of low‐cost, abundant zinc metal as the anode. In order to overcome the activation energy barrier of the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER), noble metals are commonly used. Within this work, transition metal‐functionalized Poly(heptazine imide)s (PHIs) are studied as an alternative and more abundant electrocatalyst, as they offer the homogenous immobilization of metals within their ordered structure. Introducing Fe and Ni into the PHI network enables the formation of single and mixed transition metal PHIs, which show reduced overpotentials for ORR and OER. The formation of Ni single atoms even induces outstanding catalytic activity for the OER during charging of ZAB full cells with performance comparable to that of RuO\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, full cell tests show excellent stability over the course of 250 discharge‐charge cycles, making it a promising system for sustainable energy storage. This work paves the way for the molecular design of a novel material class as an electrocatalyst for ZAB."},{"t":"原位光电化学螯合调控缺陷鲁棒配位微环境以增强水氧化反应","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522149?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OER电催化设计","kp":["[光电化学原位螯合]: 构建缺陷韧性配位微环境","[应用]: 增强水氧化(OER)"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究提出原位光电化学螯合策略，构建缺陷韧性配位微环境以增强水氧化反应。深能级缺陷作为非辐射复合中心严重限制OER性能，该策略通过光电化学过程动态修复缺陷态，稳定配位环境，降低反应能垒。此方法为克服电催化中缺陷诱导的性能衰减提供了新范式，对高效水裂解催化剂设计具有重要意义。","ot":"In Situ Photoelectrochemical Chelation Programs Defect‐Resilient Coordination Microenvironments for Enhanced Water Oxidation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep‐level defects function as non‐radiative recombination centers that throttle oxygen evolution reaction (OER) kinetics. Conventionally, static and pre‐deposited passivation layers often fail during operation, disconnecting defect suppression from the creation and sustained maintenance of catalytically competent sites. Here, we address this limitation with a photoelectrochemically‐driven microenvironment strategy that selectively manipulates the first coordination shell of surface Zn on ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    . Under the in situ photoelectrochemical chelation process, hydroxyethylidene diphosphonic acid writes robust Zn–O–P motifs that subtly distort the Zn–S framework and convert deep traps into shallow states, thereby accelerating charge transfer while suppressing recombination. Density functional theory suggests that Zn–O–P lowers the OER overpotential and switches the rate‐determining step from O\n                    *\n                    →OOH\n                    *\n                    to OOH\n                    *\n                    →O\n                    2\n                    via stabilized\n                    *\n                    OOH intermediates. The optimized photoanode delivers a photocurrent density of 5.38 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V\n                    RHE\n                    , surpassing previously reported ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ‐based photoanodes. By unifying in situ deep‐trap management and active site construction along a single chemical pathway, this work establishes a modular and general route for dynamic defect engineering and active site reconfiguration, advancing defect‐tolerant innovations in energy conversion and storage."},{"t":"通过无偏见的无监督机器学习识别恐龙足迹的变化并对有问题的标本进行分类","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527222122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Machine learning holds great promise for classifying and identifying fossils, and has recently been marshaled to identify trackmakers of dinosaur footprints and address long-standing debates over whether some dinosaur tracks are the oldest birds or ornithopods (duck-billed herbivores and kin) in the fossil record, or alternatively were made by nonavian theropods. Existing methods in paleontology, however, require supervision and a priori labeling of training data by researchers, which can lead to bias. We employ an unsupervised machine learning technique for recognizing inherent patterns in shape data, using a disentangled variational autoencoder network, to a database of 1,974 footprints, spanning a diversity of dinosaurs across their evolutionary history, including modern birds. Our neural network identified eight features of shape variation that most differentiate these tracks: overall load and shape (amount of ground contact area), digit spread, digit attachment, heel load, digit and heel emphasis, loading position, heel position, and left–right load. With the unsupervised process finished, we a posteriori labeled each track based on published expert judgments, plotted them into morphospace, and applied distance metrics to group means and nearest neighbors, which showed 80 to 93% agreement with expert identifications. Controversial Late Triassic-Early Jurassic bird-like tracks group with fossil and modern birds and some Middle Jurassic three-toed tracks with ornithopods, supporting an older origin for these groups than recorded by body fossils. We provide an app, DinoTracker, to make this process accessible, and source code that can be adapted to other cases where paleontologists or biologists are studying patterns of shape variation.","tp":"足迹机器学","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"机器学习在古生物化石的分类和识别方面展现出巨大潜力，近期被用于确定恐龙足迹的制造者，以解决某些恐龙足迹究竟是最古老的鸟类或鸟脚类，还是非鸟兽脚类动物留下的这一长期争议。然而，现有的古生物学机器学习方法需要研究人员进行监督和先验的训练数据标注，这不可避免地引入人为偏见。为解决这一问题，研究人员提出利用无监督机器学习技术，无偏见地识别恐龙足迹变化并对存疑标本进行分类，从而提供更客观的古生物学分析。"},{"t":"基于广义纳什均衡的海岛配电网氢储能优化配置：兼顾经济性、韧性与低碳","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000437?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢储能配置","kp":["[氢储配置]: 孤岛配电网广义纳什均衡优化"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Generalized Nash equilibrium-based optimal configuration of hydrogen energy storage in island distribution networks considering economy, resilience, and low-carbon"},{"t":"通过无LiF正极-电解质界面相提升高质量负载富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4正极的快充性能","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506130?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LMFP正极快充","kp":["正极[锂离子电池]: 富锰Li[Mn1-xFx]PO4","[无LiF界面CEI]: 高质量负载快充性能提升"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4（LMFP）正极材料在高负载量下的快充性能瓶颈，通过构建无LiF型正极-电解质界面膜（CEI）实现突破。LMFP作为新一代锂离子电池正极候选材料，高负载下离子传输阻抗增大导致快充性能下降。LiF-free CEI策略有效改善了界面离子传导，提升了高面密度电极的快充循环稳定性，为高能量密度磷酸盐正极的工程化应用提供新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Enhanced Fast‐Charging Performance of High‐Mass‐Loading Mn‐Rich Li[Mn1‐xFex]PO4 Cathodes via LiF‐Less Cathode–Electrolyte Interphase","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mn‐rich Li[Mn\n                    1‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    Fe\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    ]PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP) cathodes are promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries due to their structural stability and cost‐effectiveness. However, under industrially relevant high‐mass‐loading conditions, they still suffer from severe performance degradation, particularly during fast charging. In this study, we systematically demonstrate that charge‐transfer resistance, rather than bulk Li\n                    +\n                    diffusivity, governs the kinetic limitations of LMFP electrodes with an areal capacity of ∼3.5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    (∼23 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    mass loading). Surface analyses reveal that the buildup of electronically and ionically insulating LiF at the cathode–electrolyte interphase (CEI) is the primary cause of sluggish charge transfer, highlighting a previously overlooked detrimental role of LiF. Guided by this insight, we implement an interfacial engineering strategy that suppresses LiF formation at the CEI. Remarkably, the resulting high‐mass‐loading LMFP cathodes deliver a 1.6‐fold increase in capacity at 5C and retain ∼87% of their initial capacity after 100 cycles at 2C. Moreover,\n                    operando\n                    structural analysis reveals that electrodes with LiF‐suppressed CEI maintain a robust single‐phase transition during fast cycling, directly linking interfacial LiF suppression to significantly enhanced charge‐transfer kinetics. This work highlights the critical importance of CEI engineering in enabling fast‐charging Mn‐rich olivine cathodes under practical, high‐mass‐loading conditions."},{"t":"综合能源系统集群的分布式协同优化：基于一致性算法与逻辑函数的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源调度","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on consensus algorithm and logistic function"},{"t":"揭示硬碳中原子电子结构动力学与位点占据转变对钠离子存储的调控机制","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519384?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳储钠机制","kp":["[分析方法]: operando 23Na NMR","[发现]: 微孔壁碳层贡献硬碳电子结构"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究聚焦硬碳负极材料在钠离子电池中的储钠机制，通过解析原子级电子结构动力学与晶格位点占据态转变，揭示硬碳嵌钠的微观过程。硬碳储钠机理长期存在争议，本工作利用先进表征手段追踪钠离子在硬碳不同结构位点的嵌入/转化路径，阐明了原子电子结构演变与储钠容量之间的内在关联，为高容量钠电负极材料的理性设计提供原子尺度的理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Deciphering Atomic Electronic Structure Dynamics and Site Occupancy Transitions in Dictating Sodium Storage in Hard Carbon","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deciphering the hard carbon (HC) sodiation mechanism is essential for HC's rational design, but is confused by sodium insertion and pore‐filling in the plateau region due to HC's microstructural heterogeneity. This work leverages high‐resolution\n                    13\n                    C NMR and\n                    operando\n                    23\n                    Na NMR, which identify the carbon layer lining the micropore‐wall as a contributor to HC's electronic structure beyond the quasi‐metallic sodium clusters during the early plateau region. The stage coincides with a sodium occupancy transition of Na\n                    +\n                    initially residing in graphitic interlayers into sodium clusters in micropores. The synergy of these changes consequently leads to the reduction of the Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion coefficient. These results demonstrate how the carbon matrix itself, not just the pore architecture, controls the critical plateau electrochemistry in HC. Moreover, these findings provide conclusive evidence for an advanced theoretical framework of HC sodiation through three stages, and underscore the tailoring of electronic environments and Na occupancy for advanced HCs.","aip":1},{"t":"十字铰链共轭聚合物解锁导电-亲水-难溶三元协同，用于高性能水系钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00426-7?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池有机电极","kp":["[聚合物设计]: 十字铰链共轭聚合物","[特性]: 导电/亲水/不溶三重统一","工作温度[水系钠离子电池]: 零下至高温"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究设计了十字铰链型共轭聚合物，同时实现高导电性、亲水性和不溶性三重平衡，用于高性能水系钠离子电池。有机电池材料长期难以兼顾导电、水相容和结构稳定，该分子设计通过刚性十字构型锁住链间堆叠，提升电子传输并抑制溶解。该策略突破了水系有机电池的循环稳定性和倍率性能瓶颈。","ot":"Cruciform-hinged conjugated polymers unlock the conductivity-hydrophilicity-insolubility triad for high-performance aqueous sodium-ion batteries","b":"Organic materials for batteries often struggle to be conductive, water compatible, and stable all at once. We designed a conjugated polymer with a twist—the incorporation of “cruciform hinges”—to finally achieve this trifecta. This molecular architecture enables high-power, long-lasting aqueous sodium-ion batteries that perform reliably from sub-zero to high temperatures. Our work provides a new blueprint for creating durable and safe organic batteries for real-world sustainable energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"考虑动态交通流分布的耦合能源-交通网络韧性提升策略：多类型移动应急资源协同调度","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600019X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源交通网络韧性","kp":["[网络韧性]: 多类型移动应急资源耦合"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"Coupled energy-transportation network resilience improvement strategy considering dynamic traffic flow distribution: Multi-type Mobile emergency resources collaborative scheduling"},{"t":"零排放氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池系统电热平衡特性研究——面向船舶混合推进系统集成","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000784?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨燃料电池","kp":["燃料[SOFC船舶]: 氨燃料零排放","[集成]: 混合推进系统电热平衡"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"Characterizing electro-thermal balance of zero-emission ammonia-fed solid oxide fuel cell systems integrated into hybrid propulsion plant for marine applications"},{"t":"基于Stackelberg博弈的综合能源系统与加氢站双层分布鲁棒协同优化","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢站协同优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 分布鲁棒双层Stackelberg博弈"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station based on stackelberg game"},{"t":"杆状病毒劫持宿主中肠衍生的速激肽来调节趋光攀爬行为并促进病毒传播","d":"2026-01-27","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524226123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Baculoviruses are large DNA viruses that mainly infect insects. During infection, viral egress from midgut cells and subsequent behavior changes lead to terminally infected insects migrating to higher elevations on plant branches or tree limbs. However, the neural mechanisms driving this hyperactivity remain poorly understood. In this study, we demonstrate that the climbing behavior of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    larvae enhances the dispersal of\n                    Helicoverpa armigera\n                    single nucleopolyhedrovirus (HearNPV). Our findings reveal that HearNPV triggers a calcium response in enteroendocrine cells, leading to the release of midgut-derived tachykinin (TK). Released TK activates its receptor (TKR) in the brain, thereby promoting phototaxis and climbing behavior. Additionally,\n                    HaTTD14\n                    functions as a downstream regulator of the TK–TKR signaling pathway. These results provide insights into the neural and molecular mechanisms driving baculovirus-induced hyperactivity, which aids in viral transmission.","tp":"病毒行为控","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"杆状病毒是一种主要感染昆虫的大型DNA病毒。研究表明，病毒感染会导致患病昆虫（如棉铃虫幼虫）表现出异常的趋光攀爬行为，迁移到植物较高的位置，这种高度活跃的行为极大地促进了病毒的传播和分散。尽管这种通过改变宿主行为来利于病毒扩散的现象已被观察到，但其背后的具体神经机制目前仍不明确，是当前该领域研究的重点方向。"},{"t":"CIGS与CdTe薄膜太阳能光伏作为电动汽车充电站潜在能源采集系统的评估：印度对比案例研究","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏电池","kp":["光伏类型[EV充电]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Charging Stations: A comparative case study in India"},{"t":"基于误差函数SoC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案——面向可再生能源直流船载微电网分布式电池储能系统","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能SOC均衡控制","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewable energy-based DC shipboard microgrid"},{"t":"面向高比例可再生能源电力系统频率与电压安全协同的稳定约束市场出清与定价方法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场出清","kp":["[电力市场]: 稳定性约束出清与定价"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A stability-constrained market clearing and pricing approach for coordinated frequency and voltage security in high-renewable electric power systems"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-27","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场竞价","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid power systems"},{"t":"iDesignGPT通过大语言模型智能体工作流增强概念设计","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68672-1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LLM Agent设计","kp":["[框架]: LLM多智能体协作","[应用]: 概念工程设计动态问题精炼与设计空间探索"],"as":"概念工程设计长期受限于传统方法与新兴AI工具各自的能力边界。iDesignGPT构建了一套基于大语言模型的多智能体工作流框架，通过角色分工的智能体协作完成需求分析、方案生成、评估迭代等设计环节。系统将LLM的领域知识推理与工程约束验证深度耦合，显著提升概念设计阶段的自动化程度与方案质量，展示了Agent范式在复杂工程系统设计中的应用潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"iDesignGPT enhances conceptual design via large language model agentic workflows","b":"Conceptual engineering system design faces challenges from traditional methods and emerging AI tools to fully address its inherently complex, dynamic, and creativity-driven demands. iDesignGPT is a framework that integrates large language models with established design methodologies to enable dynamic multi-agent collaboration for problem refinement, information gathering, design space exploration, and evaluation. By incorporating design metrics such as coverage, diversity, and novelty, iDesignGPT provides quantitative insights for early-stage conceptual design. Performance evaluations across six public design challenges show that iDesignGPT achieves competitive novelty and consistently higher originality and modularity than GPT-4o zero-shot, GPT-4o chain-of-thought and Deepseek-r1, based on metrics and expert assessments. Two controlled user studies show positive reception across profiles and, for novice designers, lower mental demand than human-only design and clearer design flow with iDesignGPT. These results establish iDesignGPT as a practical framework for integrating language-model agents with established engineering design methods, enabling metrics-driven support for conceptual design by both expert and novice designers."},{"t":"[ASAP] 水系锌离子电池非晶电极材料的最新进展","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03711","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌离子电池电极","kp":["[材料形态]: 无定形电极材料","[电池体系]: 水系锌离子电池"],"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Recent Advances in Amorphous Electrode Materials for Aqueous Zinc-Ion Batteries"},{"t":"[ASAP] 聚烯烃C-H插入功能化实现多功能聚烯烃-聚酯相容化","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20245","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚烯烃相容剂","kp":["[功能化方法]: C–H插入官能化聚烯烃","[应用]: 聚烯烃-PET共混废弃物相容化回收","[解决问题]: 共混相分离致力学性能劣化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过C–H键插入反应对聚烯烃（如聚乙烯、聚丙烯）进行功能化修饰，以解决混合塑料废料因不相容性难以回收的难题。通过在聚烯烃分子链上引入功能基团，可改善其与其他聚合物共混时的界面相容性，从而为混合塑料废弃物的有效回收和高值化利用提供新策略，属于高分子化学与绿色化学交叉方向的前沿探索。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] C–H Insertion Functionalization of Polyolefins for Versatile Polyolefin-Polyester Compatibilization","b":"The effective recycling of commingled plastic waste blends remains a major challenge due to the immiscibility of commonly used polymers like polyethylene terephthalate (PET) with polyolefins, including high- or low-density polyethylene (HDPE, LDPE) and isotactic polypropylene (iPP). This immiscibility causes phase separation of the polymers in the blend, compromising the mechanical properties of these mixtures. Herein, we report a versatile and robust strategy to synthesize polar-group pendant polyolefins via C-H insertion from preexisting polymers, which can subsequently act as compatibilizers for blends of PET with different polyolefins. The addition of 0.5-1.0 wt % of these functionalized polyolefins to blends of PET with HDPE, LDPE, or iPP significantly improved the elongation at break, effectively restoring their material properties. This approach can be applied to prepare a compatibilizer from postconsumer HDPE bottlecaps. The waste derived compatibilizer effectively compatibilized postconsumer PET/HDPE blends, demonstrating the versatility of this method as a low-cost, efficient, and adaptable solution for restoring PET/polyolefin blend properties.","aip":1},{"t":"[尽快] 修正“铁 (II) 和 2-氧化戊二酸依赖性卤化酶的区域和立体选择性卤化作用”","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23050","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化卤化","as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":0.0,"t":6.0}},{"t":"[ASAP] 二卤碳烯与烯烃反应中的双峰 (2 + 1)/(4 + 1) 拟周环过渡态","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c13906","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report the first example of ambimodal (2 + 1)/(4 + 1) pseudopericyclic transition states (TSs) in reactions between dihalocarbenes and olefins. Quasi-classical molecular dynamics simulations of the model reaction between dibromocarbene and 1,2-bis(methylene)cycloheptane reveal a single ambimodal TS that bifurcates to the experimentally observed (2 + 1) and (4 + 1) products. Intrinsic bond orbital (IBO) and principal interacting orbital (PIO) analyses attribute this ambimodality to the amphiphilicity of dibromocarbene: its empty p-type orbital engages the diene HOMO, while its σ-lone pair interacts with both the C2 and C4 lobes of the diene LUMO. The resulting ambimodal transition structure displays a large disparity in competing bond lengths─an outlier relative to established correlations between bond length differences and ambimodal selectivity. Entropic path sampling reveals a pronounced entropic trap along the (2 + 1) pathway, giving rise to a post-transition-state dynamical intermediate that promotes extensive roaming rather than immediate product formation. This dynamic window allows the weaker (4 + 1) interaction to develop and compete, thereby enabling ambimodality despite the substantial bond length difference. An analogous ambimodal (2 + 1)/(4 + 1) cycloaddition is identified between nucleophilic dimethoxycarbene and alkenyl aldehyde relevant to natural product synthesis, underscoring the generality and synthetic utility of this manifold. Together, these findings reveal how structure, orbital interactions, and post-transition-state dynamics cooperatively govern ambimodal selectivity in this previously unrecognized carbene reaction manifold and provide a foundation for developing new strategies to tune reaction selectivity.","tp":"碳烯反应机","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"首次报道二卤碳烯与烯烃反应中存在双峰(2+1)/(4+1)拟周环过渡态。准经典分子动力学模拟揭示了二溴卡宾与双亚甲基环庚烷反应中单一过渡态分叉产生两种实验产物的机制，IBO和PIO分析将其归因于双亲性轨道相互作用，对理解有机反应机理具有理论意义。"},{"t":"对映选择性决定位点：不对称氢原子转移的机理框架","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526135?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称氢原子转移","kp":["[关键挑战]: 自由基高反应性致过渡态松散、ΔΔG‡小","[竞争路径]: 快速消旋背景反应","[覆盖体系]: 小分子/金属自由基/协同/多肽催化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了不对称氢原子转移（HAT）反应的对映选择性控制机制框架。不对称HAT一直是有机自由基化学的核心难题，因为自由基的高反应活性使得手性诱导极具挑战性。作者通过深入分析手性催化剂与底物相互作用的关键过渡态，阐明了对映选择性在催化循环中被确定的精确位置，为设计高效不对称自由基反应提供了理论指导。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Where Enantioselection is Set: A Mechanistic Framework for Asymmetric Hydrogen‐Atom Transfer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Hydrogen‐atom transfer (HAT) lies at the heart of radical chemistry, yet asymmetric HAT has been difficult because the high reactivity of radicals often forces H‐transfer to proceed through early, weakly organized transition states, yielding small ΔΔG\n                    ‡\n                    and allowing rapid racemic background pathways to compete. Recent advances across small‐molecule, metalloradical, cooperative, peptide, and enzymatic catalysis show that high enantioselectivity is attainable when the catalyst is engineered to exert stereocontrol precisely at the H‐transfer step that sets configuration. In this minireview, we organize asymmetric HAT into five regimes—donation‐controlled termination, radical‐centered control, abstraction‐controlled HAT, cooperative bimetallic catalysis, and enzyme‐mediated HAT—each specified by where chiral information is introduced during H‐transfer. Through representative cases, we illustrate how catalysts achieve enantioselection by defining radical geometry, guiding H‐delivery, enforcing selective hydrogen abstraction, or confining donor–acceptor pairs within organized chiral environments. This mechanistic framework provides a unified lens spanning synthetic and biocatalytic systems, clarifies the distinct stereochemical logics in each regime, and highlights emerging opportunities for expanding asymmetric radical chemistry through precisely orchestrated H‐atom transfer."},{"t":"重视混合能源系统的操作灵活性：汉密尔顿-雅可比-贝尔曼方程的神经解","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600070X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源灵活性","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过高熵氧化物钠离子电池中的构型熵设计调节晶体场稳定能量","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000283?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵钠电池","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","aip":1},{"t":"能源补贴改革的异质影响：蒙古能源补贴的针对性不强","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600039X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源补贴改革","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"基于烷烯基系带二芳基硼单元的可逆π-极性反转实现温度响应近红外发射","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523338?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼基近红外发光","kp":["[π-极性反转]: 可逆实现温度响应近红外发射","[路易斯碱配位]: 三配位硼基→四配位电子性质翻转"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种基于烯基桥联二芳基硼基单元的可逆π-极性反转策略，实现温度响应型近红外发射。三配位硼基与路易斯碱配位生成四配位物种，逆转硼中心电子性质，从而调控发光波长。温度变化驱动配位-解配平衡可逆切换，使材料在近红外区域表现出温度依赖的发射行为，在温度传感、生物成像和智能光学器件方面具有应用潜力。","ot":"Temperature‐Responsive Near‐Infrared Emission Enabled by Reversible π‐Umpolung with an Alkenyl‐Strapped Diarylboryl Unit","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Coordination of a Lewis base to a tricoordinate boryl group generates a tetracoordinate species, thereby inverting the electronic character of the boryl substituents from electron‐accepting to electron‐donating. Utilizing this π‐umpolung strategy, we report temperature‐responsive fluorophores that emit in the near‐infrared (NIR) region. To achieve reversible π‐umpolung, we designed a diarylboryl unit in which two aryl rings are tethered by an alkenyl linker. This alkenyl‐strapped scaffold engages in a weak olefin–borane interaction and undergoes frustrated Lewis pair (FLP)‐type addition even with bulky neutral Lewis bases such as tricyclohexylphosphine (PCy\n                    3\n                    ). When boryl groups are installed at both termini of 4,7‐di(2‐thienyl)‐2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole, coordination of PCy\n                    3\n                    induces pronounced red‐shifts in the emission spectra. In polar acetonitrile, the emission maximum reaches 732 nm, entering the NIR region. This red shift arises from the strong σ‐donating character of the resulting tetracoordinate boron centers, which enhance intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) character in the excited state. Unlike conventional dimesitylborane–fluoride complexes, the FLP‐type adducts exhibit reversible, temperature‐dependent shifts in the dissociation/association equilibrium. Although the solvent polarity influences the equilibrium, modulation of phosphine Lewis basicity enables reversible dissociation even in polar media, allowing this system to display large emission changes spanning the visible to NIR region."},{"t":"协同运维赋能海上风电全生命周期感知的机会性管理","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000760?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海上风电运维","kp":["[海上风电]: 全生命周期运维机会管理"],"dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Synergistic operation and maintenance enabling lifecycle-aware opportunistic management of offshore wind energy"},{"t":"亚5分钟超快生长毫米级长度碲纳米线及其宽带体光伏响应","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517882?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"碲纳米线光电探测","kp":["生长时间[碲纳米线]: <5分钟","尺度[碲纳米线]: 毫米级长度","[体光伏效应]: 零偏压极化依赖光响应","[窄带隙vdW半导体]: 表面自限制生长"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现亚5分钟超快生长毫米级碲纳米线，并展示其宽带体光伏响应。体光伏效应（BPVE）以极化依赖的零偏压光响应为特征，突破了传统pn结光伏的Shockley-Queisser极限。碲纳米线的一维结构与其强自旋轨道耦合特性使BPVE在宽光谱范围内高效产生光电流，为超快合成、低维光电材料及自驱动光探测器提供了新路径。","ot":"Sub‐5‐Min Ultrafast Growth of Millimeter‐Scale‐Length Tellurium Nanowires With Broadband Bulk Photovoltaic Response","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bulk photovoltaic effect (BPVE) featured by polarization‐dependent photoresponse at zero external bias exhibits huge potential for exploiting next‐generation photodetectors. However, the BPVE is mainly limited in the wide‐bandgap ferroelectrics and complex van der Waals (vdW) heterostructures and scarcely demonstrated in narrow‐bandgap vdW semiconductors. Here we develop a surface self‐limiting diffusion driven growth strategy to rapidly synthesize millimeter‐scale‐length narrow‐bandgap tellurium (Te) single‐crystal nanowires with highly uniform non‐centrosymmetric structure. The sub‐5‐min ultrafast growth‐a feat not realized in prior Te synthesis arises from ultralow self‐limiting diffusion and nucleation barriers of H\n                    2\n                    Te precursors in a hydrogen‐assisted space‐confined environment. The fabricated photodetectors show broadband BPVE response from 520 nm to 4.6 µm, ultrahigh peak responsibility of 220 A/W and blackbody responsivity of 2.3 A/W, which are far superior to the state‐of‐the‐art self‐powered vdW devices. Furthermore, we demonstrate high‐resolution polarization imaging and BPVE detector arrays in a single Te nanowire. This work opens perspectives of ultralong Te nanowires with robust BPVE for the development of high‐performance on‐chip integrated multidimensional photodetection systems."},{"t":"可拉伸材料展现出超越软组织的极高裂纹萌生抗性","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000453?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高抗裂可拉伸材料","kp":["[可拉伸材料]: 抗裂纹萌生性能超越软组织"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stretchable materials show high crack-initiation resistance that exceeds soft tissues"},{"t":"堆叠重叠石墨炔纳米离子电子学增强单价/二价阳离子选择性——面向单细胞应用","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag050/8440139?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨二炔离子电子学","kp":["[材料体系]: 石墨双炔亚纳米孔调控离子输运","[离子选择性]: 单价/二价阳离子选择性增强","[应用场景]: 单细胞pH检测"],"as":"该研究开发了一种基于堆叠-重叠构型的石墨双炔（graphdiyne）纳米离子电子学器件，能够有效抑制多价离子间的串扰干扰，实现对单价和多价离子的高选择性、高灵敏度传输与检测。石墨双炔独特的二维孔道结构和堆叠几何排列为离子筛分提供了精确的尺寸排阻与电荷筛选机制。该器件在复杂生理环境下的精准离子测量中具有广泛应用前景，包括生物传感、离子分离和神经接口等领域。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stacked-overlapped graphdiyne nano-iontronics enabling enhanced monovalent/divalent cation selectivity for single-cell p","b":"Developing nano-iontronic devices that minimize ionic interference is essential for precise measurements in complex physiological systems. Graphdiyne (GDY), a novel carbon allotrope featuring sub-nanometer pores, enables effective regulation of ionic transport and is therefore a promising material for high-performance iontronic applications. Here, we report a pH-responsive nano-iontronic device fabricated by stacking and overlapping graphdiyne (so-GDY) layers onto the tip of the nanopipette. This so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic sensor exhibits a linear decrease in ionic current under negative potential as the pH decreases from 8.00 to 5.50. This response is attributed to protonation of the oxygen-containing functional groups on the so-GDY surface and edges, which diminishes the negative surface charge and thereby reduces ionic conductivity. A key advantage of this nano-iontronic device is its excellent selectivity, demonstrating robust resistance to interference from divalent cations (Mg²⁺, Ca²⁺) and small molecules within the pH range 8.00-5.50, while maintaining stable detection currents. The so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic device achieves typical monovalent-to-divalent cation selectivity ratio (<0.4), alongside excellent repeatability, reversibility, and stability. This combination of features yields a biocompatible, high-resolution tool for minimally invasive, real-time pH measurements at the single-cell and even at a single-organelle level, opening new avenues for investigating cellular dynamics and disease pathogenesis with enhanced clarity.","aip":1},{"t":"溶液加工柔性类玻璃抗菌纳米复合涂层","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519048?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究通过溶液加工技术制备了一种柔性、类玻璃质感的抗菌纳米复合涂层，专门针对高频接触电子显示屏表面的病原微生物污染问题。涂层将纳米抗菌剂均匀分散于柔性透明基质中，兼具高透光率、优异的抗菌活性和良好的机械柔韧性。与刚性传统涂层不同，该材料可适应曲面和柔性显示屏，具有规模化涂覆潜力。该成果在公共场所触控屏、医疗设备显示屏和消费电子领域具有广阔的商业应用前景。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗菌纳米复合涂层","kp":["[溶液加工]: 柔性类玻璃抗菌纳米复合涂层","[应用]: 高触控电子显示器保护涂层"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Solution‐Processed Flexible Glass‐Like Antibacterial Nanocomposite Coatings","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐touch electronic displays represent a significant source of pathogenic contamination, creating an urgent need for protective coatings that combine antibacterial efficacy and mechanical robustness. However, developing protective coatings for emerging flexible displays faces a formidable challenge, as they must simultaneously satisfy a series of often‐conflicting property requirements: potent antibacterial activity, high biocompatibility, excellent transparency, robust mechanical durability, as well as intrinsic flexibility. Developing a single coating that integrates all the required functionalities therefore remains a highly anticipated goal. Herein, we resolve this challenge through an “all‐in‐one” precursor strategy involving the incorporation of the bifunctional coupling agent, 3‐mercaptopropyltrimethoxysilane, into a perhydropolysilazane‐Ag\n                    +\n                    system. This multicomponent design enables a synergistic chemical cascade that controls the in situ formation, stabilization, and subsequent covalent anchoring of silver nanoparticles within a dense SiO\n                    x\n                    matrix during a mild curing process. The resulting coating demonstrates a seamless integration of multiple high‐performance properties: potent and durable antibacterial activity (&gt;99.99%), excellent biocompatibility, polymer‐like flexibility, glass‐like damage tolerance, and high transparency. This work provides a reliable and scalable approach for fabricating robust, multifunctional protective surfaces, making it highly promising for next‐generation flexible electronics where both durability and hygiene are paramount."},{"t":"大面积二维材料的单点位定向外延生长","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520837?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种单点位定向外延（single-site-directed unidirectional epitaxy）策略，用于大规模合成范德华层状二维材料。传统外延生长常面临多晶成核、晶界密度高和取向不一致等问题，严重制约二维材料的晶圆级集成。该方法通过在衬底上精确定义单一成核点位，引导晶体沿单一方向均匀扩展，从而获得大面积、单晶、无晶界的高质量二维薄膜。这一突破为二维材料在集成电路、光电器件和柔性电子中的产业化应用奠定了基础。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"2D材料定向外延","kp":["[单点位定向外延]: 大规模2D材料均匀晶向生长","[多晶域合并]: 关键依赖统一结晶取向"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Single‐Site‐Directed Unidirectional Epitaxy of Large‐Scale 2D Materials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Large‐scale synthesis of van der Waals (vdW) layered 2D materials remain a major challenge for their integration into high‐performance electronics and optoelectronics. Although the multi‐grain coalescence method provides a promising route to large‐area growth, its success critically depends on achieving uniform crystallographic orientation across all nucleated domains, a challenge that has not yet been fully resolved. Here, we present an effective strategy for realizing unidirectional epitaxial growth of 2D materials by controllably introducing single active sites on flat terraces. Using the heteroepitaxy of MoSe\n                    2\n                    on Au(111) as a model system, we combine molecular beam epitaxy with first‐principles calculations to validate this mechanism. We show that Se adsorption disrupts the intrinsic herringbone reconstruction of Au(111), releasing surface Au atoms that aggregate into stable dimers. These dimers act as symmetry‐breaking nucleation centers, guiding the unidirectional alignment of MoSe\n                    2\n                    domains. From the perspective of interfacial interactions, we further clarify how substrate surface activation enhances the epitaxial quality of 2D materials. This work establishes a scalable pathway toward large‐scale single‐crystal 2D films and provides a conceptual framework for advancing the epitaxial growth of 2D materials.","aip":1},{"t":"具有声漂白配体的自组装钌配合物用于增强肿瘤穿透和免疫原性超声治疗","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523608?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Ruthenium complexes, which can be activated with precise light‐induced spatiotemporal control, are recognized as promising candidates for cancer therapy. However, the inadequate tumor penetration and their dependence on light activation present challenges to deeper clinical application. Herein, we introduce a charge‐reversal strategy to enhance tumor penetration and cellular uptake of RuIR783, a self‐assembled metalloprodrug activated by ultrasound, thereby enabling deep tissue penetration. RuIR783 is synthesized by coordinating a Ru(II) polypyridyl complex with a heptamethine cyanine dye bearing two hydrophilic sulfonic groups. The cyanine dye component serves as both the ultrasound antenna and the self‐assembly motif. RuIR783 self‐assembles into large nanoparticles with negatively charged surfaces, facilitating their circulation in the bloodstream and accumulation at tumor sites. Upon ultrasound irradiation, the cyanine scaffold within the accumulated RuIR783 nanoparticles undergoes rapid sonobleaching, resulting in their transformation into smaller nanofragments with cationic surface charges. This transformation enhanced tumor penetration by 6.5‐fold and cellular internalization by 4.2‐fold. The generation of singlet oxygen and monocationic anticancer Ru complexes enhances the efficacy of immunogenic cell death through mitochondrial damage, achieving a 90.5% tumor inhibition rate. This study demonstrates the first ultrasound‐mediated activation of metalloprodrugs for immunogenic tumor treatment through morphological transformation and charge reversal."},{"t":"面向大面积单片钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的可扩展沉积与干燥方法","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06772C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿硅叠层电池","kp":["[认证效率]: PCE>34%(钙钛矿/硅叠层,实验室)","[规模化挑战]: 沉积与干燥方法的可扩展性","[器件规模]: 中试线阶段"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该综述聚焦大面积单片钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的可扩展沉积与干燥方法。单结钙钛矿/硅叠层电池认证转换效率已突破33%，但从实验室小面积向工业级大面积制备的放大仍面临薄膜均匀性、界面缺陷和溶剂干燥控制等挑战。文章系统评述了刮刀涂布、真空沉积、喷雾涂布等可扩展工艺，以及溶剂工程和干燥动力学对钙钛矿薄膜质量的影响，为实现商业化大面积叠层组件提供技术路线参考。","ot":"Scalable deposition and drying methods toward large-area monolithic perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells","b":"Monolithic perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells have emerged as a compelling route, combining the certified power conversion efficiencies exceeding 34% for laboratory-scale devices with more cost-effective manufacturing compared to market-established silicon photovoltaics. Despite deployment in pilot processing lines beyond the lab stage, this technology still faces scaling challenges from perovskite sub-cells, such as the incompatibility with contemporary mass production lines and the upscaling efficiency deficit, that are expected to be resolved within a few years to achieve commercial viability. Here, we comprehensively elaborate the scalable deposition and drying methods of perovskite sub-cells on silicon substrates and review their recent advanced progress. We assess the merits and limitations of these competing methods, providing a systematic framework for achieving efficient and durable large-area perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells suitable for industrial production."},{"t":"可逆金属协调开关通过双重死亡和免疫协同作用实现可激活的声动力疗法","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521565?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sonodynamic therapy (SDT) holds great potential for disease treatment, yet its efficacy is limited by constitutive reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation and poor selectivity. Herein, we report a generalizable strategy using reversible metal‐ion coordination to regulate the sonodynamic activity of semiconducting polymers (SPs). A diketopyrrolopyrrole (DPP)‐based polymer (SPC) serves as the coordination scaffold, where binding with transition metal ions (Cu\n                    2+\n                    , Co\n                    2+\n                    , Zn\n                    2+\n                    , Fe\n                    3+\n                    ) redistributes electron density and increases the singlet–triplet energy gap (Δ\n                    \n                      E\n                      ST\n                    \n                    ), thereby effectively suppressing ROS generation. Among them, Cu\n                    2+\n                    is selected as a model ion due to its reductive responsiveness to glutathione (GSH) in the tumor microenvironment (TME). This enables SPCu to remain inactive during systemic circulation and become selectively reactivated within the TME. Released copper further induces mitochondrial dysfunction and cuproptosis, synergizing with ultrasound‐triggered ROS‐driven PANoptosis. Together, this dual‐death mechanism elicits robust tumor ablation, immunogenic cell death, and immune cell activation, leading to systemic antitumor immunity. Collectively, this study presents a reversible, metal coordination–based platform for constructing activatable organic sonosensitizers, offering precise SDT with immuno‐therapeutic synergy.","tp":"声动力治疗材料","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道利用可逆金属离子配位调控半导体聚合物声动力活性的通用策略。以DPP基聚合物为配位骨架，与过渡金属结合形成可逆配位开关，通过调节活性氧生成实现双重细胞死亡和免疫协同效应，显著提升声动力疗法的选择性和疗效。"},{"t":"基于铁电二维半导体的可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管，用于感知精度、上下文","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521243?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    To realize in‐memory sensing and computing platforms, it is essential to integrate sensing, computation, and memory functionalities within a single device, enabling energy‐ and time‐efficient vision systems with high perceptual precision. However, achieving such multi‐functional processing capability within a compact device structure remains a major challenge. Here, a reconfigurable vertical photodiode based on α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    is presented, a ferroelectric 2D semiconductor. Gradual and reversible modulation of built‐in electric fields at the top and bottom Schottky junctions is achieved through partial out‐of‐plane polarization switching of α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    , enabling multi‐level, non‐volatile, and polarity‐tunable photoresponsivity. This allows analog programmability with a high degree of freedom in processing within a two‐terminal metal‐ferroelectric semiconductor‐metal (MFsM) structure, effectively resolving trade‐off between structural compactness and computing versatility. Leveraging these intrinsic characteristics, we demonstrate a versatile sensor‐level perceptual processing framework using a reconfigurable photodiode crossbar array. By exploiting the high‐density spatial integration capability, the system adaptively configures its spatial support to prioritize either suppressing environmental noise for robust feature extraction or preserving fine‐grained details for precise classification, depending on the task requirements. These results lay the foundation for highly scalable and energy‐efficient neuromorphic vision system with high perceptual precision.","tp":"铁电光电二极管","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基于α-In2Se3铁电二维半导体构建可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管，实现感存算一体化。器件在单一结构内集成感知、计算和存储功能，兼具高感知精度和上下文处理能力，为开发节能高效视觉系统和类脑计算平台提供了器件层面的创新方案。"},{"t":"基于多元高斯与切比雪夫映射的进化模糊系统实时风电功率预测","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000395?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电功率预测","kp":["[预测方法]: 演化模糊系统(多元高斯+Chebyshev映射)","应用[风电]: 实时功率预测"],"dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Real-time wind power forecasting using an evolving fuzzy system based on Multivariate Gaussian and Chebyshev mapping"},{"t":"含卤代醌端基的有机半导体用于高灵敏短波红外探测与成像","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522336?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体红外探测","kp":["[卤代醌式端基]: 有机半导体SWIR探测与成像","[溶液加工]: 大面积低成本SWIR传感器阵列"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了含卤代醌型端基的有机半导体材料，用于短波红外（SWIR）探测与成像。通过溶液加工法制备，具备低成本、柔性化优势，有望突破传统无机红外探测器制备工艺复杂、成本高昂的瓶颈，在光电探测领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Organic Semiconductors with Halogenated Quinoid Terminals for Sensitive Short‐Wave Infrared Detection and Imaging","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Short‐wave infrared (SWIR) detection and imaging is vital for optoelectronics, and solution‐processed organic semiconductors pave the way for developing large‐area, cost‐effective SWIR sensor arrays compatible with readout integrated circuits through facile pattern‐free processing. However, limited by the energy gap law, molecular skeleton vibrations, especially high‐frequency stretching modes like C─H bonds, induce accelerated non‐radiative decay in SWIR molecules, making the performance of SWIR organic photodetectors (OPDs), particularly in the long‐wavelength region, still lag behind that of commercial inorganic counterparts. Here we develop an efficient molecular engineering strategy to construct vibration‐suppressed SWIR molecules by employing halogenated quinoid terminals. Relative to their analogs with H atoms, halogenated semiconductors show attenuated exciton‐vibration coupling, decreased conformation and energy disorder, as well as enhanced intramolecular charge transfer, resulting in nearly doubled exciton lifetimes and reduced energy disorder from 103 to 66–83 meV, accompanied by 0.1–0.15 eV optical bandgap narrowing. The optimized SWIR OPDs achieve broadband photoresponse (0.3–1.6 µm) and high specific detectivities up to 2.11 × 10\n                    11\n                    Jones at 1.03 µm, overwhelming all reported OPDs with &gt;1.4 µm response and comparable to Ge photodetectors in 0.9–1.4 µm range. Furthermore, we demonstrate an advanced active‐matrix OPD‐based SWIR imaging system prototype, showcasing applicability in diverse SWIR scenarios."},{"t":"基于分层多尺度建模的兆瓦级质子交换膜水电解模块优化设计","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020550?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽优化设计","kp":["规模[PEM电解水]: 兆瓦级模块","[建模]: 分层多尺度建模优化设计"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimal design of megawatt-scale proton exchange membrane water electrolysis module by hierarchical multi-scale modeling"},{"t":"离线逆强化学习联合优化工业光伏-储能系统用能成本与需量电费","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储成本优化","kp":["[方法]: 离线逆强化学习","优化目标[工业PV-电池]: 能耗与需量电费联合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery"},{"t":"拓扑锡薄膜超导异质结构的非破坏性激光纳米图案化","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512571?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"超导体与拓扑材料的异质结被认为是实现拓扑超导和马约拉纳零能模的候选平台，对未来容错拓扑量子计算至关重要。本文提出一种非破坏性激光纳米图案化技术，可在不损伤超导异质结功能的前提下，在拓扑材料表面制备纳米级结构。传统刻蚀工艺易引入缺陷态、破坏超导相干性，而激光直写方案通过精确控制能量沉积实现温和加工。该技术为在超导-拓扑界面上构建可寻址的量子器件阵列提供了新路径，有望加速拓扑量子计算器件从物理验证走向工程集成的进程。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑超导量子计算","kp":["[无损激光纳米图案化]: 拓扑Sn薄膜超导异质结构","[拓扑超导]: 原子级清洁相干界面"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Non‐Destructive Laser Nanopatterning of Superconducting Heterostructures in Topological Sn Thin Films","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterostructures composed of superconductors and topological materials have emerged as compelling platforms for realizing topological superconductivity and fault‐tolerant quantum computation. A critical bottleneck, however, lies in achieving atomically clean and structurally coherent interfaces between dissimilar materials. Here, we report the fabrication of high‐quality planar heterostructures composed of the topological Dirac semimetal (TDS) α‐Sn and the superconducting β‐Sn phase, achieved by focused laser irradiation on α‐Sn thin films. The irradiated regions undergo a phase transition from α‐Sn to β‐Sn, exhibiting atomically smooth surfaces with a root mean square (RMS) roughness of just 0.75 nm. The laser‐induced β‐Sn demonstrates superconductivity with a critical temperature of 3.7 K and a Ginzburg–Landau coherence length (\n                    ξ\n                    GL\n                    ) of 68.2 nm. Notably, β‐Sn nanowires patterned through this method exhibit a pronounced superconducting diode effect, reaching a maximum rectification ratio (\n                    η\n                    ) of 10.8%. These findings establish laser irradiation as a versatile, non‐destructive, and scalable approach for fabricating high‐quality α‐Sn/β‐Sn heterostructures, offering a promising route toward next‐generation superconducting quantum devices."},{"t":"仿生智能新视野：突触器件促进智能机器人技术探索与突破","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000295?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"观点评论","tp":"突触器件机器人","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"天然氢的技术经济分析与估值","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000589?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然氢技术经济评价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Natural hydrogen techno-economics and valuation"},{"t":"低分子量凝胶剂的分子尺度调控控制超分子组装并指导人类间充质 S","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523454?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis and characterization of a simple alcohol‐functionalized low‐molecular‐weight gelator (LMWG) based on a 1,3:2,4‐dibenzylidenesorbitol scaffold (DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH) and explore its self‐assembly in comparison to acylhydrazide‐functionalized DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH forms a stiffer, highly organized, less‐soluble self‐assembled hydrogel, with a different assembly mode and much higher entropy/enthalpy of dissociation. On mixing, the LMWGs co‐assemble into gel nanofibers with similar thermodynamics to DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH is an excellent scaffold for the growth of human mesenchymal stem cells (hMSCs), which exhibit extended spread‐shaped morphologies on the gel surface. In contrast, for DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    , hMSCs have a rounded morphology and penetrate into the softer gel. A simple functional group change on the LMWG, therefore, leads to a remarkable change in cell growth outcomes. When hMSCs are grown on the co‐assembled gel, they have the rounded morphology characteristic of DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    but remain on the gel surface, like DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH. The multi‐component gel thus shares characteristics of the individual LMWGs, with hMSC growth being controlled by factors like structure, stiffness, and dynamics. This work demonstrates how chemical manipulation of gels based on deceptively simple LMWGs can have profound impacts in biomaterials engineering.","tp":"超分子凝胶材料","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"合成醇功能化低分子量凝胶剂DBS-CH2OH，研究其在分子尺度上的调控机制如何控制超分子组装行为，并指导人间充质干细胞的生长与分化。该工作为设计智能化生物材料支架和精准调控细胞微环境提供了分子层面的设计策略。"},{"t":"分拣蛋白对甲状腺球蛋白的分子识别","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68658-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sortilin is a ubiquitous membrane receptor mediating trafficking of protein cargoes. In the thyroid, sortilin binds thyroglobulin (TG) during its endocytosis, a key process in thyroid homeostasis. Although sortilin has been proposed to recognise highly iodinated TG, the molecular details of this interaction remain unknown. In this work, using an integrative structural biology approach, we reveal that sortilin binds an unstructured TG C-terminal peptide and exhibits a strong preference for the monomeric TG over the commonly known dimeric form. We find that sortilin-TG interaction is independent of the iodination state of TG and instead relies on the conversion to its monomeric state, presumably promoted by extracellular degradation. Furthermore, using AlphaPulldown and sequence analysis, we show that recognition of other reported ligands by sortilin likely relies on similar unstructured peptide motifs, which are not constrained to a single binding orientation within the receptor cavity. Overall, this study reveals the TG-sortilin binding interface and provides insights into the recognition mechanism of other cargoes by sortilin.","tp":"蛋白分子识别","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"分拣蛋白是一种介导蛋白质货物转运的普遍存在的膜受体。在甲状腺中，分拣蛋白通过结合甲状腺球蛋白（TG）参与其内吞作用，这对维持甲状腺稳态至关重要。本研究采用综合结构生物学方法揭示，分拣蛋白能够特异性结合未折叠的TG C端肽段，并对该区域表现出强烈的偏好性。这一分子层面的相互作用为理解甲状腺生理机制及相关疾病的诊疗提供了重要理论依据。"},{"t":"纳米团簇-二氧化硅超材料的力学与光学性能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521526?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇超材料","kp":["[制造方法]: 双光子光刻","[光引发剂]: 银纳米簇+多面体低聚硅倍半氧烷","[材料]: 纳米簇-二氧化硅超材料"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用双光子光刻技术制备具有复杂三维几何结构的纳米团簇-二氧化硅超材料，并系统表征了其力学与光学性能。通过将金属纳米团簇嵌入二氧化硅基质，实现了对材料折射率、机械强度和光学响应的协同调控。这类纳米超材料在光子器件、微纳光学元件和轻质高强结构材料领域展现出应用前景，双光子光刻为三维纳米结构的精确制造提供了可行路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mechanical and Optical Properties of Nanocluster‐Silica Metamaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Nanostructured metamaterials with complex 3D geometries can be fabricated using two‐photon lithography but are typically limited to specific materials by the available photoresists. Here, we develop a two‐photon lithography photoresist for fabricating mechanically robust and optically active metamaterials. This photoresist consists of silver nanocluster photointiators in a polyhedral oligomeric silsequioxane (POSS) polymer matrix. Printed nanocomposites show a 216% increase in elastic modulus and 166% increase in energy absorption compared to structures made of POSS, while retaining 96% elastic recovery. Nanocomposite gyroid nanolattices reach 80% strain at failure. The nanolattice energy absorption is among the highest for lightweight nanoporous materials. Thermal annealing is used to convert the printed nanocomposites to nanoparticle‐embedded glass with 54% higher energy absorption than fused silica. The annealed gyroid nanolattices contain silver nanoparticles and exhibit plasmonic activity. Right and left‐handed chiral nanolattices result in different transmission spectra under linearly polarized light."},{"t":"通过原位 SN2 替代对超小型 CsPbI3 量子点进行配体工程，实现 Bright Rec。 2020 纯红色 Pero","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519475?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ultrasmall‐sized cesium lead iodide (CsPbI\n                    3\n                    ) quantum dots (QDs) are promising candidates for achieving spectrally stable pure‐red perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs) meeting Rec. 2020 standards. However, the corresponding devices hardly achieve satisfactory external quantum efficiency (EQE), current efficiency (CE), and luminance simultaneously because of the use of largely excessive insulating long‐chain ligands and additional difficulties in the defect control of ultrasmall CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs. Herein, we develop an alkyl iodide‐assisted ligand modulation strategy for CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs toward high‐efficiency and bright pure‐red PeLEDs. We elucidate an in‐situ nucleophilic bimolecular (S\n                    N\n                    2) substitution reaction between the oleylamine and additionally incorporated short‐chain 1‐iodooctane (IO) molecules during the materials synthesis. The reaction‐generated hydriodic acid (HI) induces non‐destructive surface etching of QDs, enabling exceptional luminescent properties of the strongly confined products. In addition, the S\n                    N\n                    2 reaction‐derived secondary amine strongly adsorbs at the surface of QDs, which stabilizes the products with a reduced ligand density, simultaneously enhancing photoluminescence stability and electrical properties of the assembled emissive layers. The resultant devices emitting at 632 nm demonstrate a peak EQE of 21.56%, an impressive luminance of 13,132 cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and an exceptional CE of 20.73 cd A\n                    −1\n                    , which outperforms state‐of‐the‐art Rec. 2020 pure‐red PeLEDs utilizing ultrasmall‐sized colloidal CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs.","tp":"钙钛矿量子点","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"铯铅碘(CsPbI3)量子点是实现Rec.2020标准纯红色钙钛矿LED的理想候选材料，但过量绝缘长链配体导致器件难以同时获得高外量子效率、电流效率和亮度。研究提出通过原位SN2取代反应对超小型量子点进行配体工程，优化表面配体结构，提升电荷载流子传输效率，为高效纯红光钙钛矿LED提供了新策略。"},{"t":"人唾液神经蛋白构象动力学的无标记SERS指纹识别","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513500?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"SERS蛋白构象检测","kp":["[检测方法]: 无标记SERS指纹","[样品]: 人唾液","[策略]: 电化学分子捕获(GME)","[靶标]: 神经蛋白构象动态"],"dp":1,"as":"神经蛋白的构象转变与多种神经退行性疾病密切相关，其实时监测对疾病早期诊断至关重要。该研究开发了一种无标记SERS（表面增强拉曼散射）指纹识别技术，可灵敏捕捉人源神经蛋白的构象动态变化。通过分析蛋白质二级结构特征拉曼信号，实现对α-螺旋、β-折叠等构象转变过程的实时追踪，为阿尔茨海默病等神经退行性疾病的病理研究和早期检测提供了新工具。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Label‐Free SERS Fingerprinting of Neuroprotein Conformational Dynamics in Human Saliva","b":"Abstract\n                  Conformational transitions of neuroproteins are closely associated with neurological disorders and represent key biomarkers for diagnosis and disease monitoring. A reliable and label‐free method for detecting and tracking these structural changes is critical for effective clinical application. In this work, a galvanic molecular entrapment (GME) strategy is presented to combine with surface‐enhanced Raman scattering (SERS) for localization and label‐free detection of neuroproteins. This approach integrates galvanic replacement with in situ Au surface growth to enable precise molecular entrapment and plasmonic hotspot formation directly around target analytes. Such spatial confinement optimizes analyte positioning within the electromagnetic field, thereby enhancing SERS signal intensity and overcoming geometric mismatches that typically limit sensitivity. The GME method successfully profiled neuroprotein conformational states and demonstrated strong potential for proteomic analysis. A logistic regression model applied to the spectral dataset enabled accurate classification of saliva samples from individuals with epilepsy, schizophrenia, Parkinson's disease, and healthy controls, achieving high sensitivity, specificity, and diagnostic accuracy. This integrated platform offers a non‐invasive tool for neurological diagnostics and holds significant promise for advancing personalized healthcare in the management of neurological disorders.","aip":1},{"t":"基于N/P比可控锂离子电池的锂沉积机理研究","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000796?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂枝晶沉积机制","dp":1,"as":"","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Investigation of lithium plating mechanism based on N/P ratio controlled lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度感知","kp":["监测目标[锂离子电池]: 超高倍率放电内部温度"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed ne","aip":1},{"t":"通过界面F·S相互作用实现有机-无机异质结构中的层间耦合用于近红外光电探测器","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518146?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Interlayer coupling serves as a powerful strategy for manipulating the optoelectronic characteristics of van der Waals heterostructures. Although the combination of organic and inorganic semiconductors has enabled versatile optoelectronic applications, interlayer coupling in organic–inorganic heterostructures is still limited by inherent material discrepancies such as lattice matching and stacking order. Herein, we demonstrate an interlayer–coupled organic–inorganic heterojunction achieved by interfacial noncovalent F···S interactions, which is composed of molecular 5,5''‐bis(2‐fluorophenyl)‐2,2':5',2''‐terthiophene (oF‐PTTTP) and 2D molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ). By leveraging the conformational flexibility afforded by the full C─C single bonds in its backbone, the oF‐PTTTP molecules can self‐adjust their conformations upon thermal activation. The fluorine atoms on the side chains of oF‐PTTTP engage in noncovalent interactions with the sulfur atoms of MoS\n                    2\n                    at the heterointerface, inducing a pronounced interlayer coupling effect accompanied by lattice strain. This coupling enables near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection in a spectral range inaccessible to each individual component, yielding a specific detectivity of 1.8 × 10\n                    14\n                    Jones at 808 nm, which is one of the highest values reported for organic–inorganic heterostructures. Furthermore, the device exhibits gate‐tunable positive and negative photoresponses at 808 nm, allowing real‐time motion imaging in the NIR spectrum.","tp":"异质结构光电探测","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"有机-无机范德华异质结构中的层间耦合是调控光电特性的重要策略，但受限于晶格匹配和堆叠顺序等固有材料差异。研究通过界面氟-硫(F·S)相互作用实现有机-无机异质结构的层间耦合，有效克服材料差异，为近红外光电探测器的设计与优化提供了新思路。"},{"t":"跨分布式神经回路的交互和功能专业化，用于猕猴的灵活任务控制","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-65766-0","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Reversal tasks have been regarded as probes of behavioural inhibition and linked to prefrontal and specifically orbitofrontal cortex. The centrality of behavioural inhibition to reversal task performance and the task’s dependence on particular prefrontal sub-regions have, however, been questioned in primates. Using a combination of whole brain recording, transient ultrasonic disruption, two types of reversal task, and a task model emphasizing identification of transitions between latent states, we show that male macaques track latent state transitions in addition to choice values in reversal tasks. Activity reflecting both these features is prominent in dorsomedial frontal cortex, and anterior and dorsomedial thalamus when, and just before, animals select choices. By contrast, hippocampal activity continually tracks the probability of a reversal between latent states. We identify patterns of activity interaction spanning the three nodes of this circuit and demonstrate that disruption of each leads to reversal task impairment albeit in different ways.","tp":"神经回路调控","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"传统观点认为逆转学习任务依赖于前额叶皮层（尤其是眼眶前额叶皮层）的行为抑制功能。本研究在猕猴模型中结合了全脑神经记录、瞬时超声干扰技术和两种逆转任务模型对此提出质疑。研究强调了大脑在隐状态切换识别中的关键作用，揭示了分布式神经回路在灵活任务控制中存在复杂的交互作用与功能特化，这挑战了既往关于行为抑制局限于特定脑区的传统认知。"},{"t":"Fe-Ni-聚(七嗪酰亚胺)中金属种类与含量对其作为锌-空气电池电催化剂性能的影响","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506308?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池电催化","kp":["[催化剂]: Fe-Ni-聚(三嗪酰亚胺)","[应用]: 锌空电池ORR/OER","[替代目标]: 贵金属催化剂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究系统考察了Fe-Ni-聚三嗪亚胺（Poly(heptazine imides)）复合电催化剂中金属种类与含量对电催化性能的影响，聚焦于碱性锌空气电池（ZABs）的应用。ZABs因理论能量密度高而受到广泛关注，但其空气阴极氧析出/氧还原（OER/ORR）反应动力学迟缓是核心瓶颈。研究通过调控Fe与Ni双金属活性位点的比例与配位环境，揭示了金属物种对催化活性、稳定性和反应路径选择性的协同调控规律，为设计高效、低成本的非贵金属空气阴极电催化剂提供了组分工程层面的指导。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Influence of Metal Species and Content of Fe‐Ni‐Poly(heptazine imides) on their Properties as Electrocatalysts for Zinc‐","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alkaline zinc‐air batteries (ZABs) have attracted interest in recent years for their high theoretical energy density and use of low‐cost, abundant zinc metal as the anode. In order to overcome the activation energy barrier of the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER), noble metals are commonly used. Within this work, transition metal‐functionalized Poly(heptazine imide)s (PHIs) are studied as an alternative and more abundant electrocatalyst, as they offer the homogenous immobilization of metals within their ordered structure. Introducing Fe and Ni into the PHI network enables the formation of single and mixed transition metal PHIs, which show reduced overpotentials for ORR and OER. The formation of Ni single atoms even induces outstanding catalytic activity for the OER during charging of ZAB full cells with performance comparable to that of RuO\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, full cell tests show excellent stability over the course of 250 discharge‐charge cycles, making it a promising system for sustainable energy storage. This work paves the way for the molecular design of a novel material class as an electrocatalyst for ZAB."},{"t":"原位光电化学螯合构建缺陷鲁棒配位微环境以增强水氧化性能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522149?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"缺陷耐久析氧催化","kp":["[缺陷抑制]: 原位光电化学螯合","[机制]: 深能级缺陷致非辐射复合限制OER","[功能]: 缺陷自适应配位微环境"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种原位光电化学螯合策略，通过编程缺陷韧性配位微环境来克服深层能级缺陷作为非辐射复合中心对析氧反应（OER）的抑制作用。深层缺陷是限制电催化剂性能的关键瓶颈，该工作利用光电化学手段在反应过程中原位调控活性位点的配位结构，从而构建对缺陷不敏感的催化微环境，显著提升OER催化活性与稳定性，为设计高性能电催化能源转换器件提供了新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ Photoelectrochemical Chelation Programs Defect‐Resilient Coordination Microenvironments for Enhanced Water Oxida","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep‐level defects function as non‐radiative recombination centers that throttle oxygen evolution reaction (OER) kinetics. Conventionally, static and pre‐deposited passivation layers often fail during operation, disconnecting defect suppression from the creation and sustained maintenance of catalytically competent sites. Here, we address this limitation with a photoelectrochemically‐driven microenvironment strategy that selectively manipulates the first coordination shell of surface Zn on ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    . Under the in situ photoelectrochemical chelation process, hydroxyethylidene diphosphonic acid writes robust Zn–O–P motifs that subtly distort the Zn–S framework and convert deep traps into shallow states, thereby accelerating charge transfer while suppressing recombination. Density functional theory suggests that Zn–O–P lowers the OER overpotential and switches the rate‐determining step from O\n                    *\n                    →OOH\n                    *\n                    to OOH\n                    *\n                    →O\n                    2\n                    via stabilized\n                    *\n                    OOH intermediates. The optimized photoanode delivers a photocurrent density of 5.38 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V\n                    RHE\n                    , surpassing previously reported ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ‐based photoanodes. By unifying in situ deep‐trap management and active site construction along a single chemical pathway, this work establishes a modular and general route for dynamic defect engineering and active site reconfiguration, advancing defect‐tolerant innovations in energy conversion and storage.","aip":1},{"t":"高指数面高熵合金原子层：定制活性位点以提升催化性能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000350?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵合金原子层催化","kp":["[材料]: 高熵合金原子层","[晶面工程]: 高指数晶面定制活性位"],"as":"","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-index faceted high-entropy-alloy atomic layers with tailored active sites for enhanced catalytic performance"},{"t":"经合组织国家的良好治理和能源安全：环境政策严格性的中介作用","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000340?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源政策评","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":2,"d":2,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"无氟耐腐蚀电解液设计助力锂金属电池稳定性提升","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522875?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","kp":["电解质[锂金属电池]: 无氟耐腐蚀设计","[替代LHCE氟化稀释剂]: 消除与锂金属高反应性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种无氟、耐腐蚀的液态电解液设计策略，旨在提升锂离子电池的循环稳定性。传统电解液中氟化组分的腐蚀问题严重制约电池寿命与安全性。该工作通过分子层面的理性设计，开发出不含氟且具备优异抗腐蚀能力的电解液体系，在电极界面形成稳定的保护层，有效抑制副反应发生，显著改善电池的长期循环性能和库伦效率，为下一代高性能、高安全锂电池电解液开发提供了重要方向。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Fluorine‐Free Corrosion‐Resistant Electrolyte Design for Enhanced Stability in Lithium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Advancing liquid electrolyte design is crucial for overcoming the performance limitations of current battery technologies and enabling next‐generation energy storage systems. Among recent developments, localized high‐concentration electrolytes (LHCEs) have demonstrated remarkable cycling stability. However, their reliance on fluorinated diluents, which are highly reactive with lithium metal, inevitably leads to severe spontaneous corrosion. This study introduces a fluorine‐free, corrosion‐resistant diluent (CRD) strategy, employing benzene as the CRD in combination with amphiphilic butyl methyl ether as the primary solvent. This electrolyte design simultaneously extends both cycle and calendar life by promoting an anion‐dominated solvation structure, while the diluent effectively suppresses lithium metal corrosion. As a result, the CRD‐based electrolyte exhibits outstanding durability and stability compared to conventional LHCEs. Moreover, the fluorine‐free and cost‐effective electrolyte–diluent system offers strong advantages for practical applications. Overall, this study demonstrates the potential of the CRD strategy to achieve stable electrode–electrolyte interfaces and provides broader insights for diverse battery chemistries."},{"t":"受纠缠启明的频率捷变测距技术","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68589-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子启发激光测距","kp":["[光源方案]: 经典激光能量-时间关联源","[抗噪优势]: 保留纠缠启发的噪声抑制","[应用]: 频率捷变测距"],"as":"该研究提出一种受量子纠缠启发的频率捷变测距新方法。量子纠缠的非经典关联特性已被证明可突破传统测量精度极限。该工作借鉴纠缠态的关联原理，设计频率可快速切换的测距系统，利用多频率间的相干关联信息显著提升距离测量的精度与抗干扰能力。相比传统单频或线性调频方案，该方法在复杂环境噪声下展现出更高的测距分辨率和鲁棒性，为激光雷达、遥感测绘等领域的高精度距离感知提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Entanglement-inspired frequency-agile rangefinding","b":"Entanglement, a key feature of quantum mechanics, is recognized for its non-classical correlations which have been shown to provide significant noise resistance in single-photon rangefinding and communications. Drawing inspiration from the advantage given by energy-time entanglement, we developed an energy-time correlated source based on a classical laser that preserves the substantial noise reduction typical of quantum illumination while surpassing the quantum brightness limitation by over six orders of magnitude, making it highly suitable for practical remote sensing applications. A frequency-agile pseudo-random source is realized through fiber chromatic dispersion and pulse carving using an electro-optic intensity modulator. Operating at a faint transmission power of 48 μW, the distance between two buildings 154.8182 m apart can be measured with a precision better than 0.1 mm, under varying solar background levels and weather conditions with an integration time of only 100 ms. These trials verified the predicted noise reduction of this system, demonstrating advantages over quantum illumination-based rangefinding and highlighting its potential for practical remote sensing applications.","aip":1},{"t":"通过少氟化正极-电解质界面策略提升高质量负载富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4正极的快充性能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506130?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂快充","kp":["[正极材料]: 富锰Li[Mn1-xFe4]PO4(LMFP)","[条件]: 工业级高负载量快充","[界面工程]: 无LiF正极电解质界面(CEI)"],"dp":1,"as":"富锰磷酸铁锂Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4（LMFP）正极因其4.1V高电压平台、成本低廉和热稳定性好，被视为新一代锂离子电池正极材料的有力候选。本研究聚焦提升高质量负载LMFP电极的快充性能，通过调控Mn/Fe比例优化离子扩散动力学，兼顾高能量密度与高倍率充放电能力。核心挑战在于Mn含量提高后电子电导率和Li+迁移速率下降，该工作为LMFP在实际动力电池中的快充工程化应用提供了关键突破方向。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Enhanced Fast‐Charging Performance of High‐Mass‐Loading Mn‐Rich Li[Mn1‐xFex]PO4 Cathodes via LiF‐Less Cathode–Electrolyt","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mn‐rich Li[Mn\n                    1‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    Fe\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    ]PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP) cathodes are promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries due to their structural stability and cost‐effectiveness. However, under industrially relevant high‐mass‐loading conditions, they still suffer from severe performance degradation, particularly during fast charging. In this study, we systematically demonstrate that charge‐transfer resistance, rather than bulk Li\n                    +\n                    diffusivity, governs the kinetic limitations of LMFP electrodes with an areal capacity of ∼3.5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    (∼23 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    mass loading). Surface analyses reveal that the buildup of electronically and ionically insulating LiF at the cathode–electrolyte interphase (CEI) is the primary cause of sluggish charge transfer, highlighting a previously overlooked detrimental role of LiF. Guided by this insight, we implement an interfacial engineering strategy that suppresses LiF formation at the CEI. Remarkably, the resulting high‐mass‐loading LMFP cathodes deliver a 1.6‐fold increase in capacity at 5C and retain ∼87% of their initial capacity after 100 cycles at 2C. Moreover,\n                    operando\n                    structural analysis reveals that electrodes with LiF‐suppressed CEI maintain a robust single‐phase transition during fast cycling, directly linking interfacial LiF suppression to significantly enhanced charge‐transfer kinetics. This work highlights the critical importance of CEI engineering in enabling fast‐charging Mn‐rich olivine cathodes under practical, high‐mass‐loading conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"调控电子径向效应实现固态电解质中快速Li+传输","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520337?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态Li⁺电解质","kp":["[设计原理]: 径向效应(5d轨道相对论膨胀+自旋轨道耦合)","[机制]: s-d/p-d杂化削弱Li-阴离子作用、降迁移势垒","[目标]: 高Li+电导、迁移数近1"],"dp":1,"as":"固态电解质是下一代高安全锂金属电池的核心，但Li+电导率低、迁移数不足及界面不稳定是主要瓶颈。本研究通过工程化设计电子径向效应（electronic radial effects），构建有利于Li+快速传输的局部结构环境，同时实现高离子电导率、接近1的迁移数和稳定的电极/电解质界面。该策略从电子结构层面调控离子输运通道，为固态电池突破离子传输极限提供了全新思路，对全固态电池商业化具有重要推动意义。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Engineering Electronic Radial Effects for Fast Li+ Transport in Solid‐State Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving high Li\n                    +\n                    conductivity, near‐unity transference numbers, and stable interfaces in solid‐state electrolytes remains a major challenge for lithium‐metal batteries. Here we introduce a radial‐effect design principle: relativistic expansion and spin–orbit coupling of 5\n                    d\n                    orbitals enhance\n                    s–d\n                    /\n                    p–d\n                    hybridization, weaken Li–anion interactions, and lower migration barriers. An entropy‐based descriptor,\n                    \n                      S\n                      d\n                    \n                    , trained and validated with machine learning across &gt;10,000 oxides, sulfides, and halides captures this effect. Machine‐learning‐guided high‐throughput screening flags monoclinic HfO\n                    2\n                    , whose 5\n                    d\n                    2\n                    radial expansion lowers migration barriers by ∼45% vs Sc\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    or Y\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Guided by this insight, we employ millisecond flash‐Joule heating to convert HfO\n                    2\n                    into nanosized single crystals, then embed them in a Li‐conductive binder to create sc‐HfO\n                    2\n                    @LCB, whose radial coupling yields interconnected Li\n                    +\n                    pathways (1.23 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    , 30°C;\n                    t\n                    \n                      Li\n                      +\n                    \n                    = 0.82, 25°C) and a 4.8 V electrochemical window. Operando Raman/XANES confirms faster Li\n                    +\n                    transport. Consequently, 2 Ah LiNi\n                    0.9\n                    Co\n                    0.05\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‖Li pouch cells deliver ∼472 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    (stack‐level), maintain superior rate capability over hundreds of cycles, and survive 150°C hot‐plate tests. These results establish radial‐effect engineering as a sophisticated strategy for high‐performance, thermally resilient solid‐state batteries."},{"t":"基于热电耦合废热利用的数据中心-海水淡化协同并网交互","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000802?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心余热利用","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Enabling grid-interactive data center-desalination coordination through thermo-electric coupling-based waste heat utiliz"},{"t":"以水为羟基源的电化学烯烃羟基化反应","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag047/8440146?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃电化学羟基化","kp":["[反应类型]: 烯烃电化学羟基化","[氧源]: H2O作为氧源","[底物范围]: 广谱官能团耐受"],"as":"醇是生物活性分子中最丰富的官能团之一，传统烯烃羟基化通常依赖昂贵或有毒的氧化剂。本研究开发了以水（H2O）为羟基源的烯烃电化学羟基化新方法，利用电化学驱动实现C=C双键的选择性羟基化生成醇类化合物。该路线避免了化学计量氧化剂的使用，条件温和、原子经济性高，为药物分子和精细化学品中醇官能团的绿色合成提供了新策略，在有机合成和制药工业中具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Electrochemical hydroxylation of alkenes with H2O","b":"Alcohol is one of the most prevalent functional groups found in biologically active molecules with unparalleled abundance and structural diversity. The hydroxylation reaction of alkenes represents a convenient approach for synthesizing such molecules. However, a general and direct method featuring a broad substrate scope and good functional group tolerance remains elusive. Herein, we report our efforts in applying electrochemistry to accomplish the hydroxylation of alkenes utilizing H2O as the sole source of hydroxyl without the need for stoichiometric oxidants and strong acidic reagents. This process operates via the formation of a high-valence cobalt (IV) intermediate, which could readily be entrapped by water to deliver the desired alcohols product. Mechanistic studies, cyclic voltammetry analysis and density functional theory calculations have been conducted to verify the feasibility of cobalt valence changes, including the generation of cobalt hydride species, the formation of intermediates after hydrogen atom transfer, the reasonable oxidation potential from Co (III) to Co (IV), which substantiate the proposed reaction pathways. Furthermore, the late-stage modification of biorelevant molecules has demonstrated the promising potential applications of this approach in synthetic chemistry."},{"t":"通过应变梯度有效操控斯格明子","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518161?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"应变梯度磁斯格明子","kp":["[应变梯度]: 能量高效调控斯格明子密度与尺寸","[优势]: 避免过大应变导致塑性变形或开裂"],"dp":1,"as":"斯格明子（Skyrmion）是具有拓扑保护的自旋结构，在存储、逻辑和传感器件中极具潜力，但精确操控其运动与位置是实用化的核心难题。本研究提出利用应变梯度（strain gradient）作为有效调控手段，通过机械应变场产生的挠曲电效应驱动和引导斯格明子，实现无需大电流或强磁场的低功耗操控。该方法为斯格明子自旋电子器件的读写定位提供了新机制，有望显著降低功耗并提升存储密度，推动拓扑自旋电子学走向实用。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Effective Manipulation of Skyrmions via Strain Gradient","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Skyrmion‐based devices hold considerable potential for memory, logic, and sensing applications, where precise control over skyrmion density and size is essential. While strain engineering offers an energy‐efficient route to tune these properties, excessive strain can induce plastic deformation in magnetic films or lead to cracking, compromising the reliability of strain‐mediated skyrmion control. Here, we demonstrate strain gradients as an effective additional control parameter in magnetic multilayers. By introducing microscale periodic wrinkled structures in sputtered Pt/Co/Ta multilayers, strain gradients with varying magnitudes and directions are generated. Magnetic force microscopy reveals that both skyrmion density and size vary synchronously with the in‐plane strain gradient, enabling broader tunability than uniform strain approaches. Micromagnetic simulations confirm that these effects arise from strain and strain gradient modulation of the Dzyaloshinskii‐Moriya interaction and magnetic anisotropy. Moreover, this control strategy is reversible, cyclable, and transferable across different magnetic multilayers, providing a practical avenue for precise skyrmion engineering. This approach offers significant promise for advancing flexible spintronics, skyrmion‐based memory, and neuromorphic computing architectures."},{"t":"边缘-云协同驱动的微电网电动汽车充电负荷预测规划","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000140?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"充电负荷预测","kp":["[架构]: 边云协同","[应用]: 微电网EV充电负荷预测规划"],"dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Edge-cloud collaboration-driven predictive planning of electric vehicle charging load for microgrids"},{"t":"面向产消者能源社区的动态自适应模型预测控制","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000693?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源社区模型预测控制","dp":1,"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Dynamic adaptive model predictive control for prosumers-based energy communities"},{"t":"双配位添加剂诱导高熵SEI实现稳定无负极钠金属电池","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506756?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极钠金属电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 无负极钠金属电池","[添加剂]: 双配位添加剂","[界面工程]: 高熵SEI"],"dp":1,"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究针对无负极钠金属电池，采用双配位添加剂策略诱导生成高熵固体电解质界面膜（SEI），有效抑制钠枝晶生长并提升界面稳定性。钠资源储量丰富且成本低，该方案为钠离子/钠金属电池的循环寿命与安全性提升提供了新路径。","ot":"Double‐Coordination Additives Induced High‐Entropy SEI for Stable Anode‐Less Sodium Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sodium‐ion batteries with abundant resources and cost‐effectiveness are promising candidates for energy storage. However, their insufficient energy density impedes deployment in energy‐intensive applications. Anode‐free configurations maximize energy density by eliminating the initial anode host, while facing critical challenges of irreversible sodium plating/stripping. Here, we present double‐coordination electrolyte additives‐benzimidazole (BZ) and zinc trifluoromethanesulfonate (ZF) to address these intrinsic limitations. The highly polar ZF pulls out the solvents in the primary solvation sheath for Na\n                    +\n                    diffusivity improving. Simultaneously, the ZF‐BZ complexes preferentially adsorb and decompose on the Cu foil surface, in situ forming a high‐entropy solid electrolyte interphase (ZnF\n                    2,\n                    NaF, Na\n                    2\n                    O, Na\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3,\n                    and Na\n                    3\n                    N). This ultrathin interphase (3.7 nm) features superior mechanical toughness and a lowered nucleation barrier, thereby facilitating rapid, uniform, and highly reversible sodium plating/stripping. Consequently, the Na||Cu cell using 1 \n                    m\n                    NaPF\n                    6–\n                    diethylene glycol dimethyl–BZ/ZF electrolyte achieved an average Coulombic efficiency of 99.58% for 432 cycles at 3 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    /3 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and stable cycling stability for 800 h in Na||Na cell. The assembled anode‐less cell delivers a high energy‐density of 327.54 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    ."},{"t":"条条大路通罗马吗？评估能源正义治理策略的有效性","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000236?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源正义论","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":2,"d":2,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"混合抽水蓄能梯级水电深度强化学习实时调度以缓解光伏波动","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"梯级水电智能调度","kp":["方法[水电-光伏]: 深度强化学习实时调度","应用: 混合抽蓄缓解光伏不确定性"],"dp":1,"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating pho"},{"t":"风电场功率优化的循环偏航控制：斯特劳哈尔数、机组布局与湍流强度的影响","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000711?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电场偏航控制","kp":["[关键参数]: 斯特劳哈尔数","[对象]: 风电场循环偏航控制"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cyclic yaw control for wind farm power optimization: The role of strouhal number, farm configuration, and turbulence int"},{"t":"使用 PGS-hub 平台对单祖先和多祖先多基因评分方法进行全面基准测试","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68599-7","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Polygenic scores (PGS) quantify genetic contributions to complex traits, yet existing single- and multi-ancestry methods lack multi-dimensional evaluation within a unified framework. Here, we benchmarked 13 state-of-the-art PGS methods across 36 traits in UK Biobank European and African samples. The prediction performance, computational efficiency, the number of variants, and the impact of different linkage disequilibrium (LD) reference sizes were thoroughly assessed for each method. Results of single-ancestry methods demonstrate that LDpred2 has superior performance across a broad spectrum of complex traits in terms of accuracy and computational efficiency; however, other methods remain valuable for specific traits. For multi-ancestry methods, PRS-CSx and X-Wing have comparable performance, whereas LDpred2-multi outperforms both. Notably, we find that increasing the panel size of the LD reference significantly elevates PGS performance for sample sizes below 1,000, and it reaches a plateau when it exceeds 5,000 samples. Furthermore, implementing PGS calculation methods requires considerable technical effort and resource allocation. To support easy use of these PGS methods, we developed a user-friendly online computing platform, PGS-hub, that integrates all evaluated methods and is pre-configured with ancestry-stratified LD panels. This resource enables a scalable and harmonized PGS computation platform for the PGS community.","tp":"多基因评分","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5,"i":5,"r":5,"d":7,"t":6},"as":"多基因评分(PGS)可量化遗传对复杂性状的贡献，但现有单祖先和多祖先方法缺乏统一框架下的多维评估。研究利用PGS-hub平台，在英国生物样本库的欧洲和非洲人群中系统基准测试了13种先进PGS方法，覆盖36个性状，全面评估了预测性能、计算效率、变体数量及连锁不平衡参考大小的影响。"},{"t":"通过调控p/n/σ-π杂化共轭构建羰基功能化氮杂膦嗪基多重共振发射体","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525404?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多共振发光材料","kp":["[发光体类型]: 多重共振TADF(MR-TADF)","[杂化首创]: COPN杂化","[结构]: 羰基功能化氮杂磷嗪"],"dp":1,"as":"研究报道了基于羰基功能化氮杂膦嗪（azaphosphinine）的多重共振热激活延迟荧光（MR-TADF）发射体，通过区域选择性策略精确调控分子电子结构。该类材料利用非典型电子耦合的杂原子掺杂实现了发光颜色的精细调控，在有机发光二极管（OLED）领域展现出高色纯度和高效率的潜力，为下一代显示技术提供了新的分子设计思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Carbonyl Functionalized Azaphosphinine‐Based Multiple‐Resonance Emitters via Regulated p/n/σ–π Hybrid Conjugation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Doping heteroatoms with non‐typical electronic couplings offered the great opportunity to fine‐tune chemical structures and optoelectronic properties of organic π‐conjugated molecules (OCMs). Herein, we reported the first example of hybrid COPN multiple‐resonance (MR) thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) emitters via the modular protocols. Compared with the classical BN/CON MR‐emitters having p–π conjugation, new COPN MR‐emitters maintained the various n/σ/σ*–π* hyperconjugation via the P‐center. Collaboratively with CO group, the P‐regulated (lp, O, S, and Me\n                    +\n                    ) hyperconjugation maintained the strong impacts on the TADF properties, such as FWHM, ISC/RISC, and PLQY. The dominating short‐range (SR) N➞CO charge‐transfer (CT) character suggested the CON‐type MR structure in the PO‐derivative. The strong long‐range (LR) P➞CO CT character suggested the COP‐type MR structure in the P(III)‐derivative. Leveraging on the self‐amplified PO‐hyperconjugation, the double‐PO derivative exhibited the dominating PON‐type MR‐TADF involving the SR N➞PO CT. The increased PLQYs (54%) and narrowed emission (FWHM: 13 nm) are among the best CON‐type MR‐emitters in the literature. As a proof of concept, the 1\n                    st\n                    generation hybrid MR‐emitters were applied as the light‐emitting materials in organic lighting‐emitting diodes that showed the narrow‐band blue (FWHM: 26 nm) and cyan emission (FWHM: 17 nm) with EQE as high as 7.3% and 22.8%, respectively. The current study revealed that installing the new hybrid conjugation, namely p/n/σ–π coupling into OCMs holds a great promise for designing new types of MR‐emitters with excellent TADF characters."},{"t":"通过催化酰基腙形成的自我复制子构建分子","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202506986?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Abstract\n                  Catalysis of bond‐forming reactions is key to the development of life‐like chemical systems as it allows to build up new material, increasing molecular complexity and diversity. Integrating catalysis with other characteristic properties of life, like self‐replication, represents an important advance in the transition from chemistry to life. We have previously shown that catalysis can emerge in synthetic self‐replicators that form through supramolecular assembly. However, the organocatalyzed reactions were solely bond‐breaking so far. We now report the successful expansion of the catalytic promiscuity of these systems to bond‐forming reactions. We show that a self‐replicator efficiently catalyzes acyl hydrazone formation between different hydrazides and aldehydes. This marks an important step towards the further development of evolvable systems that combine metabolic activity with self‐replication.","tp":"催化自复制","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7,"i":3,"r":5,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"催化键形成反应是发展类生命化学系统的关键，能增加分子复杂性和多样性。将催化与自我复制等生命特征整合是从化学向生命过渡的重要进展。研究此前已证明催化可在超分子组装形成的合成自我复制子中涌现，本研究进一步探索通过催化酰基腙形成反应构建自我复制分子系统，推进类生命化学系统设计。"},{"t":"BiG-SCAPE 2.0 和 BiG-SLiCE 2.0：代谢基因簇的可扩展、准确和交互式序列聚类","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68733-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Microbial metabolic gene clusters encode the biosynthesis or catabolism of metabolites that facilitate ecological specialization, mediate microbiome interactions and constitute a major source of medicines and crop protection agents. Here, we present BiG-SCAPE and BiG-SLiCE 2.0, next-generation methods that facilitate scalable, accurate and interactive gene cluster analyses. BiG-SCAPE 2.0 updates its classification, alignment methods, and visualizations, enabling more accurate analysis, up to 8x faster runtimes and halved memory requirements. BiG-SLiCE 2.0 updates its distance metric, pHMM database, and classification logic, resulting in increased sensitivity nearing that of BiG-SCAPE. Analysis of 260,630 biosynthetic gene clusters from publicly available genomes reveals that both tools generate concurring estimates of gene cluster diversity, thus providing significantly extended methodological support for recent evidence indicating that the vast majority of natural product diversity remains unexplored. Together, these updates will facilitate global genome mining efforts for natural product discovery and microbiome analyses scalable with current data sizes.","tp":"基因簇分析","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5,"i":6,"r":5,"d":6,"t":6},"as":"微生物代谢基因簇编码代谢物的生物合成与分解，是药物和作物保护剂的重要来源。研究推出下一代工具BiG-SCAPE 2.0和BiG-SLiCE 2.0，实现可扩展、准确且交互式的基因簇分析。BiG-SCAPE 2.0更新了分类、比对和可视化方法，分析速度提升达8倍，显著提高了代谢基因簇聚类效率。"},{"t":"伯努利原理介导的 Cl2 电合成","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-66643-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/非金属/其它无机非金属","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Existing technologies for chlorine (Cl2) synthesis are generally suffered from low productivity or high production cost. Guided by Bernoulli’s principle, here we report an efficient yet cost-effective electrochemical system for Cl2 electrosynthesis, which is composed of anodic chlorine evolution reaction (CER) connected to gas chamber by triple-phase gas diffusion layer. The key is to modulate gas diffusion layer by Bernoulli’s principle, wherein the pressure difference at triple-phase boundary drives oriented Cl2 migration directly into gas chamber, thus preventing the crossover of anodic/cathodic products. By further joining with a pH-tolerant catalyst, a standalone prototype device is built for high-rate Cl2 production, operating at the Faradaic efficiencies of 96.3% ~ 87.6% in the current density range of 0.1 ~ 1.14 A cm−2, having superior Cl2 synthesis performance. Further technical-economic evaluations of our synthetic scheme demonstrate reduced Cl2 production cost, saving 6.75% (1.17 million dollar per year) as comparison to conventional chlor-alkali design. We expect these findings offer broader opportunities to develop industrially production processes for other chemical commodities.","tp":"氯气电合成","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8,"i":4,"r":7,"d":6,"t":7},"aip":1,"as":"现有氯气合成技术普遍面临产率低或成本高的问题。受伯努利原理启发，研究开发了一种高效低成本的Cl2电合成电化学系统，阳极析氯反应通过三相气体扩散层连接气室。核心是利用伯努利原理调节气体扩散层，在三相边界处产生压差，优化Cl2生成与扩散过程，为绿色氯碱工业提供新路径。"},{"t":"基于双类型模型集成与在线误差修正的光伏功率自适应预测","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000498?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[光伏功率预测]: 双类型模型集成与在线误差校正"],"ot":"Adaptive forecasting of photovoltaic power based on dual-type models’ ensemble and online error correction"},{"t":"相关性不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"社区多能系统","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated unce"},{"t":"用于设计用于 RNA 治疗的靶向脂质纳米颗粒的材料工具箱","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702125005577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脂质纳米粒","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5,"i":4,"r":5,"d":3,"t":5},"as":""},{"t":"面向异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源柔性聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动分布式能源功率灵活性聚合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy"},{"t":"准固态离子液体-聚合物复合电解质实现无穿梭、无枝晶水系锌溴电池","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519357?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌溴电池电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 准固态离子液体-聚合物杂化","[固定基团]: -SO3-构建Zn2+选择性","[电池]: 水系静态锌溴电池","[特性]: 无多溴化物穿梭、无锌枝晶"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究提出一种准固态离子液体-聚合物混合电解质，用于解决水系静态锌溴电池的核心难题。传统Zn-Br电池面临两大瓶颈：多溴化物穿梭效应导致自放电和容量衰减，以及锌枝晶生长引发短路。该混合电解质通过离子液体与聚合物基质的协同作用，在抑制溴物种穿梭的同时促进均匀的锌沉积，实现无枝晶生长。这一策略使水系锌溴电池在电网级大规模储能应用中的循环稳定性和库仑效率得到显著提升，为长时储能技术提供了新路径。","ot":"A Quasi‐Solid Ionic Liquid‐Polymer Hybrid Electrolyte for Shuttle‐Free and Dendrite‐Free Aqueous Zinc─Bromine Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous static zinc─bromine (Zn─Br) batteries hold promise for grid‐scale energy storage but still suffer from severe polybromide shuttling and poor Zn reversibility. Here, we develop a quasi‐solid ionic liquid‐polymer hybrid electrolyte by integrating a sulfonated polymer matrix with anchored 1‐butyl‐3‐methylimidazolium (BMI\n                    +\n                    ) cations. The fixed −SO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    groups construct highly Zn\n                    2+\n                    selective conduction channels, while BMI\n                    +\n                    forms strong electrostatic interactions with the polymer, generating immobilized ionic‐liquid domains that effectively capture polybromides. This hybrid design transforms BMI\n                    +\n                    from a soluble additive into a structural component of the quasi‐solid framework, thereby enabling simultaneous dendrite‐free Zn plating/stripping and shuttle suppression. With this multifunctional regulation, the Zn─Br batteries achieve a high initial capacity of 162.7 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , a discharge plateau of ∼1.78 V, and 25 000‐cycle durability at 20 C. Moreover, the pouch cell with high‐loading Br cathodes (∼14 mg\n                    KBr\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ) retains 90.9% capacity after 1500 cycles. This work demonstrates that quasi‐solid ionic liquid‐polymer hybrid electrolytes can deliver shuttle‐free, long‐lasting Zn─Br batteries, pointing to a promising pathway for scalable and reliable aqueous energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"单片集成铁电-离子双重性用于随机神经形态核心集成","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517440?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电神经形态芯片","kp":["[器件]: 铁电-离子二象性单片集成","[功能]: 稳定记忆+可调随机性统一","[应用]: 随机-神经形态计算核心"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究提出一种单片铁电-离子双重性机制，用于随机神经形态核心集成。针对数据密集型AI应用中不确定环境下学习的需求，该器件利用铁电极化与离子迁移的耦合效应，实现概率性计算与神经形态计算的融合。铁电-离子双功能架构能够在硬件层面原生模拟随机性和突触可塑性，避免了传统数字计算的精度-效率折中问题。该方案有望在贝叶斯推理、概率神经网络等需要处理不确定性的AI任务中实现高能效的片上学习。","ot":"A Monolithic Ferroelectric‐Ionic Duality for Stochastic‐Neuromorphic Core Integration","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Learning under uncertainty has become increasingly critical in data‐intensive artificial intelligence applications, requiring computing systems that unify deterministic and probabilistic functions. Hardware that combines stable memory with tunable stochasticity is essential for such systems, but achieving this integration within a miniaturized architecture remains significantly challenging due to intrinsic conflicts between precise memory retention and controllable stochastic variability. Here we demonstrate a hafnia‐based ferroelectric‐ionic duality that integrates stochastic encoding and synaptic memory within a single device. By deliberately engineering the ferroelectric interface to repurpose oxygen vacancies—traditionally regarded as defects that degrade reliability in hafnia ferroelectrics—we exploit these vacancies as functional ionic components that dynamically modulate device behavior. The resulting ferroelectric‐ionic dual‐mode switching introduces voltage‐tunable stochasticity and enhances synaptic behavior within a single device architecture. Crucially, this ferroelectric‐ionic duality exhibits full complementary metal‐oxide‐semiconductor (CMOS) compatibility and scalability to very‐large scale integration (VLSI) system, enabled by wafer‐scale atomic layer deposition‐based growth of hafnia. These results establish a novel device paradigm that unifies memory, randomness, and learning capabilities within a single ferroelectric platform.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 更正：《卤代核苷生物合成中铁(II)和2-酮戊二酸依赖型卤化酶的区域和立体选择性卤化》一文","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c23050","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化卤化","sc":1.0,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":1.0,"r":1.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Correction to “Regio- and Stereoselective Halogenation by an Iron(II)- and 2-Oxoglutarate-Dependent Halogenase in the Biosynthesis of Halogenated Nucleosides”"},{"t":"通过高熵氧化物钠离子电池正极中构型熵设计调控晶体场稳定能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000283?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵氧化物钠电池","kp":["[构型熵设计]: 调控晶体场稳定能","正极材料[钠离子电池]: 高熵氧化物"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Tuning crystal field stabilization energy through configurational entropy design in high-entropy oxide sodium-ion battery cathodes"},{"t":"堆叠重叠型石墨炔纳米离子电子学增强单/二价阳离子选择性用于单细胞pH检测","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag050/8440139?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨炔纳米离子学","kp":["[材料]: 堆叠石墨二炔纳米离子学","孔径[GDY]: 亚纳米","[选择性]: 单价/二价阳离子","[应用]: 单细胞pH检测"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究开发了一种堆叠交叠石墨炔纳米离子电子器件，用于增强单价/二价阳离子选择性，实现单细胞pH检测。该器件通过石墨炔纳米结构的精确组装，构建纳米尺度的离子输运通道，有效降低复杂生理环境中不同离子间的相互干扰。堆叠交叠结构提供了高度可控的离子选择透过性，能够区分单价和二价阳离子，从而在单细胞水平的精密测量中实现高灵敏度和高选择性的pH传感，为细胞生物学研究和生物医学检测提供了有力的纳米离子工具。","dp":1,"ot":"Stacked-overlapped graphdiyne nano-iontronics enabling enhanced monovalent/divalent cation selectivity for single-cell pH detection","b":"Developing nano-iontronic devices that minimize ionic interference is essential for precise measurements in complex physiological systems. Graphdiyne (GDY), a novel carbon allotrope featuring sub-nanometer pores, enables effective regulation of ionic transport and is therefore a promising material for high-performance iontronic applications. Here, we report a pH-responsive nano-iontronic device fabricated by stacking and overlapping graphdiyne (so-GDY) layers onto the tip of the nanopipette. This so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic sensor exhibits a linear decrease in ionic current under negative potential as the pH decreases from 8.00 to 5.50. This response is attributed to protonation of the oxygen-containing functional groups on the so-GDY surface and edges, which diminishes the negative surface charge and thereby reduces ionic conductivity. A key advantage of this nano-iontronic device is its excellent selectivity, demonstrating robust resistance to interference from divalent cations (Mg²⁺, Ca²⁺) and small molecules within the pH range 8.00-5.50, while maintaining stable detection currents. The so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic device achieves typical monovalent-to-divalent cation selectivity ratio (<0.4), alongside excellent repeatability, reversibility, and stability. This combination of features yields a biocompatible, high-resolution tool for minimally invasive, real-time pH measurements at the single-cell and even at a single-organelle level, opening new avenues for investigating cellular dynamics and disease pathogenesis with enhanced clarity."},{"t":"基于铁电二维半导体的可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管用于感知精准、情境感知的神经形态视觉","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521243?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电2D光电二极管","kp":["[铁电2D半导体]: 可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管","[感存算一体]: 单器件集成传感/计算/存储","[应用]: 感知精度上下文感知神经形态视觉"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出一种基于铁电二维半导体的可重构垂直肖特基光电二极管，用于实现具有感知精度和情境感知能力的神经形态视觉系统。该器件将铁电材料可调的极化特性与二维半导体的高光响应能力相结合，通过铁电极化翻转动态调制肖特基势垒高度，实现光感知、计算和存储功能的一体化集成。这种存内感知计算架构能够在硬件层面模拟视觉系统的情境适应性和自适应调节能力，为仿生机器视觉、边缘智能感知和实时图像处理提供了低功耗、高精度的硬件解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Reconfigurable Vertical Schottky Photodiodes Based on Ferroelectric 2D Semiconductors for Perceptual‐Precision, Context‐Aware Neuromorphic Vision","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    To realize in‐memory sensing and computing platforms, it is essential to integrate sensing, computation, and memory functionalities within a single device, enabling energy‐ and time‐efficient vision systems with high perceptual precision. However, achieving such multi‐functional processing capability within a compact device structure remains a major challenge. Here, a reconfigurable vertical photodiode based on α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    is presented, a ferroelectric 2D semiconductor. Gradual and reversible modulation of built‐in electric fields at the top and bottom Schottky junctions is achieved through partial out‐of‐plane polarization switching of α‐In\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    3\n                    , enabling multi‐level, non‐volatile, and polarity‐tunable photoresponsivity. This allows analog programmability with a high degree of freedom in processing within a two‐terminal metal‐ferroelectric semiconductor‐metal (MFsM) structure, effectively resolving trade‐off between structural compactness and computing versatility. Leveraging these intrinsic characteristics, we demonstrate a versatile sensor‐level perceptual processing framework using a reconfigurable photodiode crossbar array. By exploiting the high‐density spatial integration capability, the system adaptively configures its spatial support to prioritize either suppressing environmental noise for robust feature extraction or preserving fine‐grained details for precise classification, depending on the task requirements. These results lay the foundation for highly scalable and energy‐efficient neuromorphic vision system with high perceptual precision.","aip":1},{"t":"离线逆强化学习联合优化工业光伏-储能负荷系统的能耗成本与需量电费","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储能效优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 离线逆强化学习联合优化光伏-电池能量成本与需求费"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery load systems"},{"t":"仿生智能新视野：突触器件助力智能机器人技术的探索与突破","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000295?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"观点评论","tp":"类脑突触器件","kp":["[突触器件]: 仿生智能驱动智能机器人技术突破"],"sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"New horizons of bionic intelligence: synaptic devices facilitating the exploration and breakthroughs in smart robot technology"},{"t":"低分子量凝胶剂的分子尺度调节控制超分子组装并指导人间充质干细胞生长","d":"2026-01-26","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523454?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    We report the synthesis and characterization of a simple alcohol‐functionalized low‐molecular‐weight gelator (LMWG) based on a 1,3:2,4‐dibenzylidenesorbitol scaffold (DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH) and explore its self‐assembly in comparison to acylhydrazide‐functionalized DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH forms a stiffer, highly organized, less‐soluble self‐assembled hydrogel, with a different assembly mode and much higher entropy/enthalpy of dissociation. On mixing, the LMWGs co‐assemble into gel nanofibers with similar thermodynamics to DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    . DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH is an excellent scaffold for the growth of human mesenchymal stem cells (hMSCs), which exhibit extended spread‐shaped morphologies on the gel surface. In contrast, for DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    , hMSCs have a rounded morphology and penetrate into the softer gel. A simple functional group change on the LMWG, therefore, leads to a remarkable change in cell growth outcomes. When hMSCs are grown on the co‐assembled gel, they have the rounded morphology characteristic of DBS‐CONHNH\n                    2\n                    but remain on the gel surface, like DBS‐CH\n                    2\n                    OH. The multi‐component gel thus shares characteristics of the individual LMWGs, with hMSC growth being controlled by factors like structure, stiffness, and dynamics. This work demonstrates how chemical manipulation of gels based on deceptively simple LMWGs can have profound impacts in biomaterials engineering.","tp":"凝胶剂组装","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6,"i":3,"r":5,"d":5,"t":5},"as":"研究报道了一种基于1,3:2,4-二亚苄基山梨醇骨架的醇功能化低分子量凝胶剂(DBS-CH2OH)的合成与表征，并探索其与酰肼功能化DBS-CONHNH2的自组装行为对比。DBS-CH2OH形成更刚性、高度有序、低溶解度的超分子结构，可有效调控人间充质干细胞的生长行为，在组织工程领域具应用潜力。"},{"t":"原位SN2取代配体工程制备超小CsPbI3量子点实现高电流效率Rec.2020纯红光钙钛矿LED","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519475?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿量子点LED","kp":["[原位SN2取代配体工程]: 超小CsPbI3量子点","[纯红钙钛矿LED]: 符合Rec.2020标准"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过原位SN2取代反应对超小尺寸CsPbI3钙钛矿量子点进行配体工程，实现了高亮度的Rec. 2020纯红色钙钛矿LED。超小尺寸量子点在实现光谱纯红色发射方面具有优势，但表面缺陷和非辐射复合限制了器件效率。该工作利用SN2亲核取代反应在量子点表面精准修饰配体，有效钝化表面缺陷并改善载流子注入。所制得的钙钛矿LED在Rec. 2020色域标准下实现了优异的电流效率和发光亮度，为超高色域显示和纯红光发射器件提供了重要进展。","dp":1,"ot":"Ligand Engineering of Ultrasmall CsPbI3 Quantum Dots via In Situ SN2 Substitution Enables Bright Rec. 2020 Pure‐Red Perovskite LEDs with Exceptional Current Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ultrasmall‐sized cesium lead iodide (CsPbI\n                    3\n                    ) quantum dots (QDs) are promising candidates for achieving spectrally stable pure‐red perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs) meeting Rec. 2020 standards. However, the corresponding devices hardly achieve satisfactory external quantum efficiency (EQE), current efficiency (CE), and luminance simultaneously because of the use of largely excessive insulating long‐chain ligands and additional difficulties in the defect control of ultrasmall CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs. Herein, we develop an alkyl iodide‐assisted ligand modulation strategy for CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs toward high‐efficiency and bright pure‐red PeLEDs. We elucidate an in‐situ nucleophilic bimolecular (S\n                    N\n                    2) substitution reaction between the oleylamine and additionally incorporated short‐chain 1‐iodooctane (IO) molecules during the materials synthesis. The reaction‐generated hydriodic acid (HI) induces non‐destructive surface etching of QDs, enabling exceptional luminescent properties of the strongly confined products. In addition, the S\n                    N\n                    2 reaction‐derived secondary amine strongly adsorbs at the surface of QDs, which stabilizes the products with a reduced ligand density, simultaneously enhancing photoluminescence stability and electrical properties of the assembled emissive layers. The resultant devices emitting at 632 nm demonstrate a peak EQE of 21.56%, an impressive luminance of 13,132 cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and an exceptional CE of 20.73 cd A\n                    −1\n                    , which outperforms state‐of‐the‐art Rec. 2020 pure‐red PeLEDs utilizing ultrasmall‐sized colloidal CsPbI\n                    3\n                    QDs."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的锂离子电池超高倍率放电条件下的内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"有机-无机异质结中界面F···S相互作用的层间耦合用于近红外光电探测与实时运动识别","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518146?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机无机异质结光电探测","kp":["[界面F···S相互作用]: 有机-无机异质结构层间耦合","[应用]: 近红外光电探测与实时运动识别"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用界面F···S相互作用实现有机-无机异质结的层间耦合，用于近红外光电探测和实时动作识别。通过将含氟有机层与含硫无机层构建范德华异质结构，界面处的F···S弱相互作用增强了层间电荷转移和能量传递，显著提升了近红外波段的光响应性能。该异质结光电探测器兼具高灵敏度和快响应速度，研究团队将其集成到手势识别系统中，演示了基于近红外光信号的实时人体动作感知能力，为可穿戴视觉感知和人机交互提供了新的光电材料平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Interlayer Coupling in Organic‐Inorganic Heterostructures via Interfacial F···S Interactions for Near‐Infrared Photodetection and Real‐Time Motion Recognition","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Interlayer coupling serves as a powerful strategy for manipulating the optoelectronic characteristics of van der Waals heterostructures. Although the combination of organic and inorganic semiconductors has enabled versatile optoelectronic applications, interlayer coupling in organic–inorganic heterostructures is still limited by inherent material discrepancies such as lattice matching and stacking order. Herein, we demonstrate an interlayer–coupled organic–inorganic heterojunction achieved by interfacial noncovalent F···S interactions, which is composed of molecular 5,5''‐bis(2‐fluorophenyl)‐2,2':5',2''‐terthiophene (oF‐PTTTP) and 2D molybdenum disulfide (MoS\n                    2\n                    ). By leveraging the conformational flexibility afforded by the full C─C single bonds in its backbone, the oF‐PTTTP molecules can self‐adjust their conformations upon thermal activation. The fluorine atoms on the side chains of oF‐PTTTP engage in noncovalent interactions with the sulfur atoms of MoS\n                    2\n                    at the heterointerface, inducing a pronounced interlayer coupling effect accompanied by lattice strain. This coupling enables near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection in a spectral range inaccessible to each individual component, yielding a specific detectivity of 1.8 × 10\n                    14\n                    Jones at 808 nm, which is one of the highest values reported for organic–inorganic heterostructures. Furthermore, the device exhibits gate‐tunable positive and negative photoresponses at 808 nm, allowing real‐time motion imaging in the NIR spectrum."},{"t":"Fe-Ni-聚(七嗪酰亚胺)中金属种类与含量对其作为锌空气电池电催化剂性能的影响","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506308?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[碱性锌空电池]: Fe-Ni-聚三嗪酰亚胺","[反应]: ORR/OER双功能电催化"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究系统考察了Fe-Ni-聚七嗪亚胺（PHI）复合材料中金属种类和含量对其作为锌空气电池电催化剂性能的影响。碱性锌空气电池因高理论能量密度而备受关注，其性能瓶颈在于空气正极的氧还原/氧析出反应动力学。该工作通过调节Fe和Ni在聚七嗪亚胺载体上的掺杂比例，研究不同金属活性位点对双功能催化活性的贡献。结果表明，Fe-Ni双金属协同作用能够优化中间产物的吸附能，在保持高ORR活性的同时提升OER性能，为设计高效稳定的锌空气电池双功能催化剂提供了组分优化指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Influence of Metal Species and Content of Fe‐Ni‐Poly(heptazine imides) on their Properties as Electrocatalysts for Zinc‐Air Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alkaline zinc‐air batteries (ZABs) have attracted interest in recent years for their high theoretical energy density and use of low‐cost, abundant zinc metal as the anode. In order to overcome the activation energy barrier of the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER), noble metals are commonly used. Within this work, transition metal‐functionalized Poly(heptazine imide)s (PHIs) are studied as an alternative and more abundant electrocatalyst, as they offer the homogenous immobilization of metals within their ordered structure. Introducing Fe and Ni into the PHI network enables the formation of single and mixed transition metal PHIs, which show reduced overpotentials for ORR and OER. The formation of Ni single atoms even induces outstanding catalytic activity for the OER during charging of ZAB full cells with performance comparable to that of RuO\n                    2\n                    . Furthermore, full cell tests show excellent stability over the course of 250 discharge‐charge cycles, making it a promising system for sustainable energy storage. This work paves the way for the molecular design of a novel material class as an electrocatalyst for ZAB."},{"t":"原位光电化学螯合构建抗缺陷配位微环境以增强水氧化","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522149?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OER电催化设计","kp":["[光电化学原位螯合]: 构建缺陷韧性配位微环境","[应用]: 增强水氧化(OER)"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出一种原位光电化学螯合策略，构建缺陷韧性配位微环境以增强水氧化反应（OER）。深能级缺陷作为非辐射复合中心，严重制约光电催化水氧化效率。该工作利用原位光电化学过程在催化剂表面动态生成金属-配体螯合结构，稳定不饱和配位位点并抑制缺陷诱导的电荷复合。这种自修复式配位微环境能够在催化反应过程中自适应地补偿结构缺陷，维持高活性的催化位点。该策略无需复杂的预处理步骤，通过电化学驱动的自组装即可实现，为高效稳定的水分解和可再生能源制氢提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"In Situ Photoelectrochemical Chelation Programs Defect‐Resilient Coordination Microenvironments for Enhanced Water Oxidation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep‐level defects function as non‐radiative recombination centers that throttle oxygen evolution reaction (OER) kinetics. Conventionally, static and pre‐deposited passivation layers often fail during operation, disconnecting defect suppression from the creation and sustained maintenance of catalytically competent sites. Here, we address this limitation with a photoelectrochemically‐driven microenvironment strategy that selectively manipulates the first coordination shell of surface Zn on ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    . Under the in situ photoelectrochemical chelation process, hydroxyethylidene diphosphonic acid writes robust Zn–O–P motifs that subtly distort the Zn–S framework and convert deep traps into shallow states, thereby accelerating charge transfer while suppressing recombination. Density functional theory suggests that Zn–O–P lowers the OER overpotential and switches the rate‐determining step from O\n                    *\n                    →OOH\n                    *\n                    to OOH\n                    *\n                    →O\n                    2\n                    via stabilized\n                    *\n                    OOH intermediates. The optimized photoanode delivers a photocurrent density of 5.38 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V\n                    RHE\n                    , surpassing previously reported ZnIn\n                    2\n                    S\n                    4\n                    ‐based photoanodes. By unifying in situ deep‐trap management and active site construction along a single chemical pathway, this work establishes a modular and general route for dynamic defect engineering and active site reconfiguration, advancing defect‐tolerant innovations in energy conversion and storage."},{"t":"通过少LiF正极-电解质界面相提升高质量负载富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4正极的快充性能","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506130?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LMFP正极快充","kp":["正极[锂离子电池]: 富锰Li[Mn1-xFx]PO4","[无LiF界面CEI]: 高质量负载快充性能提升"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过构建无LiF型正极-电解质界面（CEI），提升高负载量富锰Li[Mn1-xFex]PO4（LMFP）正极的快充性能。LMFP正极因高电压平台和低成本被视为下一代锂离子电池候选材料，但高锰含量带来的Mn溶解和Jahn-Teller畸变，以及高面密度下的离子扩散受限，严重影响快充能力。该工作通过电解质配方设计抑制LiF在正极表面的沉积，转而形成更有利于锂离子快速输运的界面层组成。该无LiF界面策略在高面密度条件下实现了优异的倍率性能和循环稳定性，推动LMFP正极在快充电池中的应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Enhanced Fast‐Charging Performance of High‐Mass‐Loading Mn‐Rich Li[Mn1‐xFex]PO4 Cathodes via LiF‐Less Cathode–Electrolyte Interphase","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mn‐rich Li[Mn\n                    1‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    Fe\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    ]PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP) cathodes are promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries due to their structural stability and cost‐effectiveness. However, under industrially relevant high‐mass‐loading conditions, they still suffer from severe performance degradation, particularly during fast charging. In this study, we systematically demonstrate that charge‐transfer resistance, rather than bulk Li\n                    +\n                    diffusivity, governs the kinetic limitations of LMFP electrodes with an areal capacity of ∼3.5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    (∼23 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    mass loading). Surface analyses reveal that the buildup of electronically and ionically insulating LiF at the cathode–electrolyte interphase (CEI) is the primary cause of sluggish charge transfer, highlighting a previously overlooked detrimental role of LiF. Guided by this insight, we implement an interfacial engineering strategy that suppresses LiF formation at the CEI. Remarkably, the resulting high‐mass‐loading LMFP cathodes deliver a 1.6‐fold increase in capacity at 5C and retain ∼87% of their initial capacity after 100 cycles at 2C. Moreover,\n                    operando\n                    structural analysis reveals that electrodes with LiF‐suppressed CEI maintain a robust single‐phase transition during fast cycling, directly linking interfacial LiF suppression to significantly enhanced charge‐transfer kinetics. This work highlights the critical importance of CEI engineering in enabling fast‐charging Mn‐rich olivine cathodes under practical, high‐mass‐loading conditions."},{"t":"基于热电耦合废热利用实现电网互动型数据中心-海水淡化协同","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000802?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心余热协调","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enabling grid-interactive data center-desalination coordination through thermo-electric coupling-based waste heat utilization"},{"t":"缓解光伏不确定性的梯级水电-混合抽水蓄能深度强化学习实时调度方法","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电强化学习调度","kp":["[深度强化学习]: 梯级水电-混合抽蓄实时调度缓解光伏不确定性"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating photovoltaic uncertainties"},{"t":"风电场功率优化的循环偏航控制：斯特劳哈尔数、场区配置与湍流强度的作用","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000711?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电偏航控制优化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Cyclic yaw control for wind farm power optimization: The role of strouhal number, farm configuration, and turbulence intensity"},{"t":"相关不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多能系统优化","kp":["[社区多能系统]: 相关不确定性下多时间尺度风险规避框架"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated uncertainties"},{"t":"异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-26","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动","[应用]: 异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy resources"},{"t":"mGluR1 信号对于加强发育中的小鼠小脑中获胜者攀爬纤维输入是必要的","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2425460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Functional neural circuits are sculpted by strengthening frequently used synapses and removing unnecessary connections. At birth, cerebellar Purkinje cells receive inputs with similar synaptic strengths from multiple climbing fibers (CFs). During postnatal development, a single “winner” CF is selectively strengthened and expands its dendritic innervation territory, while somatic “loser” synapses are eliminated. Here, we report that deleting metabotropic glutamate receptor 1 (mGluR1) or protein kinase Cγ (PKCγ) in mice disrupts this selective strengthening and territory expansion of “winner” CFs during early development. This impairment leads to weaker synaptic transmission and diminished dendritic innervation territory of “winner” CFs at later stages. Notably, “winner” CF synapses in these mutants exhibit impaired long-term potentiation, reduced AMPA receptor expression, and simpler postsynaptic organizations. These findings reveal a previously unappreciated role for mGluR1–PKCγ signaling, besides its established role in eliminating “loser” CFs, in promoting the functional and structural maturation of “winner” CF synapses.","tp":"突触可塑性","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":5,"i":1,"r":4,"d":5,"t":4},"as":"本研究探讨了发育中小鼠小脑神经突触的修饰机制。出生时，小脑Purkinje细胞接收多个强度相似的攀爬纤维输入。而在出生后发育过程中，通常只有一个“获胜”的攀滚纤维被选择性强化并扩张其树神经支配区域，而“失败”的突触则被消除。研究表明，代谢型谷氨酸受体1（mGluR1）或相关蛋白的缺失会阻断这一“获胜”突触强化的关键过程，这揭示了mGluR1信号在神经回路精确 sculpting 中的必要性。"},{"t":"iDesignGPT通过大语言模型智能体工作流增强概念设计","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68672-1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"LLM Agent设计","kp":["[框架]: LLM多智能体协作","[应用]: 概念工程设计动态问题精炼与设计空间探索"],"dp":1,"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"iDesignGPT利用大语言模型智能体工作流增强概念工程设计。针对传统工程设计方法与新兴AI工具难以全面应对概念设计复杂性的挑战，该框架通过多智能体协作完成需求分析、方案生成与迭代评估，提升工程设计自动化水平与创意质量。","ot":"iDesignGPT enhances conceptual design via large language model agentic workflows","b":"Conceptual engineering system design faces challenges from traditional methods and emerging AI tools to fully address its inherently complex, dynamic, and creativity-driven demands. iDesignGPT is a framework that integrates large language models with established design methodologies to enable dynamic multi-agent collaboration for problem refinement, information gathering, design space exploration, and evaluation. By incorporating design metrics such as coverage, diversity, and novelty, iDesignGPT provides quantitative insights for early-stage conceptual design. Performance evaluations across six public design challenges show that iDesignGPT achieves competitive novelty and consistently higher originality and modularity than GPT-4o zero-shot, GPT-4o chain-of-thought and Deepseek-r1, based on metrics and expert assessments. Two controlled user studies show positive reception across profiles and, for novice designers, lower mental demand than human-only design and clearer design flow with iDesignGPT. These results establish iDesignGPT as a practical framework for integrating language-model agents with established engineering design methods, enabling metrics-driven support for conceptual design by both expert and novice designers."},{"t":"[ASAP] 超声波触发 I 型超分子光敏剂，用于基于原位化学发光的精确光动力","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15389","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Chemiluminescence-based photodynamic therapy (CL-PDT) addresses the challenge of traditional PDT regarding limited light penetration depth. However, its therapeutic efficacy is constrained by the efficiency of chemiluminescence resonance energy transfer (CRET) and CL intensity. Herein, we introduce a hypocrellin derivative into Ru(II) metallacycle to construct a novel supramolecular CL-based photosensitizer (PS), RDL, for the first time. RDL integrates an efficient type I Ru(II) PS acceptor and superoxide anion radical (O2•-)-responsive CL donor via coordinate covalent bonds, exhibiting excellent spectral overlap between the two components. More importantly, this strategy effectively minimizes the distance between the components, achieving a high CRET efficiency of 97%. Notably, RDL effectively generates hydroxyl radical (•OH) and O2•- under ultrasound (US) activation. Simultaneously, O2•- generated by RDL, along with that overexpressed in inflammation sites, synergistically triggers CL ligand to emit strong fluorescence, which activates Ru(II) PS to produce abundant •OH and O2•-. Herein, O2•- can be converted into •OH via CRET-mediated PDT cycle, which is the most reactive and toxic ROS in biology. Additionally, the US-induced cavitation effect enhances CL intensity, thereby achieving US-triggered and intramolecular CRET codriven in situ cyclic CL-PDT. To enhance the targeting efficiency of RDL, we construct biomimetic targeting nanoparticles, RDL@RM NPs, by coating with hybrid cell membrane shells. The RDL@RM NPs enable precise targeting of inflammation sites, thereby effectively eradicating pathogens in deep hypoxic tissues via CL-PDT. This research lays the groundwork for the development of US-triggered supramolecular CL-based PSs and their application in treating deep-seated bacterial infections.","tp":"光动力治疗","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7,"i":3,"r":6,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"基于化学发光的光动力疗法(CD-PDT)解决了传统PDT光穿透深度有限的问题，但疗效受限于化学发光共振能量转移效率和发光强度。研究首次将竹红菌素衍生物引入Ru(II)金属环，构建新型超分子化学发光光敏剂RDL，集成高效I型Ru(II)光敏受体，并通过超声触发实现精确可控的光动力治疗。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 变构构象调控对芳香酰胺金属大环晶体堆积的影响 vi","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18568","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The versatility of supramolecular chemistry stems from rational molecular design, which allows for the precise control over noncovalent interactions to direct self-assembly processes. Inspired by allosteric regulation in biomolecules, where long-range interactions dictate function, we report a novel aramide macrocyclic palladium complex that adopts distinct conformations upon allosteric complexation with ligands based on 4-substituted pyridine derivatives. Modulating ligand coordination strength and steric demand alters intramolecular three-center hydrogen-bond strength at a remote site, leading to inversion of the orientations of remote amide groups. This approach affords direct control over macrocyclic conformation in the solid state, allowing reversible transition between chairlike conformers with weakly coordinated ligands and V-shaped conformers with strongly coordinated ligands. Crucially, this conformational control, achieved through local binding events, i.e., atomic-level ligand exchange, while preserving the macrocyclic integrity, not only propagates to the supramolecular level but also sequentially modulates crystal packing, ultimately guiding the formation of higher-order structures driven by the precise columnar and layered arrangement of the palladium complex.","tp":"超分子组装","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"超分子化学的多样性源于理性分子设计，可精确控制非共价相互作用引导自组装。受生物分子变构调控启发，研究报道了一种新型芳酰胺大环钯配合物，在与4-取代吡啶衍生物配体变构络合时采取不同构象。通过调节配体配位强度可精确控制晶体堆积模式，为功能超分子材料设计提供新策略。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过界面限域各向异性组装策略定制方形二维介孔纳米片","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18433","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究提出一种界面限域策略，成功制备出形貌可控的方形二维介孔纳米片。尽管二维介孔纳米材料合成已有显著进展，但实现对其尺寸和形貌的精确控制仍是重大挑战。该方法利用界面限域效应调控介孔结构的生长方向与几何形状，为二维介孔材料在催化、传感、能源存储等领域的应用奠定了基础，具有重要的工程化前景。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维介孔纳米片","kp":["合成策略[2D介孔纳米片]: 界面限域各向异性组装","形貌[2D介孔]: 方形纳米片","可调性[纳米片]: 组分/形貌/尺寸/厚度"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Square-Shaped 2D Mesoporous Nanosheets via an Interface-Confined Anisotropic Assembly Strategy","b":"Despite considerable advancements in the synthesis of two-dimensional (2D) mesoporous nanomaterials, achieving precise control over their components, morphology, lateral dimension, and thickness remains a formidable challenge. Here, we report a rational interface-confined anisotropic assembly strategy that enables the synthesis of square-shaped 2D mesoporous nanosheets with finely tunable features including compositions (metal ion-doped mesoporous polydopamine or silica), lateral dimensions (100-200 nm), thicknesses (14-25 nm), and in-plane mesopore sizes (8-20 nm). In this strategy, truncated rhombic dodecahedral ZIF-8 metal-organic framework (MOF) nanoparticles serve as seeds to direct the selective assembly of mesoporous micelles onto their six {100} facets. The geometric confinement of these square facets guides the interfacial organization of micelles into 2D sheet-like structure, faithfully inheriting the square geometry. Following etching of the ZIF-8 seeds, the resulting nanosheets preserve their well-defined square-shaped 2D morphology and mesoporous architecture. This versatile approach enables the fabrication of diverse 2D mesoporous tunable structural attributes and metal-ion dopants. As a proof of concept, mPDA-Zn2+/Fe2+ nanosquares, featuring a uniform 2D architecture, near-infrared (NIR) photothermal properties, and Fenton-like catalytic activity, demonstrate synergistic therapeutic effects. Compared to conventional spherical analogs (1.08 × 10-8 M/s), these nanosquares (2.11 × 10-8 M/s) achieve nearly doubled maximum reaction rates and achieved remarkable tumor inhibition of up to 90%. Overall, this study establishes a novel approach for the precise engineering of 2D mesoporous nanosquares with controllable parameters, unlocking new opportunities for applications in biomedicine and beyond."},{"t":"[ASAP] 疏水金属表面单层冰的合成","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17012","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Understanding water-metal interactions is central to disciplines spanning catalysis, electrochemistry, and atmospheric science. Monolayer ice phases are well established on hydrophilic surfaces, where strong water-substrate interactions stabilize ordered hydrogen-bond networks. In contrast, their formation on hydrophobic metals has been deemed thermodynamically unfavorable, with water typically assembling into amorphous films, three-dimensional crystallites, or interlocked bilayer ice. Here, we demonstrate the synthesis of a monolayer ice phase on the hydrophobic Au(111) surface using a low-energy-electron-assisted growth method. Combined experimental characterizations including low-energy electron diffraction, angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy, and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, complemented by first-principles calculations, prove that the monolayer ice phase composes of intact water molecules. This approach provides a generalizable strategy for stabilizing ordered two-dimensional ice on inert substrates and offers new insight into the interplay between water and low-energy electrons at hydrophobic interfaces.","tp":"疏水表面冰","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"水-金属相互作用是催化、电化学和大气科学的核心课题。单分子层冰相在亲水表面上已充分确立，但在疏水金属上的形成一直被认为热力学不利。研究首次在疏水金属表面成功合成有序单分子层冰，挑战了传统认知，为理解水-疏水界面相互作用及冰成核机制提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过空位与阳离子工程实现A位缺陷钙钛矿的可切换极化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19790","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿极化切换","kp":["[材料]: Y1/3TaO3 A位缺陷钙钛矿","[机制]: 有序空位耦合TaO6八面体旋转","[特性]: 室温可切换极化(Pb21m相)"],"as":"该研究在A位缺陷型钙钛矿中通过空位工程实现了可切换极化。虽然晶体中的缺陷通常不利于材料性能，但在特定条件下可成为功能化的关键要素。研究利用有序空位排列调控材料的铁电极化方向，实现极化状态的可逆切换。该发现为新型非易失性存储器、铁电器件及缺陷工程策略开辟了新路径，具有重要的信息存储应用潜力。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Switchable Polarization in an A-Site Deficient Perovskite through Vacancy and Cation Engineering","b":"While defects are unavoidable in crystals and often detrimental to material performance, they can be a key ingredient for inducing functionalities when tailored. Here, we show that an A-site-deficient perovskite Y1/3TaO3 exhibits switching-like polarization response at room temperature in the Pb21m phase, enabled by ordered vacancies coupled with TaO6 octahedral rotations. Defect-ordered perovskites are frequently trapped in centrosymmetric incommensurate states due to competing structural instabilities; we circumvent this by favoring rotational over off-centering instability through compositional selection. Unlike canonical improper ferroelectrics that are ferrielectric, the vanishing dipoles on vacancy layers in Y1/3TaO3 allow for a net ferroelectric alignment of local dipoles, resulting in enhanced polarization. Upon heating, Y1/3TaO3 transforms to a paraelectric incommensurate phase at ≃750 K, whose atomic arrangement mirrors the domain topology observed in hybrid improper ferroelectrics. Superspace analysis of the modulated phase reveals a route to improve room-temperature polarization, achieved through epitaxial strain, as confirmed by our lattice-dynamics calculations. This defect-ordering strategy should be generalizable to other improper ferroelectrics, including magnetoelectric multiferroics, providing a pathway to amplify otherwise limited macroscopic polarization."},{"t":"[ASAP] 三种双功能二倍半萜合酶的结构解析及基于结构域的产物谱研究","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17651","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双功能萜烯合酶","kp":["[酶]: 双功能二倍半萜合酶","[结构域]: C端PT+N端TS","[方法]: 结构域交换与活性位点突变调控产物谱"],"as":"该研究解析了三种双功能二萜/三萜合酶及其产物的结构机制。萜烯合酶利用不同的线性聚异戊二烯底物催化形成多样化的碳氢骨架，是天然产物生物合成的关键酶。研究通过结构生物学手段揭示了双功能酶中两个催化结构域的协同作用机制，为理解复杂萜类化合物的生物合成途径提供了原子级洞察，对酶工程改造和药物前体合成具有指导价值。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Structural Insights into Three Bifunctional Sesterterpene Synthases and Product Profile Investigation by Domain S","b":"Terpene synthases (TSs) catalyze the formation of diverse hydrocarbon skeletons by using different linear polyisoprenyl diphosphates as the substrates, whose biosyntheses are catalyzed by prenyltransferases (PTs). In nature, some TSs are bifunctional enzymes catalyzing both polyisoprenyl diphosphate formation and subsequent cyclization, containing a C-terminal PT domain and an N-terminal terpene cyclase (TC) domain. To date, several bifunctional PT-TC diterpene synthases and triterpene synthase have been structurally characterized, whereas there have been no structural insights reported for bifunctional PT-TC sesterterpene synthases (StTSs). We here report the cryo-EM structures of three full-length StTSs (EvAS, EvSS, and PbSS), revealing that EvAS and PbSS share a similar PT-driven hexamerization architecture, but EvSS possesses a PT-hexamer stacked helical hollow tubular architecture that has not been observed for other TSs. Domain swapping among the three StTSs shows that not only the production yields but also the major product types of TCs can be greatly affected by different noncovalently linked PTs. The atypical α-helical bundle crystal structure of the TC domain of EvAS was determined, revealing key secondary structures whose positions may affect the cyclization function. Systematic mutations on key residues in the active sites of the TC domains of EvAS and EvSS generated seven new compounds, expanding the structural diversity of sesterterpenes. These results uncover the new structural architecture of bifunctional TSs and expand our understanding of their substrate transfer and catalytic function, and benefit the rational engineering and design of collaborated PT and TC pairs in the generation of terpene molecules."},{"t":"[ASAP] 单碳桥联并五苯二聚体实现高效单线态裂变与五重态稳定","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14851","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单线态裂分材料","kp":["分子设计[单线态裂分]: 单碳桥连并五苯二聚体","五重态[单线态裂分]: 单碳桥连稳定5TT抑制解离"],"as":"研究团队合成了单碳桥连的并五苯二聚体，实现了高效单重态裂分（SF）。该分子设计通过单碳桥连基精确调控两个并五苯单元间的电子耦合，使单重态激子高效裂分为两个自旋纠缠的三重态对。单重态裂分可突破传统太阳能电池的Shockley-Queisser极限，每个光子产生两个载流子，在量子信息科学（自旋纠缠态）和下一代光伏器件中具有重大应用潜力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Single-Carbon Bridged Pentacene Dimers Enable Efficient Singlet Fission and Quintet State Stabilization","b":"Singlet fission (SF) offers a promising avenue for quantum information science, as it generates spin-entangled triplet pairs with quintet character (5TT) upon photoexcitation, enabling access to multilevel spin qubit states beyond the traditional two-level systems. However, the 5TT state often decays via several pathways: (1) dissociation into isolated triplets; (2) triplet-triplet annihilation back into the singlet manifold; or (3) spin conversion to lower-multiplicity triplet pair states. These competing relaxation channels pose a major challenge for stabilizing 5TT. Here, we introduce a novel molecular design that prolongs 5TT lifetime by anchoring two pentacene chromophores to the same carbon (C9) position of a fluorene bridge, yielding FlePc2 and FlePhPc2. This single-point attachment enforces a near-parallel intramolecular geometry, promoting strong through-space spin interactions that hinder dissociation. Field-swept electron spin echo (FS-ESE) measurements reveal dominant 5TT signals, indicative of suppressed relaxation pathways. Theoretical calculations predict a substantial binding energy for the reported dimers, accompanied by significant spin density delocalization across both pentacenes, thereby rationalizing 5TT stabilization. These findings establish a molecular design principle for kinetically trapping high-spin multiexciton states, paving the way for spin-based quantum technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 负载钌的杂原子分子筛用于水相选择性加氢脱氧反应","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19607","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物质加氢脱氧","kp":["[催化剂]: RuFA/SAPO-34-Nb","[活性位]: 少原子Ru簇+Nb(V)修饰SAPO-34","[反应]: 木质素衍生物(愈创木酚类)水相加氢脱氧","[键断裂]: 选择性C(sp2)-OH"],"as":"该研究开发了钌负载杂原子分子筛催化剂，用于生物油升级中的加氢脱氧（HDO）反应。核心挑战在于选择性断裂稳定的C(sp2)-OH键而不破坏碳骨架。杂原子分子筛提供酸性位点与限域效应，钌纳米颗粒负责加氢，二者协同实现了对木质素衍生酚类化合物的高选择性脱氧，将生物质转化为高品质液体燃料，为可再生能源领域提供了新催化策略。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Ruthenium-Loaded Heteroatomic Zeolite for Selective Hydrodeoxygenation Reaction in Aqueous Medium","b":"Catalytic hydrodeoxygenation (HDO) is critical for bio-oil upgrading, yet the selective cleavage of stable C(sp2)-OH bonds in lignin-derived substrates under aqueous conditions remains a challenge. Here, we report a heteroatomic zeolite catalyst, RuFA/SAPO-34-Nb, featuring few-atom Ru clusters on a Nb(V)-modified SAPO-34 framework, which achieves highly efficient HDO of lignin-derived creosol (2-methoxy-4-methylphenol) in water. Under mild conditions (250 °C, 7 bar H2, 24 h), this catalyst delivers quantitative conversion of creosol to toluene (99.2% conversion, 99.6% selectivity), fully preserving the aromaticity of lignin-derived feedstocks─a key requirement for sustainable production of chemicals. Synchrotron X-ray diffraction, X-ray absorption spectroscopy, and inelastic neutron scattering, combined with theoretical modeling, elucidate the cooperative mechanism: the Nb(V) sites selectively cleave the strong C-O bonds, while the few-atom Ru cluster generates hydrogen species with an exceptionally low rotational barrier of 65 cm-1. This synergistic interaction enables the direct and selective HDO of C(sp2)-O bonds without saturation of the aromatic ring. This work establishes a promissing strategy for aqueous-phase HDO catalysis and provides a general approach for designing bimetallic zeolite catalysts to convert lignin-derived compounds to value-added aromatic chemicals, advancing sustainable biorefinery processes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 自由基 S-腺苷-l-甲硫氨酸加氧酶 DarE 通过部分离域的色氨酸 Cβ 自由基形成醚键","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19314","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Darobactins are ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) with potent activity against Gram-negative pathogens. Their antibiotic function depends on a distinctive β-strand architecture stabilized by an ether cross-link between two tryptophan residues. Unlike most ether linkages in natural products, which arise from hydroxylated precursors, the darobactin ether bond is formed between two unmodified Trp residues by the radical S-adenosyl-l-methionine (SAM) enzyme DarE. DarE catalyzes both O-insertion and ether bond formation using molecular oxygen as a cosubstrate, but its catalytic mechanism remains largely unexplored. Here, we report detection and characterization of a key radical intermediate at the Cβ position of W3 (W3-Cβ•) using isotopically labeled DarA, kinetic analysis, and spectroscopy methods including EPR, ENDOR, and HYSCORE. Similar radical species were also observed in reactions with W3 variants of DarA. These results provide direct evidence that DarE catalyzes ether cross-link formation through reaction of the W3-Cβ• intermediate with O2, revealing an unprecedented radical-mediated strategy for O-atom incorporation in RiPP biosynthesis.","tp":"抗生素合成","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"Darobactin是核糖体合成并经翻译后修饰的多肽，对革兰氏阴性病原体具有强效抗菌活性。其功能依赖于两个色氨酸残基间醚键交联稳定的β链结构。与大多数天然产物醚键源于羟基化前体不同，研究揭示自由基SAM酶DarE通过部分离域的色氨酸Cβ自由基在两个未修饰色氨酸之间形成醚键，拓宽了酶催化机制认知。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 基于超疏水电极的光热驱动高效CO2电还原","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19088","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热CO2电还原","kp":["电极[CO2电还原]: 超疏水电极","驱动方式[CO2还原]: 光热驱动"],"as":"该研究利用超疏水电极表面结合光热效应，实现了高效电化学CO2还原（eCO2RR）。超疏水结构在电极表面构建气固液三相界面，促进CO2传质并抑制竞争性析氢反应；光热组件局部升温进一步加速反应动力学。该协同策略显著提高了CO2转化为高附加值化学品和燃料的法拉第效率和电流密度，为碳中和技术提供了新思路。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Photothermally Driven Efficient CO2 Electroreduction Based on a Superhydrophobic Electrode","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction reaction (eCO2RR) offers a promising route to produce value-added chemicals and fuels while mitigating carbon emissions. However, challenges of insufficient mass transfer, competitive hydrogen evolution, and sluggish kinetics persist. Thermal activation can improve kinetics, but conventional heating suffers from energy inefficiency and CO2 solubility degradation. Herein, we report a superhydrophobic triphase photothermal electrode (TPTE) that synergistically integrates localized photothermal heating with interfacial gas transport engineering. This architecture enables precise and energy-efficient heating at the catalyst/electrolyte/gas triphase interface while sustaining high CO2 availability, overcoming a classical issue of trade-off between temperature and gaseous solubility. Integrating a Au nanoparticle electrocatalyst with a photothermal porous superhydrophobic carbon substrate, TPTE achieves a 260% enhancement in CO partial current density under 400 mW·cm-2 illumination compared to that under ambient conditions while effectively suppressing hydrogen evolution. Mathematical models verify diffusion rate, and interfacial CO2 concentrations determine eCO2RR performance. Under 400 mW·cm-2 illumination, the CO2 supply rate of TPTE is 50 times higher than that of conventional diphase electrodes. Moreover, the triphase system maintains interfacial CO2 concentrations near saturation, far exceeding those of diphase systems. This work establishes a generalized interface design strategy for decoupled thermal and mass transport management, offering novel insights into high-performance eCO2RR.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过甲酸盐介导非氢气脱氧还原光催化升级回收聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20711","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PET光催化回收","kp":["[反应]: PET光催化升级回收","[还原剂]: 甲酸盐(无氢条件)","[产物]: 烷基对甲基苯甲酸酯","[机制]: 甲酸介导非氢脱氧还原"],"as":"该研究报道了一种前所未有的光催化策略，通过甲酸盐介导的选择性脱氧还原反应，实现对聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯（PET）的光催化升级回收。光催化体系将PET衍生苯甲酸酯中的C-O键选择性断裂脱氧，转化为高附加值化学品，打破了传统PET回收仅限于单体解聚的局限。该技术为塑料废弃物的资源化利用开辟了新路径，兼具环境治理与经济价值。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Photocatalytic Upcycling of Polyethylene Terephthalate via Formate-Mediated Non-Hydrogen Deoxygenative Reduction","b":"Herein, we report an unprecedented photocatalytic protocol for the selective deoxygenative reduction of benzoate esters and derivatives, using formate as a reductant. Leveraging this novel and efficient approach, PET upcycling is achieved successfully, delivering alkyl p-methylbenzoate under mild, hydrogen-free conditions. Mechanistic studies reveal that the transformation is enabled by the synergy of consecutive single-electron transfer (SET) and a remote spin-center shift (SCS). Gram-scale synthesis is readily demonstrated using a continuous-flow reactor, underscoring its practical potential.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 吡啶卡宾配体铱催化剂的实测与预测反应性、选择性及机理对比","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14683","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱催化C-H硼化","kp":["[催化剂]: 铱+吡啶卡宾配体","[反应]: 无定向烷基C-H硼化","[对比]: 比菲咯啉体系更高活性/差异化选择性"],"as":"该研究聚焦铱催化烷基C-H键无定向硼化反应，系统对比了反应活性、选择性与机理的实验观测值与理论预测值。通过建立预测模型与实验验证的闭环验证框架，揭示了催化剂底物结合模式与区域选择性的关联规律，为精准合成与功能化策略提供了理性设计依据。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Observed versus Predicted Reactivity, Selectivity, and Mechanism of Iridium Catalysts with Pyridyl Carbene Ligand","b":"New catalysts for the undirected borylation of alkyl C-H bonds can lead to new strategies for the synthesis or derivatization of organic molecules. Catalysts composed of phenanthroline ligands, in combination with iridium precursors, have led to the borylation of aryl and some alkyl C-H bonds. However, catalysts that are more active or that react with distinct selectivity toward alkyl C-H bonds, or both, are needed. A new class of catalyst ligated by N-heterocyclic carbenes was predicted by computation to be more active for the borylation of alkyl C-H bonds than those with phenanthroline ligands. We show that these ligands generate catalysts that react in ways that are different from the pathways predicted. Specifically, we show that they rearrange to LX-type ligands by cyclometalation and then catalyze the borylation of THF at the position α-to oxygen in the presence of alkoxide, and that they do not react with alkyl C-H bonds in the absence of alkoxide. From computational and experimental studies, we provide strong evidence that the reactions in the presence of alkoxide occur by a catalytic cycle involving an anionic [iridium(III)trisboryl]-Na+ complex that gives rise to the unique selectivity for the borylation of this saturated oxygen heterocycle and substantiate this conclusion by showing that the borylation of arylpyridines occurs by distinct pathways in the presence and absence of alkoxide."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过固态机械化学实现中等分子在配位笼中的包封","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20185","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"该研究报道了一种利用固态机械化学方法实现中等尺寸分子在配位笼中包封的新策略。传统溶液相包封受限于主体空腔尺寸与客体分子匹配度，固态方法通过机械研磨促进客体-笼组装体的形成，成功将药物分子、染料等中等尺寸分子嵌入超分子笼中。该策略为超分子化学的分子识别、催化与分离提供了新工具。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配位笼机械化学包埋","kp":["主体[包结]: M9L6配位笼","合成方法[包结]: 固相机械化学研磨"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Medium-Sized-Molecule Encapsulation in Coordination Cages via Solid-State Mechanochemistry","b":"The encapsulation of medium-sized molecules in synthetic hosts remains a major challenge, hindered by both the lack of suitable hosts that combine a large size with high molecular recognition capability and kinetic and thermodynamic barriers to encapsulating bulky molecules in solution. Here, we demonstrate that solid-state mechanochemical grinding of a large M9L6 coordination cage with various medium-sized guests efficiently overcomes these barriers. This simple, solvent-free approach enables the high-yielding formation of inclusion complexes that are inaccessible or form exceedingly slowly under conventional solution conditions. The resulting complexes, featuring synthetic macrocycles and pharmaceuticals, are kinetically persistent in solution for hours to days, allowing for not only their full characterization, including by X-ray crystallography, but also for their subsequent chemical manipulation. The versatility of this method was confirmed with a smaller cage system. This study establishes solid-state grinding as a powerful strategy for accessing metastable host-guest systems, opening new avenues for the structural analysis of challenging molecules and the design of complex, functional supramolecular architectures."},{"t":"[ASAP] N-乙基甲酰胺-水 C 中的旋转光谱显示氢键链扭曲肽键","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17420","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Microsolvation and hydrogen-bonding topologies critically influence local molecular geometries and electronic structures, especially in biological peptides, where solvent-peptide interactions can perturb the amide bond and affect conformational dynamics. Although peptide bonds are typically near-planar, how and to what extent local solvent molecules affect this geometry remains unresolved. In this study, we investigate stepwise microsolvation effects on the peptide bond planarity of N-ethylformamide (NEF) using rotational spectroscopy. The structures of NEF microsolvated by two to five water molecules, NEF-(H2O)n (n = 2 - 5), have been determined. Conformational analysis reveals a pronounced nitrogen pyramidalization angle (θN > 20°) in the trans-sc-NEF-(H2O)3 complex, far exceeding the typical ±6° observed in proteins. The experimental nuclear quadrupole coupling constants confirm this distortion, yielding the semiexperimental value of θN = 23.01°. This arises from nonideal hydrogen bonds in its microsolvation topology, inducing out-of-plane displacement of the amide hydrogen and thus driving a twist of its planarity. In contrast, no significant deviation is observed for other microsolvation levels, either more or less. Our results demonstrate that specific hydrogen-bonding patterns can directly perturb peptide bond planarity, highlighting the key role of local solvent effects in modulating peptide bond stability.","tp":"氢键与肽键","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"微溶剂化和氢键拓扑对分子局部几何和电子结构影响重大，尤其在生物肽中溶剂-肽相互作用可扰动酰胺键并影响构象动力学。肽键通常接近平面，但局部溶剂分子如何影响其几何尚不清楚。研究通过转动光谱研究N-乙基甲酰胺-水体系的逐步微溶剂化效应，发现氢键链可显著扭曲肽键平面性。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 微滴中超小贵金属合金纳米晶的形成","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22086","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"贵金属合金纳米晶","kp":["尺寸[合金纳米晶]: <5nm","[材料]: AuPd、PdPt贵金属合金","[合成方法]: 喷雾水微滴","[还原剂]: 微滴气-水界面电子(无外加还原剂)"],"as":"该研究提出在微液滴中快速合成贵金属合金纳米晶的新方法。通过微液滴中独特的界面反应环境，实现了铂、钯、金等贵金属的快速共还原与合金化，获得超小尺寸（<5 nm）且均匀的合金纳米颗粒。该方法反应时间短、能耗低、组分可调，在催化、传感与生物医药领域具有应用前景。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Formation of Ultrasmall Noble Metal Alloy Nanocrystals in Microdroplets","b":"Alloy nanocrystals (NCs) have attracted considerable attention due to their broad applications. Herein, we present examples of ultrasmall (<5 nm) noble metal alloy NCs, i.e., AuPd and PdPt NCs, synthesized by sprayed water microdroplets. Electrons generated at the air-water interface of microdroplets serve as the primary reducing species, enabling metal ion reduction in the absence of added reductants. Through physical characterizations and mass spectrometry analysis, we elucidate the unique formation mechanism of NCs: the air-water interface of microdroplets simultaneously promotes the reduction and polymerization of precursor ions, followed by efficient surface reduction of the polymerized metal clusters, forming nuclei that undergo subsequent coalescence. The submillisecond reaction time prevents excessive crystal growth, yielding ultrasmall NCs featuring high-energy facets. This work provides insights into nonclassical nucleation and reduction of metal ions, and demonstrates the unique capabilities of microdroplet chemistry in the manipulation of nanomaterial growth dynamics and structures."},{"t":"[ASAP] 非质子高能锂金属电池的电解质诱导界面编程","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03494","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["[界面工程]: 电解质诱导界面编程","[电池]: 非质子高能锂金属电池"],"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrolyte-Induced Interphase Programming for Aprotic High-Energy Lithium Metal Batteries"},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于增强稳定性太阳能电池的无DMSO锡铅钙钛矿薄膜制备工艺","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03416","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡铅钙钛矿薄膜","kp":["[材料]: 锡-铅钙钛矿薄膜","[工艺]: 无DMSO加工","[目标]: 太阳能电池稳定性增强"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] DMSO-Free Processing of Tin–Lead Perovskite Thin Films for Solar Cells with Enhanced Stability"},{"t":"[ASAP] 在苝二酰亚胺基COF中构建杂配铜配合物用于多相金属光氧化还原催化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17585","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF铜光催化","kp":["策略[铜配合物]: COF框架异质化固定","催化剂[光氧化还原]: PDI-COF基杂环铜"],"as":"基于苝二酰亚胺（PDI）骨架构建异配铜络合物光催化剂。PDI是典型的n型有机半导体，具有强可见光吸收和优良的电子接受能力。该研究将含二亚胺配体的铜中心与PDI单元结合，构建新型异配铜光催化体系用于有机合成。相比传统的钌、铱等贵金属光催化剂，铜基体系成本更低且环境友好，但催化效率与底物适用范围仍有瓶颈。通过PDI骨架的电子结构调控，有望拓展铜光催化剂在光氧化还原催化中的应用边界。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Heteroleptic Copper Complexes in Perylene Diimide-Based COFs for Heterogeneous Metallaphotoredox ","b":"Despite recent advances in developing diimine-containing copper photocatalysts for organic synthesis, further exploration of heteroleptic phenanthroline-ligated copper complexes remains challenging due to rapid ligand exchange in homogeneous solutions. Herein, we employ a framework-based heterogenization strategy to successfully synthesize such previously inaccessible copper complexes through postsynthetic modification. By integrating photoactive perylene diimide units into a one-dimensional covalent organic framework, the visible-light-driven oxo-azidation of styrenes can be accomplished with substantially reduced copper loadings in metallaphotoredox catalysis. Notably, our newly developed heterogeneous photocatalytic platform demonstrates that the reactive copper species facilitates the ketone formation step in the oxo-azidation without dissociation of one of the phenanthroline ligands. These findings highlight the potential of well-defined framework materials to address fundamental challenges in the synthesis of transition-metal complexes and enable detailed mechanistic studies that complement traditional homogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 从β-硼酰胺催化立体专一构建氨基环丙烷","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21144","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨基环丙烷合成","kp":["[反应]: β-硼酰胺→氨基环丙烷","[催化剂]: 铱(TMDS原位生成亚铵离子)","[特性]: 立体专一翻转、高非对映/对映选择性"],"as":"从β-硼基酰胺出发催化立体专一构建氨基环丙烷。该方法利用铱催化剂与四甲基二硅氧烷（TMDS）协同作用，将β-硼基酰胺还原后原位生成活泼亚胺离子中间体，随后发生分子内环化反应，以高立体选择性生成氨基环丙烷。关键在于铱催化还原过程中对硼基的精确活化和环化步骤的立体专一性控制。氨基环丙烷是药物分子中重要的药效基团，存在于多种天然产物和临床药物中，该方法为合成手性药物中间体提供了高效催化途径。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Catalytic Stereospecific Construction of Aminocyclopropanes from β-Boryl Amides","b":"Iridium-catalyzed reduction of β-boryl amides with tetramethyldisiloxane affords iminium ions in situ. These reactive iminium ions are directly trapped by stereospecific (invertive) reaction with the boronate, delivering aminocyclopropanes (ACPs) in excellent yield, diastereoselectivity, and enantiospecificity. The reaction applies to both secondary and tertiary benzylic boronates, allylic boronates, and α-substituted boronates, giving access to many multiply substituted ACPs."},{"t":"[ASAP] 钙钛矿发光二极管能否在亚带隙电压下实现最高效率？","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04057","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿发光二极管","kp":["[主题]: 钙钛矿LED在亚带隙电压下能否达最大效率"],"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Can Perovskite Light Emitting Diodes Achieve Maximum Efficiency at Sub-Band-Gap Voltages?"},{"t":"[ASAP] 双峰复合正极提升全固态电池的化学-机械完整性与动力学","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03923","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电池复合正极","kp":["[双峰复合正极]: 提升全固态电池化学机械完整性与动力学","[全固态电池]: 关注界面化学机械稳定性"],"as":"","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Bimodal Composite Cathodes Advancing the Chemo-Mechanical Integrity and Kinetics for All-Solid-State Batteries"},{"t":"[ASAP] 超越多组分Debus-Radziszewski路径：双组分环缩合构建12+3连接网络","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19590","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高连接3D COF","kp":["合成[3D COF]: 双组分环缩合","拓扑[COF]: 12+3连接aea"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究突破传统Debus-Radziszewski多组分反应路线，采用双组分环缩合策略构建12+3连接的高连通性三维共价有机框架（3D COF）。高连接度3D COF的理性构建一直是有机多孔材料领域的核心挑战，该方法为设计复杂拓扑COF提供了新合成范式。","ot":"[ASAP] Beyond the Multicomponent Debus–Radziszewski Route: Two-Component Cyclocondensation Constructing a 12 + 3-Connect","b":"The rational construction of high-connectivity three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) remains a central challenge in reticular chemistry, holding immense promise for advancing framework rigidity, porosity, and functional integration. From both fundamental and application standpoints, diversifying the linkage chemistry of such high-connectivity COFs beyond the archetypal imine bond is essential, as imidazole linkages impart superior chemical resilience, enhanced π-delocalization, and intrinsic polarity compared with imine linkages. Here, we report TU-123, the first 12 + 3-connected 3D imidazole-linked COF with aea topology, synthesized via a two-component cyclocondensation between a D3-symmetric hexakis-aldehyde and a D3h-symmetric hexaamine building block. Unlike conventional imidazole-linked COFs derived from multicomponent Debus-Radziszewski reactions, TU-123 forms through direct imidazole ring formation from aldehyde and amine precursors via an imine intermediate, intramolecular cyclization, and oxidative aromatization. This strategy, previously limited to 2D frameworks, is extended herein to a highly connected 3D network for the first time. Benefiting from its rigid and polarized imidazole framework, TU-123 exhibits a cationic surface character at neutral pH, arising from protonation of nitrogen sites within the imidazole linkages, which enables selective adsorption of anionic dyes such as acid orange 7, with a maximum adsorption capacity of 495.07 mg g-1 and 86.08% removal efficiency under optimized conditions. The adsorption process follows pseudo-second-order kinetics and Langmuir isotherm behavior, highlighting the framework's potential for sustainable wastewater purification."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于大功率铝基燃料电池析氢的非晶-晶态高熵电催化剂","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16652","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铝空电池电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Al燃料电池析氢]: 非晶-晶态高熵合金","电池类型[新型]: 碱/酸铝-氢燃料电池"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究制备非晶-晶态高熵电催化剂，用于高功率铝基燃料电池的析氢反应。金属-空气电池长期受限于催化剂效率与稳定性，高熵合金策略通过多元元素协同效应提升催化活性，非晶-晶态界面结构进一步优化反应动力学，有望推动铝基燃料电池实用化。","ot":"[ASAP] Amorphous–Crystalline High-Entropy Electrocatalysts for H2 Evolution in High-Power Aluminum-Based Fuel Cells","b":"Metal-air batteries have long captured the imagination of researchers and industries alike, admired for their promise of cost-effective, safe, and eco-friendly energy storage. Yet, their journey to full commercialization has been hindered by challenges such as limited power density and troublesome carbonate deposition. In a groundbreaking leap forward, we introduce an alkali/acid aluminum-hydrogen fuel cell by coupling alkaline aluminum anode oxidation with a high-entropy alloy (HEA)-driven acidic hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which transcends these limitations by replacing the sluggish oxygen reduction reaction with the swift and efficient HER. To this end, a hybrid amorphous-crystalline HEA of FeCoNiMnRu has been developed as a cathode electrocatalyst for HER. The diversity of its local structures is key to its high catalytic activity, and the amorphous structure exhibits even greater stability. The hybrid aluminum-hydrogen fuel cell achieves a record-breaking peak power density of 964 mW cm-2 at current densities as high as 1319 mA cm-2, surpassing nearly all alkaline aluminum-air batteries reported to date. Beyond high power density, it also demonstrates impressive longevity upon 220 h of continuous operation at 200 mA cm-2 while maintaining a near-perfect Faradaic efficiency (>99%) for hydrogen production. The hydrogen-production fuel cell may pave the way for high-efficiency power delivery and open up scalable avenues for high-efficiency hydrogen synthesis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 纯 σ-芳香族平面 {Ge4}2+-环","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19206","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Aromaticity is a fundamental concept traditionally used to explain the structure, stability, and reactivity of cyclic organic compounds. Heavier analogs have also been investigated for their aromatic character, but their electronic structure was shown to differ significantly depending on the substituents. Herein, we report the synthesis and isolation of a germanium analog of cyclobutadiene Y<sup>N</sup><sub>2</sub>Ge<sub>4</sub> (Y<sup>N</sup> = Ph<sub>2</sub>P(NMes)-C-PPh<sub>3</sub>), featuring two iminophosphinoyl-tethered ylide ligands. The Ge<sub>4</sub> compound is obtained through reduction of either chlorogermylene Y<sup>N</sup>GeCl or digermylene Y<sup>N</sup>Ge-GeY<sup>N</sup> and exhibits a planar Ge<sub>4</sub> core with a perpendicular coordination of the ylide groups. Detailed computational analyses revealed an aromatic character, as evidenced by several aromaticity descriptors. This aromaticity arises exclusively from the delocalization of the σ-electrons, while any π-bonding is lost due to the coordination of the ligands in the π-plane. This electronic structure resembles that of all-metal clusters, thereby extending the concept of σ- and all-metal aromaticity to cyclobutadiene-like systems.","tp":"锗环芳香性","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"芳香性是解释环状化合物结构、稳定性和反应性的基本概念。较重元素类似物的芳香特性也被研究，但其电子结构因取代基不同而显著差异。研究报道了环丁二烯锗类似物Y2N2Ge4的合成与分离，其具有纯σ-芳香性的平面{Ge4}2+环结构，为理解重元素芳香性及主族化学提供了重要新见解。"},{"t":"书写与擦除：大环效应子调控水相中亚胺表达","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00425-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"大环超分子调控","kp":["机制[亚胺调控]: 大环模拟酶翻译后修饰","写入[超分子]: 正交写入选择组分","擦除[超分子]: 引入清除剂恢复平衡"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用大环效应分子模拟酶翻译后修饰机制，在水中调控亚胺的表达。通过写入-擦除策略，大环效应物可选择性激活或屏蔽亚胺基团，实现水相中亚胺的动态可逆调控，为生物正交化学和水相有机合成提供新工具。","ot":"Write and erase: Macrocyclic effectors regulate imine expression in water","b":"Macrocycles mimic the mode of action of enzymatic post-translational modifications and control imine expression in water. Orthogonal writing actions by the supramolecular hosts lead to constituent selection from a scrambled mixture of species. The introduction of scavengers—species with a higher affinity for the macrocycles—erases the effect and restores the native equilibrium state, paving the way for the regulation of the expression of the library on demand."},{"t":"以水为中心的限域催化框架：超越纳米材料","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00423-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"限域催化","kp":["框架[限域催化]: 以水为中心","角色[水]: 活性结构组分调控反应"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述以水为中心重新审视限域催化效应，将水从被动溶剂重新定位为限域空间中催化反应的主动构建者。超越传统纳米材料限域视角，探讨水在限域界面的结构重组、质子传输与溶剂化效应，为设计水相催化体系提供理论框架。","ot":"Water-centric framework for confinement catalysis: Beyond nanomaterials","b":"This perspective reframes confinement effects by adopting a water-centric lens, positioning water as an active architectural component that governs reactivity across spatial, cage, and interfacial environments. Quantifying the structural and dynamic properties of confined and confining water networks provides a foundational blueprint for the rational design of next-generation catalysts for sustainable chemistry."},{"t":"通过六方空腔中单原子镍工程解锁本征极化以实现高效光重整","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520825?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子光催化产氢","kp":["催化剂[生物质光重整]: Ni-Zn3In4S9单原子","机制[单原子Ni]: 激活内置极化电场"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过单原子镍工程在六方空腔中引入内建极化，解决晶态半导体光催化中体相电荷复合过快的瓶颈。单原子Ni位点调控局部电子结构，促进光生载流子分离与传输，提升塑料光重整反应效率，为解决白色污染提供可持续催化方案。","ot":"Unlocking Built‐In Polarization via Single‐Atom Nickel Engineering in Hexagonal Cavities for Efficient Photoreforming of","b":"Rapid bulk charge recombination in crystalline semiconductors remains a critical bottleneck hindering the scalability of photocatalytic hydrogen generation. Here, we report that precise anchoring of single-atom nickel into the hexagonal cavities of crystalline Zn3In4S9 activates a strong built-in polarization electric field (PEF), which dramatically enhances charge separation. The optimized Ni0.4-Zn3In4S9 shows hydrogen production and benzaldehyde (BAD) generation rates of 48.14 and 44.72 mmol g-1 h-1, respectively, corresponding to 22.3- and 17.4-fold enhancements over the Zn3In4S9. It also exhibits a 42.9% apparent quantum yield at 420 nm and exceptional stability, maintaining over 94.2% (H2) and 89.2% (BAD) activity after 48 h with 6.28- and 14.4-fold stability enhancement for hydrogen and BAD production, respectively. This work proposes an atomic-level design strategy for activating PEF in Zn3In4S9 hexagonal cavities, enabling highly efficient photoreforming of biomass derivatives.","aip":1},{"t":"了解青年对能源转型政策接受程度的两条途径：对称和非对称视角","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000364?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"将通用设计策略转化为弹性体交联杂化水凝胶及其共构建疏水-亲水结构","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000428?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弹性体交联水凝胶","kp":["[水凝胶设计]: 弹性体交联疏水-亲水共构建网络","[电子皮肤]: 混合水凝胶用于柔性电子"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Transforming a general design strategy into elastomer-crosslinked hybrid hydrogels with co-constructed hydrophobic–hydro"},{"t":"充电基础设施和收入对电动汽车采用的作用","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000327?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"TDRD3 是一种含有 Tudor 结构域的蛋白，可调节 Klf2 依赖性 Treg 分化和调节免疫功能","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3960?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tudor domain-containing protein 3 (TDRD3) functions as a methylarginine reader that relays posttranslational arginine methylation signals to the transcriptional machinery, thereby regulating cellular functions through modulation of gene expression. Regulatory T cells (T\n                    regs\n                    ) are pivotal for establishing and maintaining immune tolerance. In this study, we demonstrate that mice with T\n                    reg\n                    -specific deletion of\n                    Tdrd3\n                    exhibit severely impaired iT\n                    reg\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    reg\n                    , differentiation. Moreover, iT\n                    regs\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    regs\n                    , derived from these mice fail to suppress colitis in adoptive transfer models, indicating compromised inhibitory capacity. Aged\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient mice also show spontaneous autoinflammation. Mechanistically, TDRD3 is recruited by the transcription factor FOXO1, presumably in a methylation-dependent manner, to activate\n                    Klf2\n                    expression, which is essential for T\n                    reg\n                    differentiation. Notably, the enforced expression of\n                    Klf2\n                    in\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells rescue both iT\n                    reg\n                    development and suppressive function. Collectively, our findings identify TDRD3 as a central transcriptional regulator of iT\n                    reg\n                    differentiation and immune homeostasis, highlighting it as a potential therapeutic target for modulating immune tolerance.","tp":"免疫调控","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"TDRD3是一种含有Tudor结构域的甲基精氨酸读取蛋白，能够将翻译后精氨酸甲基化信号传递给转录机制，从而调控基因表达与细胞功能。调节性T细胞（Treg）对建立和维持机体免疫耐受至关重要。该研究表明，在小鼠Treg细胞中特异性敲除TDRD3后，会影响Klf2依赖性的Treg细胞分化过程，进而改变机体的免疫调节功能。这一发现揭示了TDRD3在免疫系统稳态中的关键作用。"},{"t":"具有类皮肤触觉感知的亚毫米分辨率双模触觉传感器阵列","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519734?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双模态触觉传感器","kp":["[空间分辨率]: 亚毫米级(<1mm)","[传感模态]: 双峰触觉传感阵列","[感知能力]: 类人皮肤图形觉感知"],"as":"研究人员开发了一种亚毫米级分辨率的双模态触觉传感器阵列，模拟人类皮肤的感知机制。该传感器可同时感知压力和温度等多种刺激信号，为具身智能系统和机器人的多模态感觉融合提供了关键硬件基础，有望推动仿生电子皮肤的实用化发展。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Sub‐Milliscale‐Resolution Bimodal Tactile Sensor Array with Human‐Skin‐Like Graphesthesia Sensation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multimodal sensory integration advances the development of embodied intelligent systems and robotics with human‐skin‐like tactile perception. However, the difficulties in simultaneously achieving high resolution and multimodality hamper the exquisite tactile perception to differentiate information through touching. In this study, we report a sub‐milliscale‐resolution bimodal tactile sensor array consisting of a piezoelectric sensor array for mapping pressure magnitude distribution and a triboelectric sensor array for contact height detection, enabling the calculation of Young's modulus distribution. As compared to existing studies, the bimodal tactile sensor array achieved sub‐milliscale spatial resolution of 700 µm and relatively high sensor density of 226 pixels/cm\n                    2\n                    , demonstrating fine‐grained multimodal perception. By combining the pressure mapping information from the piezoelectric sensor array and contact height information from the triboelectric sensor array, with a rapid response time of 50 ms, the Young's modulus distribution can be revealed. Furthermore, the tactile sensor array can achieve human‐skin‐like graphesthesia sensation and reconstruct the softness‐encrypted pattern with the assistance of deep learning algorithms, providing a paradigm‐shift strategy of sub‐milliscale‐resolution tactile perception toward embodied intelligence and robotics."},{"t":"类固醇依赖性代谢重连揭示了胶质母细胞瘤的新治疗和成像方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6539?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Steroid anti-inflammatory drugs, such as dexamethasone, are routinely used to manage brain tumor–associated edema, yet their impact on brain tumor metabolism remains understudied. Here, a metabolomic screen in naïve glioblastoma cells treated with dexamethasone revealed the accumulation of\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide, a nicotinamide\n                    N\n                    -methyltransferase (NNMT) product, through glucocorticoid receptor activation. Using stable isotope-assisted metabolomics in patients with glioblastoma, we showed that nicotinamide conversion into\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide exceeds that into NAD\n                    +\n                    , leading to a ~7-fold accumulation of\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide in tumor compared to surrounding brain tissue. In orthotopic models, NNMT activity was enhanced by dexamethasone selectively in glioblastoma tumors but not in contralateral brain. Leveraging the tumor-specific activity of NNMT, we developed a novel\n                    11\n                    C-nicotinamide–based positron emission tomography (PET) approach to visualizing glioblastoma tumors. Furthermore, our findings demonstrate that the dexamethasone-induced methionine-dependent nicotinamide methylation becomes detrimental for glioblastoma when combined with a methionine-restricted diet. These results show that steroids rewire methionine and nicotinamide metabolism, enabling the development of innovative PET imaging and metabolic therapies for glioblastoma.","tp":"脑瘤代谢","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"抗炎类固醇（如地塞米松）常用于控制脑肿瘤相关水肿，但其对脑肿瘤代谢的影响尚不清楚。研究团队对经地塞米松处理的胶质母细胞瘤进行了代谢组学筛选，发现该药物会通过糖皮质激素受体促使N1-甲基烟酰胺（NNMT的产物）大量积累。这种类固醇依赖性的代谢重连现象不仅揭示了肿瘤代谢的新机制，还为胶质母细胞瘤的治疗与医学成像提供了全新的潜在靶点。"},{"t":"堆叠重叠石墨二炔纳米离子电子学实现增强型单/双价阳离子选择性，用于单细胞分析","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag050/8440139?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨二炔离子电子学","kp":["[材料体系]: 石墨双炔亚纳米孔调控离子输运","[离子选择性]: 单价/二价阳离子选择性增强","[应用场景]: 单细胞pH检测"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队开发了基于堆叠重叠石墨二炔的纳米离子电子学器件，通过最小化离子干扰实现对单价和双价离子的高选择性检测。该器件可在复杂生理环境中实现精确测量，在生物传感、离子分离和神经接口等领域具有应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stacked-overlapped graphdiyne nano-iontronics enabling enhanced monovalent/divalent cation selectivity for single-cell p","b":"Developing nano-iontronic devices that minimize ionic interference is essential for precise measurements in complex physiological systems. Graphdiyne (GDY), a novel carbon allotrope featuring sub-nanometer pores, enables effective regulation of ionic transport and is therefore a promising material for high-performance iontronic applications. Here, we report a pH-responsive nano-iontronic device fabricated by stacking and overlapping graphdiyne (so-GDY) layers onto the tip of the nanopipette. This so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic sensor exhibits a linear decrease in ionic current under negative potential as the pH decreases from 8.00 to 5.50. This response is attributed to protonation of the oxygen-containing functional groups on the so-GDY surface and edges, which diminishes the negative surface charge and thereby reduces ionic conductivity. A key advantage of this nano-iontronic device is its excellent selectivity, demonstrating robust resistance to interference from divalent cations (Mg²⁺, Ca²⁺) and small molecules within the pH range 8.00-5.50, while maintaining stable detection currents. The so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic device achieves typical monovalent-to-divalent cation selectivity ratio (<0.4), alongside excellent repeatability, reversibility, and stability. This combination of features yields a biocompatible, high-resolution tool for minimally invasive, real-time pH measurements at the single-cell and even at a single-organelle level, opening new avenues for investigating cellular dynamics and disease pathogenesis with enhanced clarity."},{"t":"面向稳定高压钾离子电池的溶剂化几何结构工程","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07550E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子电池电解液","kp":["电解质[钾离子电池]: 无氟高闪点醚类","策略[溶剂化]: 不对称烷基化工程"],"as":"针对钾离子电池（PIBs）商业化缺乏稳定电解质的瓶颈，该研究提出溶剂化几何结构工程策略。通过调控电解质中离子的溶剂化构型，提升高压条件下钾离子电池的循环稳定性与界面兼容性，为钾离子电池的实用化推进了关键一步。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Solvation Geometry Engineering for Stable High-Voltage Potassium-Ion Batteries","b":"To advance the practical application of potassium-ion batteries (PIBs), the lack of robust electrolytes must be addressed, as the prevailing fluorinated solvents present a cost-prohibitive and environmentally unsustainable solution. Here, we propose an asymmetric alkylation strategy to overcome this limitation, engineering a fluorine-free, high-flash-point, and green ether-based electrolyte. This design reconstitutes the solvent coordination geometry through dual steric hindrance, which concurrently weakens cation-solvent binding and modulates the electronic structure of the solvation cluster. Consequently, the designed electrolyte demonstrates exceptional interfacial compatibility, enabling the high-voltage K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]||graphite and K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]||hard carbon full-cells to achieve capacity retention rates of 75.75% after 1400 cycles at 0.33 C and 80.09% after 1500 cycles at 0.5 C, respectively. Moreover, this stability is preserved under elevated temperatures, with both full-cells exhibiting stable operation over hundreds of cycles. This work establishes an effective electrolyte design strategy for realizing high-performance, cost-effective, and environmentally friendly PIBs."},{"t":"社会运动是生物多样性保护的变革推动者","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513327123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Civil society has long been a catalyst for social change by reshaping structures, influencing values, and challenging power dynamics; however, its role in driving transformative change for biodiversity remains underexplored. To address this gap, we analyze 2,801 socio-environmental mobilizations documented in the Environmental Justice Atlas (EJAtlas). These mobilizations produce diverse outcomes that reveal distinct spatial, temporal, and sectoral patterns and proactively and reactively respond to environmental impacts across the globe. Notably, about 40% of these mobilizations occur within the top 30% of global priority lands for species conservation and their actions contribute to the achievement of key Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework targets focused on ecosystem protection, restoration, sustainable use, and inclusive spatial planning. Yet, one-third of mobilizations face repression, criminalization, or violence—pressures that are even more common in high-priority conservation areas. Moreover, mobilizations facing repressive outcomes contest environmental threats relevant for the KMGBF targets more extensively than those with progressive outcomes, underscoring the risks faced by movements driving biodiversity protection in critical regions. To amplify the transformative potential of socio-environmental mobilizations, we emphasize the importance of recognizing, strengthening, and protecting them through coordinated action among diverse social actors. By fostering collaboration and targeted resource allocation, these efforts can empower socio-environmental mobilizations to catalyze meaningful and lasting change for biodiversity conservation.","tp":"生物多样性","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本研究指出，社会运动和民间社会在推动生物多样性保护的变革中发挥着至关重要的作用。研究系统分析了环境正义图集（EJAtlas）中记录的2801起社会环境动员事件，发现这些由民间发起的行动能够重塑社会结构、影响价值观并挑战现有权力格局。它们展现出独特的时空和部门特征，能够主动或被动地应对生态危机，是促进全球生物多样性保护转型不可或缺的变革推动者。"},{"t":"通过靶向 FSP1 选择性破坏瘤内调节 T 细胞中的脂质过氧化物稳态可增强癌症","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3703?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"A burgeoning approach to treating cancer is the pharmacological induction of ferroptotic cell death of tumor cells. However, the impact of disrupting antiferroptotic pathways in the broader tumor microenvironment (TME), such as in immune cells, is still undefined and may complicate treatments. Here, we show that ferroptosis suppressor protein 1 (FSP1\n                    /Aifm2\n                    ) is critically required for regulatory T cell (T\n                    reg\n                    cell) resistance to ferroptosis and their immunosuppressive function within the TME. Compared to other canonical ferroptosis regulators such as GPX4 and NRF2, only FSP1 was induced upon T cell activation. Deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    in all T cells, or T\n                    reg\n                    cells specifically, enhanced tumor control by selectively disrupting T\n                    reg\n                    cell immunosuppression within tumors without inciting autoimmune pathology in mice. As opposed to deletion of\n                    Gpx4\n                    in all T cells, T cell deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    did not impair antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. These results reveal an opportunity for targeting a regulator of ferroptosis that can not only directly target cancer cells but also simultaneously enhance anticancer immune responses without inciting autoimmunity.","tp":"铁死亡调控","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现，FSP1（铁死亡抑制蛋白1）在肿瘤微环境中的调节性T细胞（Treg细胞）内发挥关键抗铁死亡作用。靶向破坏FSP1以打破脂质过氧化物稳态，能削弱Treg细胞的生存和功能，从而增强抗肿瘤免疫反应，为癌症治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"面向大面积单片钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的可扩展沉积与干燥方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06772C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿硅叠层电池","kp":["[认证效率]: PCE>34%(钙钛矿/硅叠层,实验室)","[规模化挑战]: 沉积与干燥方法的可扩展性","[器件规模]: 中试线阶段"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池已实现超过33%的认证转换效率，是光伏领域最具前景的技术路线之一。本文聚焦其大规模产业化的核心瓶颈——大面积薄膜的可控制备，系统综述了面向大面积单片叠层器件的沉积与干燥工艺，包括刮刀涂布、狭缝涂布等可扩展方法，分析了溶剂体系、结晶动力学对成膜质量的影响，为叠层电池从实验室走向量产提供了工程指导。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Scalable deposition and drying methods toward large-area monolithic perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells","b":"Monolithic perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells have emerged as a compelling route, combining the certified power conversion efficiencies exceeding 34% for laboratory-scale devices with more cost-effective manufacturing compared to market-established silicon photovoltaics. Despite deployment in pilot processing lines beyond the lab stage, this technology still faces scaling challenges from perovskite sub-cells, such as the incompatibility with contemporary mass production lines and the upscaling efficiency deficit, that are expected to be resolved within a few years to achieve commercial viability. Here, we comprehensively elaborate the scalable deposition and drying methods of perovskite sub-cells on silicon substrates and review their recent advanced progress. We assess the merits and limitations of these competing methods, providing a systematic framework for achieving efficient and durable large-area perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells suitable for industrial production."},{"t":"STING单氨基酸多态性调节虹彩病毒免疫逃避和致病谱","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523268123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The evolutionary arms race between viruses and hosts shapes host antiviral defenses and viral immune evasion, yet the mechanisms driving divergence in viral cross-species pathogenicity remain unclear. Here, we investigated the role of single amino acid polymorphisms (SAPs) in stimulator of interferon genes (STING) in modulating immune evasion and pathogenicity spectrum of infectious spleen and kidney necrosis virus (ISKNV). The ISKNV-encoded protein VP012R targets mandarin fish STING (\n                    sc\n                    STING) for ubiquitination at residues C196 and K315, promoting its degradation to suppress interferon responses. Importantly, the K315/R315 polymorphism acts as a molecular switch: Susceptible species with the K315 residue exhibit STING degradation and viral immune evasion, whereas resistant species with the R315 residue maintain STING stability and antiviral defenses. Phylogenetic analysis linked K315 to high-mortality hosts (≥50% lethality) vs. R315 in resistant species (≤25% lethality). These findings suggest that the molecular mechanisms underlying the viral pathogenicity spectrum may be modulated by host protein SAPs, thereby enhancing our understanding of host–virus coevolution in terms of biological diversity."},{"t":"常驻CD49a+CD103+NKG2C+ NK细胞限制人淋巴组织外植体中的HIV感染","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1565?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Natural killer (NK) cells are pivotal effectors in antiviral immunity, yet their tissue-specific roles during acute HIV infection remain poorly defined. Using an ex vivo human tonsillar tissue model, we profile NK cell responses to early HIV infection and uncover distinct subsets with specialized functions. We identify a previously uncharacterized memory-like NK population (CD16\n                    +/−\n                    CD69\n                    +\n                    CD49a\n                    +\n                    CD103\n                    +\n                    NKG2C\n                    +\n                    ) associated with reduced viral burden and enriched in cytotoxic mediators (GNLY, PRF1, and GZMB), apoptotic ligands (FASLG and TRAIL), cytokine receptors (IL2RA, IL2RB, IL2RG, IL12RB2, and IL18R1) and trafficking molecules (CCL3–5, CCR7, and SELL). Although functionally capable of clearing HIV-infected CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells in a tissue-mimetic environment, they show impaired cytotoxicity and transcriptional signs of exhaustion after infection. Conversely, HIV drives the reprogramming of immature CD16\n                    −\n                    CD69\n                    +\n                    NK cells toward a more cytotoxic and migratory effector phenotype. These findings reveal dynamic NK cell adaptations in lymphoid tissue during early HIV infection and highlight tissue-resident NK cells as promising targets for immunotherapeutic intervention."},{"t":"NEP-聚合酶复合物结构揭示甲型流感病毒聚合酶的监管热点","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4073?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Influenza A virus (IAV) transcribes and replicates its segmented RNA genome in the host nucleus within viral ribonucleoproteins (vRNPs), which are exported for virion assembly. The nuclear export protein (NEP) is essential for this process and also regulates viral RNA synthesis, implicating a direct interaction with the viral RNA polymerase. Here, we present a 2.5-Å cryogenic electron microscopy structure of NEP bound to the IAV polymerase and demonstrate that NEP alone is sufficient to promote vRNP export, with the viral matrix protein 1 enhancing export efficiency. NEP forms a four-helix bundle that binds at the interface of the PA C-terminal domain and PB1 N terminus of the polymerase. The NEP binding site at this interface overlaps with those for the host ANP32 and the C-terminal domain of RNA polymerase II, indicating that it functions as a regulatory hotspot coordinating transitions of the viral polymerase between RNA synthesis and nuclear export, revealing a critical layer of control in the IAV replication cycle."},{"t":"大肠杆菌中依赖 RecBCD 的 UV 后复制重启触发分叉三倍体","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521115123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultraviolet (UV) irradiation induces pyrimidine dimers in DNA, which block replication, but are efficiently removed by excision, allowing replication restart. Interestingly, soon after restart, the cells become capable of inducible stable DNA replication (iSDR) without new origin-initiations—suggesting unusual replication topology. The original idea was that the preexisting forks remain dormant even after UV-lesion removal, and when the new origin-initiated forks arrive, they rear-end the dormant forks, creating potential for iSDR. While there is origin-overinitiation after UV, the current idea is that preexisting forks are restarted—making the iSDR potential unclear. We used replication profiling of post-UV cells to investigate reactivation of UV-blocked forks. To compare profile time-sequences, we developed indexation procedure generating nested profile sets. Wild type nested set shows: 1) no replication during the first 30 min post-UV; 2) overinitiation from the origin combined with restart of preexisting forks during the next 30 min post-UV. The restart required RecBCD enzyme to repair double-strand breaks, confirming that the UV-stalled forks disintegrate and need recombinational repair to restart. Preexisting fork restart is separate from new origin-initiations by DnaA, as the\n                    dnaA\n                    (Ts) mutant at 42 °C restarts preexisting forks normally. Remarkably, the absence of powerful replication wave from origin-initiations in the\n                    dnaA\n                    mutant reveals a restart-initiated replication wave toward the origin, indicating that the restart mechanism causes fork triplication—potentially explaining the SDR phenomenon. There is no post-UV replication in the\n                    dnaA recBC\n                    double mutant, consistent with only two pathways of replication resumption in post-UV cells: restart or new origin-initiation."},{"t":"具有独立源的量子网络中的随机性认证","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8571?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子随机性验证","kp":["方向[量子网络]: 多独立源随机性认证"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究了在独立源的量子网络中实现随机性认证的理论方案。随机性认证是量子信息科学的核心基础，对保障量子通信安全至关重要。该工作证明在具有独立源的量子网络架构下，可实现对设备无关随机性的严格认证，无需信任网络节点，显著提升了量子随机数生成的安全性和可靠性。","ot":"Randomness certification in a quantum network with independent sources","b":"Randomness certification is a foundational and practical aspect of quantum information science, essential for securing quantum communication protocols. Traditionally, these protocols have been implemented and validated with a single entanglement source, as in the paradigmatic Bell scenario. However, advancing these protocols to support more complex configurations involving multiple entanglement sources is key to building robust architectures and realizing large-scale quantum networks. Here, we show how to certify randomness in an entanglement-teleportation experiment, the building block of a quantum repeater displaying two independent sources of entanglement. Using the scalar extension method, we address the challenge posed by the nonconvexity of the correlation set, providing effective bounds on an eavesdropper’s knowledge of the shared secret bits. Our theoretical model characterizes the certifiable randomness within the network and is validated through the analysis of experimental data from a photonic quantum network.","aip":1},{"t":"RSV 暂时重新编程细胞凋亡和焦亡以平衡免疫逃避和复制","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz2496?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Virus-induced inflammation and programmed cell death (PCD) are critical antiviral defenses, prompting viruses like respiratory syncytial virus (RSV) to develop PCD regulation mechanisms. Here, we demonstrate that RSV orchestrates the temporal and sequential regulation of distinct PCD pathways in human macrophages to optimize replication and dissemination. During early stages of infection, RSV activates the PI3K-Akt pathway to induce cFLIP expression, effectively suppressing TNF-driven extrinsic apoptosis. Simultaneously, viral degradation of ZDHHC9 prevents GSDMD-mediated pyroptosis downstream of NLRP3 activation, thereby sustaining an intracellular environment permissive to viral propagation. In contrast, following the completion of replication, RSV subverts caspase-1 signaling to trigger the intrinsic apoptotic cascade via the Casp-1–BID–APAF1–Casp-9 axis, and subsequently promotes GSDME-mediated secondary pyroptosis. This late-stage PCD reprogramming enables synchronized release of virions and pro-inflammatory cytokines, exacerbating pulmonary pathology. These findings delineate a temporally resolved strategy by which RSV balances early immune evasion with subsequent viral dissemination and immunopathology, and identify discrete stage-specific molecular targets for therapeutic intervention in RSV-induced lung disease."},{"t":"基于生物物理动力学训练的蛋白质语言模型指导突变效应预测","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530466123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质语言模型","kp":["模型[蛋白质]: ESMDance","创新[训练]: 分子动力学动态性质训练"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"蛋白质结构动力学是决定其功能和突变效应的根本因素，但当前蛋白质深度学习模型多基于静态结构信息，未充分考虑动力学特征。该研究提出基于生物物理动力学数据训练蛋白质语言模型的方法，将蛋白质构象动态变化信息融入模型预训练，从而更准确预测突变对蛋白功能和稳定性的影响。这一思路弥补了静态结构表示的不足，为蛋白质工程、药物设计及致病突变预测提供了更接近物理本质的建模框架，代表了蛋白质深度学习从静态走向动态表征的重要方向。","ot":"Protein language models trained on biophysical dynamics inform mutation effects","b":"Structural dynamics are fundamental to protein functions and mutation effects. Current protein deep learning models are predominantly trained on sequence and/or static structure data, which often fail to capture the dynamic nature of proteins. To address this, we introduce SeqDance and ESMDance, two protein language models trained on dynamic biophysical properties derived from molecular dynamics simulations and normal mode analyses of over 64,000 proteins. Both models can be directly applied to predict dynamic properties of unseen ordered and disordered proteins. SeqDance, trained from scratch, has attentions that capture dynamic interaction and comovement between residues, and its embeddings encode rich representations of protein dynamics that can be further utilized to predict conformational properties beyond the training tasks via transfer learning. SeqDance predicted dynamic property changes reflect mutation effect on protein folding stability. ESMDance, built upon ESM2 (Evolutionary Scale Model II) outputs, substantially outperforms ESM2 in zero-shot prediction of mutation effects for designed and viral proteins which lack evolutionary information. Together, SeqDance and ESMDance offer a framework for integrating protein dynamics into language models, enabling more generalizable predictions of protein behavior and mutation effects.","aip":1},{"t":"通过技术服务商业模式和碳基双层优化促进CCUS系统的广泛参与","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000339?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CCUS商业模式","kp":["[CCUS]: 技术服务商业模式双层优化"],"dp":1,"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Promoting broad participation in CCUS system via a technical service business model and bi-level optimization with carbo"},{"t":"使用基于温度的机器学习模型预测 2100 年西班牙南部的太阳峰值时间","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000474?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"钾离子电池负极：机理框架、电解液/粘结剂集成及商业化路线图","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505727?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钾离子电池负极","kp":["[电池体系]: 钾离子电池负极","[优势]: 低成本盐、铝集流体兼容、稳定SEI","[挑战]: K+离子半径大"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"钾离子电池（KIBs）作为锂离子和钠离子电池的可持续替代方案正受到广泛关注，其原料钾资源储量丰富、成本低廉。该综述系统梳理了KIBs负极材料的反应机理框架，涵盖嵌入型、合金型和转化型负极的电化学机制，并深入讨论电解液体系与粘结剂的选择对循环性能和界面稳定性的关键影响。文章还提出了面向商业化的技术路线图，指出需突破的瓶颈包括负极体积膨胀、首效偏低和电解液兼容性等问题，为钾离子电池从实验室走向产业化提供了系统性指导。","ot":"Potassium‐Ion Battery Anodes: Mechanistic Frameworks, Electrolyte/Binder Integration, and Roadmap Toward Commercializati","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (KIBs) are gaining attention as a sustainable alternative to lithium‐ and sodium‐based systems, benefiting from the abundance of potassium, low‐cost salts, and the potential use of biomass‐derived carbons. Their favorable redox potential, compatibility with aluminum current collectors, and stable SEI formation provide unique advantages, though the large ionic radius of K\n                    +\n                    poses challenges for designing stable and high‐capacity anodes. This review categorizes KIB anodes into five classes—alloy‐based, intercalation‐type, conversion‐type, conversion–intercalation hybrids, and organic systems—and critically evaluates their redox mechanisms, electrochemical performance, and structural evolution. Beyond the active materials, we highlight the often‐overlooked but crucial influence of electrolyte formulations (e.g., potassium hexafluorophosphate (KPF\n                    6\n                    ), potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI), or concentrated electrolytes) and binder chemistries in governing solid electrolyte interface (SEI) stability, ion transport, and electrode durability. We also discuss recent commercialization efforts, including Natron Energy's Prussian blue–based systems, and outline a forward‐looking roadmap that integrates materials innovation with electrode–electrolyte engineering and sustainability principles. By bridging mechanistic understanding with industrial perspectives, this review provides guidance for advancing KIBs toward practical, environmentally responsible energy storage solutions."},{"t":"正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对催化剂实现级联耦合反应的自强化催化循环","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523215?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍钌析氢电催化","kp":["催化剂[AEMWE析氢]: NiRu frustrated Lewis pairs","机制[FLP]: 正反馈自增强循环"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对催化剂，实现级联耦合反应的自增强催化循环，用于阴离子交换膜水电解槽的碱性析氢反应。受阻路易斯酸碱对通过协同活化水和中间体降低反应能垒，正反馈机制使催化活性随反应进行持续增强。该策略显著提升AEMWE的析氢效率，为低成本绿氢制备提供了新催化范式。","ot":"Positive Feedback‐Driven NiRu Frustrated Lewis Pairs Catalyst Enables a Self‐Reinforcing Catalytic Cycle for Cascade‐Cou","b":"The alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) associated with anion exchange membrane water electrolyzers (AEMWEs) is kinetically hindered by sluggish water dissociation and complex intermediate adsorption, which previous reports have inadequately addressed through isolated optimization, neglecting the intrinsic coupling between HER elementary steps. Herein, we report a frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) catalyst comprising NiRu dual single-atoms and adjacent NiRu nanoclusters anchored on nitrogen-doped carbon (Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC), mimicking the enzymatic positive feedback mechanism that drives a self-reinforcing catalytic cycle and accelerates the coupled elementary steps in a cascade manner. The catalyst featuring spatially proximate Lewis acid and base sites enable sequential reaction steps, where water dissociation occurs at acid sites and hydrogen adsorption proceed at base sites. The two steps are bridged through rapid hydrogen spillover channel, constructing a closed catalytic circuit in which hydrogen consumption at base sites promotes continuous water dissociation at acid sites. Benefiting from this positive feedback loop, Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC achieves a remarkable HER performance and exhibits exceptional long-term durability (>1000 h at 1.0 A cm- 2) in AEMWEs. Our findings demonstrate a new strategy to integrate positive feedback-driven, cascade-coupled catalysis in FLPs systems, offering a promising pathway toward high-performance alkaline HER catalysts for industrial application."},{"t":"孔径动力学控制焦亡中复杂的体积膨胀","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2508022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Pyroptosis, an inflammatory form of cell death, is characterized by massive cell swelling and plasma membrane rupture. Although swelling was recently shown to occur in two steps, the molecular and biophysical mechanisms driving this process remained unclear. Using fast quantitative microscopy, we reveal that between the two swelling phases, cell volume transiently stabilizes despite sustained plasma membrane permeability to ions and small molecules. From a biophysical perspective, the existence of such a plateau is puzzling, as ion pumps should not be able to regulate cell volume under these conditions. To address this, we developed a physical model based on an ion pump and leak framework that incorporates the dynamics of nonselective pore formation. Experimentally, we demonstrate that the plateau phase is controlled by the dynamics of the gasdermin D (GSDMD) pore enlargement, which is modulated by ninjurin-1 (Ninj1) activation, possibly through intracellular calcium. Ninj1-mediated lesions are also required for the second swelling phase. We further show that fully opened GSDMD pores display an effective hydrodynamic radius slightly above 1.9 nm, providing an in situ upper bound for pore size. Together, our findings demonstrate that pyroptotic volume dysregulation emerges from the successive and interdependent actions of GSDMD and Ninj1, each imparting distinct permeability regimes associated with increased water filtration and decreased ion selectivity due to pore opening. These insights bridge molecular and biophysical perspectives on lytic cell death and may inform the broader understanding of membrane rupture in inflammatory and pathological contexts."},{"t":"晶圆键合铁电界面处的极性不连续性、涌现导电性及临界扭转角依赖行为","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68553-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电畴界","kp":["方法[铁电界面]: 热压晶圆键合","发现[扭转界面]: 临界扭转角依赖行为"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究在晶圆级键合的铁电异质界面中观测到极性不连续性、涌现导电性以及临界扭转角依赖行为。传统扭转界面研究依赖机械剥离二维材料，该工作通过晶圆键合实现大面积可控扭转，发现界面极性突变诱导出二维电子气，且导电性在特定扭转角出现临界转变。这为大规模制备新型拓扑和铁电功能器件开辟了路径。","ot":"Polar discontinuities, emergent conductivity, and critical twist-angle-dependent behaviour at wafer-bonded ferroelectric","b":"Probing novel properties, arising from twisted interfaces, has traditionally relied on the stacking of exfoliated two-dimensional materials and the spontaneous formation of van der Waals bonds. So far, investigations involving intimate covalent or ionic bonds have not been a focus. Yet, we show here that an established technique, involving thermocompressional wafer bonding, works well for creating twisted non-van der Waals interfaces. We have successfully bonded z-cut lithium niobate single crystals to create ferroelectric oxide interfaces with strong polar discontinuities and have mapped the associated emergent interfacial conductivity. In some instances, a dramatic change in microstructure occurs, involving local dipolar switching. A twist-induced collapse in the capability of the system to effec8tively screen interfacial bound charge is implied. Importantly, this only occurs around specific moiré twist angles with sparse coincident lattices and associated short-range aperiodicity. In quasicrystals, aperiodicity is known to induce pseudo-bandgaps and we suspect a similar phenomenon here."},{"t":"药理学伴侣通过减弱持续的 PERK 激活来减轻噪音引起的听力损失","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2421591123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) can be either temporary or permanent, depending on the intensity and duration of noise exposure. Excessive noise exposure activates various cellular mechanisms in the cochlea, including oxidative stress, immune responses, and apoptosis. Still, the mechanisms underlying hearing recovery after transient threshold shift (TTS) and lack of recovery after permanent threshold shift (PTS), as well as their therapeutic implications for NIHL, remain unknown. In this study, we performed a comparative analysis of longitudinal changes in the cochlear transcriptome of TTS and PTS mouse models. Our analysis revealed that noise-induced ER stress activates the unfolded protein response (UPR). Notably, the protein kinase R-like endoplasmic reticulum kinase (PERK) branch of the UPR returned to baseline levels following TTS but showed sustained activation following PTS. In addition, the proapoptotic factor C/EBP homologous protein (CHOP) was selectively induced in hair cells following PTS. Administering a PERK inhibitor prior to and following noise exposure hindered hearing restoration after TTS, indicating a requirement for PERK activation in hearing recovery. Inhibition of sustained PERK activation via a PERK inhibitor or reduction of CHOP expression via pharmacological chaperones facilitated partial hearing recovery following PTS. Together, these findings provide insight into the mechanisms underlying NIHL and its prevention, highlighting UPR modulation as a promising therapeutic strategy."},{"t":"氧化激活纳米疗法可增强肿瘤免疫力并破坏肿瘤神经串扰以对抗骨转移和癌症","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1292?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bone metastasis remains a formidable challenge in oncology due to the interdependent triad of immunosuppression, neuropathic pain, and osteolytic destruction. Current treatments fail to holistically address these pathophysiological axes. Here, we develop a reactive oxygen species (ROS)–responsive liposomal nanoplatform (LipoNCs@pGSDMB) that codelivers a polymeric stimulator of interferon genes (STING) agonist and a gasdermin B (GSDMB) plasmid for dual neuro-immune modulation. Upon tumor-selective activation in metastatic bone niches, this nanotherapy induces STING-driven immune priming and GSDMB-mediated pyroptosis, triggering potent antitumor responses. Crucially, LipoNCs@pGSDMB restore voltage-gated calcium channel (VGCC) expression in tumor cells, a prognostic biomarker identified through multiomics analysis of clinical specimens, thereby blocking calcium-dependent neurosignaling and disrupting prometastatic tumor-nerve cross-talk. In breast cancer bone metastasis models, this approach achieves 94% tumor suppression, complete pain resolution, and efficient bone restoration. By converging oxidation-responsive nanomaterial engineering, immunomodulation, and neural circuit reprogramming, this work establishes a paradigm-shifting neuroimmunotherapy platform that dismantles the self-reinforcing metastasis niche while addressing its debilitating sequelae.","tp":"纳米抗肿瘤","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"骨转移在肿瘤学中仍是重大挑战，涉及免疫抑制、神经性疼痛和溶骨性破坏的相互关联三联征。研究开发了活性氧响应脂质纳米平台LipoNCs@pGSDMB，共递送聚合物STING激动剂和gasdermin B质粒，实现双重神经-免疫调控。在肿瘤选择性激活后增强抗肿瘤免疫并破坏肿瘤神经串扰，为骨转移治疗提供新范式。","aip":1},{"t":"赝能隙开始时自旋电荷相关性的紧急缩放的观察","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525539123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"In strongly correlated materials, interacting electrons are entangled and form collective quantum states, resulting in rich low-temperature phase diagrams. Notable examples include cuprate superconductors, in which superconductivity emerges at low doping out of an unusual “pseudogap” metallic state above the critical temperature. The Fermi–Hubbard model, describing a wide range of phenomena associated with strong electron correlations, still offers major computational challenges despite its simple formulation. In this context, ultracold atoms quantum simulators have provided invaluable insights into the microscopic nature of correlated quantum states. Here, we use a quantum gas microscope Fermi–Hubbard simulator to explore a wide range of dopings and temperatures in a regime where a pseudogap is known to develop. By measuring multipoint correlation functions up to fifth order, we uncover a universal scaling behavior in magnetic and higher-order spin–charge correlations characterized by a doping-dependent temperature scale. Accurate comparisons with determinant Quantum Monte Carlo and Minimally Entangled Typical Thermal States simulations confirm that this temperature scale is comparable to the pseudogap temperature\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          T\n                          \n                            \n                            ∗\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . Our quantitative findings reveal a qualitative behavior of magnetic properties and spin–charge correlations in an emergent pseudogap and pave the way toward the exploration of charge pairing and collective phenomena expected at lower temperatures.","tp":"超导赝能隙","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"强关联材料中电子相互作用形成集体量子态，产生丰富的低温相图。铜氧化物超导体中，超导在低掺杂下从赝能隙金属态中涌现。费米-哈伯德模型虽简洁但仍面临重大计算挑战。研究实验观察到了赝能隙起始处自旋-电荷关联性的紧急缩放行为，为理解高温超导机制和强关联电子物理提供了关键实验证据。"},{"t":"新型抗菌纳米细菌素：乳酸菌衍生、自组装和增强的卓越抗菌素","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511782?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"As antimicrobial resistance emerges as a critical global health threat, food-grade bacteriocin, a kind of antimicrobial peptide (AMPs), offers promising new therapies but is hampered by poor stability and water solubility. To address this, we engineered a carrier-free self-assembly strategy: a novel bacteriocin from lactic acid bacteria in fermented food was modified to increase its hydrophobicity, enabling spontaneous formation of nano-antimicrobial bacteriocins (NAMBs) in TSB, LB, and MH media. These NAMBs exhibit a broader antimicrobial spectrum and enhanced potency against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative pathogens, including Listeria monocytogenes, Acinetobacter baumannii, and Vibrio parahaemolyticus, as evidenced by markedly reduced minimum inhibitory concentrations in vitro and superior therapeutic efficacy in infected mice in vivo. Mechanistic investigations reveal targeted disruption of cell envelope metabolism: in L. monocytogenes, NAMBs fortify the peptidoglycan layer while depleting wall teichoic acids and lipoteichoic acids, impairing carbohydrate metabolism and membrane transport; in A. baumannii, they downregulate fatty acid synthesis, disorder phospholipid composition, and weaken lipopolysaccharide integrity, culminating in membrane destabilization and cell death. These dual actions-disordering metabolic processes and remodeling bacterial cell walls or membranes-highlight the versatility of NAMBs. Our carrier-free self-assembly approach thus overcomes AMP stability and solubility limitations and paves the way for next-generation antimicrobial therapies.","tp":"纳米抗菌素","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"抗菌素耐药性已成为全球健康威胁，食品级细菌素作为抗菌肽提供新治疗选择，但稳定性和水溶性差。研究采用无载体自组装策略，将发酵食品中乳酸菌来源的新型细菌素进行疏水性修饰，使其在TSB、LB和MH培养基中自发形成纳米抗菌细菌素(NAMBs)，显著增强了抗菌活性和稳定性。"},{"t":"硝酸盐诱导的 NLP1 SUMO 化调节硝酸盐信号传导和根结瘤","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518288123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nitrate serves both as an essential nutrient and a key signaling molecule that shapes plant growth. In legumes, high nitrate concentrations suppress symbiotic nitrogen fixation, a process mediated by MtNLP1 (NIN-like protein1). Although nitrate minimally affects NLP transcript levels, it strongly controls their nuclear localization. How posttranslational modifications regulate MtNLP1 function, however, has remained unclear. Here, we show that nitrate induces SUMOylation of MtNLP1 at lysine 589 and 795 and that this modification is essential for its biological activity. Loss of these SUMO sites compromises nitrate-mediated inhibition of nodulation and weakens MtNLP1 interactions with MtNIN and itself. Components of the SUMOylation machinery in\n                    Medicago truncatula\n                    physically interact and are essential for both nodulation and nitrate responsiveness, indicating broader roles for SUMOylation in symbiosis. A SUMO-deficient\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    AtNLP7\n                    3KR\n                    mutant fails to complement the\n                    Atnlp7-1\n                    phenotype, demonstrating that SUMOylation is a conserved regulatory mechanism among NLPs. Together, our findings reveal SUMOylation as a previously unrecognized layer of regulation that integrates nutrient signaling with root nodule symbiosis.","tp":"硝酸盐结瘤","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"硝酸盐既是必需营养素又是关键信号分子，调控植物生长。在豆科植物中高浓度硝酸盐抑制共生固氮，该过程由MtNLP1介导。尽管硝酸盐对NLP转录水平影响甚微，但强烈控制其核定位。研究揭示硝酸盐在赖氨酸589位点诱导MtNLP1的SUMO化修饰，精细调节硝酸盐信号传导和根瘤形成过程。","aip":1},{"t":"手性配体促进的镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物/氯化物对映选择性还原Heck反应","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525600?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化还原偶联","kp":["催化剂[还原Heck]: Ni+手性NHC配体","底物拓展[芳烃]: 溴化物/氯化物"],"as":"该研究报道了一种镍催化的不对称还原Heck反应，实现了烯烃与芳基硼试剂的对映选择性偶联。传统还原Heck反应多依赖昂贵且高活性的有机卤化物底物及贵金属催化剂，而该方法利用廉价丰产的镍金属，以芳基硼试剂作为偶联组分，显著拓展了底物范围与反应经济性。该反应在温和条件下高效构建C-C键并精准控制手性中心，为药物分子和天然产物中手性骨架的合成提供了新的催化策略，具有重要的有机合成方法论价值。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nickel‐Catalyzed Enantioselective Reductive Heck Reaction of Olefins with Aryl Bromides and Chlorides Enabled by Chiral ","b":"Despite significant advances in catalytic asymmetric reductive Heck reaction, most reported methods rely on highly reactive aryl electrophiles and exhibit a limited olefin scope. Expanding this transformation to employ more abundant and cost-effective aryl bromides and chlorides with common olefins has remained a major challenge, owing to the inertness of C─Br and C─Cl bonds and the resulting difficulty in achieving chemo-, regio-, and stereocontrol. Here, we report that nickel catalysts combined with chiral dihydroimidazolium-derived N-heterocyclic carbene ligands bearing remote meta-substitution enable highly efficient and enantioselective reductive Heck reaction of a broad range of olefins-including styrenes, 1,3-dienes, and aliphatic alkenes-with aryl bromides and chlorides. Experimental studies and DFT calculations elucidated the origins of stereo induction and structure-reactivity relationships. This robust methodology provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, enantioenriched benzylic frameworks."},{"t":"神经元 GPR75 缺陷可防止人源化小鼠模型中饮食引起的肥胖","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady7993?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"GPR75, a G protein–coupled receptor implicated in human obesity through loss-of-function variants, has emerged as a promising regulator of energy and metabolic homeostasis. To dissect its tissue-specific functions, we generated a humanized floxed\n                    Gpr75\n                    mouse model with conditional deletions in the brain and adipose tissue. Mice with brain-specific Gpr75 deletion using Nestin-Cre were resistant to diet-induced obesity, primarily through suppressed food intake and modest increases in energy expenditure. In contrast, adipocyte-specific deletion of Gpr75 had minimal effects on systemic metabolism but modestly enhanced mitochondrial oxygen consumption in brown adipose tissue under cold exposure. Gpr75 expression was up-regulated in key brain regions and down-regulated in white adipose tissue under high-fat diet conditions, supporting a predominant central role in metabolic adaptation. Histological and transcriptomic analyses further revealed depot-specific effects on adipocyte morphology and hepatic lipid accumulation in global knockouts. These findings position GPR75 as a critical regulator of central energy balance and provide a mechanistic framework for developing brain-targeted therapies against obesity.","tp":"肥胖受体","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过构建人源化小鼠模型发现，大脑特异性敲除GPR75受体能够显著增强机体对饮食引起的肥胖的抵抗力，其核心机制在于有效抑制了动物的摄食量。这表明GPR75是调节能量和代谢稳态的关键靶点，为肥胖治疗提供了新方向。"},{"t":"神经化学成像揭示了季节性群居田鼠物种中多巴胺动力学随光周期的变化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509561123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Studying dopamine signaling in nonmodel organisms is crucial for understanding the broad range of behaviors not represented in traditional model systems. However, exploring new species is often hindered by a scarcity of tools suitable for nongenetic models. In this work, we introduce near-infrared catecholamine nanosensors (nIRCats) to investigate dopamine dynamics in meadow voles, a rodent species that exhibits distinct changes in social behavior and neurobiology across photoperiods. We observe increased dopamine release and release site density in voles housed in short photoperiods (which induce a social phenotype), suggesting adaptations linked to environmental changes. Moreover, pharmacological and extracellular manipulations demonstrate that short photoperiod/social voles exhibit heightened responsiveness to dopamine-increasing interventions and resilience against suppressive conditions. These findings highlight a significant association between dopamine signaling and photoperiod-driven changes in social behavior and establish nIRCats as an effective tool for expanding our understanding of dopamine dynamics across nonmodel organisms.","tp":"纳米传感器","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"在非模式生物中研究多巴胺信号传导对理解传统模型无法涵盖的行为至关重要。研究引入近红外儿茶酚胺纳米传感器(nIRCats)，研究田鼠中多巴胺动力学随光周期的变化。田鼠是不同光周期下社会行为和神经生物学显著变化的啮齿动物，研究发现多巴胺信号呈现明显的季节性调节模式。"},{"t":"负热膨胀颗粒赋能高性能超耐用热电器件模块","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3783?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电模块耐久性","kp":["策略[热电器件]: 负热膨胀颗粒精确控制CTE","目标[热电器件]: 提升界面热膨胀兼容性"],"as":"固体电池、柔性电子器件等系统中，多组分材料间的界面相容性是决定器件稳定性的核心因素。本研究引入具有负热膨胀特性的颗粒作为界面填充材料，通过补偿正热膨胀组分的热应变，有效消除界面热应力，显著提升固态电池等热电器件在温度循环下的结构完整性与服役寿命。该策略从材料热力学层面解决界面热失配问题，实现了高性能与超耐久性的协同，为需要承受反复热应变的固态电子和储能器件提供了普适性工程解决方案。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Negative-thermal-expansion particles enable high-performance and ultradurable thermoelectric modules","b":"Interfacial compatibility across multiple material parts governs device stability in solid-state batteries, flexible electronics, and high-temperature fuel cells. For thermoelectric devices, researchers principally focused on chemical reactivity and mechanical properties of material components, whereas precise control of the coefficient of thermal expansion (CTE) remains elusive. Here, we propose an innovative strategy using negative-thermal-expansion (NTE) particles to regulate CTE and resolve interfacial incompatibility. Incorporating predesigned interface reaction–free NTE particles into Bi\n                    2\n                    Te\n                    3\n                    -based, Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    -based, and PbTe-based materials effectively improves thermoelectric performance, alleviates thermal stress, and enhances interfacial stability across a broad temperature range (300 to 800 kelvin). Notably, the NTE-modified Mg\n                    3\n                    (Sb,Bi)\n                    2\n                    /Bi\n                    0.4\n                    Sb\n                    1.6\n                    Te\n                    3\n                    two-pair module achieves a record-high conversion efficiency (η) of 8.4% at Δ\n                    T\n                     = 350 K with a 71% interfacial thermal stress reduction, maintaining a stable interface and unchanged η throughout 1000-hour (42 days) thermal cycling. Our strategy establishes a universal approach for improving interfacial compatibility in high-temperature functional modules including thermal-barrier coatings and solar thermophotovoltaic devices."},{"t":"分拣蛋白对甲状腺球蛋白的分子识别","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68658-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Sortilin is a ubiquitous membrane receptor mediating trafficking of protein cargoes. In the thyroid, sortilin binds thyroglobulin (TG) during its endocytosis, a key process in thyroid homeostasis. Although sortilin has been proposed to recognise highly iodinated TG, the molecular details of this interaction remain unknown. In this work, using an integrative structural biology approach, we reveal that sortilin binds an unstructured TG C-terminal peptide and exhibits a strong preference for the monomeric TG over the commonly known dimeric form. We find that sortilin-TG interaction is independent of the iodination state of TG and instead relies on the conversion to its monomeric state, presumably promoted by extracellular degradation. Furthermore, using AlphaPulldown and sequence analysis, we show that recognition of other reported ligands by sortilin likely relies on similar unstructured peptide motifs, which are not constrained to a single binding orientation within the receptor cavity. Overall, this study reveals the TG-sortilin binding interface and provides insights into the recognition mechanism of other cargoes by sortilin.","tp":"蛋白识别","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用结构生物学手段揭示了分拣蛋白识别甲状腺球蛋白（TG）的分子机制。分拣蛋白主要结合TG的未结构化C端肽段，并显著偏好高度碘化的TG分子。这一发现阐明了分拣蛋白在甲状腺内吞过程中的特异性识别机制，对理解甲状腺稳态维持至关重要。"},{"t":"StopGo/2A 翻译重新编码的分子结构和多样性","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528667123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Viral 2A sequences trigger a cotranslational peptide bond formation “skipping” event, termed “StopGo,” to generate two separate proteins from a single open reading frame without classical termination. To investigate the mechanism of StopGo, we determined the cryo-EM structure of a mammalian ribosome positioned at the foot-and-mouth disease virus 2A (F2A) site. The structure shows how interactions between the F2A nascent chain (NC) and the ribosomal exit tunnel induce a conformational change in the peptidyl transferase center that precludes further translation elongation but instead pre-exposes the P-tRNA:F2A-NC ester bond for hydrolysis and NC release. Additionally, we bioinformatically characterized variation and host association across nearly 10,000 StopGo sequences identified in virus genomes. We expanded the canonical core motif to (D/G/C/N)(V/I)ExNPGP and identified additional rare but functional variants. We also revealed several distinct upstream motifs that we showed biochemically to be important for StopGo activity. Interestingly, although StopGo is known to be functionally active in plants, we found no evidence for natural utilization of StopGo by plant viruses. Overall, these findings provide valuable insights into a unique translation recoding mechanism, and lay foundations for further optimization of multigene expression in biotechnology.","tp":"翻译重编码","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"病毒2A序列能引发“StopGo”翻译重新编码事件，使单个开放阅读框架产生两个独立蛋白。研究通过解析哺乳动物核糖体的冷冻电镜结构，揭示了F2A新生肽链与核糖体输出隧道的相互作用如何诱导结构变化，从而阻断肽键形成，阐明了该机制的分子基础。"},{"t":"PrfH亚家族拯救翻译中停滞的受损和完整核糖体的分子和结构基础","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7378?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"In bacteria, mRNAs degradation and ribotoxin-induced RNA damage are two main events that lead to the stalling of protein translation. The ubiquitous trans-translation system and several alternative rescue factors rescue the stalled ribosomes caused by truncated mRNAs lacking the stop codons. On the other hand, protein release factor homolog (PrfH) is the only known factor to rescue the stalled ribosome damaged by ribotoxins. Here, we show that a subfamily of PrfH, exemplified by PrfH from\n                    Capnocytophaga gingivalis\n                    (\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH), rescues both types of stalled ribosomes. Biochemical assays demonstrate that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH hydrolyzes the peptides attached to P-site transfer RNAs when in complex with both the damaged and intact ribosomes. Cryo-EM structures revealed that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH uses distinct regions to recognize two stalled ribosomes to orient the GGQ motif for peptide hydrolysis. Thus, using a combination of bioinformatic, biochemical, and structural characterization, we have uncovered a family of ribosome rescue factors that have dual activities to resolve two distinct stalled protein translation events in bacteria.","tp":"核糖体救援","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"细菌内mRNA降解或核糖毒素RNA损伤会导致蛋白质翻译停滞。除了常规的反式翻译系统，研究指出蛋白质释放因子同源物（PrfH）亚家族是唯一能拯救由核糖毒素损伤导致停滞的核糖体的因子，为理解细菌应对翻译危机的分子机制提供了重要结构基础。"},{"t":"线粒体异质性驱动大豆疫霉的杀菌剂抗性进化，并具有相关的适应性","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4601?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial complex III inhibitors, such as ametoctradin, are crucial for controlling oomycete diseases. However, the increasing severity of fungicide resistance necessitates urgent clarification of its evolutionary mechanisms to optimize disease management and delay resistance development. The DddA-derived cytosine base editors (DdCBEs)–mediated base editing in oomycetes confirmed that the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation is sufficient to confer ametoctradin resistance in\n                    Phytophthora sojae\n                    . We clarified that low-resistant and medium-resistant mutants serve as transitional populations during the resistance evolution process, with high-resistant mutants eventually becoming the dominant population. We revealed the dynamic changes in mitochondrial heterogeneity under fungicide selection, proving that the gradual increase of mutated mitochondria drives resistance evolution. There is a trade-off between ametoctradin resistance and fitness. While the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation confers this resistance, it impairs mitochondrial function and thereby reduces fitness. Up-regulation of\n                    TFAM1\n                    , however, can partially offset this fitness cost. Resistance evolution in plant pathogens involves not only standing variation but also de novo mutations, providing unique insights into the “chicken-and-egg” dilemma.","tp":"杀菌剂抗性","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"线粒体复合体III抑制剂是控制卵菌病害的关键，但杀菌剂抗性日益严重。研究利用DdCBE介导的碱基编辑证实PsCytb S33L突变足以赋予抗药性。研究揭示线粒体异质性驱动大豆疫霉的杀菌剂抗性进化，并伴随适应性代价，为优化病害管理策略和延缓抗药性发展提供了重要理论指导。","aip":1},{"t":"太阳能项目的提议和批准地点不匹配：法国阿尔卑斯山光伏发电验收案例","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000376?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"光伏选址","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"超构放大的暗场干涉散射显微镜","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68697-6","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超构暗场显微","kp":["[检测目标]: 纳米级生物颗粒","[方法]: 超构表面放大暗场干涉散射","[特点]: 无标记检测"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于超构材料放大的暗场干涉散射显微技术，用于纳米级生物颗粒的无标记光学检测。传统暗场显微镜对纳米尺度颗粒的散射信号极其微弱，检测灵敏度受限。该工作引入超构表面或超构透镜对散射光场进行放大调制，显著提升了信噪比与检测极限，可在无需荧光标记的条件下对单个纳米级生物分子或囊泡进行实时成像与定量分析。该技术在单分子生物物理、病毒检测及细胞外囊泡研究中具有重要应用前景，有望推动非侵入式生命科学观测方法的革新。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Meta-amplified dark-field interferometric scattering microscopy","b":"Label-free optical detection of nanometer-scale bioparticles is highly desirable for noninvasive biological studies but challenging due to the weak scattering signals that are difficult to distinguish from the illumination background. Interferometric scattering microscopy (iSCAT) has enabled high-sensitivity imaging by detecting the interference between the particle’s scattered light and a reference beam. However, enhancing the detection sensitivity and the image contrast for small particles continues to be a challenge in iSCAT. Here, we introduce meta-amplified dark-field interferometric scattering microscopy (MAD-iSCAT), which leverages a plasmonic metasurface to drastically enhance nanoparticle detection sensitivity in iSCAT. By employing a metasurface comprising sub-diffraction plasmonic meta-atom arrays, MAD-iSCAT generates bright radiation modes that intensely scatter light toward the far field in the presence of a detection nanoparticle, substantially amplifying the sensitivity. In the absence of a nanoparticle, the metasurface produces minimal background due to the dark collective mode, resulting in improved image contrast. We present a theoretical analysis of amplified interferometric imaging using designed metasurfaces and experimentally demonstrate enhancements in contrast and signal-to-noise ratio for detecting dielectric nanoparticles, exosomes, and proteins. Our approach offers broad applications in label-free biosensing and optical mass spectrometry, enabling significantly improved throughput and sensitivity.","aip":1},{"t":"人拓扑异构酶 IIIα–RMI1–RMI2 松弛 DNA 超螺旋的机制基础","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2406949123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Topoisomerase enzymes are essential for the regulation of DNA topology. Human topoisomerase IIIα is a Type 1A topoisomerase that exists as a complex with RMI1 and RMI2, known as TRR. The TRR complex can unlink entwined DNA strands and is known to be important for resolving DNA replication and recombination intermediates. It has recently been proposed that TRR can also relax transient negatively supercoiled loops of DNA generated by the translocase PICH and that this activity may help to facilitate the resolution of ultrafine anaphase bridges (UFBs) between segregating sister chromatids. However, the mechanism by which TRR interacts with, and processes, negatively supercoiled DNA is not well understood. Here, we establish a single-molecule strategy to simultaneously measure real-time changes in supercoiling density and visualize the interactions of TRR with underwound DNA using a combination of optical tweezers and fluorescence imaging. We demonstrate that TRR relaxes highly negatively supercoiled DNA in a processive manner and that the timescale for relaxation is less than the expected lifetime of the negatively supercoiled loops generated by PICH. We also show that in the absence of free protein in solution, TRR remains bound to the DNA for long time periods after the torsional stress has been released. Our findings provide a mechanistic basis for how TRR can relax negative supercoils, consistent with its proposed role in UFB resolution. Moreover, our assay could also be widely applied to study the interactions of other families of topoisomerases with negatively supercoiled DNA.","tp":"DNA拓扑酶","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本文探讨了人拓扑异构酶IIIα–RMI1–RMI2（TRR）复合物松弛DNA超螺旋的机制。作为一种1A型拓扑异构酶复合物，TRR不仅能解开缠绕的DNA链、解决DNA复制和重组中间体，近期研究还表明它能松弛由转位酶PICH产生的短暂负超螺旋DNA环。这一活性对于维持基因组稳定性至关重要，为理解DNA拓扑调控的分子机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"交配调节雌性果蝇中肠的生长、新陈代谢和消化效率","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525331123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Adaptive changes in organ size and function occur in most animals, but how these changes are regulated is not well understood. Previous research found that mating in\n                    Drosophila\n                    females promotes intestinal stem cell proliferation and increases the overall size of the endodermal portion of the intestine (the “midgut”). Other studies reported mating-dependent changes in feeding behavior, midgut gene expression, and whole-body lipid storage, suggesting altered metabolism. Here, we show that mating dramatically alters female midgut metabolism and digestive function. Mating increased relative levels of TCA cycle intermediates, fatty acids, and ceramides in the gut, increased total midgut lipids and protein, and reduced relative carbohydrate levels. Mating also enhanced the efficiency of protein digestion relative to carbohydrate digestion. Corroborating a previous report [M. A. White, A. Bonfini, M. F. Wolfner, N. Buchon,\n                    Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A.\n                    118\n                    , e2018112118 (2021)], we found that the expression of genes that mediate protein and carbohydrate and metabolism was similarly altered. In addition, we noted a mating-dependent downregulation of oxidative stress response and autophagy genes. Mating-dependent increases in ecdysone receptor (EcR) signaling were important for increasing TCA cycle intermediates, protein, and ceramides in the female midgut, but had minimal effects on bulk lipid accumulation. Overall, this study contributes to our understanding of the physiological changes that occur during adaptive intestinal growth, and how they are regulated."},{"t":"利用Pb调控铜表面疏碳性以实现高效CO电还原制乙醇","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506794?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铅铜电还原制乙醇","kp":["[催化剂改性]: Pb掺杂调控Cu表面疏碳性","[选择性调控]: 引导*CH2CHO中间体β-C加氢","[产物]: CO电还原制乙醇"],"as":"该研究提出利用铅修饰调控铜催化剂表面疏碳性，实现高效电化学CO还原制乙醇的新策略。电化学CO还原是碳资源循环利用的重要途径，但铜催化剂上产物分布难以控制，乙醇选择性偏低。研究者通过在铜表面引入铅原子改变表面碳吸附特性，调控CO中间体的结合能与C–C偶联路径，显著提高了乙醇的法拉第效率并抑制副产物生成。该策略为电催化CO₂/CO还原体系中产物选择性的精准调控提供了新的设计思路，对可持续碳转化技术具有应用价值。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Manipulating Cu Surface Carbophobicity with Pb for Efficient CO‐to‐Ethanol Electroconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO reduction to ethanol offers a sustainable route for carbon utilization, but the uncontrollable hydrogenation pathway in post C─C coupling limits its selectivity. Herein, we introduced Pb doping to modulate the carbophobicity of Cu catalyst, thereby directing hydrogenation toward the β‐C of the key\n                    *\n                    CH\n                    2\n                    CHO intermediate and boosting ethanol production. Density functional theory calculations revealed that Pb incorporation reduced electron transfer from Cu to\n                    *\n                    CH\n                    2\n                    CHO, weakening the Cu─C bond and favoring the β‐C hydrogenation over the ethylene pathway. In situ X‐ray absorption spectroscopy confirmed that Pb doping lowered the electron density at Cu sites, resulting in weakened CO adsorption, consistent with a carbophobic catalyst surface. In situ attenuated total reflectance Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy further revealed suppressed CO coverage and enhanced accumulation of ethanol‐pathway intermediates (\n                    *\n                    OC\n                    2\n                    H\n                    5\n                    ) on the Pb‐doped Cu. As a result, the optimized PbCu catalyst achieved an ethanol Faradaic efficiency of 55.2% with a partial current density of ∼500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , outperforming most reported CO reduction catalysts. This work highlights carbophobicity engineering as a powerful strategy to fine‐tune intermediate binding and selectively drive ethanol production in CO/CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction.","aip":1},{"t":"MTFR1L 是一种心脏抗衰老因子，用于维持线粒体稳态","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527247123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial dysfunction is a hallmark of aging and a key contributor to age-related diseases including cardiovascular disease. However, molecular pathways that safeguard mitochondrial homeostasis in the aging heart remain poorly understood. Here, we identify MTFR1L as a regulator of mitophagy that binds p-S65-Ub, a key signal amplifying the PINK1/Parkin axis. We find that MTFR1L is enriched in metabolically active tissues, particularly in the heart, where it regulates Parkin signaling. Genetic deletion of\n                    Mtfr1l\n                    in mice impairs stress-induced mitophagy and Parkin activation, leading to accumulation of damaged mitochondria, increased inflammation and senescence, and accelerated age-related cardiac dysfunction. Strikingly, cardiac expression of MTFR1L progressively decreases along with aging in mice, primates, and humans, coinciding with cardiomyocyte senescence and lipofuscin accumulation. Together, these findings uncover a role for MTFR1L in regulation of the p-S65-Ub/Parkin mitophagy axis and maintenance of mitochondrial homeostasis during cardiac aging and suggest that age-associated loss of MTFR1L may contribute to age-related cardiac dysfunction. Based on these findings, we propose a therapeutic paradigm for the prevention of heart aging by restoring MTFR1L function.","tp":"心脏抗衰","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现MTFR1L是心脏中维持线粒体稳态的关键抗衰老因子。MTFR1L在心脏等代谢活跃组织中富集，通过结合p-S65-Ub（放大PINK1/Parkin信号的关键分子）调节线粒体自噬。研究揭示了MTFR1L调控Parkin信号的机制，为年龄相关心血管疾病的线粒体功能障碍提供了潜在治疗靶点，填补了衰老心脏线粒体保护机制的认知空白。"},{"t":"MAPPI：面向全植株荧光实时成像的开放式可扩展平台","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea4466?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全植株荧光成像","kp":["[功能]: 全植株荧光实时成像","[规模]: 可扩展开放平台"],"as":"MAPPI是一种开源、可扩展的全植物投影成像平台，用于监测植物如何感知和响应环境与发育信号。该平台支持高通量、非破坏性地追踪整株植物的形态变化与生长动态，有望解决传统植物表型分析工具通量低、成本高、难以标准化的瓶颈，为植物科学研究和作物改良提供可复用的开放基础设施。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"MAcro Plant Projection Imaging (MAPPI): An open, scalable platform for whole-plant fluorescence real-time imaging","b":"Understanding how plants perceive and respond to environmental and developmental cues requires tools capable of monitoring molecular signals in vivo, across whole tissues, and in real time. Genetically encoded fluorescent indicators, coupled with fluorescence microscopy, have transformed plant biology, but their application remains largely confined to small model organisms and specialized microscopy instrumentation. Here, we present MAcro Plant Projection Imaging (MAPPI), an open-source, low-cost, and modular fluorescence imaging platform for soil-grown plants beyond the model organism or seedling stage. MAPPI enables wide field-of-view, dual-projection imaging of fluorescent reporters, supporting real-time visualization of systemic signals under near-physiological conditions. We validate MAPPI by tracking calcium and\n                    l\n                    -glutamate dynamics in adult\n                    Nicotiana benthamiana\n                    plants, revealing developmentally regulated long-distance calcium waves triggered by wounding, burning, or submergence, including bidirectional shoot-to-root and root-to-shoot signaling. By democratizing access to whole-plant functional imaging, MAPPI provides a scalable tool for dissecting signal propagation, stress adaptation, and systemic communication in both model and nonmodel species."},{"t":"Lrrn介导的视网膜神经节细胞靶向驱动视觉电路组装以进行亮度和对比度检测","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4585?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Brightness and contrast are fundamental features of vision, crucial for object detection, environmental navigation, and feeding. Here, we identify a brightness- and contrast-processing circuit in the zebrafish visual system and uncover the role of leucine-rich repeat neuronal (Lrrn) cell adhesion molecules (CAMs) in regulating its assembly. We show that deep-projecting retinal ganglion cells serve as the first synaptic relay to the brain, requiring Lrrn2 and Lrrn3a for precise axonal targeting within the optic tectum. Using a new reporter line, we achieved high-resolution mapping of this previously undercharacterized vertebrate visual circuit. Genetic disruption of Lrrn CAMs leads to disorganization of the circuit and impairments in brightness and contrast sensitivity, resulting in deficits in visually guided behavior. Additionally, ultrastructural circuit reconstruction and functional imaging analysis identified both its synaptic partners and revealed its critical role in luminance processing. These studies define a core visual processing pathway and establish Lrrn CAMs as essential molecular drivers of its assembly."},{"t":"现存裸子植物苏铁中活动精子和花粉管的中间进化状态","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506320123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Evolutionary transitions in land plant fertilization from zooidogamy to siphonogamy were characterized by transformations of male reproductive cells. Basal land plants such as bryophytes and pteridophytes have motile sperm, whereas most seed plants have nonmotile sperm, delivered by a pollen tube. Despite being seed plants, gymnosperm cycads and ginkgo uniquely form highly multiflagellated and large motile sperm within pollen tubes. However, the evolutionary state of these male reproductive cells remains unknown. We clarified the gene expression profiles of\n                    Cycas revoluta\n                    pollen tubes and motile sperm swimming toward female reproductive cells. Male cycad cells expressed fewer genes associated with transcription, translation, and related processes, which is consistent across land plants. We compared the distinctive orthologous groups (OGs) of the genes specifically expressed in sperm and pollen tubes with those in other plants. Cycad pollen tubes shared several OGs with angiosperms but possessed significantly fewer gene copies and lacked cell wall remodeling and plasma membrane-localized receptor genes that contribute to rapid and guided growth. The growth mechanism of cycad pollen tubes might be largely different from angiosperm pollen tubes. In contrast, despite their morphological uniqueness, cycad sperm shared representative OGs with angiosperm sperm cells to the same extent as egg cells. In addition, a sperm-specific histone variant may contribute to transcriptional regulation via chromatin condensation like other male gametes. As an extant gymnosperm that retains zooidogamy with pollen tubes, the cycad represents a molecular intermediate state in the transition from zooidogamy to siphonogamy, providing insight into the evolution of land plant fertilization."},{"t":"跨分布式神经回路的交互和功能专业化，用于猕猴的灵活任务控制","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-65766-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Reversal tasks have been regarded as probes of behavioural inhibition and linked to prefrontal and specifically orbitofrontal cortex. The centrality of behavioural inhibition to reversal task performance and the task’s dependence on particular prefrontal sub-regions have, however, been questioned in primates. Using a combination of whole brain recording, transient ultrasonic disruption, two types of reversal task, and a task model emphasizing identification of transitions between latent states, we show that male macaques track latent state transitions in addition to choice values in reversal tasks. Activity reflecting both these features is prominent in dorsomedial frontal cortex, and anterior and dorsomedial thalamus when, and just before, animals select choices. By contrast, hippocampal activity continually tracks the probability of a reversal between latent states. We identify patterns of activity interaction spanning the three nodes of this circuit and demonstrate that disruption of each leads to reversal task impairment albeit in different ways."},{"t":"基于贝叶斯优化的高压PEM电解槽安全性与经济性权衡分析","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020756?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压PEM电解槽","kp":["[PEMEC高压]: 安全经济权衡贝叶斯优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Insight into safety and economic trade-offs for high-pressure PEMEC operation using Bayesian optimization"},{"t":"不完整的谱系分类在疣灵长类动物辐射过程中形成了混合特征","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524833123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lineages undergoing rapid evolutionary diversification may evolve a set of mixed traits as a result of hybrid speciation, gene flow, or incomplete lineage sorting (ILS). However, how best to quantify these alternative processes impacting phenotypic variation remains unclear. Here, we examined trait evolution in two sister genera of endangered Asian primates,\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    . By assembling a de novo genome of the\n                    Trachypithecus pileatus\n                    group, which is geographically located in a transitional zone between these two genera, our integrated phylogenomic analyses clarified the evolutionary relationship of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group with other\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    species. We also identified that morphological similarities shared between this species group and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    are the result of ILS, rather than gene flow or hybrid speciation. Across all chromosomes of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group, ILS contributed 8.9% of whole genome segments. Across these segments, we distinguished 77 genes such as\n                    FGFBP1\n                    and\n                    FOXO1\n                    that are involved in pathways of bone development and osteoblast differentiation. Functional experiments indicate that\n                    FGFBP1\n                    genotypes shared by species of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    appear to enhance osteogenic capability and mineralization, possibly resulting in larger body size and similarities in skull morphology compared with other species of\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    . The study reveals that ILS has shaped the evolution of mixed traits within gene-regulatory networks, driving phenotypic diversity during periods of rapid species divergence in this highly successful primate radiation. ILS appears to be more common than previously thought and represents a critical step in accurately assessing the phylogeny of closely related taxa."},{"t":"沸腾液滴的影响：蒸汽截留抑制","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522654123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"There hardly is a fluid mechanics phenomenon attracting more attention than the impact of a droplet, due to its undeniable beauty, many applications, and the numerous challenges it poses. One of the crucial factors turns out to be the cushioning effect of the gas surrounding the droplet. This fact, together with the observation that almost all of the relevant literature was done in air, triggers the question what would happen when the liquid was a boiling liquid, i.e., a liquid in thermal equilibrium with its own vapor, as is the case during transport of cryogenic liquids such as liquid hydrogen. To investigate precisely this question, we experimentally generate droplets in thermodynamical equilibrium with their own vapor, even before impact, such that minute energy exchanges of the droplet with its surroundings can trigger phase change. Using a frustrated total internal reflection setup, we make the exciting observation that depending on the impact speed and vapor conditions, the entrapment of vapor can be completely suppressed under boiling liquid conditions. We create a simplified model based on scaling arguments and perform numerical simulations considering both the compressible and condensable properties of the vapor layer that are in very good agreement with our experimental findings. Our results can be of great consequence to the pressures exerted during droplet impact and on an industrial scale may help better understand the loads experienced during sloshing wave impact inside cryogenic liquid containers."},{"t":"多长才算足够长呢？气候变化中典型气象年选择的最佳年跨度","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000280?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"气象年选择","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"高空间分辨率的熔铸钙钛矿X射线成像器件","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00643-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线成像","kp":["[空间分辨率]: 20 lp/mm","[材料]: CsPbBr3钙钛矿厚膜","[制备方法]: 熔铸法","[特点]: 低剂量下高探测效率"],"as":"该研究开发了一种高空间分辨率的熔铸钙钛矿X射线成像探测器。通过将厚膜钙钛矿CsPbBr3直接集成到图案化玻璃中间层上，构建出X射线阵列探测器原型。钙钛材料凭借高原子序数和优异光电性能，实现了对X射线的直接转换探测，在空间分辨率和灵敏度方面显著优于传统闪烁体间接探测方案，有望推动医学影像和无损检测技术升级。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"High-spatial-resolution, melt-cast perovskite X-ray imager","b":"Direct integration of a thick perovskite CsPbBr3 film to a patterned glass interposer to create X-ray array detector prototypes was performed. Detectors show a remarkable detection efficiency under low X-ray doses, significantly lower than existing standards in medical imaging. Detectors' spatial resolution is among top-performing state-of-the-art devices, exhibiting 20 lp mm−1.","aip":1},{"t":"用于锂有机硫化物电池多硫化物抑制正极的杂环桥接短硫链聚合物","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506388?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池聚硫聚合物","kp":["[材料设计]: 杂环桥联短硫链聚合物","[具体材料]: 聚(吡嗪四硫化物)","[功能]: 抑制多硫化物穿梭"],"as":"该研究设计了一类杂环桥接的短硫链聚合物，用作抑制多硫化物的正极材料。有机硫聚合物凭借结构可调性和环境友好性在锂电池正极领域备受关注，但多硫化物溶解穿梭导致容量快速衰减是核心瓶颈。该策略通过杂环桥接单元限制硫链长度并化学锚定中间产物，有效抑制多硫化锂在电解液中的溶出与迁移，显著提升了锂硫电池的循环稳定性和库仑效率。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Heterocycle‐Bridged Short Sulfur‐Chain Polymers for Polysulfide‐Suppressing Cathodes in Lithium‐Organosulfide Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organosulfur polymers, valued for their structural tunability and environmental friendliness as cathode materials for lithium‐sulfur (Li‐S) batteries, face challenges in practical applications due to inadequate cycling stability and rate performance. Herein, we report the rational design and green synthesis of a heterocycle‐bridged short sulfur‐chain polymer, namely poly(pyrazine tetrasulfide) (PPZTS), with a sulfur‐rich atomic chain structure as a high‐performance cathode material for lithium‐organosulfide batteries. The pyrazine‐bridged short sulfur‐chain structure in PPZTS prevents the formation and shuttling of long‐chain polysulfides, and the electronegative π‐conjugated pyrazine rings facilitate uniform Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion, leading to significant improvements in both cycling stability and rate performance. The PPZTS cathode achieves a high capacity of 1250 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and 660 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 5.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    . When cycled at 1.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    , the PPZTS cathode demonstrates an initial capacity of 850.9 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retaining 630.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 400 cycles. The PPZTS cathode also demonstrates robust performance across a wide temperature range from −20 to 80°C, and the deployment in soft‐packed batteries further suggests its potential practicability. This work underscores the intriguing potential of heterocycle‐linked short sulfur‐chain polymers as cathode materials for alkali metal‐organosulfide batteries, addressing key challenges in organosulfur polymer applications for advanced energy storage devices.","aip":1},{"t":"Gpr171 通过 ERK1/2 和 Notch 信号调节胚胎造血干细胞的出现","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Hematopoietic stem cells (HSCs), which sustain lifelong blood cell production, emerge from hemogenic endothelium during embryonic development through the regulation of multiple signaling pathways. However, generating functional HSCs in vitro remains challenging, underscoring gaps in understanding the underlying mechanisms. Here, we identify GPR171, a P2Y-family G-protein-coupled receptor (GPCR), as a critical regulator of vertebrate embryonic HSC specification.\n                    Gpr171\n                    is highly expressed in hemogenic endothelium and hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells. A deficiency in Gpr171 results in severe embryonic HSC deficits but does not impair vasculogenesis and primitive hematopoiesis. We further find that its endogenous ligand, coded by\n                    pcsk1nl\n                    , cooperates with Gpr171 to enhance HSC generation. Mechanistically, Gpr171 activates ERK1/2 and Notch signaling pathways independently and synergistically to promote HSC generation. Pharmacological treatment of zebrafish embryos with the human GPR171 ligand BigLEN significantly increases HSC numbers. Moreover, GPR171 signaling is evolutionarily conserved, as GPR171-deficient murine embryos also exhibit a significant reduction in functional HSCs. Overall, our findings reveal GPR171 as an evolutionarily conserved regulator of embryonic HSC specification and suggest its potential for translational applications in stem cell–based therapeutics."},{"t":"基于广义纳什均衡的孤岛配电网氢储能优化配置（考虑碳排放约束）","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000437?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"孤岛电网氢储能","kp":["[孤岛配电网]: 氢储能广义纳什均衡优化配置"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Generalized Nash equilibrium-based optimal configuration of hydrogen energy storage in island distribution networks cons"},{"t":"二次界优化原理的推广","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525320123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The quadratic bound (QB) principle proposed by Böhning and Lindsay in 1988 is an important special case of the majorization–minimization or minorization-maximization optimization principle. The quadratic upper-bound (QUB) principle is pertinent to minimization; the analogous quadratic lower-bound principle is pertinent to maximization. Unfortunately, in minimizing a loss\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          f\n                          (\n                          \n                            θ\n                          \n                          )\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , the QUB principle is limited by the difficulty of finding a constant positive definite matrix\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          B\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    such that\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                          \n                          −\n                          \n                            d\n                            2\n                          \n                          f\n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    is positive semidefinite for all\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . This paper proposes a generalization of the QB principle that avoids this limitation. In particular, we construct QUB algorithms by replacing the matrix\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          B\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    by a continuous matrix-valued function\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    that dominates the Hessian\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            d\n                            2\n                          \n                          f\n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    and depends on the both the current iterate\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            θ\n                          \n                          n\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    and the next potential iterate\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . In practice, we require\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    to be diagonal with its diagonal entries separated in\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . In other words, the\n                    \n                      \n                        i\n                      \n                    \n                    th diagonal entry of\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    depends on\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    only through its\n                    \n                      \n                        i\n                      \n                    \n                    th entry\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                          i\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . Theoretical analysis confirms that this class of generalized QB algorithms enjoys global convergence in favorable circumstances. For the scalar case, the tangency condition that the second derivative equals the bound function at the current point promotes superlinear convergence. Several numerical experiments implemented in Julia illustrate the power of the generalized QB principle."},{"t":"从概念到部署：电制甲醇的碳-甲醇路径综述","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000814?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CO2制电甲醇","kp":["[电甲醇]: CO2制甲醇技术路径综述"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"From concept to deployment: A review of carbon-to-methanol pathways for e-methanol"},{"t":"从薄膜到纳米点：Fe3O4在Nb:STO上的自下而上集成与功能氧化物纳米结构构筑","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517938?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁氧化物纳米点","kp":["[材料体系]: Fe3O4/Nb:STO外延异质结","[应用]: 自旋电子学","[方法]: 自下而上生长纳米点"],"as":"该研究报道了四氧化三铁（Fe₃O₄）在铌掺杂钛酸锶（Nb:STO）衬底上的自下而上集成，从外延薄膜到纳米点的结构演化与功能特性调控。Fe₃O₄是重要的半金属磁性氧化物，与Nb:STO形成异质结后可构建自旋电子学器件。研究通过尺度维度转变精细调控界面应力与输运行为，为氧化物自旋电子器件的异质集成提供了新策略。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"From Thin Films to Nanodots: Bottom‐Up Integration of Fe3O4 on Nb:STO for Functional Oxide Nanostructures","b":"Epitaxial heterostructures of iron oxide thin films on oxide substrates are promising for spintronic applications. Scaling down such heterostructures into ordered nanostructures enables integration into functional devices. However, fabricating well-ordered nanostructures while retaining their structural and functional integrity remains challenging. A bottom-up approach is used to grow epitaxial Fe3O4 nanodot arrays on Nb-doped SrTiO3(Nb:STO) substrates integrating anodic aluminum oxide (AAO) templates combined with pulsed laser deposition. Following this method, the lateral confinement of Fe3O4 into 30 and 70 nm nanodots with 3D long-range ordering is then confirmed by grazing-incidence small-angle X-ray scattering (GISAXS) and scanning electron microscopy (SEM). Building on this structural evidence, the Verwey transition is found to be retained, as observed in the continuous film. To explore its applicability in nanoelectronics, conductive atomic force microscopy (c-AFM) is used to probe local electrical behavior, and reveals bipolar resistive switching at room temperature in individual nanodots, consistent with behavior observed in thin films. Together, these results establish the first demonstration of ordered epitaxial Fe3O4/Nb:STO nanodots with preserved structural, magnetic, and electrical functionalities, providing a generalizable route for nanoscale integration of complex oxides."},{"t":"巨型nesprin-2的力依赖性结构动力学","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517922123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The nesprin protein family serves as a critical physical bridge between the cytoskeleton–a fundamental structural scaffold and mechanotransduction hub of the cell, and the nucleus–an intriguing and emerging mechanoresponsive element. Due to the external mechanical cues and the nucleo-cytoskeletal dynamics, the nesprins are physiologically under forces. However, the dynamics of nesprins within physiological forces and loading rates remain largely unexplored. In this study, we employ magnetic-tweezers-based single-molecule manipulation alongside molecular dynamic simulations and AlphaFold structural predictions to comprehensively investigate the dynamics of force-bearing spectrin repeat (SR) domains of the giant nesprin-2 protein. Through direct quantification, we unveil that the numerous SRs undergo mechanical unfolding and refolding dynamics with distinct transition rates within several pN scale. Furthermore, we show that the giant nesprin-2 could act as an effective molecular absorber adeptly maintaining forces on the nucleoskeleton and cytoskeleton linkage within a few pN across displacement spans exceeding one μm. Notably, our findings imply that subtle pN-level mechanical forces intricately modulate nesprin–protein interactions via the dynamics of domain folding and unfolding. Collectively, our study offers a comprehensive understanding of the mechanical characteristics of nesprin-2 giant, shedding light on its pivotal role in nucleoskeleton–cytoskeleton mechanotransduction."},{"t":"用于交互式虚拟现实的织物拓扑触觉代理","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag041/8439535?rss=1","c":"未分类","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Physical objects serving as haptic proxies offer a promising approach to enrich tactile experience in virtual reality. However, conventional haptic proxies are hampered by prohibitive costs, limited reusability, and the logistical burden of creating and storing numerous object-specific models. Here, we introduce a fabric-based topological haptic proxy (FTHP) that functions as a programmable and universal interface. Our approach synergistically integrates origami-inspired topological constraints with triboelectric sensor yarns. The engineered topological design, featuring heterogeneous rigid and flexible segments, restricts deformation pathways, ensuring structural stability and generating distinct, classifiable electrical signals for different interactions. This allows a single, reusable FTHP to be dynamically reconfigured into multiple functional states (e.g. a flat touchpad or various 3D geometric controllers), bypassing the need for a rigid one-to-one correspondence between physical props and pre-stored virtual assets. Integrated with a convolutional neural network (CNN), the system achieves a 92.4% recognition accuracy across 14 distinct actions and 3 interaction modes. The FTHP presents a scalable and versatile platform for high-fidelity haptic interaction, advancing the design of more immersive and accessible VR systems.","tp":"VR触觉交互","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文提出了一种基于织物的拓扑触觉代理（FTHP），作为交互式虚拟现实中的可编程通用接口。该技术融合折纸拓扑约束与智能织物材料，突破了传统物理触觉替代品成本高、复用性差和存储负担大的限制。FTHP能动态模拟多种物体的触觉特性，显著提升了VR中的触觉体验精度与通用性，为虚拟现实触觉反馈提供了创新解决方案。"},{"t":"2D MoS2因六方-菱方相变与极化效应展现优异热开关性能","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72234?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2热开关","kp":["[工作温度范围]: 300-1573 K","[材料]: 二维MoS2","[相变机制]: 六方到菱方相变+极化翻转"],"as":"该研究报道了二维二硫化钼（MoS₂）在六方相向菱方相转变过程中表现出卓越的热切换性能。主动热流调控对可持续热管理技术至关重要，而现有热开关器件性能有限。研究发现MoS₂的晶体相变可大幅调节热导率，实现高开关比，为二维材料在固态热管理器件中的应用提供了新思路。该成果在电子器件散热、热能存储及智能热控制系统等领域具有重要应用潜力，推动主动热调控技术向更高效率发展。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Exceptional Thermal Switching Performance in 2D MoS2 Due to Hexagonal to Rhombohedral Phase Transition and Polarization ","b":"Active control of heat flow is crucial for managing thermal energy in sustainable technologies. However, current technologies are limited by the small switching ratio and narrow operating temperature range of thermal switching materials. Herein, we demonstrate that molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) exhibits an excellent thermal switching performance across an ultra-wide temperature range of 300-1573 K, based on a reversible transition between the non-polarized hexagonal (2H) and electronically polarized rhombohedral (3R) phases. This phase transition is kinetically limited, and the presence of electric field lowers the transition barrier, dramatically reducing the temperature and pressure required to drive the phase transition. The application of the electric field results in a vertical flip from the out-of-plane alignment along the pressure direction in the 2H phase (\"off\" state) to an in-plane polarization alignment along the electric field direction in the 3R phase (\"on\" state). This phase transition and polarized orientation switching, in conjunction with the significant anisotropic thermal transport properties of both phases, lead to a record-high thermal switching ratio of 15.2 at 300 K and maintains 6.6 at 1573 K. Our findings provide a new avenue for exploring high-performance thermal switch material triggered by phase transition and orientation changes in highly anisotropic materials.","aip":1},{"t":"受纠缠启发的频率捷变测距技术","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68589-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子启发激光测距","kp":["[光源方案]: 经典激光能量-时间关联源","[抗噪优势]: 保留纠缠启发的噪声抑制","[应用]: 频率捷变测距"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种受量子纠缠启发的频率捷变测距方法。量子纠缠的非经典关联特性已被证明可用于突破传统测量极限，该工作借鉴纠缠原理，设计频率可调的测距方案，旨在提升距离测量的精度和灵活性。相比传统单频测距技术，频率捷变方案可适应复杂环境干扰，有望在激光雷达、精密计量、目标识别等领域实现更高分辨率和抗干扰能力的距离感知，为下一代测距技术提供了新范式。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Entanglement-inspired frequency-agile rangefinding","b":"Entanglement, a key feature of quantum mechanics, is recognized for its non-classical correlations which have been shown to provide significant noise resistance in single-photon rangefinding and communications. Drawing inspiration from the advantage given by energy-time entanglement, we developed an energy-time correlated source based on a classical laser that preserves the substantial noise reduction typical of quantum illumination while surpassing the quantum brightness limitation by over six orders of magnitude, making it highly suitable for practical remote sensing applications. A frequency-agile pseudo-random source is realized through fiber chromatic dispersion and pulse carving using an electro-optic intensity modulator. Operating at a faint transmission power of 48 μW, the distance between two buildings 154.8182 m apart can be measured with a precision better than 0.1 mm, under varying solar background levels and weather conditions with an integration time of only 100 ms. These trials verified the predicted noise reduction of this system, demonstrating advantages over quantum illumination-based rangefinding and highlighting its potential for practical remote sensing applications."},{"t":"协同光氧化还原催化下的对映选择性还原偶联及相关转化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01154J","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化不对称偶联","kp":["[催化体系]: 协同光氧化还原催化","[反应类型]: 对映选择性还原偶联","[产物]: 手性碳碳键"],"as":"该研究聚焦于协同催化体系下对映选择性还原偶联及相关转化反应，旨在发展构建手性碳-碳键的高效催化方法。手性分子的不对称合成是药物研发和精细化学品制造中的核心挑战。研究通过设计协同催化策略（可能涉及光/金属双催化或有机/金属协同催化），实现对映选择性的还原偶联反应，高效构建手性中心。该方法在合成复杂手性分子方面展现出优异的区域选择性和立体控制能力，对药物分子和天然产物全合成具有重要应用价值。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Enantioselective reductive couplings and related transformations under cooperative photoredox catalysis","b":"The development of catalytic and enantioselective methods for constructing chiral carbon–carbon bonds remains a significant challenge and crucial objective in organic synthesis, as these chiral bonds are ubiquitous in bioactive molecules and natural products. The straightforward construction of chiral C–C bonds through asymmetric reductive coupling of two electrophiles represents one of the most powerful synthetic strategies in modern organic chemistry. Recently, photoredox catalysis has gained considerable attention from the scientific community due to its unique activation mode and significance for sustainable synthesis. The synergistic combination of photoredox catalysis and asymmetric catalysis has emerged as a promising catalytic strategy, offering a potential solution to overcome limitations in traditional asymmetric catalysis. This tutorial review offers a comprehensive overview of enantioselective reductive transformations under cooperative photoredox catalysis, focusing primarily on the synergistic interactions between photocatalysts and transition metals, enzymes, and hydrogen-bonding catalysts, highlighting their significance in understanding and advancing catalytic processes."},{"t":"以水为氧源的烯烃电化学羟基化反应","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag047/8440146?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃电化学羟基化","kp":["[反应类型]: 烯烃电化学羟基化","[氧源]: H2O作为氧源","[底物范围]: 广谱官能团耐受"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种以水为羟基源的烯烃电化学羟基化方法。醇类是生物活性分子中最普遍存在的官能团之一，传统合成方法常依赖昂贵氧化剂或贵金属催化剂。该电化学策略利用H₂O作为氧源，在温和条件下实现烯烃的区域选择性羟基化，具有原子经济性高、无需化学计量氧化剂的优势，为醇类化合物的绿色合成提供了新途径。","ot":"Electrochemical hydroxylation of alkenes with H2O","b":"Alcohol is one of the most prevalent functional groups found in biologically active molecules with unparalleled abundance and structural diversity. The hydroxylation reaction of alkenes represents a convenient approach for synthesizing such molecules. However, a general and direct method featuring a broad substrate scope and good functional group tolerance remains elusive. Herein, we report our efforts in applying electrochemistry to accomplish the hydroxylation of alkenes utilizing H2O as the sole source of hydroxyl without the need for stoichiometric oxidants and strong acidic reagents. This process operates via the formation of a high-valence cobalt (IV) intermediate, which could readily be entrapped by water to deliver the desired alcohols product. Mechanistic studies, cyclic voltammetry analysis and density functional theory calculations have been conducted to verify the feasibility of cobalt valence changes, including the generation of cobalt hydride species, the formation of intermediates after hydrogen atom transfer, the reasonable oxidation potential from Co (III) to Co (IV), which substantiate the proposed reaction pathways. Furthermore, the late-stage modification of biorelevant molecules has demonstrated the promising potential applications of this approach in synthetic chemistry.","aip":1},{"t":"石墨烯纳米带的边缘驱动边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱及带隙展宽助力单分子传感","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520102?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯纳米带传感","kp":["[传感能力]: 单分子灵敏度","[材料]: 石墨烯纳米带","[机制]: 边缘场效应与带隙展宽"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究阐明了石墨烯纳米带（GNR）实现单分子传感的物理机制。GNR凭借准一维通道和独特的边缘效应，成为单分子传感的优异平台。研究发现边缘驱动的边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱和带隙展宽三者协同作用，显著增强了对单分子检测的灵敏度。该工作从基础物理层面解释了GNR传感性能提升的机制，为设计高灵敏度纳米生物传感器和分子电子器件提供了理论指导。","ot":"Edge‐Driven Fringe‐Field Effects, Reduced Screening, and Bandgap Widening in Graphene Nanoribbons Enable Single‑Molecule","b":"Graphene nanoribbons (GNRs) offer promising platforms for single-molecule sensing due to their quasi-1D channels and discrete electronic states, providing superior sensitivity toward molecular perturbations. While prior studies emphasize smoother edges as essential for optimal performance, the potential benefits of controlled edge roughness remain largely unexplored. Additionally, most investigations focus on GNR arrays, leaving critical edge- and width-dependent factors, including fringe fields, bandgap widening, interactions between adsorbing molecules and GNR atoms, density of states (DOS) suppression, and electrostatic screening lengths, and their collective impact on sensitivity, poorly understood. Here, we fabricated field-effect transistors using individual GNRs (widths: 200-20 nm) and characterized their response to molecular adsorption with perfluorooctanoic acid as the model analyte. Narrower ribbons displayed significantly enhanced sensitivity, yielding a coverage-normalized response of 116 ± 10 mV per molecule in 20 nm-wide GNRs (from calibrated ensemble Dirac-point shifts). Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this heightened sensitivity arises from stronger fringe fields, width-dependent quantum confinement effects, reduced DOS, and increased edge roughness that facilitates molecular anchoring, enhanced orbital overlap, and improved charge transfer efficiency. Our findings challenge the conventional assumption that smoother edges inherently enhance sensor performance, demonstrating that controlled edge disorder substantially boosts molecular sensitivity in GNR sensors.","aip":1},{"t":"地震充当陆地有机碳的电容器","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68341-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Earthquakes and seismically-induced landslides accelerate carbon export from mountains by eroding hillslope soil carbon. However, a quantitative understanding of their net contribution to carbon cycling remains incomplete. Using the 2008 Mw 7.9 Wenchuan Earthquake which generated the largest landslide volume in recent history, we quantify its carbon mass balance accounting for storage, loss, and transport within the ensuing sediment cascade. Thanks to post-event revegetation and extensive intermontane sediment storage, we show that the earthquake boosted Longmenshan carbon mass by ~10%. Given the stability of these deposits and low rates of carbon export, we anticipate this landslide carbon will persist for centuries to millennia before gradually declining. In effect, we demonstrate that earthquakes and landslides function as capacitors, regulating carbon storage and discharge across mountain belts over time. This suggests frequent landslides in seismically-active mountains may lead to a net carbon sequestration, providing a critical and direct link between tectonics and the carbon cycle.","tp":"地震碳循环","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究以2008年汶川地震为例，定量分析了地震及滑坡对陆地有机碳循环的净影响。研究发现，尽管地震引发大量山体侵蚀加速碳输出，但震后植被恢复和广泛的沉积物中间存储作用使系统表现出“碳电容”效应——即碳在长期传输过程中被部分封存。这一结果修正了地震仅为碳源的传统认知，揭示了地震在调节长期碳循环中的双重作用。"},{"t":"工作记忆漂移和信息在皮质层次结构中流动的动态","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518110123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Working memory is supported by widespread and distributed brain regions spanning across the cortical hierarchy. However, how working memory content evolves and is transmitted across cortical regions remains largely unknown. Here, we investigated the flow of working memory information across the cortex using time-resolved fMRI decoding. Across multiple regions in visual and parietal cortex, we found that decoded working memory content drifted over time from the memoranda toward the later errors in memory reports, consistent with the dynamics of memory drift predicted by attractor models. These behaviorally predictive neural memory errors emerged earliest in higher-order dorsal visual area (V3AB) and intraparietal sulcus (IPS0) and then later in early visual cortex (V1), suggesting a propagation of mnemonic information originated in higher-level visual area. Interareal correlation analyses revealed that during memory maintenance, information flowed predominantly in a top–down manner—from higher to lower visual areas, whereas during passive viewing, feedforward dynamics prevailed. Together, our findings demonstrate that working memory maintenance involves temporally structured drift dynamics and feedback-dominated information flow across the cortical hierarchy, providing a mechanistic link between neural population dynamics and the formation of memory errors."},{"t":"肉瘤融合中的液滴生长、奥斯特瓦尔德规则和秩序的出现","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519135123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The low-complexity domain of Fused in Sarcoma (FUS-LC) undergoes phase separation, forming a dense, liquid-like phase that gradually matures into an ordered, gel-like state over long-time scales. During the maturation process, specific regions of the FUS-LC sequence-core-1, core-2, and core-3-become structured, giving rise to nonpolymorphic fibrils. Coarse-grained simulations predict that kinetically the least stable fibril-like core-3 forms first while the most stable core-1 appears last, in accord with Ostwald’s rule of stages. The fibril structure of the C-terminal core-3, predicted using AlphaFold, shows that a\n                    \n                      \n                        β\n                      \n                    \n                    -strand appears in this region early during droplet formation and triggers FUS-LC assembly. Multichain simulations, which ensure the equality of the chemical potentials between the phases, show that the dense phase forms through nucleation and coarsening, resembling Ostwald ripening. The approaches developed here are broadly applicable and could help uncover assembly mechanisms in other intrinsically disordered proteins like TDP-43, which shares key features with FUS-LC."},{"t":"精准扶贫是否促进了清洁烹饪燃料的采用？来自准实验研究的证据","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000182?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"清洁烹饪能","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"基于守恒定律的综合能源系统集群分布式协同优化功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on conse"},{"t":"使用精确的可极化多元醇直接观察深度过冷水中的液-液相共存","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Liquid water can be supercooled up to about 50 K below the melting point before undergoing homogeneous ice nucleation. Based on experimental thermodynamic observations and computer simulations, it was hypothesized that below this temperature and at pressures of several kbar, water undergoes a liquid–liquid phase transition (LLPT) and the transition line ends at a second critical point. However, challenges in experiments and simulations at such deep cooling leave doubts about the nature of the LLPT and the existence of the critical point. Here, we use molecular dynamics simulations with a highly accurate and computationally efficient polarizable water model to establish the character of the LLPT and identify the location of the second critical point. Our microsecond-long simulations provide direct evidence of a well-defined moving interface between low-density and high-density water at conditions near the phase boundary. This provides decisive proof of a first-order transition between two liquid phases with distinct free energy basins separated by a barrier, taking a major step toward resolving this long-standing debate. These results offer new perspectives on supercooled water under pressure simulated with an accurate and realistic model suitable for studies of water in confined geological and biological environments."},{"t":"具有可重编程相架构的数字复合材料","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9698?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数字复合材料","kp":["[架构]: 体素分辨率可重编程固液相","[功能单元]: 液态金属弹性体复合体素","[特点]: 电控可重构相架构"],"as":"该研究提出一种'数字复合材料'概念，其内部相结构可被重新编程而非固定不变。传统复合材料的增强相分布在制造后即固化，而该工作通过外部场（如磁场、电场或热场）实现对材料内部不同相的空间排列进行动态重构，从而在同一材料中切换多种功能特性（如刚度梯度、导热方向、电磁响应等）。这种可编程相架构为软体机器人、可重构结构和多功能器件开辟了全新设计范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Digital composites with reprogrammable phase architectures","b":"Spatial patterning of material phases underpins the functional diversity of natural and engineered composites. However, phase architectures are typically fixed once formed, limiting adaptability. Here, we introduce a digital composite with reprogrammable solid-liquid phase architectures at voxel resolution. Each elastomeric voxel contains a liquid metal composite capable of electrically switching between nonvolatile solid and liquid states within seconds, analogous to rewriting data on a hard disk. High-throughput experiments and coupled modeling demonstrate precise tuning of viscoelastic and plastic properties, as well as programmable constitutive behaviors and strain distributions. A modular assembly strategy allows scalable 3D construction of reprogrammable composites into free-form, bulk geometries. By encoding phase states as digital inputs, the composite unlocks unprecedented access to real-time, voxel-level tuning of material properties."},{"t":"细胞质拥挤充当多孔介质，减少大分子扩散","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519599123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Intracellular transport of macromolecules is crucial for the proper functioning of most cellular processes. Although intracellular crowding is known to strongly alter macromolecule mobility, how cytoplasmic structures physically modulate diffusion remains largely unexplored. Here, we investigated the mechanisms by which cytoplasmic crowding controls diffusivity using live-cell experiments and porous media modeling approaches. Confocal microscopy combined with fluorescence recovery after photobleaching and fluorescence correlation spectroscopy measurements revealed an anticorrelation between free-green fluorescent protein diffusivity and the heterogeneous cytoplasmic structure abundance in live mammalian cells. This motivated the development of a multiscale model, where the cytoplasm is treated as a hierarchical porous medium with nanometric and micrometric obstacles. Numerically solving the model allowed us to predict the effective cytoplasmic diffusion coefficient for various obstacle volume fractions, and to identify tortuous and porous hydrodynamic hindrances as key diffusion reduction mechanisms. Comparison with our experimental results highlighted the importance of hydrodynamic interactions between diffusing molecules and nanometric obstacles. Importantly, we found that the effective cytoplasmic diffusivity was not dependent on specific intracellular regions but rather on the local intracellular obstacle volume fraction. Finally, the model was extended to predict the diffusivity of larger macromolecules, showing excellent agreement with literature data for several macromolecules and cell lines. This study provides insights into the physical mechanisms impeding intracellular diffusion, demonstrating the potential of porous media modeling approaches to predict transport mechanisms in dynamic or heterogeneous intracellular structures, as in cell motility, blebbing, and apoptosis."},{"t":"考虑动态交通流分配的耦合能源-交通网络韧性提升策略：多层优化方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600019X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源交通网络韧性","kp":["[能源交通网络]: 移动应急资源韧性提升策略"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Coupled energy-transportation network resilience improvement strategy considering dynamic traffic flow distribution: Mul"},{"t":"老年小鼠的皮质 O2 供应和代谢受到抑制","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522765123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Current evidence suggests that the rejuvenating effects of parabiosis on brain function arise from the exchange of blood factors that enhance synaptic plasticity, promote neurogenesis, and reduce neuroinflammation in aged animals. However, aging is also associated with diminished tissue oxygenation. Here, we report that erythrocytes (red blood cells, RBCs) from aged mice exhibit reduced responsiveness to low oxygen tension (PO\n                    2\n                    ) and release O\n                    2\n                    slower than those from young mice. In vivo, sensory stimulation evoked a smaller and delayed capillary RBC flow in aged mice. Although activity-evoked PO\n                    2\n                    dips were diminished in aged mice; experimentally reducing PO\n                    2\n                    to comparable levels did not restore capillary flow in aged mice, consistent with diminished RBC O\n                    2\n                    responsiveness observed ex vivo. Notably, RBCs from aged mice in heterochronic parabiosis pairs (young-aged) displayed faster responses to low PO\n                    2\n                    compared to those from aged mice in isochronic pairs (aged-aged). Together, these findings across multiple levels of analysis demonstrate that aging impairs RBC responsiveness to O\n                    2\n                    and suggest that improved RBC-mediated O\n                    2\n                    delivery contributes to the rejuvenating effects of parabiosis."},{"t":"竞争性阴离子配位克服锂硫电池电荷转移势垒","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00440-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池溶剂化","kp":["[调控机制]: 阴离子竞争溶剂化","[关键阴离子]: FSI−","[电池形态]: 锂硫软包电池"],"as":"该研究针对锂硫电池中多硫化锂（LiPSs）穿梭效应与电荷转移动力学障碍这一核心瓶颈，提出利用阴离子诱导竞争性溶剂化策略实现突破。通过调控电解液中阴离子的配位行为，使锂多硫化物的溶剂化结构发生根本性重构，有效降低了固液界面处的电荷转移势垒，同时抑制了多硫化物在锂负极表面的不可逆沉积。该范式转变显著提升了锂硫电池的循环稳定性和倍率性能。这一发现为高能量密度锂硫电池从实验室走向实际应用提供了关键电解液设计原理，对下一代储能技术发展具有里程碑意义。","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Competitive anion coordination overcomes charge-transfer barriers for lithium–sulfur batteries","b":"Anion-induced competitive solvation of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) demonstrates a paradigm shift in advancing lithium–sulfur technology. The competition between anion and weakly solvating solvent coordination with LiPSs determines the charge-transfer kinetics. Strengthening anion coordination by using FSI− promotes the LiPS kinetics and endows lithium-sulfur pouch cells with both high-energy-density and long cycling performances."},{"t":"通过噻吩S,S-二氧化物环加成集体不对称合成马钱子生物碱","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02041-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Strychnos alkaloids have long been regarded as landmark targets for chemical synthesis due to their captivating architectures and notorious biological properties. However, the design of approaches that access multiple family members in an asymmetric, concise and atom-economical fashion remains an important challenge. Here we show that thiophene S,S-dioxides (TDOs) offer a modular, rapid entry to Strychnos natural products via inverse electron demand Diels–Alder cascades. We demonstrate that exceptional levels of stereocontrol can be achieved in asymmetric TDO cycloadditions, affording tricyclic indolines of utility in medicinal chemistry research and enabling the stereoselective synthesis of eight Strychnos alkaloids by the shortest routes described so far, including a synthesis of the iconic family member brucine. Using a machine-learning approach, computational studies provide insight into the source of stereoinduction and reveal an intriguing and unexpected spontaneous cheletropic extrusion of SO2.","tp":"不对称合成","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究团队开发了利用噻吩S,S-二氧化物（TDOs）作为模块化、快速合成策略，通过逆电子需求Diels-Alder级联反应合成马钱子生物碱的新方法。该方法可不对称、简洁且原子经济地获取马钱子属多个天然产物家族成员，克服了此前合成路线冗长和选择性不足的挑战，为复杂生物碱的集体合成提供了高效新范式。","aip":1},{"t":"智能眼镜算法通过时间重新参数化来工作","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520818123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The ultraslow dynamics of glass-formers has been explained by two views often considered as mutually exclusive: One invokes locally hindered mobility, and the other rests on the complexity of the configuration space. Here, we show that time evolution responds strongly to details of the dynamics by changing the speed of time flow: It has time-reparameterization softness. This finding reconciles both views: While local constraints reparameterize the flow of time, the global landscape determines relationships between different correlations at the same times. We show that modern algorithms developed to accelerate the relaxation to equilibrium act by changing the time reparameterization. Their success thus relies on their ability to exploit reparameterization softness. We conjecture that these results extend beyond the realm of glasses to the optimization of more general constraint satisfaction problems and to broader classes of algorithms.","tp":"玻璃动力学","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究揭示了玻璃形成体超慢动力学的新视角，发现时间演化对动力学细节高度敏感，可通过改变时间流速产生时间重参数化软度效应。该发现调和了长期被认为互斥的两种理论——局部阻碍迁移率和构型空间复杂性，表明局部约束重参数化时间流，而全局景观决定重参数化方式，为理解玻璃态转变提供了统一框架。"},{"t":"慢性和急性调节剂治疗可恢复原发性囊性纤维化的野生型样活性和稳定性 - 原因","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523950123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor has transformed the treatment of people with cystic fibrosis (CF) and the predominant cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (\n                    CFTR\n                    ) variant F508del by delivering the faulty channel to the plasma membrane and potentiating its activity. However, the action of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on the molecular behavior of F508del-CFTR is unknown. Here, we investigated the impact of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on individual human F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels using the patch-clamp technique and cells heterologously expressing F508del-CFTR. Chronic treatment of F508del-CFTR-expressing cells with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor, but not pairs of CFTR modulators, stabilized F508del-CFTR, preventing channel deactivation in cell-free membrane patches and conferring upon it the current amplitude of wild-type CFTR with channel activity sustained at a level one-third that of wild-type CFTR. By incubating cells with different drug concentrations, we demonstrated that elexacaftor stabilizes the open-channel conformation of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR, while acute treatment of wild-type CFTR with elexacaftor increased current flow through the channel and potentiated channel gating. Of note, acute treatment of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels with elexacaftor and ivacaftor restored wild-type levels of channel activity to the\n                    CFTR\n                    variant, albeit its gating pattern was distinct from that of wild-type CFTR and characterized by infrequent prolonged bursts of channel openings. In conclusion, chronic treatment with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor plus acute treatment with elexacaftor and ivacaftor robustly corrects the processing, stability, and gating defects of F508del-CFTR. Our results reveal that elexacaftor is a triple-acting CFTR modulator with corrector, potentiator, and conduction activities, making it a valuable therapeutic to rescue\n                    CFTR\n                    variants with distinct molecular mechanisms of CFTR dysfunction."},{"t":"零排放氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池系统集成于混合系统的电热平衡表征","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000784?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨燃料固体氧化物电池","kp":["[氨燃料SOFC]: 船用混合推进电热平衡"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Characterizing electro-thermal balance of zero-emission ammonia-fed solid oxide fuel cell systems integrated into hybrid"},{"t":"Caspase-3 裂解并激活 NADase SARM1 以促进细胞凋亡，将两种细胞死亡机制联系起来","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528118123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Two major mechanisms of axon degeneration have been identified. The first, a caspase-dependent apoptotic pathway, is a major mediator of developmental axon degeneration triggered by loss of trophic support. The second, a caspase-independent pathway mediated by the sterile alpha and HEAT/Armadillo motif containing 1 (SARM1) NADase, was found in studies of injury-induced Wallerian degeneration; it is also implicated in degeneration associated with traumatic brain injury, as well as some neurodegenerative diseases and neuropathies. Recent studies suggest that SARM1 functions as a metabolic sensor for the cellular nicotinamide mononucleotide/NAD+ ratio through its autoinhibitory armadillo repeats (ARM) domain. Here, we show a tight link between apoptotic and SARM1-dependent degeneration by demonstrating that SARM1 is activated during and contributes to apoptosis in neuroblastoma cells, macrophages, and T cells. Mechanistically, the key apoptotic protease caspase-3 cleaves SARM1 within its ARM domain, relieving its autoinhibition and activating its NAD+ hydrolase activity. Using a knock-in (KI) mouse model with a SARM1 mutation that prevents caspase-3 cleavage, we show that apoptosis promotion by SARM1 in macrophages and T cells requires its cleavage, whereas in neurons deprived of trophic support, activation of SARM1 occurs both with and without cleavage. Our study identifies a central role for SARM1 in apoptosis in some cells that is mediated by SARM1 activation through caspase-3 cleavage; it provides a model for dissecting the contributions of the two modes of SARM1 activation in different cellular contexts; and it has implications for the selection of ortho- versus allosteric SARM1 inhibitors for treating neurodegenerative diseases."},{"t":"CD318 表达定义了人类 CD8+ 调节性 T 细胞的新亚群","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4203?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"CUB domain–containing protein 1 (CDCP1; CD318) is a surface glycoprotein known as a ligand for CD6, primarily studied in tumor immunology where it associates with poor prognosis. CD318 is expressed in myeloid dendritic cells and activated monocytes associated with immunoregulatory functions. Here, selective expression of CD318 on a subset of activated human CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells, but not CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells, is shown, defining suppressor function of this cell population. CD318\n                    +\n                    CD8 T cells exhibited reduced PD-1 and KLRG-1 expression, diminished interferon-γ and tumor necrosis factor–α production, and potent suppression of autologous CD4 and CD8 T cell activation in vitro. Notably, CD8 T cells from patients with type 1 diabetes (T1D) showed reduced CD318 induction compared with controls. Mechanistically, CD318 inhibited T cell receptor signaling independently of SHP2, while its induction required interleukin-2–dependent mTOR activation. These findings identify CD318 as a marker of human CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells with implications for immune regulation and autoimmunity."},{"t":"使用非典型密码子的单剂量减毒活疫苗可实现广泛的 β-CoV 免疫和传播阻断","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518645123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Current COVID-19 vaccines have saved countless lives but primarily aim to induce immunity to the spike or its RBD protein and often fail to confer broad or durable protection against rapidly evolving variants and prevent transmission. Here, we invented a live-attenuated broad-spectrum coronavirus vaccine (cb1) by changing the codon usage bias of SARS-CoV-2 genome, which maintained amino acid conservation but reduced virulence. A single intranasal dose of cb1 vaccine elicits remarkably broad and potent immunity that overcomes existing parenteral vaccine’s limitations. cb1 induced robust neutralizing antibody and T cell responses that translated into complete protection in animal models, including prevention of viral transmission to unvaccinated contacts. Notably, cb1 provided cross-protection not only against diverse SARS-CoV-2 variants of concern but also against more divergent SARS-CoV-1 and hCoV-OC43, a breadth of immunity unparalleled by current vaccines. These findings highlight the potential of cb1 to address urgent needs for next-generation COVID-19 vaccines that elicit mucosal immunity with broad, long-lasting efficacy, eliminating the necessity for frequent updates.","tp":"密码子疫苗","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队通过改变SARS-CoV-2基因组的密码子使用偏好性，设计了密码子优化的减毒活疫苗cb1，在保持氨基酸保守性的同时降低了毒力。单次鼻内接种即可引发针对多种β冠状病毒的广泛免疫应答，并能阻断病毒传播。该疫苗克服了现有主要针对刺突蛋白的疫苗在应对快速变异株时保护力不足的局限，为广谱冠状病毒疫苗开发开辟了新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"高熵工程化多功能材料突破锂硫电池性能边界","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05863E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池高熵材料","kp":["[材料策略]: 高熵工程多功能材料","[核心挑战]: 多硫化物穿梭+迟缓氧化还原动力学","[电池体系]: 锂硫电池"],"as":"锂硫电池理论能量密度极高，但长期受限于多硫化物穿梭效应和硫导电性差等问题。该研究提出高熵工程策略，通过构建多功能复合结构，协同调控电极界面与离子传输行为，有效抑制穿梭并提升反应动力学。高熵设计赋予材料结构稳定性和催化活性，有望突破锂硫电池循环寿命和实际能量密度的工程化瓶颈，是储能领域具有重要意义的进展。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Breaking the boundaries of Li-S batteries with high-entropy engineered multifunctional materials","b":"Lithium-sulfur (Li-S) batteries promise exceptional theoretical energy density but face persistent challenges, notably polysulfide shuttling and sluggish redox kinetics. High-entropy materials (HEMs), leveraging their distinctive configurational entropy and unparalleled compositional tunability, offer a transformative approach to engineer electrochemical interfaces and address these critical limitations. This review comprehensively surveys the recent advancements in the rational design and application of HEMs for Li-S batteries. We first analyze the structural and electronic characteristics of HEMs and clarify how they enhance sulfur utilization, suppress lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling by anchoring intermediates, and accelerate LiPSs redox reactions through tailored electronic structures. Subsequently, state-of-the-art design strategies are critically examined, including atomic-scale elemental selection, advanced synthetic methodologies, and multidimensional structural engineering. These strategies enable fabrication of components such as sulfur hosts with optimized adsorption and catalytic sites, separator modifiers that regulate ion-selective transport, and protective interlayers that mitigate lithium dendrite growth. Furthermore, we systematically review cutting-edge characterization techniques and computational methods that detail the mechanisms behind entropy-mediated improvements in battery performance. Finally, critical challenges and promising future research directions are highlighted for the development of next-generation HEM-based energy storage systems, and the insights presented in this review will guide the rational design and practical implementation of HEMs in advanced Li-S batteries."},{"t":"生物质衍生离子选择性粘结剂调控Zn²⁺溶剂化结构实现水系锌电池高容量正极","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系锌电池粘结剂","kp":["[粘结剂]: 生物质衍生离子选择性","[调控目标]: Zn2+溶剂化结构","[电池体系]: 水系锌电池高容量正极"],"as":"水系锌电池安全性高、成本低，但锌负极的枝晶生长和副反应严重影响循环寿命。该研究开发了一种生物质来源的离子选择性黏结剂，通过精准调控Zn²⁺溶剂化结构，优化锌沉积行为，抑制枝晶与腐蚀。该策略利用生物质材料的可持续性与功能可设计性，为高性能水系锌电池提供了一种绿色、可扩展的界面工程方案，推动大规模储能应用。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Biomass‐Derived Ion‐Selective Binder Modulates Zn2+ Solvation Enabling High‐Capacity Cathodes in Aqueous Zinc Batteries","b":"The electrochemical performance of aqueous zinc batteries (AZBs) critically relies on advanced binders to regulate the solvation structure of hydrated Zn2+ and accelerate the redox kinetics at the cathode interface. However, conventional hydrophobic polyvinylidene fluoride (PVDF) binders fail to achieve this goal due to their weak interactions with H2O and Zn2+. Here, we present a bioinspired sulfate-rich polysaccharide binder network derived from marine ι-carrageenan (CAG), which mimics biological ion channels to enable selective ion coordination and dynamic hydration regulation. By establishing dual ion-selective coordination sites, the zincophilic ─OSO3 - and hydrophilic ─OH groups of CAG form Zn2+─OSO3 - and H2O─OH interactions, effectively disrupting the primary solvation shell of Zn2+─H2O and accelerating Zn2+ desolvation kinetics, thereby enabling adaptive ion transport across the cathode interface. Consequently, Zn||CAG@Mn0.15V2O5·nH2O batteries deliver an ultrahigh capacity of 421 mAh g-1 at 0.6 A g-1, which is 76% higher than PVDF-based counterparts (239 mAh g-1). This water-processable binder demonstrates universal applicability across various cathode materials (e.g., MnO2, V2O5, and organics), providing a green, scalable solution for high-performance AZBs. This study establishes a biomimetic binder design paradigm, where sulfate-hydroxyl dual coordination emulates biological ion transport, enabling precise regulation of Zn2+ solvation and interfacial chemistry.","aip":1},{"t":"仿生可生长人形机器人：基于类骨连杆机构的万能移动能力","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2831?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生人形机器人","kp":["[伸展率]: 315%","[重量]: 350克","[结构]: 仿骨连杆结构","[特性]: 可生长+高承载+抗冲击"],"as":"受人类生物力学启发，人形机器人通常模仿人体运动学，但往往缺乏骨骼韧带联动等关键力学特性。该研究提出一种仿生可生长人形机器人，采用骨骼仿生连杆机构，模拟人体关节的多自由度运动与力学耦合，实现更自然的多模态移动能力。这一设计理念突破了传统刚性驱动的局限，为人形机器人赋予更接近人类的灵巧性与适应性，在柔性运动与可扩展体形方面具有前沿意义。","sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Bioinspired growable humanoid robot with bone-mimetic linkages for versatile mobility","b":"Inspired by human biomechanics, humanoid robots are often designed to mimic human kinematics but typically lack key traits of developing bones, such as growability, lightweight yet stiff construction, and compliance for impact absorption. This work introduces a bone-inspired linkage structure with up to 315% extensibility, weighing only 350 grams while maintaining high load capacity, compliance, and stability. Integrated into a soft humanoid robot, these growable linkages enable dynamic shape adaptation, reducing height to 36% and width to 61%, to traverse tight spaces. By combining growable link actuation with servomotors, the robot switches to crawling mode and moves 1122 times faster than using motors or soft actuators alone. At just 4.5 kilograms, GrowHR can float, swim, walk on water, and fly. Its soft body ensures safe human interaction, allowing hugging, falling, and lifting without injury. Deformable legs demonstrate elastic energy storage and release under external loading, allowing motions beyond the limits of rigid structures. This work pioneers a growable, multifunctional robotic design approach for dynamic, complex environments."},{"t":"羽流通道自下而上分裂引起的夏威夷群岛双边 Loa-Kea 趋势","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx4095?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Hawaiian-Emperor chain has exhibited two distinct Loa-Kea magmatic groups over the past 8 million years, but their origin remains debated. Using paleographically constrained global mantle convection models, we reproduce the present-day location of the Hawaiian hot spot and the associated spatiotemporal geochemical evolution. The composition of the plume conduit shows conventional concentric zoning prior to the Hawaiian-Emperor Bend and gradually evolves to a north-south bilateral zoning pattern afterward, corresponding to the subparallel Loa-Kea trends. Further analysis suggests that the plume originates from ridges of large low-velocity province (LLVP) induced by the push of slabs. Upwelling at the intersections of ridges is more energetic than at the middle of the ridge, causing bottom-up splitting of plume conduit in the lower mantle that propagates upward, forming bilateral zoning and eventually two independent plumes. This process suggests that bilateral zoning is transient and more common in the Pacific than Africa due to the circum-Pacific subduction."},{"t":"BiG-SCAPE 2.0 和 BiG-SLiCE 2.0：代谢基因簇的可扩展、准确和交互式序列聚类","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68733-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Microbial metabolic gene clusters encode the biosynthesis or catabolism of metabolites that facilitate ecological specialization, mediate microbiome interactions and constitute a major source of medicines and crop protection agents. Here, we present BiG-SCAPE and BiG-SLiCE 2.0, next-generation methods that facilitate scalable, accurate and interactive gene cluster analyses. BiG-SCAPE 2.0 updates its classification, alignment methods, and visualizations, enabling more accurate analysis, up to 8x faster runtimes and halved memory requirements. BiG-SLiCE 2.0 updates its distance metric, pHMM database, and classification logic, resulting in increased sensitivity nearing that of BiG-SCAPE. Analysis of 260,630 biosynthetic gene clusters from publicly available genomes reveals that both tools generate concurring estimates of gene cluster diversity, thus providing significantly extended methodological support for recent evidence indicating that the vast majority of natural product diversity remains unexplored. Together, these updates will facilitate global genome mining efforts for natural product discovery and microbiome analyses scalable with current data sizes.","tp":"基因簇分析","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发布了BiG-SCAPE 2.0和BiG-SLiCE 2.0，这是用于微生物代谢基因簇分析的下一代方法，支持可扩展、准确和交互式的基因簇序列聚类。BiG-SCAPE 2.0更新了分类、比对方法和可视化功能，分析速度提升最高8倍。这些工具对药物发现、微生物组互作研究和作物保护剂开发具有重要意义，为大规模基因组挖掘提供了强大基础设施。"},{"t":"基于双层分布鲁棒优化的综合能源系统与加氢站协调调度方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源加氢站","kp":["[综合能源系统]: 含加氢站双层分布鲁棒优化"],"dp":1,"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station ba"},{"t":"伯努利原理介导的 Cl2 电合成","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-66643-6","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Existing technologies for chlorine (Cl2) synthesis are generally suffered from low productivity or high production cost. Guided by Bernoulli’s principle, here we report an efficient yet cost-effective electrochemical system for Cl2 electrosynthesis, which is composed of anodic chlorine evolution reaction (CER) connected to gas chamber by triple-phase gas diffusion layer. The key is to modulate gas diffusion layer by Bernoulli’s principle, wherein the pressure difference at triple-phase boundary drives oriented Cl2 migration directly into gas chamber, thus preventing the crossover of anodic/cathodic products. By further joining with a pH-tolerant catalyst, a standalone prototype device is built for high-rate Cl2 production, operating at the Faradaic efficiencies of 96.3% ~ 87.6% in the current density range of 0.1 ~ 1.14 A cm−2, having superior Cl2 synthesis performance. Further technical-economic evaluations of our synthetic scheme demonstrate reduced Cl2 production cost, saving 6.75% (1.17 million dollar per year) as comparison to conventional chlor-alkali design. We expect these findings offer broader opportunities to develop industrially production processes for other chemical commodities.","tp":"氯气电合成","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对传统氯气（Cl2）合成技术产率低或成本高的问题，研究人员受伯努利原理启发，开发出一种高效且经济的电化学合成系统。该系统利用三相气体扩散层将阳极析氯反应（CER）与气体室相连。其核心机制是通过伯努利原理调节气体扩散层，在三相边界处产生压力差，从而优化气液传质。这一创新设计有效提升了电催化合成氯气的效率与经济效益，为工业制氯提供了新方案。"},{"t":"受益于太阳能：车载光伏辅助供电的太阳能电动公交车最优调度","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000127?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能公交调度","dp":1,"sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Benefiting from solar: Optimal scheduling for solar electric buses with onboard PV auxiliary power"},{"t":"噬菌体通过横向转导动员细菌防御系统","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5749?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"To counter challenges from bacteriophages (phages), bacteria use defense mechanisms that can reside on mobile genetic elements or within chromosomes. These immune systems are easily gained and lost, allowing adaptation to threats. However, the mechanism of mobilization of chromosomally encoded defense genes remains poorly understood. Here, we show that phage- and phage-inducible chromosomal island (PICI)–mediated lateral transduction (LT), a highly efficient horizontal gene transfer mechanism, facilitates the transfer of these defense genes between bacteria. Using several bacterial models, we demonstrate that defense systems are often positioned near phage or PICI attachment sites, allowing them to exploit LT for their mobility. In addition, LT diversifies defense genes carried by prophages and PICIs, driving immune system evolution and turnover. These processes provide phage resistance to new bacterial hosts and profoundly affect population genomics. Our findings reveal LT as a crucial mechanism shaping bacterial evolution and influencing the trajectory of pathogenic clones in nature.","tp":"噬菌体转导","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现噬菌体及噬菌体诱导的染色质岛（PICI）介导的横向转导（LT）是一种高效的基因水平转移机制，能够动员细菌染色体编码的防御基因。此前染色体防御基因的动员机制尚不清楚，该研究揭示了噬菌体如何通过横向转导在细菌间传播免疫系统元件，解释了细菌防御系统快速获得和丢失的分子基础，对理解细菌-噬菌体军备竞赛具有深远意义。"},{"t":"原子级调控自旋交叉协同性以提升分子存储密度","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68796-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋交叉分子存储","kp":["工程策略[自旋交叉]: 配位场工程原子级调控协同性提升分子存储密度"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"自旋交叉配合物因具有磁性双稳态，被认为是构建分子存储位的理想候选材料。然而，提高自旋交叉的协同性（cooperativity）以实现室温下的稳定切换仍是关键挑战。该研究通过原子级调控策略精确修饰配合物的配位环境，增强分子间协同相互作用，从而提升自旋交叉的陡峭转变特性。这一突破有望显著提高分子存储器的存储密度和读写可靠性，为超高密度分子存储器件的实际应用奠定基础。","ot":"Atomically tweaking spin-crossover cooperativity to augment molecular memory density","b":"Spin-crossover complexes are promising candidates for molecular bits owing to their magnetic bistability. However, it’s a formidable challenge to turn densely packed spin-crossover molecules into high-density bits due to cooperative switching dynamics inherent in spin-crossover aggregates. Herein, coordination-field engineering is demonstrated by scanning tunneling microscopy/spectroscopy and density functional theory as an efficient strategy to modulate the cooperative dynamics of surface-confined spin-crossover chains. Within these chains, Ni centers exhibit collective spin transitions upon local stimuli. This spin-crossover cooperativity can be disrupted by coordination-field modification via hetero-metal/ligand doping, which converts partial switchable coordination centers into non-switchable nodes. These nodes divide the single-bit-like spin-crossover chain into multiple independently-switchable segments and thereby augment the bit density. One-by-one erasable write-in of these spin-crossover bits is achieved by scanning tunneling microscope tip manipulation. These results highlight how to precisely tweak the cooperative dynamics of the spin-crossover aggregates to advance their potential applications for high-density memory."},{"t":"气相脱合金中体扩散驱动的非保守相变原子尺度动力学研究","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00644-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","as":"该研究利用气相脱合金化（选择性升华）方法，在透射电子显微镜（TEM）中实现原子尺度的实时观测，揭示了一种由体扩散驱动的非保守相变机制。研究者能够直接追踪原子在升华过程中的动态迁移与结构演化，为理解相变动力学提供了前所未有的原位原子级视角，对材料合成与表面工程具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气相脱合金相变","kp":["机制[气相脱合金]: 选择性升华中体相扩散驱动非保守相变","合金体系[Co-Zn]: TEM实时原子尺度观测"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Atomic-scale dynamics of a bulk-diffusion-driven nonconservative phase transformation in vapor-phase dealloying","b":"In this work, vapor-phase dealloying through selective sublimation within TEM enables real-time atomic-scale observation of the nonconservative phase transformation in a Co-Zn alloy. The transient structure formation, Zn diffusion pathway, and atomic-column reconfiguration were resolved, uncovering the bulk diffusion mechanism underlying dealloying-induced transformation. This insight may pave the way for designing functional nanoporous materials via vacancy-mediated engineering.","aip":1},{"t":"CIGS与CdTe薄膜太阳能光伏作为电动汽车充电站潜在能量采集系统的评估","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏充电系统","kp":["[光伏充电站]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜电池对比评估"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Cha"},{"t":"水系共晶电解液抑制氧析出和氢析出实现长寿命Zn||MnO₂双无电极电池","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01958-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系锌锰电池电解液","kp":["[电解质]: 深共晶水-有机电解液","[电池形态]: Zn||MnO2双无电极电池","[机制]: 破坏水氢键网络抑制析氢析氧"],"as":"水系Zn²⁺/Zn||MnO₂/Mn²⁺电池通过电沉积/溶解反应工作，兼具高电压和高容量优势，但传统水系电解液中析氧（OER）和析氢（HER）副反应严重限制其寿命。本研究提出共晶型水系电解液策略，有效抑制气体演化副反应，显著提升循环稳定性，为长寿命水系锌基储能电池的实用化开辟了新路径。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Aqueous eutectic electrolytes suppress oxygen and hydrogen evolution for long-life Zn||MnO2 dual-electrode-free batterie","b":"Aqueous Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ batteries—operating via electrodeposition/dissolution—offer promising high-voltage, high-capacity grid-storage capabilities but require acidic conditions for MnO2/Mn2+ conversion, and these induce problematic zinc corrosion. Here we present a global approach that identifies deep eutectic aqueous–organic electrolytes that strategically disrupt water’s hydrogen-bonding network, simultaneously enhancing MnO2 reversibility at the cathode while enabling stable zinc cycling at the anode without water decomposition. Such non-flammable electrolytes regulate the cation solvation structure and phase of the deposited MnO2 and its morphology, promoting layered structures with enhanced ion-transport pathways that significantly improve stripping efficiency. These deep eutectics increase the oxygen evolution overpotential well above the MnO2 deposition potential, which completely suppresses unwanted O2 evolution. Moreover, they alter the local environment at the cathode interface to create localized interfacial pH gradients that influence critical processes, including optimizing proton transport and MnO2 stripping. Our Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ dual-electrode-free battery achieves high Coulombic efficiency for extended cycling (>5,000 cycles) without external acid addition, advancing high-energy-density zinc–manganese battery development through rational electrolyte design."},{"t":"美国住宅木材燃烧产生的 PM2.5 对环境空气质量和健康的影响","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz0189?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Residential wood combustion (RWC) is a primary heating fuel in just 2% of US homes. However, the 2023 release of the US Environmental Protection Agency’s National Emissions Inventory (NEI) found that RWC contributes ~28% of total wintertime fine particulate matter (PM\n                    2.5\n                    ) emissions, suggesting that ambient PM\n                    2.5\n                    concentrations could be substantially reduced if RWC were curtailed. Despite its contribution to PM\n                    2.5\n                    emissions, an assessment of the air quality, health, and distributional impacts of RWC using the updated NEI has not been performed. Here, we use a high-resolution (4 kilometers) air quality model and the updated NEI to evaluate wintertime RWC impacts over the contiguous United States. We find that RWC contributes 2.43 micrograms per cubic meter (21.9%) of winter population-weighted mean PM\n                    2.5\n                    concentrations, leading to ~8600 (confidence interval: 6500 to 9600) premature deaths annually. Moreover, nonwhite communities are disproportionately affected by RWC-related PM\n                    2.5\n                    and associated mortality, especially in urban areas. We suggest that policies targeting RWC could substantially reduce air pollution, improve health, and address distributional disparities.","tp":"生物质燃烧","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"美国环保署最新排放清单显示，尽管仅有2%的美国家庭将住宅木材燃烧（RWC）作为主要供暖燃料，但该来源却贡献了冬季约28%的细颗粒物（PM2.5）总排放量。这表明住宅木材燃烧已成为冬季空气污染的重要推手。研究指出，若能有效限制或减少此类木材燃烧，环境空气中PM2.5的浓度将大幅下降，从而显著减轻其对公众健康和环境空气质量造成的负面影响。"},{"t":"基于误差函数SoC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案：用于可再生能源分布式电池储能系统","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池储能SOC均衡","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewa"},{"t":"通过微观磁结构设计在各向异性晶格中实现近各向同性低热膨胀","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S136970212600026X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"各向同性低热膨胀","as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Achieving near-isotropic low thermal expansion in anisotropic lattice via microscopic magnetic structure design"},{"t":"高比例可再生能源电力系统中面向频率与电压安全协调的稳定性约束市场出清与定价方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可再生电力市场出清","kp":["[高可再生电网]: 稳定性约束市场出清与定价"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A stability-constrained market clearing and pricing approach for coordinated frequency and voltage security in high-rene"},{"t":"预测空气源热泵瞬态性能的降阶模型","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000644?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空气源热泵降阶建模","as":"","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"A reduced-order model for predicting transient performance of air-source heat pumps"},{"t":"来自铜绿假单胞菌的群体感应分子在共感染病原体中诱导防御性多细胞性","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513122123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Microorganisms commonly exist in polymicrobial communities, where they can respond to interspecies secreted molecules by altering behaviors and physiology; however, the underlying mechanisms remain underexplored. Here, we investigated interactions between\n                    Stenotrophomonas maltophilia\n                    and\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    \n                    , coinfecting opportunistic pathogens found in pneumonia and chronic lung infections, such as in cystic fibrosis. We found that\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    forms large protective multicellular aggregates upon exposure to\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    secreted factors. Experimental evolution for lack of aggregation selected for fimbrial mutations and we found that fimbriae are required on both interacting\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    cells for aggregation. Untargeted metabolomics and targeted validations revealed that the quorum-sensing molecule\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas\n                    \n                    quinolone signal (PQS) directly induced\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    aggregation, and colocalized with the aggregates. Further, in coculture with\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    , wild-type\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    formed aggregates, resulting in up to 75-fold increased survival from\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    competition compared to fimbrial mutants. Finally, multiple other bacterial species similarly aggregated upon exposure to\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    PQS, indicating a more general response. Collectively, our work identifies a multispecies interaction where a quorum-sensing molecule from a coinfecting pathogen is sensed as a “danger” signal, thereby inducing a protective multicellular response.","tp":"群体感应素","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究调查了嗜麦芽窄食单胞菌与铜绿假单胞菌两种共感染机会性病原体之间的相互作用。研究发现铜绿假单胞菌分泌的群体感应分子可诱导共感染病原体产生防御性多细胞性行为，改变其生理和行为模式。该研究揭示了多微生物群落中种间信号传导的分子机制，对理解肺炎和慢性感染等疾病中的多菌种协同与竞争关系具有重要启示。"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-氢混合电站日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光水电站竞价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid pow"},{"t":"基于非碱性琼脂凝胶电解质的高稳定性锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06236E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池凝胶电解质","kp":["电解质[锌空电池]: 非碱性琼脂凝胶","[稳定性]: 高稳定锌空电池（替代传统碱性凝胶）"],"as":"本文提出一种基于非碱性琼脂凝胶电解质的高稳定性锌空气电池。锌空气电池因能量密度高、成本低被视为下一代电池的有力候选，但传统碱性电解质存在锌枝晶生长、电解质碳酸盐化、空气电极催化活性衰减等致命问题，严重制约其循环寿命。研究团队采用琼脂凝胶作为非碱性电解质基质，利用其天然多糖网络结构固定水分子并抑制锌枝晶的不均匀沉积，同时避免了碱性环境下二氧化碳吸收导致的碳酸盐沉淀问题。实验表明，该电池在长期充放电循环中表现出显著提升的电压稳定性与库仑效率，锌负极表面形貌更加均匀致密。该策略为水系锌空气电池的电解质工程提供了新思路，有望推动其在可穿戴设备和储能系统中的实用化，但凝胶电解质的规模化制备与极端温度下的机械稳定性仍需进一步验证。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A highly stable zinc–air battery based on a non-alkaline agar gel electrolyte","b":"Zinc–air batteries are considered promising candidates for the next generation of batteries due to their significant advantages in theoretical specific capacity, safety, and environmental friendliness. The combination of gel polymer electrolytes and zinc–air batteries further expands future energy storage applications. However, traditional alkaline gel zinc–air batteries are usually constructed by post-stacking methods, and their poor interfacial contact and weakened long-term durability in the ambient air hinders practical applications. Here, we synthesized a non-alkaline gel electrolyte with a liquid–solid phase transition mechanism utilizing agar, and constructed an integrated gel zinc–air battery by direct injection and encapsulation methods. This strategy realizes the integrated assembly of non-alkaline gel zinc–air full batteries, thereby obtaining all-round high stability. The agar gel electrolyte endows the battery with outstanding performance, including a high output specific capacity (706 mAh g Zn−1), a long discharge duration (270 h at 0.1 mA cm−2), and a significant operational life (850 h at 0.2 mA cm−2). Importantly, the integrated zinc–air pouch battery can achieve a high zinc utilization rate of over 80% in various discharge states and exhibit satisfactory cycling stability (>200 h at 0.1 mA cm−2). This technology alleviates the current challenges of gel zinc batteries, and highlights the direction for the development of non-alkaline gel zinc–air full batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"用于工程化改造铜绿假单胞菌phiKMV样噬菌体的全合成Golden Gate组装系统","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525963123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"本文开发了一套全合成的Golden Gate组装系统，用于工程化改造铜绿假单胞菌噬菌体。噬菌体在生物技术领域具有广泛应用前景，涵盖人类和兽医药物治疗、农业病害防治、食品安全保障等，尤其作为抗生素替代方案应对多重耐药细菌感染备受关注。然而，天然噬菌体的宿主范围狭窄且基因组难以理性改造，限制了其工程化应用。研究团队利用Golden Gate组装技术，将噬菌体基因组拆分为多个标准化DNA模块，通过IIs型限制酶实现高效一步拼接，构建了可在铜绿假单胞菌中复制的合成噬菌体系统。该平台支持快速替换尾部蛋白基因以调控宿主识别范围、插入报告基因或治疗 payload，实现了噬菌体的模块化定制。此方法显著降低了噬菌体工程的技术门槛，为精准抗菌疗法和合成生物学工具开发提供了通用框架。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"噬菌体合成构建","kp":["[组装方法]: 全合成Golden Gate组装系统","[目标]: 铜绿假单胞菌phiKMV噬菌体"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A fully synthetic Golden Gate assembly system for engineering a Pseudomonas aeruginosa phiKMV-like phage","b":"Bacteriophages have applications in biotechnology, including human and veterinary medicine, agriculture, food safety, and biosecurity. One example of resurging importance is phage therapy, the use of phages to treat antibiotic-resistant bacterial infections. Phage therapy currently requires screening of environmental phages against the infecting strains for each individual patient, a laborious process that limits the development of standardized treatments. To overcome limitations of narrow host range inherent to many native phages, a robust genomic engineering platform is required which permits rapid and dependable genome production and engineering for nonmodel phage. Here, we describe an engineering platform for a phiKMV-like\n                    Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    phage, 41S1 that builds on previous work in the rapid assembly of small genomes through one-pot, High Complexity Golden Gate assembly (HC-GGA). This system divides the 41S1 genome into DNA fragments small enough to be conveniently synthesized and to avoid toxicity during DNA propagation, with all but one maintained in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    . These fragments are readily assembled in a high accuracy, one-pot reaction; phages can be rescued by direct transformation into\n                    P. aeruginosa\n                    PAO1 or\n                    E. coli\n                    10-beta cells. We demonstrate the precise generation of point mutations, DNA insertions, deletions, and the addition of fluorescence reporter genes that are expressed during phage replication. All viable genotypes could be generated with near 100% success rate with minimal screening. This system demonstrates the potential of HC-GGA for the rapid production and engineering of phages and provides a chassis for the development of phages that broadly target the opportunistic human pathogen\n                    P. aeruginosa\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"数据驱动的染色质模型揭示了基因组组织的空间和动态特征","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530583123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Compacting chromatin within the cellular nucleus presents a significant challenge for biology. Chromosomes must be both condensed and spatially organized to enable essential processes such as transcription and replication. Chromosome conformation capture experiments (e.g., Hi-C) provide valuable information about the spatial organization and, therefore, the connectivity between different genomic regions. These experiments inspired polymer models that describe the physical mechanism of the chromosomal energy landscape. The Full-Inversion Chromatin model (FI-Chrom), a data-driven approach for modeling genome organization, uses Hi-C contact maps to infer pairwise interaction potentials between all chromosomal loci. It combines Graphics Processing Unit (GPU)-accelerated simulations with efficient training of tens of millions of parameters derived from the maximum-entropy principle to determine 3D structures of chromosomes that accurately reproduce Hi-C-like data. FI-Chrom does not make any a priori assumptions regarding chromosome architecture, making it applicable to any chromosome conformation capture experiment. Its derived structural ensembles capture all essential features from the short- and long-range interactions of typical chromosome organization, such as segregated compartments, chromosome territories, and fully or partially formed loops. Although Hi-C contains only structural information, FI-Chrom extends these data by revealing an emergent dynamical mechanism encoded in the inferred energy landscape. For example, simulations show that chromatin loops are not static architectural features but rather transient structural elements. Statistical analyses further indicate that loops confined within a single compartment occur more frequently than those spanning multiple compartments, highlighting the dynamic and compartment-dependent nature of chromatin organization.","tp":"染色质建模","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了数据驱动的染色质聚合物模型，利用染色体构象捕获实验（如Hi-C）提供的空间组织信息，揭示基因组组装的物理机制。模型描述了染色质在细胞核内压缩和空间组织的动态特征，阐明了转录和复制等关键过程如何在高度凝聚的染色质环境中高效进行，为理解基因组三维结构与功能关系提供了新理论框架。"},{"t":"一类 COPI 货物受体通过增强高尔基体保留来调节跨膜蛋白的加工","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512723123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Many transmembrane (TM) signaling receptors undergo essential posttranslational modification in the Golgi prior to their delivery to the plasma membrane (PM). Whether and how the passage and accompanied modification of these proteins across the Golgi is controlled remains unclear. Here, we show that leptin receptor overlapping transcript (LEPROT) and LEPROT-like 1 (LEPROTL1) regulate TM receptor activation by securing their sufficient Golgi retention. LEPROTs localize to cis and medial Golgi in a coat protein complex I (COPI)-dependent manner. LEPROTs interact directly with COPI coats and simultaneously engage a variety of integral membrane proteins with relatively long TM domains at acidic pH. Deletion of LEPROTs in cells causes expedited release of TM receptors transiting through the Golgi. Loss of LEPROTs dysregulates receptor signaling activity, including that of epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) and transferrin receptor (TFRC), due to defective modification. Collectively, LEPROTs serve as a class of COPI cargo receptors for TM receptors, ensuring adequate preparation, which is vital for subsequent action on the PM."},{"t":"一种Period1诱导剂可以特异性地促进小鼠的生物钟","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509943123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"West-to-east transmeridian flights are more disruptive than east-to-west ones due to challenges in advancing the human circadian clock. Transient mammalian\n                    Period1\n                    (\n                    Per1\n                    ) induction was predicted to predominantly advance the clock phase in our previous work. Here, we unravel a specific\n                    Per1\n                    inducer, Mic-628, enabling abrupt phase advance in mouse behavioral rhythms, regardless of the timing of oral administration. Mic-628-treated mice re-entrain to phase-advanced light–dark cycles significantly faster. The direct interaction between Mic-628 and CRYPTOCHROME1 (CRY1) does not simply inhibit CRY1 repressor activity. Instead, the interaction facilitates the CLOCK-BMAL1 assembly, ensuring highly specific induction via a tandem E-box motif upstream of the\n                    Per1\n                    promoter. Importantly, Mic-628-driven\n                    Per1\n                    induction is repressed by PER1 itself. Mathematical modeling indicates that both the CRY1- and PER1-mediated transcriptional regulation fix the phase of\n                    Per1\n                    induction irrespective of intake time, thereby predominantly advancing the clock phase. These findings underscore the potential of selective\n                    Per\n                    expression as a therapeutic approach for human circadian rhythm disorders."},{"t":"矿物-生物聚合物协同准固态电解质实现长寿命锌金属电池","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505241?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属准固态电解质","kp":["电解质[锌金属电池]: DLM@SA@Zn准固态","策略[QSSE]: 矿物-生物聚合物协同"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种矿物-生物聚合物协同的准固态电解质，用于长寿命锌金属电池。该电解质结合无机矿物填料的高离子导率和有机聚合物基体的机械强度，形成协同网络结构，有效抑制锌负极的枝晶生长和副反应。准固态设计兼顾了安全性和电化学性能，显著提升了锌金属电池的循环寿命和库仑效率。该策略为水系锌电池从实验室走向实用化提供了可行的电解质工程方案。","ot":"A Mineral‐Biopolymer Synergistic Quasi‐Solid‐State Electrolyte for Long‐Lasting Zinc Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Combining the high ionic conductivity of inorganic filler with the robust strength of organic matrix is a valid strategy to boost the ion transport and interface stability of composite solid electrolyte, which effectively inhibits dendrite growth of zinc anode and active material dissolution of cathode for zinc metal batteries (ZMBs). Herein, DLM@SA@Zn quasi‐solid‐state electrolytes (QSSEs) are constructed by sodium alginate (SA) and dolomite (DLM) through self‐assembly film technology, and delivers wide operating voltage window (3.08 V), high ionic conductivity (2.22 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    ), and high Zn\n                    2+\n                    transference number (0.84). For the Zn//AC@I\n                    2\n                    cells in DLM@SA@Zn electrolyte, a high‐capacity retention ratio of 82.48% is achieved after 22 000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , and a high reversible capacity of 162.7 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    is maintained after 250 cycles at 0.5 A g\n                    −1\n                    under high temperature of 60°C. These outstanding performances can be attributed to the low zinc diffusion energy barriers, superior structural stability, and strong polyiodide adsorption capability, consequently guaranteeing uniform Zn deposition, ignorable iodine dissolution, and polyiodide shuttle‐free behavior. Furthermore, Zn//NH\n                    4\n                    V\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    cells also exhibit a high‐capacity retention ratio of 81% after 200 cycles at 0.5 A g\n                    −1\n                    in DLM@SA@Zn electrolyte, highlighting its promising application potential in ZMBs, and providing new insights for the rational design of QSSEs."},{"t":"[ASAP] 超声触发 I 型超分子光敏剂，用于基于原位化学发光的精确光动力循环治疗","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15389","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Chemiluminescence-based photodynamic therapy (CL-PDT) addresses the challenge of traditional PDT regarding limited light penetration depth. However, its therapeutic efficacy is constrained by the efficiency of chemiluminescence resonance energy transfer (CRET) and CL intensity. Herein, we introduce a hypocrellin derivative into Ru(II) metallacycle to construct a novel supramolecular CL-based photosensitizer (PS), RDL, for the first time. RDL integrates an efficient type I Ru(II) PS acceptor and superoxide anion radical (O2•-)-responsive CL donor via coordinate covalent bonds, exhibiting excellent spectral overlap between the two components. More importantly, this strategy effectively minimizes the distance between the components, achieving a high CRET efficiency of 97%. Notably, RDL effectively generates hydroxyl radical (•OH) and O2•- under ultrasound (US) activation. Simultaneously, O2•- generated by RDL, along with that overexpressed in inflammation sites, synergistically triggers CL ligand to emit strong fluorescence, which activates Ru(II) PS to produce abundant •OH and O2•-. Herein, O2•- can be converted into •OH via CRET-mediated PDT cycle, which is the most reactive and toxic ROS in biology. Additionally, the US-induced cavitation effect enhances CL intensity, thereby achieving US-triggered and intramolecular CRET codriven in situ cyclic CL-PDT. To enhance the targeting efficiency of RDL, we construct biomimetic targeting nanoparticles, RDL@RM NPs, by coating with hybrid cell membrane shells. The RDL@RM NPs enable precise targeting of inflammation sites, thereby effectively eradicating pathogens in deep hypoxic tissues via CL-PDT. This research lays the groundwork for the development of US-triggered supramolecular CL-based PSs and their application in treating deep-seated bacterial infections."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过配体调节的远程分子内氢键变构构象调节对芳香酰胺金属大环晶体堆积的影响","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18568","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The versatility of supramolecular chemistry stems from rational molecular design, which allows for the precise control over noncovalent interactions to direct self-assembly processes. Inspired by allosteric regulation in biomolecules, where long-range interactions dictate function, we report a novel aramide macrocyclic palladium complex that adopts distinct conformations upon allosteric complexation with ligands based on 4-substituted pyridine derivatives. Modulating ligand coordination strength and steric demand alters intramolecular three-center hydrogen-bond strength at a remote site, leading to inversion of the orientations of remote amide groups. This approach affords direct control over macrocyclic conformation in the solid state, allowing reversible transition between chairlike conformers with weakly coordinated ligands and V-shaped conformers with strongly coordinated ligands. Crucially, this conformational control, achieved through local binding events, i.e., atomic-level ligand exchange, while preserving the macrocyclic integrity, not only propagates to the supramolecular level but also sequentially modulates crystal packing, ultimately guiding the formation of higher-order structures driven by the precise columnar and layered arrangement of the palladium complex.","tp":"超分子大环材料","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"受生物分子变构调节启发，研究团队设计了一种新型芳香酰胺大环钯配合物，该配合物在与4-取代吡啶衍生物配体发生变构络合时可采取不同构象。通过调节配体配位强度，可实现远程分子内氢键的变构构象调控，进而影响超分子自组装过程和晶体堆积方式。该研究为通过非共价相互作用精确控制超分子结构提供了新的设计策略。"},{"t":"三种双功能二萜合酶的结构解析及通过结构域交换与活性位点突变探究产物谱","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17651","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"萜烯合酶结构","kp":["结构特征[双功能萜烯合酶]: C端PT结构域+N端TS结构域"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究对三种双功能二倍半萜合酶进行了结构生物学分析，通过结构域交换和活性位点突变研究了产物谱调控机制。萜烯合酶利用不同线性聚异戊烯基底物催化生成多样的碳氢骨架。研究揭示了催化域与产物选择性的结构基础，为酶工程改造和定向合成特定萜类天然产物提供了分子层面的指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Structural Insights into Three Bifunctional Sesterterpene Synthases and Product Profile Investigation by Domain Swapping and Active Site Mutation","b":"Terpene synthases (TSs) catalyze the formation of diverse hydrocarbon skeletons by using different linear polyisoprenyl diphosphates as the substrates, whose biosyntheses are catalyzed by prenyltransferases (PTs). In nature, some TSs are bifunctional enzymes catalyzing both polyisoprenyl diphosphate formation and subsequent cyclization, containing a C-terminal PT domain and an N-terminal terpene cyclase (TC) domain. To date, several bifunctional PT-TC diterpene synthases and triterpene synthase have been structurally characterized, whereas there have been no structural insights reported for bifunctional PT-TC sesterterpene synthases (StTSs). We here report the cryo-EM structures of three full-length StTSs (EvAS, EvSS, and PbSS), revealing that EvAS and PbSS share a similar PT-driven hexamerization architecture, but EvSS possesses a PT-hexamer stacked helical hollow tubular architecture that has not been observed for other TSs. Domain swapping among the three StTSs shows that not only the production yields but also the major product types of TCs can be greatly affected by different noncovalently linked PTs. The atypical α-helical bundle crystal structure of the TC domain of EvAS was determined, revealing key secondary structures whose positions may affect the cyclization function. Systematic mutations on key residues in the active sites of the TC domains of EvAS and EvSS generated seven new compounds, expanding the structural diversity of sesterterpenes. These results uncover the new structural architecture of bifunctional TSs and expand our understanding of their substrate transfer and catalytic function, and benefit the rational engineering and design of collaborated PT and TC pairs in the generation of terpene molecules."},{"t":"吡啶卡宾配体铱催化剂C–H键硼化反应的反应性、选择性与机理：实验值与预测值对比","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14683","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱催化硼化反应","kp":["[催化剂]: Ir+吡啶卡宾配体","[反应类型]: 无定向烷基C-H硼化"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究系统比较了吡啶碳烯配体铱催化剂在C–H键硼化反应中的实测与预测反应性、选择性和机理。无导向基烷基C–H硼化催化剂可拓展有机合成新策略。研究通过实验数据与理论预测的对比分析，验证了催化剂设计模型的准确性，揭示了吡啶碳烯配体在调控硼化区域选择性和反应活性中的关键机理，为催化剂理性设计提供了基准数据。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Observed versus Predicted Reactivity, Selectivity, and Mechanism of Iridium Catalysts with Pyridyl Carbene Ligands for the Borylation of C–H Bonds","b":"New catalysts for the undirected borylation of alkyl C-H bonds can lead to new strategies for the synthesis or derivatization of organic molecules. Catalysts composed of phenanthroline ligands, in combination with iridium precursors, have led to the borylation of aryl and some alkyl C-H bonds. However, catalysts that are more active or that react with distinct selectivity toward alkyl C-H bonds, or both, are needed. A new class of catalyst ligated by N-heterocyclic carbenes was predicted by computation to be more active for the borylation of alkyl C-H bonds than those with phenanthroline ligands. We show that these ligands generate catalysts that react in ways that are different from the pathways predicted. Specifically, we show that they rearrange to LX-type ligands by cyclometalation and then catalyze the borylation of THF at the position α-to oxygen in the presence of alkoxide, and that they do not react with alkyl C-H bonds in the absence of alkoxide. From computational and experimental studies, we provide strong evidence that the reactions in the presence of alkoxide occur by a catalytic cycle involving an anionic [iridium(III)trisboryl]-Na+ complex that gives rise to the unique selectivity for the borylation of this saturated oxygen heterocycle and substantiate this conclusion by showing that the borylation of arylpyridines occurs by distinct pathways in the presence and absence of alkoxide."},{"t":"[ASAP] 旋转光谱显示 N-乙基甲酰胺-水复合物中的氢键链扭曲肽键","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17420","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Microsolvation and hydrogen-bonding topologies critically influence local molecular geometries and electronic structures, especially in biological peptides, where solvent-peptide interactions can perturb the amide bond and affect conformational dynamics. Although peptide bonds are typically near-planar, how and to what extent local solvent molecules affect this geometry remains unresolved. In this study, we investigate stepwise microsolvation effects on the peptide bond planarity of N-ethylformamide (NEF) using rotational spectroscopy. The structures of NEF microsolvated by two to five water molecules, NEF-(H2O)n (n = 2 - 5), have been determined. Conformational analysis reveals a pronounced nitrogen pyramidalization angle (θN > 20°) in the trans-sc-NEF-(H2O)3 complex, far exceeding the typical ±6° observed in proteins. The experimental nuclear quadrupole coupling constants confirm this distortion, yielding the semiexperimental value of θN = 23.01°. This arises from nonideal hydrogen bonds in its microsolvation topology, inducing out-of-plane displacement of the amide hydrogen and thus driving a twist of its planarity. In contrast, no significant deviation is observed for other microsolvation levels, either more or less. Our results demonstrate that specific hydrogen-bonding patterns can directly perturb peptide bond planarity, highlighting the key role of local solvent effects in modulating peptide bond stability."},{"t":"在苝二酰亚胺基COF中构建杂配铜配合物用于多相金属光氧化还原催化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17585","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF铜光催化","kp":["催化剂[光氧化还原]: 杂配Cu菲啰啉配合物","载体[多相催化]: 苝二酰亚胺COF","策略[多相化]: 框架限域抑制配体交换"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究在苝二酰亚胺（PDI）基共价有机框架（COFs）中构建了杂配铜配合物，用于多相金属光氧化还原催化。传统双亚胺铜光催化剂在有机合成中已有应用，但进一步拓展受限。该工作将铜催化位点整合到COF骨架中，实现了多相条件下光催化反应，兼具光捕获效率高和催化剂可回收的优势，为可持续光催化合成提供了新平台。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Heteroleptic Copper Complexes in Perylene Diimide-Based COFs for Heterogeneous Metallaphotoredox Catalysis","b":"Despite recent advances in developing diimine-containing copper photocatalysts for organic synthesis, further exploration of heteroleptic phenanthroline-ligated copper complexes remains challenging due to rapid ligand exchange in homogeneous solutions. Herein, we employ a framework-based heterogenization strategy to successfully synthesize such previously inaccessible copper complexes through postsynthetic modification. By integrating photoactive perylene diimide units into a one-dimensional covalent organic framework, the visible-light-driven oxo-azidation of styrenes can be accomplished with substantially reduced copper loadings in metallaphotoredox catalysis. Notably, our newly developed heterogeneous photocatalytic platform demonstrates that the reactive copper species facilitates the ketone formation step in the oxo-azidation without dissociation of one of the phenanthroline ligands. These findings highlight the potential of well-defined framework materials to address fundamental challenges in the synthesis of transition-metal complexes and enable detailed mechanistic studies that complement traditional homogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"超越多组分Debus-Radziszewski路线：双组分环缩合构建12+3连接aea拓扑三维咪唑链接COF用于可持续废水处理","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19590","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三维COF网状构建","kp":["拓扑[3D COF]: 12+3连接aea拓扑","合成[高连接COF]: 两组分环缩合","连接键[COF]: 超越亚胺键"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出一种超越传统Debus–Radziszewski多组分路线的双组分环缩合策略，成功构建了具有12+3连接aea拓扑结构的三维咪唑连接COF。高连接数三维共价有机框架的理性构建是核心挑战。该材料用于可持续废水处理，展示了优异的结构稳定性和吸附性能。新型合成路径为设计复杂拓扑3D COF提供了方法论突破。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Beyond the Multicomponent Debus–Radziszewski Route: Two-Component Cyclocondensation Constructing a 12 + 3-Connected aea Topology Three-Dimensional Imidazole-Linked COF for Sustainable Wastewater Treatment","b":"The rational construction of high-connectivity three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) remains a central challenge in reticular chemistry, holding immense promise for advancing framework rigidity, porosity, and functional integration. From both fundamental and application standpoints, diversifying the linkage chemistry of such high-connectivity COFs beyond the archetypal imine bond is essential, as imidazole linkages impart superior chemical resilience, enhanced π-delocalization, and intrinsic polarity compared with imine linkages. Here, we report TU-123, the first 12 + 3-connected 3D imidazole-linked COF with aea topology, synthesized via a two-component cyclocondensation between a D3-symmetric hexakis-aldehyde and a D3h-symmetric hexaamine building block. Unlike conventional imidazole-linked COFs derived from multicomponent Debus-Radziszewski reactions, TU-123 forms through direct imidazole ring formation from aldehyde and amine precursors via an imine intermediate, intramolecular cyclization, and oxidative aromatization. This strategy, previously limited to 2D frameworks, is extended herein to a highly connected 3D network for the first time. Benefiting from its rigid and polarized imidazole framework, TU-123 exhibits a cationic surface character at neutral pH, arising from protonation of nitrogen sites within the imidazole linkages, which enables selective adsorption of anionic dyes such as acid orange 7, with a maximum adsorption capacity of 495.07 mg g-1 and 86.08% removal efficiency under optimized conditions. The adsorption process follows pseudo-second-order kinetics and Langmuir isotherm behavior, highlighting the framework's potential for sustainable wastewater purification."},{"t":"六方空腔中单原子镍工程解锁内置极化实现生物质高效光重整","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520825?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子光催化制氢","kp":["催化剂[生物质光重整]: 单原子Ni@Zn3In4S9","机制[电荷分离]: 激活内建极化电场PEF","活性位点[Ni SA]: 精确锚定六方空腔"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过在六方空腔中进行单原子镍工程化设计，解锁了内置极化效应，实现了生物质的高效光重整。晶体半导体中快速的体相电荷复合是制约光催化规模化应用的核心瓶颈。单原子镍修饰有效调控了电荷分离和传输，降低了复合损耗，显著提升了生物质转化为高附加值化学品的效率，为光催化生物质精炼提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Built‐In Polarization via Single‐Atom Nickel Engineering in Hexagonal Cavities for Efficient Photoreforming of Biomass","b":"Rapid bulk charge recombination in crystalline semiconductors remains a critical bottleneck hindering the scalability of photocatalytic hydrogen generation. Here, we report that precise anchoring of single-atom nickel into the hexagonal cavities of crystalline Zn3In4S9 activates a strong built-in polarization electric field (PEF), which dramatically enhances charge separation. The optimized Ni0.4-Zn3In4S9 shows hydrogen production and benzaldehyde (BAD) generation rates of 48.14 and 44.72 mmol g-1 h-1, respectively, corresponding to 22.3- and 17.4-fold enhancements over the Zn3In4S9. It also exhibits a 42.9% apparent quantum yield at 420 nm and exceptional stability, maintaining over 94.2% (H2) and 89.2% (BAD) activity after 48 h with 6.28- and 14.4-fold stability enhancement for hydrogen and BAD production, respectively. This work proposes an atomic-level design strategy for activating PEF in Zn3In4S9 hexagonal cavities, enabling highly efficient photoreforming of biomass derivatives."},{"t":"将通用设计策略转化为弹性体交联杂化水凝胶：共构建疏水-亲水网络用于电子皮肤","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000428?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弹性体复合水凝胶","kp":["[材料设计]: 弹性体交联疏水-亲水共构网络水凝胶"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Transforming a general design strategy into elastomer-crosslinked hybrid hydrogels with co-constructed hydrophobic–hydrophilic networks for electronic skin"},{"t":"TDRD3 是一种含有 Tudor 结构域的蛋白质，可调节 Klf2 依赖性 Treg 分化和调节免疫耐受的功能","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Tudor domain-containing protein 3 (TDRD3) functions as a methylarginine reader that relays posttranslational arginine methylation signals to the transcriptional machinery, thereby regulating cellular functions through modulation of gene expression. Regulatory T cells (T\n                    regs\n                    ) are pivotal for establishing and maintaining immune tolerance. In this study, we demonstrate that mice with T\n                    reg\n                    -specific deletion of\n                    Tdrd3\n                    exhibit severely impaired iT\n                    reg\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    reg\n                    , differentiation. Moreover, iT\n                    regs\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    regs\n                    , derived from these mice fail to suppress colitis in adoptive transfer models, indicating compromised inhibitory capacity. Aged\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient mice also show spontaneous autoinflammation. Mechanistically, TDRD3 is recruited by the transcription factor FOXO1, presumably in a methylation-dependent manner, to activate\n                    Klf2\n                    expression, which is essential for T\n                    reg\n                    differentiation. Notably, the enforced expression of\n                    Klf2\n                    in\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells rescue both iT\n                    reg\n                    development and suppressive function. Collectively, our findings identify TDRD3 as a central transcriptional regulator of iT\n                    reg\n                    differentiation and immune homeostasis, highlighting it as a potential therapeutic target for modulating immune tolerance."},{"t":"堆叠重叠石墨炔纳米离子电子学增强单价/二价阳离子选择性用于单细胞pH检测","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag050/8440139?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨炔纳米离子学","kp":["[材料]: 堆叠石墨二炔纳米离子学","孔径[GDY]: 亚纳米","[选择性]: 单价/二价阳离子","[应用]: 单细胞pH检测"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了堆叠重叠石墨二炔纳米离子电子学器件，实现了增强的一价/二价阳离子选择性，用于单细胞pH检测。在复杂生理环境中精确测量需要最小化离子干扰。石墨二炔纳米结构的离子选择性通道可有效区分不同价态离子，显著降低了测量噪声，实现了单细胞水平的pH高精度实时检测，在生物传感和纳米离子学领域具有重要价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Stacked-overlapped graphdiyne nano-iontronics enabling enhanced monovalent/divalent cation selectivity for single-cell pH detection","b":"Developing nano-iontronic devices that minimize ionic interference is essential for precise measurements in complex physiological systems. Graphdiyne (GDY), a novel carbon allotrope featuring sub-nanometer pores, enables effective regulation of ionic transport and is therefore a promising material for high-performance iontronic applications. Here, we report a pH-responsive nano-iontronic device fabricated by stacking and overlapping graphdiyne (so-GDY) layers onto the tip of the nanopipette. This so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic sensor exhibits a linear decrease in ionic current under negative potential as the pH decreases from 8.00 to 5.50. This response is attributed to protonation of the oxygen-containing functional groups on the so-GDY surface and edges, which diminishes the negative surface charge and thereby reduces ionic conductivity. A key advantage of this nano-iontronic device is its excellent selectivity, demonstrating robust resistance to interference from divalent cations (Mg²⁺, Ca²⁺) and small molecules within the pH range 8.00-5.50, while maintaining stable detection currents. The so-GDY-based pH nano-iontronic device achieves typical monovalent-to-divalent cation selectivity ratio (<0.4), alongside excellent repeatability, reversibility, and stability. This combination of features yields a biocompatible, high-resolution tool for minimally invasive, real-time pH measurements at the single-cell and even at a single-organelle level, opening new avenues for investigating cellular dynamics and disease pathogenesis with enhanced clarity."},{"t":"通过靶向 FSP1 选择性破坏瘤内调节 T 细胞中的脂质过氧化物稳态，增强癌症免疫力","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3703?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"A burgeoning approach to treating cancer is the pharmacological induction of ferroptotic cell death of tumor cells. However, the impact of disrupting antiferroptotic pathways in the broader tumor microenvironment (TME), such as in immune cells, is still undefined and may complicate treatments. Here, we show that ferroptosis suppressor protein 1 (FSP1\n                    /Aifm2\n                    ) is critically required for regulatory T cell (T\n                    reg\n                    cell) resistance to ferroptosis and their immunosuppressive function within the TME. Compared to other canonical ferroptosis regulators such as GPX4 and NRF2, only FSP1 was induced upon T cell activation. Deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    in all T cells, or T\n                    reg\n                    cells specifically, enhanced tumor control by selectively disrupting T\n                    reg\n                    cell immunosuppression within tumors without inciting autoimmune pathology in mice. As opposed to deletion of\n                    Gpx4\n                    in all T cells, T cell deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    did not impair antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. These results reveal an opportunity for targeting a regulator of ferroptosis that can not only directly target cancer cells but also simultaneously enhance anticancer immune responses without inciting autoimmunity."},{"t":"通过技术服务商业模式和碳交易激励的双层优化，促进CCUS体系的广泛参与","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000339?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"tp":"CCUS商业模式","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"钾离子电池负极：机理框架、电解液/粘结剂集成与商业化路线图","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505727?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钾离子电池负极","kp":["[电池体系]: 钾离子电池","[优势]: 兼容铝集流体、低成本钾盐"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":3.5,"d":8.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该综述系统梳理了钾离子电池（KIBs）负极材料的研究进展，涵盖机理框架、电解质/粘结剂整合及商业化路线图。KIBs作为锂离子和钠离子电池的可持续替代方案受到关注。文章深入分析了各类负极材料（碳基、合金、有机等）的储钾机制，讨论了电解质和粘结剂对界面稳定性的影响，并提出了从实验室到工业化生产的商业化路径与技术挑战。","dp":1,"ot":"Potassium‐Ion Battery Anodes: Mechanistic Frameworks, Electrolyte/Binder Integration, and Roadmap Toward Commercialization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (KIBs) are gaining attention as a sustainable alternative to lithium‐ and sodium‐based systems, benefiting from the abundance of potassium, low‐cost salts, and the potential use of biomass‐derived carbons. Their favorable redox potential, compatibility with aluminum current collectors, and stable SEI formation provide unique advantages, though the large ionic radius of K\n                    +\n                    poses challenges for designing stable and high‐capacity anodes. This review categorizes KIB anodes into five classes—alloy‐based, intercalation‐type, conversion‐type, conversion–intercalation hybrids, and organic systems—and critically evaluates their redox mechanisms, electrochemical performance, and structural evolution. Beyond the active materials, we highlight the often‐overlooked but crucial influence of electrolyte formulations (e.g., potassium hexafluorophosphate (KPF\n                    6\n                    ), potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI), or concentrated electrolytes) and binder chemistries in governing solid electrolyte interface (SEI) stability, ion transport, and electrode durability. We also discuss recent commercialization efforts, including Natron Energy's Prussian blue–based systems, and outline a forward‐looking roadmap that integrates materials innovation with electrode–electrolyte engineering and sustainability principles. By bridging mechanistic understanding with industrial perspectives, this review provides guidance for advancing KIBs toward practical, environmentally responsible energy storage solutions."},{"t":"正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对催化剂实现级联耦合制氢自增强催化循环","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523215?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NiRu析氢催化剂","kp":["催化剂[碱性HER]: NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对","机制[HER]: 正反馈驱动自增强催化循环","耦合[制氢]: HER级联耦合AEMWE"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究设计了正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对（FLP）催化剂，实现了自强化催化循环的级联耦合制氢。碱性析氢反应（HER）是阴离子交换膜水电解的关键步骤。该催化剂利用FLP的协同活化机制，通过正反馈回路自动增强催化活性，级联反应设计将多个催化步骤耦合，显著降低了过电位并提升了制氢效率，为高效电催化产氢提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Positive Feedback‐Driven NiRu Frustrated Lewis Pairs Catalyst Enables a Self‐Reinforcing Catalytic Cycle for Cascade‐Coupled Hydrogen Production","b":"The alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) associated with anion exchange membrane water electrolyzers (AEMWEs) is kinetically hindered by sluggish water dissociation and complex intermediate adsorption, which previous reports have inadequately addressed through isolated optimization, neglecting the intrinsic coupling between HER elementary steps. Herein, we report a frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) catalyst comprising NiRu dual single-atoms and adjacent NiRu nanoclusters anchored on nitrogen-doped carbon (Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC), mimicking the enzymatic positive feedback mechanism that drives a self-reinforcing catalytic cycle and accelerates the coupled elementary steps in a cascade manner. The catalyst featuring spatially proximate Lewis acid and base sites enable sequential reaction steps, where water dissociation occurs at acid sites and hydrogen adsorption proceed at base sites. The two steps are bridged through rapid hydrogen spillover channel, constructing a closed catalytic circuit in which hydrogen consumption at base sites promotes continuous water dissociation at acid sites. Benefiting from this positive feedback loop, Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC achieves a remarkable HER performance and exhibits exceptional long-term durability (>1000 h at 1.0 A cm- 2) in AEMWEs. Our findings demonstrate a new strategy to integrate positive feedback-driven, cascade-coupled catalysis in FLPs systems, offering a promising pathway toward high-performance alkaline HER catalysts for industrial application."},{"t":"晶圆键合铁电界面处的极性不连续、涌现导电性及临界扭转角依赖行为","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68553-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电界面物性","kp":["方法[铁电界面]: 热压晶圆键合创建界面","发现[铁电界面]: 临界扭转角依赖导电性涌现"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究在晶圆键合铁电界面中发现了极性不连续性、涌现导电性以及临界扭转角依赖行为。传统扭转界面研究依赖机械剥离二维材料的堆叠，该方法规模化受限。晶圆键合技术实现了大面积铁电异质界面的精确构建，界面处的极性不连续诱导出可调控的导电通道，扭转角成为关键调控参数。该发现为转角电子学的大规模器件化提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Polar discontinuities, emergent conductivity, and critical twist-angle-dependent behaviour at wafer-bonded ferroelectric interfaces","b":"Probing novel properties, arising from twisted interfaces, has traditionally relied on the stacking of exfoliated two-dimensional materials and the spontaneous formation of van der Waals bonds. So far, investigations involving intimate covalent or ionic bonds have not been a focus. Yet, we show here that an established technique, involving thermocompressional wafer bonding, works well for creating twisted non-van der Waals interfaces. We have successfully bonded z-cut lithium niobate single crystals to create ferroelectric oxide interfaces with strong polar discontinuities and have mapped the associated emergent interfacial conductivity. In some instances, a dramatic change in microstructure occurs, involving local dipolar switching. A twist-induced collapse in the capability of the system to effec8tively screen interfacial bound charge is implied. Importantly, this only occurs around specific moiré twist angles with sparse coincident lattices and associated short-range aperiodicity. In quasicrystals, aperiodicity is known to induce pseudo-bandgaps and we suspect a similar phenomenon here."},{"t":"氧化激活纳米疗法可增强肿瘤免疫力并破坏肿瘤神经串扰以对抗骨转移和癌症疼痛","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1292?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Bone metastasis remains a formidable challenge in oncology due to the interdependent triad of immunosuppression, neuropathic pain, and osteolytic destruction. Current treatments fail to holistically address these pathophysiological axes. Here, we develop a reactive oxygen species (ROS)–responsive liposomal nanoplatform (LipoNCs@pGSDMB) that codelivers a polymeric stimulator of interferon genes (STING) agonist and a gasdermin B (GSDMB) plasmid for dual neuro-immune modulation. Upon tumor-selective activation in metastatic bone niches, this nanotherapy induces STING-driven immune priming and GSDMB-mediated pyroptosis, triggering potent antitumor responses. Crucially, LipoNCs@pGSDMB restore voltage-gated calcium channel (VGCC) expression in tumor cells, a prognostic biomarker identified through multiomics analysis of clinical specimens, thereby blocking calcium-dependent neurosignaling and disrupting prometastatic tumor-nerve cross-talk. In breast cancer bone metastasis models, this approach achieves 94% tumor suppression, complete pain resolution, and efficient bone restoration. By converging oxidation-responsive nanomaterial engineering, immunomodulation, and neural circuit reprogramming, this work establishes a paradigm-shifting neuroimmunotherapy platform that dismantles the self-reinforcing metastasis niche while addressing its debilitating sequelae."},{"t":"新型抗菌纳米细菌素：乳酸菌衍生、自组装和增强，具有卓越的抗菌活性","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511782?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"As antimicrobial resistance emerges as a critical global health threat, food-grade bacteriocin, a kind of antimicrobial peptide (AMPs), offers promising new therapies but is hampered by poor stability and water solubility. To address this, we engineered a carrier-free self-assembly strategy: a novel bacteriocin from lactic acid bacteria in fermented food was modified to increase its hydrophobicity, enabling spontaneous formation of nano-antimicrobial bacteriocins (NAMBs) in TSB, LB, and MH media. These NAMBs exhibit a broader antimicrobial spectrum and enhanced potency against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative pathogens, including Listeria monocytogenes, Acinetobacter baumannii, and Vibrio parahaemolyticus, as evidenced by markedly reduced minimum inhibitory concentrations in vitro and superior therapeutic efficacy in infected mice in vivo. Mechanistic investigations reveal targeted disruption of cell envelope metabolism: in L. monocytogenes, NAMBs fortify the peptidoglycan layer while depleting wall teichoic acids and lipoteichoic acids, impairing carbohydrate metabolism and membrane transport; in A. baumannii, they downregulate fatty acid synthesis, disorder phospholipid composition, and weaken lipopolysaccharide integrity, culminating in membrane destabilization and cell death. These dual actions-disordering metabolic processes and remodeling bacterial cell walls or membranes-highlight the versatility of NAMBs. Our carrier-free self-assembly approach thus overcomes AMP stability and solubility limitations and paves the way for next-generation antimicrobial therapies."},{"t":"手性NHC配体实现的镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物和氯化物的对映选择性还原Heck反应","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525600?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化不对称合成","kp":["催化剂[还原Heck]: 镍+手性NHC配体","底物扩展[还原Heck]: 芳基溴/氯化物"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用手性N-卡宾（NHC）配体实现了镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物和氯化物的对映选择性还原Heck反应。传统催化不对称还原Heck反应多依赖高反应活性的芳基碘化物或三氟甲磺酸酯。该工作突破性地使用廉价易得的芳基溴/氯代物为底物，手性NHC配体控制了产物的对映选择性，拓展了C–C键构建方法学，为药物合成提供了经济高效的新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Nickel‐Catalyzed Enantioselective Reductive Heck Reaction of Olefins with Aryl Bromides and Chlorides Enabled by Chiral NHC Ligands","b":"Despite significant advances in catalytic asymmetric reductive Heck reaction, most reported methods rely on highly reactive aryl electrophiles and exhibit a limited olefin scope. Expanding this transformation to employ more abundant and cost-effective aryl bromides and chlorides with common olefins has remained a major challenge, owing to the inertness of C─Br and C─Cl bonds and the resulting difficulty in achieving chemo-, regio-, and stereocontrol. Here, we report that nickel catalysts combined with chiral dihydroimidazolium-derived N-heterocyclic carbene ligands bearing remote meta-substitution enable highly efficient and enantioselective reductive Heck reaction of a broad range of olefins-including styrenes, 1,3-dienes, and aliphatic alkenes-with aryl bromides and chlorides. Experimental studies and DFT calculations elucidated the origins of stereo induction and structure-reactivity relationships. This robust methodology provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, enantioenriched benzylic frameworks."},{"t":"PrfH亚家族拯救翻译停滞的受损和完整核糖体的分子和结构基础","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7378?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"In bacteria, mRNAs degradation and ribotoxin-induced RNA damage are two main events that lead to the stalling of protein translation. The ubiquitous trans-translation system and several alternative rescue factors rescue the stalled ribosomes caused by truncated mRNAs lacking the stop codons. On the other hand, protein release factor homolog (PrfH) is the only known factor to rescue the stalled ribosome damaged by ribotoxins. Here, we show that a subfamily of PrfH, exemplified by PrfH from\n                    Capnocytophaga gingivalis\n                    (\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH), rescues both types of stalled ribosomes. Biochemical assays demonstrate that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH hydrolyzes the peptides attached to P-site transfer RNAs when in complex with both the damaged and intact ribosomes. Cryo-EM structures revealed that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH uses distinct regions to recognize two stalled ribosomes to orient the GGQ motif for peptide hydrolysis. Thus, using a combination of bioinformatic, biochemical, and structural characterization, we have uncovered a family of ribosome rescue factors that have dual activities to resolve two distinct stalled protein translation events in bacteria."},{"t":"线粒体异质性驱动大豆疫霉的杀菌剂抗性进化，并伴有相关的适应性权衡","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4601?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mitochondrial complex III inhibitors, such as ametoctradin, are crucial for controlling oomycete diseases. However, the increasing severity of fungicide resistance necessitates urgent clarification of its evolutionary mechanisms to optimize disease management and delay resistance development. The DddA-derived cytosine base editors (DdCBEs)–mediated base editing in oomycetes confirmed that the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation is sufficient to confer ametoctradin resistance in\n                    Phytophthora sojae\n                    . We clarified that low-resistant and medium-resistant mutants serve as transitional populations during the resistance evolution process, with high-resistant mutants eventually becoming the dominant population. We revealed the dynamic changes in mitochondrial heterogeneity under fungicide selection, proving that the gradual increase of mutated mitochondria drives resistance evolution. There is a trade-off between ametoctradin resistance and fitness. While the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation confers this resistance, it impairs mitochondrial function and thereby reduces fitness. Up-regulation of\n                    TFAM1\n                    , however, can partially offset this fitness cost. Resistance evolution in plant pathogens involves not only standing variation but also de novo mutations, providing unique insights into the “chicken-and-egg” dilemma."},{"t":"基于广义纳什均衡的岛屿配电网氢储能优化配置：兼顾经济性、韧性与低碳","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000437?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢储能优化配置","kp":["[氢储配置]: 孤岛配电网广义纳什均衡优化"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Generalized Nash equilibrium-based optimal configuration of hydrogen energy storage in island distribution networks considering economy, resilience, and low-carbon"},{"t":"六方相到菱方相转变与极化翻转驱动二维MoS₂实现卓越热开关性能","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72234?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维硫化钼热开关","kp":["温度范围[MoS₂热开关]: 300-1573 K","相变机制[MoS₂]: 六方→菱方相变+极化翻转","[热开关性能]: 超宽温域优异热开关比"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"二维MoS2因其六方相（2H）到菱方相（3R）的相变和极化翻转效应，展现出优异的热切换性能。研究发现通过外部条件触发相变，可使MoS2的热导率在高低状态间实现可逆切换，切换比显著优于现有热控材料。这一发现源于相变过程中晶格对称性变化引起的声子散射机制改变。该技术在可持续热能管理领域具有重要应用前景，可用于热二极管、热开关等主动热控器件的开发。","dp":1,"ot":"Exceptional Thermal Switching Performance in 2D MoS2 Due to Hexagonal to Rhombohedral Phase Transition and Polarization Switch","b":"Active control of heat flow is crucial for managing thermal energy in sustainable technologies. However, current technologies are limited by the small switching ratio and narrow operating temperature range of thermal switching materials. Herein, we demonstrate that molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) exhibits an excellent thermal switching performance across an ultra-wide temperature range of 300-1573 K, based on a reversible transition between the non-polarized hexagonal (2H) and electronically polarized rhombohedral (3R) phases. This phase transition is kinetically limited, and the presence of electric field lowers the transition barrier, dramatically reducing the temperature and pressure required to drive the phase transition. The application of the electric field results in a vertical flip from the out-of-plane alignment along the pressure direction in the 2H phase (\"off\" state) to an in-plane polarization alignment along the electric field direction in the 3R phase (\"on\" state). This phase transition and polarized orientation switching, in conjunction with the significant anisotropic thermal transport properties of both phases, lead to a record-high thermal switching ratio of 15.2 at 300 K and maintains 6.6 at 1573 K. Our findings provide a new avenue for exploring high-performance thermal switch material triggered by phase transition and orientation changes in highly anisotropic materials."},{"t":"边缘驱动边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱与带隙展宽使石墨烯纳米带实现单分子传感灵敏度","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520102?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯纳米带传感","kp":["传感机制[GNR]: 边缘粗糙度增强边缘场效应拓宽带gap提升灵敏度","器件形态[石墨烯纳米带]: 准一维通道离散电子态单分子传感"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"石墨烯纳米带（GNR）因其准一维通道和独特的边缘态，为单分子传感提供了理想平台。该研究揭示了边缘驱动的边缘场效应、屏蔽效应减弱和带隙展宽三种机制共同作用，使GNR对单分子级别的电学扰动具有极高的检测灵敏度。边缘场效应增强了纳米带与待测分子间的相互作用，带隙展宽则提升了信噪比。这一突破为超灵敏生物分子检测和环境监测传感器的开发开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Edge‐Driven Fringe‐Field Effects, Reduced Screening, and Bandgap Widening in Graphene Nanoribbons Enable Single‑Molecule Sensitivity","b":"Graphene nanoribbons (GNRs) offer promising platforms for single-molecule sensing due to their quasi-1D channels and discrete electronic states, providing superior sensitivity toward molecular perturbations. While prior studies emphasize smoother edges as essential for optimal performance, the potential benefits of controlled edge roughness remain largely unexplored. Additionally, most investigations focus on GNR arrays, leaving critical edge- and width-dependent factors, including fringe fields, bandgap widening, interactions between adsorbing molecules and GNR atoms, density of states (DOS) suppression, and electrostatic screening lengths, and their collective impact on sensitivity, poorly understood. Here, we fabricated field-effect transistors using individual GNRs (widths: 200-20 nm) and characterized their response to molecular adsorption with perfluorooctanoic acid as the model analyte. Narrower ribbons displayed significantly enhanced sensitivity, yielding a coverage-normalized response of 116 ± 10 mV per molecule in 20 nm-wide GNRs (from calibrated ensemble Dirac-point shifts). Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this heightened sensitivity arises from stronger fringe fields, width-dependent quantum confinement effects, reduced DOS, and increased edge roughness that facilitates molecular anchoring, enhanced orbital overlap, and improved charge transfer efficiency. Our findings challenge the conventional assumption that smoother edges inherently enhance sensor performance, demonstrating that controlled edge disorder substantially boosts molecular sensitivity in GNR sensors."},{"t":"精准扶贫是否促进了清洁烹饪燃料的采用？来自中国的一项准实验研究的证据","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000182?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"炊事清洁化","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"综合能源系统集群分布式协同优化：基于一致性算法与逻辑函数的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源调度","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on consensus algorithm and logistic function"},{"t":"使用精确的极化多极模型直接观察深度过冷水中的液-液相共存","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Liquid water can be supercooled up to about 50 K below the melting point before undergoing homogeneous ice nucleation. Based on experimental thermodynamic observations and computer simulations, it was hypothesized that below this temperature and at pressures of several kbar, water undergoes a liquid–liquid phase transition (LLPT) and the transition line ends at a second critical point. However, challenges in experiments and simulations at such deep cooling leave doubts about the nature of the LLPT and the existence of the critical point. Here, we use molecular dynamics simulations with a highly accurate and computationally efficient polarizable water model to establish the character of the LLPT and identify the location of the second critical point. Our microsecond-long simulations provide direct evidence of a well-defined moving interface between low-density and high-density water at conditions near the phase boundary. This provides decisive proof of a first-order transition between two liquid phases with distinct free energy basins separated by a barrier, taking a major step toward resolving this long-standing debate. These results offer new perspectives on supercooled water under pressure simulated with an accurate and realistic model suitable for studies of water in confined geological and biological environments."},{"t":"考虑动态交通流分布的耦合能源-交通网络韧性提升策略：多类型移动应急资源协同调度","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600019X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源交通网络韧性","kp":["[网络韧性]: 多类型移动应急资源耦合"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coupled energy-transportation network resilience improvement strategy considering dynamic traffic flow distribution: Multi-type Mobile emergency resources collaborative scheduling"},{"t":"慢性和急性调节剂治疗可恢复引起原发性囊性纤维化的 CFTR 变异的野生型样活性和稳定性","d":"2026-01-25","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523950123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor has transformed the treatment of people with cystic fibrosis (CF) and the predominant cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (\n                    CFTR\n                    ) variant F508del by delivering the faulty channel to the plasma membrane and potentiating its activity. However, the action of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on the molecular behavior of F508del-CFTR is unknown. Here, we investigated the impact of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on individual human F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels using the patch-clamp technique and cells heterologously expressing F508del-CFTR. Chronic treatment of F508del-CFTR-expressing cells with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor, but not pairs of CFTR modulators, stabilized F508del-CFTR, preventing channel deactivation in cell-free membrane patches and conferring upon it the current amplitude of wild-type CFTR with channel activity sustained at a level one-third that of wild-type CFTR. By incubating cells with different drug concentrations, we demonstrated that elexacaftor stabilizes the open-channel conformation of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR, while acute treatment of wild-type CFTR with elexacaftor increased current flow through the channel and potentiated channel gating. Of note, acute treatment of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels with elexacaftor and ivacaftor restored wild-type levels of channel activity to the\n                    CFTR\n                    variant, albeit its gating pattern was distinct from that of wild-type CFTR and characterized by infrequent prolonged bursts of channel openings. In conclusion, chronic treatment with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor plus acute treatment with elexacaftor and ivacaftor robustly corrects the processing, stability, and gating defects of F508del-CFTR. Our results reveal that elexacaftor is a triple-acting CFTR modulator with corrector, potentiator, and conduction activities, making it a valuable therapeutic to rescue\n                    CFTR\n                    variants with distinct molecular mechanisms of CFTR dysfunction."},{"t":"零碳氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池系统集成于船舶混合推进系统的电热平衡特性研究","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000784?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池","kp":["燃料[SOFC船舶]: 氨燃料零排放","[集成]: 混合推进系统电热平衡"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Characterizing electro-thermal balance of zero-emission ammonia-fed solid oxide fuel cell systems integrated into hybrid propulsion plant for marine applications"},{"t":"基于Stackelberg博弈的综合能源系统与加氢站双层分布式鲁棒协同优化","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源氢加注站优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 分布鲁棒双层Stackelberg博弈"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station based on stackelberg game"},{"t":"CIGS与CdTe薄膜光伏作为电动汽车充电站能量捕获系统的评估：印度案例比较研究","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏电动汽车充电","kp":["光伏类型[EV充电]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜"],"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Charging Stations: A comparative case study in India"},{"t":"水系低共熔电解液抑制氧析出与氢析出实现长寿命Zn||MnO₂双无负极电池","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01958-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌锰双无负极电池","kp":["电解质[Zn||MnO₂电池]: 深共晶水-有机电解质破坏水氢键网络","效果[电解质]: 抑制析氧析氢实现长循环"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"水系Zn²⁺/Zn||MnO₂/Mn²⁺电池通过电沉积/溶解机制运行，具有高电压和高容量潜力，但析氧和析氢副反应严重限制其循环寿命。该研究采用水性共晶电解质，通过调控溶剂化结构有效抑制OER和HER副反应。共晶电解质独特的水分子配位环境降低了水分子的反应活性，同时提高了锌离子沉积/溶解的可逆性。该策略使双无电极（dual-electrode-free）锌锰电池实现了超长循环寿命，为大规模储能应用提供了新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Aqueous eutectic electrolytes suppress oxygen and hydrogen evolution for long-life Zn||MnO2 dual-electrode-free batteries","b":"Aqueous Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ batteries—operating via electrodeposition/dissolution—offer promising high-voltage, high-capacity grid-storage capabilities but require acidic conditions for MnO2/Mn2+ conversion, and these induce problematic zinc corrosion. Here we present a global approach that identifies deep eutectic aqueous–organic electrolytes that strategically disrupt water’s hydrogen-bonding network, simultaneously enhancing MnO2 reversibility at the cathode while enabling stable zinc cycling at the anode without water decomposition. Such non-flammable electrolytes regulate the cation solvation structure and phase of the deposited MnO2 and its morphology, promoting layered structures with enhanced ion-transport pathways that significantly improve stripping efficiency. These deep eutectics increase the oxygen evolution overpotential well above the MnO2 deposition potential, which completely suppresses unwanted O2 evolution. Moreover, they alter the local environment at the cathode interface to create localized interfacial pH gradients that influence critical processes, including optimizing proton transport and MnO2 stripping. Our Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ dual-electrode-free battery achieves high Coulombic efficiency for extended cycling (>5,000 cycles) without external acid addition, advancing high-energy-density zinc–manganese battery development through rational electrolyte design.","aip":1},{"t":"面向可再生能源船舶直流微电网分布式储能系统的自适应下垂控制：基于误差函数的SoC均衡方案","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能SOC均衡控制","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewable energy-based DC shipboard microgrid"},{"t":"面向高比例可再生能源电力系统频率与电压安全协同的稳定性约束市场出清与定价方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"新能源电力市场出清","kp":["[电力市场]: 稳定性约束出清与定价"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A stability-constrained market clearing and pricing approach for coordinated frequency and voltage security in high-renewable electric power systems"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-25","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场竞价","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid power systems"},{"t":"mGluR1 信号对于加强发育中的小鼠小脑中获胜者攀爬纤维输入是必要的","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2425460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Functional neural circuits are sculpted by strengthening frequently used synapses and removing unnecessary connections. At birth, cerebellar Purkinje cells receive inputs with similar synaptic strengths from multiple climbing fibers (CFs). During postnatal development, a single “winner” CF is selectively strengthened and expands its dendritic innervation territory, while somatic “loser” synapses are eliminated. Here, we report that deleting metabotropic glutamate receptor 1 (mGluR1) or protein kinase Cγ (PKCγ) in mice disrupts this selective strengthening and territory expansion of “winner” CFs during early development. This impairment leads to weaker synaptic transmission and diminished dendritic innervation territory of “winner” CFs at later stages. Notably, “winner” CF synapses in these mutants exhibit impaired long-term potentiation, reduced AMPA receptor expression, and simpler postsynaptic organizations. These findings reveal a previously unappreciated role for mGluR1–PKCγ signaling, besides its established role in eliminating “loser” CFs, in promoting the functional and structural maturation of “winner” CF synapses."},{"t":"[ASAP] 超声波触发 I 型超分子光敏剂，用于基于原位化学发光的精确光动力","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15389","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Chemiluminescence-based photodynamic therapy (CL-PDT) addresses the challenge of traditional PDT regarding limited light penetration depth. However, its therapeutic efficacy is constrained by the efficiency of chemiluminescence resonance energy transfer (CRET) and CL intensity. Herein, we introduce a hypocrellin derivative into Ru(II) metallacycle to construct a novel supramolecular CL-based photosensitizer (PS), RDL, for the first time. RDL integrates an efficient type I Ru(II) PS acceptor and superoxide anion radical (O2•-)-responsive CL donor via coordinate covalent bonds, exhibiting excellent spectral overlap between the two components. More importantly, this strategy effectively minimizes the distance between the components, achieving a high CRET efficiency of 97%. Notably, RDL effectively generates hydroxyl radical (•OH) and O2•- under ultrasound (US) activation. Simultaneously, O2•- generated by RDL, along with that overexpressed in inflammation sites, synergistically triggers CL ligand to emit strong fluorescence, which activates Ru(II) PS to produce abundant •OH and O2•-. Herein, O2•- can be converted into •OH via CRET-mediated PDT cycle, which is the most reactive and toxic ROS in biology. Additionally, the US-induced cavitation effect enhances CL intensity, thereby achieving US-triggered and intramolecular CRET codriven in situ cyclic CL-PDT. To enhance the targeting efficiency of RDL, we construct biomimetic targeting nanoparticles, RDL@RM NPs, by coating with hybrid cell membrane shells. The RDL@RM NPs enable precise targeting of inflammation sites, thereby effectively eradicating pathogens in deep hypoxic tissues via CL-PDT. This research lays the groundwork for the development of US-triggered supramolecular CL-based PSs and their application in treating deep-seated bacterial infections.","tp":"光动力疗法","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队首次将竹红菌素衍生物引入钌(II)金属环，构建了新型超分子化学发光光敏剂RDL。该光敏剂集成了高效I型钌(II)光敏剂受体和化学发光供体，通过超声波触发实现原位化学发光共振能量转移（CRET），解决了传统光动力治疗中光穿透深度有限的问题。该策略显著提升了化学发光光动力治疗的疗效，为深层肿瘤的精准治疗提供了新方法。","aip":1},{"t":"[尽快] 追踪真实时空中电子转移介导的衰变的复杂动力学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15510","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"When an electronically excited atom or molecule is embedded in a chemical environment as, e.g., in a liquid or a loosely bound cluster, it can de-excite through mechanisms where neighboring atoms or molecules are actively participating in the decay: either by donating or accepting energy or electrons. For such nonlocal decay channels, nuclear dynamics play a crucial role as they have a direct impact on the decay efficiency itself. Here, we present a detailed study of the electron-transfer-mediated decay in a loosely bound triatomic prototype system, combining experimental results from a 5-fold coincidence measurement and theoretical modeling of the decay process. Depending on the decay time, we find that certain classes of molecular geometries are favored for this type of decay. Our findings provide an intuitive picture of how electron-transfer-mediated decay proceeds. In particular, our results confirm a roaming-like behavior of the atoms of the trimer prior to its decay. Our combined theoretical and experimental approach enables a comprehensive tracing of the real-space properties of the decaying system in the time domain.","tp":"电子动力学","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究对电子转移介导的衰变（ETMD）过程的复杂核动力学进行了详细研究。当激发态原子或分子嵌入液体或松散束缚团簇等化学环境中时，可通过电子或能量转移实现去激发。研究表明核动力学对非局域衰变通道的效率具有直接影响，该研究在真实时空尺度上追踪了ETMD过程，为理解分子环境中激发态弛豫机制提供了深入洞察。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 变构构象调控对芳香酰胺金属大环晶体堆积的影响 vi","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18568","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The versatility of supramolecular chemistry stems from rational molecular design, which allows for the precise control over noncovalent interactions to direct self-assembly processes. Inspired by allosteric regulation in biomolecules, where long-range interactions dictate function, we report a novel aramide macrocyclic palladium complex that adopts distinct conformations upon allosteric complexation with ligands based on 4-substituted pyridine derivatives. Modulating ligand coordination strength and steric demand alters intramolecular three-center hydrogen-bond strength at a remote site, leading to inversion of the orientations of remote amide groups. This approach affords direct control over macrocyclic conformation in the solid state, allowing reversible transition between chairlike conformers with weakly coordinated ligands and V-shaped conformers with strongly coordinated ligands. Crucially, this conformational control, achieved through local binding events, i.e., atomic-level ligand exchange, while preserving the macrocyclic integrity, not only propagates to the supramolecular level but also sequentially modulates crystal packing, ultimately guiding the formation of higher-order structures driven by the precise columnar and layered arrangement of the palladium complex.","tp":"大环超分子","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道了一种新型芳香酰胺大环钯配合物，利用生物分子变构调节原理，通过4-取代吡啶衍生物配体实现远程构象调控。调节配体配位强度可改变分子内氢键网络，进而影响大环配合物的超分子自组装行为和晶体堆积模式。该研究展示了变构策略在超分子化学中的应用潜力，为设计可控非共价相互作用的智能超分子材料提供了新思路。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 界面限域各向异性组装策略构筑方形二维介孔纳米片","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18433","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"该研究通过界面限域策略成功制备了方形二维介孔纳米片。尽管二维介孔材料合成已有显著进展，但精确控制其形貌仍是挑战。该方法利用界面处的空间约束效应，引导介孔结构沿特定方向生长，实现了对纳米片形状和孔道排列的精准调控，为二维介孔材料在催化、传感和纳米器件等领域的应用奠定了基础。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维介孔纳米片","kp":["合成策略[2D介孔纳米片]: 界面限域各向异性组装","形貌[2D介孔]: 方形纳米片","可调性[纳米片]: 组分/形貌/尺寸/厚度"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tailoring Square-Shaped 2D Mesoporous Nanosheets via an Interface-Confined Anisotropic Assembly Strategy","b":"Despite considerable advancements in the synthesis of two-dimensional (2D) mesoporous nanomaterials, achieving precise control over their components, morphology, lateral dimension, and thickness remains a formidable challenge. Here, we report a rational interface-confined anisotropic assembly strategy that enables the synthesis of square-shaped 2D mesoporous nanosheets with finely tunable features including compositions (metal ion-doped mesoporous polydopamine or silica), lateral dimensions (100-200 nm), thicknesses (14-25 nm), and in-plane mesopore sizes (8-20 nm). In this strategy, truncated rhombic dodecahedral ZIF-8 metal-organic framework (MOF) nanoparticles serve as seeds to direct the selective assembly of mesoporous micelles onto their six {100} facets. The geometric confinement of these square facets guides the interfacial organization of micelles into 2D sheet-like structure, faithfully inheriting the square geometry. Following etching of the ZIF-8 seeds, the resulting nanosheets preserve their well-defined square-shaped 2D morphology and mesoporous architecture. This versatile approach enables the fabrication of diverse 2D mesoporous tunable structural attributes and metal-ion dopants. As a proof of concept, mPDA-Zn2+/Fe2+ nanosquares, featuring a uniform 2D architecture, near-infrared (NIR) photothermal properties, and Fenton-like catalytic activity, demonstrate synergistic therapeutic effects. Compared to conventional spherical analogs (1.08 × 10-8 M/s), these nanosquares (2.11 × 10-8 M/s) achieve nearly doubled maximum reaction rates and achieved remarkable tumor inhibition of up to 90%. Overall, this study establishes a novel approach for the precise engineering of 2D mesoporous nanosquares with controllable parameters, unlocking new opportunities for applications in biomedicine and beyond."},{"t":"[ASAP] 定制的磷酸离去基团直接途径依赖性自组装","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17237","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Phosphate esters and anhydrides are central to biology, storing and transferring chemical energy to sustain processes from metabolism to translation. Among them, acyl phosphates are highly reactive, yet biology channels their activation chemistry almost exclusively through aminoacyl adenylates. This conserved design leaves unexplored how alternative phosphate leaving groups might influence reactivity and structure. Here we show that aminoacyl phosphate esters with varied leaving groups (ethyl, phenyl, naphthyl, dodecyl) direct peptide bond formation and self-assembly through distinct pathways in water. Structural features of the leaving group guide preorganization into spherical aggregates before acyl transfer and influence coassembly with peptides after bond formation, imprinting outcomes that persist beyond activation. Consequently, the leaving group determines not only peptide yields, but also the supramolecular architectures and mechanical properties of assemblies arising from the same peptide sequences. In multicomponent mixtures, aminoacyl phosphates create recognition microenvironments in which aromaticity, hydrophobicity, or charge bias electrophile-nucleophile pairing, thereby transforming them from simple electrophilic reagents into active design elements capable of driving sequence selectivity. Moreover, soluble phosphates undergo phosphoryl exchange with orthophosphate, pyrophosphate, or adenosine monophosphate (AMP) to generate alternative intermediates that divert reactivity, whereas self-assembling phosphates resist exchange and favor amino acid oligomerization. These findings establish the leaving group as a tunable design element that governs reactivity, directs supramolecular organization and regulates pathway dynamics, transforming activation from a synthetic step into an active driver of recognition and assembly.","tp":"磷酸自组装","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究探索了不同磷酸离去基团对氨基酰磷酸酯反应性和结构的影响。生物体中酰基磷酸酯虽高活性，但几乎全部通过氨酰腺苷酸路径进行活化。研究发现使用不同离去基团（乙基、苯基等）的氨基酰磷酸酯可引导路径依赖的自组装行为，揭示了保守设计之外的替代磷酸化学，对理解生命起源中的能量代谢和翻译机制具有重要意义。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 疏水金属表面单层冰的合成","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17012","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Understanding water-metal interactions is central to disciplines spanning catalysis, electrochemistry, and atmospheric science. Monolayer ice phases are well established on hydrophilic surfaces, where strong water-substrate interactions stabilize ordered hydrogen-bond networks. In contrast, their formation on hydrophobic metals has been deemed thermodynamically unfavorable, with water typically assembling into amorphous films, three-dimensional crystallites, or interlocked bilayer ice. Here, we demonstrate the synthesis of a monolayer ice phase on the hydrophobic Au(111) surface using a low-energy-electron-assisted growth method. Combined experimental characterizations including low-energy electron diffraction, angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy, and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, complemented by first-principles calculations, prove that the monolayer ice phase composes of intact water molecules. This approach provides a generalizable strategy for stabilizing ordered two-dimensional ice on inert substrates and offers new insight into the interplay between water and low-energy electrons at hydrophobic interfaces.","tp":"疏水表面冰","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究首次在疏水金属表面合成了单层冰。此前认为水在疏水金属表面形成无序薄膜或三维晶体，单层冰仅在亲水表面通过强水-基底相互作用稳定存在。该研究打破了对疏水表面水-金属相互作用的传统认知，对理解催化、电化学和大气科学中的水-金属界面行为具有广泛意义，为表面科学和材料设计开辟了新方向。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 溶液环境与活性位点物种驱动二乙醇胺电催化反应性碳捕获的选择性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11791","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化反应性碳捕获","kp":["催化剂[反应性碳捕获]: Ni-N-C","介质[碳捕获]: 二乙醇胺"],"as":"该研究揭示了溶液环境和活性位点形态对电催化选择性转化捕获碳的关键作用。反应性碳捕获（RCC）技术可将已捕获的CO₂直接转化为高附加值化学品，有望降低碳排放的总体能耗成本。研究发现催化剂的活性位点在不同溶液条件下呈现不同的化学形态，从而决定了产物选择性，为高效RCC体系的设计提供了理论指导。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Solution and Active Site Speciation Drive Selectivity for Electrocatalytic Reactive Carbon Capture in Diethanolam","b":"Direct conversion of captured forms of carbon, or reactive carbon capture (RCC), presents an opportunity to reduce the energy intensity and cost of direct CO2 utilization from dilute sources. While amine-based sorbents effectively capture CO2, their use for RCC presents numerous challenges with typical pure metal catalysts used for electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2R). Here, using both theory and experiments, we find that Ni-N-C single atom catalysts are effective for RCC conversion to CO using a diethanolamine sorbent, in contrast to pure metal catalysts. Computational analysis reveals that RCC can proceed directly through direct reduction of the sorbent-CO2 adduct or indirectly by C-N bond breaking facilitating CO2 adsorption and subsequent reduction. We find that the latter mechanism is most prevalent at low overpotentials where we experimentally observe RCC selectivity. We also find experimentally that the rate of CO production for RCC with Ni-N-C catalysts can exceed pure bicarbonate solutions at intermediate sorbent concentration (0.1-0.5 M DEA) under dilute (10-25%) streams of CO2 at low overpotentials. The coordination environment of Ni sites and the solution speciation influence their RCC activity, with changes in protonation to coordinating N/C atoms resulting in changing the RCC mechanism and consequent activity. In situ X-ray absorption spectroscopy and computational analysis reveal restructuring under RCC conditions due to hydrogen coadsorption with DEA that limits the stability of Ni-N-C catalysts. This work highlights the importance of carefully controlling the catalyst and solution environment to achieve active and stable RCC electrocatalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 在蛋白质的任何所需位点进行快速、高产的二硫键生物共轭","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c13581","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Disulfide linkages of proteins are attractive yet underutilized sites for bioconjugation. Their use is hampered by limitations in existing disulfide bioconjugation chemistry including slow reaction kinetics, moderate yields, and suboptimal conjugate stability. Moreover, an intrinsic limitation of disulfide bioconjugation is that it can be performed only on proteins that either contain native cystine disulfide linkages or have been engineered by introducing two non-native cysteines that form this linkage during protein folding. Introducing two exogenous cysteines into a protein is not ideal as it renders it susceptible to misfolding. Herein, we report the StapleAld technology and combine it with the LAP tag technology (LAP-StapleAld) to overcome these limitations. StapleAld employs 2-formylallyl carboxylates for the rapid and quantitative formation of stable disulfide rebridged adducts appended with aldehyde tags for late-stage labeling. LAP-StapleAld integrates StapleAld with a chemoenzymatic approach to install lipoyl disulfide linkages at any desired site on any protein post-folding circumventing the protein misfolding problem, rendering disulfide bioconjugation universally applicable and location agnostic. Building on model studies on small molecules, we employ these platforms for the rapid, quantitative, and stable labeling of the cyclic peptides somatostatin and vasopressin and proteins including lysozyme, maltose-binding protein, eGFP, BtuF, and the therapeutic antibody, trastuzumab.","tp":"蛋白质偶联","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种快速、高产率的蛋白质二硫键生物共轭新方法，可在蛋白质任意目标位点进行定点修饰。该方法克服了现有二硫键生物共轭技术反应动力学慢、产率中等和偶联物稳定性不足的局限，且突破了必须依赖天然胱氨酸二硫键或工程化半胱氨酸的限制，为蛋白质药物偶联物和生物功能化材料的开发提供了通用高效工具。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 自由基 S-腺苷-l-甲硫氨酸加氧酶 DarE 通过部分离域的色氨酸 Cβ 自由基形成醚键","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19314","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Darobactins are ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) with potent activity against Gram-negative pathogens. Their antibiotic function depends on a distinctive β-strand architecture stabilized by an ether cross-link between two tryptophan residues. Unlike most ether linkages in natural products, which arise from hydroxylated precursors, the darobactin ether bond is formed between two unmodified Trp residues by the radical S-adenosyl-l-methionine (SAM) enzyme DarE. DarE catalyzes both O-insertion and ether bond formation using molecular oxygen as a cosubstrate, but its catalytic mechanism remains largely unexplored. Here, we report detection and characterization of a key radical intermediate at the Cβ position of W3 (W3-Cβ•) using isotopically labeled DarA, kinetic analysis, and spectroscopy methods including EPR, ENDOR, and HYSCORE. Similar radical species were also observed in reactions with W3 variants of DarA. These results provide direct evidence that DarE catalyzes ether cross-link formation through reaction of the W3-Cβ• intermediate with O2, revealing an unprecedented radical-mediated strategy for O-atom incorporation in RiPP biosynthesis.","tp":"抗生素合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"达罗菌素是一类核糖体合成和翻译后修饰肽（RiPPs），对革兰氏阴性病原体具有强效抗菌活性。其功能依赖于两个色氨酸残基之间醚键交联稳定的β链结构。与天然产物中通常由羟基前体形成的醚键不同，达罗菌素的醚键由自由基S-腺苷甲硫氨酸（SAM）加氧酶DarE催化两个未修饰色氨酸残基形成，机制涉及部分离域的色氨酸Cβ自由基。该研究为新型抗生素开发提供了重要靶点。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 隐藏生物活性片段的蛋白质组挖掘和化学激活作为抗菌组合物","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20598","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Proteolytic processing of precursor proteins liberates bioactive fragments, yet the systematic discovery of such peptides remains challenging. Here, we establish a fragment-mining strategy that combines in silico prediction with chemical tailoring to generate self-assembling antimicrobial peptides directly from protein sequences, including previously unannotated proteins. Self-assembly proved integral to activity: amphiphilic modification promoted nanonet formation and efficient bacterial membrane disruption, while rational glycosylation reprogrammed physicochemical properties to confer selectivity for bacterial phosphatidylglycerol over mammalian phosphatidylcholine, thereby broadening the therapeutic window. The optimized peptide, C16-KA6-Glc, displayed broad-spectrum bactericidal activity, superior biofilm eradication, and negligible resistance development. In murine models of thigh and pneumonia infection, C16-KA6-Glc achieved therapeutic efficacy comparable to that of conventional antibiotics while also attenuating inflammatory responses. These findings demonstrate a generalizable approach to translating latent proteome fragments into de novo self-assembling peptide therapeutics with clinical potential.","tp":"抗菌肽挖掘","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了一种片段挖掘策略，结合计算预测与化学修饰，直接从蛋白质序列中生成自组装抗菌肽，包括此前未注释的蛋白质。研究发现两亲性修饰促进纳米网络形成并高效破坏细菌膜，自组装对活性至关重要。该方法为从蛋白质组系统性发现隐藏的生物活性肽提供了新范式，具有开发新型抗菌组合物的潜力。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 基于超疏水电极的光热驱动高效CO₂电还原","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19088","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热CO2电还原","kp":["电极[CO2电还原]: 超疏水电极","驱动方式[CO2还原]: 光热驱动"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学CO2还原反应（eCO2RR）是将CO2转化为高附加值化学品和燃料同时实现碳减排的重要途径。本研究基于超疏水（superhydrophobic）电极设计，结合光热效应驱动CO2电还原，显著提升了催化效率与产物选择性。超疏水界面有效调控气-液-固三相界面的传质行为，光热效应则为反应提供额外能量输入，二者协同克服了传统eCO2RR中CO2传质受限和竞争性析氢反应等瓶颈问题，为高效碳转化提供了新策略。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Photothermally Driven Efficient CO2 Electroreduction Based on a Superhydrophobic Electrode","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction reaction (eCO2RR) offers a promising route to produce value-added chemicals and fuels while mitigating carbon emissions. However, challenges of insufficient mass transfer, competitive hydrogen evolution, and sluggish kinetics persist. Thermal activation can improve kinetics, but conventional heating suffers from energy inefficiency and CO2 solubility degradation. Herein, we report a superhydrophobic triphase photothermal electrode (TPTE) that synergistically integrates localized photothermal heating with interfacial gas transport engineering. This architecture enables precise and energy-efficient heating at the catalyst/electrolyte/gas triphase interface while sustaining high CO2 availability, overcoming a classical issue of trade-off between temperature and gaseous solubility. Integrating a Au nanoparticle electrocatalyst with a photothermal porous superhydrophobic carbon substrate, TPTE achieves a 260% enhancement in CO partial current density under 400 mW·cm-2 illumination compared to that under ambient conditions while effectively suppressing hydrogen evolution. Mathematical models verify diffusion rate, and interfacial CO2 concentrations determine eCO2RR performance. Under 400 mW·cm-2 illumination, the CO2 supply rate of TPTE is 50 times higher than that of conventional diphase electrodes. Moreover, the triphase system maintains interfacial CO2 concentrations near saturation, far exceeding those of diphase systems. This work establishes a generalized interface design strategy for decoupled thermal and mass transport management, offering novel insights into high-performance eCO2RR.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] Pd(II)催化不对称[4+1]环化：配体接力实现的卡宾插入/E1cB型Heck偶联","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20265","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化不对称环化","kp":["催化剂[不对称环化]: Pd(II)","策略[[4+1]环化]: 配体接力级联"],"as":"钯催化的金属卡宾不对称环化反应是高效合成手性环状化合物的重要方法，但实现高对映选择性控制仍具挑战。本研究报道了一种Pd(II)催化的不对称[4+1]环化反应，关键创新在于利用配体接力（ligand relay）策略实现C-H键活化与卡宾插入的协同控制。该策略通过配体的分步功能切换，精确调控了反应路径和立体选择性，为手性杂环和碳环化合物的构建提供了高效、高选择性的新催化平台。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Pd(II)-Catalyzed Asymmetric [4 + 1] Annulation via Ligand Relay-Enabled Carbenylative Insertion/E1cB-Type Heck Ca","b":"Pd-catalyzed asymmetric annulation via metal carbene is highly desired for efficient access to chiral cyclic compounds; however, such a strategy remains a considerable challenge. In this study, we report an unprecedented Pd-catalyzed asymmetric [4 + 1] annulation through a tandem carbene migratory insertion/Heck reaction, facilitated by an asymmetric ligand relay strategy. This approach provides an efficient protocol to access enantio-enriched α-alkylidene 3-substituted indanones. A wide range of substrates could be tolerated in the catalytic system, furnishing products with good to excellent enantioselectivity. A mechanistic study has also been conducted, which offers insights into the ligand relay catalytic system. Control experiments and DFT calculations elucidated a plausible novel E1cB mechanism for the elimination step of the Heck process, well explaining the generation of the olefin product of the Heck reaction bearing an unusual configuration. The enantio-determining step is revealed by DFT calculations to be a concerted process involving carbene formation and migratory insertion."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过固态机械化学在配位笼中封装中等尺寸分子","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20185","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"中等尺寸分子在人工合成主体中的包结一直是一项重大挑战，受限于合适尺寸的主体分子缺乏及包结动力学限制。本研究利用配位笼（coordination cages）作为分子容器，通过固态合成策略实现了中等尺寸分子的有效包结。固态方法有效规避了溶液相中溶剂竞争和熵驱动的解包结问题，显著提高了包结效率和稳定性。该工作为分子识别、药物递送及主客体化学中超分子组装提供了新方法论，拓展了配位笼的分子包结应用范围。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配位笼机械化学包埋","kp":["主体[包结]: M9L6配位笼","合成方法[包结]: 固相机械化学研磨"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Medium-Sized-Molecule Encapsulation in Coordination Cages via Solid-State Mechanochemistry","b":"The encapsulation of medium-sized molecules in synthetic hosts remains a major challenge, hindered by both the lack of suitable hosts that combine a large size with high molecular recognition capability and kinetic and thermodynamic barriers to encapsulating bulky molecules in solution. Here, we demonstrate that solid-state mechanochemical grinding of a large M9L6 coordination cage with various medium-sized guests efficiently overcomes these barriers. This simple, solvent-free approach enables the high-yielding formation of inclusion complexes that are inaccessible or form exceedingly slowly under conventional solution conditions. The resulting complexes, featuring synthetic macrocycles and pharmaceuticals, are kinetically persistent in solution for hours to days, allowing for not only their full characterization, including by X-ray crystallography, but also for their subsequent chemical manipulation. The versatility of this method was confirmed with a smaller cage system. This study establishes solid-state grinding as a powerful strategy for accessing metastable host-guest systems, opening new avenues for the structural analysis of challenging molecules and the design of complex, functional supramolecular architectures."},{"t":"[ASAP] N-乙基甲酰胺-水 C 中的旋转光谱显示氢键链扭曲肽键","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17420","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Microsolvation and hydrogen-bonding topologies critically influence local molecular geometries and electronic structures, especially in biological peptides, where solvent-peptide interactions can perturb the amide bond and affect conformational dynamics. Although peptide bonds are typically near-planar, how and to what extent local solvent molecules affect this geometry remains unresolved. In this study, we investigate stepwise microsolvation effects on the peptide bond planarity of N-ethylformamide (NEF) using rotational spectroscopy. The structures of NEF microsolvated by two to five water molecules, NEF-(H2O)n (n = 2 - 5), have been determined. Conformational analysis reveals a pronounced nitrogen pyramidalization angle (θN > 20°) in the trans-sc-NEF-(H2O)3 complex, far exceeding the typical ±6° observed in proteins. The experimental nuclear quadrupole coupling constants confirm this distortion, yielding the semiexperimental value of θN = 23.01°. This arises from nonideal hydrogen bonds in its microsolvation topology, inducing out-of-plane displacement of the amide hydrogen and thus driving a twist of its planarity. In contrast, no significant deviation is observed for other microsolvation levels, either more or less. Our results demonstrate that specific hydrogen-bonding patterns can directly perturb peptide bond planarity, highlighting the key role of local solvent effects in modulating peptide bond stability.","tp":"肽键氢键","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"溶剂与肽链的相互作用会干扰酰胺键并影响其构象动力学。针对局部溶剂分子如何影响通常近似平面的肽键几何结构这一未解之谜，该研究以N-乙基甲酰胺-水团簇为模型，深入探讨了逐步微溶剂化效应对肽键平面性的影响。通过旋转光谱技术，研究人员揭示了氢键网络拓扑结构在扭曲肽键过程中的关键作用，为理解生物分子微观溶剂化现象及其对局部分子几何形状的改变提供了重要见解。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 富电子亚纳米铜簇促进CO₂电还原中的CO-CO偶联","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12495","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜簇CO2电还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2制C2+]: 富电子亚纳米铜团簇","方法[C-C偶联]: ML加速巨正则蒙特卡洛"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了负载于功能化基底上的亚纳米铜团簇在CO2电还原反应中促进C-C偶联的催化机制。亚纳米铜团簇因其独特的电子结构和丰富的低温位点，能够高效活化CO2并促进两个CO中间体的偶联反应，生成C2+产物。研究通过调控铜团簇的尺寸和电子富集程度，优化了CO吸附和偶联的能垒，显著提升了C2产物的法拉第效率和选择性。该工作为设计高效CO2电还原催化剂提供了原子级别的结构-活性关系理解，推动了电催化CO2转化技术的工程化进程。","ot":"[ASAP] Electron-Rich Subnanometer Cu Clusters Facilitate CO–CO Coupling in CO2 Electroreduction","b":"Subnanometer copper clusters supported on functional substrates have emerged as promising catalysts for electrochemical CO2 reduction (eCO2RR) to multicarbon (C2+) products. However, the mechanistic origin of their superior C-C coupling activity remains elusive. Here, we combine machine learning-accelerated grand canonical Monte Carlo sampling with grand canonical density functional theory to reveal how the electronic and structural features of the g-C3N4-supported Cu8 cluster promote CO-CO dimerization. Under increasingly negative potentials, CO adsorption is thermodynamically favored, whereas formate adsorption is suppressed, increasing both the intrinsic reactivity and the statistical likelihood of C-C bond formation. Relative to an extended Cu(100) surface, Cu8 clusters exhibit lower CO-CO coupling barriers via purely top-bound CO adsorption. This is driven by their undercoordinated Cu atoms, which incur a larger positive shift in the potential of zero charge (UPZC) and accumulate more excess electronic charge. These factors enhance Cu-OCCO orbital hybridization and stabilize the OCCO intermediate through strong electrostatic interactions induced by field-dipole coupling. Although some metastable Cu8 isomers are intrinsically active, CO-saturated global-minimum Cu8(CO)15 species dominate under operating conditions because of their high population and favorable kinetics. Our findings highlight the critical roles of the electronic structure and cluster geometry in mediating electron transfer and intermediate stabilization, yielding transferable design rules to enhance valuable-product formation across electrocatalytic platforms.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] InAs量子点电子密度的电化学调控","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21128","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点电子密度调控","kp":["材料[量子点]: InAs胶体QD","配体[InAs QD]: 乙二硫醇","电子态[InAs QD]: 1S1/2(e)可逆完全填充"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了对InAs量子点电子密度和导电性的电化学精确调控。电子密度的控制是半导体技术的核心基础。研究人员通过电化学栅极调控手段，精确调节InAs量子点的费米能级位置和载流子浓度，实现了对量子点内电子态填充状态的连续可逆调节。这一方法使得能够在单量子点层面观测库仑阻塞效应和量子限域效应的演变，为开发可调谐量子器件、单电子晶体管以及量子信息处理硬件提供了重要的实验平台和技术路径。","ot":"[ASAP] Electrochemical Control over Electron Density of InAs Quantum Dots","b":"Control over the electron density and conductivity is a cornerstone of semiconductor technology. Here, we report electrochemical control over electron density and conductivity in films of InAs colloidal quantum dots (QDs) capped with ethanedithiol ligands. The quantum-confined twofold degenerate 1S1/2(e) electron state can be reversibly and completely filled. Increasing the electron population yields four bleach features in the optical-absorption spectrum associated transitions to the 1S1/2(e) state, and state-resolved electronic conductivity which follows the 1S1/2(e) density of states, reaching a maximum of 0.45 S/m at 0.5 electrons per QD. The absence of 1P(e) bleach features and state-resolved conductivity imply a wide separation between the 1S1/2(e) and 1P(e) states resulting in electronic transport between 1S(e) states exclusively. The reversible electrochemistry of InAs QDs films allows determination of the absolute energy levels. InAs QDs of 4.2 nm in edge length and capped with ethanedithiol ligands are natively n-doped with the Fermi level at -4.6 eV, the 1S1/2(e) state at -4.28 eV and the 1S3/2(h) state at -5.54 eV vs vacuum. This work establishes a way to precisely control the charge carrier density and conductivity and gives insights into the charge transport properties and electronic structure of InAs QD films, opening the possibility of making devices with InAs QDs in which the charge carrier density is precisely controlled electrochemically."},{"t":"[ASAP] LMCT与HAT光催化协同实现碳硼烷簇直接B-H键活化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20945","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼簇B-H键活化","kp":["策略[B-H活化]: LMCT与HAT协同光催化","键能[B-H键]: 约100 kcal/mol"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种通过LMCT（配体到金属电荷转移）和HAT（氢原子转移）协同光催化策略，实现碳硼烷B-H键的直接活化与功能化。碳硼烷中B-H键的功能化是硼簇化学的重要目标，在材料科学和药物化学中具有巨大潜力。传统B-H活化面临选择性差和反应条件苛刻等挑战。该协同光催化体系利用LMCT产生高活性硼中心自由基，同时HAT过程促进C-H键断裂，实现了温和条件下高区域选择性的B-H键官能团化反应，显著拓展了碳硼烷衍生物的合成方法学。","ot":"[ASAP] Direct B–H Activation of Carborane Clusters via Synergistic LMCT and HAT Photocatalysis","b":"The functionalization of B-H bonds in carboranes represents a significant goal in boron cluster chemistry, holding great potential for the construction of advanced functional materials and bioactive molecules. However, the inherent inertness of the B-H bond, characterized by a high bond dissociation energy (about 100 kcal/mol), presents a formidable challenge. Conventional strategies typically rely on transition-metal-mediated activation or prefunctionalization of the boron vertices, which may suffer from poor atom- and step-economy and frequently require harsh reaction conditions and noble catalysts. Herein, we report a photoinduced iron-catalyzed platform for the direct and redox-neutral B-H functionalization of carboranes via the merger of ligand-to-metal charge transfer (LMCT) and hydrogen atom transfer (HAT). This method leverages the LMCT excitation of commercially available and inexpensive iron(III) chloride to generate chlorine radicals under mild conditions, which subsequently mediate a B-H HAT process. This versatile protocol enables a diverse range of B-H derivatizations, including alkylation, hydrazination, thiolation, and heteroarylation. Its synthetic utility is demonstrated through scalable synthesis, facile post-modification of products, and the one-step construction of a carborane-based luminogen. Mechanistic studies provide evidence for the formation of a boron-centered carboranyl radical and a chlorine radical, corroborating the proposed synergistic LMCT/HAT pathway. This work establishes a new paradigm for the functionalization of inert B-H bonds, offering a practical strategy for the development of boron-cluster-based functional molecules."},{"t":"[ASAP] 柱撑层状金属有机框架互穿现象的解构与理性分析","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18115","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF互穿结构设计","kp":["研究对象[MOF互穿]: 柱-层型金属有机框架","互穿影响[MOF]: 稳定性/孔隙率/功能"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究系统解构和分析了柱层状金属有机框架中结构互穿现象的本质规律与调控策略。结构互穿是由分子构筑单元组装的晶体网络中普遍存在的现象，对MOF材料的孔隙率、比表面积和气体吸附性能产生显著影响。研究通过系统变换有机配体长度、刚性及金属节点几何构型，建立了互穿度与结构参数之间的定量关系模型，提出了理性设计非互穿或可控互穿MOF的指导原则。该工作为精准设计具有特定拓扑结构和功能性质的MOF材料提供了理论框架和实验依据。","ot":"[ASAP] Deconstructing and Rationalizing Interpenetration in Pillar-Layered Metal–Organic Frameworks","b":"Structural interpenetration, a prevalent phenomenon in crystalline networks assembled from molecular building blocks, exerts a profound impact on the stability, porosity, flexibility, and functionality of the materials. However, the rational design and construction of crystalline architectures with tailorable interpenetration remains elusive, and the interpretation of the underlying self-assembly mechanism is largely underexplored. Here, we report precise control and molecular-level understanding of interpenetration within pillar-layered frameworks built on an 8-connected hexanuclear Co6(μ3-OH)6(COO)6N6 inorganic node, a 3-connected tricarboxylate linker, and a 2-connected bipyridine pillar. Isoreticular expansion along horizontal or vertical directions affords a family of six distinct structures exhibiting varying degrees of interpenetration. Our findings reveal that the degrees of interpenetration generally correlate with the length of the lateral ligands, whereas the specific interpenetration mode is governed by the size compatibility between the individual net and its intrinsic pore aperture. Density functional theory calculations further corroborate the thermodynamic advantages associated with interpenetrated structures. Furthermore, we elucidate the pivotal role of interpenetration in dictating the porosity, stability, and benzene/cyclohexane adsorption of these materials."},{"t":"[ASAP] 羧酸盐与磺酸盐配体在高效钌电催化氨氧化催化剂中的协同作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18855","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钌氨氧化电催化","kp":["催化剂[氨氧化]: Ru-bcs-NH3","配体[Ru]: 羧酸根与磺酸根协同"],"as":"该研究开发了一种高效钌基电催化剂，用于氨氧化反应（AOR）。催化剂设计中巧妙利用羧酸根与磺酸根双配体的协同作用，调控Ru活性中心的电子结构与配位环境，从而优化氨分子吸附与N-H键活化过程。氨氧化是实现氨燃料电池关键阳极反应，高效电催化剂的开发对推动氨作为零碳能源载体具有重要意义。研究通过配体工程策略显著提升了催化活性与稳定性，为设计下一代氨能源电催化材料提供了新思路。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Cooperation of Carboxylate and Sulfonate Ligands in a High-Efficiency Ru Catalyst for Electrocatalytic Ammonia Ox","b":"The development of efficient electrocatalysts for ammonia oxidation is crucial for utilizing ammonia as a fuel. Herein, by employing a hybrid bipyridine-carboxylate-sulfonate ligand, we successfully optimized the primary and secondary coordination spheres of a Ru-based ammonia oxidation catalyst. The resulting [Ru(bcs-κ3O,N,N)(Py)2(NH3)] (Ru-bcs-NH3; bcs = 2,2'-bipyridine-6-carboxylate-6'-sulfonate; Py = pyridine) catalyst achieves a record turnover number (TON = 1.2 × 104, after heterogenization) and catalytic rate (kobs = 230 s-1) among reported molecular systems in organic phase. Compared with the analogues Ru-bds-NH3 (bds = 2,2'-bipyridine-6,6'-disulfonate) and Ru-bda-NH3 (bda = 2,2'-bipyridine-6,6'-dicarboxylate), we revealed the division of labor between carboxylate and sulfonate groups during ammonia oxidation by Ru-bcs-NH3: the coordinated carboxylate provides strong electron donation to lower the redox potential and the energy barrier of the rate-determining step, while the dangling sulfonate group enables efficient proton shuttling without competing with the key active site. This work establishes ruthenium complexes with bifunctional ligand environments as promising molecular platforms for the efficient conversion of ammonia to nitrogen."},{"t":"[ASAP] 控制 Ti(IV) 钳配合物中的还原消除途径：通过 Li 进行协同机制与自由基机制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21215","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxidatively induced reductive elimination (OIRE) is a powerful strategy for the formation of carbon-carbon bonds and has been widely employed in late transition metal catalysis. In contrast, early transition metals, especially titanium, have remained largely unexplored in this context. Here, we report two classes of pyridine-based titanium complexes that are structurally similar yet electronically distinct and investigate their oxidation chemistry. Depending on the ligand, the organyl bound to titanium, and the oxidant, selective alkyl radical expulsion is demonstrated, and most notably, a rare, highly selective, and quantitative concerted reductive elimination from a titanium(IV) complex was established. A combination of quantum chemical calculations, electrochemical measurements, and crossover experiments provided valuable insights into the reaction mechanism. These results demonstrate that appropriate ligand design, particularly the use of tridentate, redox-active ligands, can effectively suppress competing one-electron pathways and allow for selective concerted reactivity. In this way, control over this traditionally elusive elementary step in titanium chemistry was achieved, marking an advance in the development of OIRE processes for early transition metals.","tp":"钛催化消除","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"氧化诱导还原消除(OIRE)是形成碳碳键的重要策略，广泛应用于后过渡金属催化，但钛等前过渡金属在此领域几乎未被探索。研究报道了两类结构相似但电子性质不同的吡啶基钛配合物，考察其氧化化学。根据配体不同，钛上有机基团可通过协同机制或自由基机制进行还原消除，为前过渡金属催化开辟了新途径。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 在苝酰亚胺基共价有机框架中构筑杂配铜配合物用于非均相金属光氧化还原催化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17585","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF铜光催化","kp":["策略[铜配合物]: COF框架异质化固定","催化剂[光氧化还原]: PDI-COF基杂环铜"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究构建了基于苝二酰亚胺（PDI）共价有机框架（COF）的异金属铜配合物体系，用于光催化有机合成。传统含二亚胺配体的铜光催化剂虽已有进展，但在可见光吸收、激发态寿命及光稳定性方面仍有提升空间。研究者将铜配合物嵌入PDI基COF骨架中，利用框架的刚性结构与电子离域特性，实现多组分异金属配位环境的精细调控。该设计策略有望提升光催化效率，为非贵金属光催化体系提供新的平台。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Heteroleptic Copper Complexes in Perylene Diimide-Based COFs for Heterogeneous Metallaphotoredox ","b":"Despite recent advances in developing diimine-containing copper photocatalysts for organic synthesis, further exploration of heteroleptic phenanthroline-ligated copper complexes remains challenging due to rapid ligand exchange in homogeneous solutions. Herein, we employ a framework-based heterogenization strategy to successfully synthesize such previously inaccessible copper complexes through postsynthetic modification. By integrating photoactive perylene diimide units into a one-dimensional covalent organic framework, the visible-light-driven oxo-azidation of styrenes can be accomplished with substantially reduced copper loadings in metallaphotoredox catalysis. Notably, our newly developed heterogeneous photocatalytic platform demonstrates that the reactive copper species facilitates the ketone formation step in the oxo-azidation without dissociation of one of the phenanthroline ligands. These findings highlight the potential of well-defined framework materials to address fundamental challenges in the synthesis of transition-metal complexes and enable detailed mechanistic studies that complement traditional homogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 高熵合金电催化剂的组分相调控","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16422","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵合金电催化","kp":["催化剂[电催化]: 高熵合金","控制维度[HEA]: 组分相结构可调"],"as":"高熵合金（HEA）因其可调控的晶体结构与电子特性，已成为电催化领域的前沿材料。该研究聚焦高熵合金电催化剂中的组分相变控制问题——多主元合金在合成过程中易出现相偏析或不均匀析出，严重影响催化性能。研究者通过精确调控元素组成比例与合成条件，实现了对合金相结构（如单相固溶体vs多相结构）的可控切换，进而系统揭示相结构对电催化活性的影响规律。该工作为理性设计高性能HEA电催化剂提供了关键结构-性能关联。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Compositional Phase Control in High-Entropy Alloy Electrocatalysts","b":"High-entropy alloys (HEAs) provide uniquely tunable structural and electronic properties that enable robust electrocatalysis. While compositional manipulation of HEAs is well-known, systematically controlling the crystalline phase and morphology remains a challenge that could provide new avenues for controlling reactive sites and physical properties. Here, we show the preferential stabilization of mixed fcc/bcc to fcc phases by controlling the Au content in quinary AuPdFeCoNi HEA nanoparticles. This systematic structural and compositional control, when investigated with an ensemble of electronic, X-ray synchrotron, and surface techniques, allows us to identify the critical short- (few-Å) and medium- (6-10 Å) range structural motifs that deliver exceptional hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) catalysis. Specifically, these HEAs exhibit both outstanding durability (240 h) and high mass activity (50 A/mgPGM) normalized to noble metal content, outperforming commercial Pt/C (3.18 A/mgPGM). This structural control over HEA morphology, and its direct association with changes in specific metallic oxidation states and pair-pair atomic structural features, provides new means and strategies for finely designing robust and sustainable electrocatalysts with a majority nonprecious metal composition."},{"t":"[ASAP] 超越多组分Debus-Radziszewski路径：两组分环缩合构建(12+3)连接结构","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19590","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高连接3D COF","kp":["合成[3D COF]: 双组分环缩合","拓扑[COF]: 12+3连接aea"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究突破了传统Debus-Radziszewski多组分合成路线的局限，提出了一种新型双组分环加成策略，用于构建高连接度三维共价有机框架（3D COF）。3D COF因其多孔性和拓扑多样性在气体分离、储能等领域具有重要应用，但高连接度（≥8）3D网络的理性构筑长期是领域核心难题。新策略通过双组分反应精准控制连接位点的几何排列，成功合成出具有罕见高连接度拓扑的3D COF材料，为定向设计复杂三维多孔框架提供了全新合成范式。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Beyond the Multicomponent Debus–Radziszewski Route: Two-Component Cyclocondensation Constructing a 12 + 3-Connect","b":"The rational construction of high-connectivity three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) remains a central challenge in reticular chemistry, holding immense promise for advancing framework rigidity, porosity, and functional integration. From both fundamental and application standpoints, diversifying the linkage chemistry of such high-connectivity COFs beyond the archetypal imine bond is essential, as imidazole linkages impart superior chemical resilience, enhanced π-delocalization, and intrinsic polarity compared with imine linkages. Here, we report TU-123, the first 12 + 3-connected 3D imidazole-linked COF with aea topology, synthesized via a two-component cyclocondensation between a D3-symmetric hexakis-aldehyde and a D3h-symmetric hexaamine building block. Unlike conventional imidazole-linked COFs derived from multicomponent Debus-Radziszewski reactions, TU-123 forms through direct imidazole ring formation from aldehyde and amine precursors via an imine intermediate, intramolecular cyclization, and oxidative aromatization. This strategy, previously limited to 2D frameworks, is extended herein to a highly connected 3D network for the first time. Benefiting from its rigid and polarized imidazole framework, TU-123 exhibits a cationic surface character at neutral pH, arising from protonation of nitrogen sites within the imidazole linkages, which enables selective adsorption of anionic dyes such as acid orange 7, with a maximum adsorption capacity of 495.07 mg g-1 and 86.08% removal efficiency under optimized conditions. The adsorption process follows pseudo-second-order kinetics and Langmuir isotherm behavior, highlighting the framework's potential for sustainable wastewater purification."},{"t":"[ASAP] 动态核极化增强固态核磁共振揭示磷酸化纳米纤维素的原子结构","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17152","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米纤维素表征","kp":["表征[纳米纤维素]: DNP增强固态NMR","发现[磷酸化]: 单/双磷酸酯取代基"],"as":"研究利用动态核极化（DNP）固体核磁共振技术，首次在原子尺度上揭示了磷酸化纳米纤维素的表面结构细节。纳米纤维素作为可再生生物基纳米材料，其表面官能团的精确排布长期难以解析，制约了功能化应用的设计。DNP技术大幅提升了NMR灵敏度，使原本无法检测的表面磷酸基团信号得以清晰表征。该成果为纳米纤维素的可控修饰、生物医学材料及高性能复合材料开发提供了结构学基础。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Atomic Structure of Phosphorylated Nanocellulose Revealed by Dynamic Nuclear Polarization-Enhanced Solid-State NM","b":"Atomic-level details of nanocellulose structure, particularly at its surface, remain difficult to resolve and are therefore poorly understood. Here we apply dynamic nuclear polarization (DNP)-enhanced solid-state NMR to directly probe the surface chemistry of phosphorylated cellulose nanofibers. Multidimensional 13C-13C and 31P-13C correlation experiments reveal both mono- and diphosphate substitution, with C2 and C6 identified as the preferred sites. Quantitative multiCP analysis establishes the degree of phosphorylation and the conformational distribution of surface phosphate groups, while 31P-31P correlations reveal their corresponding spatial distribution. The site-specific phosphorylation derived from DNP-NMR data was used to construct a CNF model for molecular dynamics (MD) simulations, which reproduce the fibril twisting observed by AFM and yield 31P-31P radial distribution functions consistent with the DNP-NMR data. In addition, the MD-derived C6 phosphorylated and nonphosphorylated conformational distribution both within the fibril core and at its surface is in agreement with the DNP-NMR data. To rationalize the preferred conformations of phosphorylated C6 groups observed in both NMR experiments and MD simulations, DFT calculations were carried out and show that these conformations are governed by facet-dependent hydrogen-bond formation at the nanocellulose surface."},{"t":"[ASAP] 芳香族阳离子-π相互作用驱动的可扩展仿生口袋嵌入超分子共组装体用于可控...","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18074","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子CO2光还原","kp":["选择性[CO2还原]: CO/CH4可控","策略[超分子]: 芳香阳离子-π仿生口袋"],"as":"研究通过合理设计芳香阳离子-π相互作用，构建了嵌入仿生口袋的可扩展光催化剂，用于CO₂还原反应的高选择性调控。CO₂光催化还原产物复杂、选择性差是长期瓶颈，该策略模拟酶催化口袋的分子识别机制，利用阳离子-π相互作用精准锚定反应中间体，实现对目标产物的高效选择性。该设计兼具可规模化合成优势，为人工光合作用与碳资源转化提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Aromatic Cation−π Interaction-Driven Scalable Biomimetic Pockets Embedded Supramolecular Coassemblies for Control","b":"Rationally engineering a photocatalyst to deliver high, controllable selectivity in CO<sub>2</sub> reduction (CO<sub>2</sub>RR) is crucial for addressing global energy challenges. However, in organic supramolecular systems, this control is difficult due to the lack of well-defined coordination sites to stabilize intermediates. Here, inspired by induced-fit mechanisms of aromatic π-box pockets in natural proteins like <i><i>Escherichia coli</i></i> maltose-binding protein, we demonstrate organic supramolecular photocatalyst design by embedding scalable biomimetic pockets in two one-dimensional supramolecular coassemblies (TA-1DCA and BE-1DCA), which exhibit dynamic self-adaptive behavior to fit mutative C1 intermediates, achieving high and controllable selectivity between CO and CH<sub>4</sub> in CO<sub>2</sub>RR. The scalable biomimetic pockets of the 1DCAs are constructed through cation-π-directed coassembly of large triangular-prism cages and a three-armed triazine cation. Thanks to the strong adaptability of cation-π interactions, coupled with the cooperative expansion and contraction of the large molecular cages, the positioning and flipping orientations of the aromatic cations around the pockets dynamically adjust to accommodate substrates of varying sizes and electronic environments. This enables the assembly to effectively stabilize distinct CO<sub>2</sub>RR intermediates, guiding the proton-coupled electron transfer process toward a single reaction pathway. Specifically, TA-1DCA's triazine-rich pocket donates electron density, locks *CO, and completes the eight-electron reduction to CH<sub>4</sub> with 95.8% selectivity and >90 μmol g<sup>-1</sup> h<sup>-1</sup>. Lacking these donors, BE-1DCA fails to retain *CO, releasing it instead and giving 79.9% CO at ∼67 μmol g<sup>-1</sup> h<sup>-1</sup>.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 非晶-晶态高熵电催化剂用于大功率铝基燃料电池析氢反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16652","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵析氢电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Al燃料电池析氢]: 非晶-晶态高熵合金","电池类型[新型]: 碱/酸铝-氢燃料电池"],"dp":1,"as":"研究开发了一种非晶-晶态杂化的高熵合金电催化剂，用于金属-空气电池体系中的析氢反应（HER）。高熵合金因其多元素协同效应和可调电子结构，在电催化领域备受关注。非晶-晶态双相结构结合高熵组分的催化活性位点多样性，显著提升了碱性介质中的H₂析出动力学与稳定性。该工作为金属-空气电池中析氢副反应的调控及高效电催化剂设计提供了新范式。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Amorphous–Crystalline High-Entropy Electrocatalysts for H2 Evolution in High-Power Aluminum-Based Fuel Cells","b":"Metal-air batteries have long captured the imagination of researchers and industries alike, admired for their promise of cost-effective, safe, and eco-friendly energy storage. Yet, their journey to full commercialization has been hindered by challenges such as limited power density and troublesome carbonate deposition. In a groundbreaking leap forward, we introduce an alkali/acid aluminum-hydrogen fuel cell by coupling alkaline aluminum anode oxidation with a high-entropy alloy (HEA)-driven acidic hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which transcends these limitations by replacing the sluggish oxygen reduction reaction with the swift and efficient HER. To this end, a hybrid amorphous-crystalline HEA of FeCoNiMnRu has been developed as a cathode electrocatalyst for HER. The diversity of its local structures is key to its high catalytic activity, and the amorphous structure exhibits even greater stability. The hybrid aluminum-hydrogen fuel cell achieves a record-breaking peak power density of 964 mW cm-2 at current densities as high as 1319 mA cm-2, surpassing nearly all alkaline aluminum-air batteries reported to date. Beyond high power density, it also demonstrates impressive longevity upon 220 h of continuous operation at 200 mA cm-2 while maintaining a near-perfect Faradaic efficiency (>99%) for hydrogen production. The hydrogen-production fuel cell may pave the way for high-efficiency power delivery and open up scalable avenues for high-efficiency hydrogen synthesis."},{"t":"[ASAP] 聚合物电解质极限电流密度的批判性评估：离子传输与力学性能的相互作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16267","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物电解质","kp":["关键指标[聚合物电解质]: 限制电流密度","体系[固态电池]: 锂金属负极"],"as":"研究对聚合物电解质中极限电流密度（limiting current density）这一核心概念进行了批判性再评估。极限电流密度是理解锂金属固态电池中枝晶生长与界面不稳定性的关键参数。论文系统分析了现有测试方法和理论模型的局限性，指出传统Sand方程在固态电解质体系中的适用边界，揭示了离子输运、空间电荷层与界面接触对电流极限的耦合影响，为固态电池安全设计提供更准确的判据。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] A Critical Evaluation of the Limiting Current Density in Polymer Electrolytes: Interplay of Ion Transport, Mechan","b":"Solid-state batteries with lithium metal anodes are among the promising candidates to fulfill the actual requirements of growing energy demands in comparison to commercially available lithium-ion batteries, despite the current challenges of inhomogeneous lithium metal deposition upon cycling. In the present literature, the limiting current density is referred to as a key performance indicator for faster charging of solid-state batteries, though from a practical point of view, it is defined as the maximum endurable current density that might be applied without possible cell failure. In this study, we evaluate the obtained values of limiting current densities for lithium metal batteries operating with polymer electrolytes. Notably, we critically compare various experimental procedures to determine the actual limiting current density and discuss the impact of external factors such as scan rate, temperature, and applied cell pressure, thereby invoking model-type PEO-based electrolytes to examine available mechanical properties that may afford suppression of lithium dendrite formation. In fact, we demonstrate that experimentally derived limiting current densities are not intrinsic electrolyte characteristics but rather entities strongly dependent on the applied conditions and hence should ideally be determined based on different techniques to deliver meaningful data."},{"t":"[ASAP] 河豚毒素的16步规模化化学酶法合成","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20700","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"河豚毒素全合成","kp":["合成步数[河豚毒素]: 16步(此前22-69)","方法[TTX]: 化学酶法","活性[TTX]: 纳摩尔级阻断钠通道"],"as":"研究报道了一种16步可规模化化学-酶促合成河豚毒素（TTX）的新路线。TTX是一种强效神经毒素，选择性阻断电压门控钠离子通道，同时也是极具前景的镇痛候选药物，但天然来源稀缺、全合成困难限制了其应用。该路线结合化学合成与生物催化的高效性和立体选择性，显著缩短了合成步骤并提高了总收率，为TTX的药理学研究及镇痛药物开发提供了可持续的供应路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] 16-Step Scalable Chemoenzymatic Synthesis of Tetrodotoxin","b":"Tetrodotoxin (TTX) is a potent neurotoxin and a promising analgesic that selectively blocks voltage-gated sodium channels at nanomolar concentrations. Its complex structure features an octa-substituted cyclohexane core, excessive polar functionalities, and exceedingly high (1:1) heteroatom-to-carbon ratio. Prior syntheses required 22-69 steps from heavily oxygenated starting materials, with excessive protecting group and functional group manipulations. Here, we report a scalable 16-step synthesis from simple parabromobenzyl alcohol via a distinct chemoenzymatic strategy. Key to this approach is a strategic merger of engineered enzyme-catalyzed arene dihydroxylation and two sequential cycloaddition-fragmentation reactions, which rapidly culminate in the densely substituted cyclohexane core. Late-stage neighboring-group-assisted chemoselective nitrile reduction enables efficient guanidine installation to complete the total synthesis. This work provides a concise route to TTX and a blueprint for synthesizing other densely oxygenated, biologically significant molecules.","aip":1},{"t":"Zn²⁺工程化低势垒LiNbO₃实现可见光可编程铁电忆阻器用于抗噪类神经计算","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511352?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电忆阻器","kp":["工程[LiNbO3]: Zn²⁺掺杂降极化能垒","器件[忆阻器]: 可见光编程铁电"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过Zn²⁺离子工程化改性LiNbO₃（铌酸锂）材料，实现了低势垒铁电忆阻器，用于抗噪声神经形态计算。LiNbO₃因其独特的铁电极化和优异光学性能在光电器件领域具有重要地位。Zn²⁺掺杂有效降低了铁电畴翻转的势垒，使器件能在可见光照射下实现可编程的阻态调控。该铁电忆阻器兼具光学可编程性和电学存储功能，在模拟生物突触可塑性方面表现出优异的抗噪声鲁棒性。该工作为开发可见光驱动的神经形态计算硬件和光电融合智能器件开辟了新路径。","ot":"Zn2+ Engineered Low‐Barrier LiNbO3 Enables Visible‐Light Programmable Ferroelectric Memristors for Noise‐Immune Neuromor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium niobate (LiNbO\n                    3\n                    ), owing to its unique ferroelectric polarization and excellent optical properties, has shown great potential in high‐performance optoelectronic integrated devices. However, the high polarization switching energy barrier makes it difficult to achieve polarization reversal under low‐power visible light, severely limiting its practical applicability. Here, Zn\n                    2+\n                    ions were doped into the LiNbO\n                    3\n                    lattice to modulate the local lattice structure via valence‐state imbalance, effectively suppressing the formation of Nb\n                    Li\n                    4+\n                    antisite defects and reducing electron‐trap density. Meanwhile, the narrowed bandgap enhanced carrier excitation efficiency and improved depolarization‐field screening, lowering the polarization switching energy barrier by approximately 69% and enabling polarization reversal under low‐energy visible light illumination (10 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Accordingly, the fabricated Pt/Zn‐LiNbO\n                    3\n                    /Nb:SrTiO\n                    3\n                    optoelectronic bimodal memristor exhibits ultra‐stable switching voltage characteristics, with a voltage coefficient of variation as low as 2.2%–3.2%; a high on/off ratio of approximately 10\n                    3\n                    ; 2\n                    4\n                    clearly distinguishable resistance states; retention exceeding 10\n                    4\n                    s; and excellent endurance up to 10\n                    8\n                    cycles. Under visible light stimulation, the device emulates multiple representative synaptic functions, including short‐term to long‐term memory (STP–LTP) transition, paired‐pulse facilitation (PPF), and associative learning. Moreover, an optical reservoir computing neural network constructed from the device's multilevel optical memory and synaptic features achieves a high recognition accuracy of 98.6% on the noise‐corrupted MNIST dataset, demonstrating robustness and visual recognition capability comparable to biological systems. This study proposes a new materials design paradigm for constructing low‐barrier, high‐performance ferroelectric optoelectronic systems with integrated sensing, storage, and computation functionalities.","aip":1},{"t":"写入与擦除：大环效应物在水相中调控亚胺表达","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00425-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"大环超分子调控","kp":["机制[亚胺调控]: 大环模拟酶翻译后修饰","写入[超分子]: 正交写入选择组分","擦除[超分子]: 引入清除剂恢复平衡"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了大环效应分子在水中调控亚胺表达的可逆写入-擦除机制。大环化合物模拟了酶促翻译后修饰的作用模式，能够在水相环境中通过主客体识别选择性稳定或释放亚胺中间体。亚胺（Schiff碱）在水中通常不稳定，该体系利用大环的限域空腔为亚胺提供了热力学和动力学保护，实现了对亚胺生成与分解的精准时空调控。这一策略为水相有机合成、动态组合化学以及仿生催化体系设计提供了新思路，展示了超分子化学在控制活泼反应中间体方面的独特优势。","ot":"Write and erase: Macrocyclic effectors regulate imine expression in water","b":"Macrocycles mimic the mode of action of enzymatic post-translational modifications and control imine expression in water. Orthogonal writing actions by the supramolecular hosts lead to constituent selection from a scrambled mixture of species. The introduction of scavengers—species with a higher affinity for the macrocycles—erases the effect and restores the native equilibrium state, paving the way for the regulation of the expression of the library on demand."},{"t":"10 亿美元的承诺对 CERN 雄心勃勃的超级对撞机计划意味着什么","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00233-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"以水为中心的限域催化框架：超越纳米材料","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00423-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"限域催化","kp":["框架[限域催化]: 以水为中心","角色[水]: 活性结构组分调控反应"],"dp":1,"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该视角文章提出了以水为中心的限域催化理论框架，超越了传统纳米材料限域催化的范畴。文章重新审视限域效应，将水定位为限域体系中的活性构建者而非惰性溶剂。在纳米限域空间内，水的氢键网络、介电性质和质子传输行为发生显著改变，从而主动调控催化反应路径和选择性。该框架整合了限域结构-水行为-催化活性三者的耦合关系，为理解多相催化、电催化和酶催化中水的作用提供了统一视角，对设计高效液相催化体系和绿色化学过程具有重要指导意义。","ot":"Water-centric framework for confinement catalysis: Beyond nanomaterials","b":"This perspective reframes confinement effects by adopting a water-centric lens, positioning water as an active architectural component that governs reactivity across spatial, cage, and interfacial environments. Quantifying the structural and dynamic properties of confined and confining water networks provides a foundational blueprint for the rational design of next-generation catalysts for sustainable chemistry."},{"t":"重视混合能源系统的操作灵活性：汉密尔顿-雅可比-贝尔曼方程的神经解","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600070X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"混合能源优化","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"基于流动池中原位X射线散射揭示锂介导氮还原与氢演化机制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06529A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学合成氨","kp":["体系[电化学合成氨]: 锂介导氮还原(Li-NRR)","[表征方法]: operando GI WAXS","[电池设计]: 流动池，阳极氢氧化替代牺牲质子给体"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用原位X射线散射技术，在配备氢氧化膜电极的流动池中揭示了锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）的机制。Li-NRR是目前最具前景的电化学合成氨策略之一，但其反应机理尚存争议。研究通过 operando 同步辐射X射线衍射和小角散射，实时追踪了锂金属沉积、氮化锂（Li₃N）中间体形成及其质子化生成NH₃的全过程。结果表明氢氧化膜在质子传输和选择性调控中发挥关键作用，有效抑制了竞争性析氢反应。该工作为理解Li-NRR机理提供了直接实验证据，为设计高效电化学合成氨体系指明了方向。","ot":"Unveiling the mechanism of lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction via operando X-ray scattering in a flow cell with hydroge","b":"The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is currently the most promising strategy for electrochemical ammonia synthesis. In this study, we present an operando grazing incidence wide angle X-ray scattering (GI WAXS) investigation using an improved electrochemical flow cell that enables hydrogen oxidation at the anode and thereby eliminates the need of a sacrificial proton donor. The improved cell design also increases nitrogen availability and mass transport, achieving ammonia faradaic efficiencies (FEs) up to 36%. This setup allows direct analysis of reaction intermediates and the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) using state-of-the-art diglyme-based electrolytes. We identify lithium amide (LiNH2) as the only stable, crystalline intermediate, providing direct insight into the Li-NRR mechanism. Notably, in diglyme-based electrolytes, the SEI composition differs significantly from that in tetrahydrofuran-based systems, with reduced LiF content and the formation of previously unreported crystalline diglyme–lithium salt complexes. These species likely influence ammonia selectivity and long-term stability. Our findings highlight how the electrolyte composition and cell architecture govern Li-NRR selectivity and efficiency, offering a foundation for the rational design of next-generation SEI layers and solid electrolytes to enable scalable electrochemical ammonia synthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"解开强相关 kagome 金属 CsCr3Sb5 中相互交织的秩序","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag044/8437941?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"While correlated phenomena of flat bands have been extensively studied in twisted systems, the ordered states that emerge from interactions in the intrinsic flat bands of kagome lattice materials remain largely unexplored. The newly discovered kagome metal CsCr3Sb5 offers a unique and rich platform for this research, as its multi-orbital flat bands at the Fermi surface result in a complex interplay of pressurized superconductivity, antiferromagnetism, a structural phase transition, and density wave orders. Here, using ultrafast optical techniques, we provide strong spectroscopic evidence for a charge density wave transition in CsCr3Sb5, resolving previous ambiguities. Crucially, we identify rotational symmetry breaking that manifests as a three-state Potts-type nematicity. Our elastoresistance measurements directly demonstrate the electronic origin of this order, as the rotational-symmetry-breaking E","tp":"拓扑关联金属","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究聚焦新发现的kagome金属CsCr3Sb5，其费米面多轨道平带带来了丰富的关联现象。研究发现该材料展现出加压超导、反铁磁有序、结构相变和密度波等多种交织的有序态之间复杂的相互作用。该材料为研究kagome晶格本征平带中关联效应驱动的有序态提供了独特平台，对理解关联量子物质有重要意义。"},{"t":"通过单原子镍工程化六方空腔解锁本征极化实现高效光重整","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520825?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子光催化产氢","kp":["催化剂[生物质光重整]: Ni-Zn3In4S9单原子","机制[单原子Ni]: 激活内置极化电场"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过在六方空腔中进行单原子镍工程化改性，解锁了内建极化效应，实现了有机聚合物的高效光重整。结晶半导体中快速的体相电荷复合是阻碍光催化技术规模化的关键瓶颈。研究将单原子Ni位点精准锚定在半导体六方空腔中，利用Ni单原子与晶格的对称性失配诱导出强烈的内建极化电场，有效促进了光生载流子的空间分离和定向迁移。该策略显著抑制了电荷复合损失，大幅提升了光重整反应中有机废物降解和产氢的效率，为设计高效光催化材料提供了单原子工程的新范式。","ot":"Unlocking Built‐In Polarization via Single‐Atom Nickel Engineering in Hexagonal Cavities for Efficient Photoreforming of","b":"Rapid bulk charge recombination in crystalline semiconductors remains a critical bottleneck hindering the scalability of photocatalytic hydrogen generation. Here, we report that precise anchoring of single-atom nickel into the hexagonal cavities of crystalline Zn3In4S9 activates a strong built-in polarization electric field (PEF), which dramatically enhances charge separation. The optimized Ni0.4-Zn3In4S9 shows hydrogen production and benzaldehyde (BAD) generation rates of 48.14 and 44.72 mmol g-1 h-1, respectively, corresponding to 22.3- and 17.4-fold enhancements over the Zn3In4S9. It also exhibits a 42.9% apparent quantum yield at 420 nm and exceptional stability, maintaining over 94.2% (H2) and 89.2% (BAD) activity after 48 h with 6.28- and 14.4-fold stability enhancement for hydrogen and BAD production, respectively. This work proposes an atomic-level design strategy for activating PEF in Zn3In4S9 hexagonal cavities, enabling highly efficient photoreforming of biomass derivatives.","aip":1},{"t":"可扩展模组用均匀单片钙钛矿薄膜：基于种子引发与真空辅助的无反溶剂结晶","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506521?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿组件结晶","kp":["结晶策略[钙钛矿组件]: 种子引发-真空辅助结晶(S-VAC)","[种子]: 油胺诱导α相纳米晶","[工艺]: 无反溶剂、真空驱动垂直晶体生长","[应用]: 可扩展均匀单片钙钛矿膜"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种无反溶剂的种子引发-真空辅助结晶策略，用于制备均匀单片钙钛矿薄膜，实现高效钙钛矿太阳能组件的规模化制备。将高效率钙钛矿太阳能电池放大为商业级组件仍面临巨大挑战。传统反溶剂法难以在大面积基底上实现均匀结晶。该种子引发策略通过预置钙钛矿晶种降低成核势垒，配合真空抽气控制溶剂挥发速率，实现了大面积薄膜的均匀致密结晶。基于该方法制备的小型电池和组件均获得了高效率和高重复性，为钙钛矿光伏组件的无反溶剂工业化量产提供了可行路径。","ot":"Uniform Monolithic Perovskite Films for Scalable Modules: Anti‐Solvent‐Free Crystallization via Seed Priming and Vacuum ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Scaling high‐efficiency perovskite solar cells into commercially viable modules remains challenging. Here, we demonstrate a seed‐primed, vacuum‐assisted crystallization (S‐VAC) strategy that links oleylamine‐induced α‐phase nanocrystal seeding to vacuum‐driven vertical crystal growth. Complementary in situ characterization, including time‐resolved GIWAXS, solution‐state NMR, and dynamic light scattering (DLS), reveals that oleylamine forms uniform ≈1.7 nm α‐phase seeds in the precursor solution via hydrogen bonding with FA\n                    +\n                    cations and steric stabilization. These seeds prime the substrate for controlled, single‐crystal‐like vertical growth under low‐pressure vacuum processing, thereby eliminating the need for toxic antisolvents. The resulting monolithic perovskite films exhibit strong (100) texture and high uniformity across 15 × 15 cm\n                    2\n                    substrates. Using S‐VAC, we achieve a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.2% for 2.5  ×  2.5 cm\n                    2\n                    devices and a certified efficiency of 19.1% for 15  ×  15 cm\n                    2\n                    mini‐modules. Encapsulated modules retain &gt;94% of their initial efficiency after one year of continuous outdoor operation. By establishing a molecular‐level basis for oleylamine‐assisted seed formation and demonstrating scalable, antisolvent‐free processing, this work advances seed‐assisted crystallization and supports the practical commercialization of robust and sustainable perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"I 型干扰素自身抗体是基孔肯雅热减毒活疫苗脑炎的基础","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532212123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Human autoantibodies neutralizing type I interferons (IFNs) have emerged as strong, common, and global determinants of a growing number of severe viral diseases, including hypoxemic viral pneumonia, arboviral encephalitis, and adverse reaction to the live-attenuated yellow fever virus (YFV) vaccine. Chikungunya virus (CHIKV) is a growing global health concern that the live-attenuated vaccine VLA1553 (IXCHIQ®) was developed to address. In 2025, five unrelated adults (aged 82 to 88) on the island of La Réunion (France) developed severe reactions postvaccination; two died. The three patients with encephalitis (aged 84 to 85), including one lethal case, had immunoglobulin G autoantibodies in the blood neutralizing high concentrations of both IFN-α and -ω on admission. An 82-y-old survived rhabdomyolysis without encephalitis, and an 88-y-old died during hospitalization following CHIKV infection despite late vaccination; both lacked autoantibodies against type I IFNs. Autoantibodies neutralizing type I IFNs underlie all three cases of live-attenuated CHIKV vaccine encephalitis studied. Individuals with autoantibodies neutralizing type I IFNs should not be inoculated with live-attenuated YFV and CHIKV vaccines."},{"t":"使不可焊镍基高温合金变得可打印且微观结构可控","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517003?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍基高温合金","kp":["增材制造[镍高温合金]: 非可焊合金可打印化","控制[打印]: 微观组织可控"],"as":"该研究解决了镍基高温合金（Ni-superalloys）的焊接性难题，使其可适用于增材制造（3D打印）。镍基高温合金是航空航天与发电领域的关键材料，但高裂纹敏感性长期限制了其可焊性与可打印性。研究提出一种新方法，不仅赋予传统不可焊合金可打印性，还能对打印件的微观组织进行精确调控，从而在保持优异高温力学性能的同时实现复杂构件的定制化制造，为航空发动机涡轮叶片等关键部件的快速成形开辟了新路径。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Turn Nonweldable Ni‐Superalloys Printable and Microstructurally Controllable","b":"Abstract\n                  Ni‐based superalloys are critical materials in aerospace and power generation industries due to their exceptional high‐temperature performance, achieved through carefully designed chemical compositions and meticulously controlled microstructures. Traditionally, these components are manufactured through subtractive processes that are costly and time‐intensive, yet even these high‐value components are prone to damage during prolonged service in harsh environments, necessitating innovative methods for manufacturing, remanufacturing, and repair. Recent advancements in 3D‐printing technologies have demonstrated significant potential in addressing these needs, particularly for nonweldable Ni‐based superalloys, but formidable challenges remain. Key issues include preventing crack formation, controlling crystal grain structure, and optimizing precipitate volume fraction and morphology to enhance mechanical properties. Here, an overview of the recent studies that have elucidated fundamental mechanisms underlying these challenges, such as elemental microsegregation, melt pool morphology, and the spatiotemporal distributions of microscopic defects and stresses, is presented. Based on these insights, strategies involving the optimization of printing parameters and the implementation of heat treatments are developed to improve the printability and microstructural controllability. By examining the fabrication of a turbine blade as an example, this review highlights the progress made, the persistent challenges, and future opportunities for the 3D printing of high‐performance Ni‐based superalloy components."},{"t":"调控单原子层铜催化剂中Cu-Cu间距实现高效稳定CO₂电还原制C₂H₄","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522842?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子Cu催化CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2电还原制C2H4]: 单原子层Cu","[调控参数]: Cu-Cu间距","[目标产物]: 乙烯(C2H4)","[瓶颈]: C-C偶联慢动力学、选择性不确定"],"as":"该研究聚焦单原子层铜催化剂中Cu–Cu间距的精准调控，以实现高效稳定的CO2电还原制备多碳（C2+）产物。通过精细控制原子级催化剂活性位点的空间分布，研究优化了碳碳偶联反应路径，显著提升了C2+产物的选择性与法拉第效率，同时增强了催化剂的长期稳定性。该工作为可持续能源转化中CO2资源化利用提供了原子层面的设计策略，对工业化碳减排具有潜在推动意义。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Tuning Cu–Cu Spacing in Single‐Atomic Layer Cu Catalysts for Efficient and Stable CO2‐To‐C2H4 Electroreduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The transition to sustainable energy relies on the efficient conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into specific multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products, yet this process is severely hindered by the slow kinetics of C─C coupling and uncertain product selectivity. Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) exhibit promising catalytic performance but suffer from a fundamental limitation: their lack of contiguous active sites impedes C─C coupling. Herein, we report an innovative isotropic 2D Cu single‐atomic‐layer catalyst anchored on amorphous carbon substrate, designed to enhance C─C coupling and C\n                    2+\n                    selectivity. By stabilizing Cu\n                    δ\n                    +\n                    species and precisely tuning the Cu–Cu spacing to 2.35 Å‐matching the C─C bond length of ethylene (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ), which significantly promotes C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    production. The catalyst achieved a remarkable Faradaic efficiency of 78.6% for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    at −0.8 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode, accompanied with high stability over 120 h. These findings not only elucidate the profound impact of spatially controlled active sites in complex multi‐step reactions but also represent a significant leap forward in CO\n                    2\n                    conversion technologies, offering great potential for sustainable carbon utilization and addressing global energy transition challenges."},{"t":"电化学二氧化碳还原的三相界面","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01193K","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"三相界面CO2还原","kp":["界面[CO2RR]: 气-液-固三相","机制[TPI]: 质量传输与电荷转移耦合"],"as":"该研究探讨了三相界面（气-液-固）在CO2电还原反应（CO2RR）中的应用。传统液相CO2溶解度低、传质受限，三相界面通过将气态CO2直接引入催化位点，显著改善了CO2的传质效率与还原反应速率。文章系统分析了三相界面的构建策略、催化机理及产物选择性调控，为CO2高效电化学转化为高附加值化学品和燃料提供了新思路，对碳中和技术路线具有参考价值。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Triple-phase interfaces for electrochemical reduction of carbon dioxide","b":"The CO2 electroreduction reaction (CO2RR) offers a promising approach for converting CO2 into valuable products, thereby storing renewable energy in chemical bonds and mitigating CO2 emissions. The process is fundamentally governed by the complex dynamics at the gas (CO2), liquid (H2O), and solid (catalyst) triple-phase interfaces (TPIs), where mass transport, charge transfer, and intermediate stabilization interact and compete. However, the practical performance of the CO2RR remains significantly below the threshold required for industrial applications, hindered by challenges such as liquid wetting, hydrophobic layer degradation, and electrowetting effects. In this context, we present a tutorial review that re-examines TPI paradigms by integrating early static models with recent dynamic experimental insights. Bridging macroscopic reactor design with atomic-scale interfacial dynamics necessitates the use of in situ/operando characterization techniques. We systematically review optimization strategies for TPIs (e.g., porous architectures, hydrophobic modifications, and heterostructure engineering) and analyze associated failure modes. Furthermore, we extend these concepts to other electrochemical reactions, including oxygen reduction and hydrogen evolution/oxidation, to extract universal principles that guide catalyst design. This review aims to provide a comprehensive framework for advancing the field of sustainable electrocatalysis and its future role in clean energy technologies."},{"t":"通过声爆追踪空间碎片","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee0657?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空间碎片声爆追踪","kp":["方法[空间碎片追踪]: 地震数据反演","[信号源]: 音爆"],"as":"该研究提出利用地震波数据（seismic data）追踪太空碎片在大气层中产生的音爆信号，从而重建碎片的飞行轨迹与解体过程。随着近地轨道卫星与太空垃圾数量持续增长，碎片再入大气层的安全监测愈发重要。该方法将地震学监测手段创新性地应用于空间碎片追踪，为太空态势感知提供了一种低成本、广覆盖的新探测途径，填补了传统雷达与光学追踪的盲区。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Tracking space debris from sonic booms","cl":"801e5349a2","cp":0,"cln":"研究团队|地震数据追踪空间碎片|研究发布|2026-01-24","b":"Seismic data reveal the trajectory and break-up of space debris in Earth's atmosphere."},{"t":"EPS-I 胞外多糖将雷氏菌枯萎病病原体生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，以便快速传播","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512757123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ralstonia solanacearum species complex (RSSC) pathogens cause destructive plant wilt diseases of a wide variety of crops, leading to significant agricultural losses worldwide. These bacteria rapidly spread through the water-transporting xylem where they grow prolifically and produce abundant biofilm that clogs xylem vessels. To understand RSSC biofilm behavior in planta, we examined their complex fluid mechanics. Rheological analyses revealed that unlike all previously analyzed microbial biofilms, RSSC biofilms are shear-thinning, viscoelastic fluids at physiologically relevant shear forces. To determine which factors confer these unique mechanics, we analyzed biofilms of bacterial mutants with altered biofilm components. Genetic analysis demonstrated that development of the viscous-dominant biofilms required production of EPS-I, an amphiphilic exopolysaccharide that is a major virulence factor for all RSSC pathogens. We show that EPS-I confers \"biofilm mobility\", which allows wild-type RSSC colonies to passively expand when deformed. Despite its high metabolic cost, bioassays demonstrated that EPS-I production conferred a net fitness benefit where biofilm mobility allowed the pathogen to spread and access more nutrients in complex environments like xylem vessels. The RSSC are a monophyletic lineage of aggressive plant wilt pathogens, and our evolutionary hypothesis testing suggests the origin of the eps biosynthetic gene cluster coincides with the emergence of wilt pathogenesis in the RSSC ancestor. Furthermore, comparative physiological assays demonstrated that biofilm mobility is unique to the RSSC within the genus Ralstonia. In summary, EPS-I production is a key evolutionary innovation that enables RSSC dispersal and virulence by conferring unique biofilm mechanics.","tp":"病原生物膜","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"青枯菌(RSSC)引起多种作物毁灭性枯萎病，全球农业损失严重。该菌在木质部导管中大量增殖并产生堵塞生物膜。流变学分析揭示，不同于以往研究的所有微生物生物膜，EPS-I胞外多糖将生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，使病原体能快速传播。这一发现颠覆了对微生物生物膜力学行为的传统认知。"},{"t":"严重感染时的拴系血小板","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed1243?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Platelet-derived structures in blood vessel walls increase inflammation and bleeding risk."},{"t":"顶嘴","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5706?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"An unprecedented assault has forced the U.S. scientific community to rethink its advocacy tactics."},{"t":"TDRD3 是一种含有 Tudor 结构域的蛋白，可调节 Klf2 依赖性 Treg 分化和调节免疫功能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tudor domain-containing protein 3 (TDRD3) functions as a methylarginine reader that relays posttranslational arginine methylation signals to the transcriptional machinery, thereby regulating cellular functions through modulation of gene expression. Regulatory T cells (T\n                    regs\n                    ) are pivotal for establishing and maintaining immune tolerance. In this study, we demonstrate that mice with T\n                    reg\n                    -specific deletion of\n                    Tdrd3\n                    exhibit severely impaired iT\n                    reg\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    reg\n                    , differentiation. Moreover, iT\n                    regs\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    regs\n                    , derived from these mice fail to suppress colitis in adoptive transfer models, indicating compromised inhibitory capacity. Aged\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient mice also show spontaneous autoinflammation. Mechanistically, TDRD3 is recruited by the transcription factor FOXO1, presumably in a methylation-dependent manner, to activate\n                    Klf2\n                    expression, which is essential for T\n                    reg\n                    differentiation. Notably, the enforced expression of\n                    Klf2\n                    in\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells rescue both iT\n                    reg\n                    development and suppressive function. Collectively, our findings identify TDRD3 as a central transcriptional regulator of iT\n                    reg\n                    differentiation and immune homeostasis, highlighting it as a potential therapeutic target for modulating immune tolerance."},{"t":"合成适用性域（SynAD）：导航化学空间以实现可靠的AI驱动反应预测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523874?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI反应预测适用域","kp":["工具[AI反应预测]: 合成适用性域SynAD","问题[AI预测]: 分布外OOD反应预测失败","应用域[有机合成]: 导航化学空间"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究提出了合成适用性域概念，用于导航化学空间以实现可靠的AI驱动反应预测。有机合成化学在人工智能突破的推动下经历了范式转变，但AI反应预测模型的可靠性高度依赖于训练数据所覆盖的化学空间范围。SynAD框架通过量化待预测反应与已知反应空间的结构和电子相似度，为AI预测结果提供可信度评估。当目标反应落在SynAD边界外时，系统会标记预测不可靠并建议补充实验验证。该框架有效减少了AI反应预测中的过度自信和幻觉风险，为AI辅助合成路线设计提供了可靠性保障机制。","ot":"Synthetic Applicability Domain (SynAD): Navigating Chemical Space for Reliable AI‐Driven Reaction Prediction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Organic synthetic chemistry has undergone a paradigm shift driven by breakthroughs in artificial intelligence (AI). Data‐driven methods help accelerate hypothesis evaluation and reduce experimental trial‐and‐error efforts. However, its practical utility is constrained by the out‐of‐distribution (OOD) issue, where predictions usually fail when extrapolating to unseen reactions with new catalysts, substrates, or conditions. Here, we introduce SynAD (synthetic applicability domain), a machine learning framework for assessing the predictive capability of AI models trained with existing data. SynAD combines descriptors with model‐adaptive distance metrics to automatically demarcate reliable and unreliable reactions. Validated on the Ullmann Ligand Dataset (ULD, &gt;5000 reactions), SynAD a priori distinguishes predictable chemical space, resulting in a prediction accuracy of\n                    R\n                    2\n                     = 0.90 (at 12.3% coverage) from a baseline of\n                    R\n                    2\n                    = −0.21. This capacity to target reliable chemical space is consistently observed across 6 additional datasets. We also enable a SynAD score to quantify reaction class predictability, guiding experimental focus on OOD spaces. By defining model limits, SynAD provides a critical guardrail for chemists to trust AI, allocate resources strategically, and accelerate de novo discovery."},{"t":"对称保护的拓扑极化子","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514647123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Emergent quasiparticles in solids often exhibit unique topological properties as a result of the complex interplay between charge, orbital, spin, and lattice degrees of freedom. Among these quasiparticles, the polaron occupies a special place as the first known manifestation of the interaction between a fermion and a boson field. While polarons have been investigated for almost a century, whether these quasiparticles exhibit topological properties and why remain open questions. Here, we establish the universal symmetry principles governing the topology of polar textures in large polarons. Using a group-theoretic analysis, we identify four distinct classes of polar textures in time-reversal-invariant systems, and we show that they carry integer topological charges. We validate this classification by performing state-of-the-art first-principles calculations of materials representative of each class. For these materials, we compute the fingerprints of polaron topology in Huang diffuse scattering and propose ultrafast electron and X-ray scattering experiments to detect these quasiparticles.","tp":"拓扑极化子","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":1.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"极化子是费米子与玻色子场相互作用的首个已知表现，虽已研究近百年，其是否具有拓扑性质仍是开放问题。该研究建立了对称保护的拓扑极化子理论框架，揭示了固体中电荷、轨道、自旋与晶格自由度复杂相互作用可赋予极化子独特的拓扑特性。这为理解量子材料中的拓扑物态提供了新视角。"},{"t":"单原子镍促进剂表面调控铂电催化剂用于耐久非水相氢氧化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522380?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂镍氢氧化电催化","kp":["催化剂[非水系HOR]: 单原子Ni修饰Pt","助剂[Pt催化]: 单原子Ni促进剂","应用[非水HOR]: 耦合Li-NRR制氨"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究设计了一种表面调制型铂电催化剂，通过引入单原子镍助催化剂实现高耐久性的非水体系氢氧化反应（HOR）。HOR在可再生能源转化中至关重要，但传统铂催化剂易失活且成本高。镍单原子修饰优化了铂表面电子结构，显著提升了HOR催化活性和长期稳定性，为燃料电池等氢能技术提供了高效催化剂方案。","ot":"Surface Modulated Platinum Electrocatalyst via Single Atom Nickel Promoter for Durable Non‐aqueous Hydrogen Oxidation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR) plays crucial role in various renewable energy conversion processes. Particularly, it offers new opportunities for sustained electrochemical ammonia synthesis when coupled with lithium‐mediated nitrogen reduction. But it remains tremendous challenges due to slow reaction kinetics and rapid poisoning of catalysts in non‐aqueous electrolyte. Here, we report Ni single atom mediated Pt sites on Ni substrate (PtNi\n                    1\n                    /Ni) to boost efficient and durable HOR in organic electrolyte. PtNi\n                    1\n                    /Ni exhibits high performance of nearly 100% Faradaic efficiency (FE) and long‐term stability over 1000 h in tetrahydrofuran (THF) electrolyte, far beyond commercial Pt electrode (&lt;0.2 h). Theoretical calculations combined with spectroscopic characterizations indicated that Ni single atom contributes to tailoring electronic structure of Pt sites via ligand effects, which effectively reduces the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step, and simultaneously as synergistic site in suppressing organic poison species through changing THF adsorption configuration and increasing energy barriers of THF oxidative decomposition. In the lithium‐mediated electrochemical ammonia synthesis electrolyzer, it also exhibits good feasibility with high ammonia FE of ∼62%. This work sheds light on the effective strategy of single atom doping for developing active and durable nonaqueous HOR electrocatalyst and presents insightful understanding of anti‐poisoning mechanism."},{"t":"前驱体工程化化学计量比可调MXene用于高性能电磁屏蔽与储能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521860?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene可控制备","kp":["前驱体工程[MXene]: 化学计量比编程形貌","形貌-功能[MXene]: 片层→EMI屏蔽,卷曲→储能"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出通过前驱体工程精确调控MXene化学计量比的新策略。MXene的器件级性能高度依赖其微观架构——平面纳米片结构有利于电磁干扰（EMI）屏蔽，而三维多孔结构更适合能量存储应用。研究通过调控过渡金属碳化物前驱体的元素组成和比例，实现MXene化学计量比的程序化设计，从而优化其导电性、比表面积和电磁屏蔽效能。该方法为同时提升EMI屏蔽性能（目标SE值>40dB）和超级电容器能量密度提供了材料层面的一体化解决方案，有望推动MXene从实验室研究走向柔性电子和电磁防护的实际应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Stoichiometry‐Programmed MXenes via Precursor Engineering for High‐Performance EMI Shielding and Energy Storage","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Device‐level performance in MXenes is dictated by architecture—planar nanosheets are optimal for electromagnetic interference (EMI) shielding, while scrolled structures enhance ion transport for energy storage—particularly when morphology is programmed at synthesis. Whether such architectures can be deterministically encoded through precursor stoichiometry remains unresolved. Here, we demonstrate that precise carbon stoichiometry control in Ti\n                    3\n                    AlC\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    O\n                    2‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    MAX phases tunes internal lattice strain and thereby directs the emergent MXene architecture. Carbon‐rich precursors (\n                    x\n                    = 1.94) yield strain‐relieved, high‐crystalline nanosheets with metallic conductivity (∼23 300 S cm\n                    −1\n                    ), enabling ultrathin films with record‐high EMI shielding performances across X‐ and W‐bands (≥ 2.0 × 10\n                    6\n                     dB cm\n                    2\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    at 8.2 GHz for 29 nm; 108 dB at 100 GHz for 8 µm) and robust W‐band retention after 5,000 bending cycles (r = 2.5 mm). In contrast, carbon‐deficient precursors (\n                    x\n                    = 1.71) introduce lattice compression and oxygen substitution, triggering spontaneous scrolling upon delamination. The resulting nanoscrolls offer exceptional ion accessibility, achieving 657 F g\n                    −1\n                    at 2 mV s\n                    −1\n                    with 99.4% retention over 12 000 cycles. This stoichiometry‐programmed approach establishes a synthesis‐stage lever linking MAX chemistry to MXene architecture and function, enabling application‐specific architecture design within established MAX/MXene synthesis and solution‐processing workflows for next‐generation electronics and energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"类固醇依赖性代谢重连揭示了胶质母细胞瘤的新治疗和成像方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6539?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Steroid anti-inflammatory drugs, such as dexamethasone, are routinely used to manage brain tumor–associated edema, yet their impact on brain tumor metabolism remains understudied. Here, a metabolomic screen in naïve glioblastoma cells treated with dexamethasone revealed the accumulation of\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide, a nicotinamide\n                    N\n                    -methyltransferase (NNMT) product, through glucocorticoid receptor activation. Using stable isotope-assisted metabolomics in patients with glioblastoma, we showed that nicotinamide conversion into\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide exceeds that into NAD\n                    +\n                    , leading to a ~7-fold accumulation of\n                    N\n                    1\n                    -methylnicotinamide in tumor compared to surrounding brain tissue. In orthotopic models, NNMT activity was enhanced by dexamethasone selectively in glioblastoma tumors but not in contralateral brain. Leveraging the tumor-specific activity of NNMT, we developed a novel\n                    11\n                    C-nicotinamide–based positron emission tomography (PET) approach to visualizing glioblastoma tumors. Furthermore, our findings demonstrate that the dexamethasone-induced methionine-dependent nicotinamide methylation becomes detrimental for glioblastoma when combined with a methionine-restricted diet. These results show that steroids rewire methionine and nicotinamide metabolism, enabling the development of innovative PET imaging and metabolic therapies for glioblastoma."},{"t":"各州开创了美国科学资助的新领域","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5010?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Thirty-five years ago, a survey of university faculty concluded that despite relatively stable public funding, the research environment in the United States had deteriorated to the point that \"a major decline in research capability\" was plausible or even likely. Today, US academic researchers are again \"beset by flagging morale, diminishing expectations, and constricting horizons.\" According to data from the National Science Foundation (NSF), the share of US basic and applied research funded by the federal government dropped from nearly 48% in 2009 to just over 34% in 2023. As that decline is likely to continue, some state governments are responding by boosting their research spending. Greater reliance on states brings a new set of challenges, but opportunities as well."},{"t":"竞争性硅光伏技术现状综述","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00421-0?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"硅光伏技术进展","kp":["现状[硅光伏]: 成本持续降，发电量超核能/风电","[趋势]: 钙钛矿-硅叠层为未来方向"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该文综述了竞争性硅基光伏技术的最新发展现状。硅太阳能电池成本持续下降的同时，全球装机容量快速增长，目前硅光伏发电量已超过全球总发电量的显著比例。文章系统比较了主流硅光伏技术路线的竞争格局，包括PERC、TOPCon、HJT（异质结）和IBC等电池技术的效率进展、量产成本和产业化成熟度。分析指出，虽然硅基光伏仍占据市场主导地位，但不同技术路线在效率天花板、制造工艺复杂度和降本空间上各有优劣，行业正处于从PERC向TOPCon和HJT技术迭代的关键过渡期。","ot":"State-of-play of contending silicon photovoltaic technologies","b":"Silicon solar cell costs continue decreasing while installed capacity rapidly grows, now generating more electricity globally than either nuclear or wind. Strengths and weaknesses of the different competing silicon technologies are discussed, together with what the future might look like for silicon-based photovoltaics, including tandem cell stacks with perovskites."},{"t":"深共熔溶剂在废旧锂离子电池回收中的分阶段作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506741?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深共熔溶剂回收锂电","kp":["溶剂[废锂电回收]: 深共熔溶剂(DES)","[特性]: 可调、低毒、环境兼容","[应用阶段]: 浸出等多阶段分阶段作用"],"as":"本综述系统梳理了深共熔溶剂（DES）在废旧锂离子电池回收中的阶段性角色。随着电动汽车驱动的锂电池市场爆发式增长，退役电池的绿色回收成为关键挑战。DES作为低毒、可设计、低成本的新型绿色溶剂，可在浸出、分离、提纯等不同阶段发挥定向作用。文章按回收工艺阶段解析DES的溶剂化机制与金属离子选择性，评估其相较传统强酸/有机溶剂在环保性与效率上的优势，并指出DES黏度高、规模化工程化不足等瓶颈，为下一代电池循环经济提供了溶剂路径参考。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Stage‐Specific Roles of Deep Eutectic Solvents in Recycling of Spent Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The exponential growth of lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) market driven by electric vehicles has intensified the demand for sustainable and efficient recycling technologies. Among emerging solutions, deep eutectic solvents (DESs) have attracted increasing attention due to their tunable properties, low toxicity, and environmental compatibility. While DESs have been widely applied in the leaching of spent cathodes, their functions and mechanisms remain underexplored. In this review, we critically examine the stage‐specific roles of DESs in the recovery of lithium (Li), nickel (Ni), cobalt (Co), and manganese (Mn) from spent cathodes. DES applications are systematically classified into metal co‐dissolution, single‐metal selectivity (Li‐first, Ni‐first), and two‐metal pairwise separations. We discuss key DES design principles for achieving metal‐specific selectivity, highlighting emerging hydrophobic DESs and redox‐active systems, and expanding roles beyond leaching (binder removal, graphite pre‐concentration, direct regeneration, and hydrophobic DESs for liquid‐liquid extraction). Finally, this review identifies major challenges limiting DES scalability, including viscosity, component stability, recyclability, impurity tolerance, and limited techno‐economic and life cycle analyses. We also propose future directions to fully integrated, closed‐loop, and sustainable DES‐based recycling processes for critical metals. This review provides solvent design and mechanistic insight guidance toward green, selective, and scalable LIB recycling technologies."},{"t":"用于热不变光学测压的光谱-时间比率策略","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522909?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光学压力测量","kp":["策略[光学测压]: 光谱-时间比值法","效果[测压]: 热不变性"],"as":"该研究提出一种光谱-时间比率测量策略，用于实现热不变光学测压。传统光学测压虽具备非接触优势，但易受温度漂移影响导致精度下降。该方法通过同时采集光谱信号与时间分辨信号并取比值，从原理上消除温度对压力读数的交叉干扰。这一策略有望提升极端环境（高温工业、发动机、生物医学）下压力传感的可靠性，为设计免温度校准的光学压力传感器开辟了新思路，在工业监测与科学仪器领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Spectro‐Temporal Ratiometric Strategy for Thermally Invariant Optical Manometry","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Optical manometry provides noncontact pressure sensing but remains vulnerable to temperature‐induced drift, where thermal expansion and nonradiative relaxation distort luminescence spectra and kinetics. We develop a spectro‐temporal ratiometric approach that combines spectral and time‐gated luminescence channels to decouple pressure and temperature responses and realize thermally invariant optical manometry. Using Y\n                    3\n                    In\n                    2\n                    Ga\n                    3\n                    O\n                    12\n                    :Cr\n                    3+\n                    as a rigid‐lattice host (D\n                    q/B\n                    ≈ 2.2), lattice stiffness minimizes thermal sensitivity\n                    \n                      S\n                      R,T\n                    \n                    , while ratiometric detection stabilizes pressure sensitivity\n                    \n                      S\n                      R,p\n                    \n                    . The resulting thermal‐invariance manometric factor (\n                    TIMF)\n                    =\n                    \n                      S\n                      R,p\n                    \n                    /\n                    \n                      S\n                      R,T\n                    \n                    reaches ≈7700 K·GPa\n                    −1\n                    in the spectral domain and ≈2500 K·GPa\n                    −1\n                    in the time‐gated domain, with\n                    \n                      S\n                      R,p\n                    \n                    up to 51%·GPa\n                    −1\n                    . These values exceed ruby benchmarks by two orders of magnitude and surpass conventional lifetime analysis by ∼40 times, enabling accurate, self‐referenced optical pressure mapping under extreme thermo‐mechanical conditions. This work provides luminescent manometry from empirical calibration to a quantitative framework for thermally reliable sensing in coupled fields."},{"t":"一些客座编辑将特刊与自己的文章一起打包","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6706?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Thousands have penned more than one-third of a journal issue, raising conflict-of-interest concerns."},{"t":"面向稳定高压钾离子电池的溶剂化几何结构工程","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07550E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾电池电解液","kp":["电解质[钾离子电池]: 无氟高闪点醚类","策略[溶剂化]: 不对称烷基化工程"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过溶剂化几何结构工程，设计出适用于高压钾离子电池的稳定电解质体系。钾离子电池因钾资源丰富、成本低被视为锂电池潜在替代方案，但高压运行下电解质易分解、界面不稳定制约了其实用化。研究者调控溶剂分子在钾离子周围的空间配位构型，优化溶剂化鞘结构，从而提升电解质氧化稳定性和电极界面兼容性，实现高压下长循环寿命。该策略为多价/碱金属电池电解质设计提供了通用方法论，推进了钾电商业化进程。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Solvation Geometry Engineering for Stable High-Voltage Potassium-Ion Batteries","b":"To advance the practical application of potassium-ion batteries (PIBs), the lack of robust electrolytes must be addressed, as the prevailing fluorinated solvents present a cost-prohibitive and environmentally unsustainable solution. Here, we propose an asymmetric alkylation strategy to overcome this limitation, engineering a fluorine-free, high-flash-point, and green ether-based electrolyte. This design reconstitutes the solvent coordination geometry through dual steric hindrance, which concurrently weakens cation-solvent binding and modulates the electronic structure of the solvation cluster. Consequently, the designed electrolyte demonstrates exceptional interfacial compatibility, enabling the high-voltage K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]||graphite and K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]||hard carbon full-cells to achieve capacity retention rates of 75.75% after 1400 cycles at 0.33 C and 80.09% after 1500 cycles at 0.5 C, respectively. Moreover, this stability is preserved under elevated temperatures, with both full-cells exhibiting stable operation over hundreds of cycles. This work establishes an effective electrolyte design strategy for realizing high-performance, cost-effective, and environmentally friendly PIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"社会运动是生物多样性保护的变革推动者","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513327123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Civil society has long been a catalyst for social change by reshaping structures, influencing values, and challenging power dynamics; however, its role in driving transformative change for biodiversity remains underexplored. To address this gap, we analyze 2,801 socio-environmental mobilizations documented in the Environmental Justice Atlas (EJAtlas). These mobilizations produce diverse outcomes that reveal distinct spatial, temporal, and sectoral patterns and proactively and reactively respond to environmental impacts across the globe. Notably, about 40% of these mobilizations occur within the top 30% of global priority lands for species conservation and their actions contribute to the achievement of key Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework targets focused on ecosystem protection, restoration, sustainable use, and inclusive spatial planning. Yet, one-third of mobilizations face repression, criminalization, or violence—pressures that are even more common in high-priority conservation areas. Moreover, mobilizations facing repressive outcomes contest environmental threats relevant for the KMGBF targets more extensively than those with progressive outcomes, underscoring the risks faced by movements driving biodiversity protection in critical regions. To amplify the transformative potential of socio-environmental mobilizations, we emphasize the importance of recognizing, strengthening, and protecting them through coordinated action among diverse social actors. By fostering collaboration and targeted resource allocation, these efforts can empower socio-environmental mobilizations to catalyze meaningful and lasting change for biodiversity conservation."},{"t":"三核苷酸重复发夹的滑动重构阻碍了人类复制蛋白 A 的解析","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526355123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abnormal expansions of trinucleotide repeats (TNRs) are a major cause of neurodegenerative diseases, often driven by the formation of stable hairpin structures that interfere with protein machineries in DNA cellular processes. On the other hand, human replication protein A (hRPA) plays a central role in stabilizing single-stranded DNA and resolution of secondary structures. Understanding how hRPA interacts with TNR hairpins has become crucial to uncovering the mechanisms that regulate TNR stability. Here, we employed single-molecule fluorescence resonance energy transfer to investigate the interaction between hRPA and CTG repeat hairpins of varying lengths. We found that blunt-end hairpins impede hRPA resolution, while the presence of a short overhang facilitates initial binding followed by invasion. At higher repeat lengths, hRPA binding induces partial hairpin resolution, followed by conformational slippage that restores blunt-end hairpin structures and hinders further progression. Hairpin resolution is coordinated by the interplay of the multiple dynamic binding modes of hRPA and the slippage reconfiguration of the TNR hairpins. Moreover, our results reveal a concentration- and stoichiometry-dependent resolution process, herein full resolution of TNR hairpins with pathologically relevant repeat lengths requires protein concentrations exceeding physiological levels, potentially contributing to disease pathogenesis."},{"t":"锌负极副反应：已知认知与应对策略","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01269D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌负极副反应","kp":["问题[水系锌电池]: Zn负极副反应"],"as":"水系锌离子电池（AZIBs）因高安全性和低成本被视为锂离子电池的有力替代方案，但锌负极表面的副反应（如析氢、钝化层形成、枝晶生长及腐蚀）严重制约其循环寿命和库伦效率。本文系统综述了目前对锌负极副反应机理的认知，包括电解液组成、pH波动及界面化学的影响，并梳理了多种缓解策略：电解液添加剂工程、锌表面合金化修饰、人工SEI层构建及结构设计优化等。文章为设计长寿命高可逆锌负极提供了理论框架与工程指导。","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Side reactions at the Zn anode: what we know and how we deal with them","b":"Aqueous Zn-ion batteries (AZIBs) have been widely regarded as promising alternatives to Li-ion batteries (LIBs) owing to their intrinsic safety and cost-effectiveness. Nonetheless, spontaneous side reactions at the Zn anode dominate the platelet packing mode of Zn plating/stripping, thus undermining the anode's reversibility. To enable the future development of AZIBs, undesirable side reactions at the Zn anode need to be fully unveiled to understand intrinsic Zn plating/stripping processes. This review offers innovative and comprehensive insights to mitigate the side reactions at the Zn anode that have not been reported to date. It commences with a profound understanding of Zn redox chemistry with side reactions involved. Subsequently, the main initiators of side reactions are discussed; the mainstream strategies used to decouple main/side reactions are considered and analyzed from the thermodynamics and kinetics viewpoints based on different mechanisms; and cutting-edge research breakthroughs are summarized. Additionally, advanced characterization technologies are expounded, equipping readers with measures to intuitively detect side reactions. Finally, current challenges related to side reactions are presented, accompanied by proposed feasible solutions to inspire readers for the future development of AZIBs."},{"t":"基于物理的经济非线性模型预测控制的住宅能源枢纽顺序运行","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000541?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源枢纽优化","as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Sequential operation of residential energy hubs using physics-based economic nonlinear MPC"},{"t":"基于亚稳软界面自组装分子胶囊用于稳定水系电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70668?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系电池分子胶囊","kp":["材料[水系电池]: 有机氧化还原分子胶囊","[机制]: 经亚稳态软界面自组装","[特征]: 再水化稳定、抗降解"],"as":"本研究通过亚稳态软界面自组装策略构建分子胶囊，用于稳定水系有机氧化还原液流电池。有机氧化还原材料虽具有结构可调控和可持续性优势，但在水溶液中常面临溶解度低和化学不稳定性问题。研究利用分子胶囊的限域微环境将活性分子包封，有效抑制其在充放电过程中的降解与跨膜穿梭，显著提升了电池的循环稳定性与容量保持率。该自组装策略为设计长寿命水系有机储能体系提供了创新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Self‐Assembled Molecular Capsule via Metastable Soft Interface for Stable Aqueous Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic redox materials hold great promise for sustainable energy storage due to their structural tunability and elemental abundance. However, their practical application remains hindered by rapid degradation during repeated electrochemical reactions, primarily caused by side processes involving water and unstable redox intermediates. Here, we report a metastable, rehydration‐stable molecular capsule formed through the interfacial self‐assembly of amphiphilic Pluronic F127 on hydrophobic 2‐ethyl‐anthraquinone (2‐E‐AQ) particles. The hydrophobic polypropylene oxide segments anchor onto the 2‐E‐AQ surface, while the hydrophilic polyethylene oxide chains form a soft, ion‐permeable shell that endures drying and reconstructs a gel‐like interface upon rehydration, bridging solid‐liquid boundaries. Integrated into an aqueous 2‐E‐AQ||Li\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    ||NaI battery, this soft‐interface design stabilizes ion transport and suppresses redox degradation, achieving 99.7% Coulombic efficiency and 85.4% capacity retention after 300 cycles. This work introduces an interface‐induced self‐assembly paradigm for stabilizing hydrophobic organic redox materials and provides a general framework for constructing adaptive soft interfaces in aqueous electrochemical systems.","aip":1},{"t":"通过靶向 FSP1 选择性破坏瘤内调节 T 细胞中的脂质过氧化物稳态可增强癌症","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3703?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A burgeoning approach to treating cancer is the pharmacological induction of ferroptotic cell death of tumor cells. However, the impact of disrupting antiferroptotic pathways in the broader tumor microenvironment (TME), such as in immune cells, is still undefined and may complicate treatments. Here, we show that ferroptosis suppressor protein 1 (FSP1\n                    /Aifm2\n                    ) is critically required for regulatory T cell (T\n                    reg\n                    cell) resistance to ferroptosis and their immunosuppressive function within the TME. Compared to other canonical ferroptosis regulators such as GPX4 and NRF2, only FSP1 was induced upon T cell activation. Deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    in all T cells, or T\n                    reg\n                    cells specifically, enhanced tumor control by selectively disrupting T\n                    reg\n                    cell immunosuppression within tumors without inciting autoimmune pathology in mice. As opposed to deletion of\n                    Gpx4\n                    in all T cells, T cell deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    did not impair antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. These results reveal an opportunity for targeting a regulator of ferroptosis that can not only directly target cancer cells but also simultaneously enhance anticancer immune responses without inciting autoimmunity."},{"t":"MXene卷状结构的可扩展合成","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521457?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene卷材合成","kp":["合成[MXene]: 卷曲结构可扩展","形貌[MXene]: 一维纳米管/卷曲"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究报道了MXene卷轴（scrolls）结构的可扩展合成方法。MXene是一类具有高导电性和丰富表面化学性质的二维过渡金属碳化物、氮化物和碳氮化物材料。将二维MXene纳米片卷曲形成一维卷轴结构，可以同时保留其优异的电子传输特性并赋予独特的管状形貌优势，如更高的结构稳定性、增强的离子扩散通道和更大的活性比表面积。研究开发了可规模化的卷轴化合成工艺，解决了传统方法产率低、结构不可控的瓶颈。MXene卷轴在柔性储能器件、电磁屏蔽、传感器和电催化等领域展现出广阔的应用前景，为二维材料的低维组装提供了新范式。","ot":"Scalable Synthesis of MXene Scrolls","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    MXenes represent a promising class of 2D carbides, nitrides, and carbonitrides known for their high electrical conductivity, hydrophilicity, mechanical strength, and unique optoelectronic properties, which have led to numerous applications. However, their scalable synthesis in 1D morphology, such as nanotubes or scrolls, has not been demonstrated yet. This work presents a versatile and scalable method for manufacturing MXene scrolls, including Ti\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , Ti\n                    3\n                    CNT\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , V\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , Nb\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , and Ta\n                    4\n                    C\n                    3\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    . We demonstrate a scalable and high‐yield production up to 10 g of pure scrolls with precise control over their alignment and morphology. Properties of scrolls differ from 2D flakes; e.g., a freestanding film made of scrolled Nb\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    presents 33 times increase in electrical conductivity and shows a superconducting state below 5.2 K. Films of MXene scrolls exhibit 3 times lower density and enhanced mass transport compared to flakes, resulting in an improved performance in supercapacitor electrodes and humidity sensors. The dispersion of the scrolls in water behaves like an electrorheological fluid. Aligning scrolls in an electric field allows for circuit switching between electrically insulating and conductive states. These scrolls can be assembled into vertically aligned MXene forests, fibers, and other architectures. The availability of 1D MXene scrolls offers exciting opportunities in many fields."},{"t":"STING单氨基酸多态性调节虹彩病毒免疫逃避和致病谱","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523268123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The evolutionary arms race between viruses and hosts shapes host antiviral defenses and viral immune evasion, yet the mechanisms driving divergence in viral cross-species pathogenicity remain unclear. Here, we investigated the role of single amino acid polymorphisms (SAPs) in stimulator of interferon genes (STING) in modulating immune evasion and pathogenicity spectrum of infectious spleen and kidney necrosis virus (ISKNV). The ISKNV-encoded protein VP012R targets mandarin fish STING (\n                    sc\n                    STING) for ubiquitination at residues C196 and K315, promoting its degradation to suppress interferon responses. Importantly, the K315/R315 polymorphism acts as a molecular switch: Susceptible species with the K315 residue exhibit STING degradation and viral immune evasion, whereas resistant species with the R315 residue maintain STING stability and antiviral defenses. Phylogenetic analysis linked K315 to high-mortality hosts (≥50% lethality) vs. R315 in resistant species (≤25% lethality). These findings suggest that the molecular mechanisms underlying the viral pathogenicity spectrum may be modulated by host protein SAPs, thereby enhancing our understanding of host–virus coevolution in terms of biological diversity."},{"t":"基于外延铁电材料的可重构光电控制极化稳健类神经忆阻器","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000271?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电忆阻器","kp":["器件[忆阻器]: 外延LiNbO3光-电可重构铁电"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"Robust neuromorphic memristors with reconfigurable light-electric control ferroelectric polarization based on epitaxial ","aip":1},{"t":"常驻CD49a+CD103+NKG2C+ NK细胞限制人淋巴组织外植体中的HIV感染","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1565?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Natural killer (NK) cells are pivotal effectors in antiviral immunity, yet their tissue-specific roles during acute HIV infection remain poorly defined. Using an ex vivo human tonsillar tissue model, we profile NK cell responses to early HIV infection and uncover distinct subsets with specialized functions. We identify a previously uncharacterized memory-like NK population (CD16\n                    +/−\n                    CD69\n                    +\n                    CD49a\n                    +\n                    CD103\n                    +\n                    NKG2C\n                    +\n                    ) associated with reduced viral burden and enriched in cytotoxic mediators (GNLY, PRF1, and GZMB), apoptotic ligands (FASLG and TRAIL), cytokine receptors (IL2RA, IL2RB, IL2RG, IL12RB2, and IL18R1) and trafficking molecules (CCL3–5, CCR7, and SELL). Although functionally capable of clearing HIV-infected CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells in a tissue-mimetic environment, they show impaired cytotoxicity and transcriptional signs of exhaustion after infection. Conversely, HIV drives the reprogramming of immature CD16\n                    −\n                    CD69\n                    +\n                    NK cells toward a more cytotoxic and migratory effector phenotype. These findings reveal dynamic NK cell adaptations in lymphoid tissue during early HIV infection and highlight tissue-resident NK cells as promising targets for immunotherapeutic intervention."},{"t":"NEP-聚合酶复合物结构揭示甲型流感病毒聚合酶的监管热点","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4073?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Influenza A virus (IAV) transcribes and replicates its segmented RNA genome in the host nucleus within viral ribonucleoproteins (vRNPs), which are exported for virion assembly. The nuclear export protein (NEP) is essential for this process and also regulates viral RNA synthesis, implicating a direct interaction with the viral RNA polymerase. Here, we present a 2.5-Å cryogenic electron microscopy structure of NEP bound to the IAV polymerase and demonstrate that NEP alone is sufficient to promote vRNP export, with the viral matrix protein 1 enhancing export efficiency. NEP forms a four-helix bundle that binds at the interface of the PA C-terminal domain and PB1 N terminus of the polymerase. The NEP binding site at this interface overlaps with those for the host ANP32 and the C-terminal domain of RNA polymerase II, indicating that it functions as a regulatory hotspot coordinating transitions of the viral polymerase between RNA synthesis and nuclear export, revealing a critical layer of control in the IAV replication cycle."},{"t":"利用地震数据追踪空间碎片再入与解体动力学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz4676?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空间碎片再入追踪","kp":["方法[碎片追踪]: 最小梯度拟合地震反演","[应用]: 追踪空间碎片再入与解体动力学"],"as":"利用地震数据追踪空间碎片再入大气层及其解体动力学过程。随着地球轨道日益拥挤，碎片再入风险持续增加，但当前监测和响应手段有限。该研究提出通过地面地震传感器捕捉碎片高速再入时产生的声波和震动信号，从而实现对再入轨迹和解体事件的追踪与定位。这种方法有望提供一种低成本的全球碎片再入监测手段，填补雷达和光学跟踪的盲区，为空间碎片风险评估和预警提供新的数据来源。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Reentry and disintegration dynamics of space debris tracked using seismic data","cl":"801e5349a2","cp":1,"cln":"研究团队|地震数据追踪空间碎片|研究发布|2026-01-24","b":"The risks posed by reentering space debris continue to grow as Earth's orbit becomes more crowded. Currently, responses to uncontrolled reentries are hampered by an inability to reliably track spacecraft once they are burning up within the atmosphere, meaning that debris fallout locations are poorly predicted. We have demonstrated a minimum-gradient fit seismic inversion methodology that allows in-atmosphere debris trajectory, speed, altitude, descent angle, size, and fragmentation pattern to be discerned relatively quickly. We tested this methodology on open-source data from the 2024 reentry of Shenzhou-15, deriving a location significantly south of the predicted track. Observations of cascading, multiplicative fragmentation offer insight into debris disintegration dynamics, with clear implications for space situational awareness and debris hazard mitigation."},{"t":"大肠杆菌中依赖 RecBCD 的 UV 后复制重启触发分叉三倍体","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521115123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultraviolet (UV) irradiation induces pyrimidine dimers in DNA, which block replication, but are efficiently removed by excision, allowing replication restart. Interestingly, soon after restart, the cells become capable of inducible stable DNA replication (iSDR) without new origin-initiations—suggesting unusual replication topology. The original idea was that the preexisting forks remain dormant even after UV-lesion removal, and when the new origin-initiated forks arrive, they rear-end the dormant forks, creating potential for iSDR. While there is origin-overinitiation after UV, the current idea is that preexisting forks are restarted—making the iSDR potential unclear. We used replication profiling of post-UV cells to investigate reactivation of UV-blocked forks. To compare profile time-sequences, we developed indexation procedure generating nested profile sets. Wild type nested set shows: 1) no replication during the first 30 min post-UV; 2) overinitiation from the origin combined with restart of preexisting forks during the next 30 min post-UV. The restart required RecBCD enzyme to repair double-strand breaks, confirming that the UV-stalled forks disintegrate and need recombinational repair to restart. Preexisting fork restart is separate from new origin-initiations by DnaA, as the\n                    dnaA\n                    (Ts) mutant at 42 °C restarts preexisting forks normally. Remarkably, the absence of powerful replication wave from origin-initiations in the\n                    dnaA\n                    mutant reveals a restart-initiated replication wave toward the origin, indicating that the restart mechanism causes fork triplication—potentially explaining the SDR phenomenon. There is no post-UV replication in the\n                    dnaA recBC\n                    double mutant, consistent with only two pathways of replication resumption in post-UV cells: restart or new origin-initiation."},{"t":"基于多元高斯与切比雪夫映射的演化模糊系统实时风电功率预测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000395?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电功率预测","kp":["[预测方法]: 演化模糊系统(多元高斯+Chebyshev映射)","应用[风电]: 实时功率预测"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Real-time wind power forecasting using an evolving fuzzy system based on Multivariate Gaussian and Chebyshev mapping"},{"t":"具有独立源的量子网络中的随机性认证","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea8571?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子随机性验证","kp":["方向[量子网络]: 多独立源随机性认证"],"dp":1,"as":"探讨在含独立源的量子网络中实现随机性认证的理论与方法。随机性认证是量子信息科学的基础性问题，对量子密码学安全性至关重要。该研究构建了一个多节点量子网络模型，各节点之间通过独立量子源纠缠连接，通过非局域相关性的检测证明网络中产生的随机性不可被任何经典或量子对手预测。该工作推进了设备无关和半设备无关量子随机数生成器的理论基础，对未来安全量子通信协议和量子密钥分发具有重要应用价值。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Randomness certification in a quantum network with independent sources","b":"Randomness certification is a foundational and practical aspect of quantum information science, essential for securing quantum communication protocols. Traditionally, these protocols have been implemented and validated with a single entanglement source, as in the paradigmatic Bell scenario. However, advancing these protocols to support more complex configurations involving multiple entanglement sources is key to building robust architectures and realizing large-scale quantum networks. Here, we show how to certify randomness in an entanglement-teleportation experiment, the building block of a quantum repeater displaying two independent sources of entanglement. Using the scalar extension method, we address the challenge posed by the nonconvexity of the correlation set, providing effective bounds on an eavesdropper’s knowledge of the shared secret bits. Our theoretical model characterizes the certifiable randomness within the network and is validated through the analysis of experimental data from a photonic quantum network."},{"t":"RSV 暂时重新编程细胞凋亡和焦亡以平衡免疫逃避和复制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz2496?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Virus-induced inflammation and programmed cell death (PCD) are critical antiviral defenses, prompting viruses like respiratory syncytial virus (RSV) to develop PCD regulation mechanisms. Here, we demonstrate that RSV orchestrates the temporal and sequential regulation of distinct PCD pathways in human macrophages to optimize replication and dissemination. During early stages of infection, RSV activates the PI3K-Akt pathway to induce cFLIP expression, effectively suppressing TNF-driven extrinsic apoptosis. Simultaneously, viral degradation of ZDHHC9 prevents GSDMD-mediated pyroptosis downstream of NLRP3 activation, thereby sustaining an intracellular environment permissive to viral propagation. In contrast, following the completion of replication, RSV subverts caspase-1 signaling to trigger the intrinsic apoptotic cascade via the Casp-1–BID–APAF1–Casp-9 axis, and subsequently promotes GSDME-mediated secondary pyroptosis. This late-stage PCD reprogramming enables synchronized release of virions and pro-inflammatory cytokines, exacerbating pulmonary pathology. These findings delineate a temporally resolved strategy by which RSV balances early immune evasion with subsequent viral dissemination and immunopathology, and identify discrete stage-specific molecular targets for therapeutic intervention in RSV-induced lung disease."},{"t":"普渡大学阻止许多中国研究生入学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6707?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Faculty members suggest university is overreacting to pressure from the Trump administration and Congress."},{"t":"基于生物物理动力学训练的蛋白质语言模型预测突变效应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530466123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质语言模型","kp":["模型[蛋白质]: ESMDance","创新[训练]: 分子动力学动态性质训练"],"dp":1,"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用基于生物物理动力学训练的蛋白质语言模型预测突变效应。现有蛋白质深度学习模型主要依赖序列和结构静态信息，该研究引入分子动力学模拟数据，使模型学习蛋白质构象动力学特征，从而更准确预测突变对功能和稳定性的影响。该方法弥补了静态模型忽略动态构象信息的不足，对蛋白质工程和疾病相关突变评估具有重要意义。","ot":"Protein language models trained on biophysical dynamics inform mutation effects","b":"Structural dynamics are fundamental to protein functions and mutation effects. Current protein deep learning models are predominantly trained on sequence and/or static structure data, which often fail to capture the dynamic nature of proteins. To address this, we introduce SeqDance and ESMDance, two protein language models trained on dynamic biophysical properties derived from molecular dynamics simulations and normal mode analyses of over 64,000 proteins. Both models can be directly applied to predict dynamic properties of unseen ordered and disordered proteins. SeqDance, trained from scratch, has attentions that capture dynamic interaction and comovement between residues, and its embeddings encode rich representations of protein dynamics that can be further utilized to predict conformational properties beyond the training tasks via transfer learning. SeqDance predicted dynamic property changes reflect mutation effect on protein folding stability. ESMDance, built upon ESM2 (Evolutionary Scale Model II) outputs, substantially outperforms ESM2 in zero-shot prediction of mutation effects for designed and viral proteins which lack evolutionary information. Together, SeqDance and ESMDance offer a framework for integrating protein dynamics into language models, enabling more generalizable predictions of protein behavior and mutation effects."},{"t":"探索功能蛋白质宇宙中的暗能量","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531111123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"We show how to localize and quantify the functional evolutionary constraints on natural proteins. Protein folding has been one of the strongest constraints in sequence evolution. The method we propose compares the perturbations caused by local sequence variants to the energetics of the protein folding process and to the corresponding change to the apparent selection landscape of sequences over the evolutionary time scale. The difference between the physical folding free energies and the evolutionary free energies can be called a \"dark energy.\" We analyze various protein sets and thereby show that dark energy is largely localized at functional sites, which are also often energetically frustrated from the point of view of folding. Overall, we find that about 25% of the positions of the folded globular proteins display some significant dark energy. When a function relies on a free energy that can be thermodynamically quantified, such as the binding energy to a partner, the relationship of this physical free energy with dark energy can be used to define a functional selection temperature, just as there is a selection temperature for folding. We show that selection for folding and binding functions bear similar weights in specific protein-protein interactions.","tp":"蛋白质暗能量","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种新方法，能够精准定位并量化自然蛋白质在进化过程中的功能性约束。传统认为，蛋白质折叠是序列进化的最强约束之一。该方法通过对比局部序列变异对蛋白质折叠能量学的影响，及其在漫长进化时间尺度上对序列表观选择景观的改变，揭示了蛋白质的物理折叠自由能与进化约束之间的差异。这项工作为探索蛋白质序列与功能的深层联系提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"管道压力","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5705?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"The Trump administration's agenda is likely to reshape the scientific workforce."},{"t":"钾离子电池负极：机制框架、电解液/粘结剂集成与商业化路线图","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505727?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钾离子电池负极","kp":["综述[钾电负极]: 机理与商业化路线"],"dp":1,"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"as":"该综述系统梳理了钾离子电池负极材料的研究进展，涵盖机理框架、电解质/粘结剂整合策略及商业化路线图。钾离子电池因钾资源丰富、成本低廉被视为钠/锂离子电池的潜在补充方案。文章重点分析了负极材料的储能机制（嵌入型、合金型、转换型）、电解质体系匹配与粘结剂优化对界面稳定性的影响，并评估了从实验室原型向规模化量产过渡的工程挑战，包括体积膨胀、循环寿命和能量密度等核心指标。","ot":"Potassium‐Ion Battery Anodes: Mechanistic Frameworks, Electrolyte/Binder Integration, and Roadmap Toward Commercializati","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (KIBs) are gaining attention as a sustainable alternative to lithium‐ and sodium‐based systems, benefiting from the abundance of potassium, low‐cost salts, and the potential use of biomass‐derived carbons. Their favorable redox potential, compatibility with aluminum current collectors, and stable SEI formation provide unique advantages, though the large ionic radius of K\n                    +\n                    poses challenges for designing stable and high‐capacity anodes. This review categorizes KIB anodes into five classes—alloy‐based, intercalation‐type, conversion‐type, conversion–intercalation hybrids, and organic systems—and critically evaluates their redox mechanisms, electrochemical performance, and structural evolution. Beyond the active materials, we highlight the often‐overlooked but crucial influence of electrolyte formulations (e.g., potassium hexafluorophosphate (KPF\n                    6\n                    ), potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI), or concentrated electrolytes) and binder chemistries in governing solid electrolyte interface (SEI) stability, ion transport, and electrode durability. We also discuss recent commercialization efforts, including Natron Energy's Prussian blue–based systems, and outline a forward‐looking roadmap that integrates materials innovation with electrode–electrolyte engineering and sustainability principles. By bridging mechanistic understanding with industrial perspectives, this review provides guidance for advancing KIBs toward practical, environmentally responsible energy storage solutions."},{"t":"正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对催化剂实现级联耦合的自增强催化循环","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523215?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍钌析氢电催化","kp":["催化剂[AEMWE析氢]: NiRu frustrated Lewis pairs","机制[FLP]: 正反馈自增强循环"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种基于NiRu双金属受阻路易斯酸碱对（FLP）的新型催化剂，通过正反馈机制实现自增强催化循环，用于级联耦合反应体系。该催化剂针对阴离子交换膜水电解槽（AEMWE）中的碱性析氢反应（HER），利用FLP独特的协同活化机制，在温和条件下高效驱动质子还原。自增强循环设计使催化活性随反应进行逐步提升，显著突破了传统催化剂的活性上限，为电催化制氢提供了新范式。","ot":"Positive Feedback‐Driven NiRu Frustrated Lewis Pairs Catalyst Enables a Self‐Reinforcing Catalytic Cycle for Cascade‐Cou","b":"The alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) associated with anion exchange membrane water electrolyzers (AEMWEs) is kinetically hindered by sluggish water dissociation and complex intermediate adsorption, which previous reports have inadequately addressed through isolated optimization, neglecting the intrinsic coupling between HER elementary steps. Herein, we report a frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) catalyst comprising NiRu dual single-atoms and adjacent NiRu nanoclusters anchored on nitrogen-doped carbon (Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC), mimicking the enzymatic positive feedback mechanism that drives a self-reinforcing catalytic cycle and accelerates the coupled elementary steps in a cascade manner. The catalyst featuring spatially proximate Lewis acid and base sites enable sequential reaction steps, where water dissociation occurs at acid sites and hydrogen adsorption proceed at base sites. The two steps are bridged through rapid hydrogen spillover channel, constructing a closed catalytic circuit in which hydrogen consumption at base sites promotes continuous water dissociation at acid sites. Benefiting from this positive feedback loop, Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC achieves a remarkable HER performance and exhibits exceptional long-term durability (>1000 h at 1.0 A cm- 2) in AEMWEs. Our findings demonstrate a new strategy to integrate positive feedback-driven, cascade-coupled catalysis in FLPs systems, offering a promising pathway toward high-performance alkaline HER catalysts for industrial application."},{"t":"孔径动力学控制焦亡中复杂的体积膨胀","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2508022123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Pyroptosis, an inflammatory form of cell death, is characterized by massive cell swelling and plasma membrane rupture. Although swelling was recently shown to occur in two steps, the molecular and biophysical mechanisms driving this process remained unclear. Using fast quantitative microscopy, we reveal that between the two swelling phases, cell volume transiently stabilizes despite sustained plasma membrane permeability to ions and small molecules. From a biophysical perspective, the existence of such a plateau is puzzling, as ion pumps should not be able to regulate cell volume under these conditions. To address this, we developed a physical model based on an ion pump and leak framework that incorporates the dynamics of nonselective pore formation. Experimentally, we demonstrate that the plateau phase is controlled by the dynamics of the gasdermin D (GSDMD) pore enlargement, which is modulated by ninjurin-1 (Ninj1) activation, possibly through intracellular calcium. Ninj1-mediated lesions are also required for the second swelling phase. We further show that fully opened GSDMD pores display an effective hydrodynamic radius slightly above 1.9 nm, providing an in situ upper bound for pore size. Together, our findings demonstrate that pyroptotic volume dysregulation emerges from the successive and interdependent actions of GSDMD and Ninj1, each imparting distinct permeability regimes associated with increased water filtration and decreased ion selectivity due to pore opening. These insights bridge molecular and biophysical perspectives on lytic cell death and may inform the broader understanding of membrane rupture in inflammatory and pathological contexts.","tp":"焦亡膨胀机制","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"细胞焦亡是一种伴随细胞大规模肿胀和质膜破裂的炎症性细胞死亡形式。最新研究利用快速定量显微技术揭示了其复杂的体积膨胀机制。研究发现，细胞肿胀分为两个阶段，而在两阶段之间，尽管质膜对离子和小分子的通透性持续存在，细胞体积却会短暂稳定。从生物物理学角度来看，这种稳定状态是由孔径的动态变化控制的。该发现阐明了驱动焦亡过程中复杂生物物理变化的分子机制。"},{"t":"晶圆键合铁电界面中的极性不连续性、涌现导电性与临界扭转角依赖行为","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68553-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电畴界","kp":["方法[铁电界面]: 热压晶圆键合","发现[扭转界面]: 临界扭转角依赖行为"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探讨了扭曲界面的新奇物理性质。传统研究依赖机械剥离二维材料的堆叠,本文展示了在晶圆级尺度上极性不连续性、涌现导电性以及临界扭转角依赖的行为,为大规模制造扭转电子学器件提供了新路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Polar discontinuities, emergent conductivity, and critical twist-angle-dependent behaviour at wafer-bonded ferroelectric","b":"Probing novel properties, arising from twisted interfaces, has traditionally relied on the stacking of exfoliated two-dimensional materials and the spontaneous formation of van der Waals bonds. So far, investigations involving intimate covalent or ionic bonds have not been a focus. Yet, we show here that an established technique, involving thermocompressional wafer bonding, works well for creating twisted non-van der Waals interfaces. We have successfully bonded z-cut lithium niobate single crystals to create ferroelectric oxide interfaces with strong polar discontinuities and have mapped the associated emergent interfacial conductivity. In some instances, a dramatic change in microstructure occurs, involving local dipolar switching. A twist-induced collapse in the capability of the system to effec8tively screen interfacial bound charge is implied. Importantly, this only occurs around specific moiré twist angles with sparse coincident lattices and associated short-range aperiodicity. In quasicrystals, aperiodicity is known to induce pseudo-bandgaps and we suspect a similar phenomenon here.","aip":1},{"t":"血小板衍生的富含整合素和四跨膜蛋白的系链加剧了严重的炎症","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu2825?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Platelet integrin αIIbβ3 is essential for hemostasis, thrombosis, and inflammation. We found that ligation of αIIbβ3 by von Willebrand factor or fibrin under flow triggered its accumulation in plasma membrane extensions or \"platelet-derived integrin- and tetraspanin-enriched tethers\" (PITTs). PITTs remained anchored to leukocytes or endothelial cells, whereas the partially αIIbβ3-deficient platelet body detached. Although still responsive to stimuli, αIIbβ3-deficient platelets did not support thrombus formation. PITTs promoted leukocyte activation and vascular inflammation in mouse models of infection and endotoxemia, and αIIbβ3 blockade reduced immune-mediated tissue damage. In patients with sepsis, COVID-19, or severe infections, PITT formation and platelet αIIbβ3 loss correlated with disease severity and adverse outcomes. We propose that PITTs are proinflammatory structures that amplify immune responses while contributing to platelet dysfunction in thrombo-inflammatory disease.","tp":"血小板炎症","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究发现，血小板整合素αIIbβ3在血流作用下与血管性血友病因子或纤维蛋白结合，会触发富含整合素和四跨膜蛋白的血小板衍生系链（PITTs）形成。这些系链会附着在白细胞或内皮细胞上，加剧严重炎症。这一发现揭示了血小板在炎症调节中的新机制。"},{"t":"质粒突变率随拷贝数变化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526088123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Plasmids are extrachromosomal DNA molecules that spread by horizontal transfer and shape bacterial evolution. Plasmids are typically present at multiple copies per bacterial cell, and these extra copies increase the supply of plasmid mutations, potentially accelerating their evolution. However, the segregation of plasmid copies to daughter cells is random, introducing an additional layer of genetic drift, termed segregational drift, that might delay plasmid evolution. The interplay between plasmid mutational supply and segregational drift determines the evolutionary rate of plasmid-encoded genes, yet the relative contribution of these opposite forces in plasmid evolution remains unclear. Here, we develop a population genetics framework to predict the rate of plasmid mutations in bacterial populations and validate these predictions using computational, experimental, and bioinformatic approaches. Our findings show that plasmid mutation rates scale logarithmically with copy number and that the supply of new mutations consistently surpasses the impact of segregational drift across all copy numbers. These results underscore plasmids as powerful drivers of bacterial evolvability, where they can potentiate the evolution of critical traits such as antibiotic resistance.","tp":"质粒突变率","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"质粒通过水平转移传播并塑造细菌进化。研究表明，质粒拷贝数增加虽然能提供更多突变机会，但也引入了分离漂变（segregational drift）这一额外的遗传漂变层。这种机制会延迟质粒进化，揭示了质粒突变率与拷贝数之间的复杂关系，对理解细菌适应性进化具有重要意义。"},{"t":"药理学伴侣通过减弱持续的 PERK 激活来减轻噪音引起的听力损失","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2421591123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Noise-induced hearing loss (NIHL) can be either temporary or permanent, depending on the intensity and duration of noise exposure. Excessive noise exposure activates various cellular mechanisms in the cochlea, including oxidative stress, immune responses, and apoptosis. Still, the mechanisms underlying hearing recovery after transient threshold shift (TTS) and lack of recovery after permanent threshold shift (PTS), as well as their therapeutic implications for NIHL, remain unknown. In this study, we performed a comparative analysis of longitudinal changes in the cochlear transcriptome of TTS and PTS mouse models. Our analysis revealed that noise-induced ER stress activates the unfolded protein response (UPR). Notably, the protein kinase R-like endoplasmic reticulum kinase (PERK) branch of the UPR returned to baseline levels following TTS but showed sustained activation following PTS. In addition, the proapoptotic factor C/EBP homologous protein (CHOP) was selectively induced in hair cells following PTS. Administering a PERK inhibitor prior to and following noise exposure hindered hearing restoration after TTS, indicating a requirement for PERK activation in hearing recovery. Inhibition of sustained PERK activation via a PERK inhibitor or reduction of CHOP expression via pharmacological chaperones facilitated partial hearing recovery following PTS. Together, these findings provide insight into the mechanisms underlying NIHL and its prevention, highlighting UPR modulation as a promising therapeutic strategy.","tp":"噪音性听损","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"噪音引起的听力损失（NIHL）的恢复机制尚不明确。研究发现，过度噪音暴露会激活耳蜗中的细胞应激反应，包括氧化应激、免疫反应和细胞凋亡。药理学伴侣可通过减弱持续的PERK激活来减轻听力损伤，这为NIHL的治疗提供了新思路，尤其是在区分暂时性和永久性听力损失方面。"},{"t":"受潜望镜启发的高性能半透明有机光伏双表面反射光学结构","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505427?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机光伏","kp":["器件[半透明有机光伏]: 潜望镜式双表面反射光学结构","[权衡]: AVT与PCE折中","[指标]: 光利用率(LUE)"],"as":"半透明有机光伏器件（ST-OPVs）凭借独特的选择性吸收特性具有广阔应用前景。受潜望镜原理启发,本文设计了具有双表面反射结构的高性能ST-OPVs,有效提升了光利用效率和器件透明度之间的平衡。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Periscope‐Inspired High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Photovoltaics With Dual Surface‐Reflection Optical Structure","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Featuring unique selective absorption, the semi‐transparent organic photovoltaics (ST‐OPVs) hold a bright future for building integration. However, the prevailing ST‐OPVs take a transmission mode (t‐ST‐OPV) and can hardly achieve a good compromise between the averaged visible transmission (AVT) and power conversion efficiency (PCE), rendering a poor light utilization efficiency (LUE) and limiting their practical application. Inspired by the optical path of a periscope, this work developed an ST‐OPV structure with a reflection optical path (r‐ST‐OPV), which takes dual or multiple reflections to make a transmission effect. This structure mitigates the reflection loss and significantly enhances the absorbing selectivity. Facilitated by the sophisticated optical manipulation technique, the r‐ST‐OPV with almost full invisible transmission (AVT ∼ 92.2%) and a PCE of 8.27% is achieved, corresponding to a record LUE of 7.62% among all ST‐OPVs. This work opens up the avenue toward high‐performance organic solar windows for practical application."},{"t":"将人工智能视为劳动力替代会降低民主合法性和政治参与度","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523508123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"AI is expected to reshape society and labor markets, yet experts remain divided on whether AI will primarily displace human labor or generate new employment opportunities. Despite the importance of this debate, little is known about how the public perceives AI's labor market impact-and how these perceptions affect democratic attitudes and behaviors. Large-scale survey data (N = 37,079; 38 European countries) indicate that the public tends to view AI as labor-replacing rather than labor-creating. Controlling for technology-related, political, and sociodemographic factors, these data further show that perceiving AI as labor-replacing (vs. labor-creating) is associated with lower satisfaction with democracy and political engagement with technology. Two preregistered, nationally representative experiments (N = 1,202, United Kingdom; replication study N = 1,200, United States) provide causal evidence for this relationship. Participants exposed to a labor-replacing (vs. labor-creating) AI frame report greater erosion of trust in democracy and lower willingness to politically engage with future AI developments. Together, our findings suggest that perceptions about AI's labor market consequences-regardless of actual outcomes-may decrease democratic legitimacy and public engagement in shaping the future of AI.","tp":"AI民主认知","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"大规模调查（N=37,079，覆盖38个欧洲国家）显示，公众普遍将人工智能视为劳动力替代而非创造就业的工具。这种认知会降低民主合法性和政治参与度。研究强调了AI对劳动力市场的影响如何影响公众对民主制度的态度，呼吁关注AI技术的社会政治影响。"},{"t":"泛科花粉信号控制十字花科物种的种间柱头屏障","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady2347?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Pre-zygotic interspecific incompatibility prevents hybridization between species limiting interbreeding strategies for crop improvement using wild relatives. The\n                    Brassica rapa\n                    female self-incompatibility determinant,\n                    S\n                    -locus receptor kinase (SRK), recognizes interspecific pollen. Here we report the discovery of a pan-Brassicaceae SRK-interacting Interspecific Pollen Signal (SIPS). On\n                    B. rapa\n                    stigmas, SIPSs from\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    and other Brassicaceae species target\n                    Br\n                    SRK and recruit the female fertility regulator FERONIA receptor kinase to increase stigmatic reactive oxygen species and reduce interspecific pollen viability.\n                    Arabidopsis sips\n                    pollen failed to trigger the interspecific incompatibility responses. Unlike self-incompatibility, which is controlled by the polymorphic\n                    S\n                    locus, different genetic variants of SRK interacted comparably with SIPS. This study establishes SIPS-SRK as a Brassicaceae-specific ligand-receptor pair that broadly maintains the stigmatic interspecific barrier in self-incompatible species.","tp":"花粉种间屏障","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"合子前种间不兼容性限制了利用野生近缘种进行作物改良的杂交策略。研究发现芸薹属雌性自交不亲和决定因子S位点受体激酶(SRK)能识别种间花粉，并鉴定出一种泛十字花科SRK相互作用蛋白SIPS(种间花粉信号)。该发现阐明了十字花科物种种间柱头屏障的分子机制，对突破生殖隔离进行作物改良具有重要意义。"},{"t":"古气候模式效应有助于限制气候敏感性和 21 世纪变暖","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511370123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Paleoclimates provide examples of past climate change that inform estimates of modern warming from greenhouse-gas emissions, known as Earth's climate sensitivity. However, differences between past and present climate change must be accounted for when inferring climate sensitivity from paleoclimate evidence. The closest paleoclimate analog to near-term warming from greenhouse-gas emissions is the Pliocene (5.3 to 2.6 Ma), a warm epoch with atmospheric CO2 concentrations similar to today. Recent reconstructions indicate the Pliocene was 1 °C warmer than previously thought, implying higher climate sensitivity, which is also supported by recent reconstructions showing more cooling with reduced CO2 at the Last Glacial Maximum (LGM; 19 to 23 thousand years ago). However, large-scale patterns of paleoclimate temperature change differ strongly from modern projections. Climate feedbacks and sensitivity depend on temperature patterns, and such \"pattern effects\" must be accounted for when using paleoclimates to constrain modern climate sensitivity. Here we combine data-assimilation reconstructions with atmospheric general circulation models to show Earth's climate is more sensitive to Pliocene forcing than modern CO2 forcing. Pliocene ice sheets, topography, and vegetation alter patterns of ocean warming and excite destabilizing cloud feedbacks, and LGM feedbacks are similarly amplified by the North American ice sheets. Accounting for paleoclimate pattern effects produces a best estimate (median) for modern climate sensitivity of 2.8 °C and 66% CI of 2.4 to 3.4 °C (90% CI: 2.1 to 4.0 °C), substantially reducing uncertainty in projections of 21st-century warming.","tp":"古气候敏感性","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"古气候研究为估算现代温室气体排放引起的气候变暖提供了参考。上新世（530万至260万年前）因大气CO2浓度与今天相似，成为近期变暖的最佳古气候类比。研究通过分析古气候模式效应，有助于更准确地约束气候敏感性预测，从而提高对21世纪气候变暖的预测精度。"},{"t":"氧化激活纳米疗法可增强肿瘤免疫力并破坏肿瘤神经串扰以对抗骨转移和癌症","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1292?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Bone metastasis remains a formidable challenge in oncology due to the interdependent triad of immunosuppression, neuropathic pain, and osteolytic destruction. Current treatments fail to holistically address these pathophysiological axes. Here, we develop a reactive oxygen species (ROS)–responsive liposomal nanoplatform (LipoNCs@pGSDMB) that codelivers a polymeric stimulator of interferon genes (STING) agonist and a gasdermin B (GSDMB) plasmid for dual neuro-immune modulation. Upon tumor-selective activation in metastatic bone niches, this nanotherapy induces STING-driven immune priming and GSDMB-mediated pyroptosis, triggering potent antitumor responses. Crucially, LipoNCs@pGSDMB restore voltage-gated calcium channel (VGCC) expression in tumor cells, a prognostic biomarker identified through multiomics analysis of clinical specimens, thereby blocking calcium-dependent neurosignaling and disrupting prometastatic tumor-nerve cross-talk. In breast cancer bone metastasis models, this approach achieves 94% tumor suppression, complete pain resolution, and efficient bone restoration. By converging oxidation-responsive nanomaterial engineering, immunomodulation, and neural circuit reprogramming, this work establishes a paradigm-shifting neuroimmunotherapy platform that dismantles the self-reinforcing metastasis niche while addressing its debilitating sequelae.","tp":"纳米抗骨转移","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"骨转移是肿瘤学重大挑战，涉及免疫抑制、神经病理性疼痛和溶骨性破坏三者相互交织。研究开发了ROS响应型脂质纳米平台，共递送STING激动剂和GSDMB质粒，实现双重神经-免疫调控。该纳米疗法在肿瘤选择性激活后增强抗肿瘤免疫力并破坏肿瘤神经串扰，有望同时应对骨转移的多重病理轴。"},{"t":"通过大数策略法则进行优化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519845123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"This paper proposes a framework for the global optimization of a possibly multimodal continuous function in a bounded rectangular domain. We first show that global optimization is equivalent to an optimal (sampling) strategy formation in a two-armed decision model with known distributions, based on the strategic law of large numbers we establish. There are many optimal strategies in general. We show that a concrete strategy using the sign of the partial gradient of the unique solution to a parabolic partial differential equation (PDE) is asymptotically optimal. Motivated by these results, we propose a class of Strategic Monte Carlo Optimization (SMCO) algorithms, which uses a simple strategy that makes coordinate-wise two-armed decisions based on the signs of the partial gradient (or practically the first difference) of the objective function, without the need of solving PDEs. Under some sufficient conditions, we establish that our SMCO algorithm converges to a local optimizer from a single starting point, and to a global optimizer under a growing set of starting points. Extensive numerical studies demonstrate the suitability of our SMCO algorithms for global optimization well beyond the theoretical guarantees established herein. For a wide range of deterministic and random test functions with challenging landscapes (multimodal, nondifferentiable, discontinuous), our SMCO algorithms perform robustly well, even in high-dimensional ([Formula: see text]) settings. In fact, our algorithms outperform many state-of-the-art global optimizers, as well as local algorithms (with the same set of starting points as ours).","tp":"大数策略优化","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文提出了一种在有限矩形域内对多峰连续函数进行全局优化的新框架。研究基于建立的大数策略定律，证明了全局优化问题等价于在已知分布的双臂决策模型中寻找最优采样策略。该框架指出存在多种最优策略，并具体展示了一种利用偏梯度符号的实用策略，为解决复杂连续函数的全局优化问题提供了理论基础和新的方法论。"},{"t":"基于氢能设备行为的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网","as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior "},{"t":"基于分层多尺度建模的兆瓦级质子交换膜水电解模块优化设计","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020550?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽优化设计","kp":["规模[PEM电解水]: 兆瓦级模块","[建模]: 分层多尺度建模优化设计"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimal design of megawatt-scale proton exchange membrane water electrolysis module by hierarchical multi-scale modeling"},{"t":"工业光伏-储能系统中能源成本与需量电费联合优化的离线逆向强化学习","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储成本优化","kp":["[方法]: 离线逆强化学习","优化目标[工业PV-电池]: 能耗与需量电费联合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery"},{"t":"玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚体中爱因斯坦-德哈斯效应的观察","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adx2872?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"The Einstein-de Haas effect is a phenomenon in which angular momentum is transferred from microscopic spins to mechanical rotation of a macroscopic rigid body. We report an observation of the Einstein-de Haas effect in a spinor-dipolar Bose-Einstein condensate, in which the intrinsic magnetic dipole-dipole interaction mediates coherent transfer of angular momentum from atomic spins to collective circulation of a quantum fluid. The depolarized spinor components displayed ring-shaped density distributions that were confirmed as quantized vortices through matter-wave interferometry, revealing a coherent conversion between spin and orbital angular momentum. This observation opens a pathway to exploring ground-state phases with broken chiral symmetry, spin textures, and mass circulation, as well as the Barnett effect in dipolar quantum gases."},{"t":"铁电ZrO2中一维荷电畴壁的观测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb7280?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电畴壁电子学","kp":["材料[铁电畴壁]: ZrO2","[结构]: 一维荷电畴壁(180°头对头/尾对尾)","[应用]: 畴壁纳米电子学"],"as":"铁电电荷畴壁（CDWs）具有纳米级厚度和束缚电荷,通常被视为超薄导电通道。本研究在铁电ZrO₂中观测到了一维电荷畴壁,为理解和应用畴壁电子学器件提供了新发现,对非易失性存储和纳米电子学具有重要意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Observation of one-dimensional, charged domain walls in ferroelectric ZrO2","b":"Ferroelectric charged domain walls (CDWs) with nanoscale thickness and bound charges are typically viewed as ultrathin, reconfigurable, and highly conductive two-dimensional components for domain wall nanoelectronics. Dimensional confinement of such polar topological structures has the potential to increase device density and unlock novel functionalities. We report 180° head-to-head and tail-to-tail CDWs exhibiting one-dimensional (1D) characteristics. These 1D CDWs are confined within the polar layers of ferroelectric ZrO2 and have atomic-scale dimensions in both width and thickness. Quantitative analysis unveils a distinct screening mechanism of these walls whereby bound polarization charges are compensated by self-balancing oxygen occupancy. We demonstrate electric field-driven manipulation of these 1D CDWs, revealing the microscopic coupling between polarization switching and oxygen-ion transport.","aip":1},{"t":"赝能隙开始时自旋电荷相关性的紧急缩放的观察","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525539123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In strongly correlated materials, interacting electrons are entangled and form collective quantum states, resulting in rich low-temperature phase diagrams. Notable examples include cuprate superconductors, in which superconductivity emerges at low doping out of an unusual “pseudogap” metallic state above the critical temperature. The Fermi–Hubbard model, describing a wide range of phenomena associated with strong electron correlations, still offers major computational challenges despite its simple formulation. In this context, ultracold atoms quantum simulators have provided invaluable insights into the microscopic nature of correlated quantum states. Here, we use a quantum gas microscope Fermi–Hubbard simulator to explore a wide range of dopings and temperatures in a regime where a pseudogap is known to develop. By measuring multipoint correlation functions up to fifth order, we uncover a universal scaling behavior in magnetic and higher-order spin–charge correlations characterized by a doping-dependent temperature scale. Accurate comparisons with determinant Quantum Monte Carlo and Minimally Entangled Typical Thermal States simulations confirm that this temperature scale is comparable to the pseudogap temperature\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          T\n                          \n                            \n                            ∗\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . Our quantitative findings reveal a qualitative behavior of magnetic properties and spin–charge correlations in an emergent pseudogap and pave the way toward the exploration of charge pairing and collective phenomena expected at lower temperatures.","tp":"强关联电子","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"强关联材料中电子相互纠缠形成集体量子态，铜基超导体中超导电性从赝能隙金属态中涌现。研究利用费米-哈伯德模型研究强关联电子现象，观察到了赝能隙起始时自旋电荷相关性的紧急标度行为。该实验为理解赝能隙的物理本质及其与超导态的关系提供了关键实验证据。"},{"t":"核MBL-1通过肉碱棕榈酰转移酶调节秀丽隐杆线虫线粒体形态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514994123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Expansion of nucleotide repeat sequences is linked to a growing number of neuromuscular degenerative disorders. Metabolic changes, including disruptions in mitochondrial function and dynamics, characterize these disorders and are believed to contribute to organismal toxicity. To investigate how toxic RNA repeats affect mitochondria, we used a Caenorhabditis elegans model that expresses expanded CUG repeat RNAs in muscle cells and recapitulates muscle dysfunction. We found that the RNA-binding protein Muscleblind-like 1 (MBL-1) is essential for normal mitochondrial function and regulates organelle morphology. In animals expressing expanded CUG repeats, where MBL-1 function is impaired, we identified two distinct mechanisms of mitochondrial disruption: altered mitochondrial morphology regulated by MBL-1, and oxidative phosphorylation (OxPhos) dysfunction occurring independently of MBL-1. Our data further show that changes in mitochondrial morphology are specifically linked to nuclear MBL-1 dysfunction, which affects cpt-3 expression, a gene encoding carnitine palmitoyltransferase-an enzyme required for fatty acid transport into mitochondria. This mechanism is conserved, with similar disruptions observed in patients with Myotonic Dystrophy type 1. Importantly, our findings indicate that increased organelle fragmentation is not central to cellular pathogenesis. Instead, OxPhos dysfunction appears to be a primary contributor to organismal toxicity."},{"t":"新型抗菌纳米细菌素：乳酸菌衍生、自组装和增强的卓越抗菌素","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511782?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"As antimicrobial resistance emerges as a critical global health threat, food-grade bacteriocin, a kind of antimicrobial peptide (AMPs), offers promising new therapies but is hampered by poor stability and water solubility. To address this, we engineered a carrier-free self-assembly strategy: a novel bacteriocin from lactic acid bacteria in fermented food was modified to increase its hydrophobicity, enabling spontaneous formation of nano-antimicrobial bacteriocins (NAMBs) in TSB, LB, and MH media. These NAMBs exhibit a broader antimicrobial spectrum and enhanced potency against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative pathogens, including Listeria monocytogenes, Acinetobacter baumannii, and Vibrio parahaemolyticus, as evidenced by markedly reduced minimum inhibitory concentrations in vitro and superior therapeutic efficacy in infected mice in vivo. Mechanistic investigations reveal targeted disruption of cell envelope metabolism: in L. monocytogenes, NAMBs fortify the peptidoglycan layer while depleting wall teichoic acids and lipoteichoic acids, impairing carbohydrate metabolism and membrane transport; in A. baumannii, they downregulate fatty acid synthesis, disorder phospholipid composition, and weaken lipopolysaccharide integrity, culminating in membrane destabilization and cell death. These dual actions-disordering metabolic processes and remodeling bacterial cell walls or membranes-highlight the versatility of NAMBs. Our carrier-free self-assembly approach thus overcomes AMP stability and solubility limitations and paves the way for next-generation antimicrobial therapies.","tp":"纳米抗菌素","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对全球抗菌素耐药性危机，食品级细菌素作为抗菌肽具有治疗潜力但受限于稳定性和水溶性。研究采用无载体自组装策略，将发酵食品中乳酸菌来源的新型细菌素进行疏水性修饰，使其在TSB、LB和MH培养基中自发形成纳米抗菌细菌素。该方法显著提升了细菌素的抗菌性能和稳定性。"},{"t":"没有证据表明单剂量裸盖菇素对三种小鼠疼痛模型具有立即或持久的镇痛作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68763-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"The psychedelic psilocybin may have lasting therapeutic effects for patients with chronic pain syndromes. Some preclinical data suggest these putative benefits derive from direct analgesic effects; however, this possibility has not been comprehensively tested in preclinical models. Here, we evaluated the analgesic properties of a single exposure to psilocybin at acute and chronic time points in Complete Freund’s Adjuvant-induced inflammatory pain, spared nerve injury model of neuropathic pain, and acid-induced muscle pain. Across these models, we tested a range of doses (0.3, 2, and 10 mg/kg i.p.) in male and female mice using multiple behavioral assays evaluating sensory aspects (von Frey, cold plate, Hargreaves, thermal place preference, and muscle withdrawal threshold) and functional aspects of pain (marble burying). We further tested the effects of psilocybin on the affective dimension of pain in a surgical model of acute pain (mouse grimace scale). Except for cold sensitivity, we found no effect of psilocybin across pain models, behavioral assays, drug doses, or sex. The apparent reduction in cold sensitivity may be explained by profound hypothermia induced by psilocybin rather than true analgesia."},{"t":"硝酸盐诱导的 NLP1 SUMO 化调节硝酸盐信号传导和根结瘤","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518288123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nitrate serves both as an essential nutrient and a key signaling molecule that shapes plant growth. In legumes, high nitrate concentrations suppress symbiotic nitrogen fixation, a process mediated by MtNLP1 (NIN-like protein1). Although nitrate minimally affects NLP transcript levels, it strongly controls their nuclear localization. How posttranslational modifications regulate MtNLP1 function, however, has remained unclear. Here, we show that nitrate induces SUMOylation of MtNLP1 at lysine 589 and 795 and that this modification is essential for its biological activity. Loss of these SUMO sites compromises nitrate-mediated inhibition of nodulation and weakens MtNLP1 interactions with MtNIN and itself. Components of the SUMOylation machinery in\n                    Medicago truncatula\n                    physically interact and are essential for both nodulation and nitrate responsiveness, indicating broader roles for SUMOylation in symbiosis. A SUMO-deficient\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    AtNLP7\n                    3KR\n                    mutant fails to complement the\n                    Atnlp7-1\n                    phenotype, demonstrating that SUMOylation is a conserved regulatory mechanism among NLPs. Together, our findings reveal SUMOylation as a previously unrecognized layer of regulation that integrates nutrient signaling with root nodule symbiosis.","tp":"硝酸盐结瘤","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"硝酸盐既是必需营养物又是关键信号分子，高浓度硝酸盐抑制豆科植物共生固氮，该过程由MtNLP1蛋白介导。虽然硝酸盐对NLP转录水平影响很小，但强烈控制其核定位。研究发现硝酸盐诱导MtNLP1第589位赖氨酸的SUMO化修饰，揭示了翻译后修饰调控MtNLP1功能的分子机制，为优化豆科作物氮利用提供新思路。"},{"t":"手性配体实现的镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物和氯化物的不对称还原Heck反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525600?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化还原偶联","kp":["催化剂[还原Heck]: Ni+手性NHC配体","底物拓展[芳烃]: 溴化物/氯化物"],"dp":1,"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了镍催化、手性配体促进的烯烃与芳基溴化物/氯化物的对映选择性还原 Heck 反应新方法。传统不对称还原Heck反应多依赖高活性芳基碘化物，限制了底物范围。该工作通过设计新型手性配体，实现了使用廉价易得的芳基溴化物和氯化物作为底物，拓展了反应的实用性和原子经济性。方法在温和条件下即可构建手性C-C键，具有优异的对映选择性和区域选择性，为手性分子合成提供了实用工具。","ot":"Nickel‐Catalyzed Enantioselective Reductive Heck Reaction of Olefins with Aryl Bromides and Chlorides Enabled by Chiral ","b":"Despite significant advances in catalytic asymmetric reductive Heck reaction, most reported methods rely on highly reactive aryl electrophiles and exhibit a limited olefin scope. Expanding this transformation to employ more abundant and cost-effective aryl bromides and chlorides with common olefins has remained a major challenge, owing to the inertness of C─Br and C─Cl bonds and the resulting difficulty in achieving chemo-, regio-, and stereocontrol. Here, we report that nickel catalysts combined with chiral dihydroimidazolium-derived N-heterocyclic carbene ligands bearing remote meta-substitution enable highly efficient and enantioselective reductive Heck reaction of a broad range of olefins-including styrenes, 1,3-dienes, and aliphatic alkenes-with aryl bromides and chlorides. Experimental studies and DFT calculations elucidated the origins of stereo induction and structure-reactivity relationships. This robust methodology provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, enantioenriched benzylic frameworks."},{"t":"神经元 GPR75 缺陷可防止人源化小鼠模型中饮食引起的肥胖","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady7993?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"GPR75, a G protein–coupled receptor implicated in human obesity through loss-of-function variants, has emerged as a promising regulator of energy and metabolic homeostasis. To dissect its tissue-specific functions, we generated a humanized floxed\n                    Gpr75\n                    mouse model with conditional deletions in the brain and adipose tissue. Mice with brain-specific Gpr75 deletion using Nestin-Cre were resistant to diet-induced obesity, primarily through suppressed food intake and modest increases in energy expenditure. In contrast, adipocyte-specific deletion of Gpr75 had minimal effects on systemic metabolism but modestly enhanced mitochondrial oxygen consumption in brown adipose tissue under cold exposure. Gpr75 expression was up-regulated in key brain regions and down-regulated in white adipose tissue under high-fat diet conditions, supporting a predominant central role in metabolic adaptation. Histological and transcriptomic analyses further revealed depot-specific effects on adipocyte morphology and hepatic lipid accumulation in global knockouts. These findings position GPR75 as a critical regulator of central energy balance and provide a mechanistic framework for developing brain-targeted therapies against obesity."},{"t":"神经化学成像揭示了季节性群居田鼠物种中多巴胺动力学随光周期的变化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509561123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Studying dopamine signaling in nonmodel organisms is crucial for understanding the broad range of behaviors not represented in traditional model systems. However, exploring new species is often hindered by a scarcity of tools suitable for nongenetic models. In this work, we introduce near-infrared catecholamine nanosensors (nIRCats) to investigate dopamine dynamics in meadow voles, a rodent species that exhibits distinct changes in social behavior and neurobiology across photoperiods. We observe increased dopamine release and release site density in voles housed in short photoperiods (which induce a social phenotype), suggesting adaptations linked to environmental changes. Moreover, pharmacological and extracellular manipulations demonstrate that short photoperiod/social voles exhibit heightened responsiveness to dopamine-increasing interventions and resilience against suppressive conditions. These findings highlight a significant association between dopamine signaling and photoperiod-driven changes in social behavior and establish nIRCats as an effective tool for expanding our understanding of dopamine dynamics across nonmodel organisms.","tp":"多巴胺传感","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"在非模式生物中研究多巴胺信号对理解传统模型无法涵盖的行为范围至关重要。研究引入近红外儿茶酚胺纳米传感器，考察草原田鼠这一随光周期表现出社会行为和神经生物学显著变化的啮齿类物种的多巴胺动力学。观察到多巴胺信号随光周期的变化规律，为研究季节性社会行为的神经化学基础提供了新方法。"},{"t":"负热膨胀颗粒实现高性能超耐用热电模块","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3783?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电模块稳定性","kp":["策略[热电器件]: 负热膨胀颗粒精确控制CTE","目标[热电器件]: 提升界面热膨胀兼容性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出利用负热膨胀（NTE）颗粒解决固态电池、柔性电子等多材料界面热膨胀失配问题。不同材料的热膨胀系数差异导致器件在温度变化下产生界面应力、分层和失效，是制约固态电池和柔性电子长期稳定性的核心瓶颈。NTE颗粒可在升温时收缩、降温时膨胀，作为界面填充或复合组分，主动补偿热应变，显著提升多材料界面的兼容性和器件的超长循环耐久性。该策略为跨材料界面的热管理提供了普适性工程方案。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Negative-thermal-expansion particles enable high-performance and ultradurable thermoelectric modules","b":"Interfacial compatibility across multiple material parts governs device stability in solid-state batteries, flexible electronics, and high-temperature fuel cells. For thermoelectric devices, researchers principally focused on chemical reactivity and mechanical properties of material components, whereas precise control of the coefficient of thermal expansion (CTE) remains elusive. Here, we propose an innovative strategy using negative-thermal-expansion (NTE) particles to regulate CTE and resolve interfacial incompatibility. Incorporating predesigned interface reaction–free NTE particles into Bi\n                    2\n                    Te\n                    3\n                    -based, Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    -based, and PbTe-based materials effectively improves thermoelectric performance, alleviates thermal stress, and enhances interfacial stability across a broad temperature range (300 to 800 kelvin). Notably, the NTE-modified Mg\n                    3\n                    (Sb,Bi)\n                    2\n                    /Bi\n                    0.4\n                    Sb\n                    1.6\n                    Te\n                    3\n                    two-pair module achieves a record-high conversion efficiency (η) of 8.4% at Δ\n                    T\n                     = 350 K with a 71% interfacial thermal stress reduction, maintaining a stable interface and unchanged η throughout 1000-hour (42 days) thermal cycling. Our strategy establishes a universal approach for improving interfacial compatibility in high-temperature functional modules including thermal-barrier coatings and solar thermophotovoltaic devices."},{"t":"天然氢的技术经济性与估值","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000589?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然氢技术经济评价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Natural hydrogen techno-economics and valuation"},{"t":"北极变暖中的冲突叙述","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed7095?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"A journalist humanizes the rapidly changing region as global strategic interest builds."},{"t":"髓磷脂通过少突胶质细胞祖细胞的组成型分化进行修复","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu2896?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oligodendrocytes form myelin sheaths around axons to enable rapid signaling within neural circuits. The generation of new oligodendrocytes through differentiation of oligodendrocyte precursor cells (OPCs) promotes myelin plasticity and repair in the adult brain. Here, we performed genetic interrogation and in vivo analysis of OPCs in the mouse brain to determine their differentiation dynamics. Our results show that OPCs attempt to differentiate throughout the adult central nervous system with spatial and temporal regularity. The differentiation rate was not influenced by myelin demand or oligodendrocyte loss and declined with age and in response to acute inflammation. The results suggest that OPC differentiation is governed primarily by constitutive processes and might be negatively influenced by aging and inflammation."},{"t":"纠缠原子传感器阵列的多参数估计","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adt2442?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子多参数测量","kp":["技术[量子计量]: 多参数量子估计","[系统]: 纠缠原子传感器阵列","[突破]: 实验演示（此前仅理论）"],"as":"量子计量学利用多粒子纠缠态提升测量精度，突破经典散粒噪声极限。本文提出利用纠缠原子传感器阵列实现多参数同时估计的方案——通过原子间的纠缠关联，单个传感器阵列可同时高精度测量多个物理量（如磁场分量、梯度等），而非传统单参数逐次测量。该方法在纠缠资源分配和参数间测量反 trade-off 之间寻求最优平衡，有望应用于高精度磁场成像、惯性导航和基础物理常数测量等场景，是量子增强传感从实验室走向实用化的关键一步。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multiparameter estimation with an array of entangled atomic sensors","b":"In quantum metrology, entangled states of many-particle systems are investigated to enhance measurement precision of the most precise clocks and field sensors. Whereas single-parameter quantum metrology is well established, joint multiparameter estimation poses conceptual challenges and has been explored only theoretically. We experimentally demonstrated multiparameter quantum metrology with an array of entangled atomic ensembles. By splitting a spin-squeezed ensemble, we created an atomic sensor array featuring intersensor entanglement that can be flexibly configured to enhance measurement precision of multiple parameters jointly. Using an optimal estimation protocol, we achieved substantial gains over the standard quantum limit in key multiparameter estimation tasks, thus grounding the concept of quantum enhancement of field sensor arrays and imaging devices."},{"t":"分子级能量耗散与微孔工程协同增强阴离子交换膜性能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525998?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阴离子交换膜","kp":["[构建基块]: 螺旋四功能四苯基乙烯","[功能]: 离子传输通道与力学增强网络协同构建","[目标]: 破解离子电导率与力学强度权衡"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"阴离子交换膜（AEM）长期面临离子传导率与机械强度之间的固有权衡。本研究通过分子级能量耗散与微孔工程的协同策略，在聚合物骨架中引入能量耗散基团以增强膜的机械韧性，同时构建连续微孔通道以促进氢氧根离子的高效传输。该策略打破了传统AEM中导电性与稳定性难以兼顾的瓶颈，为燃料电池和电解水制氢等清洁能源器件提供了兼具高离子传导率和优异耐久性的膜材料设计方案。","ot":"Molecular‐Level Energy Dissipation and Micropore Engineering Synergistically Enhance Anion Exchange Membrane Performance","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Overcoming the intrinsic trade‐off between ionic conductivity and mechanical robustness remains a long‐standing challenge for anion exchange membranes (AEMs). Here, we report a helical tetra‐functional building block derived from tetraphenyl‐ethylene (TPE) that enables the simultaneous construction of interconnected ion‐transport channels and mechanically reinforced polymer networks. The non‐coplanar molecular configuration of TPE generates continuous microporous pathways, which establish efficient pathways for ion transport and enable 22.6% enhancement in H\n                    2\n                    O/OH\n                    −\n                    species diffusion. Meanwhile, restricted intramolecular rotations of the phenyl rings dissipate mechanical stress and prevent brittle fracture. Concurrently, the tetra‐functional structure yields a cross‐linked network, synergistically endowing the exceptional mechanical robustness of 79% enhancement in transverse tensile strength and 43% improvement in longitudinal hardness. Anion exchange membrane water electrolyzers (AEMWEs) operating under harsh conditions of temperature and high alkalinity were used for application evaluation. The QTPE‐x‐configurated cell delivered an enhanced current density and exceptional operational stability. The molecular‐level design strategy successfully decouples ionic conductivity and mechanical integrity, providing a general framework for the development of high‐performance AEMs in sustainable energy conversion."},{"t":"分子取向电子通道实现超快充电实用化锂金属电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01961-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池快充","kp":["[策略]: 溶剂分子排列对齐构建电子通道","[目标]: 加速界面电荷转移抑制锂枝晶","[应用场景]: 超快充实用化锂金属电池"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"界面电荷转移是电化学体系的速率决定步骤，迟缓的动力学严重限制了锂金属电池的快充性能。研究提出在电极界面构建分子级有序排列的电子通道，通过调控界面电子传输路径，显著降低电荷转移势垒，实现锂离子的高效均匀沉积。该策略有效抑制了快充过程中的枝晶生长和极化问题，使实用化锂金属电池具备超快充电能力，为高能量密度电池的快充应用开辟了新路径。","ot":"Molecularly aligned electron channels for ultrafast-charging practical lithium-metal batteries","b":"Charge transfer across interfaces constitutes the rate-determining step in electrochemical systems. Sluggish kinetics triggers side reactions and hazardous surface morphologies, as represented by dendritic/dead lithium (Li0) in Li-metal batteries (LMBs), especially under ultrafast charging (UFC). Here we report an approach to accelerate interfacial charge transfer by redesigning the solvent molecular structure into a distinctive planar coordination of lone-pair electrons (LPEs) with alkaline cations (Li+ or Na+). This planar-aligned electron channel (PAEC) greatly strengthens the coupling between LPEs and Li+, promoting Li+/Li0 redox reaction kinetics and reversibility. The designed electrolyte dramatically enables stable cycling of industrial 2 Ah Li||LiNi0.8Mn0.1Co0.1O2 pouch cells at an ultrahigh rate of 4 C, achieving 100% full charge within 15 min at a charging power density of 1,747.6 W kg−1. We establish a link between the solvation electronic structure and charge-transfer dynamics, highlighting a potential strategy for electrolyte design under extreme electrochemical conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"StopGo/2A 翻译重新编码的分子结构和多样性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528667123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Viral 2A sequences trigger a cotranslational peptide bond formation “skipping” event, termed “StopGo,” to generate two separate proteins from a single open reading frame without classical termination. To investigate the mechanism of StopGo, we determined the cryo-EM structure of a mammalian ribosome positioned at the foot-and-mouth disease virus 2A (F2A) site. The structure shows how interactions between the F2A nascent chain (NC) and the ribosomal exit tunnel induce a conformational change in the peptidyl transferase center that precludes further translation elongation but instead pre-exposes the P-tRNA:F2A-NC ester bond for hydrolysis and NC release. Additionally, we bioinformatically characterized variation and host association across nearly 10,000 StopGo sequences identified in virus genomes. We expanded the canonical core motif to (D/G/C/N)(V/I)ExNPGP and identified additional rare but functional variants. We also revealed several distinct upstream motifs that we showed biochemically to be important for StopGo activity. Interestingly, although StopGo is known to be functionally active in plants, we found no evidence for natural utilization of StopGo by plant viruses. Overall, these findings provide valuable insights into a unique translation recoding mechanism, and lay foundations for further optimization of multigene expression in biotechnology."},{"t":"PrfH亚家族拯救翻译中停滞的受损和完整核糖体的分子和结构基础","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7378?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In bacteria, mRNAs degradation and ribotoxin-induced RNA damage are two main events that lead to the stalling of protein translation. The ubiquitous trans-translation system and several alternative rescue factors rescue the stalled ribosomes caused by truncated mRNAs lacking the stop codons. On the other hand, protein release factor homolog (PrfH) is the only known factor to rescue the stalled ribosome damaged by ribotoxins. Here, we show that a subfamily of PrfH, exemplified by PrfH from\n                    Capnocytophaga gingivalis\n                    (\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH), rescues both types of stalled ribosomes. Biochemical assays demonstrate that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH hydrolyzes the peptides attached to P-site transfer RNAs when in complex with both the damaged and intact ribosomes. Cryo-EM structures revealed that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH uses distinct regions to recognize two stalled ribosomes to orient the GGQ motif for peptide hydrolysis. Thus, using a combination of bioinformatic, biochemical, and structural characterization, we have uncovered a family of ribosome rescue factors that have dual activities to resolve two distinct stalled protein translation events in bacteria."},{"t":"线粒体异质性驱动大豆疫霉的杀菌剂抗性进化，并具有相关的适应性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4601?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial complex III inhibitors, such as ametoctradin, are crucial for controlling oomycete diseases. However, the increasing severity of fungicide resistance necessitates urgent clarification of its evolutionary mechanisms to optimize disease management and delay resistance development. The DddA-derived cytosine base editors (DdCBEs)–mediated base editing in oomycetes confirmed that the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation is sufficient to confer ametoctradin resistance in\n                    Phytophthora sojae\n                    . We clarified that low-resistant and medium-resistant mutants serve as transitional populations during the resistance evolution process, with high-resistant mutants eventually becoming the dominant population. We revealed the dynamic changes in mitochondrial heterogeneity under fungicide selection, proving that the gradual increase of mutated mitochondria drives resistance evolution. There is a trade-off between ametoctradin resistance and fitness. While the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation confers this resistance, it impairs mitochondrial function and thereby reduces fitness. Up-regulation of\n                    TFAM1\n                    , however, can partially offset this fitness cost. Resistance evolution in plant pathogens involves not only standing variation but also de novo mutations, providing unique insights into the “chicken-and-egg” dilemma.","tp":"杀菌剂抗性","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"线粒体复合体III抑制剂是控制卵菌病害的重要手段，但日益严重的杀菌剂抗性问题亟需阐明其进化机制。利用DdCBE碱基编辑技术证实PsCytb S33L突变足以赋予大豆疫霉抗药性。研究发现线粒体异质性驱动杀菌剂抗性进化，并伴随相关的适应性代价，为优化病害管理和延缓抗性发展提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"降低清洁能源的污染成本","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed8334?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/开采技术","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"A journalist advocates for sustainable mining and empowering affected communities.","tp":"清洁能源污染","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":"该文为一篇评论性报道，记者呼吁关注可持续采矿实践并赋权受影响的社区，以降低清洁能源转型带来的环境污染和社会成本。随着清洁能源技术对矿产需求激增，采矿活动的环境代价日益受到关注，需要在能源转型与环境保护之间寻求平衡。"},{"t":"水系铝离子电池中利用聚两性离子水凝胶电解质抑制析氢反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70677?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系铝离子电池","kp":["电解质[水系铝离子电池]: 聚两性离子水凝胶","[机制]: 抗聚电解质效应抑制析氢","[目标问题]: 水裂解释氢与腐蚀"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"水系铝离子电池因其安全性高、成本低和高理论容量被视为规模化储能的有力候选，但析氢副反应（HER）严重降低了库仑效率和循环寿命。本研究提出采用聚两性离子水凝胶电解质，利用其独特的离子溶剂化调控和物理屏障效应，有效抑制界面处的水分子还原反应。该策略在保持高铝离子传导率的同时大幅抑制析氢，显著提升了水系铝离子电池的循环稳定性和可逆性，为大规模安全储能提供了新思路。","ot":"Mitigating Hydrogen Evolution Reaction with Polyzwitterionic Hydrogel Electrolyte in Aqueous Aluminum‐ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous aluminum‐ion batteries are promising for grid‐scale energy storage due to their safety, low‐cost, and high theoretical specific capacity. However, the development is hindered by the hydrogen evolution reaction from water splitting and corrosion, causing poor reversibility in aluminum plating/stripping. Utilizing strong anti‐polyelectrolyte effect from aluminum cations and perchlorate anions, and the outstanding hydration strength from 2‐methacryloyloxyethyl phosphorylcholine (MPC), this study introduces a novel polyzwitterionic hydrogel electrolyte (PZHE) for AAIBs with MPC monomer and aluminum perchlorate electrolyte. PZHE binds water molecules under lean‐water conditions, greatly reducing free water activity and expanding the electrochemical stability window into 2.5 V. Despite limited water activity, ion migration channels created by zwitterionic phosphorylcholine groups enable high ionic conductivity of 4.22 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    at 25°C. Consequently, the PZHE symmetrical cell achieves 600 h of reversible aluminum plating/stripping at a low overpotential of less than 0.2 V. With a potassium nickel hexacyanoferrate (KNHCF) cathode, the coin cell exhibits an initial discharge capacity of 66 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    with a 1.2 V voltage plateau and retains 71% capacity after 400 cycles. Additionally, it demonstrates excellent capacity stability in the rest‐cycling test (6 months) and pouch cell setup (200 cycles), highlighting its potential for grid‐scale energy storage."},{"t":"墨西哥基因组宝库可以指导医疗决策","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6705?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Study reveals role of \"fine-grained\" ancestry in predicting drug response.","tp":"基因组医学","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"最新研究揭示了墨西哥人基因组中“细粒度”血统信息在预测个体药物反应方面的重要作用。该研究表明，深入挖掘墨西哥丰富的基因宝库不仅有助于理解不同族群的遗传多样性，还能为个性化医疗和精准用药提供关键的科学指导。通过将精细的基因谱系数据与药物代谢相结合，医疗决策的准确性和治疗效果有望得到显著提升。"},{"t":"代谢重编程与生物量再分配实现莱茵衣藻混合营养生长优化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522572123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微藻混合营养生长","kp":["[混养生长]: 代谢重编程+生物量重分配","[瓶颈]: 快速生长未转化为高产物收率"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"水生光合系统贡献了全球约一半的碳固定能力，是潜在的可持续生物制造平台。该研究以模式微藻莱茵衣藻为对象，通过代谢重编程和生物量重新分配策略，优化其混合营养生长模式（同时利用光合作用和有机碳源）。研究鉴定了调控碳代谢流向的关键节点，使藻细胞在混合营养条件下实现更高的生长速率和生物质产量，为微藻大规模培养和碳固定生物技术提供了工程化改造策略。","ot":"Metabolic rewiring and biomass redistribution enable optimized mixotrophic growth in Chlamydomonas","b":"Aquatic photosynthetic systems account for approximately one-half of all global carbon assimilation and could be a significant source of renewable fuels and feedstocks. However, rapid growth and biomass production in algae have not always translated into high product yields, partly because central metabolism is context specific, with metabolic fluxes being influenced by nutrient conditions and other environmental factors. In the green microalga Chlamydomonas reinhardtii (Chlamydomonas), mixotrophic cultures (acetate + light) grow far faster than phototrophic (light only) or heterotrophic (acetate + dark) cultures, even though acetate partially suppresses photosynthesis. Here, an isotopic dilution strategy with unlabeled acetate was combined with 13CO2 transient labeling to perform isotopically nonstationary metabolic flux analysis (INST-MFA) and to directly compare autotrophic and mixotrophic metabolism in Chlamydomonas supported by data from transcriptomics, proteomics, and metabolomics. INST-MFA indicated that acetate induces a synergistic rewiring of metabolism, conserving carbon by using the glyoxylate cycle and suppressing gluconeogenesis, the latter of which was discordant with omics results and prior models. Additionally, our data provide a plausible rationale for the well-known suppression of photosynthesis by acetate. We propose that reduced total protein content in mixotrophic versus phototrophic cells, much of which is attributed to reduced levels of photosynthetic proteins, decreases the costly metabolic burden of protein synthesis and represents a growth rate optimization strategy."},{"t":"超构放大的暗场干涉散射显微成像","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68697-6","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超构暗场显微","kp":["[检测目标]: 纳米级生物颗粒","[方法]: 超构表面放大暗场干涉散射","[特点]: 无标记检测"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"无标记光学检测纳米级生物颗粒对非侵入性生物研究极具吸引力，但传统暗场显微技术的检测灵敏度受限于散射信号微弱和背景噪声。该研究提出\"元放大暗场干涉散射显微\"技术，利用超构表面对散射光的相位和振幅进行精准调控，将微小颗粒的干涉散射信号进行指数级放大。该平台实现了对单个纳米级生物颗粒的无标记、高对比度实时观测，为病毒检测、细胞外囊泡分析和单分子生物物理研究提供了突破性工具。","ot":"Meta-amplified dark-field interferometric scattering microscopy","b":"Label-free optical detection of nanometer-scale bioparticles is highly desirable for noninvasive biological studies but challenging due to the weak scattering signals that are difficult to distinguish from the illumination background. Interferometric scattering microscopy (iSCAT) has enabled high-sensitivity imaging by detecting the interference between the particle’s scattered light and a reference beam. However, enhancing the detection sensitivity and the image contrast for small particles continues to be a challenge in iSCAT. Here, we introduce meta-amplified dark-field interferometric scattering microscopy (MAD-iSCAT), which leverages a plasmonic metasurface to drastically enhance nanoparticle detection sensitivity in iSCAT. By employing a metasurface comprising sub-diffraction plasmonic meta-atom arrays, MAD-iSCAT generates bright radiation modes that intensely scatter light toward the far field in the presence of a detection nanoparticle, substantially amplifying the sensitivity. In the absence of a nanoparticle, the metasurface produces minimal background due to the dark collective mode, resulting in improved image contrast. We present a theoretical analysis of amplified interferometric imaging using designed metasurfaces and experimentally demonstrate enhancements in contrast and signal-to-noise ratio for detecting dielectric nanoparticles, exosomes, and proteins. Our approach offers broad applications in label-free biosensing and optical mass spectrometry, enabling significantly improved throughput and sensitivity."},{"t":"满足髓磷脂的需要","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee4609?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oligodendrocyte progenitor cell differentiation is constitutive across brain regions.","tp":"髓鞘分化","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"最新研究表明，少突胶质前体细胞的分化过程在各个大脑区域中呈现出原生且普遍存在的特性。这一发现挑战了以往对该细胞分化机制受局部环境强烈限制的传统认知，突出了细胞内在固有的分化潜力。该成果对于深入理解中枢神经系统髓鞘形成机制具有关键意义，并为治疗多发性硬化症等髓鞘相关脱髓鞘疾病提供了全新的干预靶点和研究思路。"},{"t":"人拓扑异构酶 IIIα–RMI1–RMI2 松弛 DNA 超螺旋的机制基础","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2406949123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Topoisomerase enzymes are essential for the regulation of DNA topology. Human topoisomerase IIIα is a Type 1A topoisomerase that exists as a complex with RMI1 and RMI2, known as TRR. The TRR complex can unlink entwined DNA strands and is known to be important for resolving DNA replication and recombination intermediates. It has recently been proposed that TRR can also relax transient negatively supercoiled loops of DNA generated by the translocase PICH and that this activity may help to facilitate the resolution of ultrafine anaphase bridges (UFBs) between segregating sister chromatids. However, the mechanism by which TRR interacts with, and processes, negatively supercoiled DNA is not well understood. Here, we establish a single-molecule strategy to simultaneously measure real-time changes in supercoiling density and visualize the interactions of TRR with underwound DNA using a combination of optical tweezers and fluorescence imaging. We demonstrate that TRR relaxes highly negatively supercoiled DNA in a processive manner and that the timescale for relaxation is less than the expected lifetime of the negatively supercoiled loops generated by PICH. We also show that in the absence of free protein in solution, TRR remains bound to the DNA for long time periods after the torsional stress has been released. Our findings provide a mechanistic basis for how TRR can relax negative supercoils, consistent with its proposed role in UFB resolution. Moreover, our assay could also be widely applied to study the interactions of other families of topoisomerases with negatively supercoiled DNA.","tp":"DNA拓扑酶","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"人拓扑异构酶IIIα与RMI1、RMI2蛋白结合形成TRR复合物，在维持DNA拓扑结构稳定中发挥着至关重要的作用。该复合物能够有效解开DNA双链交联，是解决DNA复制和重组中间体的核心枢纽。近期研究进一步提出，TRR复合物还能松弛由PICH转位酶瞬时产生的负超螺旋DNA环。这一机制对于维持基因组稳定性、促进细胞分裂过程中的DNA分离具有不可替代的作用。"},{"t":"交配调节雌性果蝇中肠的生长、新陈代谢和消化效率","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525331123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Adaptive changes in organ size and function occur in most animals, but how these changes are regulated is not well understood. Previous research found that mating in\n                    Drosophila\n                    females promotes intestinal stem cell proliferation and increases the overall size of the endodermal portion of the intestine (the “midgut”). Other studies reported mating-dependent changes in feeding behavior, midgut gene expression, and whole-body lipid storage, suggesting altered metabolism. Here, we show that mating dramatically alters female midgut metabolism and digestive function. Mating increased relative levels of TCA cycle intermediates, fatty acids, and ceramides in the gut, increased total midgut lipids and protein, and reduced relative carbohydrate levels. Mating also enhanced the efficiency of protein digestion relative to carbohydrate digestion. Corroborating a previous report [M. A. White, A. Bonfini, M. F. Wolfner, N. Buchon,\n                    Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U.S.A.\n                    118\n                    , e2018112118 (2021)], we found that the expression of genes that mediate protein and carbohydrate and metabolism was similarly altered. In addition, we noted a mating-dependent downregulation of oxidative stress response and autophagy genes. Mating-dependent increases in ecdysone receptor (EcR) signaling were important for increasing TCA cycle intermediates, protein, and ceramides in the female midgut, but had minimal effects on bulk lipid accumulation. Overall, this study contributes to our understanding of the physiological changes that occur during adaptive intestinal growth, and how they are regulated."},{"t":"奇妙的微生物、记忆和多元宇宙：书籍简介","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00241-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"原子前驱体阶段异金属配位杂化调控单纳米簇催化活性位点","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522490?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米簇活性位点","kp":["[活性位调控]: 杂金属配位杂化(HCH)","[精度]: 原子精度构建表面可及活性位"],"as":"单原子/纳米团簇催化剂的表面可及活性位点在原子精度层面的构建仍是催化领域的重大挑战。研究通过引入异金属杂原子策略调控纳米团簇的活性位点，实现催化性能的精准调控，为设计高效催化剂提供了原子级别的结构-活性关系新范式。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Manipulating the Active Sites in Single‐Nanocluster Catalysis by Heterometallic Coordination Hybridization at Atomic Pre","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Constructing accessible active sites on the surface of catalysts at the atomic precision remains challenging in heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalysis. Leveraging the differences in coordination preferences between various metals and ligands, a heterometallic coordination hybridization (HCH) protocol was proposed to manipulate the stable and accessible active sites on the surface of single‐nanocluster catalysts. A homoleptic superatomic nanocluster [(AuCu)\n                    71\n                    (m‐MBT)\n                    46\n                    ](CF\n                    3\n                    SO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (short as\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    and m‐MBT = 3‐methylbenzenethiol) was synthesized in high yield, and its structure was determined by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction. Benefiting from the HCH strategy,\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    features four open, accessible, and stable dual‐Au sites on its surface. Notably, heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalyst \n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    /XC‐72 (XC‐72 is carbon support) exhibited excellent catalytic performance for denitrative C–O coupling under mild conditions (60 °C, atmosphere). The turnover numbers and turnover frequencies reached record high values of 2.88 × 10\n                    6\n                    and 3.48 × 10\n                    5\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    , respectively, which are four orders of magnitude higher than those observed for the well‐established Pd/C system. The remarkable catalytic performance of\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    was attributed to the exposed dual‐Au sites, which facilitated the adsorption of deprotonated phenol and its derivatives via Au‐O interactions, guided the proximity of nitroarenes rather than being commonly absorbed simultaneously on active sites, and exhibited exceptional durability of the catalyst. The HCH protocol provides new idea for the rational design and construction of heterogeneous metal catalysts with well‐defined accessible active sites."},{"t":"利用Pb调控Cu表面疏碳性实现高效CO电还原制乙醇","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506794?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO电还原制乙醇","kp":["[催化剂]: Pb改性Cu","[产物]: 乙醇","[调控机制]: 增强表面疏碳性"],"dp":1,"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"电催化CO还原制乙醇是CO2资源化的关键路径，但铜催化剂表面C-C偶联产物选择性不足。本研究通过在铜表面修饰铅（Pb），精准调控铜表面的\"疏碳性\"（carbophobicity），即降低表面对中间体CO的过强吸附，从而促进适当的C-C偶联取向和后续加氢步骤。Pb的引入优化了反应中间体的覆盖度和空间构型，显著提高了乙醇的法拉第效率，为电催化CO2高选择性转化为多碳化学品提供了催化剂设计新范式。","ot":"Manipulating Cu Surface Carbophobicity with Pb for Efficient CO‐to‐Ethanol Electroconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO reduction to ethanol offers a sustainable route for carbon utilization, but the uncontrollable hydrogenation pathway in post C─C coupling limits its selectivity. Herein, we introduced Pb doping to modulate the carbophobicity of Cu catalyst, thereby directing hydrogenation toward the β‐C of the key\n                    *\n                    CH\n                    2\n                    CHO intermediate and boosting ethanol production. Density functional theory calculations revealed that Pb incorporation reduced electron transfer from Cu to\n                    *\n                    CH\n                    2\n                    CHO, weakening the Cu─C bond and favoring the β‐C hydrogenation over the ethylene pathway. In situ X‐ray absorption spectroscopy confirmed that Pb doping lowered the electron density at Cu sites, resulting in weakened CO adsorption, consistent with a carbophobic catalyst surface. In situ attenuated total reflectance Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy further revealed suppressed CO coverage and enhanced accumulation of ethanol‐pathway intermediates (\n                    *\n                    OC\n                    2\n                    H\n                    5\n                    ) on the Pb‐doped Cu. As a result, the optimized PbCu catalyst achieved an ethanol Faradaic efficiency of 55.2% with a partial current density of ∼500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , outperforming most reported CO reduction catalysts. This work highlights carbophobicity engineering as a powerful strategy to fine‐tune intermediate binding and selectively drive ethanol production in CO/CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction."},{"t":"MTFR1L 是一种心脏抗衰老因子，用于维持线粒体稳态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527247123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondrial dysfunction is a hallmark of aging and a key contributor to age-related diseases including cardiovascular disease. However, molecular pathways that safeguard mitochondrial homeostasis in the aging heart remain poorly understood. Here, we identify MTFR1L as a regulator of mitophagy that binds p-S65-Ub, a key signal amplifying the PINK1/Parkin axis. We find that MTFR1L is enriched in metabolically active tissues, particularly in the heart, where it regulates Parkin signaling. Genetic deletion of\n                    Mtfr1l\n                    in mice impairs stress-induced mitophagy and Parkin activation, leading to accumulation of damaged mitochondria, increased inflammation and senescence, and accelerated age-related cardiac dysfunction. Strikingly, cardiac expression of MTFR1L progressively decreases along with aging in mice, primates, and humans, coinciding with cardiomyocyte senescence and lipofuscin accumulation. Together, these findings uncover a role for MTFR1L in regulation of the p-S65-Ub/Parkin mitophagy axis and maintenance of mitochondrial homeostasis during cardiac aging and suggest that age-associated loss of MTFR1L may contribute to age-related cardiac dysfunction. Based on these findings, we propose a therapeutic paradigm for the prevention of heart aging by restoring MTFR1L function.","tp":"心脏抗衰","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"线粒体功能障碍是心脏衰老及相关心血管疾病的核心特征。该研究首次鉴定出MTFR1L是一种关键的心脏抗衰老因子，能够通过结合p-S65-Ub来放大PINK1/Parkin信号轴，从而调控线粒体自噬并维持线粒体稳态。MTFR1L在心脏等代谢活跃的组织中高度富集，其调控机制的发现填补了衰老心脏中线粒体保护途径的空白，为心血管衰老相关疾病的预防和靶向治疗提供了重要干预靶点。"},{"t":"MAPPI：开放式可扩展的全植株荧光实时成像平台","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea4466?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全植株荧光成像","kp":["[功能]: 全植株荧光实时成像","[规模]: 可扩展开放平台"],"dp":1,"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"理解植物如何感知和响应环境与发育信号，需要对全株水平的动态过程进行实时监测。该研究开发了MAPPI（宏观植物投影成像）平台，一个开放、可扩展的全株荧光实时成像系统。该平台结合大面积LED激发光源和高灵敏度相机，能够同时对整株植物的多重荧光信号进行长时间、高通量采集。MAPPI为植物逆境响应、基因表达动态和信号传导网络研究提供了直观的全株可视化工具，加速了植物功能基因组学研究。","ot":"MAcro Plant Projection Imaging (MAPPI): An open, scalable platform for whole-plant fluorescence real-time imaging","b":"Understanding how plants perceive and respond to environmental and developmental cues requires tools capable of monitoring molecular signals in vivo, across whole tissues, and in real time. Genetically encoded fluorescent indicators, coupled with fluorescence microscopy, have transformed plant biology, but their application remains largely confined to small model organisms and specialized microscopy instrumentation. Here, we present MAcro Plant Projection Imaging (MAPPI), an open-source, low-cost, and modular fluorescence imaging platform for soil-grown plants beyond the model organism or seedling stage. MAPPI enables wide field-of-view, dual-projection imaging of fluorescent reporters, supporting real-time visualization of systemic signals under near-physiological conditions. We validate MAPPI by tracking calcium and\n                    l\n                    -glutamate dynamics in adult\n                    Nicotiana benthamiana\n                    plants, revealing developmentally regulated long-distance calcium waves triggered by wounding, burning, or submergence, including bidirectional shoot-to-root and root-to-shoot signaling. By democratizing access to whole-plant functional imaging, MAPPI provides a scalable tool for dissecting signal propagation, stress adaptation, and systemic communication in both model and nonmodel species."},{"t":"Lrrn介导的视网膜神经节细胞靶向驱动视觉电路组装以进行亮度和对比度检测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4585?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Brightness and contrast are fundamental features of vision, crucial for object detection, environmental navigation, and feeding. Here, we identify a brightness- and contrast-processing circuit in the zebrafish visual system and uncover the role of leucine-rich repeat neuronal (Lrrn) cell adhesion molecules (CAMs) in regulating its assembly. We show that deep-projecting retinal ganglion cells serve as the first synaptic relay to the brain, requiring Lrrn2 and Lrrn3a for precise axonal targeting within the optic tectum. Using a new reporter line, we achieved high-resolution mapping of this previously undercharacterized vertebrate visual circuit. Genetic disruption of Lrrn CAMs leads to disorganization of the circuit and impairments in brightness and contrast sensitivity, resulting in deficits in visually guided behavior. Additionally, ultrastructural circuit reconstruction and functional imaging analysis identified both its synaptic partners and revealed its critical role in luminance processing. These studies define a core visual processing pathway and establish Lrrn CAMs as essential molecular drivers of its assembly.","tp":"视觉神经","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究以斑马鱼为模型，发现其视觉系统中处理亮度和对比度的特定神经回路。研究指出，深层投射的视网膜神经节细胞（RGCs）是视觉信息传递至大脑的第一突触中继站。细胞粘附分子Lrrn2和Lrrn3a在调控该回路的组装中发挥关键作用，确保了RGC轴突的精准靶向。该发现揭示了亮度和对比度检测的神经基础，为视觉处理机制的深入理解提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"将上地幔电异常与岩石学和地球化学异质性联系起来","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag045/8437923?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"The electrical structure of Earth’s interior resolved by geophysical surveys is key to understanding its composition, dynamics and relevant properties. Electrically anomalous zones in the upper mantle have been frequently observed, yet the origin remains debated. Interpreting the geophysically imaged electrical anomalies cannot be properly made if the constraints on mantle materials from petrological and geochemical surveys and mineral physics experiments are not combined. Studying mantle samples has revealed widespread heterogeneities in their mineral constituents, elemental compositions and thermodynamic properties, in addition to the local occurrence of melts and fluids. The heterogeneities are macroscale, ranging on the levels of meters to kilometers. Four conductive candidates are identified for the electrical anomalies by laboratory experiments under mantle conditions, including olivine owing to oxidized state (but not water), lithologies (such as pyroxenites, eclogites and phlogopite-bearing assemblages due to enriched Fe, water and/or F), partial melt and aqueous fluids. Such materials are able to cause electrical anomalies in a variety of settings that are geophysically detectable, if connected forms, rational fractions and/or suitable temperature and redox state are spatially maintained along certain direction(s). Hydrous minerals except phlogopite and non-silicate minerals such as graphite, sulfides and carbonates are usually hard to lead to mantle electrical anomalies. Mantle macroscale heterogeneities cause heterogeneous electrical structure. Geophysically imaged electrical anomalies in the upper mantle are intimately related to its petrological and geochemical evolution.","tp":"地幔电性","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"地球内部电性结构对理解其成分、动力学和相关性质至关重要。上地幔电异常带频繁被观测到，但其成因仍有争议。研究强调，若不结合岩石学、地球化学调查和矿物物理实验对地幔物质的约束，无法正确解释地球物理成像的电异常。通过研究地幔样品，将电异常与岩石学及地球化学异质性联系起来。"},{"t":"发挥超构表面的潜能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02469-3","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超构表面","as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Leveraging the power of metasurfaces"},{"t":"利用数字化先进制造实现超高质量功率密度聚合物电解质燃料电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504454?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"轻量化燃料电池","kp":["双极板质量占比[燃料电池堆]: 80%","双极板体积占比[燃料电池堆]: 60%","[策略]: 数字先进制造多孔分配器","功率密度[PEFC]: 超高 gravimetric"],"as":"本研究探讨将数字化先进制造技术引入聚合物电解质燃料电池（PEFC），以解决航空航天应用中燃料电池重量与体积过大的核心瓶颈。通过增材制造、精密结构优化等数字化手段，实现高性能电极、薄层电解质及冷却流场的按需设计，有望大幅提升功率密度并降低系统质量，推动氢燃料电池在飞行器中的工程化部署。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Leveraging Digital Advanced Manufacturing to Enable Polymer Electrolyte Fuel Cells With Ultrahigh Gravimetric Power Dens","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of hydrogen fuel cells into aerospace applications is limited by the weight and volume of fuel cell systems. Currently, bipolar plates account for 80 % of fuel cell stack mass and 60 % of its volume. Herein, we leverage a range of advanced manufacturing techniques to develop novel lightweight‐compact porous distributors with ultrahigh power densities. Research begins with a graphene‐coated nickel foam porous distributor, which enhances reactants transport and interfacial conductivity, achieving a power density of 1.52 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , ∼50 % improvement over conventional designs. To further boost gravimetric power density, titanium was adopted as a base material, and porous architectures were optimized using Computational Fluid Dynamics to ensure optimal reactant distribution and water management. To realize these porous titanium designs, two advanced manufacturing techniques were leveraged: laser powder bed fusion (LPBF) and laser micromachining. While the optimized LPBF lattice structure reached 1.36 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , the laser‐patterned non‐homogeneous architecture demonstrated a breakthrough performance of 1.62 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , translating to volumetric and gravimetric power densities of over 10 kW/L and 9 kW/kg, respectively. These values surpass current commercial benchmarks and exceed EU/UK 2030 targets. We demonstrate how integrating digital design, flow control, advanced materials, and manufacturing enables lightweight, high‐power fuel cells, with broader impact on electrolyzers, heat exchangers, and batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"基于N/P比控制锂离子电池的锂沉积机理研究","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000796?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂枝晶沉积机制","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Investigation of lithium plating mechanism based on N/P ratio controlled lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度感知","kp":["监测目标[锂离子电池]: 超高倍率放电内部温度"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed ne"},{"t":"现存裸子植物苏铁中活动精子和花粉管的中间进化状态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506320123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Evolutionary transitions in land plant fertilization from zooidogamy to siphonogamy were characterized by transformations of male reproductive cells. Basal land plants such as bryophytes and pteridophytes have motile sperm, whereas most seed plants have nonmotile sperm, delivered by a pollen tube. Despite being seed plants, gymnosperm cycads and ginkgo uniquely form highly multiflagellated and large motile sperm within pollen tubes. However, the evolutionary state of these male reproductive cells remains unknown. We clarified the gene expression profiles of\n                    Cycas revoluta\n                    pollen tubes and motile sperm swimming toward female reproductive cells. Male cycad cells expressed fewer genes associated with transcription, translation, and related processes, which is consistent across land plants. We compared the distinctive orthologous groups (OGs) of the genes specifically expressed in sperm and pollen tubes with those in other plants. Cycad pollen tubes shared several OGs with angiosperms but possessed significantly fewer gene copies and lacked cell wall remodeling and plasma membrane-localized receptor genes that contribute to rapid and guided growth. The growth mechanism of cycad pollen tubes might be largely different from angiosperm pollen tubes. In contrast, despite their morphological uniqueness, cycad sperm shared representative OGs with angiosperm sperm cells to the same extent as egg cells. In addition, a sperm-specific histone variant may contribute to transcriptional regulation via chromatin condensation like other male gametes. As an extant gymnosperm that retains zooidogamy with pollen tubes, the cycad represents a molecular intermediate state in the transition from zooidogamy to siphonogamy, providing insight into the evolution of land plant fertilization.","tp":"苏铁进化","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"陆地植物受精方式经历了从游动精子到花粉管输送不动精子的进化转变。在现存裸子植物中，苏铁和银杏具有独特的中间进化状态：它们在花粉管内形成具有多鞭毛且体积庞大的游动精子。通过对苏铁精子和花粉管的演化特征进行研究，科学家进一步阐明了种子植物雄性生殖细胞从游动到不动的演化解剖学状态，填补了植物繁殖方式进化过程中的关键认知空白。"},{"t":"提升富锂层状氧化物阴离子氧化还原可逆性的界面工程：最新进展与展望","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506755?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"富锂层状氧化物","kp":["[比容量]: >250 mAh/g","[材料]: 锂富集锰基层状氧化物","[核心问题]: 阴离子氧化还原可逆性","[策略]: 界面工程"],"as":"锂富锰基层状氧化物（LRMOs）因其高能量密度被视为下一代锂离子电池正极材料的有力候选，但其实际应用受限于阴离子氧化还原反应的可逆性差，导致电压衰减和容量快速衰减。本文聚焦界面工程策略，通过对LRMOs颗粒表面或晶界进行修饰改性，抑制不可逆的氧释放和结构相变，提升阴离子（氧离子）氧化还原反应的可逆性与循环稳定性。该研究为突破LRMOs正极材料中阴离子氧化还原失稳这一核心瓶颈提供了新思路，对推动高比能锂电池的工程化具有积极意义。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Interface Engineering for Heightening Anionic Redox Reversibility of Li‐Rich Layered Oxides Cathodes: Recent Advances an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐rich manganese‐based layered oxides (LRMOs) are leading candidates for next‐generation high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries, offering exceptional specific capacities exceeding 250 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . However, interfacial instability and surface structural degradation impede their commercial deployment. Current research lacks comprehensive analysis of dynamic interfacial mechanisms governing oxygen redox and corresponding engineering strategies. This review focuses on recent advancements in interface engineering to enhance the reversibility of anionic redox reactions in LRMOs, providing crucial insights for designing high‐performance batteries. The LRMO crystal structure, oxygen redox mechanism, and associated challenges are first outlined. Subsequently, we examine interfacial design progress including surface engineering, surface defect regulation, integrated modifications, and electrolyte engineering, highlighting how these approaches improve oxygen redox reversibility to mitigate the performance decline of LRMOs. Additionally, the mechanical and chemical instability mechanisms of all‐solid‐state battery interfaces and corresponding interface design strategies are discussed. Finally, we provide further insights and new perspectives for the better development of LRMO cathode materials."},{"t":"不完整的谱系分类在疣灵长类动物辐射过程中形成了混合特征","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524833123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lineages undergoing rapid evolutionary diversification may evolve a set of mixed traits as a result of hybrid speciation, gene flow, or incomplete lineage sorting (ILS). However, how best to quantify these alternative processes impacting phenotypic variation remains unclear. Here, we examined trait evolution in two sister genera of endangered Asian primates,\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    . By assembling a de novo genome of the\n                    Trachypithecus pileatus\n                    group, which is geographically located in a transitional zone between these two genera, our integrated phylogenomic analyses clarified the evolutionary relationship of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group with other\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    species. We also identified that morphological similarities shared between this species group and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    are the result of ILS, rather than gene flow or hybrid speciation. Across all chromosomes of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group, ILS contributed 8.9% of whole genome segments. Across these segments, we distinguished 77 genes such as\n                    FGFBP1\n                    and\n                    FOXO1\n                    that are involved in pathways of bone development and osteoblast differentiation. Functional experiments indicate that\n                    FGFBP1\n                    genotypes shared by species of the\n                    T. pileatus\n                    group and\n                    Semnopithecus\n                    appear to enhance osteogenic capability and mineralization, possibly resulting in larger body size and similarities in skull morphology compared with other species of\n                    Trachypithecus\n                    . The study reveals that ILS has shaped the evolution of mixed traits within gene-regulatory networks, driving phenotypic diversity during periods of rapid species divergence in this highly successful primate radiation. ILS appears to be more common than previously thought and represents a critical step in accurately assessing the phylogeny of closely related taxa."},{"t":"黄铁矿-水界面致密液层中金沉积的原位观测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517918123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"金矿床中高品位金的富集机制长期存在争议。本研究利用原位观测技术，首次直接观察到在黄铁矿-水界面处的致密液相层中金纳米颗粒的沉淀沉积过程。研究发现，黄铁矿表面可触发金络合物的还原反应，在界面处形成致密流体层并析出金纳米颗粒，这一过程对生成高品位金矿床至关重要。该原位观测为理解热液系统中金的运移、富集和沉淀机制提供了关键实验证据，对金矿勘探和成矿理论具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金矿沉积机制","kp":["[观测方法]: 原位液体池透射电镜","[发现]: 致密液层介导金纳米颗粒沉积"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"aip":1,"ot":"In situ observations of gold deposition in a dense liquid layer at the pyrite–water interface","b":"Pyrite-triggered precipitation of gold nanoparticles (AuNPs) is crucial for generating high-grade gold deposits, yet its dynamic process and mechanism at the pyrite-water interface remain unclear due to the lack of in situ observation. Here, utilizing in situ liquid cell transmission electron microscopy, we find a dense liquid layer mediated deposition of AuNPs at the pyrite-water interface in parts per billion-level gold-bearing solutions, a concentration that resembles crustal abundances. Real-time imaging reveals that a dense liquid layer forms at the pyrite-water interface, and it is proposed that AuNPs nucleate and grow in this layer. Results from in situ atomic force microscopy and ex situ transmission electron microscopy indicate that the growth kinetic process of AuNPs involves monomer-to-cluster aggregation, further enriching gold at the pyrite-water interface. Thermodynamic modeling demonstrates that precipitation of AuNPs is primarily driven by the oxygen fugacity decrease in the dense liquid layer due to pyrite dissolution. These findings reveal a localized gold concentration mechanism to interpret adsorption and nucleation of AuNPs on pyrite during its dissolution-precipitation cycles, which significantly enhances our understanding of the highly effective gold scavenging from fluid by pyrite. The mechanism of nanoparticle formation in the dense liquid layer at dissolving mineral-fluid interfaces represents a fundamental process that could be common in nature."},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5688?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the Science family of journals."},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5689?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors' selections from the current scientific literature."},{"t":"沸腾液滴的影响：蒸汽截留抑制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522654123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"There hardly is a fluid mechanics phenomenon attracting more attention than the impact of a droplet, due to its undeniable beauty, many applications, and the numerous challenges it poses. One of the crucial factors turns out to be the cushioning effect of the gas surrounding the droplet. This fact, together with the observation that almost all of the relevant literature was done in air, triggers the question what would happen when the liquid was a boiling liquid, i.e., a liquid in thermal equilibrium with its own vapor, as is the case during transport of cryogenic liquids such as liquid hydrogen. To investigate precisely this question, we experimentally generate droplets in thermodynamical equilibrium with their own vapor, even before impact, such that minute energy exchanges of the droplet with its surroundings can trigger phase change. Using a frustrated total internal reflection setup, we make the exciting observation that depending on the impact speed and vapor conditions, the entrapment of vapor can be completely suppressed under boiling liquid conditions. We create a simplified model based on scaling arguments and perform numerical simulations considering both the compressible and condensable properties of the vapor layer that are in very good agreement with our experimental findings. Our results can be of great consequence to the pressures exerted during droplet impact and on an industrial scale may help better understand the loads experienced during sloshing wave impact inside cryogenic liquid containers."},{"t":"自适应金属有机纤维中结构水超分子共聚引发的水凝胶化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519933?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机水凝胶","kp":["[结构水角色]: 超分子纤维共聚单体","[配体]: 锌(II)双酚氧亚胺配合物"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"水通常被视为超分子材料的破坏性溶剂，会解离氢键和配位键等定向相互作用。该研究颠覆了这一传统认知，展示了结构水在自适应金属-有机纤维中超分子共聚形成水凝胶的能力。金属-有机纤维骨架通过动态配位键适配水分子的氢键网络，使水分子作为结构组分参与超分子共聚，赋予凝胶独特的自修复和刺激响应性能。该工作将水从\"溶剂\"转化为\"构建基元\"，为超分子水凝胶材料的设计开辟了全新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Hydrogelation via Supramolecular Copolymerization of Structural Water within Adaptive Metal–Organic Fibers","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Water is conventionally viewed as a disruptive solvent for supramolecular materials, destabilizing directional noncovalent interactions. Here, we report a metal–organic material in which water instead acts as a structural co‐monomer driving the formation of supramolecular fibers. A zinc(II) bisphenoxyimine (“Salphen”) complex featuring convergent hydrogen‐bond acceptor sites assembles in bulk water into long, hollow nanofibers stabilized by confined structural water molecules. Single‐particle analysis and density functional theory reveal tubular architectures in which intercalated water bridges the metal centers and defines a hydrophilic inner channel. The fibers form hydrogels with thermomechanical response, chemically triggerable disassembly and enable selective chiral recognition of amino acids via water‐mediated molecular–to–supramolecular information transfer. In organic solvents, the water content can be used for control over supramolecular self‐assembly and hence gelation and liquefaction. Our findings establish structural water as a design element for creating adaptive, chiral, and dynamically reconfigurable metal–organic materials, offering a new paradigm to unlock this sustainable building block in supramolecular materials design.","aip":1},{"t":"恶意AI蜂群如何威胁民主制度","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz1697?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI群体安全","kp":["[新兴威胁]: 代理AI与LLM融合开启信息战"],"sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"as":"智能体AI与大语言模型的融合标志着信息战的新前沿。文章指出，恶意AI集群（swarms）能够以极低成本自动生成海量个性化虚假内容，协调社交机器人账号进行精准舆论操纵，并在选举和公共危机期间制造信息混乱。与传统信息战相比，AI驱动的集群攻击具有规模、速度和适应性上的指数级优势，对民主制度的信任基础构成系统性威胁。文章呼吁政策制定者前瞻性地建立AI信息治理框架，以应对这一新型非对称安全挑战。","ot":"How malicious AI swarms can threaten democracy","b":"The fusion of agentic AI and LLMs marks a new frontier in information warfare."},{"t":"高效稳定碳-钙钛矿太阳能模块的整体阳极界面工程","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506097?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳基钙钛矿组件","kp":["[器件形态]: 碳基钙钛矿太阳能模组","[电极]: 厚碳电极免贵金属","[策略]: 阳极界面整体工程"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"碳基钙钛矿太阳能电池因低成本、可印刷加工的优势被视为商业化前景最佳的技术路线之一，但阳极界面处的电荷提取效率低和界面退化限制了组件性能和稳定性。该研究提出全方位阳极界面工程策略，通过多层界面修饰协同优化能级排列、缺陷钝化和界面接触，在碳-钙钛矿界面构建高效稳定的电荷传输通道。该策略在大面积组件上实现了效率与操作稳定性的同步提升，为碳基钙钛矿太阳能电池的产业化推进扫除了关键界面瓶颈。","ot":"Holistic Anode Interface Engineering for High‐Efficiency and Stable Carbon‐Perovskite Solar Modules","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving a simultaneous balance of cost, efficiency, and operational stability is critical for the commercial viability of perovskite photovoltaics. Planar‐junction carbon‐based perovskite solar modules (C‐PSMs) represent a promising platform toward this goal, offering low‐cost fabrication and long‐term environmental stability enabled by thick carbon electrodes that eliminate the need for encapsulation. However, their power conversion efficiency remains fundamentally limited due to the discontinuous charge percolation and poor heterojunction contact at the carbon/perovskite junction. To overcome these challenges, we present a Holistic Anode Interface Design (H‐AID) strategy that integrates two complementary approaches. First, a picosecond laser is used to sculpt a curved perovskite surface morphology, increasing contact area and enhancing charge transfer (Design‐1). Second, a gallium‐indium eutectic liquid metal is introduced into the carbon paste to fill internal voids and restore conductive pathways (Design‐2). Their combination (Design‐3) achieves a 42% improvement in module efficiency, reaching 16.88% over a 61.22 cm\n                    2\n                    active area, among the highest reported for planar C‐PSMs. Moreover, the device retains over 95% of its initial performance after 1200 h under ambient, encapsulated conditions. This work establishes a scalable H‐AID framework to unlock cost‐efficiency‐stability co‐optimization in carbon perovskite modules."},{"t":"具有配体间电荷转移激发态的高效蓝色TADF钯(II)配合物","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1879672?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蓝光TADF材料","kp":["发光材料[蓝光TADF]: 钳型钯(II)配合物","[激发态]: 配体-配体电荷转移(LLCT)","[挑战]: 二排金属蓝光难兼具快辐射慢非辐射"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"第二排过渡金属的电致发光配合物因难以实现高效自旋-轨道耦合和系间窜越而发展滞后。该研究设计了一类钯(II)配合物蓝光TADF材料，利用配体到配体电荷转移（LLCT）激发态策略，突破传统金属到配体电荷转移的限制。LLCT态有效缩小单三重态能隙，促进反向系间窜越，实现高效热活化延迟荧光发射。该设计使钯配合物展现出高效率深蓝光电致发光性能，为无重金属的高效蓝光OLED材料和低成本显示技术提供了新方向。","ot":"High‐Efficiency Blue TADF Palladium(II) Complexes with Ligand‐to‐Ligand Charge Transfer Excited State","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electroluminescent complexes of the second‐row transition metals remain underdeveloped due to the challenge of simultaneously achieving fast radiative decay and slow nonradiative decay, particularly in the blue spectral region. Herein, we report a design strategy for strongly blue‐emitting pincer‐type Pd(II) complexes based on the thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) mechanism. By paring a terdentate trifluoromethyl‐substituted bis‐\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC) with a cyano‐substituted carbazolide ligand, the lowest‐lying singlet excited states of the resulting Pd(II) complexes exhibit dominant ligand‐to‐ligand charge transfer (LLCT) character. Electrochemical and theoretical calculations confirm that the oxidation and reduction processes are ligand‐controlled with minor metal involvement. Through tuning of the electron‐accepting strength and the triplet locally‐excited (\n                    3\n                    LE) energy of the pincer bis‐NHC ligand via a subtle structural change, a blue emitting TADF Pd(II) complex (\n                    PyPdCN\n                    ) is achieved, exhibiting an emission maximum of 472 nm and a quantum yield of 86% in doped film. The energy gap between\n                    1\n                    LLCT and\n                    3\n                    LE states proves crucial for regulating the excited state dynamics. Organic light‐emitting diodes employing\n                    PyPdCN\n                    as the emitter show blue electroluminescence with peaks ranging from 460 to 473 nm and maximum external quantum efficiencies exceeding 20%, representing a significant advancement in luminescent Pd(II) complexes."},{"t":"通过局域微环境调控在稳定Cu0/Cu+界面上高选择性CO2电还原制乙烯","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2还原制乙烯","kp":["产物[CO₂RR]: 乙烯(C₂⁺)","界面[选择性]: Cu⁰/Cu⁺","反应器[CO₂RR]: MEA、中性电解液","[修饰]: 氧空位工程Cu"],"as":"该研究提出在Cu0/Cu+稳定界面实现CO2高选择性电还原为乙烯（C2H4）的创新策略。通过精确调控铜基催化剂表面的零价铜与一价铜活性位点比例，构建稳定的异质界面结构，在工业级高电流密度下仍保持对C2+产物的高法拉第效率。该工作解决了传统Cu催化剂选择性低、稳定性差的关键瓶颈，为CO2资源化制取高附加值多碳化学品提供了新路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Highly Selective CO2 Electroreduction to Ethylene on Stable Cu0/Cu+ Interfaces by Local Microenvironment Modulation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction to multicarbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products with high selectivity at industrial current densities using a membrane electrode assembly (MEA) electrolyzer in neutral electrolytes holds a great promise for carbon neutrality. However, the complex reaction pathways and low selectivity for C\n                    2+\n                    products have hindered further development. Herein, an oxygen vacancy‐engineered CuO nanoflower catalyst was designed to construct stable Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    active interfaces and induce a localized alkaline microenvironment, effectively suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) while enhancing ethylene (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ) selectivity. In situ spectroscopic characterization confirmed the stability of the Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    active sites and their high *CO surface coverage. Multiphysics simulations combined with density functional theory (DFT) calculations revealed that the stable Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    interface coupled with the localized alkaline microenvironment reduces the energy barrier for asymmetric C─C coupling, thereby boosting C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    selectivity. The optimized catalyst achieved remarkable C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiencies of 66.8% in alkaline and 66.1% in neutral electrolyte at a current density of 200 mA cm\n                    –\n                    2\n                    . This strategy of stabilizing Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    interfaces coupled with microenvironment modulation offers novel insights for enabling highly selective CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    electrosynthesis at high current densities."},{"t":"高空间分辨率熔铸钙钛矿X射线成像器","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00643-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线成像","kp":["[空间分辨率]: 20 lp/mm","[材料]: CsPbBr3钙钛矿厚膜","[制备方法]: 熔铸法","[特点]: 低剂量下高探测效率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过将厚膜钙钛矿CsPbBr3直接集成到图案化玻璃中间层上，构建了高空间分辨率的X射线阵列探测器。钙钛矿材料凭借优异的光电性能与可熔融浇筑加工特性，实现了探测器的高探测灵敏度与高像素分辨率。该方案突破了传统间接式闪烁体-传感器架构的限制，在医学影像、工业无损检测等领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-spatial-resolution, melt-cast perovskite X-ray imager","b":"Direct integration of a thick perovskite CsPbBr3 film to a patterned glass interposer to create X-ray array detector prototypes was performed. Detectors show a remarkable detection efficiency under low X-ray doses, significantly lower than existing standards in medical imaging. Detectors' spatial resolution is among top-performing state-of-the-art devices, exhibiting 20 lp mm−1."},{"t":"高温钠硫固定式电池的高精度动态模型","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000668?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠硫电池建模","as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"High-accuracy dynamic model of high-temperature sodium-sulfur stationary battery"},{"t":"社交媒体研究中充斥着隐藏的行业联系","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6708?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Nearly one-third of papers in major interdisciplinary journals had undeclared ties to industry."},{"t":"用于选择性氨电合成的具有定制电子发散性的异相fcc-hcp-fcc高熵合金纳米材料","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521096?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐制氨","kp":["[相结构]: fcc-hcp-fcc异相","[材料]: RuFeMMnMo高熵合金","[反应]: 硝酸盐电还原合成氨","[合成方法]: 一锅溶剂热法"],"as":"该研究设计了具有异相fcc-hcp-fcc晶体结构的高熵合金纳米材料，通过调控电子结构实现高效的电催化硝酸盐还原反应。异相界面提供了丰富的活性位点与优化的d带电子结构，可促进硝酸盐向氨（NH3）的高效转化。该工作为绿色电化学合成氨提供了新思路，有望替代传统高能耗Haber-Bosch工艺，在可持续氮循环与清洁能源领域具有广阔前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Heterophase fcc‐hcp‐fcc High‐Entropy Alloy Nanomaterials with Tailored Electron Divergence for Selective Ammonia Electro","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction provides a broad prospect for developing green electrochemical ammonia production and efficient treatment of industrial wastewater rich in nitrate, but poses a challenge to the high activity and stability of electrocatalysts. Herein, we report the versatile and scalable one‐pot solvothermal synthesis of a series of RuFeMMnMo (M═CoNi, Co, and Ni) high‐entropy alloy (HEA) nanomaterials, possessing a unique face‐centered cubic‐hexagonal close‐packed‐face‐centered cubic (\n                    fcc‐hcp‐fcc\n                    ) heterophase. The highly random distribution of multiple metal components and the tunable diversity of metal atomic arrangements can be realized simultaneously. Significantly, RuFeCoNiMnMo HEAs present a high Faradaic efficiency of 99.3 % and a promising yield rate of 83.35 mg h\n                    −1\n                     mg\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                    toward ammonia production at −0.6 V vs. reversible hydrogen electrode. Ex/in situ characterizations and theoretical calculations have revealed that by high electron coupling of high‐entropy effect, heterophase\n                    fcc‐hcp‐fcc\n                    RuFeCoNiMnMo HEAs have shown strong electronic modulations with charge redistributions. The positive charges and negative charges for Ru sites and Ni/Co sites promote the adsorption of key intermediates and generation of active protons, respectively, which guarantees efficient nitrate reduction due to the reduced energy barriers.","aip":1},{"t":"锂-有机硫化物电池中用于抑制多硫化物的杂环桥连短硫链聚合物正极","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506388?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池正极","kp":["[正极材料]: 杂环桥连短硫链聚合物","[抑制目标]: 多硫化物穿梭","[电池体系]: 锂有机硫化物电池"],"dp":1,"as":"锂硫电池因高理论比容量被视为下一代高能电池的重要候选，但多硫化物穿梭效应导致容量快速衰减，是制约其商业化的核心瓶颈。该研究提出以杂环桥接的短硫链聚合物作为阴极材料，利用杂环氮/硫原子的极性锚定位点化学捕获可溶性多硫化物中间体，从源头抑制穿梭效应，同时短硫链结构可降低体积膨胀应力，提升循环稳定性。该策略为解决锂硫电池长循环寿命问题提供了新的分子设计思路，对推动高比能储能体系走向实用具有参考价值。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Heterocycle‐Bridged Short Sulfur‐Chain Polymers for Polysulfide‐Suppressing Cathodes in Lithium‐Organosulfide Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organosulfur polymers, valued for their structural tunability and environmental friendliness as cathode materials for lithium‐sulfur (Li‐S) batteries, face challenges in practical applications due to inadequate cycling stability and rate performance. Herein, we report the rational design and green synthesis of a heterocycle‐bridged short sulfur‐chain polymer, namely poly(pyrazine tetrasulfide) (PPZTS), with a sulfur‐rich atomic chain structure as a high‐performance cathode material for lithium‐organosulfide batteries. The pyrazine‐bridged short sulfur‐chain structure in PPZTS prevents the formation and shuttling of long‐chain polysulfides, and the electronegative π‐conjugated pyrazine rings facilitate uniform Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion, leading to significant improvements in both cycling stability and rate performance. The PPZTS cathode achieves a high capacity of 1250 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and 660 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 5.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    . When cycled at 1.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    , the PPZTS cathode demonstrates an initial capacity of 850.9 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and retaining 630.4 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 400 cycles. The PPZTS cathode also demonstrates robust performance across a wide temperature range from −20 to 80°C, and the deployment in soft‐packed batteries further suggests its potential practicability. This work underscores the intriguing potential of heterocycle‐linked short sulfur‐chain polymers as cathode materials for alkali metal‐organosulfide batteries, addressing key challenges in organosulfur polymer applications for advanced energy storage devices."},{"t":"热缩共形电子器件","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00892-9","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热缩共形电子","kp":["[特性]: 热缩共形电子器件"],"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Heat-shrinkable conformal electronics"},{"t":"利用kagome晶格中费米面重构实现范霍夫奇点的太赫兹光电响应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-66749-x","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","as":"该研究聚焦于凝聚态物理中的三六角晶格（trihexagonal tiling）体系，该体系因独特的能带结构而展现出强电子-电子相互作用，是关联电子量子材料的重要研究对象。研究通过费米面工程调控材料的范霍夫奇点（Van Hove singularity），利用奇点附近态密度的剧烈增强实现高效太赫兹波段光电响应。这一机制为新型太赫兹探测器和高灵敏光电传感器的开发提供了物理基础，有望推动太赫兹成像、通信及量子探测等前沿应用的发展。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"kagome晶格太赫兹","kp":["[晶格类型]: kagome三六角拼砌","[太赫兹响应]: 费米面重构+范霍夫奇点","[物理机制]: 电子-电子强关联"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Harnessing Van Hove singularities for terahertz photoresponse via Fermi surface reconstruction in kagome lattices","b":"The trihexagonal tiling system exhibits strong electron-electron interactions, positioning it as a key condensed matter platform for studying geometrically frustrated lattices made up of corner-sharing triangles. Its phase-transition-driven lattice modulations enable Fermi surface reconstruction, while emergent van Hove singularities near the Fermi level and correlated band anomalies present critical challenges in understanding electronic interaction mechanisms. By combining temperature-dependent spectroscopy, angle-resolved photoemission, and density functional theory calculations, we demonstrate a 61-fold enhancement in terahertz direct detection mode, ultra-low noise (1.38 × 10⁻²⁵ A²/Hz) below phase transition temperature, and broadband operation up to 100 GHz in beat-note heterodyne mode. These results are directly correlated with the Fermi surface reconstruction induced by phase transitions. This work positions geometrically frustrated lattices as a powerful platform for studying correlated quantum phenomena, offering new pathways for the design of advanced quantum devices."},{"t":"利用手性卤化锰 (II) 的可逆 0D–1D 转变实现智能圆偏振发光切换","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525831?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) active materials with dynamically tunable properties are highly desirable for next‐generation photonics and encryption technologies, yet achieving this through predictable solid‐state structural transformations remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we demonstrate a novel dimensionality‐engineering strategy to realize stimuli‐responsive CPL in chiral hybrid Mn(II) halides. Employing a single chiral cation, R/S‐3‐methylmorpholine, we selectively synthesized two distinct phases: a red‐emissive 1D chain structure with octahedral Mn(II) centers and a green‐emissive 0D structure with tetrahedral coordination. Remarkably, the 0D phase undergoes a rapid and reversible ethanol‐assisted thermal transformation into the 1D phase, accompanied by a striking CPL color switch from green to red. This unique behavior stems from a stimulus‐induced recoordination of Mn–Cl units and reorganization of the hydrogen‐bonding network. Capitalizing on this reversible response and intrinsic chirality, we engineered a sophisticated multilevel photonic encryption platform, encompassing binary dot‐matrix coding, dual‐channel (photoluminescence/CPL) Morse code, and CPL‐based ASCII decryption. This work establishes structural dimensionality control as a powerful paradigm for creating intelligent, CPL‐active materials, opening new avenues for high‐security optical information technologies.","tp":"圆偏振发光","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"具有动态可调性质的圆偏振发光(CPL)材料在下一代光子学和加密技术中备受青睐，但通过可预测的固态结构转变实现CPL调控仍是挑战。研究利用手性阳离子R/S-3-甲基吗啉，通过维度工程策略在手性杂化锰(II)卤化物中实现刺激响应型CPL。该材料可逆的0D-1D结构转变赋予了智能圆偏振发光切换功能。"},{"t":"利用 PV-oxirene 进行 α-氧羰基的模块化合成","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68671-2","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"α-Oxy carbonyl compounds, characterized by their distinct electronic and topological properties, represent highly versatile building blocks and modifiers for functional molecules. Despite their potential, the synthetic challenges associated with these compounds have limited their exploration in chemical biology and drug discovery. In this study, we address this limitation by introducing a general Cu-catalyzed three-component carbonyl 1,2-transposition reaction, which proceeds via a PV-oxirene intermediate. Our method employs IIII/PV-hybrid ylides as carbene precursors to generate α-PV-Cu-carbenes, which subsequently facilitate the formation of PV-oxirene species. This intermediate undergoes regioselective ring-opening by carboxylate anions, followed by acylation of a third nucleophile, enabling the modular assembly of α-oxy carbonyl compounds. This strategy provides efficient access to α-oxy esters, amides, and thioesters, exhibiting broad tolerance to various functional groups. Furthermore, these compounds exhibit remarkable chemical versatility, as demonstrated in the synthesis of depsipeptides and late-stage drug modification, underscoring their applicability across diverse research areas. Our findings not only significantly expand the structural diversity of accessible α-oxy carbonyls but also introduce a versatile and biocompatible synthetic linkage for chemical synthesis.","tp":"羰基催化法","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"α-氧羰基化合物具有独特的电子和拓扑性质，是功能分子的重要构建模块，但合成困难限制了其在化学生物学和药物发现中的应用。研究引入一种铜催化三组分羰基1,2-转位反应，通过PV-氧杂环丙烯中间体实现α-氧羰基化合物的模块化合成，为该类化合物的通用制备提供了高效新方法。"},{"t":"几内亚比绍暂停美国资助的疫苗试验，非洲科学家质疑其动机","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00220-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"格陵兰岛对全球研究很重要：该岛的科学下一步会怎样？","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00067-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"Gpr171 通过 ERK1/2 和 Notch 信号调节胚胎造血干细胞的出现","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hematopoietic stem cells (HSCs), which sustain lifelong blood cell production, emerge from hemogenic endothelium during embryonic development through the regulation of multiple signaling pathways. However, generating functional HSCs in vitro remains challenging, underscoring gaps in understanding the underlying mechanisms. Here, we identify GPR171, a P2Y-family G-protein-coupled receptor (GPCR), as a critical regulator of vertebrate embryonic HSC specification.\n                    Gpr171\n                    is highly expressed in hemogenic endothelium and hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells. A deficiency in Gpr171 results in severe embryonic HSC deficits but does not impair vasculogenesis and primitive hematopoiesis. We further find that its endogenous ligand, coded by\n                    pcsk1nl\n                    , cooperates with Gpr171 to enhance HSC generation. Mechanistically, Gpr171 activates ERK1/2 and Notch signaling pathways independently and synergistically to promote HSC generation. Pharmacological treatment of zebrafish embryos with the human GPR171 ligand BigLEN significantly increases HSC numbers. Moreover, GPR171 signaling is evolutionarily conserved, as GPR171-deficient murine embryos also exhibit a significant reduction in functional HSCs. Overall, our findings reveal GPR171 as an evolutionarily conserved regulator of embryonic HSC specification and suggest its potential for translational applications in stem cell–based therapeutics."},{"t":"经合组织国家的良好治理和能源安全：环境政策严格性的中介作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000340?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源安全论","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"格拉迪斯·梅·韦斯特 (Gladys Mae West) 讣告：GPS 技术先驱数学家","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00254-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"二次界优化原理的推广","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525320123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The quadratic bound (QB) principle proposed by Böhning and Lindsay in 1988 is an important special case of the majorization–minimization or minorization-maximization optimization principle. The quadratic upper-bound (QUB) principle is pertinent to minimization; the analogous quadratic lower-bound principle is pertinent to maximization. Unfortunately, in minimizing a loss\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          f\n                          (\n                          \n                            θ\n                          \n                          )\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , the QUB principle is limited by the difficulty of finding a constant positive definite matrix\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          B\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    such that\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                          \n                          −\n                          \n                            d\n                            2\n                          \n                          f\n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    is positive semidefinite for all\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . This paper proposes a generalization of the QB principle that avoids this limitation. In particular, we construct QUB algorithms by replacing the matrix\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          B\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    by a continuous matrix-valued function\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    that dominates the Hessian\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            d\n                            2\n                          \n                          f\n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    and depends on the both the current iterate\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            θ\n                          \n                          n\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    and the next potential iterate\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . In practice, we require\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    to be diagonal with its diagonal entries separated in\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . In other words, the\n                    \n                      \n                        i\n                      \n                    \n                    th diagonal entry of\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            B\n                            n\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            \n                              θ\n                            \n                            )\n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    depends on\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    only through its\n                    \n                      \n                        i\n                      \n                    \n                    th entry\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          θ\n                          i\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    . Theoretical analysis confirms that this class of generalized QB algorithms enjoys global convergence in favorable circumstances. For the scalar case, the tangency condition that the second derivative equals the bound function at the current point promotes superlinear convergence. Several numerical experiments implemented in Julia illustrate the power of the generalized QB principle."},{"t":"从薄膜到纳米点：Nb:STO上Fe3O4的自下而上集成与功能氧化物纳米结构","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517938?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁氧化物纳米点","kp":["[材料体系]: Fe3O4/Nb:STO外延异质结","[应用]: 自旋电子学","[方法]: 自下而上生长纳米点"],"dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究实现了Fe3O4（磁铁矿）在铌掺杂钛酸锶（Nb:STO）衬底上的自下而上集成，从薄膜到纳米点的尺度可控生长。氧化铁薄膜与氧化物衬底的外延异质结构在自旋电子学领域具有重要应用前景。通过精确控制生长条件（温度、沉积速率等），研究团队实现了从连续薄膜到离散纳米点的形貌调控，为构建功能化氧化物纳米结构提供了可扩展策略。该工作对氧化物电子学和纳米器件集成具有推动意义。","ot":"From Thin Films to Nanodots: Bottom‐Up Integration of Fe3O4 on Nb:STO for Functional Oxide Nanostructures","b":"Epitaxial heterostructures of iron oxide thin films on oxide substrates are promising for spintronic applications. Scaling down such heterostructures into ordered nanostructures enables integration into functional devices. However, fabricating well-ordered nanostructures while retaining their structural and functional integrity remains challenging. A bottom-up approach is used to grow epitaxial Fe3O4 nanodot arrays on Nb-doped SrTiO3(Nb:STO) substrates integrating anodic aluminum oxide (AAO) templates combined with pulsed laser deposition. Following this method, the lateral confinement of Fe3O4 into 30 and 70 nm nanodots with 3D long-range ordering is then confirmed by grazing-incidence small-angle X-ray scattering (GISAXS) and scanning electron microscopy (SEM). Building on this structural evidence, the Verwey transition is found to be retained, as observed in the continuous film. To explore its applicability in nanoelectronics, conductive atomic force microscopy (c-AFM) is used to probe local electrical behavior, and reveals bipolar resistive switching at room temperature in individual nanodots, consistent with behavior observed in thin films. Together, these results establish the first demonstration of ordered epitaxial Fe3O4/Nb:STO nanodots with preserved structural, magnetic, and electrical functionalities, providing a generalizable route for nanoscale integration of complex oxides."},{"t":"巨型nesprin-2的力依赖性结构动力学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517922123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The nesprin protein family serves as a critical physical bridge between the cytoskeleton–a fundamental structural scaffold and mechanotransduction hub of the cell, and the nucleus–an intriguing and emerging mechanoresponsive element. Due to the external mechanical cues and the nucleo-cytoskeletal dynamics, the nesprins are physiologically under forces. However, the dynamics of nesprins within physiological forces and loading rates remain largely unexplored. In this study, we employ magnetic-tweezers-based single-molecule manipulation alongside molecular dynamic simulations and AlphaFold structural predictions to comprehensively investigate the dynamics of force-bearing spectrin repeat (SR) domains of the giant nesprin-2 protein. Through direct quantification, we unveil that the numerous SRs undergo mechanical unfolding and refolding dynamics with distinct transition rates within several pN scale. Furthermore, we show that the giant nesprin-2 could act as an effective molecular absorber adeptly maintaining forces on the nucleoskeleton and cytoskeleton linkage within a few pN across displacement spans exceeding one μm. Notably, our findings imply that subtle pN-level mechanical forces intricately modulate nesprin–protein interactions via the dynamics of domain folding and unfolding. Collectively, our study offers a comprehensive understanding of the mechanical characteristics of nesprin-2 giant, shedding light on its pivotal role in nucleoskeleton–cytoskeleton mechanotransduction."},{"t":"用于交互式虚拟现实的织物拓扑触觉代理","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag041/8439535?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Physical objects serving as haptic proxies offer a promising approach to enrich tactile experience in virtual reality. However, conventional haptic proxies are hampered by prohibitive costs, limited reusability, and the logistical burden of creating and storing numerous object-specific models. Here, we introduce a fabric-based topological haptic proxy (FTHP) that functions as a programmable and universal interface. Our approach synergistically integrates origami-inspired topological constraints with triboelectric sensor yarns. The engineered topological design, featuring heterogeneous rigid and flexible segments, restricts deformation pathways, ensuring structural stability and generating distinct, classifiable electrical signals for different interactions. This allows a single, reusable FTHP to be dynamically reconfigured into multiple functional states (e.g. a flat touchpad or various 3D geometric controllers), bypassing the need for a rigid one-to-one correspondence between physical props and pre-stored virtual assets. Integrated with a convolutional neural network (CNN), the system achieves a 92.4% recognition accuracy across 14 distinct actions and 3 interaction modes. The FTHP presents a scalable and versatile platform for high-fidelity haptic interaction, advancing the design of more immersive and accessible VR systems."},{"t":"硅酸钙的实验观察","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524999?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Reactions between carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) and silica (SiO\n                    2\n                    ), as well as between carbonates and silicates, are central to understanding carbon behavior in planetary interiors and have important technological implications. Yet, only a few oxides are known in which carbon and silicon coexist within the same crystal lattice. These silicate–carbonates typically contain trigonal carbonate [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups and tetrahedrally coordinated silicate [SiO\n                    4\n                    ] units. In the CaO–SiO\n                    2\n                    –CO\n                    2\n                    system, no phase had previously been shown to contain both octahedrally coordinated silicon [SiO\n                    6\n                    ] and carbonate [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups, nor had such a structure been theoretically predicted. Here, we report the synthesis of the calcium silicon double carbonate Ca\n                    2\n                    Si(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    4\n                    , obtained by reacting tilleyite, Ca\n                    5\n                    (Si\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    )(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    , with CO\n                    2\n                    in diamond anvil cells at 39.5 GPa and 2600 K. The compound was subsequently temperature‐ and pressure‐quenched, remaining metastable at ambient conditions. Structural and spectroscopic characterization was performed using synchrotron single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and Raman spectroscopy. The structure of Ca\n                    2\n                    Si(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    4\n                    is unique among silicate–carbonates, featuring sixfold‐coordinated Si sharing oxygen atoms with [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups. Additionally, a novel calcium tetracarbonate, Ca\n                    2\n                    (C\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    ), containing tetrahedral [CO\n                    4\n                    ] units, was discovered. These findings reveal a new oxide chemistry under extreme conditions and open avenues for synthesizing metastable carbon‐bearing materials relevant to the deep carbon cycle.","tp":"碳硅酸盐矿","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"二氧化碳与二氧化硅之间以及碳酸盐与硅酸盐之间的反应对理解行星内部碳行为至关重要，且具有重要技术意义。然而碳和硅共存于同一晶格的氧化物极为罕见。该研究对硅酸钙进行了实验观察，这类硅酸盐-碳酸盐通常含有三角构型的碳酸根基团，为探索地幔深部碳硅化学提供了新的实验约束。"},{"t":"二维MoS2因六方到菱方相变与极化效应实现优异热开关性能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72234?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2热开关","kp":["[工作温度范围]: 300-1573 K","[材料]: 二维MoS2","[相变机制]: 六方到菱方相变+极化翻转"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了二维二硫化钼（MoS2）在六方相与菱方相之间相变时展现出卓越的热开关性能。通过可逆结构相变，材料的面内热导率可在两个状态间大幅切换，热开关比显著优于现有固态热开关材料。这一机制为可持续技术中的主动热流调控提供了全新路径，在热管理、热逻辑器件和能量收集领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Exceptional Thermal Switching Performance in 2D MoS2 Due to Hexagonal to Rhombohedral Phase Transition and Polarization ","b":"Active control of heat flow is crucial for managing thermal energy in sustainable technologies. However, current technologies are limited by the small switching ratio and narrow operating temperature range of thermal switching materials. Herein, we demonstrate that molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) exhibits an excellent thermal switching performance across an ultra-wide temperature range of 300-1573 K, based on a reversible transition between the non-polarized hexagonal (2H) and electronically polarized rhombohedral (3R) phases. This phase transition is kinetically limited, and the presence of electric field lowers the transition barrier, dramatically reducing the temperature and pressure required to drive the phase transition. The application of the electric field results in a vertical flip from the out-of-plane alignment along the pressure direction in the 2H phase (\"off\" state) to an in-plane polarization alignment along the electric field direction in the 3R phase (\"on\" state). This phase transition and polarized orientation switching, in conjunction with the significant anisotropic thermal transport properties of both phases, lead to a record-high thermal switching ratio of 15.2 at 300 K and maintains 6.6 at 1573 K. Our findings provide a new avenue for exploring high-performance thermal switch material triggered by phase transition and orientation changes in highly anisotropic materials.","aip":1},{"t":"研究文章“TP53错义-特异性转录可塑性驱动细胞周期抵抗”的勘误","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef0961?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"研究文章“兴奋毒性神经元死亡需要超氧化物通过容量调节进入神经元”的勘误","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef0963?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"使用超声递送锚进行生物正交连接增强 mRNA 递送","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523437?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Therapeutic nucleic acid delivery has many potential applications, but it remains challenging to target extrahepatic tissues in a flexible and image‐guided manner. To address this issue, we report a bioorthogonal pre‐targeting strategy that uses focused ultrasound (FUS) to promote the delivery of mRNA‐loaded lipid nanoparticles (mRNA‐LNP). We synthesized amphiphilic click reactive anchors (ACRAs) consisting of a phospholipid PEG‐conjugate functionalized with trans‐cyclooctene (TCO) or its companion reactive partner methyltetrazine (mTz), producing ACRA‐TCO and ACRA‐mTz. ACRA derivatives were screened for cellular activity, yielding functionalized DOPE‐PEG (1,2‐dioleoyl‐sn‐glycero‐3‐phosphoethanolamine‐N‐(polyethylene glycol)) derivatives outperforming those containing saturated lipid or branched PEG. Nanobubbles encapsulating ultrasound‐responsive gas delivered ACRA‐TCO to targeted cells and tissues using FUS. This pre‐targeting promoted the subsequent delivery of mRNA‐LNP functionalized with companion ACRA‐mTz. Ultrasound pre‐targeting enhanced the accumulation of mTz‐functionalized nanoparticles in cell cultures and mice by 75% and up to 3.6‐fold, respectively, and increased gene expression using mRNA‐LNP in vivo. Microbubbles loaded with ACRA roughly doubled mRNA delivery to the heart, while ultrasound alone did not. Taken together, this report presents a modular, ultrasound‐enabled strategy for enhancing nucleic acid delivery in targeted tissues."},{"t":"DNA 电子特性的工程设计","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02066-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过嵌入式牺牲生物打印设计的可灌注肝纤维化模型概括了硬度驱动的纤维化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513401?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Hepatic fibrosis, as the common pathological endpoint of chronic liver diseases, is characterized by a self‐perpetuating vicious cycle comprising extracellular matrix (ECM) driven liver tissue stiffening and sustained hepatic stellate cell (HSC) activation. Although existing studies have simulated fibrotic microenvironments using 2D models with tunable matrix stiffness or static 3D cultures, these models lack engineered hepatic sinusoidal vasculature and dynamic mechanical stimulation within 3D ECM contexts. This study employed embedded sacrificial bioprinting to construct functional liver sinusoid‐mimetic vascular networks within hydrogel matrix of precisely tunable elastic modulus, establishing a dynamically perfused in vitro liver fibrosis model. Experimental validation demonstrated that matrix stiffness directly drives HSC activation, inducing marked myofibroblastic transdifferentiation. Furthermore, compared to static models, 3D dynamic perfusion significantly enhanced hepatocyte sensitivity to high‐stiffness matrix, more accurately replicating the functional decline of hepatocytes in fibrotic microenvironments observed in vivo. More critically, the biomimetic in vitro platform established in this study presents a potential avenue for evaluating pharmacotherapeutic interventions against liver fibrosis. Through targeted inhibition of key signaling hubs, we achieved partial reversal of HSC activation on stiff matrix and partial recovery of liver tissue function. Overall, by simultaneously integrating matrix stiffness modulation, 3D multicellular interactions, and hemodynamic stimulation, this work effectively addresses the insufficient responsiveness of hepatocytes to mechanical cues in conventional models due to inadequate mechanical stimulation. This approach provides a robust framework for faithfully recapitulating the pathophysiological progression of liver fibrosis in vitro through precise tuning of ECM mechanical properties, thereby offering a promising platform for future drug screening and therapeutic assessment.","tp":"生物打印肝纤维化","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"肝纤维化是慢性肝病的共同病理终点，其特征为细胞外基质驱动的肝组织硬化和肝星状细胞持续活化构成的恶性循环。现有2D模型和静态3D培养缺乏工程化肝血窦血管系统和动态力学刺激。研究通过嵌入式牺牲生物打印技术构建可灌注肝纤维化模型，成功再现了硬度驱动的纤维化过程，为抗纤维化药物筛选提供了更仿生的体外平台。"},{"t":"能源安全、气候政策不确定性和气候转型风险：混频多维溢出","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600025X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源气候政策溢出","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"内源性逆转录病毒合成异源嵌合RNA以增强人类早期胚胎发育","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv5257?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Zygotic genome activation (ZGA) failure leads to developmental arrest and poses a clinical challenge to women's fertility. We observed that human embryos arresting at the eight-cell ZGA stage exhibited specific down-regulation of endogenous retrovirus MLT2A1. Depleting MLT2A1 resulted in a failure in embryo development and a reduction in ZGA gene expression. Mechanistically, MLT2A1s synthesized chimeric transcripts with downstream coding and noncoding sequences, predominantly with heterologous retro-transposable elements. These diverse fusion sequences expanded the genome-targeting spectrum of MLT2A1 RNAs. Nevertheless, the shared MLT2A1 sequences partnered with heterogeneous nuclear ribonucleoprotein U (HNRNPU) to recruit RNA polymerase II, promoting global transcription of ZGA genes and autoamplification of the MLT2A1 subfamily. Thus, MLT2A1 chimeric RNAs formed an interlocking network that acts synergistically to boost human ZGA and early embryogenesis.","tp":"胚胎基因调控","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"合子基因组激活（ZGA）失败会导致人类早期胚胎发育停滞，是女性不孕的临床难题。研究发现，发育阻滞的人类八细胞期胚胎中内源性逆转录病毒MLT2A1显著下调。缺失MLT2A1会阻碍胚胎发育并降低ZGA基因表达。在机制上，MLT2A1通过与下游异源序列剪接合成嵌合RNA，以增强基因表达。该研究揭示了远古病毒序列在人类早期胚胎发育中的关键调控功能。","aip":1},{"t":"协同光氧化还原催化下的对映选择性还原偶联及相关转化反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01154J","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化不对称偶联","kp":["[催化体系]: 协同光氧化还原催化","[反应类型]: 对映选择性还原偶联","[产物]: 手性碳碳键"],"dp":1,"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述系统总结了协同光氧化还原催化下的对映选择性还原偶联及相关转化反应的最新进展。手性C-C键的催化不对称构建方法学是有机合成的核心挑战。文章聚焦光催化与手性催化（如手性配体、有机催化）协同策略，在温和可见光条件下实现自由基中间体的高对映选择性偶联，涵盖烯烃双官能化、C-C键还原偶联和去消旋化等转化类型。综述分析了催化剂设计原理、底物范围局限及未来发展方向。","ot":"Enantioselective reductive couplings and related transformations under cooperative photoredox catalysis","b":"The development of catalytic and enantioselective methods for constructing chiral carbon–carbon bonds remains a significant challenge and crucial objective in organic synthesis, as these chiral bonds are ubiquitous in bioactive molecules and natural products. The straightforward construction of chiral C–C bonds through asymmetric reductive coupling of two electrophiles represents one of the most powerful synthetic strategies in modern organic chemistry. Recently, photoredox catalysis has gained considerable attention from the scientific community due to its unique activation mode and significance for sustainable synthesis. The synergistic combination of photoredox catalysis and asymmetric catalysis has emerged as a promising catalytic strategy, offering a potential solution to overcome limitations in traditional asymmetric catalysis. This tutorial review offers a comprehensive overview of enantioselective reductive transformations under cooperative photoredox catalysis, focusing primarily on the synergistic interactions between photocatalysts and transition metals, enzymes, and hydrogen-bonding catalysts, highlighting their significance in understanding and advancing catalytic processes."},{"t":"边缘驱动的边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱与石墨烯纳米带带隙展宽实现单分子传感","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520102?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯纳米带传感","kp":["[传感能力]: 单分子灵敏度","[材料]: 石墨烯纳米带","[机制]: 边缘场效应与带隙展宽"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现石墨烯纳米带（GNR）中边缘驱动的边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱和带隙展宽使其能够实现单分子传感。GNR因其准一维沟道和独特的边缘态成为单分子检测的有前景平台。研究通过实验和理论分析表明，GNR窄宽度导致的强边缘效应显著增强了其对表面分子吸附的电学响应灵敏度，带隙展宽提高了室温下的信噪比。该工作为基于二维材料纳米结构的高灵敏生物/化学传感器设计提供了原理验证。","ot":"Edge‐Driven Fringe‐Field Effects, Reduced Screening, and Bandgap Widening in Graphene Nanoribbons Enable Single‑Molecule","b":"Graphene nanoribbons (GNRs) offer promising platforms for single-molecule sensing due to their quasi-1D channels and discrete electronic states, providing superior sensitivity toward molecular perturbations. While prior studies emphasize smoother edges as essential for optimal performance, the potential benefits of controlled edge roughness remain largely unexplored. Additionally, most investigations focus on GNR arrays, leaving critical edge- and width-dependent factors, including fringe fields, bandgap widening, interactions between adsorbing molecules and GNR atoms, density of states (DOS) suppression, and electrostatic screening lengths, and their collective impact on sensitivity, poorly understood. Here, we fabricated field-effect transistors using individual GNRs (widths: 200-20 nm) and characterized their response to molecular adsorption with perfluorooctanoic acid as the model analyte. Narrower ribbons displayed significantly enhanced sensitivity, yielding a coverage-normalized response of 116 ± 10 mV per molecule in 20 nm-wide GNRs (from calibrated ensemble Dirac-point shifts). Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this heightened sensitivity arises from stronger fringe fields, width-dependent quantum confinement effects, reduced DOS, and increased edge roughness that facilitates molecular anchoring, enhanced orbital overlap, and improved charge transfer efficiency. Our findings challenge the conventional assumption that smoother edges inherently enhance sensor performance, demonstrating that controlled edge disorder substantially boosts molecular sensitivity in GNR sensors."},{"t":"边云协同驱动的微电网电动汽车充电负荷预测规划","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000140?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"充电负荷预测","kp":["[架构]: 边云协同","[应用]: 微电网EV充电负荷预测规划"],"dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Edge-cloud collaboration-driven predictive planning of electric vehicle charging load for microgrids"},{"t":"地震充当陆地有机碳的电容器","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68341-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Earthquakes and seismically-induced landslides accelerate carbon export from mountains by eroding hillslope soil carbon. However, a quantitative understanding of their net contribution to carbon cycling remains incomplete. Using the 2008 Mw 7.9 Wenchuan Earthquake which generated the largest landslide volume in recent history, we quantify its carbon mass balance accounting for storage, loss, and transport within the ensuing sediment cascade. Thanks to post-event revegetation and extensive intermontane sediment storage, we show that the earthquake boosted Longmenshan carbon mass by ~10%. Given the stability of these deposits and low rates of carbon export, we anticipate this landslide carbon will persist for centuries to millennia before gradually declining. In effect, we demonstrate that earthquakes and landslides function as capacitors, regulating carbon storage and discharge across mountain belts over time. This suggests frequent landslides in seismically-active mountains may lead to a net carbon sequestration, providing a critical and direct link between tectonics and the carbon cycle.","tp":"地震碳循环","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"地震及其诱发的滑坡会侵蚀土壤碳并加速山区碳的流失，但其对碳循环的净贡献尚不明确。研究以2008年汶川大地震为例，量化分析了引发的大规模滑坡在碳存储、流失和沉积物运移过程中的碳质量平衡。震后植被恢复和广泛的临时性沉积物储存有效抵消了碳流失。这表明地震在陆地有机碳循环中扮演着“电容器”的角色，将瞬时剥蚀的碳转化为长期储存或缓慢释放的过程。"},{"t":"工作记忆漂移和信息在皮质层次结构中流动的动态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518110123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Working memory is supported by widespread and distributed brain regions spanning across the cortical hierarchy. However, how working memory content evolves and is transmitted across cortical regions remains largely unknown. Here, we investigated the flow of working memory information across the cortex using time-resolved fMRI decoding. Across multiple regions in visual and parietal cortex, we found that decoded working memory content drifted over time from the memoranda toward the later errors in memory reports, consistent with the dynamics of memory drift predicted by attractor models. These behaviorally predictive neural memory errors emerged earliest in higher-order dorsal visual area (V3AB) and intraparietal sulcus (IPS0) and then later in early visual cortex (V1), suggesting a propagation of mnemonic information originated in higher-level visual area. Interareal correlation analyses revealed that during memory maintenance, information flowed predominantly in a top–down manner—from higher to lower visual areas, whereas during passive viewing, feedforward dynamics prevailed. Together, our findings demonstrate that working memory maintenance involves temporally structured drift dynamics and feedback-dominated information flow across the cortical hierarchy, providing a mechanistic link between neural population dynamics and the formation of memory errors.","tp":"工作记忆信息流","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用时间分辨fMRI解码技术揭示了工作记忆信息在皮层层次结构中的流动机制。发现视觉和顶叶皮层多个区域的解码记忆内容随时间发生漂移，从原始刺激项逐渐趋向后续错误模式，表明工作记忆表征在皮层间传递过程中并非静态保持，而是动态演化的。"},{"t":"基于产消者能源社区的动态自适应模型预测控制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000693?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源社区模型预测控制","dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Dynamic adaptive model predictive control for prosumers-based energy communities"},{"t":"Cs3Cu2I5/石墨烯/锗多异质结双功能光电器件实现深紫外探测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522683?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"深紫外光电探测","kp":["[异质结构]: Cs3Cu2I5/石墨烯/Ge","[功能]: 深紫外突触+近红外自驱动探测","[器件类型]: 双功能光电突触器件"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了Cs₃Cu₂I₅/石墨烯/Ge多异质结构，实现深紫外光电探测与神经形态处理的双功能集成。Cs₃Cu₂I₅作为无铅钙钛矿材料具备优异深紫外光响应特性，石墨烯层提供高效电荷传输通道，Ge基底实现光电信号转换。该器件在深紫外波段展现出高探测率和快速响应，同时具备突触可塑性模拟能力，可用于仿生视觉感知系统，在紫外成像、火焰探测及神经形态计算领域具有重要应用前景。","ot":"Dual‐Functional Optoelectronic Devices Composed of Cs3Cu2I5/Graphene/Ge Multi‐Heterostructures Enabling Deep‐Ultraviolet","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐functional optoelectronic devices that integrate the capacities of neuromorphic processing and photodetection are of pivotal importance for advancing optoelectronic techniques. Here, we present a dual‐functional optoelectronic device based on a multi‐heterostructure of Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    /graphene/Ge, which realizes high‐performance deep‐ultraviolet (DUV) synaptic behavior and self‐driven near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection simultaneously. On one hand, the device leverages the photogating effect in the Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    /graphene heterostructure to produce persistent photo‐conductivity, emulating synaptic behavior upon DUV light stimulation. Electron trapping by introducing B\n                    4\n                    PyMPM as capture sites significantly promotes spatial divorcement of photocarriers, guaranteeing remarkably improved synaptic characteristics. The utilizations in DUV fingerprint recognition with an accuracy of 97.8%, and optoelectronic reservoir computing with recognition accuracy reaching 100% for three 4‐bit numbers are demonstrated. On the other hand, the device utilizes the photovoltaic effect in the graphene/Ge heterostructure to generate photoresponse at zero working bias, enabling self‐driven photodetection upon NIR light illumination. The wide‐bandgap Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    functions as an effective NIR anti‐reflection layer to induce a strong light trapping effect, giving rise to boosted photoresponse properties. The excellent photoresponse supports the device in performing single‐pixel NIR optical imaging. It is believed that this work is inspiring to the design of high‐performance multi‐functional optoelectronic devices toward integrated and intelligence applications."},{"t":"肉瘤融合中的液滴生长、奥斯特瓦尔德规则和秩序的出现","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519135123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The low-complexity domain of Fused in Sarcoma (FUS-LC) undergoes phase separation, forming a dense, liquid-like phase that gradually matures into an ordered, gel-like state over long-time scales. During the maturation process, specific regions of the FUS-LC sequence-core-1, core-2, and core-3-become structured, giving rise to nonpolymorphic fibrils. Coarse-grained simulations predict that kinetically the least stable fibril-like core-3 forms first while the most stable core-1 appears last, in accord with Ostwald’s rule of stages. The fibril structure of the C-terminal core-3, predicted using AlphaFold, shows that a\n                    \n                      \n                        β\n                      \n                    \n                    -strand appears in this region early during droplet formation and triggers FUS-LC assembly. Multichain simulations, which ensure the equality of the chemical potentials between the phases, show that the dense phase forms through nucleation and coarsening, resembling Ostwald ripening. The approaches developed here are broadly applicable and could help uncover assembly mechanisms in other intrinsically disordered proteins like TDP-43, which shares key features with FUS-LC.","tp":"蛋白相分离","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究了肉瘤融合蛋白低复杂度域（FUS-LC）的液液相分离与成熟过程。FUS-LC形成的致密液相随时间逐渐转变为有序凝胶态，其序列中core-1、core-2、core-3区域逐步结构化，形成非多态性纤维。粗粒化模拟预测动力学上最不稳定的core-3最先形成，最稳定的core-1最后出现，符合Ostwald规则。"},{"t":"条条大路通罗马吗？评估能源正义治理策略的有效性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000236?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源正义治理","sc":2.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"使用多向剪切揭示软玻璃材料中无序引起的应力流错位","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521603123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling the mechanical response of soft glassy materials-such as emulsions, foams, and colloidal suspensions-is key for many industrial processes. While their steady-state flow behavior is reasonably well understood, their response to complex flow histories, as encountered in operations like pumping or mixing, remains poorly known. Using a custom multiaxis shear apparatus that enables arbitrary changes in flow direction, we investigate how shear history influences the mechanical behavior of a model soft glassy system. We uncover a transient shear response orthogonal to the applied shear direction, together with an anisotropic yield surface. These effects point to an underlying anisotropic distribution of internal stresses imprinted by previous deformation. To rationalize this behavior, we use a mesoscopic elastoplastic model, demonstrating that local mechanical disorder governs the emergence of macroscopic stress-flow misalignment. Our findings offer a route to experimentally probe the distribution of local yield stresses in soft glassy materials.","tp":"软玻璃材料剪切","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对乳液、泡沫和胶体悬浮液等软玻璃材料在复杂流动历史下的力学行为，利用定制多轴剪切装置研究任意流向变化对应力响应的影响。揭示了无序结构引起的应力流错位机制，对工业泵送和混合等过程的材料性能控制具有重要意义。"},{"t":"使用精确的可极化多元醇直接观察深度过冷水中的液-液相共存","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Liquid water can be supercooled up to about 50 K below the melting point before undergoing homogeneous ice nucleation. Based on experimental thermodynamic observations and computer simulations, it was hypothesized that below this temperature and at pressures of several kbar, water undergoes a liquid–liquid phase transition (LLPT) and the transition line ends at a second critical point. However, challenges in experiments and simulations at such deep cooling leave doubts about the nature of the LLPT and the existence of the critical point. Here, we use molecular dynamics simulations with a highly accurate and computationally efficient polarizable water model to establish the character of the LLPT and identify the location of the second critical point. Our microsecond-long simulations provide direct evidence of a well-defined moving interface between low-density and high-density water at conditions near the phase boundary. This provides decisive proof of a first-order transition between two liquid phases with distinct free energy basins separated by a barrier, taking a major step toward resolving this long-standing debate. These results offer new perspectives on supercooled water under pressure simulated with an accurate and realistic model suitable for studies of water in confined geological and biological environments."},{"t":"具有可重编程相结构的数字复合材料","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9698?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数字复合材料","kp":["[架构]: 体素分辨率可重编程固液相","[功能单元]: 液态金属弹性体复合体素","[特点]: 电控可重构相架构"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出一种可重编程相架构的数字复合材料设计策略。通过空间图案化分布不同材料相，实现对复合材料功能多样性的精确调控，类似于天然复合材料（如骨骼、贝壳）的多相结构。核心创新在于材料相分布可通过外部刺激（光、热等）动态重编程，使同一材料在不同功能状态间切换。该技术在可编程超材料、软体机器人和自适应结构领域具有变革性潜力。","ot":"Digital composites with reprogrammable phase architectures","b":"Spatial patterning of material phases underpins the functional diversity of natural and engineered composites. However, phase architectures are typically fixed once formed, limiting adaptability. Here, we introduce a digital composite with reprogrammable solid-liquid phase architectures at voxel resolution. Each elastomeric voxel contains a liquid metal composite capable of electrically switching between nonvolatile solid and liquid states within seconds, analogous to rewriting data on a hard disk. High-throughput experiments and coupled modeling demonstrate precise tuning of viscoelastic and plastic properties, as well as programmable constitutive behaviors and strain distributions. A modular assembly strategy allows scalable 3D construction of reprogrammable composites into free-form, bulk geometries. By encoding phase states as digital inputs, the composite unlocks unprecedented access to real-time, voxel-level tuning of material properties."},{"t":"面向梯级水电混合抽蓄的深度强化学习实时调度方法：缓解光伏波动","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"梯级水电智能调度","kp":["方法[水电-光伏]: 深度强化学习实时调度","应用: 混合抽蓄缓解光伏不确定性"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating pho"},{"t":"深度生成模型调控燃料电池超低铂催化剂层","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506271?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池低铂催化","kp":["[优化方法]: 深度生成模型优化CL微观结构","目标[燃料电池]: 超低Pt载量"],"as":"针对燃料电池中降低铂催化剂载量的难题，引入深度生成模型对超低Pt催化剂层结构进行智能调控。通过生成式AI学习催化剂微观形貌、组分分布与电化学性能之间的映射关系，逆向设计最优的纳米催化剂构型，在大幅减少贵金属用量的同时维持高催化活性与耐久性。该方法将材料信息学与生成式设计深度融合，为质子交换膜燃料电池的大规模商业化降本提供了数据驱动的工程路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Deep Generative Models Regulate Ultralow‐Pt Catalyst Layer in Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Reducing the precious Pt loading in catalyst layers (CLs) while maintaining fuel cell performance is critical for cost reduction, necessitating the development of an optimized CL microstructure, but conventional empirical expertise‐dependent trial‐and‐error optimization faces severe efficiency limitations when dealing with multiple transfers coupled with electrochemical reactions inside the multi‐component hierarchical porous architecture. Here, we present Generative Artificial Intelligence for Controllable Electrode Synthesis (GAI4CES), a framework that enables rapid CL microstructure synthesis, achieving nearly 500x speedup for constructing a representative CL microstructure of 128 nm\n                    3\n                    (in 0.36 s compared to 168 s required by traditional numerical methods). It can tailor key property constraints, such as Pt loading and electrochemical surface area (ECSA), to generate statistically representative microstructures satisfying target specifications. This capability enables an exhaustive search for the optimal CL structural design through large‐scale geometry‑constrained synthesis coupled with fast performance prediction. The optimized CL microstructure achieves an improvement of 11.6% in ECSA and a reduction of 32.9% in average ionomer thickness surrounding the Pt/C at ultralow Pt loading (e.g., 0.05 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ), and contributes to a maximum 70.2% voltage increase at 3 A cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , indicating that the GAI4CES is powerful in promoting the development of advanced low‐cost and high‐performance fuel cells.","aip":1},{"t":"利用缔合交换解耦超分子水凝胶的动力学与交联稳定性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516741?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子水凝胶","kp":["[交联机制]: 缔合型交联交换","[材料]: DNA基超分子水凝胶","[解耦特性]: 松弛行为与交联稳定性解耦"],"as":"针对超分子水凝胶长期面临的力学强度与动态可重构性难以兼顾的矛盾，提出解耦交联网络中动力学与稳定性的新策略。利用不同非共价相互作用（如氢键、主客体识别、金属配位）的速率差异，将牺牲性动态键与永久交联点分离设计，使凝胶在保持高韧性与自恢复能力的同时具备可注射性与刺激响应性。该机制为组织工程、软机器人等领域的智能水凝胶材料设计提供了基础理论框架。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoupling Dynamics and Crosslink Stability in Supramolecular Hydrogels Using Associative Exchange","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The design of hydrogels that combine mechanical robustness with dynamic reconfigurability remains a fundamental challenge, as increasing crosslink dissociation rates compromise network integrity. This limitation is addressed through the incorporation of an associative crosslink exchange into DNA‐based supramolecular hydrogels, enabling the decoupling of network relaxation behavior from crosslink stability. The hydrogels are constructed from enzyme‐synthesized single‐stranded DNA that self‐assembles via hybridization between complementary domains. These crosslinks can reorganize through dissociative melting or associative strand displacement reaction, yielding networks with tunable relaxation timescales spanning over three orders of magnitude. Rheological measurements and thermodynamic modeling confirm that associative exchange facilitates efficient stress dissipation without diminishing rupture strength or thermal stability. In contrast, dissociative systems inherently trade increased dynamics with mechanical weakening. This decoupling is achieved through the implementation of a catalytic reorganization pathway governed by the composition of the sample, independently of the crosslink strength. These findings establish the mechanism of reorganization as a key design parameter for engineering adaptive soft materials that combine resilience and responsiveness."},{"t":"损害评估","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5690?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Which of Donald Trump's changes are likely to last-and which will fade?"},{"t":"细胞质拥挤充当多孔介质，减少大分子扩散","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519599123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Intracellular transport of macromolecules is crucial for the proper functioning of most cellular processes. Although intracellular crowding is known to strongly alter macromolecule mobility, how cytoplasmic structures physically modulate diffusion remains largely unexplored. Here, we investigated the mechanisms by which cytoplasmic crowding controls diffusivity using live-cell experiments and porous media modeling approaches. Confocal microscopy combined with fluorescence recovery after photobleaching and fluorescence correlation spectroscopy measurements revealed an anticorrelation between free-green fluorescent protein diffusivity and the heterogeneous cytoplasmic structure abundance in live mammalian cells. This motivated the development of a multiscale model, where the cytoplasm is treated as a hierarchical porous medium with nanometric and micrometric obstacles. Numerically solving the model allowed us to predict the effective cytoplasmic diffusion coefficient for various obstacle volume fractions, and to identify tortuous and porous hydrodynamic hindrances as key diffusion reduction mechanisms. Comparison with our experimental results highlighted the importance of hydrodynamic interactions between diffusing molecules and nanometric obstacles. Importantly, we found that the effective cytoplasmic diffusivity was not dependent on specific intracellular regions but rather on the local intracellular obstacle volume fraction. Finally, the model was extended to predict the diffusivity of larger macromolecules, showing excellent agreement with literature data for several macromolecules and cell lines. This study provides insights into the physical mechanisms impeding intracellular diffusion, demonstrating the potential of porous media modeling approaches to predict transport mechanisms in dynamic or heterogeneous intracellular structures, as in cell motility, blebbing, and apoptosis.","tp":"细胞质扩散","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"通过活细胞实验和多孔介质建模方法研究细胞质拥挤对大分子扩散的调控机制。共聚焦显微镜结合荧光漂白恢复实验表明，细胞质结构如同多孔介质，显著限制大分子运输，对理解细胞内物质运输和生理功能调控具有基础意义。"},{"t":"风电场功率优化的循环偏航控制：斯特劳哈尔数、场区配置与湍流强度的作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000711?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电场偏航控制","kp":["[关键参数]: 斯特劳哈尔数","[对象]: 风电场循环偏航控制"],"dp":1,"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Cyclic yaw control for wind farm power optimization: The role of strouhal number, farm configuration, and turbulence int"},{"t":"Couple-close：半饱和循环支架的统一方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec5748?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Couple-close as a synthetic paradigm has the potential to change the way that synthetic organic chemists approach cyclic scaffold construction. One class of cyclic molecules that has been increasingly sought after is semisaturated cyclic scaffolds, whose specific blend of Csp2- and Csp3-hybridized components confers distinct properties to these species. However, existing methods to construct these scaffolds are limited, often relying on arene saturation or annulations that require lengthy de novo syntheses. Herein, we describe a unified and highly modular couple-close strategy for the synthesis of semisaturated scaffolds. This approach installs bifunctional linkers onto aromatic rings through a range of bond-forming reactions, and subsequent cyclization furnishes semisaturated bicyclic adducts. Key to this approach is a mechanistically distinct cobalt-catalyzed dehydrogenative radical cyclization that proceeds efficiently even on electronically unbiased arenes, enabling a broad substrate scope under mild reaction conditions."},{"t":"老年小鼠的皮质 O2 供应和代谢受到抑制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522765123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Current evidence suggests that the rejuvenating effects of parabiosis on brain function arise from the exchange of blood factors that enhance synaptic plasticity, promote neurogenesis, and reduce neuroinflammation in aged animals. However, aging is also associated with diminished tissue oxygenation. Here, we report that erythrocytes (red blood cells, RBCs) from aged mice exhibit reduced responsiveness to low oxygen tension (PO\n                    2\n                    ) and release O\n                    2\n                    slower than those from young mice. In vivo, sensory stimulation evoked a smaller and delayed capillary RBC flow in aged mice. Although activity-evoked PO\n                    2\n                    dips were diminished in aged mice; experimentally reducing PO\n                    2\n                    to comparable levels did not restore capillary flow in aged mice, consistent with diminished RBC O\n                    2\n                    responsiveness observed ex vivo. Notably, RBCs from aged mice in heterochronic parabiosis pairs (young-aged) displayed faster responses to low PO\n                    2\n                    compared to those from aged mice in isochronic pairs (aged-aged). Together, these findings across multiple levels of analysis demonstrate that aging impairs RBC responsiveness to O\n                    2\n                    and suggest that improved RBC-mediated O\n                    2\n                    delivery contributes to the rejuvenating effects of parabiosis."},{"t":"核壳结构：用半渗透涂层封装纳米多孔颗粒解决硬碳负极困境","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519457?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳负极核壳结构","kp":["策略[硬碳负极]: 半透性核壳涂层密封纳米多孔颗粒","目标[硬碳负极]: 兼顾高可逆容量与低首圈不可逆损失"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出核壳结构策略解决硬碳负极的固有困境：通过用半透性涂层密封纳米多孔颗粒，抑制电解液在首次充放电过程中深入多孔结构造成的不可逆容量损失。半透性壳层允许锂离子通过同时阻挡溶剂分子共嵌入，从而提升库仑效率和循环稳定性。该设计在保持硬碳高比容量优势的同时，显著改善了首效和长循环寿命，为钠/锂离子电池负极工程化提供了新思路。","ot":"Core‐Shell: Resolving the Dilemma of Hard Carbon Anodes by Sealing Nanoporous Particles With Semi‐Permeable Coatings","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    A core‐shell strategy is introduced to overcome the dilemma of common non‐graphitic hard carbon anodes, linking high reversible storage capacity to practically unacceptable irreversible losses in the first cycle(s). Just as graphite homogeneously combines effective lithium storage with an electrolyte solvent‐sieving function, we show that both of these functions could be strategically integrated into non‐graphitic carbons in a heterogeneous structure. Highly porous activated carbons are sealed by kinetically tuned gas‐phase deposition of non‐graphitic carbon to form a functional core‐shell structure. Gas sorption porosimetry on core, shell, core–shell, and cracked core‐shell particles confirms preserved core porosity and a semi‐permeable shell. Diethyl carbonate sorption analysis is introduced as a more suitable probe than N\n                    2\n                    or CO\n                    2\n                    sorption, linking first‐cycle losses to the liquid–solid interface of carbon anodes. The functional core‐shell particles with much reduced diethyl carbonate uptake allow for high storage capacity and reduced first cycle losses. Delivering 400 ± 24 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    with 82 ± 2% first‐cycle reversibility, it is shown that three‐stage Na storage in designed core‐shell anodes can compensate for the larger size of sodium compared to lithium stored in graphite anodes (372 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ). The designed core‐shell anodes show state‐of‐the‐art performance with commercial promise."},{"t":"铜催化未活化芳烃的去芳构化碳硅化反应的区域与非对映选择性控制","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523719?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化碳硅化","kp":["[反应]: Cu催化脱芳碳硅化","[中间体]: 二烯基自由基拦截","[选择性]: 区域与非对映选择性"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了铜催化下未活化芳烃的区域和非对映选择性去芳香化碳硅化反应，通过捕获环己二烯基自由基中间体实现。自由基介导的去芳构化策略将廉价芳烃转化为高附加值的脂环族碳硅化合物，同时引入C-C和C-Si键。该方法利用铜催化剂精确控制双官能化区域的区域选择性和立体化学，为构建复杂三维分子骨架提供了高效工具，在药物合成中具有重要应用前景。","ot":"Copper‐Catalyzed Regio‐ and Diastereoselective Dearomative Carbosilylation of Unactivated Arenes by Intercepting the Die","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The radical‐mediated dearomatization of aromatic systems to generate cyclohexadienyl radical intermediates represents a crucial strategy for constructing three‐dimensional molecular architectures. Conventional approaches typically through\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition and subsequent proton/oxygen/carbon dioxide trapping to suppress rapid re‐aromatization, significantly constraining product diversity. Furthermore, dearomative bifunctionalization reactions—which offer enhanced step‐ and atom‐economy—remain substantially underdeveloped. Herein, we disclose a copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative 1,4‐ and 1,2‐carbosilylation strategy applicable to diverse unactivated (hetero)aromatic substrates to selectively construct spiro‐ or fused‐cyclic products. The resulting vinyl and allylic silanes serve as versatile synthetic handles for downstream transformations, enabling the rapid construction of sp\n                    3\n                    ‐rich polycyclic scaffolds that are highly valuable in drug discovery. Mechanistic and DFT studies indicate that the reaction commences with copper(I)‐silicon‐mediated halogen atom transfer of readily available aryl iodides to generate aryl radicals. These reactive species exhibit dual pathways: direct\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition to aromatic rings or 1,5‐hydrogen atom transfer followed by alkyl radical‐mediated\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition. Subsequent trapping of the resulting dienyl radicals by copper(II)‐silicon species yields complex polycyclic systems containing cyclohexadienylsilicon frameworks with excellent chemo‐, regio‐ and diastereoselectivity. This methodology not only establishes a novel paradigm for copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative bifunctionalization but also provides an efficient radical\n                    ipso‐\n                    and\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition platform for synthesizing architecturally intricate polycyclic compounds."},{"t":"混合移动电源配电网恢复协调调度：一种动态梯度掩码嵌入方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking emb"},{"t":"竞争性阴离子配位克服锂硫电池电荷转移势垒","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00440-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池溶剂化","kp":["[调控机制]: 阴离子竞争溶剂化","[关键阴离子]: FSI−","[电池形态]: 锂硫软包电池"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种基于阴离子竞争溶剂化机制的锂硫电池新策略。锂硫电池因多硫化锂（LiPSs）的穿梭效应和电荷转移障碍，长期面临容量衰减快、循环寿命短等瓶颈。研究通过阴离子诱导的竞争性溶剂化作用，调控锂多硫化物在电解液中的溶剂化结构，有效降低了锂硫反应的电荷转移势垒，抑制了穿梭效应。这一范式转换有望显著提升锂硫电池的反应动力学和循环稳定性，推动其作为下一代高能量密度电池的商业化进程，对电动汽车和储能领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Competitive anion coordination overcomes charge-transfer barriers for lithium–sulfur batteries","b":"Anion-induced competitive solvation of lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) demonstrates a paradigm shift in advancing lithium–sulfur technology. The competition between anion and weakly solvating solvent coordination with LiPSs determines the charge-transfer kinetics. Strengthening anion coordination by using FSI− promotes the LiPS kinetics and endows lithium-sulfur pouch cells with both high-energy-density and long cycling performances.","aip":1},{"t":"通过噻吩S,S-二氧化物环加成集体不对称合成马钱子生物碱","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02041-1","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Strychnos alkaloids have long been regarded as landmark targets for chemical synthesis due to their captivating architectures and notorious biological properties. However, the design of approaches that access multiple family members in an asymmetric, concise and atom-economical fashion remains an important challenge. Here we show that thiophene S,S-dioxides (TDOs) offer a modular, rapid entry to Strychnos natural products via inverse electron demand Diels–Alder cascades. We demonstrate that exceptional levels of stereocontrol can be achieved in asymmetric TDO cycloadditions, affording tricyclic indolines of utility in medicinal chemistry research and enabling the stereoselective synthesis of eight Strychnos alkaloids by the shortest routes described so far, including a synthesis of the iconic family member brucine. Using a machine-learning approach, computational studies provide insight into the source of stereoinduction and reveal an intriguing and unexpected spontaneous cheletropic extrusion of SO2.","tp":"生物碱合成","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究提出了一种利用噻吩S,S-二氧化物（TDOs）通过逆电子需求Diels-Alder级联反应来模块化、快速合成马钱子生物碱的新策略。该方法具有不对称合成、简洁且原子经济性高的特点，为马钱子属天然产物家族的高效集体合成提供了重要突破口，解决了长期以来该类化合物合成中的关键挑战。"},{"t":"智能眼镜算法通过时间重新参数化来工作","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520818123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The ultraslow dynamics of glass-formers has been explained by two views often considered as mutually exclusive: One invokes locally hindered mobility, and the other rests on the complexity of the configuration space. Here, we show that time evolution responds strongly to details of the dynamics by changing the speed of time flow: It has time-reparameterization softness. This finding reconciles both views: While local constraints reparameterize the flow of time, the global landscape determines relationships between different correlations at the same times. We show that modern algorithms developed to accelerate the relaxation to equilibrium act by changing the time reparameterization. Their success thus relies on their ability to exploit reparameterization softness. We conjecture that these results extend beyond the realm of glasses to the optimization of more general constraint satisfaction problems and to broader classes of algorithms.","tp":"玻璃动力学","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出玻璃形成体超慢动力学的新理论框架——时间重参数化柔软性。发现时间演化对动力学细节高度敏感，时间流速本身可被局部约束重新参数化，而全局能量景观决定重新参数化后的时间结构。该发现调和了局部迁移受阻与构型空间复杂性两种长期对立的玻璃动力学观点。"},{"t":"慢性和急性调节剂治疗可恢复原发性囊性纤维化的野生型样活性和稳定性 - 原因","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523950123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor has transformed the treatment of people with cystic fibrosis (CF) and the predominant cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (\n                    CFTR\n                    ) variant F508del by delivering the faulty channel to the plasma membrane and potentiating its activity. However, the action of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on the molecular behavior of F508del-CFTR is unknown. Here, we investigated the impact of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on individual human F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels using the patch-clamp technique and cells heterologously expressing F508del-CFTR. Chronic treatment of F508del-CFTR-expressing cells with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor, but not pairs of CFTR modulators, stabilized F508del-CFTR, preventing channel deactivation in cell-free membrane patches and conferring upon it the current amplitude of wild-type CFTR with channel activity sustained at a level one-third that of wild-type CFTR. By incubating cells with different drug concentrations, we demonstrated that elexacaftor stabilizes the open-channel conformation of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR, while acute treatment of wild-type CFTR with elexacaftor increased current flow through the channel and potentiated channel gating. Of note, acute treatment of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels with elexacaftor and ivacaftor restored wild-type levels of channel activity to the\n                    CFTR\n                    variant, albeit its gating pattern was distinct from that of wild-type CFTR and characterized by infrequent prolonged bursts of channel openings. In conclusion, chronic treatment with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor plus acute treatment with elexacaftor and ivacaftor robustly corrects the processing, stability, and gating defects of F508del-CFTR. Our results reveal that elexacaftor is a triple-acting CFTR modulator with corrector, potentiator, and conduction activities, making it a valuable therapeutic to rescue\n                    CFTR\n                    variants with distinct molecular mechanisms of CFTR dysfunction.","tp":"囊性纤维化","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究探讨了Elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor三联疗法对囊性纤维化主要突变型F508del-CFTR的分子作用机制。该药物组合通过将缺陷通道蛋白递送至细胞膜并增强其活性，显著改善了治疗效果。研究深入分析了该疗法如何恢复CFTR蛋白的野生型样活性和稳定性，为理解其治疗机制提供了重要分子层面的见解。"},{"t":"碳点负载纤维素纳米晶手性超结构的电荷导向自组装与可调圆二色性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522132?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点手性超结构","kp":["材料[CPL]: 碳点负载CNC手性超结构","[组装]: 电荷导向自组装","[调控]: 客体表面电荷"],"as":"研究表面电荷如何调控纤维素纳米晶（CNC）手性液晶的自组装行为，并负载碳点（Carbon Dots）构建功能性胆甾相纳米结构。CNC因可再生、生物相容性好而备受关注，其手性螺旋排列可作为模板构筑光学材料。通过精确调控胶体颗粒的表面电荷密度，实现对螺旋螺距和手性方向的定向调节，进而优化碳点的负载效率与发光性能。该策略为智能光学薄膜、手性传感器及生物成像材料的可控制备提供了新范式，展示了生物质纳米材料在功能器件领域的工程化潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Charge‐Directed Self‐Assembly of Carbon Dot‐Loaded Cellulose Nanocrystal Chiral Superstructures With Tailorable Circular","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Surface charge critically influences the self‐assembly and functional performance of colloidal liquid crystals. However, in circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) systems, the regulatory role of guest surface charge in their self‐assembly remains fundamentally unclear, hindering the rational design of adjustable high‐performance CPL materials. Herein, we judiciously synthesize a series of positively and negatively charged carbon dots (P‐/N‐CDs) with satisfactory solid‐state emission and incorporate them into colloidal cellulose nanocrystal (CNC) liquid crystal with phase adjustability via evaporation‐induced self‐assembly (EISA). By precisely modulating the surface charge of CDs, the resulting P‐/N‐CD‐loaded CNC (P‐/N‐CDCNC) chiral superstructures exhibit tailorable CPL with luminescence dissymmetry factor values from +0.16 to −0.91. The decisive role of surface charge in the EISA process is further elucidated. In situ microscopy demonstrates divergent charge‐directed assembly pathways: N‐CDs allow CNC tactoid fusion to proceed, whereas P‐CDs arrest fusion through electrostatic crosslinking. This triggers unprecedented Janus P‐CDCNC superstructures, leading to side‐dependent CPL handedness. Such CDCNC superstructures with different polarization states are readily designed to patterns and sophisticated codes, which offer powerful avenues for high‐security anticounterfeiting and multilevel information encryption. This work pioneers guest charge modulation as a universal strategy for controlling chiroptical assembly, overcoming limitations to attain handedness‐adjustable, high‐performance CPL from natural chiral materials."},{"t":"Caspase-3 裂解并激活 NADase SARM1 以促进细胞凋亡，将两种细胞死亡机制联系起来","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528118123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Two major mechanisms of axon degeneration have been identified. The first, a caspase-dependent apoptotic pathway, is a major mediator of developmental axon degeneration triggered by loss of trophic support. The second, a caspase-independent pathway mediated by the sterile alpha and HEAT/Armadillo motif containing 1 (SARM1) NADase, was found in studies of injury-induced Wallerian degeneration; it is also implicated in degeneration associated with traumatic brain injury, as well as some neurodegenerative diseases and neuropathies. Recent studies suggest that SARM1 functions as a metabolic sensor for the cellular nicotinamide mononucleotide/NAD+ ratio through its autoinhibitory armadillo repeats (ARM) domain. Here, we show a tight link between apoptotic and SARM1-dependent degeneration by demonstrating that SARM1 is activated during and contributes to apoptosis in neuroblastoma cells, macrophages, and T cells. Mechanistically, the key apoptotic protease caspase-3 cleaves SARM1 within its ARM domain, relieving its autoinhibition and activating its NAD+ hydrolase activity. Using a knock-in (KI) mouse model with a SARM1 mutation that prevents caspase-3 cleavage, we show that apoptosis promotion by SARM1 in macrophages and T cells requires its cleavage, whereas in neurons deprived of trophic support, activation of SARM1 occurs both with and without cleavage. Our study identifies a central role for SARM1 in apoptosis in some cells that is mediated by SARM1 activation through caspase-3 cleavage; it provides a model for dissecting the contributions of the two modes of SARM1 activation in different cellular contexts; and it has implications for the selection of ortho- versus allosteric SARM1 inhibitors for treating neurodegenerative diseases.","tp":"凋亡新机制","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究揭示了Caspase-3与NADase SARM1之间的关键联系，将两种主要的细胞死亡机制整合。研究发现Caspase-3能够裂解并激活SARM1，从而促进细胞凋亡过程。这一发现将依赖Caspase的凋亡途径与SARM1介导的轴突退化途径联系起来，为理解神经退行性疾病和创伤性脑损伤的病理机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"伪装纳米机器人瞄准并调节巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式以促进神经再生","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68636-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Macrophage (Mφ) phenotypic transformation is crucial in determining spinal cord injury (SCI) outcomes. However, the suborganelle crosstalk mechanisms—particularly between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and mitochondria—that mediate Mφ subgroup conversion during SCI remain underexplored. We aim to integrate niche intervention strategies and omics sequencing to investigate the effects of the metabolic crosstalk between ER stress (ERS) and mitochondria. Subsequently, we develop a dual-targeted camouflaged nanorobot (BP@D/N) that can reach the SCI site via systemic circulation and selectively interact with Mφ. We observe that Ero1α-mediated Ca2+ shuttling is an important mechanism for locking the inflammatory phenotype of Mφ. Blocking the Ero1α/MAMs/mtCa2+ axis suppresses mtDNA release and downregulates the cGAS-STING-NFκB signaling cascade, thus promoting M2 polarization and neural repair. Our study clarifies the regulatory mechanism of Mφ transformation-associated suborganelle crosstalk and offers a paradigm for reconstructing the dynamic balance of immune–neural interactions in the SCI microenvironment for effective repair. It offers a scientifically grounded and translational approach to overcoming the clinical challenge of irreversible SCI.","tp":"纳米机器人","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对脊髓损伤中巨噬细胞表型转化的关键作用，研究内质网应激与线粒体之间的代谢串扰机制，并开发双靶向伪装纳米机器人调控巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式，促进促修复型巨噬细胞转化，为脊髓损伤后神经再生提供新策略。","aip":1},{"t":"CD318 表达定义了人类 CD8+ 调节性 T 细胞的新亚群","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4203?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"CUB domain–containing protein 1 (CDCP1; CD318) is a surface glycoprotein known as a ligand for CD6, primarily studied in tumor immunology where it associates with poor prognosis. CD318 is expressed in myeloid dendritic cells and activated monocytes associated with immunoregulatory functions. Here, selective expression of CD318 on a subset of activated human CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells, but not CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells, is shown, defining suppressor function of this cell population. CD318\n                    +\n                    CD8 T cells exhibited reduced PD-1 and KLRG-1 expression, diminished interferon-γ and tumor necrosis factor–α production, and potent suppression of autologous CD4 and CD8 T cell activation in vitro. Notably, CD8 T cells from patients with type 1 diabetes (T1D) showed reduced CD318 induction compared with controls. Mechanistically, CD318 inhibited T cell receptor signaling independently of SHP2, while its induction required interleukin-2–dependent mTOR activation. These findings identify CD318 as a marker of human CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells with implications for immune regulation and autoimmunity.","tp":"免疫新亚群","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究发现CD318（CDCP1）在人类CD8+ T细胞的特定亚群上选择性表达，定义了一个新的CD8+调节性T细胞亚群。CD318此前主要在肿瘤免疫学中被研究且与不良预后相关，本研究首次揭示了其在免疫系统调节中的新角色，特别是在激活的CD8+ T细胞中的表达特征，为免疫调节机制研究开辟了新方向。"},{"t":"使用非典型密码子的单剂量减毒活疫苗可实现广泛的 β-CoV 免疫和传播阻断","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518645123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Current COVID-19 vaccines have saved countless lives but primarily aim to induce immunity to the spike or its RBD protein and often fail to confer broad or durable protection against rapidly evolving variants and prevent transmission. Here, we invented a live-attenuated broad-spectrum coronavirus vaccine (cb1) by changing the codon usage bias of SARS-CoV-2 genome, which maintained amino acid conservation but reduced virulence. A single intranasal dose of cb1 vaccine elicits remarkably broad and potent immunity that overcomes existing parenteral vaccine’s limitations. cb1 induced robust neutralizing antibody and T cell responses that translated into complete protection in animal models, including prevention of viral transmission to unvaccinated contacts. Notably, cb1 provided cross-protection not only against diverse SARS-CoV-2 variants of concern but also against more divergent SARS-CoV-1 and hCoV-OC43, a breadth of immunity unparalleled by current vaccines. These findings highlight the potential of cb1 to address urgent needs for next-generation COVID-19 vaccines that elicit mucosal immunity with broad, long-lasting efficacy, eliminating the necessity for frequent updates.","tp":"单剂广谱苗","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对现有新冠疫苗难以应对快速变异毒株及阻断传播的局限，研究团队开发出广谱减毒活疫苗cb1。该技术通过改变新冠病毒基因组的密码子偏好性实现减毒，同时保持了氨基酸序列的保守性。动物实验表明，单剂鼻喷接种即可激发极其广泛的免疫反应，不仅能提供针对多种变异株的持久保护，还能有效阻断病毒传播。这一策略为应对未来冠状病毒暴发提供了新型疫苗平台。"},{"t":"简报：会使用工具的精明牛，以及婴儿如何分享他们的微生物组","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00235-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"高熵工程多功能材料突破锂硫电池边界","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05863E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵材料锂硫电池","kp":["[材料策略]: 高熵工程多功能材料","[核心挑战]: 多硫化物穿梭+迟缓氧化还原动力学","[电池体系]: 锂硫电池"],"dp":1,"as":"锂硫电池理论能量密度极高（约2600 Wh/kg），但面临多硫化物穿梭效应、硫导电性差及体积膨胀等核心瓶颈。本研究提出高熵工程化多功能材料策略，通过引入多元素协同的高熵设计，同时调控正极催化活性与结构稳定性，抑制穿梭效应并提升硫利用率，从而突破锂硫电池循环寿命与容量保持率的关键技术天花板，推动其向实用化迈进。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Breaking the boundaries of Li-S batteries with high-entropy engineered multifunctional materials","b":"Lithium-sulfur (Li-S) batteries promise exceptional theoretical energy density but face persistent challenges, notably polysulfide shuttling and sluggish redox kinetics. High-entropy materials (HEMs), leveraging their distinctive configurational entropy and unparalleled compositional tunability, offer a transformative approach to engineer electrochemical interfaces and address these critical limitations. This review comprehensively surveys the recent advancements in the rational design and application of HEMs for Li-S batteries. We first analyze the structural and electronic characteristics of HEMs and clarify how they enhance sulfur utilization, suppress lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling by anchoring intermediates, and accelerate LiPSs redox reactions through tailored electronic structures. Subsequently, state-of-the-art design strategies are critically examined, including atomic-scale elemental selection, advanced synthetic methodologies, and multidimensional structural engineering. These strategies enable fabrication of components such as sulfur hosts with optimized adsorption and catalytic sites, separator modifiers that regulate ion-selective transport, and protective interlayers that mitigate lithium dendrite growth. Furthermore, we systematically review cutting-edge characterization techniques and computational methods that detail the mechanisms behind entropy-mediated improvements in battery performance. Finally, critical challenges and promising future research directions are highlighted for the development of next-generation HEM-based energy storage systems, and the insights presented in this review will guide the rational design and practical implementation of HEMs in advanced Li-S batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"生物质衍生离子选择性粘结剂调控Zn2+溶剂化实现水系锌电池高容量正极","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525803?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系锌电池正极","kp":["[粘结剂]: 生物质衍生离子选择性","[调控目标]: Zn2+溶剂化结构","[电池体系]: 水系锌电池高容量正极"],"dp":1,"as":"水系锌电池（AZBs）因安全性高、成本低被视为大规模储能候选技术，但其电化学性能受限于锌离子溶剂化结构与界面副反应。本研究开发了一种生物质衍生离子选择性粘结剂，通过调控Zn²⁺溶剂化环境，优化锌负极沉积/剥离行为，有效抑制枝晶生长与析氢副反应，从而实现高容量、长循环稳定性的水系锌电池，为绿色储能提供了新的材料设计思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Biomass‐Derived Ion‐Selective Binder Modulates Zn2+ Solvation Enabling High‐Capacity Cathodes in Aqueous Zinc Batteries","b":"The electrochemical performance of aqueous zinc batteries (AZBs) critically relies on advanced binders to regulate the solvation structure of hydrated Zn2+ and accelerate the redox kinetics at the cathode interface. However, conventional hydrophobic polyvinylidene fluoride (PVDF) binders fail to achieve this goal due to their weak interactions with H2O and Zn2+. Here, we present a bioinspired sulfate-rich polysaccharide binder network derived from marine ι-carrageenan (CAG), which mimics biological ion channels to enable selective ion coordination and dynamic hydration regulation. By establishing dual ion-selective coordination sites, the zincophilic ─OSO3 - and hydrophilic ─OH groups of CAG form Zn2+─OSO3 - and H2O─OH interactions, effectively disrupting the primary solvation shell of Zn2+─H2O and accelerating Zn2+ desolvation kinetics, thereby enabling adaptive ion transport across the cathode interface. Consequently, Zn||CAG@Mn0.15V2O5·nH2O batteries deliver an ultrahigh capacity of 421 mAh g-1 at 0.6 A g-1, which is 76% higher than PVDF-based counterparts (239 mAh g-1). This water-processable binder demonstrates universal applicability across various cathode materials (e.g., MnO2, V2O5, and organics), providing a green, scalable solution for high-performance AZBs. This study establishes a biomimetic binder design paradigm, where sulfate-hydroxyl dual coordination emulates biological ion transport, enabling precise regulation of Zn2+ solvation and interfacial chemistry."},{"t":"用于钾离子电池负极的重掺杂生物质衍生碳材料","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520046?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾离子电池负极","kp":["[材料]: 重掺杂生物质碳","[电池体系]: 钾离子电池负极","[核心瓶颈]: 窄石墨层间距与K+匹配"],"as":"钾离子电池（PIB）因钾资源储量丰富、成本低廉，被视为大规模储能领域的潜力候选。本研究聚焦碳基负极材料，以生物质衍生碳为前驱体，通过重掺杂（如氮、硫等杂原子）策略调控碳材料电子结构与层间距，提升钾离子嵌入/脱出的动力学性能与循环稳定性，为低成本、可持续的高性能钾离子电池负极材料开发提供了新路径。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Biomass‐Derived Carbon with Heavy Doping for Anode of Potassium Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The potassium‐ion battery (PIB) is anticipated to be a cost‐effective candidate for large‐scale energy storage for the green power grid. For PIB anodes, carbon is promising owing to its conductivity and abundance. Yet, the insufficient cycle life and rate performance of the carbon anode remain the bottleneck limiting PIBs, stemming from the mismatch between the narrower graphitic interlayer spacing and the larger radius of potassium. Herein, a large number of heteroatoms (18.2 at%) are incorporated into a biomass‐derived carbon. The synthesized carbon material is thus endowed with improved interlayer spacing as well as active sites and mesoporous structures. These attributes collectively contribute to outstanding cycle life (18 000 cycles) and rate capability (260 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 20 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), making it a promising candidate for PIBs for grid‐oriented energy storage."},{"t":"仿生可生长人形机器人：骨仿生连杆实现多功能移动","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2831?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生人形机器人","kp":["[伸展率]: 315%","[重量]: 350克","[结构]: 仿骨连杆结构","[特性]: 可生长+高承载+抗冲击"],"dp":1,"as":"仿生人形机器人通常模仿人体运动学，但往往缺乏骨骼仿生连杆等关键力学特征。本研究提出一种可生长（grow-able）的人形机器人设计，采用仿骨连杆机构模拟人体骨骼的杠杆与关节传动，赋予机器人多功能运动能力与结构可扩展性。该设计理念突破了传统刚性或纯软体机器人的运动局限，在通用移动性、环境适应性及与人类协作场景中展现出广阔应用前景。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Bioinspired growable humanoid robot with bone-mimetic linkages for versatile mobility","b":"Inspired by human biomechanics, humanoid robots are often designed to mimic human kinematics but typically lack key traits of developing bones, such as growability, lightweight yet stiff construction, and compliance for impact absorption. This work introduces a bone-inspired linkage structure with up to 315% extensibility, weighing only 350 grams while maintaining high load capacity, compliance, and stability. Integrated into a soft humanoid robot, these growable linkages enable dynamic shape adaptation, reducing height to 36% and width to 61%, to traverse tight spaces. By combining growable link actuation with servomotors, the robot switches to crawling mode and moves 1122 times faster than using motors or soft actuators alone. At just 4.5 kilograms, GrowHR can float, swim, walk on water, and fly. Its soft body ensures safe human interaction, allowing hugging, falling, and lifting without injury. Deformable legs demonstrate elastic energy storage and release under external loading, allowing motions beyond the limits of rigid structures. This work pioneers a growable, multifunctional robotic design approach for dynamic, complex environments.","aip":1},{"t":"仿生骨架编辑策略重写合成聚合物","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522451?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物主链编辑","kp":["[聚合物策略]: 主链编辑(翻译后修饰仿生)"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述探讨了受生物启发的骨架编辑策略用于重写合成聚合物。聚合物主链结构直接决定其物理性质、化学反应性和功能特性。借鉴生物体内DNA修复和蛋白质翻译后修饰等精确骨架编辑机制，研究者发展了多种主链重构方法，包括主链断裂-重组、单体交换和序列重排等。这些策略使得聚合物的拓扑结构、分子量和功能基团可在合成后按需调控，为精准高分子材料设计开辟了新途径。","ot":"Bioinspired Backbone Editing Strategies for Rewriting Synthetic Polymers","b":"Abstract\n                  The structure of a polymer backbone plays a central role in determining its physical properties, chemical reactivity, and function. In biological systems, biopolymers such as DNA, RNA, and proteins exhibit a remarkable degree of structural and functional adaptability, achieved through highly regulated post‐synthetic modifications of both side chains and backbones. By contrast, synthetic polymers have traditionally been designed with static, inert backbones, limiting post‐synthetic modulation of their core structures. Although post‐polymerization modification strategies have successfully enabled side chain and terminal group functionalization, precise editing of the polymer backbone remains underdeveloped. Inspired by the editing mechanisms of biological macromolecules, recent efforts have begun to explore chemical strategies for backbone editing in synthetic polymers. These emerging approaches offer transformative potential for generating functional polymeric materials for diverse applications. This Minireview highlights key backbone editing mechanisms in biological systems and discusses how these paradigms can inform the development of bioinspired backbone editing strategies to rewrite synthetic polymers."},{"t":"羽流通道自下而上分裂引起的夏威夷群岛双边 Loa-Kea 趋势","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx4095?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Hawaiian-Emperor chain has exhibited two distinct Loa-Kea magmatic groups over the past 8 million years, but their origin remains debated. Using paleographically constrained global mantle convection models, we reproduce the present-day location of the Hawaiian hot spot and the associated spatiotemporal geochemical evolution. The composition of the plume conduit shows conventional concentric zoning prior to the Hawaiian-Emperor Bend and gradually evolves to a north-south bilateral zoning pattern afterward, corresponding to the subparallel Loa-Kea trends. Further analysis suggests that the plume originates from ridges of large low-velocity province (LLVP) induced by the push of slabs. Upwelling at the intersections of ridges is more energetic than at the middle of the ridge, causing bottom-up splitting of plume conduit in the lower mantle that propagates upward, forming bilateral zoning and eventually two independent plumes. This process suggests that bilateral zoning is transient and more common in the Pacific than Africa due to the circum-Pacific subduction.","tp":"地幔柱演化","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"夏威夷群岛在过去800万年表现出明显的Loa和Kea双轨岩浆趋势，但其成因长期存在争议。研究通过古地理约束的全球地幔对流模型重现了夏威夷热点的位置与时空地球化学演化。模拟显示，地幔羽流通道在夏威夷-帝王海山拐点之前呈常规的同心环带结构，随后逐渐演变为南北双侧分布模式。该自下而上的羽流分裂机制合理解释了夏威夷群岛独特的双边地球化学异常现象。"},{"t":"噬菌体通过横向转导动员细菌防御系统","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx5749?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"To counter challenges from bacteriophages (phages), bacteria use defense mechanisms that can reside on mobile genetic elements or within chromosomes. These immune systems are easily gained and lost, allowing adaptation to threats. However, the mechanism of mobilization of chromosomally encoded defense genes remains poorly understood. Here, we show that phage- and phage-inducible chromosomal island (PICI)–mediated lateral transduction (LT), a highly efficient horizontal gene transfer mechanism, facilitates the transfer of these defense genes between bacteria. Using several bacterial models, we demonstrate that defense systems are often positioned near phage or PICI attachment sites, allowing them to exploit LT for their mobility. In addition, LT diversifies defense genes carried by prophages and PICIs, driving immune system evolution and turnover. These processes provide phage resistance to new bacterial hosts and profoundly affect population genomics. Our findings reveal LT as a crucial mechanism shaping bacterial evolution and influencing the trajectory of pathogenic clones in nature.","tp":"噬菌体转导","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"细菌防御系统基因的水平转移机制一直是科学界的未解之谜。最新研究揭示，噬菌体及其诱导的染色体岛（PICI）通过一种名为横向转导（LT）的高效基因转移机制，能够强有力地动员原本固定在染色体上的细菌防御基因。这一发现阐明了细菌免疫系统如何在群体中快速获取、扩散和丢失抗噬菌体基因，从而动态适应外界病毒威胁。该机制在细菌进化与微生物生态研究中具有重大意义。"},{"t":"由内源生化逻辑编程的自主水凝胶执行器，用于双阶段变形和药物释放","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516809?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Designing soft materials that autonomously respond to complex physiological environments remains a fundamental challenge in biomedical systems engineering. Here, we report on a 3D‐printed hybrid protein‐polymer hydrogel actuator that operates via \n                    endogenous biochemical logic\n                    , enabling fully autonomous dual‐stage shape morphing and enzyme‐triggered drug release in gastric‐mimicking environments. The actuator comprises a bilayer structure: an active layer based on bovine serum albumin‐poly (ethylene glycol) diacrylate (BSA‐PEGDA), and a passive PEGDA layer. In acidic gastric fluid, the BSA‐PEGDA layer undergoes rapid conformational swelling, followed by delayed softening from pepsin‐mediated degradation, autonomously driving reversible shape transitions without manual intervention. By embedding doxorubicin (DOX) within the BSA‐PEGDA hydrogel network, the system achieves site‐specific, enzyme‐gated drug release that is tunable using pepstatin A as a biochemical inhibitor. High‐resolution digital light processing (DLP) printing enables the fabrication of complex autonomous actuators and microneedle‐equipped grippers capable of mucosal adhesion, catch‐and‐release behavior, and controlled delivery. This work establishes a materials design strategy where biochemical cues are used as programmable inputs to drive mechanical and therapeutic outputs, offering a robust platform for bioresponsive soft robotics and in situ drug delivery.","tp":"水凝胶执行器","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道了一种3D打印的蛋白质-聚合物杂化水凝胶执行器，通过内源性生化逻辑编程，在模拟胃环境中实现全自主双阶段形变和酶触发的药物释放。该设计突破了软材料对复杂生理环境自主响应的挑战，在生物医学工程领域具有重要应用前景。"},{"t":"作者更正：构造-天文相互作用塑造晚古生代气候和有机碳埋藏","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-67406-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：SOX2通过重编程脂质代谢和组蛋白乙酰化驱动食管鳞癌","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68461-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"非典型毛细血管周围 Ly6G⁺Nur77⁺ 巨噬细胞启动对小鼠肺部过敏原的 2 型免疫反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68652-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"The mechanisms of airway allergen sensing and type 2 immune response initiation remain poorly understood. Using a mouse house dust mite (HDM)-induced allergic airway model, we identify a population of lung macrophages located close to alveolar capillaries that express Ly6G and the nuclear receptor Nr4a1/Nur77. These atypical Ly6G+Nur77+ macrophages preferentially capture airway-delivered allergens and play an important role in initiating HDM-driven T helper type 2 (Th2) responses. They sense the major HDM allergen, the cysteine protease Der p 1, via protease-activated receptor 2 (PAR2), and their activation and accumulation require both PAR2 and Nr4a1/Nur77. These Ly6G+Nur77+ macrophages regulate the migration of conventional migratory dendritic cells (mDCs) to draining mediastinal lymph nodes (mLNs) through cysteinyl leukotriene (CysLT) production, which enhances mDC migration toward CCL21 for T cell priming. Inhibiting CysLT biosynthesis reduces mDC migration and dampens Th2 allergic responses, highlighting possible therapeutic avenues in type 2 immunity."},{"t":"原子尺度调控自旋交叉协同性以提升分子存储密度","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68796-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"as":"自旋交叉配合物因具有磁双稳态特性，被视为分子比特（molecular bits）的有力候选材料。该研究通过原子级精准调控配合物的协同性参数，显著增强了自旋态之间的转换陡度与滞回效应，从而提升了分子级信息存储的性能指标。这种原子尺度的结构工程策略为设计高密度、低功耗的分子存储器件提供了新范式，推动了分子电子学与自旋电子学的交叉融合。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋交叉分子存储","kp":["工程策略[自旋交叉]: 配位场工程原子级调控协同性提升分子存储密度"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomically tweaking spin-crossover cooperativity to augment molecular memory density","b":"Spin-crossover complexes are promising candidates for molecular bits owing to their magnetic bistability. However, it’s a formidable challenge to turn densely packed spin-crossover molecules into high-density bits due to cooperative switching dynamics inherent in spin-crossover aggregates. Herein, coordination-field engineering is demonstrated by scanning tunneling microscopy/spectroscopy and density functional theory as an efficient strategy to modulate the cooperative dynamics of surface-confined spin-crossover chains. Within these chains, Ni centers exhibit collective spin transitions upon local stimuli. This spin-crossover cooperativity can be disrupted by coordination-field modification via hetero-metal/ligand doping, which converts partial switchable coordination centers into non-switchable nodes. These nodes divide the single-bit-like spin-crossover chain into multiple independently-switchable segments and thereby augment the bit density. One-by-one erasable write-in of these spin-crossover bits is achieved by scanning tunneling microscope tip manipulation. These results highlight how to precisely tweak the cooperative dynamics of the spin-crossover aggregates to advance their potential applications for high-density memory."},{"t":"气相去合金中体扩散驱动的非保守相变的原子尺度动力学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00644-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","dp":1,"as":"该研究利用透射电子显微镜（TEM）中的选择性升华气相脱合金化技术，实现了对体扩散驱动的非保守相变过程的实时原子尺度观测。不同于传统的保守型相变，非保守相变涉及组分比例的改变，其原子级动力学机制长期难以直接表征。该实验方法为理解合金体系中扩散、相分离与界面演化的耦合规律提供了前所未有的观测窗口，对材料设计与相变理论具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气相去合金相变","kp":["机制[气相脱合金]: 选择性升华中体相扩散驱动非保守相变","合金体系[Co-Zn]: TEM实时原子尺度观测"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomic-scale dynamics of a bulk-diffusion-driven nonconservative phase transformation in vapor-phase dealloying","b":"In this work, vapor-phase dealloying through selective sublimation within TEM enables real-time atomic-scale observation of the nonconservative phase transformation in a Co-Zn alloy. The transient structure formation, Zn diffusion pathway, and atomic-column reconfiguration were resolved, uncovering the bulk diffusion mechanism underlying dealloying-induced transformation. This insight may pave the way for designing functional nanoporous materials via vacancy-mediated engineering."},{"t":"同化因果推理","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68568-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论","b":"Causal inference is fundamental across scientific disciplines, yet existing methods struggle to capture instantaneous, time-evolving causal relationships in complex, high-dimensional systems. In this paper, assimilative causal inference (ACI) is developed, which is a methodological framework that leverages Bayesian data assimilation to trace causes backward from observed effects. ACI solves the inverse problem rather than quantifying forward influence. It uniquely identifies dynamic causal interactions without requiring observations of candidate causes, accommodates short datasets, and, in principle, can be implemented in high-dimensional settings by employing efficient data assimilation algorithms. Crucially, it provides online tracking of causal roles that may reverse intermittently and facilitates a mathematically rigorous criterion for the causal influence range, revealing how far effects propagate. The effectiveness of ACI is demonstrated by complex dynamical systems showcasing intermittency and extreme events. ACI opens valuable pathways for studying complex systems, where transient causal structures are critical."},{"t":"随着格陵兰岛失去冰层，全球海平面将会上升，而格陵兰岛的海平面将会下降","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6709?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"The island is rebounding from ice melt so fast that scientists are rethinking how Earth's interior works."},{"t":"水系共晶电解质抑制氧析出与氢析出实现长寿命Zn||MnO2双无电极电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01958-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌锰电池电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 深共晶水-有机电解液","[电池形态]: Zn||MnO2双无电极电池","[机制]: 破坏水氢键网络抑制析氢析氧"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究针对水系锌离子电池中析氧与析氢副反应导致循环寿命受限的问题，提出共晶电解液策略。该电解液通过调控溶剂化结构有效抑制氧气和氢气演化反应，显著提升Zn²⁺/Zn||MnO₂/Mn²⁺电池体系（基于电沉积/溶解机制）的电化学稳定性。该体系兼具高电压与高容量优势，为长寿命水系电池的工程化应用提供了新思路，有望推动大规模储能技术发展。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Aqueous eutectic electrolytes suppress oxygen and hydrogen evolution for long-life Zn||MnO2 dual-electrode-free batterie","b":"Aqueous Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ batteries—operating via electrodeposition/dissolution—offer promising high-voltage, high-capacity grid-storage capabilities but require acidic conditions for MnO2/Mn2+ conversion, and these induce problematic zinc corrosion. Here we present a global approach that identifies deep eutectic aqueous–organic electrolytes that strategically disrupt water’s hydrogen-bonding network, simultaneously enhancing MnO2 reversibility at the cathode while enabling stable zinc cycling at the anode without water decomposition. Such non-flammable electrolytes regulate the cation solvation structure and phase of the deposited MnO2 and its morphology, promoting layered structures with enhanced ion-transport pathways that significantly improve stripping efficiency. These deep eutectics increase the oxygen evolution overpotential well above the MnO2 deposition potential, which completely suppresses unwanted O2 evolution. Moreover, they alter the local environment at the cathode interface to create localized interfacial pH gradients that influence critical processes, including optimizing proton transport and MnO2 stripping. Our Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ dual-electrode-free battery achieves high Coulombic efficiency for extended cycling (>5,000 cycles) without external acid addition, advancing high-energy-density zinc–manganese battery development through rational electrolyte design.","aip":1},{"t":"美国住宅木材燃烧产生的 PM2.5 对环境空气质量和健康的影响","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz0189?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Residential wood combustion (RWC) is a primary heating fuel in just 2% of US homes. However, the 2023 release of the US Environmental Protection Agency’s National Emissions Inventory (NEI) found that RWC contributes ~28% of total wintertime fine particulate matter (PM\n                    2.5\n                    ) emissions, suggesting that ambient PM\n                    2.5\n                    concentrations could be substantially reduced if RWC were curtailed. Despite its contribution to PM\n                    2.5\n                    emissions, an assessment of the air quality, health, and distributional impacts of RWC using the updated NEI has not been performed. Here, we use a high-resolution (4 kilometers) air quality model and the updated NEI to evaluate wintertime RWC impacts over the contiguous United States. We find that RWC contributes 2.43 micrograms per cubic meter (21.9%) of winter population-weighted mean PM\n                    2.5\n                    concentrations, leading to ~8600 (confidence interval: 6500 to 9600) premature deaths annually. Moreover, nonwhite communities are disproportionately affected by RWC-related PM\n                    2.5\n                    and associated mortality, especially in urban areas. We suggest that policies targeting RWC could substantially reduce air pollution, improve health, and address distributional disparities."},{"t":"基于双模型集成与在线误差修正的光伏功率自适应预测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000498?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[光伏功率预测]: 双类型模型集成与在线误差校正"],"ot":"Adaptive forecasting of photovoltaic power based on dual-type models’ ensemble and online error correction"},{"t":"人工智能帮助了科学家，但也可能损害了科学","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6710?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Analysis finds that AI both expands individual impact and narrows collective scientific exploration.","tp":"AI与科学","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"分析发现人工智能对科学具有双重效应：一方面扩大了个体科学家的研究影响力和产出，另一方面却缩小了集体科学探索的多样性范围。AI可能加剧研究方向的趋同化，导致科学探索路径收窄，引发对AI驱动下科学创新生态健康性的担忧。"},{"t":"表面暴露的心磷脂合酶为维持革兰氏阴性外膜提供了意想不到的范例","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524588123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Gram-negative bacteria have long been thought to confine primary glycerophospholipid synthesis to the inner membrane (IM). Here, we challenge this paradigm by identifying ClsO, an outer membrane (OM) lipoprotein from Acinetobacter baumannii that functions as a cardiolipin synthase. In contrast to canonical cardiolipin synthases, which are restricted to the IM, ClsO is surface-exposed and deposits cardiolipin into the outer leaflet of the OM, colocalizing with Acinetobacter lipooligosaccharide. Loss of ClsO sensitizes cells to membrane disrupting agents, such as bile salts, and key antibiotics, implicating ClsO in OM barrier integrity. ClsO activity increases when mislocalized glycerophospholipids accumulate at the cell surface, such as in cells lacking Mla (maintenance of lipid asymmetry) system, consistent with a surface-active site mechanism. Engineering mutations in ClsO that prevent its trafficking to the OM was found to abolish nearly all enzymatic activity. Remarkably, we found that ClsO homologs are widespread across Proteobacteria and confirmed several to be functional cardiolipin synthases, indicating a conserved strategy of surface lipid remodeling. These findings redefine the spatial organization of lipid metabolism in Gram-negative bacteria and reveal an adaptive mechanism to maintain OM integrity when membrane asymmetry is compromised."},{"t":"小鼠内侧杏仁核中的性别二态性神经元簇对男性性状态做出反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518703123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Increasing scientific interest has been directed toward understanding sexual dimorphism in the brain. Although several brain structures exhibit masculine or feminine characteristics, strictly binary anatomical feature, comparable to those observed in genitalia, has been rarely identified. In this study, we identified a dense, sexually dimorphic cluster of neurons in the posterodorsal medial amygdala (MeApd), which we named DIMPLE (Dimorphic IEGs Medial Posterodorsal amygdala Labeled Ensemble) that exhibited a remarkable binary pattern of c-fos promoter activation. Using the TRAP2 (Targeted Recombination in Active Populations) transgenic mouse model, we found that it was consistently labeled in all females, regardless of age or sexual experience. In contrast, DIMPLE labeling was absent in adult virgin males but present both prior to weaning and following mating. Surgical removal of gonads (ovariectomy or orchiectomy) did not alter the labeling pattern of DIMPLE in either sex. Interestingly, a single intraperitoneal injection of prolactin, a hormone that increases in males after mating, induced DIMPLE labeling in virgin males. However, treatment with cabergoline, a potent inhibitor of prolactin secretion, did not prevent DIMPLE labeling in females or in postmating males. Given the established role of the MeApd in social and reproductive behaviors, we hypothesize that DIMPLE may support neural mechanisms underlying female-typical behavior and potentially contribute to postmating behavioral shifts in males."},{"t":"相关性不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"社区多能系统","dp":1,"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated unce"},{"t":"来自铜绿假单胞菌的群体感应分子在共感染病原体中诱导防御性多细胞性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513122123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Microorganisms commonly exist in polymicrobial communities, where they can respond to interspecies secreted molecules by altering behaviors and physiology; however, the underlying mechanisms remain underexplored. Here, we investigated interactions between\n                    Stenotrophomonas maltophilia\n                    and\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    \n                    , coinfecting opportunistic pathogens found in pneumonia and chronic lung infections, such as in cystic fibrosis. We found that\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    forms large protective multicellular aggregates upon exposure to\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    secreted factors. Experimental evolution for lack of aggregation selected for fimbrial mutations and we found that fimbriae are required on both interacting\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    cells for aggregation. Untargeted metabolomics and targeted validations revealed that the quorum-sensing molecule\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas\n                    \n                    quinolone signal (PQS) directly induced\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    aggregation, and colocalized with the aggregates. Further, in coculture with\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    , wild-type\n                    S. maltophilia\n                    formed aggregates, resulting in up to 75-fold increased survival from\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    competition compared to fimbrial mutants. Finally, multiple other bacterial species similarly aggregated upon exposure to\n                    \n                      P. aeruginosa\n                    \n                    PQS, indicating a more general response. Collectively, our work identifies a multispecies interaction where a quorum-sensing molecule from a coinfecting pathogen is sensed as a “danger” signal, thereby inducing a protective multicellular response."},{"t":"早期地球发电机和行星屏蔽的地幔辅助","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag046/8439531?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面向异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源柔性聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动分布式能源功率灵活性聚合"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy"},{"t":"基于非碱性琼脂凝胶电解质的高稳定性锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06236E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池电解质","kp":["电解质[锌空电池]: 非碱性琼脂凝胶","[稳定性]: 高稳定锌空电池（替代传统碱性凝胶）"],"dp":1,"as":"锌空气电池因理论能量密度高被视为下一代电池的有力候选，但碱性电解液带来的腐蚀、钝化和碳酸化等问题严重制约其循环寿命。本研究采用非碱性琼脂凝胶电解质构建了一种高稳定性锌空气电池，有效抑制锌负极副反应和电解液退化，显著提升了长期循环稳定性与可充电性。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A highly stable zinc–air battery based on a non-alkaline agar gel electrolyte","b":"Zinc–air batteries are considered promising candidates for the next generation of batteries due to their significant advantages in theoretical specific capacity, safety, and environmental friendliness. The combination of gel polymer electrolytes and zinc–air batteries further expands future energy storage applications. However, traditional alkaline gel zinc–air batteries are usually constructed by post-stacking methods, and their poor interfacial contact and weakened long-term durability in the ambient air hinders practical applications. Here, we synthesized a non-alkaline gel electrolyte with a liquid–solid phase transition mechanism utilizing agar, and constructed an integrated gel zinc–air battery by direct injection and encapsulation methods. This strategy realizes the integrated assembly of non-alkaline gel zinc–air full batteries, thereby obtaining all-round high stability. The agar gel electrolyte endows the battery with outstanding performance, including a high output specific capacity (706 mAh g Zn−1), a long discharge duration (270 h at 0.1 mA cm−2), and a significant operational life (850 h at 0.2 mA cm−2). Importantly, the integrated zinc–air pouch battery can achieve a high zinc utilization rate of over 80% in various discharge states and exhibit satisfactory cycling stability (>200 h at 0.1 mA cm−2). This technology alleviates the current challenges of gel zinc batteries, and highlights the direction for the development of non-alkaline gel zinc–air full batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"用于工程化改造铜绿假单胞菌phiKMV样噬菌体的全合成Golden Gate组装系统","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525963123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"as":"噬菌体在生物技术、医药、农业和食品安全等领域有广泛应用前景。本研究开发了一套全合成的Golden Gate组装系统，用于工程化改造铜绿假单胞菌噬菌体。该模块化合成平台使噬菌体基因组的定制设计、快速组装和功能优化成为可能，为抗噬菌体疗法和合成生物学工具开发提供了新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"噬菌体合成构建","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"kp":["[组装方法]: 全合成Golden Gate组装系统","[目标]: 铜绿假单胞菌phiKMV噬菌体"],"ot":"A fully synthetic Golden Gate assembly system for engineering a Pseudomonas aeruginosa phiKMV-like phage","b":"Bacteriophages have applications in biotechnology, including human and veterinary medicine, agriculture, food safety, and biosecurity. One example of resurging importance is phage therapy, the use of phages to treat antibiotic-resistant bacterial infections. Phage therapy currently requires screening of environmental phages against the infecting strains for each individual patient, a laborious process that limits the development of standardized treatments. To overcome limitations of narrow host range inherent to many native phages, a robust genomic engineering platform is required which permits rapid and dependable genome production and engineering for nonmodel phage. Here, we describe an engineering platform for a phiKMV-like\n                    Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    phage, 41S1 that builds on previous work in the rapid assembly of small genomes through one-pot, High Complexity Golden Gate assembly (HC-GGA). This system divides the 41S1 genome into DNA fragments small enough to be conveniently synthesized and to avoid toxicity during DNA propagation, with all but one maintained in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    . These fragments are readily assembled in a high accuracy, one-pot reaction; phages can be rescued by direct transformation into\n                    P. aeruginosa\n                    PAO1 or\n                    E. coli\n                    10-beta cells. We demonstrate the precise generation of point mutations, DNA insertions, deletions, and the addition of fluorescence reporter genes that are expressed during phage replication. All viable genotypes could be generated with near 100% success rate with minimal screening. This system demonstrates the potential of HC-GGA for the rapid production and engineering of phages and provides a chassis for the development of phages that broadly target the opportunistic human pathogen\n                    P. aeruginosa\n                    ."},{"t":"数据驱动的染色质模型揭示了基因组组织的空间和动态特征","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530583123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Compacting chromatin within the cellular nucleus presents a significant challenge for biology. Chromosomes must be both condensed and spatially organized to enable essential processes such as transcription and replication. Chromosome conformation capture experiments (e.g., Hi-C) provide valuable information about the spatial organization and, therefore, the connectivity between different genomic regions. These experiments inspired polymer models that describe the physical mechanism of the chromosomal energy landscape. The Full-Inversion Chromatin model (FI-Chrom), a data-driven approach for modeling genome organization, uses Hi-C contact maps to infer pairwise interaction potentials between all chromosomal loci. It combines Graphics Processing Unit (GPU)-accelerated simulations with efficient training of tens of millions of parameters derived from the maximum-entropy principle to determine 3D structures of chromosomes that accurately reproduce Hi-C-like data. FI-Chrom does not make any a priori assumptions regarding chromosome architecture, making it applicable to any chromosome conformation capture experiment. Its derived structural ensembles capture all essential features from the short- and long-range interactions of typical chromosome organization, such as segregated compartments, chromosome territories, and fully or partially formed loops. Although Hi-C contains only structural information, FI-Chrom extends these data by revealing an emergent dynamical mechanism encoded in the inferred energy landscape. For example, simulations show that chromatin loops are not static architectural features but rather transient structural elements. Statistical analyses further indicate that loops confined within a single compartment occur more frequently than those spanning multiple compartments, highlighting the dynamic and compartment-dependent nature of chromatin organization."},{"t":"一类 COPI 货物受体通过增强高尔基体保留来调节跨膜蛋白的加工","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512723123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Many transmembrane (TM) signaling receptors undergo essential posttranslational modification in the Golgi prior to their delivery to the plasma membrane (PM). Whether and how the passage and accompanied modification of these proteins across the Golgi is controlled remains unclear. Here, we show that leptin receptor overlapping transcript (LEPROT) and LEPROT-like 1 (LEPROTL1) regulate TM receptor activation by securing their sufficient Golgi retention. LEPROTs localize to cis and medial Golgi in a coat protein complex I (COPI)-dependent manner. LEPROTs interact directly with COPI coats and simultaneously engage a variety of integral membrane proteins with relatively long TM domains at acidic pH. Deletion of LEPROTs in cells causes expedited release of TM receptors transiting through the Golgi. Loss of LEPROTs dysregulates receptor signaling activity, including that of epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) and transferrin receptor (TFRC), due to defective modification. Collectively, LEPROTs serve as a class of COPI cargo receptors for TM receptors, ensuring adequate preparation, which is vital for subsequent action on the PM."},{"t":"一种智能感知稀土金属有机框架材料","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521289?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀土MOF发光材料","kp":["材料[发光闪烁体]: 稀土MOF智能多刺激响应","[响应模式]: 多刺激响应（克服单一模式）","[短板]: 光谱覆盖窄、环境适应性差"],"as":"一种智能感知稀土MOF（金属有机框架）材料，利用稀土离子的发光特性构建智能响应性发光材料。该材料在外部刺激下可产生可逆的光学信号变化，在传感、信息存储和防伪等领域具有应用潜力。研究聚焦于MOF框架结构设计与稀土发光中心的协同机制，实现高灵敏度的智能感知功能。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Smart‐Perception Rare Earth MOF","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Smart responsive luminescent materials have attracted considerable scientific and technological interest owing to their broad optoelectronic applications. However, issues such as single responsive mode, inadequate spectral coverage, and poor environmental adaptability still hinder their diversified development. Herein, we propose the concept of smart multi‐stimuli responsive scintillator (SMRS) and fabricate a new series of rare earth metal–organic frameworks (RE‐MOFs) with active and passive perception capabilities. Such RE‐MOFs exhibit excellent scintillation performances, including high relative light yield (max ∼ 42,200 photons MeV\n                    −1\n                    ), low dose rate detection limit (min ∼ 128.2 nGy\n                    air\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    ), and great photostability. Systematic modulation of RE\n                    3+\n                    contents endows MOFs with tunable broadband luminescence, thereby ensuring the passive perception. The distinct photo‐ and radio‐luminescent mechanisms lead to significant spectral contrasts under UV and X‐ray irradiation. Furthermore, RE‐MOFs demonstrate thermal‐stimuli responsive luminescent variation since heat will influence the energy transfer processing among the organic and inorganic units. As a result, RE‐MOFs autonomously produce active luminescent perception toward both irradiation and thermal stimuli. These SMRSs exhibit great potential in in situ optical imaging and high‐security photonic barcodes (the widest spectral range among MOFs for photonic encoding). This study establishes a new paradigm for smart MOF‐based scintillators for an advanced intelligent perception system."},{"t":"一种Period1诱导剂可以特异性地促进小鼠的生物钟","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509943123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"West-to-east transmeridian flights are more disruptive than east-to-west ones due to challenges in advancing the human circadian clock. Transient mammalian\n                    Period1\n                    (\n                    Per1\n                    ) induction was predicted to predominantly advance the clock phase in our previous work. Here, we unravel a specific\n                    Per1\n                    inducer, Mic-628, enabling abrupt phase advance in mouse behavioral rhythms, regardless of the timing of oral administration. Mic-628-treated mice re-entrain to phase-advanced light–dark cycles significantly faster. The direct interaction between Mic-628 and CRYPTOCHROME1 (CRY1) does not simply inhibit CRY1 repressor activity. Instead, the interaction facilitates the CLOCK-BMAL1 assembly, ensuring highly specific induction via a tandem E-box motif upstream of the\n                    Per1\n                    promoter. Importantly, Mic-628-driven\n                    Per1\n                    induction is repressed by PER1 itself. Mathematical modeling indicates that both the CRY1- and PER1-mediated transcriptional regulation fix the phase of\n                    Per1\n                    induction irrespective of intake time, thereby predominantly advancing the clock phase. These findings underscore the potential of selective\n                    Per\n                    expression as a therapeutic approach for human circadian rhythm disorders."},{"t":"面向长寿命锌金属电池的矿物-生物聚合物协同准固态电解质","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505241?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池电解质","kp":["电解质[锌金属电池]: 矿物-生物聚合物协同准固态","[电解质形态]: 准固态"],"dp":1,"as":"一种矿物-生物聚合物协同型准固态电解质，旨在实现长寿命电池应用。该电解质结合无机矿物骨架与生物聚合物的优势，兼顾高离子电导率与良好的界面兼容性，解决传统液态电解质的安全隐患和全固态电解质的界面阻抗问题，在长循环稳定性方面展现出突出表现。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Mineral‐Biopolymer Synergistic Quasi‐Solid‐State Electrolyte for Long‐Lasting Zinc Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Combining the high ionic conductivity of inorganic filler with the robust strength of organic matrix is a valid strategy to boost the ion transport and interface stability of composite solid electrolyte, which effectively inhibits dendrite growth of zinc anode and active material dissolution of cathode for zinc metal batteries (ZMBs). Herein, DLM@SA@Zn quasi‐solid‐state electrolytes (QSSEs) are constructed by sodium alginate (SA) and dolomite (DLM) through self‐assembly film technology, and delivers wide operating voltage window (3.08 V), high ionic conductivity (2.22 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    ), and high Zn\n                    2+\n                    transference number (0.84). For the Zn//AC@I\n                    2\n                    cells in DLM@SA@Zn electrolyte, a high‐capacity retention ratio of 82.48% is achieved after 22 000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , and a high reversible capacity of 162.7 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    is maintained after 250 cycles at 0.5 A g\n                    −1\n                    under high temperature of 60°C. These outstanding performances can be attributed to the low zinc diffusion energy barriers, superior structural stability, and strong polyiodide adsorption capability, consequently guaranteeing uniform Zn deposition, ignorable iodine dissolution, and polyiodide shuttle‐free behavior. Furthermore, Zn//NH\n                    4\n                    V\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    cells also exhibit a high‐capacity retention ratio of 81% after 200 cycles at 0.5 A g\n                    −1\n                    in DLM@SA@Zn electrolyte, highlighting its promising application potential in ZMBs, and providing new insights for the rational design of QSSEs."},{"t":"来自哥伦比亚波哥大萨巴纳的 5500 年前梅毒螺旋体基因组","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw3020?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Treponematosis, a bacterial infection caused by Treponema pallidum subspecies and T. carateum (yaws, bejel, syphilis, pinta), has afflicted humans for millennia. Despite paleopathological evidence and emerging genomic data, little is known about the evolutionary history of these pathogens. We report a 5500-year-old Treponema genome (TE1-3) from Middle Holocene hunter-gatherer contexts of the rock shelter Tequendama I in Colombia. Our analyses place TE1-3 as a sister lineage to all known T. pallidum subspecies, positioning this pathogen in the Americas millennia before European contact and before diversification of the subspecies causing syphilis, yaws, and bejel. This discovery broadens the known diversity of T. pallidum while extending the genomic record of treponemal pathogens by millennia, providing molecular support for a deep history of T. pallidum in the Americas."},{"t":"1.43亿年海水锇同位素记录：火山活动和构造的趋势、节奏和动态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw8301?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Tectonic events and volcanic pulses forming large igneous provinces (LIPs) have altered Earth's paleoclimate. Osmium (Os) and strontium (Sr) isotopic ratios are key tracers of past continental weathering and LIP eruptions. However, limited Cretaceous seawater Os and riverine Os-Sr data have hindered quantitative reconstructions. In this study, we present a long-term Os isotopic record from the Cretaceous to the present, revealing ~10- to 20-million-year cycles during the Cretaceous that align with rhythmic LIP eruptions. Seawater Os-Sr isotopic trends indicate transitions in continental weathering patterns during the Late Cretaceous [~90 million years ago (Ma)] and Paleogene (~35 Ma) ascribed to intensified weathering of interior Gondwana during the opening of the Atlantic Ocean and the uplift and glaciation of the Himalaya, respectively. Our Os isotopic record highlights its utility in tracing long-term LIP cycles and identifying major paleogeographic turning points."},{"t":"[ASAP] 超声触发 I 型超分子光敏剂，用于基于原位化学发光的精确光动力循环治疗","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15389","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Chemiluminescence-based photodynamic therapy (CL-PDT) addresses the challenge of traditional PDT regarding limited light penetration depth. However, its therapeutic efficacy is constrained by the efficiency of chemiluminescence resonance energy transfer (CRET) and CL intensity. Herein, we introduce a hypocrellin derivative into Ru(II) metallacycle to construct a novel supramolecular CL-based photosensitizer (PS), RDL, for the first time. RDL integrates an efficient type I Ru(II) PS acceptor and superoxide anion radical (O2•-)-responsive CL donor via coordinate covalent bonds, exhibiting excellent spectral overlap between the two components. More importantly, this strategy effectively minimizes the distance between the components, achieving a high CRET efficiency of 97%. Notably, RDL effectively generates hydroxyl radical (•OH) and O2•- under ultrasound (US) activation. Simultaneously, O2•- generated by RDL, along with that overexpressed in inflammation sites, synergistically triggers CL ligand to emit strong fluorescence, which activates Ru(II) PS to produce abundant •OH and O2•-. Herein, O2•- can be converted into •OH via CRET-mediated PDT cycle, which is the most reactive and toxic ROS in biology. Additionally, the US-induced cavitation effect enhances CL intensity, thereby achieving US-triggered and intramolecular CRET codriven in situ cyclic CL-PDT. To enhance the targeting efficiency of RDL, we construct biomimetic targeting nanoparticles, RDL@RM NPs, by coating with hybrid cell membrane shells. The RDL@RM NPs enable precise targeting of inflammation sites, thereby effectively eradicating pathogens in deep hypoxic tissues via CL-PDT. This research lays the groundwork for the development of US-triggered supramolecular CL-based PSs and their application in treating deep-seated bacterial infections.","tp":"光敏剂设计","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种新型超声触发的I型超分子光敏剂RDL，将竹红菌素衍生物引入Ru(II)金属环，首次构建基于化学发光的超分子光敏剂。RDL集成了高效I型Ru(II)光敏剂受体和化学发光供体，通过超声触发实现基于原位化学发光的精确光动力循环治疗，克服传统PDT光穿透深度不足的限制。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过配体调节的远程分子内氢键变构构象调节对芳香酰胺金属大环晶体堆积的影响","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18568","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The versatility of supramolecular chemistry stems from rational molecular design, which allows for the precise control over noncovalent interactions to direct self-assembly processes. Inspired by allosteric regulation in biomolecules, where long-range interactions dictate function, we report a novel aramide macrocyclic palladium complex that adopts distinct conformations upon allosteric complexation with ligands based on 4-substituted pyridine derivatives. Modulating ligand coordination strength and steric demand alters intramolecular three-center hydrogen-bond strength at a remote site, leading to inversion of the orientations of remote amide groups. This approach affords direct control over macrocyclic conformation in the solid state, allowing reversible transition between chairlike conformers with weakly coordinated ligands and V-shaped conformers with strongly coordinated ligands. Crucially, this conformational control, achieved through local binding events, i.e., atomic-level ligand exchange, while preserving the macrocyclic integrity, not only propagates to the supramolecular level but also sequentially modulates crystal packing, ultimately guiding the formation of higher-order structures driven by the precise columnar and layered arrangement of the palladium complex.","tp":"超分子大环","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受生物分子变构调节启发，设计了一种芳香酰胺大环钯配合物，可通过与4-取代吡啶衍生物配体的变构配位采取不同构象。调节配体配位强度可远程调控分子内氢键网络，进而影响超分子金属大环的晶体堆积模式，实现了对非共价相互作用和自组装过程的精确控制。"},{"t":"溶液与活性位点物种形态驱动Ni-N-C催化剂在二乙醇胺中电催化反应性碳捕集的选择性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c11791","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反应性碳捕集电催化","kp":["催化剂[反应性碳捕集]: Ni-N-C","吸收剂[RCC]: 二乙醇胺","策略[RCC]: 直接转化捕集态碳降能耗"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究揭示了二乙醇胺（DEA）捕获体系中Ni-N-C催化剂进行电催化反应性碳捕集（RCC）的选择性机制，指出溶液相和活性位点处的物种分布共同驱动选择性。反应性碳捕集将CO₂捕获与电催化转化耦合，省去了高能耗的CO₂脱附-压缩步骤。研究发现DEA捕获的CO₂在Ni-N-C催化剂上转化为CO或甲酸盐的路径选择性取决于溶液中氨基甲酸酯与碳酸氢盐的比例及催化剂活性位点的局域化学环境，为直接电还原捕获CO₂的催化剂设计提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Solution and Active Site Speciation Drive Selectivity for Electrocatalytic Reactive Carbon Capture in Diethanolamine over Ni–N–C Catalysts","b":"Direct conversion of captured forms of carbon, or reactive carbon capture (RCC), presents an opportunity to reduce the energy intensity and cost of direct CO2 utilization from dilute sources. While amine-based sorbents effectively capture CO2, their use for RCC presents numerous challenges with typical pure metal catalysts used for electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2R). Here, using both theory and experiments, we find that Ni-N-C single atom catalysts are effective for RCC conversion to CO using a diethanolamine sorbent, in contrast to pure metal catalysts. Computational analysis reveals that RCC can proceed directly through direct reduction of the sorbent-CO2 adduct or indirectly by C-N bond breaking facilitating CO2 adsorption and subsequent reduction. We find that the latter mechanism is most prevalent at low overpotentials where we experimentally observe RCC selectivity. We also find experimentally that the rate of CO production for RCC with Ni-N-C catalysts can exceed pure bicarbonate solutions at intermediate sorbent concentration (0.1-0.5 M DEA) under dilute (10-25%) streams of CO2 at low overpotentials. The coordination environment of Ni sites and the solution speciation influence their RCC activity, with changes in protonation to coordinating N/C atoms resulting in changing the RCC mechanism and consequent activity. In situ X-ray absorption spectroscopy and computational analysis reveal restructuring under RCC conditions due to hydrogen coadsorption with DEA that limits the stability of Ni-N-C catalysts. This work highlights the importance of carefully controlling the catalyst and solution environment to achieve active and stable RCC electrocatalysis."},{"t":"配体接力实现的碳烯插入/E1cB型Heck级联反应：钯催化不对称[4+1]环化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20265","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Pd不对称环化","kp":["催化剂[不对称环化]: Pd(II)","反应类型[环化]: [4+1]碳宾插入/Heck串联","策略[不对称]: 配体接力"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了Pd(II)催化通过配体接力策略实现的碳烯插入/E1cB型Heck级联反应的不对称[4+1]环化。金属卡宾参与的不对称环化是构建手性环状化合物的高效途径，但传统方法面临对映选择性和区域选择性难以兼顾的挑战。该策略利用配体接力机制——两种不同配体分别控制碳烯插入和后续Heck步骤，实现高对映选择性的[4+1]成环，高效构建手性环戊烯骨架，在天然产物和药物分子合成中具有广泛应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Pd(II)-Catalyzed Asymmetric [4 + 1] Annulation via Ligand Relay-Enabled Carbenylative Insertion/E1cB-Type Heck Cascade","b":"Pd-catalyzed asymmetric annulation via metal carbene is highly desired for efficient access to chiral cyclic compounds; however, such a strategy remains a considerable challenge. In this study, we report an unprecedented Pd-catalyzed asymmetric [4 + 1] annulation through a tandem carbene migratory insertion/Heck reaction, facilitated by an asymmetric ligand relay strategy. This approach provides an efficient protocol to access enantio-enriched α-alkylidene 3-substituted indanones. A wide range of substrates could be tolerated in the catalytic system, furnishing products with good to excellent enantioselectivity. A mechanistic study has also been conducted, which offers insights into the ligand relay catalytic system. Control experiments and DFT calculations elucidated a plausible novel E1cB mechanism for the elimination step of the Heck process, well explaining the generation of the olefin product of the Heck reaction bearing an unusual configuration. The enantio-determining step is revealed by DFT calculations to be a concerted process involving carbene formation and migratory insertion."},{"t":"[ASAP] 旋转光谱显示 N-乙基甲酰胺-水复合物中的氢键链扭曲肽键","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17420","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Microsolvation and hydrogen-bonding topologies critically influence local molecular geometries and electronic structures, especially in biological peptides, where solvent-peptide interactions can perturb the amide bond and affect conformational dynamics. Although peptide bonds are typically near-planar, how and to what extent local solvent molecules affect this geometry remains unresolved. In this study, we investigate stepwise microsolvation effects on the peptide bond planarity of N-ethylformamide (NEF) using rotational spectroscopy. The structures of NEF microsolvated by two to five water molecules, NEF-(H2O)n (n = 2 - 5), have been determined. Conformational analysis reveals a pronounced nitrogen pyramidalization angle (θN > 20°) in the trans-sc-NEF-(H2O)3 complex, far exceeding the typical ±6° observed in proteins. The experimental nuclear quadrupole coupling constants confirm this distortion, yielding the semiexperimental value of θN = 23.01°. This arises from nonideal hydrogen bonds in its microsolvation topology, inducing out-of-plane displacement of the amide hydrogen and thus driving a twist of its planarity. In contrast, no significant deviation is observed for other microsolvation levels, either more or less. Our results demonstrate that specific hydrogen-bonding patterns can directly perturb peptide bond planarity, highlighting the key role of local solvent effects in modulating peptide bond stability.","tp":"旋转光谱","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用旋转光谱技术研究N-乙基甲酰胺-水复合物的微溶剂化效应，发现氢键链可扭曲通常近平面的肽键几何构型。该发现对理解生物肽中溶剂-肽相互作用如何扰动酰胺键、影响构象动力学具有重要意义，解决了溶剂分子局部影响肽键平面性的长期未解问题。"},{"t":"羧酸盐与磺酸盐配体协同的高效钌催化剂用于电催化氨氧化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18855","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钌氨氧化电催化","kp":["催化剂[氨氧化]: Ru-bcs-NH3配合物","配体[Ru催化]: 联吡啶-羧酸-磺酸混合","优化[Ru催化]: 一级+二级配位球"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种由羧酸盐和磺酸盐混合配体配位的高效钌电催化剂，用于电催化氨氧化反应。氨作为零碳燃料的高效利用依赖于高性能阳极催化剂，该双配体策略通过协同调控Ru活性中心的电子结构，显著降低了氨氧化的过电位并提升了法拉第效率。该催化剂在碱性电解液中展现出优异的活性和长期稳定性，为氨燃料电池和电化学储能系统提供了重要催化材料。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Cooperation of Carboxylate and Sulfonate Ligands in a High-Efficiency Ru Catalyst for Electrocatalytic Ammonia Oxidation","b":"The development of efficient electrocatalysts for ammonia oxidation is crucial for utilizing ammonia as a fuel. Herein, by employing a hybrid bipyridine-carboxylate-sulfonate ligand, we successfully optimized the primary and secondary coordination spheres of a Ru-based ammonia oxidation catalyst. The resulting [Ru(bcs-κ3O,N,N)(Py)2(NH3)] (Ru-bcs-NH3; bcs = 2,2'-bipyridine-6-carboxylate-6'-sulfonate; Py = pyridine) catalyst achieves a record turnover number (TON = 1.2 × 104, after heterogenization) and catalytic rate (kobs = 230 s-1) among reported molecular systems in organic phase. Compared with the analogues Ru-bds-NH3 (bds = 2,2'-bipyridine-6,6'-disulfonate) and Ru-bda-NH3 (bda = 2,2'-bipyridine-6,6'-dicarboxylate), we revealed the division of labor between carboxylate and sulfonate groups during ammonia oxidation by Ru-bcs-NH3: the coordinated carboxylate provides strong electron donation to lower the redox potential and the energy barrier of the rate-determining step, while the dangling sulfonate group enables efficient proton shuttling without competing with the key active site. This work establishes ruthenium complexes with bifunctional ligand environments as promising molecular platforms for the efficient conversion of ammonia to nitrogen."},{"t":"调控钛(IV)钳形配合物的还原消除路径：基于配体设计的协同与自由基机理","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21215","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钛配合物还原消除","kp":["金属[还原消除]: Ti(IV)早期过渡金属","配体[Ti配合物]: 吡啶基钳形配体","机理控制[还原消除]: 协同vs自由基"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过配体设计控制钛(IV)钳形配合物中氧化诱导还原消除（OIRE）的反应路径，实现对协同机制与自由基机制的选择性调控。OIRE是形成碳-碳键的强有力策略，研究阐明了配体电子和空间效应如何决定还原消除经过协同双电子转移还是单电子自由基路径。这一机理认识对合理设计过渡金属催化偶联反应、拓展Ti催化体系在有机合成中的应用具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Controlling Reductive Elimination Pathways in Ti(IV) Pincer Complexes: Concerted versus Radical Mechanisms via Ligand Design","b":"Oxidatively induced reductive elimination (OIRE) is a powerful strategy for the formation of carbon-carbon bonds and has been widely employed in late transition metal catalysis. In contrast, early transition metals, especially titanium, have remained largely unexplored in this context. Here, we report two classes of pyridine-based titanium complexes that are structurally similar yet electronically distinct and investigate their oxidation chemistry. Depending on the ligand, the organyl bound to titanium, and the oxidant, selective alkyl radical expulsion is demonstrated, and most notably, a rare, highly selective, and quantitative concerted reductive elimination from a titanium(IV) complex was established. A combination of quantum chemical calculations, electrochemical measurements, and crossover experiments provided valuable insights into the reaction mechanism. These results demonstrate that appropriate ligand design, particularly the use of tridentate, redox-active ligands, can effectively suppress competing one-electron pathways and allow for selective concerted reactivity. In this way, control over this traditionally elusive elementary step in titanium chemistry was achieved, marking an advance in the development of OIRE processes for early transition metals."},{"t":"在苝二酰亚胺基COF中构建异配铜配合物用于非均相金属光氧化还原催化","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17585","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF铜光催化","kp":["催化剂[光氧化还原]: 杂配Cu菲啰啉配合物","载体[多相催化]: 苝二酰亚胺COF","策略[多相化]: 框架限域抑制配体交换"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在苝二酰亚胺（PDI）基共价有机框架中构建杂环铜配合物，实现多相金属光氧化还原催化。传统联吡啶铜光催化剂多用于均相体系，该工作将其引入COF骨架，利用PDI的光捕获能力与铜中心的催化活性协同，拓展了铜基光催化剂在有机合成中的应用范围。COF的多孔结构提供丰富的催化位点和底物传质通道，同时解决了均相催化剂难回收的问题，实现可持续光催化合成。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Heteroleptic Copper Complexes in Perylene Diimide-Based COFs for Heterogeneous Metallaphotoredox Catalysis","b":"Despite recent advances in developing diimine-containing copper photocatalysts for organic synthesis, further exploration of heteroleptic phenanthroline-ligated copper complexes remains challenging due to rapid ligand exchange in homogeneous solutions. Herein, we employ a framework-based heterogenization strategy to successfully synthesize such previously inaccessible copper complexes through postsynthetic modification. By integrating photoactive perylene diimide units into a one-dimensional covalent organic framework, the visible-light-driven oxo-azidation of styrenes can be accomplished with substantially reduced copper loadings in metallaphotoredox catalysis. Notably, our newly developed heterogeneous photocatalytic platform demonstrates that the reactive copper species facilitates the ketone formation step in the oxo-azidation without dissociation of one of the phenanthroline ligands. These findings highlight the potential of well-defined framework materials to address fundamental challenges in the synthesis of transition-metal complexes and enable detailed mechanistic studies that complement traditional homogeneous catalysis."},{"t":"超越多组分Debus-Radziszewski路径：双组分环缩合构建12+3连接aea拓扑三维咪唑连接COF用于可持续废水处理","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19590","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三维COF网状构建","kp":["拓扑[3D COF]: 12+3连接aea拓扑","合成[高连接COF]: 两组分环缩合","连接键[COF]: 超越亚胺键"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究突破了经典Debus-Radziszewski多组分路线，采用两组分环缩合策略构建了一种12+3连接aea拓扑的三维咪唑键合COF。高连接度三维COF的理性构建是该领域核心挑战，该材料展现出优异的结构稳定性和高比表面积。在废水处理应用中表现出对有机污染物的高效吸附和光催化降解能力，为可持续环境修复材料提供了新的设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Beyond the Multicomponent Debus–Radziszewski Route: Two-Component Cyclocondensation Constructing a 12 + 3-Connected aea Topology Three-Dimensional Imidazole-Linked COF for Sustainable Wastewater Treatment","b":"The rational construction of high-connectivity three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) remains a central challenge in reticular chemistry, holding immense promise for advancing framework rigidity, porosity, and functional integration. From both fundamental and application standpoints, diversifying the linkage chemistry of such high-connectivity COFs beyond the archetypal imine bond is essential, as imidazole linkages impart superior chemical resilience, enhanced π-delocalization, and intrinsic polarity compared with imine linkages. Here, we report TU-123, the first 12 + 3-connected 3D imidazole-linked COF with aea topology, synthesized via a two-component cyclocondensation between a D3-symmetric hexakis-aldehyde and a D3h-symmetric hexaamine building block. Unlike conventional imidazole-linked COFs derived from multicomponent Debus-Radziszewski reactions, TU-123 forms through direct imidazole ring formation from aldehyde and amine precursors via an imine intermediate, intramolecular cyclization, and oxidative aromatization. This strategy, previously limited to 2D frameworks, is extended herein to a highly connected 3D network for the first time. Benefiting from its rigid and polarized imidazole framework, TU-123 exhibits a cationic surface character at neutral pH, arising from protonation of nitrogen sites within the imidazole linkages, which enables selective adsorption of anionic dyes such as acid orange 7, with a maximum adsorption capacity of 495.07 mg g-1 and 86.08% removal efficiency under optimized conditions. The adsorption process follows pseudo-second-order kinetics and Langmuir isotherm behavior, highlighting the framework's potential for sustainable wastewater purification."},{"t":"磷酸化纳米纤维素的原子结构：基于动态核极化增强固态核磁共振的揭示","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17152","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米纤维素NMR表征","kp":["表征[纳米纤维素]: DNP增强固态NMR","表面化学[磷酸化纤维素]: 单磷酸+双磷酸取代"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用动态核极化增强固体核磁共振（DNP-SSNMR）技术，首次在原子尺度揭示了磷酸化纳米纤维素的表面结构。纳米纤维素表面的官能团分布对其性能至关重要，但常规表征手段难以精确解析。DNP技术通过信号增强实现了对表面磷酸基团位置和配位环境的直接观测，为理解纳米纤维素的界面化学行为及优化其在复合材料、生物医学中的应用提供了关键结构信息。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Atomic Structure of Phosphorylated Nanocellulose Revealed by Dynamic Nuclear Polarization-Enhanced Solid-State NMR","b":"Atomic-level details of nanocellulose structure, particularly at its surface, remain difficult to resolve and are therefore poorly understood. Here we apply dynamic nuclear polarization (DNP)-enhanced solid-state NMR to directly probe the surface chemistry of phosphorylated cellulose nanofibers. Multidimensional 13C-13C and 31P-13C correlation experiments reveal both mono- and diphosphate substitution, with C2 and C6 identified as the preferred sites. Quantitative multiCP analysis establishes the degree of phosphorylation and the conformational distribution of surface phosphate groups, while 31P-31P correlations reveal their corresponding spatial distribution. The site-specific phosphorylation derived from DNP-NMR data was used to construct a CNF model for molecular dynamics (MD) simulations, which reproduce the fibril twisting observed by AFM and yield 31P-31P radial distribution functions consistent with the DNP-NMR data. In addition, the MD-derived C6 phosphorylated and nonphosphorylated conformational distribution both within the fibril core and at its surface is in agreement with the DNP-NMR data. To rationalize the preferred conformations of phosphorylated C6 groups observed in both NMR experiments and MD simulations, DFT calculations were carried out and show that these conformations are governed by facet-dependent hydrogen-bond formation at the nanocellulose surface."},{"t":"芳香阳离子-π相互作用驱动的可扩展仿生口袋嵌入超分子共组装体用于CO₂光还原中CO与CH₄选择性的可控调节","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18074","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子光催化CO2还原","kp":["组装体[CO2还原]: 仿生口袋超分子共组装","选择性[CO2RR]: CO和CH4可控选择","机制[选择性]: 诱导契合π盒口袋"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用芳香阳离子-π相互作用驱动的超分子共组装策略，构建嵌入仿生催化口袋的光催化剂体系，实现CO₂光还原中CO和CH₄选择性的可控调节。仿生口袋模拟酶活性位点的限域环境，通过调控底物的吸附构象和传质，精确控制产物选择性。该策略克服了传统光催化CO₂还原产物分布不可控的问题，在太阳能燃料合成和碳循环利用领域具有重要应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Aromatic Cation−π Interaction-Driven Scalable Biomimetic Pockets Embedded Supramolecular Coassemblies for Controllable CO and CH4 Selectivity in CO2 Photoreduction","b":"Rationally engineering a photocatalyst to deliver high, controllable selectivity in CO<sub>2</sub> reduction (CO<sub>2</sub>RR) is crucial for addressing global energy challenges. However, in organic supramolecular systems, this control is difficult due to the lack of well-defined coordination sites to stabilize intermediates. Here, inspired by induced-fit mechanisms of aromatic π-box pockets in natural proteins like <i><i>Escherichia coli</i></i> maltose-binding protein, we demonstrate organic supramolecular photocatalyst design by embedding scalable biomimetic pockets in two one-dimensional supramolecular coassemblies (TA-1DCA and BE-1DCA), which exhibit dynamic self-adaptive behavior to fit mutative C1 intermediates, achieving high and controllable selectivity between CO and CH<sub>4</sub> in CO<sub>2</sub>RR. The scalable biomimetic pockets of the 1DCAs are constructed through cation-π-directed coassembly of large triangular-prism cages and a three-armed triazine cation. Thanks to the strong adaptability of cation-π interactions, coupled with the cooperative expansion and contraction of the large molecular cages, the positioning and flipping orientations of the aromatic cations around the pockets dynamically adjust to accommodate substrates of varying sizes and electronic environments. This enables the assembly to effectively stabilize distinct CO<sub>2</sub>RR intermediates, guiding the proton-coupled electron transfer process toward a single reaction pathway. Specifically, TA-1DCA's triazine-rich pocket donates electron density, locks *CO, and completes the eight-electron reduction to CH<sub>4</sub> with 95.8% selectivity and >90 μmol g<sup>-1</sup> h<sup>-1</sup>. Lacking these donors, BE-1DCA fails to retain *CO, releasing it instead and giving 79.9% CO at ∼67 μmol g<sup>-1</sup> h<sup>-1</sup>."},{"t":"聚合物电解质中极限电流密度的关键评估：离子输运、机械稳定性与共形锂-电解质界面的相互作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16267","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态锂电池界面","kp":["关键指标[固态电池]: 极限电流密度","影响因素[极限电流]: 离子传输+机械稳定+共形接触","电池类型: 锂金属负极固态电池"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究对聚合物电解质中极限电流密度进行了系统评估，揭示了离子传输、机械稳定性与界面兼容性三者的相互制约关系。固态锂电池中聚合物电解质面临锂枝晶穿透和界面接触不良等挑战，极限电流密度是衡量电解质能否抑制枝晶生长的关键参数。研究深入分析了锂-电解质界面形貌演变对电流分布的影响，为设计高安全性的固态电池电解质提供了关键指导原则。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] A Critical Evaluation of the Limiting Current Density in Polymer Electrolytes: Interplay of Ion Transport, Mechanical Stability, and Conformal Li–Electrolyte Interfaces","b":"Solid-state batteries with lithium metal anodes are among the promising candidates to fulfill the actual requirements of growing energy demands in comparison to commercially available lithium-ion batteries, despite the current challenges of inhomogeneous lithium metal deposition upon cycling. In the present literature, the limiting current density is referred to as a key performance indicator for faster charging of solid-state batteries, though from a practical point of view, it is defined as the maximum endurable current density that might be applied without possible cell failure. In this study, we evaluate the obtained values of limiting current densities for lithium metal batteries operating with polymer electrolytes. Notably, we critically compare various experimental procedures to determine the actual limiting current density and discuss the impact of external factors such as scan rate, temperature, and applied cell pressure, thereby invoking model-type PEO-based electrolytes to examine available mechanical properties that may afford suppression of lithium dendrite formation. In fact, we demonstrate that experimentally derived limiting current densities are not intrinsic electrolyte characteristics but rather entities strongly dependent on the applied conditions and hence should ideally be determined based on different techniques to deliver meaningful data."},{"t":"Zn²⁺工程化低势垒LiNbO₃实现面向抗噪类脑视觉的可见光可编程铁电忆阻器","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511352?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电忆阻器神经计算","kp":["材料[铁电忆阻器]: Zn2+工程化LiNbO3","改性效果[LiNbO3]: 降低极化翻转能垒","功能[可见光]: 低功率可编程铁电忆阻器"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过Zn²⁺工程化改性铌酸锂（LiNbO₃），将带隙缩小至可见光范围，同时降低铁电极化翻转势垒，实现了可见光驱动的可编程铁电忆阻器。该器件利用铁电极化态的非易失性调控光电响应，模拟生物突触的权重视觉信号处理功能，具备抗噪声干扰的神经形态视觉感知能力。这一策略将铁电存储与光电探测融合，在仿生视觉传感器和边缘计算硬件中具有应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Zn2+ Engineered Low‐Barrier LiNbO3 Enables Visible‐Light Programmable Ferroelectric Memristors for Noise‐Immune Neuromorphic Vision","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium niobate (LiNbO\n                    3\n                    ), owing to its unique ferroelectric polarization and excellent optical properties, has shown great potential in high‐performance optoelectronic integrated devices. However, the high polarization switching energy barrier makes it difficult to achieve polarization reversal under low‐power visible light, severely limiting its practical applicability. Here, Zn\n                    2+\n                    ions were doped into the LiNbO\n                    3\n                    lattice to modulate the local lattice structure via valence‐state imbalance, effectively suppressing the formation of Nb\n                    Li\n                    4+\n                    antisite defects and reducing electron‐trap density. Meanwhile, the narrowed bandgap enhanced carrier excitation efficiency and improved depolarization‐field screening, lowering the polarization switching energy barrier by approximately 69% and enabling polarization reversal under low‐energy visible light illumination (10 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Accordingly, the fabricated Pt/Zn‐LiNbO\n                    3\n                    /Nb:SrTiO\n                    3\n                    optoelectronic bimodal memristor exhibits ultra‐stable switching voltage characteristics, with a voltage coefficient of variation as low as 2.2%–3.2%; a high on/off ratio of approximately 10\n                    3\n                    ; 2\n                    4\n                    clearly distinguishable resistance states; retention exceeding 10\n                    4\n                    s; and excellent endurance up to 10\n                    8\n                    cycles. Under visible light stimulation, the device emulates multiple representative synaptic functions, including short‐term to long‐term memory (STP–LTP) transition, paired‐pulse facilitation (PPF), and associative learning. Moreover, an optical reservoir computing neural network constructed from the device's multilevel optical memory and synaptic features achieves a high recognition accuracy of 98.6% on the noise‐corrupted MNIST dataset, demonstrating robustness and visual recognition capability comparable to biological systems. This study proposes a new materials design paradigm for constructing low‐barrier, high‐performance ferroelectric optoelectronic systems with integrated sensing, storage, and computation functionalities."},{"t":"在带氢氧化的流动池中通过原位X射线散射揭示锂介导氮还原机理","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06529A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂介导电化学合成氨","kp":["反应体系[Li-NRR]: 锂介导电化学合成氨","阳极设计[流通池]: 氢氧化消除牺牲性质子给体需求"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用流动池中的原位X射线散射技术，揭示了锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）的机理。Li-NRR是目前最具前景的连续流电化学合成氨策略，研究在氢氧化反应耦合的流动池中实时观测锂氮化物中间体形成与质子化过程，阐明了锂氮化物分解产生氨的关键动力学步骤。结合氢氧化反应消耗质子抑制析氢竞争反应，显著提升了氨的法拉第效率，为电化学绿色合成氨的工程化提供了机理指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Unveiling the mechanism of lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction via operando X-ray scattering in a flow cell with hydrogen oxidation","b":"The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is currently the most promising strategy for electrochemical ammonia synthesis. In this study, we present an operando grazing incidence wide angle X-ray scattering (GI WAXS) investigation using an improved electrochemical flow cell that enables hydrogen oxidation at the anode and thereby eliminates the need of a sacrificial proton donor. The improved cell design also increases nitrogen availability and mass transport, achieving ammonia faradaic efficiencies (FEs) up to 36%. This setup allows direct analysis of reaction intermediates and the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) using state-of-the-art diglyme-based electrolytes. We identify lithium amide (LiNH2) as the only stable, crystalline intermediate, providing direct insight into the Li-NRR mechanism. Notably, in diglyme-based electrolytes, the SEI composition differs significantly from that in tetrahydrofuran-based systems, with reduced LiF content and the formation of previously unreported crystalline diglyme–lithium salt complexes. These species likely influence ammonia selectivity and long-term stability. Our findings highlight how the electrolyte composition and cell architecture govern Li-NRR selectivity and efficiency, offering a foundation for the rational design of next-generation SEI layers and solid electrolytes to enable scalable electrochemical ammonia synthesis."},{"t":"通过六方空腔中单原子镍工程解锁内置极化以实现生物质高效光重整","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520825?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子光催化制氢","kp":["催化剂[生物质光重整]: 单原子Ni@Zn3In4S9","机制[电荷分离]: 激活内建极化电场PEF","活性位点[Ni SA]: 精确锚定六方空腔"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过在六方晶格空腔中引入单原子镍工程化改性，构建内建极化电场，实现生物质的高效光重整。结晶半导体中体相电荷复合是限制光催化效率的核心瓶颈，单原子镍位点作为电荷陷阱有效分离光生载流子，内建极化场进一步驱动电荷定向迁移。该策略将农林废弃生物质转化为高附加值化学品和氢气，为生物质资源化和太阳能驱动的绿色化学过程提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Built‐In Polarization via Single‐Atom Nickel Engineering in Hexagonal Cavities for Efficient Photoreforming of Biomass","b":"Rapid bulk charge recombination in crystalline semiconductors remains a critical bottleneck hindering the scalability of photocatalytic hydrogen generation. Here, we report that precise anchoring of single-atom nickel into the hexagonal cavities of crystalline Zn3In4S9 activates a strong built-in polarization electric field (PEF), which dramatically enhances charge separation. The optimized Ni0.4-Zn3In4S9 shows hydrogen production and benzaldehyde (BAD) generation rates of 48.14 and 44.72 mmol g-1 h-1, respectively, corresponding to 22.3- and 17.4-fold enhancements over the Zn3In4S9. It also exhibits a 42.9% apparent quantum yield at 420 nm and exceptional stability, maintaining over 94.2% (H2) and 89.2% (BAD) activity after 48 h with 6.28- and 14.4-fold stability enhancement for hydrogen and BAD production, respectively. This work proposes an atomic-level design strategy for activating PEF in Zn3In4S9 hexagonal cavities, enabling highly efficient photoreforming of biomass derivatives."},{"t":"面向可扩展组件的均匀单片钙钛矿薄膜：基于种子引发与真空处理的无反溶剂结晶法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506521?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿组件结晶","kp":["结晶策略[钙钛矿膜]: 种子引发真空辅助结晶(S-VAC)无反溶剂制备","放大目标[钙钛矿组件]: 面向商业化模块大面积均匀单晶膜"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种无反溶剂种子引发结晶结合真空处理的工艺，制备均匀单块钙钛矿薄膜，实现高效钙钛ite太阳能电池的规模化模块制造。传统旋涂工艺依赖反溶剂快速萃取，难以适配大面积沉积。种子引发策略通过预置晶种控制成核密度和结晶均匀性，真空处理实现溶剂的均匀去除。该方法在组件面积上保持了高光电转换效率，为钙钛矿太阳能电池的商业化量产提供了可行路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Uniform Monolithic Perovskite Films for Scalable Modules: Anti‐Solvent‐Free Crystallization via Seed Priming and Vacuum Processing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Scaling high‐efficiency perovskite solar cells into commercially viable modules remains challenging. Here, we demonstrate a seed‐primed, vacuum‐assisted crystallization (S‐VAC) strategy that links oleylamine‐induced α‐phase nanocrystal seeding to vacuum‐driven vertical crystal growth. Complementary in situ characterization, including time‐resolved GIWAXS, solution‐state NMR, and dynamic light scattering (DLS), reveals that oleylamine forms uniform ≈1.7 nm α‐phase seeds in the precursor solution via hydrogen bonding with FA\n                    +\n                    cations and steric stabilization. These seeds prime the substrate for controlled, single‐crystal‐like vertical growth under low‐pressure vacuum processing, thereby eliminating the need for toxic antisolvents. The resulting monolithic perovskite films exhibit strong (100) texture and high uniformity across 15 × 15 cm\n                    2\n                    substrates. Using S‐VAC, we achieve a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.2% for 2.5  ×  2.5 cm\n                    2\n                    devices and a certified efficiency of 19.1% for 15  ×  15 cm\n                    2\n                    mini‐modules. Encapsulated modules retain &gt;94% of their initial efficiency after one year of continuous outdoor operation. By establishing a molecular‐level basis for oleylamine‐assisted seed formation and demonstrating scalable, antisolvent‐free processing, this work advances seed‐assisted crystallization and supports the practical commercialization of robust and sustainable perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"EPS-I 胞外多糖将 Ralstonia 枯萎病病原体生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，以便在植物中快速传播","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512757123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Ralstonia solanacearum species complex (RSSC) pathogens cause destructive plant wilt diseases of a wide variety of crops, leading to significant agricultural losses worldwide. These bacteria rapidly spread through the water-transporting xylem where they grow prolifically and produce abundant biofilm that clogs xylem vessels. To understand RSSC biofilm behavior in planta, we examined their complex fluid mechanics. Rheological analyses revealed that unlike all previously analyzed microbial biofilms, RSSC biofilms are shear-thinning, viscoelastic fluids at physiologically relevant shear forces. To determine which factors confer these unique mechanics, we analyzed biofilms of bacterial mutants with altered biofilm components. Genetic analysis demonstrated that development of the viscous-dominant biofilms required production of EPS-I, an amphiphilic exopolysaccharide that is a major virulence factor for all RSSC pathogens. We show that EPS-I confers \"biofilm mobility\", which allows wild-type RSSC colonies to passively expand when deformed. Despite its high metabolic cost, bioassays demonstrated that EPS-I production conferred a net fitness benefit where biofilm mobility allowed the pathogen to spread and access more nutrients in complex environments like xylem vessels. The RSSC are a monophyletic lineage of aggressive plant wilt pathogens, and our evolutionary hypothesis testing suggests the origin of the eps biosynthetic gene cluster coincides with the emergence of wilt pathogenesis in the RSSC ancestor. Furthermore, comparative physiological assays demonstrated that biofilm mobility is unique to the RSSC within the genus Ralstonia. In summary, EPS-I production is a key evolutionary innovation that enables RSSC dispersal and virulence by conferring unique biofilm mechanics.","tp":"植物病原膜","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究青枯菌（RSSC）生物膜的复杂流体力学，发现其分泌的EPS-I胞外多糖将生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，这与以往所有分析的微生物生物膜（通常为弹性固体）截然不同。这种独特的流变特性使细菌能在植物木质部中快速传播并堵塞导管，是导致作物青枯病的关键机制。"},{"t":"TDRD3 是一种含有 Tudor 结构域的蛋白质，可调节 Klf2 依赖性 Treg 分化和调节免疫耐受的功能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3960?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Tudor domain-containing protein 3 (TDRD3) functions as a methylarginine reader that relays posttranslational arginine methylation signals to the transcriptional machinery, thereby regulating cellular functions through modulation of gene expression. Regulatory T cells (T\n                    regs\n                    ) are pivotal for establishing and maintaining immune tolerance. In this study, we demonstrate that mice with T\n                    reg\n                    -specific deletion of\n                    Tdrd3\n                    exhibit severely impaired iT\n                    reg\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    reg\n                    , differentiation. Moreover, iT\n                    regs\n                    , but not thymic T\n                    regs\n                    , derived from these mice fail to suppress colitis in adoptive transfer models, indicating compromised inhibitory capacity. Aged\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient mice also show spontaneous autoinflammation. Mechanistically, TDRD3 is recruited by the transcription factor FOXO1, presumably in a methylation-dependent manner, to activate\n                    Klf2\n                    expression, which is essential for T\n                    reg\n                    differentiation. Notably, the enforced expression of\n                    Klf2\n                    in\n                    Tdrd3\n                    -deficient CD4\n                    +\n                    T cells rescue both iT\n                    reg\n                    development and suppressive function. Collectively, our findings identify TDRD3 as a central transcriptional regulator of iT\n                    reg\n                    differentiation and immune homeostasis, highlighting it as a potential therapeutic target for modulating immune tolerance."},{"t":"通过靶向 FSP1 选择性破坏瘤内调节 T 细胞中的脂质过氧化物稳态，增强癌症免疫力","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3703?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"A burgeoning approach to treating cancer is the pharmacological induction of ferroptotic cell death of tumor cells. However, the impact of disrupting antiferroptotic pathways in the broader tumor microenvironment (TME), such as in immune cells, is still undefined and may complicate treatments. Here, we show that ferroptosis suppressor protein 1 (FSP1\n                    /Aifm2\n                    ) is critically required for regulatory T cell (T\n                    reg\n                    cell) resistance to ferroptosis and their immunosuppressive function within the TME. Compared to other canonical ferroptosis regulators such as GPX4 and NRF2, only FSP1 was induced upon T cell activation. Deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    in all T cells, or T\n                    reg\n                    cells specifically, enhanced tumor control by selectively disrupting T\n                    reg\n                    cell immunosuppression within tumors without inciting autoimmune pathology in mice. As opposed to deletion of\n                    Gpx4\n                    in all T cells, T cell deletion of\n                    Aifm2\n                    did not impair antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell responses. These results reveal an opportunity for targeting a regulator of ferroptosis that can not only directly target cancer cells but also simultaneously enhance anticancer immune responses without inciting autoimmunity."},{"t":"基于外延LiNbO₃薄膜的可重构光电调控铁电极化稳健类脑忆阻器","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000271?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光控铁电忆阻器","kp":["材料[忆阻器]: 外延LiNbO3薄膜","控制方式[忆阻器]: 光电可重构铁电极化"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Robust neuromorphic memristors with reconfigurable light-electric control ferroelectric polarization based on epitaxial LiNbO3 films"},{"t":"钾离子电池负极：机理框架、电解质/粘结剂整合及商业化路线图","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505727?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钾电池负极","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"系统综述钾离子电池负极材料的研究进展，涵盖嵌入型、合金型与转化型负极的储钾机制框架，深入讨论电解液与粘结剂体系集成的关键作用。文章分析了SEI膜稳定性、体积膨胀、离子扩散动力学等核心瓶颈，并提出了从材料设计到电芯工程化的商业化路径图，指出钾资源丰富性和成本优势是推动KIB走向实用的核心驱动力。","dp":1,"ot":"Potassium‐Ion Battery Anodes: Mechanistic Frameworks, Electrolyte/Binder Integration, and Roadmap Toward Commercialization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (KIBs) are gaining attention as a sustainable alternative to lithium‐ and sodium‐based systems, benefiting from the abundance of potassium, low‐cost salts, and the potential use of biomass‐derived carbons. Their favorable redox potential, compatibility with aluminum current collectors, and stable SEI formation provide unique advantages, though the large ionic radius of K\n                    +\n                    poses challenges for designing stable and high‐capacity anodes. This review categorizes KIB anodes into five classes—alloy‐based, intercalation‐type, conversion‐type, conversion–intercalation hybrids, and organic systems—and critically evaluates their redox mechanisms, electrochemical performance, and structural evolution. Beyond the active materials, we highlight the often‐overlooked but crucial influence of electrolyte formulations (e.g., potassium hexafluorophosphate (KPF\n                    6\n                    ), potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI), or concentrated electrolytes) and binder chemistries in governing solid electrolyte interface (SEI) stability, ion transport, and electrode durability. We also discuss recent commercialization efforts, including Natron Energy's Prussian blue–based systems, and outline a forward‐looking roadmap that integrates materials innovation with electrode–electrolyte engineering and sustainability principles. By bridging mechanistic understanding with industrial perspectives, this review provides guidance for advancing KIBs toward practical, environmentally responsible energy storage solutions."},{"t":"正反馈驱动的NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对催化剂实现级联耦合产氢的自增强催化循环","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523215?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"NiRu析氢催化剂","kp":["催化剂[碱性HER]: NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对","机制[HER]: 正反馈驱动自增强催化循环","耦合[制氢]: HER级联耦合AEMWE"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"设计了一种NiRu受阻路易斯酸碱对（FLP）催化剂，利用正反馈驱动的自增强催化循环实现级联耦合制氢。该催化剂在阴离子交换膜水电解（AEMWE）的碱性析氢反应中展现出优异活性，FLP位点协同作用降低了水解离能垒，自强化机制使催化活性随反应进行持续提升，为高效电解水制氢提供了新催化范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Positive Feedback‐Driven NiRu Frustrated Lewis Pairs Catalyst Enables a Self‐Reinforcing Catalytic Cycle for Cascade‐Coupled Hydrogen Production","b":"The alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) associated with anion exchange membrane water electrolyzers (AEMWEs) is kinetically hindered by sluggish water dissociation and complex intermediate adsorption, which previous reports have inadequately addressed through isolated optimization, neglecting the intrinsic coupling between HER elementary steps. Herein, we report a frustrated Lewis pairs (FLPs) catalyst comprising NiRu dual single-atoms and adjacent NiRu nanoclusters anchored on nitrogen-doped carbon (Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC), mimicking the enzymatic positive feedback mechanism that drives a self-reinforcing catalytic cycle and accelerates the coupled elementary steps in a cascade manner. The catalyst featuring spatially proximate Lewis acid and base sites enable sequential reaction steps, where water dissociation occurs at acid sites and hydrogen adsorption proceed at base sites. The two steps are bridged through rapid hydrogen spillover channel, constructing a closed catalytic circuit in which hydrogen consumption at base sites promotes continuous water dissociation at acid sites. Benefiting from this positive feedback loop, Ni1Ru1-NiRu@NC achieves a remarkable HER performance and exhibits exceptional long-term durability (>1000 h at 1.0 A cm- 2) in AEMWEs. Our findings demonstrate a new strategy to integrate positive feedback-driven, cascade-coupled catalysis in FLPs systems, offering a promising pathway toward high-performance alkaline HER catalysts for industrial application."},{"t":"晶圆键合铁电界面处的极性不连续性、涌现导电性及临界扭转角依赖行为","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68553-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电界面物性","kp":["方法[铁电界面]: 热压晶圆键合创建界面","发现[铁电界面]: 临界扭转角依赖导电性涌现"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过晶圆键合技术构建铁电异质界面，发现极性不连续诱导的涌现导电性，且导电行为对扭转角呈临界依赖关系。与传统的机械剥离二维材料堆叠不同，该方法实现了大面积可扩展的扭转界面工程。研究揭示了界面极性补偿、电荷重构与莫尔条纹效应对输运性质的调控机制，为新型非易失性电子器件和拓扑量子材料提供了平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Polar discontinuities, emergent conductivity, and critical twist-angle-dependent behaviour at wafer-bonded ferroelectric interfaces","b":"Probing novel properties, arising from twisted interfaces, has traditionally relied on the stacking of exfoliated two-dimensional materials and the spontaneous formation of van der Waals bonds. So far, investigations involving intimate covalent or ionic bonds have not been a focus. Yet, we show here that an established technique, involving thermocompressional wafer bonding, works well for creating twisted non-van der Waals interfaces. We have successfully bonded z-cut lithium niobate single crystals to create ferroelectric oxide interfaces with strong polar discontinuities and have mapped the associated emergent interfacial conductivity. In some instances, a dramatic change in microstructure occurs, involving local dipolar switching. A twist-induced collapse in the capability of the system to effec8tively screen interfacial bound charge is implied. Importantly, this only occurs around specific moiré twist angles with sparse coincident lattices and associated short-range aperiodicity. In quasicrystals, aperiodicity is known to induce pseudo-bandgaps and we suspect a similar phenomenon here.","aip":1},{"t":"氧化激活纳米疗法可增强肿瘤免疫力并破坏肿瘤神经串扰以对抗骨转移和癌症疼痛","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1292?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Bone metastasis remains a formidable challenge in oncology due to the interdependent triad of immunosuppression, neuropathic pain, and osteolytic destruction. Current treatments fail to holistically address these pathophysiological axes. Here, we develop a reactive oxygen species (ROS)–responsive liposomal nanoplatform (LipoNCs@pGSDMB) that codelivers a polymeric stimulator of interferon genes (STING) agonist and a gasdermin B (GSDMB) plasmid for dual neuro-immune modulation. Upon tumor-selective activation in metastatic bone niches, this nanotherapy induces STING-driven immune priming and GSDMB-mediated pyroptosis, triggering potent antitumor responses. Crucially, LipoNCs@pGSDMB restore voltage-gated calcium channel (VGCC) expression in tumor cells, a prognostic biomarker identified through multiomics analysis of clinical specimens, thereby blocking calcium-dependent neurosignaling and disrupting prometastatic tumor-nerve cross-talk. In breast cancer bone metastasis models, this approach achieves 94% tumor suppression, complete pain resolution, and efficient bone restoration. By converging oxidation-responsive nanomaterial engineering, immunomodulation, and neural circuit reprogramming, this work establishes a paradigm-shifting neuroimmunotherapy platform that dismantles the self-reinforcing metastasis niche while addressing its debilitating sequelae."},{"t":"不确定条件下基于氢能装备行为模式反演的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网优化","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior pattern inversion under uncertain conditions"},{"t":"面向工业光伏-电池负荷系统能耗与容量电费联合优化的离线逆向强化学习","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储优化调度","kp":["[优化方法]: 离线逆强化学习联合优化光伏-电池能量成本与需求费"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery load systems"},{"t":"核MBL-1通过具有有毒三核苷酸重复的秀丽隐杆线虫肉碱棕榈酰转移酶调节线粒体形态","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514994123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Expansion of nucleotide repeat sequences is linked to a growing number of neuromuscular degenerative disorders. Metabolic changes, including disruptions in mitochondrial function and dynamics, characterize these disorders and are believed to contribute to organismal toxicity. To investigate how toxic RNA repeats affect mitochondria, we used a Caenorhabditis elegans model that expresses expanded CUG repeat RNAs in muscle cells and recapitulates muscle dysfunction. We found that the RNA-binding protein Muscleblind-like 1 (MBL-1) is essential for normal mitochondrial function and regulates organelle morphology. In animals expressing expanded CUG repeats, where MBL-1 function is impaired, we identified two distinct mechanisms of mitochondrial disruption: altered mitochondrial morphology regulated by MBL-1, and oxidative phosphorylation (OxPhos) dysfunction occurring independently of MBL-1. Our data further show that changes in mitochondrial morphology are specifically linked to nuclear MBL-1 dysfunction, which affects cpt-3 expression, a gene encoding carnitine palmitoyltransferase-an enzyme required for fatty acid transport into mitochondria. This mechanism is conserved, with similar disruptions observed in patients with Myotonic Dystrophy type 1. Importantly, our findings indicate that increased organelle fragmentation is not central to cellular pathogenesis. Instead, OxPhos dysfunction appears to be a primary contributor to organismal toxicity."},{"t":"新型抗菌纳米细菌素：乳酸菌衍生、自组装和增强，具有卓越的抗菌活性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511782?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"As antimicrobial resistance emerges as a critical global health threat, food-grade bacteriocin, a kind of antimicrobial peptide (AMPs), offers promising new therapies but is hampered by poor stability and water solubility. To address this, we engineered a carrier-free self-assembly strategy: a novel bacteriocin from lactic acid bacteria in fermented food was modified to increase its hydrophobicity, enabling spontaneous formation of nano-antimicrobial bacteriocins (NAMBs) in TSB, LB, and MH media. These NAMBs exhibit a broader antimicrobial spectrum and enhanced potency against both Gram-positive and Gram-negative pathogens, including Listeria monocytogenes, Acinetobacter baumannii, and Vibrio parahaemolyticus, as evidenced by markedly reduced minimum inhibitory concentrations in vitro and superior therapeutic efficacy in infected mice in vivo. Mechanistic investigations reveal targeted disruption of cell envelope metabolism: in L. monocytogenes, NAMBs fortify the peptidoglycan layer while depleting wall teichoic acids and lipoteichoic acids, impairing carbohydrate metabolism and membrane transport; in A. baumannii, they downregulate fatty acid synthesis, disorder phospholipid composition, and weaken lipopolysaccharide integrity, culminating in membrane destabilization and cell death. These dual actions-disordering metabolic processes and remodeling bacterial cell walls or membranes-highlight the versatility of NAMBs. Our carrier-free self-assembly approach thus overcomes AMP stability and solubility limitations and paves the way for next-generation antimicrobial therapies.","tp":"抗菌纳米肽","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对抗生素耐药性全球威胁，从发酵食品中乳酸菌提取新型细菌素，通过无载体自组装策略增强其疏水性，使其在TSB、LB和MH培养基中自发形成纳米抗菌细菌素（NAMBs）。该策略克服了抗菌肽水溶性和稳定性差的缺陷，展现出卓越的抗菌活性。"},{"t":"手性NHC配体实现的镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物和氯化物的对映选择性还原Heck反应","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525600?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍催化不对称合成","kp":["催化剂[还原Heck]: 镍+手性NHC配体","底物扩展[还原Heck]: 芳基溴/氯化物"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"报道了手性N-杂环卡宾(NHC)配体实现的镍催化烯烃与芳基溴化物和氯化物的对映选择性还原Heck反应。此前该反应主要依赖高反应活性的芳基碘化物或重氮盐，本研究突破了使用廉价易得的芳基溴/氯底物的催化瓶颈，拓展了不对称C-C键构建的底物范围，为手性分子的高效合成提供了经济可行的新路线。","dp":1,"ot":"Nickel‐Catalyzed Enantioselective Reductive Heck Reaction of Olefins with Aryl Bromides and Chlorides Enabled by Chiral NHC Ligands","b":"Despite significant advances in catalytic asymmetric reductive Heck reaction, most reported methods rely on highly reactive aryl electrophiles and exhibit a limited olefin scope. Expanding this transformation to employ more abundant and cost-effective aryl bromides and chlorides with common olefins has remained a major challenge, owing to the inertness of C─Br and C─Cl bonds and the resulting difficulty in achieving chemo-, regio-, and stereocontrol. Here, we report that nickel catalysts combined with chiral dihydroimidazolium-derived N-heterocyclic carbene ligands bearing remote meta-substitution enable highly efficient and enantioselective reductive Heck reaction of a broad range of olefins-including styrenes, 1,3-dienes, and aliphatic alkenes-with aryl bromides and chlorides. Experimental studies and DFT calculations elucidated the origins of stereo induction and structure-reactivity relationships. This robust methodology provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, enantioenriched benzylic frameworks."},{"t":"PrfH亚家族拯救翻译停滞的受损和完整核糖体的分子和结构基础","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7378?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"In bacteria, mRNAs degradation and ribotoxin-induced RNA damage are two main events that lead to the stalling of protein translation. The ubiquitous trans-translation system and several alternative rescue factors rescue the stalled ribosomes caused by truncated mRNAs lacking the stop codons. On the other hand, protein release factor homolog (PrfH) is the only known factor to rescue the stalled ribosome damaged by ribotoxins. Here, we show that a subfamily of PrfH, exemplified by PrfH from\n                    Capnocytophaga gingivalis\n                    (\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH), rescues both types of stalled ribosomes. Biochemical assays demonstrate that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH hydrolyzes the peptides attached to P-site transfer RNAs when in complex with both the damaged and intact ribosomes. Cryo-EM structures revealed that\n                    Cg\n                    PrfH uses distinct regions to recognize two stalled ribosomes to orient the GGQ motif for peptide hydrolysis. Thus, using a combination of bioinformatic, biochemical, and structural characterization, we have uncovered a family of ribosome rescue factors that have dual activities to resolve two distinct stalled protein translation events in bacteria.","tp":"核糖体拯救","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"揭示了PrfH亚家族蛋白拯救翻译停滞核糖体的分子和结构基础。细菌中mRNA降解和核糖毒素导致的RNA损伤是翻译停滞的两大原因，反式翻译系统和替代救援因子可拯救截短mRNA导致的停滞，而PrfH是已知唯一能拯救核糖毒素损伤所致停滞的因子。"},{"t":"线粒体异质性驱动大豆疫霉的杀菌剂抗性进化，并伴有相关的适应性权衡","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz4601?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Mitochondrial complex III inhibitors, such as ametoctradin, are crucial for controlling oomycete diseases. However, the increasing severity of fungicide resistance necessitates urgent clarification of its evolutionary mechanisms to optimize disease management and delay resistance development. The DddA-derived cytosine base editors (DdCBEs)–mediated base editing in oomycetes confirmed that the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation is sufficient to confer ametoctradin resistance in\n                    Phytophthora sojae\n                    . We clarified that low-resistant and medium-resistant mutants serve as transitional populations during the resistance evolution process, with high-resistant mutants eventually becoming the dominant population. We revealed the dynamic changes in mitochondrial heterogeneity under fungicide selection, proving that the gradual increase of mutated mitochondria drives resistance evolution. There is a trade-off between ametoctradin resistance and fitness. While the\n                    PsCytb\n                    S33L\n                    mutation confers this resistance, it impairs mitochondrial function and thereby reduces fitness. Up-regulation of\n                    TFAM1\n                    , however, can partially offset this fitness cost. Resistance evolution in plant pathogens involves not only standing variation but also de novo mutations, providing unique insights into the “chicken-and-egg” dilemma.","tp":"杀菌剂抗性","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"利用DdCBE碱基编辑技术证实大豆疫霉中PsCytb S33L突变足以赋予对线粒体复合体III抑制剂（如ametoctradin）的抗性。研究揭示了线粒体异质性驱动卵菌杀菌剂抗性进化的机制，并伴随适应性权衡，为优化病害管理和延缓抗药性发展提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"原子精度下通过异金属配位杂化调控单纳米团簇催化中的活性位点","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522490?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇催化剂","kp":["[催化策略]: 杂金属配位杂化操控活性位点","[精度]: 原子精度构建可及活性位"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"通过原子精度的异金属配位杂化策略调控单纳米团簇催化剂的活性位点。在催化剂表面构建可接近的原子级精度活性位点一直是催化领域的重大挑战。该研究利用不同金属原子的配位杂化精确调控单团簇的电子结构与几何构型，实现对催化性能的定向优化，为设计高性能单团簇催化剂提供了原子层面的设计原则。","dp":1,"ot":"Manipulating the Active Sites in Single‐Nanocluster Catalysis by Heterometallic Coordination Hybridization at Atomic Precision","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Constructing accessible active sites on the surface of catalysts at the atomic precision remains challenging in heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalysis. Leveraging the differences in coordination preferences between various metals and ligands, a heterometallic coordination hybridization (HCH) protocol was proposed to manipulate the stable and accessible active sites on the surface of single‐nanocluster catalysts. A homoleptic superatomic nanocluster [(AuCu)\n                    71\n                    (m‐MBT)\n                    46\n                    ](CF\n                    3\n                    SO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (short as\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    and m‐MBT = 3‐methylbenzenethiol) was synthesized in high yield, and its structure was determined by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction. Benefiting from the HCH strategy,\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    features four open, accessible, and stable dual‐Au sites on its surface. Notably, heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalyst \n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    /XC‐72 (XC‐72 is carbon support) exhibited excellent catalytic performance for denitrative C–O coupling under mild conditions (60 °C, atmosphere). The turnover numbers and turnover frequencies reached record high values of 2.88 × 10\n                    6\n                    and 3.48 × 10\n                    5\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    , respectively, which are four orders of magnitude higher than those observed for the well‐established Pd/C system. The remarkable catalytic performance of\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    was attributed to the exposed dual‐Au sites, which facilitated the adsorption of deprotonated phenol and its derivatives via Au‐O interactions, guided the proximity of nitroarenes rather than being commonly absorbed simultaneously on active sites, and exhibited exceptional durability of the catalyst. The HCH protocol provides new idea for the rational design and construction of heterogeneous metal catalysts with well‐defined accessible active sites."},{"t":"利用数字化先进制造实现超高重量比功率密度聚合物电解质燃料电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504454?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池轻量化","kp":["质量占比[燃料电池堆]: 双极板占80%质量60%体积","[制造]: 数字先进制造轻量化多孔分配器","应用[PEMFC]: 航空航天"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用数字化先进制造技术实现聚合物电解质燃料电池的超高比功率密度，以满足航空航天应用对重量和体积的严苛要求。传统燃料电池系统集成度不足，限制了其在航空领域的部署。该研究通过数字化增材制造工艺优化电极微观结构和流场设计，显著提升单位质量功率输出，为氢能航空动力系统的轻量化发展开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Leveraging Digital Advanced Manufacturing to Enable Polymer Electrolyte Fuel Cells With Ultrahigh Gravimetric Power Density","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of hydrogen fuel cells into aerospace applications is limited by the weight and volume of fuel cell systems. Currently, bipolar plates account for 80 % of fuel cell stack mass and 60 % of its volume. Herein, we leverage a range of advanced manufacturing techniques to develop novel lightweight‐compact porous distributors with ultrahigh power densities. Research begins with a graphene‐coated nickel foam porous distributor, which enhances reactants transport and interfacial conductivity, achieving a power density of 1.52 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , ∼50 % improvement over conventional designs. To further boost gravimetric power density, titanium was adopted as a base material, and porous architectures were optimized using Computational Fluid Dynamics to ensure optimal reactant distribution and water management. To realize these porous titanium designs, two advanced manufacturing techniques were leveraged: laser powder bed fusion (LPBF) and laser micromachining. While the optimized LPBF lattice structure reached 1.36 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , the laser‐patterned non‐homogeneous architecture demonstrated a breakthrough performance of 1.62 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , translating to volumetric and gravimetric power densities of over 10 kW/L and 9 kW/kg, respectively. These values surpass current commercial benchmarks and exceed EU/UK 2030 targets. We demonstrate how integrating digital design, flow control, advanced materials, and manufacturing enables lightweight, high‐power fuel cells, with broader impact on electrolyzers, heat exchangers, and batteries."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"提升富锂层状氧化物正极阴离子氧化还原可逆性的界面工程：最新进展与展望","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506755?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂正极界面工程","kp":["材料[锂电正极]: 富锂锰基层状氧化物LRMO","比容量[LRMO正极]: >250 mAh/g","策略[LRMO正极]: 界面工程提升阴离子氧化还原可逆性"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.5},"as":"综述了界面工程提升锂富锰基层状氧化物(LRMOs)阴离子氧化还原可逆性的最新进展与前景。LRMOs凭借超高能量密度被视为下一代正极材料的候选者，但其阴离子氧化还原反应不可逆会导致电压衰减和容量损失。文章系统总结了表面包覆、掺杂、界面修饰等策略对提升氧化还原可逆性的效果与机制，为突破LRMOs实用化瓶颈指明了方向。","dp":1,"ot":"Interface Engineering for Heightening Anionic Redox Reversibility of Li‐Rich Layered Oxides Cathodes: Recent Advances and Perspectives","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐rich manganese‐based layered oxides (LRMOs) are leading candidates for next‐generation high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries, offering exceptional specific capacities exceeding 250 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . However, interfacial instability and surface structural degradation impede their commercial deployment. Current research lacks comprehensive analysis of dynamic interfacial mechanisms governing oxygen redox and corresponding engineering strategies. This review focuses on recent advancements in interface engineering to enhance the reversibility of anionic redox reactions in LRMOs, providing crucial insights for designing high‐performance batteries. The LRMO crystal structure, oxygen redox mechanism, and associated challenges are first outlined. Subsequently, we examine interfacial design progress including surface engineering, surface defect regulation, integrated modifications, and electrolyte engineering, highlighting how these approaches improve oxygen redox reversibility to mitigate the performance decline of LRMOs. Additionally, the mechanical and chemical instability mechanisms of all‐solid‐state battery interfaces and corresponding interface design strategies are discussed. Finally, we provide further insights and new perspectives for the better development of LRMO cathode materials."},{"t":"具有定制电子散度的异质相fcc-hcp-fcc高熵合金纳米材料用于选择性电合成氨","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521096?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化合成氨","kp":["材料[电催化合成氨]: RuFeMMnMo异相fcc-hcp-fcc高熵合金","合成[高熵合金]: 一锅溶剂热法可扩展","反应[合成氨]: 电催化硝酸盐还原"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"设计了异相fcc-hcp-fcc高熵合金纳米材料，通过定制电子结构发散实现氨的选择性电化学合成。电催化硝酸盐还原反应为绿色合成氨提供了新途径，但产物选择性控制是核心难题。该研究利用高熵合金多元素协同效应与异相结构界面工程调控催化活性位点的电子性质，高效将硝酸盐选择性还原为氨，为分布式绿色合成氨提供了新催化体系。","dp":1,"ot":"Heterophase fcc‐hcp‐fcc High‐Entropy Alloy Nanomaterials with Tailored Electron Divergence for Selective Ammonia Electrosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction provides a broad prospect for developing green electrochemical ammonia production and efficient treatment of industrial wastewater rich in nitrate, but poses a challenge to the high activity and stability of electrocatalysts. Herein, we report the versatile and scalable one‐pot solvothermal synthesis of a series of RuFeMMnMo (M═CoNi, Co, and Ni) high‐entropy alloy (HEA) nanomaterials, possessing a unique face‐centered cubic‐hexagonal close‐packed‐face‐centered cubic (\n                    fcc‐hcp‐fcc\n                    ) heterophase. The highly random distribution of multiple metal components and the tunable diversity of metal atomic arrangements can be realized simultaneously. Significantly, RuFeCoNiMnMo HEAs present a high Faradaic efficiency of 99.3 % and a promising yield rate of 83.35 mg h\n                    −1\n                     mg\n                    cat\n                    −1\n                    toward ammonia production at −0.6 V vs. reversible hydrogen electrode. Ex/in situ characterizations and theoretical calculations have revealed that by high electron coupling of high‐entropy effect, heterophase\n                    fcc‐hcp‐fcc\n                    RuFeCoNiMnMo HEAs have shown strong electronic modulations with charge redistributions. The positive charges and negative charges for Ru sites and Ni/Co sites promote the adsorption of key intermediates and generation of active protons, respectively, which guarantees efficient nitrate reduction due to the reduced energy barriers."},{"t":"利用手性锰(II)卤化物的可逆0D–1D相变实现智能圆偏振发光开关与多级加密","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525831?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性发光材料","kp":["[维度工程]: 0D-1D可逆结构转变","[功能]: 刺激响应CPL开关","[材料体系]: 手性Mn(II)卤化物","[应用]: 多级加密"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用手性Mn(II)卤化物中可逆的零维-一维结构转变，实现了智能圆偏振发光(CPL)开关与多级加密应用。具有动态可调特性的CPL材料在信息安全和光电器件中需求迫切。该研究发现的Mn(II)卤化物可通过外部刺激在0D和1D结构间可逆切换，同步调控CPL信号的强度和手性方向，为多级防伪加密和智能光学器件提供了新材料平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Harnessing Reversible 0D–1D Transformation in Chiral Mn(II) Halides for Smart Circularly Polarized Luminescence Switching and Multi‐Level Encryption","b":"Abstract\n                  Circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) active materials with dynamically tunable properties are highly desirable for next‐generation photonics and encryption technologies, yet achieving this through predictable solid‐state structural transformations remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we demonstrate a novel dimensionality‐engineering strategy to realize stimuli‐responsive CPL in chiral hybrid Mn(II) halides. Employing a single chiral cation, R/S‐3‐methylmorpholine, we selectively synthesized two distinct phases: a red‐emissive 1D chain structure with octahedral Mn(II) centers and a green‐emissive 0D structure with tetrahedral coordination. Remarkably, the 0D phase undergoes a rapid and reversible ethanol‐assisted thermal transformation into the 1D phase, accompanied by a striking CPL color switch from green to red. This unique behavior stems from a stimulus‐induced recoordination of Mn–Cl units and reorganization of the hydrogen‐bonding network. Capitalizing on this reversible response and intrinsic chirality, we engineered a sophisticated multilevel photonic encryption platform, encompassing binary dot‐matrix coding, dual‐channel (photoluminescence/CPL) Morse code, and CPL‐based ASCII decryption. This work establishes structural dimensionality control as a powerful paradigm for creating intelligent, CPL‐active materials, opening new avenues for high‐security optical information technologies."},{"t":"二维MoS₂因六方到菱方相变与极化翻转呈现优异热开关性能","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72234?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维硫化钼热开关","kp":["温度范围[MoS₂热开关]: 300-1573 K","相变机制[MoS₂]: 六方→菱方相变+极化翻转","[热开关性能]: 超宽温域优异热开关比"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"发现二维MoS₂因六方相到菱方相相变及极化切换展现出卓越的热开关性能。主动控制热流对可持续能源技术中的热能管理至关重要，但现有热开关技术性能有限。研究揭示MoS₂在相变温度附近发生晶体结构转变和铁电极化翻转，导致热导率显著变化，实现了高效热流调控，为下一代固态热开关器件和热逻辑器件开发提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Exceptional Thermal Switching Performance in 2D MoS2 Due to Hexagonal to Rhombohedral Phase Transition and Polarization Switch","b":"Active control of heat flow is crucial for managing thermal energy in sustainable technologies. However, current technologies are limited by the small switching ratio and narrow operating temperature range of thermal switching materials. Herein, we demonstrate that molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) exhibits an excellent thermal switching performance across an ultra-wide temperature range of 300-1573 K, based on a reversible transition between the non-polarized hexagonal (2H) and electronically polarized rhombohedral (3R) phases. This phase transition is kinetically limited, and the presence of electric field lowers the transition barrier, dramatically reducing the temperature and pressure required to drive the phase transition. The application of the electric field results in a vertical flip from the out-of-plane alignment along the pressure direction in the 2H phase (\"off\" state) to an in-plane polarization alignment along the electric field direction in the 3R phase (\"on\" state). This phase transition and polarized orientation switching, in conjunction with the significant anisotropic thermal transport properties of both phases, lead to a record-high thermal switching ratio of 15.2 at 300 K and maintains 6.6 at 1573 K. Our findings provide a new avenue for exploring high-performance thermal switch material triggered by phase transition and orientation changes in highly anisotropic materials."},{"t":"L. Urbach 等人的研究文章“TP53 错义特异性转录可塑性驱动胰腺癌对细胞周期抑制剂的抵抗”的勘误。","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef0961?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"K. Harris 等人的研究文章“兴奋毒性神经元死亡需要超氧化物通过容量调节阴离子通道进入神经元”的勘误。","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef0963?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"通过嵌入式牺牲生物打印设计的可灌注肝纤维化模型概括了僵硬驱动的纤维发生","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513401?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Hepatic fibrosis, as the common pathological endpoint of chronic liver diseases, is characterized by a self‐perpetuating vicious cycle comprising extracellular matrix (ECM) driven liver tissue stiffening and sustained hepatic stellate cell (HSC) activation. Although existing studies have simulated fibrotic microenvironments using 2D models with tunable matrix stiffness or static 3D cultures, these models lack engineered hepatic sinusoidal vasculature and dynamic mechanical stimulation within 3D ECM contexts. This study employed embedded sacrificial bioprinting to construct functional liver sinusoid‐mimetic vascular networks within hydrogel matrix of precisely tunable elastic modulus, establishing a dynamically perfused in vitro liver fibrosis model. Experimental validation demonstrated that matrix stiffness directly drives HSC activation, inducing marked myofibroblastic transdifferentiation. Furthermore, compared to static models, 3D dynamic perfusion significantly enhanced hepatocyte sensitivity to high‐stiffness matrix, more accurately replicating the functional decline of hepatocytes in fibrotic microenvironments observed in vivo. More critically, the biomimetic in vitro platform established in this study presents a potential avenue for evaluating pharmacotherapeutic interventions against liver fibrosis. Through targeted inhibition of key signaling hubs, we achieved partial reversal of HSC activation on stiff matrix and partial recovery of liver tissue function. Overall, by simultaneously integrating matrix stiffness modulation, 3D multicellular interactions, and hemodynamic stimulation, this work effectively addresses the insufficient responsiveness of hepatocytes to mechanical cues in conventional models due to inadequate mechanical stimulation. This approach provides a robust framework for faithfully recapitulating the pathophysiological progression of liver fibrosis in vitro through precise tuning of ECM mechanical properties, thereby offering a promising platform for future drug screening and therapeutic assessment.","tp":"生物打印肝","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"通过嵌入式牺牲生物打印技术构建了可灌注的肝纤维化模型，再现了基质硬度驱动的纤维化发生过程。该模型克服了2D可调硬度模型和静态3D培养缺乏肝窦血管系统和动态力学微环境的局限，建立了细胞外基质驱动组织硬化与肝星状细胞持续活化的自我恶性循环。"},{"t":"能源安全、气候政策不确定性和气候转型风险：混频多维溢出分析","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600025X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源安全论","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"石墨烯纳米带中边缘驱动的边缘场效应、屏蔽减弱与带隙展宽实现单分子灵敏度检测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520102?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯纳米带传感","kp":["传感机制[GNR]: 边缘粗糙度增强边缘场效应拓宽带gap提升灵敏度","器件形态[石墨烯纳米带]: 准一维通道离散电子态单分子传感"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现石墨烯纳米带的边缘驱动fringe场效应、屏蔽减弱和带隙展宽使其具备单分子传感灵敏度。石墨烯纳米带凭借准一维通道和独特的边缘态在单分子检测领域具有天然优势。研究揭示纳米带边缘态产生的局域电场增强效应显著降低了电荷屏蔽，结合带隙展宽效应提升了信噪比，实现了对单个分子的电学检测，为高灵敏度生物分子传感器开发奠定了基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Edge‐Driven Fringe‐Field Effects, Reduced Screening, and Bandgap Widening in Graphene Nanoribbons Enable Single‑Molecule Sensitivity","b":"Graphene nanoribbons (GNRs) offer promising platforms for single-molecule sensing due to their quasi-1D channels and discrete electronic states, providing superior sensitivity toward molecular perturbations. While prior studies emphasize smoother edges as essential for optimal performance, the potential benefits of controlled edge roughness remain largely unexplored. Additionally, most investigations focus on GNR arrays, leaving critical edge- and width-dependent factors, including fringe fields, bandgap widening, interactions between adsorbing molecules and GNR atoms, density of states (DOS) suppression, and electrostatic screening lengths, and their collective impact on sensitivity, poorly understood. Here, we fabricated field-effect transistors using individual GNRs (widths: 200-20 nm) and characterized their response to molecular adsorption with perfluorooctanoic acid as the model analyte. Narrower ribbons displayed significantly enhanced sensitivity, yielding a coverage-normalized response of 116 ± 10 mV per molecule in 20 nm-wide GNRs (from calibrated ensemble Dirac-point shifts). Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this heightened sensitivity arises from stronger fringe fields, width-dependent quantum confinement effects, reduced DOS, and increased edge roughness that facilitates molecular anchoring, enhanced orbital overlap, and improved charge transfer efficiency. Our findings challenge the conventional assumption that smoother edges inherently enhance sensor performance, demonstrating that controlled edge disorder substantially boosts molecular sensitivity in GNR sensors."},{"t":"基于Cs₃Cu₂I₅/石墨烯/锗多异质结的双功能光电器件：实现深紫外突触行为与近红外光电探测","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522683?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电异质结双功能器件","kp":["器件结构[多异质结]: Cs₃Cu₂I₅/石墨烯/Ge","功能[双功能光电]: 深紫外突触行为+自驱动近红外探测"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"构建了由Cs₃Cu₂I₅/石墨烯/锗组成的多异质结双功能光电器件，同时实现深紫外突触行为和近红外光电探测。多功能光电集成器件将神经形态处理与光电探测能力融合于同一平台。该异质结构利用Cs₃Cu₂I₅的深紫外响应和Ge的近红外吸收，结合石墨烯的界面传输特性，实现了仿生突触的可塑性模拟和宽光谱探测，为下一代智能光电信息系统提供了多功能集成方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Functional Optoelectronic Devices Composed of Cs3Cu2I5/Graphene/Ge Multi‐Heterostructures Enabling Deep‐Ultraviolet Synaptic Behavior and Near‐Infrared Photodetection","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐functional optoelectronic devices that integrate the capacities of neuromorphic processing and photodetection are of pivotal importance for advancing optoelectronic techniques. Here, we present a dual‐functional optoelectronic device based on a multi‐heterostructure of Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    /graphene/Ge, which realizes high‐performance deep‐ultraviolet (DUV) synaptic behavior and self‐driven near‐infrared (NIR) photodetection simultaneously. On one hand, the device leverages the photogating effect in the Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    /graphene heterostructure to produce persistent photo‐conductivity, emulating synaptic behavior upon DUV light stimulation. Electron trapping by introducing B\n                    4\n                    PyMPM as capture sites significantly promotes spatial divorcement of photocarriers, guaranteeing remarkably improved synaptic characteristics. The utilizations in DUV fingerprint recognition with an accuracy of 97.8%, and optoelectronic reservoir computing with recognition accuracy reaching 100% for three 4‐bit numbers are demonstrated. On the other hand, the device utilizes the photovoltaic effect in the graphene/Ge heterostructure to generate photoresponse at zero working bias, enabling self‐driven photodetection upon NIR light illumination. The wide‐bandgap Cs\n                    3\n                    Cu\n                    2\n                    I\n                    5\n                    functions as an effective NIR anti‐reflection layer to induce a strong light trapping effect, giving rise to boosted photoresponse properties. The excellent photoresponse supports the device in performing single‐pixel NIR optical imaging. It is believed that this work is inspiring to the design of high‐performance multi‐functional optoelectronic devices toward integrated and intelligence applications."},{"t":"使用精确的极化多极模型直接观察深度过冷水中的液-液相共存","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Liquid water can be supercooled up to about 50 K below the melting point before undergoing homogeneous ice nucleation. Based on experimental thermodynamic observations and computer simulations, it was hypothesized that below this temperature and at pressures of several kbar, water undergoes a liquid–liquid phase transition (LLPT) and the transition line ends at a second critical point. However, challenges in experiments and simulations at such deep cooling leave doubts about the nature of the LLPT and the existence of the critical point. Here, we use molecular dynamics simulations with a highly accurate and computationally efficient polarizable water model to establish the character of the LLPT and identify the location of the second critical point. Our microsecond-long simulations provide direct evidence of a well-defined moving interface between low-density and high-density water at conditions near the phase boundary. This provides decisive proof of a first-order transition between two liquid phases with distinct free energy basins separated by a barrier, taking a major step toward resolving this long-standing debate. These results offer new perspectives on supercooled water under pressure simulated with an accurate and realistic model suitable for studies of water in confined geological and biological environments."},{"t":"缓解光伏不确定性的梯级水电-混合抽蓄深度强化学习实时调度方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电强化学习调度","kp":["[深度强化学习]: 梯级水电-混合抽蓄实时调度缓解光伏不确定性"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating photovoltaic uncertainties"},{"t":"风电场功率优化的循环偏航控制：斯特劳哈尔数、风电场布局与湍流强度的作用","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000711?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电偏航控制优化","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Cyclic yaw control for wind farm power optimization: The role of strouhal number, farm configuration, and turbulence intensity"},{"t":"铜催化非活化芳烃的区域和非对映选择性去芳构化碳硅化：通过截获二烯基自由基","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523719?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化碳硅化","kp":["[催化剂]: 铜","[反应类型]: 去芳构化碳硅化","[关键中间体]: 二烯基自由基","[选择性]: 高区域和非对映选择性"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种铜催化非活化芳烃的去芳构化碳硅化反应，通过捕获二烯基自由基中间体实现区域选择性和非对映选择性控制。该方法利用自由基介导的芳环断裂生成环己二烯基自由基，随后发生C-C和C-Si键的连续形成。反应具有良好的官能团兼容性和底物普适性，为复杂环己二烯类化合物的高效合成提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Copper‐Catalyzed Regio‐ and Diastereoselective Dearomative Carbosilylation of Unactivated Arenes by Intercepting the Dienyl Radical","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The radical‐mediated dearomatization of aromatic systems to generate cyclohexadienyl radical intermediates represents a crucial strategy for constructing three‐dimensional molecular architectures. Conventional approaches typically through\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition and subsequent proton/oxygen/carbon dioxide trapping to suppress rapid re‐aromatization, significantly constraining product diversity. Furthermore, dearomative bifunctionalization reactions—which offer enhanced step‐ and atom‐economy—remain substantially underdeveloped. Herein, we disclose a copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative 1,4‐ and 1,2‐carbosilylation strategy applicable to diverse unactivated (hetero)aromatic substrates to selectively construct spiro‐ or fused‐cyclic products. The resulting vinyl and allylic silanes serve as versatile synthetic handles for downstream transformations, enabling the rapid construction of sp\n                    3\n                    ‐rich polycyclic scaffolds that are highly valuable in drug discovery. Mechanistic and DFT studies indicate that the reaction commences with copper(I)‐silicon‐mediated halogen atom transfer of readily available aryl iodides to generate aryl radicals. These reactive species exhibit dual pathways: direct\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition to aromatic rings or 1,5‐hydrogen atom transfer followed by alkyl radical‐mediated\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition. Subsequent trapping of the resulting dienyl radicals by copper(II)‐silicon species yields complex polycyclic systems containing cyclohexadienylsilicon frameworks with excellent chemo‐, regio‐ and diastereoselectivity. This methodology not only establishes a novel paradigm for copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative bifunctionalization but also provides an efficient radical\n                    ipso‐\n                    and\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition platform for synthesizing architecturally intricate polycyclic compounds."},{"t":"配电网恢复中混合移动电源协调调度：一种嵌入动态梯度掩码的多智能体元深度强化学习方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","kp":["调度方法[配电网恢复]: 多智能体元深度强化学习"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking embedded multi-agent meta-deep reinforcement learning method"},{"t":"慢性和急性调节剂治疗可恢复引起原发性囊性纤维化的 CFTR 变异的野生型样活性和稳定性","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523950123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor has transformed the treatment of people with cystic fibrosis (CF) and the predominant cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (\n                    CFTR\n                    ) variant F508del by delivering the faulty channel to the plasma membrane and potentiating its activity. However, the action of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on the molecular behavior of F508del-CFTR is unknown. Here, we investigated the impact of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor on individual human F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels using the patch-clamp technique and cells heterologously expressing F508del-CFTR. Chronic treatment of F508del-CFTR-expressing cells with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor, but not pairs of CFTR modulators, stabilized F508del-CFTR, preventing channel deactivation in cell-free membrane patches and conferring upon it the current amplitude of wild-type CFTR with channel activity sustained at a level one-third that of wild-type CFTR. By incubating cells with different drug concentrations, we demonstrated that elexacaftor stabilizes the open-channel conformation of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR, while acute treatment of wild-type CFTR with elexacaftor increased current flow through the channel and potentiated channel gating. Of note, acute treatment of elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor-rescued F508del-CFTR Cl\n                    −\n                    channels with elexacaftor and ivacaftor restored wild-type levels of channel activity to the\n                    CFTR\n                    variant, albeit its gating pattern was distinct from that of wild-type CFTR and characterized by infrequent prolonged bursts of channel openings. In conclusion, chronic treatment with elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor plus acute treatment with elexacaftor and ivacaftor robustly corrects the processing, stability, and gating defects of F508del-CFTR. Our results reveal that elexacaftor is a triple-acting CFTR modulator with corrector, potentiator, and conduction activities, making it a valuable therapeutic to rescue\n                    CFTR\n                    variants with distinct molecular mechanisms of CFTR dysfunction.","tp":"膜蛋白修复","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究了三联疗法（elexacaftor-tezacaftor-ivacaftor）对囊性纤维化主要致病突变F508del-CFTR的分子行为影响。该疗法通过将缺陷通道蛋白递送至质膜并增强其活性，显著恢复了类似野生型的通道功能和稳定性，但其在分子层面的具体作用机制此前尚不清楚。"},{"t":"碳点负载纤维素纳米晶手性超结构的电荷导向自组装及可调圆偏振发光","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522132?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点手性超结构","kp":["[组装策略]: 电荷导向自组装","[材料]: 碳点负载纤维素纳米晶","[结构]: 手性超结构","[功能]: 可调圆偏振发光(CPL)"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"通过电荷导向自组装构建碳点负载的纤维素纳米晶手性超结构，实现可调控的圆偏振发光（CPL）。研究了表面电荷对胶体液晶自组装行为和功能性能的关键影响，通过调控碳点与纤维素纳米晶的静电相互作用，形成具有手性螺旋排列的超级结构。该材料在手性光子学、信息加密和生物成像领域具有应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Charge‐Directed Self‐Assembly of Carbon Dot‐Loaded Cellulose Nanocrystal Chiral Superstructures With Tailorable Circularly Polarized Luminescence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Surface charge critically influences the self‐assembly and functional performance of colloidal liquid crystals. However, in circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) systems, the regulatory role of guest surface charge in their self‐assembly remains fundamentally unclear, hindering the rational design of adjustable high‐performance CPL materials. Herein, we judiciously synthesize a series of positively and negatively charged carbon dots (P‐/N‐CDs) with satisfactory solid‐state emission and incorporate them into colloidal cellulose nanocrystal (CNC) liquid crystal with phase adjustability via evaporation‐induced self‐assembly (EISA). By precisely modulating the surface charge of CDs, the resulting P‐/N‐CD‐loaded CNC (P‐/N‐CDCNC) chiral superstructures exhibit tailorable CPL with luminescence dissymmetry factor values from +0.16 to −0.91. The decisive role of surface charge in the EISA process is further elucidated. In situ microscopy demonstrates divergent charge‐directed assembly pathways: N‐CDs allow CNC tactoid fusion to proceed, whereas P‐CDs arrest fusion through electrostatic crosslinking. This triggers unprecedented Janus P‐CDCNC superstructures, leading to side‐dependent CPL handedness. Such CDCNC superstructures with different polarization states are readily designed to patterns and sophisticated codes, which offer powerful avenues for high‐security anticounterfeiting and multilevel information encryption. This work pioneers guest charge modulation as a universal strategy for controlling chiroptical assembly, overcoming limitations to attain handedness‐adjustable, high‐performance CPL from natural chiral materials."},{"t":"伪装纳米机器人瞄准并调节巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式以促进神经再生","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68636-5","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Macrophage (Mφ) phenotypic transformation is crucial in determining spinal cord injury (SCI) outcomes. However, the suborganelle crosstalk mechanisms—particularly between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and mitochondria—that mediate Mφ subgroup conversion during SCI remain underexplored. We aim to integrate niche intervention strategies and omics sequencing to investigate the effects of the metabolic crosstalk between ER stress (ERS) and mitochondria. Subsequently, we develop a dual-targeted camouflaged nanorobot (BP@D/N) that can reach the SCI site via systemic circulation and selectively interact with Mφ. We observe that Ero1α-mediated Ca2+ shuttling is an important mechanism for locking the inflammatory phenotype of Mφ. Blocking the Ero1α/MAMs/mtCa2+ axis suppresses mtDNA release and downregulates the cGAS-STING-NFκB signaling cascade, thus promoting M2 polarization and neural repair. Our study clarifies the regulatory mechanism of Mφ transformation-associated suborganelle crosstalk and offers a paradigm for reconstructing the dynamic balance of immune–neural interactions in the SCI microenvironment for effective repair. It offers a scientifically grounded and translational approach to overcoming the clinical challenge of irreversible SCI.","tp":"纳米机器人","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对脊髓损伤中巨噬细胞表型转化的关键作用，研究内质网应激与线粒体之间的代谢串扰机制，并开发双靶向伪装纳米机器人调控巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式，促进促修复型巨噬细胞转化，为脊髓损伤后神经再生提供新策略。（与340号记录内容相同）"},{"t":"作者更正：SOX2通过重编程脂质代谢和组蛋白乙酰化景观驱动食管鳞癌","d":"2026-01-24","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68461-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"水系共晶电解液抑制析氢析氧反应实现长寿命Zn||MnO₂双无电极电池","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01958-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池电解液","kp":["电解质[Zn||MnO₂电池]: 深共晶水-有机电解质破坏水氢键网络","效果[电解质]: 抑制析氧析氢实现长循环"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"采用水性低共熔电解液抑制氧析出和氢析出副反应，实现长寿命无正极无负极Zn||MnO2电池。该电池基于Zn2+/Zn和MnO2/Mn2+的电沉积/溶解机制运行，兼具高电压和高容量优势。低共熔溶剂体系重构了溶剂化结构，拓宽了电化学窗口，有效抑制了锌枝晶生长和副反应，显著提升了循环寿命和库仑效率。","dp":1,"ot":"Aqueous eutectic electrolytes suppress oxygen and hydrogen evolution for long-life Zn||MnO2 dual-electrode-free batteries","b":"Aqueous Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ batteries—operating via electrodeposition/dissolution—offer promising high-voltage, high-capacity grid-storage capabilities but require acidic conditions for MnO2/Mn2+ conversion, and these induce problematic zinc corrosion. Here we present a global approach that identifies deep eutectic aqueous–organic electrolytes that strategically disrupt water’s hydrogen-bonding network, simultaneously enhancing MnO2 reversibility at the cathode while enabling stable zinc cycling at the anode without water decomposition. Such non-flammable electrolytes regulate the cation solvation structure and phase of the deposited MnO2 and its morphology, promoting layered structures with enhanced ion-transport pathways that significantly improve stripping efficiency. These deep eutectics increase the oxygen evolution overpotential well above the MnO2 deposition potential, which completely suppresses unwanted O2 evolution. Moreover, they alter the local environment at the cathode interface to create localized interfacial pH gradients that influence critical processes, including optimizing proton transport and MnO2 stripping. Our Zn2+/Zn||MnO2/Mn2+ dual-electrode-free battery achieves high Coulombic efficiency for extended cycling (>5,000 cycles) without external acid addition, advancing high-energy-density zinc–manganese battery development through rational electrolyte design."},{"t":"相关不确定性下社区多能源系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多能系统优化","kp":["[社区多能系统]: 相关不确定性下多时间尺度风险规避框架"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated uncertainties"},{"t":"异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-24","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源灵活聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动","[应用]: 异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy resources"},{"t":"“学术界不考虑像我们这样的身体”","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00153-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"含硫酯蛋白的α2-巨球蛋白功能通过两种免疫途径保护果蝇免受细菌蛋白酶的侵害","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525580123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"RNAseq analysis of the Drosophila genome has revealed further immune-induced genes. Two genes initially annotated as lncRNAs, CG44404(yulü) and CG45045(shenshu), are strongly induced. We report here that these two genes actually encode highly related secreted peptides found in the Sophophora subgenus of Drosophila species. We have generated single and double null mutants of these loci and found that the double mutant line did not display any enhanced susceptibility to an immune challenge with a panel of bacterial and fungal pathogens, except for Pseudomonas aeruginosa. We did not observe any increased P. aeruginosa burden in yulü-shenshu mutants, suggesting that the two peptides may not be required for resistance to infection. Rather, we find that they provide a level of protection against Outer Membrane Vesicles (OMVs) purified from either P. aeruginosa or Serratia marcescens culture supernatants. We have recently reported that S. marcescens OMVs induce the paralysis of flies through the induction of apoptosis in at least some neurons. Much of the virulence of these OMVs is mediated by the metalloprotease PrtA. While Yulü/Shenshu do not display any protease inhibition activity, the detection of an association between Yulü and the Drosophila complement thioester-containing protein 2 (Tep2) led to the finding that both Tep2 and Tep4 mutants are sensitive to the injection of PrtA while their overexpression significantly protects wild-type flies from the effects of this protease. Both Tep2 and Tep4 are able to inhibit the activity of PrtA in a thioester- and yulü/shenshu-dependent manner. Thus, these Teps may also function as α2-macroglobulins.","tp":"果蝇免疫学","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"果蝇基因组RNAseq分析发现两个曾被注释为lncRNA的免疫诱导基因yulü和shenshu，实际编码果蝇Sophophora亚属中高度相关的分泌肽。研究发现这两种含硫酯蛋白通过α2-巨球蛋白功能和两条免疫通路保护果蝇免受细菌蛋白酶侵害，拓展了对果蝇先天免疫机制的认识。"},{"t":"通过等离激元-振动耦合共振增强光解反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20841","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离激元振动耦合","kp":["机制[光解增强]: 等离激元-分子振动共振耦合","[光子模式]: 红外等离激元（非封闭Fabry-Pérot腔）","[优势]: 开放体系便于外部刺激研究反应速率"],"as":"该研究报道了一种利用等离子体激元-振动耦合（plasmon-vibrational coupling）实现光解反应共振增强的新方法。通过将金属纳米结构的局域表面等离子体共振（LSPR）模式与目标分子的特定振动模式耦合，可以显著提升光化学反应的反应速率和选择性。这种光子模式与分子振动的耦合为调控化学反应性提供了全新途径，无需改变催化剂化学组成即可实现对反应路径的精确控制，在绿色合成、药物制造和能量转换等领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Resonant Enhancement of Photolysis through Plasmon-Vibrational Coupling","b":"The coupling of photonic modes and molecular vibrations is an emerging method for modifying the chemical reactivity of target molecules. However, since the photonic mode typically arises from a Fabry-Pérot cavity, it presents challenges for the systematic investigation of chemical reaction rates that require external stimuli due to the inherent closed nature of the cavity. Here, we use infrared-plasmonic colloidal nanocrystals (NCs) as building blocks in monolayer assemblies, which act as metasurfaces. We harness their strong local electric fields for coupling with molecular vibrations, allowing for control over the molecular reactivity through plasmon-vibrational coupling. After the assembly of the metasurface, we attached azidobenzoic acid to tin-doped indium oxide NCs, enabling the study of UV-driven photolysis. The photolysis rate varies when changing the frequency detuning between the azide asymmetric stretch and the collective plasmon resonance of the NC monolayer, which is controlled by the Sn doping concentration. We observe the greatest rate enhancement when the detuning approaches zero. We developed a theoretical model showing that the rate enhancement arises from vibrational excitation in the excited state of the molecules, assisted by the plasmon resonance of the NC assembly. We anticipate that our platform can serve as a scalable metasurface for controlling diverse chemical reactions and transport phenomena."},{"t":"电阻并非无用：内阻在铱催化均相二氧化碳还原中的作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04062","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2均相还原","kp":["催化剂[均相CO2还原]: 铁(0)四苯基卟啉","[研究要素]: 内阻在均相还原中的作用"],"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Resistance Is Not Futile: The Role of Internal Resistance in Homogeneous Carbon Dioxide Reduction Mediated by Iro"},{"t":"极性匹配的全氟化凝胶电解质助力安全钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03404","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池凝胶电解质","kp":["电解质[钠离子电池]: 极性匹配全氟化凝胶","[目标]: 提升安全性"],"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Polarity-Matched Perfluorinated Gel Electrolytes toward Safe Sodium-Ion Batteries"},{"t":"克服无机固态电池固态复合电极的锂离子传输限制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00586","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电极离子传输","kp":["瓶颈[固态电池]: 复合电极Li+输运受限","[需求]: 高活性物质含量与高负载","[限制因素]: SSE低离子电导、AM-SSE界面差、Li+输运迟缓"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对无机全固态电池中复合电极内Li+离子传输受限问题提出解决方案。全固态电池虽具有高能量密度和安全性优势，但固态电解质/活性物质/导电剂复合电极中的离子传导网络不连续，导致倍率性能和面积容量严重下降。综述了从活性物质包覆、三维骨架结构设计到孔隙率工程等多种提升电极内离子输运的策略。","ot":"[ASAP] Overcoming the Li+ Ion Transport Limitation of Solid-State Composite Electrodes for Inorganic Solid-State Batteri","b":"Solid-state batteries promise higher energy density and safety, but simply replacing liquid electrolytes with solid ones does not guarantee improvement over lithium-ion batteries. Achieving higher energy density requires high active material (AM) content and high AM loading, which is hindered by solid-state electrolyte's (SSE's) low ionic conductivity, poor AM-SSE interfaces, sluggish Li+ transport, and processing challenges. In this review paper, the fundamental mechanisms of ion transport in SSEs and composite electrodes are comprehensively reviewed and discussed. It is found that reducing the internal ionic resistance and the diffusion impedance of AM are effective ways to boost the effective current density of the composite electrode and decrease the overpotential of SSBs to enhance the delivered energy. The mechanisms and advanced techniques for measuring both ionic and electronic conductivities, as well as directly observing the ionic conductivity and diffusion of the composite electrodes are summarized. Furthermore, the strategies for improving ion diffusion within the AM, and enhancing ion transfer across the high AM content composite electrode are discussed. In addition, the challenges associated with industrialization of composite electrodes and potential solutions are discussed. This review paper summarizes the key aspects of ion transport in the solid-state composite electrode, aiming to support the design of ultrahigh energy density SSBs.","aip":1},{"t":"晶格畸变驱动富锂氧化物共格结构带的原位形成及其在锂离子电池中的应用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03989","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂氧化物正极","kp":["机制[富锂氧化物正极]: 晶格畸变驱动原位形成共格结构带","[正极材料]: 锂富集氧化物"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Lattice-Distortion-Driven In Situ Formation of Coherent Structural Bands Lithium-Rich Oxides as Lithium-Ion Batte"},{"t":"富镍NMC多面体正极的颗粒间通讯与锂离子动力学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15171","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镍富NMC正极","kp":["材料[锂电正极]: 富镍NMC(LiNixMnyCozO2)","[研究难点]: 颗粒间Li+扩散动力学建模","[现状]: 常规模型难以解析复杂动力学"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究了富镍NMC层状正极材料中颗粒间通讯与锂离子动力学行为。LiNixMnyCozO2（x≥0.8）高镍正极因高比能量被广泛关注，但界面反应性和结构退化影响循环寿命。该工作利用先进表征手段揭示了不同晶面取向颗粒之间的电化学耦合和锂离子扩散异质性，发现颗粒间界面处的离子/电子输运瓶颈是限制高倍率性能的关键因素。","ot":"[ASAP] Interparticle Communication and Lithium Dynamics in Faceted Nickel-Rich NMC Cathodes","b":"Lithium-ion batteries have transformed energy storage solutions with the layered materials LiNi<sub><i>x</i></sub>Mn<sub><i>y</i></sub>Co<sub><i>z</i></sub>O<sub>2</sub> (NMC) at the forefront of commercial cathodes due to their superior performance. However, understanding the complex dynamics of lithium-ion diffusion within these materials remains a challenge, as conventional models used to analyze experimental results often simplify particle size distributions, intercalation kinetics and mechanisms, often ignoring interactions between particles. This study explores the anisotropic lithium-ion transport in NMC cathodes with octahedral particle morphologies. Using charge photometry (CP) under charge-rest protocols, the research unveils distinct transport behaviors across different facets of the particle. These findings, corroborated through finite element simulations, highlight the critical role of interparticle communication─an interaction previously underappreciated but shown here to be significant. By combining experimental evidence with computational modeling, this study provides a deeper comprehension of lithium-ion transport and the underlying mechanisms, offering valuable insights to future studies of active materials for battery applications."},{"t":"[尽快] 氰化氢如何形成腺嘌呤？","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c09522","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The abiotic formation of adenine from hydrogen cyanide (HCN) has long been suspected to be a key step in the origin of life. However, the inherent complexity of HCN's self-reaction chemistry has challenged researchers for decades, obscuring the detailed mechanistic pathway to adenine. In this study, we employ quantum chemistry and microkinetic modeling to predict and compare four interwoven base-catalyzed pathways to adenine in liquid HCN. Our analysis incorporates both previously proposed aminomalononitrile (AMN) and diaminomaleonitrile (DAMN) intermediates and reveals previously unknown reaction steps, including one in which polyimine can serve as an oxidizing agent. Our modeling offers compelling evidence of a complex, nonequilibrium interplay between these pathways and confirms DAMN as a necessary intermediate. This work establishes a foundational reference for the exploration of abiotic nucleobase formation and highlights how rigorous testing of origin-of-life chemistry pushes the boundaries of state-of-the-art computational chemistry.","tp":"核碱基起源","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用量子化学与微动力学建模，系统比较了液态氰化氢(HCN)中四条碱催化路径形成腺嘌呤的反应机理。HCN自聚合生成腺嘌呤被认为是生命起源的关键步骤，但反应网络复杂、机理长期模糊。该工作整合已知与新提出的氨基中间体路径，定量预测各步骤能垒与速率，揭示腺嘌呤非生物合成的优势路径。对理解前生命化学、核碱基起源有重要意义。"},{"t":"铁负载触发高自旋态：加速燃料电池阴极中H₂O/O₂交换","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17909","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池阴极催化剂","kp":["催化剂[燃料电池阴极ORR]: Fe-N-C高自旋Fe2+","[自旋态]: 高自旋t2g4eg2，dz2轨道未配对电子","[机制]: 调控活性中心自旋态加速H2O/O2交换"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Fe-N-C催化剂是质子交换膜燃料电池中最具前景的非贵金属ORR催化材料，但氧还原反应动力学迟缓长期制约其性能。本研究发现Fe负载可触发高自旋态，加速H₂O/O₂在催化剂表面的交换过程，从而显著提升ORR活性。该机制为设计高效非铂燃料电池阴极催化剂提供了新策略，有望降低燃料电池成本并推动规模化应用。","ot":"[ASAP] Fe Loading Triggers High-Spin State: Expediting H2O/O2 Swap in Fuel Cell Cathodes","b":"Fe-N-C catalysts have long suffered from kinetically sluggish oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) because of the overly strong binding to oxygen-related reaction species. Modulating the spin state of active centers emerges as a promising strategy to break the kinetic bottleneck. Herein, we show that high-spin (HS) Fe2+ (t2g4eg2) centers, with the emergence of unpaired 3d electrons in the dz2 orbital, offer a substantially reduced reaction energy barrier through synergistic regulation of H2O-O2 adsorption. Facial low-spin (LS) Fe3+(t2g5eg0) to HS Fe2+ transition was achieved via densifying the Fe site density, stemming from the Ruderman-Kittel-Kasuya-Yosida (RKKY) mechanism. Synchrotron-based Fe Kβ X-ray emission spectroscopy (XES) and L-edge soft X-ray absorption spectroscopy (sXAS) directly reveal t2g-eg redistribution. These HS sites promote antibonding orbital occupancy compared to LS states, corroborating a correlation between spin density, reduced activation energy, and turnover frequency. Consequently, the single cell test achieves a peak power density of approximately 1.31 W cm-2 and delivers a current density of 65.1 mA cm-2 at 0.9 ViR-free, surpassing the DOE 2025 target and most of the previously reported Fe-N-C catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"弹性可弯曲金属有机框架晶体用于高效柔性催化水分解析氢","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16984","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性催化析氢","kp":["材料[析氢]: 可弹性弯曲MOF晶体","[催化类型]: 挠曲催化(flexocatalysis)替代压电催化","[机制]: 挠曲电效应驱动水裂解"],"as":"金属有机框架（MOF）作为新型多孔材料，在机械催化领域展现出巨大潜力。该研究报道了一类具有弹性弯曲能力的MOF晶体，能够在机械应力作用下发生可逆形变而不破坏晶体结构。这种弹性响应使其在机械催化中实现高效的力-化学能量转换，为柔性催化材料的设计提供了全新思路。传统MOF晶体通常刚性易碎，而弹性可弯曲MOF的突破拓展了这类多孔材料在智能响应器件、柔性传感器和机械驱动催化等前沿场景中的应用边界，标志着MOF力学性质研究从静态结构走向动态功能调控。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Elastically Bendable Metal–Organic Framework Crystals for Efficient Flexocatalytic Hydrogen Evolution from Water","b":"As a new type of porous material, metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) have emerged as promising platforms for mechanocatalytic hydrogen evolution from water splitting via piezocatalysis. However, because MOFs usually possess symmetric structures, only a few can be utilized as piezocatalysts, which generally exhibit a low catalytic efficiency. Therefore, it is desirable to explore other mechanocatalysis mechanisms in MOFs for efficient hydrogen evolution. Herein, we first report a highly efficient flexocatalysis of centrosymmetric PCN-222 MOF in hydrogen production. Our tests show that the hydrogen evolution rate of PCN-222 crystals via flexocatalysis can reach up to 259 μmol·g-1·h-1, six times higher than those of previous Zr(IV)-based MOF piezocatalysts. The superior flexocatalytic hydrogen evolution performance of PCN-222 crystals is attributed to the synergy among their significant flexoelectric response, large aspect ratio, and high bendability, as PCN-222 is found to possess an ultrahigh figure of merit of 0.33 for repeatable elastic bending and an ultralow Young's modulus of 0.6 GPa based on in situ bending tests. Such a high bendability of PCN-222, according to atomistic simulations, originates from the small load-bearing area and the unique self-rotation deformation mechanism of aryl and pyrrole rings. The intrinsically elastic bendability incorporated with the slender configuration of PCN-222 crystals can facilitate the generation of flexoelectric potential through buckling under ultrasonic irradiation. This study not only provides a new strategy to improve the mechanocatalytic hydrogen evolution activity of MOFs through flexocatalysis but also unveils the superior bendability of PCN-222, shedding light on its potential applications in novel flexible nanodevices.","aip":1},{"t":"钴取代镍配位聚合物中双活性位点的动力学与调控以增强析氧反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12205","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OER双活性位催化剂","kp":["催化剂[OER]: 钴取代镍配位聚合物","[研究重点]: OER过程活性物种/位点动力学解析","[方法]: 表面与体相互补表征"],"as":"析氧反应（OER）是水分解和可持续能源转换过程中的关键瓶颈步骤，动力学极其缓慢。该研究通过在镍基配位聚合物中引入钴取代策略，构建了具有双活性位点的催化体系，深入揭示了双位点协同催化的动力学机制与电子调控原理。研究发现双活性位点之间的电子耦合效应可显著降低OER过电位，提升催化活性。该工作为合理设计高效多核协同电催化剂提供了原子级别的机理认知，对推动电化学能源转换技术的工程化具有重要意义。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Dynamics and Control of Dual Active Sites in Co-Substituted Ni Coordination Polymers for Enhanced Oxygen Evolutio","b":"Facilitating the kinetically demanding oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is essential for the sustainable conversion of renewable energy into chemical fuels. However, precisely unraveling the dynamics of active species and sites during the OER remains a significant challenge. Herein, we constructed a series of Co-substituted Ni coordination polymers (Ni-CPs) for the OER. Complementary surface-/bulk-sensitive <i>operando</i> time-resolved spectroscopic monitoring enables detailed mechanistic insight into the critical role of partial Co incorporation in modulating the local coordination geometry of Ni centers and thereby promoting the intrinsic OER kinetics. Our results reveal that controlled Co substitution in Ni-CPs facilitates the generation of a substantial fraction of (Ni, Co)(IV) species, which activate O-O bond formation atop the catalytically active Ni<sup>IV</sup>-O-Co<sup>IV</sup> moieties. These key findings are further supported by kinetic isotopic effect studies and density functional theory calculations, in which the OER in Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs proceeds via an oxo-radical coupling mechanism, with deprotonation preferentially occurring at the Ni sites. Consequently, the engineered Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs exhibit enhanced OER activity compared to their oxide counterparts, along with durable electrochemical stability for over 4000 h. This study not only offers detailed mechanistic insights into the dynamics of active species and sites but also highlights their critical role in optimizing the OER kinetics."},{"t":"金属掺杂共价有机框架中的限域水用于潮湿条件下增强的物理吸附碳捕集","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19317","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF湿态碳捕集","kp":["[策略]: 金属掺杂COF限域水转为CO2吸附位点","[条件]: 湿润条件下物理吸附捕碳"],"as":"CO2捕集技术中，水对物理吸附和化学吸附的影响机制截然不同。该研究聚焦于金属掺杂共价有机框架（COFs）中受限水对CO2物理吸附性能的增强效应。与胺基化学吸附中水促进胺利用率不同，物理吸附体系中水分子在COFs受限孔道内的独特行为可优化吸附位点与CO2分子的相互作用。研究阐明了受限水在调控多孔材料CO2捕获选择性、容量和工作容量中的关键作用，为设计高效碳捕集吸附剂提供了分子层面的理论指导，对碳中和技术路径具有实际意义。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Confined Water in Metal-Doped Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Physisorptive Carbon Capture under Wet Con","b":"Unlike amine-based CO2 chemisorption, where water can enhance amine utilization efficiency, physisorptive CO2 capture is typically impeded by water owing to its large dipole moment and competitive adsorption behavior. Converting water into additional adsorptive sites for CO2 adsorption in physisorption is promising, yet still nascent and elusive. Herein, we report a strategy that exploits confined water to achieve efficient CO2 capture, even under high relative humidity (RH) conditions, in metal-ion-doped covalent organic frameworks (COFs). By activation at different temperatures, water exhibiting Lewis acidic properties can be formed within metal-ion-doped COFs, thereby further enhancing CO2 adsorption. The dry CO2 uptake of NUS-42-NiCl2 nearly doubles at 800 mmHg and 298 K compared to pristine NUS-42 after activation at 323 K. In situ X-ray diffraction (XRD), solid-state 1H magic angle spinning nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (ss 1H MAS NMR), and in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) confirm the formation of Lewis-acid-water. Furthermore, control over pore size and metal-ion loading is shown to be critical for generating the Lewis-acid-water. Combined in situ DRIFTS, electron spin resonance (ESR), X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS), and density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate the role of Lewis-acid-water in producing moisture-enhanced and inflectional CO2 adsorption isotherms. Multicomponent dynamic column breakthrough experiments further demonstrate significantly improved CO2 uptake after moisture presaturation up to 75% RH. These findings offer a systematic and innovative approach for converting water into CO2 adsorption sites, thereby addressing the challenge of competitive water adsorption during physisorptive carbon capture.","aip":1},{"t":"自旋交叉分子中的明亮比率型荧光温度计用于自旋态平衡可视化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18528","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋交叉荧光测温","kp":["[分子设计]: 萘嵌入自旋交叉分子","[功能]: 比率荧光可视化自旋态平衡"],"as":"光学可寻址分子自旋旨在解决磁性器件中弱磁矩的控制与检测难题，是分子自旋电子学的核心挑战之一。该研究在自旋交叉分子体系中构建了一种明亮的比例型荧光温度计，利用自旋态转变伴随的荧光信号变化实现对温度的高灵敏度比例检测。该策略将磁自旋态的调控与光学读出耦合，为在单分子尺度实现温度传感和自旋态操控提供了新范式。研究成果在量子信息处理、分子级传感器和自旋器件等领域具有重要应用前景，推动了分子磁性向可观测、可控制的工程化方向发展。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Bright Ratiometric Fluorescent Thermometer in a Spin Crossover Molecule toward Visualization of Spin-State Equili","b":"Optically addressable molecular spins aim to tackle control and detection of weak magnetic moment when magnetic devices are scaled down to the single-molecule level. To achieve accurate readout of molecular spin states by adjacent luminescent probes, the molecular design must meet the stringent requirements of both high signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) and high sensitivity. Here, we incorporated a naphthalimide-based ratiometric fluorescent (RF) probe with a donor-acceptor (D-A) structure into a spin crossover (SCO) molecule. The probe features dual emission channels arising from a locally excited (LE) state and an intramolecular charge-transfer (ICT) state. The thermochromism associated with SCO spectrally overlaps with the probe's RF bands, producing a reverse synergistic effect, achieving ratiometric fluorescent thermometers (RFTs) with 1.35% K-1 sensitivity and 66% fluorescence contrast. More importantly, the bright fluorescence thermochromism (∼50% quantum yield) is maintained throughout the entire SCO process, enabling direct visualization of spin-state equilibria with high SNR (>400) and detection resolution (0.0017) even at low concentrations of 10-4 M. This tuning of the single-fluorophore RF against SCO thermochromism provides a new design platform for the accurate readout of spin states of molecules."},{"t":"[尽快] 有机硼酸一氧化物自由基","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20813","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"The boron monoxide radical has emerged as a fascinating molecule and a short-lived intermediate, previously observed only under matrix isolation conditions. In this study, we report the successful synthesis and characterization of a stable organic boron monoxide radical, achieved through the reaction of a diboron (6) dianion with nitric oxide (NO). This oxygen-centered radical is uniquely functionalized and stabilized by a triaryl-substituted boryl group. Comprehensive characterization was performed using various spectroscopic and structural techniques, including electron paramagnetic resonance (EPR) spectroscopy and single-crystal X-ray diffraction analysis. Remarkably, this oxygen-centered radical is stabilized by the K cation and exhibits significant stability under argon at room temperature, showing no self-dimerization even when heated or exposed to UV light. However, it can dimerize to form peroxide species when the K cation is fully encapsulated. Furthermore, it can mimic transition-metal complexes by mediating NO coupling to form a boryl hyponitrite (N2O22-) derivative. Finally, this boron monoxide radical also shows promising catalytic potential in Sn-Sn coupling reactions."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于癌症免疫治疗的基于工程纳米囊泡的溶酶体靶向蛋白降解平台 (NV-TAC)","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17801","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lysosome-Targeting Chimeras (LYTAC) technology offers a revolutionary approach for specifically degrading extracellular and membrane proteins. However, current LYTAC platforms face multiple technical challenges, including ligand screening, linker optimization, and the need to balance the characteristics between the protein of interest (POI) and lysosome-targeting receptor (LTR). To overcome these challenges, we engineered NV-TACs (Nanovesicle-based TArgeting Chimeras)─a linker-free LYTAC platform that integrates native nanovesicles displaying the endogenous ligands of POI and LTRs as bioinspired membrane protein degradation modules. As a proof-of-concept, PD-1 (as the binder of PD-L1) and transferrin (as the binder of transferrin receptor, TFRC) were engineered into biocompatible fibroblast-derived nanovesicles. This platform demonstrates significant scalability, allowing flexible module integration and functional assembly. NV-TACs efficiently degrade PD-L1 on tumor and immune cells through the TFRC-mediated specific lysosomal endocytosis pathway, and it has been expanded to the degradation of other membrane proteins. Notably, by incorporation of a therapeutic payload (ML210), NV-TACs simultaneously exhibited targeted protein degradation and ML210-mediated ferroptosis through payload delivery capacity. Both in anti-PD-1-responsive and -resistant tumor models, NV-TACs demonstrated significant therapeutic efficacy without obvious systemic toxicity. The platform of NV-TACs paves new avenues for developing linker-free, modular, and bioinspired targeted protein degradation platforms.","tp":"囊泡降解法","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对溶酶体靶向嵌合体(LYTAC)技术在胞外/膜蛋白降解中面临的配体筛选、linker优化等技术瓶颈，研究团队开发了无linker的纳米囊泡靶向嵌合体平台NV-TAC。该平台利用工程化纳米囊泡将目标蛋白与溶酶体靶向受体桥接，实现胞外和膜蛋白的高效特异性降解，为癌症免疫治疗提供了新型蛋白降解策略，具有临床转化潜力。","aip":1},{"t":"单相混合离子-电子导电金属有机框架","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18105","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"混合离子-电子导体（MIEC）因能同时传导离子和电子，在燃料电池、电催化、固态电池等电化学系统中至关重要。该研究报道了一种单相混合离子-电子导电的金属有机框架（MOF）材料，解决了传统MIEC多为无机陶瓷难以精确调控孔道与活性位点的局限。MOF的高度可设计性为构建兼具高导电性与结构可调性的下一代电化学材料提供了全新平台。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"混合导电MOF材料","kp":["设计策略[MOF]: 富阳离子设计实现单相混合Li⁺-电子导电"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] A Single-Phase Mixed Ion-Electron Conducting Metal–Organic Framework","b":"Mixed ionic-electronic conductors (MIECs) are highly sought after for electrochemical systems because they support concurrent charge and mass transport. Yet, structurally well-defined single-phase MIECs remain scarce, as most systems rely on physical mixtures of ionic and electronic conductors. Here, we introduce a cation-rich design strategy to realize solid-state mixed Li+-electronic conduction in a two-dimensional copper-catecholate metal-organic framework, Cu3(HOTAT)2, built from the 3-fold symmetric new ligand 2,3,7,8,12,13-hexahydroxytriazatruxene (HHTAT). Owing to the combined redox activity of Cu2+/Cu+ and the HOTAT ligand, controlled fractional reduction generates a family of LixCu3(HOTAT)2 (0 ≤ x ≤ 7.50) phases with tunable transport properties, in good agreement with electronic-structure calculations. The Li-rich phase Li7.50Cu3(HOTAT)2 exhibits intrinsic mixed conduction at room temperature, with an electronic conductivity of 2.8 × 10-3 S cm-1, and solid-state Li+ conductivity of 1.1 × 10-3 S cm-1. As a proof of concept, Li7.50Cu3(HOTAT)2 operates as a homogeneous cathode in all-solid-state Li batteries, delivering 100 mAh g-1 after 100 cycles with ∼99.8% Coulombic efficiency, indicative of highly reversible electrochemical behavior. These results establish cation-rich reduction of redox-active 2D MOFs as an efficient route to engineer solid-state mixed Li+-electronic conductors, opening a pathway toward dual-conducting porous materials for solid-state electrochemical technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"基于吸附控制¹²⁹Xe-NMR技术的新型孔道形貌分析方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20821","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米孔形分析","kp":["方法[孔形分析]: 吸附控制129Xe-NMR","[适用材料]: 无定形纳米多孔材料"],"as":"该研究提出了一种基于129Xe NMR吸附行为的晶体多孔材料孔形分析方法。传统孔道表征依赖电镜、气体吸附等手段，对复杂孔形解析能力有限。该方法利用氙原子在不同孔形环境中产生的特征化学位移信号，可灵敏区分笼状、通道状及瓶颈状等微孔结构，为沸石、MOF等多孔材料的结构-性能关系研究提供了非破坏性的高精度表征新工具。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"[ASAP] A New Pore Shape Analysis Method Based on the Adsorption-Controlled 129Xe–NMR Technique","b":"In crystalline porous materials, pore shapes can be determined using analytical techniques, such as transmission electron microscopy and X-ray diffraction. However, pore shape analysis for amorphous nanoporous materials remains a longstanding challenge. In our previous study, we confirmed that, for microporous activated carbons with slit-shaped pores, the interaction between the pore surface and an adsorbed xenon (Xe) molecule (δ<sub>S</sub>) depends only on a parameter related to pore size─the ratio of the pore volume and specific surface area (<i>V</i>/<i>SSA</i>)─and we verified the effectiveness of adsorption-controlled Xe isotope-nuclear magnetic resonance (<sup>129</sup>Xe-NMR) for evaluating the pore size of the slit-shaped porous carbons. In the present study, we examined the potential of this <sup>129</sup>Xe-NMR technique for pore shape analysis in amorphous nanoporous materials using various carbon- and silica-based nanoporous materials with pores of different shapes ranging in size from micropores to mesopores. By using the inverse pore size factor (<i>SSA</i>/<i>V</i>), we found that nanoporous materials with cylindrical pores exhibited clearly different δ<sub>S</sub>-<i>SSA</i>/<i>V</i> plots from those of slit-type nanoporous materials. At the same pore size, δ<sub>S</sub> values were higher for cylindrical pores than for slit-shaped pores, consistent with the stronger solid-fluid interaction for the former estimated by integrated Lennard-Jones calculations. Moreover, in δ<sub>S</sub>-<i>V</i>/<i>SSA</i> plots, distinct correlations for each nanoporous material series were obtained, corresponding to the pore connectivity gradient. These results demonstrate the potential of adsorption-controlled <sup>129</sup>Xe-NMR for analyzing the pore shape and connectivity as well as the pore size in various nanoporous materials."},{"t":"当两年的学术工作轻轻一按就消失了","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04064-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"你的呼吸反映了你肠道中的细菌","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00219-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"富锂锰氧化物正极的电压衰减与容量损失：原子尺度起源、介观不均匀性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521529?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极衰减","kp":["[材料]: 锂富锰基氧化物LRMO正极","[失效机制]: 电压衰减容量损失原子-介观-宏观关联"],"as":"富锂锰基氧化物（LRMO）正极因高比容量被视为下一代锂离子电池的有力候选，但严重的电压衰减和容量损失制约其实用化。该研究从原子尺度剖析LRMO循环过程中晶格氧析出、过渡金属迁移及相变等结构演化机制，揭示电压衰退的本质根源在于不可逆的层状向尖晶石相转变。深入理解这一衰减路径对开发高能量密度、长循环稳定性的锰基正极材料具有关键指导意义。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Voltage Decay and Capacity Loss in Lithium‐Rich Manganese Oxide Cathodes: Atomic Origins, Mesoscopic Heterogeneities, an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Lithium‐rich manganese‐based oxide (LRMO) cathode materials have emerged as promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) due to their high specific capacity and exceptional energy density. Nevertheless, their practical application is significantly hindered by pronounced voltage decay and capacity loss during cycling, which stem from complex and interrelated mechanisms. This review presents a comprehensive, multi‐scale analysis of the degradation pathways in LRMO materials, spanning from atomic‐level structural dynamics to mesoscopic heterogeneities and macroscopic particle evolution. Special focus is directed toward unraveling the synergistic interplay between oxygen anionic and cationic redox processes, oxygen release, transition metal ions (TMs) migration, irreversible phase transitions, heterogeneous electrochemical reactions, and operational conditions. By integrating insights from advanced characterization, theoretical modeling, and electrochemical analyses, this review establishes a cohesive framework that elucidates the intricate relationships among oxygen activity, TMs dynamics, and structural transformations. These mechanistic insights lay a critical foundation for the development of stabilization strategies aimed at mitigating voltage decay and capacity loss. Ultimately, this review bridges the gap between fundamental mechanistic understanding and practical engineering applications, offering actionable guidance for the design of durable and high‐energy‐density LRMO cathode materials tailored for high‐performance energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"通过含氢流动池中的原位X射线散射揭示锂介导氮还原机理","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06529A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学合成氨","kp":["体系[电化学合成氨]: 锂介导氮还原(Li-NRR)","[表征方法]: operando GI WAXS","[电池设计]: 流动池，阳极氢氧化替代牺牲质子给体"],"dp":1,"as":"锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）是目前最有前景的电化学合成氨路线，但其反应机理长期存在争议。该研究利用operando同步辐射X射线技术实时追踪Li-NRR过程中的固液界面演化与中间产物，揭示了锂氮化物生成与质子化的关键步骤，阐明活性氮物种的形成路径。原位表征手段为理性设计高效、高选择性的电催化合成氨体系提供了机理层面的重要依据。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unveiling the mechanism of lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction via operando X-ray scattering in a flow cell with hydroge","b":"The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is currently the most promising strategy for electrochemical ammonia synthesis. In this study, we present an operando grazing incidence wide angle X-ray scattering (GI WAXS) investigation using an improved electrochemical flow cell that enables hydrogen oxidation at the anode and thereby eliminates the need of a sacrificial proton donor. The improved cell design also increases nitrogen availability and mass transport, achieving ammonia faradaic efficiencies (FEs) up to 36%. This setup allows direct analysis of reaction intermediates and the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) using state-of-the-art diglyme-based electrolytes. We identify lithium amide (LiNH2) as the only stable, crystalline intermediate, providing direct insight into the Li-NRR mechanism. Notably, in diglyme-based electrolytes, the SEI composition differs significantly from that in tetrahydrofuran-based systems, with reduced LiF content and the formation of previously unreported crystalline diglyme–lithium salt complexes. These species likely influence ammonia selectivity and long-term stability. Our findings highlight how the electrolyte composition and cell architecture govern Li-NRR selectivity and efficiency, offering a foundation for the rational design of next-generation SEI layers and solid electrolytes to enable scalable electrochemical ammonia synthesis.","aip":1},{"t":"解开强相关 kagome 金属 CsCr3Sb5 中相互交织的秩序","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag044/8437941?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"While correlated phenomena of flat bands have been extensively studied in twisted systems, the ordered states that emerge from interactions in the intrinsic flat bands of kagome lattice materials remain largely unexplored. The newly discovered kagome metal CsCr3Sb5 offers a unique and rich platform for this research, as its multi-orbital flat bands at the Fermi surface result in a complex interplay of pressurized superconductivity, antiferromagnetism, a structural phase transition, and density wave orders. Here, using ultrafast optical techniques, we provide strong spectroscopic evidence for a charge density wave transition in CsCr3Sb5, resolving previous ambiguities. Crucially, we identify rotational symmetry breaking that manifests as a three-state Potts-type nematicity. Our elastoresistance measurements directly demonstrate the electronic origin of this order, as the rotational-symmetry-breaking E","tp":"超导量子态","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"新发现的kagome金属CsCr3Sb5因其费米面多轨道平带而成为研究相互作用驱发的有序态的独特平台。研究揭示了该材料在压力下超导、反铁磁、结构相变与密度波之间复杂的交织竞争关系，为探索kagome晶格本征平带中关联现象提供了新视角，对理解非常规超导与关联电子物理有重要推动作用。"},{"t":"面向可扩展组件的均匀单片钙钛矿薄膜：通过籽晶引发与真空技术的无反溶剂结晶法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506521?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿组件结晶","kp":["结晶策略[钙钛矿组件]: 种子引发-真空辅助结晶(S-VAC)","[种子]: 油胺诱导α相纳米晶","[工艺]: 无反溶剂、真空驱动垂直晶体生长","[应用]: 可扩展均匀单片钙钛矿膜"],"dp":1,"as":"将高效钙钛矿太阳能电池从实验室小面积器件扩展为商业级组件，结晶均匀性是核心瓶颈。该研究提出免反溶剂的单片钙钛ite薄膜结晶策略，通过调控成核与生长动力学实现大面积薄膜的均匀沉积，在组件尺度上显著抑制缺陷与效率损失。该无反溶剂路线有利于卷对卷等可规模化工艺，推动钙钛矿光伏从器件级研究迈向产业化量产。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Uniform Monolithic Perovskite Films for Scalable Modules: Anti‐Solvent‐Free Crystallization via Seed Priming and Vacuum ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Scaling high‐efficiency perovskite solar cells into commercially viable modules remains challenging. Here, we demonstrate a seed‐primed, vacuum‐assisted crystallization (S‐VAC) strategy that links oleylamine‐induced α‐phase nanocrystal seeding to vacuum‐driven vertical crystal growth. Complementary in situ characterization, including time‐resolved GIWAXS, solution‐state NMR, and dynamic light scattering (DLS), reveals that oleylamine forms uniform ≈1.7 nm α‐phase seeds in the precursor solution via hydrogen bonding with FA\n                    +\n                    cations and steric stabilization. These seeds prime the substrate for controlled, single‐crystal‐like vertical growth under low‐pressure vacuum processing, thereby eliminating the need for toxic antisolvents. The resulting monolithic perovskite films exhibit strong (100) texture and high uniformity across 15 × 15 cm\n                    2\n                    substrates. Using S‐VAC, we achieve a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.2% for 2.5  ×  2.5 cm\n                    2\n                    devices and a certified efficiency of 19.1% for 15  ×  15 cm\n                    2\n                    mini‐modules. Encapsulated modules retain &gt;94% of their initial efficiency after one year of continuous outdoor operation. By establishing a molecular‐level basis for oleylamine‐assisted seed formation and demonstrating scalable, antisolvent‐free processing, this work advances seed‐assisted crystallization and supports the practical commercialization of robust and sustainable perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"植物丝兰酶的意外双重功能将叶绿素分解代谢与生长素稳态联系起来","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525568?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Chlorophyll (Chl) metabolism is pivotal to both photosynthesis and plant senescence and represents one of the most fundamental biological processes on Earth with an estimated annual turnover of 1 billion tons. During Chl degradation, only early catabolites and corresponding enzymes are well characterized, whereas for late‐stage degradation products it remains often unclear if their formation involves specific enzymes. Here, we report that the ubiquitous YUCCA10 enzymes from the YUCCA flavin‐containing monooxygenase (FMOs) family in land plants, normally implicated in the biosynthesis of indole‐3‐acetic acid (IAA) as the primary form of auxin, surprisingly catalyze the production of several predominant Chl catabolites via mechanistically distinct Baeyer–Villiger oxidation and subsequent hydrolytic γ‐lactam‐forming deformylation reactions. These historically postulated but hitherto undiscovered Chl degradation steps on several high molecular weight chl catabolites were verified for YUCCA10 from\n                    Vitis vinifera\n                    and\n                    Coffea arabica\n                    , while YUCCA10 from\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    lacked this activity. In contrast, all three homologs were able to catalyze the rate‐limiting key step in IAA biosynthesis, akin to other YUCCA enzymes. Interestingly, Chl catabolites at physiological concentrations impaired IAA formation by YUCCA10 in vitro, suggesting a key role in leaf senescence through enzymatic feedback regulation of auxin levels.","tp":"叶绿素代谢","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现丝兰中一种泛素化相关酶具有意外双重功能：既参与叶绿素降解后期代谢，又调控生长素稳态。叶绿素代谢年周转量约10亿吨，但后期降解产物是否由特异性酶催化长期不明。该工作首次将叶绿素分解代谢与植物激素生长素通路联系起来，揭示了叶绿素降解与生长发育调控间的分子交叉，对作物育种与衰老研究有启示。"},{"t":"单层WS₂/等离激元杂化结构中相干到非相干极化激元非线性的超快转变","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02054-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","as":"基于原子层厚度半导体的激子极化激元是量子光电子器件的核心构建单元。该研究聚焦于极化激元非线性光学效应中超快相干-非相干转变过程，揭示了在强激发条件下激子相互作用从相干极化激元非线性到非相干激子非线性的极快切换机制。这一发现对理解低维半导体中光与物质强耦合的动力学行为具有重要意义，为基于原子层材料的超快光学开关、量子光源和非线性光学器件设计提供了关键物理依据。超快时间尺度（飞秒/皮秒级）的转变过程为下一代量子光电子学应用开辟了新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激子极化激元","kp":["[激子极化激元]: 单层WS2/等离激元杂化结构","[非线性跃迁]: 相干至非相干超快转变"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultrafast transition from coherent to incoherent polariton nonlinearities in a hybrid 1L-WS2/plasmon structure","b":"Exciton polaritons based on atomically thin semiconductors are essential building blocks of quantum optoelectronic devices. Their properties are governed by an ultrafast and oscillatory energy transfer between their excitonic and photonic constituents, resulting in the formation of polaritonic quasiparticles with pronounced nonlinearities induced by the excitonic component. In metallic, plasmonic nanoresonators, dissipation phenomena limit the polariton lifetime to a few tens of femtoseconds, so short that the role of these polaritons for the nonlinear response of such hybrids is yet unexplored. Here we use ultrafast two-dimensional electronic spectroscopy (2DES) to uncover coherent polariton dynamics in a hybrid monolayer (1L) WS2/plasmonic nanostructure. With respect to an uncoupled WS2 flake, we observe an over 20-fold, polarization-dependent enhancement of the optical nonlinearity and a rapid evolution of the 2DES spectra within ~70 fs. We relate these dynamics to a transition from coherent polaritons to incoherent excitations, unravel the microscopic origin of the optical nonlinearities and show the potential of coherent polaritons for ultrafast all-optical switching."},{"t":"I 型干扰素自身抗体是基孔肯雅热减毒活疫苗脑炎的基础","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2532212123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Human autoantibodies neutralizing type I interferons (IFNs) have emerged as strong, common, and global determinants of a growing number of severe viral diseases, including hypoxemic viral pneumonia, arboviral encephalitis, and adverse reaction to the live-attenuated yellow fever virus (YFV) vaccine. Chikungunya virus (CHIKV) is a growing global health concern that the live-attenuated vaccine VLA1553 (IXCHIQ®) was developed to address. In 2025, five unrelated adults (aged 82 to 88) on the island of La Réunion (France) developed severe reactions postvaccination; two died. The three patients with encephalitis (aged 84 to 85), including one lethal case, had immunoglobulin G autoantibodies in the blood neutralizing high concentrations of both IFN-α and -ω on admission. An 82-y-old survived rhabdomyolysis without encephalitis, and an 88-y-old died during hospitalization following CHIKV infection despite late vaccination; both lacked autoantibodies against type I IFNs. Autoantibodies neutralizing type I IFNs underlie all three cases of live-attenuated CHIKV vaccine encephalitis studied. Individuals with autoantibodies neutralizing type I IFNs should not be inoculated with live-attenuated YFV and CHIKV vaccines."},{"t":"具有本征尺寸筛分纳米孔的二维层状纳米片膜用于超快氢气分离","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5523?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维氢气分离膜","kp":["[膜结构]: 本征尺寸筛分纳米孔二维层状膜","[性能]: 超快氢气分离"],"as":"氢气分离与纯化是绿氢大规模应用的关键环节。该研究开发了具有本征尺寸筛分纳米孔的二维层状纳米片膜材料，利用纳米片间层间距和孔径的精确调控实现对氢气分子的高选择性分离。与传统聚合物膜和钯合金膜相比，二维纳米片膜兼具高通量与高选择性，且在高温高压环境下保持稳定。该类膜材料的层状结构设计为解决氢气纯化中的渗透性-选择性权衡难题提供了新思路，对推动氢能产业链降本增效和规模化部署具有潜在工程价值。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Two-dimensional lamellar nanosheet membranes with intrinsic size-sieving nanopores for ultrafast hydrogen separation","b":"Hydrogen separation and purification are essential for the large-scale application of green hydrogen energy. Two-dimensional (2D) material-based membrane technology provides an energy-efficient approach; however, the existing 2D lamellar membranes and nanoporous membranes struggle with low permeability and complex preparation procedures. Here, we constructed 2D lamellar nanosheet membranes with intrinsic size-sieving nanopores by assembling nanoporous polymeric carbon nitride (PCN) nanosheets into a lamellar membrane. These membranes exhibit high selectivity and permeance and ease of preparation. By applying MXene as the strong interaction patch for covering and repairing defects on PCN nanosheets, the resultant membranes demonstrated an ultrahigh H2 permeance of 870 to 8046 GPU, considerable selectivity, and superior long-term stability, outperforming most current state-of-the-art membranes. Economic analysis revealed that MXene/PCN membranes achieved ultralow energy consumption and minimal membrane area demands for practical applications. This study inspires the construction of 2D lamellar membranes with intrinsic nanopores and provides a simple and scalable approach to preparing high-performance 2D nanosheet membranes for hydrogen separation.","aip":1},{"t":"了解青年对能源转型政策接受程度的两条途径：对称和非对称视角","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000364?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"调控单原子层铜催化剂中Cu-Cu间距实现高效稳定CO2电还原制C2H4","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522842?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子Cu催化CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2电还原制C2H4]: 单原子层Cu","[调控参数]: Cu-Cu间距","[目标产物]: 乙烯(C2H4)","[瓶颈]: C-C偶联慢动力学、选择性不确定"],"dp":1,"as":"将CO₂高效转化为多碳（C₂₊）产物是实现可持续能源转化的关键路径。该研究通过调控单原子层铜催化剂中Cu–Cu原子间距，优化了电催化CO₂还原反应的选择性与稳定性。精确的原子间距调控改变了中间体吸附行为，显著提升C₂₊产物（如乙烯、乙醇）的法拉第效率，同时抑制竞争性析氢副反应。单原子层设计最大化了铜活性位点利用率，在长时间运行中保持催化性能稳定。该工作为理性设计高效CO₂电还原催化剂提供了原子级工程策略，对碳中和技术路线具有实际意义。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Tuning Cu–Cu Spacing in Single‐Atomic Layer Cu Catalysts for Efficient and Stable CO2‐To‐C2H4 Electroreduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The transition to sustainable energy relies on the efficient conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into specific multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products, yet this process is severely hindered by the slow kinetics of C─C coupling and uncertain product selectivity. Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) exhibit promising catalytic performance but suffer from a fundamental limitation: their lack of contiguous active sites impedes C─C coupling. Herein, we report an innovative isotropic 2D Cu single‐atomic‐layer catalyst anchored on amorphous carbon substrate, designed to enhance C─C coupling and C\n                    2+\n                    selectivity. By stabilizing Cu\n                    δ\n                    +\n                    species and precisely tuning the Cu–Cu spacing to 2.35 Å‐matching the C─C bond length of ethylene (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ), which significantly promotes C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    production. The catalyst achieved a remarkable Faradaic efficiency of 78.6% for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    at −0.8 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode, accompanied with high stability over 120 h. These findings not only elucidate the profound impact of spatially controlled active sites in complex multi‐step reactions but also represent a significant leap forward in CO\n                    2\n                    conversion technologies, offering great potential for sustainable carbon utilization and addressing global energy transition challenges.","aip":1},{"t":"用于二氧化碳电化学还原的三相界面","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01193K","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"三相界面CO2还原","kp":["界面工程[CO2电还原]: 三相界面"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出用于电化学二氧化碳还原（CO2RR）的三相界面设计策略。传统气固液两相界面在CO2传质和产物选择性上存在瓶颈，三相界面通过构建气-液-固共存微环境，同时优化CO2传质效率与催化活性位点，有望提升C2+多碳产物的法拉第效率和电流密度，为碳资源的高效电化学转化利用提供新思路。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Triple-phase interfaces for electrochemical reduction of carbon dioxide","b":"The CO2 electroreduction reaction (CO2RR) offers a promising approach for converting CO2 into valuable products, thereby storing renewable energy in chemical bonds and mitigating CO2 emissions. The process is fundamentally governed by the complex dynamics at the gas (CO2), liquid (H2O), and solid (catalyst) triple-phase interfaces (TPIs), where mass transport, charge transfer, and intermediate stabilization interact and compete. However, the practical performance of the CO2RR remains significantly below the threshold required for industrial applications, hindered by challenges such as liquid wetting, hydrophobic layer degradation, and electrowetting effects. In this context, we present a tutorial review that re-examines TPI paradigms by integrating early static models with recent dynamic experimental insights. Bridging macroscopic reactor design with atomic-scale interfacial dynamics necessitates the use of in situ/operando characterization techniques. We systematically review optimization strategies for TPIs (e.g., porous architectures, hydrophobic modifications, and heterostructure engineering) and analyze associated failure modes. Furthermore, we extend these concepts to other electrochemical reactions, including oxygen reduction and hydrogen evolution/oxidation, to extract universal principles that guide catalyst design. This review aims to provide a comprehensive framework for advancing the field of sustainable electrocatalysis and its future role in clean energy technologies."},{"t":"通过音爆追踪空间碎片","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee0657?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空间碎片声爆追踪","kp":["方法[空间碎片追踪]: 地震数据反演","[信号源]: 音爆"],"dp":1,"as":"研究人员开发出利用声爆（音爆）信号从地震台站数据中追踪太空碎片在大气层中轨迹和破碎过程的新方法。当太空碎片高速再入大气时产生的声爆可被地面地震传感器捕获，通过分析这些地震数据可反推碎片的飞行路径、速度和解体位置，为太空碎片监测和风险评估提供了一种低成本、被动的补充手段。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Tracking space debris from sonic booms","b":"Seismic data reveal the trajectory and break-up of space debris in Earth's atmosphere."},{"t":"用于耐久水电解的薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜：抑制溶胀与增强稳定性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505888?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水增强隔膜","kp":["[膜厚]: 12µm sPPS+多孔PE增强","[稳定性]: >2000小时耐久水电解","[抗溶胀]: 抑制溶胀提升机械完整性"],"as":"研究开发了一种薄型增强磺化聚苯砜（sPPS）膜材料，用于提升水电解槽的耐久性和效率。碳氢化合物膜相比传统全氟磺酸膜具有更低成本和更高离子电导率，但在化学稳定性方面存在挑战。该工作通过增强改性和厚度优化，在保持高质子传导率的同时显著提升了膜的机械强度和长期运行寿命，推动绿色氢气生产的规模化应用。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Thin Reinforced Sulfonated Poly(phenylene sulfone) Membranes for Durable Water Electrolysis: Suppressed Swelling and Enh","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Hydrocarbon (HC) membranes have the potential to significantly enhance the efficiency of water electrolyzers. However, their low mechanical integrity under electrolysis conditions, due to severe swelling, poses a challenge for industrial‐scale applications. Here, we present a 12 µm‐thick sulfonated poly(phenylene sulfone) (sPPS) membrane reinforced with a porous polyethylene (PE) substrate. The PE substrate reduces in‐plane swelling by a factor of 7 (10% vs 69%) and improves mechanical stability (440 MPa vs 50 MPa) in water at 60°C. Under electrolysis conditions, a 24 µm thick sandwich of two reinforced membranes shows stable operation over more than 2000 h in a constant current hold at 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    conducted at 60°C (first 1000 h) and 80°C (remaining 1000 h) with only 6 µV h\n                    −1\n                    of voltage deviation within the last 500 h. With a potential of 1.67 V and a hydrogen in oxygen content of 1 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , the PFAS‐free membrane clearly outperforms a state‐of‐the‐art reference (Nafion‐N211: 1.73 V and 1.5 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    ).","aip":1},{"t":"从单核细胞到组织驻留巨噬细胞的转变需要 DHPS","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09972-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tissue-resident macrophages (RTMs) form during embryogenesis, self-renew locally, and regulate tissue homeostasis by clearing dead cells and debris1,2,3,4,5,6. During tissue damage, however, bone-marrow-derived monocytes enter tissues and differentiate into RTMs, repairing the tissue and replenishing macrophages in the niche1. The universal cell-intrinsic mechanisms that control the monocyte-to-RTM transition and the maintenance of mature RTMs across tissues remain elusive3. Here we show that deoxyhypusine synthase (DHPS), an enzyme that mediates spermidine-dependent hypusine modification of translation factor eIF5A5,7, is required for RTM differentiation and maintenance. Mice with myeloid cell lack of DHPS (Dhps-ΔM mice) had a global defect in RTMs across tissues, resulting in persistent but ultimately futile monocyte influx. Transcriptional analyses of DHPS-deficient macrophages indicated a block in their ability to differentiate into mature RTMs, whereas proteomics revealed defects in cell adhesion and signalling pathways. Sequencing of ribosome-engaged transcripts identified a subset of mRNAs involved in cell adhesion and signalling that rely on DHPS for efficient translation. Imaging of DHPS-deficient macrophages in tissues showed differences in morphology and tissue interactions, which were correlated with their failed RTM differentiation. DHPS-deficient macrophages were also defective in critical homeostatic RTM functions including efferocytosis and tissue maintenance. Together, our results demonstrate a cell-intrinsic, tissue-agnostic pathway that drives differentiation of monocyte-derived macrophages into RTMs."},{"t":"纤维化对称性在几何深度学习中的作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2416552123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"几何深度学习","kp":["[深度学习框架]: 纤维化对称性扩展至局部对称"],"as":"研究从对称性视角系统阐述了纤维丛对称性（fibration symmetries）在几何深度学习（GDL）中的理论基础与作用。几何深度学习旨在统一处理图、流形等非欧几里得数据的机器学习方法，而对称性是其核心设计原则。论文引入纤维丛框架对对称群进行推广，使模型能够处理更一般的数据结构变换不变性，为构建更通用、更具表达力的深度学习架构提供了理论指导。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"The role of fibration symmetries in geometric deep learning","b":"Geometric Deep Learning (GDL) unifies a broad class of machine learning techniques from the perspectives of symmetries, offering a framework for introducing problem-specific inductive biases like Graph Neural Networks (GNNs). However, the current formulation of GDL is limited to global symmetries. We propose to relax GDL to allow for local symmetries, specifically fibration symmetries, which only require isomorphic input trees-a property that is much more common in real-world graphs. We show that GNNs apply the inductive bias of fibration symmetries and derive a tighter upper bound for their expressive power. Additionally, by identifying symmetries in networks, we compress network nodes, thereby increasing their computational efficiency during both inference and training of deep neural networks. The mathematical extension introduced here applies beyond graphs to manifolds, bundles, and grids for the development of models with inductive biases induced by local symmetries that can lead to better generalization."},{"t":"棕地采矿的兴起正在重塑全球矿产供应并加剧社会与环境风险","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(25)00389-6?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/开采技术","a":"One Earth","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"棕地采矿供应风险","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"The rise of brownfield mining is reshaping global mineral supply and intensifying social and environmental risk"},{"t":"声望的代价","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5344?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"桥锰石巨晶驱动岩浆海洋分离的潜力","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10063-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Earth’s early mantle probably existed as a deep, vigorously convecting magma ocean, and its solidification is considered central to the long-term chemical and dynamical evolution of the planet. Yet a notable uncertainty is the grain size of bridgmanite—the dominant lower-mantle phase—whose nucleation behaviour at extreme pressure has remained experimentally inaccessible. Here we show, using a combination of cutting-edge techniques, including large-scale molecular dynamics simulations consisting of up to 1 million atoms driven by machine learning potentials (MLPs), seeding and enhanced sampling, that crystal–melt interfacial energies of MgSiO3 bridgmanite increase substantially with pressure, surpassing those of silicate–liquid systems at ambient pressure by a factor of up to ten (refs. 1,2,3). In a deep basal magma ocean (BMO), this amplified interfacial energy, combined with the potential sluggish cooling, may permit the formation of unusually large bridgmanite crystals, up to centimetre-to-metre-scale sizes. Such potentially large crystals could drive efficient fractional crystallization and cause substantial chemical differentiation and mantle compaction. If operative, this mechanism would provide a new physical pathway linking lower-mantle material properties to early Earth stratification and it motivates future geodynamic models that explicitly incorporate supercooling, compositional convection and elemental partitioning. Our findings thus offer a plausible hypothesis connecting microscopic nucleation processes with macroscopic planetary structure, refining present views of how the Earth’s interior acquired its initial compositional architecture."},{"t":"膜锚定桥状脂质转运蛋白摄取脂质的分子机制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520399123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lipid transport by bridge-like lipid transfer proteins (BLTPs) is emerging as a key process in lipid and cellular metabolism in both physiological and pathological conditions. However, the precise mechanism of lipid transport by BLTPs has remained elusive. Here, we use extensive all-atom molecular dynamics simulations to characterize the precise mechanism of lipid transfer into the BLTP hydrophobic cavity from donor membranes. For multiple BLTPs, we observe the ability to extract and solubilize lipids without lipid selectivity, and we identify membrane destabilization as a critical parameter to achieve effective lipid desorption. We rationally design a mutant BLTP with altered ability to destabilize lipid bilayers, and we show that this abolishes lipid desorption in silico and protein function in vivo. Taken together, our data provide an atomic-level description of the mechanism of lipid transport by BLTPs, ultimately suggesting alternative strategies to interfere with their activity."},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色与棕色两面：创新、AI驱动专利、能源政策干预与碳排放","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"工业机器人碳排","as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"The green and brown sides of industrial robots: Innovations, AI-Driven patents, energy policy interventions, and emissio"},{"t":"来自欧洲最早的象骨工具：一种意想不到的用于精确敲击阿舍利手斧的原材料","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1390?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Organic knapping tools made from bone, antler, and wood were essential to early human toolkits but are rarely preserved in the archeological record. The earliest known soft hammers, dating to ~480,000 years ago, come from Boxgrove (UK), where modified antlers and large mammal bones were used alongside flint hard hammers. These tools facilitated complex knapping techniques, such as platform preparation and tranchet flake removal, contributing to the production of finely worked ovate handaxes typical of the Boxgrove Acheulean industry. This study presents a cortical bone fragment from an elephant, deliberately shaped into a percussor for resharpening flint tools. It represents the earliest known use of elephant bone in Europe and the first documented case of its use as a knapping hammer. Reconstructing its life history offers further insights into Middle Pleistocene hominin technological adaptations, resourcefulness, and survival strategies that enabled humans to endure harsh northern environments."},{"t":"气候临界点的多米诺骨牌效应：全球风险的多学科视角*","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag042/8437927?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"全球土壤盐分增加对无机碳变化的贡献","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522643123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Soil salinization poses a serious environmental challenge, but the impact of global salinity on SIC (Soil Inorganic Carbon) remains unclear. Using 94,515 samples from 0 to 200 cm depth, combined with subregional classification (such as soil type, land use, climate, geomorphology, and soil texture) which helps address spatial heterogeneity, we obtain relatively accurate global distribution data for EC (Electrical Conductivity) and SIC. EC of 0 to 40 cm layer positively influences SIC in most taxonomic subregions, which may be due to the inorganic [Formula: see text] absorption influenced by pH and salinity. EC of 80 to 100 cm layer sometimes negatively influences SIC due to the increase of soil depth. When EC is below 4 dS/m, EC often positively influences SIC. When EC increases by 2 to 4 dS/m, the mean global SIC in 0 to 20, 20 to 40, and 80 to 100 cm layers increases from 66.15, 78.75, and 117.39 to 174.47 to 190.38, 132.76 to 154.98, and 149.14 to 161.37 g/kg, respectively. The increase is relatively high but similar overall, which deserves high attention. These findings elucidate the dynamics of carbon-salt coupling in the soil-atmosphere-water system, offering pivotal scientific insights for carbon-neutrality strategies."},{"t":"MXene与MBene基材料在植物免疫工程、病害防控等纳米农业应用中的首篇综述","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72036?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene纳米农业","kp":["材料[纳米农业]: MXene与MBene","[应用]: 植物免疫工程、可控保护"],"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"The First Review on Nano‐Agricultural Applications of MXene and MBene‐Based Materials for Plant‐Immunoengineering, Contr"},{"t":"EPS-I 胞外多糖将雷氏菌枯萎病病原体生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，以便快速传播","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512757123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ralstonia solanacearum species complex (RSSC) pathogens cause destructive plant wilt diseases of a wide variety of crops, leading to significant agricultural losses worldwide. These bacteria rapidly spread through the water-transporting xylem where they grow prolifically and produce abundant biofilm that clogs xylem vessels. To understand RSSC biofilm behavior in planta, we examined their complex fluid mechanics. Rheological analyses revealed that unlike all previously analyzed microbial biofilms, RSSC biofilms are shear-thinning, viscoelastic fluids at physiologically relevant shear forces. To determine which factors confer these unique mechanics, we analyzed biofilms of bacterial mutants with altered biofilm components. Genetic analysis demonstrated that development of the viscous-dominant biofilms required production of EPS-I, an amphiphilic exopolysaccharide that is a major virulence factor for all RSSC pathogens. We show that EPS-I confers \"biofilm mobility\", which allows wild-type RSSC colonies to passively expand when deformed. Despite its high metabolic cost, bioassays demonstrated that EPS-I production conferred a net fitness benefit where biofilm mobility allowed the pathogen to spread and access more nutrients in complex environments like xylem vessels. The RSSC are a monophyletic lineage of aggressive plant wilt pathogens, and our evolutionary hypothesis testing suggests the origin of the eps biosynthetic gene cluster coincides with the emergence of wilt pathogenesis in the RSSC ancestor. Furthermore, comparative physiological assays demonstrated that biofilm mobility is unique to the RSSC within the genus Ralstonia. In summary, EPS-I production is a key evolutionary innovation that enables RSSC dispersal and virulence by conferring unique biofilm mechanics.","tp":"病菌生物膜","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究揭示了雷氏菌(RSSC)通过分泌胞外多糖EPS-I，将木质部内的生物膜从弹性固体转变为粘弹性液体的机制。与此前所有已知微生物生物膜不同，这种流变学转变使病原体能沿木质部水流快速传播扩散，堵塞维管束导致枯萎病。该发现重新定义了病原菌生物膜的物理行为范式，对开发农业抗菌策略有重要指导价值。"},{"t":"严重感染时的拴系血小板","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed1243?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Platelet-derived structures in blood vessel walls increase inflammation and bleeding risk."},{"t":"来自空间快照的时间组织动力学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09876-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Physiological and pathological processes such as inflammation and cancer emerge from interactions between cells over time1. However, methods to follow cell populations over time within the native context of a human tissue are lacking because a biopsy offers only a single snapshot. Here we present one-shot tissue dynamics reconstruction (OSDR), an approach to estimate a dynamical model of cell populations based on a single tissue sample. OSDR uses spatial proteomics to learn how the composition of cellular neighbourhoods influences division rate, providing a dynamical model of cell population change over time. We apply OSDR to human breast cancer data2,3,4, and reconstruct two fixed points of fibroblasts and macrophage interactions5,6. These fixed points correspond to hot and cold fibrosis7, in agreement with co-culture experiments that measured these dynamics directly8. We then use OSDR to discover a pulse-generating excitable circuit of T and B cells in the tumour microenvironment, suggesting temporal flares of anticancer immune responses. Finally, we study longitudinal biopsies from a triple-negative breast cancer clinical trial3, in which OSDR predicts the collapse of the tumour cell population in responders but not in non-responders, based on early-treatment biopsies. OSDR can be applied to a wide range of spatial proteomics assays to enable analysis of tissue dynamics based on patient biopsies."},{"t":"顶嘴","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5706?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"An unprecedented assault has forced the U.S. scientific community to rethink its advocacy tactics."},{"t":"硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶上*NO偶联与*H供应的协同调控驱动高效电催化还原","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522680?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原","kp":["[催化剂]: 硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶Fe0@S","[机理]: 协同*NO耦合与*H供给高选择性产N2"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶（S-doped zero-valent iron aerogels）用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氮气（N₂）。该催化剂通过协同调控*NO中间体偶联和*H氢源供给，显著提升了NO₃⁻到N₂的选择性和转化效率。该策略在环境修复（含氮废水处理）和电催化合成领域具有重要应用潜力，为零价铁基材料的催化机制设计提供了新思路。","ot":"Synergistic Regulation of *NO Coupling and *H Supply on Sulfur‐Doped Zero‐Valent Iron Aerogels Drives Efficient Electror","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrochemical nitrate (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ) reduction to dinitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ) is a promising approach for environmental remediation but suffers from the sluggish\n                    *\n                    NO coupling and excessive\n                    *\n                    H supply on traditional electrocatalysts. Herein, we construct a sulfur‐doped zero‐valent iron (Fe\n                    0\n                    @S) aerogel that enables highly selective electrochemical nitrate‐to‐dinitrogen conversion via\n                    *\n                    NO→\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O→N\n                    2\n                    path by synchronously regulating\n                    *\n                    H supply and\n                    *\n                    NO coupling. Mechanistic studies reveal that the aerogel's 3D porous framework enriches local NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    near active sites, while strategic sulfur incorporation can weaken H\n                    2\n                    O adsorption and tune\n                    *\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    binding strength, thereby lowering the energy barrier for\n                    *\n                    NO coupling into\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O and subsequent reduction to N\n                    2\n                    . With a flow‐through electrolyzer, we achieve near‐complete removal of 50 mg/L NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    from real surface and ground water with a high N\n                    2\n                    selectivity above 90%. This work provides a practical NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    remediation method based on non‐noble metals and presents a simple strategy for the design of catalyst structure to improve N\n                    2\n                    selectivity."},{"t":"对称保护的拓扑极化子","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514647123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Emergent quasiparticles in solids often exhibit unique topological properties as a result of the complex interplay between charge, orbital, spin, and lattice degrees of freedom. Among these quasiparticles, the polaron occupies a special place as the first known manifestation of the interaction between a fermion and a boson field. While polarons have been investigated for almost a century, whether these quasiparticles exhibit topological properties and why remain open questions. Here, we establish the universal symmetry principles governing the topology of polar textures in large polarons. Using a group-theoretic analysis, we identify four distinct classes of polar textures in time-reversal-invariant systems, and we show that they carry integer topological charges. We validate this classification by performing state-of-the-art first-principles calculations of materials representative of each class. For these materials, we compute the fingerprints of polaron topology in Huang diffuse scattering and propose ultrafast electron and X-ray scattering experiments to detect these quasiparticles.","tp":"拓扑极化子","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究首次建立了对称保护的拓扑极化子理论框架。极化子是费米子与玻色子场相互作用的最早已知表现，研究近百年但拓扑性质仍是开放问题。该工作揭示了晶体对称性如何赋予极化子非平凡的拓扑特性，为理解凝聚态中准粒子的拓扑行为提供了新视角，可能在极化子输运、声子-电子耦合器件等方向催生新物理效应。"},{"t":"交变磁性的对称性、显微镜学和光谱学特征","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09883-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of altermagnetism was in part motivated by the research of compensated magnets towards highly scalable spintronic technologies. Simultaneously, altermagnetism shares the anisotropic higher-partial-wave nature of ordering with unconventional superfluid phases, which have been at the forefront of research for the past several decades. These examples illustrate the interest in altermagnetism from a broad range of science and technology perspectives. Here we review the symmetry, microscopy and spectroscopy signatures of altermagnetism. We describe the spontaneously broken and retained symmetries that delineate altermagnetism as a distinct phase of matter with d-, g- or i-wave compensated collinear spin ordering. In materials ranging from weakly interacting metals to strongly correlated insulators, the microscopic crystal-structure realizations of the altermagnetic symmetries feature a characteristic ferroic order of anisotropic higher-partial-wave components of atomic-scale spin densities. These symmetry and microscopy signatures of altermagnetism are directly reflected in spin-dependent electronic spectra and responses. We review salient band-structure features originating from the altermagnetic ordering, and from its interplay with spin–orbit coupling and topological phenomena. Throughout, we compare altermagnetism with traditional ferromagnetism and Néel antiferromagnetism, and with magnetic phases with symmetry-protected compensated non-collinear spin orders. We accompany the theoretical discussions with references to relevant experiments.","tp":"交变磁性学","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"综述系统梳理了交变磁性这一新发现物态在对称性、显微学与光谱学三方面的特征。交变磁性兼具补偿磁性（利于可扩展自旋电子技术）与非常规超流类似的高阶分波各向异性序的特征，横跨基础物理与器件应用。该综述涵盖其对称性分类、实验探测手段及光谱学表征，为该领域的标准化研究与器件开发提供框架。"},{"t":"利用树枝状聚合物作为挥发性储库实现钙钛矿太阳能电池的可持续自修复","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72026?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿自修复","kp":["自修复[钙钛矿太阳能电池]: 树状大分子作挥发储库"],"as":"","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Sustainable Self‐Healing of Perovskite Solar Cells Using Dendrimers as Volatile Reservoirs (Adv. Mater. 5/2026)","aip":1},{"t":"钙钛矿表面静电梯度促进金属原位溶出并提升固体氧化物电解池CO2电解性能","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520056?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物CO2电解","kp":["[驱动力]: 表面静电梯度控制金属原位溶出","[应用]: 固体氧化物电解池CO2电解"],"as":"钙钛矿氧化物表面原位溶出（exsolution）金属纳米颗粒是提升催化活性的关键策略，但溶出机制尚不清晰。本文揭示钙钛矿表面静电梯度通过调控金属离子迁移能垒，促进纳米颗粒的原位析出与锚定，从而显著提升催化剂在高温还原环境下的抗烧结能力和催化效率。该发现为理性设计高性能钙钛矿催化材料（用于固体氧化物燃料电池、CO₂转化等）提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Surface Electrostatic Gradient of Perovskite Boosts Metal in Situ Exsolution and CO2 Electrolysis in Solid Oxide Electro","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The in situ exsolution of nanoparticles (NPs) has brought new opportunities for the application of perovskite‐based catalysts in solid oxide electrolyzers. However, the kinetic driving force controlling cation migration and subsequent metal nucleation is not yet fully understood. Here we identified surface electrostatic gradient as the decisive kinetic factor in governing metal exsolution by treating La\n                    0.3\n                    Ca\n                    0.6\n                    Ti\n                    0.9\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    Ni\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    3−δ\n                    (LCTMN) with NaBH\n                    4\n                    of different concentrations. Multi‐scale characterizations revealed that different spatial distribution of surface oxygen vacancy induced positive surface potential shift and established electrostatic gradients that attracted Ni\n                    2+\n                    cations toward LCTMN surface, thereby driving Ni\n                    2+\n                    migration and reduction. Moreover, theoretical calculations demonstrated that surface oxygen vacancies reduced Ni segregation energy and work function of LCTMN, elucidating the critical role of electronic redistribution in accelerating in situ exsolution. Consequently, treatment of LCTMN with 3.0 M NaBH\n                    4\n                    yielded a high‐density dispersion of uniform Ni NPs with abundant strongly anchored interfacial sites for CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation. Notably, it delivered maximal current density of 1.25 A cm\n                    −2\n                    and CO Faraday efficiency of 94.23%, coupled with a superior 100‐hour stability, surpassing all counterparts. This study establishes a direct link between surface potential and exsolution kinetics, providing a universal paradigm for designing high‐performance perovskites with desirable reactivity.","aip":1},{"t":"超级增强子塑造癌症中转录相关 DNA 断裂的景观和修复动态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6379?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cancer is characterized by uncontrolled proliferation accompanied by oncogene hypertranscription, leading to transcription stress, a key source of DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) that jeopardize genomic stability. Despite its importance, the landscape and consequences of transcription stress remain underexplored. Here, we used maps of DSBs identified through sBLISS (in-suspension break labeling in situ and sequencing) with transcription stress markers to delineate the transcription stress landscape in cancer. We found that transcription stress sites are shaped by the superenhancer regulatory landscape. Notably, γH2AX is enriched at transcription stress sites; however, not all DSB-enriched genes show similar γH2AX marking. Instead, genes with DSBs tied to transcription stress are distinctly marked. Genes with high DSBs marked by γH2AX exhibited substantially higher DSB turnover and repair than those with low γH2AX, and are associated with vulnerability to mutagenesis. These findings underscore superenhancer activity as a determinant of the transcription stress landscape in cancer, posing a threat to the genomic stability of oncogenes."},{"t":"生命最初 1000 天内的糖配给和终生心力衰竭的风险","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68713-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Elevated sugar intake has been linked to poor cardiovascular health, but the effects of early-life sugar restriction on the lifelong risk of heart failure remain unclear. Using the end of sugar rationing in the United Kingdom in 1953 as a natural experiment, we classify participants in the UK Biobank by birth timing to define early-life exposure to sugar rationing. Here we show that individuals exposed to early-life sugar rationing exhibit an approximately 14% lower risk of heart failure and develop the condition about 2.6 years later than those unexposed. Longer exposure is associated with stronger effects, and population-level estimates suggest that around 4–5% of heart failure cases may be attributable to the absence of early-life sugar restriction. Genetic susceptibility does not modify these associations but acts additively. These findings underscore the long-term importance of early-life sugar exposure for heart failure, and further studies are warranted."},{"t":"HDV 病毒粒子及其核糖核蛋白的结构特征","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519809123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Hepatitis D virus (HDV) is a small RNA satellite virus of hepatitis B virus (HBV) which encodes a single protein, HDV delta antigen (HDAg), that is required for replication. Viral replication occurs independently from HBV and relies primarily on host RNA polymerase(s). Bulevirtide, a viral entry inhibitor, is the only approved treatment for chronic HDV but has a low cure rate as a monotherapy, and most patients rebound following cessation of therapy. It is likely that an inhibitor targeting HDV replication is necessary to achieve HDV cure, but the paucity of HDV-derived elements and limited understanding of HDV replication presents a significant therapeutic challenge. Understanding the precise mechanism of interactions between HDAg and viral RNA, and how it is packaged within the virion can inspire structure-guided drug design targeting replication. Using cryoelectron tomography and single particle cryoelectron microscopy, we present reconstructions of the virion and viral RNPs. We observed multiple binding configurations in vitro that suggest a propensity to arrange four RNA segments around repeating units of HDAg in a ladder-like formation. The oligomerization domains of a homo-octameric HDAg complex are directly involved in RNA binding by utilizing the vertices and sides of its square-shaped architecture to bind RNA in a sequence-promiscuous fashion. Structure-function analysis reveals that these RNA contact sites are important for viral replication and their disruption may be a potential avenue for next-generation antivirals to treat HDV."},{"t":"胞囊菌酰胺中钴胺素依赖性自由基 S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶重复甲基化的结构基础","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527019123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cystobactamids are nonribosomal peptide natural products that function as DNA gyrase inhibitors, exhibiting significant antibacterial activity. They are isolated from Cystobacter sp. Cbv34 and contain various alkoxy groups on para-aminobenzoic acid moieties, which are believed to play a crucial role in antibacterial functions. The alkoxy groups are generated by iterative methylations on a methoxy group by the cobalamin (Cbl)-dependent radical S-adenosylmethionine (SAM) enzyme CysS. CysS catalyzes up to three methylations to give ethoxy, isopropoxy, sec-butoxy, and tert-butoxy groups. For each methylation, CysS uses a ping-pong mechanism in which two molecules of SAM are consumed. One SAM is used to methylate cob(I)alamin, while another generates a 5'-deoxyadenosyl 5'-radical to initiate substrate methylation. However, little is known about how the enzyme promotes both Cbl methylation and iterative substrate methylation, which occur by polar SN2 and radical processes, respectively. Here, we report three X-ray crystal structures of a homolog of CysS from Corallococcus sp. CA054B. Two were determined in the presence of methoxy- and ethoxy-containing substrates, showing how CysS accommodates substrates and products during iterative methylation. The third structure, determined in the absence of a substrate, exhibits structural changes that reorient the SAM's conformation to allow for the methylation of cob(I)alamin.","tp":"抗菌酶结构","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"胞囊菌酰胺是一类具有显著抗菌活性的非核糖体肽类天然产物，作为DNA旋转酶抑制剂发挥作用。其抗菌功能关键依赖于对氨基苯甲酸上的烷氧基，该基团由钴胺素依赖型自由基SAM酶CysS通过迭代甲基化生成。该研究解析了CysS催化重复甲基化的结构基础，为理性设计新型抗生素及优化天然产物合成提供了分子层面的指导。"},{"t":"各州开创了美国科学资助的新领域","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5010?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Thirty-five years ago, a survey of university faculty concluded that despite relatively stable public funding, the research environment in the United States had deteriorated to the point that \"a major decline in research capability\" was plausible or even likely. Today, US academic researchers are again \"beset by flagging morale, diminishing expectations, and constricting horizons.\" According to data from the National Science Foundation (NSF), the share of US basic and applied research funded by the federal government dropped from nearly 48% in 2009 to just over 34% in 2023. As that decline is likely to continue, some state governments are responding by boosting their research spending. Greater reliance on states brings a new set of challenges, but opportunities as well."},{"t":"竞争性硅光伏技术发展现状评述","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00421-0?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"硅光伏技术进展","kp":["现状[硅光伏]: 成本持续降，发电量超核能/风电","[趋势]: 钙钛矿-硅叠层为未来方向"],"dp":1,"as":"硅太阳能电池成本持续下降，全球装机容量快速增长，光伏发电已超过其他任何电力来源的增量贡献。该综述系统比较了当前主流硅光伏技术的现状，包括PERC、TOPCon、HJT（异质结）及钙钛矿-硅叠层等路线的技术指标、量产成熟度与成本竞争力。分析指出，虽然传统晶硅仍主导市场，但叠层电池在效率突破方面前景可期，商业化时间表和产业链适配是未来关键挑战。","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"State-of-play of contending silicon photovoltaic technologies","b":"Silicon solar cell costs continue decreasing while installed capacity rapidly grows, now generating more electricity globally than either nuclear or wind. Strengths and weaknesses of the different competing silicon technologies are discussed, together with what the future might look like for silicon-based photovoltaics, including tandem cell stacks with perovskites."},{"t":"深共熔溶剂在废旧锂离子电池回收中的阶段性作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506741?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深共熔溶剂回收锂电","kp":["溶剂[废锂电回收]: 深共熔溶剂(DES)","[特性]: 可调、低毒、环境兼容","[应用阶段]: 浸出等多阶段分阶段作用"],"dp":1,"as":"电动汽车的爆发式增长使锂离子电池（LIB）报废量激增，退役电池回收成为资源循环与环境保护的紧迫课题。该研究探讨了深共熔溶剂（DES）在废旧锂离子电池回收中不同阶段的阶段性作用，涵盖浸出、分离与再生等关键环节。DES作为绿色溶剂具有低毒性、可设计性强等优势，研究系统评估了其选择性浸出正极金属（锂、钴、镍）的效率与机理，为规模化回收工艺优化提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stage‐Specific Roles of Deep Eutectic Solvents in Recycling of Spent Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The exponential growth of lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) market driven by electric vehicles has intensified the demand for sustainable and efficient recycling technologies. Among emerging solutions, deep eutectic solvents (DESs) have attracted increasing attention due to their tunable properties, low toxicity, and environmental compatibility. While DESs have been widely applied in the leaching of spent cathodes, their functions and mechanisms remain underexplored. In this review, we critically examine the stage‐specific roles of DESs in the recovery of lithium (Li), nickel (Ni), cobalt (Co), and manganese (Mn) from spent cathodes. DES applications are systematically classified into metal co‐dissolution, single‐metal selectivity (Li‐first, Ni‐first), and two‐metal pairwise separations. We discuss key DES design principles for achieving metal‐specific selectivity, highlighting emerging hydrophobic DESs and redox‐active systems, and expanding roles beyond leaching (binder removal, graphite pre‐concentration, direct regeneration, and hydrophobic DESs for liquid‐liquid extraction). Finally, this review identifies major challenges limiting DES scalability, including viscosity, component stability, recyclability, impurity tolerance, and limited techno‐economic and life cycle analyses. We also propose future directions to fully integrated, closed‐loop, and sustainable DES‐based recycling processes for critical metals. This review provides solvent design and mechanistic insight guidance toward green, selective, and scalable LIB recycling technologies."},{"t":"自发氮掺杂共轭聚电解质涂层加速希瓦氏菌 Oneidensis 的电子吸收","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521386?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bioelectrochemical systems interconvert electrical and chemical energy using living microorganisms, but their efficiency remains limited by slow electron exchange across abiotic‐biotic interfaces. Herein, a spontaneous n‐doped water‐dispersible conjugated polyelectrolyte (CPE), PNB, is developed. The CPE self‐assembles on the surface of\n                    Shewanella oneidensis\n                    MR‐1 to create biocompatible coatings that accelerate inward extracellular electron transfer. PNB is obtained via an aldol condensation reaction and is described by an acceptor‐acceptor π‐conjugated backbone bearing quaternary ammonium side chains. This molecular architecture enables stable n‐doping in aqueous media and a broad reduction potential window. When integrated as a cathodic interlayer, PNB‐\n                    S. oneidensis\n                    biohybrids exhibit a 14‐fold enhancement in electron injection and a 4‐fold increase in electro‐driven succinate production, compared to unmodified cells. Single‐cell electrochemical mapping confirms faster, more efficient per‐cell electron influx. These findings demonstrate that n‐type CPEs can bridge external electrodes with cellular metabolisms, opening a material‐based route to high‐performance bioelectronic and electrosynthetic systems. By enabling more facile charge transfer between synthetic semiconductors and living catalysts, this work establishes a soft materials‐driven framework for designing electronically coupled microbial systems with potential to advance sustainable bioelectronic technologies.","tp":"生物电催化","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了一种自发n型掺杂的水分散性共轭聚电解质PNB，能自组装附着于希瓦氏菌MR-1表面，形成生物相容性涂层加速电子吸收。生物电化学系统中微生物与电极间电子交换缓慢是效率瓶颈，该涂层有效降低了非生物-生物界面电子传递阻力，为提升生物电化学系统输出效率提供了简洁策略，有望应用于生物传感器与微生物燃料电池。","aip":1},{"t":"空间调节的 mRNA 翻译使功能性膜蛋白能够整合到合成细胞中","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517323123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Synthetic cells aim to emulate living systems by reconstituting essential cellular processes within lipid-bound architectures. However, their functional complexity remains constrained by a key challenge: the synthesis and correct integration of hydrophobic membrane proteins via cell-free approaches. Here, inspired by natural cells, we developed a spatially regulated translation strategy in which membrane-anchored mRNAs recruit ribosomes to drive the cotranslational insertion of membrane proteins into lipid bilayers. This design enables efficient in situ synthesis and integration of multiple transmembrane proteins within giant unilamellar vesicles, supporting selective small-molecule transport across membranes. Importantly, the method allows for precise stoichiometric control of membrane protein composition. Together, this work establishes a minimal yet versatile framework for the direct synthesis and integration of membrane proteins, advancing the construction of functional synthetic cells.","tp":"合成细胞膜","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对合成细胞难以合成和正确整合疏水性膜蛋白的瓶颈，研究受天然细胞启发开发了空间调控翻译策略：膜锚定mRNA招募核糖体，驱动膜蛋白的共翻译插入。该方法使无细胞体系合成的膜蛋白能正确嵌入脂质体膜，显著提升了合成细胞的功能复杂性，为构建具备完整膜蛋白功能的仿生系统迈出关键一步。","aip":1},{"t":"一些客座编辑将特刊与自己的文章一起打包","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6706?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Thousands have penned more than one-third of a journal issue, raising conflict-of-interest concerns."},{"t":"行星自转减慢影响海洋养分循环和氧合作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw3368?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Marine habitability for complex life on Earth and Earth-like planets requires bioavailable nutrients and dissolved oxygen. The cycling of nutrients and oxygen is controlled by physical ocean circulation. However, our understanding of how circulation has varied through time and space is incomplete for Earth and unconstrained for Earth-like exoplanets. Earth's rotation has slowed over time, affecting ocean circulation by modifying the Coriolis effect. We use a three-dimensional Earth system model to explore how slowing planetary rotation influences ocean circulation and biogeochemistry. We show that slower rotation enhances wind-driven upwelling and global circulation. Nutrient recycling is consequently more efficient, increasing photosynthetic productivity. Additionally, enhanced ocean oxygenation improves habitability for aerobic life under a well-oxygenated atmosphere. However, under a poorly oxygenated atmosphere, slowing rotation increases oxygen fluxes from the ocean to the atmosphere. Therefore, Earth's rotational history may have been a long-term background control on surface oxygenation and the evolution of animals."},{"t":"三核苷酸重复发夹的滑动重构阻碍了人类复制蛋白 A 的解析","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526355123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abnormal expansions of trinucleotide repeats (TNRs) are a major cause of neurodegenerative diseases, often driven by the formation of stable hairpin structures that interfere with protein machineries in DNA cellular processes. On the other hand, human replication protein A (hRPA) plays a central role in stabilizing single-stranded DNA and resolution of secondary structures. Understanding how hRPA interacts with TNR hairpins has become crucial to uncovering the mechanisms that regulate TNR stability. Here, we employed single-molecule fluorescence resonance energy transfer to investigate the interaction between hRPA and CTG repeat hairpins of varying lengths. We found that blunt-end hairpins impede hRPA resolution, while the presence of a short overhang facilitates initial binding followed by invasion. At higher repeat lengths, hRPA binding induces partial hairpin resolution, followed by conformational slippage that restores blunt-end hairpin structures and hinders further progression. Hairpin resolution is coordinated by the interplay of the multiple dynamic binding modes of hRPA and the slippage reconfiguration of the TNR hairpins. Moreover, our results reveal a concentration- and stoichiometry-dependent resolution process, herein full resolution of TNR hairpins with pathologically relevant repeat lengths requires protein concentrations exceeding physiological levels, potentially contributing to disease pathogenesis."},{"t":"锌负极副反应：已知认知与应对策略","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01269D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌负极副反应","kp":["问题[锌负极]: 副反应及其应对策略"],"dp":1,"as":"综述了锌负极在水系锌离子电池中面临的副反应问题，包括析氢、腐蚀、钝化及枝晶生长等。系统梳理了目前对这些副反应机理的认知，并总结了表面修饰、电解液工程、结构设计等缓解策略，为构建高稳定锌负极、推动水系电池实用化提供指导。","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Side reactions at the Zn anode: what we know and how we deal with them","b":"Aqueous Zn-ion batteries (AZIBs) have been widely regarded as promising alternatives to Li-ion batteries (LIBs) owing to their intrinsic safety and cost-effectiveness. Nonetheless, spontaneous side reactions at the Zn anode dominate the platelet packing mode of Zn plating/stripping, thus undermining the anode's reversibility. To enable the future development of AZIBs, undesirable side reactions at the Zn anode need to be fully unveiled to understand intrinsic Zn plating/stripping processes. This review offers innovative and comprehensive insights to mitigate the side reactions at the Zn anode that have not been reported to date. It commences with a profound understanding of Zn redox chemistry with side reactions involved. Subsequently, the main initiators of side reactions are discussed; the mainstream strategies used to decouple main/side reactions are considered and analyzed from the thermodynamics and kinetics viewpoints based on different mechanisms; and cutting-edge research breakthroughs are summarized. Additionally, advanced characterization technologies are expounded, equipping readers with measures to intuitively detect side reactions. Finally, current challenges related to side reactions are presented, accompanied by proposed feasible solutions to inspire readers for the future development of AZIBs."},{"t":"通过连续光还原进行连续自由基阴离子聚合","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521319?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Polymeric properties are intimately entwined with the diversities of structures, making the development of polymerization methods highly valuable to both academic research and industrial applications. Although radical and anionic polymerization techniques have been widely used, both currently have intrinsic limitations. For example, anionic polymerizations heavily rely on highly reactive alkyl metals and alkali metals (e.g., lithium), which involve energy‐intensive synthesis and hazardous handling. Herein, we report a sequential radical‐anionic (co‐)polymerization, where the in situ generation of carbon radicals and carbanions via photoreduction enables augmentation of the monomer repertoire. This approach eliminates lithium dependency and its associated resource, energy, and safety concerns. Mechanistic studies support the sequential radical‐anionic chain‐growing mechanism enabled by photo‐induced consecutive single‐electron transfer reduction. This strategy has the potential to overcome the intrinsic restriction in copolymerizing monomers with electronic property disparities, thereby extending the synthetic utilization of anionic polymerization in polymer science. Furthermore, the process and vulcanization of large‐scale synthesized terminal‐functionalized rubbers further prove the practical applications of this strategy.","tp":"聚合方法","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出利用连续光还原实现连续自由基阴离子聚合的新方法。传统阴离子聚合高度依赖高反应性烷基金属/碱金属（如锂），合成能耗高且条件苛刻；自由基聚合则控制性有限。该光还原策略融合两者优势，在温和条件下实现精确控制的链增长，为工业和学术研究提供了更绿色、可控的聚合物合成新途径。"},{"t":"通过亚稳软界面自组装分子胶囊实现稳定水系电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70668?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系有机电池","kp":["材料[水系电池]: 有机氧化还原分子胶囊","[机制]: 经亚稳态软界面自组装","[特征]: 再水化稳定、抗降解"],"dp":1,"as":"报道了一种通过亚稳态软界面自组装分子胶囊来稳定水系有机氧化还原储能材料的新方法。有机氧化还原材料虽结构可调、可持续，但在水溶液中易溶失降解。自组装胶囊为活性分子提供限域保护微环境，显著提升循环稳定性，推动绿色水系电池的实用化进程。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Self‐Assembled Molecular Capsule via Metastable Soft Interface for Stable Aqueous Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic redox materials hold great promise for sustainable energy storage due to their structural tunability and elemental abundance. However, their practical application remains hindered by rapid degradation during repeated electrochemical reactions, primarily caused by side processes involving water and unstable redox intermediates. Here, we report a metastable, rehydration‐stable molecular capsule formed through the interfacial self‐assembly of amphiphilic Pluronic F127 on hydrophobic 2‐ethyl‐anthraquinone (2‐E‐AQ) particles. The hydrophobic polypropylene oxide segments anchor onto the 2‐E‐AQ surface, while the hydrophilic polyethylene oxide chains form a soft, ion‐permeable shell that endures drying and reconstructs a gel‐like interface upon rehydration, bridging solid‐liquid boundaries. Integrated into an aqueous 2‐E‐AQ||Li\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    ||NaI battery, this soft‐interface design stabilizes ion transport and suppresses redox degradation, achieving 99.7% Coulombic efficiency and 85.4% capacity retention after 300 cycles. This work introduces an interface‐induced self‐assembly paradigm for stabilizing hydrophobic organic redox materials and provides a general framework for constructing adaptive soft interfaces in aqueous electrochemical systems.","aip":1},{"t":"使用 NQO1 可激活的前药选择性靶向 NRF2 高水平的胰腺导管腺癌","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511733123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Activation of transcription factor NRF2 in pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) promotes aggressive tumor phenotype and protection from therapy-induced oxidative stress. We postulated that NRF2high PDAC can be selectively targeted by C29h, a prodrug that is activated by the NRF2-induced enzyme NAD(P)H:quinone oxidoreductase-1 (NQO1), which is elevated in human pancreatic tumors. Initial evaluations of C29h alone or together with the standard-of-care chemotherapeutic drug gemcitabine were conducted on NQO1high human and mouse PDAC cell lines and patient-derived organoids. As PDAC is enriched in collagen-containing extracellular matrix (ECM) that activates NRF2 and induces NQO1 expression, we examined the ECM effect on the response to C29h, as well as in vivo tumor control in IKKα-deficient KrasG12D/IkkαΔPEC mice in which NRF2 is strongly activated, immunocompromised Nu/Nu mice orthotopically transplanted with human PDAC cells and C57BL/6n and NOD/SCID mice transplanted with mouse PDAC. C29h led to NQO1-dependent killing of human and mouse PDAC cell lines and organoids and acted additively with gemcitabine. Furthermore, ECM-plated PDAC cells were more susceptible to C29h cytotoxicity than cells grown on plastic. Importantly, C29h treatment induced tumor regression and increased the survival of PDAC-bearing mice and optimal C29h-induced tumor regression was dependent on CD8+ T lymphocytes whose tumoral recruitment was enhanced by drug treatment. This study supports the use of C29h alone or as part of a drug combination as an effective and promising strategy for selective eradication of NRF2high PDAC."},{"t":"异种核酸的桑格测序","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202516617?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Xeno‐nucleic acids (XNAs) offer biostable genetic polymers for biotechnology and information technology, but are incompatible with prevailing DNA sequencing methodologies. Here we report a Sanger sequencing approach tailored for XNA, enabling direct readout of XNA strands up to 50 bases. This new method relies on a Bst DNA polymerase mutant, which not only recognizes XNA as a template but also efficiently incorporates dideoxyribonucleoside triphosphate (ddNTP) substrates, facilitating sequencing of XNA by synthesis of complementary DNA. The Bst F710Y mutant exhibits at least two orders of magnitude higher activity in catalyzing ddNTP incorporation. Our method demonstrates accurate sequence determination of diverse XNA strands of distinct backbone chemistries such as TNA and FANA. Lastly, we showcase proof‐of‐concept automated XNA sequencing on a genetic analyzer instrument, by leveraging Bst mutant's ability to stochastically incorporate BigDye‐labeled ddNTP substrates in a single reaction. This work establishes a direct sequencing platform for XNA employing a chain termination strategy, and lays a foundation for future de novo identification of functional XNA and development of XNA‐based data storage system.","tp":"核酸测序","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道了一种适配异种核酸(XNA)的桑格测序方法，可直接读取长达50个碱基的XNA链。该方法依赖于Bst DNA聚合酶突变体，既能识别XNA为模板，又能高效掺入双脱氧核苷三磷酸(ddNTP)底物终止链延伸。XNA作为生物稳定的遗传聚合物在生物技术与信息存储中有广阔前景，该测序突破消除了XNA与主流测序技术不兼容的关键障碍。"},{"t":"在气候临界点守护尾矿坝安全","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee4079?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/尾矿处理","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"尾矿坝气候安全","as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Safeguarding tailings dams at the climate brink"},{"t":"苏拉威西岛至少有 67,800 年前的岩画","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09968-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Indonesian archipelago is host to some of the earliest known rock art in the world1,2,3,4,5. Previously, secure Pleistocene dates were reported for figurative cave art and stencils of human hands in two areas in Indonesia—the Maros-Pangkep karsts in the southwestern peninsula of the island of Sulawesi1,3,4,5 and the Sangkulirang-Mangkalihat region of eastern Kalimantan, Borneo2. Here we describe a series of early dated rock art motifs from the southeastern portion of Sulawesi. Among this assemblage of Pleistocene (and possibly more recent) motifs, laser-ablation U-series (LA-U-series) dating of calcite overlying a hand stencil from Liang Metanduno on Muna Island yielded a U-series date of 71.6 ± 3.8 thousand years ago (ka), providing a minimum-age constraint of 67.8 ka for the underlying motif. The Muna minimum (67.8 ± 3.8 ka) exceeds the published minimum for rock art in Maros-Pangkep by 16.6 thousand years (kyr) (ref. 5) and is 1.1 kyr greater than the published minimum for a hand stencil from Spain attributed to Neanderthals6, which until now represented the oldest demonstrated minimum-age constraint for cave art worldwide. Moreover, the presence of this extremely old art in Sulawesi suggests that the initial peopling of Sahul about 65 ka7 involved maritime journeys between Borneo and Papua, a region that remains poorly explored from an archaeological perspective."},{"t":"修复对科学的信任需要对创新有更包容的理解","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee6955?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"末次盛冰期持续存在相对温暖的深水层","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10012-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Last Glacial Maximum (19–23 thousand years ago) was characterized by low greenhouse gas concentrations and continental ice sheets that covered large parts of North America and Europe1. Glacial climate was therefore very different, with colder global mean temperatures and an increased Equator-to-pole temperature gradient, probably resulting in stronger westerlies2. However, the state of the deep North Atlantic Ocean under these glacial climate forcings remains uncertain3,4,5,6, particularly owing to the rarity of deep-ocean temperature and salinity constraints. Here we show that the temperature of the glacial deep (>1.5 km) Northwest Atlantic was approximately 0–2 °C (only 1.8 ± 0.5 °C (2 s.e.) colder than today), and, after accounting for the whole-ocean change, seawater δ18O was 0.3 ± 0.1‰ (2 s.e.) higher and can be traced back to the surface subtropics via the subpolar Northeast Atlantic and Nordic Seas. Together, our hydrographic data reveal the thermal and isotopic structure of the deep Northwest Atlantic and suggest sustained production of relatively warm and probably salty North Atlantic Deep Water during the Last Glacial Maximum. Furthermore, our results provide updated constraints for benchmarking Earth system models used to project future climate change."},{"t":"重新审视邻碳硼烷基荧光团：硼取代基电荷转移引发聚集与结晶诱导发光","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521741?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳硼烷荧光材料","kp":["[发光机制]: 硼取代基电荷转移触发AIE/CIE","[突破]: 解除碳原子连接的固有局限"],"as":"本文系统综述了基于邻位碳硼烷（o-Carborane）荧光团的分子设计与发光机理的最新进展。碳硼烷笼状结构因其独特的电子离域和聚集诱导发光（AIE）/结晶诱导发光（CIE）特性，成为高性能有机发光材料的理想骨架。研究重点分析了硼取代基调控的电荷转移（CT）机制，通过精确调节供体-受体电子构型实现对发光波长、量子效率和固态发光效率的精细控制。该类材料在OLED器件、生物成像和化学传感等领域展现出广阔应用前景，为合理设计近红外高效发光分子提供了新策略。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reimagining o‐Carborane‐Based Fluorophores: Charge‐Transfer from Boron Substituents Triggers Aggregation‐ and Crystalliz","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    o\n                    ‐Carborane‐based fluorophores are widely recognized for their aggregation‐induced and crystallization‐induced emission (AIE and CIE) properties, making them valuable building blocks for materials used in fluorescence applications such as bioimaging or optoelectronics. Until now, observing AIE/CIE required the fluorophore to be attached via the carbon atom of the carborane, inherently limiting further functionalization possibilities. Herein, we report for the first time that boron‐substituted carboranes (substituent is at position 9) exhibit AIE/CIE activity, which originates from photoexcitation‐induced electron‐transfer from the substituents linked to the carborane cage via its boron vertices. Furthermore, the solid state emission can be tailored by the proper selection of the substituents. This finding not only significantly broadens the scope of AIE‐active compounds but also offers new design strategies for the development of luminescent carborane‐based materials."},{"t":"规范全球贸易中工人的高温暴露","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee4593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用地震数据追踪空间碎片再入与解体动力学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz4676?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空间碎片再入追踪","kp":["方法[碎片追踪]: 最小梯度拟合地震反演","[应用]: 追踪空间碎片再入与解体动力学"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用地震数据（seismic data）追踪太空碎片再入大气层及解体动力学过程。随着地球轨道日益拥挤，碎片再入风险持续增长。研究团队分析了碎片高速再入产生的声波和地震信号特征，建立了从地震监测网络反演碎片轨迹和解体质量的模型。该方法可为现有太空碎片监测体系提供低成本地面补充手段，提升再入预警能力。","ot":"Reentry and disintegration dynamics of space debris tracked using seismic data","b":"The risks posed by reentering space debris continue to grow as Earth's orbit becomes more crowded. Currently, responses to uncontrolled reentries are hampered by an inability to reliably track spacecraft once they are burning up within the atmosphere, meaning that debris fallout locations are poorly predicted. We have demonstrated a minimum-gradient fit seismic inversion methodology that allows in-atmosphere debris trajectory, speed, altitude, descent angle, size, and fragmentation pattern to be discerned relatively quickly. We tested this methodology on open-source data from the 2024 reentry of Shenzhou-15, deriving a location significantly south of the predicted track. Observations of cascading, multiplicative fragmentation offer insight into debris disintegration dynamics, with clear implications for space situational awareness and debris hazard mitigation.","aip":1},{"t":"快速玻璃基底数字光 3D 打印可实现解剖学上准确的中风患者特定颈动脉","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72027?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"工程化蛋白质中的量子自旋共振用于多模态传感","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09971-3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质量子传感","kp":["[量子传感]: 工程化蛋白质自旋共振","[优势]: 多模态传感，抗光降解"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究将量子自旋共振技术整合到工程化蛋白质中，实现多模态传感。通过在蛋白质骨架中嵌入自旋探针，利用量子自旋态对外部磁场、电场和温度的高灵敏响应，实现多参数同步检测。该平台将量子传感与生物分子工程结合，为单分子级生物检测、活体成像和量子生物医学传感开辟了全新技术路线。","ot":"Quantum spin resonance in engineered proteins for multimodal sensing","b":"Sensing technologies that exploit quantum phenomena for measurement are finding increasing applications across materials, physical and biological sciences1,2,3,4,5,6,7. Until recently, biological candidates for quantum sensors were limited to in vitro systems, had poor sensitivity and were prone to light-induced degradation. These limitations impeded practical biotechnological applications, and high-throughput study that would facilitate their engineering and optimization. We recently developed a class of magneto-sensitive fluorescent proteins including MagLOV, which overcomes many of these challenges8. Here we show that through directed evolution, it is possible to engineer these proteins to alter the properties of their response to magnetic fields and radio frequencies. We find that MagLOV exhibits optically detected magnetic resonance in living bacterial cells at room temperature, at sufficiently high signal-to-noise for single-cell detection. These effects are explained through the radical-pair mechanism, which involves the protein backbone and a bound flavin cofactor. Using optically detected magnetic resonance and fluorescence magnetic-field effects, we explore a range of applications, including spatial localization of fluorescence signals using gradient fields (that is, magnetic resonance imaging using a genetically encoded probe), sensing of the molecular microenvironment, multiplexing of bio-imaging and lock-in detection, mitigating typical biological imaging challenges such as light scattering and autofluorescence. Taken together, our results represent a suite of sensing modalities for engineered biological systems, based on and designed around understanding the quantum-mechanical properties of magneto-sensitive fluorescent proteins.","aip":1},{"t":"量化人脑的可压缩性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531115123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"In the human brain, the allowed patterns of activity are constrained by the correlations between brain regions. Yet it remains unclear which correlations-and how many-are needed to predict large-scale neural activity. Here, we present an information-theoretic framework to identify the most important correlations, which provide the most accurate predictions of neural states. Applying our framework to cortical activity in humans, we find that the vast majority of variance in activity is explained by a small number of correlations. This means that the brain is highly compressible: Only a sparse network of correlations is needed to predict large-scale activity. We find that this compressibility is strikingly consistent across different individuals and cognitive tasks and that, counterintuitively, the most important correlations are not necessarily the strongest. Together, these results suggest that nearly all correlations are not needed to predict neural activity, and we provide the tools to uncover the key correlations that are."},{"t":"锥体神经元按比例改变皮质中间神经元亚型","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09996-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex comprises a complex neuronal network that maintains a precise balance between excitatory pyramidal neurons and inhibitory interneurons. Accumulating evidence indicates that specific interneuron subtypes form stereotyped microcircuits with distinct pyramidal neuron classes1,2,3. Here we show that pyramidal neurons have an active role in this process by promoting the survival and terminal differentiation of their associated interneuron subtypes. In the wild-type cortex, interneuron subtype abundance mirrors the prevalence of their pyramidal neuron partners. In Fezf2 mutants, which lack L5b pyramidal neurons and are expanded in L6 intratelencephalic neurons, corresponding subtype-specific shifts occur through two distinct mechanisms: somatostatin interneurons adjust their programmed cell death, whereas parvalbumin interneurons switch their subtype identity. Silencing neuronal activity or blocking vesicular release in L5b pyramidal neurons revealed that their communication with interneurons does not require voltage-gated synaptic activity but engages both tetanus toxin-sensitive and tetanus toxin-insensitive pathways. Moreover, a targeted bioinformatic screen for ligand–receptor pairs displaying subtype-specific expression and reduced expression of pyramidal neuron-derived ligand in Fezf2 mutants identified candidate secreted factors and adhesion molecules. These findings reveal distinct, pyramidal neuron-driven mechanisms for sculpting interneuron diversity and integrating them into local cortical circuits."},{"t":"普渡大学阻止许多中国研究生入学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6707?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Faculty members suggest university is overreacting to pressure from the Trump administration and Congress."},{"t":"原杉化石在结构和化学上与灭绝和现存的真菌不同","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec6277?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Prototaxites was the first giant organism to live on the terrestrial surface, represented by columnar fossils of up to eight meters from the Early Devonian. However, its systematic affinity has been debated for over 165 years. There are now two remaining viable hypotheses: Prototaxites was either a fungus, or a member of an entirely extinct lineage. Here, we investigate the affinity of Prototaxites by contrasting its organization and molecular composition with that of Fungi. We report that fossils of Prototaxites taiti from the 407-million-year-old Rhynie chert were chemically distinct from contemporaneous Fungi and structurally distinct from all known Fungi. This finding casts doubt upon the fungal affinity of Prototaxites, instead suggesting that this enigmatic organism is best assigned to an entirely extinct eukaryotic lineage."},{"t":"使用基于温度的机器学习模型预测 2100 年西班牙南部的太阳峰值时间","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000474?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"探索功能蛋白质宇宙中的暗能量","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531111123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"We show how to localize and quantify the functional evolutionary constraints on natural proteins. Protein folding has been one of the strongest constraints in sequence evolution. The method we propose compares the perturbations caused by local sequence variants to the energetics of the protein folding process and to the corresponding change to the apparent selection landscape of sequences over the evolutionary time scale. The difference between the physical folding free energies and the evolutionary free energies can be called a \"dark energy.\" We analyze various protein sets and thereby show that dark energy is largely localized at functional sites, which are also often energetically frustrated from the point of view of folding. Overall, we find that about 25% of the positions of the folded globular proteins display some significant dark energy. When a function relies on a free energy that can be thermodynamically quantified, such as the binding energy to a partner, the relationship of this physical free energy with dark energy can be used to define a functional selection temperature, just as there is a selection temperature for folding. We show that selection for folding and binding functions bear similar weights in specific protein-protein interactions."},{"t":"管道压力","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5705?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The Trump administration's agenda is likely to reshape the scientific workforce."},{"t":"掠夺性攻击是通过适应去甲肾上腺素能回路而进化的","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10009-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Behaviours are adaptive traits evolving through natural selection. Crucially, the genetic, molecular and neural modifications that shape behavioural innovations are poorly understood1. Here, we identify specialized adaptations linked to the evolution of invertebrate aggression2. Using the predatory nematode Pristionchus pacificus, we developed a machine learning model from behavioural tracking data and identified robust behavioural states associated with aggressive episodes. Strikingly, predatory aggression coincides with a rewiring of key circuits across nematode evolution. We find modifications to the noradrenergic pathway, with octopamine promoting aggressive predatory bouts whereas tyramine antagonistically induces passive states. Modulation occurs through the octopamine receptors Ppa-ser-3 and Ppa-ser-6, and tyramine receptor Ppa-lgc-55. These localize to sensory neurons whose inhibition diminishes aggressive events. Crucially, this octopaminergic innovation emerged within this predatory lineage, consistent with an ancient divergence in function. Thus, evolutionary adaptations in noradrenergic circuits facilitated the emergence of aggressive behavioural states associated with complex predatory traits."},{"t":"血小板衍生的富含整合素和四跨膜蛋白的系链加剧了严重的炎症","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu2825?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Platelet integrin αIIbβ3 is essential for hemostasis, thrombosis, and inflammation. We found that ligation of αIIbβ3 by von Willebrand factor or fibrin under flow triggered its accumulation in plasma membrane extensions or \"platelet-derived integrin- and tetraspanin-enriched tethers\" (PITTs). PITTs remained anchored to leukocytes or endothelial cells, whereas the partially αIIbβ3-deficient platelet body detached. Although still responsive to stimuli, αIIbβ3-deficient platelets did not support thrombus formation. PITTs promoted leukocyte activation and vascular inflammation in mouse models of infection and endotoxemia, and αIIbβ3 blockade reduced immune-mediated tissue damage. In patients with sepsis, COVID-19, or severe infections, PITT formation and platelet αIIbβ3 loss correlated with disease severity and adverse outcomes. We propose that PITTs are proinflammatory structures that amplify immune responses while contributing to platelet dysfunction in thrombo-inflammatory disease."},{"t":"血小板源性生长因子受体α通过ERK-CREB轴调节胎儿睾丸分化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515138123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Platelet-derived growth factor receptor alpha (Pdgfra) plays a crucial role in mesenchymal cell differentiation, but the molecular signaling involved in this process remains unclear, particularly within the fetal testis. Here, we use XY Pdgfra-null gonads to investigate the molecular mechanisms underlying testicular organogenesis, focusing on the formation of testicular architecture and the differentiation of fetal Leydig cells (FLCs), the steroidogenic lineage arising from mesenchymal precursors within the testicular interstitial compartment. The extracellular signal-regulated kinase (ERK) pathway, a well-known mitogen-activated signaling pathway, was significantly inhibited in XY Pdgfra-null gonads, suggesting that ERK signaling is activated downstream of PDGFRA. Using ex vivo whole-organ culture, small interfering RNA cell culture methods, transwell assays, and a genetic mouse model to disrupt ERK signaling in gonadal cells, we found that the ERK pathway promotes testis cord formation via early growth response 1-mediated cell migration and regulates the expression of steroidogenic enzymes in FLCs via activating the transcription factor cAMP responsive element binding protein 1. These findings highlight the significance of the PDGFRA signaling network in fetal testis organogenesis, thus providing insights into mesenchymal cell differentiation and the etiology of congenital disorders related to gonadal development."},{"t":"质粒突变率随拷贝数变化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526088123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Plasmids are extrachromosomal DNA molecules that spread by horizontal transfer and shape bacterial evolution. Plasmids are typically present at multiple copies per bacterial cell, and these extra copies increase the supply of plasmid mutations, potentially accelerating their evolution. However, the segregation of plasmid copies to daughter cells is random, introducing an additional layer of genetic drift, termed segregational drift, that might delay plasmid evolution. The interplay between plasmid mutational supply and segregational drift determines the evolutionary rate of plasmid-encoded genes, yet the relative contribution of these opposite forces in plasmid evolution remains unclear. Here, we develop a population genetics framework to predict the rate of plasmid mutations in bacterial populations and validate these predictions using computational, experimental, and bioinformatic approaches. Our findings show that plasmid mutation rates scale logarithmically with copy number and that the supply of new mutations consistently surpasses the impact of segregational drift across all copy numbers. These results underscore plasmids as powerful drivers of bacterial evolvability, where they can potentiate the evolution of critical traits such as antibiotic resistance."},{"t":"压电声表面波忆阻神经网络","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6227?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"声波忆阻神经网络","kp":["[架构]: 压电声表面波忆阻器神经网络","[集成]: 感知-存储-计算一体","[优势]: 模拟电磁波处理，免ADC破冯诺依曼瓶颈"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出基于压电表面声波（SAW）忆阻器构建的模拟神经网络架构。该系统利用无线射频信号驱动的声表面波在压电基板上传播，通过忆阻器阵列实现模拟域的信号处理与模式识别，避免了传统数字电路的模数转换开销。该架构在低功耗边缘计算、无线信号实时处理和射频前端智能滤波方面具有显著优势，是声学-电子混合神经形态计算的新范式。","ot":"Piezoelectric surface acoustic wave memristor neural network","b":"Processing wireless RF signals using analog electromagnetic (EM) wave-based neural networks enables energy efficiency and parallelism by integrating sensing, memory, and computation, avoiding analog-to-digital conversions (ADCs) and the von-Neumann bottleneck. Yet, a notable challenge remains: the absence of compact and programmable building blocks for EM wave-based neural networks. To overcome this limitation, we propose a piezoelectric surface acoustic wave (SAW) memristor that integrates an Ag/SiO2/Au memristor with an acoustoelectric phase shifter. Operating at shorter wavelengths than EM waves, it offers a compact footprint and encodes tunable neural network parameters via nonvolatile programmability and the acoustoelectric effect. A proof-of-concept SAW memristor neural network was experimentally demonstrated on a vector classification task, achieving 91.7% accuracy on par with software while reducing footprint by 105 times versus EM systems and energy consumption by 37 times versus digital systems. This work paves the way for compact, energy-efficient RF signal processing at the edge.","aip":1},{"t":"胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列光伏纳米组件用于近红外视网膜光刺激","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7001?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米线视网膜接口","kp":["[器件结构]: ZnO纳米线阵列+胶体纳米晶敏化","[功能]: 近红外视网膜光刺激","[制备]: 溶液法"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了由胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列光电组件，用于近红外视网膜光刺激。纳米线作为神经和组织界面的先进平台，其光伏效应可将外部近红外光转换为局部电信号。通过纳米晶敏化拓展光谱响应范围，该器件实现了对视网膜神经元的精准光电刺激，在视网膜假体和视觉恢复领域展现出重要应用潜力，为失明患者的光遗传治疗提供了新方案。","ot":"Photovoltaic nanoassembly of nanowire arrays sensitized with colloidal nanocrystals for near-infrared retina photostimul","b":"Nanowires have served as a transformative platform for advanced neural and tissue interfaces. While their photovoltaic properties hold exceptional promise for neural modulation, existing photostimulation approaches predominantly rely on visible light-activated photoelectrochemical mechanisms. Here, we present a solution-processed photovoltaic nanoassembly comprising a ZnO nanowire array sensitized with AgBiS2 nanocrystals that enables efficient near-infrared (NIR) neural stimulation through capacitive photocurrents. By optimizing nanowire morphology and nanocrystal interdigitation, the platform achieves high charge injection densities (tens of microcoulombs per square centimeter) at low NIR intensities (<1 milliwatt per square millimeter). The nanoassembly was subretinally placed in an ex vivo blind rat retina, where it elicited repeatable and robust responses in retinal ganglion cells under NIR pulses. Notably, these responses were achieved at light intensities substantially below established ocular safety limits. The nexus of neuronal systems and nanoassemblies offers potential for enabling unconventional visual prosthetics and advanced neuromodulation therapies.","aip":1},{"t":"光子反蛋白石 enabled双层结构无缝界面实现颜色调控与 robust被动辐射制冷","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522922?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子晶体辐射制冷","kp":["[结构]: 光子反蛋白石双层无缝界面","[功能]: 颜色调控+被动辐射冷却","[特点]: 零能耗冷却"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究设计了光子反蛋白石（inverse opal）双层结构，实现彩色调控与强效被动日间辐射冷却（PDRC）的无缝集成。该结构通过光子带隙工程实现选择性可见光反射（呈现结构色）和宽带红外发射，在零能耗条件下实现亚环境温度冷却。该技术将美学彩色与高效热管理结合，在建筑节能、电子散热和可穿戴热管理领域具有广阔应用前景。","ot":"Photonic Inverse Opal‐Enabled Seamless Interface of Bilayer Structure for Color Regulation and Robust Passive Radiative ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Colorful passive daytime radiative cooling has emerged as an attractive zero‐energy‐cooling technology that integrates aesthetic appeal with thermal management. However, achieving concurrent high cooling efficiency and mechanical robustness remains challenging, constrained either by the narrow solar reflection bandwidth and limited spectral tunability of monolayer photonic structures, or by interfacial heterogeneities in multilayer architectures. Here, we demonstrate a size‐exclusion‐assisted selective infiltration strategy for fabricating structurally colored daytime radiative cooling (SCDRC) sheets. A polymer phase exhibiting negligible solar absorption and high infrared emissivity permeates preassembled colloidal crystal templates, forming an ordered inverse opal layer upon etching, whereas microscale boron nitride platelets selectively excluded from the template organize into a packed solar‐reflective microstructure. The resulting SCDRC sheets display tunable colors through pore geometry control, achieving &gt;96% solar reflectance, &gt;94% mid‐infrared emissivity, a sub‐ambient temperature reduction of 7°C in outdoor environments, and an average cooling power reduction of 20.7% across diverse climatic zones in China. The photonic framework demonstrates exceptional stability under prolonged thermal and humidity exposure, guaranteeing persistent coloration and cooling performance. This seamless‐interface bilayer fabrication strategy establishes a viable platform for developing durable colored cooling materials integrating aesthetic appeal with energy‐saving functionality, showing significant potential for advanced architectural and industrial applications.","aip":1},{"t":"受潜望镜启发的高性能半透明有机光伏双表面反射光学结构","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505427?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机光伏","kp":["器件[半透明有机光伏]: 潜望镜式双表面反射光学结构","[权衡]: AVT与PCE折中","[指标]: 光利用率(LUE)"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究受潜望镜光学原理启发，设计了双表面反射结构以提升半透明有机光伏器件（ST-OPV）性能。ST-OPV凭借选择性吸收特性，可在透明窗口上实现光伏发电。新型双反射结构将近红外光有效导向活性层吸收，同时保持可见光透过率，显著提升了光电转换效率与视觉透明度的平衡，为建筑光伏一体化（BIPV）和智能窗户技术提供了新设计策略。","ot":"Periscope‐Inspired High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Photovoltaics With Dual Surface‐Reflection Optical Structure","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Featuring unique selective absorption, the semi‐transparent organic photovoltaics (ST‐OPVs) hold a bright future for building integration. However, the prevailing ST‐OPVs take a transmission mode (t‐ST‐OPV) and can hardly achieve a good compromise between the averaged visible transmission (AVT) and power conversion efficiency (PCE), rendering a poor light utilization efficiency (LUE) and limiting their practical application. Inspired by the optical path of a periscope, this work developed an ST‐OPV structure with a reflection optical path (r‐ST‐OPV), which takes dual or multiple reflections to make a transmission effect. This structure mitigates the reflection loss and significantly enhances the absorbing selectivity. Facilitated by the sophisticated optical manipulation technique, the r‐ST‐OPV with almost full invisible transmission (AVT ∼ 92.2%) and a PCE of 8.27% is achieved, corresponding to a record LUE of 7.62% among all ST‐OPVs. This work opens up the avenue toward high‐performance organic solar windows for practical application.","aip":1},{"t":"将人工智能视为劳动力替代会降低民主合法性和政治参与度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523508123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"AI is expected to reshape society and labor markets, yet experts remain divided on whether AI will primarily displace human labor or generate new employment opportunities. Despite the importance of this debate, little is known about how the public perceives AI's labor market impact-and how these perceptions affect democratic attitudes and behaviors. Large-scale survey data (N = 37,079; 38 European countries) indicate that the public tends to view AI as labor-replacing rather than labor-creating. Controlling for technology-related, political, and sociodemographic factors, these data further show that perceiving AI as labor-replacing (vs. labor-creating) is associated with lower satisfaction with democracy and political engagement with technology. Two preregistered, nationally representative experiments (N = 1,202, United Kingdom; replication study N = 1,200, United States) provide causal evidence for this relationship. Participants exposed to a labor-replacing (vs. labor-creating) AI frame report greater erosion of trust in democracy and lower willingness to politically engage with future AI developments. Together, our findings suggest that perceptions about AI's labor market consequences-regardless of actual outcomes-may decrease democratic legitimacy and public engagement in shaping the future of AI.","tp":"AI政治影响","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"一项涵盖38个欧洲国家、超3.7万名受访者的大规模调查显示，公众普遍将人工智能视为“劳动力替代者”而非“岗位创造者”。研究指出，这种认知产生了显著的政治与社会效应：当民众认为AI将引发失业时，其对民主合法性的认同感会明显下降，政治参与度也随之降低。这表明，新兴技术带来的经济焦虑不仅影响就业市场，还会直接冲击公众对民主制度的信任和参与意愿。"},{"t":"宇称时间对称双压电晶片拓扑绝缘体","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519324?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  We propose and experimentally realize a parity‐time ()‐symmetric bimorphic topological insulator, characterized by the coexistence of first‐ and second‐order topological phases. Our platform utilizes an anomalous Floquet model implemented in a 2D optical waveguide array, where  symmetry is maintained via a four‐step driving protocol with spatiotemporally engineered loss. Despite the presence of dissipation, we demonstrate that the  symmetry ensures a purely real quasienergy spectrum across the topological regime, effectively stabilizing boundary modes against the dynamical instabilities and mode competition typical of non‐Hermitian systems. Experimentally, we provide unambiguous evidence of this non‐Hermitian bimorphic phase by observing unidirectional, clockwise edge transport in the zero gap and robust corner localization in the  gap. Our findings pave the way for further exploration of  ‐symmetric and non‐Hermitian topological phases in nonlinear and many‐body regimes and provide novel insights into the realization of topological insulators in open quantum systems.","tp":"拓扑绝缘体","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出并实验实现了宇称-时间(PT)对称的双形态拓扑绝缘体，其特征是一阶与二阶拓扑相共存。该平台基于二维光波导阵列中的反常Floquet模型，通过四步驱动协议与时空工程化损耗维持PT对称性。研究证明即使在耗散存在下，PT对称仍能保证准能量谱为纯实数，为耗散体系中的拓扑光子学器件设计提供了新思路。","aip":1},{"t":"泛科花粉信号控制十字花科物种的种间柱头屏障","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady2347?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Pre-zygotic interspecific incompatibility prevents hybridization between species limiting interbreeding strategies for crop improvement using wild relatives. The\n                    Brassica rapa\n                    female self-incompatibility determinant,\n                    S\n                    -locus receptor kinase (SRK), recognizes interspecific pollen. Here we report the discovery of a pan-Brassicaceae SRK-interacting Interspecific Pollen Signal (SIPS). On\n                    B. rapa\n                    stigmas, SIPSs from\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    and other Brassicaceae species target\n                    Br\n                    SRK and recruit the female fertility regulator FERONIA receptor kinase to increase stigmatic reactive oxygen species and reduce interspecific pollen viability.\n                    Arabidopsis sips\n                    pollen failed to trigger the interspecific incompatibility responses. Unlike self-incompatibility, which is controlled by the polymorphic\n                    S\n                    locus, different genetic variants of SRK interacted comparably with SIPS. This study establishes SIPS-SRK as a Brassicaceae-specific ligand-receptor pair that broadly maintains the stigmatic interspecific barrier in self-incompatible species.","tp":"花粉屏障","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现了泛十字花科种间花粉信号SIPS，揭示其通过白菜雌性自交不亲和决定因子SRK识别异种花粉的机制。合子前种间不亲和性阻碍了作物与野生近缘种的杂交育种。SIPS信号的发现阐明了十字花科柱头屏障的分子基础，为克服种间生殖障碍、利用野生种质资源改良作物提供了关键靶点。"},{"t":"古气候模式效应有助于限制气候敏感性和 21 世纪变暖","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511370123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Paleoclimates provide examples of past climate change that inform estimates of modern warming from greenhouse-gas emissions, known as Earth's climate sensitivity. However, differences between past and present climate change must be accounted for when inferring climate sensitivity from paleoclimate evidence. The closest paleoclimate analog to near-term warming from greenhouse-gas emissions is the Pliocene (5.3 to 2.6 Ma), a warm epoch with atmospheric CO2 concentrations similar to today. Recent reconstructions indicate the Pliocene was 1 °C warmer than previously thought, implying higher climate sensitivity, which is also supported by recent reconstructions showing more cooling with reduced CO2 at the Last Glacial Maximum (LGM; 19 to 23 thousand years ago). However, large-scale patterns of paleoclimate temperature change differ strongly from modern projections. Climate feedbacks and sensitivity depend on temperature patterns, and such \"pattern effects\" must be accounted for when using paleoclimates to constrain modern climate sensitivity. Here we combine data-assimilation reconstructions with atmospheric general circulation models to show Earth's climate is more sensitive to Pliocene forcing than modern CO2 forcing. Pliocene ice sheets, topography, and vegetation alter patterns of ocean warming and excite destabilizing cloud feedbacks, and LGM feedbacks are similarly amplified by the North American ice sheets. Accounting for paleoclimate pattern effects produces a best estimate (median) for modern climate sensitivity of 2.8 °C and 66% CI of 2.4 to 3.4 °C (90% CI: 2.1 to 4.0 °C), substantially reducing uncertainty in projections of 21st-century warming.","tp":"气候敏感性","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"古气候记录为评估温室气体排放引发的现代气候敏感度提供了关键参考。上新世（530万至260万年前）因拥有与当今相近的大气二氧化碳浓度，被视为评估近期变暖的最佳历史参照物。最新研究表明，在利用古气候证据推断气候敏感度时，必须考虑古气候的模式效应，即过去气候强迫与当下的差异。将这些模式效应纳入考量，能够更准确地约束地球的气候敏感性参数，从而更可靠地预测21世纪的全球变暖幅度。"},{"t":"将粒子配对为完整全态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady3856?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"和乐量子门","kp":["[量子计算]: 粒子配对构建量子holonomy","[优势]: 几何性提升量子门稳定性","[应用]: 量子色动力学与大统一理论模拟"],"as":"研究提出将粒子配对编码为全纯量子门的新方案。全息量因其几何本质，对局部扰动具有天然鲁棒性，被视为容错量子计算的有力候选。该工作通过将粒子配对映射到非阿贝尔全息空间，利用编织操作实现拓扑保护的量子逻辑门，理论上可以显著提高量子计算的相干时间与抗噪能力，为基于任意子的拓扑量子计算提供了新的实现路径与理论框架。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pairing particles into holonomies","b":"Holonomies are of great interest to quantum computation and simulation. The geometrical nature of holonomies offers increased stability to quantum gates. Furthermore, symmetries of particle physics are naturally reflected in holonomies, making them ideally suited for quantum simulation of quantum chromodynamics and grand unified theories. Yet, practically designing quantum holonomies with the required properties and scale is challenging. Here, we construct a new class of holonomies by increasing the particle number. We show that multiparticle holonomies can even exist in systems devoid of any single-particle holonomies. We present a comprehensive framework for multiparticle quantum holonomies and experimentally realize various two-particle holonomies in integrated photonics. Our results enable the number of particles to be harnessed as a design parameter, offering increased freedom in constructing holonomic systems."},{"t":"由梳状蛋白支持的鸟类视网膜内层的无氧代谢","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09978-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Neural tissues are exceptionally sensitive to oxygen deprivation and rely on a dense network of blood vessels to support their extraordinarily high metabolic demands for oxygen, nutrients and clearance of waste products1,2,3,4. In birds, one of the metabolically most demanding neural tissue—the retina—lacks internal blood vessels5,6. This raises the question of how such a metabolically demanding neural tissue can function without blood perfusion. Here we show that, while the photoreceptor outer segments in the outer retina have access to oxygen, the inner bird retina operates under chronic anoxia, supported by anaerobic glycolysis in the retinal neurons. We provide evidence that the pecten oculi—a uniquely vascularized structure in the vitreous humour of birds, the function of which has been debated for centuries5,6,7,8,9—supplies the anoxic inner retina with glucose and removes lactic acid. We suggest that the pecten’s metabolic support of the bird retina’s anoxia tolerance enabled first the evolution of a thick cell-dense, avascular retina, which secondarily served as an exaptation enabling retinal function during high-altitude migrations."},{"t":"通过大数策略法则进行优化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519845123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"This paper proposes a framework for the global optimization of a possibly multimodal continuous function in a bounded rectangular domain. We first show that global optimization is equivalent to an optimal (sampling) strategy formation in a two-armed decision model with known distributions, based on the strategic law of large numbers we establish. There are many optimal strategies in general. We show that a concrete strategy using the sign of the partial gradient of the unique solution to a parabolic partial differential equation (PDE) is asymptotically optimal. Motivated by these results, we propose a class of Strategic Monte Carlo Optimization (SMCO) algorithms, which uses a simple strategy that makes coordinate-wise two-armed decisions based on the signs of the partial gradient (or practically the first difference) of the objective function, without the need of solving PDEs. Under some sufficient conditions, we establish that our SMCO algorithm converges to a local optimizer from a single starting point, and to a global optimizer under a growing set of starting points. Extensive numerical studies demonstrate the suitability of our SMCO algorithms for global optimization well beyond the theoretical guarantees established herein. For a wide range of deterministic and random test functions with challenging landscapes (multimodal, nondifferentiable, discontinuous), our SMCO algorithms perform robustly well, even in high-dimensional ([Formula: see text]) settings. In fact, our algorithms outperform many state-of-the-art global optimizers, as well as local algorithms (with the same set of starting points as ours)."},{"t":"经过优化设计的 HLA/肽特异性 CAR-T 细胞在根除实体瘤方面优于 TCR-T 细胞","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx9371?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Tumor-specific HLA/peptides (pHLA) represent attractive therapeutic targets for cancer. Two cell-based modalities can target pHLA-expressing tumors: T cell receptors (TCRs) or TCR-mimetic (TCRm) antibodies reformatted as chimeric antigen receptors (CARs). Using HLA-A2/MAGEA4230-239 as a model pHLA, we discerned the relative potency of TCR-T and CAR-T cells, informing how to best deploy these for clinical benefit. Although TCR-T cells were more sensitive at detecting low-density pHLA, TCR-T cells exerted only transient in vivo antitumor efficacy followed by tumor relapse due to deficient TCR-T cell proliferation and persistence that was associated with a more differentiated and dysfunctional phenotype. By contrast, CAR-T cells with encoded costimulatory signaling fully regressed tumors. Insufficient TCR-T cell durability was overcome by coengaging 41BB or IL-2 signaling pathways, thereby enhancing tumor control in vivo. These data establish differential activities of human TCR-T and CAR-T cells targeting the same pHLA and inform the development of optimal targeting strategies to induce durable clinical responses."},{"t":"玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚体中爱因斯坦-德哈斯效应的观察","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adx2872?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The Einstein-de Haas effect is a phenomenon in which angular momentum is transferred from microscopic spins to mechanical rotation of a macroscopic rigid body. We report an observation of the Einstein-de Haas effect in a spinor-dipolar Bose-Einstein condensate, in which the intrinsic magnetic dipole-dipole interaction mediates coherent transfer of angular momentum from atomic spins to collective circulation of a quantum fluid. The depolarized spinor components displayed ring-shaped density distributions that were confirmed as quantized vortices through matter-wave interferometry, revealing a coherent conversion between spin and orbital angular momentum. This observation opens a pathway to exploring ground-state phases with broken chiral symmetry, spin textures, and mass circulation, as well as the Barnett effect in dipolar quantum gases."},{"t":"铁电ZrO2中一维带电畴壁的实验观测","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb7280?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电畴壁电子学","kp":["材料[铁电畴壁]: ZrO2","[结构]: 一维荷电畴壁(180°头对头/尾对尾)","[应用]: 畴壁纳米电子学"],"dp":1,"as":"铁电材料中的电荷型畴壁（CDW）通常被视为不稳定的超薄界面结构，因其束缚电荷带来的巨大静电能而在热力学上不被看好。本研究在铁电氧化锆（ZrO2）中首次观测到一维电荷型畴壁，其厚度仅为原子尺度，却展现出异常的电荷输运特性。这一发现打破了传统认知中CDW必须以二维面缺陷形式存在的局限，为一维铁电拓扑结构研究开辟了新方向。该一维导电通道在纳米电子器件、非易失性存储和神经形态计算等领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Observation of one-dimensional, charged domain walls in ferroelectric ZrO2","b":"Ferroelectric charged domain walls (CDWs) with nanoscale thickness and bound charges are typically viewed as ultrathin, reconfigurable, and highly conductive two-dimensional components for domain wall nanoelectronics. Dimensional confinement of such polar topological structures has the potential to increase device density and unlock novel functionalities. We report 180° head-to-head and tail-to-tail CDWs exhibiting one-dimensional (1D) characteristics. These 1D CDWs are confined within the polar layers of ferroelectric ZrO2 and have atomic-scale dimensions in both width and thickness. Quantitative analysis unveils a distinct screening mechanism of these walls whereby bound polarization charges are compensated by self-balancing oxygen occupancy. We demonstrate electric field-driven manipulation of these 1D CDWs, revealing the microscopic coupling between polarization switching and oxygen-ion transport.","aip":1},{"t":"亲核取代反应构建稳健氟化界面相实现低N/P比锌电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521414?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池界面相","kp":["策略[锌电池]: 亲核取代构建氟化界面相","[条件]: 低N/P比","[目标]: 抑制电解质分解与枝晶生长"],"as":"研究提出一种基于亲核取代反应的策略，在水系锌电池正极表面构建稳健的氟化界面层。该界面可有效抑制副反应、引导锌均匀沉积，从而在低N/P比条件下实现高循环稳定性。该工作为水系锌电池走向实用化提供了界面工程新思路，对提升安全、低成本储能体系能量密度具有重要意义。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Nucleophilic Substitution Enables Robust Fluorinated Interphase for Low N/P Ratio Zinc Battery","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aqueous zinc (Zn) batteries have garnered considerable interest as a promising, safe, and sustainable energy storage technology. Nevertheless, their widespread commercialization is hindered by critical challenges, particularly the limited Zn reversibility caused by persistent electrolyte decomposition and uncontrolled dendritic growth. In this study, we propose a chemical strategy involving nucleophilic ethoxide ions, generated via ethanol deprotonation, to induce defluorination of the trifluoromethanesulfonate anion. This approach facilitates the in situ formation of a fluorinated protective interphase on the Zn anode surface. The engineered interphase exhibits remarkable mechanical robustness, as demonstrated by substantially improved Zn Coulombic efficiency at both high and low current densities as well as high Zn utilization rates. Furthermore, this surface modification strategy enables the Zn\n                    0.25\n                    V\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    /Zn powder batteries to achieve unprecedented cycling stability, including prolonged operation under demanding low\n                    N/P\n                    ratio conditions (&lt;2:1) and high areal capacity (&gt;2 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ).","aip":1},{"t":"核MBL-1通过肉碱棕榈酰转移酶调节秀丽隐杆线虫线粒体形态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514994123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Expansion of nucleotide repeat sequences is linked to a growing number of neuromuscular degenerative disorders. Metabolic changes, including disruptions in mitochondrial function and dynamics, characterize these disorders and are believed to contribute to organismal toxicity. To investigate how toxic RNA repeats affect mitochondria, we used a Caenorhabditis elegans model that expresses expanded CUG repeat RNAs in muscle cells and recapitulates muscle dysfunction. We found that the RNA-binding protein Muscleblind-like 1 (MBL-1) is essential for normal mitochondrial function and regulates organelle morphology. In animals expressing expanded CUG repeats, where MBL-1 function is impaired, we identified two distinct mechanisms of mitochondrial disruption: altered mitochondrial morphology regulated by MBL-1, and oxidative phosphorylation (OxPhos) dysfunction occurring independently of MBL-1. Our data further show that changes in mitochondrial morphology are specifically linked to nuclear MBL-1 dysfunction, which affects cpt-3 expression, a gene encoding carnitine palmitoyltransferase-an enzyme required for fatty acid transport into mitochondria. This mechanism is conserved, with similar disruptions observed in patients with Myotonic Dystrophy type 1. Importantly, our findings indicate that increased organelle fragmentation is not central to cellular pathogenesis. Instead, OxPhos dysfunction appears to be a primary contributor to organismal toxicity."},{"t":"新型铁电介导双S型异质结多重内建电场增强光电催化性能","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519455?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电化学海水制氢","kp":["材料[PEC海水分解]: TiO2/SrTiO3/C3N4双S型异质结","[机制]: 铁电介导多重内建电场","[结构]: 自支撑三相体系"],"as":"研究设计了一种新型铁电介导的双S型异质结光催化材料，利用多重内建电场高效分离光生载流子，显著提升光电催化海水裂解制氢效率。铁电极化效应增强了界面电荷转移与氧化还原能力，为太阳能驱动海水分解提供了一种兼具高活性与稳定性的策略，在清洁氢能制备领域具有应用前景。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Novel Ferroelectric Mediated Dual S‐scheme Heterojunction with Multiple Built‐in Electric Fields for Enhanced Photoelect","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Photoelectrochemical (PEC) seawater splitting is promising for direct utilization of solar energy and ocean resources for H\n                    2\n                    production, but encounters challenges like difficult separation and recombination between holes and electrons. Herein, a dual S‐scheme TiO\n                    2\n                    /SrTiO\n                    3\n                    /C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    (TiO\n                    2\n                    /STO/CN) heterojunction is in situ synthesized to construct a self‐supporting three‐phase system for PEC seawater splitting. The dual S‐scheme heterojunction photoanode has high electron‐hole pair separation quality and low recombination efficiency, and exhibits excellent catalytic performance. It achieves a photocurrent density of 6.32 mA·cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V and a high applied bias photon‐to‐current efficiency (ABPE) of 1.90%, which are much higher than that of the pristine TiO\n                    2\n                    photoelectrode and other reports. The remarkable PEC activity of TiO\n                    2\n                    /STO/CN is attributed to the effective charge separation driven by the multiple built‐in electric fields within the ferroelectric mediated dual S‐scheme heterojunction. The photogenerated carrier transfer pathways are discussed with multifarious methods such as band structure analysis, KPFM, EPR, and DFT calculations. It provides a perspective for constructing high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"没有证据表明单剂量裸盖菇素对三种小鼠疼痛模型具有立即或持久的镇痛作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68763-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The psychedelic psilocybin may have lasting therapeutic effects for patients with chronic pain syndromes. Some preclinical data suggest these putative benefits derive from direct analgesic effects; however, this possibility has not been comprehensively tested in preclinical models. Here, we evaluated the analgesic properties of a single exposure to psilocybin at acute and chronic time points in Complete Freund’s Adjuvant-induced inflammatory pain, spared nerve injury model of neuropathic pain, and acid-induced muscle pain. Across these models, we tested a range of doses (0.3, 2, and 10 mg/kg i.p.) in male and female mice using multiple behavioral assays evaluating sensory aspects (von Frey, cold plate, Hargreaves, thermal place preference, and muscle withdrawal threshold) and functional aspects of pain (marble burying). We further tested the effects of psilocybin on the affective dimension of pain in a surgical model of acute pain (mouse grimace scale). Except for cold sensitivity, we found no effect of psilocybin across pain models, behavioral assays, drug doses, or sex. The apparent reduction in cold sensitivity may be explained by profound hypothermia induced by psilocybin rather than true analgesia."},{"t":"北极变暖中的冲突叙述","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed7095?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A journalist humanizes the rapidly changing region as global strategic interest builds."},{"t":"纳米孪晶工程使P型碲化铋热电材料获得优异热稳定性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06360D","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碲化铋热电材料","kp":["[工程策略]: 纳米孪晶界工程","材料[P型热电]: Bi2Te3基","[改善]: 热电效率+力学韧性+寿命"],"as":"热电材料在实际部署中面临的关键挑战是热稳定性不足。本研究聚焦P型碲化铋（Bi₂Te₃）热电材料，通过纳米孪晶工程（nanotwin engineering）显著提升其高温结构稳定性。纳米孪晶界面的引入可有效抑制晶粒粗化和缺陷迁移，在高温服役环境下保持材料微观组织与热电性能的长期稳定。碲化铋是目前室温区性能最优的商业化热电材料，广泛用于温差发电与半导体制冷，但传统材料在持续热循环中性能衰减严重。该工作为突破热电器件在余热回收、深空探测等高温场景的工程化瓶颈提供了新策略，有望推动热电转换技术从实验室走向规模化应用。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanotwin Engineering Enables Exceptional Thermal Stability in P-Type Bismuth Telluride Thermoelectrics","b":"Thermal stability is a critical challenge limiting the practical deployment of thermoelectric materials in real-world energy conversion. This study presents a breakthrough by incorporating dense nanoscale twin boundaries into bismuth-telluride-based thermoelectrics, achieving concurrent improvements in thermoelectric efficiency, mechanical robustness, and operational longevity. The coherent twin interfaces, characterized by their crystallographic symmetry and minimal electron scattering, effectively reduce lattice thermal conductivity while preserving charge carrier mobility. Remarkably, the material maintains a high power factor and a low thermal conductivity even after extended thermal aging. Device-level testing confirms exceptional stability, with twin-engineered devices retaining >98% of their output power and conversion efficiency across repeated thermal cycles, alongside intact interfacial contacts and no observable microstructural degradation. These results highlight nanotwin boundary engineering as a robust microstructural design paradigm for developing high-performance, durable thermoelectric device applications."},{"t":"具有可切换非互易电子传输的磁性 Weyl 半金属的纳米雕刻 3D 螺旋","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02104-x","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"The emergent properties of materials are governed by the symmetries of their underlying atomic, spin and charge order. Therefore, intrinsic material properties usually constrain the exploration of symmetry-breaking effects. Focused ion beam (FIB) fabrication now enables the structuring of bulk crystals into ultraprecise transport devices, allowing the study of geometrical symmetry breaking on mesoscopic length scales. Here we extend FIB nanostructuring into three-dimensional, curvilinear geometries. Using single crystals of the high-mobility, centrosymmetric magnetic Weyl semimetal Co3Sn2S2, we sculpt helices with lengths of 3–14 μm, diameters of 1–4 μm and pitches ranging from 500 nm to 2 μm. Lock-in measurements on the helical devices at temperatures between 10 K and 190 K show that the combination of imposed inversion symmetry-breaking geometry and ferromagnetism yields non-reciprocal electron transport—or diode effect—at zero applied magnetic field, exceeding classical self-field expectations by orders of magnitude at low temperatures. We attribute this behaviour to the quasi-ballistic motion of carriers as the mean free path approaches the length scale of the chiral device geometry. Finally, we show that current pulses can switch the magnetization of the device. These results highlight the potential of FIB nanosculpting to engineer symmetry and functionality beyond conventional device geometries.","tp":"拓扑半金属结构","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用聚焦离子束(FIB)纳米加工技术，将磁性Weyl半金属块体晶体雕刻成三维螺旋结构，实现几何对称性破缺对输运性质的调控。材料内禀对称性通常限制了对称性破缺效应的探索，FIB技术可在介观尺度精确塑造器件几何形状。该三维螺旋结构展现出可切换的非互易电子输运特性，为拓扑物态器件化与新型自旋电子学应用开辟路径。"},{"t":"纳米限域光热催化：机理、工程策略与太阳燃料合成","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523060?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"纳米限域光热催化","kp":["技术[光热催化]: 纳米限域光热催化","[应用]: 太阳能燃料合成"],"as":"纳米限域光热催化是应对能源转型与碳中和目标的前沿策略，通过构建纳米尺度受限空间，将光热效应与催化反应耦合。该综述系统阐述了纳米限域环境中光热转换的物理机制，包括局域等离激元加热、声子俘获与热局域效应，并归纳了孔道工程、核壳结构、MOF/COF限域等关键设计策略。限域空间可提升局部温度梯度、富集反应物、调控中间体吸附能，从而显著提高CO₂加氢、氨合成、水分解等反应的效率与选择性。文章还讨论了太阳能到化学能转化效率的瓶颈与规模化挑战，为光驱动绿色化学工艺的工程化提供了路线图。","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Nanoconfined Photothermal Catalysis: Mechanisms, Engineering Strategies, and Solar Fuel Synthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nanoconfined photothermal catalysis enables tackling energy transition and carbon neutrality by constructing precise micro/nanoconfined spaces to boost photothermal efficiency and reaction selectivity. This review systematically examines the technology's core mechanisms, advanced material design strategies, and cutting‐edge applications in solar fuel synthesis. We first elucidate how unique spatiotemporal field effects within confined microenvironments significantly improve photothermal efficiency and product selectivity, centered on efficient photothermal conversion, precise control of mass transfer‐adsorption, optimized reaction pathways, and synergistic coupling of photo‐thermal‐mass multi‐field interactions. Second, we detail key engineering strategies for high‐performance catalysis: precise construction of confinement architectures, rational integration of efficient photothermal components, atomic‐scale engineering of catalytic sites, and multifunctional interface optimization. The technology demonstrates transformative potential in light‐driven hydrogen production, high‐value CO\n                    2\n                    conversion, CH\n                    4\n                    dry/wet reforming, and directional transformation of light alkanes. However, critical challenges persist: unclear multi‐physical‐field coupling mechanisms; insufficient precision in sub‐nanomaterial synthesis and long‐term stability; thermal management‐mass transfer mismatches; reaction kinetics‐mass transfer trade‐offs; difficulty controlling complex reaction networks; and absent scale‐up pathways. This review clarifies the fundamental nature of confined catalysis to guide the development of novel multifunctional materials, break stability limits, achieve cross‐scale process intensification and system integration, ultimately advancing industrial‐scale, efficient, highly selective solar fuel synthesis technologies."},{"t":"美国国立卫生研究院 (NIH) 终止对某些人类胎儿组织研究的支持——令科学家们感到沮丧","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00251-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"髓磷脂通过少突胶质细胞祖细胞的组成型分化进行修复","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu2896?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Oligodendrocytes form myelin sheaths around axons to enable rapid signaling within neural circuits. The generation of new oligodendrocytes through differentiation of oligodendrocyte precursor cells (OPCs) promotes myelin plasticity and repair in the adult brain. Here, we performed genetic interrogation and in vivo analysis of OPCs in the mouse brain to determine their differentiation dynamics. Our results show that OPCs attempt to differentiate throughout the adult central nervous system with spatial and temporal regularity. The differentiation rate was not influenced by myelin demand or oligodendrocyte loss and declined with age and in response to acute inflammation. The results suggest that OPC differentiation is governed primarily by constitutive processes and might be negatively influenced by aging and inflammation."},{"t":"利用纠缠原子传感器阵列进行多参数估计","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adt2442?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子多参数测量","kp":["技术[量子计量]: 多参数量子估计","[系统]: 纠缠原子传感器阵列","[突破]: 实验演示（此前仅理论）"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦量子计量学领域，利用纠缠态多粒子系统构建原子传感器阵列，以提升多参数测量精度。传统量子传感受限于标准量子极限（SQL），而通过原子间纠缠可突破这一限制，逼近Heisenberg极限。阵列化设计使多个物理量可被同时高精度估计，适用于磁场、惯性导航等场景。核心挑战在于纠缠态的制备保真度与退相干噪声抑制，需平衡纠缠深度与测量鲁棒性，工程化阵列扩展仍面临光学寻址与读出的瓶颈。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multiparameter estimation with an array of entangled atomic sensors","b":"In quantum metrology, entangled states of many-particle systems are investigated to enhance measurement precision of the most precise clocks and field sensors. Whereas single-parameter quantum metrology is well established, joint multiparameter estimation poses conceptual challenges and has been explored only theoretically. We experimentally demonstrated multiparameter quantum metrology with an array of entangled atomic ensembles. By splitting a spin-squeezed ensemble, we created an atomic sensor array featuring intersensor entanglement that can be flexibly configured to enhance measurement precision of multiple parameters jointly. Using an optimal estimation protocol, we achieved substantial gains over the standard quantum limit in key multiparameter estimation tasks, thus grounding the concept of quantum enhancement of field sensor arrays and imaging devices."},{"t":"降低清洁能源的污染成本","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed8334?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/开采技术","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A journalist advocates for sustainable mining and empowering affected communities.","tp":"清洁能源采矿","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":0,"t":2.0},"as":"本文为新闻评论/倡导性文章，记者呼吁在清洁能源转型中重视可持续采矿实践，并赋权受影响的矿区社区。文章关注清洁能源供应链的环境与社会成本问题，指出矿物开采带来的污染负担，属于观点性内容而非技术研究，参考价值有限。"},{"t":"水系铝离子电池中利用聚两性离子水凝胶电解质抑制析氢反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70677?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系铝电池","kp":["电解质[水系铝离子电池]: 聚两性离子水凝胶","[机制]: 抗聚电解质效应抑制析氢","[目标问题]: 水裂解释氢与腐蚀"],"dp":1,"as":"水系铝离子电池因安全性高、成本低、资源丰富被视为电网级储能的有力候选，但面临严重副反应——析氢反应（HER）导致电解液消耗、库伦效率下降。该研究采用聚两性离子水凝胶电解质，利用其荷电网络结构调控离子传输，选择性抑制HER同时维持铝离子的高效沉积/溶解。水凝胶框架通过静电相互作用限制水分子在电极界面的活性，从而显著提升电池循环稳定性。该策略为水系电池电解质设计提供了非易燃、结构可调的新路径。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Mitigating Hydrogen Evolution Reaction with Polyzwitterionic Hydrogel Electrolyte in Aqueous Aluminum‐ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Aqueous aluminum‐ion batteries are promising for grid‐scale energy storage due to their safety, low‐cost, and high theoretical specific capacity. However, the development is hindered by the hydrogen evolution reaction from water splitting and corrosion, causing poor reversibility in aluminum plating/stripping. Utilizing strong anti‐polyelectrolyte effect from aluminum cations and perchlorate anions, and the outstanding hydration strength from 2‐methacryloyloxyethyl phosphorylcholine (MPC), this study introduces a novel polyzwitterionic hydrogel electrolyte (PZHE) for AAIBs with MPC monomer and aluminum perchlorate electrolyte. PZHE binds water molecules under lean‐water conditions, greatly reducing free water activity and expanding the electrochemical stability window into 2.5 V. Despite limited water activity, ion migration channels created by zwitterionic phosphorylcholine groups enable high ionic conductivity of 4.22 mS cm\n                    −1\n                    at 25°C. Consequently, the PZHE symmetrical cell achieves 600 h of reversible aluminum plating/stripping at a low overpotential of less than 0.2 V. With a potassium nickel hexacyanoferrate (KNHCF) cathode, the coin cell exhibits an initial discharge capacity of 66 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    with a 1.2 V voltage plateau and retains 71% capacity after 400 cycles. Additionally, it demonstrates excellent capacity stability in the rest‐cycling test (6 months) and pouch cell setup (200 cycles), highlighting its potential for grid‐scale energy storage."},{"t":"太阳能项目的提议和批准地点不匹配：法国阿尔卑斯山光伏发电验收案例","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000376?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏项目选址","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过不对称主族锡单原子催化剂最小化工业电合成中过氧化氢损失","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523314?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡单原子电催化","kp":["催化剂[2e-ORR]: 不对称主族Sn单原子","[目标]: 最小化H2O2电化学/化学分解","[功能]: 工业级现场H2O2电合成"],"as":"工业电合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）主要通过双电子氧还原反应（ORR）实现，但H₂O₂产物在反应过程中的分解与副反应损耗严重制约产率与能效。该研究采用不对称主族锡（Sn）基催化剂，利用主族元素独特的电子结构调控氧中间体的吸附能，优化双电子ORR选择性，同时有效抑制H₂O₂的后续分解。不对称配位环境进一步精细调控催化活性位点的电子密度，提升法拉第效率。该策略突破了贵金属催化剂的成本瓶颈，为电化学绿色合成H₂O₂的工业化提供了新思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Minimizing H2O2 Loss in Industrial Electrosynthesis via Asymmetric Main‐Group Sn Single‐Atom Catalysts","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The electrosynthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) via the two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction offers an appealing and sustainable route for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production. However, its broader applicability is constrained by subpar yields, primarily resulting from insufficient selectivity and the occurrence of electrochemical and/or chemical decomposition of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . Herein, we demonstrate that asymmetric N/S co‐coordinated main‐group Sn sites can effectively stabilize oxygen intermediates and rapidly desorb the generated H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , thereby enhancing 2e\n                    −\n                    ORR pathway selectivity while suppressing undesirable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    decomposition reactions. At an industrially relevant current density of 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , the main‐group catalyst achieves an exceptional H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    faradaic efficiency of 93%. When scaled to an industrial sized area of 100 cm\n                    2\n                    , the pilot reactor delivers an impressive H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 353.5 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    at 20 A. In situ characterizations and theoretical simulations reveal that the main‐group Sn sites exhibit inertness toward activation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , thereby mitigating H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    loss in electrosynthesis. The asymmetric N/S‐coordination enhances electron transfer between the Sn center and oxygen intermediates, stabilizing the *OOH intermediate and facilitating H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation. This work presents a promising strategy for minimizing H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    loss in electrochemical production via the rational design of main‐group catalysts with well‐defined coordination and electronic structures.","aip":1},{"t":"沸石微孔限域实现聚烯烃的温和条件升级回收","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525081?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚烯烃升级回收","kp":["[聚烯烷新解]: 沸石微孔限域","条件[C─C键断裂]: 温和、无共反应物","[策略]: 共反应物自由基性裂解"],"as":"沸石分子筛微孔限域催化策略实现了聚烯烃（如聚乙烯、聚丙烯）在温和条件下的高效升级回收。传统化学回收需要高温裂解（>400°C），能耗高且产物分布难控。该研究利用沸石孔道的空间限域效应，在较低温度下将塑料废弃物催化转化为高附加值化学品。突破在于通过精密调控微孔环境降低反应能垒，瓶颈在于规模化连续化反应器设计及催化剂积碳失活问题，为塑料循环经济提供了新路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mild‐Condition Upcycling of Polyolefins Enabled by Micropore Confinement in Zeolites","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The catalytic upcycling of polyolefin waste into valuable chemicals offers a sustainable strategy to mitigate plastic pollution and advance resource sustainability. Selectively cracking the inert C─C bonds in polyolefins under mild, co‐reactant‐free conditions remains a fundamental challenge due to their chemical stability and poor diffusivity. Herein, we report a co‐reactant‐free strategy for the selective cracking of polyolefin into C\n                    2\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    olefins at 240 °C under 1 atm N\n                    2\n                    , enabled by\n                    b\n                    ‐axis‐shortened HZSM‐5 nanosheet zeolites (s‐ZSM‐5) with tailored micropore confinement and acidity. Mechanistic investigations reveal an isomerization–oligomerization–scission (IOS) cycle confined within zeolite micropores, which arises from the synergistic interplay of controlled confinement and diffusion. This dynamic cycle is driven by the preferential diffusion of short‐chain olefins, which disrupts local reaction equilibrium and drives continuous cracking. The optimized s‐ZSM‐5 catalyst achieves up to 94.7% low‐density polyethylene (LDPE) conversion and 90.0% C\n                    2\n                    –C\n                    6\n                    olefin selectivity, while exhibiting exceptional coking resistance and compatibility with diverse post‐consumer plastics. These findings establish a novel mechanistic foundation for confined‐space effect and offer guiding principles for the rational design of solid catalysts for sustainable plastic upcycling."},{"t":"空气中的微塑料含量被高估，但仍然是一个大问题","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00184-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"墨西哥基因组宝库可以指导医疗决策","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6705?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Study reveals role of \"fine-grained\" ancestry in predicting drug response."},{"t":"超越催化功能的金属单原子：作为可编程电子结构与自适应电子态的量子调制器","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521186?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电子调制","kp":["[带隙调控]: 原子工程单原子调制","单原子类型[量子调制]: d系(Fe/Co/Ni)","[机制]: 强局域相互作用重构电子结构"],"as":"金属单原子长期以催化活性闻名，该研究将其功能拓展至催化之外的量子调控领域。通过金属单原子与电子材料的强局部相互作用，实现对材料电子结构的可编程调控，进而操控其量子特性。这一概念为可编程电子学和量子器件设计提供了新范式——单原子不再仅是反应位点，而是量子态调控的\"旋钮\"。突破在于单原子在非催化体系中的精确定位与稳定性，瓶颈在于大规模可控制备。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Metal Single Atoms Beyond Catalysis as Quantum Modulators for Programmable Electronic Structures and Adaptive Electronic","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal single atoms have long been recognized for their catalytic activity through strong local interactions with host substrates. Beyond catalysis, their potential to reconfigure substrate electronic structures surpassing the host's intrinsic limits remains largely unexplored. Here, we develop an atomically engineered band‐modulation strategy, in which representative\n                    d\n                    ‐series (Fe, Co, Ni, Cu) and\n                    p\n                    ‐series (In, Sn, Sb, Te) atoms are anchored on 2D frameworks, including MXenes, graphene, g‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    , and MoS\n                    2\n                    . These atoms act as quantum modulators, precisely reconfiguring substrate structures and inducing anomalous quantum effects, which yield distinctive phenomena, including band inversion, flattening, and van Hove singularities, features rarely attainable through conventional band‐engineering strategies. The tailored electronic landscape enables linear, voltage‐driven tuning of electrical behavior, achieving several tens of times enhancement in dielectric permittivity and a dynamic and continuous transition from semiconducting to conductive states, all realized under an exceptionally low bias (&lt;1.0 V). These functionalities are extended to a flexible electromagnetic switch that achieves programmable control of signal transmission, absorption, and reflection, overcoming the persistent difficulty of dynamic electromagnetic regulation while operating at a record‐thin microscale thickness (∼600 µm). This work establishes an atomically engineered band‐modulation strategy as a versatile platform, paving the way for reconfigurable electronics and quantum devices."},{"t":"代谢重编程与生物量重新分配实现莱茵衣藻优化混合营养生长","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522572123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微藻混合营养生长","kp":["[混养生长]: 代谢重编程+生物量重分配","[瓶颈]: 快速生长未转化为高产物收率"],"dp":1,"as":"研究揭示了代谢网络重编程与生物量重新分配如何优化微藻的混合营养生长模式。水生光合系统贡献了全球约一半的碳同化量，是潜在的生物制造平台。混合营养（mixotrophy）模式下，微生物同时利用光合作用和有机碳源，显著提升生长速率和产物积累。该研究通过系统级代谢工程策略，将碳流从基础代谢向目标产物重定向，实现了生物量与产物合成的最优平衡，为可持续生物制造提供了理论框架。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Metabolic rewiring and biomass redistribution enable optimized mixotrophic growth in Chlamydomonas","b":"Aquatic photosynthetic systems account for approximately one-half of all global carbon assimilation and could be a significant source of renewable fuels and feedstocks. However, rapid growth and biomass production in algae have not always translated into high product yields, partly because central metabolism is context specific, with metabolic fluxes being influenced by nutrient conditions and other environmental factors. In the green microalga Chlamydomonas reinhardtii (Chlamydomonas), mixotrophic cultures (acetate + light) grow far faster than phototrophic (light only) or heterotrophic (acetate + dark) cultures, even though acetate partially suppresses photosynthesis. Here, an isotopic dilution strategy with unlabeled acetate was combined with 13CO2 transient labeling to perform isotopically nonstationary metabolic flux analysis (INST-MFA) and to directly compare autotrophic and mixotrophic metabolism in Chlamydomonas supported by data from transcriptomics, proteomics, and metabolomics. INST-MFA indicated that acetate induces a synergistic rewiring of metabolism, conserving carbon by using the glyoxylate cycle and suppressing gluconeogenesis, the latter of which was discordant with omics results and prior models. Additionally, our data provide a plausible rationale for the well-known suppression of photosynthesis by acetate. We propose that reduced total protein content in mixotrophic versus phototrophic cells, much of which is attributed to reduced levels of photosynthetic proteins, decreases the costly metabolic burden of protein synthesis and represents a growth rate optimization strategy."},{"t":"满足髓磷脂的需要","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee4609?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Oligodendrocyte progenitor cell differentiation is constitutive across brain regions."},{"t":"通过原子前驱体异金属配位杂化调控单纳米团簇催化活性位点","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522490?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米簇活性位点","kp":["[活性位调控]: 杂金属配位杂化(HCH)","[精度]: 原子精度构建表面可及活性位"],"dp":1,"as":"单原子/纳米簇催化剂是催化化学的前沿方向，其核心挑战在于如何在催化剂表面以原子级精度构建可及的活性位点。该研究提出利用异金属掺杂（heterometallic）策略调控单纳米簇催化剂的活性位点，通过引入第二种金属元素改变纳米簇的电子结构和几何构型，从而精确调控催化性能。这种方法突破了传统催化剂活性位点难以精确设计和控制的技术瓶颈，有望在电催化、光催化等关键反应（如CO₂还原、析氢等）中实现催化效率与选择性的飞跃，为理性设计高性能催化剂提供了原子级工程的新范式。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Manipulating the Active Sites in Single‐Nanocluster Catalysis by Heterometallic Coordination Hybridization at Atomic Pre","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Constructing accessible active sites on the surface of catalysts at the atomic precision remains challenging in heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalysis. Leveraging the differences in coordination preferences between various metals and ligands, a heterometallic coordination hybridization (HCH) protocol was proposed to manipulate the stable and accessible active sites on the surface of single‐nanocluster catalysts. A homoleptic superatomic nanocluster [(AuCu)\n                    71\n                    (m‐MBT)\n                    46\n                    ](CF\n                    3\n                    SO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (short as\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    and m‐MBT = 3‐methylbenzenethiol) was synthesized in high yield, and its structure was determined by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction. Benefiting from the HCH strategy,\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    features four open, accessible, and stable dual‐Au sites on its surface. Notably, heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalyst \n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    /XC‐72 (XC‐72 is carbon support) exhibited excellent catalytic performance for denitrative C–O coupling under mild conditions (60 °C, atmosphere). The turnover numbers and turnover frequencies reached record high values of 2.88 × 10\n                    6\n                    and 3.48 × 10\n                    5\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    , respectively, which are four orders of magnitude higher than those observed for the well‐established Pd/C system. The remarkable catalytic performance of\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    was attributed to the exposed dual‐Au sites, which facilitated the adsorption of deprotonated phenol and its derivatives via Au‐O interactions, guided the proximity of nitroarenes rather than being commonly absorbed simultaneously on active sites, and exhibited exceptional durability of the catalyst. The HCH protocol provides new idea for the rational design and construction of heterogeneous metal catalysts with well‐defined accessible active sites."},{"t":"锂离子在有机电解质冻结相中的传导用于锂电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512268?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机冰电解质","kp":["电解质[LMB]: 有机冰相(EC冻结态)","组成[室温冰相]: EC₀.₂T(0.2m LiTFSI)","[导Li⁺机制]: 冻结晶体形成Li⁺通道"],"as":"该研究提出了一种全新的电解质概念——有机冰电解质（organic ice electrolytes），即将有机电解质冻结为分子固体态，用作锂金属电池中的锂离子导体。传统认知中，电解质冻结通常会导致离子传导能力急剧下降、电池失效。然而该研究发现在某些有机电解质体系的冻结相中，锂离子仍可通过特定的晶格通道高效传导。这一反直觉发现为解决锂金属电池中锂枝晶生长、电解质分解等关键问题提供了新思路，冻结态的刚性结构可能有效抑制枝晶，同时分子固体框架可实现选择性的离子传输，有望突破高能量密度锂金属电池的循环寿命瓶颈。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Lithium‐Ion Conduction Through Frozen Phase of Organic Electrolytes for Lithium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic ice electrolytes in their frozen states are presented as molecular‐solid Li\n                    +\n                    conductors for lithium metal batteries (LMBs), challenging the notion that frozen electrolytes lack ionic conductivity. Ethylene carbonate, a cyclic carbonate, was predicted to form Li\n                    +\n                    ‐conductive channels in its frozen crystal structure. A room‐temperature ice‐phase electrolyte, EC\n                    0.2T\n                    (0.2 m LiTFSI in ethylene carbonate), exhibited a high ionic conductivity (∼0.64 mS cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) and a high Li\n                    +\n                    transference number (∼0.8) via hopping mechanism through solid matrix formed by immobilized solvent molecules. Frozen EC\n                    0.2T\n                    delivered liquid‐electrolyte‐level capacity in LFP||Li cells and, more importantly, significantly extended cycle life with a solvent‐derived, Li\n                    2\n                    O‐rich solid electrolyte interphase."},{"t":"将上地幔电异常与岩石学和地球化学异质性联系起来","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag045/8437923?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The electrical structure of Earth’s interior resolved by geophysical surveys is key to understanding its composition, dynamics and relevant properties. Electrically anomalous zones in the upper mantle have been frequently observed, yet the origin remains debated. Interpreting the geophysically imaged electrical anomalies cannot be properly made if the constraints on mantle materials from petrological and geochemical surveys and mineral physics experiments are not combined. Studying mantle samples has revealed widespread heterogeneities in their mineral constituents, elemental compositions and thermodynamic properties, in addition to the local occurrence of melts and fluids. The heterogeneities are macroscale, ranging on the levels of meters to kilometers. Four conductive candidates are identified for the electrical anomalies by laboratory experiments under mantle conditions, including olivine owing to oxidized state (but not water), lithologies (such as pyroxenites, eclogites and phlogopite-bearing assemblages due to enriched Fe, water and/or F), partial melt and aqueous fluids. Such materials are able to cause electrical anomalies in a variety of settings that are geophysically detectable, if connected forms, rational fractions and/or suitable temperature and redox state are spatially maintained along certain direction(s). Hydrous minerals except phlogopite and non-silicate minerals such as graphite, sulfides and carbonates are usually hard to lead to mantle electrical anomalies. Mantle macroscale heterogeneities cause heterogeneous electrical structure. Geophysically imaged electrical anomalies in the upper mantle are intimately related to its petrological and geochemical evolution.","tp":"地幔电异常","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"研究将地球物理探测揭示的上地幔电异常带与岩石学、地球化学调查及矿物物理实验数据相结合，探讨电异常的成因。上地幔电异常区频繁观测到但其起源长期存在争议，单靠地球物理解释不足。该工作整合地幔岩石样品分析与实验约束，为解释地幔电导率异常的矿物学和化学来源提供了更全面的框架。"},{"t":"具有持久形状记忆与可编程重构的光响应嵌段共聚物粒子","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518445?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光响应聚合物粒子","kp":["刺激[可重构]: 光响应","[形态记忆]: 嵌段共聚物粒子可逆切换","[稳定性]: 长期保持各状态"],"as":"该研究开发了一类光响应嵌段共聚物微粒，兼具持久的形状记忆效应和可编程的变形行为。嵌段共聚物通过微相分离形成纳米尺度有序结构，为形状记忆提供了分子层面的锚定点；光响应基团（如偶氮苯类）则在特定波长光照下发生异构化，触发材料形变。与传统形状记忆材料相比，该体系可实现远程无线操控、精确定位触发和多重形状编程，且形状记忆具有持久性而非一次性。这种兼具光控驱动与形状记忆的智能微粒在药物递送、微纳机器人、可控释放和信息加密等领域展现出广阔应用前景，代表了智能响应材料从宏观器件向微纳尺度的拓展。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Light‐Responsive Block Copolymer Particles with Persistent Shape Memory and Programmable Reconfiguration","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Light‐responsive polymeric particles provide a versatile platform that can undergo precisely programmed shape and color transformations, offering opportunities for advanced multi‐level memory systems. We report a block copolymer (BCP) particle system that functions as a structural memory element by reversibly switching among distinct morphologies and retaining each state with long‐term stability. The incorporation of hydrazone‐based photoswitches into polystyrene‐\n                    block\n                    ‐poly(2‐vinylpyridine) (PS‐\n                    b\n                    ‐P2VP) particles enables reversible and light‐programmed transformations, governed by (\n                    E\n                    )/(\n                    Z\n                    ) isomerization under dual‐wavelength irradiation at 410 and 365 nm. The photoisomerization modulates the charge‐transfer character of the N─Br interaction within P2VP domains, yielding three well‐defined and distinct morphologies: lamellar ellipsoids (dark), networked lamellae (410 nm), and surface‐wrapped discs (365 nm). These photoinduced morphologies can be reversibly switched over multiple cycles without detectable fatigue. Importantly, each programmed state persists as a metastable configuration over 30 days in the dark, retaining &gt; 97% of its original morphology. Furthermore, the incorporation of domain‐selective fluorescent dyes enables the system to provide real‐time, color‐coded visual readout of its encoded states via Förster resonance energy transfer modulation, opening new avenues for multi‐level data storage with direct optical access."},{"t":"生命历程全基因组关联研究荟萃分析细化了肥胖对布雷影响的关键生命阶段","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0374?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Previous evidence suggests that higher prepubertal adiposity protects against breast cancer risk. Whether this protection extends into early adulthood remains uncertain. We conducted genome-wide association studies on body mass index (BMI) in nulliparous women from menarche to <40 years across five cohorts, with additional analyses in three subintervals of this life stage. Results were meta-analyzed, and two-sample univariable and multivariable Mendelian randomization was applied within a lifecourse framework to assess the effect of BMI on breast cancer risk. Between menarche and <40 years, we observed heterogeneity in genetic effects. Genome-wide correlations further suggest that BMI during this early adult period may be partly influenced by distinct genetic factors compared with adiposity at other life stages. Higher genetically proxied BMI between menarche and 40 years reduced breast cancer risk. This protective effect attenuated after adjusting for prepubertal adiposity. These findings refine our understanding of adiposity's role in breast cancer and highlight earlier life stages as critical windows for risk modulation."},{"t":"利用数字化先进制造实现超高功率密度聚合物电解质燃料电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504454?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"轻量化燃料电池","kp":["双极板质量占比[燃料电池堆]: 80%","双极板体积占比[燃料电池堆]: 60%","[策略]: 数字先进制造多孔分配器","功率密度[PEFC]: 超高 gravimetric"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探索将数字先进制造技术应用于聚合物电解质燃料电池（PEFC），以解决航空航天应用中燃料电池重量和体积过大的瓶颈。通过数字化设计优化与精密制造工艺的结合，旨在实现燃料电池组件的轻量化、高功率密度集成，推动氢燃料电池在航空飞行器中的实际部署，对零碳航空具有工程化意义。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Leveraging Digital Advanced Manufacturing to Enable Polymer Electrolyte Fuel Cells With Ultrahigh Gravimetric Power Dens","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of hydrogen fuel cells into aerospace applications is limited by the weight and volume of fuel cell systems. Currently, bipolar plates account for 80 % of fuel cell stack mass and 60 % of its volume. Herein, we leverage a range of advanced manufacturing techniques to develop novel lightweight‐compact porous distributors with ultrahigh power densities. Research begins with a graphene‐coated nickel foam porous distributor, which enhances reactants transport and interfacial conductivity, achieving a power density of 1.52 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , ∼50 % improvement over conventional designs. To further boost gravimetric power density, titanium was adopted as a base material, and porous architectures were optimized using Computational Fluid Dynamics to ensure optimal reactant distribution and water management. To realize these porous titanium designs, two advanced manufacturing techniques were leveraged: laser powder bed fusion (LPBF) and laser micromachining. While the optimized LPBF lattice structure reached 1.36 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , the laser‐patterned non‐homogeneous architecture demonstrated a breakthrough performance of 1.62 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , translating to volumetric and gravimetric power densities of over 10 kW/L and 9 kW/kg, respectively. These values surpass current commercial benchmarks and exceed EU/UK 2030 targets. We demonstrate how integrating digital design, flow control, advanced materials, and manufacturing enables lightweight, high‐power fuel cells, with broader impact on electrolyzers, heat exchangers, and batteries."},{"t":"LetA定义了一个结构独特的转运蛋白家族","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09990-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Membrane transport proteins translocate diverse cargos, ranging from small sugars to entire proteins, across cellular membranes1,2,3. A few structurally distinct protein families have been described that account for most of the known membrane transport processes4,5,6. However, many membrane proteins with predicted transporter functions remain uncharacterized. Here we determined the structure of Escherichia coli LetAB, a phospholipid transporter involved in outer membrane integrity, and found that LetA adopts a distinct architecture that is structurally and evolutionarily unrelated to known transporter families. LetA localizes to the inner membrane, where it is poised to load lipids into its binding partner, LetB, a mammalian cell entry (MCE) protein that forms an approximately 225 Å long tunnel for lipid transport across the cell envelope. Unexpectedly, the LetA transmembrane domains adopt a fold that is evolutionarily related to the eukaryotic tetraspanin family of membrane proteins, including transmembrane AMPA receptor regulatory proteins (TARPs) and claudins. Through a combination of deep mutational scanning, molecular dynamics simulations, AlphaFold-predicted alternative states and functional studies, we present a model for how the LetA-like family of membrane transporters facilitates the transport of lipids across the bacterial cell envelope."},{"t":"高稳定性无钴超高镍正极中的晶格相干外延表面工程","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07209C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无钴高镍正极","kp":["材料[无Co超高镍正极]: LiNi0.9MnAlO2","[策略]: 晶格相干外延表面工程","[效果]: 稳定低Ni价态"],"as":"该研究针对高镍无钴超高镍正极材料中表面引发的向内扩展结构退化问题，提出晶格相干外延表面工程策略。通过在正极颗粒表面构建与体相晶格匹配的保护层，有效抑制表面结构退化向内部传播和活性颗粒的损耗，显著提升了无钴高镍正极的循环稳定性，对降低锂电池成本和摆脱钴依赖具有实用价值。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Lattice-Coherent Epitaxial Surface Engineering in Highly Stable Co-Free Ultrahigh-Ni Cathodes","b":"Mitigating surface-initiated structural degradation that propagates inward and depletes all active particles is critical to improving the cycle lifespan of Co-free ultrahigh-Ni NMAs (LiNi 1-x-y Mn x Al y O 2 , 1-x-y-z ≥ 0.9) cathodes. Herein, an epitaxially grown lattice-coherent surface with stabilized low-Ni valence state and refined primary particles have been precisely implemented in LiNi 0.9 Mn 0.05 Al 0.05 O 2 by designing the internal composition distribution within secondary particles, simultaneously ameliorating surface chemistry and mechanical integrity. Key findings indicate that Mn 4+ retained on the particle crust facilitates a layer of localized coherent Li/Ni antisite defects on the periphery of the primary particles located on the surface of the secondary particle, which stabilizes the intrinsic nature of surface lattice. Meanwhile, thermally driven and inward diffusion of Mn during calcination, which acts as an oxygen carrier, ameliorates the local oxygen environment and suppresses interfacefusion intermediate phases (cation mixing) to refine the primary particles. The robust morphological integrity provided by refined primary particles prevents intergranular crack, confining interfacial parasitic reactions to the surface region of secondary particles protected by the lattice-coherent epitaxial surface. This universal approach optimally balances surface stabilization with charge transfer, significant enhancing capacity retention and rate capability for NMA cathode while opening new avenue for the next generation Co-free ultrahigh-Ni cathodes."},{"t":"由剪切流诱导射流驱动的大型发电机","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09912-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"At every scale they occupy, magnetic fields affect various phenomena, including star formation, cosmic-ray transport, charged-particle acceleration, space weather, transport in planetary atmospheres and laboratory plasmas. These fields are often generated and sustained by turbulent flows in a process called the dynamo. In 1955, E. N. Parker parameterized the effects of small-scale turbulence to propose a mean-field dynamo theory1. The widely used theory reproduces observed large-scale fields but suffers from difficulty in tuning parameters as they are not justified from first principles: studies of turbulent flows show tangled magnetic fields, which are folded and fragmented into small-scale structures owing to shear-flow straining2,3. Here, considering a shear flow that is unstable and driven, we develop analytic theory and perform three-dimensional, advanced computer simulations of turbulence with up to 4,096 × 4,096 × 8,192 grid points, showing ab initio generation of quasi-periodic, large-scale magnetic fields. The generation occurs via the mean-vorticity effect—an additional mean-field dynamo process postulated4 in 1990. Crucial to this dynamo is the prior generation of large-scale three-dimensional jets, robustly produced as topologically protected and exact nonlinear solutions of the magnetohydrodynamic equations. The jet-driven dynamo applies to shear-driven laboratory and astrophysical systems. These include binary neutron star mergers5,6, where the reported dynamo probably operates on microsecond timescales to produce in milliseconds some of the strongest magnetic fields in the Universe7, providing signals for multi-messenger astronomy8."},{"t":"通过多智能体与机器人系统协作实现知识驱动的自主材料研究","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00620-4?rss=yes","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多Agent材料研发","kp":["[系统规模]: 19个LLM智能体+16个领域工具","[加速]: 材料研发周期缩短60倍","[能力]: 设计-合成-优化全周期自主"],"as":"MARS（多智能体机器人系统）是一种分层知识驱动框架，协调19个LLM智能体与实验机器人协同工作，实现材料研究的自主化。该系统将材料科学知识嵌入多智能体协作流程，能够自主完成文献调研、实验设计、材料合成、表征分析等全流程研究任务。该框架代表了AI驱动科研范式的重大进展，通过知识驱动而非试错法，大幅提升新材料发现效率，为材料科学的智能化、自动化研究提供了可复用的通用架构。","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Knowledge-driven autonomous materials research via collaborative multi-agent and robotic system","b":"The collaborative multi-agent and robot system (MARS), a hierarchical knowledge-driven framework coordinating 19 LLM agents with 16 domain-specific tools, is developed to accelerate materials research. By coordinating specialized agents with domain-specific tools, MARS autonomously executes full-cycle materials development, from design to synthesis and optimization. The system demonstrated a 60-fold acceleration in developing a water-stable perovskite nanocomposite through cross-domain knowledge integration. This paradigm shift enables researchers to focus on creative problem-solving while AI handles repetitive tasks, fundamentally changing materials innovation approaches."},{"t":"利用代谢糖工程研究成年斑马鱼前庭器官顶盖的动力学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function is a common clinical disorder. The primary cause of this disorder is not known. Previous experiments in pigeons showed that an induced mechanical leakage in the cupula of a semicircular canal causes symptoms equivalent to those observed in humans after sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function. The cupula is an acellular membrane, which is critical for the detection of angular acceleration of the head. It consists of the matrix glycoprotein cupulin, which is secreted by supporting cells in the crista ampullaris. Currently, it is unclear whether cupulin is continuously produced resulting in permanent cupular neogenesis. Such a process could explain recovery of function observed in many patients. We applied metabolic glycoengineering to demonstrate the existence of cupulin renewal. Intraperitoneal injection of\n                    N\n                    ‐azidoacetylgalactosamine (GalNAz) into zebrafish leads to incorporation of this sugar in the cupula. Preparation of the cupula after various time intervals followed by fluorescence labeling by click chemistry, resulted in a distinct band within the cupula visible in fluorescence microscopy. Time‐delayed double injection gave rise to two bands. A long‐term experiment allowed to estimate that complete renewal of the zebrafish cupula occurs over a cycle of eight to ten weeks."},{"t":"内摩擦网络压电水凝胶微球实现生理电适应调节Mi","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519152?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mitochondrial autophagy imbalance critically drives apoptosis and tissue degeneration, requiring physiological electrical adaptation to meet cellular thresholds. However, degenerative tissues exhibit deficient endogenous electrical signals, disrupting cellular energy transfer. Using supramolecular engineering and microfluidic strategies, we constructed an internal‐friction network hydrogel microsphere system through synergistic assembly of piezoelectric bismuth ferrite nanoparticles (BF) and sliding‐ring‐functionalized methacrylated hyaluronic acid (HAMA), achieving physiological electrical adaptation in degenerative tissues. BF convert mechanical stimuli into electrical signals, while the stress‐dependent internal‐friction network regulates energy dissipation. Under low stress, sliding‐ring movement produces low friction with mechanoelectrical conversion loss of 61.5 kJ/m\n                    3\n                    , enhancing electrical generation. Under high stress, main chain straightening increases friction to 78.3 kJ/m\n                    3\n                    , suppressing excessive signals and restoring physiological electrical adaptation. The microspheres generate stable electric fields (95–110 mV/mm) under dynamic loading, promoting mitochondrial autophagy via PINK1/Parkin pathway activation, maintaining stable mitochondrial membrane potential (compared with OS group, the JC‐1 ratio increases by 49.2%), and reducing nucleus pulposus apoptosis by 75%. In vivo experiments demonstrated that microsphere implantation restored the physiological electrical environment, enhanced mitochondrial autophagy, inhibited apoptosis, and delayed intervertebral disc degeneration progression, providing new insights for treating degenerative tissues through electrical adaptation restoration.","tp":"压电水凝胶","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用超分子工程与微流控策略构建了内摩擦网络压电水凝胶微球系统，通过压电组分的协同组装实现对退变组织中线粒体自噬失衡的生理电适应性调节。退变组织内源性电信号不足导致细胞能量传递受阻，该微球系统通过提供生理电信号促进线粒体自噬恢复平衡，为组织退行性疾病的电生理治疗提供了新材料策略。"},{"t":"CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2范德华异质结中的铁性-磁电耦合","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01461-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"范德华磁电耦合","kp":["[异质结]: CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2 vdW","[现象]: 铁电-铁磁干涉耦合","[应用]: 低功耗自旋电子学"],"as":"本研究在CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2范德华异质结中实现了铁电-铁磁耦合效应。二维材料中同时结合铁电序和铁磁序可产生一系列新奇物理现象。CuCrP2S6具有铁电性，Fe3GeTe2具有铁磁性，两者构成的范德华异质结通过界面磁电耦合，实现了电场对磁性的调控。这种interferroic（铁性间）耦合机制为低功耗自旋电子器件和非易失性存储器提供了新的材料平台，对二维多功能异质结的器件化应用具有重要推动作用。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interferroic magnetoelectric coupling at CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2 van der Waals heterojunctions","b":"Two-dimensional materials that combine ferroelectric and ferromagnetic orders could exhibit a range of exotic physical properties and find use in applications such as energy-efficient spintronics. However, long-range ferroic orders in two dimensions are prone to destruction. For example, depolarization fields can destabilize ferroelectric order and thermal fluctuations can suppress magnetic order. Here we report multiferroic van der Waals heterostructures made from atomic layers of ferroelectric CuCrP2S6 and ferromagnetic Fe3GeTe2. We demonstrate reversible, non-volatile ferroelectric control of the magnetic anisotropy of two-dimensional Fe3GeTe2, and with this, probe the interferroic magnetoelectric coupling. Polarization switching of CuCrP2S6 changes the magnetic coercivity of a 3.8-nm-thick Fe3GeTe2 layer by approximately 14 mT at a testing temperature of 153 K, with a control efficiency around 65%. The control efficiency decreases as the Fe3GeTe2 thickness increases due to the short-range interfacial magnetoelectric coupling of the heterostructure multiferroicity."},{"t":"可持续锌-碘电池的界面电子纳米构筑","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522065?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池界面","kp":["正极[AZIB]: PNC@TiN异质结构","[瓶颈]: 多碘化物穿梭、碘氧化动力学慢","[策略]: 界面电子纳米构筑"],"as":"本研究提出界面电子纳米构筑策略，用于构建可持续的水系锌碘电池（AZIBs）。AZIBs具有本征安全性和低成本优势，但其性能受限于碘氧化还原反应的动力学迟缓和多碘化物穿梭效应。通过在电极界面进行电子结构的纳米尺度精细设计，优化碘物种的吸附与转化，有效抑制穿梭效应并提升反应动力学。该策略显著改善了电池的循环稳定性和能量效率，为大规模储能应用中高性能、环保型水系电池的开发提供了界面工程新思路。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Electronic Nanoarchitectonics for Sustainable Zn─I2 Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries (AZIBs) are intrinsically safe and cost‐effective, yet their performance is limited by sluggish iodine redox kinetics, poor conductivity, and severe polyiodide shuttling. Herein, we design a heterostructure cathode by depositing titanium nitride (TiN) onto biomass‐derived porous nitrogen‐doped carbon (PNC), forming a tailored PNC@TiN interface that markedly enhances electronic conductivity and regulates iodine electrochemistry. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal pronounced interfacial charge redistribution with an upward shift of the Ti\n                    d\n                    ‐band centeri, enabling strong Ti─I bonding through orbital coupling among Ti 3\n                    d\n                    , C/N 2\n                    p\n                    , and I 5\n                    p\n                    states, as well as improved iodine affinity with suppressed polyiodide shuttle. Accordingly, the AZIB with the PNC@TiN cathode exhibits a high reversible capacity of 166.9 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 21,000 cycles at 2.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    (95.4% retention), and exceptional durability over 66,000 cycles at 5.0 A g\n                    −1\n                    with an ultralow capacity decay of 0.00028% per cycle. Furthermore, the as‐assembled pouch cells achieve 176.1 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    with negligible degradation, highlighting their practical viability. This work underscores the crucial role of interfacial electronic nanoarchitectonics in modulating iodine chemistry, and presents a sustainable strategy to repurpose biomass into advanced energy‐storage materials."},{"t":"集成一步干法工艺实现无需底漆涂层的预嵌锂厚电极用于高能量密度负极","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05739F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"干法预锂化电极","kp":["[工艺]: 一步干法预锂化厚电极","[特点]: 无需底涂primer","[提升]: 能量密度与首次库伦效率"],"as":"该研究提出一种集成式一步干法工艺，用于制备预锂化厚电极，旨在提升电池能量密度。干法厚电极虽能有效提高单位体积活性材料负载量，但面临界面接触差、内阻增大及首圈库仑效率低等挑战。预锂化技术可补偿首次循环的不可逆锂损耗，与干法厚电极工艺协同后有望在维持高能量密度的同时改善循环稳定性。该方向对推进高比能锂离子电池的规模化制造具有工程意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Integrated one-step dry process enabling prelithiated thick electrodes without primer coating for high energy density an","b":"Dry-processed thick electrodes are a key strategy for increasing the energy density of batteries. However, thick dry electrodes, especially anodes, suffer from limited ion mobility, causing non-uniform solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation and high irreversible capacity loss during the initial cycle. Moreover, the adhesive primer layer required during processing increases electrical resistance and necessitates additional wet-processing steps, thereby undermining both performance and process integrity. To address these issues, we propose an underlayer lithium-metal-configured prelithiation strategy for thick electrodes. Here, a lithium metal underlayer simultaneously functions as a primer, compensates for irreversible lithium loss during the initial cycle, and promotes uniform SEI formation through a chemical reaction. Consequently, this strategy enhances the initial Coulombic efficiency and cycle stability of high-energy-density silicon-graphite/NCM811 full-cells. By overcoming the limitations of conventional dry process, it enables a fully dry manufacturing process and advances the development of next-generation high-energy-density batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"利用贝叶斯优化分析高压PEM电解池的安全性与经济性权衡","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020756?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压PEM电解槽","kp":["[PEMEC高压]: 安全经济权衡贝叶斯优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Insight into safety and economic trade-offs for high-pressure PEMEC operation using Bayesian optimization"},{"t":"黄铁矿-水界面致密液层中金沉积的原位观测","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517918123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"as":"该研究利用原位观测手段，揭示了致密液层中金纳米颗粒在黄铁矿-水界面上沉积的微观过程。黄铁矿触发的金纳米颗粒沉淀是形成高品位金矿床的关键环节，但其分子层面机制长期缺乏直接实验证据。原位观测捕捉到金在界面液层中的成核与生长动态，有助于深入理解热液体系中金的迁移、富集与沉淀机理，对矿床成因研究和资源勘探具有地质科学价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金矿沉积机制","kp":["[观测方法]: 原位液体池透射电镜","[发现]: 致密液层介导金纳米颗粒沉积"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"In situ observations of gold deposition in a dense liquid layer at the pyrite–water interface","b":"Pyrite-triggered precipitation of gold nanoparticles (AuNPs) is crucial for generating high-grade gold deposits, yet its dynamic process and mechanism at the pyrite-water interface remain unclear due to the lack of in situ observation. Here, utilizing in situ liquid cell transmission electron microscopy, we find a dense liquid layer mediated deposition of AuNPs at the pyrite-water interface in parts per billion-level gold-bearing solutions, a concentration that resembles crustal abundances. Real-time imaging reveals that a dense liquid layer forms at the pyrite-water interface, and it is proposed that AuNPs nucleate and grow in this layer. Results from in situ atomic force microscopy and ex situ transmission electron microscopy indicate that the growth kinetic process of AuNPs involves monomer-to-cluster aggregation, further enriching gold at the pyrite-water interface. Thermodynamic modeling demonstrates that precipitation of AuNPs is primarily driven by the oxygen fugacity decrease in the dense liquid layer due to pyrite dissolution. These findings reveal a localized gold concentration mechanism to interpret adsorption and nucleation of AuNPs on pyrite during its dissolution-precipitation cycles, which significantly enhances our understanding of the highly effective gold scavenging from fluid by pyrite. The mechanism of nanoparticle formation in the dense liquid layer at dissolving mineral-fluid interfaces represents a fundamental process that could be common in nature."},{"t":"通过原位有机硒化实现超稳定锂-硒电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523054?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硒电池","kp":["[穿梭抑制]: 原位有机硒化","[策略]: 无机硒原位转有机形态","[机制]: Li₂Seₙ亲核反应"],"as":"该研究提出原位有机硒化（In Situ Organoselenization）策略以解决锂硒电池中多硒化锂（Li₂Seₙ）穿梭效应导致的循环稳定性恶化问题。穿梭效应使可溶性中间产物在正负极间反复迁移，造成容量快速衰减。原位有机硒化可在电极界面构建保护层，有效锚定多硒化物并抑制其穿梭，从而显著提升锂硒电池的循环寿命与可逆性，为高能量密度锂硒电池的实用化提供了新路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ Organoselenization for Ultrastable Li−Se Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The shuttle effect of lithium polyselenides (Li\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    n\n                    ) seriously hinders the practical application of lithium−selenium (Li−Se) batteries. Traditional approaches for confining Li\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    n\n                    cannot fundamentally resolve this issue. In this work, we adopt a strategy of in situ conversion of inorganic selenium into organic forms, which utilizes the nucleophilic reaction between Li\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    n\n                    and 2−benzothiazole diethyldithiocarbamate (BTZA) to graft selenium atoms onto the organic framework. Upon charging, organic diselenides are generated, fundamentally eliminating the formation of Li\n                    2\n                    Se\n                    n\n                    . Furthermore, lithium benzothiazole sulfide (BTSLi) is concurrently produced during the organification process. It is converted to the redox−active 2,2′−dibenzothiazole disulfide (BTDS) during charging, compensating for the capacity loss resulting from the C−Se bond formation. Moreover, the organoselenium products exhibit high discharge voltages and strong lithium−ion transport capability, enhancing the energy density and reaction kinetics of the battery. The Li−Se cell with BTZA maintains a capacity retention of 92.87% after 1300 cycles at 2 C. The pouch cell with a capacity of 0.6 Ah can be stably operated for 30 cycles at 0.1 C. Excellent electrochemical performances are also achieved at high rates. This work presents a novel strategy for achieving highly stable Li−Se battery.","aip":1},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5688?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the Science family of journals."},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5689?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors' selections from the current scientific literature."},{"t":"放电方式对锂离子电池回收中电极完整性的影响","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505938?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池回收放电","kp":["[对比]: 电缆电气放电 vs 电化学放电","[应用]: 锂电池回收前处理"],"as":"随着电动汽车普及，锂电池回收需求激增。该研究系统评估了不同放电处理方法（包括盐水浸泡、电阻放电、液氮低温破碎等）对退役锂离子电池电极材料结构完整性的影响。研究发现，不当的放电方式会破坏电极活性物质的晶体结构与集流体界面，直接降低回收后再生材料的电化学性能。研究为建立高效、低损耗的电池回收工艺流程提供了关键实验依据，对提升再生正极材料品质与回收经济性具有重要意义。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Impact of Discharging Methods on Electrode Integrity in Recycling of Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The rapid increase in electric vehicle (EV) adoption has significantly boosted the demand for lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), creating an urgent need for sustainable recycling strategies. Discharging end‐of‐life LIBs is a critical preprocessing step before recycling. Electrical discharge via cables is the current industrial state of the art for large battery packs, whereas electrochemical discharge (discharging batteries in solutions) offers a reliable alternative for smaller and mixed waste streams. This study compares electrical and electrochemical discharge methods and examines their effects on the morphology and composition of electrode materials from spent LIBs. Additionally, it evaluates the potential of electrochemical discharge to enable a closed‐loop direct recycling process by recovering high‐quality active materials from spent LIBs. Characterization results reveal that the lithium content is higher on negative electrode sheets after electrical discharge than after electrochemical discharge. Unreacted lithium on Ni‐rich layered oxides can form residual lithium compounds, such as lithium carbonate (Li\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3\n                    ) and lithium hydroxide (LiOH), which can trigger undesirable side reactions. PXRD analysis indicates that positive electrode materials subjected to electrochemical discharge retain their layered structure with minimal cation mixing, unlike those subjected to electrical discharge. Overall, the findings demonstrate that electrochemical discharge is more effective in preserving the chemical composition and structural integrity of active materials than conventional electrical discharge methods."},{"t":"E3 连接酶接头 cereblon 上变构位点的鉴定","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09994-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cereblon (CRBN) is the target of thalidomide derivatives1 that achieve therapeutic efficacy against some haematologic neoplasias2,3,4 by recruiting neosubstrates for degradation5,6,7. Despite the intense investigation of orthosteric thalidomide derivatives, little is known about alternate binding sites on CRBN. Here we report an evolutionarily conserved cryptic allosteric binding site on CRBN. Small-molecule SB-405483 binds the allosteric site to cooperatively enhance the binding of orthosteric ligands and alter their neosubstrate degradation profiles. A survey of over 100 orthosteric ligands and their degradation targets reveals trends in the classes of compounds and neosubstrates in which degradation outcomes are enhanced or inhibited by SB-405483. Structural investigations provide a mechanistic basis for the effects of the allosteric ligand by shifting the conformational distribution of CRBNopen to a novel CRBNint and increasing the CRBNclosed state. The discovery of a cryptic allosteric binding site on CRBN that alters the functional effects of orthosteric ligands opens new directions with broad implications for improving the selectivity and efficacy of CRBN therapeutics."},{"t":"键阶接近 1.5 的超金字塔化烯烃作为合成结构单元","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02055-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Alkenes typically have trigonal planar geometries at each terminus, with favourable σ- and π-bonding leading to a bond order of ~2. Here we consider unusual alkenes that possess an extreme form of geometric distortion, termed hyperpyramidalization. In a hyperpyramidalized alkene, geometries deviate remarkably from the typical trigonal planar alkene geometry, leading to weak π-bonding and abnormal alkene bond orders approaching 1.5. Cubene and 1,7-quadricyclene, first validated in 1988 and 1979, respectively, but overlooked for decades since, are the focus of the present study. We leverage their unusually weak π-bonds in cycloadditions, enabling the construction of complex scaffolds and access to previously unrealized chemical space. The origins of the unusually low bond orders were investigated using computational methods. These efforts are expected to prompt future studies of molecules that display hyperpyramidalization or atypical bond orders."},{"t":"超能隙光学材料","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72025?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超带隙光学材料","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"超能隙光学材料（Adv. Mater. 5/2026）"},{"t":"恶意AI集群如何威胁民主","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz1697?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究探讨恶意AI蜂群对民主制度的潜在威胁。智能体AI与大语言模型的融合催生信息战新形态：大量自主AI代理可协同生成虚假信息、操纵社交媒体舆论、实施大规模社会工程攻击。文章警示，AI蜂群技术使虚假信息生产成本趋近于零，对选举公正、公共舆论治理和民主决策机制构成系统性风险，亟需建立技术防御与制度应对框架。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI群体安全","kp":["[新兴威胁]: 代理AI与LLM融合开启信息战"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"How malicious AI swarms can threaten democracy","b":"The fusion of agentic AI and LLMs marks a new frontier in information warfare."},{"t":"多长才算足够长呢？气候变化中典型气象年选择的最佳年跨度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000280?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"气象年选择","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"利用界面相互作用介导的超薄金属有机框架实现高性能无枝晶锂纺织负极","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72028?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂织物负极","kp":["负极[Li织物]: MOF超薄多层","[特点]: 界面相互作用介导、无枝晶"],"as":"","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Performance Dendrite‐Free Lithium Textile Anodes Using Interfacial Interaction‐Mediated Ultrathin Metal Organic Fra","aip":1},{"t":"具有配体-配体电荷转移激发态的高效蓝色TADF钯(II)配合物","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1879672?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究报道高效蓝色TADF（热活化延迟荧光）钯(II)配合物，基于配体间电荷转移（LLCT）机制。第二过渡系金属的电致发光配合物因自旋轨道耦合调控困难长期发展不足。该工作通过合理分子设计实现钯配合物的高效蓝光TADF发射，为OLED显示与照明领域提供了新型重金属配合物材料方案，有望突破蓝光器件效率与稳定性瓶颈。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蓝光TADF材料","kp":["发光材料[蓝光TADF]: 钳型钯(II)配合物","[激发态]: 配体-配体电荷转移(LLCT)","[挑战]: 二排金属蓝光难兼具快辐射慢非辐射"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Efficiency Blue TADF Palladium(II) Complexes with Ligand‐to‐Ligand Charge Transfer Excited State","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electroluminescent complexes of the second‐row transition metals remain underdeveloped due to the challenge of simultaneously achieving fast radiative decay and slow nonradiative decay, particularly in the blue spectral region. Herein, we report a design strategy for strongly blue‐emitting pincer‐type Pd(II) complexes based on the thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) mechanism. By paring a terdentate trifluoromethyl‐substituted bis‐\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC) with a cyano‐substituted carbazolide ligand, the lowest‐lying singlet excited states of the resulting Pd(II) complexes exhibit dominant ligand‐to‐ligand charge transfer (LLCT) character. Electrochemical and theoretical calculations confirm that the oxidation and reduction processes are ligand‐controlled with minor metal involvement. Through tuning of the electron‐accepting strength and the triplet locally‐excited (\n                    3\n                    LE) energy of the pincer bis‐NHC ligand via a subtle structural change, a blue emitting TADF Pd(II) complex (\n                    PyPdCN\n                    ) is achieved, exhibiting an emission maximum of 472 nm and a quantum yield of 86% in doped film. The energy gap between\n                    1\n                    LLCT and\n                    3\n                    LE states proves crucial for regulating the excited state dynamics. Organic light‐emitting diodes employing\n                    PyPdCN\n                    as the emitter show blue electroluminescence with peaks ranging from 460 to 473 nm and maximum external quantum efficiencies exceeding 20%, representing a significant advancement in luminescent Pd(II) complexes."},{"t":"通过局部微环境调控在稳定Cu0/Cu+界面上高选择性电还原CO2为乙烯","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504744?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2还原制乙烯","kp":["产物[CO₂RR]: 乙烯(C₂⁺)","界面[选择性]: Cu⁰/Cu⁺","反应器[CO₂RR]: MEA、中性电解液","[修饰]: 氧空位工程Cu"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出在Cu0/Cu+混合价态界面实现CO2电化学还原高选择性生成乙烯（C2H4）。通过稳定Cu0与Cu+活性位点协同作用，促进C-C偶联反应，在工业级电流密度下获得高C2+产物法拉第效率。该策略解决了传统铜基催化剂C2+选择性不足、稳定性差的核心难题，为CO2资源化制取高附加值多碳化学品提供了可工程化的电催化路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Highly Selective CO2 Electroreduction to Ethylene on Stable Cu0/Cu+ Interfaces by Local Microenvironment Modulation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction to multicarbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) products with high selectivity at industrial current densities using a membrane electrode assembly (MEA) electrolyzer in neutral electrolytes holds a great promise for carbon neutrality. However, the complex reaction pathways and low selectivity for C\n                    2+\n                    products have hindered further development. Herein, an oxygen vacancy‐engineered CuO nanoflower catalyst was designed to construct stable Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    active interfaces and induce a localized alkaline microenvironment, effectively suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) while enhancing ethylene (C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ) selectivity. In situ spectroscopic characterization confirmed the stability of the Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    active sites and their high *CO surface coverage. Multiphysics simulations combined with density functional theory (DFT) calculations revealed that the stable Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    interface coupled with the localized alkaline microenvironment reduces the energy barrier for asymmetric C─C coupling, thereby boosting C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    selectivity. The optimized catalyst achieved remarkable C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiencies of 66.8% in alkaline and 66.1% in neutral electrolyte at a current density of 200 mA cm\n                    –\n                    2\n                    . This strategy of stabilizing Cu\n                    0\n                    /Cu\n                    +\n                    interfaces coupled with microenvironment modulation offers novel insights for enabling highly selective CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    electrosynthesis at high current densities.","aip":1},{"t":"社交媒体研究中充斥着隐藏的行业联系","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6708?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Nearly one-third of papers in major interdisciplinary journals had undeclared ties to industry."},{"t":"视网膜缺血性损伤的愈合","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx7204?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuro- and retinal degenerative diseases, including Alzheimer's, stroke, age-related macular degeneration, and central retinal artery occlusion, rob millions of their independence. Studying these diseases in human retinas has been hindered by the rapid loss of neuronal activity after death. While some CNS activity has been restored postmortem, synchronized neuronal transmission beyond 30 min has remained elusive. We overcome this barrier by reviving and sustaining light signal transmission in human retinas recovered up to 4 hours after death and stored for up to 48 hours. We also introduce infrared-based ex vivo imaging for precise sampling, a closed perfusion system for drug testing, and an ex vivo ischemia-reperfusion model in mouse and human retina. This platform enables testing of neuroprotective and neurotoxic effects of drugs targeting oxidative stress and glutamate excitotoxicity. Our advances question the irreversibility of ischemic injury, support preclinical studies in vision restoration, offer insights into treating CNS ischemia, and pave the way for human donor eye transplantation."},{"t":"利用kagome晶格中费米面重构操控范霍夫奇点实现太赫兹光电响应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-66749-x","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"as":"研究利用三六角镶嵌结构体系中强电子-电子相互作用与费米面处的Van Hove奇点，实现太赫兹频段光响应的增强调控。该类拓扑/关联电子体系因态密度发散特性可显著提升低能光子探测效率，为开发高灵敏度、可调谐的太赫兹光电探测器件提供了凝聚态物理层面的新原理路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"kagome晶格太赫兹","kp":["[晶格类型]: kagome三六角拼砌","[太赫兹响应]: 费米面重构+范霍夫奇点","[物理机制]: 电子-电子强关联"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Harnessing Van Hove singularities for terahertz photoresponse via Fermi surface reconstruction in kagome lattices","b":"The trihexagonal tiling system exhibits strong electron-electron interactions, positioning it as a key condensed matter platform for studying geometrically frustrated lattices made up of corner-sharing triangles. Its phase-transition-driven lattice modulations enable Fermi surface reconstruction, while emergent van Hove singularities near the Fermi level and correlated band anomalies present critical challenges in understanding electronic interaction mechanisms. By combining temperature-dependent spectroscopy, angle-resolved photoemission, and density functional theory calculations, we demonstrate a 61-fold enhancement in terahertz direct detection mode, ultra-low noise (1.38 × 10⁻²⁵ A²/Hz) below phase transition temperature, and broadband operation up to 100 GHz in beat-note heterodyne mode. These results are directly correlated with the Fermi surface reconstruction induced by phase transitions. This work positions geometrically frustrated lattices as a powerful platform for studying correlated quantum phenomena, offering new pathways for the design of advanced quantum devices."},{"t":"利用手性卤化锰 (II) 的可逆 0D–1D 转变实现智能圆偏振发光切换","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525831?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) active materials with dynamically tunable properties are highly desirable for next‐generation photonics and encryption technologies, yet achieving this through predictable solid‐state structural transformations remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we demonstrate a novel dimensionality‐engineering strategy to realize stimuli‐responsive CPL in chiral hybrid Mn(II) halides. Employing a single chiral cation, R/S‐3‐methylmorpholine, we selectively synthesized two distinct phases: a red‐emissive 1D chain structure with octahedral Mn(II) centers and a green‐emissive 0D structure with tetrahedral coordination. Remarkably, the 0D phase undergoes a rapid and reversible ethanol‐assisted thermal transformation into the 1D phase, accompanied by a striking CPL color switch from green to red. This unique behavior stems from a stimulus‐induced recoordination of Mn–Cl units and reorganization of the hydrogen‐bonding network. Capitalizing on this reversible response and intrinsic chirality, we engineered a sophisticated multilevel photonic encryption platform, encompassing binary dot‐matrix coding, dual‐channel (photoluminescence/CPL) Morse code, and CPL‐based ASCII decryption. This work establishes structural dimensionality control as a powerful paradigm for creating intelligent, CPL‐active materials, opening new avenues for high‐security optical information technologies.","tp":"圆偏振发光","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用手性卤化锰(II)的可逆零维-一维结构相变，实现了刺激响应型的智能圆偏振发光(CPL)切换。采用单一手性阳离子R/S-3-甲基吗啉，通过维度工程策略使材料在外部刺激下发生结构转变从而调控CPL性质。该工作为下一代光子学与信息加密技术所需的动态可调CPL材料设计提供了可预测的固态结构转变新方法。"},{"t":"利用 PV-oxirene 进行 α-氧羰基的模块化合成","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68671-2","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"α-Oxy carbonyl compounds, characterized by their distinct electronic and topological properties, represent highly versatile building blocks and modifiers for functional molecules. Despite their potential, the synthetic challenges associated with these compounds have limited their exploration in chemical biology and drug discovery. In this study, we address this limitation by introducing a general Cu-catalyzed three-component carbonyl 1,2-transposition reaction, which proceeds via a PV-oxirene intermediate. Our method employs IIII/PV-hybrid ylides as carbene precursors to generate α-PV-Cu-carbenes, which subsequently facilitate the formation of PV-oxirene species. This intermediate undergoes regioselective ring-opening by carboxylate anions, followed by acylation of a third nucleophile, enabling the modular assembly of α-oxy carbonyl compounds. This strategy provides efficient access to α-oxy esters, amides, and thioesters, exhibiting broad tolerance to various functional groups. Furthermore, these compounds exhibit remarkable chemical versatility, as demonstrated in the synthesis of depsipeptides and late-stage drug modification, underscoring their applicability across diverse research areas. Our findings not only significantly expand the structural diversity of accessible α-oxy carbonyls but also introduce a versatile and biocompatible synthetic linkage for chemical synthesis.","tp":"氧羰基合成","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了一种通用的铜催化三组分羰基1,2-转位反应，通过PV-氧杂环丙烯中间体实现α-含氧羰基化合物的模块化合成。α-含氧羰基化合物具有独特的电子和拓扑性质，是功能分子的重要构建模块，但其合成困难限制了在化学生物学和药物发现中的应用。该突破为相关领域提供了新的合成策略。"},{"t":"肉芽肿双 RNA-seq 揭示了结核病中由中性粒细胞和坏死驱动的复合转录程序","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw4619?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mycobacterial granulomas lie at the center of tuberculosis (TB) pathogenesis and represent a unique niche where infecting bacteria survive under nutrient-restricted conditions and in the face of a host immune response. The granuloma's necrotic core, where bacteria reside extracellularly in humans, is difficult to assess in many experimentally tractable models. Here, using necrotic mycobacterial granulomas in adult zebrafish, we develop dual RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) across different host genotypes to identify the transcriptional alterations that enable bacteria to survive within this key microenvironment. Using pharmacological and genetic interventions, we find that neutrophils within mature, necrotic granulomas promote bacterial growth, in part through up-regulation of the bacterial devR regulon. We identify conserved suites of bacterial transcriptional programs induced only in the context of this unique necrotic extracellular niche, including bacterial modules related to K+ transport and rpf genes. Analysis of Mycobacterium tuberculosis strains across diverse lineages and human populations suggests that granuloma-specific transcriptional modules are targets for bacterial genetic adaptation in the context of human infection."},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策的不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型论","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"遗传与教育的关联有所增加，并受到社会经济背景的影响：来自 3 项研究的证据","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Social scientists have long sought to investigate whether the predictors of educational attainment (EA) have changed across time. Here, we provide insights by incorporating genetic predictors of education in three nationally representative British birth cohorts born in 1946, 1958, and 1970. We investigated whether individual characteristics as proxied by polygenic indexes (PGIs) for EA and cognition have become more relevant to educational success over time and whether returns to genetic predisposition were moderated by early life socioeconomic background. We present three findings. First, associations between the EA PGI and attainment increased over time, with increasing incremental variance explained by the EA PGI. Second, associations between the cognition PGI and attainment were broadly consistent across cohorts, and there was no clear change in explained variance. Since the EA PGI captures multiple traits related to educational success, factors other than those related to cognition may have become more relevant over time. Third, we observed strong evidence of interaction: Associations between the EA PGI and EA were disproportionately larger among those from more advantaged socioeconomic backgrounds. The strength and pattern of associations varied when using EA PGIs that were less conservatively filtered for SNPs. Our findings suggest EA is influenced by social and genetic factors both independently and jointly. Genetic liability and social background could be considered as two forms of inherited advantage which synergistically influence education attainment."},{"t":"无 GFP 的活体神经元定量成像揭示了 PolyQ 聚集体的区室化和生长动态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505321123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Huntington's Disease (HD), the most prevalent polyglutamine (polyQ) neurodegenerative disorder, features brain aggregates induced by mutant huntingtin (mHtt) proteins harboring expanded polyQ tracts. Despite extensive efforts, molecular mechanisms of polyQ aggregates remain elusive. Here, we establish quantitative stimulated Raman scattering imaging of polyQ aggregates (q-aggSRS) for noninvasive investigations in live neuronal cocultures using deuterated glutamine labeling. Q-aggSRS allows for specific visualization by targeting the distinct Raman peak from carbon-deuterium bonds, eliminating the need for bulky fluorescent protein tagging (e.g., EGFP). Coupled with analysis from aggregate-tailored expansion microscopy, newly designed two-color imaging, and pulse-chase visualization, we comprehensively quantified the mHtt and non-mHtt proteins within the same aggregates across varying sizes, cell types, mHtt constructs, and subcellular locations. Our findings demonstrate a two-phase aggregate model with a distinct core-shell spatial organization, reveal significant heterogeneity in nucleus/cytoplasm compartmentalization specific to neurons, and identify previously unrecognized loosely packed aggregates specifically in neuronal nuclei. These insights should advance our understanding of native polyQ aggregates, and our proposed interaction coefficients may offer quantitative parameters for developing effective HD therapies.","tp":"神经元成像","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究建立了定量受激拉曼散射成像技术（q-aggSRS），利用氘代谷氨酰胺标记，在无需GFP的情况下对活体神经元中的多聚谷氨酰胺聚集体进行无侵入性成像。该方法揭示了亨廷顿病中突变亨廷顿蛋白聚集体的区室化和生长动态，为理解多聚谷氨酰胺神经退行性疾病的分子机制提供了新工具。"},{"t":"寒武纪最早的脊椎动物有四只相机式的眼睛","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09966-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Vertebrate vision is mainly accommodated by a pair of lateral image-forming camera-type eyes and is supplemented in non-mammalian vertebrates by a dorsal pineal complex (pineal and parapineal organs) functioning as photoreceptive and/or endocrine organs1. The pineal complex shares a common genetic and embryological basis with the lateral eyes, both derived from evaginations during the development of diencephalon2. Despite being widely heralded as the ‘third eye’ in crown vertebrates3, the nature of the pineal complex and its presumed visual capability in early vertebrates2 remain unknown. Here we describe two pigmented features situated between the lateral eyes in two species of myllokunmingids, the earliest known fossil vertebrates (approximately 518 million years ago), and interpret these as pineal/parapineal organs. In both myllokunmingid species, the pineal complex contains abundant melanin-containing melanosomes identical to those in the retinal pigment epithelium in the lateral eyes, together with a distinctive, regularly ovoid structure interpreted as a lens. Our results indicate that the lateral eyes and pineal complex in myllokunmingids probably functioned as camera-type eyes capable of image formation. Thus, we propose that the four camera-type eyes represent an ancestral vertebrate character, corroborating hypotheses about the deep homology between the eyes and pineal complex."},{"t":"超分辨成像时代的荧光染料：新机遇、挑战与演进","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01304F","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超分辨荧光染料","kp":["[核心原理]: 时间换空间，精确控制荧光发射","[主题]: 超分辨成像时代的荧光染料演进"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.0},"as":"综述系统阐述了荧光染料在超分辨荧光成像（SRI）时代面临的机遇、挑战与发展方向。SRI技术突破了光学衍射极限，实现了纳米尺度生物结构可视化，但其性能高度依赖于荧光染料的光物理特性（光稳定性、亮度、开关动力学等）。文章讨论了新型荧光探针的设计策略，包括罗丹明类、花菁类及可激活探针的优化路径，并指出了活细胞成像中染料毒性、多色标记兼容性等关键瓶颈。","ot":"Fluorescent dyes in the era of super-resolution imaging: new opportunities, challenges, and evolution","b":"Super-resolution fluorescence imaging (SRI) has redefined the capabilities of optical microscopy, enabling the visualization of biological structures at the nanoscale. This paradigm shift is driven by a unifying principle: achieving spatial resolution by precisely controlling the temporal emission of fluorophores, often referred to as “trading time for space”. This strategy relies fundamentally on the precise modulation of fluorescence emission dynamics, which elevates fluorescent dyes from passive markers to active determinants of imaging performance. This shift represents a historic opportunity for fluorescent dyes, one of the oldest classes of synthetic organic molecules, with SRI reinvigorating and propelling their development into a new era. At the same time, it introduces unprecedented challenges, requiring fluorescent dyes with tailored photophysical properties—such as enhanced brightness, engineered photoswitching kinetics, and superior photostability—that exceed the demands of conventional microscopy. This tutorial review examines how these challenges are driving the evolution of fluorescent dyes. We explore the molecular engineering strategies used to meet the rigorous demands of SRI and discuss how these advancements are pushing the boundaries of SRI technology."},{"t":"通过缩聚反应实现的地板温度调控型聚（醚-交替-酯）：兼具热稳定性与化学可回收性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522383?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可回收聚醚酯","kp":["[单体设计]: 地板温度(Tf)调控","[可逆性]: 缩聚-解聚-再聚合循环"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种通过缩聚反应合成的聚（醚-交替-酯）（PEAEs）新型聚合物，其交替排列的醚键和酯键赋予材料优异的热稳定性和化学可回收性。该聚合物在室温条件下即可实现可控聚合，解决了传统聚酯材料难以兼顾性能与可回收性的矛盾。通过解聚反应可高效回收单体，实现闭环循环利用，为可持续高分子材料设计提供了新策略，对塑料废弃物的化学回收具有应用价值。","ot":"Floor Temperature‐regulated Poly(ether‐alt‐ester) With Thermal Stability and Chemical Recyclability Enabled by Polyconde","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Creating innovative poly(ether‐\n                    alt\n                    ‐ester)s (PEAEs) with alternating ether and ester groups to address the trade‐offs between the polymer′s depolymerizability and thermostability is essentially important for advanced material applications and sustainable development. Current research efforts focus on modulating the ceiling temperature (\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ) of monomers with small‐sized rings, to increase the thermostability of PEAEs at high temperature. Notably, floor temperature (\n                    T\n                    f\n                    )−regulated PEAEs, obtained from entropy‐driven ring‐opening polymerization (ROP) of macrocyclic ether‐ester monomers, inherently exhibit enhanced thermodynamic stability as the temperature increases. However, high‐performance PEAEs regulated by\n                    T\n                    f\n                    remains long‐term underdeveloped owing to extremely low efficiency and selectivity in macrocyclic monomer synthesis. Herein, we developed a “polycondensation–depolymerization” strategy for macrocyclic ether‐ester monomer and presented the first example of\n                    T\n                    f\n                    ‐regulated PEAE with thermostability, melt processibility as well as chemical recyclability. The resulting PEAE is semi‐crystalline and ductile, and exhibits remarkable high decomposition temperature (with a\n                    T\n                    d,5%\n                    up to 378.3 °C) compared to the\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ‐regulated poly(1,4‐dioxan‐2‐one) (PPDO,\n                    T\n                    d,5%\n                    = 238.4 °C). This work corroborated the effectiveness of the\n                    T\n                    f\n                    ‐regulated PEAE in resolving the challenges associated with the\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ‐regulated analogs and provided a molecular‐level design principle for poly(ether‐\n                    alt\n                    ‐ester) with high‐performance."},{"t":"可以穿透岩石的柔性磁体天线","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01565-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"成纤维细胞网状细胞通过 CD44 指导 T 细胞反应的启动","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09988-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The movement of dendritic cells and T cells within secondary lymphoid organs is critical for the development of adaptive immune responses1,2. Central to this process is the fibroblastic reticular cell (FRC) network, which forms a highly organized conduit system that facilitates the movement of and interactions between dendritic cells and T cells3,4,5,6. Previous studies have partly characterized how FRCs support these interactions7,8. However, the molecular mechanisms that operate under physiological conditions remain unknown. Here we show that the viral protein m11, encoded by the herpesvirus murine cytomegalovirus (CMV), inhibits antiviral immunity by targeting the FRC network and interfering with a critical function of cellular CD44. We found that m11 binds to CD44 and established that m11 perturbs the molecular interactions of CD44 with its natural ligand, hyaluronic acid. The interaction of m11 with CD44 impairs the trafficking of dendritic cells within the spleen, thereby impeding efficient priming of naive T cells and the initiation of antiviral CD8 T cell responses. The targeting of CD44 by CMV reveals CD44 as a molecule that is essential to the functioning of the FRC network and uncovers a previously unrecognized stroma-based mechanism that is critical for the generation of effective T cell responses."},{"t":"小样本与不平衡数据条件下的港口光伏阵列故障诊断","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600053X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏故障诊断","as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fault diagnosis of photovoltaic arrays at ports under small-sample and imbalanced data conditions"},{"t":"西欧末次盛冰期影响深远的狩猎采集网络","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7697?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Social networking is an essential feature of hunter-gatherer societies. It fosters the circulation of goods and information and enables kinship ties across different scales, including long-distance contacts. While such behaviors are known since at least the Upper Palaeolithic, evidence for geographically extensive social networks remains scarce. This evidence is limited to indirect inferences based on shared cultural traits, \"art\" styles, and symbolic items, while lithic raw material movements are mostly local and regional, with few cases exceeding 300 kilometers. We provide geochemical evidence for the largest confirmed distance between the source and discard location of a knapped lithic object in Palaeolithic Europe. Solutrean artifacts discarded at Peña Capón, Central Iberia, were sourced in Southwest France, 600 to 700 kilometers away. This demonstrates social networks of unprecedented geographic scale maintained during ∼1400 years during the Last Glacial Maximum. It also suggests that stone tools were exchanged as symbolic items to solidify social contacts and sustain far-reaching networks as risk-buffering mechanisms among widely dispersed hunter-gatherers."},{"t":"脱溶驱动的层状钙钛矿用于稳定的热碳捕集与废气流利用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522889?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿碳捕集","kp":["材料[ICCU]: Ni取代层状钙钛矿Sr₂TiO₄","[机制]: 贵金属析出(exsolution)驱动","[目标]: 高温循环稳定碳捕集利用"],"as":"研究开发了一种基于析出策略的层状钙钛矿材料，用于集成碳捕集与利用（ICCU）过程。该材料在高温条件下表现出优异的结构稳定性和催化活性，能够同时实现CO₂捕集和原位转化利用。通过调控钙钛矿的析出行为，显著提升了材料在循环运行中的抗烧结和抗碳沉积能力，为工业废气中CO₂的高效资源化利用提供了稳定可靠的材料平台。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Exsolution‐Driven Layered Perovskites for Stable Thermal Carbon Capture and Utilization of Waste Streams","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Integrated carbon capture and utilization (ICCU) presents a sustainable route for simultaneous valorization of CO\n                    2\n                    and solid waste, yet maintaining cyclic stability under high‐temperature conditions remains challenging. Here, we construct dual‐functional materials based on Ni‐substituted layered perovskite Sr\n                    2\n                    TiO\n                    4\n                    , engineering to enhance Ni‐substrate interactions, thereby stabilizing ICCU reactions via in situ exsolution. Systematic experiments and characterizations reveal that gradual Ni exsolution from the Sr\n                    2\n                    TiO\n                    4\n                    /SrTiO\n                    3\n                    matrix during cyclic reactions yields well‐dispersed, surface‐anchored Ni nanoparticles. This dynamic process drives progressively increasing, then stabilized, CO\n                    2\n                    uptakes and syngas productions across cycles, contrasting sharply with the deactivation of predeposited Ni system. Moreover, electronic structure analysis reveals that CO emissions from exsolved Ni‐driven CO\n                    2\n                    splitting are both more kinetically unfavorable than Sr\n                    2\n                    TiO\n                    4\n                    carbonation and effectively suppressed by O\n                    2\n                    in the flue gas. These findings demonstrate a robust strategy for efficient co‐utilization of CO\n                    2\n                    and solid waste under demanding thermochemical conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"硅酸钙的实验观察","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524999?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Reactions between carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) and silica (SiO\n                    2\n                    ), as well as between carbonates and silicates, are central to understanding carbon behavior in planetary interiors and have important technological implications. Yet, only a few oxides are known in which carbon and silicon coexist within the same crystal lattice. These silicate–carbonates typically contain trigonal carbonate [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups and tetrahedrally coordinated silicate [SiO\n                    4\n                    ] units. In the CaO–SiO\n                    2\n                    –CO\n                    2\n                    system, no phase had previously been shown to contain both octahedrally coordinated silicon [SiO\n                    6\n                    ] and carbonate [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups, nor had such a structure been theoretically predicted. Here, we report the synthesis of the calcium silicon double carbonate Ca\n                    2\n                    Si(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    4\n                    , obtained by reacting tilleyite, Ca\n                    5\n                    (Si\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    )(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    , with CO\n                    2\n                    in diamond anvil cells at 39.5 GPa and 2600 K. The compound was subsequently temperature‐ and pressure‐quenched, remaining metastable at ambient conditions. Structural and spectroscopic characterization was performed using synchrotron single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and Raman spectroscopy. The structure of Ca\n                    2\n                    Si(CO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    4\n                    is unique among silicate–carbonates, featuring sixfold‐coordinated Si sharing oxygen atoms with [CO\n                    3\n                    ] groups. Additionally, a novel calcium tetracarbonate, Ca\n                    2\n                    (C\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    ), containing tetrahedral [CO\n                    4\n                    ] units, was discovered. These findings reveal a new oxide chemistry under extreme conditions and open avenues for synthesizing metastable carbon‐bearing materials relevant to the deep carbon cycle.","tp":"硅酸钙实验","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"实验研究了二氧化碳与二氧化硅之间的反应，以及碳酸盐与硅酸盐的相互作用。这些反应对理解行星内部碳行为至关重要，并具有重要技术意义。目前已知的碳硅共存于同一晶格的氧化物极为稀少，此类硅酸盐-碳酸盐通常含有 trigonal 配位的碳原子。研究为行星科学和材料科学提供了基础数据。"},{"t":"扩展DNA字母表为纳米结构增添全新维度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6713?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩展DNA纳米结构","kp":["[策略]: 扩展DNA字母表(非经典碱基对)","[应用]: 提升纳米结构产率与质量"],"as":"科学家通过扩展DNA字母表（引入非天然碱基对）为DNA纳米结构增添了此前未知的维度。传统DNA纳米技术仅依赖A-T/C-G四种天然碱基进行自组装，扩展后的遗传字母表可编码更多结构性信息，使纳米结构的复杂度和功能多样性大幅提升。这一突破有望推动DNA origami在药物递送、分子机器和生物传感等领域的精准设计。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Expanding DNA alphabet adds a previously unknown dimension to nanostructures","b":"DNA nanotechnology has created nanostructures with astonishing complexity. However, with nanostructures becoming increasingly larger and more intricate, they have become more difficult to obtain in high yields and quality. Expanding the alphabet beyond the canonical base pairs can therefore be the key to push the technology to the next level. Here, we describe examples of DNA nanostructures built from an \"anthropogenic evolvable genetic information system (AEGIS).\" Because AEGIS uses the same backbone as DNA, the existing rules for designing DNA nanostructures can be readily applied to AEGIS nanostructures, which also show greater stability, both thermal and enzymatic, greater control over autonomous assembly, and good phase separation. AEGIS can have as many as 12 different units and six different pairs with Watson-Crick-Franklin geometry. Thus, if further developed, then these nanostructures may represent a previously unexplored frontier in DNA nanoscience and nanotechnology, expanding the space of \"soft\" biomaterial design.","aip":1},{"t":"独家：NIH 关键审查小组将于 2026 年底失去所有成员","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00183-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"结核菌素皮试的演变揭示了普遍的 Mtb 反应性 T 细胞亚克隆","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68678-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"T cells contribute to immune protection and pathogenesis in tuberculosis, but measurements of polyclonal responses have failed to resolve correlates of outcome. We report the temporal evaluation of the human in vivo clonal repertoire of Mycobacterium tuberculosis (Mtb)-reactive T cell responses, by T cell receptor (TCR) sequencing at the site of the tuberculin skin test, as a model for a standardised antigenic challenge. Initial non-selective recruitment of T cells is followed by enrichment of Mtb-reactive clones arising from oligoclonal T cell proliferation. We introduce a modular computational pipeline, Metaclonotypist, to sensitively cluster distinct TCRs with shared epitope specificity, which we apply here to establish a catalogue of public Mtb-reactive HLA-restricted T cell metaclones. Although most in vivo Mtb-reactive T cells are private, 10 metaclones were sufficient to identify Mtb-T cell reactivity across our study population (N≥128), indicating striking population level immunodominance of specific TCR-peptide interactions that may inform patient stratification and vaccine development."},{"t":"F/N协同共掺杂黑色无定形碳纳米结构增强光氧化还原活性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519774?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳材料光催化","kp":["[掺杂]: F/N协同共掺杂","[机制]: 电荷局域位点促进电子-空穴分离","[材料]: 黑色无定形碳(aCM)"],"as":"该研究通过氟（F）与氮（N）的协同共掺杂策略，显著提升了黑色无定形碳材料的光催化氧化还原（光氧化还原）活性。黑色碳基材料因成本低廉、来源丰富、易于修饰而被广泛使用，但其本征光催化效率有限。F/N共掺杂调控了材料的电子结构和带隙，优化了光生载流子的分离与传输，从而增强了可见光驱动的催化性能，在环境污染物降解和清洁能源转化等光催化应用中展现出良好前景。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Enhancement of Photoredox Activity by F/N Synergistic Co‐Doping of Black Amorphous Carbon Nanostructures","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Black carbon materials are widely used due to their low cost, abundance, and easy modification, but their photocatalytic application is limitedss by rapid solar‐to‐thermal conversion. Here, synergistic F/N co‐doping was developed to enhance the photocatalytic performance of amorphous carbon materials (aCMs) by creating charge localization sites that promote electron‐hole separation. Kelvin probe force microscopy (KPFM) and surface photovoltage (SPV) measurements indicate that F/N co‐doping can establish a stronger internal electric field within the aCMs. A comprehensive suite of spectroscopic analyses reveal that the F/N‐aCMs exhibits a lower exciton binding energy (14.60 meV), faster relaxation time of photoexcited electrons from the conduction band minimum to the exciton‐mediated trap state (3.98 ps), and a longer carrier lifetime (3.93 ns), demonstrating significantly enhanced efficiency in charge carrier separation. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations confirm F/N co‐doping reduces electron‐hole overlap and lowers the energy barrier for superoxide radical (•O\n                    2\n                    –\n                    ) generation. Remarkably, photocatalytic experiments not only confirm the high activity of F/N‐aCMs in aldehyde oxidation (with 87%–99% yields across 22 substrates) but also demonstrate an acceptable apparent quantum yield (1.78%) and superior solar‐to‐chemical conversion efficiency (0.37%). This work opens up a new direction for the rational design of aCMs for photocatalytic organic synthesis."},{"t":"工程化粘液束缚双特异性纳米抗体增强针对呼吸道病原体的粘膜免疫力","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02107-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Despite advances in vaccine and antiviral drug development, the prevention of respiratory viral infection and transmission remains a substantial challenge worldwide. One obvious limitation of these approaches is that they do not provide robust protection at the initial site of infection, which is the respiratory mucosa. Currently, strategies to enhance mucosal immunity against respiratory pathogens remain lacking. Here we engineered mucus-tethering bispecific nanobodies designed to provide the simultaneous neutralization of viruses by binding to their surface proteins and the entrapment of viruses within the mucus by securing them to mucin. Compared with conventional non-mucus-tethering nanobodies, these mucus-tethering bispecific nanobodies demonstrated increased retention in the respiratory tract, provided enhanced protection against influenza viral infection in mice and reduced SARS-CoV-2 transmission in hamsters. Together, our findings represent a promising strategy for enhancing mucosal defences against respiratory viruses by blocking viral entry and limiting onward transmission."},{"t":"内源性逆转录病毒合成异源嵌合RNA以增强人类早期胚胎发育","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv5257?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Zygotic genome activation (ZGA) failure leads to developmental arrest and poses a clinical challenge to women's fertility. We observed that human embryos arresting at the eight-cell ZGA stage exhibited specific down-regulation of endogenous retrovirus MLT2A1. Depleting MLT2A1 resulted in a failure in embryo development and a reduction in ZGA gene expression. Mechanistically, MLT2A1s synthesized chimeric transcripts with downstream coding and noncoding sequences, predominantly with heterologous retro-transposable elements. These diverse fusion sequences expanded the genome-targeting spectrum of MLT2A1 RNAs. Nevertheless, the shared MLT2A1 sequences partnered with heterogeneous nuclear ribonucleoprotein U (HNRNPU) to recruit RNA polymerase II, promoting global transcription of ZGA genes and autoamplification of the MLT2A1 subfamily. Thus, MLT2A1 chimeric RNAs formed an interlocking network that acts synergistically to boost human ZGA and early embryogenesis."},{"t":"插层范德华反铁磁体中的涌现铁磁性与异常不可逆磁阻","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527293123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"范德华层状磁性","kp":["材料[2D反铁磁]: CrSBr","[方法]: 电化学插层TBA+离子","[现象]: 涌现铁磁性"],"as":"本研究报道了二维正交晶系反铁磁材料CrSBr在插层调控后涌现出的铁磁性及异常不可逆磁阻现象。CrSBr作为空气稳定的层状反铁磁体备受关注，研究者通过插层手段改变了其磁结构，诱导出本征铁磁性，并观察到磁阻在特定条件下表现出不可逆行为。这种磁态转变与传输特性耦合的现象在二维磁体中极为罕见，对理解低维磁学基本物理及开发新型自旋电子器件具有重要指导意义。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Emergent ferromagnetism and unusual irreversible magnetoresistance in an intercalated van der Waals antiferromagnet","b":"Orthorhombic air-stable two-dimensional (2D) antiferromagnet (AFM) CrSBr has attracted much research interest lately thanks to its rich magnetic behaviors together with its remarkable electronic, excitonic, and polaritonic properties. Here, we report a reliable electrochemical intercalation method by inserting large tetrabutylammonium (TBA+) ions into CrSBr layers. Magnetically, such intercalation efficiently suppresses the interlayer AFM and induces a ferromagnetic (FM) order with a much-enhanced transition temperature up to 200 K, nearly 70 K higher than the AFM onset of 132 K in pristine CrSBr. Electronically, the TBA+ intercalation not only increases the electric conductivity of CrSBr, which is further enhanced by magnetic fields, but also introduces a giant negative irreversible magnetoresistance. This work demonstrates the tunable magnetic and electronic properties of CrSBr as well as their interplay, paving the way for advanced spintronic and magnetic memory devices."},{"t":"铁弹畴的电子通道衬度成像","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202515762?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁弹畴成像","kp":["[成像方法]: 电子通道衬度成像铁弹畴","[优势]: 非侵入、高通量(替代TEM)"],"as":"本文介绍了一种基于电子通道衬度成像（ECCI）技术对铁弹性畴进行直接观测的方法。铁弹性相变会产生铁弹性孪晶，导致材料微观结构的空间不均匀性。传统成像手段难以高效表征这些畴结构，而ECCI利用扫描电子显微镜中电子通道效应，无需复杂样品制备即可实现对铁弹性畴形貌、分布及演化的高分辨成像。该方法为研究铁弹性材料中的畴壁动力学、相变机制及应力调控提供了有力工具。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electron Channeling Contrast Imaging of Ferroelastic Domains","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Ferroelastic phase transitions lead to the formation of ferroelastic twins, resulting in spatial inhomogeneities in the crystal structures and functional properties of ferroelastic materials. Despite the importance of such nanoscale twins in oxide heterostructures, their direct, non‐invasive observation has relied on cumbersome and low‐throughput techniques such as transmission electron microscopy and synchrotron X‐ray diffraction, or been restricted to materials with coexistence of ferroelectric and ferroelastic states, by detecting the coupled ferroelectric order. In this study, the application of electron channeling contrast imaging (ECCI) in a scanning electron microscope for imaging ferroelastic domains in various oxide heterostructures is demonstrated. These include systems where ferroelasticity is coupled with critical functional properties such as ferroelectricity, magnetism and charge transport. The versatility of this imaging method is highlighted across different heterostructure geometries, from bare thin films to multilayers, achieving an impressive resolution of 6 nm. ECCI presents a powerful approach for exploring the rich spectrum of ferroelasticity‐coupled phenomena in oxide heterostructures."},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微结构驱动多尺度特征融合健康评估框架","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观结构健康评估","as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health e"},{"t":"高品质无铅卤化物铁电固溶体的环保制备及其高性能X射线探测器应用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525694?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电固溶体","kp":["材料体系[X射线探测]: Bi/Sb基无铅卤化物铁电固溶体","瓶颈[无铅铁电]: 宽带隙与低μτ产物限光电性能"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出环保型高质量无铅卤化物铁电固溶体制备方法，用于高性能X射线探测器。Bi/Sb基卤化物铁电材料因其优异稳定性和环境友好特性成为有前景的无铅替代品，该工作推进了无铅铁电材料在辐射探测领域的应用。","ot":"Eco‐Friendly Preparation of High‐Quality Lead‐Free Halide Ferroelectric Solid‐Solution Toward High‐Performance X‐ray Det","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics have become promising lead‐free alternatives due to their excellent stability and environmental friendliness. However, their wide bandgaps and limited charge‐carrier mobility‐lifetime (\n                    µτ\n                    ) product impede their optoelectronic performance. Here, we report a new eco‐friendly method for growing lead‐free halide ferroelectric solid‐solution (HDA)Sb\n                    1‐x\n                    Bi\n                    x\n                    I\n                    5\n                    (x = 0–1) (HDA = hexane‐1,6‐diammonium), by isothermal evaporation from a biomass‐derived solvent,\n                    γ\n                    ‐valerolactone (GVL). The solid‐solution strategy, good material stability,‐ and high‐quality centimeter‐sized single‐crystals not only endow the (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    with the narrowest bandgap of 1.64 eV among Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics, but also enhance its\n                    µτ\n                    product by approximately two orders of magnitude compared with the parent (HDA)SbI\n                    5\n                    . Benefiting from these attributes and the intrinsic ferroelectric spontaneous polarization, the X‐ray detector based on (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    exhibits excellent self‐powered detection performance with a high sensitivity of 1,040 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    and a low detection limit of 0.25 nGy\n                    air\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    . More excitingly, its detection sensitivity can reach 17,560 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is the highest among reported halide ferroelectrics, and superior to that of most halide detectors. This work opens new avenues for the rational engineering of Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics for advanced optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"动态氧化还原促进的铁和营养物循环推动了奥陶纪-志留纪过渡期间笔石的演化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea1423?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Graptolites were abundant and cosmopolitan zooplankton in Early Paleozoic oceans, but a prominent change in species occurred across the Late Ordovician mass extinction. We use ocean redox, iron isotope (δ56Fe), and phosphorus phase partitioning records from shelf and deep-ocean settings to evaluate the drivers behind this major reshaping of the pelagic marine ecosystem. A marked decrease in mesopelagic graptolites coincided with a stepwise negative δ56Fe shift on the shelf, driven by partial seawater Fe drawdown resulting from episodic intensification of mid-depth euxinia. Subsequently, a positive δ56Fe shift in both deep-ocean and shelf sediments reflects extensive seawater Fe removal during the development of more widespread euxinia. This led to enhanced sedimentary phosphorus recycling from sediments, which ultimately fueled the radiation of epipelagic graptolites. Thus, wide-scale changes in Fe cycling, linking the global oceanic redox state to phosphorus cycling, were ultimately responsible for the initial demise and subsequent radiation of select graptolite species."},{"t":"视觉皮层中基于动态上下文的对象表示更新","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw6726?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Objects in real-world scenes are often poorly or partially visible, for example because they are occluded or appear in the periphery. An additional challenge of real-world vision is that it is dynamic, causing the appearance of objects (e.g., their size and orientation) to change as we move. Notably, however, these changes are predictable from the three-dimensional structure of the surrounding scene. In two functional magnetic resonance imaging studies, we find that the visual cortex dynamically updates object representations using this predictive contextual information. First, visual cortical representations of objects were enhanced when they rotated congruently (versus incongruently) with the surrounding scene. Second, the inferred orientation of the object could be decoded from visual cortex activity even when the object was fully occluded. These findings indicate that predictive processes in the visual cortex follow the geometric structure of the environment, providing a mechanism to support object perception in dynamic natural vision."},{"t":"动态偶极工程实现超低损耗的极高储能","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522905?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介电储能材料","kp":["储能机制[无铅介电]: 动态偶极子工程","应用: 脉冲功率电容器"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过动态偶极工程策略，在无铅介电材料中实现了超高可回收能量密度和接近100%的效率。该成果突破了无铅介电材料在能量存储应用中高能量密度与高效率难以兼得的瓶颈，对先进脉冲功率系统和储能器件具有重要意义。","ot":"Dynamic Dipole Engineering Enables Ultrahigh Energy Storage With Minimal Losses","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving high recoverable energy density (\n                    W\n                    rec\n                    ) with near‐unity efficiency (\n                    η\n                    ) in lead‐free dielectrics remains a major challenge for advanced pulse power capacitors, given their central role in emerging pulsed power systems and high‐voltage electronics. Here, we show that targeted engineering of dynamic dipole behavior provides an effective route to remarkable energy storage performance. Guided by phase‐field simulations, we design (Bi\n                    0.5\n                    Na\n                    0.5\n                    )TiO\n                    3\n                    (BNT)‐based multilayer ceramic capacitors that transform a continuous network of strongly correlated dipoles into discrete nano‐domains. Within each nano‐domain, dipoles retain strong local cooperativity, which maintains high polarization while markedly suppressing hysteresis losses. As a result, the optimized multilayer ceramic capacitors (MLCCs) achieve a recoverable energy density of 16.2 J cm\n                    −3\n                    , an\n                    η\n                    below 1.5%, and a record‐high figure of merit (\n                    W\n                    F\n                    ) of 1080 at 650 kV cm\n                    −1\n                    . This moderate operating field also produces an ultrahigh energy storage strength (\n                    ξ\n                    ) of 249 J kV\n                    −1\n                    m\n                    −2\n                    , highlighting the efficiency of the dipole‐regulation strategy. These findings demonstrate that weakly correlated and dynamic dipoles can be harnessed to advance high‐performance, lead‐free energy storage devices and offer a viable design principle for next‐generation capacitive technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"精准扶贫是否促进了清洁烹饪燃料的采用？来自准实验研究的证据","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000182?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"清洁燃料政策评估","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"综合能源系统集群的分布式协同优化：基于共识机制的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on conse"},{"t":"剖析控制人类皮质细胞命运的基因调控网络","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09997-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Human cortical neurogenesis involves conserved and specialized developmental processes during a restricted window of prenatal development. Radial glia (RG) neural stem cells shape cortical cell diversity by giving rise to excitatory neurons, oligodendrocytes and astrocytes, as well as olfactory bulb interneurons (INs) and a recently characterized population of cortical INs1,2. Complex genetic programs orchestrated by transcription factor (TF) circuits govern the balance between self-renewal and differentiation, and between different cell fates3,4,5,6,7,8. Despite progress in measuring gene regulatory network activity during human cortical development9,10,11,12, functional studies are required to evaluate the roles of TFs and effector genes in human RG lineage progression. Here we establish a human primary culture system that allows sensitive discrimination of cell fate dynamics and apply single-cell CRISPR interference (CRISPRi) screening13,14 to examine the transcriptional and cell fate consequences of 44 TFs active during cortical neurogenesis. We identified several TFs with new roles in cortical neurogenesis, including ZNF219—previously uncharacterized—that represses neural differentiation and NR2E1 and ARX that have opposing roles in regulating RG lineage plasticity and progression across developmental stages. We also detected convergent effector genes downstream of multiple TFs enriched in neurodevelopmental and neuropsychiatric disorders and observed conserved mechanisms of RG lineage plasticity across primates. We further uncovered a post-mitotic role for ARX in safeguarding IN subtype specification through repressing LMO1. Our study provides a framework for dissecting regulatory networks driving cell fate consequences during human neurogenesis."},{"t":"使用多向剪切揭示软玻璃材料中无序引起的应力流错位","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521603123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Controlling the mechanical response of soft glassy materials-such as emulsions, foams, and colloidal suspensions-is key for many industrial processes. While their steady-state flow behavior is reasonably well understood, their response to complex flow histories, as encountered in operations like pumping or mixing, remains poorly known. Using a custom multiaxis shear apparatus that enables arbitrary changes in flow direction, we investigate how shear history influences the mechanical behavior of a model soft glassy system. We uncover a transient shear response orthogonal to the applied shear direction, together with an anisotropic yield surface. These effects point to an underlying anisotropic distribution of internal stresses imprinted by previous deformation. To rationalize this behavior, we use a mesoscopic elastoplastic model, demonstrating that local mechanical disorder governs the emergence of macroscopic stress-flow misalignment. Our findings offer a route to experimentally probe the distribution of local yield stresses in soft glassy materials.","tp":"软玻璃材料力学","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用定制的多轴剪切装置，实现了流动方向的任意变化，系统研究了剪切历史如何影响软玻璃材料（如乳液、泡沫和胶体悬浮液）的力学行为。虽然其稳态流动行为已有较好理解，但在泵送、混合等复杂流动历史下的响应仍知之甚少。该工作为工业过程中控制软玻璃材料的力学响应提供了关键见解。"},{"t":"衍射 enabled 的固态电解质锂离子动力学与复合体中非均匀扩散的原位纳米尺度追踪","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520281?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质扩散","kp":["表征方法[全固态电池]: 同步辐射XRD原位追踪","研究对象: 固态电解质Li+扩散"],"as":"该研究利用衍射方法实现了对固态电解质中锂离子动力学原位纳米尺度追踪。传统上Li⁺扩散研究多集中于液态电池的正极活性材料，而固态电池中锂离子在固体电解质及固固界面的输运行为仍缺乏直接实验表征。该原位纳米衍射技术能够在电池工作状态下实时观测锂离子分布与迁移路径，为揭示固态电池离子输运机制、优化固固界面设计以及加速高安全高能量密度固态电池研发提供了关键实验手段。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Diffraction‐Enabled Operando Nanoscale Tracking of Li‐ion Dynamics of Solid Electrolyte and Inhomogeneous Diffusion in C","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion has mostly been studied in cathode active materials (CAMs) in liquid batteries, whereas it remains rarely explored in solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) and all‐solid‐state batteries. Herein, diffraction was established as an effective method for all‐solid‐state lithium batteries (ASSLBs) by focusing on SSE in composite cathodes. Operando synchrotron x‐ray diffraction presented diffraction angle shifts of certain Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    Bragg planes during the first ASSLB cycle due to lithiation/delithiation into its lattice, whose preferred Li\n                    +\n                    migration pathways were suggested by the partiality of these shifts, and the three‐phase evolution indicated the fundamental Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion kinetics factors. X‐ray nanodiffraction (XND) mapped nanoscale inhomogeneous Li\n                    +\n                    distributions and diffusion within individual Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    particles, revealing facilitated Li\n                    +\n                    conduction in high‐crystallinity regions and their role as pathways across SSE/CAM interfaces, and the most negatively strained regions were shown to be less susceptible to Li\n                    +\n                    insertion. XND from various electrochemical techniques inferred high transient charging rates to be the culprit of irreversible Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion instead of the overall charging depth. This study proved diffraction to be a potent tool to probe intricate Li\n                    +\n                    dynamics in ASSLBs and provide microscopic insights for optimal battery designs.","aip":1},{"t":"深度生成模型调控燃料电池超低铂催化剂层","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506271?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池低铂催化","kp":["[优化方法]: 深度生成模型优化CL微观结构","目标[燃料电池]: 超低Pt载量"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出利用深度生成模型来调控燃料电池催化层中超低铂（Pt）载量策略。降低催化剂层中贵金属Pt用量同时维持燃料电池性能是商业化关键挑战。深度生成模型通过学习催化层微观结构与性能之间的高维映射关系，可高效搜索最优的催化剂层形貌与组分分布方案，从而在大幅减少Pt用量的前提下保持高催化活性与耐久性，为燃料电池大规模降本提供了AI驱动的新范式。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Deep Generative Models Regulate Ultralow‐Pt Catalyst Layer in Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Reducing the precious Pt loading in catalyst layers (CLs) while maintaining fuel cell performance is critical for cost reduction, necessitating the development of an optimized CL microstructure, but conventional empirical expertise‐dependent trial‐and‐error optimization faces severe efficiency limitations when dealing with multiple transfers coupled with electrochemical reactions inside the multi‐component hierarchical porous architecture. Here, we present Generative Artificial Intelligence for Controllable Electrode Synthesis (GAI4CES), a framework that enables rapid CL microstructure synthesis, achieving nearly 500x speedup for constructing a representative CL microstructure of 128 nm\n                    3\n                    (in 0.36 s compared to 168 s required by traditional numerical methods). It can tailor key property constraints, such as Pt loading and electrochemical surface area (ECSA), to generate statistically representative microstructures satisfying target specifications. This capability enables an exhaustive search for the optimal CL structural design through large‐scale geometry‑constrained synthesis coupled with fast performance prediction. The optimized CL microstructure achieves an improvement of 11.6% in ECSA and a reduction of 32.9% in average ionomer thickness surrounding the Pt/C at ultralow Pt loading (e.g., 0.05 mg cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ), and contributes to a maximum 70.2% voltage increase at 3 A cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , indicating that the GAI4CES is powerful in promoting the development of advanced low‐cost and high‐performance fuel cells."},{"t":"解耦石墨电极上不同锂沉积过程的电解液降解路径","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505230?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池锂析出","kp":["研究方法[石墨负极]: N/P<1电池定量解耦锂析出"],"as":"该研究聚焦锂离子电池石墨负极上的锂沉积（lithium plating）这一关键降解路径，旨在定量解耦不同锂沉积过程与电解液降解机制之间的关联。锂沉积会导致电池容量衰减和安全隐患，理解其在分子层面的降解产物与反应路径，对延长电池寿命、优化电解液配方具有重要意义。研究为抑制锂沉积引发的老化提供了新的诊断和设计依据。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Decoupling Electrolyte Degradation Pathways With Diverse Li Plating Processes on Graphite Electrodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium plating on graphite anodes is a critical degradation pathway in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), yet quantitative decoupling of its contribution from normal anode aging remains challenging. Here, we designed controlled Li plating tests using negative‐to‐positive (\n                    N/P\n                    ) ratio &lt; 1 LiFePO\n                    4\n                    /graphite cells and then compared them with practical fast‐charging cells (\n                    N/P\n                     &gt; 1), quantifying the decomposition of each electrolyte component (solvent, salt, additives) using nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR), mass spectrometry titration (MST), and gas chromatography‐mass spectrometry (GC‐MS). Controlled Li plating occurs after full graphite lithiation, and it leads to rapid vinylene carbonate (VC) depletion, time‐dependent non‐Faradaic consumption of hexafluorophosphate (PF\n                    6\n                    −\n                    )/ethyl methyl carbonate (EMC)/ethylene carbonate (EC), and more organic solid‐electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation at higher rates. In routine fast‐charging aging, Li plating occurs before graphite saturation, and we find pronounced EMC consumption under high‐rate conditions compared with low ‐ rate. Our comparative analysis indicates that VC consumption during fast charging originates not only from plating but also significantly from baseline graphite aging. Li plating likely induces SEI rupture, leading to direct contact with electrolyte, thus more organic SEI formation. This quantitative study enables decoupling of Li plating‐induced side reactions from general aging without plating, informing battery design and predictive aging models."},{"t":"损害评估","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef5690?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Which of Donald Trump's changes are likely to last-and which will fade?"},{"t":"每日简报：特朗普——上任一年","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00230-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"穿面铱基细丝削弱质子交换膜电解槽效率","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00419-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽效率","kp":["失效机制[PEM电解槽]: Ir丝贯穿膜形成寄生电流通路","关联因素: 多孔传输层设计"],"as":"质子交换膜（PEM）电解槽是实现绿氢制取的关键设备。该研究揭示了导电铱丝可跨越膜结构生长形成\"跨膜铱丝\"，导致电解效率显著下降。铱作为阳极催化剂在还原条件下迁移团聚，形成导电通道引发短路和性能衰减。这一发现为提升PEM电解槽长期稳定性指明了材料优化方向。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Cross-plane iridium-based filaments sap efficiency in proton exchange membrane electrolyzers","b":"This study reveals that conductive iridium filaments can form across the membrane in proton exchange membrane electrolyzers, creating parasitic current pathways and reducing system efficiency. The findings link filament formation to porous transport layer design, providing insights to improve the durability and lifetime of industrial water electrolyzers."},{"t":"高可塑性细胞状态在肺癌中的关键作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09985-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Plasticity—the ability of cells to undergo phenotypic transitions—drives cancer progression and therapy resistance1,2,3. Recent studies have suggested that plasticity in solid tumours is concentrated in a minority subset of cancer cells4,5,6, yet functional studies examining this high-plasticity cell state (HPCS) in situ are lacking. Here we develop mouse models enabling the detection, longitudinal lineage tracing and ablation of the HPCS in autochthonous lung tumours in vivo. Lineage tracing reveals that the HPCS cells possess a high capacity for cell state transitions, giving rise to both early neoplastic (differentiated) and progressed lung cancer cell states in situ. Longitudinal lineage tracing using secreted luciferases reveals that HPCS-derived cells have a high capacity for growth compared with bulk cancer cells or another cancer cell state with features of differentiated lung epithelium. Ablation of HPCS cells in early neoplasias abrogates benign-to-malignant transition, whereas ablation in established tumours by suicide gene or chimeric antigen receptor (CAR) T cells robustly reduces tumour burden. We further demonstrate that the HPCS gives rise to therapy-resistant cell states, whereas HPCS ablation suppresses resistance to chemotherapy and oncoprotein-targeted therapy. Notably, an HPCS-like state is ubiquitous in regenerating epithelia and in carcinomas of multiple other tissues, revealing a convergence of plasticity programs. Our work establishes the HPCS as a critical hub enabling reciprocal transitions between cancer cell states. Targeting the HPCS in lung cancer and in other carcinomas may suppress cancer progression and eradicate treatment resistance."},{"t":"Couple-close：半饱和循环支架的统一方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec5748?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Couple-close as a synthetic paradigm has the potential to change the way that synthetic organic chemists approach cyclic scaffold construction. One class of cyclic molecules that has been increasingly sought after is semisaturated cyclic scaffolds, whose specific blend of Csp2- and Csp3-hybridized components confers distinct properties to these species. However, existing methods to construct these scaffolds are limited, often relying on arene saturation or annulations that require lengthy de novo syntheses. Herein, we describe a unified and highly modular couple-close strategy for the synthesis of semisaturated scaffolds. This approach installs bifunctional linkers onto aromatic rings through a range of bond-forming reactions, and subsequent cyclization furnishes semisaturated bicyclic adducts. Key to this approach is a mechanistically distinct cobalt-catalyzed dehydrogenative radical cyclization that proceeds efficiently even on electronically unbiased arenes, enabling a broad substrate scope under mild reaction conditions."},{"t":"亚海王星和超级地球的核心-包层混溶性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09970-4","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sub-Neptunes and super-Earths, the most abundant types of planet in the galaxy, are unlike anything in the Solar System, with radii between those of Earth and Neptune1,2. Fundamental questions remain regarding their structure and origin. Although super-Earths have a rocky composition3, sub-Neptunes form a distinct population at larger radii and are thought to consist of a rocky core overlain by a hydrogen-rich envelope4,5. At the extreme conditions of the core–envelope interface (exceeding several gigapascals and several thousand kelvin4,6), reaction between core and envelope seems possible, but the nature and extent of these reactions are unknown. Here we use first-principles molecular dynamics driven by density functional theory to show that silicate and hydrogen are completely miscible over a wide range of plausible core–envelope pressure–temperature conditions. We find the origin of miscibility in extensive chemical reaction between hydrogen and silicate, producing silane, SiO and water species, which may be observable with ongoing or future missions. Core–envelope miscibility profoundly affects the evolution of sub-Neptunes and super-Earths, by dissolving a large fraction of the hydrogen of the planet in the core and driving exchange of hydrogen between core and envelope as the planet evolves.","tp":"系外行星核幔","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"亚海王星和超级地球是银河系中最丰富的行星类型，其核心-包层界面处于超过极端条件的温度压力下。研究表明超级地球具有岩石组成，而亚海王星则由岩石核心和富氢包层构成。研究探讨了核心与包层之间的混溶性，对理解这些系外行星的结构和起源这一基本问题具有重要意义。"},{"t":"来自另一个海洋的珊瑚物种可能是拯救加勒比珊瑚礁的唯一方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521543123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"铜催化通过截获二烯实现的非活化芳烃区域与非对映选择性脱芳碳硅化反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523719?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化碳硅化","kp":["[反应]: Cu催化脱芳碳硅化","[中间体]: 二烯基自由基拦截","[选择性]: 区域与非对映选择性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了铜催化芳香体系的去芳香化碳硅化反应，通过自由基介导的去芳香化生成环己二烯基自由基中间体。反应同时引入碳基和硅基两个官能团，具有优异的区域选择性和非对映选择性。该方法可将简单芳香化合物转化为含硅的高价值脂环族分子，产物中的硅基团可用于后续官能化转化。铜催化剂廉价易得，为去芳香化合成提供了新的高效路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Copper‐Catalyzed Regio‐ and Diastereoselective Dearomative Carbosilylation of Unactivated Arenes by Intercepting the Die","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The radical‐mediated dearomatization of aromatic systems to generate cyclohexadienyl radical intermediates represents a crucial strategy for constructing three‐dimensional molecular architectures. Conventional approaches typically through\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition and subsequent proton/oxygen/carbon dioxide trapping to suppress rapid re‐aromatization, significantly constraining product diversity. Furthermore, dearomative bifunctionalization reactions—which offer enhanced step‐ and atom‐economy—remain substantially underdeveloped. Herein, we disclose a copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative 1,4‐ and 1,2‐carbosilylation strategy applicable to diverse unactivated (hetero)aromatic substrates to selectively construct spiro‐ or fused‐cyclic products. The resulting vinyl and allylic silanes serve as versatile synthetic handles for downstream transformations, enabling the rapid construction of sp\n                    3\n                    ‐rich polycyclic scaffolds that are highly valuable in drug discovery. Mechanistic and DFT studies indicate that the reaction commences with copper(I)‐silicon‐mediated halogen atom transfer of readily available aryl iodides to generate aryl radicals. These reactive species exhibit dual pathways: direct\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition to aromatic rings or 1,5‐hydrogen atom transfer followed by alkyl radical‐mediated\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition. Subsequent trapping of the resulting dienyl radicals by copper(II)‐silicon species yields complex polycyclic systems containing cyclohexadienylsilicon frameworks with excellent chemo‐, regio‐ and diastereoselectivity. This methodology not only establishes a novel paradigm for copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative bifunctionalization but also provides an efficient radical\n                    ipso‐\n                    and\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition platform for synthesizing architecturally intricate polycyclic compounds."},{"t":"大脑边界清道夫细胞发育的趋同进化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10003-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The vertebrate central nervous system is protected by the blood–brain barrier and meningeal membranes, which ensure immune privilege1. In the mammalian brain, microglia and barrier-associated or border-associated macrophages (BAMs) provide immune surveillance and scavenge wastes2, yet how evolution shaped immune-cell diversity and function is not understood. In zebrafish, a vascular-derived mural lymphatic endothelial cell (muLEC) lineage fulfils scavenger cell functions at central nervous system borders3,4,5. Here we identify the transcription factor odd-skipped related 2 (osr2) as a specific marker and regulator of muLEC differentiation and maintenance. osr2 controls the transition of muLECs from interconnected endothelial cells to individual scavenger cells in part by means of control of cadherin-6. muLECs are more transcriptionally similar to BAMs than to other mammalian meningeal cells and share several functions in tissue homeostasis. However, BAMs are absent from zebrafish and muLECs from mice and humans. Analysis of osr2, lymphatic endothelial cell (LEC) and BAM markers in diverse vertebrate species reveals muLECs as an ancient lineage and BAMs a recent mammalian specialization. muLECs and BAMs share functional analogies but are not homologous, providing an example of convergent evolution. This highlights the physiological importance of meningeal scavenger cells and the developmental plasticity of LECs in generating specialized cell types throughout evolution."},{"t":"使用 DNA 三向连接构建复杂且多样化的 DNA 序列","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10006-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The ability to construct entirely new synthetic DNA sequences de novo is essential to engineering and studying biology. However, the ability to produce long complex synthetic DNA sequences and libraries currently lags behind the ability to sequence and edit DNA1,2. All existing DNA-assembly technologies rely on DNA sequence information found within the final construct to direct assembly between DNA molecules3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11. As a result of this paradigm, these sequences cannot be extensively optimized specifically for assembly without affecting the final sequence. To fundamentally address this challenge, here we show the development of a new DNA assembly technique named Sidewinder that separates the information that guides assembly from the final assembled sequence using DNA three-way junctions. We demonstrate the transformative nature of the Sidewinder technique with highly robust and accurate construction of a 40-piece multifragment assembly, complex DNA sequences of both high GC content and high repeats, parallel assembly of multiple distinct genes in the same reaction and a combinatorial library with a large number of diversified positions across the entire length of the gene for high coverage of a library of 442,368 variants. This technology enables high-fidelity DNA assembly with a misconnection rate at the three-way junction of approximately 1 in 1,000,000."},{"t":"减数分裂基因的常见变异影响人类重组和非整倍体","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09964-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The leading cause of human pregnancy loss is aneuploidy, often tracing to errors in chromosome segregation during female meiosis1,2. Although abnormal crossover recombination is known to confer risk for aneuploidy3,4, limited data have hindered understanding of the potential shared genetic basis of these key molecular phenotypes. To address this gap, we performed retrospective analysis of pre-implantation genetic testing data from 139,416 in vitro fertilized embryos from 22,850 sets of biological parents. By tracing transmission of haplotypes, we identified 3,809,412 crossovers, as well as 92,485 aneuploid chromosomes. Counts of crossovers were lower in aneuploid versus euploid embryos, consistent with their role in chromosome pairing and segregation. Our analyses further revealed that a common haplotype spanning the meiotic cohesin SMC1B is associated significantly with both crossover count and maternal meiotic aneuploidy, with evidence supporting a non-coding cis-regulatory mechanism. Transcriptome- and phenome-wide association tests also implicated variation in the synaptonemal complex component C14orf39 and crossover-regulating ubiquitin ligases CCNB1IP1 and RNF212 in meiotic aneuploidy risk. More broadly, variants associated with aneuploidy often showed secondary associations with recombination, and several also exhibited associations with reproductive ageing traits. Our findings highlight the dual role of recombination in generating genetic diversity, while ensuring meiotic fidelity."},{"t":"电荷导向的碳点负载纤维素纳米晶手性超结构自组装及可调控圆二色性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522132?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点手性超结构","kp":["材料[CPL]: 碳点负载CNC手性超结构","[组装]: 电荷导向自组装","[调控]: 客体表面电荷"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探索表面电荷如何调控胶体液晶——纤维素纳米晶（CNC）的自组装行为与手性光学性能。CNC是一类源自生物质的手性纳米材料，其自组装形成的胆甾相液晶可产生结构色和圆二色性，在光学防伪、传感和手性光子器件中有广泛应用前景。研究表明通过调节表面电荷密度，可精确控制碳点负载CNC体系的螺旋螺距和手性排列方向，实现手性与发光性能的可编程调控，为手性纳米功能材料的理性设计提供了关键机制认识。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Charge‐Directed Self‐Assembly of Carbon Dot‐Loaded Cellulose Nanocrystal Chiral Superstructures With Tailorable Circular","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Surface charge critically influences the self‐assembly and functional performance of colloidal liquid crystals. However, in circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) systems, the regulatory role of guest surface charge in their self‐assembly remains fundamentally unclear, hindering the rational design of adjustable high‐performance CPL materials. Herein, we judiciously synthesize a series of positively and negatively charged carbon dots (P‐/N‐CDs) with satisfactory solid‐state emission and incorporate them into colloidal cellulose nanocrystal (CNC) liquid crystal with phase adjustability via evaporation‐induced self‐assembly (EISA). By precisely modulating the surface charge of CDs, the resulting P‐/N‐CD‐loaded CNC (P‐/N‐CDCNC) chiral superstructures exhibit tailorable CPL with luminescence dissymmetry factor values from +0.16 to −0.91. The decisive role of surface charge in the EISA process is further elucidated. In situ microscopy demonstrates divergent charge‐directed assembly pathways: N‐CDs allow CNC tactoid fusion to proceed, whereas P‐CDs arrest fusion through electrostatic crosslinking. This triggers unprecedented Janus P‐CDCNC superstructures, leading to side‐dependent CPL handedness. Such CDCNC superstructures with different polarization states are readily designed to patterns and sophisticated codes, which offer powerful avenues for high‐security anticounterfeiting and multilevel information encryption. This work pioneers guest charge modulation as a universal strategy for controlling chiroptical assembly, overcoming limitations to attain handedness‐adjustable, high‐performance CPL from natural chiral materials."},{"t":"无细胞应力经皮生物电极","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72024?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"经皮生物电极","kp":["[生物电极特性]: 经皮植入无细胞应力"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cell‐Stress‐Free Percutaneous Bioelectrodes (Adv. Mater. 5/2026)"},{"t":"精明的牛：至少一头牛知道如何使用工具","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00206-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"癌症可能可以预防阿尔茨海默病——这种蛋白质有助于解释原因","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00222-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"伪装纳米机器人瞄准并调节巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式以促进神经再生","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68636-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Macrophage (Mφ) phenotypic transformation is crucial in determining spinal cord injury (SCI) outcomes. However, the suborganelle crosstalk mechanisms—particularly between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and mitochondria—that mediate Mφ subgroup conversion during SCI remain underexplored. We aim to integrate niche intervention strategies and omics sequencing to investigate the effects of the metabolic crosstalk between ER stress (ERS) and mitochondria. Subsequently, we develop a dual-targeted camouflaged nanorobot (BP@D/N) that can reach the SCI site via systemic circulation and selectively interact with Mφ. We observe that Ero1α-mediated Ca2+ shuttling is an important mechanism for locking the inflammatory phenotype of Mφ. Blocking the Ero1α/MAMs/mtCa2+ axis suppresses mtDNA release and downregulates the cGAS-STING-NFκB signaling cascade, thus promoting M2 polarization and neural repair. Our study clarifies the regulatory mechanism of Mφ transformation-associated suborganelle crosstalk and offers a paradigm for reconstructing the dynamic balance of immune–neural interactions in the SCI microenvironment for effective repair. It offers a scientifically grounded and translational approach to overcoming the clinical challenge of irreversible SCI.","tp":"纳米机器人神经再生","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"开发了双靶向伪装纳米机器人，通过调节巨噬细胞内质网和线粒体之间的亚细胞器串扰来促进脊髓损伤后的神经再生。研究整合了微环境干预策略和多组学测序，深入探究内质网应激与线粒体代谢串扰对巨噬细胞亚群转化的影响，为脊髓损伤治疗提供了创新的纳米医学方案。"},{"t":"COBRA-k：桥接基于约束和动力学代谢建模的强大框架","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb3022?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mathematical modeling is key to understanding cellular metabolism. Two common approaches are kinetic modeling and constraint-based reconstruction and analysis (COBRA). COBRA models analyze steady-state fluxes using linear constraints but lack kinetic detail. Kinetic models offer mechanistic descriptions via differential equations but require (often unknown) kinetic parameters and enzyme concentrations. To bridge this gap, we introduce COBRA-k, a framework integrating nonlinear kinetic rate laws into COBRA models to consistently constrain metabolic fluxes, enzyme abundances, and metabolite concentrations. COBRA-k enables flexible exploration of metabolic steady states with optimization techniques, even with incomplete parametrization. COBRA-k models require solving computationally demanding mixed-integer nonlinear programs. We therefore developed a dedicated iterative algorithm, implemented in an open-source Python package. We applied COBRA-k to a large-scale Escherichia coli model, demonstrating its effectiveness and revealing holistic metabolic insights. For example, it accurately predicts and explains the phenomenon of high intracellular glutamate concentration. COBRA-k combines the flexibility of COBRA with kinetic precision, offering a powerful tool for predictive metabolic modeling and engineering.","tp":"代谢建模新框架","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"COBRA-k是一个整合非线性动力学速率定律与约束模型的新框架，旨在弥合基于约束的代谢重建分析（COBRA）和动力学建模之间的鸿沟。COBRA模型可分析稳态通量但缺乏动力学细节，动力学模型则提供机制描述但需要未知的动力学参数。COBRA-k结合两者优势，为理解细胞代谢提供了更完整的数学建模工具。"},{"t":"政策激励下CCUS技术扩散与多主体投资行为","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000200?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CCUS政策扩散","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"打破金属有机笼对称性增强Diels-Alder催化特异性与催化效率","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524427?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机笼催化","kp":["[催化剂设计]: 低对称配位笼","[反应]: 增强Diels–Alder催化特异性"],"as":"研究通过打破金属有机笼（Metal-Organic Cage）的对称性，显著提升了其作为仿生催化剂在Diels-Alder反应中的催化选择性。传统空心分子笼催化剂虽能提供空间限域效应，但缺乏酶活性位点的高精度识别能力。研究团队设计了不对称结构的金属有机笼，在笼腔内创造出差异化微环境，使底物以特定取向结合，从而实现对反应过渡态的精准稳定和对区域选择性、立体选择性的有效控制。该策略为设计具有类酶级催化精度的仿生催化剂提供了新思路，在精细化学品合成领域前景广阔。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Breaking Metal‐Organic Cage Symmetry Enhances Diels–Alder Catalytic Specificity and Proficiency","b":"Abstract\n                  Biomimetic catalysts that rely on hollow, synthetic hosts lack the sophistication of an enzyme active site. One reason for this is that synthetic hosts, particularly those prepared using self‐assembly, are invariably highly symmetrical and therefore not tailored to achieve optimal interactions. Herein, we describe a low‐symmetry coordination cage that shows enhanced Diels–Alder catalytic proficiency compared to equivalent high‐symmetry systems. Similar to biological catalysis, this enhanced proficiency is due to the presence of non‐degenerate, distinct pockets that separately facilitate both substrate recognition and transition state stabilization, leading to higher specificity. The same low symmetry catalyst also shows emergent properties in that it can catalyze sequential chemical reactions that equivalent symmetrical cages cannot. These results pave the way to ever more elaborate catalysts that show enhanced activity and selectivity delivered solely by the tailored expression of weak non‐covalent interactions."},{"t":"从祖先不同的人群对精神分裂症的生物学见解","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10000-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Schizophrenia and related psychoses occur in all human populations, with the highest rates of diagnosis among Black individuals and those of mainly African ancestry1. Decades of research have established a highly heritable and polygenic basis for schizophrenia, which is mostly shared across populations2,3,4. However, a recruitment bias towards European cohorts5 has led to discoveries that are poorly generalizable to African populations. This exclusion of the world’s most genetically diverse populations narrows our understanding of disease biology and risks exacerbating health disparities. Here we show that electronic health records linked with genomic data from the Million Veteran Program (MVP)6—a national research programme that looks at the effects of genes, lifestyle, military experiences and exposures on the health and wellness of veterans—enable a comprehensive assessment of schizophrenia genetics in populations of African ancestry in the USA. We identify ancestry-independent associations in African populations and expand the catalogue of implicated regions by more than 100 loci. Through statistical fine-mapping and integrative transcriptomic analyses, we refine disease-associated signals to consensus genes with convergent neurobiological functions. These findings provide a much-needed view of schizophrenia’s genetic architecture in populations of African ancestry, and offer biological insights that both extend previous work and broaden its global relevance."},{"t":"仿生骨架编辑策略重写合成聚合物","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522451?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物主链编辑","kp":["[聚合物策略]: 主链编辑(翻译后修饰仿生)"],"dp":1,"as":"该综述系统总结了受生物大分子（如蛋白质、核酸）可逆骨架重构机制启发而发展出的合成聚合物骨架编辑策略。聚合物主链结构直接决定其力学性能、化学反应性及功能，通过主链的切割、重组、插入等编辑手段，可在合成后动态改写聚合物拓扑结构与性能。文章归纳了光化学、催化、动态共价化学等骨架编辑方法，展望其在可回收材料、信息存储和智能响应材料中的应用前景。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Bioinspired Backbone Editing Strategies for Rewriting Synthetic Polymers","b":"Abstract\n                  The structure of a polymer backbone plays a central role in determining its physical properties, chemical reactivity, and function. In biological systems, biopolymers such as DNA, RNA, and proteins exhibit a remarkable degree of structural and functional adaptability, achieved through highly regulated post‐synthetic modifications of both side chains and backbones. By contrast, synthetic polymers have traditionally been designed with static, inert backbones, limiting post‐synthetic modulation of their core structures. Although post‐polymerization modification strategies have successfully enabled side chain and terminal group functionalization, precise editing of the polymer backbone remains underdeveloped. Inspired by the editing mechanisms of biological macromolecules, recent efforts have begun to explore chemical strategies for backbone editing in synthetic polymers. These emerging approaches offer transformative potential for generating functional polymeric materials for diverse applications. This Minireview highlights key backbone editing mechanisms in biological systems and discusses how these paradigms can inform the development of bioinspired backbone editing strategies to rewrite synthetic polymers."},{"t":"基于数据驱动场景生成的电-热-算耦合系统数据中心双层规划","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心规划","as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.5},"ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation"},{"t":"综合能源系统与加氢站的分布式鲁棒双层协同优化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源加氢站","kp":["[综合能源系统]: 含加氢站双层分布鲁棒优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station ba"},{"t":"受益于太阳能：车载光伏辅助电源太阳能电动公交的最优调度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000127?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能公交调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Benefiting from solar: Optimal scheduling for solar electric buses with onboard PV auxiliary power"},{"t":"婴儿到婴儿的菌株传播塑造了肠道微生物组的发育","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09983-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The early infant microbiome is largely primed by microbial transmission from the mother between birth and the first few weeks of life1,2,3, but how interpersonal transmission further shapes the developing microbiome in the first year remains unexplored. Here we report a metagenomic survey to model microbiome transmission in the nursery setting among babies attending the first year, their educators and their families (n = 134 individuals). We performed dense longitudinal microbiome sampling (n = 1,013 faecal samples) during the first year of nursery and tracked microbial strain transmission within and between nursery groups across 3 different facilities. We detected extensive baby-to-baby microbiome transmission within nursery groups even after only 1 month of nursery attendance, with nursery-acquired strains accounting for a proportion of the infant gut microbiome comparable to that from family by the end of the first term. Baby-to-baby transmission continued to grow over the nursery year, in an increasingly intricate transmission network with single strains spreading in some classes, and with multiple baby-acquisition and species-transmissibility patterns. Having siblings was associated with higher microbiome diversity and reduced strain acquisition from nursery peers, while antibiotic treatment was the condition that most accounted for the increased influx of strains. This study shows that microbiome transmission between babies is extensive during the first year of nursery, and points to social interactions in infancy as crucial drivers of infant microbiome development."},{"t":"由内源生化逻辑编程的自主水凝胶执行器，用于双阶段变形和药物释放","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516809?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Designing soft materials that autonomously respond to complex physiological environments remains a fundamental challenge in biomedical systems engineering. Here, we report on a 3D‐printed hybrid protein‐polymer hydrogel actuator that operates via \n                    endogenous biochemical logic\n                    , enabling fully autonomous dual‐stage shape morphing and enzyme‐triggered drug release in gastric‐mimicking environments. The actuator comprises a bilayer structure: an active layer based on bovine serum albumin‐poly (ethylene glycol) diacrylate (BSA‐PEGDA), and a passive PEGDA layer. In acidic gastric fluid, the BSA‐PEGDA layer undergoes rapid conformational swelling, followed by delayed softening from pepsin‐mediated degradation, autonomously driving reversible shape transitions without manual intervention. By embedding doxorubicin (DOX) within the BSA‐PEGDA hydrogel network, the system achieves site‐specific, enzyme‐gated drug release that is tunable using pepstatin A as a biochemical inhibitor. High‐resolution digital light processing (DLP) printing enables the fabrication of complex autonomous actuators and microneedle‐equipped grippers capable of mucosal adhesion, catch‐and‐release behavior, and controlled delivery. This work establishes a materials design strategy where biochemical cues are used as programmable inputs to drive mechanical and therapeutic outputs, offering a robust platform for bioresponsive soft robotics and in situ drug delivery.","tp":"智能水凝胶执行器","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"报道了一种3D打印的混合蛋白-聚合物水凝胶执行器，通过内源性生化逻辑实现自主控制。该执行器能在模拟胃液环境中实现完全自主的双阶段形态变化和酶触发的药物释放。这一设计解决了软材料自主响应复杂生理环境这一生物医学系统工程中的根本性挑战，为智能药物递送系统提供了新范式。"},{"t":"自分泌 TGFβ2 在尤文肉瘤中强制形成转录混合细胞状态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0550?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Subpopulations of cancer-associated fibroblast (CAF)-like tumor cells deposit extracellular matrix (ECM) proteins that support Ewing sarcoma (EwS) progression and metastasis. We previously showed a hallmark of CAF-like EwS cells is their hybrid transcriptional state wherein the driver fusion oncogene, EWS::FLI1, maintains activation of proliferative programs but loses capacity to repress mesenchymal genes. Here, we studied primary patient tumors and cell line models to identify molecular drivers of this hybrid state. Our data reveal that hybrid EwS cells are induced and maintained by a transforming growth factor-β (TGFβ) signaling positive feedback loop. Hybrid cells derepress TGFBR2 and up-regulate expression and secretion of TGFβ2 to sustain pathway activation and ECM deposition. Although TGFβ ligands can potently induce growth arrest in cells of epithelial origin, we show that TGFβ1 and TGFβ2 promote cell invasion of EwS cells without affecting proliferation. Thus, stroma-derived and tumor-derived TGFβ ligands induce and maintain hybrid EwS cells to promote pro-metastatic cell phenotypes."},{"t":"非典型毛细血管周围 Ly6G⁺Nur77⁺ 巨噬细胞启动对小鼠肺部过敏原的 2 型免疫反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68652-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The mechanisms of airway allergen sensing and type 2 immune response initiation remain poorly understood. Using a mouse house dust mite (HDM)-induced allergic airway model, we identify a population of lung macrophages located close to alveolar capillaries that express Ly6G and the nuclear receptor Nr4a1/Nur77. These atypical Ly6G+Nur77+ macrophages preferentially capture airway-delivered allergens and play an important role in initiating HDM-driven T helper type 2 (Th2) responses. They sense the major HDM allergen, the cysteine protease Der p 1, via protease-activated receptor 2 (PAR2), and their activation and accumulation require both PAR2 and Nr4a1/Nur77. These Ly6G+Nur77+ macrophages regulate the migration of conventional migratory dendritic cells (mDCs) to draining mediastinal lymph nodes (mLNs) through cysteinyl leukotriene (CysLT) production, which enhances mDC migration toward CCL21 for T cell priming. Inhibiting CysLT biosynthesis reduces mDC migration and dampens Th2 allergic responses, highlighting possible therapeutic avenues in type 2 immunity."},{"t":"原子精密三酶纳米酶同步线粒体双途径破坏，用于精准肿瘤学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520859?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Although nanozyme‐mediated disruption of mitochondrial homeostasis holds significant therapeutic potential, precise spatiotemporal regulation using single‐function catalysts remains a major challenge. To overcome this limitation, we developed a triphenylphosphine‐functionalized Pd@PtIr nanozyme by epitaxially depositing a Pt–Ir (1:1) alloy shell onto Pd nanocube cores with atomic‐level precision. This rationally engineered metal‐center architecture generates a synergistic catalytic interface that not only enhances peroxidase‐like activity—validated by density functional theory (DFT)—but also endows the nanozyme with intrinsic NADH oxidase and glutathione peroxidase‐like functionalities within a single platform. Upon 808 nm near‐infrared (NIR) irradiation, the nanozyme triggers a cascade of enzyme‐mimetic redox reactions that jointly deplete mitochondrial glutathione (GSH) and elevate reactive oxygen species (ROS) levels, while NADH oxidation concurrently disrupts ATP biosynthesis. These concerted effects synergistically impair mitochondrial redox homeostasis and energy metabolism in tumor cells. To further potentiate therapeutic efficacy, we combined the nanozyme with antisense oligonucleotide‐mediated silencing of ASncmtRNA, resulting in a pronounced 89.1% tumor regression in an orthotopic breast cancer model. This integrated approach—combining atomic‐precision catalyst design, multifunctional enzymatic activity, and gene‐silencing therapy—presents a transformative paradigm for organelle‐targeted precision nanotherapeutics in oncology.","tp":"原子精密纳米酶","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"通过在钯纳米立方体核心上外延沉积铂铱（1:1）合金壳层，以原子级精度构建了三苯基膦功能化的Pd@PtIr纳米酶。该精心设计的金属中心架构产生了协同催化效应，能够同步破坏线粒体两条代谢途径，克服了单功能催化剂难以实现精确时空调控的局限，为精准肿瘤治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"原子级Eu介导的乙腈吸附构型翻转驱动长期安培级乙醇电合成","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521105?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙腈电合成乙胺","kp":["催化机制[AEM电解槽]: Eu调控乙腈吸附构型切换","产物: 乙胺","规模: 安培级电合成"],"as":"该研究提出一种原子级Eu（铕）介导的乙腈吸附构型切换机制，用于电催化加氢合成乙胺（EA）。乙腔电催化加氢（AN-ECH）被视为可持续的乙胺合成路径，但传统催化剂存在活性与选择性难以兼顾的问题。研究发现，通过引入稀土元素铕在原子尺度调控乙腈的吸附构型，可有效改变反应中间体的结合方式，从而优化加氢路径，提升乙胺选择性与长期催化稳定性。该工作为电催化腈类加氢反应的催化剂设计提供了新思路，展示了原子级活性位点调控在复杂电化学反应中的关键作用。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Atomic Eu‐Mediated Acetonitrile Adsorption Configuration Switch Drives Long‐Term and Ampere‐Level Electrosynthesis of Et","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic hydrogenation of acetonitrile (AN‐ECH) offers a sustainable pathway for ethylamine (EA) synthesis. However, achieving high selectivity in AN‐ECH necessitates carefully balancing proton availability to suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which often conflicts with the proton supply requirements under industrial‐grade current densities. Herein, we design and develop a novel and effective AN‐ECH catalyst consisting of rare‐earth Eu atoms modified on Cu\n                    2\n                    O nanoneedles to drive efficient and durable AN‐ECH at ampere‐level currents. The optimized Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a high EA Faradaic efficiency of 98.1 % and an exceptional production rate of 2253.2 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    compared with pure Cu\n                    2\n                    O. Notably, the Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O can continuously operate 420 h at 2 A in an anion‐exchange membrane electrolyzer for AN‐ECH, representing the longest reported stability under the industrial‐current conditions to date. Operando characterization and theoretical calculations elucidate that the Eu incorporation tailors the electronic structure of Cu sites, thus switching the adsorption configuration of AN from the flat‐lying multi‐site π‐adsorption to vertical N‐end adsorption. This reconfiguration of the adsorption site lowers the energy barrier for the imine hydrogenation step, dictating the ideal proton addition pathway while enhancing the proton addition kinetics to suppress the HER. This work provides fundamental insights into rare‐earth tuning of AN hydrogenation mechanisms and represents a critical advancement toward ampere‐scale electrosynthesis of EA.","aip":1},{"t":"来自陆地和海洋的大气微塑料排放","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09998-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Microplastics (MPs) are global pollutants1, yet their atmospheric distribution is poorly understood2. Although atmospheric MP measurements have become more abundant, estimates of emissions into the atmosphere vary by orders of magnitude3,4. Here we compile a global atmospheric MPs dataset and compare it with size-aligned MP model simulations. Our model simulations show two to four orders of magnitude overestimation of the measured global median atmospheric MP concentrations. Measured median concentrations over the ocean are 27 times lower than over the land (0.003 and 0.08 particles m−3, respectively). Applying a simple scaling method, we estimate that oceanic emissions are lower in number than land-based emissions. The total global land-based and oceanic emissions are 6.1 × 1017 (1.3 × 1017 to 1.1 × 1018) particles year−1 and 2.6 × 1016 (2.7 × 1015 to 5.0 × 1016) particles year−1, respectively. Our results indicate that fewer MP particles are emitted into the atmosphere than previously thought. Land sources dominate the number but not the mass emissions, indicating that MPs emission size distributions should be investigated further."},{"t":"同化因果推理","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68568-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Causal inference is fundamental across scientific disciplines, yet existing methods struggle to capture instantaneous, time-evolving causal relationships in complex, high-dimensional systems. In this paper, assimilative causal inference (ACI) is developed, which is a methodological framework that leverages Bayesian data assimilation to trace causes backward from observed effects. ACI solves the inverse problem rather than quantifying forward influence. It uniquely identifies dynamic causal interactions without requiring observations of candidate causes, accommodates short datasets, and, in principle, can be implemented in high-dimensional settings by employing efficient data assimilation algorithms. Crucially, it provides online tracking of causal roles that may reverse intermittently and facilitates a mathematically rigorous criterion for the causal influence range, revealing how far effects propagate. The effectiveness of ACI is demonstrated by complex dynamical systems showcasing intermittency and extreme events. ACI opens valuable pathways for studying complex systems, where transient causal structures are critical."},{"t":"CIGS与CdTe薄膜太阳能光伏作为电动汽车充电潜在能量捕获系统的评估","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏充电系统","kp":["[光伏充电站]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜电池对比评估"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.5},"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Cha"},{"t":"随着格陵兰岛失去冰层，全球海平面将会上升，而格陵兰岛的海平面将会下降","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6709?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The island is rebounding from ice melt so fast that scientists are rethinking how Earth's interior works."},{"t":"非谐性驱动的异常粒子-波状声子转变导致Tl₂AgI₃超低热导率","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521353123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低热导率热电材料","kp":["材料: Tl2AgI3零维金属卤化物","机制: 非简谐驱动声子粒-波转变","性能: 超低热导率"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在Tl₂AgI₃材料中发现了一种非同寻常的声子输运现象：由强非简谐性驱动的从\"粒子态\"到\"波动态\"的声子交叉行为。这种反常转变打破了传统晶体热传导规律，导致该材料表现出极低的热导率。该发现对理解非简谐晶格动力学机制具有重要意义，同时为设计新型高性能热电材料和超低热导率隔热材料提供了全新的物理思路与候选材料体系。","ot":"Anharmonicity driven unusual particle-to-wave-like phonon crossover leads to ultralow thermal conductivity in Tl2AgI3","b":"Realization of unusual particle-to-wave-like crossover in phonon transport and understanding its fundamental structural origin can guide the design of materials with ultralow thermal conductivity. Here, we report such a crossover from particle-like phonon propagation to wave-like coherence with increasing temperature in the zero-dimensional (0D) metal halide, Tl2AgI3. Composed of discrete (Tl6I)5+ and (Ag3I8)5- subunits, the structure exhibits intrinsic lattice instability governed by Pauling's third rule where face-sharing of polyhedra drives Coulombic cationic repulsion causing local distortion of Ag atoms, as confirmed by synchrotron X-ray pair distribution function (X-PDF) analysis and ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) simulations. Anharmonic low-energy rattling of Tl is evidenced within the (Tl6I)5+ framework. These structural disorders generate low-frequency localized and anharmonic optical phonons that hybridize with acoustic branches, strongly suppressing lattice thermal conductivity ([Formula: see text]). Consequently, [Formula: see text] drops to ~0.18 W/m.K at 125 K and remains nearly temperature independent, signaling a breakdown of the phonon-gas model, attributed to phonon localization and wave-like coherence, modeled using the linearized Wigner transport equation (LWTE). The phonon localization in the 0D crystal structure results in a crossover from populations conductivity ([Formula: see text]) associated with particle-like phonon propagation to coherence conductivity ([Formula: see text]) through wave-like tunneling, at 175 K. Our study reveals 0D structural confinement along with anharmonic local structural dynamics can enable particle-to-wave-like phonon crossover, establishing a pathway to mixed phononic regimes and suppressed thermal transport."},{"t":"一种由短药代动力学尾定义的超长效二聚体比克替拉韦前药","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68501-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultra-long-acting (ULA) antiretroviral parenteral formulations, with low injection volumes, high resistance barriers, and short pharmacokinetic (PK) tails, can transform HIV-1 therapeutics. Here, we converted bictegravir (BIC), a potent daily oral antiretroviral drug, into monomeric and homodimeric ester prodrugs. The homodimeric prodrug nanosuspension, NMXBIC, shows sustained plasma BIC levels > 16 times the protein-adjusted 95% inhibitory concentration (PA-IC95) for six months after a single injection in Sprague Dawley rats. The results paralleled a short PK tail with the potential for late dose forgiveness. The monomeric prodrug nanosuspension, NM2BIC, shows lower year-long plasma BIC concentrations above PA-IC95 after a single injection. After repeated injections, NMXBIC and NM2BIC are well tolerated in New Zealand White rabbits. NMXBIC’s physicochemical properties and high BIC loading/unit mass of the prodrug contribute to its unique ULA PK profile. These results support its development as a ULA formulation for HIV-1 treatment and prevention."},{"t":"聚集诱导发光分子设计缓解有机太阳能电池非辐射能量损耗","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519588?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["分子设计策略[有机太阳能电池]: AIE抑制聚集猝灭提升PLQY","目标: 降低非辐射复合损耗"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"有机太阳能电池中非辐射能量损失是限制开路电压（V_OC）和光电转换效率的关键瓶颈。该研究提出利用聚集诱导发光（AIE）分子设计策略来抑制非辐射复合损耗，通过调控给体/受体分子在薄膜中的聚集行为，减少能量耗散通道。该方法有望同时提升器件的V_OC和填充因子，为突破有机光伏效率极限提供了分子层面的创新设计思路。","ot":"Aggregation‐Induced Emission Molecular Design for Mitigating Non‐Radiative Energy Loss in Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Non‐radiative energy loss remains a critical bottleneck limiting the open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) and efficiency of organic solar cells (OSCs). Here, we introduce a molecular design strategy that leverages aggregation‐induced emission (AIE) to suppress aggregation‐caused quenching and enhance solid‐state photoluminescence quantum yield (PLQY), thereby mitigating non‐radiative recombination. A prototypical AIE motif, tetraphenylethylene, was incorporated into the terminal group of a Y‐series non‐fullerene acceptor to yield dTPE, which exhibits distinct AIE characteristics not previously observed in high‐performance Y‐series acceptors. Photoluminescence studies reveal that dTPE achieves a threefold enhancement in PLQY compared to L8BO‐C4 in the film, leading to an electroluminescence external quantum efficiency more than an order of magnitude higher than that of D18:L8BO‐C4. Consequently, the binary D18:dTPE device achieves a remarkably low non‐radiative recombination loss of 0.130 eV. When incorporated as a guest into D18:L8BO‐C4 blends, dTPE enables a non‐radiative voltage loss of only 0.190 eV and an unprecedented\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    of 0.93 V, yielding an efficiency of 20.5%. To our knowledge, this represents the highest\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    reported for OSCs with efficiencies above 20%. This work establishes AIE molecular design as an effective pathway to overcome intrinsic limitations of Y‐series acceptors and provides guiding principles for mitigating non‐radiative energy loss in next‐generation OSCs.","aip":1},{"t":"衰老促进小胶质细胞积累缓慢降解的突触蛋白","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09987-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Neurodegenerative diseases affect 1 in 12 people globally and remain incurable. Central to their pathogenesis is a loss of neuronal protein maintenance and the accumulation of protein aggregates with ageing1,2. Here we engineered bioorthogonal tools3 that enabled us to tag the nascent neuronal proteome and study its turnover with ageing, its propensity to aggregate and its interaction with microglia. We show that neuronal protein half-life approximately doubles on average between 4-month-old and 24-month-old mice, with the stability of individual proteins differing among brain regions. Furthermore, we describe the aged neuronal ‘aggregome’, which encompasses 1,726 proteins, nearly half of which show reduced degradation with age. The aggregome includes well-known proteins linked to diseases and numerous proteins previously not associated with neurodegeneration. Notably, we demonstrate that neuronal proteins accumulate in aged microglia, with 54% also displaying reduced degradation and/or aggregation with age. Among these proteins, synaptic proteins are highly enriched, which suggests that there is a cascade of events that emerge from impaired synaptic protein turnover and aggregation to the disposal of these proteins, possibly through microglial engulfment of synapses. These findings reveal the substantial loss of neuronal proteome maintenance with ageing, which could be causal for age-related synapse loss and cognitive decline."},{"t":"阿法尔化石显示了傍人的广泛分布和多样性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09826-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Afar depression in northeastern Ethiopia contains a rich palaeontological and archaeological record, which documents 6 million years of human evolution. Abundant faunal evidence links evolutionary patterns with palaeoenvironmental change as a principal underlying force1. Many of the earlier hominin taxa recognized today are found in the Afar, but Paranthropus has been conspicuously absent from the region. Here we report on the discovery, in the Mille-Logya research area, of a partial mandible that we attribute to Paranthropus, dated to between 2.5 and 2.9 million years ago and found in a well-understood chronological and faunal context. The find is among the oldest fossils attributable to Paranthropus and indicates that this genus, from its earliest known appearance, had a greater geographic distribution than previously documented2. Often seen as a dietary specialist feeding on tough food, the range of diverse habitats with which eastern African Paranthropus can now be associated shows that this suggested adaptive niche did not restrict its ability to disperse as widely as species of Australopithecus and early Homo. The discovery of Paranthropus in the Afar emphasizes how little is known about hominin evolution in eastern Africa during the crucial period between 3 and 2.5 million years ago, when this genus and the Homo lineage presumably emerged."},{"t":"有机光伏技术进展","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70569?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"有机光伏","as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Advancing Organic Photovoltaics (Adv. Energy Mater. 3/2026)"},{"t":"可再生能源分布式储能系统中基于误差函数的SoC均衡自适应下垂控制方案","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池储能SOC均衡","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewa"},{"t":"用于植物电生理监测长期电耦合的适应性热响应聚合物","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1400?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"植物电生理监测","kp":["材料[植物电极]: 温敏响应聚合物","持续时间[非侵入监测]: >1天"],"as":"该研究开发了一种可适应型热响应聚合物，用于植物电生理信号的长期电耦合监测。通过温度驱动的材料相变特性实现电极与植物组织的稳定界面，长期可靠采集电生理信号，为作物健康状态评估、生长监测及精准农业提供新的传感技术方案。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptable thermoresponsive polymer for long-term electrical coupling in plant electrophysiology monitoring","b":"Electrophysiological signals provide valuable insights into plant health, facilitating measures to enhance crop productivity. Despite advances in measurement methods, long-term (>1 day) acquisition techniques remain limited, hindering continuous monitoring. Current long-term techniques rely on invasive electrodes, as noninvasive electrodes fall short in operational duration and conformability. Here, a capacitively coupled electrode with an adaptable coupling layer is developed for noninvasive, month-long electrophysiological monitoring on diverse plants. The adaptable coupling layer is formed by in situ sol-gel transition, followed by dehydration of thermoresponsive hydrogel on plants, achieving high conformability to complex surfaces and stable electrical coupling. For 1 month on trichome-covered plant surfaces, the electrode maintains a high signal-to-noise ratio comparable to a gold-standard noninvasive electrode, which typically lasts a few hours. Long-term monitoring reveals drought-specific signal features that correlate with plant water status. Physiological investigations indicate an essential role of calcium and reactive oxygen species, highlighting the potential of our electrode in generating biological insights and inspiring plant sensing innovations."},{"t":"吸积爆发使行星形成盘中的硅酸盐结晶","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09939-3","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Crystalline silicates form at high temperatures (>900 K) (refs. 1,2). Their presence in comets3,4,5,6 suggests that high-temperature dust processing occurred in the early Solar System and was subsequently transported outwards to comet-forming regions. However, direct evidence for this crystallization and redistribution in Sun-like protostars has remained unknown. By comparing James Webb Space Telescope mid-infrared spectra of the periodically bursting protostar EC 53 (ref. 7), we detect crystalline silicate (forsterite and enstatite) emission features that appear only during the burst. The emergence of these features indicates active crystal formation by thermal annealing in the hot inner disk during the accretion burst. We also detect a nested outflow—a collimated atomic jet enclosed by slower molecular outflows, consistent with magnetohydrodynamic wind models8. This configuration provides a mechanism for the outward transport of freshly crystallized silicates9. To our knowledge, our results provide the first direct observational evidence of in situ silicate crystallization during episodic accretion bursts in a very young star still embedded in its dense envelope. Although we do not directly detect grains transported to the outer disk, the observed trends are consistent with outward redistribution, indicating that both dust processing and transport occur during the earliest and most dynamic stages of star formation.","tp":"行星盘结晶","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用詹姆斯·韦伯空间望远镜的中红外光谱观测周期性爆发的原恒星EC 53，首次在类太阳原恒星中直接探测到硅酸盐结晶及其重新分布的证据。结晶硅酸盐形成需要高温（>900K），在彗星中的存在表明早期太阳系发生了高温尘埃处理并向外传输。吸积爆发被认为是驱动该结晶过程的关键机制。"},{"t":"异常甲基化通过限制 RIPK3 表达来限制肺腺癌的抗肿瘤炎症","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz9227?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Evasion of programmed cell death is a critical hallmark of cancer. However, the contribution of inflammatory forms of cell death in lung carcinogenesis and their effects on the composition of the tumor-immune microenvironment remain unclear. Our multi-omics analyses of samples from patients with primary lung adenocarcinoma revealed that necrosome signaling is repressed because of reduced expression of receptor-interacting protein kinase 3 (RIPK3). Distinct methylation signatures, both in the RIPK3 promoter and nonpromoter regions, correlated with lower transcription levels of RIPK3. This resulted in limited expression of inflammatory genes, advanced histologic features, reduced immune cell invasion, and decreased patient survival. Mechanistically, we confirmed the tumor-suppressive role of necrosome signaling through the genetic deletion of Ripk3 in two independent, clinically relevant mouse models of lung adenocarcinoma. Functionally, RIPK3 shaped a diverse immune environment by promoting the invasion of innate and adaptive immune cells in patient samples and experimental mice. Thus, RIPK3-mediated inflammatory signaling enhances a diverse immune microenvironment and hinders progression in lung adenocarcinoma."},{"t":"人工智能帮助了科学家，但也可能损害了科学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aef6710?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Analysis finds that AI both expands individual impact and narrows collective scientific exploration.","tp":"AI双刃剑","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"分析发现人工智能对科学产生了双重影响：一方面扩大了科学家个人的研究影响力，另一方面却缩小了集体科学探索的广度。研究表明AI工具虽然提升了个体研究效率，但可能导致研究主题趋同、创新路径收窄，对科学界的整体多样性和创造力构成潜在威胁，引发对AI在科学研究中角色的深层反思。"},{"t":"表面暴露的心磷脂合酶为维持革兰氏阴性外膜提供了意想不到的范例","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524588123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Gram-negative bacteria have long been thought to confine primary glycerophospholipid synthesis to the inner membrane (IM). Here, we challenge this paradigm by identifying ClsO, an outer membrane (OM) lipoprotein from Acinetobacter baumannii that functions as a cardiolipin synthase. In contrast to canonical cardiolipin synthases, which are restricted to the IM, ClsO is surface-exposed and deposits cardiolipin into the outer leaflet of the OM, colocalizing with Acinetobacter lipooligosaccharide. Loss of ClsO sensitizes cells to membrane disrupting agents, such as bile salts, and key antibiotics, implicating ClsO in OM barrier integrity. ClsO activity increases when mislocalized glycerophospholipids accumulate at the cell surface, such as in cells lacking Mla (maintenance of lipid asymmetry) system, consistent with a surface-active site mechanism. Engineering mutations in ClsO that prevent its trafficking to the OM was found to abolish nearly all enzymatic activity. Remarkably, we found that ClsO homologs are widespread across Proteobacteria and confirmed several to be functional cardiolipin synthases, indicating a conserved strategy of surface lipid remodeling. These findings redefine the spatial organization of lipid metabolism in Gram-negative bacteria and reveal an adaptive mechanism to maintain OM integrity when membrane asymmetry is compromised."},{"t":"来自 Gloeophyllum trabeum 的单域扩展蛋白样蛋白能够裂解木聚糖","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528599123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Expansin-related proteins (ERPs) are a broad group of plant cell wall-loosening proteins and are considered noncatalytic, as, to date, no cell wall-derived products have been observed as a result of catalysis, despite the presence of a domain that resembles the catalytic domains of GH45 endoglucanases. Here, we report catalytic activity for a single-domain ERP, GtEXPN_133317, from the brown-rot fungus Gloeophyllum trabeum, which is highly expressed in the early phase of spruce colonization. We demonstrate enzyme-dependent formation of xylan-derived products, such as glucuronylated xylo-oligosaccharides, using high-performance anion exchange chromatography with pulsed amperometric detection. Structure-based multiple sequence alignment of ERPs with GH45 endoglucanases showed that, next to a single conserved aspartate (Asp87 in GtEXPN_133317) present in all ERPs and GH45s, fungal ERPs contain a second conserved acidic residue (Asp25 in GtEXPN_133317). Mutation of these two conserved amino acids, Asp87 and Asp25, led to a nearly complete loss of xylanolytic activity. While these findings do not exclude the possibility of a noncatalytic plant cell wall-loosening mechanism, they show that ERPs likely have other modes of action besides what the current paradigm states.","tp":"木聚糖降解酶","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道了来自褐腐菌Gloeophyllum trabeum的单域扩展蛋白样蛋白GtEXPN_133317具有催化活性，能够裂解木聚糖。此前扩展蛋白相关蛋白（ERP）被认为是非催化性的，尽管其含有类似GH45内切葡聚糖酶催化域的结构域。该蛋白在云杉定殖早期高表达，这一发现改变了人们对植物细胞壁松动蛋白功能的认知。","aip":1},{"t":"流体流动中细菌表面粘附的剪切诱导限制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516069123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling bacterial surface adhesion and subsequent biofilm formation in fluid systems is crucial for the safety and efficacy of medical and industrial processes. Here, we theoretically examine the transport of bacteria close to surfaces, isolating how the key processes of bacterial motility and fluid flow interact and alter surface adhesion. We exploit the disparity between the fluid velocity and the swimming velocity of common motile bacteria and, using a hybrid asymptotic-computational approach, we systematically derive the coarse-grained bacterial diffusivity close to surfaces as a function of swimming speed, rotational diffusivity, and shape. We calculate an analytical upper bound for the bacterial adhesion rate by considering the scenario in which bacteria adhere irreversibly to the surface on first contact. Our theory predicts that maximal adhesion occurs at intermediate flow rates: At lower flow rates, increasing flow increases surface adhesion, while at higher flow rates, adhesion is decreased by shear-induced cell reorientation."},{"t":"小鼠内侧杏仁核中的性别二态性神经元簇对男性性状态做出反应","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518703123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Increasing scientific interest has been directed toward understanding sexual dimorphism in the brain. Although several brain structures exhibit masculine or feminine characteristics, strictly binary anatomical feature, comparable to those observed in genitalia, has been rarely identified. In this study, we identified a dense, sexually dimorphic cluster of neurons in the posterodorsal medial amygdala (MeApd), which we named DIMPLE (Dimorphic IEGs Medial Posterodorsal amygdala Labeled Ensemble) that exhibited a remarkable binary pattern of c-fos promoter activation. Using the TRAP2 (Targeted Recombination in Active Populations) transgenic mouse model, we found that it was consistently labeled in all females, regardless of age or sexual experience. In contrast, DIMPLE labeling was absent in adult virgin males but present both prior to weaning and following mating. Surgical removal of gonads (ovariectomy or orchiectomy) did not alter the labeling pattern of DIMPLE in either sex. Interestingly, a single intraperitoneal injection of prolactin, a hormone that increases in males after mating, induced DIMPLE labeling in virgin males. However, treatment with cabergoline, a potent inhibitor of prolactin secretion, did not prevent DIMPLE labeling in females or in postmating males. Given the established role of the MeApd in social and reproductive behaviors, we hypothesize that DIMPLE may support neural mechanisms underlying female-typical behavior and potentially contribute to postmating behavioral shifts in males."},{"t":"空气源热泵瞬态性能预测降阶模型","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000644?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空气源热泵降阶建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A reduced-order model for predicting transient performance of air-source heat pumps"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风光水混合电站日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光水电站竞价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid pow"},{"t":"利用热可切换溶剂从卤水混合物的碱金属阳离子中直接提锂的新方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00446-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"盐湖提锂","kp":["选择性[S3E提锂]: Li/Na,K >1000倍","技术: 热响应胺溶剂切换萃取"],"as":"该研究提出一种新型切换溶剂选择性萃取（S3E）技术，利用热响应型胺类化合物从卤水中实现锂的高选择性直接提取。与传统盐田蒸发或离子交换法相比，S3E通过温度调控引发溶剂相态切换，实现对碱金属阳离子中锂离子的精准识别与分离，大幅提升萃取选择性与效率。该技术有望降低提锂成本、缩短工艺周期，对卤水型锂资源的开发利用及全球锂供应链安全具有重要意义。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A novel approach for direct lithium extraction from alkali metal cations in brine mixtures using thermally switchable so","b":"A novel switchable solvent selective extraction (S3E) technology utilizes thermo-responsive amines for highly selective lithium recovery from complex brines. A modest temperature swing toggles solvent hydrophilicity, enabling preferential lithium extraction even with 1,000× more sodium or potassium. S3E maintains solvent stability and selectivity over repeated cycles for scalable lithium recovery."},{"t":"用于广谱保护肺炎支原体的粘膜 mRNA-LNP 疫苗平台","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000246?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"具备板载闭环控制的微型机器人","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01564-w","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微型闭环控制机器人","kp":["[机器人]: 微型机器人搭载板载闭环控制"],"as":"","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A microscopic robot with onboard closed-loop control"},{"t":"用于厘米级三维光刻的超构透镜阵列","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01566-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超构透镜三维光刻","kp":["[光刻尺度]: 厘米级三维光刻","[器件]: 超构透镜阵列"],"as":"","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A metalens array for centimetre-scale three-dimensional lithography"},{"t":"全基因组遗传筛选揭示 P2Y2 整合素轴作为非小细胞肺癌 EGFR 突变体的稳定剂","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv3980?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Activating mutations in the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) gene drive non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). Oncogenic EGFR mutants are ligand-independent and more stable, but the underlying mechanism remains unclear. We hypothesized that EGFR mutants selectively leverage cellular stabilizers to evade degradation. Genome-wide RNA interference screens identified genes (encoding for stabilizers) responsible for mutant EGFR stability, with P2Y2 receptor (P2Y2) emerging as a bona fide stabilizer. Mechanistically, high extracellular adenosine triphosphate (ATP) levels transactivate EGFR mutants via P2Y2 activation, previously shown to signal through Src kinase-dependent EGFR phosphorylation. Our study reveals that ATP-driven P2Y2 activation stabilizes EGFR mutants by forming a P2Y2-integrin β1-EGFR complex enriched in endosomes. Targeting this axis destabilizes EGFR mutants and offers a strategy against drug resistance. Elevated P2Y2 and integrin β1 expression in patients with NSCLC implies clinical relevance. Our results provide previously unidentified insight that EGFR mutants enhance extracellular ATP levels to activate P2Y2-integrin for enhanced stability of EGFR mutants to drive the oncogenic program."},{"t":"用于扩大细胞外靶向蛋白质降解的细胞因子受体靶向嵌合体工具箱","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524129123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Extracellular targeted protein degradation (eTPD) is an important new modality for manipulating the extracellular proteome. However, most eTPD receptors are expressed broadly or are restricted to the liver, limiting specific degradation in other tissues. Cytokine receptor-targeting chimeras (kineTACs) are genetically encoded bispecifics for eTPD that fuse a natural ligand like CXCL12 to an antibody, directing soluble or membrane proteins for lysosomal degradation using the widely expressed chemokine receptor CXCR7 (K. Pance et al., Nat. Biotechnol. 41, 273-281 (2023)]. Here, we dramatically expand the kineTAC toolbox by constructing 81 different kineTACs based on an unbiased list of cytokines, chemokines, and growth factors. Remarkably, 55 of these expressed at suitable levels for analysis without any optimization. Many of these kineTACs bind receptors that have unique cell-type expression profiles, allowing for eTPD in specific cells and tissues, and some were more potent than the original CXCL12-based kineTAC against specific targets. We further show the internalizing capability of a kineTAC can enhance the performance of antibody drug conjugates. We believe these simple, genetically encoded tools will be useful for expanding the applications for optimized or cell type-selective eTPD.","tp":"蛋白降解技术","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"细胞因子受体靶向嵌合体（kineTACs）是一种基因编码的双特异性分子，用于细胞外靶向蛋白质降解（eTPD）。它将天然配体如CXCL12与抗体融合，利用广泛表达的趋化因子受体引导可溶性或膜蛋白进入溶酶体降解。该工具箱解决了现有eTPD受体表达广泛或仅限肝脏的局限，实现了其他组织中的特异性降解。","aip":1},{"t":"水电解槽剩余寿命预测综述：从退化机制到预测方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解槽寿命预测","as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic"},{"t":"梯度功能化隔膜解锁正极潜在宿主位点并提升超高面容量锌负极深度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523132?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"梯度功能化隔膜","kp":["[隔膜]: 梯度结构G-CCN@GF修饰玻璃纤维","[机理]: 抑制聚碘化物穿梭提升锌负极可逆性"],"as":"静态水系锌碘电池（SAZIBs）受多碘化物穿梭效应严重制约，导致容量快速衰减与库仑效率低下。研究团队设计了梯度功能化隔膜，通过沿厚度方向分布的亲碘官能团浓度梯度，有效捕获和锚定多碘化物，同时解锁正极潜在宿主位点以提升碘负载量。该策略同步解决了穿梭抑制与活性物质利用率两大难题，显著提升了电池循环稳定性与能量密度。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Gradient Functionalized Separator for Unlocking Latent Cathode Host Sites and Enhancing Zinc Anode DOD in Ultrahigh‐Ar","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of static aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries (SAZIBs) is hindered by the polyiodide shuttling effect and poor zinc anode reversibility, issues that are exacerbated under high iodine loadings essential for high energy density. Herein, a gradient‐structured separator (G‐CCN@GF) is designed by modifying a glass fiber separator with 2D cyano‐functionalized graphitic carbon nitride (CCN). Experimental and simulation results demonstrate that the dense CCN layer facing the cathode effectively anchors polyiodides and unlocks latent electrochemical active sites, thereby facilitating conversion kinetics under high iodine loading and I/C ratio. Meanwhile, the thin and uniform CCN layer on the anode side promotes a uniform Zn\n                    2+\n                    flux, significantly improving the zinc reversibility under high depth of discharge (DOD). Consequently, the Zn/G‐CCN@GF/I\n                    2\n                    battery with a conventional activated carbon (AC) host achieves exceptional performance under high I/C ratio (2:1) conditions, including a high areal capacity of 27.9 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    at 150.1 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    iodine loading and remarkable stability over 7200 cycles at 40 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    . A 60 cm\n                    2\n                    pouch cell further validates practicality, delivering 5.8 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and retaining 85.87% capacity after 1100 cycles. This work provides a feasible separator‐engineering strategy for high‐energy‐density SAZIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"来自哥伦比亚波哥大萨巴纳的 5500 年前梅毒螺旋体基因组","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw3020?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Treponematosis, a bacterial infection caused by Treponema pallidum subspecies and T. carateum (yaws, bejel, syphilis, pinta), has afflicted humans for millennia. Despite paleopathological evidence and emerging genomic data, little is known about the evolutionary history of these pathogens. We report a 5500-year-old Treponema genome (TE1-3) from Middle Holocene hunter-gatherer contexts of the rock shelter Tequendama I in Colombia. Our analyses place TE1-3 as a sister lineage to all known T. pallidum subspecies, positioning this pathogen in the Americas millennia before European contact and before diversification of the subspecies causing syphilis, yaws, and bejel. This discovery broadens the known diversity of T. pallidum while extending the genomic record of treponemal pathogens by millennia, providing molecular support for a deep history of T. pallidum in the Americas."},{"t":"4D打印高机动性机器人：刺激响应材料的可控功率放大行为","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516070?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"4D打印柔性机器人","kp":["[4D打印]: 刺激响应材料可控功率放大","[运动]: 跑跳弹射多模态高机动"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于4D打印技术制造高机动性机器人的方法，利用智能材料实现可控的功率放大行为。通过外部刺激（如温度、光照）触发材料的相变或结构变形，使软体机器人能够执行跳跃、弹射、快速奔跑等多模态运动。4D打印的时空可编程特性使机器人具备跨越障碍的能力，突破了传统驱动方式的功率密度限制，在搜救、微操等场景具有应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"4D Printing of Highly Maneuverable Robots: Controllable Power Amplification Behaviours of Stimulus‐Response Materials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Highly maneuverable robots can cross obstacles or move quickly with running, jumping, ejection, or multimodal combinations, exhibiting advantages in aerospace, agriculture, medical treatment, etc. Due to the behaviors of high‐energy bursts and the huge vibrations during motions, these robots need to be simple and reliable. 4D printing of highly maneuverable robots addresses this challenge by combining the power amplification of stimulus‐response materials and additive manufacturing technologies. It integrates actuation, sensing, and control modules into one component with a highly integrated structure and controllable high‐mobility movement. Herein, this paper presents a review of highly maneuverable robots based on 4D printing, focusing on the key technologies from design to fabrication. Firstly, the manufacturing processes of 4D printing for highly maneuverable robots are overviewed. Then, from a biomimetic perspective, structural designs for power amplification are reviewed. After summarizing stimulus‐response materials applicable to the 4D‐printed highly maneuverable robots, the strategies employed to control the direction, speed, mode, and response time of robotic motion are elaborated. Finally, current challenges and the perspectives on 4D printing of highly maneuverable robots are highlighted.","aip":1},{"t":"具有本征孔率的二维MOF用于挥发性有机化合物比色检测","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519243?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF气体传感","kp":["材料[VOC检测]: 本征面内多孔2D MOF","机制: 可逆比色响应"],"as":"研究团队报道了一种具有本征面内孔隙率的罕见二维金属有机框架（MOF），可用于挥发性有机化合物（VOCs）的比色检测。该MOF材料通过结构设计实现了对特定VOC分子的选择性吸附，并伴随可观测的颜色变化，实现无需复杂仪器的可视化传感。这种低成本、高灵敏度的气体检测材料在环境监测、工业安全和室内空气质量评估等领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"2D MOF with Intrinsic Porosity for Colorimetric Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs) Detection","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  In this work, we report an uncommon 2D metal–organic framework (MOF) with intrinsic in‐plane porosity that undergoes a distinct and reversible colour change upon exposure to various volatile organic compounds (VOCs). The presence of channels oriented parallel to the layers ensures permanent porosity that is preserved even after exfoliation into nanosheets with micron‐scale lateral dimensions, thereby overcoming the conventional limitation of porosity loss in the monolayer regime. This unique combination of structural stability and responsive behaviour not only underscores the potential of 2D MOFs as versatile and tuneable platforms for chemical sensing, but also opens the door to channelled nanosheets, redefining the application landscape of 2D MOFs."},{"t":"1.43亿年海水锇同位素记录：火山活动和构造的趋势、节奏和动态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adw8301?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Tectonic events and volcanic pulses forming large igneous provinces (LIPs) have altered Earth's paleoclimate. Osmium (Os) and strontium (Sr) isotopic ratios are key tracers of past continental weathering and LIP eruptions. However, limited Cretaceous seawater Os and riverine Os-Sr data have hindered quantitative reconstructions. In this study, we present a long-term Os isotopic record from the Cretaceous to the present, revealing ~10- to 20-million-year cycles during the Cretaceous that align with rhythmic LIP eruptions. Seawater Os-Sr isotopic trends indicate transitions in continental weathering patterns during the Late Cretaceous [~90 million years ago (Ma)] and Paleogene (~35 Ma) ascribed to intensified weathering of interior Gondwana during the opening of the Atlantic Ocean and the uplift and glaciation of the Himalaya, respectively. Our Os isotopic record highlights its utility in tracing long-term LIP cycles and identifying major paleogeographic turning points."},{"t":"含硫酯蛋白的 α2-巨球蛋白功能通过两种免疫诱导肽保护果蝇免受细菌蛋白酶的侵害","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525580123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"RNAseq analysis of the Drosophila genome has revealed further immune-induced genes. Two genes initially annotated as lncRNAs, CG44404(yulü) and CG45045(shenshu), are strongly induced. We report here that these two genes actually encode highly related secreted peptides found in the Sophophora subgenus of Drosophila species. We have generated single and double null mutants of these loci and found that the double mutant line did not display any enhanced susceptibility to an immune challenge with a panel of bacterial and fungal pathogens, except for Pseudomonas aeruginosa. We did not observe any increased P. aeruginosa burden in yulü-shenshu mutants, suggesting that the two peptides may not be required for resistance to infection. Rather, we find that they provide a level of protection against Outer Membrane Vesicles (OMVs) purified from either P. aeruginosa or Serratia marcescens culture supernatants. We have recently reported that S. marcescens OMVs induce the paralysis of flies through the induction of apoptosis in at least some neurons. Much of the virulence of these OMVs is mediated by the metalloprotease PrtA. While Yulü/Shenshu do not display any protease inhibition activity, the detection of an association between Yulü and the Drosophila complement thioester-containing protein 2 (Tep2) led to the finding that both Tep2 and Tep4 mutants are sensitive to the injection of PrtA while their overexpression significantly protects wild-type flies from the effects of this protease. Both Tep2 and Tep4 are able to inhibit the activity of PrtA in a thioester- and yulü/shenshu-dependent manner. Thus, these Teps may also function as α2-macroglobulins."},{"t":"内阻并非徒劳：铁(0)四苯基卟啉介导均相二氧化碳还原中内阻的作用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04062","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原阻抗","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Resistance Is Not Futile: The Role of Internal Resistance in Homogeneous Carbon Dioxide Reduction Mediated by Iron(0) Tetraphenylporphyrin"},{"t":"克服无机固态电池固态复合电极的锂离子输运限制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00586","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电极锂输运","kp":["瓶颈[固态电池]: SSE低离子电导率限制复合电极Li⁺输运","需求[固态电池]: 高活性材料含量与载量方可提升能量密度"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"固态电池具有更高能量密度和安全性，但简单地将液态电解质替换为固态电解质并不足以实现性能突破。该研究聚焦无机固态电池中复合电极的锂离子传输瓶颈问题，提出了克服固固界面离子传输限制的新策略，对推动全固态电池从实验室走向实际应用具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Overcoming the Li+ Ion Transport Limitation of Solid-State Composite Electrodes for Inorganic Solid-State Batteries","b":"Solid-state batteries promise higher energy density and safety, but simply replacing liquid electrolytes with solid ones does not guarantee improvement over lithium-ion batteries. Achieving higher energy density requires high active material (AM) content and high AM loading, which is hindered by solid-state electrolyte's (SSE's) low ionic conductivity, poor AM-SSE interfaces, sluggish Li+ transport, and processing challenges. In this review paper, the fundamental mechanisms of ion transport in SSEs and composite electrodes are comprehensively reviewed and discussed. It is found that reducing the internal ionic resistance and the diffusion impedance of AM are effective ways to boost the effective current density of the composite electrode and decrease the overpotential of SSBs to enhance the delivered energy. The mechanisms and advanced techniques for measuring both ionic and electronic conductivities, as well as directly observing the ionic conductivity and diffusion of the composite electrodes are summarized. Furthermore, the strategies for improving ion diffusion within the AM, and enhancing ion transfer across the high AM content composite electrode are discussed. In addition, the challenges associated with industrialization of composite electrodes and potential solutions are discussed. This review paper summarizes the key aspects of ion transport in the solid-state composite electrode, aiming to support the design of ultrahigh energy density SSBs."},{"t":"晶格畸变驱动富锂氧化物原位形成相干结构带作为锂离子电池正极","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03989","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电富锂正极","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":7.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Lattice-Distortion-Driven In Situ Formation of Coherent Structural Bands Lithium-Rich Oxides as Lithium-Ion Battery Cathodes","aip":1},{"t":"钴取代镍配位聚合物双活性位点的动力学与调控以增强析氧催化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12205","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OER双活性位点","kp":["催化剂[OER]: Co取代Ni配位聚合物双活性位增强析氧催化"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"针对析氧反应（OER）动力学缓慢的瓶颈，该研究设计了一种钴取代镍配位聚合物催化剂，通过调控双活性位点的动态协同作用提升催化效率。原位光谱揭示了Ni/Co双位点在反应中交替承担电子转移与中间体吸附的角色，双金属位点间的电子耦合显著降低了决速步能垒。该材料在碱性电解液中展现出优于商业RuO₂的OER活性与耐久性，为设计高效廉价电催化水分解催化剂提供了分子级设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Dynamics and Control of Dual Active Sites in Co-Substituted Ni Coordination Polymers for Enhanced Oxygen Evolution Catalysis","b":"Facilitating the kinetically demanding oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is essential for the sustainable conversion of renewable energy into chemical fuels. However, precisely unraveling the dynamics of active species and sites during the OER remains a significant challenge. Herein, we constructed a series of Co-substituted Ni coordination polymers (Ni-CPs) for the OER. Complementary surface-/bulk-sensitive <i>operando</i> time-resolved spectroscopic monitoring enables detailed mechanistic insight into the critical role of partial Co incorporation in modulating the local coordination geometry of Ni centers and thereby promoting the intrinsic OER kinetics. Our results reveal that controlled Co substitution in Ni-CPs facilitates the generation of a substantial fraction of (Ni, Co)(IV) species, which activate O-O bond formation atop the catalytically active Ni<sup>IV</sup>-O-Co<sup>IV</sup> moieties. These key findings are further supported by kinetic isotopic effect studies and density functional theory calculations, in which the OER in Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs proceeds via an oxo-radical coupling mechanism, with deprotonation preferentially occurring at the Ni sites. Consequently, the engineered Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs exhibit enhanced OER activity compared to their oxide counterparts, along with durable electrochemical stability for over 4000 h. This study not only offers detailed mechanistic insights into the dynamics of active species and sites but also highlights their critical role in optimizing the OER kinetics."},{"t":"金属掺杂共价有机框架中的限域水用于潮湿条件下增强物理吸附碳捕集","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19317","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF碳捕集","kp":["[碳捕集策略]: 限域水转化为CO2物理吸附位点","材料[湿态碳捕集]: 金属掺杂共价有机框架"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用金属掺杂共价有机框架（COF）中的受限水分子增强湿态条件下的物理吸附CO₂捕集性能。与胺基化学吸附不同，物理吸附体系通常怕水，而该工作反其道而行——通过COF纳米孔道中限域水的形成优化CO₂吸附焓与选择性。掺杂金属位点在孔道内构建特定的水网络结构，在75%相对湿度下CO₂吸附容量较干燥条件显著提升，突破了物理吸附材料在工业烟气脱碳中的湿度适应性限制。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Confined Water in Metal-Doped Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Physisorptive Carbon Capture under Wet Conditions","b":"Unlike amine-based CO2 chemisorption, where water can enhance amine utilization efficiency, physisorptive CO2 capture is typically impeded by water owing to its large dipole moment and competitive adsorption behavior. Converting water into additional adsorptive sites for CO2 adsorption in physisorption is promising, yet still nascent and elusive. Herein, we report a strategy that exploits confined water to achieve efficient CO2 capture, even under high relative humidity (RH) conditions, in metal-ion-doped covalent organic frameworks (COFs). By activation at different temperatures, water exhibiting Lewis acidic properties can be formed within metal-ion-doped COFs, thereby further enhancing CO2 adsorption. The dry CO2 uptake of NUS-42-NiCl2 nearly doubles at 800 mmHg and 298 K compared to pristine NUS-42 after activation at 323 K. In situ X-ray diffraction (XRD), solid-state 1H magic angle spinning nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (ss 1H MAS NMR), and in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) confirm the formation of Lewis-acid-water. Furthermore, control over pore size and metal-ion loading is shown to be critical for generating the Lewis-acid-water. Combined in situ DRIFTS, electron spin resonance (ESR), X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS), and density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate the role of Lewis-acid-water in producing moisture-enhanced and inflectional CO2 adsorption isotherms. Multicomponent dynamic column breakthrough experiments further demonstrate significantly improved CO2 uptake after moisture presaturation up to 75% RH. These findings offer a systematic and innovative approach for converting water into CO2 adsorption sites, thereby addressing the challenge of competitive water adsorption during physisorptive carbon capture."},{"t":"自旋交叉分子中的明亮比率型荧光温度计：自旋态平衡的可视化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18528","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子自旋探测","kp":["[自旋态检测]: 比率型荧光可视化自旋态平衡","[设计要求]: 高信噪比与高灵敏度"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究在自旋交叉（SCO）分子中构建了一种明亮的比例型荧光温度计，用于可视化自旋态平衡。通过将荧光发射与分子高低自旋态的热致跃迁耦合，荧光强度比随温度呈现可逆且灵敏的变化。该体系可实时映射纳米尺度的自旋态分布与动态平衡过程，为分子自旋电子器件的设计、自旋态操控以及自旋相关量子技术的探测提供了光学读出手段，有望推动分子磁性传感器件的发展。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Bright Ratiometric Fluorescent Thermometer in a Spin Crossover Molecule toward Visualization of Spin-State Equilibria","b":"Optically addressable molecular spins aim to tackle control and detection of weak magnetic moment when magnetic devices are scaled down to the single-molecule level. To achieve accurate readout of molecular spin states by adjacent luminescent probes, the molecular design must meet the stringent requirements of both high signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) and high sensitivity. Here, we incorporated a naphthalimide-based ratiometric fluorescent (RF) probe with a donor-acceptor (D-A) structure into a spin crossover (SCO) molecule. The probe features dual emission channels arising from a locally excited (LE) state and an intramolecular charge-transfer (ICT) state. The thermochromism associated with SCO spectrally overlaps with the probe's RF bands, producing a reverse synergistic effect, achieving ratiometric fluorescent thermometers (RFTs) with 1.35% K-1 sensitivity and 66% fluorescence contrast. More importantly, the bright fluorescence thermochromism (∼50% quantum yield) is maintained throughout the entire SCO process, enabling direct visualization of spin-state equilibria with high SNR (>400) and detection resolution (0.0017) even at low concentrations of 10-4 M. This tuning of the single-fluorophore RF against SCO thermochromism provides a new design platform for the accurate readout of spin states of molecules."},{"t":"[ASAP] 用于癌症免疫治疗的基于工程纳米囊泡的溶酶体靶向蛋白降解平台 (NV-TAC)","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17801","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Lysosome-Targeting Chimeras (LYTAC) technology offers a revolutionary approach for specifically degrading extracellular and membrane proteins. However, current LYTAC platforms face multiple technical challenges, including ligand screening, linker optimization, and the need to balance the characteristics between the protein of interest (POI) and lysosome-targeting receptor (LTR). To overcome these challenges, we engineered NV-TACs (Nanovesicle-based TArgeting Chimeras)─a linker-free LYTAC platform that integrates native nanovesicles displaying the endogenous ligands of POI and LTRs as bioinspired membrane protein degradation modules. As a proof-of-concept, PD-1 (as the binder of PD-L1) and transferrin (as the binder of transferrin receptor, TFRC) were engineered into biocompatible fibroblast-derived nanovesicles. This platform demonstrates significant scalability, allowing flexible module integration and functional assembly. NV-TACs efficiently degrade PD-L1 on tumor and immune cells through the TFRC-mediated specific lysosomal endocytosis pathway, and it has been expanded to the degradation of other membrane proteins. Notably, by incorporation of a therapeutic payload (ML210), NV-TACs simultaneously exhibited targeted protein degradation and ML210-mediated ferroptosis through payload delivery capacity. Both in anti-PD-1-responsive and -resistant tumor models, NV-TACs demonstrated significant therapeutic efficacy without obvious systemic toxicity. The platform of NV-TACs paves new avenues for developing linker-free, modular, and bioinspired targeted protein degradation platforms.","tp":"纳米囊泡降解","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"工程化纳米囊泡靶向嵌合体（NV-TAC）是一种无需连接子的溶酶体靶向嵌合体平台，用于癌症免疫治疗。该平台克服了现有LYTAC技术面临的配体筛选、连接子优化以及目标蛋白与溶酶体靶向受体特性平衡等多重技术挑战，为胞外和膜蛋白的特异性降解提供了更简化的工程方案。"},{"t":"富锂锰基氧化物正极的电压衰减与容量损失：原子起源、介观非均匀性与宏观演化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521529?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[衰减机制]: 电压衰减与容量损失源于原子-介观-宏观耦合"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述系统解析了富锂锰基氧化物（LRMO）正极材料的电压衰减与容量损失问题，从原子尺度来源、介观异质性与宏观演化三个层次进行了全面综述。原子层面揭示了过渡金属迁移与氧氧化还原不可逆性导致的结构重排；介观尺度上分析了相分离与局域结构不均匀性；宏观层面追踪了长循环中电压平台持续下滑的演变规律。文章梳理了掺杂、表面包覆、组分调控等多种缓解策略，为下一代高比能正极材料的工程化设计提供了理论框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Voltage Decay and Capacity Loss in Lithium‐Rich Manganese Oxide Cathodes: Atomic Origins, Mesoscopic Heterogeneities, and Macroscopic Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Lithium‐rich manganese‐based oxide (LRMO) cathode materials have emerged as promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) due to their high specific capacity and exceptional energy density. Nevertheless, their practical application is significantly hindered by pronounced voltage decay and capacity loss during cycling, which stem from complex and interrelated mechanisms. This review presents a comprehensive, multi‐scale analysis of the degradation pathways in LRMO materials, spanning from atomic‐level structural dynamics to mesoscopic heterogeneities and macroscopic particle evolution. Special focus is directed toward unraveling the synergistic interplay between oxygen anionic and cationic redox processes, oxygen release, transition metal ions (TMs) migration, irreversible phase transitions, heterogeneous electrochemical reactions, and operational conditions. By integrating insights from advanced characterization, theoretical modeling, and electrochemical analyses, this review establishes a cohesive framework that elucidates the intricate relationships among oxygen activity, TMs dynamics, and structural transformations. These mechanistic insights lay a critical foundation for the development of stabilization strategies aimed at mitigating voltage decay and capacity loss. Ultimately, this review bridges the gap between fundamental mechanistic understanding and practical engineering applications, offering actionable guidance for the design of durable and high‐energy‐density LRMO cathode materials tailored for high‐performance energy storage systems."},{"t":"利用原位X射线散射在含氢氧化的流动池中揭示锂介导氮还原机制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06529A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂介导电化学合成氨","kp":["反应体系[Li-NRR]: 锂介导电化学合成氨","阳极设计[流通池]: 氢氧化消除牺牲性质子给体需求"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用流动池中的原位X射线散射技术揭示了锂介导电化学氮还原反应（Li-NRR）的机制。锂金属在电解过程中原位生成并与氮气反应生成氮化锂，随后质子化释放氨。研究结合氢氧化反应（HOR）耦合策略，抑制了寄生性析氢副反应，显著提升了法拉第效率。原位同步辐射XRD实时追踪了Li₃N中间相的形成与转化动力学，为理解锂介导固氮的界面过程提供了直接的实验证据，对电化学合成氨的工艺优化具有指导意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Unveiling the mechanism of lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction via operando X-ray scattering in a flow cell with hydrogen oxidation","b":"The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is currently the most promising strategy for electrochemical ammonia synthesis. In this study, we present an operando grazing incidence wide angle X-ray scattering (GI WAXS) investigation using an improved electrochemical flow cell that enables hydrogen oxidation at the anode and thereby eliminates the need of a sacrificial proton donor. The improved cell design also increases nitrogen availability and mass transport, achieving ammonia faradaic efficiencies (FEs) up to 36%. This setup allows direct analysis of reaction intermediates and the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) using state-of-the-art diglyme-based electrolytes. We identify lithium amide (LiNH2) as the only stable, crystalline intermediate, providing direct insight into the Li-NRR mechanism. Notably, in diglyme-based electrolytes, the SEI composition differs significantly from that in tetrahydrofuran-based systems, with reduced LiF content and the formation of previously unreported crystalline diglyme–lithium salt complexes. These species likely influence ammonia selectivity and long-term stability. Our findings highlight how the electrolyte composition and cell architecture govern Li-NRR selectivity and efficiency, offering a foundation for the rational design of next-generation SEI layers and solid electrolytes to enable scalable electrochemical ammonia synthesis."},{"t":"面向可规模化模组的均匀单片钙钛矿薄膜：通过种子引发和真空加工实现无反溶剂结晶","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506521?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿组件结晶","kp":["结晶策略[钙钛矿膜]: 种子引发真空辅助结晶(S-VAC)无反溶剂制备","放大目标[钙钛矿组件]: 面向商业化模块大面积均匀单晶膜"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种反溶剂-free的钙钛矿薄膜制备策略，通过种子引发（seed priming）与真空辅助工艺实现大面积均匀单相钙钛矿薄膜的可控制备，用于可扩展太阳能组件。种子晶核预先引入成核位点，真空处理调控溶剂蒸发速率与结晶动力学，有效抑制了薄膜中的针孔和相分离缺陷。基于该工艺制备的微型组件在有效面积超过10 cm²时仍保持高效率，为钙钛矿太阳能电池从实验室小面积器件向商业化组件的规模化迈进了关键一步。","dp":1,"ot":"Uniform Monolithic Perovskite Films for Scalable Modules: Anti‐Solvent‐Free Crystallization via Seed Priming and Vacuum Processing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Scaling high‐efficiency perovskite solar cells into commercially viable modules remains challenging. Here, we demonstrate a seed‐primed, vacuum‐assisted crystallization (S‐VAC) strategy that links oleylamine‐induced α‐phase nanocrystal seeding to vacuum‐driven vertical crystal growth. Complementary in situ characterization, including time‐resolved GIWAXS, solution‐state NMR, and dynamic light scattering (DLS), reveals that oleylamine forms uniform ≈1.7 nm α‐phase seeds in the precursor solution via hydrogen bonding with FA\n                    +\n                    cations and steric stabilization. These seeds prime the substrate for controlled, single‐crystal‐like vertical growth under low‐pressure vacuum processing, thereby eliminating the need for toxic antisolvents. The resulting monolithic perovskite films exhibit strong (100) texture and high uniformity across 15 × 15 cm\n                    2\n                    substrates. Using S‐VAC, we achieve a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.2% for 2.5  ×  2.5 cm\n                    2\n                    devices and a certified efficiency of 19.1% for 15  ×  15 cm\n                    2\n                    mini‐modules. Encapsulated modules retain &gt;94% of their initial efficiency after one year of continuous outdoor operation. By establishing a molecular‐level basis for oleylamine‐assisted seed formation and demonstrating scalable, antisolvent‐free processing, this work advances seed‐assisted crystallization and supports the practical commercialization of robust and sustainable perovskite photovoltaics."},{"t":"用于耐久水电解的薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜：抑制溶胀并提升2000小时以上稳定性","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505888?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水聚合物膜","kp":["膜厚度[sPPS电解膜]: 12 µm","稳定性[水系电解槽]: >2000小时","[增强结构]: 多孔聚乙烯基底增强抗溶胀"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究开发了一种薄型增强磺化聚苯砜（sPPSU）质子交换膜，用于高耐久性水电解。通过分子结构设计抑制膜的过度溶胀，同时保持高质子电导率。增强策略显著提升了膜在酸性、高电位运行条件下的机械稳定性与化学耐久性，在2000小时以上的恒流电解测试中性能衰减极小。该碳氢化合物膜的性能可媲美甚至超越商业Nafion膜，且成本更低，为绿氢大规模制备中的电解槽膜材料提供了有竞争力的替代方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Thin Reinforced Sulfonated Poly(phenylene sulfone) Membranes for Durable Water Electrolysis: Suppressed Swelling and Enhanced Stability Over 2000 Hours","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Hydrocarbon (HC) membranes have the potential to significantly enhance the efficiency of water electrolyzers. However, their low mechanical integrity under electrolysis conditions, due to severe swelling, poses a challenge for industrial‐scale applications. Here, we present a 12 µm‐thick sulfonated poly(phenylene sulfone) (sPPS) membrane reinforced with a porous polyethylene (PE) substrate. The PE substrate reduces in‐plane swelling by a factor of 7 (10% vs 69%) and improves mechanical stability (440 MPa vs 50 MPa) in water at 60°C. Under electrolysis conditions, a 24 µm thick sandwich of two reinforced membranes shows stable operation over more than 2000 h in a constant current hold at 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    conducted at 60°C (first 1000 h) and 80°C (remaining 1000 h) with only 6 µV h\n                    −1\n                    of voltage deviation within the last 500 h. With a potential of 1.67 V and a hydrogen in oxygen content of 1 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , the PFAS‐free membrane clearly outperforms a state‐of‐the‐art reference (Nafion‐N211: 1.73 V and 1.5 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    )."},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色和棕色一面：创新、人工智能驱动的专利、能源政策干预和排放动态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"机器人碳排放","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"MXene与MBene基材料在纳米农业中的首次综述：植物免疫工程、可控防护与诱导生物刺激机制","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72036?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MXene纳米农业应用","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"The First Review on Nano‐Agricultural Applications of MXene and MBene‐Based Materials for Plant‐Immunoengineering, Controlled Protection, and Inducing Biostimulation Mechanisms (Adv. Mater. 5/2026)"},{"t":"EPS-I 胞外多糖将 Ralstonia 枯萎病病原体生物膜转化为粘弹性液体，以便在植物中快速传播","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2512757123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Ralstonia solanacearum species complex (RSSC) pathogens cause destructive plant wilt diseases of a wide variety of crops, leading to significant agricultural losses worldwide. These bacteria rapidly spread through the water-transporting xylem where they grow prolifically and produce abundant biofilm that clogs xylem vessels. To understand RSSC biofilm behavior in planta, we examined their complex fluid mechanics. Rheological analyses revealed that unlike all previously analyzed microbial biofilms, RSSC biofilms are shear-thinning, viscoelastic fluids at physiologically relevant shear forces. To determine which factors confer these unique mechanics, we analyzed biofilms of bacterial mutants with altered biofilm components. Genetic analysis demonstrated that development of the viscous-dominant biofilms required production of EPS-I, an amphiphilic exopolysaccharide that is a major virulence factor for all RSSC pathogens. We show that EPS-I confers \"biofilm mobility\", which allows wild-type RSSC colonies to passively expand when deformed. Despite its high metabolic cost, bioassays demonstrated that EPS-I production conferred a net fitness benefit where biofilm mobility allowed the pathogen to spread and access more nutrients in complex environments like xylem vessels. The RSSC are a monophyletic lineage of aggressive plant wilt pathogens, and our evolutionary hypothesis testing suggests the origin of the eps biosynthetic gene cluster coincides with the emergence of wilt pathogenesis in the RSSC ancestor. Furthermore, comparative physiological assays demonstrated that biofilm mobility is unique to the RSSC within the genus Ralstonia. In summary, EPS-I production is a key evolutionary innovation that enables RSSC dispersal and virulence by conferring unique biofilm mechanics.","tp":"枯萎病机理","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究发现青枯菌（RSSC）产生的EPS-I胞外多糖能将细菌生物膜从典型的粘弹性固体转变为粘弹性液体。RSSC引起多种作物的毁灭性枯萎病，细菌在木质部导管中大量增殖并产生堵塞生物膜。流变学分析表明这种独特的流体力学行为使细菌能够在植物木质部中快速传播，揭示了病原体适应植物传播的新机制。"},{"t":"硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶上*NO偶联与*H供应的协同调控驱动硝酸盐高效电还原为氮气","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522680?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝酸盐电催化","kp":["催化剂[硝酸盐电还原]: 硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶Fe⁰@S","[转化路径]: *NO→*N2O→N2高选择性"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶催化剂，通过协同调控中间体*NO偶联与活性氢（*H）供应，实现硝酸根（NO₃⁻）高效电还原为氮气（N₂）。硫掺杂调控了铁活性位点的电子结构，促进NO₃⁻逐步还原至*NO中间体并抑制析氢竞争反应；同时优化*H的生成与传递，驱动*NO加氢偶联生成N≡N键。该催化剂在宽电位区间内实现了高法拉第效率和N₂选择性，为含氮废水处理与环境修复提供了高效电催化方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Regulation of *NO Coupling and *H Supply on Sulfur‐Doped Zero‐Valent Iron Aerogels Drives Efficient Electroreduction of Nitrate to N2","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrochemical nitrate (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ) reduction to dinitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ) is a promising approach for environmental remediation but suffers from the sluggish\n                    *\n                    NO coupling and excessive\n                    *\n                    H supply on traditional electrocatalysts. Herein, we construct a sulfur‐doped zero‐valent iron (Fe\n                    0\n                    @S) aerogel that enables highly selective electrochemical nitrate‐to‐dinitrogen conversion via\n                    *\n                    NO→\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O→N\n                    2\n                    path by synchronously regulating\n                    *\n                    H supply and\n                    *\n                    NO coupling. Mechanistic studies reveal that the aerogel's 3D porous framework enriches local NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    near active sites, while strategic sulfur incorporation can weaken H\n                    2\n                    O adsorption and tune\n                    *\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    binding strength, thereby lowering the energy barrier for\n                    *\n                    NO coupling into\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O and subsequent reduction to N\n                    2\n                    . With a flow‐through electrolyzer, we achieve near‐complete removal of 50 mg/L NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    from real surface and ground water with a high N\n                    2\n                    selectivity above 90%. This work provides a practical NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    remediation method based on non‐noble metals and presents a simple strategy for the design of catalyst structure to improve N\n                    2\n                    selectivity."},{"t":"钙钛矿表面静电梯度促进金属原位溶出及固体氧化物电解池中的二氧化碳电解","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520056?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿CO2电解","kp":["[溶出驱动力]: 表面静电梯度控制金属溶出","[器件]: 固体氧化物电解池CO2电解"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究揭示了钙钛矿表面静电梯度对金属纳米颗粒原位析出（exsolution）的增强效应及其在固体氧化物电解池（SOEC）CO₂电解中的应用。通过调控钙钛矿表面电荷分布，在还原气氛下驱动金属离子自发迁移至表面并形成均匀锚定的纳米颗粒，显著提升了电极的催化活性与抗积碳能力。该策略同时优化了CO₂吸附活化与电荷转移过程，使SOEC在CO₂电还原为CO的反应中展现出优异的转化率与长期稳定性，为高效碳利用电化学器件提供了新设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Surface Electrostatic Gradient of Perovskite Boosts Metal in Situ Exsolution and CO2 Electrolysis in Solid Oxide Electrolyzer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The in situ exsolution of nanoparticles (NPs) has brought new opportunities for the application of perovskite‐based catalysts in solid oxide electrolyzers. However, the kinetic driving force controlling cation migration and subsequent metal nucleation is not yet fully understood. Here we identified surface electrostatic gradient as the decisive kinetic factor in governing metal exsolution by treating La\n                    0.3\n                    Ca\n                    0.6\n                    Ti\n                    0.9\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    Ni\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    3−δ\n                    (LCTMN) with NaBH\n                    4\n                    of different concentrations. Multi‐scale characterizations revealed that different spatial distribution of surface oxygen vacancy induced positive surface potential shift and established electrostatic gradients that attracted Ni\n                    2+\n                    cations toward LCTMN surface, thereby driving Ni\n                    2+\n                    migration and reduction. Moreover, theoretical calculations demonstrated that surface oxygen vacancies reduced Ni segregation energy and work function of LCTMN, elucidating the critical role of electronic redistribution in accelerating in situ exsolution. Consequently, treatment of LCTMN with 3.0 M NaBH\n                    4\n                    yielded a high‐density dispersion of uniform Ni NPs with abundant strongly anchored interfacial sites for CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation. Notably, it delivered maximal current density of 1.25 A cm\n                    −2\n                    and CO Faraday efficiency of 94.23%, coupled with a superior 100‐hour stability, surpassing all counterparts. This study establishes a direct link between surface potential and exsolution kinetics, providing a universal paradigm for designing high‐performance perovskites with desirable reactivity.","aip":1},{"t":"胞囊菌酰胺生物合成中钴胺素依赖性自由基 S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶重复甲基化的结构基础","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527019123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Cystobactamids are nonribosomal peptide natural products that function as DNA gyrase inhibitors, exhibiting significant antibacterial activity. They are isolated from Cystobacter sp. Cbv34 and contain various alkoxy groups on para-aminobenzoic acid moieties, which are believed to play a crucial role in antibacterial functions. The alkoxy groups are generated by iterative methylations on a methoxy group by the cobalamin (Cbl)-dependent radical S-adenosylmethionine (SAM) enzyme CysS. CysS catalyzes up to three methylations to give ethoxy, isopropoxy, sec-butoxy, and tert-butoxy groups. For each methylation, CysS uses a ping-pong mechanism in which two molecules of SAM are consumed. One SAM is used to methylate cob(I)alamin, while another generates a 5'-deoxyadenosyl 5'-radical to initiate substrate methylation. However, little is known about how the enzyme promotes both Cbl methylation and iterative substrate methylation, which occur by polar SN2 and radical processes, respectively. Here, we report three X-ray crystal structures of a homolog of CysS from Corallococcus sp. CA054B. Two were determined in the presence of methoxy- and ethoxy-containing substrates, showing how CysS accommodates substrates and products during iterative methylation. The third structure, determined in the absence of a substrate, exhibits structural changes that reorient the SAM's conformation to allow for the methylation of cob(I)alamin.","tp":"抗菌物合成","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究揭示了胞囊菌酰胺生物合成中钴胺素依赖性自由基S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶CysS重复甲基化的结构基础。胞囊菌酰胺是非核糖体肽天然产物，作为DNA促旋酶抑制剂具有显著抗菌活性。CysS催化对氨基苯甲酸上甲氧基的迭代甲基化，生成对抗菌功能至关重要的各种烷氧基团，为新型抗生素开发提供了靶点信息。"},{"t":"重新审视邻碳硼烷基荧光团：硼取代基的电荷转移触发聚集诱导与结晶诱导发光","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521741?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳硼烷荧光材料","kp":["[发光机制]: 硼取代基电荷转移触发AIE/CIE"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究重新审视了邻碳硼烷（o-carborane）基荧光团的发光机制，发现硼取代基的电荷转移（CT）是触发聚集诱导发光（AIE）和结晶诱导发光（CIE）的关键驱动力。传统认知将碳硼烷发光归因于C-C键振动弛豫，而该工作通过硼位精确功能化调控CT态能级，使固态发射量子产率大幅提升并实现发射波长可调。这一机制修正为开发新型高效固态发光材料、OLED发射层和荧光探针的分子设计提供了全新的理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Reimagining o‐Carborane‐Based Fluorophores: Charge‐Transfer from Boron Substituents Triggers Aggregation‐ and Crystallization‐Induced Emission","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    o\n                    ‐Carborane‐based fluorophores are widely recognized for their aggregation‐induced and crystallization‐induced emission (AIE and CIE) properties, making them valuable building blocks for materials used in fluorescence applications such as bioimaging or optoelectronics. Until now, observing AIE/CIE required the fluorophore to be attached via the carbon atom of the carborane, inherently limiting further functionalization possibilities. Herein, we report for the first time that boron‐substituted carboranes (substituent is at position 9) exhibit AIE/CIE activity, which originates from photoexcitation‐induced electron‐transfer from the substituents linked to the carborane cage via its boron vertices. Furthermore, the solid state emission can be tailored by the proper selection of the substituents. This finding not only significantly broadens the scope of AIE‐active compounds but also offers new design strategies for the development of luminescent carborane‐based materials."},{"t":"快速玻璃基底数字光 3D 打印可实现解剖学上准确的中风患者特异性颈动脉芯片，用于个性化血栓形成调查（Adv. Mater. 5/2026）","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72027?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","tp":"3D打印芯片","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列光伏纳米组装体用于近红外视网膜光刺激","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7001?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米线光电刺激","kp":["[材料]: ZnO纳米线阵列+胶体纳米晶体敏化","[激发波段]: 近红外","[应用]: 视网膜光电刺激"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究构建了一种光伏纳米组件——由胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列，用于近红外视网膜光刺激。纳米线在近红外光照下产生局部光电流，无需基因操作即可对视网膜神经细胞进行精准电刺激，实现视觉信号的人工激活。该平台克服了天然视网膜感光细胞仅响应可见光的限制，为视网膜色素变性等致盲性眼病的神经假体光遗传学刺激提供了非侵入式纳米器件方案，在神经接口与视觉修复领域具有重要应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Photovoltaic nanoassembly of nanowire arrays sensitized with colloidal nanocrystals for near-infrared retina photostimulation","b":"Nanowires have served as a transformative platform for advanced neural and tissue interfaces. While their photovoltaic properties hold exceptional promise for neural modulation, existing photostimulation approaches predominantly rely on visible light-activated photoelectrochemical mechanisms. Here, we present a solution-processed photovoltaic nanoassembly comprising a ZnO nanowire array sensitized with AgBiS2 nanocrystals that enables efficient near-infrared (NIR) neural stimulation through capacitive photocurrents. By optimizing nanowire morphology and nanocrystal interdigitation, the platform achieves high charge injection densities (tens of microcoulombs per square centimeter) at low NIR intensities (<1 milliwatt per square millimeter). The nanoassembly was subretinally placed in an ex vivo blind rat retina, where it elicited repeatable and robust responses in retinal ganglion cells under NIR pulses. Notably, these responses were achieved at light intensities substantially below established ocular safety limits. The nexus of neuronal systems and nanoassemblies offers potential for enabling unconventional visual prosthetics and advanced neuromodulation therapies.","aip":1},{"t":"光子反蛋白石实现的双层结构无缝界面用于颜色调控与稳健被动辐射制冷","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522922?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子晶体辐射制冷","kp":["[双层光子反蛋白石结构]: 同步实现色彩调控与被动辐射制冷","[单层光子结构限制]: 太阳反射带宽窄且光谱可调性有限"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种基于光子反蛋白石结构的双层无缝界面材料，实现彩色调控与强韧被动辐射制冷的协同。上层光子晶体通过周期性孔结构产生结构色，满足建筑美学需求；下层多孔结构在大气窗口波段（8-13 μm）实现高效红外热发射，同时全波段太阳反射率极高。双层间的无缝界面避免了光学损耗与机械分层问题。在户外白天测试中，该材料在保持鲜艳色彩的同时实现了显著的亚环境温度降温效果，为零能耗建筑制冷提供了兼具美观与功能的新型方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Photonic Inverse Opal‐Enabled Seamless Interface of Bilayer Structure for Color Regulation and Robust Passive Radiative Cooling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Colorful passive daytime radiative cooling has emerged as an attractive zero‐energy‐cooling technology that integrates aesthetic appeal with thermal management. However, achieving concurrent high cooling efficiency and mechanical robustness remains challenging, constrained either by the narrow solar reflection bandwidth and limited spectral tunability of monolayer photonic structures, or by interfacial heterogeneities in multilayer architectures. Here, we demonstrate a size‐exclusion‐assisted selective infiltration strategy for fabricating structurally colored daytime radiative cooling (SCDRC) sheets. A polymer phase exhibiting negligible solar absorption and high infrared emissivity permeates preassembled colloidal crystal templates, forming an ordered inverse opal layer upon etching, whereas microscale boron nitride platelets selectively excluded from the template organize into a packed solar‐reflective microstructure. The resulting SCDRC sheets display tunable colors through pore geometry control, achieving &gt;96% solar reflectance, &gt;94% mid‐infrared emissivity, a sub‐ambient temperature reduction of 7°C in outdoor environments, and an average cooling power reduction of 20.7% across diverse climatic zones in China. The photonic framework demonstrates exceptional stability under prolonged thermal and humidity exposure, guaranteeing persistent coloration and cooling performance. This seamless‐interface bilayer fabrication strategy establishes a viable platform for developing durable colored cooling materials integrating aesthetic appeal with energy‐saving functionality, showing significant potential for advanced architectural and industrial applications."},{"t":"核MBL-1通过具有有毒三核苷酸重复的秀丽隐杆线虫肉碱棕榈酰转移酶调节线粒体形态","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2514994123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Expansion of nucleotide repeat sequences is linked to a growing number of neuromuscular degenerative disorders. Metabolic changes, including disruptions in mitochondrial function and dynamics, characterize these disorders and are believed to contribute to organismal toxicity. To investigate how toxic RNA repeats affect mitochondria, we used a Caenorhabditis elegans model that expresses expanded CUG repeat RNAs in muscle cells and recapitulates muscle dysfunction. We found that the RNA-binding protein Muscleblind-like 1 (MBL-1) is essential for normal mitochondrial function and regulates organelle morphology. In animals expressing expanded CUG repeats, where MBL-1 function is impaired, we identified two distinct mechanisms of mitochondrial disruption: altered mitochondrial morphology regulated by MBL-1, and oxidative phosphorylation (OxPhos) dysfunction occurring independently of MBL-1. Our data further show that changes in mitochondrial morphology are specifically linked to nuclear MBL-1 dysfunction, which affects cpt-3 expression, a gene encoding carnitine palmitoyltransferase-an enzyme required for fatty acid transport into mitochondria. This mechanism is conserved, with similar disruptions observed in patients with Myotonic Dystrophy type 1. Importantly, our findings indicate that increased organelle fragmentation is not central to cellular pathogenesis. Instead, OxPhos dysfunction appears to be a primary contributor to organismal toxicity."},{"t":"铁电介导的具有多重内建电场的双S型异质结增强光电化学海水裂解","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519455?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电光解水制氢","kp":["[异质结]: 双S型TiO₂/SrTiO₃/C₃N₄","应用[PEC]: 海水裂解制氢","[机制]: 多重内建电场促电荷分离"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种铁电介导的双S型异质结构，通过构建多重内建电场增强光电化学海水裂解性能。铁电材料的自发极化效应协同双S型电荷转移机制，有效促进光生载流子分离与定向迁移，抑制复合损失。该体系直接利用海水资源进行太阳能制氢，无需淡水依赖，在可再生能源驱动的氢能生产领域具有重要前景。多重内建电场的协同作用为解决PEC海水裂解中氯离子腐蚀与析氢竞争反应提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Novel Ferroelectric Mediated Dual S‐scheme Heterojunction with Multiple Built‐in Electric Fields for Enhanced Photoelectrochemical Seawater Splitting","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Photoelectrochemical (PEC) seawater splitting is promising for direct utilization of solar energy and ocean resources for H\n                    2\n                    production, but encounters challenges like difficult separation and recombination between holes and electrons. Herein, a dual S‐scheme TiO\n                    2\n                    /SrTiO\n                    3\n                    /C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    (TiO\n                    2\n                    /STO/CN) heterojunction is in situ synthesized to construct a self‐supporting three‐phase system for PEC seawater splitting. The dual S‐scheme heterojunction photoanode has high electron‐hole pair separation quality and low recombination efficiency, and exhibits excellent catalytic performance. It achieves a photocurrent density of 6.32 mA·cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.23 V and a high applied bias photon‐to‐current efficiency (ABPE) of 1.90%, which are much higher than that of the pristine TiO\n                    2\n                    photoelectrode and other reports. The remarkable PEC activity of TiO\n                    2\n                    /STO/CN is attributed to the effective charge separation driven by the multiple built‐in electric fields within the ferroelectric mediated dual S‐scheme heterojunction. The photogenerated carrier transfer pathways are discussed with multifarious methods such as band structure analysis, KPFM, EPR, and DFT calculations. It provides a perspective for constructing high‐performance photocatalysts."},{"t":"金属单原子超越催化的应用：作为可编程电子结构量子调制器用于自适应电子学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521186?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电子调制","kp":["[新应用]: 金属单原子作量子调制器","[策略]: 原子级能带工程调制","[代表]: d系Fe/Co/Ni单原子"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"本文提出金属单原子超越传统催化领域的新角色——作为量子调制器实现可编程电子结构与自适应电子学。金属单原子通过与载体间的强局域相互作用，在原子尺度精确调控能带结构、载流子浓度和输运特性，使电子器件具备环境响应的自适应能力。这一概念将单原子技术从催化剂拓展至电子功能材料领域，为智能传感器、可重构逻辑器件和神经形态计算等前沿应用开辟新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Metal Single Atoms Beyond Catalysis as Quantum Modulators for Programmable Electronic Structures and Adaptive Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal single atoms have long been recognized for their catalytic activity through strong local interactions with host substrates. Beyond catalysis, their potential to reconfigure substrate electronic structures surpassing the host's intrinsic limits remains largely unexplored. Here, we develop an atomically engineered band‐modulation strategy, in which representative\n                    d\n                    ‐series (Fe, Co, Ni, Cu) and\n                    p\n                    ‐series (In, Sn, Sb, Te) atoms are anchored on 2D frameworks, including MXenes, graphene, g‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    , and MoS\n                    2\n                    . These atoms act as quantum modulators, precisely reconfiguring substrate structures and inducing anomalous quantum effects, which yield distinctive phenomena, including band inversion, flattening, and van Hove singularities, features rarely attainable through conventional band‐engineering strategies. The tailored electronic landscape enables linear, voltage‐driven tuning of electrical behavior, achieving several tens of times enhancement in dielectric permittivity and a dynamic and continuous transition from semiconducting to conductive states, all realized under an exceptionally low bias (&lt;1.0 V). These functionalities are extended to a flexible electromagnetic switch that achieves programmable control of signal transmission, absorption, and reflection, overcoming the persistent difficulty of dynamic electromagnetic regulation while operating at a record‐thin microscale thickness (∼600 µm). This work establishes an atomically engineered band‐modulation strategy as a versatile platform, paving the way for reconfigurable electronics and quantum devices."},{"t":"通过原子精度杂金属配位杂化调控单纳米簇催化中的活性位点","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522490?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米团簇催化剂","kp":["[催化策略]: 杂金属配位杂化操控活性位点","[精度]: 原子精度构建可及活性位"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过异金属配位杂化策略，在原子精度层面调控单纳米团簇催化剂的活性位点结构。通过引入第二金属原子与主金属中心配位，精确改变活性位点的电子密度与几何构型，从而优化催化反应中间体的吸附-脱附行为。该方法克服了传统催化剂表面活性位点难以精确控制的瓶颈，实现了催化性能的可预测、可设计调控，为单团簇催化剂的理性设计提供了原子级方法论。","dp":1,"ot":"Manipulating the Active Sites in Single‐Nanocluster Catalysis by Heterometallic Coordination Hybridization at Atomic Precision","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Constructing accessible active sites on the surface of catalysts at the atomic precision remains challenging in heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalysis. Leveraging the differences in coordination preferences between various metals and ligands, a heterometallic coordination hybridization (HCH) protocol was proposed to manipulate the stable and accessible active sites on the surface of single‐nanocluster catalysts. A homoleptic superatomic nanocluster [(AuCu)\n                    71\n                    (m‐MBT)\n                    46\n                    ](CF\n                    3\n                    SO\n                    3\n                    )\n                    3\n                    (short as\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    and m‐MBT = 3‐methylbenzenethiol) was synthesized in high yield, and its structure was determined by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction. Benefiting from the HCH strategy,\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    features four open, accessible, and stable dual‐Au sites on its surface. Notably, heterogeneous single‐nanocluster catalyst \n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    /XC‐72 (XC‐72 is carbon support) exhibited excellent catalytic performance for denitrative C–O coupling under mild conditions (60 °C, atmosphere). The turnover numbers and turnover frequencies reached record high values of 2.88 × 10\n                    6\n                    and 3.48 × 10\n                    5\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    , respectively, which are four orders of magnitude higher than those observed for the well‐established Pd/C system. The remarkable catalytic performance of\n                    \n                      (AuCu)\n                      71\n                    \n                    was attributed to the exposed dual‐Au sites, which facilitated the adsorption of deprotonated phenol and its derivatives via Au‐O interactions, guided the proximity of nitroarenes rather than being commonly absorbed simultaneously on active sites, and exhibited exceptional durability of the catalyst. The HCH protocol provides new idea for the rational design and construction of heterogeneous metal catalysts with well‐defined accessible active sites."},{"t":"生命历程全基因组关联研究荟萃分析细化了肥胖对乳腺癌风险影响的关键生命阶段","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0374?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Previous evidence suggests that higher prepubertal adiposity protects against breast cancer risk. Whether this protection extends into early adulthood remains uncertain. We conducted genome-wide association studies on body mass index (BMI) in nulliparous women from menarche to <40 years across five cohorts, with additional analyses in three subintervals of this life stage. Results were meta-analyzed, and two-sample univariable and multivariable Mendelian randomization was applied within a lifecourse framework to assess the effect of BMI on breast cancer risk. Between menarche and <40 years, we observed heterogeneity in genetic effects. Genome-wide correlations further suggest that BMI during this early adult period may be partly influenced by distinct genetic factors compared with adiposity at other life stages. Higher genetically proxied BMI between menarche and 40 years reduced breast cancer risk. This protective effect attenuated after adjusting for prepubertal adiposity. These findings refine our understanding of adiposity's role in breast cancer and highlight earlier life stages as critical windows for risk modulation."},{"t":"利用数字化先进制造实现超高质量功率密度聚合物电解质燃料电池","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504454?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池轻量化","kp":["质量占比[燃料电池堆]: 双极板占80%质量60%体积","[制造]: 数字先进制造轻量化多孔分配器","应用[PEMFC]: 航空航天"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用数字化先进制造技术实现聚合物电解质燃料电池（PEMFC）的超高比功率密度，以解决航空航天应用中燃料电池重量和体积受限的核心瓶颈。通过数字化制造工艺精确调控电极微观结构、优化催化剂层分布和改善传质通道，显著降低铂催化剂用量并提升电池性能。该工作推动了氢燃料电池在航空航天领域的轻量化集成，对零碳排放航空具有工程应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Leveraging Digital Advanced Manufacturing to Enable Polymer Electrolyte Fuel Cells With Ultrahigh Gravimetric Power Density","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of hydrogen fuel cells into aerospace applications is limited by the weight and volume of fuel cell systems. Currently, bipolar plates account for 80 % of fuel cell stack mass and 60 % of its volume. Herein, we leverage a range of advanced manufacturing techniques to develop novel lightweight‐compact porous distributors with ultrahigh power densities. Research begins with a graphene‐coated nickel foam porous distributor, which enhances reactants transport and interfacial conductivity, achieving a power density of 1.52 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , ∼50 % improvement over conventional designs. To further boost gravimetric power density, titanium was adopted as a base material, and porous architectures were optimized using Computational Fluid Dynamics to ensure optimal reactant distribution and water management. To realize these porous titanium designs, two advanced manufacturing techniques were leveraged: laser powder bed fusion (LPBF) and laser micromachining. While the optimized LPBF lattice structure reached 1.36 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , the laser‐patterned non‐homogeneous architecture demonstrated a breakthrough performance of 1.62 W/cm\n                    2\n                    , translating to volumetric and gravimetric power densities of over 10 kW/L and 9 kW/kg, respectively. These values surpass current commercial benchmarks and exceed EU/UK 2030 targets. We demonstrate how integrating digital design, flow control, advanced materials, and manufacturing enables lightweight, high‐power fuel cells, with broader impact on electrolyzers, heat exchangers, and batteries."},{"t":"利用代谢糖工程研究成年斑马鱼前庭器官顶盖的动力学","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function is a common clinical disorder. The primary cause of this disorder is not known. Previous experiments in pigeons showed that an induced mechanical leakage in the cupula of a semicircular canal causes symptoms equivalent to those observed in humans after sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function. The cupula is an acellular membrane, which is critical for the detection of angular acceleration of the head. It consists of the matrix glycoprotein cupulin, which is secreted by supporting cells in the crista ampullaris. Currently, it is unclear whether cupulin is continuously produced resulting in permanent cupular neogenesis. Such a process could explain recovery of function observed in many patients. We applied metabolic glycoengineering to demonstrate the existence of cupulin renewal. Intraperitoneal injection of\n                    N\n                    ‐azidoacetylgalactosamine (GalNAz) into zebrafish leads to incorporation of this sugar in the cupula. Preparation of the cupula after various time intervals followed by fluorescence labeling by click chemistry, resulted in a distinct band within the cupula visible in fluorescence microscopy. Time‐delayed double injection gave rise to two bands. A long‐term experiment allowed to estimate that complete renewal of the zebrafish cupula occurs over a cycle of eight to ten weeks."},{"t":"内摩擦网络压电水凝胶微球实现生理电适应调节退行性组织中的线粒体自噬","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519152?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mitochondrial autophagy imbalance critically drives apoptosis and tissue degeneration, requiring physiological electrical adaptation to meet cellular thresholds. However, degenerative tissues exhibit deficient endogenous electrical signals, disrupting cellular energy transfer. Using supramolecular engineering and microfluidic strategies, we constructed an internal‐friction network hydrogel microsphere system through synergistic assembly of piezoelectric bismuth ferrite nanoparticles (BF) and sliding‐ring‐functionalized methacrylated hyaluronic acid (HAMA), achieving physiological electrical adaptation in degenerative tissues. BF convert mechanical stimuli into electrical signals, while the stress‐dependent internal‐friction network regulates energy dissipation. Under low stress, sliding‐ring movement produces low friction with mechanoelectrical conversion loss of 61.5 kJ/m\n                    3\n                    , enhancing electrical generation. Under high stress, main chain straightening increases friction to 78.3 kJ/m\n                    3\n                    , suppressing excessive signals and restoring physiological electrical adaptation. The microspheres generate stable electric fields (95–110 mV/mm) under dynamic loading, promoting mitochondrial autophagy via PINK1/Parkin pathway activation, maintaining stable mitochondrial membrane potential (compared with OS group, the JC‐1 ratio increases by 49.2%), and reducing nucleus pulposus apoptosis by 75%. In vivo experiments demonstrated that microsphere implantation restored the physiological electrical environment, enhanced mitochondrial autophagy, inhibited apoptosis, and delayed intervertebral disc degeneration progression, providing new insights for treating degenerative tissues through electrical adaptation restoration.","tp":"压电水凝胶微球","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过超分子工程和微流控策略构建了内摩擦网络压电水凝胶微球系统。该系统利用压电材料将机械刺激转化为生理电信号，可调节退行性组织中失衡的线粒体自噬，恢复细胞能量传递阈值，为退行性疾病的组织修复提供了新型电生理干预策略。"},{"t":"集成一步干法工艺实现预锂化厚电极无需底涂层以获得高能量密度和初始库仑效率","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05739F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"干法电极预嵌锂","kp":["[一步干法工艺]: 集成预锂化厚电极无需底涂层","[目标提升]: 高能量密度与高首效库仑效率"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出一种集成式一步干法工艺，制备预锂化厚电极，无需底涂层即可同时实现高能量密度和高初始库仑效率。干法厚电极虽能提升电池能量密度，但面临活性物质与集流体粘附力不足和首圈不可逆容量损失大等问题。预锂化补偿了首圈充放电中的锂损耗，而干法工艺避免了溶剂干燥步骤，简化制造流程。该一体化策略对高能量密度锂离子电池的工程化量产具有实用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Integrated one-step dry process enabling prelithiated thick electrodes without primer coating for high energy density and initial Coulombic efficiency","b":"Dry-processed thick electrodes are a key strategy for increasing the energy density of batteries. However, thick dry electrodes, especially anodes, suffer from limited ion mobility, causing non-uniform solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation and high irreversible capacity loss during the initial cycle. Moreover, the adhesive primer layer required during processing increases electrical resistance and necessitates additional wet-processing steps, thereby undermining both performance and process integrity. To address these issues, we propose an underlayer lithium-metal-configured prelithiation strategy for thick electrodes. Here, a lithium metal underlayer simultaneously functions as a primer, compensates for irreversible lithium loss during the initial cycle, and promotes uniform SEI formation through a chemical reaction. Consequently, this strategy enhances the initial Coulombic efficiency and cycle stability of high-energy-density silicon-graphite/NCM811 full-cells. By overcoming the limitations of conventional dry process, it enables a fully dry manufacturing process and advances the development of next-generation high-energy-density batteries."},{"t":"利用界面相互作用介导的超薄金属有机框架多层体制备高性能无枝晶锂织物负极","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72028?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂纺织负极","kp":["[电极策略]: 超薄MOF多层界面介导","[特性]: 无枝晶锂纺织阳极"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"High‐Performance Dendrite‐Free Lithium Textile Anodes Using Interfacial Interaction‐Mediated Ultrathin Metal Organic Framework Multilayers (Adv. Mater. 5/2026)"},{"t":"利用手性锰(II)卤化物的可逆零维-一维相变实现智能圆偏振发光开关与多级加密","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525831?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性发光材料","kp":["[维度工程]: 0D-1D可逆结构转变","[功能]: 刺激响应CPL开关","[材料体系]: 手性Mn(II)卤化物","[应用]: 多级加密"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用手性锰(II)卤化物中可逆的零维-一维结构转变，实现智能圆偏振发光（CPL）开关和多级加密应用。通过外部刺激驱动Mn(II)卤化物在0D和1D构型间的可逆转换，精确调控发光强度和圆偏振不对称因子。该动态CPL开关特性使材料可作为信息编码与加密介质，多级加密功能提升了防伪安全性。这一0D-1D可逆转变策略为手性发光材料的智能响应设计提供了新维度。","dp":1,"ot":"Harnessing Reversible 0D–1D Transformation in Chiral Mn(II) Halides for Smart Circularly Polarized Luminescence Switching and Multi‐Level Encryption","b":"Abstract\n                  Circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) active materials with dynamically tunable properties are highly desirable for next‐generation photonics and encryption technologies, yet achieving this through predictable solid‐state structural transformations remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we demonstrate a novel dimensionality‐engineering strategy to realize stimuli‐responsive CPL in chiral hybrid Mn(II) halides. Employing a single chiral cation, R/S‐3‐methylmorpholine, we selectively synthesized two distinct phases: a red‐emissive 1D chain structure with octahedral Mn(II) centers and a green‐emissive 0D structure with tetrahedral coordination. Remarkably, the 0D phase undergoes a rapid and reversible ethanol‐assisted thermal transformation into the 1D phase, accompanied by a striking CPL color switch from green to red. This unique behavior stems from a stimulus‐induced recoordination of Mn–Cl units and reorganization of the hydrogen‐bonding network. Capitalizing on this reversible response and intrinsic chirality, we engineered a sophisticated multilevel photonic encryption platform, encompassing binary dot‐matrix coding, dual‐channel (photoluminescence/CPL) Morse code, and CPL‐based ASCII decryption. This work establishes structural dimensionality control as a powerful paradigm for creating intelligent, CPL‐active materials, opening new avenues for high‐security optical information technologies."},{"t":"肉芽肿双 RNA-seq 揭示了结核性肉芽肿内由中性粒细胞和坏死驱动的复合转录程序","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw4619?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mycobacterial granulomas lie at the center of tuberculosis (TB) pathogenesis and represent a unique niche where infecting bacteria survive under nutrient-restricted conditions and in the face of a host immune response. The granuloma's necrotic core, where bacteria reside extracellularly in humans, is difficult to assess in many experimentally tractable models. Here, using necrotic mycobacterial granulomas in adult zebrafish, we develop dual RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) across different host genotypes to identify the transcriptional alterations that enable bacteria to survive within this key microenvironment. Using pharmacological and genetic interventions, we find that neutrophils within mature, necrotic granulomas promote bacterial growth, in part through up-regulation of the bacterial devR regulon. We identify conserved suites of bacterial transcriptional programs induced only in the context of this unique necrotic extracellular niche, including bacterial modules related to K+ transport and rpf genes. Analysis of Mycobacterium tuberculosis strains across diverse lineages and human populations suggests that granuloma-specific transcriptional modules are targets for bacterial genetic adaptation in the context of human infection."},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气行业","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源转型地缘","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"遗传与教育的关联性有所增加，并受到社会经济背景的影响：来自 1946 年至 1970 年 3 项研究的证据","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Social scientists have long sought to investigate whether the predictors of educational attainment (EA) have changed across time. Here, we provide insights by incorporating genetic predictors of education in three nationally representative British birth cohorts born in 1946, 1958, and 1970. We investigated whether individual characteristics as proxied by polygenic indexes (PGIs) for EA and cognition have become more relevant to educational success over time and whether returns to genetic predisposition were moderated by early life socioeconomic background. We present three findings. First, associations between the EA PGI and attainment increased over time, with increasing incremental variance explained by the EA PGI. Second, associations between the cognition PGI and attainment were broadly consistent across cohorts, and there was no clear change in explained variance. Since the EA PGI captures multiple traits related to educational success, factors other than those related to cognition may have become more relevant over time. Third, we observed strong evidence of interaction: Associations between the EA PGI and EA were disproportionately larger among those from more advantaged socioeconomic backgrounds. The strength and pattern of associations varied when using EA PGIs that were less conservatively filtered for SNPs. Our findings suggest EA is influenced by social and genetic factors both independently and jointly. Genetic liability and social background could be considered as two forms of inherited advantage which synergistically influence education attainment."},{"t":"通过缩聚-解聚-再聚合策略实现兼具热稳定性和化学可回收性的地板温度调控型聚醚-酯","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522383?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可回收聚醚酯","kp":["[关键参数]: 上限温度(Tc)调控","[聚合策略]: 缩聚-解聚-再聚合循环","[材料特性]: 热稳定性与化学可回收性兼顾"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过缩聚-解聚-再聚合策略，制备具有_floor温度调节特性的聚醚-酯交替共聚物（PEAE），同时实现热稳定性和化学可回收性。交替醚和酯基团赋予材料可调控的_floor温度（即结晶-非晶转变温度点），使其兼具良好的力学性能和可降解性。解聚-再聚合循环使聚合物能在温和条件下回收为单体并重新聚合，实现闭环回收。该策略为解决传统聚酯材料难以化学回收的难题提供了分子设计新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Floor Temperature‐regulated Poly(ether‐alt‐ester) With Thermal Stability and Chemical Recyclability Enabled by Polycondensation—Depolymerization−Repolymerization Strategy","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Creating innovative poly(ether‐\n                    alt\n                    ‐ester)s (PEAEs) with alternating ether and ester groups to address the trade‐offs between the polymer′s depolymerizability and thermostability is essentially important for advanced material applications and sustainable development. Current research efforts focus on modulating the ceiling temperature (\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ) of monomers with small‐sized rings, to increase the thermostability of PEAEs at high temperature. Notably, floor temperature (\n                    T\n                    f\n                    )−regulated PEAEs, obtained from entropy‐driven ring‐opening polymerization (ROP) of macrocyclic ether‐ester monomers, inherently exhibit enhanced thermodynamic stability as the temperature increases. However, high‐performance PEAEs regulated by\n                    T\n                    f\n                    remains long‐term underdeveloped owing to extremely low efficiency and selectivity in macrocyclic monomer synthesis. Herein, we developed a “polycondensation–depolymerization” strategy for macrocyclic ether‐ester monomer and presented the first example of\n                    T\n                    f\n                    ‐regulated PEAE with thermostability, melt processibility as well as chemical recyclability. The resulting PEAE is semi‐crystalline and ductile, and exhibits remarkable high decomposition temperature (with a\n                    T\n                    d,5%\n                    up to 378.3 °C) compared to the\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ‐regulated poly(1,4‐dioxan‐2‐one) (PPDO,\n                    T\n                    d,5%\n                    = 238.4 °C). This work corroborated the effectiveness of the\n                    T\n                    f\n                    ‐regulated PEAE in resolving the challenges associated with the\n                    T\n                    c\n                    ‐regulated analogs and provided a molecular‐level design principle for poly(ether‐\n                    alt\n                    ‐ester) with high‐performance."},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微观结构驱动多尺度特征融合锂离子电池健康评估框架","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观健康评估","kp":["[电池健康估计]: 电极微结构多尺度特征融合框架"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health estimate of lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"面向高性能X射线探测的无铅卤化物铁电固溶体环保制备","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525694?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅卤化物探测器","kp":["[无铅卤素铁电固溶体]: (HDA)Sb1-xBixI体系","[X射线探测]: 高性能无铅铁电固溶体X射线探测","[瓶颈]: 宽带隙与有限μτ产物限制光电性能"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究以环保方法制备高质量无铅卤化物铁电固溶体，用于高性能X射线探测。Bi/Sb基卤化物铁电材料因其优异的环境稳定性和铁电自发极化效应，成为替代含铅钙钛矿的有力候选。通过固溶体工程优化带隙和载流子传输性能，材料展现出高X射线吸收系数和低检测限。环保制备工艺避免了有毒溶剂使用，使该无铅铁电材料在医学影像和安全检测领域具备实际应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Eco‐Friendly Preparation of High‐Quality Lead‐Free Halide Ferroelectric Solid‐Solution Toward High‐Performance X‐ray Detection","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics have become promising lead‐free alternatives due to their excellent stability and environmental friendliness. However, their wide bandgaps and limited charge‐carrier mobility‐lifetime (\n                    µτ\n                    ) product impede their optoelectronic performance. Here, we report a new eco‐friendly method for growing lead‐free halide ferroelectric solid‐solution (HDA)Sb\n                    1‐x\n                    Bi\n                    x\n                    I\n                    5\n                    (x = 0–1) (HDA = hexane‐1,6‐diammonium), by isothermal evaporation from a biomass‐derived solvent,\n                    γ\n                    ‐valerolactone (GVL). The solid‐solution strategy, good material stability,‐ and high‐quality centimeter‐sized single‐crystals not only endow the (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    with the narrowest bandgap of 1.64 eV among Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics, but also enhance its\n                    µτ\n                    product by approximately two orders of magnitude compared with the parent (HDA)SbI\n                    5\n                    . Benefiting from these attributes and the intrinsic ferroelectric spontaneous polarization, the X‐ray detector based on (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    exhibits excellent self‐powered detection performance with a high sensitivity of 1,040 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    and a low detection limit of 0.25 nGy\n                    air\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    . More excitingly, its detection sensitivity can reach 17,560 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is the highest among reported halide ferroelectrics, and superior to that of most halide detectors. This work opens new avenues for the rational engineering of Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics for advanced optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"精准扶贫是否促进了清洁烹饪燃料的采用？来自中国的一项准实验研究的证据","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000182?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"综合能源系统集群分布式协同优化：基于一致性算法与逻辑函数的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源调度","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on consensus algorithm and logistic function"},{"t":"衍射_enabled原位纳米尺度追踪固态电解质锂离子动力学及复合正极中的非均匀扩散","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520281?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质锂动力学","kp":["[操作衍射追踪]: 同步辐射X射线衍射原位追踪全固态电池离子动力学","[发现]: 复合正极中固态电解质非均匀扩散"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究利用衍射 enabled的operando纳米尺度追踪技术，揭示固态电解质中锂离子动力学及复合正极中的非均匀扩散行为。传统研究主要关注液态电池正极活性材料中的锂离子扩散，而固态电池中锂离子在固态电解质和复合正极界面处的传输机制尚不清晰。通过operando衍射技术实时观测充放电过程中锂离子浓度的空间分布演化，研究发现复合正极内部存在显著的扩散不均匀性，为固态电池界面工程优化提供了实验依据。","dp":1,"ot":"Diffraction‐Enabled Operando Nanoscale Tracking of Li‐ion Dynamics of Solid Electrolyte and Inhomogeneous Diffusion in Composite Cathode","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion has mostly been studied in cathode active materials (CAMs) in liquid batteries, whereas it remains rarely explored in solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) and all‐solid‐state batteries. Herein, diffraction was established as an effective method for all‐solid‐state lithium batteries (ASSLBs) by focusing on SSE in composite cathodes. Operando synchrotron x‐ray diffraction presented diffraction angle shifts of certain Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    Bragg planes during the first ASSLB cycle due to lithiation/delithiation into its lattice, whose preferred Li\n                    +\n                    migration pathways were suggested by the partiality of these shifts, and the three‐phase evolution indicated the fundamental Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion kinetics factors. X‐ray nanodiffraction (XND) mapped nanoscale inhomogeneous Li\n                    +\n                    distributions and diffusion within individual Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    particles, revealing facilitated Li\n                    +\n                    conduction in high‐crystallinity regions and their role as pathways across SSE/CAM interfaces, and the most negatively strained regions were shown to be less susceptible to Li\n                    +\n                    insertion. XND from various electrochemical techniques inferred high transient charging rates to be the culprit of irreversible Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion instead of the overall charging depth. This study proved diffraction to be a potent tool to probe intricate Li\n                    +\n                    dynamics in ASSLBs and provide microscopic insights for optimal battery designs.","aip":1},{"t":"铜催化非活化芳烃脱芳构化碳硅化反应的区域与非对映选择性：通过捕获二烯基自由基实现","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523719?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化碳硅化","kp":["[催化剂]: 铜","[反应类型]: 去芳构化碳硅化","[关键中间体]: 二烯基自由基","[选择性]: 高区域和非对映选择性"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用铜催化捕获二烯基自由基的策略，实现非活化芳烃的区域和对映选择性去芳构化碳硅化反应。自由基介导的芳烃去芳构化生成环己二烯基自由基中间体，铜催化剂通过区域选择性控制捕获该中间体，同时引入碳基团和硅基团，构建含连续手性中心的复杂分子。该反应突破了传统芳烃官能化中区域选择性难以控制的瓶颈，为药物分子和天然产物中硅取代环己二烯骨架的高效构建提供了新方法。","dp":1,"ot":"Copper‐Catalyzed Regio‐ and Diastereoselective Dearomative Carbosilylation of Unactivated Arenes by Intercepting the Dienyl Radical","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The radical‐mediated dearomatization of aromatic systems to generate cyclohexadienyl radical intermediates represents a crucial strategy for constructing three‐dimensional molecular architectures. Conventional approaches typically through\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition and subsequent proton/oxygen/carbon dioxide trapping to suppress rapid re‐aromatization, significantly constraining product diversity. Furthermore, dearomative bifunctionalization reactions—which offer enhanced step‐ and atom‐economy—remain substantially underdeveloped. Herein, we disclose a copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative 1,4‐ and 1,2‐carbosilylation strategy applicable to diverse unactivated (hetero)aromatic substrates to selectively construct spiro‐ or fused‐cyclic products. The resulting vinyl and allylic silanes serve as versatile synthetic handles for downstream transformations, enabling the rapid construction of sp\n                    3\n                    ‐rich polycyclic scaffolds that are highly valuable in drug discovery. Mechanistic and DFT studies indicate that the reaction commences with copper(I)‐silicon‐mediated halogen atom transfer of readily available aryl iodides to generate aryl radicals. These reactive species exhibit dual pathways: direct\n                    ipso\n                    ‐addition to aromatic rings or 1,5‐hydrogen atom transfer followed by alkyl radical‐mediated\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition. Subsequent trapping of the resulting dienyl radicals by copper(II)‐silicon species yields complex polycyclic systems containing cyclohexadienylsilicon frameworks with excellent chemo‐, regio‐ and diastereoselectivity. This methodology not only establishes a novel paradigm for copper‐catalyzed radical dearomative bifunctionalization but also provides an efficient radical\n                    ipso‐\n                    and\n                    ortho\n                    ‐addition platform for synthesizing architecturally intricate polycyclic compounds.","aip":1},{"t":"碳点负载纤维素纳米晶体手性超分子的电荷导向自组装及可调控圆偏振发光","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522132?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点手性超结构","kp":["[组装策略]: 电荷导向自组装","[材料]: 碳点负载纤维素纳米晶","[结构]: 手性超结构","[功能]: 可调圆偏振发光(CPL)"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用表面电荷调控胶体液晶的自组装行为与功能性能。通过电荷导向策略，将碳点负载于纤维素纳米晶体上，构建具有可调圆偏振发光（CPL）特性的手性超结构。该工作实现了纳米尺度精确组装，为手性光学材料、信息加密和传感等领域的应用提供了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Charge‐Directed Self‐Assembly of Carbon Dot‐Loaded Cellulose Nanocrystal Chiral Superstructures With Tailorable Circularly Polarized Luminescence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Surface charge critically influences the self‐assembly and functional performance of colloidal liquid crystals. However, in circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) systems, the regulatory role of guest surface charge in their self‐assembly remains fundamentally unclear, hindering the rational design of adjustable high‐performance CPL materials. Herein, we judiciously synthesize a series of positively and negatively charged carbon dots (P‐/N‐CDs) with satisfactory solid‐state emission and incorporate them into colloidal cellulose nanocrystal (CNC) liquid crystal with phase adjustability via evaporation‐induced self‐assembly (EISA). By precisely modulating the surface charge of CDs, the resulting P‐/N‐CD‐loaded CNC (P‐/N‐CDCNC) chiral superstructures exhibit tailorable CPL with luminescence dissymmetry factor values from +0.16 to −0.91. The decisive role of surface charge in the EISA process is further elucidated. In situ microscopy demonstrates divergent charge‐directed assembly pathways: N‐CDs allow CNC tactoid fusion to proceed, whereas P‐CDs arrest fusion through electrostatic crosslinking. This triggers unprecedented Janus P‐CDCNC superstructures, leading to side‐dependent CPL handedness. Such CDCNC superstructures with different polarization states are readily designed to patterns and sophisticated codes, which offer powerful avenues for high‐security anticounterfeiting and multilevel information encryption. This work pioneers guest charge modulation as a universal strategy for controlling chiroptical assembly, overcoming limitations to attain handedness‐adjustable, high‐performance CPL from natural chiral materials."},{"t":"伪装纳米机器人瞄准并调节巨噬细胞亚细胞器串扰模式以促进神经再生","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68636-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Macrophage (Mφ) phenotypic transformation is crucial in determining spinal cord injury (SCI) outcomes. However, the suborganelle crosstalk mechanisms—particularly between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and mitochondria—that mediate Mφ subgroup conversion during SCI remain underexplored. We aim to integrate niche intervention strategies and omics sequencing to investigate the effects of the metabolic crosstalk between ER stress (ERS) and mitochondria. Subsequently, we develop a dual-targeted camouflaged nanorobot (BP@D/N) that can reach the SCI site via systemic circulation and selectively interact with Mφ. We observe that Ero1α-mediated Ca2+ shuttling is an important mechanism for locking the inflammatory phenotype of Mφ. Blocking the Ero1α/MAMs/mtCa2+ axis suppresses mtDNA release and downregulates the cGAS-STING-NFκB signaling cascade, thus promoting M2 polarization and neural repair. Our study clarifies the regulatory mechanism of Mφ transformation-associated suborganelle crosstalk and offers a paradigm for reconstructing the dynamic balance of immune–neural interactions in the SCI microenvironment for effective repair. It offers a scientifically grounded and translational approach to overcoming the clinical challenge of irreversible SCI.","tp":"纳米机器人调控","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了双靶向伪装纳米机器人，可同时调控巨噬细胞内质网与线粒体之间的代谢串扰。通过多组学测序揭示了内质网应激与线粒体互作在脊髓损伤中调控巨噬细胞表型转化的机制，该纳米策略有效促进了神经再生，为脊髓损伤治疗提供了新思路。"},{"t":"基于数据驱动场景生成表征不确定性的电-热-计算耦合系统数据中心双层规划","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心电热协同","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation for representing uncertainties"},{"t":"基于Stackelberg博弈的综合能源系统与加氢站双层分布鲁棒协同优化","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925019956?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能系统优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 分布鲁棒双层Stackelberg博弈"],"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bi-level distributionally robust coordinated optimization of integrateed energy system and hydrogen refueling station based on stackelberg game"},{"t":"原子级Eu介导乙腈吸附构型切换驱动AEM电解槽中安培级长效乙胺电合成","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521105?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙腈电合成乙胺","kp":["[机制]: Eu介导乙腈吸附构型翻转调控质子可用性","[器件]: AEM电解槽","[电流密度]: 安培级","[产物]: 乙胺"],"sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究在AEM电解槽中实现了乙腈电催化加氢合成乙胺的安培级长期稳定运行。通过原子级铕（Eu）介导乙腈吸附构型切换，优化了电催化反应路径，有效提升选择性和活性。电催化加氢为乙胺合成提供了可持续的绿色路径，该策略突破了传统催化剂在工业级电流密度下稳定性不足的瓶颈。","dp":1,"ot":"Atomic Eu‐Mediated Acetonitrile Adsorption Configuration Switch Drives Long‐Term and Ampere‐Level Electrosynthesis of Ethylamine in AEM Electrolyzer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic hydrogenation of acetonitrile (AN‐ECH) offers a sustainable pathway for ethylamine (EA) synthesis. However, achieving high selectivity in AN‐ECH necessitates carefully balancing proton availability to suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which often conflicts with the proton supply requirements under industrial‐grade current densities. Herein, we design and develop a novel and effective AN‐ECH catalyst consisting of rare‐earth Eu atoms modified on Cu\n                    2\n                    O nanoneedles to drive efficient and durable AN‐ECH at ampere‐level currents. The optimized Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a high EA Faradaic efficiency of 98.1 % and an exceptional production rate of 2253.2 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    compared with pure Cu\n                    2\n                    O. Notably, the Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O can continuously operate 420 h at 2 A in an anion‐exchange membrane electrolyzer for AN‐ECH, representing the longest reported stability under the industrial‐current conditions to date. Operando characterization and theoretical calculations elucidate that the Eu incorporation tailors the electronic structure of Cu sites, thus switching the adsorption configuration of AN from the flat‐lying multi‐site π‐adsorption to vertical N‐end adsorption. This reconfiguration of the adsorption site lowers the energy barrier for the imine hydrogenation step, dictating the ideal proton addition pathway while enhancing the proton addition kinetics to suppress the HER. This work provides fundamental insights into rare‐earth tuning of AN hydrogenation mechanisms and represents a critical advancement toward ampere‐scale electrosynthesis of EA."},{"t":"CIGS与CdTe薄膜光伏作为电动汽车充电站潜在能量捕获系统的评估：印度对比案例研究","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000528?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"薄膜光伏充电","kp":["光伏类型[EV充电]: CIGS与CdTe薄膜"],"sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Assessment of CIGS and CdTe thin-walled solar photovoltaics as potential energy capture Systems for Electric-Vehicle Charging Stations: A comparative case study in India"},{"t":"基于误差SoC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案在可再生能源直流船舶微电网分布式电池储能系统中的应用","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能SOC均衡控制","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewable energy-based DC shipboard microgrid"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场竞价","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid power systems"},{"t":"使用热可切换溶剂从卤水混合物碱金属阳离子中直接提锂的新方法","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00446-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"卤水提锂","kp":["[技术]: S3E热响应胺溶剂选择性提锂","[选择性]: 1000倍过量Na/K下优先提锂","[驱动]: 温度切换调控溶剂亲水性"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种新型可切换溶剂选择性萃取（S3E）技术，利用热响应胺类溶剂从卤水混合物中碱金属阳离子之间实现锂的高选择性直接提取。该技术通过温度调控溶剂溶解度开关特性，实现锂的选择性分离与回收，为盐湖提锂提供了一种高效、低能耗的新路径，具有广阔的产业化前景。","dp":1,"ot":"A novel approach for direct lithium extraction from alkali metal cations in brine mixtures using thermally switchable solvents","b":"A novel switchable solvent selective extraction (S3E) technology utilizes thermo-responsive amines for highly selective lithium recovery from complex brines. A modest temperature swing toggles solvent hydrophilicity, enabling preferential lithium extraction even with 1,000× more sodium or potassium. S3E maintains solvent stability and selectivity over repeated cycles for scalable lithium recovery."},{"t":"全基因组遗传筛选揭示 P2Y2 整合素轴作为非小细胞肺癌 (NSCLC) EGFR 突变体的稳定剂","d":"2026-01-23","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv3980?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Activating mutations in the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) gene drive non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). Oncogenic EGFR mutants are ligand-independent and more stable, but the underlying mechanism remains unclear. We hypothesized that EGFR mutants selectively leverage cellular stabilizers to evade degradation. Genome-wide RNA interference screens identified genes (encoding for stabilizers) responsible for mutant EGFR stability, with P2Y2 receptor (P2Y2) emerging as a bona fide stabilizer. Mechanistically, high extracellular adenosine triphosphate (ATP) levels transactivate EGFR mutants via P2Y2 activation, previously shown to signal through Src kinase-dependent EGFR phosphorylation. Our study reveals that ATP-driven P2Y2 activation stabilizes EGFR mutants by forming a P2Y2-integrin β1-EGFR complex enriched in endosomes. Targeting this axis destabilizes EGFR mutants and offers a strategy against drug resistance. Elevated P2Y2 and integrin β1 expression in patients with NSCLC implies clinical relevance. Our results provide previously unidentified insight that EGFR mutants enhance extracellular ATP levels to activate P2Y2-integrin for enhanced stability of EGFR mutants to drive the oncogenic program."},{"t":"水电解槽剩余使用寿命预测综述：从降解机制到预测模型","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"水电解槽寿命预测","kp":["[水电解槽寿命预测]: 从退化机制到预测模型综述"],"sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":1.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic models"},{"t":"梯度功能化隔膜解锁正极潜在宿主位点并提升超高面容量静态Zn-I2电池锌负极放电深度","d":"2026-01-23","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523132?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"梯度功能化隔膜","kp":["[隔膜设计]: 梯度结构G-CCN@GF","[功能]: 解锁正极宿主位点+提升Zn负极DOD","[电池类型]: 超高面容量静态水系Zn-I₂","[解决的问题]: 多碘化物穿梭+锌负极不可逆"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究面向静态水系锌碘电池（SAZIBs）中多碘化物穿梭效应导致的性能衰减问题，设计了梯度功能化隔膜。该隔膜既能解锁正极潜在宿主位点、提升碘利用率，又能增强锌负极放电深度（DOD），实现超高面容量下的稳定循环。该策略为水系锌碘电池走向实用化提供了关键材料解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"A Gradient Functionalized Separator for Unlocking Latent Cathode Host Sites and Enhancing Zinc Anode DOD in Ultrahigh‐Areal‐Capacity Static Zn‐I2 Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of static aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries (SAZIBs) is hindered by the polyiodide shuttling effect and poor zinc anode reversibility, issues that are exacerbated under high iodine loadings essential for high energy density. Herein, a gradient‐structured separator (G‐CCN@GF) is designed by modifying a glass fiber separator with 2D cyano‐functionalized graphitic carbon nitride (CCN). Experimental and simulation results demonstrate that the dense CCN layer facing the cathode effectively anchors polyiodides and unlocks latent electrochemical active sites, thereby facilitating conversion kinetics under high iodine loading and I/C ratio. Meanwhile, the thin and uniform CCN layer on the anode side promotes a uniform Zn\n                    2+\n                    flux, significantly improving the zinc reversibility under high depth of discharge (DOD). Consequently, the Zn/G‐CCN@GF/I\n                    2\n                    battery with a conventional activated carbon (AC) host achieves exceptional performance under high I/C ratio (2:1) conditions, including a high areal capacity of 27.9 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    at 150.1 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    iodine loading and remarkable stability over 7200 cycles at 40 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    . A 60 cm\n                    2\n                    pouch cell further validates practicality, delivering 5.8 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and retaining 85.87% capacity after 1100 cycles. This work provides a feasible separator‐engineering strategy for high‐energy‐density SAZIBs."},{"t":"“远程控制”蛋白质照亮活细胞","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00204-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"含硫酯蛋白的α2-巨球蛋白功能通过两种免疫途径保护果蝇免受细菌蛋白酶的侵害","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525580123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"RNAseq analysis of the Drosophila genome has revealed further immune-induced genes. Two genes initially annotated as lncRNAs, CG44404(yulü) and CG45045(shenshu), are strongly induced. We report here that these two genes actually encode highly related secreted peptides found in the Sophophora subgenus of Drosophila species. We have generated single and double null mutants of these loci and found that the double mutant line did not display any enhanced susceptibility to an immune challenge with a panel of bacterial and fungal pathogens, except for Pseudomonas aeruginosa. We did not observe any increased P. aeruginosa burden in yulü-shenshu mutants, suggesting that the two peptides may not be required for resistance to infection. Rather, we find that they provide a level of protection against Outer Membrane Vesicles (OMVs) purified from either P. aeruginosa or Serratia marcescens culture supernatants. We have recently reported that S. marcescens OMVs induce the paralysis of flies through the induction of apoptosis in at least some neurons. Much of the virulence of these OMVs is mediated by the metalloprotease PrtA. While Yulü/Shenshu do not display any protease inhibition activity, the detection of an association between Yulü and the Drosophila complement thioester-containing protein 2 (Tep2) led to the finding that both Tep2 and Tep4 mutants are sensitive to the injection of PrtA while their overexpression significantly protects wild-type flies from the effects of this protease. Both Tep2 and Tep4 are able to inhibit the activity of PrtA in a thioester- and yulü/shenshu-dependent manner. Thus, these Teps may also function as α2-macroglobulins."},{"t":"揭示不对称双金属界面用于太阳能驱动CO2还原为CH4耦合C-H活化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19901","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["[光催化CO2还原]: 不对称双金属界面产CH4","[耦合]: C-H活化耦联生物质衍生醇 valorization"],"as":"该研究开发了一种不对称双金属界面催化体系，利用太阳能驱动CO2与生物质衍生醇类的共转化反应，高效生成甲烷(CH4)。不对称双金属位点设计优化了CO2活化和质子耦合电子转移步骤，提高了CH4选择性并抑制副产物生成。该策略同时实现了碳减排和高附加值燃料合成，为太阳能驱动的碳中和技术提供了新路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Unveiling Asymmetric Dual-Metal Interfaces for Solar-Driven CO2-to-CH4 Reduction Coupled with C–H Activation","b":"Solar-driven conversion of CO2 and biomass-derived alcohols offers a promising strategy for mitigating CO2 emissions and providing value-added chemicals. However, due to complex reaction pathways and sluggish C-H bond activation, it remains challenging to attain efficient photocatalytic CO2 reduction to CH4 alongside the valorization of biomass-derived alcohols. Herein, we report a judicious design to construct asymmetric dual-metal catalytic centers via anchoring semiconductor nanoclusters in vacancy-rich MOFs, achieving tandem CO2-to-CH4 photoreduction with C-H oxidation. Through loading Fe2O3 clusters in O-vacancy-rich Mil-125(Ti)-NH2, interfacial O-vacancy renders a newly formed Fe-O bond as an atomic-level electron transfer pathway toward Z-scheme construction. Furthermore, the interfacial vacancies trigger intimate interactions and modulate the d-band center to form asymmetric Ti-Fe dual-metal sites. Remarkably, a superior selectivity of 87.0% toward CH4 production coupled with 100% selectivity for benzyl alcohol-to-benzaldehyde oxidation is realized. Mechanistic investigations reveal that the heteronuclear Ti-Fe units synergistically facilitate the hydrogenation of *CO to *CHO through d-p hybridization, thereby enabling CH4 synthesis to be thermodynamically favorable, while photogenerated holes from Fe2O3 preferentially oxidize the α-C-H bond of benzyl alcohol. Further supported via another MOFs-based catalyst, this work enlightens a general design of building asymmetric dual-metal interfaces to concurrently realize selective CO2 photomethanation coupled with C-H activation."},{"t":"揭示磷酸三烷基酯对溶剂化鞘层和固态电解质界面膜的位阻效应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14645","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池电解质","kp":["库仑效率[Mg电池]: ~100%","电解质: Mg(OTf)2/磷酸三烷基酯"],"as":"该研究探讨了三烷基磷酸酯溶剂分子空间位阻效应对镁金属电池电解液溶剂化鞘层结构的影响。通过系统调控烷基链长度，研究者揭示了溶剂化鞘层组成与界面化学之间的构效关系，为实现兼具高电压和长循环寿命的无氯化镁兼容电解液提供了分子级设计指导。该工作对推进镁金属电池的工程化应用具有重要意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Steric Effect of Trialkyl Phosphates on the Solvation Sheath and Solid Electrolyte Interphase in H","b":"Designing Mg-compatible and chloride-free electrolytes is important to achieving high-voltage and long-life Mg metal batteries. In electrolytes based on Mg(OTf)2/diglyme: triethyl phosphate that exhibit near 100% Coulombic efficiency for Mg plating/stripping at high current densities and capacities, the TXP (X = alkyl group) plays a key role. Herein, we unveil steric hindrance as the fundamental origin of this role in optimizing the Mg2+ solvation structure and forming electrolyte-derived solid electrolyte interphases. The steric hindrance was tuned by systematically changing the alkyl chain length of the phosphate (TXP) from one to five. Its impact on altering bulk electrolyte solvation and interfacial SEI chemistry was studied by combining both spectroscopy techniques and theoretical modeling methods. We demonstrate that low steric hindrance leads to easy decomposition of phosphate solvents, whereas high steric hindrance fails to interrupt Mg2+-triflate/diglyme interactions. TEP with medium hindrance shows optimized behavior in both scenarios, which is the origin of its superior electrochemical performance. Our finding provides a new solvent design principle at the molecular level for chloride-free Mg2+ electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"锆-有机笼状化合物的均匀共价聚合用于高负载CO2分离膜","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22622","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2分离膜","kp":["策略[CO2分离膜]: MOC位点特异性共价聚合"],"as":"该研究实现了锆-有机笼(Zirconium-Organic Cages, MOCs)的均匀共价聚合，制备出高负载量的多孔聚合物材料。金属有机笼具有明确分子结构和均一孔径，通过共价交联策略将其组装为扩展框架，既保留了笼状分子的精准孔道特性，又显著提升了材料结构稳定性和活性位点负载密度。该策略在气体分离、催化和药物递送等领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Uniform Covalent Polymerization of Zirconium–Organic Cages for High-Loading CO2 Separation Membranes","b":"Metal-organic cages (MOCs), with their well-defined molecular structures and uniform porosity, hold great promise for application in gas separation membranes. However, the aggregation of MOCs in membranes at high loadings during conventional physical blending drastically deteriorates the separation performance. Herein, this study presents a strategy of MOC site-specific polymerization for fabricating uniform, high-loading, and selective membranes for CO2 separation. An amino-functionalized zirconium MOC (ZrTNH2) is synthesized as the building block and subsequently polymerized with poly(ethylene glycol)diisocyanate (NCO-PEG-NCO) through extensive nucleophilic addition reactions. The resulting ZrTNH2-PEG membrane exhibits a remarkable loading of up to 75 wt %, while preserving the discrete structural characteristics of ZrTNH2. It exhibits a high CO2 permeability of 577 Barrer and an exceptional CO2/N2 selectivity of 50 at 298 K and 2 bar, surpassing the latest upper bound and many previously reported MOC-based membranes. This membrane design greatly advances the mixed-matrix concept in membranes and serves as a new starting point for next-generation separation materials."},{"t":"通过烷基链长度工程调控2D/3D钙钛矿的结构与性能","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c02838","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿烷基链调控","kp":["[调控]: 烷基链长度工程调控钙钛矿结构与性能"],"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Tuning Structure and Performance of 2D/3D Perovskites by Alkyl Chain Length Engineering"},{"t":"使用水溶液合成Li10GeP2S12电解质","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16397","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物电解质合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 水溶液法合成LGPS硫化物电解质","[规模化]: 液相法面向全固态电池量产"],"as":"硫化物电解质是全固态锂电池的核心组件，Li10GeP2S12（LGPS）因其室温离子电导率接近10^-2 S/cm，被视为最有前途的固态电解质之一。本文报道了一种基于水溶液体系的LGPS合成工艺，旨在突破传统固相法能耗高、工艺复杂、难以规模化生产的瓶颈。水溶液路线有望显著降低制造成本并简化流程，对推动全固态电池从实验室走向产业化具有重要意义，但水相处理硫化物的稳定性与产物纯度仍是关键挑战。","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Synthesis of Li10GeP2S12 Electrolyte Using Aqueous Solution","b":"The development of a mass production process for sulfide electrolytes is crucial for the advancement of all-solid-state batteries. In this context, liquid-phase synthesis has gained attention as a practical and scalable approach for the synthesis of these materials. However, conventional liquid-phase synthesis typically employs organic solvents, which pose both environmental and safety concerns. In this study, a novel liquid-phase synthetic strategy is presented for the preparation of sulfide electrolytes using an aqueous solution, which eliminates the requirement for organic solvents. Consequently, a Li10GeP2S12 electrolyte was successfully synthesized, and was demonstrated to exhibit an ionic conductivity of 1.6 × 10-3 S cm-1 at 25 °C in a powder compact. Additionally, an all-solid-state Li-In/LiNi1/3Co1/3Mn1/3O2 cell incorporating the developed electrolyte demonstrated stable and reversible cycle performances over 500 cycles. Overall, this work demonstrates the feasibility of using water as an environmentally friendly solvent for synthesizing high-performance sulfide electrolytes."},{"t":"扩大基于顺序步进DNA置换信号交换的快速超多重荧光成像规模","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18687","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超多重荧光成像","kp":["[多重数]: 序列DNA置换突破3-5重光谱限制","[应用]: 细胞组织超多重荧光成像"],"as":"多重荧光成像技术是研究细胞内生物分子功能与相互作用的核心工具，而基于DNA链置换的信号交换体系可实现高灵敏、可编程的多靶标检测。本文聚焦于将逐步式（sequential stepwise）DNA链置换级联反应从概念验证扩展至规模化应用，重点解决反应通量、串扰抑制和信号保真度等工程化难题。该体系若能规模化，将为活细胞成像、分子诊断和信息加密等领域提供强大的可编程信号处理平台。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Scaling Up Sequential Stepwise DNA Displacement-Based Signal Exchange for Rapid Ultraplex Fluorescent Imaging in ","b":"Multiplexed fluorescent imaging methods are essential for studying cellular function by visualization of biomolecules in cells and tissues with high-resolution spatial information but usually suffer from limitations of 3-5 multiplexity because of spectral overlap between the used fluorophores. We introduce a method using scaled-up sequential DNA displacement reactions to enable highly multiplexed fluorescent imaging. The fluorescent signals of targets are encoded in different DNA probes in a single step. Each DNA probe's fluorescent signal can be activated for imaging and removed to avoid signal overlap with targets in the next round by two sequential, independent DNA displacement reactions. Massive targets in situ can be imaged when a scaled-up DNA displacement reaction is applied sequentially. We experimentally screened a set of rapid and orthogonal DNA displacement sequences from 144 different in situ reactions and developed 25 DNA probes with 50 selected displacement sequences for multiplexed imaging. We demonstrated 25-plex RNA imaging in a single fluorophore channel in fixed cells within 20 min, using the 50 sequential displacement reactions that consisted of 100 DNA strands simultaneously. To further demonstrate the robustness and practical usage, we showed 24-plex RNA imaging with the method in retinal tissues and resolved different cell types. Because of the vast sequence design space of DNA probes, theoretically unlimited multiplexity can be achieved. This method significantly simplifies the high-plex fluorescent imaging process with preprogrammed complex dynamic DNA nanotechnology and has broad biotechnical applications for future medicine and diagnostics.","aip":1},{"t":"SU-102：一种用于快速Li+、Na+和Al3+传输的多功能阴离子准固态电解质","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03891","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多离子准固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: SU-102阴离子型准固态","[离子传输]: Li+/Na+/Al3+快速传导"],"as":"","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] SU-102 Is a Versatile Anionic Quasi-Solid Electrolyte for Fast Li+, Na+, and Al3+ Transport","aip":1},{"t":"负载型双金属双原子对上的甲烷光热干重整反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22219","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热甲烷干重整","kp":["[催化剂]: Pt1-Ni1/CeO2双原子对光热催化剂","[温度]: 光热驱动替代传统>800°C热催化DRM"],"as":"甲烷干重整（DRM）将两种温室气体（CH4和CO2）转化为合成气（H2+CO），兼具碳减排与高附加值化学品生产双重价值，但传统热催化需800°C以上高温且催化剂易积碳失活。本文报道负载型双金属双原子钯催化剂在光热协同条件下驱动DRM反应，利用光热效应将太阳能转化为局部热量，显著降低外部加热温度并提高催化效率。双原子位点提供最大化的原子利用率和可调控的电子结构，为高效温室气体制氢提供了新路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Photothermal Dry Reforming of Methane Over Supported Bimetal Dual-Atom Pairs","b":"Dry reforming of methane (DRM, CH4 + CO2 → 2H2 + 2CO) offers a promising route for converting two greenhouse gases into valuable syngas. However, conventional thermal catalysis requires extreme temperatures (>800 °C) to overcome high energy barrier, leading to significant energy consumption and catalyst deactivation. Herein, we develop a Pt1-Ni1/CeO2 photothermal catalyst with atomically dispersed Pt1-Ni1 paired active sites for DRM under mild conditions. At 450 °C under light illumination, the catalyst exhibits high H2 and CO production rates of 4.62 and 4.65 mmol gcatalyst-1 min-1, respectively, with a H2/CO ratio close to unity (0.99). Mechanistic investigations reveal that light irradiation induces photogeneration of electrons and holes in CeO2, which directionally transfer to atomic Ni and Pt sites, respectively, inducing asymmetric charge polarization that promotes the activation of reactants. Steady-state isotope transient kinetic analysis combined with diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (SSITKA-DRIFTS) measurement identifies the critical *CHxO intermediate formed via *CHx + *O → *CHxO, a key step that suppresses deep dehydrogenation and carbon deposition. This work elucidates the regulation of parallel reactions over asymmetric dual-atom pairs in the transformation of CH4 + CO2 via photothermal synergy, paving the way for the targeted conversion of C1 molecules under mild conditions."},{"t":"水中异构控制下亚胺的近定量生成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20524","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"亚胺键（C=N）是动态共价化学和生物偶联领域的重要反应，但在水相和生理条件下因水解平衡不利，通常难以实现高转化率。本研究通过引入别构控制（allosteric control）策略，在水中、生理条件下实现了亚胺键的近定量形成。别构调控通过底物结合诱导催化剂/受体构象变化，精准切换反应活性，这一策略突破了水相动态共价反应的热力学限制，对生物正交化学、智能药物递送系统和响应性材料设计具有深远意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水相亚胺合成","kp":["产率[水中亚胺生成]: 近定量","[策略]: 金属配位键增强亚胺热力学稳定性","[条件]: 生理相关水相"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Near-Quantitative Formation of Imines in Water with Allosteric Control","b":"We demonstrate the near-quantitative formation of an imine bond in water under physiologically relevant conditions using a stoichiometric ratio of aldehyde and amine. To overcome the low hydrolytic stability of imines in water, a complementary metal coordination bond between the amine and aldehyde monomers is introduced to enhance the thermodynamic stability of the imine. Imine bond formation is substrate-selective, tolerates the presence of a variety of functional groups, and produces imines that are stable in a broad pH range. We also show that the presence of a second metal-ion complex in the building blocks provides a regulatory handle to 'switch on' imine-bond formation using ATP as an external allosteric effector."},{"t":"[ASAP] 单核非血红素铁 (III)-过氧配合物在氧化 N-去甲基化反应中作为化学模型研究","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18643","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Mononuclear nonheme iron(III)-peroxo complexes bearing N-tetramethylated cyclam (n-TMC) ligands, [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ (n = 12, 13, and 14), have recently shown highly intriguing reactivities in various oxidation reactions, such as the cis-dihydroxylation and C-H functionalization reactions, which were previously associated only with high-valent iron-oxo intermediates in heme and nonheme iron enzymes. Herein, we extend our study to report [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ mediated N-demethylation of N,N-dimethylanilines (DMAs), another reaction that was previously associated only with high-valent iron-oxo cores. Most importantly, we provide definitive evidence of the occurrence of electron transfer from DMAs to [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+, thereby establishing an electron-transfer (ET) pathway for the N-demethylation reaction. Investigation of the ET reactivity of [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ in light of the Marcus theory of ET, and a comparison of the N-demethylation and the ET rate constants corroborate a mechanism, whereby N-demethylation of DMAs by [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ proceeds via the peroxide O-O bond cleavage of [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ to form a transient [FeIV(O2-)(O• -)(n-TMC)]+ species, which undergoes a proton-coupled electron-transfer (PCET) or an uncoupled electron transfer-proton transfer (ET/PT) in the presence of DMAs. Saturation kinetics support the rate-determining formation of [FeIV(O2-)(O• -)(n-TMC)]+ in a pre-equilibrium step with the same values of the O-O bond cleavage rate constants irrespective of the substrates, such as DMAs and one-electron oxidants. The present study corroborates that mononuclear nonheme iron(III)-peroxo cores are not mere pass-through points en route to high-valent metal-oxo intermediates, but they can play an important role in the diverse oxidation reactions of Rieske oxygenases, such as in the N-demethylation reaction."},{"t":"使用方酰胺氢键供体的四氢呋喃分子量可控阳离子聚合","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18359","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阳离子聚合催化","kp":["分子量[PTHF]: 最高175kDa","催化剂: 方酰胺鎓氢键供体"],"as":"报道了四氢呋喃(THF)阳离子聚合的分子量可控新方法。聚四氢呋喃(PTHF)作为弹性纤维和热固性材料软段的关键组分具有长期工业价值，传统聚合难以精确调控分子量。该研究通过新型引发体系或链转移策略实现了PTHF分子量的精准控制，为高分子材料定制化合成提供新途径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Molecular Weight-Controlled Cationic Polymerization of Tetrahydrofuran Using a Squaramidinium Hydrogen-Bond Donor","b":"Poly(tetrahydrofuran) (PTHF) has long-standing industrial relevance as the soft block of elastic fibers and thermosets. Despite its commercial importance, the synthesis of PTHF with molecular weight (MW) control beyond 20 kDa has proved challenging. In this work, we disclose a MW-controlled synthesis of PTHF up to 175 kDa by cationic ring-opening polymerization, using a cationic squaramidinium hydrogen-bond donor (HBD) catalyst in combination with an α-phosphonooxymethyl ether initiator at room temperature. Mechanistic studies support a reversible-deactivation polymerization pathway, wherein the HBD catalyst facilitates the anchimeric ionization of the primary alkyl phosphate chain end, generating the propagating oxonium species. The stability of the phosphate chain end was demonstrated by isolating PTHF with high chain-end fidelity and subsequently extending the PTHF macroinitiator to higher molecular weights. This system was further applied to the copolymerization of THF and 1,3-dioxolane (DXL), affording copolymers with tunable thermal properties. We demonstrate near-quantitative chemical recycling of both PTHF and PTHF-co-PDXL back to monomer, highlighting the potential of this strategy for the development of sustainable polymers."},{"t":"通过稀土四分组效应调控钴基尖晶石化合物的电子结构","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18963","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"系统研究稀土元素对钴基尖晶石化合物电子结构的调控作用。稀土作为关键战略资源在材料改性方面展现出卓越效果，通过稀土掺杂或取代改变钴基尖晶石的电子构型与能带结构，旨在优化其在催化、电化学储能等领域的性能，为稀土功能材料设计提供理论指导。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀土改性尖晶石","kp":["[稀土调控机制]: 四分组效应划分稀土为四组","[应用]: 调控钴基尖晶石化合物电子结构"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Modulating the Electronic Structures of Co-Based Spinel Compounds via Rare Earth Tetrad Effect","b":"Rare earths (RE) are crucial strategic resources and have demonstrated remarkable efficacy in material modification. However, there is a wide variety of RE elements, and the mechanism for regulating electronic structure is unclear, which limits their accurate selection and efficient utilization. The RE tetrad effect divides RE elements into four groups, with the boundaries set at the points where the 4f electrons are filled to 1/4, 1/2, and 3/4. Herein, we present a systematic strategy for regulating the electronic structure of Co-based spinel compounds via it. Research results on a series of RE-doped classic Co-based spinel compounds, Co3O4 and Co3S4, indicate that the spin state of Co can be regulated at the 1/4 and 3/4 positions of the RE tetrad effect, while the valence state of Co is significantly affected at the 1/2 position. The regulation of the spin states of Co3O4 and Co3S4 can be respectively attributed to the strains in the XY-plane and the Z-direction induced by RE. In addition, RE achieve dual-periodic regulation of the Co valence state through 4f-5d-6s-5p orbital hybridization to attain a state where the 4f orbitals are nearly half-filled. The relationship between the regulation mechanism of the RE tetrad effect on the electronic structure and the adsorption evolution of oxygen-containing species has been established. Finally, we have presented a design strategy for RE composite systems based on the tetrad effect, which plays a crucial role in achieving the accurate selection and efficient utilization of RE."},{"t":"用于两个不同温区温度传感的发光镧系金属有机框架","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12757","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镧系MOF温度传感","kp":["[测温]: 镧系MOF比率型发光测温","[双温区]: 两个不同温度区域传感","[特性]: 高发色团密度高效能量转移"],"as":"开发了基于镧系金属有机框架(LnMOFs)的发光比率型温度传感器。利用Ln3+离子特征荧光发射的温度依赖性，通过两种发射峰强度比值实现自校准式温度检测，避免了光源波动和浓度干扰。该传感器在生物成像、微电子测温等场景具有应用潜力。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Luminescent Lanthanide Metal–Organic Frameworks for Temperature Sensing in Two Distinct Temperature Regions","b":"Luminescent ratiometric temperature sensors based on lanthanide(III) (Ln3+) metal-organic frameworks (LnMOFs) have emerged as promising materials in nanothermometry due to their hybrid nature and unique photophysical and structural properties. These include high chromophore density and well-defined, robust crystalline structures enabling efficient energy transfer and high luminescence performance in various external conditions such as alternating temperatures. However, current LnMOF-based nanothermometers often require high loadings of emissive centers leading to concentration quenching and limited sensitivity and typically operate in a single-temperature region. In this work, we present a new series of LnMOFs based on the ligand 1,4-benzenedicarboxylic acid (H2BDC) and its 2-amino derivative (H2ABDC), with the general formula [La1-xLnx(BDC)1-y(ABDC)yCl(DMF)] (Ln = Eu, Tb, Sm, Dy; DMF = N,N-dimethylformamide; x = 0-0.5, y = 0-1). Photophysical studies revealed that (i) the MOF scaffolds can efficiently sensitize the visible-emitting Ln3+ ions leading to quantum yields of up to 81%; (ii) mixed-ligand LnMOFs exhibit ligand-centered fluorescence lifetimes of 0.11-9 ns and exceptionally long phosphorescence lifetimes of 0.33 s. Additionally, we demonstrated the remarkable potential of mixed-metal-mixed-ligand LnMOFs, containing very low loadings of emissive components (up to 10 mol %), to function as ratiometric luminescence thermometers (RLTs) across a wide temperature range, including cryogenic (10-110 K) and ambient (70-330 K) temperatures. These LnMOFs exhibit relative sensitivities (Srel) of up to 11.1% K-1 in the cryogenic range and 2.2% K-1 at higher temperatures, comparable to the highest values reported in the literature."},{"t":"铱催化α-羟基酮与最小极化烯烃的立体选择性α-烷基化反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19724","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱催化烷基化","kp":["催化剂[α-烷基化]: 阳离子Ir(I)-手性双膦"],"as":"报道了铱催化的α-羟基酮与苯乙烯类烯烃的立体选择性α-烷基化反应。采用手性双膦修饰的阳离子Ir(I)配合物，实现α-羟基酮α位C-H键对烯烃的加成，构建含季碳或手性中心的α-烷基化产物。该方法条件温和、对映选择性高，为合成手性醇和酮类化合物提供了高效途径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Iridium-Catalyzed Stereoselective α-Alkylation of α-Hydroxy Ketones with Minimally Polarized Alkenes","b":"Cationic Ir(I)-complexes modified with homochiral diphosphines promote the α-C-H addition of α-hydroxy ketones to styrenes or alkyl olefins. These processes are predicated on the hydroxyl-directed formation of an Ir-enolate. Inter- and intramolecular processes are feasible, with the latter offering stereocontrolled access to carbocycles bearing two new stereocenters. The intramolecular processes constitute rare examples of alkene-based Conia-ene reactions that are enantio- and diastereoselective."},{"t":"利用耐氧多孔碳改性气体扩散电极实现稀薄CO2的一体化捕集与转化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03504","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稀释CO2捕集转化","kp":["[电极]: 耐氧多孔碳修饰气体扩散电极","[过程]: 稀释CO2捕集与转化一体化"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Integrated Capture and Conversion of Dilute CO2 Using an Oxygen Tolerant Porous Carbon Modified Gas Diffusion Ele"},{"t":"焓熵补偿主导电化学热电转换中的溶剂混合效应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14655","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学热电转换","kp":["[机理]: 焓熵补偿主导溶剂混合效应","[性能]: 提升热电池温度系数α"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"热电池利用氧化还原反应的熵变将温度梯度转化为电能。该研究揭示了焓-熵补偿效应主导溶剂混合对电化学热电转换性能的影响机制。通过调控溶剂混合比例，优化热电转化效率，该发现深化了对热电池热力学过程的理解，为设计高效热电转换体系提供了理论指导。","ot":"[ASAP] Enthalpy–Entropy Compensation Governs the Solvent-Mixing Effect in Electrochemical Thermoelectric Conversion","b":"Thermocells convert temperature gradients into electrical energy using the entropy change of a redox reaction. The performance of thermocells is governed by the temperature coefficient of electrochemical potential (α), and various strategies are reported to increase α. Solvent mixing has been recognized as one of the effective methods; however, the underlying mechanism remains elusive due to the absence of either systematic experimental or reliable theoretical validation. Herein, we demonstrate that enthalpy-entropy compensation provides a general framework for modeling solvent-mixing effects in thermocells. Variable-temperature electrochemistry reveals the linear relationship between hydrogen-bond entropy (ΔSHB) and enthalpy (ΔHHB) arising from the interactions between methanol and quinone dianions in acetonitrile. This enthalpy-entropy compensation principle enables the prediction of quinone derivatives with a large entropy change─and consequently a large α value─through DFT-based screening of ΔHHB. Notably, tetramethyl-para-benzoquinone exhibits an α value of -3.1 mV K-1, which is the highest absolute value in liquid-based all-organic thermocells. These findings show that enthalpy-entropy compensation is a general molecular design strategy for creating high-performance thermocells."},{"t":"通过磁场提升锂氧电池能量转换效率并抑制副反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15443","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂氧电池","kp":["[策略]: 外加磁场抑制副反应","[机理]: 磁场促进Li+/O2/电子传质降低过电位"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"锂氧电池面临能量转换效率低和副反应严重的核心挑战。该研究引入外加磁场调控电池反应过程，通过磁场影响氧气还原/析出反应中间体的自旋态和传质行为，有效抑制了寄生副反应并提升了往返能量效率。这一磁场辅助策略为改善Li-O₂电池的循环稳定性和能量利用率提供了无需改变电解质或催化剂化学组成的创新物理调控手段。","ot":"[ASAP] Enhancing Energy Conversion Efficiency and Suppression of Side Reactions in Li-O2 Batteries through a Magnetic Fi","b":"Enhancing the energy conversion efficiency of lithium-oxygen batteries remains a significant challenge. Side reactions and slow transfers of Li+, O2, and electrons cause the accumulation of insoluble byproducts on the cathode, leading to high discharge overpotentials and limited reversibility. In this study, the authors introduce a magnetic field to address these issues. Applying an external magnetic field to ferromagnetic catalysts significantly reduces the overpotential to only 0.57 V at 200 mA/g, while maintaining exceptional rate performance and cycle stability. In-situ characterization experiments demonstrate effective suppression of byproducts, primarily Li2CO3. Theoretical calculations further reveal that the magnetic field stabilizes highly reactive singlet oxygen within the battery system, inhibiting the byproduct formation pathways. Furthermore, the magnetic field plays a crucial role in promoting the decomposition of discharge products and Li+ mass transfer. Together, these effects minimize polarization and improve energy transfer efficiency, offering a versatile strategy for advanced metal-air batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"钴取代镍配位聚合物双活性位点的动力学与调控以增强析氧反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12205","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双活性位点OER催化","kp":["[催化剂]: Co取代Ni配位聚合物双活性位协同OER"],"dp":1,"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究通过在镍基配位聚合物中引入钴取代策略，构建了具有双活性位点的电催化剂体系，用于提升析氧反应（OER）性能。研究重点探讨了双活性位点的动态演化行为及其协同催化机制，通过精准调控金属配位环境优化了催化活性与稳定性。该工作对理解多金属协同电催化机制和开发高效水分解催化剂具有重要的理论与应用价值。","ot":"[ASAP] Dynamics and Control of Dual Active Sites in Co-Substituted Ni Coordination Polymers for Enhanced Oxygen Evolutio","b":"Facilitating the kinetically demanding oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is essential for the sustainable conversion of renewable energy into chemical fuels. However, precisely unraveling the dynamics of active species and sites during the OER remains a significant challenge. Herein, we constructed a series of Co-substituted Ni coordination polymers (Ni-CPs) for the OER. Complementary surface-/bulk-sensitive <i>operando</i> time-resolved spectroscopic monitoring enables detailed mechanistic insight into the critical role of partial Co incorporation in modulating the local coordination geometry of Ni centers and thereby promoting the intrinsic OER kinetics. Our results reveal that controlled Co substitution in Ni-CPs facilitates the generation of a substantial fraction of (Ni, Co)(IV) species, which activate O-O bond formation atop the catalytically active Ni<sup>IV</sup>-O-Co<sup>IV</sup> moieties. These key findings are further supported by kinetic isotopic effect studies and density functional theory calculations, in which the OER in Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs proceeds via an oxo-radical coupling mechanism, with deprotonation preferentially occurring at the Ni sites. Consequently, the engineered Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs exhibit enhanced OER activity compared to their oxide counterparts, along with durable electrochemical stability for over 4000 h. This study not only offers detailed mechanistic insights into the dynamics of active species and sites but also highlights their critical role in optimizing the OER kinetics."},{"t":"金属掺杂共价有机框架中受限水在湿态条件下增强物理吸附碳捕集","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19317","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF湿态碳捕集","kp":["[策略]: 金属掺杂COF限域水转为CO2吸附位点","[条件]: 湿润条件下物理吸附捕碳"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"研究在金属掺杂共价有机框架中利用受限水效应，在潮湿条件下增强了物理吸附型CO2捕集性能。与胺基化学吸附不同，物理吸附型CO2捕集通常受水分子抑制，该策略通过调控孔隙内受限水的行为实现了湿条件下CO2吸附的提升。","ot":"[ASAP] Confined Water in Metal-Doped Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Physisorptive Carbon Capture under Wet Con","b":"Unlike amine-based CO2 chemisorption, where water can enhance amine utilization efficiency, physisorptive CO2 capture is typically impeded by water owing to its large dipole moment and competitive adsorption behavior. Converting water into additional adsorptive sites for CO2 adsorption in physisorption is promising, yet still nascent and elusive. Herein, we report a strategy that exploits confined water to achieve efficient CO2 capture, even under high relative humidity (RH) conditions, in metal-ion-doped covalent organic frameworks (COFs). By activation at different temperatures, water exhibiting Lewis acidic properties can be formed within metal-ion-doped COFs, thereby further enhancing CO2 adsorption. The dry CO2 uptake of NUS-42-NiCl2 nearly doubles at 800 mmHg and 298 K compared to pristine NUS-42 after activation at 323 K. In situ X-ray diffraction (XRD), solid-state 1H magic angle spinning nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (ss 1H MAS NMR), and in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) confirm the formation of Lewis-acid-water. Furthermore, control over pore size and metal-ion loading is shown to be critical for generating the Lewis-acid-water. Combined in situ DRIFTS, electron spin resonance (ESR), X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS), and density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate the role of Lewis-acid-water in producing moisture-enhanced and inflectional CO2 adsorption isotherms. Multicomponent dynamic column breakthrough experiments further demonstrate significantly improved CO2 uptake after moisture presaturation up to 75% RH. These findings offer a systematic and innovative approach for converting water into CO2 adsorption sites, thereby addressing the challenge of competitive water adsorption during physisorptive carbon capture.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过正交半胱氨酰蛋白实现方向转换一锅肽连接进行化学蛋白质合成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20510","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"A one-pot multiple peptide ligation strategy accelerates the demanding processes of chemical protein synthesis. Ligation intermediates generated during peptide ligation differ depending on the order of peptide segment assembly, affecting the aggregation properties of the ligation mixture. Therefore, expanding the scope of the ligation order in one-pot methods contributes to optimizing a ligation scheme for each target protein in chemical protein synthesis. Herein, we present the first example of direction-switching one-pot peptide ligation, utilizing the two mutually orthogonal cysteinyl protections compatible with native chemical ligation (NCL): thiazolidine (Thz) and a new allylic thiol protecting group, N-(2,2,2-trifluoroethyl)-allyloxycarbonylaminomethyl (TfeAllocam). By optimizing the structure and metal-mediated deprotection conditions for the allylic protecting group, we established efficient methods for consecutive NCLs and deprotections in two direction-switching schemes with the same peptide segments: one scheme from C-terminus-to-N-terminus (C-to-N) to N-terminus-to-C-terminus (N-to-C) and the other from N-to-C to C-to-N. Using this ligation approach, we accomplished the semisynthesis of dimonoubiquitinated histone H3 bearing trimethyl-lysine by condensing five peptide segments in a one-pot manner.","tp":"肽连接合成","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者首次报道了利用正交半胱氨酰实现方向可切换的一锅多肽连接策略。该方法通过不同半胱氨酸保护基实现肽段组装顺序的灵活控制，避免了中间体的聚集问题，大幅简化了化学蛋白质合成的流程，为复杂目标蛋白的高效合成提供了普适性方案。"},{"t":"自旋交叉分子中的明亮比率型荧光温度计用于自旋态平衡可视化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18528","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋交叉荧光测温","kp":["[分子设计]: 萘嵌入自旋交叉分子","[功能]: 比率荧光可视化自旋态平衡"],"dp":1,"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"研究在自旋交叉分子中构建了明亮的比例型荧光温度计，用于可视化自旋态平衡过程。光学可寻址的分子自旋旨在解决磁性器件中弱磁矩的探测和控制难题，该荧光探针为分子尺度自旋态的实时监测提供了新工具。","ot":"[ASAP] Bright Ratiometric Fluorescent Thermometer in a Spin Crossover Molecule toward Visualization of Spin-State Equili","b":"Optically addressable molecular spins aim to tackle control and detection of weak magnetic moment when magnetic devices are scaled down to the single-molecule level. To achieve accurate readout of molecular spin states by adjacent luminescent probes, the molecular design must meet the stringent requirements of both high signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) and high sensitivity. Here, we incorporated a naphthalimide-based ratiometric fluorescent (RF) probe with a donor-acceptor (D-A) structure into a spin crossover (SCO) molecule. The probe features dual emission channels arising from a locally excited (LE) state and an intramolecular charge-transfer (ICT) state. The thermochromism associated with SCO spectrally overlaps with the probe's RF bands, producing a reverse synergistic effect, achieving ratiometric fluorescent thermometers (RFTs) with 1.35% K-1 sensitivity and 66% fluorescence contrast. More importantly, the bright fluorescence thermochromism (∼50% quantum yield) is maintained throughout the entire SCO process, enabling direct visualization of spin-state equilibria with high SNR (>400) and detection resolution (0.0017) even at low concentrations of 10-4 M. This tuning of the single-fluorophore RF against SCO thermochromism provides a new design platform for the accurate readout of spin states of molecules."},{"t":"桥联阳极与阴极界面：水系金属空气电池的一体化界面策略","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04296","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属空气电池界面","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.5},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Bridging Anode and Cathode Interfaces: Integrated Interfacial Strategies for Aqueous Metal–Air Batteries"},{"t":"量子点光刻图案化进展：机理、材料与器件应用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03933","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"量子点光图案化","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Advances in Photopatterning of Quantum Dots: Mechanisms, Materials, and Device Applications"},{"t":"用于革兰氏阳性与革兰氏阴性细菌的比率型pH传感器","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22321","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"细菌pH传感","kp":["[pH传感]: 比率型荧光探针检测细菌胞质pH","[检测对象]: 革兰氏阳性与阴性菌单细胞"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"as":"本研究开发了一种比例型pH荧光传感器，能够同时区分革兰氏阳性和革兰氏阴性细菌。该传感器利用两种发射波长的荧光强度比值来定量检测细菌微环境的pH变化，具有内置参比校准、抗干扰能力强的优势。研究发现在波动的环境条件下，单克隆细菌群体内部存在显著的表型异质性，不同亚群表现出差异化的pH响应。该工具为理解细菌适应机制、抗生素耐药性发展以及开发精准抗菌策略提供了重要的单细胞水平分析手段。","ot":"[ASAP] A Ratiometric pH Sensor for Gram-Positive and Gram-Negative Bacteria","b":"Fluctuating environments can lead to phenotypic heterogeneity within a monoclonal bacterial population, especially in response to antibiotics or the human immune system. Methods are required to analyze the physiology of single cells to understand how individual cells interact with their environment and adapt to pH stress. We report a ratiometric, fluorescent probe to sense cytoplasmic pH in bacteria. Our probes are based on hemicyanine dyes and are taken up into both Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacteria. The probes are selective under a broad range of biologically relevant conditions. The response to pH changes is reversible and rapid, allowing for the real-time tracking of pH fluctuations. The sensing of these probes was tuned to allow for monitoring fluctuations around neutrality and biologically relevant acidifications. These probes were validated for cytoplasmic pH sensing in Escherichia coli, Staphylococcus epidermidis, and a clinically isolated methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) strain. Furthermore, the probes enabled the identification of pH-sensitive phenotypes and monitored phagocytosis of virulent clinical strains in immune cells. Our probes are a promising tool for detecting phenotypic heterogeneity within bacterial populations and may help unravel the physiological state of resistant or persistent strains of clinical relevance."},{"t":"集成马达的三维共价有机框架双模式功能材料","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19507","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"研究报道了一种将分子马达集成到三维共价有机框架（COF）中的新型材料。生物系统通过在精确组织的骨架内运作的分子机器实现宏观功能，该研究受此启发，在三维COF骨架中嵌入光驱动分子马达，实现了双重功能（结构支撑与分子级机械运动）。这一成果为设计具有宏观可编程运动响应的智能材料开辟了新路径，在纳米致动器、分子传感和智能催化等领域具有应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子马达COF","kp":["[策略]: 拓扑网状策略嵌入旋转分子马达","[马达]: 过度拥挤烯烃旋转马达","[载体]: 3D共价有机框架"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] A Motor-Integrated Three-Dimensional Covalent Organic Framework with Dual-Mode Functionality","b":"Biological systems achieve macroscopic functionality through molecular machines operating within precisely organized scaffolds. Replicating this coordinated motion synthetically requires integrating high-performance molecular motors into structurally ordered, yet dynamically active, frameworks. We present a reticular design strategy for incorporating overcrowded alkene rotary motors into 3D covalent organic frameworks (COFs), creating JUC-666 as a prototype. This crystalline material maintains a unidirectional motor rotation in both solution and solid states, as confirmed by spectroscopic and kinetic analyses. The embedded motors enable dual-mode functionality: reversible CO2 uptake modulation (>83% capacity variation at 273 K) under light-dark cycling, and precisely controlled drug release with light-dosage-proportional kinetics, showing a ∼50-fold increase in cumulative release. These results demonstrate how COFs can bridge molecular-scale motion to macroscopic responses, establishing a platform for designing adaptive functional materials."},{"t":"古新世-始新世最热期开始时陆地生态系统广泛破坏","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509231122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Paleocene-Eocene Thermal Maximum (PETM, ~56 Mya) interval was marked by massive 13C-depleted carbon emissions into the ocean/atmosphere system, manifested as a negative carbon isotope excursion (CIE) in sedimentary components, and ~5 °C global average warming. Episodes of hydrological perturbations and soil-erosion have been widely documented for the PETM but their link with vegetation- and carbon cycle changes remain poorly constrained. Here, we present organic microfossil evidence showing a strong increase in fern-dominated pioneer vegetation that replaced coniferous forests on the margin of the Norwegian Sea during the first millennia of the CIE. With the present stratigraphic constraints, the \"fern spike\" occurred simultaneously in terrestrial settings along the North Sea, Arctic Ocean, the US east coast and in southern Australia, indicating that pioneer vegetation persisted for several millennia following a partial collapse of previously stable terrestrial ecosystems. Both the ferns and influx of microcharcoal imply recurrent physical disturbance, including soil destabilization and erosion, potentially linked to droughts, wildfires, and strong hydrological forcing resulting from extreme climate change. Together with evidence for reworked clay minerals and ancient organic matter (kerogen), these findings show that highly disturbed terrestrial ecosystems were widespread across mid- and high-latitude regions globally. Carbon cycle model simulations suggest that a substantial loss of standing and buried biomass, along with oxidation of soil organic matter, acted as important positive feedbacks during the onset of the CIE. Additionally, enhanced kerogen weathering likely contributed as another major positive feedback throughout both the onset and main phase of the CIE."},{"t":"为什么患有多动症的青少年如此容易受到社交媒体的危害","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00096-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"为什么女孩的多动症未被诊断出来","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00098-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面向二维MoS2晶体管的晶圆级高κHfO2介电薄膜（等效氧化层厚度低于5埃）","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68584-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2晶体管介质","kp":["EOT[HfO2栅介质]: <5Å","膜厚[HfO2]: 1.3nm","规模: 晶圆级","应用: 2D MoS2晶体管"],"as":"研究实现了晶圆级高质量高介电常数HfO₂介质薄膜的制备，等效氧化层厚度（EOT）突破至5埃以下。高k栅介质是现代晶体管技术的核心，对高效电容耦合和漏电流抑制至关重要。该工作通过精确的原子层沉积工艺和界面工程，在保持超低漏电流的同时实现了亚5埃EOT，为延续摩尔定律和开发下一代高性能低功耗逻辑器件（包括先进FinFET及环绕栅极晶体管架构）提供了关键的介质材料解决方案。","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Wafer-scale high-κ HfO2 dielectric films with sub-5-Å equivalent oxide thickness for 2D MoS2 transistors","b":"High-κ gate dielectrics are indispensable in modern transistor technology and play a pivotal role in efficient capacitive gating and suppression of leakage currents. However, the realization of industry-compatible high-κ gate dielectrics at a sub-5-Å equivalent oxide thickness (EOT) remains challenging. Here we report the realization of 1.3-nm thick hafnium oxide (HfO2) dielectrics via an industry-compatible multiple oxidation atomic layer deposition process at 200 °C. A low EOT down to 2.5 Å is demonstrated for 1.3-nm thick HfO2 dielectrics on metal gates with a low leakage current of 10−6 A/cm2 and a robust breakdown electric field of ~22.3 MV/cm. Remarkably, such low EOT high-κ/metal gates can be directly implanted into emerging two-dimensional (2D) transistors and low-power logic circuits on 8-inch wafer scale to showcase their potentials. The as-fabricated molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) transistors exhibit a large on-state current density of 260 µA/µm at source-drain bias of 0.5 V, a high on/off ratio of 108, an average subthreshold slope (SS) of 75 mV/dec, and small capacitance equivalent thickness (CET) values of 0.34 nm for gate-first transistors and 0.50 nm for gate-last transistors. Our ultra-scaled dielectrics hold significant promise for advanced semiconductor fabrication processes towards the angstrom era."},{"t":"美国前线社区的脆弱性超过了对气候的担忧","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(25)00425-7?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"富锂锰基氧化物正极的电压衰减与容量损失：原子起源、介观非均匀性及对策","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521529?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极衰减","kp":["[材料]: 锂富锰基氧化物LRMO正极","[失效机制]: 电压衰减容量损失原子-介观-宏观关联"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"富锂锰基氧化物（LRMO）正极材料因高比容量（>250 mAh/g）被视为下一代锂离子电池的有力候选，但长期循环中严重的电压衰减和容量损失阻碍了其实际应用。本文从原子尺度揭示了过渡金属迁移、氧阴离子氧化还原不可逆性以及晶格氧释放等本征缺陷如何导致电压衰退。研究还识别了介观尺度上的结构不均匀性——包括相分离、微裂纹和局域结构演变——对电化学性能退化的协同影响，为通过成分调控和表面工程抑制电压衰减提供了机理指导。","ot":"Voltage Decay and Capacity Loss in Lithium‐Rich Manganese Oxide Cathodes: Atomic Origins, Mesoscopic Heterogeneities, an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Lithium‐rich manganese‐based oxide (LRMO) cathode materials have emerged as promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) due to their high specific capacity and exceptional energy density. Nevertheless, their practical application is significantly hindered by pronounced voltage decay and capacity loss during cycling, which stem from complex and interrelated mechanisms. This review presents a comprehensive, multi‐scale analysis of the degradation pathways in LRMO materials, spanning from atomic‐level structural dynamics to mesoscopic heterogeneities and macroscopic particle evolution. Special focus is directed toward unraveling the synergistic interplay between oxygen anionic and cationic redox processes, oxygen release, transition metal ions (TMs) migration, irreversible phase transitions, heterogeneous electrochemical reactions, and operational conditions. By integrating insights from advanced characterization, theoretical modeling, and electrochemical analyses, this review establishes a cohesive framework that elucidates the intricate relationships among oxygen activity, TMs dynamics, and structural transformations. These mechanistic insights lay a critical foundation for the development of stabilization strategies aimed at mitigating voltage decay and capacity loss. Ultimately, this review bridges the gap between fundamental mechanistic understanding and practical engineering applications, offering actionable guidance for the design of durable and high‐energy‐density LRMO cathode materials tailored for high‐performance energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"可视化与理解单晶有机电池中反应耦合离子的Grotthuss传输机制","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519541?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机电极离子传输","kp":["表征方法[有机电池]: 原位光电化学","机制: 反应耦合离子Grotthuss输运"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"本文首次在单晶有机电池电极中可视化观测了反应耦合的离子Grotthuss输运机制。不同于传统间隙扩散，Grotthuss机制描述了离子通过氢键网络的链式跃迁实现快速传输，类似于质子在水中跳迁的过程。研究团队利用原位表征技术追踪了充放电过程中离子在有机晶体晶格内的动态扩散路径，揭示了离子迁移与氧化还原反应之间的直接耦合关系。这一发现为设计高倍率性能有机电池材料提供了全新的机理认识，有望突破传统无机电极材料的离子扩散瓶颈。","ot":"Visualizing and Understanding the Reaction‐Coupled Ion Grotthuss Transport in Single‐Crystal Organic Battery","b":"Abstract\n                  Tracking dynamic ion diffusion in electrode materials has long posed a significant challenge in battery performance research. The development of facile visualization techniques to reveal ion transport dynamics enables more intuitive and in‐depth understanding of degradation mechanisms. In this study, we introduce an in situ optical electrochemical characterization method for organic single‐crystal electrode materials. By leveraging the electrochemical‐responsive optical properties of these materials, we successfully visualized the dynamic ion diffusion process within organic single‐crystal electrodes. Using this approach, we identified a reaction‐coupled ion diffusion mechanism governed by Fick's first law. Our results reveal strong crystal‐plane‐dependent diffusion characteristics and demonstrate that reaction‐induced conductivity enhancement is a key factor enabling high‐rate performance. Furthermore, the method vividly captures ion‐intercalation‐induced volume expansion and active material dissolution/shuttling phenomena. This methodology provides fundamental insights into the kinetic behavior and degradation mechanisms of organic electrode systems and demonstrates broad applicability to other material systems.","aip":1},{"t":"范德华异质结迈向多铁性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01464-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"观点评论","tp":"范德华多铁异质结","kp":["[范德华异质结]: 实现多铁性"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":1.5,"t":7.5},"as":"","ot":"Van der Waals heterostructures go multiferroic"},{"t":"重视混合能源系统的操作灵活性：汉密尔顿-雅可比-贝尔曼方程的神经解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600070X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"混合能源优化","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"持久性污染物的升级回收：迈向电化学驱动的循环卤素经济","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00422-X?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电化学卤素回收","kp":["理念[卤素回收]: 电化学驱动循环卤素经济"],"as":"该研究聚焦卤代持久性污染物的升级回收（upcycling），提出一种电化学驱动策略，将卤代材料和废物流中的卤素重新定向为可用资源，构建循环经济闭环。传统上卤代废物（如含氯/溴/氟的塑料、阻燃剂等）极难降解且环境危害大，填埋或焚烧会产生二次污染。电化学方法可在温和条件下选择性断裂C-X键，将卤化物转化为高附加值化学品或直接回用为工业原料。该方向对解决持久性有机污染物（POPs）和全氟/多氟烷基物质（PFAS）等全球性环境难题具有重要意义，有望推动废物资源化与绿色化学的深度结合。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Upcycling of persistent pollutants: Toward an electrochemically driven circular halogen economy","b":"The recycling of halogenated materials and waste streams is of significant importance. Redirecting halides back into the value chain of chemical products is desirable and could be enabled with the help of electrosynthetic technology. Such electrical energy, when obtained from renewable resources, will allow for a sustainable and potentially closed-loop, circular halide economy. Recent developments and approaches are summarized and highlighted.","aip":1},{"t":"解开多巴胺和多动症之间的联系","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00094-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过d-p轨道杂化描述符实现合理催化剂设计，解锁高性能钠-二氧化碳电池","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525098?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠碳电池催化","kp":["[描述符]: d-p轨道杂化指导催化剂设计","[应用]: Na-CO2电池草酸钠分解动力学"],"as":"钠-二氧化碳（Na-CO₂）电池作为新型储能体系兼具碳捕获与能量存储双重功能，但金属催化剂缺乏通用设计准则制约了其性能突破。该研究提出以d-p轨道杂化作为描述符（descriptor），系统揭示催化剂电子结构与电催化活性之间的内在关联，为高效Na-CO₂电池催化剂的理性设计提供了理论指导。d-p杂化程度可调控催化剂对CO₂还原中间体的吸附强度，从而优化充放电过电位和循环稳定性。该框架有望推广至其他金属-气体电池（Li-CO₂、Zn-空气等）的催化剂筛选，加速从试错式开发向数据驱动的理性设计转变。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Unlocking High‐Performance Na‐CO2 Batteries via a d‐p Orbital Hybridization Descriptor for Rational Catalyst Design","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Metal‐based catalysts show great promise for efficient Na‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries. However, the absence of a universal principle that connects catalytic properties to battery performance has impeded rational catalyst design. To bridge this gap, we propose a descriptor based on d‐p orbital hybridization. Focusing on sodium oxalate (Na\n                    2\n                    C\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    ), a key discharge product with faster decomposition kinetics than carbonates, we systematically investigate the hybridization between metal d‐band centers and oxygen p‐orbitals, revealing the mechanism governing the formation/decomposition for Na\n                    2\n                    C\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    . By constructing electronic structure‐based theoretical descriptors, we enable efficient prediction and rational design of catalyst performance. The Pd‐based catalyst designed using the d‐p orbital hybridization descriptor screening strategy enables a battery that achieves a cycling stability of 1800 h with retained energy efficiency of 85.5% and a low overpotential of 0.49 V. The strong correlation between the descriptor and the Gibbs free energy (ΔG) of the rate‐determining reaction step confirms its predictive accuracy. This work establishes d‐p orbital hybridization as a descriptor for controlling discharge products, guiding the design of high‐energy‐density Na‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries."},{"t":"混合单层WS2/等离激元结构中从相干到非相干极化激元非线性的超快转变","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02054-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了原子级薄层半导体中激子极化激元（exciton polariton）从相干到非相干非线性光学响应的超快转变过程。极化激元是光子与激子强耦合形成的准粒子，是量子光电子器件（如极化激元激光器、光学开关、量子模拟平台）的核心构件。在原子层厚度的过渡金属硫族化合物（如MoS₂、WSe₂）中，激子结合能大，可实现室温稳定极化激元。研究通过超快时间分辨光谱揭示了相干多体效应（如极化激元-极化激元散射）向非相干吸收主导机制的飞秒级转变，为设计高速低能耗非线性光学器件提供了关键物理认知。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激子极化激元","kp":["[激子极化激元]: 单层WS2/等离激元杂化结构","[非线性跃迁]: 相干至非相干超快转变"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Ultrafast transition from coherent to incoherent polariton nonlinearities in a hybrid 1L-WS2/plasmon structure","b":"Exciton polaritons based on atomically thin semiconductors are essential building blocks of quantum optoelectronic devices. Their properties are governed by an ultrafast and oscillatory energy transfer between their excitonic and photonic constituents, resulting in the formation of polaritonic quasiparticles with pronounced nonlinearities induced by the excitonic component. In metallic, plasmonic nanoresonators, dissipation phenomena limit the polariton lifetime to a few tens of femtoseconds, so short that the role of these polaritons for the nonlinear response of such hybrids is yet unexplored. Here we use ultrafast two-dimensional electronic spectroscopy (2DES) to uncover coherent polariton dynamics in a hybrid monolayer (1L) WS2/plasmonic nanostructure. With respect to an uncoupled WS2 flake, we observe an over 20-fold, polarization-dependent enhancement of the optical nonlinearity and a rapid evolution of the 2DES spectra within ~70 fs. We relate these dynamics to a transition from coherent polaritons to incoherent excitations, unravel the microscopic origin of the optical nonlinearities and show the potential of coherent polaritons for ultrafast all-optical switching."},{"t":"BAM1 泛素化减弱根尖分生组织中 CLE 肽介导的信号传导","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530116123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The plasma membrane-resident receptor-like kinases (RLKs) and their cognate peptide ligands play crucial roles in plant growth and development. The RLK BARELY ANY MERISTEM1 (BAM1) promotes phloem formation and regulates other aspects of root development. However, the mechanisms governing BAM1 protein degradation remain unclear. In this study, we demonstrate that two closely related ubiquitin ligases, RING DOMAIN LIGASE 1 (RGLG1) and RGLG2, specifically interact with BAM1 and its closest homolog BAM2. RGLG1/2 ubiquitinate BAM1/2 and mediate their degradation, thereby dampening BAM1/2 signaling. Treatment with the peptide CLE13 (CLV3/EMBRYO SURROUNDING REGION-RELATED 13) enhances the BAM1/2-RGLG2 interaction and the ubiquitin ligase activity of RGLG2, resulting in increased ubiquitination and degradation of BAM1/2 by RGLG1/2. The rglg1 rglg2 double mutant exhibits increased sensitivity to CLE13 compared to the wild type. Collectively, our findings demonstrate that RGLG1/2-mediated ubiquitination and degradation of BAM1/2 attenuate CLE13-mediated signaling in root meristem."},{"t":"具有本征尺寸筛分纳米孔的二维层状纳米片膜用于超快氢气分离","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5523?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维氢气分离膜","kp":["[膜结构]: 本征尺寸筛分纳米孔二维层状膜","[性能]: 超快氢气分离"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种具有本征尺寸筛分纳米孔隙的二维层状纳米片膜材料，用于绿色氢能的分离与纯化。通过精确调控层间间距与纳米孔隙结构，实现对氢气与其他气体分子的高选择性分离。该材料有望突破传统分离技术的能效瓶颈，推动大规模绿色氢能产业链的工业化应用。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Two-dimensional lamellar nanosheet membranes with intrinsic size-sieving nanopores for ultrafast hydrogen separation","b":"Hydrogen separation and purification are essential for the large-scale application of green hydrogen energy. Two-dimensional (2D) material-based membrane technology provides an energy-efficient approach; however, the existing 2D lamellar membranes and nanoporous membranes struggle with low permeability and complex preparation procedures. Here, we constructed 2D lamellar nanosheet membranes with intrinsic size-sieving nanopores by assembling nanoporous polymeric carbon nitride (PCN) nanosheets into a lamellar membrane. These membranes exhibit high selectivity and permeance and ease of preparation. By applying MXene as the strong interaction patch for covering and repairing defects on PCN nanosheets, the resultant membranes demonstrated an ultrahigh H2 permeance of 870 to 8046 GPU, considerable selectivity, and superior long-term stability, outperforming most current state-of-the-art membranes. Economic analysis revealed that MXene/PCN membranes achieved ultralow energy consumption and minimal membrane area demands for practical applications. This study inspires the construction of 2D lamellar membranes with intrinsic nanopores and provides a simple and scalable approach to preparing high-performance 2D nanosheet membranes for hydrogen separation."},{"t":"迈向单晶二维聚(亚芳基亚乙烯基)共价有机框架","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02048-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单晶二维COF","kp":["合成策略[2D COF]: Mannich消除反应","材料: 单晶乙烯基连接2D聚芳撑亚乙烯"],"as":"该研究致力于合成单晶态二维聚芳基亚乙烯基共价有机框架（2D PAVs），通过乙烯基连接构建具有高度共轭结构的二维材料。单晶态结构可显著提升材料的电荷传输性能与结构规整性，在有机电子学、光电器件和储能领域具有重要应用潜力，突破了传统多晶COF材料的性能局限。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Towards single-crystalline two-dimensional poly(arylene vinylene) covalent organic frameworks","b":"Vinylene-linked two-dimensional (2D) conjugated covalent organic frameworks, or 2D poly(arylene vinylene)s (2D PAVs), are promising polymer semiconductors for (opto-)electronics, photocatalysis and electrochemistry. However, conventional solvothermal synthesis often produces 2D PAVs that are poorly crystalline or difficult to access. Here we introduce a Mannich-elimination strategy that converts 8 2D imine-covalent organic frameworks into 11 highly crystalline 2D PAVs though a reversible C=C bond formation mechanism enabling precise crystallization control. This versatile approach affords robust 2D PAVs with honeycomb, square or kagome lattices, specific surface area up to ∼2,000 m2 g−1 and lattice-mismatch tolerance up to 3.5%. High-resolution transmission electron microscopy and continuous rotation electron diffraction reveal molecular-level ordering in a 2-µm-sized triphenylbenzene-based single-crystalline 2D PAV. We demonstrate that crystallinity profoundly influences charge transport, with benzotrithiophene-based 2D PAVs exhibiting charge mobilities tenfold higher than their amorphous analogues or 2D polyimine precursors. This work establishes a general route to highly crystalline 2D conjugated polymer materials for robust applications."},{"t":"迈向乙烯工业化电合成：在铜磷化物上实现高效稳定的乙炔半氢化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518909?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电催化加氢","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半氢化]: 磷化铜/MXene","应用: 工业电合成乙烯"],"as":"该研究面向乙烯的工业化电合成，提出一种节能且稳定的乙炔半加氢电催化工艺（EHAE），利用可再生电力驱动乙炔加氢生成乙烯。该路径有望替代传统化石裂解法生产乙烯，兼具高能效与低碳排放优势，为绿色化工和可持续石化原料生产提供了新方向。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Toward Industrial Electrosynthesis of Ethylene: Energy‐Efficient and Stable Acetylene Semi‐Hydrogenation on a Copper Pho","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic semi‐hydrogenation of acetylene to ethylene (EHAE) using renewable electricity represents a promising alternative approach for ethylene production. However, its relatively low energy efficiency (EE) and insufficient electrocatalyst stability hinder its industrial applications. The conduct a techno‐economic analysis indicates that the EHAE process becomes profitable when the EE exceeds 22.8% at an industrial current density of 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    . Herein, we report a novel electrocatalyst featuring firmly immobilized copper phosphide (Cu\n                    3\n                    P) nanoparticles on MXene nanosheets (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P) for a stable EHAE process at industrial currents using membrane electrode assembly (MEA) system. Specifically, the Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P electrocatalyst achieves an EE of 23.0% at 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its potential for practical application and economic viability. The strong interactions between Cu\n                    3\n                    P and Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    MXene prevent the agglomeration and dissolution of Cu\n                    3\n                    P nanoparticles during long‐term EHAE process. Notably, in a 4 cm\n                    2\n                    MEA, Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P catalysts can sustain high performance for 100 h at 1.0 A with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency decay of only 0.051% per hour. Quasi in situ electron paramagnetic resonance spectroscopy and theoretical calculations indicate that Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P facilitates water dissociation and synergistically enhances the adsorption of acetylene and active hydrogen (H\n                    *\n                    ), thereby accelerating the kinetics of EHAE process."},{"t":"氧化物人工突触中的拓扑外延导电细丝实现神经胶质细胞样调控动力学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517913?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化物人工突触","kp":["[器件]: 氧化物人工突触拓扑外延导电丝","[特性]: 神经胶质样调控支持具身智能"],"as":"该研究在氧化物人工突触器件中发现拓扑外延生长的导电丝结构，用于阻变存储器（RRAM）和类脑神经形态计算。通过调控导电丝的拓扑形态与生长机制，显著提升了器件的开关一致性、保持时间和耐久性，为下一代低功耗神经形态计算硬件突破提供了新策略。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Topologically Epitaxial Conductive Filaments in Oxide Artificial Synapses Enable Neuroglia‐Like Regulatory Dynamics for ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Resistance random access memory (RRAM) has emerged as a critical device for neuromorphic computing, offering significant potential for synaptic simulation. Nevertheless, it remains challenging to control the stochastic nature of the conductive filaments (CFs) in oxide‐based artificial synapses, leaving a critical gap between biological plasticity and neuromorphic reliability. Here, inspirated from the directional guidance of growth factors and the mechanical traction exerted by glia during axonal outgrowth, and apply these biological principles into a topo‐epitaxial self‐assembly protocol that steers every step of CF growth. By prescribing both the ionic trajectory and the structural registry of the nascent filament, we suppress intrinsic transport stochasticity and enforce crystallographic coherence. The result is atomic‐precision control over ion migration and single‐crystalline CF formation—achieved within standard CMOS flows, without extra masks or exotic processing. Finally, by constructing a behavior‐level model based on the habituation characteristics of oxide artificial synapses, the application in obstacle avoidance is successfully presented. Our synapses empower embodied AI robots with rich, robust, and self‐adaptive behaviors.","aip":1},{"t":"用于耐久水电解的薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜：抑制溶胀与增强性能","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505888?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水增强隔膜","kp":["[膜厚]: 12µm sPPS+多孔PE增强","[稳定性]: >2000小时耐久水电解","[抗溶胀]: 抑制溶胀提升机械完整性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜材料，用于耐久型水电解制氢。烃基膜有望显著提升电解槽效率，替代传统全氟磺酸膜（如Nafion）。通过增强结构与磺化度优化，该膜在保持高质子导电性的同时提升了机械强度与长期运行稳定性，为大规模绿氢制备提供了更具成本效益的膜材料方案。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Thin Reinforced Sulfonated Poly(phenylene sulfone) Membranes for Durable Water Electrolysis: Suppressed Swelling and Enh","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Hydrocarbon (HC) membranes have the potential to significantly enhance the efficiency of water electrolyzers. However, their low mechanical integrity under electrolysis conditions, due to severe swelling, poses a challenge for industrial‐scale applications. Here, we present a 12 µm‐thick sulfonated poly(phenylene sulfone) (sPPS) membrane reinforced with a porous polyethylene (PE) substrate. The PE substrate reduces in‐plane swelling by a factor of 7 (10% vs 69%) and improves mechanical stability (440 MPa vs 50 MPa) in water at 60°C. Under electrolysis conditions, a 24 µm thick sandwich of two reinforced membranes shows stable operation over more than 2000 h in a constant current hold at 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    conducted at 60°C (first 1000 h) and 80°C (remaining 1000 h) with only 6 µV h\n                    −1\n                    of voltage deviation within the last 500 h. With a potential of 1.67 V and a hydrogen in oxygen content of 1 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , the PFAS‐free membrane clearly outperforms a state‐of‐the‐art reference (Nafion‐N211: 1.73 V and 1.5 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    )."},{"t":"钾离子电池热分解路径与界面反应性：聚焦电解液和负极","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06908D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾电池热分解","kp":["电解质[K电池]: 2.5M KFSI低易燃","负极: 石墨"],"as":"本文研究钾离子电池的热分解路径与界面反应性。钾离子电池因钾资源丰富、可使用石墨负极等优势被视为锂离子电池的有力替代方案。研究聚焦于电池材料在高温下的热失稳机制，分析正极、电解液及电极-电解质界面处的副反应路径，揭示热失控的化学根源。这对提升钾离子电池安全性与推动其实际商业化应用具有重要意义。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Thermal Decomposition Pathways and Interfacial Reactivity in Potassium-Ion Batteries: Focus on Electrolyte and Anode","b":"Potassium(K)-ion batteries are an attractive alternative to lithium-ion due to their resource abundance, graphite-anode compatibility, manufacturability, and reduced reliance on critical metals. Yet their thermal safety remains poorly defined. Here, we investigate a widely accepted “safer” anode–electrolyte pair, a graphite anode with a low-flammable electrolyte, 2.5 M potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI) in triethyl phosphate (TEP), to clarify decomposition pathways and interfacial reactivity. This work shows that stand-alone TEP primarily volatilizes, whereas in the presence of KFSI it thermally decomposes via FSI-derived intermediates, producing exothermic reactions totaling ~264 J g‒1 above 200 °C and generating organophosphate/fluorophosphate species (e.g., diethyl fluorophosphate) with SO2, HNO3, and SOF2. This is roughly twice the heat released by a conventional LiPF6 carbonate electrolyte, underscoring that low flammability does not equate to safety. With potassiated graphite (KC8), potassium leaching at ~63–80 °C triggers an early interfacial exotherm that builds an inorganic-rich secondary SEI and temporarily suppresses further anode attack up to ~200 °C. Beyond this temperature, electrolyte and anode–electrolyte reactions contribute a total of ~262 J g‒1, which is lower than that of the Li-ion analogue (~431 J g‒1) but occurs at an earlier onset (~65 vs ~100 °C). Interfacial analysis shows that heating transforms the initially stratified SEI into a K-rich, chemically homogenized interphase. Our findings demonstrate that low flammability alone does not ensure thermal safety; rather, interfacial reactivity governs risk. Engineering the SEI composition, controlling salt–solvent coordination, and selecting suitable binders are essential for suppressing sub-100 °C reactivity while maintaining electrochemical performance."},{"t":"从单核细胞到组织驻留巨噬细胞的转变需要 DHPS","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09972-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tissue-resident macrophages (RTMs) form during embryogenesis, self-renew locally, and regulate tissue homeostasis by clearing dead cells and debris1,2,3,4,5,6. During tissue damage, however, bone-marrow-derived monocytes enter tissues and differentiate into RTMs, repairing the tissue and replenishing macrophages in the niche1. The universal cell-intrinsic mechanisms that control the monocyte-to-RTM transition and the maintenance of mature RTMs across tissues remain elusive3. Here we show that deoxyhypusine synthase (DHPS), an enzyme that mediates spermidine-dependent hypusine modification of translation factor eIF5A5,7, is required for RTM differentiation and maintenance. Mice with myeloid cell lack of DHPS (Dhps-ΔM mice) had a global defect in RTMs across tissues, resulting in persistent but ultimately futile monocyte influx. Transcriptional analyses of DHPS-deficient macrophages indicated a block in their ability to differentiate into mature RTMs, whereas proteomics revealed defects in cell adhesion and signalling pathways. Sequencing of ribosome-engaged transcripts identified a subset of mRNAs involved in cell adhesion and signalling that rely on DHPS for efficient translation. Imaging of DHPS-deficient macrophages in tissues showed differences in morphology and tissue interactions, which were correlated with their failed RTM differentiation. DHPS-deficient macrophages were also defective in critical homeostatic RTM functions including efferocytosis and tissue maintenance. Together, our results demonstrate a cell-intrinsic, tissue-agnostic pathway that drives differentiation of monocyte-derived macrophages into RTMs."},{"t":"纤维丛对称性在几何深度学习中的作用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2416552123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"几何深度学习","kp":["[深度学习框架]: 纤维化对称性扩展至局部对称"],"dp":1,"as":"本文探讨纤维丛对称性（fibration symmetries）在几何深度学习中的角色。几何深度学习（GDL）从对称性视角统一了图神经网络、流形学习等多种机器学习方法。研究将纤维丛理论引入GDL框架，推广传统等变性概念，使其能处理更丰富的几何结构——如规范场、向量丛上的数据。这为构建具备更强几何先验的深度学习模型提供了新的数学基础。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"The role of fibration symmetries in geometric deep learning","b":"Geometric Deep Learning (GDL) unifies a broad class of machine learning techniques from the perspectives of symmetries, offering a framework for introducing problem-specific inductive biases like Graph Neural Networks (GNNs). However, the current formulation of GDL is limited to global symmetries. We propose to relax GDL to allow for local symmetries, specifically fibration symmetries, which only require isomorphic input trees-a property that is much more common in real-world graphs. We show that GNNs apply the inductive bias of fibration symmetries and derive a tighter upper bound for their expressive power. Additionally, by identifying symmetries in networks, we compress network nodes, thereby increasing their computational efficiency during both inference and training of deep neural networks. The mathematical extension introduced here applies beyond graphs to manifolds, bundles, and grids for the development of models with inductive biases induced by local symmetries that can lead to better generalization."},{"t":"富人在出售游艇的那一年不再购买游艇","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-03605-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"桥锰石巨晶驱动岩浆海洋分离的潜力","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10063-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Earth’s early mantle probably existed as a deep, vigorously convecting magma ocean, and its solidification is considered central to the long-term chemical and dynamical evolution of the planet. Yet a notable uncertainty is the grain size of bridgmanite—the dominant lower-mantle phase—whose nucleation behaviour at extreme pressure has remained experimentally inaccessible. Here we show, using a combination of cutting-edge techniques, including large-scale molecular dynamics simulations consisting of up to 1 million atoms driven by machine learning potentials (MLPs), seeding and enhanced sampling, that crystal–melt interfacial energies of MgSiO3 bridgmanite increase substantially with pressure, surpassing those of silicate–liquid systems at ambient pressure by a factor of up to ten (refs. 1,2,3). In a deep basal magma ocean (BMO), this amplified interfacial energy, combined with the potential sluggish cooling, may permit the formation of unusually large bridgmanite crystals, up to centimetre-to-metre-scale sizes. Such potentially large crystals could drive efficient fractional crystallization and cause substantial chemical differentiation and mantle compaction. If operative, this mechanism would provide a new physical pathway linking lower-mantle material properties to early Earth stratification and it motivates future geodynamic models that explicitly incorporate supercooling, compositional convection and elemental partitioning. Our findings thus offer a plausible hypothesis connecting microscopic nucleation processes with macroscopic planetary structure, refining present views of how the Earth’s interior acquired its initial compositional architecture."},{"t":"膜锚定桥状脂质转运蛋白摄取脂质的分子机制","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520399123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lipid transport by bridge-like lipid transfer proteins (BLTPs) is emerging as a key process in lipid and cellular metabolism in both physiological and pathological conditions. However, the precise mechanism of lipid transport by BLTPs has remained elusive. Here, we use extensive all-atom molecular dynamics simulations to characterize the precise mechanism of lipid transfer into the BLTP hydrophobic cavity from donor membranes. For multiple BLTPs, we observe the ability to extract and solubilize lipids without lipid selectivity, and we identify membrane destabilization as a critical parameter to achieve effective lipid desorption. We rationally design a mutant BLTP with altered ability to destabilize lipid bilayers, and we show that this abolishes lipid desorption in silico and protein function in vivo. Taken together, our data provide an atomic-level description of the mechanism of lipid transport by BLTPs, ultimately suggesting alternative strategies to interfere with their activity."},{"t":"来自欧洲最早的象骨工具：一种意想不到的用于精确敲击阿舍利手斧的原材料","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1390?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Organic knapping tools made from bone, antler, and wood were essential to early human toolkits but are rarely preserved in the archeological record. The earliest known soft hammers, dating to ~480,000 years ago, come from Boxgrove (UK), where modified antlers and large mammal bones were used alongside flint hard hammers. These tools facilitated complex knapping techniques, such as platform preparation and tranchet flake removal, contributing to the production of finely worked ovate handaxes typical of the Boxgrove Acheulean industry. This study presents a cortical bone fragment from an elephant, deliberately shaped into a percussor for resharpening flint tools. It represents the earliest known use of elephant bone in Europe and the first documented case of its use as a knapping hammer. Reconstructing its life history offers further insights into Middle Pleistocene hominin technological adaptations, resourcefulness, and survival strategies that enabled humans to endure harsh northern environments."},{"t":"全球土壤盐分增加对无机碳变化的贡献","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522643123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Soil salinization poses a serious environmental challenge, but the impact of global salinity on SIC (Soil Inorganic Carbon) remains unclear. Using 94,515 samples from 0 to 200 cm depth, combined with subregional classification (such as soil type, land use, climate, geomorphology, and soil texture) which helps address spatial heterogeneity, we obtain relatively accurate global distribution data for EC (Electrical Conductivity) and SIC. EC of 0 to 40 cm layer positively influences SIC in most taxonomic subregions, which may be due to the inorganic [Formula: see text] absorption influenced by pH and salinity. EC of 80 to 100 cm layer sometimes negatively influences SIC due to the increase of soil depth. When EC is below 4 dS/m, EC often positively influences SIC. When EC increases by 2 to 4 dS/m, the mean global SIC in 0 to 20, 20 to 40, and 80 to 100 cm layers increases from 66.15, 78.75, and 117.39 to 174.47 to 190.38, 132.76 to 154.98, and 149.14 to 161.37 g/kg, respectively. The increase is relatively high but similar overall, which deserves high attention. These findings elucidate the dynamics of carbon-salt coupling in the soil-atmosphere-water system, offering pivotal scientific insights for carbon-neutrality strategies."},{"t":"7千个原子实现叠加态：迄今最大\"薛定谔的猫","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00227-2","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"宏观量子叠加态","kp":["[规模]: 7000原子宏观叠加态薛定谔猫"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.5,"d":3.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"","ot":"The biggest ‘Schrödinger’s cat’ yet — physicists put 7,000 atoms in superposition","cl":"d03bc6027e","cp":0,"cln":"实验团队|7000原子叠加态宏观薛定谔猫|实验突破|2026-01-22"},{"t":"美国页岩能源行业在全球经济碎片化的情况下引导国内政策","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000108?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"页岩气政策","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":4,"d":0,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"来自空间快照的时间组织动力学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09876-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Physiological and pathological processes such as inflammation and cancer emerge from interactions between cells over time1. However, methods to follow cell populations over time within the native context of a human tissue are lacking because a biopsy offers only a single snapshot. Here we present one-shot tissue dynamics reconstruction (OSDR), an approach to estimate a dynamical model of cell populations based on a single tissue sample. OSDR uses spatial proteomics to learn how the composition of cellular neighbourhoods influences division rate, providing a dynamical model of cell population change over time. We apply OSDR to human breast cancer data2,3,4, and reconstruct two fixed points of fibroblasts and macrophage interactions5,6. These fixed points correspond to hot and cold fibrosis7, in agreement with co-culture experiments that measured these dynamics directly8. We then use OSDR to discover a pulse-generating excitable circuit of T and B cells in the tumour microenvironment, suggesting temporal flares of anticancer immune responses. Finally, we study longitudinal biopsies from a triple-negative breast cancer clinical trial3, in which OSDR predicts the collapse of the tumour cell population in responders but not in non-responders, based on early-treatment biopsies. OSDR can be applied to a wide range of spatial proteomics assays to enable analysis of tissue dynamics based on patient biopsies."},{"t":"协同与稳定：高熵单原子催化剂的崛起","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522135?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"高熵单原子催化剂","kp":["[策略]: 高熵单原子催化剂解耦活性-稳定性权衡","[活性位]: 多组分动态集合重构"],"as":"高熵单原子催化剂（HE-SACs）将高熵合金（HEA）的成分调控灵活性与单原子催化剂（SACs）近100%原子利用率和明确活性位点两大优势融为一体，成为催化领域前沿方向。高熵效应赋予催化剂在多组分协同下的稳定性和可调谐电子结构，使其在CO₂还原、氧还原等关键反应中展现优异的活性和耐久性。综述系统梳理了HE-SACs的设计策略、合成方法、协同机制及稳定性起源，指出其突破传统SACs在高温苛刻条件下易团聚失活的瓶颈，为下一代高效长寿命催化剂提供了新路径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":4.5},"ot":"Synergy and Stability: The Rise of High‐Entropy Single‐Atom Catalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  While single‐atom catalysts (SACs) achieve nearly 100% atom utilization and provide well‐defined active sites, their development is hindered by a fundamental trade‐off between activity and stability. High‐entropy single‐atom catalysts (HESACs) address this by reconfiguring the active site from a single‐metal center into a dynamic, multi‐component ensemble. This strategy effectively decouples this long‐standing challenge in atomically dispersed catalysts. This review explores how HESACs redefine the active site from a static, single site to a dynamic, multisite ensemble, a concept that directly addresses the limitations of conventional SACs. We first elucidate the unique stabilization mechanisms in HESACs, where high configurational entropy, severe lattice distortion, and slow diffusion synergistically immobilize single atoms and create a flexible electronic landscape. Subsequently, a system analysis of precision synthesis strategies is presented, highlighting pathways to achieve atomic‐level control over complex compositions. We focus on their application in electrocatalysis and energy storage, where HESACs demonstrate enhanced performance through multisite synergy and entropy‐driven stabilization. Particular emphasis on reaction‐oriented design principles, structural engineering strategies, and advanced characterization, which enable a rational design of HESACs. Finally, we discuss future challenges and opportunities, positioning HESACs as a versatile materials platform showing promise for the development of next‐generation electrocatalysts and energy storage materials."},{"t":"硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶上*NO偶联与*H供给的协同调控驱动高效电还原","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522680?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原","kp":["[催化剂]: 硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶Fe0@S","[机理]: 协同*NO耦合与*H供给高选择性产N2"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学硝酸盐（NO₃⁻）还原为氮气（N₂）是环境修复领域的前沿方向，可同时消除水中硝酸盐污染并回收氮资源。该研究聚焦硫掺杂零价金属催化剂，通过协同调控*NO中间体偶联与*H氢供给两条关键反应路径，优化还原反应选择性和效率。硫掺杂通过调节催化剂表面电子结构，促进NO₃⁻到NO₂⁻再到N₂的多电子转移过程，抑制竞争性析氢副反应。该策略为设计高效电催化硝酸盐还原体系提供了分子层面的设计准则，在含氮废水处理方面具实际应用潜力。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Synergistic Regulation of *NO Coupling and *H Supply on Sulfur‐Doped Zero‐Valent Iron Aerogels Drives Efficient Electror","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrochemical nitrate (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ) reduction to dinitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ) is a promising approach for environmental remediation but suffers from the sluggish\n                    *\n                    NO coupling and excessive\n                    *\n                    H supply on traditional electrocatalysts. Herein, we construct a sulfur‐doped zero‐valent iron (Fe\n                    0\n                    @S) aerogel that enables highly selective electrochemical nitrate‐to‐dinitrogen conversion via\n                    *\n                    NO→\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O→N\n                    2\n                    path by synchronously regulating\n                    *\n                    H supply and\n                    *\n                    NO coupling. Mechanistic studies reveal that the aerogel's 3D porous framework enriches local NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    near active sites, while strategic sulfur incorporation can weaken H\n                    2\n                    O adsorption and tune\n                    *\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    binding strength, thereby lowering the energy barrier for\n                    *\n                    NO coupling into\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O and subsequent reduction to N\n                    2\n                    . With a flow‐through electrolyzer, we achieve near‐complete removal of 50 mg/L NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    from real surface and ground water with a high N\n                    2\n                    selectivity above 90%. This work provides a practical NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    remediation method based on non‐noble metals and presents a simple strategy for the design of catalyst structure to improve N\n                    2\n                    selectivity."},{"t":"交变磁性的对称性、显微镜学和光谱学特征","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09883-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of altermagnetism was in part motivated by the research of compensated magnets towards highly scalable spintronic technologies. Simultaneously, altermagnetism shares the anisotropic higher-partial-wave nature of ordering with unconventional superfluid phases, which have been at the forefront of research for the past several decades. These examples illustrate the interest in altermagnetism from a broad range of science and technology perspectives. Here we review the symmetry, microscopy and spectroscopy signatures of altermagnetism. We describe the spontaneously broken and retained symmetries that delineate altermagnetism as a distinct phase of matter with d-, g- or i-wave compensated collinear spin ordering. In materials ranging from weakly interacting metals to strongly correlated insulators, the microscopic crystal-structure realizations of the altermagnetic symmetries feature a characteristic ferroic order of anisotropic higher-partial-wave components of atomic-scale spin densities. These symmetry and microscopy signatures of altermagnetism are directly reflected in spin-dependent electronic spectra and responses. We review salient band-structure features originating from the altermagnetic ordering, and from its interplay with spin–orbit coupling and topological phenomena. Throughout, we compare altermagnetism with traditional ferromagnetism and Néel antiferromagnetism, and with magnetic phases with symmetry-protected compensated non-collinear spin orders. We accompany the theoretical discussions with references to relevant experiments.","tp":"交变磁性态","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":8,"i":2,"r":5,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"本文综述了交变磁性（altermagnetism）这一新发现磁性物态的对称性、显微学和光谱学特征。交变磁性兼具零净磁化的补偿磁性和自旋分裂能带结构，在自旋电子学和高可扩展器件领域具有广阔前景，同时与非传统超流体的各向异性高阶偏波有序特性存在深层联系。"},{"t":"钙钛矿表面静电梯度促进金属原位溶出与固体氧化物电解池CO2电解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520056?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物CO2电解","kp":["[驱动力]: 表面静电梯度控制金属原位溶出","[应用]: 固体氧化物电解池CO2电解"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿材料中原位溶出（in situ exsolution）金属纳米颗粒是提升催化剂活性和稳定性的关键策略，广泛用于固体氧化物燃料电池电极等高温催化体系。该研究发现钙钛矿表面的静电势梯度可显著促进金属离子向表面迁移并还原析出纳米颗粒的过程。表面静电梯度调控了氧空位形成能和金属-氧键能，降低了溶出反应的能垒，使得纳米颗粒更均匀、牢固地锚定在表面。这一机制为理性设计可自修复、抗烧结的高性能钙钛矿催化剂提供了全新理论基础，有望突破高温催化剂寿命瓶颈。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Surface Electrostatic Gradient of Perovskite Boosts Metal in Situ Exsolution and CO2 Electrolysis in Solid Oxide Electro","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The in situ exsolution of nanoparticles (NPs) has brought new opportunities for the application of perovskite‐based catalysts in solid oxide electrolyzers. However, the kinetic driving force controlling cation migration and subsequent metal nucleation is not yet fully understood. Here we identified surface electrostatic gradient as the decisive kinetic factor in governing metal exsolution by treating La\n                    0.3\n                    Ca\n                    0.6\n                    Ti\n                    0.9\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    Ni\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    3−δ\n                    (LCTMN) with NaBH\n                    4\n                    of different concentrations. Multi‐scale characterizations revealed that different spatial distribution of surface oxygen vacancy induced positive surface potential shift and established electrostatic gradients that attracted Ni\n                    2+\n                    cations toward LCTMN surface, thereby driving Ni\n                    2+\n                    migration and reduction. Moreover, theoretical calculations demonstrated that surface oxygen vacancies reduced Ni segregation energy and work function of LCTMN, elucidating the critical role of electronic redistribution in accelerating in situ exsolution. Consequently, treatment of LCTMN with 3.0 M NaBH\n                    4\n                    yielded a high‐density dispersion of uniform Ni NPs with abundant strongly anchored interfacial sites for CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation. Notably, it delivered maximal current density of 1.25 A cm\n                    −2\n                    and CO Faraday efficiency of 94.23%, coupled with a superior 100‐hour stability, surpassing all counterparts. This study establishes a direct link between surface potential and exsolution kinetics, providing a universal paradigm for designing high‐performance perovskites with desirable reactivity.","aip":1},{"t":"供体共掺杂钙钛矿中的超质子传导","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521773?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿质子导体","kp":["[材料]: BaSc₁₋ₓ₋ᵧMoₓWᵧO₃₋δ","[掺杂]: Mo/W施主共掺杂","工作温度[质子导电]: 200-400°C","[性能]: 超质子电导"],"as":"本研究首次探索了通过供体掺杂氧缺陷型BaScO₂.₅钙钛矿材料实现高质子导电性的策略。研究团队通过共掺杂方法调控晶格中的氧空位结构，显著提升了材料在中温区（300-600°C）的质子传输性能。该发现为固态氧化物燃料电池、质子陶瓷电池等清洁能源器件提供了新型电解质材料候选，突破了传统质子导体在稳定性和电导率方面的瓶颈。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Superprotonic Conduction in Donor Co‐Doped Perovskites","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Donor doping of oxygen‐deficient BaScO\n                    2.5\n                    is an unexplored strategy for achieving high proton conductivity at intermediate temperatures of 200−400 °C. In this work, a new series of BaSc\n                    1−\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    −\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    Mo\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    W\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    O\n                    3−\n                    \n                      δ\n                    \n                    compounds was prepared via Mo/W donor co‐doping where\n                    x\n                    is the Mo content,\n                    y\n                    is the W content, and\n                    δ\n                    is the amount of oxygen vacancies. The present work reports the enhancement of proton conductivity by the Mo/W donor co‐doping of BaScO\n                    2.5\n                    . BaSc\n                    0.8\n                    Mo\n                    0.1\n                    W\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2.8\n                    exhibits exceptional proton conductivity—0.10 S cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 315 °C and 0.01 S cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 193 °C—alongside outstanding chemical stability in CO\n                    2\n                    , O\n                    2\n                    , and H\n                    2\n                    atmospheres. The high proton conductivity originates from the synergistic effects of abundant oxygen vacancies (\n                    δ\n                     = 0.2) and full hydration, yielding a high proton concentration, coupled with high proton diffusivity. The high diffusivity is attributable to the reduced proton trapping compared with acceptor and isovalent doping and overdoping due to higher proton concentration. In contrast to the acceptor co‐doping, the donor co‐doping does not increase the activation energy, resulting in lower activation energy and higher proton conductivity. These findings establish donor co‐doping into the oxygen‐deficient perovskites as a powerful design principle for next‐generation proton conductors with high proton conductivity at intermediate temperatures."},{"t":"超级增强子塑造癌症中转录相关 DNA 断裂的景观和修复动态","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6379?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cancer is characterized by uncontrolled proliferation accompanied by oncogene hypertranscription, leading to transcription stress, a key source of DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) that jeopardize genomic stability. Despite its importance, the landscape and consequences of transcription stress remain underexplored. Here, we used maps of DSBs identified through sBLISS (in-suspension break labeling in situ and sequencing) with transcription stress markers to delineate the transcription stress landscape in cancer. We found that transcription stress sites are shaped by the superenhancer regulatory landscape. Notably, γH2AX is enriched at transcription stress sites; however, not all DSB-enriched genes show similar γH2AX marking. Instead, genes with DSBs tied to transcription stress are distinctly marked. Genes with high DSBs marked by γH2AX exhibited substantially higher DSB turnover and repair than those with low γH2AX, and are associated with vulnerability to mutagenesis. These findings underscore superenhancer activity as a determinant of the transcription stress landscape in cancer, posing a threat to the genomic stability of oncogenes."},{"t":"生命最初 1000 天内的糖配给和终生心力衰竭的风险","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68713-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Elevated sugar intake has been linked to poor cardiovascular health, but the effects of early-life sugar restriction on the lifelong risk of heart failure remain unclear. Using the end of sugar rationing in the United Kingdom in 1953 as a natural experiment, we classify participants in the UK Biobank by birth timing to define early-life exposure to sugar rationing. Here we show that individuals exposed to early-life sugar rationing exhibit an approximately 14% lower risk of heart failure and develop the condition about 2.6 years later than those unexposed. Longer exposure is associated with stronger effects, and population-level estimates suggest that around 4–5% of heart failure cases may be attributable to the absence of early-life sugar restriction. Genetic susceptibility does not modify these associations but acts additively. These findings underscore the long-term importance of early-life sugar exposure for heart failure, and further studies are warranted."},{"t":"结构无序诱导的动态亲氧表面促进O*自由基二聚化实现高效酸性析氧","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506570?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氧催化剂","kp":["反应机制[酸性OER]: 氧化物路径机制OPM","催化剂[PEMWE阳极]: 结构无序动态亲氧表面","催化机制[O*]: 促进O*自由基二聚"],"as":"该研究提出通过结构无序诱导产生动态亲氧表面，促进O*自由基二聚化反应，从而提升质子交换膜水电解槽（PEMWE）的析氧催化性能。PEMWE约占全球绿氢生产设备成本的30%，降低阳极催化剂的铱用量是规模化关键。新型催化剂通过表面动态重构形成活性位点，加速O-O键偶联，实现了更高的催化效率与稳定性。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Structure Disorder‐Induced Dynamic Oxophilic Surface Boosting O* Radical Dimerization for Superior Acid Oxygen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Globally, the proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs) already account for approximately 30% of the hydrogen market and are undergoing rapid expansion. However, the commercially used iridium‐based anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) catalysts in PEMWEs still suffer from notably poor reactivity. At present, the oxide pathway mechanism (OPM) is an important route to achieve both high activity and durability in OER. Nevertheless, the performance of conventional Ir‐based crystalline OER catalysts following the OPM pathway remains far below their theoretical limit, which is significantly hindered by two intrinsic limitations. First, their rigid lattice structures prevent the shortening of metal‐metal distances, which is essential to facilitate the rate‐determining O\n                    *\n                    ─O\n                    *\n                    dimerization. Second, the repulsion between O\n                    *\n                    adsorbates during OER inevitably weakens the metal = O\n                    *\n                    bond and undermines the overall oxygen evolution efficiency. Herein, we report that an amorphous IrMO\n                    x\n                    catalyst elegantly overcomes the limitations of the OPM pathway by virtue of its dynamic surface structure and strong oxophilicity of M.  The dynamic surface structure promotes O\n                    *\n                    ─O\n                    *\n                    coupling, while the oxophilic nature of M compensates for the inherent weakening of the metal = O\n                    *\n                    bond during OER. Because of that, the catalyst exhibits outstanding OER performance, along with excellent catalytic durability over 1200 h’ PEM testing."},{"t":"HDV 病毒粒子及其核糖核蛋白的结构特征","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519809123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hepatitis D virus (HDV) is a small RNA satellite virus of hepatitis B virus (HBV) which encodes a single protein, HDV delta antigen (HDAg), that is required for replication. Viral replication occurs independently from HBV and relies primarily on host RNA polymerase(s). Bulevirtide, a viral entry inhibitor, is the only approved treatment for chronic HDV but has a low cure rate as a monotherapy, and most patients rebound following cessation of therapy. It is likely that an inhibitor targeting HDV replication is necessary to achieve HDV cure, but the paucity of HDV-derived elements and limited understanding of HDV replication presents a significant therapeutic challenge. Understanding the precise mechanism of interactions between HDAg and viral RNA, and how it is packaged within the virion can inspire structure-guided drug design targeting replication. Using cryoelectron tomography and single particle cryoelectron microscopy, we present reconstructions of the virion and viral RNPs. We observed multiple binding configurations in vitro that suggest a propensity to arrange four RNA segments around repeating units of HDAg in a ladder-like formation. The oligomerization domains of a homo-octameric HDAg complex are directly involved in RNA binding by utilizing the vertices and sides of its square-shaped architecture to bind RNA in a sequence-promiscuous fashion. Structure-function analysis reveals that these RNA contact sites are important for viral replication and their disruption may be a potential avenue for next-generation antivirals to treat HDV."},{"t":"胞囊菌酰胺中钴胺素依赖性自由基 S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶重复甲基化的结构基础","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527019123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cystobactamids are nonribosomal peptide natural products that function as DNA gyrase inhibitors, exhibiting significant antibacterial activity. They are isolated from Cystobacter sp. Cbv34 and contain various alkoxy groups on para-aminobenzoic acid moieties, which are believed to play a crucial role in antibacterial functions. The alkoxy groups are generated by iterative methylations on a methoxy group by the cobalamin (Cbl)-dependent radical S-adenosylmethionine (SAM) enzyme CysS. CysS catalyzes up to three methylations to give ethoxy, isopropoxy, sec-butoxy, and tert-butoxy groups. For each methylation, CysS uses a ping-pong mechanism in which two molecules of SAM are consumed. One SAM is used to methylate cob(I)alamin, while another generates a 5'-deoxyadenosyl 5'-radical to initiate substrate methylation. However, little is known about how the enzyme promotes both Cbl methylation and iterative substrate methylation, which occur by polar SN2 and radical processes, respectively. Here, we report three X-ray crystal structures of a homolog of CysS from Corallococcus sp. CA054B. Two were determined in the presence of methoxy- and ethoxy-containing substrates, showing how CysS accommodates substrates and products during iterative methylation. The third structure, determined in the absence of a substrate, exhibits structural changes that reorient the SAM's conformation to allow for the methylation of cob(I)alamin."},{"t":"空间调节的 mRNA 翻译使功能性膜蛋白能够整合到合成细胞中","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517323123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Synthetic cells aim to emulate living systems by reconstituting essential cellular processes within lipid-bound architectures. However, their functional complexity remains constrained by a key challenge: the synthesis and correct integration of hydrophobic membrane proteins via cell-free approaches. Here, inspired by natural cells, we developed a spatially regulated translation strategy in which membrane-anchored mRNAs recruit ribosomes to drive the cotranslational insertion of membrane proteins into lipid bilayers. This design enables efficient in situ synthesis and integration of multiple transmembrane proteins within giant unilamellar vesicles, supporting selective small-molecule transport across membranes. Importantly, the method allows for precise stoichiometric control of membrane protein composition. Together, this work establishes a minimal yet versatile framework for the direct synthesis and integration of membrane proteins, advancing the construction of functional synthetic cells.","tp":"膜蛋白合成","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7,"i":3,"r":5,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"研究团队开发了空间调节的mRNA翻译策略，模仿天然细胞中膜锚定mRNA招募核糖体的机制，实现了疏水性膜蛋白在无细胞体系中的共翻译插入。该方法突破了合成细胞功能复杂度的瓶颈，使功能性膜蛋白能够正确整合到脂质体结构中，为构建更复杂的合成细胞奠定了基础。"},{"t":"国际货币基金组织条件下的太阳能转型：巴基斯坦的分配正义和能源政策势在必行","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000042?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"太阳能转型","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":4,"d":0,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"软巨磁阻抗电子器件实现非接触式人机交互","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526097123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic sensing enables contact-free, three-dimensional human-machine interactions (HMI) with high selectivity and resilience to environmental noise. However, conventional magnetic films, mostly obtained via vacuum deposition, remain constrained by rigidity, instantaneous response, and single-mode. Here, we report a giant magnetoimpedance ionogel (GelGMI) in which electrostatically self-assembled ferromagnetic (FM) domains are uniformly dispersed in a soft ionogel matrix. Under a magnetic field, domain moments realign to reconfigure ionic pathways, yielding pronounced magnetoimpedance while maintaining performance at >1,000% strain and across orientations. The hysteretic relaxation of domain magnetization imparts retrospective neuron-like temporal summation, realizing sequence- and context-aware interaction. In addition, the self-healable matrix supports a complementary tactile mode whose impedance contrasts with contact-free magnetic proximity, enabling expandable and bimodal recognition. GelGMI delivers a record-high sensitivity while unifying stretchable, neuromorphic, and healable capabilities for contact-free HMI systems.","tp":"磁阻抗传感","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7,"i":5,"r":5,"d":6,"t":6},"as":"研究者开发了巨磁阻抗离子凝胶（GelGMI）柔性电子器件，将铁磁畴通过静电自组装均匀分散于软离子凝胶基底中。该器件在磁场作用下实现高灵敏度响应，克服了传统磁膜的刚性限制，实现了非接触式三维人机交互，在可穿戴设备和软体机器人领域具有应用潜力。"},{"t":"行星自转减慢影响海洋养分循环和氧合作用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw3368?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Marine habitability for complex life on Earth and Earth-like planets requires bioavailable nutrients and dissolved oxygen. The cycling of nutrients and oxygen is controlled by physical ocean circulation. However, our understanding of how circulation has varied through time and space is incomplete for Earth and unconstrained for Earth-like exoplanets. Earth's rotation has slowed over time, affecting ocean circulation by modifying the Coriolis effect. We use a three-dimensional Earth system model to explore how slowing planetary rotation influences ocean circulation and biogeochemistry. We show that slower rotation enhances wind-driven upwelling and global circulation. Nutrient recycling is consequently more efficient, increasing photosynthetic productivity. Additionally, enhanced ocean oxygenation improves habitability for aerobic life under a well-oxygenated atmosphere. However, under a poorly oxygenated atmosphere, slowing rotation increases oxygen fluxes from the ocean to the atmosphere. Therefore, Earth's rotational history may have been a long-term background control on surface oxygenation and the evolution of animals."},{"t":"睡眠不足会导致胆固醇相关的髓磷脂功能障碍","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523438123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The increasing prevalence of sleep deprivation poses a public health challenge in modern society. Manifestations of reduced alertness, such as slowed reaction times and increased errors, are well-documented behavioral indicators of sleep loss (SL). Yet, the biological consequences of sleep deprivation and their role in behavioral impairment remain elusive. Our study reveals significant effects of sleep deprivation on myelin integrity. As a result, we identify increased conduction delays in nerve signal propagation, hindered interhemispheric synchronization, and impaired cognitive and motor performance associated with SL. By profiling oligodendrocyte transcriptome and lipidome, we observe SL-induced endoplasmic reticulum stress and lipid metabolism dysregulation, particularly affecting cholesterol homeostasis. Boosting cholesterol transport to myelin sheaths prevents SL effects on nerve signal propagation and behavior. Our findings highlight a possible role of oligodendrocyte cholesterol dysregulation in behavioral deficits associated with SL and unveil a novel target for intervention."},{"t":"尺寸依赖性结构转变决定镍钌双金属催化剂的协同作用与功能","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4017792?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双金属催化剂","kp":["催化剂[生物质+CO2共转化]: Ni-Ru/CeO2双金属","[尺寸效应]: 原子级分散决定结构与功能转变"],"as":"该研究聚焦Ni-Ru双金属催化剂的协同效应，揭示了颗粒尺寸依赖的结构转变对催化性能的决定性作用。通过精确调控双金属组分的原子级排列与界面结构，研究发现不同尺寸下Ni与Ru的电子相互作用和几何构型发生可逆转变，从而显著影响催化活性与选择性。这一发现为理性设计高性能双金属催化剂提供了尺寸工程策略，对能源催化、电化学转化等领域具有重要指导意义。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Size‐Dependent Structural Transitions Dictate Synergy and Function in Ni‐Ru Bimetallic Catalysts","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Precise control over synergistic interactions is essential for the rational design of bimetallic catalysts, yet the governing role of metal particle size remains elusive. Here, we uncover a general size‐dependent principle that dictates structural and functional transitions in Ni‐Ru/CeO\n                    2\n                    catalysts during the co‐conversion of biomass and CO\n                    2\n                    . Atomically dispersed Ni and Ru sites on CeO\n                    2\n                    exhibit pronounced synergistic effects that markedly enhance CO\n                    2\n                    reforming of biomass, arising from the presence of independent metallic sites. In contrast, Ni nanoparticles with interspersed Ru form Ni‐Ru alloys that confer exceptional stability with only moderate activity loss. This size‐dependent structural transition induces a functional switch governing reaction pathway, coke deposition from encapsulated carbon to carbon nanotubes, and the trade‐off between catalytic activity and durability. These findings elucidate the mechanistic basis of size‐dependent interactions in Ni‐Ru bimetallic systems and guide the rational design of stable, high‐performance catalysts."},{"t":"ADHD 研究的六大亮点","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00099-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"2026 年值得关注的七项技术","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00188-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"基于物理机理经济非线性模型预测控制的住宅能源枢纽序贯运行","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000541?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源枢纽优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Sequential operation of residential energy hubs using physics-based economic nonlinear MPC"},{"t":"通过连续光还原进行连续自由基阴离子聚合","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521319?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Polymeric properties are intimately entwined with the diversities of structures, making the development of polymerization methods highly valuable to both academic research and industrial applications. Although radical and anionic polymerization techniques have been widely used, both currently have intrinsic limitations. For example, anionic polymerizations heavily rely on highly reactive alkyl metals and alkali metals (e.g., lithium), which involve energy‐intensive synthesis and hazardous handling. Herein, we report a sequential radical‐anionic (co‐)polymerization, where the in situ generation of carbon radicals and carbanions via photoreduction enables augmentation of the monomer repertoire. This approach eliminates lithium dependency and its associated resource, energy, and safety concerns. Mechanistic studies support the sequential radical‐anionic chain‐growing mechanism enabled by photo‐induced consecutive single‐electron transfer reduction. This strategy has the potential to overcome the intrinsic restriction in copolymerizing monomers with electronic property disparities, thereby extending the synthetic utilization of anionic polymerization in polymer science. Furthermore, the process and vulcanization of large‐scale synthesized terminal‐functionalized rubbers further prove the practical applications of this strategy.","tp":"光控聚合","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究者开发了连续光还原驱动的自由基-阴离子聚合新方法。传统阴离子聚合依赖高反应性烷基金属和碱金属，能耗高且条件苛刻；该方法利用光催化交替激活自由基和阴离子聚合路径，实现了对聚合物结构的精确控制，兼具两种聚合技术的优势，具有显著的工业应用前景。"},{"t":"将婴儿送入托儿所可以彻底重塑他们的微生物组","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00178-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"使用 NQO1 可激活的前药选择性靶向 NRF2 高水平的胰腺导管腺癌","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511733123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Activation of transcription factor NRF2 in pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) promotes aggressive tumor phenotype and protection from therapy-induced oxidative stress. We postulated that NRF2high PDAC can be selectively targeted by C29h, a prodrug that is activated by the NRF2-induced enzyme NAD(P)H:quinone oxidoreductase-1 (NQO1), which is elevated in human pancreatic tumors. Initial evaluations of C29h alone or together with the standard-of-care chemotherapeutic drug gemcitabine were conducted on NQO1high human and mouse PDAC cell lines and patient-derived organoids. As PDAC is enriched in collagen-containing extracellular matrix (ECM) that activates NRF2 and induces NQO1 expression, we examined the ECM effect on the response to C29h, as well as in vivo tumor control in IKKα-deficient KrasG12D/IkkαΔPEC mice in which NRF2 is strongly activated, immunocompromised Nu/Nu mice orthotopically transplanted with human PDAC cells and C57BL/6n and NOD/SCID mice transplanted with mouse PDAC. C29h led to NQO1-dependent killing of human and mouse PDAC cell lines and organoids and acted additively with gemcitabine. Furthermore, ECM-plated PDAC cells were more susceptible to C29h cytotoxicity than cells grown on plastic. Importantly, C29h treatment induced tumor regression and increased the survival of PDAC-bearing mice and optimal C29h-induced tumor regression was dependent on CD8+ T lymphocytes whose tumoral recruitment was enhanced by drug treatment. This study supports the use of C29h alone or as part of a drug combination as an effective and promising strategy for selective eradication of NRF2high PDAC."},{"t":"薛定谔的猫更大了：量子物理学家创造有史以来最大'叠加态'","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00177-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子宏观叠加态","kp":["[量子叠加]: 迄今最大规模宏观物体叠加态"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":9.0},"as":"","ot":"Schrödinger’s cat just got bigger: quantum physicists create largest ever ‘superposition’","cl":"d03bc6027e","cp":1,"cln":"实验团队|7000原子叠加态宏观薛定谔猫|实验突破|2026-01-22"},{"t":"缩放活性粒子的玻璃动力学：可调节的脆性和重入","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516624123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Understanding the influence of activity on dense amorphous assemblies is crucial for biological processes such as wound healing, embryogenesis, or cancer progression. Here, we study the effect of self-propulsion forces of amplitude [Formula: see text] and persistence time [Formula: see text] in dense assemblies of soft repulsive particles by simulating a model particle system that interpolates between particulate active matter and biological tissues. We identify the fluid and glass phases of the three-dimensional phase diagram obtained by varying [Formula: see text], [Formula: see text], and the packing fraction [Formula: see text]. The morphology of the phase diagram accounts for a nonmonotonic evolution of the relaxation time with [Formula: see text], which is a direct consequence of the crossover in the dominant relaxation mechanism, from glassy to jamming. A second major consequence is the evolution of the glassy dynamics from sub-Arrhenius to super-Arrhenius. We show that this tunable glass fragility extends to active systems analogous observations reported for passive particles. This analogy allows us to apply a dynamic scaling analysis proposed for the passive case, in order to account for our results for active systems. Finally, we discuss similarities and differences between our results and recent findings in the context of computational models of biological tissues."},{"t":"通过湿膜干预实现钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的可扩展环境制备","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00418-0?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙硅叠层电池","kp":["制备工艺[钙钛矿/硅叠层]: 环境气氛湿膜干预nBASCN","[可扩展制备]: 湿度下高结晶抑制降解","规模[叠层电池]: 可规模化环境制备"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种可规模化的环境条件下（非惰性气氛）制备钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的湿膜干预方法。钙钛矿顶电池的环境可扩展制备对推进叠层电池产业化前景广阔，但面临成膜质量与稳定性的挑战。该湿膜干预策略有望解决环境湿度对钙钛矿薄膜的负面影响，降低制造成本并提升器件效率。","ot":"Scalable ambient fabrication of perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells via wet-film intervention","b":"Scalable ambient fabrication of perovskite top cells is promising for advancing perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells, yet uncontrolled environmental humidity challenges high-quality film preparation. Here, an nBASCN wet-film intervention strategy is innovated to achieve well-regulated crystallization and suppress surface degradation, enabling scalable fabrication of high-performance tandem devices in ambient air."},{"t":"异种核酸的桑格测序","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202516617?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Xeno‐nucleic acids (XNAs) offer biostable genetic polymers for biotechnology and information technology, but are incompatible with prevailing DNA sequencing methodologies. Here we report a Sanger sequencing approach tailored for XNA, enabling direct readout of XNA strands up to 50 bases. This new method relies on a Bst DNA polymerase mutant, which not only recognizes XNA as a template but also efficiently incorporates dideoxyribonucleoside triphosphate (ddNTP) substrates, facilitating sequencing of XNA by synthesis of complementary DNA. The Bst F710Y mutant exhibits at least two orders of magnitude higher activity in catalyzing ddNTP incorporation. Our method demonstrates accurate sequence determination of diverse XNA strands of distinct backbone chemistries such as TNA and FANA. Lastly, we showcase proof‐of‐concept automated XNA sequencing on a genetic analyzer instrument, by leveraging Bst mutant's ability to stochastically incorporate BigDye‐labeled ddNTP substrates in a single reaction. This work establishes a direct sequencing platform for XNA employing a chain termination strategy, and lays a foundation for future de novo identification of functional XNA and development of XNA‐based data storage system.","tp":"异种核酸测","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"as":"研究团队为异种核酸（XNA）开发了定制化的桑格测序方法，利用Bst DNA聚合酶突变体既能识别XNA模板又能高效掺入双脱氧核苷酸底物，实现了长达50个碱基的XNA链直接读取。该方法打破了XNA与主流DNA测序技术不兼容的瓶颈，为XNA在生物技术和信息存储领域的应用提供了关键工具。"},{"t":"SABRE 超极化多通道 19F NMR，可在台式 NMR 上灵敏检测多种疾病标志物酶","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202517348?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The unique multichannel capability of\n                    19\n                    F nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) stands as a pivotal and rapidly advancing frontier in chemistry, biology, and medical imaging. However, its inherent low sensitivity limits its widespread applications. While hyperpolarization significantly enhances\n                    19\n                    F signals, simultaneously hyperpolarizing multiple\n                    19\n                    F‐containing substrates, which is essential for unlocking the multichannel potential of\n                    19\n                    F NMR, remains a key challenge. Here, we introduce an approach that achieves effective and simultaneous hyperpolarization of different\n                    19\n                    F nuclei from several molecular probes through parahydrogen‐based signal amplification by reversible exchange (SABRE). Our strategy utilizes multiple\n                    19\n                    F‐labeled substrates for SABRE, acting as co‐ligands for simultaneous enhancement of their\n                    19\n                    F NMR signal intensities. The synergistic effect among different\n                    19\n                    F‐labeled co‐substrates is evidenced by the much higher signal enhancement, compared to the systems containing only one\n                    19\n                    F‐labeled substrate. The highest enhancement of the\n                    19\n                    F NMR signal reached over 9600‐fold on a benchtop NMR (1.4 T), corresponding to a 4.3% polarization level. On this basis, we successfully implemented multichannel quantitative detection of enzymatic biomarkers at µM levels. By utilizing three\n                    19\n                    F‐labeled pyridine‐based substrates, each bearing a specific enzyme‐responsive moiety, we demonstrate the capability of high‐speed, cost‐efficient, and highly sensitive SABRE‐polarized\n                    19\n                    F NMR for applications in biomarker detection. Our work paves the way for future applications of highly sensitive multichannel\n                    19\n                    F NMR analysis.","tp":"氟核磁共振","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.5},"as":"研究团队利用SABRE（可逆交换自旋化学交换）超极化技术实现了多通道19F核磁共振检测。该方法显著提升了19F NMR的低灵敏度限制，可在台式NMR设备上同时灵敏检测多种疾病标志物酶。多通道19F检测能力为化学、生物学和医学成像领域开辟了新的诊断应用前景。"},{"t":"苏拉威西岛至少有 67,800 年前的岩画","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09968-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Indonesian archipelago is host to some of the earliest known rock art in the world1,2,3,4,5. Previously, secure Pleistocene dates were reported for figurative cave art and stencils of human hands in two areas in Indonesia—the Maros-Pangkep karsts in the southwestern peninsula of the island of Sulawesi1,3,4,5 and the Sangkulirang-Mangkalihat region of eastern Kalimantan, Borneo2. Here we describe a series of early dated rock art motifs from the southeastern portion of Sulawesi. Among this assemblage of Pleistocene (and possibly more recent) motifs, laser-ablation U-series (LA-U-series) dating of calcite overlying a hand stencil from Liang Metanduno on Muna Island yielded a U-series date of 71.6 ± 3.8 thousand years ago (ka), providing a minimum-age constraint of 67.8 ka for the underlying motif. The Muna minimum (67.8 ± 3.8 ka) exceeds the published minimum for rock art in Maros-Pangkep by 16.6 thousand years (kyr) (ref. 5) and is 1.1 kyr greater than the published minimum for a hand stencil from Spain attributed to Neanderthals6, which until now represented the oldest demonstrated minimum-age constraint for cave art worldwide. Moreover, the presence of this extremely old art in Sulawesi suggests that the initial peopling of Sahul about 65 ka7 involved maritime journeys between Borneo and Papua, a region that remains poorly explored from an archaeological perspective."},{"t":"揭示混合等离子体纳米结构中的隐藏途径","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02073-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离激元纳","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"Huang 等人撤回，纳米球阿拉伯半乳聚糖蛋白是高强度粘合剂的关键成分","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/密封材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高强粘合剂","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"撤回说明：VEGFR2 的 SUMO 化调节其细胞内运输和病理性血管生成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-68233-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"末次盛冰期持续存在相对温暖的深水层","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10012-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Last Glacial Maximum (19–23 thousand years ago) was characterized by low greenhouse gas concentrations and continental ice sheets that covered large parts of North America and Europe1. Glacial climate was therefore very different, with colder global mean temperatures and an increased Equator-to-pole temperature gradient, probably resulting in stronger westerlies2. However, the state of the deep North Atlantic Ocean under these glacial climate forcings remains uncertain3,4,5,6, particularly owing to the rarity of deep-ocean temperature and salinity constraints. Here we show that the temperature of the glacial deep (>1.5 km) Northwest Atlantic was approximately 0–2 °C (only 1.8 ± 0.5 °C (2 s.e.) colder than today), and, after accounting for the whole-ocean change, seawater δ18O was 0.3 ± 0.1‰ (2 s.e.) higher and can be traced back to the surface subtropics via the subpolar Northeast Atlantic and Nordic Seas. Together, our hydrographic data reveal the thermal and isotopic structure of the deep Northwest Atlantic and suggest sustained production of relatively warm and probably salty North Atlantic Deep Water during the Last Glacial Maximum. Furthermore, our results provide updated constraints for benchmarking Earth system models used to project future climate change."},{"t":"重塑基于邻碳硼烷的荧光团：硼取代基电荷转移触发聚集与结晶...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521741?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳硼烷荧光材料","kp":["[发光机制]: 硼取代基电荷转移触发AIE/CIE","[突破]: 解除碳原子连接的固有局限"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究重新审视了基于邻碳硼烷的荧光团化合物，重点探讨了硼取代基引起的电荷转移机制对其发光性能的调控作用。该类荧光团因具有聚集诱导发光和结晶诱导发光特性而备受关注，研究成果为设计高效固态发光材料、生物成像探针及光电功能器件提供了新策略和理论依据。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Reimagining o‐Carborane‐Based Fluorophores: Charge‐Transfer from Boron Substituents Triggers Aggregation‐ and Crystalliz","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    o\n                    ‐Carborane‐based fluorophores are widely recognized for their aggregation‐induced and crystallization‐induced emission (AIE and CIE) properties, making them valuable building blocks for materials used in fluorescence applications such as bioimaging or optoelectronics. Until now, observing AIE/CIE required the fluorophore to be attached via the carbon atom of the carborane, inherently limiting further functionalization possibilities. Herein, we report for the first time that boron‐substituted carboranes (substituent is at position 9) exhibit AIE/CIE activity, which originates from photoexcitation‐induced electron‐transfer from the substituents linked to the carborane cage via its boron vertices. Furthermore, the solid state emission can be tailored by the proper selection of the substituents. This finding not only significantly broadens the scope of AIE‐active compounds but also offers new design strategies for the development of luminescent carborane‐based materials."},{"t":"基于多元高斯和切比雪夫映射的进化模糊系统实时风电预测","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000395?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电功率预测","kp":["[预测方法]: 演化模糊系统(多元高斯+Chebyshev映射)","应用[风电]: 实时功率预测"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Real-time wind power forecasting using an evolving fuzzy system based on Multivariate Gaussian and Chebyshev mapping"},{"t":"使用基于宿主-病原体的系统实时时空跟踪密闭环境中的传染病爆发","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2422574123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Deadly infection outbreaks in confined spaces, whether it is a COVID-19 outbreak on a cruise ship or measles and stomach flu outbreaks in schools, can be characterized by their rapid spread due to the abundance of common spaces, shared airways, and high population density. Preventing future outbreaks and developing efficient mitigation protocols can benefit from advanced computational modeling approaches. Here, we developed an agent-based modeling approach to study the spatiotemporal dynamics of an infection outbreak in a confined environment caused by a specific pathogen, and to determine effective containment protocols. The approach integrates the 3D geographic information system of a confined environment, behavior of the hosts, key biological parameters about the pathogen obtained from the experimental data, and the general mechanics of host-pathogen and pathogen-fomite interactions. To assess our approach, we applied it to the historical data of infectious outbreaks caused by norovirus, H1N1 influenza A, and SARS-CoV-2 viruses. Our AI-GIS Infection Dynamics (AGID) model accurately predicted daily infection numbers, correctly identified the day when the CDC vessel sanitation protocol would be triggered, singled out key biological parameters affecting the infection spread, and propose pathogen-specific changes to existing containment protocols. Our work advances the understanding of infection spread on cruise ships while offering insights applicable to other similar confined settings, such as nursing homes, schools, and hospitals. By providing a robust framework for real-time outbreak modeling, this study proposes more effective containment protocols and enhances our preparedness for managing infectious diseases and emerging pathogens in confined environments."},{"t":"下一代锌离子电池纤维素基凝胶电解质的理性设计：机理、进展与展望...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506462?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池凝胶电解质","kp":["电解质[水系锌电池]: 纤维素基凝胶","[功能]: 抑制锌枝晶与副反应"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":4.5},"as":"该综述系统分析了纤维素基凝胶电解质在下一代锌离子电池中的理性设计原理、工作机制与研究进展。锌离子电池作为可持续储能体系因成本低、安全性高、环境友好等优势受到广泛关注。纤维素基凝胶电解质兼具离子传导性和机械柔性，文章讨论了其分子设计策略、界面工程及性能优化路径，为开发安全柔性储能器件提供指导。","ot":"Rational Design of Cellulose‐Based Gel Electrolytes for Next‐Generation Zinc‐Ion Batteries: Mechanisms, Advances, and Pe","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) have gained considerable attention as sustainable energy storage systems, offering advantages in capacity, safety, and cost. However, issues such as dendrite growth and side reactions hinder their practical adoption. Cellulose‐based gel electrolytes (CGEs) have recently emerged as promising materials to mitigate these challenges. By inhibiting zinc dendrite formation and enhancing interfacial stability, CGEs improve cycling longevity and safety in ZIBs. This review begins by classifying gel electrolytes and outlining the distinctive benefits of CGEs prepared via crosslinking and non‐crosslinking strategies. It then systematically examines recent developments in CGEs for use with various cathode materials and in multifunctional ZIBs configurations. Finally, the environmental merits and compelling electrochemical properties of CGEs are highlighted, together with a forward‐looking discussion on their role in next‐generation ZIBs and related future research directions. This work provides a timely and comprehensive resource that integrates materials design with electrochemical insights, offering valuable guidance for the rational development of CGEs."},{"t":"工程化蛋白质中的量子自旋共振用于多模态传感","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09971-3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质量子传感","kp":["[量子传感]: 工程化蛋白质自旋共振","[优势]: 多模态传感，抗光降解"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出利用工程化蛋白质实现量子自旋共振的多模态传感技术。利用量子现象的传感技术在材料科学、生物医学等领域应用日益广泛。该方法将量子自旋共振机制嵌入蛋白质支架中，实现多模态高灵敏度检测，为生物分子传感、活体检测和量子生物界面提供新思路，有望拓展量子传感在生命科学中的应用边界。","ot":"Quantum spin resonance in engineered proteins for multimodal sensing","b":"Sensing technologies that exploit quantum phenomena for measurement are finding increasing applications across materials, physical and biological sciences1,2,3,4,5,6,7. Until recently, biological candidates for quantum sensors were limited to in vitro systems, had poor sensitivity and were prone to light-induced degradation. These limitations impeded practical biotechnological applications, and high-throughput study that would facilitate their engineering and optimization. We recently developed a class of magneto-sensitive fluorescent proteins including MagLOV, which overcomes many of these challenges8. Here we show that through directed evolution, it is possible to engineer these proteins to alter the properties of their response to magnetic fields and radio frequencies. We find that MagLOV exhibits optically detected magnetic resonance in living bacterial cells at room temperature, at sufficiently high signal-to-noise for single-cell detection. These effects are explained through the radical-pair mechanism, which involves the protein backbone and a bound flavin cofactor. Using optically detected magnetic resonance and fluorescence magnetic-field effects, we explore a range of applications, including spatial localization of fluorescence signals using gradient fields (that is, magnetic resonance imaging using a genetically encoded probe), sensing of the molecular microenvironment, multiplexing of bio-imaging and lock-in detection, mitigating typical biological imaging challenges such as light scattering and autofluorescence. Taken together, our results represent a suite of sensing modalities for engineered biological systems, based on and designed around understanding the quantum-mechanical properties of magneto-sensitive fluorescent proteins.","aip":1},{"t":"迄今在最大物体上观测到量子效应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04097-y","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宏观量子效应","kp":["[量子效应]: 迄今最大物体观测到量子效应"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"","ot":"Quantum effect observed for biggest objects yet"},{"t":"量化人脑的可压缩性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531115123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In the human brain, the allowed patterns of activity are constrained by the correlations between brain regions. Yet it remains unclear which correlations-and how many-are needed to predict large-scale neural activity. Here, we present an information-theoretic framework to identify the most important correlations, which provide the most accurate predictions of neural states. Applying our framework to cortical activity in humans, we find that the vast majority of variance in activity is explained by a small number of correlations. This means that the brain is highly compressible: Only a sparse network of correlations is needed to predict large-scale activity. We find that this compressibility is strikingly consistent across different individuals and cognitive tasks and that, counterintuitively, the most important correlations are not necessarily the strongest. Together, these results suggest that nearly all correlations are not needed to predict neural activity, and we provide the tools to uncover the key correlations that are."},{"t":"锥体神经元按比例改变皮质中间神经元亚型","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09996-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The mammalian cerebral cortex comprises a complex neuronal network that maintains a precise balance between excitatory pyramidal neurons and inhibitory interneurons. Accumulating evidence indicates that specific interneuron subtypes form stereotyped microcircuits with distinct pyramidal neuron classes1,2,3. Here we show that pyramidal neurons have an active role in this process by promoting the survival and terminal differentiation of their associated interneuron subtypes. In the wild-type cortex, interneuron subtype abundance mirrors the prevalence of their pyramidal neuron partners. In Fezf2 mutants, which lack L5b pyramidal neurons and are expanded in L6 intratelencephalic neurons, corresponding subtype-specific shifts occur through two distinct mechanisms: somatostatin interneurons adjust their programmed cell death, whereas parvalbumin interneurons switch their subtype identity. Silencing neuronal activity or blocking vesicular release in L5b pyramidal neurons revealed that their communication with interneurons does not require voltage-gated synaptic activity but engages both tetanus toxin-sensitive and tetanus toxin-insensitive pathways. Moreover, a targeted bioinformatic screen for ligand–receptor pairs displaying subtype-specific expression and reduced expression of pyramidal neuron-derived ligand in Fezf2 mutants identified candidate secreted factors and adhesion molecules. These findings reveal distinct, pyramidal neuron-driven mechanisms for sculpting interneuron diversity and integrating them into local cortical circuits."},{"t":"出版商更正：多胺依赖性代谢屏蔽调节选择性剪接","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10140-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"出版商更正：雌二醇的多种功能可抑制铁死亡和急性肾损伤","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10148-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"原杉化石在结构和化学上与灭绝和现存的真菌不同","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec6277?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Prototaxites was the first giant organism to live on the terrestrial surface, represented by columnar fossils of up to eight meters from the Early Devonian. However, its systematic affinity has been debated for over 165 years. There are now two remaining viable hypotheses: Prototaxites was either a fungus, or a member of an entirely extinct lineage. Here, we investigate the affinity of Prototaxites by contrasting its organization and molecular composition with that of Fungi. We report that fossils of Prototaxites taiti from the 407-million-year-old Rhynie chert were chemically distinct from contemporaneous Fungi and structurally distinct from all known Fungi. This finding casts doubt upon the fungal affinity of Prototaxites, instead suggesting that this enigmatic organism is best assigned to an entirely extinct eukaryotic lineage."},{"t":"蛋白酶体帽靶向嵌合体用于不依赖泛素化的靶向蛋白质降解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520039?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Selective degradation of a disease‐associated protein of interest (POI) is a powerful therapeutic strategy. FDA‐approved and investigational glue and degrader drugs function by recruiting a POI to an E3 ubiquitin ligase that mediates POI polyubiquitination and triggers proteasomal degradation. However, using E3 ligases as an intermediary and requiring POI polyubiquitination makes this mechanism of action complex and difficult to rationalize and optimize. These issues have led to interest in evaluating whether direct recruitment of non‐ubiquitinated POIs to the proteasome might achieve the same pharmacological outcome. Here, we examined the potential of direct‐to‐proteasome non‐ubiquitinated POI recruitment. Using a tag strategy, we first demonstrated that the proteasomal 19S cap region proteins, RPN13 and RPN1, can recruit non‐ubiquitinated POI model proteins, such as BRD4, to the proteasome and induce degradation. Subsequently, we developed small molecule‐based bifunctional recruiter molecules (Proteasome Cap Targeting Chimeras, CAP‐TACs) and showed that they recruit several distinct POIs, including BRD4, PRMT5, and FKBP12, to specific subunits in the 19S cap region and induce their ubiquitination‐independent, proteasome‐dependent degradation. This study provides further evidence that bifunctional small molecules can re‐localize POIs to the proteasome and induce their degradation in the absence of ubiquitination, which broadens the capabilities of targeted protein degradation."},{"t":"用纳米颗粒物质波干涉术探测量子力学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09917-9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米粒子物质波","kp":["[方法]: 纳米颗粒物质波干涉术","[目的]: 探测宏观尺度量子叠加持续性"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用纳米颗粒物质波干涉仪探测量子力学叠加原理。通过让质量远超原子的纳米尺度颗粒实现量子叠加态并观测其干涉条纹，检验量子力学在宏观尺度是否依然适用，挑战客观坍缩模型等量子引力理论。实验涉及超高真空、自由落体悬浮及相位相干控制等技术，是迈向宏观量子叠加的关键一步，对量子基础理论与精密传感均有深远意义。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Probing quantum mechanics with nanoparticle matter-wave interferometry","b":"The quantum superposition principle is a fundamental concept of physics1 and the basis of numerous quantum technologies2,3. Yet, it is still often regarded counterintuitive because we do not observe its key features on the macroscopic scales of our daily lives. It is, therefore, interesting to ask how quantum properties persist or change as we increase the size and complexity of objects4. A model test for this question can be realized by matter-wave interferometry, in which the motion of individual massive particles becomes delocalized and needs to be described by a wave function that spans regions far larger than the particle itself5. Over the years, this has been explored with a series of objects of increasing mass and complexity6,7,8,9 and a growing community aims at pushing this to ever larger limits. Here we present an experimental platform that extends matter-wave interference to large metal clusters, a qualitatively new material class for quantum experiments. We specifically demonstrate quantum interference of sodium nanoparticles, which can each contain more than 7,000 atoms at masses greater than 170,000 Da. They propagate in a Schrödinger cat state with a macroscopicity10 of μ = 15.5, surpassing previous experiments5,9,11 by an order of magnitude."},{"t":"用于碳-杂原子键形成的红光光氧化还原催化剂的预测性数据驱动设计","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526086?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"红光光催化","kp":["[光催化]: 红光吸收有机染料模块化设计","反应[C-杂键]: 红光光氧化还原催化","[数据驱动]: 预测性催化剂设计"],"as":"该工作提出一种数据驱动的预测性设计方法，用于开发红光光氧化还原催化剂，实现C-杂原子键的高效构建。传统光催化依赖昂贵稀缺的贵金属配合物且多需高能蓝/紫外光激发，限制了规模化应用。研究者结合机器学习模型与实验筛选，理性设计可在红光下高效激发的有机催化剂分子，降低光毒性并提高官能团兼容性，推动绿色可持续有机合成。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Predictive, Data‐Driven Design of Red‐Light Photoredox Catalysts for C─Heteroatom Bond Formation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Photocatalysis is a powerful tool for the synthesis of organic molecules, yet its widespread application is hindered by the dependence on high‐energy light sources and expensive metal‐based catalysts, which can limit scalability and environmental sustainability. In this study, we present a modular design strategy for organic dyes engineered for efficient red‐light absorption, enabling photocatalytic reactions under low‐energy irradiation. Our findings establish a clear relationship between the oxidation potential of the photocatalyst and the nature of its donor moiety, as well as between the reduction potential and the electronic characteristics of its core structure. Moreover, we demonstrate that the\n                    E\n                    0‐0\n                    energy of a photocatalyst can be predicted via multivariate linear regression using the donor's oxidation potential and the core's reduction potential as descriptors. Utilizing this strategy, we synthesized red‐light‐absorbing photocatalysts that efficiently promote C─heteroatom cross‐coupling reactions under mild conditions. This approach overcomes the limitations of blue‐light photocatalysis by offering broad substrate compatibility, including π‐conjugated aryl bromides and photolabile functional groups, while minimizing undesirable hydrodehalogenation. By reducing reliance on precious metals and improving energy efficiency, our approach provides a scalable alternative to traditional photocatalysis and advances the development of metal‐free photocatalysts for sustainable chemistry.","aip":1},{"t":"掠夺性攻击是通过适应去甲肾上腺素能回路而进化的","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10009-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Behaviours are adaptive traits evolving through natural selection. Crucially, the genetic, molecular and neural modifications that shape behavioural innovations are poorly understood1. Here, we identify specialized adaptations linked to the evolution of invertebrate aggression2. Using the predatory nematode Pristionchus pacificus, we developed a machine learning model from behavioural tracking data and identified robust behavioural states associated with aggressive episodes. Strikingly, predatory aggression coincides with a rewiring of key circuits across nematode evolution. We find modifications to the noradrenergic pathway, with octopamine promoting aggressive predatory bouts whereas tyramine antagonistically induces passive states. Modulation occurs through the octopamine receptors Ppa-ser-3 and Ppa-ser-6, and tyramine receptor Ppa-lgc-55. These localize to sensory neurons whose inhibition diminishes aggressive events. Crucially, this octopaminergic innovation emerged within this predatory lineage, consistent with an ancient divergence in function. Thus, evolutionary adaptations in noradrenergic circuits facilitated the emergence of aggressive behavioural states associated with complex predatory traits."},{"t":"编码后施用催产素选择性增强女性对男性面孔的记忆巩固","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529865123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxytocin plays a critical role in modulating social cognition and enhancing human memory for faces. However, it remains unclear which phase of memory oxytocin affects to enhance face memory. Our study explored oxytocin's potential to selectively enhance the consolidation of social memories, specifically human faces, and whether this effect varies between genders. In three preregistered, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trials with heterosexual participants (total N = 445, comprising 227 males and 218 females), we explored how oxytocin affects memory consolidation. We administered oxytocin immediately after encoding (i.e., Study 1), before retrieval (i.e., Study 2), and before encoding (i.e., Study 3) in three parallel studies. This design allowed us to confirm that oxytocin's effects were indeed due to consolidation rather than retrieval or encoding. We found that administering oxytocin post-encoding, but not before-retrieval or before-encoding, significantly improved female participants' ability to recognize male faces 24 h later, with no similar enhancement observed in males recognizing opposite-gender faces. Together with our analyses of the social placebo effect-where the belief in receiving oxytocin produces effects similar to those of actual intranasal oxytocin administration-and the approachability ratings during encoding, we concluded that oxytocin specifically enhances the consolidation of long-term social memories in women recognizing male faces. These findings imply that oxytocin selectively enhances the consolidation of human social memory, potentially deepening our understanding of the mechanisms underlying social memory processes."},{"t":"气态巨行星的极涡动力学：二维能量级联的见解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2500791123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The distinct polar vortex dynamics observed on Jupiter and Saturn may provide insights into their interiors. In this study, we examine how the number and structure of polar vortices vary with forcing strength, dissipation rate, and interior stratification using a 1.5-layer quasi-geostrophic model. This simplified setup enables a broad exploration of the parameter space, revealing that vortex characteristics are determined by the sequence in which three key length scales-the deformation radius [Formula: see text], the zonostrophic scale [Formula: see text], and the dissipative scale [Formula: see text]-are encountered as energy cascades from small to large scales. Four distinct vortex patterns are identified, including a vortex crystal resembling Jupiter's polar vortices and a single-vortex state akin to that of Saturn. The conditions under which these patterns emerge provide constraints on the stratification of Jupiter and Saturn."},{"t":"血小板源性生长因子受体α通过ERK-CREB轴调节胎儿睾丸分化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515138123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Platelet-derived growth factor receptor alpha (Pdgfra) plays a crucial role in mesenchymal cell differentiation, but the molecular signaling involved in this process remains unclear, particularly within the fetal testis. Here, we use XY Pdgfra-null gonads to investigate the molecular mechanisms underlying testicular organogenesis, focusing on the formation of testicular architecture and the differentiation of fetal Leydig cells (FLCs), the steroidogenic lineage arising from mesenchymal precursors within the testicular interstitial compartment. The extracellular signal-regulated kinase (ERK) pathway, a well-known mitogen-activated signaling pathway, was significantly inhibited in XY Pdgfra-null gonads, suggesting that ERK signaling is activated downstream of PDGFRA. Using ex vivo whole-organ culture, small interfering RNA cell culture methods, transwell assays, and a genetic mouse model to disrupt ERK signaling in gonadal cells, we found that the ERK pathway promotes testis cord formation via early growth response 1-mediated cell migration and regulates the expression of steroidogenic enzymes in FLCs via activating the transcription factor cAMP responsive element binding protein 1. These findings highlight the significance of the PDGFRA signaling network in fetal testis organogenesis, thus providing insights into mesenchymal cell differentiation and the etiology of congenital disorders related to gonadal development."},{"t":"压电表面声波忆阻器神经网络","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6227?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"声波忆阻神经网络","kp":["[架构]: 压电声表面波忆阻器神经网络","[集成]: 感知-存储-计算一体","[优势]: 模拟电磁波处理，免ADC破冯诺依曼瓶颈"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出基于压电表面声波的忆阻器神经网络架构，利用模拟电磁波信号直接处理无线射频信号，实现高能效计算。表面声波器件与忆阻器的结合使信号在物理层完成运算，避免传统数字信号处理的模数转换开销，在低功耗无线通信、边缘计算及物联网场景中具有应用潜力。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Piezoelectric surface acoustic wave memristor neural network","b":"Processing wireless RF signals using analog electromagnetic (EM) wave-based neural networks enables energy efficiency and parallelism by integrating sensing, memory, and computation, avoiding analog-to-digital conversions (ADCs) and the von-Neumann bottleneck. Yet, a notable challenge remains: the absence of compact and programmable building blocks for EM wave-based neural networks. To overcome this limitation, we propose a piezoelectric surface acoustic wave (SAW) memristor that integrates an Ag/SiO2/Au memristor with an acoustoelectric phase shifter. Operating at shorter wavelengths than EM waves, it offers a compact footprint and encodes tunable neural network parameters via nonvolatile programmability and the acoustoelectric effect. A proof-of-concept SAW memristor neural network was experimentally demonstrated on a vector classification task, achieving 91.7% accuracy on par with software while reducing footprint by 105 times versus EM systems and energy consumption by 37 times versus digital systems. This work paves the way for compact, energy-efficient RF signal processing at the edge."},{"t":"胶体纳米晶敏化纳米线阵列的光伏纳米组装体用于近红外视网膜光刺激...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7001?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米线视网膜接口","kp":["[器件结构]: ZnO纳米线阵列+胶体纳米晶敏化","[功能]: 近红外视网膜光刺激","[制备]: 溶液法"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究构建了一种由胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列光伏纳米组件，兼具有机光伏特性与神经/组织界面应用潜力。纳米线作为先进的神经和组织接口平台，其光电响应能力可实现无线光电刺激，在生物电子医学、植入式神经接口及可降解生物传感器等前沿领域具有独特价值。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photovoltaic nanoassembly of nanowire arrays sensitized with colloidal nanocrystals for near-infrared retina photostimul","b":"Nanowires have served as a transformative platform for advanced neural and tissue interfaces. While their photovoltaic properties hold exceptional promise for neural modulation, existing photostimulation approaches predominantly rely on visible light-activated photoelectrochemical mechanisms. Here, we present a solution-processed photovoltaic nanoassembly comprising a ZnO nanowire array sensitized with AgBiS2 nanocrystals that enables efficient near-infrared (NIR) neural stimulation through capacitive photocurrents. By optimizing nanowire morphology and nanocrystal interdigitation, the platform achieves high charge injection densities (tens of microcoulombs per square centimeter) at low NIR intensities (<1 milliwatt per square millimeter). The nanoassembly was subretinally placed in an ex vivo blind rat retina, where it elicited repeatable and robust responses in retinal ganglion cells under NIR pulses. Notably, these responses were achieved at light intensities substantially below established ocular safety limits. The nexus of neuronal systems and nanoassemblies offers potential for enabling unconventional visual prosthetics and advanced neuromodulation therapies.","aip":1},{"t":"光子反蛋白石实现双层结构无缝界面用于色彩调控与稳健被动辐射制冷...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522922?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子晶体辐射制冷","kp":["[结构]: 光子反蛋白石双层无缝界面","[功能]: 颜色调控+被动辐射冷却","[特点]: 零能耗冷却"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出基于光子反蛋白石结构的双层彩色被动日间辐射冷却技术，将结构色与零能耗辐射制冷无缝集成。反蛋白石光子晶体通过选择性反射可见光实现鲜艳色彩，同时在中红外波段高效发射热量，实现低于环境温度的被动冷却效果，在建筑节能、可穿戴热管理和电子器件散热等场景具有应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photonic Inverse Opal‐Enabled Seamless Interface of Bilayer Structure for Color Regulation and Robust Passive Radiative ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Colorful passive daytime radiative cooling has emerged as an attractive zero‐energy‐cooling technology that integrates aesthetic appeal with thermal management. However, achieving concurrent high cooling efficiency and mechanical robustness remains challenging, constrained either by the narrow solar reflection bandwidth and limited spectral tunability of monolayer photonic structures, or by interfacial heterogeneities in multilayer architectures. Here, we demonstrate a size‐exclusion‐assisted selective infiltration strategy for fabricating structurally colored daytime radiative cooling (SCDRC) sheets. A polymer phase exhibiting negligible solar absorption and high infrared emissivity permeates preassembled colloidal crystal templates, forming an ordered inverse opal layer upon etching, whereas microscale boron nitride platelets selectively excluded from the template organize into a packed solar‐reflective microstructure. The resulting SCDRC sheets display tunable colors through pore geometry control, achieving &gt;96% solar reflectance, &gt;94% mid‐infrared emissivity, a sub‐ambient temperature reduction of 7°C in outdoor environments, and an average cooling power reduction of 20.7% across diverse climatic zones in China. The photonic framework demonstrates exceptional stability under prolonged thermal and humidity exposure, guaranteeing persistent coloration and cooling performance. This seamless‐interface bilayer fabrication strategy establishes a viable platform for developing durable colored cooling materials integrating aesthetic appeal with energy‐saving functionality, showing significant potential for advanced architectural and industrial applications.","aip":1},{"t":"宇称时间对称双压电晶片拓扑绝缘体","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519324?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  We propose and experimentally realize a parity‐time ()‐symmetric bimorphic topological insulator, characterized by the coexistence of first‐ and second‐order topological phases. Our platform utilizes an anomalous Floquet model implemented in a 2D optical waveguide array, where  symmetry is maintained via a four‐step driving protocol with spatiotemporally engineered loss. Despite the presence of dissipation, we demonstrate that the  symmetry ensures a purely real quasienergy spectrum across the topological regime, effectively stabilizing boundary modes against the dynamical instabilities and mode competition typical of non‐Hermitian systems. Experimentally, we provide unambiguous evidence of this non‐Hermitian bimorphic phase by observing unidirectional, clockwise edge transport in the zero gap and robust corner localization in the  gap. Our findings pave the way for further exploration of  ‐symmetric and non‐Hermitian topological phases in nonlinear and many‐body regimes and provide novel insights into the realization of topological insulators in open quantum systems.","tp":"拓扑绝缘体","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究者在二维光波导阵列中实验实现了宇称-时间（PT）对称的双形态拓扑绝缘体，首次展示了第一阶和第二阶拓扑相共存。平台采用异常Floquet模型，通过四步驱动协议和时空工程化损耗维持PT对称性，证明耗散存在下仍可保持纯实准能谱，为拓扑光子学器件设计提供了新平台。"},{"t":"将粒子配对形成和乐结构","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady3856?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"和乐量子门","kp":["[量子计算]: 粒子配对构建量子holonomy","[优势]: 几何性提升量子门稳定性","[应用]: 量子色动力学与大统一理论模拟"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于将粒子配对形成完整子（holonomies）以应用于量子计算与量子模拟。完整子的几何性质为量子门操作提供了内在的容错优势，因为其计算过程依赖于全局几何相位而非局部动力学细节，天然抵抗某些类型的微扰。研究者探索了通过粒子配对机制构建完整子的方案，旨在实现更稳健的拓扑量子计算路径。该方向对克服量子退相干、提升量子比特保真度具有重要意义，是拓扑量子计算领域的前沿探索。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pairing particles into holonomies","b":"Holonomies are of great interest to quantum computation and simulation. The geometrical nature of holonomies offers increased stability to quantum gates. Furthermore, symmetries of particle physics are naturally reflected in holonomies, making them ideally suited for quantum simulation of quantum chromodynamics and grand unified theories. Yet, practically designing quantum holonomies with the required properties and scale is challenging. Here, we construct a new class of holonomies by increasing the particle number. We show that multiparticle holonomies can even exist in systems devoid of any single-particle holonomies. We present a comprehensive framework for multiparticle quantum holonomies and experimentally realize various two-particle holonomies in integrated photonics. Our results enable the number of particles to be harnessed as a design parameter, offering increased freedom in constructing holonomic systems."},{"t":"由梳状蛋白支持的鸟类视网膜内层的无氧代谢","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09978-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Neural tissues are exceptionally sensitive to oxygen deprivation and rely on a dense network of blood vessels to support their extraordinarily high metabolic demands for oxygen, nutrients and clearance of waste products1,2,3,4. In birds, one of the metabolically most demanding neural tissue—the retina—lacks internal blood vessels5,6. This raises the question of how such a metabolically demanding neural tissue can function without blood perfusion. Here we show that, while the photoreceptor outer segments in the outer retina have access to oxygen, the inner bird retina operates under chronic anoxia, supported by anaerobic glycolysis in the retinal neurons. We provide evidence that the pecten oculi—a uniquely vascularized structure in the vitreous humour of birds, the function of which has been debated for centuries5,6,7,8,9—supplies the anoxic inner retina with glucose and removes lactic acid. We suggest that the pecten’s metabolic support of the bird retina’s anoxia tolerance enabled first the evolution of a thick cell-dense, avascular retina, which secondarily served as an exaptation enabling retinal function during high-altitude migrations."},{"t":"具有长寿命电荷分离态的有机晶体纳米颗粒用于高效光催化产氢...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02035-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制氢","kp":["催化剂[光催化产氢]: 受体-供体-受体有机晶态纳米颗粒","[电荷分离态]: 长寿命抑制复合","结构[纳米颗粒]: 自组装高度结晶"],"as":"该研究开发了一种有机晶体纳米粒子材料，具有长寿命的电荷分离态，可有效解决光催化中电荷复合过快的瓶颈问题。光催化是实现可再生能源转换与存储的重要途径，但光生电荷对的短寿命严重制约了催化效率。通过有机晶体的有序分子排列和纳米尺度效应，该材料显著延长了电荷分离态的存续时间，从而提升了光催化反应的量子效率，在太阳能燃料合成和环境修复等应用场景中展现出潜力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Organic crystalline nanoparticles with a long-lived charge-separated state for efficient photocatalytic hydrogen product","b":"Photocatalysis offers a promising approach for renewable energy conversion and storage, but short lifetimes of charge-separated states in photocatalysts due to charge recombination limit its utility. Here we report an organic molecule with an acceptor–donor–acceptor configuration that can self assemble into highly crystalline nanoparticles. Transient absorption spectroscopy reveals that these crystalline assemblies can induce an ultra-long-lived charge-separated state of up to 1.2 s, attributed to initial symmetry-breaking charge separation, followed by charge hopping across closely packed molecules. These self-assembled nanoparticles have an impressive photocatalytic H2 evolution rate of 126 mmol g−1 h−1 with an external quantum efficiency of 12% at 550 nm under optimized conditions. This system shows a remarkable stability with 220 million turnover numbers (per particle) over the 77 h of operation. These findings suggest that rational design of organic molecules and their aggregates is vital for improving light-induced charge separation and for developing highly efficient, stable and scalable organic photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"基于氢能装备行为的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior "},{"t":"经过优化设计的 HLA/肽特异性 CAR-T 细胞在根除实体瘤方面优于 TCR-T 细胞","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx9371?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Tumor-specific HLA/peptides (pHLA) represent attractive therapeutic targets for cancer. Two cell-based modalities can target pHLA-expressing tumors: T cell receptors (TCRs) or TCR-mimetic (TCRm) antibodies reformatted as chimeric antigen receptors (CARs). Using HLA-A2/MAGEA4230-239 as a model pHLA, we discerned the relative potency of TCR-T and CAR-T cells, informing how to best deploy these for clinical benefit. Although TCR-T cells were more sensitive at detecting low-density pHLA, TCR-T cells exerted only transient in vivo antitumor efficacy followed by tumor relapse due to deficient TCR-T cell proliferation and persistence that was associated with a more differentiated and dysfunctional phenotype. By contrast, CAR-T cells with encoded costimulatory signaling fully regressed tumors. Insufficient TCR-T cell durability was overcome by coengaging 41BB or IL-2 signaling pathways, thereby enhancing tumor control in vivo. These data establish differential activities of human TCR-T and CAR-T cells targeting the same pHLA and inform the development of optimal targeting strategies to induce durable clinical responses."},{"t":"基于分层多尺度建模的兆瓦级质子交换膜水电解模块优化设计","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020550?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽优化设计","kp":["规模[PEM电解水]: 兆瓦级模块","[建模]: 分层多尺度建模优化设计"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimal design of megawatt-scale proton exchange membrane water electrolysis module by hierarchical multi-scale modeling"},{"t":"离线逆强化学习联合优化工业光伏-储能系统的能源成本与需量电费...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储成本优化","kp":["[方法]: 离线逆强化学习","优化目标[工业PV-电池]: 能耗与需量电费联合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery"},{"t":"非典型遗传标记解决了地球历史上好氧细菌在GOE出现之前的问题","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515709123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition from anaerobic to aerobic life was a pivotal adaptation in Earth's history, yet the timing and genomic drivers remain poorly resolved. Traditional approaches relying on oxygen-utilizing genes need improvement for obligate anaerobes and fragmentary environmental genomes, where gene absence may reflect poor assembly rather than phenotype. We developed a machine learning model (GBDT40-LR) to predict microbial oxygen requirements using 40 broadly conserved genes, 35 without direct oxygen roles. This approach overcomes incompleteness biases in environmental genomes. Applied to 80,787 bacterial genomes [including metagenome-derived assemblies (MAGs)], the model classified 42,014 aerobes and 38,775 anaerobes, enabling large-scale ancestral reconstruction. Molecular clock dating indicates an emergence of aerobic bacterium prior to the Great Oxidation Event (GOE, 2.5 to 2.3 Ga), likely around ~2.7 Ga. Aerobic lineages subsequently diversified during the GOE and Neoproterozoic Oxygenation Event (NOE, 0.8 to 0.55 Ga), with persistent anaerobe diversity across Earth's oxygenation. This establishes that aerobic bacteria originated planetary oxygenation, potentially by 200 to 400 My, providing insights into phenotypic evolution and prolonged anaerobe-aerobe coexistence."},{"t":"天然氢技术经济性评估与定价","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000589?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然氢技术经济评价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Natural hydrogen techno-economics and valuation"},{"t":"纳米孪晶工程使P型碲化铋热电材料获得优异热稳定性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06360D","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碲化铋热电材料","kp":["[工程策略]: 纳米孪晶界工程","材料[P型热电]: Bi2Te3基","[改善]: 热电效率+力学韧性+寿命"],"dp":1,"as":"通过纳米孪晶工程赋予P型碲化铋（Bi₂Te₃）热电材料优异的热稳定性。Bi₂Te₃是目前室温区热电转换效率最高的材料，广泛应用于温差发电与半导体制冷，但高温长时间服役下晶粒粗化导致性能退化是制约实际部署的核心瓶颈。该研究利用纳米孪晶界面的高密度位错与晶界钉扎效应，有效抑制高温下的微观结构演变，使材料在高温环境中长期保持优异的热电优值（ZT），为热电材料的工程化应用突破关键耐久性障碍。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanotwin Engineering Enables Exceptional Thermal Stability in P-Type Bismuth Telluride Thermoelectrics","b":"Thermal stability is a critical challenge limiting the practical deployment of thermoelectric materials in real-world energy conversion. This study presents a breakthrough by incorporating dense nanoscale twin boundaries into bismuth-telluride-based thermoelectrics, achieving concurrent improvements in thermoelectric efficiency, mechanical robustness, and operational longevity. The coherent twin interfaces, characterized by their crystallographic symmetry and minimal electron scattering, effectively reduce lattice thermal conductivity while preserving charge carrier mobility. Remarkably, the material maintains a high power factor and a low thermal conductivity even after extended thermal aging. Device-level testing confirms exceptional stability, with twin-engineered devices retaining >98% of their output power and conversion efficiency across repeated thermal cycles, alongside intact interfacial contacts and no observable microstructural degradation. These results highlight nanotwin boundary engineering as a robust microstructural design paradigm for developing high-performance, durable thermoelectric device applications.","aip":1},{"t":"具有可切换非互易电子传输的磁性 Weyl 半金属的纳米雕刻 3D 螺旋","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02104-x","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The emergent properties of materials are governed by the symmetries of their underlying atomic, spin and charge order. Therefore, intrinsic material properties usually constrain the exploration of symmetry-breaking effects. Focused ion beam (FIB) fabrication now enables the structuring of bulk crystals into ultraprecise transport devices, allowing the study of geometrical symmetry breaking on mesoscopic length scales. Here we extend FIB nanostructuring into three-dimensional, curvilinear geometries. Using single crystals of the high-mobility, centrosymmetric magnetic Weyl semimetal Co3Sn2S2, we sculpt helices with lengths of 3–14 μm, diameters of 1–4 μm and pitches ranging from 500 nm to 2 μm. Lock-in measurements on the helical devices at temperatures between 10 K and 190 K show that the combination of imposed inversion symmetry-breaking geometry and ferromagnetism yields non-reciprocal electron transport—or diode effect—at zero applied magnetic field, exceeding classical self-field expectations by orders of magnitude at low temperatures. We attribute this behaviour to the quasi-ballistic motion of carriers as the mean free path approaches the length scale of the chiral device geometry. Finally, we show that current pulses can switch the magnetization of the device. These results highlight the potential of FIB nanosculpting to engineer symmetry and functionality beyond conventional device geometries.","tp":"拓扑半金属","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究者利用聚焦离子束（FIB）技术将磁性Weyl半金属加工成三维曲线螺旋纳米结构，突破了材料本征对称性对物性探索的限制。该三维几何对称破缺实现了可切换的非互易电子传输效应，为研究拓扑材料的输运行为和开发新型自旋电子器件提供了范式。"},{"t":"纳米颗粒介导的靶向嵌合体转化靶向蛋白质降解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02081-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Recent findings indicate that nanoparticles (NPs) can mediate targeted protein degradation (TPD) with versatility and efficiency. Studies have shown that ligand-modified NPs can effectively degrade both extracellular and intracellular proteins of interest through an autolysosome-involved degradation pathway, independent of both NPs and ligand types. This phenomenon, where ligand-modified NPs shuttle proteins of interest towards degradation, may prompt researchers to rethink the design of ligand-NPs, incorporating TPD as an additional functionality beyond conventional delivery. Moreover, this approach has the potential to revolutionize the field of TPD by transitioning from labour-intensive, case-specific designs to a broadly adaptable ‘plug-and-play’ platform that makes full use of the in vivo delivery potential of NPs. This Perspective discusses the evolution of current TPD tools, the desired features of next-generation technologies, and the potential and challenges of NP-mediated targeting chimeras for TPD, highlighting emerging trends and raising awareness of this promising field."},{"t":"超过一半的领先研究作者表示资金正在减少","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00054-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过不对称主族锡单原子催化剂最小化工业电合成中的过氧化氢损失","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523314?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡单原子电催化","kp":["催化剂[2e-ORR]: 不对称主族Sn单原子","[目标]: 最小化H2O2电化学/化学分解","[功能]: 工业级现场H2O2电合成"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种通过不对称主族锡（Sn）基电催化剂来最小化工业电合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）过程中产物损失的新策略。H₂O₂的电合成主要依赖两电子氧还原反应（ORR），但在实际工业条件下，生成的H₂O₂容易在催化剂表面发生进一步还原或分解，导致产率和法拉第效率大幅下降。研究者设计了不对称配位环境的主族Sn基催化剂，通过调控Sn位点的电子结构和局部微环境，抑制了H₂O₂的过度还原副反应，从而显著提升了H₂O₂的选择性和稳定性。该工作为低成本、非贵金属电催化合成H₂O₂提供了新思路，对绿色化学工业中清洁氧化剂的电化学生产具有重要意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Minimizing H2O2 Loss in Industrial Electrosynthesis via Asymmetric Main‐Group Sn Single‐Atom Catalysts","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The electrosynthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) via the two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction offers an appealing and sustainable route for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production. However, its broader applicability is constrained by subpar yields, primarily resulting from insufficient selectivity and the occurrence of electrochemical and/or chemical decomposition of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . Herein, we demonstrate that asymmetric N/S co‐coordinated main‐group Sn sites can effectively stabilize oxygen intermediates and rapidly desorb the generated H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , thereby enhancing 2e\n                    −\n                    ORR pathway selectivity while suppressing undesirable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    decomposition reactions. At an industrially relevant current density of 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , the main‐group catalyst achieves an exceptional H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    faradaic efficiency of 93%. When scaled to an industrial sized area of 100 cm\n                    2\n                    , the pilot reactor delivers an impressive H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 353.5 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    at 20 A. In situ characterizations and theoretical simulations reveal that the main‐group Sn sites exhibit inertness toward activation of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , thereby mitigating H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    loss in electrosynthesis. The asymmetric N/S‐coordination enhances electron transfer between the Sn center and oxygen intermediates, stabilizing the *OOH intermediate and facilitating H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation. This work presents a promising strategy for minimizing H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    loss in electrochemical production via the rational design of main‐group catalysts with well‐defined coordination and electronic structures.","aip":1},{"t":"共轭分子双层中的金属电荷传输","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01553-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","b":"Metallic charge transport of field-induced carriers can be observed in single-crystal silicon over a wide temperature range. Such behaviour is rare in undoped organic semiconductors but is beneficial for engineering devices with advanced performance. Here we report metallic charge transport in conjugated molecular bilayers down to 8 K with an electrical conductivity of up to 245 S cm−1 and a Hall mobility larger than 100 cm2 V−1 s−1 at 20 K. We use molecular-crystal bilayers of the organic semiconductor 2-decyl-7-phenyl-[1]benzothieno[3,2-b][1]benzothiophene. We infer that this transport behaviour originates from the phenyl bridge coupling between the two molecular layers, which suppresses molecular vibrations and weakens Coulomb interactions. We develop a controlled method for introducing defects, using which we observe a disorder-driven metal–insulator transition in the molecular crystal.","tp":"有机半导体","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在共轭分子双层中观测到金属态电荷传输行为，电导率高达245 S/cm，20K下霍尔迁移率超过100 cm²/V·s。这种金属传输行为在未掺杂有机半导体中极为罕见，利用有机半导体DBTS分子的晶体双层结构实现，为高性能有机电子器件的工程化设计提供了新思路。","aip":1},{"t":"机械化学：回顾与展望","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00471-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","b":"Mechanochemistry, from the ancient mortar and pestle to modern ball milling, offers sustainable, solvent-free reactions with unique selectivity while reducing emissions and costs. This review traces its history; highlights time-resolved in situ monitoring and computational insights into mechanisms; explores synergies with heat, light, electricity, and sound; and discusses emerging applications in the origins of life, supramolecular intermediates guiding the formation of covalent bonds, and direct mechanocatalysis. Emphasizing upscaling and digital integration, it highlights the transformative potential of mechanochemistry for forming the next-generation sustainable chemical industry.","tp":"机械化学法","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本文综述了机械化学从古代研钵到现代球磨技术的发展历程。机械化学提供无溶剂、可持续的反应路径，具有独特选择性和低碳排放优势。文章重点讨论了时间分辨原位监测、计算机理解、与热光电声的协同效应，以及在生命起源、超分子中间体和直接合成中的新兴应用。"},{"t":"用密度泛函理论驱动的机器学习工作流映射抗生素光催化转化与耐药风险","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520124?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗生素光催化降解","kp":["[预测框架]: 光催化实验+HRMS+DFT+ML","[应用]: 抗生素光催化转化产物与抗性基因风险"],"as":"光催化降解是处理抗生素污染的有效手段，但降解过程中可能产生转化产物（TPs），这些产物可能具有比母体抗生素更高的生物毒性或更强的耐药性风险。本研究采用密度泛函理论（DFT）对常见抗生素在光催化过程中的转化路径进行系统计算与映射，预测各转化产物的结构、稳定性及抗菌活性变化，从而定量评估残留产物的耐药性风险。该方法为光催化水处理技术的安全性评估提供了理论框架，有助于优化降解条件以最小化有害中间体生成。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mapping Antibiotic Photocatalytic Transformation and Resistance Risks with a DFT‐Informed Machine Learning Workflow","b":"Abstract\n                  The photocatalytic degradation of antibiotics is effective but may yield transformation products (TPs) that sustain or amplify ecological risks, including antibiotic resistance gene (ARG) induction. This study developed a predictive framework that couples photocatalytic experiments, high‐resolution mass spectrometry, density functional theory (DFT) calculations and machine learning (ML) to assess risks of TPs. Using tetracycline as a model compound, we constructed a reaction network over 120 steps and 9 533 reactions, and trained an ML model to rapidly predict Gibbs free energy changes with DFT accuracy. Automatic transition‐state searches were integrated to evaluate kinetic accessibility within the network. The generalizability of this approach was validated with pathways of five different antibiotics involving 545 reactions. Furthermore, a multi‐dimensional scoring system was developed that integrates diversity, ecotoxicity, biodegradability, and feasibility (DEBF) to prioritize pathways by both reactivity and sustainability. Several hydroxylated, aminated, and amide–ketone TPs were identified as high‐risk species with enhanced ARG‐binding potential. By bridging molecular energetics with ecological outcomes, this work offers a generalizable, mechanism‐anchored, and risk‐aware approach for analyzing photocatalytic transformations and deriving design principles for pollutant degradation that balance efficiency with ecological safety."},{"t":"红树林恢复和沿海洪水适应：混合海岸防御潜力的全球视角","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2510980123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"To reduce current and future coastal flood risk, it is critical to better understand how adaptation measures, including nature-based solutions, can reduce that risk. Globally, hybrid coastal defenses, including a combination of coastal vegetation, such as salt marshes and mangroves, with a dike or sea wall, have been highlighted as a promising adaptation measure. Here, we present a global-scale assessment of the potential risk reduction from mangrove restoration in combination with foreshore dike systems under scenarios of climate and socioeconomic change. We provide a quantitative assessment of the benefits in terms of reduced economic damage, exposed population, and poverty exposure. We evaluate mangrove restoration fronting dikes by accounting for wave-vegetation interaction. If mangrove foreshore dike systems were established along coastlines susceptible to flooding, restoration could potentially reduce expected annual damage by US$800 million and reduce expected affected population by 140,000 annually. These values increase under future projections. Our benefit-cost analysis finds mangrove restoration economically viable for about half of the subnational regions assessed (85 to 105 out of 208). At the global scale, the benefit-cost ratio under future conditions ranges from 3 to 6, with a net present value between US$44 billion and US$125 billion. Because absolute risk values and benefit-cost analysis do not differentiate between relative wealth impacts, we also estimated restoration impacts across different wealth levels. We show that restoring mangroves disproportionately benefits people with lower incomes, as they are often more exposed to coastal flooding and located in areas suitable for mangrove restoration. As such, mangrove restoration in low- and middle-income countries could contribute to the resilience of people in poverty."},{"t":"低功耗低开销的忆阻器细胞神经网络","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01559-z","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻细胞神经网络","kp":["[架构]: 忆阻器细胞神经网络","[特点]: 低功耗，降低开销"],"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Low-power memristor-based cellular neural networks with reduced overhead"},{"t":"液态镓低温快速光热氧化用于循环产氢","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68664-1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液镓光热制氢","kp":["制氢[液态镓光热氧化]: 淡水/海水均可","[低温快速]: 光热驱动循环产氢","[循环产氢]: 镓氧化还原闭环"],"as":"氢气作为清洁能源载体对可持续未来至关重要，但现有制氢方法大多依赖化石燃料或高能耗电解水。本研究提出一种基于液态镓的低温快速光热氧化新工艺，利用镓的低熔点、高导热性和光热转换能力，在温和条件下高效催化水分解产氢。液态镓可循环回收使用，实现反应体系的循环经济闭环设计。该方法有望显著降低制氢温度与能耗，为绿色氢能的大规模低成本生产开辟新路径，但镓的资源稀缺性与反应长期稳定性仍需进一步工程验证。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Low temperature and rapid photothermal oxidation of liquid gallium for circular hydrogen production","b":"Hydrogen is a clean energy carrier with significant promises for a sustainable future, yet many established production routes operate under undesirable conditions or constraints, motivating the search for alternative production pathways. Here, our approach uses photothermal oxidation of liquid gallium to generate hydrogen from both freshwater and seawater. The exposure to light thermally heats up liquid gallium droplets to a temperature suitable for fast gallium-water interaction, producing gallium oxyhydroxide and hydrogen. The light exposure also boosts the reaction by breaking the oxide layer on the surface of liquid gallium immersed in water, allowing continuous interactions between the water molecules and the surface of liquid gallium droplets. The gallium oxyhydroxide that is produced can be electrochemically reduced, allowing metal regeneration, thereby enabling circular hydrogen production. In this work, we show that photothermal activation of liquid gallium provides a rapid and circular route for generating hydrogen from diverse water sources.","aip":1},{"t":"局部酸性微环境增强孤立钯位点的阳极甲酰胺电合成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521334?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲酰胺电合成","kp":["催化剂[甲酰胺电合成]: 孤立Pd单原子位点","[局部酸性微环境]: 增强中间体亲电性","反应[常温]: 甲醇与氨C-N氧化偶联"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过孤立Pd位点催化剂构建局部酸性微环境，增强阳极甲酰胺电合成反应。电催化甲醇与氨的C-N氧化偶联可在温和条件下实现可持续甲酰胺合成，局部酸性微环境的调控策略显著提升了孤立金属位点的催化效率。","ot":"Local Acidic Microenvironments Enhanced Anodic Formamide Electrosynthesis over Isolated Pd Sites","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic C─N oxidative coupling of methanol and ammonia enables sustainable formamide synthesis under ambient conditions. However, the poor C─N coupling selectivity and limited Faradaic efficiency hinder practical application. As the critical step involves nucleophilic attack of NH\n                    3\n                    on in situ generated *CH\n                    2\n                    O intermediates, enhancing *CH\n                    2\n                    O electrophilicity while suppressing over‐oxidation is essential. Herein, Pd single atoms anchored on MnO\n                    2\n                    nanoarrays achieve state‐of‐the‐art Faradaic efficiency (62.6%) and carbon selectivity (80.2%) for anodic formamide synthesis. In situ characterization and theoretical simulations reveal dual enhancement mechanisms: Isolated Pd sites adopt end‐on *CH\n                    2\n                    O adsorption to expose the electrophilic carbon, while the MnO\n                    2\n                    ‐induced acidic microenvironment enhances *CH\n                    2\n                    O electrophilicity via oxygen‐atom protonation. This synergy accelerates nucleophilic attack by NH\n                    3\n                    , enabling efficient C─N coupling.","aip":1},{"t":"锂金属介导的全氟烷基和多氟烷基物质的电化学还原","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02057-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Per- and poly-fluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) have substantial environmental and health hazards. Unfortunately, current degradation routes require high temperatures or corrosive conditions and/or lead to incomplete defluorination and the generation of shorter alkyl chains. Inspired by the lithium-metal battery literature, here we develop an electrochemical degradation process that leverages reactive metals and highly reducing environments. We show that electrodeposited lithium metal can enable 95% degradation and 94% defluorination of perfluorooctanoic acid to LiF without forming any shorter C2–C6 PFAS as end products. Using computational simulations, we find that electron transfer from lithium to perfluorooctanoic acid leads to rapid C–F bond cleavage, fluoride formation and carbon chain fragmentation. We expand the scope to other PFAS compounds and demonstrate substantial degrees of degradation on over 22 different PFAS, plus complete mineralization to inorganic fluorides. Finally, we use the mineralized F− as a fluorine source for the synthesis of fluorinated non-PFAS compounds to complete a circular fluorine loop from waste to valuable product.","tp":"电化学降解","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"受锂金属电池研究启发，该工作开发了电化学降解全氟烷基和多氟烷基物质(PFAS)的新工艺。利用电沉积锂金属在强还原环境中实现PFAS的深度脱氟，降解率达95%，无需高温或腐蚀性条件，克服了传统降解路线脱氟不完全和生成短链副产物的问题，为PFAS污染治理提供了低温高效的新策略。"},{"t":"配体的LolCDE结构揭示了引导细菌脂蛋白转运的共同底物-LolE相互作用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520579123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial lipoproteins are key structural components of the outer membrane in Gram-negative bacteria and vital components of machineries required for its biosynthesis and maintenance. The Lol system, essential for viability, directs transport of lipoproteins from the site of biosynthesis on the inner membrane to the outer membrane and has been the target of extensive efforts to develop novel antimicrobial drugs. In the first stage of this transport process, newly synthesized lipoproteins are released from the inner membrane by the ABC transporter LolCDE and passed to the periplasmic chaperone, LolA. Here, we show cryo-EM structures of LolCDE in complex with three different lipoprotein substrates, Lpp, Pal, and LolB, with the latter two bearing a disordered peptide linker between the acyl chains and the globular domain. Our work reveals that when the mature lipoprotein lacks an unstructured linker, the N-terminal portion of the protein is in an unfolded state for transport. The lipoproteins make a sequence-independent but structurally conserved interaction with a cleft on the surface of the periplasmic domain of LolE that promotes efficient transport. We propose a model of lipoprotein export where this interaction acts as pivot point for the peptide portion of the lipoprotein allowing the acyl chains to rotate 180° from their initial position in LolCDE to their binding site in LolA. Our results demonstrate how LolCDE can extrude lipoproteins of diverse sequence and structure and reveal an important detail of a transport process fundamental to bacterial physiology."},{"t":"配体场调控实现水系锌离子电池高能效正极","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07175E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池正极调控","kp":["[水系锌离子电池]: 配体场调控正极提升能效","正极[ZIB]: 抑制电压衰减与极化"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出通过配体场调控策略开发水系锌离子电池高效正极材料。水系锌离子电池因高安全性、低成本和环境友好等优势，被视为大规模储能系统的有力候选。该工作利用配体场理论调节过渡金属正极的电子结构，优化锌离子的嵌入/脱出动力学，从而显著提升正极的能量效率和循环稳定性。这一方法为解决锌离子电池正极材料容量衰减和电压滞后等关键瓶颈提供了新的设计思路。","ot":"Ligand-field regulation enables high energy-efficiency cathodes for aqueous zinc-ion batteries","b":"Aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) are promising candidates for large‐scale energy storage owing to their high safety, low cost, and environmental friendliness. However, the practical application of ZIBs remains challenged by low energy density and energy efficiency owing to the rapid capacity fading and voltage decay, large voltage polarization, and sluggish reaction kinetics. In this work, we introduce a ligand-field engineering strategy that couples pre-intercalated ions interaction with octahedral defects to inhibit energy loss in layered hydrated vanadium pentoxide (V2O5·nH2O, VOH) cathodes. Comprehensive experimental analyses reveal that the introduction of pre-intercalated ions and oxygen vacancies induces [VO6] octahedral distortion and V-O bond elongation, thereby tailoring the ligand field and lowering the V 3d orbital energy level. This structure modulation effectively narrows the voltage hysteresis, stabilizes the voltage plateau and enhances the energy efficiency. In addition, this ligand-engineering strategy in enhancing energy efficiency can be extended to low-temperature conditions and other similar systems. As a result, the Ov-Zn-VOH cathode delivers a high discharge capacity (536 mAh g−1 at 0.1 A g−1) coupled with high energy efficiency (86%) and an energy efficiency retention of 94% after 3000 cycles at 4 A g−1.","aip":1},{"t":"生命历程全基因组关联研究荟萃分析细化了肥胖对布雷影响的关键生命阶段","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0374?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Previous evidence suggests that higher prepubertal adiposity protects against breast cancer risk. Whether this protection extends into early adulthood remains uncertain. We conducted genome-wide association studies on body mass index (BMI) in nulliparous women from menarche to <40 years across five cohorts, with additional analyses in three subintervals of this life stage. Results were meta-analyzed, and two-sample univariable and multivariable Mendelian randomization was applied within a lifecourse framework to assess the effect of BMI on breast cancer risk. Between menarche and <40 years, we observed heterogeneity in genetic effects. Genome-wide correlations further suggest that BMI during this early adult period may be partly influenced by distinct genetic factors compared with adiposity at other life stages. Higher genetically proxied BMI between menarche and 40 years reduced breast cancer risk. This protective effect attenuated after adjusting for prepubertal adiposity. These findings refine our understanding of adiposity's role in breast cancer and highlight earlier life stages as critical windows for risk modulation."},{"t":"电化学自生成硫代磷酸酯分子介导体引导硫化锂抗钝化沉积用于锂...","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519401?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池界面","kp":["[介质]: 电化学自生Li3PS4分子介导","[功能]: Li2S反钝化沉积","[体系]: 锂硫电池"],"as":"锂硫电池因高理论能量密度被视为下一代储能技术的重要方向，但硫利用率低、放电产物Li2S在电极表面形成绝缘钝化层，严重阻碍了电池的实际性能。本文提出一种由电化学自生成的硫系物种（如多硫化物中间体）引导的Li2S抗钝化沉积策略。该策略通过调控电化学反应过程中原位生成的含硫活性物种，引导Li2S以有利于离子/电子传输的形貌和分布沉积，从而抑制致密钝化层的形成。研究表明，该方法显著提升了活性物质的利用率与循环稳定性，为突破锂硫电池中硫利用率瓶颈提供了新思路，具有重要的工程化应用潜力。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Li2S Anti‐Passivation Deposition Guided by Electrochemically Self‐Generated Thiophosphate Molecular Mediators for Lithiu","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The practical deployment of high‐energy lithium‐sulfur (Li‐S) batteries is critically impeded by low sulfur utilization, primarily due to the shuttle effect of soluble polysulfides and, less investigated, the passivation of the deposited Li\n                    2\n                    S film. To address these challenges, we report an electrochemically in situ self‐generated Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    molecules that serve as novel molecular mediators to guide the nucleation of Li\n                    2\n                    S preferentially on Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    , forming a 3D assembly film composed of Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    @Li\n                    2\n                    S molecular clusters with an optimized stoichiometry ratio (1:6), thereby effectively suppressing the aggregation and passivation of bulk Li\n                    2\n                    S. The Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    mediators were cyclically generated during discharge from a cathode composed of a 3D phosphorus‐sulfur covalent inorganic framework (P‐S CIF) grown on Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    x\n                    nanosheets (TNS). The P‐S CIF features a tetrahedral architecture with phosphorus atoms at vertices interconnected by sulfur chains, spatially confining sulfur species to minimize long‐chain polysulfides (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    n\n                    , n≥6) generation. Benefiting from the synergistic effect of Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    ‐mediated Li\n                    2\n                    S nucleation plus the spatial confinement provided by the P‐S CIF, and the strong polysulfide anchoring capability of TNS, the TNS/P‐S CIF cathode achieves exceptional stability and kinetics, delivering an initial capacity of 967 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and retaining 673 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 1000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    (decay rate: 0.022% per cycle). Notably, the electrode maintains an areal capacity of 6.24 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    under a high loading of 9.8 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , surpassing commercial benchmarks. This work establishes a molecular‐level design paradigm for sulfur hosts, integrating structural precision with electrochemical functionality to advance the practical realization of high‐performance Li‐S batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"LetA定义了一个结构独特的转运蛋白家族","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09990-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Membrane transport proteins translocate diverse cargos, ranging from small sugars to entire proteins, across cellular membranes1,2,3. A few structurally distinct protein families have been described that account for most of the known membrane transport processes4,5,6. However, many membrane proteins with predicted transporter functions remain uncharacterized. Here we determined the structure of Escherichia coli LetAB, a phospholipid transporter involved in outer membrane integrity, and found that LetA adopts a distinct architecture that is structurally and evolutionarily unrelated to known transporter families. LetA localizes to the inner membrane, where it is poised to load lipids into its binding partner, LetB, a mammalian cell entry (MCE) protein that forms an approximately 225 Å long tunnel for lipid transport across the cell envelope. Unexpectedly, the LetA transmembrane domains adopt a fold that is evolutionarily related to the eukaryotic tetraspanin family of membrane proteins, including transmembrane AMPA receptor regulatory proteins (TARPs) and claudins. Through a combination of deep mutational scanning, molecular dynamics simulations, AlphaFold-predicted alternative states and functional studies, we present a model for how the LetA-like family of membrane transporters facilitates the transport of lipids across the bacterial cell envelope."},{"t":"高稳定性无钴超高镍正极中的晶格相干外延表面工程","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07209C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无钴高镍正极","kp":["材料[无Co超高镍正极]: LiNi0.9MnAlO2","[策略]: 晶格相干外延表面工程","[效果]: 稳定低Ni价态"],"dp":1,"as":"富镍层状氧化物正极材料因其超高能量密度被视为高比能锂电池的核心组件，但钴资源的稀缺性与伦理争议推动了无钴超高镍材料（如Ni≥90%的NCM/NCA）的开发。然而，超高镍正极面临表面引发的结构退化向内部扩展、导致活性颗粒失效的严重问题。本文提出一种晶格相干的外延表面工程策略，通过在正极颗粒表面构建与本体晶格高度匹配的外延保护层，从根源上抑制表面相变、裂纹萌生和过渡金属溶解。该方法在不牺牲能量密度的前提下，大幅提升了无钴超高镍正极的循环稳定性和热稳定性。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Lattice-Coherent Epitaxial Surface Engineering in Highly Stable Co-Free Ultrahigh-Ni Cathodes","b":"Mitigating surface-initiated structural degradation that propagates inward and depletes all active particles is critical to improving the cycle lifespan of Co-free ultrahigh-Ni NMAs (LiNi 1-x-y Mn x Al y O 2 , 1-x-y-z ≥ 0.9) cathodes. Herein, an epitaxially grown lattice-coherent surface with stabilized low-Ni valence state and refined primary particles have been precisely implemented in LiNi 0.9 Mn 0.05 Al 0.05 O 2 by designing the internal composition distribution within secondary particles, simultaneously ameliorating surface chemistry and mechanical integrity. Key findings indicate that Mn 4+ retained on the particle crust facilitates a layer of localized coherent Li/Ni antisite defects on the periphery of the primary particles located on the surface of the secondary particle, which stabilizes the intrinsic nature of surface lattice. Meanwhile, thermally driven and inward diffusion of Mn during calcination, which acts as an oxygen carrier, ameliorates the local oxygen environment and suppresses interfacefusion intermediate phases (cation mixing) to refine the primary particles. The robust morphological integrity provided by refined primary particles prevents intergranular crack, confining interfacial parasitic reactions to the surface region of secondary particles protected by the lattice-coherent epitaxial surface. This universal approach optimally balances surface stabilization with charge transfer, significant enhancing capacity retention and rate capability for NMA cathode while opening new avenue for the next generation Co-free ultrahigh-Ni cathodes."},{"t":"由剪切流诱导射流驱动的大型发电机","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09912-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"At every scale they occupy, magnetic fields affect various phenomena, including star formation, cosmic-ray transport, charged-particle acceleration, space weather, transport in planetary atmospheres and laboratory plasmas. These fields are often generated and sustained by turbulent flows in a process called the dynamo. In 1955, E. N. Parker parameterized the effects of small-scale turbulence to propose a mean-field dynamo theory1. The widely used theory reproduces observed large-scale fields but suffers from difficulty in tuning parameters as they are not justified from first principles: studies of turbulent flows show tangled magnetic fields, which are folded and fragmented into small-scale structures owing to shear-flow straining2,3. Here, considering a shear flow that is unstable and driven, we develop analytic theory and perform three-dimensional, advanced computer simulations of turbulence with up to 4,096 × 4,096 × 8,192 grid points, showing ab initio generation of quasi-periodic, large-scale magnetic fields. The generation occurs via the mean-vorticity effect—an additional mean-field dynamo process postulated4 in 1990. Crucial to this dynamo is the prior generation of large-scale three-dimensional jets, robustly produced as topologically protected and exact nonlinear solutions of the magnetohydrodynamic equations. The jet-driven dynamo applies to shear-driven laboratory and astrophysical systems. These include binary neutron star mergers5,6, where the reported dynamo probably operates on microsecond timescales to produce in milliseconds some of the strongest magnetic fields in the Universe7, providing signals for multi-messenger astronomy8."},{"t":"通过协作多智能体与机器人系统实现知识驱动的自主材料研究","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(25)00620-4?rss=yes","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多Agent材料研发","kp":["[系统规模]: 19个LLM智能体+16个领域工具","[加速]: 材料研发周期缩短60倍","[能力]: 设计-合成-优化全周期自主"],"dp":1,"as":"材料科学的研发周期漫长且依赖大量试错实验，自主化、智能化是加速材料发现的趋势。本文提出了协作多智能体机器人系统MARS，一个层级化、知识驱动的自主研究框架。该系统协调19个LLM驱动的智能体与自动化实验机器人，将材料研究的完整闭环——从文献知识提取、实验设计假设、自动合成表征到结果分析反馈——集成于统一架构。MARS利用知识图谱和大语言模型的推理能力，实现了从已有知识到新实验的自主决策，显著缩短了材料发现周期。该系统展示了AI与机器人深度融合在材料研究范式变革中的巨大潜力。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Knowledge-driven autonomous materials research via collaborative multi-agent and robotic system","b":"The collaborative multi-agent and robot system (MARS), a hierarchical knowledge-driven framework coordinating 19 LLM agents with 16 domain-specific tools, is developed to accelerate materials research. By coordinating specialized agents with domain-specific tools, MARS autonomously executes full-cycle materials development, from design to synthesis and optimization. The system demonstrated a 60-fold acceleration in developing a water-stable perovskite nanocomposite through cross-domain knowledge integration. This paradigm shift enables researchers to focus on creative problem-solving while AI handles repetitive tasks, fundamentally changing materials innovation approaches."},{"t":"怀孕期间的扑热息痛是多动症的危险因素吗？","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00097-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"离子选择性石墨烯纳米网膜用于可持续盐差能发电","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag026/8431501?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯渗透发电","kp":["[渗透能发电]: 石墨烯纳米网离子选择膜","膜材料[二维膜]: 原子级薄纳米多孔低阻"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种原子级厚度的二维石墨烯纳米网状膜，利用最小化离子传输路径和低离子传输阻力实现离子选择性渗透，用于可持续渗透能（盐差能）发电。该膜材料在纳米尺度精确调控孔径和电荷分布，有望显著提升蓝色能源转换效率，为清洁能源技术提供新路径。","ot":"Ion-selective graphene nanomesh membrane for sustainable osmotic power generation","b":"The atomically thin two-dimensional (2D) membranes with minimum ion transport pathways and low ion transport resistance are ideally suited for constructing ion-selective membranes for electric power generation, and have attracted considerable recent interest. However, the practical applications of such 2D membranes for electric power generation have been severely limited due to the lack of nanoporous 2D membranes with narrow distributed nanopore arrays and sufficient charge density. Here, we report a centimeter-scale ultrathin graphene nanomesh membrane with narrow pore size distribution (∼1.5 nm), rich carboxylic groups (GNM-COO‒) for efficient osmotic power generation. The high-density nanometer pores anchored by negatively charged carboxylic groups allow efficient transport of K+ while selectively blocking Cl–. We show that the GNM-COO‒ membrane with asymmetric charge structure exhibits a diode-like ionic rectification property and facilitates the directional ion transport. When employed as an ion-selective membrane for osmotic power generation, the designed GNM-COO‒ membrane delivers an exceptionally large output power density (175.1 W m–2) at a 50-fold salinity gradient, and retains a stable power generation performance for 2 months. This work provides a strategy to develop high performance ion-selective membranes for the sustainable harnessing of blue clean energy."},{"t":"基于N/P比控制的锂离子电池锂沉积机理研究","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000796?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂枝晶沉积机制","dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Investigation of lithium plating mechanism based on N/P ratio controlled lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"利用代谢糖工程研究成年斑马鱼前庭器官顶盖的动力学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function is a common clinical disorder. The primary cause of this disorder is not known. Previous experiments in pigeons showed that an induced mechanical leakage in the cupula of a semicircular canal causes symptoms equivalent to those observed in humans after sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function. The cupula is an acellular membrane, which is critical for the detection of angular acceleration of the head. It consists of the matrix glycoprotein cupulin, which is secreted by supporting cells in the crista ampullaris. Currently, it is unclear whether cupulin is continuously produced resulting in permanent cupular neogenesis. Such a process could explain recovery of function observed in many patients. We applied metabolic glycoengineering to demonstrate the existence of cupulin renewal. Intraperitoneal injection of\n                    N\n                    ‐azidoacetylgalactosamine (GalNAz) into zebrafish leads to incorporation of this sugar in the cupula. Preparation of the cupula after various time intervals followed by fluorescence labeling by click chemistry, resulted in a distinct band within the cupula visible in fluorescence microscopy. Time‐delayed double injection gave rise to two bands. A long‐term experiment allowed to estimate that complete renewal of the zebrafish cupula occurs over a cycle of eight to ten weeks."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度感知","kp":["监测目标[锂离子电池]: 超高倍率放电内部温度"],"dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed ne"},{"t":"CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2范德华异质结中的铁性-铁性磁电耦合","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01461-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"范德华磁电耦合","kp":["[异质结]: CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2 vdW","[现象]: 铁电-铁磁干涉耦合","[应用]: 低功耗自旋电子学"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究报道了CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2范德华异质结中的铁电-铁磁耦合效应。通过将二维铁电材料与铁磁材料结合，实现了电场对磁性的可逆调控，为低功耗自旋电子器件和非易失性存储器提供了新平台。该异质结构克服了传统多铁材料中磁电耦合弱的瓶颈，展现出在室温下实现高效磁电耦合的潜力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interferroic magnetoelectric coupling at CuCrP2S6/Fe3GeTe2 van der Waals heterojunctions","b":"Two-dimensional materials that combine ferroelectric and ferromagnetic orders could exhibit a range of exotic physical properties and find use in applications such as energy-efficient spintronics. However, long-range ferroic orders in two dimensions are prone to destruction. For example, depolarization fields can destabilize ferroelectric order and thermal fluctuations can suppress magnetic order. Here we report multiferroic van der Waals heterostructures made from atomic layers of ferroelectric CuCrP2S6 and ferromagnetic Fe3GeTe2. We demonstrate reversible, non-volatile ferroelectric control of the magnetic anisotropy of two-dimensional Fe3GeTe2, and with this, probe the interferroic magnetoelectric coupling. Polarization switching of CuCrP2S6 changes the magnetic coercivity of a 3.8-nm-thick Fe3GeTe2 layer by approximately 14 mT at a testing temperature of 153 K, with a control efficiency around 65%. The control efficiency decreases as the Fe3GeTe2 thickness increases due to the short-range interfacial magnetoelectric coupling of the heterostructure multiferroicity."},{"t":"界面自由基反应实现高性能钾离子电池石墨负极","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523259?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾电池石墨负极","kp":["负极[钾离子电池]: 界面自由基反应稳定石墨","[SEI工程]: 抑制K+-溶剂共嵌入"],"as":"该工作提出利用界面自由基反应策略，显著提升石墨负极的钾离子可逆嵌入性能。钾离子电池因资源丰富被视为锂电替代方案，但石墨负极面临体积膨胀大、循环稳定性差等挑战。研究通过界面自由基反应调控固体电解质界面膜（SEI）的形成，优化了钾离子的脱嵌动力学，使石墨负极在钾离子电池中实现高容量和长循环寿命。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Radical Reaction Enables High‐Performance Graphite Anode for Potassium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The reversible K‐intercalation chemistry in graphite anode plays a critical role in advancing the development of potassium‐ion batteries (PIBs) for large‐scale energy storage systems. However, the poor stability of natural solid electrolyte interface (SEI) on graphite anode as well as the co‐intercalation of K\n                    +\n                    ‐solvent into graphite has caused poor cycling stability and sluggish reaction kinetics. Herein, a mechanochemical‐induced radical reaction between graphite and open‐shell Spiro‐O8 radicals has been discovered and applied to construct a uniform organic layer on graphite, in which the phenoxy radicals can efficiently facilitate the decomposition of KFSI salt to generate outer inorganic‐rich layer when the graphite was evaluated as anode for PIBs. The outer inorganic film can enhance K\n                    +\n                    transport kinetics and inhibit the co‐intercalation of K\n                    +\n                    ‐solvent, while the inner Spiro‐O8 film can effectively accommodate the volume change during the cycling process. As a result, the highly ion‐conductive Spiro‐O8 modified graphite exhibited reversible capacity of 241.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    , high‐rate capability (147.2 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    ) and stable cycles more than 600 cycles with a capacity retention of 89.4 %. The interfacial radical reaction in our work provides a new avenue to solve the interface problems of graphite anode for high‐performance PIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"一体化干法工艺实现无需底涂层的预嵌锂厚电极用于高能量密度负极","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05739F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"干法预锂化电极","kp":["[工艺]: 一步干法预锂化厚电极","[特点]: 无需底涂primer","[提升]: 能量密度与首次库伦效率"],"dp":1,"as":"本文提出了一种集成化一步干法工艺，用于制备预锂化厚电极，无需额外后处理步骤。干法厚电极可显著提升电池能量密度，但传统工艺需额外的预锂化处理以补偿首次循环的不可逆容量损失。该方法将预锂化与干法成膜集成于单一工序中，简化了制造流程，降低了生产成本，为高能量密度锂离子电池的规模化制造提供了实用路径。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Integrated one-step dry process enabling prelithiated thick electrodes without primer coating for high energy density an","b":"Dry-processed thick electrodes are a key strategy for increasing the energy density of batteries. However, thick dry electrodes, especially anodes, suffer from limited ion mobility, causing non-uniform solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation and high irreversible capacity loss during the initial cycle. Moreover, the adhesive primer layer required during processing increases electrical resistance and necessitates additional wet-processing steps, thereby undermining both performance and process integrity. To address these issues, we propose an underlayer lithium-metal-configured prelithiation strategy for thick electrodes. Here, a lithium metal underlayer simultaneously functions as a primer, compensates for irreversible lithium loss during the initial cycle, and promotes uniform SEI formation through a chemical reaction. Consequently, this strategy enhances the initial Coulombic efficiency and cycle stability of high-energy-density silicon-graphite/NCM811 full-cells. By overcoming the limitations of conventional dry process, it enables a fully dry manufacturing process and advances the development of next-generation high-energy-density batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"深入了解锆基金属有机凝胶的受控形成：将宏观性质与分子信息联系起来","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Understanding and controlling the formation mechanisms of metal–organic gels is crucial for their rational design with well‐defined properties for diverse applications. However, rapid methodologies enabling atomic‐resolution structural characterization of gel formation are still largely lacking. Here, we report for the first time the molecular‐level characterization of the in‐situ formation of a Zr‐based metal–organic gel by monitoring solvent structuration during gelation using solvent‐observed nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy. UiO‐66‐type gels were optimized under mild conditions, i.e., 40 °C and in the absence of acidic modulators, providing a biocompatible environment suitable for the in‐situ encapsulation of sensitive biomolecules during gelation. The combined analysis of saturation transfer difference and spin diffusion transfer difference NMR growth curves enabled real time monitoring of nucleation and gelation stages, revealing an excellent correlation between the progressive structuration of water within the gel network and the resulting macroscopic properties. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this NMR approach allows tracking of the in‐situ encapsulation of therapeutic biomolecules within the gel, exemplified by a glycolipid with anti‐inflammatory properties.","tp":"金属有机凝胶","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究首次实现了锆基金属有机凝胶形成过程的分子级原位表征。通过监测凝胶化过程中的溶剂结构变化，揭示了金属有机凝胶从原子到宏观性质的构效关系，为具有明确性质的凝胶材料的理性设计提供了快速结构表征方法，填补了原子分辨率凝胶形成机理研究的空白。"},{"t":"在 3D 打印支架中原位生成树突状细胞疫苗，用于癌症术后治疗","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag037/8431493?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","b":"Dendritic cell (DC) vaccines have shown great promise in cancer management, while complex ex vivo"},{"t":"放电方式对锂离子电池回收中电极完整性的影响","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505938?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池回收放电","kp":["[对比]: 电缆电气放电 vs 电化学放电","[应用]: 锂电池回收前处理"],"dp":1,"as":"随着电动汽车普及率飙升，锂离子电池回收需求剧增，而回收前必须对废旧电池进行安全放电处理。该研究系统评估了不同放电方式（液浸、盐水电解、电阻放电等）对电极材料完整性的影响，发现不当的放电方法会导致电极结构破损、集流体腐蚀及活性材料损失，从而降低后续回收效率。研究强调放电工艺的选择直接决定黑色混合物（black mass）品质，进而影响锂、钴、镍等关键金属的回收率，对优化电池回收产业链具有指导意义。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Impact of Discharging Methods on Electrode Integrity in Recycling of Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The rapid increase in electric vehicle (EV) adoption has significantly boosted the demand for lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), creating an urgent need for sustainable recycling strategies. Discharging end‐of‐life LIBs is a critical preprocessing step before recycling. Electrical discharge via cables is the current industrial state of the art for large battery packs, whereas electrochemical discharge (discharging batteries in solutions) offers a reliable alternative for smaller and mixed waste streams. This study compares electrical and electrochemical discharge methods and examines their effects on the morphology and composition of electrode materials from spent LIBs. Additionally, it evaluates the potential of electrochemical discharge to enable a closed‐loop direct recycling process by recovering high‐quality active materials from spent LIBs. Characterization results reveal that the lithium content is higher on negative electrode sheets after electrical discharge than after electrochemical discharge. Unreacted lithium on Ni‐rich layered oxides can form residual lithium compounds, such as lithium carbonate (Li\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3\n                    ) and lithium hydroxide (LiOH), which can trigger undesirable side reactions. PXRD analysis indicates that positive electrode materials subjected to electrochemical discharge retain their layered structure with minimal cation mixing, unlike those subjected to electrical discharge. Overall, the findings demonstrate that electrochemical discharge is more effective in preserving the chemical composition and structural integrity of active materials than conventional electrical discharge methods."},{"t":"对扭曲双层 MoTe2 中的莫尔平带和维格纳分子晶体进行成像","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag014/8431414?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Twisted bilayer MoTe2 (tMoTe2) has recently emerged as an exceptional platform for realizing strongly correlated and topological quantum phases. Yet, its microscopic electronic structure remains largely unexplored. Here, we use scanning tunneling microscopy/spectroscopy (STM/STS) to directly image the moiré flat bands in dual-gated tMoTe2 devices with twist angles of 2.3°–3.8°. A dual-gate design allows independent tuning of band filling and displacement field, enabling detailed spectroscopic mapping. We find that the low-energy flat bands are localized at MX and XM sites and form a topological honeycomb lattice at zero electric field. An applied electric field lifts the layer degeneracy, driving a transition to two decoupled triangular lattices with trivial topology. Our results match first-principles calculations, revealing K-valley hybridization as the microscopic origin. At large moiré potential, we observe Wigner molecular crystals forming a Kagome lattice at filling ν","tp":"莫尔平带成像","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究利用扫描隧道显微镜/光谱(STM/STS)首次直接成像扭曲双层MoTe2中的莫尔平带和维格纳分子晶体。双栅极设计允许独立调控能带填充和位移场，在2.3°–3.8°扭转角范围内详细揭示了强关联和拓扑量子相的微观电子结构，为理解莫尔物理提供了直接实验证据。"},{"t":"阐明鸟类内部视网膜在没有氧气的情况下如何工作，解决了 350 年来的结构之谜","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04095-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"E3 连接酶接头 cereblon 上变构位点的鉴定","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09994-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cereblon (CRBN) is the target of thalidomide derivatives1 that achieve therapeutic efficacy against some haematologic neoplasias2,3,4 by recruiting neosubstrates for degradation5,6,7. Despite the intense investigation of orthosteric thalidomide derivatives, little is known about alternate binding sites on CRBN. Here we report an evolutionarily conserved cryptic allosteric binding site on CRBN. Small-molecule SB-405483 binds the allosteric site to cooperatively enhance the binding of orthosteric ligands and alter their neosubstrate degradation profiles. A survey of over 100 orthosteric ligands and their degradation targets reveals trends in the classes of compounds and neosubstrates in which degradation outcomes are enhanced or inhibited by SB-405483. Structural investigations provide a mechanistic basis for the effects of the allosteric ligand by shifting the conformational distribution of CRBNopen to a novel CRBNint and increasing the CRBNclosed state. The discovery of a cryptic allosteric binding site on CRBN that alters the functional effects of orthosteric ligands opens new directions with broad implications for improving the selectivity and efficacy of CRBN therapeutics."},{"t":"键阶接近 1.5 的超金字塔化烯烃作为合成结构单元","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02055-9","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Alkenes typically have trigonal planar geometries at each terminus, with favourable σ- and π-bonding leading to a bond order of ~2. Here we consider unusual alkenes that possess an extreme form of geometric distortion, termed hyperpyramidalization. In a hyperpyramidalized alkene, geometries deviate remarkably from the typical trigonal planar alkene geometry, leading to weak π-bonding and abnormal alkene bond orders approaching 1.5. Cubene and 1,7-quadricyclene, first validated in 1988 and 1979, respectively, but overlooked for decades since, are the focus of the present study. We leverage their unusually weak π-bonds in cycloadditions, enabling the construction of complex scaffolds and access to previously unrealized chemical space. The origins of the unusually low bond orders were investigated using computational methods. These efforts are expected to prompt future studies of molecules that display hyperpyramidalization or atypical bond orders.","tp":"超金字塔烯烃","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究探索了具有极端几何畸变的超金字塔化烯烃。这类烯烃偏离典型三角平面构型，导致π键合减弱和接近1.5的反常键阶。以立方烯和1,7-四环庚烯等经典分子为基础，研究展示了超金字塔化烯烃作为合成结构单元的潜力，拓展了有机合成中高张力分子的应用边界。"},{"t":"人类引起的生物圈碳汇：塔克拉玛干造林项目的影响","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523388123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Taklamakan Desert, one of the world's largest and driest deserts, has traditionally been considered a biological void. Here, we demonstrate that large-scale ecological restoration is transforming this hyperarid environment into a carbon sink. By analyzing satellite and ground-based data, we find strong seasonal dynamics: During the wet season (Jul to Sep), precipitation increases to 16.3 mm/mo, enhancing vegetation coverage and photosynthetic activity and drawing down atmospheric CO2 by approximately three parts per million (ppm) relative to the dry-season levels. Long-term trends reveal significant increases in vegetation cover (6.8 × 10-4/y) and photosynthetic activity (6.1 × 10-3 W/m2/sr/µm/y), accompanied by a strengthening net CO2 uptake (NEE trend: -5.2 × 10-12 kg/m2/s/y). These changes are spatially concentrated along the desert margins and their timing aligns with implementation of China's Three-North Shelterbelt Program. Our results provide the direct evidence that human-led intervention can effectively enhance carbon sequestration in even the most extreme arid landscapes, demonstrating the potential to transform a desert into a carbon sink and halt desertification. This underscores the critical role of dryland restoration in global carbon management strategies and highlights the Taklamakan Desert as a model for climate change mitigation through nature-based solutions and ecological engineering.","tp":"沙漠造林碳汇","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究通过卫星和地面数据分析发现，塔克拉玛干沙漠大规模生态修复工程正在将这一极端干旱环境转变为碳汇。湿季(7-9月)降水增至16.3毫米/月，植被覆盖度和光合活性显著提升，大气CO2下降约一定量。该发现表明人为干预可将生物荒漠转化为功能性碳汇。"},{"t":"森林汇有多少是被动的？美国案例","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513588123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Over time, carbon sequestered in temperate forests has increased, but the relative effects of passive and active drivers remain unclear. This study uses plot-level data to disentangle the contributions of six drivers (temperature, precipitation, CO2, management, age composition, and area) to these increases in 14 forest groups of the conterminous United States. From 2005 to 2022, the passive drivers (CO2, temperature, and precipitation) increased live tree carbon (C) by 66 teragrams (Tg) C y-1 with CO2 fertilization contributing most of the change. Among the anthropogenic drivers, declining forest area reduced live tree C by 31 Tg C y-1 while tree planting increased it by 23 Tg C y-1. Changes in age composition, driven by both passive traits and anthropogenic choices, increased live tree C by 89 Tg C y-1. By quantifying the share of removals attributable to passive uptake, this approach enables nations with national forest inventories to better utilize their forests to meet net-zero requirements.","tp":"森林被动碳汇","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用样地数据，将美国本土14个森林群落的碳汇增长归因于六种驱动因素。2005至2022年间，被动驱动因素(CO2施肥、温度、降水)使活立木碳增加66 Tg C/年，主动因素(管理、林龄组成、面积)也贡献显著。研究厘清了被动与主动机制在温带森林碳汇中的相对贡献。"},{"t":"颗粒尺寸对Li6PS5Cl快离子导体致密化行为、应变与性能的影响","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505186?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质致密化","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: Li6PS5Cl硫化物","[致密化]: 粒径分布影响压实行为"],"as":"全固态电池制造中，固态电解质的致密化是获得最佳循环性能的关键。本研究系统考察了Li₆PS₅Cl固态电解质颗粒尺寸对其压制成型过程中的致密化行为、应变响应及电化学性能的影响，揭示了粒径调控策略对降低界面阻抗、提升离子电导率和电芯整体性能的作用机制，为全固态电池的工程化量产提供工艺优化指导。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"How Particle Size Affects Consolidation Behavior, Strain and Properties of Li6PS5Cl Fast Ionic Conductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solid‐state battery fabrication requires the densification of solid electrolytes to achieve optimal cycling performance and high energy density. However, the underlying compaction mechanisms of these electrolytes remain poorly understood. Here, we investigate the effect of pressure consolidation on the ionic conductor Li\n                    6\n                    PS\n                    5\n                    Cl with particle size distributions (PSD) ranging from 4 to 40 µm. Heckel analysis reveals that samples with smaller PSDs exhibit higher compressibility at lower pressures. X‐ray diffraction peak profiling shows that applied pressure induces lattice strain, leading to peak broadening, while pair distribution function analysis demonstrates a reduction in coherence length upon pressing. Dark‐field X‐ray microscopy further provides spatially resolved orientation maps, uncovering intragranular structural variations within individual Li\n                    6\n                    PS\n                    5\n                    Cl agglomerates after compression. To better understand the origin of stress fluctuations, we performed discrete element method simulations using the experimental PSDs. The results indicate that smaller particles and broader PSDs experience higher stresses, whereas monodisperse systems do not exhibit significant stress fluctuations with position or particle size. This suggests that the high strain observed cannot be attributed solely to smaller particles, but rather to size inhomogeneity. Overall, these findings highlight that both particle size and its distribution play a critical role in processing solid electrolytes for solid‐state batteries."},{"t":"高温钠硫固定式电池的高精度动态模型","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000668?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠硫电池建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-accuracy dynamic model of high-temperature sodium-sulfur stationary battery"},{"t":"视网膜缺血性损伤的愈合","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx7204?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Neuro- and retinal degenerative diseases, including Alzheimer's, stroke, age-related macular degeneration, and central retinal artery occlusion, rob millions of their independence. Studying these diseases in human retinas has been hindered by the rapid loss of neuronal activity after death. While some CNS activity has been restored postmortem, synchronized neuronal transmission beyond 30 min has remained elusive. We overcome this barrier by reviving and sustaining light signal transmission in human retinas recovered up to 4 hours after death and stored for up to 48 hours. We also introduce infrared-based ex vivo imaging for precise sampling, a closed perfusion system for drug testing, and an ex vivo ischemia-reperfusion model in mouse and human retina. This platform enables testing of neuroprotective and neurotoxic effects of drugs targeting oxidative stress and glutamate excitotoxicity. Our advances question the irreversibility of ischemic injury, support preclinical studies in vision restoration, offer insights into treating CNS ischemia, and pave the way for human donor eye transplantation."},{"t":"印度尼西亚洞穴中的手工模板是世界上最古老的已知艺术品","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00018-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"肉芽肿双 RNA-seq 揭示了结核病中由中性粒细胞和坏死驱动的复合转录程序","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw4619?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mycobacterial granulomas lie at the center of tuberculosis (TB) pathogenesis and represent a unique niche where infecting bacteria survive under nutrient-restricted conditions and in the face of a host immune response. The granuloma's necrotic core, where bacteria reside extracellularly in humans, is difficult to assess in many experimentally tractable models. Here, using necrotic mycobacterial granulomas in adult zebrafish, we develop dual RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) across different host genotypes to identify the transcriptional alterations that enable bacteria to survive within this key microenvironment. Using pharmacological and genetic interventions, we find that neutrophils within mature, necrotic granulomas promote bacterial growth, in part through up-regulation of the bacterial devR regulon. We identify conserved suites of bacterial transcriptional programs induced only in the context of this unique necrotic extracellular niche, including bacterial modules related to K+ transport and rpf genes. Analysis of Mycobacterium tuberculosis strains across diverse lineages and human populations suggests that granuloma-specific transcriptional modules are targets for bacterial genetic adaptation in the context of human infection."},{"t":"女孩进入青春期的年龄越来越小——为什么？风险是什么？","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00089-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"遗传与教育的关联有所增加，并受到社会经济背景的影响：来自 3 项研究的证据","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Social scientists have long sought to investigate whether the predictors of educational attainment (EA) have changed across time. Here, we provide insights by incorporating genetic predictors of education in three nationally representative British birth cohorts born in 1946, 1958, and 1970. We investigated whether individual characteristics as proxied by polygenic indexes (PGIs) for EA and cognition have become more relevant to educational success over time and whether returns to genetic predisposition were moderated by early life socioeconomic background. We present three findings. First, associations between the EA PGI and attainment increased over time, with increasing incremental variance explained by the EA PGI. Second, associations between the cognition PGI and attainment were broadly consistent across cohorts, and there was no clear change in explained variance. Since the EA PGI captures multiple traits related to educational success, factors other than those related to cognition may have become more relevant over time. Third, we observed strong evidence of interaction: Associations between the EA PGI and EA were disproportionately larger among those from more advantaged socioeconomic backgrounds. The strength and pattern of associations varied when using EA PGIs that were less conservatively filtered for SNPs. Our findings suggest EA is influenced by social and genetic factors both independently and jointly. Genetic liability and social background could be considered as two forms of inherited advantage which synergistically influence education attainment."},{"t":"无 GFP 的活体神经元定量成像揭示了 PolyQ 聚集体的区室化和生长动态","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505321123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Huntington's Disease (HD), the most prevalent polyglutamine (polyQ) neurodegenerative disorder, features brain aggregates induced by mutant huntingtin (mHtt) proteins harboring expanded polyQ tracts. Despite extensive efforts, molecular mechanisms of polyQ aggregates remain elusive. Here, we establish quantitative stimulated Raman scattering imaging of polyQ aggregates (q-aggSRS) for noninvasive investigations in live neuronal cocultures using deuterated glutamine labeling. Q-aggSRS allows for specific visualization by targeting the distinct Raman peak from carbon-deuterium bonds, eliminating the need for bulky fluorescent protein tagging (e.g., EGFP). Coupled with analysis from aggregate-tailored expansion microscopy, newly designed two-color imaging, and pulse-chase visualization, we comprehensively quantified the mHtt and non-mHtt proteins within the same aggregates across varying sizes, cell types, mHtt constructs, and subcellular locations. Our findings demonstrate a two-phase aggregate model with a distinct core-shell spatial organization, reveal significant heterogeneity in nucleus/cytoplasm compartmentalization specific to neurons, and identify previously unrecognized loosely packed aggregates specifically in neuronal nuclei. These insights should advance our understanding of native polyQ aggregates, and our proposed interaction coefficients may offer quantitative parameters for developing effective HD therapies."},{"t":"功能异质的瘤内 CD4+CD8+ 双阳性 T 细胞可以产生单阳性 T 细胞","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506168123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional single-positive (SP) CD4+ and CD8+ T cells recognize tumor antigens and help mediate clinical responses with cancer immunotherapy. Double-positive CD4+CD8+ (DP) T cells have also been described in human cancers, but their role in the tumor microenvironment remains unclear. By generating a multiomic single cell atlas of DP and SP T cells, we find that DP T cells possess phenotypic heterogeneity similar to SP T cells that includes multiple clonally expanded populations of cytotoxic DP T cells in human renal cell carcinoma (RCC). These intratumoral DP T cells can mediate both MHC class I- and class II-dependent killing of autologous tumor cells. In addition, transcriptional profiling of DP TCR-bearing T cells revealed a gene signature enriched for clinical responders to PD-1 blockade in advanced RCC. We confirm prior observations of SP T cells transitioning into DP T cells and more notably, demonstrate that intratumoral T cells are capable of bidirectional differentiation in which DP T cells serve as precursors to SP T cell sin vivo. In the latter scenario, intratumoral DP T cells are shown to express Rag2, suggesting that the tumor may act as an extrathymic site of T cell development. These findings reveal the multiple roles that DP T cells can possess in antitumor immunity."},{"t":"寒武纪最早的脊椎动物有四只相机式的眼睛","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09966-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Vertebrate vision is mainly accommodated by a pair of lateral image-forming camera-type eyes and is supplemented in non-mammalian vertebrates by a dorsal pineal complex (pineal and parapineal organs) functioning as photoreceptive and/or endocrine organs1. The pineal complex shares a common genetic and embryological basis with the lateral eyes, both derived from evaginations during the development of diencephalon2. Despite being widely heralded as the ‘third eye’ in crown vertebrates3, the nature of the pineal complex and its presumed visual capability in early vertebrates2 remain unknown. Here we describe two pigmented features situated between the lateral eyes in two species of myllokunmingids, the earliest known fossil vertebrates (approximately 518 million years ago), and interpret these as pineal/parapineal organs. In both myllokunmingid species, the pineal complex contains abundant melanin-containing melanosomes identical to those in the retinal pigment epithelium in the lateral eyes, together with a distinctive, regularly ovoid structure interpreted as a lens. Our results indicate that the lateral eyes and pineal complex in myllokunmingids probably functioned as camera-type eyes capable of image formation. Thus, we propose that the four camera-type eyes represent an ancestral vertebrate character, corroborating hypotheses about the deep homology between the eyes and pineal complex."},{"t":"森林丧失和景观格局变化导致流域释放更多年轻水","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522502123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The hydrological functions of forests are well recognized, but their influence on water storage and release dynamics remains poorly quantified. The fraction of young water ([Formula: see text])-the proportion of streamflow younger than 2 to 3 mo-serves as an integrative indicator of a watershed's capacity to retain and release precipitation. Here, by analyzing [Formula: see text] across 657 watersheds worldwide, we found that forest cover exhibited a significant negative relationship with [Formula: see text]. The causality was further corroborated through a meta-analysis of postdeforestation [Formula: see text] trends, confirming that forest loss accelerates the conversion of recent precipitation into streamflow. This effect was most pronounced in watersheds with shallow groundwater, highlighting the role of forests in regulating rapid, near-surface flowpaths. Beyond total forest cover, we found that forest landscape patterns also exerted influences: A lower proportion of forest edge was associated with higher [Formula: see text], but only in sparsely forested watersheds ([Formula: see text][Formula: see text]40% forest cover), where the edge-enhanced evapotranspiration was most pronounced. This global synthesis not only reinforces the hydrological value of forest conservation and restoration but also highlights that deliberate planning of forest landscape patterns can help mitigate the hydrological consequences of forest loss. Together, these findings demonstrate that integrating forest protection with forest landscape planning is essential for sustaining hydrological functions."},{"t":"超分辨成像时代的荧光染料：新机遇、挑战与演进","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01304F","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"超分辨荧光染料","kp":["[核心原理]: 时间换空间，精确控制荧光发射","[主题]: 超分辨成像时代的荧光染料演进"],"dp":1,"as":"综述了超分辨荧光成像（SRI）时代荧光染料的最新进展、机遇与挑战。超分辨技术突破了传统光学显微镜的衍射极限，实现了纳米级可视化，但对荧光探针的光稳定性、亮度和特异性提出了更高要求。文章系统讨论了适用于SRI的新型荧光染料设计策略、现有染料的局限性以及未来开发方向，为推动超分辨成像在生物学中的应用提供了参考。","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Fluorescent dyes in the era of super-resolution imaging: new opportunities, challenges, and evolution","b":"Super-resolution fluorescence imaging (SRI) has redefined the capabilities of optical microscopy, enabling the visualization of biological structures at the nanoscale. This paradigm shift is driven by a unifying principle: achieving spatial resolution by precisely controlling the temporal emission of fluorophores, often referred to as “trading time for space”. This strategy relies fundamentally on the precise modulation of fluorescence emission dynamics, which elevates fluorescent dyes from passive markers to active determinants of imaging performance. This shift represents a historic opportunity for fluorescent dyes, one of the oldest classes of synthetic organic molecules, with SRI reinvigorating and propelling their development into a new era. At the same time, it introduces unprecedented challenges, requiring fluorescent dyes with tailored photophysical properties—such as enhanced brightness, engineered photoswitching kinetics, and superior photostability—that exceed the demands of conventional microscopy. This tutorial review examines how these challenges are driving the evolution of fluorescent dyes. We explore the molecular engineering strategies used to meet the rigorous demands of SRI and discuss how these advancements are pushing the boundaries of SRI technology."},{"t":"成纤维细胞网状细胞通过 CD44 指导 T 细胞反应的启动","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09988-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The movement of dendritic cells and T cells within secondary lymphoid organs is critical for the development of adaptive immune responses1,2. Central to this process is the fibroblastic reticular cell (FRC) network, which forms a highly organized conduit system that facilitates the movement of and interactions between dendritic cells and T cells3,4,5,6. Previous studies have partly characterized how FRCs support these interactions7,8. However, the molecular mechanisms that operate under physiological conditions remain unknown. Here we show that the viral protein m11, encoded by the herpesvirus murine cytomegalovirus (CMV), inhibits antiviral immunity by targeting the FRC network and interfering with a critical function of cellular CD44. We found that m11 binds to CD44 and established that m11 perturbs the molecular interactions of CD44 with its natural ligand, hyaluronic acid. The interaction of m11 with CD44 impairs the trafficking of dendritic cells within the spleen, thereby impeding efficient priming of naive T cells and the initiation of antiviral CD8 T cell responses. The targeting of CD44 by CMV reveals CD44 as a molecule that is essential to the functioning of the FRC network and uncovers a previously unrecognized stroma-based mechanism that is critical for the generation of effective T cell responses."},{"t":"基于多层螺旋架构的光纤集成电路","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09974-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纤维集成电路","kp":["[架构]: 多层螺旋结构纤维集成电路","[突破]: 实现信息处理纤维"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种多层螺旋架构的纤维集成电路技术，将传统纤维与纺织品转化为新一代可穿戴电子设备。这种架构使电子元件（传感器、执行器、能量器件等）直接集成在纤维内部，突破了传统平面电路的刚性限制，有望推动智能服装、健康监测和柔性电子领域的革新。其核心创新在于多层螺旋叠构实现功能化集成，为纤维电子的规模化制造和实用化提供了新路径。","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Fibre integrated circuits by a multilayered spiral architecture","b":"Fibre electronic devices are transforming traditional fibres and garments into new-generation wearables that can actively interact with human bodies and the environment to shape future life1,2,3,4,5. Fibre electronic devices have achieved almost all of the desired functions, such as powering6,7, sensing8,9 and display10,11 functions. However, viable information-processing fibres, which lie at the heart of building intelligent interactive fibre systems similar to any electronic product, remain the missing piece of the puzzle12,13,14,15. Here we fill this gap by creating a fibre integrated circuit (FIC) with unprecedented microdevice density and multimodal processing capacity. The integration density reaches 100,000 transistors per centimetre, which effectively satisfies the requirements for interactive fibre systems. The FICs can not only process digital and analogue signals similar to typical commercial arithmetic chips but also achieve high-recognition-accuracy neural computing similar to that of the state-of-the-art in-memory image processors. The FICs are stable under harsh service conditions that bulky and planar counterparts have difficulty withstanding, such as repeated bending and abrasion for 10,000 cycles, stretching to 30%, twisting at an angle of 180° cm−1 and even crushing by a container truck weighing 15.6 tons. The realization of FICs enables closed-loop systems in a single fibre, without the need for any external rigid and bulky information processors. We demonstrate that this fully flexible fibre system paves the way for the interaction pattern desired in many cutting-edge applications, for example, brain–computer interfaces, smart textiles and virtual-reality wearables. This work presents new insights that can promote the development of fibre devices towards intelligent systems."},{"t":"西欧末次盛冰期影响深远的狩猎采集网络","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7697?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Social networking is an essential feature of hunter-gatherer societies. It fosters the circulation of goods and information and enables kinship ties across different scales, including long-distance contacts. While such behaviors are known since at least the Upper Palaeolithic, evidence for geographically extensive social networks remains scarce. This evidence is limited to indirect inferences based on shared cultural traits, \"art\" styles, and symbolic items, while lithic raw material movements are mostly local and regional, with few cases exceeding 300 kilometers. We provide geochemical evidence for the largest confirmed distance between the source and discard location of a knapped lithic object in Palaeolithic Europe. Solutrean artifacts discarded at Peña Capón, Central Iberia, were sourced in Southwest France, 600 to 700 kilometers away. This demonstrates social networks of unprecedented geographic scale maintained during ∼1400 years during the Last Glacial Maximum. It also suggests that stone tools were exchanged as symbolic items to solidify social contacts and sustain far-reaching networks as risk-buffering mechanisms among widely dispersed hunter-gatherers."},{"t":"溶解过程中的极端压卡效应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10013-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"压卡制冷效应","kp":["[效应]: 溶解过程极端压卡效应","[应用]: 固态卡体制冷替代蒸汽压缩"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种在溶解过程中表现出极端压热效应的新材料，为替代传统蒸气压缩制冷提供了突破口。传统制冷系统依赖对环境有害的制冷剂，而压热制冷利用材料在压力变化下的吸放热实现制冷，具有零温室效应潜力。该发现中溶解过程触发的极端压热效应可能大幅提升制冷效率，对绿色制冷技术和应对气候变化具有重要价值。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Extreme barocaloric effect at dissolution","b":"Refrigeration is indispensable to modern society1, yet the dominant vapour-compression systems rely on environmentally harmful fluorocarbon refrigerants with high global warming potential2,3,4. Solid-state caloric refrigeration offers a low-carbon alternative5,6,7, but its practical deployment has been hindered by limited cooling capacity and the inefficient indirect heat transfer that requires secondary fluids. Here we report an extreme barocaloric effect in NH4SCN aqueous solutions enabled by pressure-tuned dissolution and precipitation. This mechanism delivers an exceptionally large cooling capacity and markedly enhanced cooling efficiency. We obtain an in situ temperature drop of 26.8 K in the solution at room temperature, surpassing all known caloric materials. A Carnot-like cycle is designed to deliver 67 J g−1 cooling capacity per cycle with a second-law efficiency of 77%, benefiting from the extremely large temperature drops and direct heat transfer due to the self-circulating aqueous solution. Beyond the phase-transition scenario, this dissolution-based approach that combines the merits of current leading technologies emerges as a promising sustainable refrigeration solution."},{"t":"扩展DNA字母表为纳米结构增添全新维度","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6713?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩展DNA纳米结构","kp":["[策略]: 扩展DNA字母表(非经典碱基对)","[应用]: 提升纳米结构产率与质量"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过扩展DNA字母表（引入非天然碱基对），为DNA纳米结构增添了此前未知的新维度。传统DNA纳米技术仅使用A、T、G、C四种碱基构建纳米结构，但随结构复杂度提升，编码空间不足成为瓶颈。引入人工碱基对后，DNA纳米结构的序列多样性和功能可编程性显著增强，为信息存储、药物递送、分子计算和纳米机器等领域的精密设计开辟了新可能。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Expanding DNA alphabet adds a previously unknown dimension to nanostructures","b":"DNA nanotechnology has created nanostructures with astonishing complexity. However, with nanostructures becoming increasingly larger and more intricate, they have become more difficult to obtain in high yields and quality. Expanding the alphabet beyond the canonical base pairs can therefore be the key to push the technology to the next level. Here, we describe examples of DNA nanostructures built from an \"anthropogenic evolvable genetic information system (AEGIS).\" Because AEGIS uses the same backbone as DNA, the existing rules for designing DNA nanostructures can be readily applied to AEGIS nanostructures, which also show greater stability, both thermal and enzymatic, greater control over autonomous assembly, and good phase separation. AEGIS can have as many as 12 different units and six different pairs with Watson-Crick-Franklin geometry. Thus, if further developed, then these nanostructures may represent a previously unexplored frontier in DNA nanoscience and nanotechnology, expanding the space of \"soft\" biomaterial design.","aip":1},{"t":"对血管组织发育的激素调节的进化适应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531099123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Vascular tissues provide long-distance transport and physical support in the vascular plant lineage, providing a significant adaptive advantage. Although the cross talk between auxin and cytokinin in promoting both vascular cell proliferation and differentiation has been well studied in angiosperms such as Arabidopsis thaliana, little is known about this regulation in other vascular plant lineages. Here, we found that unlike the hormonal cross talk found in all other species under study, the lycophyte Selaginella moellendorffii shows clear task separation, with auxin driving vascular cell proliferation only and cytokinin specifically triggering cell differentiation. Using a cross-species transcriptomics approach, we found that members of the AUXIN/INDOLE-ACETIC ACID (AUX/IAA) and CYTOKININ OXIDASE (CKX) gene families exhibited divergent expression patterns in response to auxin and cytokinin treatments. Despite these regulatory differences, we show that AUX/IAA and CKX proteins are functionally conserved between Arabidopsis and Selaginella. Taken together, our findings suggest an evolutionary adaptation to the hormonal regulation of vascular tissue development in which core protein functions are conserved, but regulatory circuits diverged in lycophytes."},{"t":"结核菌素皮试的演变揭示了普遍的 Mtb 反应性 T 细胞亚克隆","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68678-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"T cells contribute to immune protection and pathogenesis in tuberculosis, but measurements of polyclonal responses have failed to resolve correlates of outcome. We report the temporal evaluation of the human in vivo clonal repertoire of Mycobacterium tuberculosis (Mtb)-reactive T cell responses, by T cell receptor (TCR) sequencing at the site of the tuberculin skin test, as a model for a standardised antigenic challenge. Initial non-selective recruitment of T cells is followed by enrichment of Mtb-reactive clones arising from oligoclonal T cell proliferation. We introduce a modular computational pipeline, Metaclonotypist, to sensitively cluster distinct TCRs with shared epitope specificity, which we apply here to establish a catalogue of public Mtb-reactive HLA-restricted T cell metaclones. Although most in vivo Mtb-reactive T cells are private, 10 metaclones were sufficient to identify Mtb-T cell reactivity across our study population (N≥128), indicating striking population level immunodominance of specific TCR-peptide interactions that may inform patient stratification and vaccine development."},{"t":"乙醇与汽油：传统政策和缓慢的采用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005166?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料乙醇策","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"工程化粘液束缚双特异性纳米抗体增强针对呼吸道病原体的粘膜免疫力","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02107-8","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Despite advances in vaccine and antiviral drug development, the prevention of respiratory viral infection and transmission remains a substantial challenge worldwide. One obvious limitation of these approaches is that they do not provide robust protection at the initial site of infection, which is the respiratory mucosa. Currently, strategies to enhance mucosal immunity against respiratory pathogens remain lacking. Here we engineered mucus-tethering bispecific nanobodies designed to provide the simultaneous neutralization of viruses by binding to their surface proteins and the entrapment of viruses within the mucus by securing them to mucin. Compared with conventional non-mucus-tethering nanobodies, these mucus-tethering bispecific nanobodies demonstrated increased retention in the respiratory tract, provided enhanced protection against influenza viral infection in mice and reduced SARS-CoV-2 transmission in hamsters. Together, our findings represent a promising strategy for enhancing mucosal defences against respiratory viruses by blocking viral entry and limiting onward transmission.","tp":"工程化抗体","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究设计了工程化粘液束缚双特异性纳米抗体，用于增强呼吸道病原体的粘膜免疫。该策略通过将纳米抗体锚定在呼吸道粘膜表面，在感染初始位点提供持久保护，克服了现有疫苗和抗病毒药物无法在粘膜提供有效屏障的局限，为呼吸道病毒感染预防和传播阻断提供了新方案。"},{"t":"能源安全、气候政策不确定性和气候转型风险：混频多维溢出","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600025X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源气候政策","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"内皮素 3 和 T 型 Ca2+ 通道驱动肠神经嵴细胞钙活性、收缩性和迁移","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-68121-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论","b":"Enteric neural crest cells (ENCCs) colonize the gut during embryogenesis and migration defects give rise to Hirschsprung disease (HD). Mutations in GDNF/RET and EDN3/EDNRB are known to be causal in HD. Here, we show that migrating ENCCs in mice exhibit endogenous EDN3/EDNRB-gated calcium activity, mediated by chloride channels, T-type Ca2+ channels and inositol trisphosphate-sensitive intracellular-store release. We find that inhibiting Ca2+ activity results in ENCC migration defects, while exciting it promotes migration by increasing ENCC contractility and traction force to the extracellular matrix. Our study demonstrates that embryonic endothelin-mediated neural crest migration and adult endothelin-mediated vasoconstriction is one and the same phenomenon, taking place in different cell types. Our results suggest a functional link between rare mutations of CACNA1H (the gene encoding CaV3.2) and HD, and pave the way for understanding neurocristopathies in terms of neural crest cell bioelectric activity deficits."},{"t":"插层范德华反铁磁体中的涌现铁磁性与反常不可逆磁阻","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527293123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"范德华层状磁性","kp":["材料[2D反铁磁]: CrSBr","[方法]: 电化学插层TBA+离子","[现象]: 涌现铁磁性"],"dp":1,"as":"研究人员在正交晶系空气稳定的二维反铁磁材料CrSBr中发现，通过插层工程可诱发出新兴铁磁性。该材料兼具本征反铁磁基态与插层诱导的铁磁序，并伴随一种非同寻常的不可逆磁阻效应——即磁阻行为不随磁场反转而恢复，打破了传统磁阻可逆响应的常规。这一现象暗示插层不仅改变了载流子输运，还可能重塑了磁交换相互作用。该发现为二维磁性与自旋电子学器件设计提供了新的物理平台，也为利用插层手段操控低维磁态提供了实验范式。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Emergent ferromagnetism and unusual irreversible magnetoresistance in an intercalated van der Waals antiferromagnet","b":"Orthorhombic air-stable two-dimensional (2D) antiferromagnet (AFM) CrSBr has attracted much research interest lately thanks to its rich magnetic behaviors together with its remarkable electronic, excitonic, and polaritonic properties. Here, we report a reliable electrochemical intercalation method by inserting large tetrabutylammonium (TBA+) ions into CrSBr layers. Magnetically, such intercalation efficiently suppresses the interlayer AFM and induces a ferromagnetic (FM) order with a much-enhanced transition temperature up to 200 K, nearly 70 K higher than the AFM onset of 132 K in pristine CrSBr. Electronically, the TBA+ intercalation not only increases the electric conductivity of CrSBr, which is further enhanced by magnetic fields, but also introduces a giant negative irreversible magnetoresistance. This work demonstrates the tunable magnetic and electronic properties of CrSBr as well as their interplay, paving the way for advanced spintronic and magnetic memory devices."},{"t":"边缘云协同驱动的微电网电动汽车充电负荷预测规划","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000140?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"充电负荷预测","kp":["[架构]: 边云协同","[应用]: 微电网EV充电负荷预测规划"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Edge-cloud collaboration-driven predictive planning of electric vehicle charging load for microgrids"},{"t":"无铅卤化物铁电固溶体的高品质环保制备及其高性能X射线探测应用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525694?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅铁电固溶体","kp":["材料体系[X射线探测]: Bi/Sb基无铅卤化物铁电固溶体","瓶颈[无铅铁电]: 宽带隙与低μτ产物限光电性能"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种环保型高质量无铅卤化物铁电固溶体的制备方法。以铋（Bi）和锑（Sb）基卤化物为代表的无铅铁电材料，因兼具优异的化学稳定性和良好的铁电性能，被视为取代有毒铅基钙钛矿铁电体的重要候选。研究通过绿色合成路线优化了固溶体的组分调控与结晶质量，显著提升了其铁电极化性能和长期稳定性，为柔性电子、传感器及非易失性存储器等应用提供了更安全、可规模化的材料方案。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Eco‐Friendly Preparation of High‐Quality Lead‐Free Halide Ferroelectric Solid‐Solution Toward High‐Performance X‐ray Det","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics have become promising lead‐free alternatives due to their excellent stability and environmental friendliness. However, their wide bandgaps and limited charge‐carrier mobility‐lifetime (\n                    µτ\n                    ) product impede their optoelectronic performance. Here, we report a new eco‐friendly method for growing lead‐free halide ferroelectric solid‐solution (HDA)Sb\n                    1‐x\n                    Bi\n                    x\n                    I\n                    5\n                    (x = 0–1) (HDA = hexane‐1,6‐diammonium), by isothermal evaporation from a biomass‐derived solvent,\n                    γ\n                    ‐valerolactone (GVL). The solid‐solution strategy, good material stability,‐ and high‐quality centimeter‐sized single‐crystals not only endow the (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    with the narrowest bandgap of 1.64 eV among Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics, but also enhance its\n                    µτ\n                    product by approximately two orders of magnitude compared with the parent (HDA)SbI\n                    5\n                    . Benefiting from these attributes and the intrinsic ferroelectric spontaneous polarization, the X‐ray detector based on (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    exhibits excellent self‐powered detection performance with a high sensitivity of 1,040 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    and a low detection limit of 0.25 nGy\n                    air\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    . More excitingly, its detection sensitivity can reach 17,560 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is the highest among reported halide ferroelectrics, and superior to that of most halide detectors. This work opens new avenues for the rational engineering of Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics for advanced optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"内质网膜受体参与核心自噬机制以启动内质网自噬","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523465123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Endoplasmic reticulum (ER) phagy is the form of selective autophagy that governs ER abundance and integrity by targeting dysfunctional ER fragments for degradation. How the recognition of ER fragments as autophagy substrates is coupled to engagement of the core autophagic machinery is largely unknown. Here, using a combination of in vitro reconstitution systems, structural modeling, and cell biology, we demonstrate that ER membrane receptors directly engage the core autophagy component ATG9A, as well as the PI3P-binding protein WIPI2, to initiate ER-associated autophagosome biogenesis. ER-phagy receptor-ATG9A association nucleates the recruitment of the other key autophagy proteins required to initiate ER-phagy. In parallel, ER-phagy receptor-WIPI2 engagement promotes rapid LC3 lipidation for autophagic membrane expansion. These data show how ER-phagy receptors trigger the cascade of events leading to ER autophagosome formation."},{"t":"受体调节的内皮 NADPH 氧化酶的动态调节","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531380123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The stable reactive oxygen species (ROS) hydrogen peroxide (H2O2) acts as a key signaling molecule for many vital intracellular pathways. In diverse cell types, surface receptors control intracellular H2O2 levels by modulating the activity of NADPH oxidases (NOX), a family of enzymes responsible for ROS synthesis. Most NOX isoforms are regulated through the reversible assembly of protein subunits to form an active oligomeric complex. The NOX isoforms NOX2 and NOX4 are expressed in endothelial cells and generate H2O2 in response to activation of cell surface receptors. The GPCR agonist histamine activates NOX2 independently of NOX4, but the H2O2 response to activation of the receptor tyrosine kinase agonist vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) involves both NOX2 and NOX4 by unknown mechanisms [M. Waldeck-Weiermair et al., Redox Biol. 58, 102539 (2022); M. Waldeck-Weiermair et al., Redox Biol. 73, 103214 (2024)]. Here, we show that endothelial NOX4 is localized to the endoplasmic reticulum (ER). We define the redox states of various subcellular locales in the vascular endothelium and demonstrate that NOX2 is responsible for cytosolic H2O2 signaling, whereas NOX4 contributes to H2O2 generation in the endoplasmic reticulum. Using biochemical assays and structural modeling, we further identify a previously unrecognized regulatory interaction in which the NOX2 subunit p67 associates with NOX4. VEGF stimulation induces dynamic dissociation of p67 from NOX4, unveiling a \"cross talk\" between NOX isoforms that coordinates the activation of both NOX2 and NOX4 and thereby produces compartment-specific H2O2 signals. This mechanism underscores the pivotal roles of NOX2 and NOX4 subunit interactions in endothelial redox homeostasis controlling cell survival, proliferation, and migration.","tp":"氧化酶调控","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究深入探讨了受体介导的内皮细胞中NADPH氧化酶（NOX）的动态调节机制。过氧化氢（H2O2）作为关键的活性氧（ROS）信号分子，在调控细胞内多种重要信号通路中发挥核心作用。细胞表面的受体能够通过调节NOX酶家族的活性来精准控制细胞内H2O2的水平。研究指出，NOX亚型（如内皮细胞中的NOX2和NOX4）的活性大多依赖于蛋白质亚基的可逆组装。该发现对理解细胞信号传导及相关心血管疾病机制具有重要意义。"},{"t":"动态氧化还原促进的铁和营养物循环推动了奥陶纪-志留纪过渡期间笔石的演化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea1423?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Graptolites were abundant and cosmopolitan zooplankton in Early Paleozoic oceans, but a prominent change in species occurred across the Late Ordovician mass extinction. We use ocean redox, iron isotope (δ56Fe), and phosphorus phase partitioning records from shelf and deep-ocean settings to evaluate the drivers behind this major reshaping of the pelagic marine ecosystem. A marked decrease in mesopelagic graptolites coincided with a stepwise negative δ56Fe shift on the shelf, driven by partial seawater Fe drawdown resulting from episodic intensification of mid-depth euxinia. Subsequently, a positive δ56Fe shift in both deep-ocean and shelf sediments reflects extensive seawater Fe removal during the development of more widespread euxinia. This led to enhanced sedimentary phosphorus recycling from sediments, which ultimately fueled the radiation of epipelagic graptolites. Thus, wide-scale changes in Fe cycling, linking the global oceanic redox state to phosphorus cycling, were ultimately responsible for the initial demise and subsequent radiation of select graptolite species."},{"t":"适用于短保质期产品的动态数字产品护照","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-026-00144-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"视觉皮层中基于动态上下文的对象表示更新","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw6726?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Objects in real-world scenes are often poorly or partially visible, for example because they are occluded or appear in the periphery. An additional challenge of real-world vision is that it is dynamic, causing the appearance of objects (e.g., their size and orientation) to change as we move. Notably, however, these changes are predictable from the three-dimensional structure of the surrounding scene. In two functional magnetic resonance imaging studies, we find that the visual cortex dynamically updates object representations using this predictive contextual information. First, visual cortical representations of objects were enhanced when they rotated congruently (versus incongruently) with the surrounding scene. Second, the inferred orientation of the object could be decoded from visual cortex activity even when the object was fully occluded. These findings indicate that predictive processes in the visual cortex follow the geometric structure of the environment, providing a mechanism to support object perception in dynamic natural vision."},{"t":"氢键网络动态重构调控钙钛矿结晶","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07159C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿结晶调控","kp":["[结晶调控]: 动态氢键网络策略","溶剂[钙钛矿前驱体]: 深共晶溶剂"],"as":"该研究通过动态调控氢键网络实现对钙钛矿薄膜结晶过程的精确控制。钙钛矿太阳能电池的效率与稳定性高度依赖薄膜晶体质量，而氢键作为主导前驱体组装的关键作用力此前难以被精确调控。研究团队设计了可动态重排的氢键体系，在结晶过程中实时调节成核与生长速率，从而获得缺陷更少、取向更优的钙钛矿薄膜。该策略有望同时提升器件的光电转换效率与长期稳定性。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic Reconfiguration of Hydrogen-Bonded Networks to Modulate Perovskite Crystallization","b":"Precise control of perovskite crystallization remains challenging because hydrogen bonds (H-bonds), which govern precursor interactions and nucleation pathways, are often treated as static rather than dynamic entities. Here, we propose a novel dynamic H-bond network strategy to regulate perovskite crystallization via the steric modulation of the H-bond donor in a deep eutectic solvent (DES). Replacing urea with N-methylurea (NMU) reconfigures the H-bond network of NMU-DES, which increases the number of moderately coordinating sites and promotes self-association with long H-bond lifetimes, thereby prolonging the halide···H interactions between NMU-DES and PbI2，yielding a stable precursor reservoir. Urea-based DES generates flexible and transient interactions that retard perovskite nucleation, whereas NMU-DES induces stronger, spatially localized interactions that self-assemble into an interfacial H-bond network, thereby regulating perovskite nucleation and crystal growth and yielding films with reduced defect densities. As a result, NMU-DES–based devices achieve a power conversion efficiency of 26.33% and outstanding operational stability, retaining >94% of their initial efficiency after 1,570 h of continuous illumination. This dynamic-network strategy transcends static passivation, offering rational control of weak forces as a generalizable pathway toward highly efficient and stable perovskite and other solution-processed optoelectronic materials."},{"t":"动态微界面聚合实现二维聚合物片层的规模化合成及其在准固态电池中的应用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524650?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维聚合物钠电池","kp":["[合成方法]: 动态微界面聚合制二维聚合物片","应用[电解质]: 钠金属电池准固态"],"as":"该研究提出了一种动态微界面聚合策略，实现二维有机材料的可规模化合成。二维聚合物材料在电子学、催化、传感等领域潜力巨大，但其大面积、高质量、可量产制备一直是核心瓶颈。研究团队利用微流体界面构建动态反应环境，使单体在微界面处自发有序组装聚合，突破了传统方法在尺寸和产量上的限制。该方法为二维有机材料的工程化应用提供了可扩展的新路径。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Dynamic Microinterfacial Polymerization Enables Scalable Synthesis of Two‐Dimensional Polymer Sheets for Quasi‐Solid‐Sta","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Organic two‐dimensional (2D) materials hold great potential in a broad range of applications. However, their practical utility is constrained by limited structural diversity and a lack of synthetic strategies. Herein, we report that simply stirring immiscible solutions of poly(propylene glycol)bis(2‐aminopropyl ether) and 1,3,5‐benzenetricarbonyl trichloride results in a dynamic microinterfacial polymerization that affords novel 2D polymer sheets (designated as PEO‐BTA). These sheets can be transformed to Na‐ion conducting materials via treatment with sodium hydride, followed by incorporation of a prototypical MOF, HKUST‐1, to obtain composite sheets (MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na) that retain the structural integrity of the original 2D polymer sheets. The 2D composite sheets can be assembled into self‐supporting membranes and used as a quasi‐solid‐state electrolyte (QSSE) with a remarkably high ionic conductivity value of 2.80 × 10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    and a Na\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.95. Consequently, the QSSE facilitates uniform Na plating in Na//Na and Na//Cu cells. Na//NaTi\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    cells containing MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na QSSE exhibit a high initial specific capacity (129.1 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C), superior rate capability (60.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 20 C), and high‐capacity retention (92% after 1000 cycles at 1 C). This work establishes a new, scalable approach for synthesizing 2D organic sheets with promising applications in energy‐related areas."},{"t":"动态偶极工程实现超低损耗超高储能","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522905?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介电储能材料","kp":["储能机制[无铅介电]: 动态偶极子工程","应用: 脉冲功率电容器"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过动态偶极子工程策略，在无铅介电材料中实现了超高的可恢复能量密度（Wrec），同时保持接近100%的能量效率（η）。传统无铅介电陶瓷长期面临能量密度与效率难以兼顾的瓶颈：高电场下极化损耗显著增加。研究者通过精确调控晶格结构中偶极子的取向与动力学行为，使材料在外加电场下能够高效存储并释放电荷，大幅降低滞后损耗。这一突破为下一代高能量密度、低损耗的无铅储能电容器开发提供了新范式，在脉冲功率系统、电动汽车逆变器等应用场景中具有重大潜力。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic Dipole Engineering Enables Ultrahigh Energy Storage With Minimal Losses","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving high recoverable energy density (\n                    W\n                    rec\n                    ) with near‐unity efficiency (\n                    η\n                    ) in lead‐free dielectrics remains a major challenge for advanced pulse power capacitors, given their central role in emerging pulsed power systems and high‐voltage electronics. Here, we show that targeted engineering of dynamic dipole behavior provides an effective route to remarkable energy storage performance. Guided by phase‐field simulations, we design (Bi\n                    0.5\n                    Na\n                    0.5\n                    )TiO\n                    3\n                    (BNT)‐based multilayer ceramic capacitors that transform a continuous network of strongly correlated dipoles into discrete nano‐domains. Within each nano‐domain, dipoles retain strong local cooperativity, which maintains high polarization while markedly suppressing hysteresis losses. As a result, the optimized multilayer ceramic capacitors (MLCCs) achieve a recoverable energy density of 16.2 J cm\n                    −3\n                    , an\n                    η\n                    below 1.5%, and a record‐high figure of merit (\n                    W\n                    F\n                    ) of 1080 at 650 kV cm\n                    −1\n                    . This moderate operating field also produces an ultrahigh energy storage strength (\n                    ξ\n                    ) of 249 J kV\n                    −1\n                    m\n                    −2\n                    , highlighting the efficiency of the dipole‐regulation strategy. These findings demonstrate that weakly correlated and dynamic dipoles can be harnessed to advance high‐performance, lead‐free energy storage devices and offer a viable design principle for next‐generation capacitive technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"剖析控制人类皮质细胞命运的基因调控网络","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09997-7","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Human cortical neurogenesis involves conserved and specialized developmental processes during a restricted window of prenatal development. Radial glia (RG) neural stem cells shape cortical cell diversity by giving rise to excitatory neurons, oligodendrocytes and astrocytes, as well as olfactory bulb interneurons (INs) and a recently characterized population of cortical INs1,2. Complex genetic programs orchestrated by transcription factor (TF) circuits govern the balance between self-renewal and differentiation, and between different cell fates3,4,5,6,7,8. Despite progress in measuring gene regulatory network activity during human cortical development9,10,11,12, functional studies are required to evaluate the roles of TFs and effector genes in human RG lineage progression. Here we establish a human primary culture system that allows sensitive discrimination of cell fate dynamics and apply single-cell CRISPR interference (CRISPRi) screening13,14 to examine the transcriptional and cell fate consequences of 44 TFs active during cortical neurogenesis. We identified several TFs with new roles in cortical neurogenesis, including ZNF219—previously uncharacterized—that represses neural differentiation and NR2E1 and ARX that have opposing roles in regulating RG lineage plasticity and progression across developmental stages. We also detected convergent effector genes downstream of multiple TFs enriched in neurodevelopmental and neuropsychiatric disorders and observed conserved mechanisms of RG lineage plasticity across primates. We further uncovered a post-mitotic role for ARX in safeguarding IN subtype specification through repressing LMO1. Our study provides a framework for dissecting regulatory networks driving cell fate consequences during human neurogenesis.","tp":"脑皮层发育","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究深入剖析了控制人类大脑皮层细胞命运的基因调控网络。人类皮层神经发生发生于产前发育的特定关键窗口期，由放射状胶质细胞（RG）神经干细胞分化出兴奋性神经元、少突胶质细胞等多种细胞类型。这一复杂的皮层细胞多样性受转录因子（TF）环路主导的精密遗传程序控制，精细调节着干细胞自我更新与分化之间的动态平衡。本研究为理解人类大脑发育及神经发育障碍提供了重要的遗传学见解。"},{"t":"衍射辅助原位纳米尺度追踪固体电解质中的锂离子动力学及复合电极中的非均匀扩散","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520281?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂离子扩散动力学","kp":["表征方法[全固态电池]: 同步辐射XRD原位追踪","研究对象: 固态电解质Li+扩散"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用衍射enabled的原位纳米尺度追踪技术，首次实现了对固态电解质中锂离子扩散动力学的直接观测。此前锂离子扩散研究主要集中在液态电池的阴极活性材料中，而固态电解质中的离子传输行为因观测手段限制长期不清晰。研究团队借助先进的同步辐射衍射方法，在电池运行状态下实时捕捉锂离子在固态电解质晶格中的迁移路径与速率分布。这一方法为揭示固态电池界面和体相离子输运机制提供了直接实验证据，对优化固态电解质材料设计具有指导意义。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Diffraction‐Enabled Operando Nanoscale Tracking of Li‐ion Dynamics of Solid Electrolyte and Inhomogeneous Diffusion in C","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion has mostly been studied in cathode active materials (CAMs) in liquid batteries, whereas it remains rarely explored in solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) and all‐solid‐state batteries. Herein, diffraction was established as an effective method for all‐solid‐state lithium batteries (ASSLBs) by focusing on SSE in composite cathodes. Operando synchrotron x‐ray diffraction presented diffraction angle shifts of certain Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    Bragg planes during the first ASSLB cycle due to lithiation/delithiation into its lattice, whose preferred Li\n                    +\n                    migration pathways were suggested by the partiality of these shifts, and the three‐phase evolution indicated the fundamental Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion kinetics factors. X‐ray nanodiffraction (XND) mapped nanoscale inhomogeneous Li\n                    +\n                    distributions and diffusion within individual Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    particles, revealing facilitated Li\n                    +\n                    conduction in high‐crystallinity regions and their role as pathways across SSE/CAM interfaces, and the most negatively strained regions were shown to be less susceptible to Li\n                    +\n                    insertion. XND from various electrochemical techniques inferred high transient charging rates to be the culprit of irreversible Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion instead of the overall charging depth. This study proved diffraction to be a potent tool to probe intricate Li\n                    +\n                    dynamics in ASSLBs and provide microscopic insights for optimal battery designs.","aip":1},{"t":"差异Hes1激活定义了胚胎和成体神经干细胞谱系定型和生态位维持","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511800123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mode of Hes1 activation and its differential expression are crucial for the maintenance of neural stem cells/progenitor cells (NSCs/NPCs) in the embryonic cortex. This differential mode of Hes1 activation has been translated into a heterogeneous population of NSCs comprising Notch-independent Hes1-expressing (NIHes1) NSCs and Notch-dependent Hes1-expressing (NDHes1) radial glial cells (RGCs). Using single-cell transcriptomics and a Nestin-CreERT2;NIHes1fl/fl conditional knock-out mouse model, we have characterized the NIHes1 NSCs. Our analyses show that NIHes1 NSCs are the ancestral precursor NSCs that generate RGCs and intermediate progenitor cells during development. Loss of NIHes1 expression significantly alters the NSC niche, leading to increased gliogenesis and aberrant migration of projection neurons. NIHes1 NSCs are set aside at embryonic stages as adult neural stem cells and are maintained by NIHes1 expression even at adult stage. Our findings suggest that NIHes1 NSCs are functionally distinct Hes1-expressing NSCs, which are critical for establishing both embryonic and adult NSC niches, thereby contributing to the overall cortical development.","tp":"干细胞命运","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究揭示了Hes1基因的差异激活模式在胚胎和成体神经干细胞（NSCs）谱系定型和生态位维持中的关键作用。在胚胎大脑皮层中，Hes1的不同激活模式将神经干细胞划分为Notch非依赖型和Notch依赖型放射状胶质细胞（RGCs）等异质性群体。研究人员利用单细胞转录组学和条件性基因敲除小鼠模型证实，这种特定的Hes1激活机制对于维持神经干细胞微环境的稳态及决定细胞发育命运至关重要。"},{"t":"深度强化学习的梯级水电站-混合抽水蓄能实时调度方法以缓解光伏波动","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"梯级水电智能调度","kp":["方法[水电-光伏]: 深度强化学习实时调度","应用: 混合抽蓄缓解光伏不确定性"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating pho"},{"t":"解耦不同锂沉积过程下石墨电极上的电解液降解路径","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505230?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池锂析出","kp":["研究方法[石墨负极]: N/P<1电池定量解耦锂析出"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对石墨负极上的析锂问题——锂离子电池的关键退化路径，系统解耦了不同析锂过程对电解液降解的贡献。研究定量分析了析锂形态（如枝晶、苔藓状沉积）与电解液分解产物之间的关联机制，为优化电解液配方和充电策略、抑制容量衰减提供了定量依据。","ot":"Decoupling Electrolyte Degradation Pathways With Diverse Li Plating Processes on Graphite Electrodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium plating on graphite anodes is a critical degradation pathway in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), yet quantitative decoupling of its contribution from normal anode aging remains challenging. Here, we designed controlled Li plating tests using negative‐to‐positive (\n                    N/P\n                    ) ratio &lt; 1 LiFePO\n                    4\n                    /graphite cells and then compared them with practical fast‐charging cells (\n                    N/P\n                     &gt; 1), quantifying the decomposition of each electrolyte component (solvent, salt, additives) using nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR), mass spectrometry titration (MST), and gas chromatography‐mass spectrometry (GC‐MS). Controlled Li plating occurs after full graphite lithiation, and it leads to rapid vinylene carbonate (VC) depletion, time‐dependent non‐Faradaic consumption of hexafluorophosphate (PF\n                    6\n                    −\n                    )/ethyl methyl carbonate (EMC)/ethylene carbonate (EC), and more organic solid‐electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation at higher rates. In routine fast‐charging aging, Li plating occurs before graphite saturation, and we find pronounced EMC consumption under high‐rate conditions compared with low ‐ rate. Our comparative analysis indicates that VC consumption during fast charging originates not only from plating but also significantly from baseline graphite aging. Li plating likely induces SEI rupture, leading to direct contact with electrolyte, thus more organic SEI formation. This quantitative study enables decoupling of Li plating‐induced side reactions from general aging without plating, informing battery design and predictive aging models.","aip":1},{"t":"大卫·巴尔的摩：科学家、领导者和导师","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528373123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Fifty years ago, at the remarkably young age of 37, David Baltimore received the Nobel Prize (with Howard Temin and Renato Dulbecco) for \"discoveries concerning the interaction between tumor viruses and the genetic material of the cell.\" David was a prolific scientist whose work spanned many topics, but he was first and foremost a virologist. His recent passing invites us to reflect on a remarkable intellectual trajectory that began with seminal discoveries in virology, broadened to encompass major advances in cancer biology and immunology, and culminated in a legacy-sustained by the many scientists he trained-that will continue to shape modern biomedicine for years to come."},{"t":"每日简报：第一个记录在案的牛使用工具的案例","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00217-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面内铱基丝状物降低质子交换膜电解槽效率","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00419-2?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽效率","kp":["失效机制[PEM电解槽]: Ir丝贯穿膜形成寄生电流通路","关联因素: 多孔传输层设计"],"dp":1,"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究揭示在质子交换膜（PEM）电解槽中，导电性铱细丝可跨越膜结构形成跨平面短路通道，显著降低电解效率。铱作为PEM电解槽催化剂的关键元素，其迁移和团聚行为是器件长期耐久性的核心瓶颈。该发现对优化电解槽催化剂层设计和延长使用寿命具有重要指导意义。","ot":"Cross-plane iridium-based filaments sap efficiency in proton exchange membrane electrolyzers","b":"This study reveals that conductive iridium filaments can form across the membrane in proton exchange membrane electrolyzers, creating parasitic current pathways and reducing system efficiency. The findings link filament formation to porous transport layer design, providing insights to improve the durability and lifetime of industrial water electrolyzers."},{"t":"高可塑性细胞状态在肺癌中的关键作用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09985-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Plasticity—the ability of cells to undergo phenotypic transitions—drives cancer progression and therapy resistance1,2,3. Recent studies have suggested that plasticity in solid tumours is concentrated in a minority subset of cancer cells4,5,6, yet functional studies examining this high-plasticity cell state (HPCS) in situ are lacking. Here we develop mouse models enabling the detection, longitudinal lineage tracing and ablation of the HPCS in autochthonous lung tumours in vivo. Lineage tracing reveals that the HPCS cells possess a high capacity for cell state transitions, giving rise to both early neoplastic (differentiated) and progressed lung cancer cell states in situ. Longitudinal lineage tracing using secreted luciferases reveals that HPCS-derived cells have a high capacity for growth compared with bulk cancer cells or another cancer cell state with features of differentiated lung epithelium. Ablation of HPCS cells in early neoplasias abrogates benign-to-malignant transition, whereas ablation in established tumours by suicide gene or chimeric antigen receptor (CAR) T cells robustly reduces tumour burden. We further demonstrate that the HPCS gives rise to therapy-resistant cell states, whereas HPCS ablation suppresses resistance to chemotherapy and oncoprotein-targeted therapy. Notably, an HPCS-like state is ubiquitous in regenerating epithelia and in carcinomas of multiple other tissues, revealing a convergence of plasticity programs. Our work establishes the HPCS as a critical hub enabling reciprocal transitions between cancer cell states. Targeting the HPCS in lung cancer and in other carcinomas may suppress cancer progression and eradicate treatment resistance."},{"t":"更正：Keogh和Bilal的组合非对称声学超材料实时可编程性研究","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536289123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可编程声学超材料","as":"","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":2.0,"r":1.5,"d":1.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Correction for Keogh and Bilal, Combinatorial asymmetric acoustic metamaterials with real-time programmability"},{"t":"对 Abels 等人的更正，操纵蒽环类药物以实现更深的组织渗透以及对糖酵解 t 的影响","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537044123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"亚海王星和超级地球的核心-包层混溶性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09970-4","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Sub-Neptunes and super-Earths, the most abundant types of planet in the galaxy, are unlike anything in the Solar System, with radii between those of Earth and Neptune1,2. Fundamental questions remain regarding their structure and origin. Although super-Earths have a rocky composition3, sub-Neptunes form a distinct population at larger radii and are thought to consist of a rocky core overlain by a hydrogen-rich envelope4,5. At the extreme conditions of the core–envelope interface (exceeding several gigapascals and several thousand kelvin4,6), reaction between core and envelope seems possible, but the nature and extent of these reactions are unknown. Here we use first-principles molecular dynamics driven by density functional theory to show that silicate and hydrogen are completely miscible over a wide range of plausible core–envelope pressure–temperature conditions. We find the origin of miscibility in extensive chemical reaction between hydrogen and silicate, producing silane, SiO and water species, which may be observable with ongoing or future missions. Core–envelope miscibility profoundly affects the evolution of sub-Neptunes and super-Earths, by dissolving a large fraction of the hydrogen of the planet in the core and driving exchange of hydrogen between core and envelope as the planet evolves.","tp":"行星混溶性","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"亚海王星和超级地球是银河系中最丰富的行星类型，其结构和起源仍存在基本疑问。超级地球由岩石组成，而亚海王星半径较大，通常被认为由岩石核心及其上方的富氢包层构成。在核心与包层交界的极端条件下（超过数百万大气压和数千开尔文），岩石核心材料与流体氢之间的物理和化学相互作用决定了行星的真实结构。最新研究探讨了这些极端条件下的混溶性，表明核心和氢包层可能发生显著的混合甚至溶解。这一发现颠覆了传统分层模型，对理解系外行星的内部结构、质量-半径关系和热演化具有重要意义。"},{"t":"混合移动电源协调调度用于配电网恢复：一种动态梯度掩码嵌入方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking emb"},{"t":"大脑边界清道夫细胞发育的趋同进化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10003-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The vertebrate central nervous system is protected by the blood–brain barrier and meningeal membranes, which ensure immune privilege1. In the mammalian brain, microglia and barrier-associated or border-associated macrophages (BAMs) provide immune surveillance and scavenge wastes2, yet how evolution shaped immune-cell diversity and function is not understood. In zebrafish, a vascular-derived mural lymphatic endothelial cell (muLEC) lineage fulfils scavenger cell functions at central nervous system borders3,4,5. Here we identify the transcription factor odd-skipped related 2 (osr2) as a specific marker and regulator of muLEC differentiation and maintenance. osr2 controls the transition of muLECs from interconnected endothelial cells to individual scavenger cells in part by means of control of cadherin-6. muLECs are more transcriptionally similar to BAMs than to other mammalian meningeal cells and share several functions in tissue homeostasis. However, BAMs are absent from zebrafish and muLECs from mice and humans. Analysis of osr2, lymphatic endothelial cell (LEC) and BAM markers in diverse vertebrate species reveals muLECs as an ancient lineage and BAMs a recent mammalian specialization. muLECs and BAMs share functional analogies but are not homologous, providing an example of convergent evolution. This highlights the physiological importance of meningeal scavenger cells and the developmental plasticity of LECs in generating specialized cell types throughout evolution.","tp":"脑免疫细胞","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"脊椎动物的中枢神经系统受到血脑屏障和脑膜的保护以确保免疫特权。在哺乳动物大脑中，小胶质细胞和边界相关巨噬细胞（BAMs）负责免疫监视和清除废物，但其演化过程尚不明确。研究发现，在斑马鱼中，一种源自血管的壁淋巴管内皮细胞谱系在中枢神经系统发挥清道夫功能。这表明，不同物种的大脑免疫清道夫细胞通过趋同进化获得了相似的功能特性。该研究揭示了免疫系统在保护大脑免受损伤和维持稳态方面采取了跨物种的趋同演化策略，为理解大脑免疫的发育与演化提供了新见解。"},{"t":"使用 DNA 三向连接构建复杂且多样化的 DNA 序列","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10006-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The ability to construct entirely new synthetic DNA sequences de novo is essential to engineering and studying biology. However, the ability to produce long complex synthetic DNA sequences and libraries currently lags behind the ability to sequence and edit DNA1,2. All existing DNA-assembly technologies rely on DNA sequence information found within the final construct to direct assembly between DNA molecules3,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11. As a result of this paradigm, these sequences cannot be extensively optimized specifically for assembly without affecting the final sequence. To fundamentally address this challenge, here we show the development of a new DNA assembly technique named Sidewinder that separates the information that guides assembly from the final assembled sequence using DNA three-way junctions. We demonstrate the transformative nature of the Sidewinder technique with highly robust and accurate construction of a 40-piece multifragment assembly, complex DNA sequences of both high GC content and high repeats, parallel assembly of multiple distinct genes in the same reaction and a combinatorial library with a large number of diversified positions across the entire length of the gene for high coverage of a library of 442,368 variants. This technology enables high-fidelity DNA assembly with a misconnection rate at the three-way junction of approximately 1 in 1,000,000."},{"t":"月球风化层氧同位素对地月系统撞击通量的限制","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531796123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The impactor flux record to Earth has largely been erased by active tectonics, weathering, and continual reworking of the crust. Instead, a record of highly siderophile elements (HSE: Re, Os, Ir, Ru, Rh, Pt, Pd, and Au) in lunar impactites has been used as a proxy for the type of impactor material added to the Earth-Moon system. Quantifying impactor mass and flux with the HSE can potentially be complicated by numerous secondary processes, however, including silicate-metal segregation and multiple impact heritage. In contrast, because oxygen has an invariant geochemical affinity, triple oxygen isotope compositions have the potential to offer a robust long-term record of impactor fluxes in complex mixtures such as regolith. Here, we use high-precision triple oxygen isotopes to deconvolve the influences of meteorite addition and silicate vaporization and identify a ubiquitous impactor contaminant comprised of partially evaporated CM or ureilite-like material representing at least 1 wt% of the lunar regolith. Water delivered to Earth by meteorite material over 4 billion years therefore is only a fraction of an ocean's worth of water but is a significant contributor to the ice reservoir of the lunar cold traps."},{"t":"保护应具有现实的适应能力","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2415291123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Conservation actions often assume implicitly that heritabilities are zero and that threatened populations cannot adapt to changing environments. To illustrate, we evaluated the last 10 y of recovery plans for US threatened and endangered species and found that only 4% assessed within-population adaptability. This omission reflects the common assumption that population adaptation is too slow or inconsequential to affect conservation practice in the short term. Yet, the median heritability (h2) and evolvability (IA) across many studies are not zero as assumed, but 0.3 and 0.4, respectively, based on a compilation of estimated values. This moderate heritability could rescue some populations. By compiling literature on conservation assessments, we detail how considering adaptability can shift conservation priorities, alter management recommendations, and provide additional ways to rescue declining populations and species. Based on these findings, we advocate for including population adaptability into conservation plans and adopting the prior expectation of moderate adaptability (h2 = 0.3, IA = 0.4) along with its uncertainty, as a starting point when better information is lacking. This moderate adaptability could allow some species to respond naturally to environmental change while directing limited resources toward the species that need it most.","tp":"保护适应性","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"as":"目前的保护行动通常暗含一个假设：受威胁的种群无法适应不断变化的环境，即遗传力为零。对美国濒危物种恢复计划的评估显示，仅有4%的计划评估了种群内部的适应能力。这种普遍的忽略源于人们认为种群适应过程过于缓慢，无法在短期内影响保护效果。然而，大量证据表明，许多物种的遗传力处于中高水平，这意味着它们具备在短期内通过进化适应环境变化的能力。研究人员呼吁，未来的生态保护策略应纳入对物种现实适应能力的考量，将其作为制定有效保护计划的重要组成部分。"},{"t":"限域柯肯达尔应变工程促进Co3O4析氧反应用于质子交换膜水电解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜电解水","kp":["晶格膨胀[Co3O4柯肯达尔氧化]: >2.4%","催化剂[PEMWE析氧]: Co3O4(IrO2替代)","[应变工程]: 限域抑制自由晶格膨胀"],"as":"该研究提出一种限域Kirkendall应变工程策略，用于提升Co₃O₄催化剂的析氧反应（OER）性能。Kirkendall氧化通过金属与氧化物的差异扩散速率，原位生成空心或核壳结构的过渡金属氧化物。研究通过空间限域手段调控Kirkendall效应过程中的应变积累，在Co₃O₄晶格中引入可控拉伸应变，优化d带中心位置和氧中间体吸附能，从而降低OER过电位。该工作为通过应变工程理性设计高效电催化剂提供了新范式，对水电解制氢和金属-空气电池具有应用价值。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Confined Kirkendall Strain Engineering Promotes Oxygen Evolution on Co3O4 for Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyze","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    While Kirkendall oxidation (KO) facilely fabricates transition metal oxides for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) in proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs), it concomitantly triggers detrimental lattice expansion. For Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , an appealing IrO\n                    2\n                    ‐alternative catalyst, KO generates a free lattice expansion above 2.4%, resulting in suboptimal activity and stability. Here, we design a confined KO approach and coat the precursor Co nanoparticles with atomic carbon layers, enabling controllable lattice expansion of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    between 0.2% and 1.8%. For the first time, a strain‐dependent OER activity of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    is established in acidic media, with an expansion strain of 1.4% exhibiting the lowest overpotential of 377 mV at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Synchrotron X‐ray absorption spectroscopies and theoretical calculations unravel the adjustable lattice strain regulates the d‐band center of Co sites and further modifies the oxygenate adsorptions. When integrated into a PEMWE, the 1.4%‐strained Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    catalyst sustainably operates at 250 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    over 100 h. The reported confined KO provides a new means for strain engineering of transition metal oxides for energy electrocatalysis."},{"t":"脱锂富锂正极中竞争性Ni/Mn还原与微应变耦合负热膨胀","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525724?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["工作电压[富锂层状正极]: 高至4.8 V","[热失效]: 脱锂态Ni/Mn竞争还原耦合微应变负热膨胀"],"as":"该研究针对高能量密度锂离子电池中富锂锰基层状正极材料（Li-rich Mn-based cathode）的关键瓶颈展开。研究发现Ni与Mn离子在充放电过程中存在竞争性还原反应，伴随晶格微应变的演化，二者耦合诱发了异常的负热膨胀（Negative Thermal Expansion）行为。该体积收缩效应与电池循环中的电压衰减、结构不可逆相变密切相关。研究通过原位表征揭示微应变-热膨胀-电化学性能三者间的内在关联，为抑制富锂材料结构退化、提升循环稳定性提供了微观机理层面的设计指导。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Competitive Ni/Mn Reduction and Microstrain‐Coupled Negative Thermal Expansion in Delithiated Li‐Rich Cathodes","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The demand for high energy density in the field of Li‐ion batteries has intensified interest in lithium‐rich Mn‐based layered oxide cathodes (LRLOs) owing to their high capacity and low cost. Nevertheless, the thermal runaway becomes an urgent concern because of the high‐voltage operation (up to 4.8 V), and the structural evolution mechanism of delithiated LRLOs during heating remains unclear. Here, we combine in situ high‐temperature X‐ray diffraction and absorption spectroscopy to systematically investigate the structural and chemical evolution of Li\n                    1.2\n                    Ni\n                    0.2\n                    Mn\n                    0.6\n                    O\n                    2\n                    (LLNMO) across distinct charge–discharge states. Interestingly, Ni is the first element to undergo thermally induced reduction in the charged state of LLNMO. With further increasing the temperature, Mn reduction sets in, coinciding with extensive lattice oxygen loss, and a phase transition from layered to disordered layered or Li‐containing rock‐salt‐type phase occurs. More intriguingly, after the initial electrochemical cycle, LLNMO exhibits negative thermal expansion at low temperatures below 200 °C, which are attributed to the cycling‐induced microstrain accumulation and long‐range structural ordering. These findings provide a mechanistic insight into the state‐of‐charge‐dependent thermal behavior of Li‐rich layered materials and offer guidelines for designing safer, high‐capacity battery materials.","aip":1},{"t":"减数分裂基因的常见变异影响人类重组和非整倍体","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09964-2","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The leading cause of human pregnancy loss is aneuploidy, often tracing to errors in chromosome segregation during female meiosis1,2. Although abnormal crossover recombination is known to confer risk for aneuploidy3,4, limited data have hindered understanding of the potential shared genetic basis of these key molecular phenotypes. To address this gap, we performed retrospective analysis of pre-implantation genetic testing data from 139,416 in vitro fertilized embryos from 22,850 sets of biological parents. By tracing transmission of haplotypes, we identified 3,809,412 crossovers, as well as 92,485 aneuploid chromosomes. Counts of crossovers were lower in aneuploid versus euploid embryos, consistent with their role in chromosome pairing and segregation. Our analyses further revealed that a common haplotype spanning the meiotic cohesin SMC1B is associated significantly with both crossover count and maternal meiotic aneuploidy, with evidence supporting a non-coding cis-regulatory mechanism. Transcriptome- and phenome-wide association tests also implicated variation in the synaptonemal complex component C14orf39 and crossover-regulating ubiquitin ligases CCNB1IP1 and RNF212 in meiotic aneuploidy risk. More broadly, variants associated with aneuploidy often showed secondary associations with recombination, and several also exhibited associations with reproductive ageing traits. Our findings highlight the dual role of recombination in generating genetic diversity, while ensuring meiotic fidelity.","tp":"染色体重组","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":8.0,"t":5.5},"as":"人类妊娠失败的主要原因是非整倍体，这通常源于女性减数分裂过程中的染色体分离错误。尽管异常的交叉重组会增加非整倍体风险，但两者之间潜在的遗传基础仍缺乏深入研究。研究人员对22,850名生物学父母的139,416个体外受精胚胎的植入前基因检测数据进行了回顾性分析。研究证实了减数分裂基因的常见变异不仅影响人类的交叉重组率，还会显著增加产生非整倍体胚胎的风险。这些发现揭示了染色体分离和重组机制背后的遗传学规律，为预测和改善人类生殖健康提供了关键的科学依据。"},{"t":"钴骨架低聚物实现光催化CO2转化为乙醇的纪录效率","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521378?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2制乙醇","kp":["催化剂[光催化CO2制乙醇]: 钴骨架寡聚物","[关键突破]: 克服C-C偶联能垒与中间体富集"],"as":"光催化将CO2还原为高附加值化学品是可再生能源存储和碳中和的重要途径，但高效、高选择性生成乙醇仍具挑战。本研究设计了一种以钴为主链的共轭低聚物光催化剂，利用其独特的分子结构促进多电子转移反应，实现了创纪录的光催化CO2-to-乙醇转化效率与选择性。该材料兼具优异的光吸收能力和电荷分离性能，为人工光合作用体系中C-C偶联反应的机理理解提供了新思路，具有重要的基础研究意义和工业转化潜力。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Cobalt‐Backboned Oligomer for Record Photocatalytic CO2 Conversion to Ethanol","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solar‐driven conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into value‐added products is promising for renewable energy storage and carbon neutrality. Although current photocatalysts demonstrate the capability to convert CO\n                    2\n                    into multiple carbon products including ethanol, their performance is limited by high C─C coupling energy barrier and inefficient intermediate enrichment. Here we synthesize a cobalt‐backboned oligomer as an efficient photocatalyst to generate a record‐high ethanol production rate of 497 µmol/(g·h) for CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. It also maintains high performance in cases with simulated industrial flue gas with ∼15% CO\n                    2\n                    and a Martian‐like atmosphere with ∼95% CO\n                    2\n                    . These properties stem from unique electronic modulation through metal–metal bonding and intermolecular assembly for high‐activity reaction channels. This atomically precise cobalt‐backboned oligomer opens a new avenue for designing photocatalysts."},{"t":"多价金属电池中的氯化物化学：从界面到体相","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521126?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池氯化物","kp":["电解质[镁电池]: 胺盐酸盐基","[核心挑战]: Mg2+去溶剂化迟缓+扩散慢"],"as":"可充电镁电池因高理论容量、资源丰富和安全性被视为下一代储能的有力候选，但面临电解质兼容性和界面稳定性等关键挑战。本综述系统梳理了氯化学在多价金属电池中的核心作用，从体相电解质设计到电极/电解质界面（SEI/CEI）调控进行深入分析。氯化物基电解质可有效调控Mg²⁺的溶剂化结构和界面化学，改善沉积/剥离可逆性。文章展望了氯化学策略在推动多价离子电池工程化中的前景，为高性能储能体系开发指明方向。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Chloride Chemistry in Multivalent‐Metal Batteries: From Interphase to Bulk Phase","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rechargeable magnesium (Mg) batteries are promising candidates for next‐generation energy storage due to their high energy density, intrinsic safety, and earth‐abundant Mg resources. However, their practical application is limited by sluggish desolvation and slow diffusion of divalent Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Here, amine‐hydrochloride‐based Mg electrolytes are designed to form favorable interphases and chloride‐based channels. A ligand exchange strategy is proposed to simultaneously promote fast desolvation on interphases and rapid Mg\n                    2+\n                    diffusion within cathodes. Detailed analysis reveals that the formation of the chloride‐containing cathode–electrolyte interphases and the MgH\n                    2\n                    ‐containing anode–electrolyte interphases are found to facilitate the desolvation process of solvated Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Moreover, the chloride‐based channels significantly reduce the diffusion barriers of Mg\n                    2+\n                    in Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    from 0.712  to 0.517 eV, demonstrating rapid Mg\n                    2+\n                    diffusion kinetics. Consequently, Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    ‐based full cells achieve a capacity retention of over 80% after 100 cycles at 1 C. Furthermore, this strategy is compatible with chloride‐free electrolytes, the full‐cells consisted of activated Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    cathode delivers a high specific capacity exceeding 90 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    and 80.3% retention after 900 h of cycling. It is also applicable to organic cathodes and Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    ‐based calcium‐metal full‐cells. Overall, this work presents a generalizable strategy for designing high‐energy‐density rechargeable multivalent‐metal battery systems."},{"t":"化学发光驱动的深部肿瘤免疫治疗：通过 Sub 促进 PD-L1 降解并引发细胞焦亡","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519569?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organelle‐targeted therapy represents a promising strategy for cancer therapy and immune activation. Here, we present a novel Chemiluminescence‐Powered Immunotherapy (CPIT) platform designed to induce immunogenic pyroptosis and promote PD‐L1 degradation by exploiting two key subcellular organelles—lysosomes and the endoplasmic reticulum (ER). CPIT utilizes a PD‐L1‐targeted delivery vehicle (up to 10.8 %ID/g) to facilitate PD‐L1 degradation within lysosomes (&gt;55% efficiency) and concurrently delivers a dual‐locked chemiluminescence‐resonance energy transfer (CRET) system to the ER for localized pyroptosis. The dual‐locking mechanism ensures tumor‐selective and ER‐confined activation, maximizing oxidative damage and specifically inducing pyroptosis while minimizing off‐target toxicity. In vivo studies demonstrate remarkable tumor selectivity (due to tumor‐specific delivery plus tumor‐selective activation), robust regression of metastatic tumors, and the induction of a durable adaptive immune response. CPIT overcomes the limitation of conventional photodynamic therapy‐driven immunogenic cell death (ICD) strategies, being effective only for superficial tumors. Simultaneously, it lowers the immune activation threshold by promoting PD‐L1 degradation, addressing the challenge of T cell exhaustion common in ICD‐based cancer immunotherapies. This approach holds promise as a transformative approach to treating hard‐to‐reach malignancies and expanding the reach of immunotherapeutic strategies. The modular design of CPIT enables rapid substitution of protein‐specific ligands or alternative chemiluminescent donors, further expanding its potential for diverse cancer immunotherapy applications."},{"t":"双锚定功能化分子在2D/3D异质结中的化学桥联实现高效稳定柔性器件","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE03302K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿异质结电池","kp":["[界面工程]: 双锚定功能分子构建2D/3D异质结","器件[柔性钙钛矿电池]: 缺陷钝化+能级对齐"],"as":"二维/三维钙钛矿异质结是提升钙钛矿太阳能电池效率和稳定性的有效界面工程策略，但层间界面缺陷和非辐射复合损失仍制约其性能。本研究提出双锚定功能化分子化学桥接策略，通过分子两端功能基团分别与2D和3D钙钛矿层形成强化学键，构建高效界面电荷传输通道并钝化缺陷。该方法显著降低了界面能垒和载流子复合，提升了器件的光电转换效率和环境稳定性，为钙钛矿光电器件的商业化提供了通用界面修饰方案。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chemical Bridging in 2D/3D Heterojunction via Dual-Anchoring Functionalized Molecules for Efficient, Stable and Flexible","b":"Constructing two-dimensional/three-dimensional (2D/3D) perovskite heterojunctions has emerged as an effective interfacial engineering strategy to passivate surface defects, optimize energy-level alignment, and suppress ion migration. However, conventional 2D layers are typically formed by surface stacking of bulky organic cations, which often result in weak interfacial coupling and hindered carrier transport, thereby limiting device performance. In this work, a single-molecule dual-functional surface-passivation strategy is proposed, in which 5-methyltryptamne hydrochloride (Me-TACl) treatment constructs a stable 2D perovskite passivation layer on top of 3D perovskite films and establishes a chemical bridge between them. This \"chemically bridged heterojunction passivation\" enhances interfacial coupling, suppresses surface defects, and optimizes energy level alignment. As a result, the Me-TACl treated devices exhibit remarkable enhancement in photovoltaic performance. The champion device achieves a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.35%, with a stabilized power output (SPO) of 26.20% over 300 s, outperforming the control device (24.67%). Moreover, the flexible device retains 92% of its initial efficiency (24.12%) after bending at a curvature radius of 5 mm for 5000 cycles, demonstrating outstanding mechanical durability. This post-treatment strategy simultaneously enhances efficiency, stability, and flexibility, offering insights for scalable high-efficiency perovskite photovoltaics and a viable interfacial design for next-generation devices."},{"t":"共价有机框架中电荷调控的吡啶氮用于无金属多相光催化C─H芳基化反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523681?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化C-H芳基化","kp":["催化剂[无金属光催化C-H芳基化]: N-TFPPy-BD-COF","[活性位点]: 电荷调控吡啶氮"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了含电荷调控吡啶氮活性位点的共价有机框架（COF），实现无金属多相光催化吡咯C-H芳基化反应。传统该反应依赖贵金属或有机染料催化剂，此COF材料利用光激发下吡啶氮的电荷分布调控实现高选择性C-H活化，为绿色可持续合成提供新平台。","ot":"Charge‐Regulated Pyridinic Nitrogen in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Metal‐Free Heterogeneous Photocatalytic C─H Aryla","b":"Abstract\n                  Conventional catalytic systems for the C─H arylation of pyrrole predominantly rely on noble metals or organic dyes, which suffer from inherent limitations such as low sustainability, challenging recyclability, and high cost. To address these challenges, this study develops a metal‐free photocatalytic strategy employing a designed covalent organic framework, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF, as an efficient heterogeneous catalyst with a precisely tailored electronic structure. Site‐specific nitrogen doping within the pyrene‐based scaffold enables fine‐tuning of the electronic landscape. Spectroscopic characterization and theoretical computations reveal that nitrogen doping facilitates spatial separation of photogenerated electron–hole pairs, suppresses recombination, thereby improves visible‐light absorption, prolongs charge‐carrier lifetimes, and enhances charge‐separation efficiency. Under visible‐light irradiation, the catalyst delivers outstanding performance in the arylation of pyrroles, affording a yield of 79% with 98% selectivity, surpassing those achieved by noble metal and organic dye‐based systems. Furthermore, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF exhibits remarkable stability as a heterogeneous catalyst, maintaining its structural integrity over ten consecutive catalytic cycles. This work not only presents a sustainable and efficient pathway for C─H arylation but also establishes a general strategy for the rational design of COF‐based photocatalysts through electronic structure engineering."},{"t":"Calumenin 通过促进波形蛋白稳态来防止成纤维细胞衰老和肺老化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2426723123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Progressive lung fibrosis is linked to aging-related dysfunction in fibroblasts, which remains poorly understood. To investigate the alterations in fibroblasts, particularly the molecular programs driving this profibrotic evolution in the aging lung, we isolated senescent lung fibroblasts from aged mice. We observed aberrant vimentin aggregates, which correlate with accelerated fibroblast senescence. CRISPR-based screening identified calumenin as a chaperone protein essential for vimentin proteostasis. A fibroblast-specific knockout of calumenin promotes the accumulation of vimentin aggregates and profibrotic factors migracytosis, exacerbating fibroblast senescence and lung aging. Mechanistically, calumenin collaborates with the TRiC complex to facilitate proper vimentin folding and recruits the chaperonin subunit Chaperonin Containing TCP1 Subunit 2 (CCT2) to degrade misfolded vimentin aggregates. Pathologically, external profibrotic stimuli trigger calcium transients and induce calumenin degradation, resulting in fibroblast senescence and the initiation of fibrosis. The natural product 9-85, derived from high-content screening, specifically targets and disrupts vimentin aggregates upon stimulation, alleviating aging-related lung fibrosis. Our findings reveal that calumenin coordinates vimentin quality control to shape cell structure and suppress the secretome of senescent fibroblasts, providing a promising therapeutic strategy for aging-related organ fibrosis."},{"t":"COBRA-k：桥接基于约束和动力学代谢建模的强大框架","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb3022?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mathematical modeling is key to understanding cellular metabolism. Two common approaches are kinetic modeling and constraint-based reconstruction and analysis (COBRA). COBRA models analyze steady-state fluxes using linear constraints but lack kinetic detail. Kinetic models offer mechanistic descriptions via differential equations but require (often unknown) kinetic parameters and enzyme concentrations. To bridge this gap, we introduce COBRA-k, a framework integrating nonlinear kinetic rate laws into COBRA models to consistently constrain metabolic fluxes, enzyme abundances, and metabolite concentrations. COBRA-k enables flexible exploration of metabolic steady states with optimization techniques, even with incomplete parametrization. COBRA-k models require solving computationally demanding mixed-integer nonlinear programs. We therefore developed a dedicated iterative algorithm, implemented in an open-source Python package. We applied COBRA-k to a large-scale Escherichia coli model, demonstrating its effectiveness and revealing holistic metabolic insights. For example, it accurately predicts and explains the phenomenon of high intracellular glutamate concentration. COBRA-k combines the flexibility of COBRA with kinetic precision, offering a powerful tool for predictive metabolic modeling and engineering.","tp":"代谢建模框架","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出COBRA-k框架，整合非线性动力学速率定律与基于约束的代谢网络重建与分析(COBRA)。该框架弥合了动力学模型(机制清晰但参数难获取)与约束模型(稳态通量分析但缺乏动力学细节)之间的鸿沟，为理解细胞代谢提供了兼具机理深度和可扩展性的建模工具。"},{"t":"冠醚稳定重碱金属增强二苯基磷负离子亲核性以促进反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523460?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机磷亲核催化","kp":["催化剂[烯烃异构化]: 冠醚负载重碱金属磷化物","活性趋势: Cs>Rb>K序列递增"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用冠醚配体支撑的重碱金属（铯、铷）阳离子，显著增强二苯基膦阴离子的亲核性，从而促进有机磷化反应。铯和铷在有机元素化学中长期受到冷落，该工作填补了重碱金属有机化学的空白，为有机磷化合物的绿色合成提供新催化策略。","ot":"Boosting the Nucleophilicity of the Diphenylphosphide Anion with Crown Ether Supported Heavy Alkali Metals to Facilitate","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Caesium and rubidium have long experienced an interest drought in organoelement chemistry in comparison to the vast ocean of applications accomplished mainly by lithium and to a lesser extent, by sodium and potassium in this field. Here, we report a breakthrough study in catalytic alkene isomerisation using crown ether‐supported alkali metal phosphides in which the activity increases sequentially and significantly as Group One is descended with Cs(18‐crown‐6)PPh\n                    2\n                    performing best even at 1 mol% loadings with high turnover frequencies (TOFs) and good functional group tolerance. Elevating its profile further, Cs(18‐crown‐6)PPh\n                    2\n                    is also successful in a stepwise double catalysis on combining alkene isomerisation with its newly established hydrophosphination (HP) capacity to access challenging to make Markovnikov products. This remote functionalisation approach was also applied to alkynes with terminal alkynes preferentially producing allenes over internal alkynes in one‐pot reactions and then under HP, generating highly functionalised vinyl phosphines. Kinetic studies and DFT calculations have also been performed to shed light on mechanistic aspects of the Cs‐mediated isomerisation of model alkene allylbenzene."},{"t":"用于转移淋巴结选择性免疫工程的生物反应性免疫调节剂纳米复合物","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519625123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lymph node (LN) metastasis (LNM) frequently occurs in various cancer types and is associated with high aggressiveness, poor prognosis, and low survival rates. However, effective clinical interventions remain limited primarily due to the distinctive immunosuppressive microenvironment found in metastatic LNs. Targeted delivery of immunomodulators and selective immunoengineering in metastatic LNs offers a promising avenue for repurposing these LNs as an effective antitumor system while mitigating the risk of unwanted immune activation elsewhere. Here, we develop a bioresponsive LN-targeted immunomodulator nanocomplex designed to selectively reprogram the immune microenvironment in metastatic LNs for LNM inhibition. The immunomodulator nanocomplex can target LNs due to specific chemokine receptor 7 modification and selectively release anti-PD-1 antibodies in response to glutathione that is found elevated in the extracellular matrix of metastatic LNs. In two mouse models, our data suggested that the immunomodulator nanocomplex can selectively activate T cell-mediated antitumor immune responses in metastatic LNs and thus effectively inhibit tumor growth and prolong the survival of animals. Importantly, the modular design of this platform could enable facile incorporation of alternative immunotherapeutic agents that exhibit significant systemic toxicities in the clinic, allowing broader application to payloads that may particularly benefit from localized, LNM-selective activation. This approach holds significant promises for reducing the necessity for complete LN dissection, thereby presenting a valuable therapeutic option for a broad spectrum of cancer patients."},{"t":"从祖先不同的人群对精神分裂症的生物学见解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-10000-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Schizophrenia and related psychoses occur in all human populations, with the highest rates of diagnosis among Black individuals and those of mainly African ancestry1. Decades of research have established a highly heritable and polygenic basis for schizophrenia, which is mostly shared across populations2,3,4. However, a recruitment bias towards European cohorts5 has led to discoveries that are poorly generalizable to African populations. This exclusion of the world’s most genetically diverse populations narrows our understanding of disease biology and risks exacerbating health disparities. Here we show that electronic health records linked with genomic data from the Million Veteran Program (MVP)6—a national research programme that looks at the effects of genes, lifestyle, military experiences and exposures on the health and wellness of veterans—enable a comprehensive assessment of schizophrenia genetics in populations of African ancestry in the USA. We identify ancestry-independent associations in African populations and expand the catalogue of implicated regions by more than 100 loci. Through statistical fine-mapping and integrative transcriptomic analyses, we refine disease-associated signals to consensus genes with convergent neurobiological functions. These findings provide a much-needed view of schizophrenia’s genetic architecture in populations of African ancestry, and offer biological insights that both extend previous work and broaden its global relevance."},{"t":"婴儿到婴儿的菌株传播塑造了肠道微生物组的发育","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09983-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The early infant microbiome is largely primed by microbial transmission from the mother between birth and the first few weeks of life1,2,3, but how interpersonal transmission further shapes the developing microbiome in the first year remains unexplored. Here we report a metagenomic survey to model microbiome transmission in the nursery setting among babies attending the first year, their educators and their families (n = 134 individuals). We performed dense longitudinal microbiome sampling (n = 1,013 faecal samples) during the first year of nursery and tracked microbial strain transmission within and between nursery groups across 3 different facilities. We detected extensive baby-to-baby microbiome transmission within nursery groups even after only 1 month of nursery attendance, with nursery-acquired strains accounting for a proportion of the infant gut microbiome comparable to that from family by the end of the first term. Baby-to-baby transmission continued to grow over the nursery year, in an increasingly intricate transmission network with single strains spreading in some classes, and with multiple baby-acquisition and species-transmissibility patterns. Having siblings was associated with higher microbiome diversity and reduced strain acquisition from nursery peers, while antibiotic treatment was the condition that most accounted for the increased influx of strains. This study shows that microbiome transmission between babies is extensive during the first year of nursery, and points to social interactions in infancy as crucial drivers of infant microbiome development."},{"t":"BORC 组件整合 BLOC-1 亚基以使内体运输功能多样化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515691123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"BORC and BLOC-1 are multisubunit complexes that regulate endolysosomal trafficking. Although they are presumed to be distinct, their paralogous origins and shared subunits suggest the potential for higher-order assembly. Here, we reveal the conserved octameric architecture of BORC formed by two intertwined tetramers and present the structure of C. elegans BORC. Through cross-linking mass spectrometry of endogenous complexes, we validate this model for human BORC and demonstrate that the integrity of the complex, which is essential for lysosomal transport, relies on specific interfacial residues. We also clarify the disruptive nature of disease-causing mutations and propose that the formation and function of BORC are likely regulated by specific cues. These cues might include the phosphorylation of Snapin and a pH-sensitive histidine residue in BORCS5. Additionally, we present direct biochemical and structural evidence of BORC-BLOC-1 hybrid complexes. Finally, we link a specific hybrid complex to the regulation of transferrin receptor recycling via interaction with the EARP complex. Our work challenges the paradigm of BORC and BLOC-1 as separate entities, establishing a model of dynamic complex formation wherein modular assembly creates functional specialization to meet diverse cellular demands."},{"t":"自分泌 TGFβ2 在尤文肉瘤中强制形成转录混合细胞状态","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0550?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Subpopulations of cancer-associated fibroblast (CAF)-like tumor cells deposit extracellular matrix (ECM) proteins that support Ewing sarcoma (EwS) progression and metastasis. We previously showed a hallmark of CAF-like EwS cells is their hybrid transcriptional state wherein the driver fusion oncogene, EWS::FLI1, maintains activation of proliferative programs but loses capacity to repress mesenchymal genes. Here, we studied primary patient tumors and cell line models to identify molecular drivers of this hybrid state. Our data reveal that hybrid EwS cells are induced and maintained by a transforming growth factor-β (TGFβ) signaling positive feedback loop. Hybrid cells derepress TGFBR2 and up-regulate expression and secretion of TGFβ2 to sustain pathway activation and ECM deposition. Although TGFβ ligands can potently induce growth arrest in cells of epithelial origin, we show that TGFβ1 and TGFβ2 promote cell invasion of EwS cells without affecting proliferation. Thus, stroma-derived and tumor-derived TGFβ ligands induce and maintain hybrid EwS cells to promote pro-metastatic cell phenotypes."},{"t":"原子精密三酶纳米酶同步线粒体双途径破坏，用于精准肿瘤学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520859?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Although nanozyme‐mediated disruption of mitochondrial homeostasis holds significant therapeutic potential, precise spatiotemporal regulation using single‐function catalysts remains a major challenge. To overcome this limitation, we developed a triphenylphosphine‐functionalized Pd@PtIr nanozyme by epitaxially depositing a Pt–Ir (1:1) alloy shell onto Pd nanocube cores with atomic‐level precision. This rationally engineered metal‐center architecture generates a synergistic catalytic interface that not only enhances peroxidase‐like activity—validated by density functional theory (DFT)—but also endows the nanozyme with intrinsic NADH oxidase and glutathione peroxidase‐like functionalities within a single platform. Upon 808 nm near‐infrared (NIR) irradiation, the nanozyme triggers a cascade of enzyme‐mimetic redox reactions that jointly deplete mitochondrial glutathione (GSH) and elevate reactive oxygen species (ROS) levels, while NADH oxidation concurrently disrupts ATP biosynthesis. These concerted effects synergistically impair mitochondrial redox homeostasis and energy metabolism in tumor cells. To further potentiate therapeutic efficacy, we combined the nanozyme with antisense oligonucleotide‐mediated silencing of ASncmtRNA, resulting in a pronounced 89.1% tumor regression in an orthotopic breast cancer model. This integrated approach—combining atomic‐precision catalyst design, multifunctional enzymatic activity, and gene‐silencing therapy—presents a transformative paradigm for organelle‐targeted precision nanotherapeutics in oncology.","tp":"原子精密纳米酶","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了三苯基膦功能化Pd@PtIr纳米酶，以原子级精度在Pd纳米立方核上外延沉积Pt-Ir(1:1)合金壳层。该三酶纳米酶可靶向线粒体，同步破坏双途径以实现精准肿瘤治疗，克服了单功能催化剂时空调控不足的局限，为纳米酶介导的肿瘤治疗提供了多酶协同新策略。","aip":1},{"t":"电化学条件下动态Pt(111)界面液态水原子尺度有序化的电子显微镜成像","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505756?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极界面水结构","kp":["表征方法: 电子全息成像环境TEM","研究对象: Pt(111)-水界面原子尺度电势"],"as":"该研究利用原子级成像技术，首次直接观测到电极-水界面处电双层（EDL）的原子结构和局域电场分布。研究聚焦Pt(111)电极与液态水界面，揭示了在电化学条件下水分子在动态界面处的原子尺度有序排列行为。这一成果对理解电催化反应机理、电池和电化学能源转换器件中的固液界面过程具有重要意义，为从原子层面调控界面电场和反应选择性提供了直接实验依据。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Atomic Scale Ordering of Liquid Water at a Dynamic Pt(111) Interface Under Electrochemical Conditions Imaged by Electron","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Imaging atomic structure and electric fields of the electric double layer at electrode‐water interfaces is essential for understanding electrochemical reactions. The wave properties of electrons in an environmental transmission electron microscope were used to reconstruct the atomic scale electric potentials of a platinum (111) interface in water by phase shifting electron holography. This progress allowed the observation of ordered water layers at the dynamic state of the platinum (111) surface and the water reorganization under applied electric potentials. The obtained projected electric potential of the Pt‐water interface is quantitatively compared to ab‐initio molecular dynamics simulations, revealing an extended ordered water region. We conclude that the potential drop at the Pt ‐H\n                    2\n                    O interface is mainly carried by the polarization field of the ordered water structure. The impact of different surface Pt configurations and the presence of adsorbates on the ordered structure are discussed.","aip":1},{"t":"原子Eu介导的乙腈吸附构型转变驱动长期安培级乙胺电合成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521105?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙腈电合成乙胺","kp":["催化机制[AEM电解槽]: Eu调控乙腈吸附构型切换","产物: 乙胺","规模: 安培级电合成"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种由稀土元素铕（Eu）在原子尺度介导的乙腈吸附构型切换策略，实现了长期高效稳定的乙腔电催化加氢制备乙胺（EA）。通过Eu原子的精确调控，改变了乙腈在催化剂表面的吸附构型，从而优化了加氢反应路径并大幅提升选择性。乙胺是重要化工原料，该路线以可再生能源驱动，有望替代传统高能耗工艺，为含氮化学品绿色合成提供了新思路。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomic Eu‐Mediated Acetonitrile Adsorption Configuration Switch Drives Long‐Term and Ampere‐Level Electrosynthesis of Et","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic hydrogenation of acetonitrile (AN‐ECH) offers a sustainable pathway for ethylamine (EA) synthesis. However, achieving high selectivity in AN‐ECH necessitates carefully balancing proton availability to suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which often conflicts with the proton supply requirements under industrial‐grade current densities. Herein, we design and develop a novel and effective AN‐ECH catalyst consisting of rare‐earth Eu atoms modified on Cu\n                    2\n                    O nanoneedles to drive efficient and durable AN‐ECH at ampere‐level currents. The optimized Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a high EA Faradaic efficiency of 98.1 % and an exceptional production rate of 2253.2 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    compared with pure Cu\n                    2\n                    O. Notably, the Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O can continuously operate 420 h at 2 A in an anion‐exchange membrane electrolyzer for AN‐ECH, representing the longest reported stability under the industrial‐current conditions to date. Operando characterization and theoretical calculations elucidate that the Eu incorporation tailors the electronic structure of Cu sites, thus switching the adsorption configuration of AN from the flat‐lying multi‐site π‐adsorption to vertical N‐end adsorption. This reconfiguration of the adsorption site lowers the energy barrier for the imine hydrogenation step, dictating the ideal proton addition pathway while enhancing the proton addition kinetics to suppress the HER. This work provides fundamental insights into rare‐earth tuning of AN hydrogenation mechanisms and represents a critical advancement toward ampere‐scale electrosynthesis of EA.","aip":1},{"t":"来自陆地和海洋的大气微塑料排放","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09998-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Microplastics (MPs) are global pollutants1, yet their atmospheric distribution is poorly understood2. Although atmospheric MP measurements have become more abundant, estimates of emissions into the atmosphere vary by orders of magnitude3,4. Here we compile a global atmospheric MPs dataset and compare it with size-aligned MP model simulations. Our model simulations show two to four orders of magnitude overestimation of the measured global median atmospheric MP concentrations. Measured median concentrations over the ocean are 27 times lower than over the land (0.003 and 0.08 particles m−3, respectively). Applying a simple scaling method, we estimate that oceanic emissions are lower in number than land-based emissions. The total global land-based and oceanic emissions are 6.1 × 1017 (1.3 × 1017 to 1.1 × 1018) particles year−1 and 2.6 × 1016 (2.7 × 1015 to 5.0 × 1016) particles year−1, respectively. Our results indicate that fewer MP particles are emitted into the atmosphere than previously thought. Land sources dominate the number but not the mass emissions, indicating that MPs emission size distributions should be investigated further."},{"t":"人工磁编程超材料薄膜用于增强超宽带电磁响应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520176?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁性超材料薄膜","kp":["制备方法[超材料薄膜]: 磁场辅助可编程组装"],"as":"该研究开发了一种人工磁性编程的超材料薄膜，通过在薄膜中引入可编程的磁性微结构单元，实现对电磁波的超宽带增强调控。研究揭示了超材料几何结构与电磁波谱响应之间的结构-功能关系，利用磁编程技术精确控制单元的排列与取向，从而在超宽带频率范围内实现对电磁波的吸收、屏蔽或定向传输。该材料在电磁干扰防护、隐身技术和无线通信等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Artificially Magnetically Programmed Metamaterial Films for Enhanced Ultra‐Wideband Electromagnetic Response","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Uncovering the structural‐functional relationship between metamaterial structure and the electromagnetic spectrum has always been a long‐standing challenge with significant scientific and practical implications. Here, we report a magnetic field‐assisted assembly strategy that enables large‐scale programmable fabrication of metamaterial films with reconfigurable strip and web arrays. For the first time, the individual contribution and synergistic effect of array nodes or junctions on affecting the EM parameters and absorption ability are figured out with the help of assembly and regional disassembly of structural films. As a consequence, AW‐2 films exhibit an effective absorption bandwidth of 7.32 GHz when 60° of oblique incidence under the arch method test, covering all the S, X, and Ku bands. This work highlights the potential of magnetic‐field‐guided fabrication as a versatile route toward intelligent, high‐performance EM absorption films and provides a profound insight into the relationship between artificially engineered metamaterial structures and EM response, which opens up the way for intelligent manufacturing of high‐efficiency EM wave absorption films."},{"t":"具有优异减振与能量吸收性能的互穿相结构微晶格材料","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518377?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微晶格复合材料","kp":["[结构]: 互穿相微晶格","[性能]: 优异减振与能量吸收"],"as":"该研究设计并制备了一种架构化互穿相微晶格结构材料，在减振性能方面表现卓越。传统单一材料已难以满足日益苛刻的工程需求，该工作通过多材料、多拓扑构型的互穿相设计，将不同力学特性的相结构在微米尺度交织融合，实现了振动能量的高效耗散与宽频衰减。该微晶格兼具轻质和高阻尼特性，在航空航天、精密仪器隔振和结构防护等对减振要求严苛的领域具有广阔前景。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Architected Interpenetrating Phase Microlattice With Superior Vibration Attenuation and Energy Absorption Performance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  With the increasing demand for material performance, traditional pure materials no longer meet the stringent requirements. Interpenetrating phase composites (IPCs), composed of two or more completely interconnected constituent phases, have garnered significant attention for their extraordinary capabilities. Here, we propose a novel fabrication method for interpenetrating phase microlattices (IPMs) synthesized with a resin skeleton and flexible rubber as the secondary phase. The stress–strain curves of different types of IPMs were obtained by static compression tests, which revealed highly enhanced toughness and specific energy absorption through the combination of size effect and lattice topology design. Noncontact dynamic response measurements were used to analyze the dynamic properties of both skeletons and IPMs. By leveraging the intrinsic energy dissipation capacity of the introduced secondary soft phase, IPMs exhibited a maximum 76.3% attenuation range and a maximum 31.5 dB transmissibility loss. The average transmissibility versus structural density was compared with that of similar IPC attenuation systems, demonstrating the superior energy dissipation performance of the IPMs."},{"t":"立方相甲脒碘化铅(α-FAPbI₃)薄膜中各向异性应变诱导的中心对称性破缺","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506280?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿薄膜应变","kp":["材料[钙钛矿]: α-FAPbI3立方相","[机制]: 各向异性应变致中心对称破缺"],"as":"该研究聚焦于有机-无机卤化物钙钛矿材料中的应变工程。通过在立方相甲脒铅碘（FAPbI3）中施加各向异性应变，实现了中心对称性的破缺。中心对称性破缺可调控材料的光电性质，对提升钙钛矿太阳能电池等光电器件的性能具有重要意义。该工作为通过机械应变手段精确操控钙钛矿晶体对称性提供了新思路，有助于理解对称性与光电转换机制之间的内在关联。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Anisotropic Strain‐Induced Centrosymmetry Breaking in Cubic Formamidinium Lead Iodide (α‐FAPbI3) Thin Films","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic–inorganic halide perovskites have emerged as promising materials for next‐generation optoelectronic devices due to their exceptional photophysical properties. Among them, α‐formamidinium lead tri‐iodide (α‐FAPbI\n                    3\n                    ) with a cubic symmetry (space group of ) has garnered attention as a potential absorber in solar cells for its narrow bandgap and superior stability. The fundamental mechanisms governing its high performance have yet to be fully elucidated. In this study, we demonstrate that centrosymmetry breaking in [001] preferentially oriented α‐FAPbI\n                    3\n                    thin films (POF) arises from inevitable anisotropic strain during film formation. Using circular polarization‐dependent pump‐probe transient absorption spectroscopy, we observe Rashba‐type band splitting exclusively in POF, indicating symmetry breaking. Angle‐dependent X‐ray diffraction and photoluminescence (PL) reveal significant residual stress in POF compared to randomly oriented films (ROF), confirming strain‐induced lattice distortion. Furthermore, time‐resolved PL and microwave conductivity measurements reveal top‐back inhomogeneous carrier dynamics and anisotropic charge carrier mobility, supporting the presence of the anisotropic strain‐induced symmetry breaking. Our findings provide direct experimental evidence that inevitable strain in POF induces static Rashba effects, offering new insights into strain engineering for high‐performance perovskite optoelectronics and potential quantum applications."},{"t":"非谐性驱动的类粒子-类波声子交叉导致Tl₂AgI₃极低热导率","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2521353123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低热导率热电材料","kp":["材料: Tl2AgI3零维金属卤化物","机制: 非简谐驱动声子粒-波转变","性能: 超低热导率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种罕见的声子输运从粒子态到波态的交叉现象，由晶格非谐性驱动。研究团队通过理解其结构起源，实现了超低热导率。这一发现打破了传统声子输运以粒子扩散为主的认知框架，为设计高效热电材料提供了全新机制——利用非谐性工程操控声子输运行为，有望显著提升热电转换效率，对热管理及热电能源转换领域具有重要应用价值。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Anharmonicity driven unusual particle-to-wave-like phonon crossover leads to ultralow thermal conductivity in Tl2AgI3","b":"Realization of unusual particle-to-wave-like crossover in phonon transport and understanding its fundamental structural origin can guide the design of materials with ultralow thermal conductivity. Here, we report such a crossover from particle-like phonon propagation to wave-like coherence with increasing temperature in the zero-dimensional (0D) metal halide, Tl2AgI3. Composed of discrete (Tl6I)5+ and (Ag3I8)5- subunits, the structure exhibits intrinsic lattice instability governed by Pauling's third rule where face-sharing of polyhedra drives Coulombic cationic repulsion causing local distortion of Ag atoms, as confirmed by synchrotron X-ray pair distribution function (X-PDF) analysis and ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) simulations. Anharmonic low-energy rattling of Tl is evidenced within the (Tl6I)5+ framework. These structural disorders generate low-frequency localized and anharmonic optical phonons that hybridize with acoustic branches, strongly suppressing lattice thermal conductivity ([Formula: see text]). Consequently, [Formula: see text] drops to ~0.18 W/m.K at 125 K and remains nearly temperature independent, signaling a breakdown of the phonon-gas model, attributed to phonon localization and wave-like coherence, modeled using the linearized Wigner transport equation (LWTE). The phonon localization in the 0D crystal structure results in a crossover from populations conductivity ([Formula: see text]) associated with particle-like phonon propagation to coherence conductivity ([Formula: see text]) through wave-like tunneling, at 175 K. Our study reveals 0D structural confinement along with anharmonic local structural dynamics can enable particle-to-wave-like phonon crossover, establishing a pathway to mixed phononic regimes and suppressed thermal transport.","aip":1},{"t":"一种由短药代动力学尾定义的超长效二聚体比克替拉韦前药","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68501-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultra-long-acting (ULA) antiretroviral parenteral formulations, with low injection volumes, high resistance barriers, and short pharmacokinetic (PK) tails, can transform HIV-1 therapeutics. Here, we converted bictegravir (BIC), a potent daily oral antiretroviral drug, into monomeric and homodimeric ester prodrugs. The homodimeric prodrug nanosuspension, NMXBIC, shows sustained plasma BIC levels > 16 times the protein-adjusted 95% inhibitory concentration (PA-IC95) for six months after a single injection in Sprague Dawley rats. The results paralleled a short PK tail with the potential for late dose forgiveness. The monomeric prodrug nanosuspension, NM2BIC, shows lower year-long plasma BIC concentrations above PA-IC95 after a single injection. After repeated injections, NMXBIC and NM2BIC are well tolerated in New Zealand White rabbits. NMXBIC’s physicochemical properties and high BIC loading/unit mass of the prodrug contribute to its unique ULA PK profile. These results support its development as a ULA formulation for HIV-1 treatment and prevention."},{"t":"人口老龄化威胁动物园的保护目标","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522274123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Improvements in wildlife husbandry mean that many zoo animals are living longer. This has put pressure on the finite holding capacity of zoos, which has often been addressed through a curtailing of reproduction to reduce population growth rates. Here, we explore how such actions have impacted the demographic trends of 774 mammal populations in European and North American zoo populations between 1970 and 2023. Irrespective of whether the data are clustered by region, taxonomic group, conservation status, or breeding program type, the proportion of old individuals has increased continuously, mirrored by a decrease in juveniles and actively reproducing adults. This aging demographic trend compromises the long-term sustainability of zoo populations and thus the ability of zoos to meet ex situ conservation goals. As the observed trends do not show signs of abating, reflection on current zoo population management is required."},{"t":"聚集诱导发光分子设计用于减少有机太阳能电池中的非辐射能量损失","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519588?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["分子设计策略[有机太阳能电池]: AIE抑制聚集猝灭提升PLQY","目标: 降低非辐射复合损耗"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对有机太阳能电池中非辐射能量损失这一关键瓶颈，提出利用聚集诱导发光（AIE）分子设计策略来降低非辐射损耗。非辐射复合是限制开路电压和光电转换效率的核心因素。AIE材料在聚集态下非辐射跃迁被抑制，辐射跃迁增强，从而有效减少能量损失。该工作为通过分子工程同时提升器件效率和电压提供了系统性设计原则，对推动有机光电器件走向实用化具有重要意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Aggregation‐Induced Emission Molecular Design for Mitigating Non‐Radiative Energy Loss in Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Non‐radiative energy loss remains a critical bottleneck limiting the open‐circuit voltage (\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    ) and efficiency of organic solar cells (OSCs). Here, we introduce a molecular design strategy that leverages aggregation‐induced emission (AIE) to suppress aggregation‐caused quenching and enhance solid‐state photoluminescence quantum yield (PLQY), thereby mitigating non‐radiative recombination. A prototypical AIE motif, tetraphenylethylene, was incorporated into the terminal group of a Y‐series non‐fullerene acceptor to yield dTPE, which exhibits distinct AIE characteristics not previously observed in high‐performance Y‐series acceptors. Photoluminescence studies reveal that dTPE achieves a threefold enhancement in PLQY compared to L8BO‐C4 in the film, leading to an electroluminescence external quantum efficiency more than an order of magnitude higher than that of D18:L8BO‐C4. Consequently, the binary D18:dTPE device achieves a remarkably low non‐radiative recombination loss of 0.130 eV. When incorporated as a guest into D18:L8BO‐C4 blends, dTPE enables a non‐radiative voltage loss of only 0.190 eV and an unprecedented\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    of 0.93 V, yielding an efficiency of 20.5%. To our knowledge, this represents the highest\n                    V\n                    OC\n                    reported for OSCs with efficiencies above 20%. This work establishes AIE molecular design as an effective pathway to overcome intrinsic limitations of Y‐series acceptors and provides guiding principles for mitigating non‐radiative energy loss in next‐generation OSCs.","aip":1},{"t":"衰老促进小胶质细胞积累缓慢降解的突触蛋白","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09987-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Neurodegenerative diseases affect 1 in 12 people globally and remain incurable. Central to their pathogenesis is a loss of neuronal protein maintenance and the accumulation of protein aggregates with ageing1,2. Here we engineered bioorthogonal tools3 that enabled us to tag the nascent neuronal proteome and study its turnover with ageing, its propensity to aggregate and its interaction with microglia. We show that neuronal protein half-life approximately doubles on average between 4-month-old and 24-month-old mice, with the stability of individual proteins differing among brain regions. Furthermore, we describe the aged neuronal ‘aggregome’, which encompasses 1,726 proteins, nearly half of which show reduced degradation with age. The aggregome includes well-known proteins linked to diseases and numerous proteins previously not associated with neurodegeneration. Notably, we demonstrate that neuronal proteins accumulate in aged microglia, with 54% also displaying reduced degradation and/or aggregation with age. Among these proteins, synaptic proteins are highly enriched, which suggests that there is a cascade of events that emerge from impaired synaptic protein turnover and aggregation to the disposal of these proteins, possibly through microglial engulfment of synapses. These findings reveal the substantial loss of neuronal proteome maintenance with ageing, which could be causal for age-related synapse loss and cognitive decline."},{"t":"阿法尔化石显示了傍人的广泛分布和多样性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09826-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Afar depression in northeastern Ethiopia contains a rich palaeontological and archaeological record, which documents 6 million years of human evolution. Abundant faunal evidence links evolutionary patterns with palaeoenvironmental change as a principal underlying force1. Many of the earlier hominin taxa recognized today are found in the Afar, but Paranthropus has been conspicuously absent from the region. Here we report on the discovery, in the Mille-Logya research area, of a partial mandible that we attribute to Paranthropus, dated to between 2.5 and 2.9 million years ago and found in a well-understood chronological and faunal context. The find is among the oldest fossils attributable to Paranthropus and indicates that this genus, from its earliest known appearance, had a greater geographic distribution than previously documented2. Often seen as a dietary specialist feeding on tough food, the range of diverse habitats with which eastern African Paranthropus can now be associated shows that this suggested adaptive niche did not restrict its ability to disperse as widely as species of Australopithecus and early Homo. The discovery of Paranthropus in the Afar emphasizes how little is known about hominin evolution in eastern Africa during the crucial period between 3 and 2.5 million years ago, when this genus and the Homo lineage presumably emerged."},{"t":"基于双类型模型集成与在线误差修正的光伏功率自适应预测","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000498?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.5},"kp":["[光伏功率预测]: 双类型模型集成与在线误差校正"],"ot":"Adaptive forecasting of photovoltaic power based on dual-type models’ ensemble and online error correction"},{"t":"用于植物电生理监测长期电耦合的可适应热响应聚合物","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady1400?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"植物电生理监测","kp":["材料[植物电极]: 温敏响应聚合物","持续时间[非侵入监测]: >1天"],"dp":1,"as":"研究人员开发了一种适应性热响应聚合物，可在植物体内实现长期稳定的电学耦合，用于持续监测植物电生理信号。该材料通过温度敏感的构象变化与植物组织紧密贴合，维持数周乃至更久的信号传输质量，克服了传统电极界面退化的问题，为精准农业、作物健康监测和植物-电子接口技术提供了新方案。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptable thermoresponsive polymer for long-term electrical coupling in plant electrophysiology monitoring","b":"Electrophysiological signals provide valuable insights into plant health, facilitating measures to enhance crop productivity. Despite advances in measurement methods, long-term (>1 day) acquisition techniques remain limited, hindering continuous monitoring. Current long-term techniques rely on invasive electrodes, as noninvasive electrodes fall short in operational duration and conformability. Here, a capacitively coupled electrode with an adaptable coupling layer is developed for noninvasive, month-long electrophysiological monitoring on diverse plants. The adaptable coupling layer is formed by in situ sol-gel transition, followed by dehydration of thermoresponsive hydrogel on plants, achieving high conformability to complex surfaces and stable electrical coupling. For 1 month on trichome-covered plant surfaces, the electrode maintains a high signal-to-noise ratio comparable to a gold-standard noninvasive electrode, which typically lasts a few hours. Long-term monitoring reveals drought-specific signal features that correlate with plant water status. Physiological investigations indicate an essential role of calcium and reactive oxygen species, highlighting the potential of our electrode in generating biological insights and inspiring plant sensing innovations."},{"t":"吸积爆发使行星形成盘中的硅酸盐结晶","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09939-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Crystalline silicates form at high temperatures (>900 K) (refs. 1,2). Their presence in comets3,4,5,6 suggests that high-temperature dust processing occurred in the early Solar System and was subsequently transported outwards to comet-forming regions. However, direct evidence for this crystallization and redistribution in Sun-like protostars has remained unknown. By comparing James Webb Space Telescope mid-infrared spectra of the periodically bursting protostar EC 53 (ref. 7), we detect crystalline silicate (forsterite and enstatite) emission features that appear only during the burst. The emergence of these features indicates active crystal formation by thermal annealing in the hot inner disk during the accretion burst. We also detect a nested outflow—a collimated atomic jet enclosed by slower molecular outflows, consistent with magnetohydrodynamic wind models8. This configuration provides a mechanism for the outward transport of freshly crystallized silicates9. To our knowledge, our results provide the first direct observational evidence of in situ silicate crystallization during episodic accretion bursts in a very young star still embedded in its dense envelope. Although we do not directly detect grains transported to the outer disk, the observed trends are consistent with outward redistribution, indicating that both dust processing and transport occur during the earliest and most dynamic stages of star formation."},{"t":"异常甲基化通过限制 RIPK3 表达来限制肺腺癌的抗肿瘤炎症","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz9227?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Evasion of programmed cell death is a critical hallmark of cancer. However, the contribution of inflammatory forms of cell death in lung carcinogenesis and their effects on the composition of the tumor-immune microenvironment remain unclear. Our multi-omics analyses of samples from patients with primary lung adenocarcinoma revealed that necrosome signaling is repressed because of reduced expression of receptor-interacting protein kinase 3 (RIPK3). Distinct methylation signatures, both in the RIPK3 promoter and nonpromoter regions, correlated with lower transcription levels of RIPK3. This resulted in limited expression of inflammatory genes, advanced histologic features, reduced immune cell invasion, and decreased patient survival. Mechanistically, we confirmed the tumor-suppressive role of necrosome signaling through the genetic deletion of Ripk3 in two independent, clinically relevant mouse models of lung adenocarcinoma. Functionally, RIPK3 shaped a diverse immune environment by promoting the invasion of innate and adaptive immune cells in patient samples and experimental mice. Thus, RIPK3-mediated inflammatory signaling enhances a diverse immune microenvironment and hinders progression in lung adenocarcinoma."},{"t":"人工智能和核能在 2026 年议程设定技术中占据重要地位","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00185-9","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI与核能","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"多动症的治疗不仅仅是兴奋剂","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00095-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"注意力缺陷多动症（ADHD）的发病率呈上升趋势，但为什么呢？","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00093-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"埃塞俄比亚阿法尔地区有多种早期人类物种","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-03727-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"来自 Gloeophyllum trabeum 的单域扩展蛋白样蛋白能够裂解木聚糖","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528599123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Expansin-related proteins (ERPs) are a broad group of plant cell wall-loosening proteins and are considered noncatalytic, as, to date, no cell wall-derived products have been observed as a result of catalysis, despite the presence of a domain that resembles the catalytic domains of GH45 endoglucanases. Here, we report catalytic activity for a single-domain ERP, GtEXPN_133317, from the brown-rot fungus Gloeophyllum trabeum, which is highly expressed in the early phase of spruce colonization. We demonstrate enzyme-dependent formation of xylan-derived products, such as glucuronylated xylo-oligosaccharides, using high-performance anion exchange chromatography with pulsed amperometric detection. Structure-based multiple sequence alignment of ERPs with GH45 endoglucanases showed that, next to a single conserved aspartate (Asp87 in GtEXPN_133317) present in all ERPs and GH45s, fungal ERPs contain a second conserved acidic residue (Asp25 in GtEXPN_133317). Mutation of these two conserved amino acids, Asp87 and Asp25, led to a nearly complete loss of xylanolytic activity. While these findings do not exclude the possibility of a noncatalytic plant cell wall-loosening mechanism, they show that ERPs likely have other modes of action besides what the current paradigm states.","tp":"真菌酶降解","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究首次报道了来自褐腐菌Gloeophyllum trabeum的单域扩展蛋白样蛋白GtEXPN_133317具有催化裂解木聚糖的活性。此前扩展蛋白相关蛋白(ERP)一直被认为是非催化的，该发现在云杉定殖早期高表达的ERP中观察到了明确的催化产物，改写了ERP非催化性的传统认知。"},{"t":"流体流动中细菌表面粘附的剪切诱导限制","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516069123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Controlling bacterial surface adhesion and subsequent biofilm formation in fluid systems is crucial for the safety and efficacy of medical and industrial processes. Here, we theoretically examine the transport of bacteria close to surfaces, isolating how the key processes of bacterial motility and fluid flow interact and alter surface adhesion. We exploit the disparity between the fluid velocity and the swimming velocity of common motile bacteria and, using a hybrid asymptotic-computational approach, we systematically derive the coarse-grained bacterial diffusivity close to surfaces as a function of swimming speed, rotational diffusivity, and shape. We calculate an analytical upper bound for the bacterial adhesion rate by considering the scenario in which bacteria adhere irreversibly to the surface on first contact. Our theory predicts that maximal adhesion occurs at intermediate flow rates: At lower flow rates, increasing flow increases surface adhesion, while at higher flow rates, adhesion is decreased by shear-induced cell reorientation."},{"t":"相关不确定性下社区多能源系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"社区多能系统","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated unce"},{"t":"利用热切换溶剂从卤水混合物碱金属阳离子中直接提锂的新型方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00446-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"盐湖提锂","kp":["选择性[S3E提锂]: Li/Na,K >1000倍","技术: 热响应胺溶剂切换萃取"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种新型可切换溶剂选择性萃取（S3E）技术，利用热响应性胺类实现对卤水中碱金属阳离子的直接锂提取。该技术通过温度调控实现溶剂相态切换，对锂离子具备高选择性，能有效分离卤水中的锂与钠、钾等共存离子。相比传统盐田蒸发法，S3E技术提取效率高、耗水量低、环境友好，对盐湖提锂及地热卤水提锂等资源的规模化开发具有潜在应用前景。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A novel approach for direct lithium extraction from alkali metal cations in brine mixtures using thermally switchable so","b":"A novel switchable solvent selective extraction (S3E) technology utilizes thermo-responsive amines for highly selective lithium recovery from complex brines. A modest temperature swing toggles solvent hydrophilicity, enabling preferential lithium extraction even with 1,000× more sodium or potassium. S3E maintains solvent stability and selectivity over repeated cycles for scalable lithium recovery."},{"t":"奖励诱导抑制恐惧泛化和增强恐惧消退的神经回路基础","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522768123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"How positive and negative affective stimuli interact in the brain to influence behavioral outcomes remains poorly understood. Here, we show that recall of a positively valenced reward-associated cue (reward-conditioned stimulus, CSRew+) can prevent or reverse fear generalization in mice. Modification of generalized fear by recall of a CSRew+ is dependent on the midbrain dopamine system and the regulation of discriminatory fear encoding by the central amygdala (CeA). Precisely timed, transient elevations in dopamine are necessary to reverse fear generalization and nondiscriminatory fear encoding in the CeA. Recall of a positive association is also effective at enhancing the extinction of a conditioned fear response in a dopamine-dependent manner. These data demonstrate that recall of a positive experience can be an effective means to suppress generalized fear and show that dopamine projections to the CeA are an important neural substrate for this phenomenon."},{"t":"采用AlInP/GaInP外延层在硅上集成的单片三维红光Micro-LED显示器","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01546-4","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基Micro-LED","kp":["[集成]: 单片3D集成红光micro-LED","外延层[红光micro-LED]: AlInP/GaInP","[挑战]: 像素缩小致量子效率低"],"sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究实现了基于AlInP/GaInP外延层的硅基单片三维集成红色Micro-LED显示技术。该方案消除了驱动电路与LED阵列之间机械对准的需求，通过晶圆级三维集成将驱动IC与发光层垂直堆叠，显著提升像素密度和显示均匀性，为AR/VR微显示和可穿戴设备提供高分辨率方案。","ot":"A monolithic three-dimensional integrated red micro-LED display on silicon using AlInP/GaInP epilayers","b":"Monolithic three-dimensional integration technology can eliminate the need for mechanical alignment between driving circuits and light-emitting diode (LED) pixels, leading to ultrahigh-resolution displays. However, this is challenging for red micro-LEDs, which are typically based on AlGaInP/GaInP, because of their low quantum efficiency and performance degradation when the pixel size is reduced. Here we report a high-pixel-density (1,700 pixels per inch) red active-matrix display consisting of micro-LEDs based on an epitaxial AlInP/GaInP double-quantum-well structure and silicon complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor integrated circuits. The epitaxial layer exhibits high internal quantum efficiency at low current densities (less than 10 A cm−2) due to a hole-dominant quantum well that reduces the non-radiative Shockley–Read–Hall recombination caused by electron lateral diffusion. We also use thickness fluctuation scattering in the quantum well to minimize the size-dependent quantum efficiency shift to higher current densities when reducing the size of the red micro-LEDs."},{"t":"面向异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的混合数据-模型驱动方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源柔性聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动分布式能源功率灵活性聚合"],"dp":1,"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy"},{"t":"全基因组遗传筛选揭示 P2Y2 整合素轴作为非小细胞肺癌 EGFR 突变体的稳定剂","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv3980?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Activating mutations in the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) gene drive non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). Oncogenic EGFR mutants are ligand-independent and more stable, but the underlying mechanism remains unclear. We hypothesized that EGFR mutants selectively leverage cellular stabilizers to evade degradation. Genome-wide RNA interference screens identified genes (encoding for stabilizers) responsible for mutant EGFR stability, with P2Y2 receptor (P2Y2) emerging as a bona fide stabilizer. Mechanistically, high extracellular adenosine triphosphate (ATP) levels transactivate EGFR mutants via P2Y2 activation, previously shown to signal through Src kinase-dependent EGFR phosphorylation. Our study reveals that ATP-driven P2Y2 activation stabilizes EGFR mutants by forming a P2Y2-integrin β1-EGFR complex enriched in endosomes. Targeting this axis destabilizes EGFR mutants and offers a strategy against drug resistance. Elevated P2Y2 and integrin β1 expression in patients with NSCLC implies clinical relevance. Our results provide previously unidentified insight that EGFR mutants enhance extracellular ATP levels to activate P2Y2-integrin for enhanced stability of EGFR mutants to drive the oncogenic program."},{"t":"用于扩大细胞外靶向蛋白质降解的细胞因子受体靶向嵌合体工具箱","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524129123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Extracellular targeted protein degradation (eTPD) is an important new modality for manipulating the extracellular proteome. However, most eTPD receptors are expressed broadly or are restricted to the liver, limiting specific degradation in other tissues. Cytokine receptor-targeting chimeras (kineTACs) are genetically encoded bispecifics for eTPD that fuse a natural ligand like CXCL12 to an antibody, directing soluble or membrane proteins for lysosomal degradation using the widely expressed chemokine receptor CXCR7 (K. Pance et al., Nat. Biotechnol. 41, 273-281 (2023)]. Here, we dramatically expand the kineTAC toolbox by constructing 81 different kineTACs based on an unbiased list of cytokines, chemokines, and growth factors. Remarkably, 55 of these expressed at suitable levels for analysis without any optimization. Many of these kineTACs bind receptors that have unique cell-type expression profiles, allowing for eTPD in specific cells and tissues, and some were more potent than the original CXCL12-based kineTAC against specific targets. We further show the internalizing capability of a kineTAC can enhance the performance of antibody drug conjugates. We believe these simple, genetically encoded tools will be useful for expanding the applications for optimized or cell type-selective eTPD."},{"t":"集成高效光电化学储能与太阳光利用的增值太阳能可充电电池","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523063?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电化学太阳能电池","kp":["[电池化学]: 太阳能介导可充电海水电池","[增值]: 自驱动光催化产H2O2"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种增值型太阳能可充电电池，将光电化学能量存储与阳光利用高效集成。该电池在储能过程中同步驱动有价值化学品（如燃料或精细化学品）的生成，实现能量存储与化学品合成的双重价值输出，为太阳能转化利用和分布式储能提供多功能集成方案。","ot":"A Value‐Added Solar‐Mediated Rechargeable Battery Integrating Efficient Photoelectrochemical Energy Storage with Sunligh","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Developing sustainable functional batteries capable of generating valuable chemicals during electricity storage/release represents challenging frontiers. Here, we present a new battery chemistry that enables the first value‐added solar‐mediated rechargeable seawater battery integrating photoelectrochemical energy storage with sunlight‐boosted self‐powered H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production from seawater without external power/O\n                    2\n                    supply. This system is enabled by rationally‐designed bifunctional S‐scheme heterojunction photocathodes (MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    ) comprising A3‐(D‐core) polymer (MP‐COP) encapsulated TiO\n                    2\n                    . A3‐(D‐core) topology induces favorable electronic modulation that optimizes oxygen specie adsorption and steering oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) toward one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    pathway—while facilitating electronic coupling with oxygen evolution reaction (OER)‐active TiO\n                    2\n                    to establish S‐scheme charge transfer mechanism alongside strengthened built‐in electric field. These endow MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sunlight‐boosted 4e\n                    –\n                    OER for in situ O\n                    2\n                    ‐generation during photo‐charge and 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    synthesis during photo‐discharge, establishing solar‐mediated self‐sustaining value‐added reaction cycles. Integrating MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sodium anodes and seawater creates previously‐unexplored functional battery, yielding remarkable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    yield of 5.47 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during photo‐discharge—9.4 times those in dark and exceeding most reported seawater systems while delivering near‐zero charge/discharge voltage gap under illumination. Mechanistic studies reveal promoting effect of A3‐(D‐core) modulation and its synergistic role with S‐scheme charge transfer that promotes Yeager‐type O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and facilitates one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR toward H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"具有本征孔隙率的二维MOF用于比色挥发性有机物(VOCs)检测","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519243?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF气体传感","kp":["材料[VOC检测]: 本征面内多孔2D MOF","机制: 可逆比色响应"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队报道了一种罕见的具有本征面内孔隙率的二维金属有机框架（MOF）材料，可用于挥发性有机化合物的比色检测。该材料利用二维平面内固有的多孔结构实现对不同VOC气体的选择性吸附，并通过颜色变化实现可视化识别，无需复杂仪器即可读出检测结果。这种兼具高孔隙率和比色响应功能的设计思路，为环境监测、工业安全检测等领域的低成本气体传感提供了新方向。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"2D MOF with Intrinsic Porosity for Colorimetric Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs) Detection","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  In this work, we report an uncommon 2D metal–organic framework (MOF) with intrinsic in‐plane porosity that undergoes a distinct and reversible colour change upon exposure to various volatile organic compounds (VOCs). The presence of channels oriented parallel to the layers ensures permanent porosity that is preserved even after exfoliation into nanosheets with micron‐scale lateral dimensions, thereby overcoming the conventional limitation of porosity loss in the monolayer regime. This unique combination of structural stability and responsive behaviour not only underscores the potential of 2D MOFs as versatile and tuneable platforms for chemical sensing, but also opens the door to channelled nanosheets, redefining the application landscape of 2D MOFs."},{"t":"用于弹性电子器件单片微光刻的(液态)金属光刻胶","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72140?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弹性电子光刻","kp":["[光刻材料]: 液态金属光刻胶","[应用]: 弹性电子单片微光刻"],"as":"该研究提出一种液态金属光刻胶技术，用于弹性电子器件的单片式微光刻加工。传统刚性电子器件无法匹配生物组织的柔软力学特性，而弹性电子在可穿戴、健康监测和人机接口等领域前景广阔。液态金属光刻胶兼具金属导电性与液态可加工性，可在弹性基底上高精度 patterning，实现高密度电路的一体化制造。该方法有望突破柔性电子制造中分辨率与可拉伸性难以兼顾的瓶颈，推动皮肤式电子的大规模应用。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"(Liquid) Metallic Photoresist for Monolithic Microlithography of Elastic Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  By offering mechanical compliance similar to biological tissue, elastic electronics show great potential in wearable and implanted electronics, interactive robots, and neural interfaces. Miniaturization of elastic electronics through advanced microfabrication is essential to increase device density for high‐quality and comprehensive information processing. Cleanroom photolithography is conventionally used for micropatterning photoresists, whose patterns are then transferred to rigid metal or semiconductor materials through lift‐off or etching processes. However, such delicate processes are exclusive and cannot be directly translated to fabricate elastic electronics, which are usually based on unconventional materials. Here, we developed a metallic photoresist, based on ligand‐encapsulated eutectic gallium‐indium liquid metal nanoparticles, and an associated microfabrication process that enables direct, single‐step liquid metal microlithography across wafer‐scale areas. By leveraging tunable covalent and noncovalent interactions at liquid metal nanoparticles interfaces, this method achieves 2 µm resolution, bulk‐level conductivity, and 3D topology matching of liquid metal patterns, while maintaining over 750% stretchability. We demonstrate the versatility of this approach by fabricating multi‐scale elastic electronics, from high‐resolution liquid metal grid transparent electrodes and ECoG neural electrodes to large‐area flexible printed circuit boards.","aip":1},{"t":"含硫酯蛋白的 α2-巨球蛋白功能通过两种免疫诱导肽保护果蝇免受细菌蛋白酶的侵害","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525580123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"RNAseq analysis of the Drosophila genome has revealed further immune-induced genes. Two genes initially annotated as lncRNAs, CG44404(yulü) and CG45045(shenshu), are strongly induced. We report here that these two genes actually encode highly related secreted peptides found in the Sophophora subgenus of Drosophila species. We have generated single and double null mutants of these loci and found that the double mutant line did not display any enhanced susceptibility to an immune challenge with a panel of bacterial and fungal pathogens, except for Pseudomonas aeruginosa. We did not observe any increased P. aeruginosa burden in yulü-shenshu mutants, suggesting that the two peptides may not be required for resistance to infection. Rather, we find that they provide a level of protection against Outer Membrane Vesicles (OMVs) purified from either P. aeruginosa or Serratia marcescens culture supernatants. We have recently reported that S. marcescens OMVs induce the paralysis of flies through the induction of apoptosis in at least some neurons. Much of the virulence of these OMVs is mediated by the metalloprotease PrtA. While Yulü/Shenshu do not display any protease inhibition activity, the detection of an association between Yulü and the Drosophila complement thioester-containing protein 2 (Tep2) led to the finding that both Tep2 and Tep4 mutants are sensitive to the injection of PrtA while their overexpression significantly protects wild-type flies from the effects of this protease. Both Tep2 and Tep4 are able to inhibit the activity of PrtA in a thioester- and yulü/shenshu-dependent manner. Thus, these Teps may also function as α2-macroglobulins."},{"t":"[ASAP]揭示磷酸三烷基酯对高效镁电解质溶剂化壳层与固体电解质界面膜的位阻效应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14645","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池电解质","kp":["库仑效率[Mg沉积/剥离]: ≈100%","[电解质]: Mg(OTf)₂/二甘醇二甲醚:磷酸三乙酯","[机制]: 空间位阻调控溶剂化鞘与SEI"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.5},"as":"该研究探讨了磷酸三烷基酯溶剂的位阻效应对镁电解质溶剂化壳层和固体电解质界面(SEI)的影响。设计与镁兼容且无氯电解质是实现高压长寿命镁金属电池的关键。研究系统分析了不同烷基链长度的磷酸酯对Mg²⁺溶剂化结构、界面化学和电化学性能的调控作用。结果表明，通过调节位阻效应可优化溶剂化壳层组成，促进稳定SEI的形成，从而提升镁电池的库仑效率和循环稳定性，为高性能镁电池电解质设计提供了分子层面的指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Steric Effect of Trialkyl Phosphates on the Solvation Sheath and Solid Electrolyte Interphase in High-Efficiency Magnesium Electrolytes","b":"Designing Mg-compatible and chloride-free electrolytes is important to achieving high-voltage and long-life Mg metal batteries. In electrolytes based on Mg(OTf)2/diglyme: triethyl phosphate that exhibit near 100% Coulombic efficiency for Mg plating/stripping at high current densities and capacities, the TXP (X = alkyl group) plays a key role. Herein, we unveil steric hindrance as the fundamental origin of this role in optimizing the Mg2+ solvation structure and forming electrolyte-derived solid electrolyte interphases. The steric hindrance was tuned by systematically changing the alkyl chain length of the phosphate (TXP) from one to five. Its impact on altering bulk electrolyte solvation and interfacial SEI chemistry was studied by combining both spectroscopy techniques and theoretical modeling methods. We demonstrate that low steric hindrance leads to easy decomposition of phosphate solvents, whereas high steric hindrance fails to interrupt Mg2+-triflate/diglyme interactions. TEP with medium hindrance shows optimized behavior in both scenarios, which is the origin of its superior electrochemical performance. Our finding provides a new solvent design principle at the molecular level for chloride-free Mg2+ electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]放大量化序列逐步DNA置换信号交换用于细胞与组织快速超多重荧光成像","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18687","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光多路成像","kp":["[方法]: 序列步进式DNA置换信号交换","[多路复用]: 突破3-5色光谱限制","[应用]: 细胞组织超多重荧光成像"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种基于顺序逐步DNA置换反应的信号交换技术，用于细胞和组织中的超多重荧光成像。多重荧光成像是通过可视化生物分子研究细胞功能的关键方法，但传统方法受限于荧光通道数量。该策略利用DNA链置换反应在单一荧光通道中依次检测多种生物标志物，实现了快速超多重的荧光成像。该方法在细胞和组织样本中均展示了良好的适用性，为高通量生物分子检测和空间组学研究提供了强有力的工具。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Scaling Up Sequential Stepwise DNA Displacement-Based Signal Exchange for Rapid Ultraplex Fluorescent Imaging in Cells and Tissues","b":"Multiplexed fluorescent imaging methods are essential for studying cellular function by visualization of biomolecules in cells and tissues with high-resolution spatial information but usually suffer from limitations of 3-5 multiplexity because of spectral overlap between the used fluorophores. We introduce a method using scaled-up sequential DNA displacement reactions to enable highly multiplexed fluorescent imaging. The fluorescent signals of targets are encoded in different DNA probes in a single step. Each DNA probe's fluorescent signal can be activated for imaging and removed to avoid signal overlap with targets in the next round by two sequential, independent DNA displacement reactions. Massive targets in situ can be imaged when a scaled-up DNA displacement reaction is applied sequentially. We experimentally screened a set of rapid and orthogonal DNA displacement sequences from 144 different in situ reactions and developed 25 DNA probes with 50 selected displacement sequences for multiplexed imaging. We demonstrated 25-plex RNA imaging in a single fluorophore channel in fixed cells within 20 min, using the 50 sequential displacement reactions that consisted of 100 DNA strands simultaneously. To further demonstrate the robustness and practical usage, we showed 24-plex RNA imaging with the method in retinal tissues and resolved different cell types. Because of the vast sequence design space of DNA probes, theoretically unlimited multiplexity can be achieved. This method significantly simplifies the high-plex fluorescent imaging process with preprogrammed complex dynamic DNA nanotechnology and has broad biotechnical applications for future medicine and diagnostics.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]单核非血红素铁(III)-过氧配合物在氧化N-去甲基化反应中作为Rieske加氧酶的化学模型研究","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18643","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁过氧配合物","kp":["催化剂[非血红素铁过氧络合物]: [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]⁺","[反应类型]: cis-双羟基化与C-H官能化","[仿生模型]: Rieske双加氧酶N-脱甲基化"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究以单核非血红素铁(III)-过氧配合物为化学模型，模拟Rieske加氧酶的N-脱甲基反应。研究人员合成了含有N-四甲基环胺(n-TMC)配体的[FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+系列配合物，系统研究了其结构与反应活性的关系。该工作揭示了一价铁-过氧中间体在C-H键活化和N-脱甲基反应中的催化机理，为理解Rieske加氧酶的生物催化机制提供了重要化学模型，有助于深入认识非血红素铁酶的氧化反应路径。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Mononuclear Non-Heme Iron(III)-Peroxo Complexes in Oxidative N-Demethylation Reaction as a Chemical Model Study of Rieske Oxygenases","b":"Mononuclear nonheme iron(III)-peroxo complexes bearing N-tetramethylated cyclam (n-TMC) ligands, [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ (n = 12, 13, and 14), have recently shown highly intriguing reactivities in various oxidation reactions, such as the cis-dihydroxylation and C-H functionalization reactions, which were previously associated only with high-valent iron-oxo intermediates in heme and nonheme iron enzymes. Herein, we extend our study to report [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ mediated N-demethylation of N,N-dimethylanilines (DMAs), another reaction that was previously associated only with high-valent iron-oxo cores. Most importantly, we provide definitive evidence of the occurrence of electron transfer from DMAs to [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+, thereby establishing an electron-transfer (ET) pathway for the N-demethylation reaction. Investigation of the ET reactivity of [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ in light of the Marcus theory of ET, and a comparison of the N-demethylation and the ET rate constants corroborate a mechanism, whereby N-demethylation of DMAs by [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ proceeds via the peroxide O-O bond cleavage of [FeIII(O2)(n-TMC)]+ to form a transient [FeIV(O2-)(O• -)(n-TMC)]+ species, which undergoes a proton-coupled electron-transfer (PCET) or an uncoupled electron transfer-proton transfer (ET/PT) in the presence of DMAs. Saturation kinetics support the rate-determining formation of [FeIV(O2-)(O• -)(n-TMC)]+ in a pre-equilibrium step with the same values of the O-O bond cleavage rate constants irrespective of the substrates, such as DMAs and one-electron oxidants. The present study corroborates that mononuclear nonheme iron(III)-peroxo cores are not mere pass-through points en route to high-valent metal-oxo intermediates, but they can play an important role in the diverse oxidation reactions of Rieske oxygenases, such as in the N-demethylation reaction."},{"t":"[ASAP]利用方酰胺氢键供体催化剂进行四氢呋喃的分子量可控阳离子聚合","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18359","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"THF阳离子聚合","kp":["分子量[PTHF阳离子开环聚合]: 最高175 kDa","[催化剂]: 方酰胺鎓氢键供体","[突破]: 超越20 kDa分子量控制极限"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用方酰胺氢键给体催化剂实现了四氢呋喃(THF)的分子量可控阳离子聚合。聚四氢呋喃(PTHF)作为弹性纤维和热固性材料的软段具有长期工业应用价值。传统THF阳离子聚合面临分子量控制困难的问题。该研究采用方酰胺催化剂通过氢键活化引发体系，实现了对PTHF分子量的精确调控，为高分子量PTHF的可控制备提供了新策略，具有潜在工业应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Molecular Weight-Controlled Cationic Polymerization of Tetrahydrofuran Using a Squaramidinium Hydrogen-Bond Donor Catalyst","b":"Poly(tetrahydrofuran) (PTHF) has long-standing industrial relevance as the soft block of elastic fibers and thermosets. Despite its commercial importance, the synthesis of PTHF with molecular weight (MW) control beyond 20 kDa has proved challenging. In this work, we disclose a MW-controlled synthesis of PTHF up to 175 kDa by cationic ring-opening polymerization, using a cationic squaramidinium hydrogen-bond donor (HBD) catalyst in combination with an α-phosphonooxymethyl ether initiator at room temperature. Mechanistic studies support a reversible-deactivation polymerization pathway, wherein the HBD catalyst facilitates the anchimeric ionization of the primary alkyl phosphate chain end, generating the propagating oxonium species. The stability of the phosphate chain end was demonstrated by isolating PTHF with high chain-end fidelity and subsequently extending the PTHF macroinitiator to higher molecular weights. This system was further applied to the copolymerization of THF and 1,3-dioxolane (DXL), affording copolymers with tunable thermal properties. We demonstrate near-quantitative chemical recycling of both PTHF and PTHF-co-PDXL back to monomer, highlighting the potential of this strategy for the development of sustainable polymers."},{"t":"[ASAP]利用耐氧多孔碳改性气体扩散电极实现稀薄CO₂的捕集与转化一体化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c03504","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2捕集电转化","kp":["[CO2处理]: 稀释CO2一体化捕获与电化学转化","[电极]: 多孔碳修饰耐氧气体扩散电极"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Integrated Capture and Conversion of Dilute CO2 Using an Oxygen Tolerant Porous Carbon Modified Gas Diffusion Electrode"},{"t":"[ASAP]通过磁场策略提升Li-O₂电池能量转换效率并抑制副反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15443","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁场调控锂氧电池","kp":["[改性策略]: 外加磁场抑制副反应","[Li-O2瓶颈]: 不溶副产物积聚致高过电位"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究提出利用磁场策略提升锂氧电池的能量转换效率并抑制副反应。锂氧电池理论能量密度极高，但实际应用中面临能量效率低和副反应严重等挑战。研究通过引入外部磁场调控氧气还原/析出反应过程中的电荷传输和产物形貌，有效降低了充放电极化，抑制了碳酸盐等副产物的生成。磁场策略改善了催化反应动力学，显著提升了锂氧电池的往返效率和循环寿命，为高能量密度金属-空气电池的性能优化提供了非化学改性的新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Enhancing Energy Conversion Efficiency and Suppression of Side Reactions in Li-O2 Batteries through a Magnetic Field Strategy","b":"Enhancing the energy conversion efficiency of lithium-oxygen batteries remains a significant challenge. Side reactions and slow transfers of Li+, O2, and electrons cause the accumulation of insoluble byproducts on the cathode, leading to high discharge overpotentials and limited reversibility. In this study, the authors introduce a magnetic field to address these issues. Applying an external magnetic field to ferromagnetic catalysts significantly reduces the overpotential to only 0.57 V at 200 mA/g, while maintaining exceptional rate performance and cycle stability. In-situ characterization experiments demonstrate effective suppression of byproducts, primarily Li2CO3. Theoretical calculations further reveal that the magnetic field stabilizes highly reactive singlet oxygen within the battery system, inhibiting the byproduct formation pathways. Furthermore, the magnetic field plays a crucial role in promoting the decomposition of discharge products and Li+ mass transfer. Together, these effects minimize polarization and improve energy transfer efficiency, offering a versatile strategy for advanced metal-air batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]钴取代镍配位聚合物中双活性位点的动力学与调控用于增强析氧催化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12205","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OER电催化","kp":["催化剂[OER]: Co取代Ni配位聚合物双活性位"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究了钴取代镍配位聚合物中双活性位点的动力学行为及其控制策略，以增强析氧催化(OER)性能。析氧反应是水分解和金属-空气电池等能源技术的关键瓶颈反应。通过将钴引入镍基配位聚合物框架，构建了Ni和Co双活性中心，两者之间的协同电子耦合效应优化了中间体吸附能。研究揭示了双活性位点的动态演变规律及其对催化活性的调控机制，为合理设计高效非贵金属析氧催化剂提供了结构-功能关系的新见解。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Dynamics and Control of Dual Active Sites in Co-Substituted Ni Coordination Polymers for Enhanced Oxygen Evolution Catalysis","b":"Facilitating the kinetically demanding oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is essential for the sustainable conversion of renewable energy into chemical fuels. However, precisely unraveling the dynamics of active species and sites during the OER remains a significant challenge. Herein, we constructed a series of Co-substituted Ni coordination polymers (Ni-CPs) for the OER. Complementary surface-/bulk-sensitive <i>operando</i> time-resolved spectroscopic monitoring enables detailed mechanistic insight into the critical role of partial Co incorporation in modulating the local coordination geometry of Ni centers and thereby promoting the intrinsic OER kinetics. Our results reveal that controlled Co substitution in Ni-CPs facilitates the generation of a substantial fraction of (Ni, Co)(IV) species, which activate O-O bond formation atop the catalytically active Ni<sup>IV</sup>-O-Co<sup>IV</sup> moieties. These key findings are further supported by kinetic isotopic effect studies and density functional theory calculations, in which the OER in Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs proceeds via an oxo-radical coupling mechanism, with deprotonation preferentially occurring at the Ni sites. Consequently, the engineered Ni<sub>3</sub>Co<sub>1</sub>-CPs exhibit enhanced OER activity compared to their oxide counterparts, along with durable electrochemical stability for over 4000 h. This study not only offers detailed mechanistic insights into the dynamics of active species and sites but also highlights their critical role in optimizing the OER kinetics."},{"t":"[ASAP]金属掺杂共价有机框架中的限域水用于湿润条件下增强物理吸附碳捕集","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19317","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF碳捕集","kp":["[碳捕集策略]: 限域水转化为CO2物理吸附位点","材料[湿态碳捕集]: 金属掺杂共价有机框架"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究探讨了在潮湿条件下金属掺杂共价有机框架(COFs)中限制水对物理吸附CO2捕集的增强作用。与胺基化学吸附CO2不同，物理吸附CO2捕集通常在潮湿条件下性能下降。该研究发现，通过金属掺杂在COFs孔道内构建限制水网络，可以在湿润环境中反而提升CO2物理吸附容量和选择性。限制水通过调控孔道微环境促进CO2吸附，该策略打破了物理吸附材料在含湿条件下的性能瓶颈，为实际烟气条件下的碳捕集材料设计提供了新方向。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Confined Water in Metal-Doped Covalent Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Physisorptive Carbon Capture under Wet Conditions","b":"Unlike amine-based CO2 chemisorption, where water can enhance amine utilization efficiency, physisorptive CO2 capture is typically impeded by water owing to its large dipole moment and competitive adsorption behavior. Converting water into additional adsorptive sites for CO2 adsorption in physisorption is promising, yet still nascent and elusive. Herein, we report a strategy that exploits confined water to achieve efficient CO2 capture, even under high relative humidity (RH) conditions, in metal-ion-doped covalent organic frameworks (COFs). By activation at different temperatures, water exhibiting Lewis acidic properties can be formed within metal-ion-doped COFs, thereby further enhancing CO2 adsorption. The dry CO2 uptake of NUS-42-NiCl2 nearly doubles at 800 mmHg and 298 K compared to pristine NUS-42 after activation at 323 K. In situ X-ray diffraction (XRD), solid-state 1H magic angle spinning nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (ss 1H MAS NMR), and in situ diffuse reflectance infrared Fourier transform spectroscopy (DRIFTS) confirm the formation of Lewis-acid-water. Furthermore, control over pore size and metal-ion loading is shown to be critical for generating the Lewis-acid-water. Combined in situ DRIFTS, electron spin resonance (ESR), X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS), and density functional theory (DFT) calculations elucidate the role of Lewis-acid-water in producing moisture-enhanced and inflectional CO2 adsorption isotherms. Multicomponent dynamic column breakthrough experiments further demonstrate significantly improved CO2 uptake after moisture presaturation up to 75% RH. These findings offer a systematic and innovative approach for converting water into CO2 adsorption sites, thereby addressing the challenge of competitive water adsorption during physisorptive carbon capture."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过正交半胱氨酰保护实现方向转换一锅肽连接来合成化学蛋白质","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20510","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"A one-pot multiple peptide ligation strategy accelerates the demanding processes of chemical protein synthesis. Ligation intermediates generated during peptide ligation differ depending on the order of peptide segment assembly, affecting the aggregation properties of the ligation mixture. Therefore, expanding the scope of the ligation order in one-pot methods contributes to optimizing a ligation scheme for each target protein in chemical protein synthesis. Herein, we present the first example of direction-switching one-pot peptide ligation, utilizing the two mutually orthogonal cysteinyl protections compatible with native chemical ligation (NCL): thiazolidine (Thz) and a new allylic thiol protecting group, N-(2,2,2-trifluoroethyl)-allyloxycarbonylaminomethyl (TfeAllocam). By optimizing the structure and metal-mediated deprotection conditions for the allylic protecting group, we established efficient methods for consecutive NCLs and deprotections in two direction-switching schemes with the same peptide segments: one scheme from C-terminus-to-N-terminus (C-to-N) to N-terminus-to-C-terminus (N-to-C) and the other from N-to-C to C-to-N. Using this ligation approach, we accomplished the semisynthesis of dimonoubiquitinated histone H3 bearing trimethyl-lysine by condensing five peptide segments in a one-pot manner.","tp":"肽连接合成","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究报道了首个通过正交半胱氨酰保护实现方向转换的一锅多肽连接策略，用于加速化学蛋白质合成。不同肽段组装顺序产生的连接中间体影响混合物的聚集性质，该方法扩展了一锅法连接顺序的选择范围，有助于为每个目标蛋白优化连接方案。"},{"t":"[ASAP]自旋交叉分子中的明亮比率型荧光温度计用于自旋态平衡可视化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18528","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子自旋探测","kp":["[自旋态检测]: 比率型荧光可视化自旋态平衡","[设计要求]: 高信噪比与高灵敏度"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究在自旋交叉分子中构建了明亮的比率型荧光温度计，用于可视化自旋态平衡。光学可寻址的分子自旋旨在解决磁性器件中弱磁矩的控制与检测难题。该自旋交叉分子在温度变化时发生高自旋/低自旋态转变，同时伴随荧光发射波长和强度的比率变化，实现自旋态的荧光可视化读出。该策略将分子自旋态的检测转化为光学信号，为分子级自旋电子器件的探测和量子信息处理提供了新工具。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Bright Ratiometric Fluorescent Thermometer in a Spin Crossover Molecule toward Visualization of Spin-State Equilibria","b":"Optically addressable molecular spins aim to tackle control and detection of weak magnetic moment when magnetic devices are scaled down to the single-molecule level. To achieve accurate readout of molecular spin states by adjacent luminescent probes, the molecular design must meet the stringent requirements of both high signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) and high sensitivity. Here, we incorporated a naphthalimide-based ratiometric fluorescent (RF) probe with a donor-acceptor (D-A) structure into a spin crossover (SCO) molecule. The probe features dual emission channels arising from a locally excited (LE) state and an intramolecular charge-transfer (ICT) state. The thermochromism associated with SCO spectrally overlaps with the probe's RF bands, producing a reverse synergistic effect, achieving ratiometric fluorescent thermometers (RFTs) with 1.35% K-1 sensitivity and 66% fluorescence contrast. More importantly, the bright fluorescence thermochromism (∼50% quantum yield) is maintained throughout the entire SCO process, enabling direct visualization of spin-state equilibria with high SNR (>400) and detection resolution (0.0017) even at low concentrations of 10-4 M. This tuning of the single-fluorophore RF against SCO thermochromism provides a new design platform for the accurate readout of spin states of molecules."},{"t":"富锂锰氧化物正极中的电压衰减与容量损失：原子起源、介观异质性与宏观演化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521529?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[衰减机制]: 电压衰减与容量损失源于原子-介观-宏观耦合"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该综述/研究深入分析了富锂锰基氧化物(LRMO)正极材料的电压衰减和容量损失问题，从原子尺度起源、介观不均匀性和宏观演化三个层面进行系统解析。LRMO正极因高比容量被视为下一代锂离子电池候选材料，但循环中的电压衰减严重制约其实际应用。研究揭示了过渡金属迁移、氧释放和结构相变等原子级机制导致电压衰减的根源，并分析了颗粒内部和颗粒间的介观结构异质性对宏观电化学性能的影响，为设计稳定LRMO正极提供了多层次结构工程策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Voltage Decay and Capacity Loss in Lithium‐Rich Manganese Oxide Cathodes: Atomic Origins, Mesoscopic Heterogeneities, and Macroscopic Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Lithium‐rich manganese‐based oxide (LRMO) cathode materials have emerged as promising candidates for next‐generation lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) due to their high specific capacity and exceptional energy density. Nevertheless, their practical application is significantly hindered by pronounced voltage decay and capacity loss during cycling, which stem from complex and interrelated mechanisms. This review presents a comprehensive, multi‐scale analysis of the degradation pathways in LRMO materials, spanning from atomic‐level structural dynamics to mesoscopic heterogeneities and macroscopic particle evolution. Special focus is directed toward unraveling the synergistic interplay between oxygen anionic and cationic redox processes, oxygen release, transition metal ions (TMs) migration, irreversible phase transitions, heterogeneous electrochemical reactions, and operational conditions. By integrating insights from advanced characterization, theoretical modeling, and electrochemical analyses, this review establishes a cohesive framework that elucidates the intricate relationships among oxygen activity, TMs dynamics, and structural transformations. These mechanistic insights lay a critical foundation for the development of stabilization strategies aimed at mitigating voltage decay and capacity loss. Ultimately, this review bridges the gap between fundamental mechanistic understanding and practical engineering applications, offering actionable guidance for the design of durable and high‐energy‐density LRMO cathode materials tailored for high‐performance energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"面向乙烯工业电合成：磷化铜/MXene电催化剂上节能稳定的乙炔半加氢反应","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518909?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化乙烯合成","kp":["[催化剂]: 磷化铜/MXene","[反应]: 乙炔半加氢制乙烯(EHAE)","[经济性]: 技经分析确定盈利阈值"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种铜磷化物/MXene电催化剂，用于电催化乙炔半加氢制乙烯(EHAE)，实现节能高效的工业级乙烯电合成。利用可再生电力驱动乙炔半加氢是生产高纯乙烯的前景路线。铜磷化物与MXene载体的协同作用优化了乙炔和氢中间体的吸附，实现了高选择性的乙烯产物。该催化剂在工业相关条件下展示了优异的活性和稳定性，避免了传统乙炔加氢中使用的贵金属催化剂和高温条件，为绿色乙烯生产提供了电化学替代方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward Industrial Electrosynthesis of Ethylene: Energy‐Efficient and Stable Acetylene Semi‐Hydrogenation on a Copper Phosphide/MXene Electrocatalyst","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic semi‐hydrogenation of acetylene to ethylene (EHAE) using renewable electricity represents a promising alternative approach for ethylene production. However, its relatively low energy efficiency (EE) and insufficient electrocatalyst stability hinder its industrial applications. The conduct a techno‐economic analysis indicates that the EHAE process becomes profitable when the EE exceeds 22.8% at an industrial current density of 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    . Herein, we report a novel electrocatalyst featuring firmly immobilized copper phosphide (Cu\n                    3\n                    P) nanoparticles on MXene nanosheets (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P) for a stable EHAE process at industrial currents using membrane electrode assembly (MEA) system. Specifically, the Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P electrocatalyst achieves an EE of 23.0% at 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its potential for practical application and economic viability. The strong interactions between Cu\n                    3\n                    P and Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    MXene prevent the agglomeration and dissolution of Cu\n                    3\n                    P nanoparticles during long‐term EHAE process. Notably, in a 4 cm\n                    2\n                    MEA, Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P catalysts can sustain high performance for 100 h at 1.0 A with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency decay of only 0.051% per hour. Quasi in situ electron paramagnetic resonance spectroscopy and theoretical calculations indicate that Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P facilitates water dissociation and synergistically enhances the adsorption of acetylene and active hydrogen (H\n                    *\n                    ), thereby accelerating the kinetics of EHAE process."},{"t":"氧化物人工突触中拓扑外延导电细丝实现类神经胶质调控动力学用于具身智能","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517913?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"人工突触器件","kp":["[器件类型]: 阻变存储器(RRAM)人工突触","[仿生机制]: 拓扑外延导电丝实现类神经胶质调控"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究在氧化物人工突触中构建了拓扑外延导电细丝，实现了类神经胶质细胞的调控动力学，服务于具身智能。阻变存储器(RRAM)是神经形态计算的关键器件。研究发现通过控制导电细丝的拓扑外延生长，可引入类似神经胶质细胞的调节机制，增强突触可塑性的模拟精度和器件稳定性。这种仿生调控策略突破了传统RRAM中细丝随机生长导致的器件变异性问题，为构建可靠的高密度人工神经网络和具身智能硬件提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Topologically Epitaxial Conductive Filaments in Oxide Artificial Synapses Enable Neuroglia‐Like Regulatory Dynamics for Embodied Intelligence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Resistance random access memory (RRAM) has emerged as a critical device for neuromorphic computing, offering significant potential for synaptic simulation. Nevertheless, it remains challenging to control the stochastic nature of the conductive filaments (CFs) in oxide‐based artificial synapses, leaving a critical gap between biological plasticity and neuromorphic reliability. Here, inspirated from the directional guidance of growth factors and the mechanical traction exerted by glia during axonal outgrowth, and apply these biological principles into a topo‐epitaxial self‐assembly protocol that steers every step of CF growth. By prescribing both the ionic trajectory and the structural registry of the nascent filament, we suppress intrinsic transport stochasticity and enforce crystallographic coherence. The result is atomic‐precision control over ion migration and single‐crystalline CF formation—achieved within standard CMOS flows, without extra masks or exotic processing. Finally, by constructing a behavior‐level model based on the habituation characteristics of oxide artificial synapses, the application in obstacle avoidance is successfully presented. Our synapses empower embodied AI robots with rich, robust, and self‐adaptive behaviors."},{"t":"用于持久水电解的薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜：抑制溶胀并提升2000小时以上稳定性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505888?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水聚合物膜","kp":["膜厚度[sPPS电解膜]: 12 µm","稳定性[水系电解槽]: >2000小时","[增强结构]: 多孔聚乙烯基底增强抗溶胀"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究制备了薄型增强磺化聚苯砜膜，用于耐久性水电解，实现了超过2000小时的稳定运行。烃类(HC)膜有望显著提升水电解槽效率，但溶胀和降解限制了其耐久性。该增强膜通过抑制溶胀行为和增强结构稳定性，在高温高湿环境下保持优异质子传导性能和机械强度。薄膜化策略降低了膜电阻，提升了电解效率，同时2000小时以上的稳定运行验证了其工程可行性，为低成本、高效率质子交换膜水电解技术提供了实用膜材料方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Thin Reinforced Sulfonated Poly(phenylene sulfone) Membranes for Durable Water Electrolysis: Suppressed Swelling and Enhanced Stability Over 2000 Hours","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Hydrocarbon (HC) membranes have the potential to significantly enhance the efficiency of water electrolyzers. However, their low mechanical integrity under electrolysis conditions, due to severe swelling, poses a challenge for industrial‐scale applications. Here, we present a 12 µm‐thick sulfonated poly(phenylene sulfone) (sPPS) membrane reinforced with a porous polyethylene (PE) substrate. The PE substrate reduces in‐plane swelling by a factor of 7 (10% vs 69%) and improves mechanical stability (440 MPa vs 50 MPa) in water at 60°C. Under electrolysis conditions, a 24 µm thick sandwich of two reinforced membranes shows stable operation over more than 2000 h in a constant current hold at 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    conducted at 60°C (first 1000 h) and 80°C (remaining 1000 h) with only 6 µV h\n                    −1\n                    of voltage deviation within the last 500 h. With a potential of 1.67 V and a hydrogen in oxygen content of 1 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , the PFAS‐free membrane clearly outperforms a state‐of‐the‐art reference (Nafion‐N211: 1.73 V and 1.5 vol% at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    )."},{"t":"硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶上*NO偶联与*H供给的协同调控驱动硝酸盐高效电还原为N2","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522680?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝酸盐电催化","kp":["催化剂[硝酸盐电还原]: 硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶Fe⁰@S","[转化路径]: *NO→*N2O→N2高选择性"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究开发了硫掺杂零价铁气凝胶催化剂，通过协同调控*NO偶联和*H供应，实现了硝酸盐高效电还原为氮气(N2)。电化学硝酸盐还原是一种有前景的环境修复和废水处理方法，但产物选择性和效率控制困难。硫掺杂调控了铁活性位点的电子结构，促进了*NO中间体的C-N偶联反应路径，同时优化了*H的供应平衡，抑制了副产物(如氨)的生成。该催化剂在硝酸盐还原反应中展示了高N2选择性和法拉第效率，为电化学脱氮技术提供了新催化策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Regulation of *NO Coupling and *H Supply on Sulfur‐Doped Zero‐Valent Iron Aerogels Drives Efficient Electroreduction of Nitrate to N2","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrochemical nitrate (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ) reduction to dinitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ) is a promising approach for environmental remediation but suffers from the sluggish\n                    *\n                    NO coupling and excessive\n                    *\n                    H supply on traditional electrocatalysts. Herein, we construct a sulfur‐doped zero‐valent iron (Fe\n                    0\n                    @S) aerogel that enables highly selective electrochemical nitrate‐to‐dinitrogen conversion via\n                    *\n                    NO→\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O→N\n                    2\n                    path by synchronously regulating\n                    *\n                    H supply and\n                    *\n                    NO coupling. Mechanistic studies reveal that the aerogel's 3D porous framework enriches local NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    near active sites, while strategic sulfur incorporation can weaken H\n                    2\n                    O adsorption and tune\n                    *\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    binding strength, thereby lowering the energy barrier for\n                    *\n                    NO coupling into\n                    *\n                    N\n                    2\n                    O and subsequent reduction to N\n                    2\n                    . With a flow‐through electrolyzer, we achieve near‐complete removal of 50 mg/L NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    from real surface and ground water with a high N\n                    2\n                    selectivity above 90%. This work provides a practical NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    remediation method based on non‐noble metals and presents a simple strategy for the design of catalyst structure to improve N\n                    2\n                    selectivity."},{"t":"钙钛矿表面静电梯度促进金属原位析出及固体氧化物电解池CO2电解","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520056?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿CO2电解","kp":["[溶出驱动力]: 表面静电梯度控制金属溶出","[器件]: 固体氧化物电解池CO2电解"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究发现钙钛矿表面静电梯度可促进金属纳米颗粒原位析出，并提升固体氧化物电解槽中CO2电解性能。钙钛矿原位析出纳米颗粒为固体氧化物电池电极设计带来了新机遇。研究通过调控钙钛矿表面静电势分布，驱动过渡金属在还原气氛下选择性析出并锚定在表面，形成高分散催化活性位点。该策略增强了CO2电催化还原活性，同时提高了电极抗积碳和抗烧结稳定性，为高效固体氧化物电解槽阴极的理性设计提供了静电调控新维度。","dp":1,"ot":"Surface Electrostatic Gradient of Perovskite Boosts Metal in Situ Exsolution and CO2 Electrolysis in Solid Oxide Electrolyzer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The in situ exsolution of nanoparticles (NPs) has brought new opportunities for the application of perovskite‐based catalysts in solid oxide electrolyzers. However, the kinetic driving force controlling cation migration and subsequent metal nucleation is not yet fully understood. Here we identified surface electrostatic gradient as the decisive kinetic factor in governing metal exsolution by treating La\n                    0.3\n                    Ca\n                    0.6\n                    Ti\n                    0.9\n                    Mn\n                    0.05\n                    Ni\n                    0.05\n                    O\n                    3−δ\n                    (LCTMN) with NaBH\n                    4\n                    of different concentrations. Multi‐scale characterizations revealed that different spatial distribution of surface oxygen vacancy induced positive surface potential shift and established electrostatic gradients that attracted Ni\n                    2+\n                    cations toward LCTMN surface, thereby driving Ni\n                    2+\n                    migration and reduction. Moreover, theoretical calculations demonstrated that surface oxygen vacancies reduced Ni segregation energy and work function of LCTMN, elucidating the critical role of electronic redistribution in accelerating in situ exsolution. Consequently, treatment of LCTMN with 3.0 M NaBH\n                    4\n                    yielded a high‐density dispersion of uniform Ni NPs with abundant strongly anchored interfacial sites for CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation. Notably, it delivered maximal current density of 1.25 A cm\n                    −2\n                    and CO Faraday efficiency of 94.23%, coupled with a superior 100‐hour stability, surpassing all counterparts. This study establishes a direct link between surface potential and exsolution kinetics, providing a universal paradigm for designing high‐performance perovskites with desirable reactivity."},{"t":"胞囊菌酰胺生物合成中钴胺素依赖性自由基 S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶重复甲基化的结构基础","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2527019123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Cystobactamids are nonribosomal peptide natural products that function as DNA gyrase inhibitors, exhibiting significant antibacterial activity. They are isolated from Cystobacter sp. Cbv34 and contain various alkoxy groups on para-aminobenzoic acid moieties, which are believed to play a crucial role in antibacterial functions. The alkoxy groups are generated by iterative methylations on a methoxy group by the cobalamin (Cbl)-dependent radical S-adenosylmethionine (SAM) enzyme CysS. CysS catalyzes up to three methylations to give ethoxy, isopropoxy, sec-butoxy, and tert-butoxy groups. For each methylation, CysS uses a ping-pong mechanism in which two molecules of SAM are consumed. One SAM is used to methylate cob(I)alamin, while another generates a 5'-deoxyadenosyl 5'-radical to initiate substrate methylation. However, little is known about how the enzyme promotes both Cbl methylation and iterative substrate methylation, which occur by polar SN2 and radical processes, respectively. Here, we report three X-ray crystal structures of a homolog of CysS from Corallococcus sp. CA054B. Two were determined in the presence of methoxy- and ethoxy-containing substrates, showing how CysS accommodates substrates and products during iterative methylation. The third structure, determined in the absence of a substrate, exhibits structural changes that reorient the SAM's conformation to allow for the methylation of cob(I)alamin.","tp":"抗生素机制","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究揭示了胞囊菌酰胺生物合成中钴胺素依赖性自由基S-腺苷甲硫氨酸酶CysS重复甲基化的结构基础。CysS在甲氧基上催化迭代甲基化生成不同烷氧基，这些基团对胞囊菌酰胺的DNA促旋酶抑制和抗菌活性至关重要，为非核糖体肽天然产物的生物合成改造提供了机理依据。"},{"t":"Huang 等人撤回，纳米球形阿拉伯半乳聚糖蛋白是英国常春藤分泌的高强度粘合剂的关键成分","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537150123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/密封材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"生物粘合材料","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"重新审视邻碳硼烷基荧光团：硼取代基的电荷转移触发聚集与结晶诱导发光","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521741?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳硼烷荧光材料","kp":["[发光机制]: 硼取代基电荷转移触发AIE/CIE"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究重新审视了邻碳硼烷基荧光团，发现硼取代基的电荷转移可触发聚集诱导发光(AIE)和结晶诱导发光(CIE)。邻碳硼烷荧光团被广泛认知其AIE和CIE特性，但传统机制主要归因于碳笼的分子运动限制。该研究揭示了一条新的发光机制路径：硼取代基到碳硼烷笼的电荷转移态在聚集或结晶状态下被增强，从而直接贡献荧光发射。这一发现修正了对碳硼烷荧光团发光机理的理解，为设计高效固态发光材料提供了分子工程新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Reimagining o‐Carborane‐Based Fluorophores: Charge‐Transfer from Boron Substituents Triggers Aggregation‐ and Crystallization‐Induced Emission","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    o\n                    ‐Carborane‐based fluorophores are widely recognized for their aggregation‐induced and crystallization‐induced emission (AIE and CIE) properties, making them valuable building blocks for materials used in fluorescence applications such as bioimaging or optoelectronics. Until now, observing AIE/CIE required the fluorophore to be attached via the carbon atom of the carborane, inherently limiting further functionalization possibilities. Herein, we report for the first time that boron‐substituted carboranes (substituent is at position 9) exhibit AIE/CIE activity, which originates from photoexcitation‐induced electron‐transfer from the substituents linked to the carborane cage via its boron vertices. Furthermore, the solid state emission can be tailored by the proper selection of the substituents. This finding not only significantly broadens the scope of AIE‐active compounds but also offers new design strategies for the development of luminescent carborane‐based materials."},{"t":"使用基于宿主-病原体的系统实时时空跟踪密闭环境中的传染病爆发","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2422574123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Deadly infection outbreaks in confined spaces, whether it is a COVID-19 outbreak on a cruise ship or measles and stomach flu outbreaks in schools, can be characterized by their rapid spread due to the abundance of common spaces, shared airways, and high population density. Preventing future outbreaks and developing efficient mitigation protocols can benefit from advanced computational modeling approaches. Here, we developed an agent-based modeling approach to study the spatiotemporal dynamics of an infection outbreak in a confined environment caused by a specific pathogen, and to determine effective containment protocols. The approach integrates the 3D geographic information system of a confined environment, behavior of the hosts, key biological parameters about the pathogen obtained from the experimental data, and the general mechanics of host-pathogen and pathogen-fomite interactions. To assess our approach, we applied it to the historical data of infectious outbreaks caused by norovirus, H1N1 influenza A, and SARS-CoV-2 viruses. Our AI-GIS Infection Dynamics (AGID) model accurately predicted daily infection numbers, correctly identified the day when the CDC vessel sanitation protocol would be triggered, singled out key biological parameters affecting the infection spread, and propose pathogen-specific changes to existing containment protocols. Our work advances the understanding of infection spread on cruise ships while offering insights applicable to other similar confined settings, such as nursing homes, schools, and hospitals. By providing a robust framework for real-time outbreak modeling, this study proposes more effective containment protocols and enhances our preparedness for managing infectious diseases and emerging pathogens in confined environments."},{"t":"面向新一代锌离子电池的纤维素基凝胶电解质的理性设计：机理、进展与展望","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506462?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌离子凝胶电解质","kp":["电解质[锌离子电池]: 纤维素基凝胶电解质","[功能]: 抑制锌枝晶生长与副反应"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"该综述系统阐述了纤维素基凝胶电解质在下一代锌离子电池中的理性设计原理、最新进展与未来展望。锌离子电池作为可持续储能体系，面临锌枝晶生长、副反应（析氢、腐蚀）和离子传输不均匀等核心挑战。纤维素及其衍生物因其丰富的羟基官能团、优异的机械性能和生物相容性，可有效调控凝胶电解质的离子电导率、界面稳定性和锌离子沉积行为。文章从分子机制层面分析了纤维素结构-性能关系，并展望了功能化改性和复合策略在提升锌电池循环寿命和安全性方面的前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Rational Design of Cellulose‐Based Gel Electrolytes for Next‐Generation Zinc‐Ion Batteries: Mechanisms, Advances, and Perspectives","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) have gained considerable attention as sustainable energy storage systems, offering advantages in capacity, safety, and cost. However, issues such as dendrite growth and side reactions hinder their practical adoption. Cellulose‐based gel electrolytes (CGEs) have recently emerged as promising materials to mitigate these challenges. By inhibiting zinc dendrite formation and enhancing interfacial stability, CGEs improve cycling longevity and safety in ZIBs. This review begins by classifying gel electrolytes and outlining the distinctive benefits of CGEs prepared via crosslinking and non‐crosslinking strategies. It then systematically examines recent developments in CGEs for use with various cathode materials and in multifunctional ZIBs configurations. Finally, the environmental merits and compelling electrochemical properties of CGEs are highlighted, together with a forward‐looking discussion on their role in next‐generation ZIBs and related future research directions. This work provides a timely and comprehensive resource that integrates materials design with electrochemical insights, offering valuable guidance for the rational development of CGEs."},{"t":"胶体纳米晶敏化的纳米线阵列光伏纳米组装体用于近红外视网膜光刺激","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea7001?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米线光电刺激","kp":["[材料]: ZnO纳米线阵列+胶体纳米晶体敏化","[激发波段]: 近红外","[应用]: 视网膜光电刺激"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种基于纳米线阵列的光伏神经接口技术，利用胶体纳米晶体敏化纳米线，实现近红外光对视网膜神经元的精准光刺激。传统神经接口中纳米线的光伏效应多限于可见光波段，该工作通过纳米晶体敏化将响应拓展至近红外区，使深层组织光遗传调控成为可能。技术核心在于纳米线-纳米晶异质结构的构建，实现光生电荷的高效分离与传输。该平台在神经假体、视网膜修复及脑机接口等领域具有重要应用前景，为非侵入式神经调控提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Photovoltaic nanoassembly of nanowire arrays sensitized with colloidal nanocrystals for near-infrared retina photostimulation","b":"Nanowires have served as a transformative platform for advanced neural and tissue interfaces. While their photovoltaic properties hold exceptional promise for neural modulation, existing photostimulation approaches predominantly rely on visible light-activated photoelectrochemical mechanisms. Here, we present a solution-processed photovoltaic nanoassembly comprising a ZnO nanowire array sensitized with AgBiS2 nanocrystals that enables efficient near-infrared (NIR) neural stimulation through capacitive photocurrents. By optimizing nanowire morphology and nanocrystal interdigitation, the platform achieves high charge injection densities (tens of microcoulombs per square centimeter) at low NIR intensities (<1 milliwatt per square millimeter). The nanoassembly was subretinally placed in an ex vivo blind rat retina, where it elicited repeatable and robust responses in retinal ganglion cells under NIR pulses. Notably, these responses were achieved at light intensities substantially below established ocular safety limits. The nexus of neuronal systems and nanoassemblies offers potential for enabling unconventional visual prosthetics and advanced neuromodulation therapies."},{"t":"光子反蛋白石启发的双层结构无缝界面用于颜色调控与稳健被动辐射制冷","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522922?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子晶体辐射制冷","kp":["[双层光子反蛋白石结构]: 同步实现色彩调控与被动辐射制冷","[单层光子结构限制]: 太阳反射带宽窄且光谱可调性有限"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究提出一种基于光子反蛋白石结构的双层界面设计，将色彩调控与被动辐射冷却相结合，实现彩色日间辐射冷却。被动辐射冷却是零能耗制冷技术，但传统方案多为白色或银色，限制了建筑外观应用。研究通过光子晶体结构工程，在保持高太阳反射率和高红外发射率的同时，实现结构色的可编程调控。双层结构分别负责光谱选择性反射与热发射，解决了色彩与冷却性能之间的权衡问题。该技术对建筑节能、城市热岛缓解具有实际价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Photonic Inverse Opal‐Enabled Seamless Interface of Bilayer Structure for Color Regulation and Robust Passive Radiative Cooling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Colorful passive daytime radiative cooling has emerged as an attractive zero‐energy‐cooling technology that integrates aesthetic appeal with thermal management. However, achieving concurrent high cooling efficiency and mechanical robustness remains challenging, constrained either by the narrow solar reflection bandwidth and limited spectral tunability of monolayer photonic structures, or by interfacial heterogeneities in multilayer architectures. Here, we demonstrate a size‐exclusion‐assisted selective infiltration strategy for fabricating structurally colored daytime radiative cooling (SCDRC) sheets. A polymer phase exhibiting negligible solar absorption and high infrared emissivity permeates preassembled colloidal crystal templates, forming an ordered inverse opal layer upon etching, whereas microscale boron nitride platelets selectively excluded from the template organize into a packed solar‐reflective microstructure. The resulting SCDRC sheets display tunable colors through pore geometry control, achieving &gt;96% solar reflectance, &gt;94% mid‐infrared emissivity, a sub‐ambient temperature reduction of 7°C in outdoor environments, and an average cooling power reduction of 20.7% across diverse climatic zones in China. The photonic framework demonstrates exceptional stability under prolonged thermal and humidity exposure, guaranteeing persistent coloration and cooling performance. This seamless‐interface bilayer fabrication strategy establishes a viable platform for developing durable colored cooling materials integrating aesthetic appeal with energy‐saving functionality, showing significant potential for advanced architectural and industrial applications."},{"t":"具有长寿命电荷分离态的有机晶体纳米颗粒用于高效光催化产氢","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02035-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制氢","kp":["分子构型: 受体-供体-受体(A-D-A)","[纳米结构]: 自组装高结晶性纳米颗粒","应用: 光催化产氢"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用有机晶体纳米颗粒构建长寿命电荷分离态，解决光催化产氢中电荷复合过快的核心瓶颈。光催化太阳能燃料转化面临的主要挑战是光生电子-空穴对寿命极短，导致催化反应效率低下。研究通过有机晶体的分子堆积设计，形成稳定的电荷分离中间态，显著延长载流子寿命，从而提升光催化析氢量子效率。相比传统无机半导体，有机晶体的能级可调性更高，为低成本、可溶液加工的光催化材料体系提供了新策略，对可再生能源转化具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Organic crystalline nanoparticles with a long-lived charge-separated state for efficient photocatalytic hydrogen production","b":"Photocatalysis offers a promising approach for renewable energy conversion and storage, but short lifetimes of charge-separated states in photocatalysts due to charge recombination limit its utility. Here we report an organic molecule with an acceptor–donor–acceptor configuration that can self assemble into highly crystalline nanoparticles. Transient absorption spectroscopy reveals that these crystalline assemblies can induce an ultra-long-lived charge-separated state of up to 1.2 s, attributed to initial symmetry-breaking charge separation, followed by charge hopping across closely packed molecules. These self-assembled nanoparticles have an impressive photocatalytic H2 evolution rate of 126 mmol g−1 h−1 with an external quantum efficiency of 12% at 550 nm under optimized conditions. This system shows a remarkable stability with 220 million turnover numbers (per particle) over the 77 h of operation. These findings suggest that rational design of organic molecules and their aggregates is vital for improving light-induced charge separation and for developing highly efficient, stable and scalable organic photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"不确定条件下基于氢能设备行为模式反演的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网优化","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior pattern inversion under uncertain conditions"},{"t":"工业光伏-电池负荷系统中能源成本与需求电费联合优化的离线逆强化学习方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储能耗优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 离线逆强化学习联合优化光伏-电池能量成本与需求费"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery load systems"},{"t":"生命历程全基因组关联研究荟萃分析细化了肥胖对乳腺癌风险影响的关键生命阶段","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady0374?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Previous evidence suggests that higher prepubertal adiposity protects against breast cancer risk. Whether this protection extends into early adulthood remains uncertain. We conducted genome-wide association studies on body mass index (BMI) in nulliparous women from menarche to <40 years across five cohorts, with additional analyses in three subintervals of this life stage. Results were meta-analyzed, and two-sample univariable and multivariable Mendelian randomization was applied within a lifecourse framework to assess the effect of BMI on breast cancer risk. Between menarche and <40 years, we observed heterogeneity in genetic effects. Genome-wide correlations further suggest that BMI during this early adult period may be partly influenced by distinct genetic factors compared with adiposity at other life stages. Higher genetically proxied BMI between menarche and 40 years reduced breast cancer risk. This protective effect attenuated after adjusting for prepubertal adiposity. These findings refine our understanding of adiposity's role in breast cancer and highlight earlier life stages as critical windows for risk modulation."},{"t":"电化学自生成硫代磷酸盐分子介导体引导Li2S抗钝化沉积用于锂硫电池","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519401?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池沉积调控","kp":["[分子介导剂]: 电化学原位自生Li3PS4分子","[Li2S沉积]: 反钝化沉积引导提升硫利用率","[电池体系]: 锂硫电池"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对锂硫电池中Li2S沉积钝化导致硫利用率低的瓶颈，提出利用电化学自生成的硫代磷酸盐分子介导体引导Li2S的抗钝化沉积策略。该介导体在充放电过程中原位生成，调控Li2S的成核与生长行为，抑制绝缘性Li2S的致密钝化层形成，从而提高活性物质的转化效率和电极的循环稳定性。该方法为高能量密度锂硫电池的实用化提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Li2S Anti‐Passivation Deposition Guided by Electrochemically Self‐Generated Thiophosphate Molecular Mediators for Lithium‐Sulfur Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The practical deployment of high‐energy lithium‐sulfur (Li‐S) batteries is critically impeded by low sulfur utilization, primarily due to the shuttle effect of soluble polysulfides and, less investigated, the passivation of the deposited Li\n                    2\n                    S film. To address these challenges, we report an electrochemically in situ self‐generated Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    molecules that serve as novel molecular mediators to guide the nucleation of Li\n                    2\n                    S preferentially on Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    , forming a 3D assembly film composed of Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    @Li\n                    2\n                    S molecular clusters with an optimized stoichiometry ratio (1:6), thereby effectively suppressing the aggregation and passivation of bulk Li\n                    2\n                    S. The Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    mediators were cyclically generated during discharge from a cathode composed of a 3D phosphorus‐sulfur covalent inorganic framework (P‐S CIF) grown on Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    x\n                    nanosheets (TNS). The P‐S CIF features a tetrahedral architecture with phosphorus atoms at vertices interconnected by sulfur chains, spatially confining sulfur species to minimize long‐chain polysulfides (Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    n\n                    , n≥6) generation. Benefiting from the synergistic effect of Li\n                    3\n                    PS\n                    4\n                    ‐mediated Li\n                    2\n                    S nucleation plus the spatial confinement provided by the P‐S CIF, and the strong polysulfide anchoring capability of TNS, the TNS/P‐S CIF cathode achieves exceptional stability and kinetics, delivering an initial capacity of 967 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    and retaining 673 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 1000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    (decay rate: 0.022% per cycle). Notably, the electrode maintains an areal capacity of 6.24 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    under a high loading of 9.8 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , surpassing commercial benchmarks. This work establishes a molecular‐level design paradigm for sulfur hosts, integrating structural precision with electrochemical functionality to advance the practical realization of high‐performance Li‐S batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"利用代谢糖工程研究成年斑马鱼前庭器官顶盖的动力学","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function is a common clinical disorder. The primary cause of this disorder is not known. Previous experiments in pigeons showed that an induced mechanical leakage in the cupula of a semicircular canal causes symptoms equivalent to those observed in humans after sudden loss of peripheral vestibular function. The cupula is an acellular membrane, which is critical for the detection of angular acceleration of the head. It consists of the matrix glycoprotein cupulin, which is secreted by supporting cells in the crista ampullaris. Currently, it is unclear whether cupulin is continuously produced resulting in permanent cupular neogenesis. Such a process could explain recovery of function observed in many patients. We applied metabolic glycoengineering to demonstrate the existence of cupulin renewal. Intraperitoneal injection of\n                    N\n                    ‐azidoacetylgalactosamine (GalNAz) into zebrafish leads to incorporation of this sugar in the cupula. Preparation of the cupula after various time intervals followed by fluorescence labeling by click chemistry, resulted in a distinct band within the cupula visible in fluorescence microscopy. Time‐delayed double injection gave rise to two bands. A long‐term experiment allowed to estimate that complete renewal of the zebrafish cupula occurs over a cycle of eight to ten weeks."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的锂离子电池超高倍率放电条件下内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"集成一步干法工艺实现无底涂层的预锂化厚电极以获得高能量密度与高首次库仑效率","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05739F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"干法电极预嵌锂","kp":["[一步干法工艺]: 集成预锂化厚电极无需底涂层","[目标提升]: 高能量密度与高首效库仑效率"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出一种集成式一步干法工艺，实现预锂化厚电极的无底涂层制备，显著提升电池能量密度和首次库仑效率。传统干法厚电极面临导电性差、首效低等问题，该工艺将预锂化与干法涂布合为一体，无需额外底涂层即可构建均匀的厚电极结构。预锂化补偿了首次循环的活性锂损失，厚电极设计则提高了活性物质负载量，两者协同实现了高能量密度电池。","dp":1,"ot":"Integrated one-step dry process enabling prelithiated thick electrodes without primer coating for high energy density and initial Coulombic efficiency","b":"Dry-processed thick electrodes are a key strategy for increasing the energy density of batteries. However, thick dry electrodes, especially anodes, suffer from limited ion mobility, causing non-uniform solid-electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation and high irreversible capacity loss during the initial cycle. Moreover, the adhesive primer layer required during processing increases electrical resistance and necessitates additional wet-processing steps, thereby undermining both performance and process integrity. To address these issues, we propose an underlayer lithium-metal-configured prelithiation strategy for thick electrodes. Here, a lithium metal underlayer simultaneously functions as a primer, compensates for irreversible lithium loss during the initial cycle, and promotes uniform SEI formation through a chemical reaction. Consequently, this strategy enhances the initial Coulombic efficiency and cycle stability of high-energy-density silicon-graphite/NCM811 full-cells. By overcoming the limitations of conventional dry process, it enables a fully dry manufacturing process and advances the development of next-generation high-energy-density batteries."},{"t":"锆基金属有机凝胶可控形成的机理研究：基于溶液态NMR分子信息关联宏观性质","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锆基金属有机凝胶","kp":["材料体系: Zr基金属有机凝胶","表征方法: 溶液态NMR原位分子级监测"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究深入探究了锆基金属-有机凝胶的可控形成机制，通过溶液态核磁共振（NMR）技术将宏观性质与分子层面的信息建立关联。金属-有机凝胶的形成涉及金属节点与有机配体的配位组装过程，理解这一机制对于理性设计具有特定功能的凝胶材料至关重要。研究利用NMR追踪凝胶化过程中的分子物种演变，揭示了组装条件对凝胶形貌、孔隙率和力学性能的影响规律。","dp":1,"ot":"Insights into the Controlled Formation of Zr‐Based Metal–Organic Gels: Linking Macroscopic Properties with Molecular Information from Solution State NMR","b":"Abstract\n                  Understanding and controlling the formation mechanisms of metal–organic gels is crucial for their rational design with well‐defined properties for diverse applications. However, rapid methodologies enabling atomic‐resolution structural characterization of gel formation are still largely lacking. Here, we report for the first time the molecular‐level characterization of the in‐situ formation of a Zr‐based metal–organic gel by monitoring solvent structuration during gelation using solvent‐observed nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy. UiO‐66‐type gels were optimized under mild conditions, i.e., 40 °C and in the absence of acidic modulators, providing a biocompatible environment suitable for the in‐situ encapsulation of sensitive biomolecules during gelation. The combined analysis of saturation transfer difference and spin diffusion transfer difference NMR growth curves enabled real time monitoring of nucleation and gelation stages, revealing an excellent correlation between the progressive structuration of water within the gel network and the resulting macroscopic properties. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this NMR approach allows tracking of the in‐situ encapsulation of therapeutic biomolecules within the gel, exemplified by a glycolipid with anti‐inflammatory properties."},{"t":"肉芽肿双 RNA-seq 揭示了结核性肉芽肿内由中性粒细胞和坏死驱动的复合转录程序","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw4619?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mycobacterial granulomas lie at the center of tuberculosis (TB) pathogenesis and represent a unique niche where infecting bacteria survive under nutrient-restricted conditions and in the face of a host immune response. The granuloma's necrotic core, where bacteria reside extracellularly in humans, is difficult to assess in many experimentally tractable models. Here, using necrotic mycobacterial granulomas in adult zebrafish, we develop dual RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) across different host genotypes to identify the transcriptional alterations that enable bacteria to survive within this key microenvironment. Using pharmacological and genetic interventions, we find that neutrophils within mature, necrotic granulomas promote bacterial growth, in part through up-regulation of the bacterial devR regulon. We identify conserved suites of bacterial transcriptional programs induced only in the context of this unique necrotic extracellular niche, including bacterial modules related to K+ transport and rpf genes. Analysis of Mycobacterium tuberculosis strains across diverse lineages and human populations suggests that granuloma-specific transcriptional modules are targets for bacterial genetic adaptation in the context of human infection."},{"t":"遗传与教育的关联性有所增加，并受到社会经济背景的影响：来自 1946 年至 1970 年 3 项研究的证据","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516460123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Social scientists have long sought to investigate whether the predictors of educational attainment (EA) have changed across time. Here, we provide insights by incorporating genetic predictors of education in three nationally representative British birth cohorts born in 1946, 1958, and 1970. We investigated whether individual characteristics as proxied by polygenic indexes (PGIs) for EA and cognition have become more relevant to educational success over time and whether returns to genetic predisposition were moderated by early life socioeconomic background. We present three findings. First, associations between the EA PGI and attainment increased over time, with increasing incremental variance explained by the EA PGI. Second, associations between the cognition PGI and attainment were broadly consistent across cohorts, and there was no clear change in explained variance. Since the EA PGI captures multiple traits related to educational success, factors other than those related to cognition may have become more relevant over time. Third, we observed strong evidence of interaction: Associations between the EA PGI and EA were disproportionately larger among those from more advantaged socioeconomic backgrounds. The strength and pattern of associations varied when using EA PGIs that were less conservatively filtered for SNPs. Our findings suggest EA is influenced by social and genetic factors both independently and jointly. Genetic liability and social background could be considered as two forms of inherited advantage which synergistically influence education attainment."},{"t":"能源安全、气候政策不确定性和气候转型风险：混频多维溢出分析","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600025X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源气候风险","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"面向高性能X射线检测的高质量无铅卤化物铁电固溶体环保制备","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525694?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无铅卤化物探测器","kp":["[无铅卤素铁电固溶体]: (HDA)Sb1-xBixI体系","[X射线探测]: 高性能无铅铁电固溶体X射线探测","[瓶颈]: 宽带隙与有限μτ产物限制光电性能"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种环保制备工艺，合成高质量无铅卤化物铁电固溶体材料，用于高性能X射线探测。传统含铅铁电材料在X射线探测中性能优异但存在环境危害，Bi/Sb基卤化物铁电体因其优异的稳定性和环境友好性成为有前景的替代方案。研究通过固溶体工程优化材料组分，实现了高的铁电极化、灵敏度和探测分辨率，推动了无铅铁电材料在辐射探测领域的实用化。","dp":1,"ot":"Eco‐Friendly Preparation of High‐Quality Lead‐Free Halide Ferroelectric Solid‐Solution Toward High‐Performance X‐ray Detection","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics have become promising lead‐free alternatives due to their excellent stability and environmental friendliness. However, their wide bandgaps and limited charge‐carrier mobility‐lifetime (\n                    µτ\n                    ) product impede their optoelectronic performance. Here, we report a new eco‐friendly method for growing lead‐free halide ferroelectric solid‐solution (HDA)Sb\n                    1‐x\n                    Bi\n                    x\n                    I\n                    5\n                    (x = 0–1) (HDA = hexane‐1,6‐diammonium), by isothermal evaporation from a biomass‐derived solvent,\n                    γ\n                    ‐valerolactone (GVL). The solid‐solution strategy, good material stability,‐ and high‐quality centimeter‐sized single‐crystals not only endow the (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    with the narrowest bandgap of 1.64 eV among Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics, but also enhance its\n                    µτ\n                    product by approximately two orders of magnitude compared with the parent (HDA)SbI\n                    5\n                    . Benefiting from these attributes and the intrinsic ferroelectric spontaneous polarization, the X‐ray detector based on (HDA)Sb\n                    0.39\n                    Bi\n                    0.61\n                    I\n                    5\n                    exhibits excellent self‐powered detection performance with a high sensitivity of 1,040 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    and a low detection limit of 0.25 nGy\n                    air\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    . More excitingly, its detection sensitivity can reach 17,560 µC Gy\n                    air\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is the highest among reported halide ferroelectrics, and superior to that of most halide detectors. This work opens new avenues for the rational engineering of Bi/Sb‐based halide ferroelectrics for advanced optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"动态微界面聚合实现二维聚合物片的可扩展合成及其在钠金属电池准固态电解质中的应用","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524650?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维聚合物钠电池","kp":["[合成方法]: 动态微界面聚合(搅拌不混溶液)","产物: 二维聚合物片","应用: 钠金属电池准固态电解质"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出动态微界面聚合策略，实现了二维聚合物片层的可规模化合成，并将其应用于钠金属电池准固态电解质。有机二维材料在储能等领域应用潜力巨大，但其可控宏量合成长期受限。该方法利用微界面调控聚合反应的动力学过程，可制备大面积、结构均匀的二维聚合物片层。作为准固态电解质，该材料兼具高离子电导率和良好的界面兼容性，有效抑制钠枝晶生长。","dp":1,"ot":"Dynamic Microinterfacial Polymerization Enables Scalable Synthesis of Two‐Dimensional Polymer Sheets for Quasi‐Solid‐State Electrolytes in Sodium‐Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Organic two‐dimensional (2D) materials hold great potential in a broad range of applications. However, their practical utility is constrained by limited structural diversity and a lack of synthetic strategies. Herein, we report that simply stirring immiscible solutions of poly(propylene glycol)bis(2‐aminopropyl ether) and 1,3,5‐benzenetricarbonyl trichloride results in a dynamic microinterfacial polymerization that affords novel 2D polymer sheets (designated as PEO‐BTA). These sheets can be transformed to Na‐ion conducting materials via treatment with sodium hydride, followed by incorporation of a prototypical MOF, HKUST‐1, to obtain composite sheets (MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na) that retain the structural integrity of the original 2D polymer sheets. The 2D composite sheets can be assembled into self‐supporting membranes and used as a quasi‐solid‐state electrolyte (QSSE) with a remarkably high ionic conductivity value of 2.80 × 10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    and a Na\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.95. Consequently, the QSSE facilitates uniform Na plating in Na//Na and Na//Cu cells. Na//NaTi\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    cells containing MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na QSSE exhibit a high initial specific capacity (129.1 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C), superior rate capability (60.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 20 C), and high‐capacity retention (92% after 1000 cycles at 1 C). This work establishes a new, scalable approach for synthesizing 2D organic sheets with promising applications in energy‐related areas.","aip":1},{"t":"衍射enabled的原位纳米尺度追踪固体电解质锂离子动力学及复合正极中的非均匀扩散","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520281?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质锂扩散","kp":["[操作衍射追踪]: 同步辐射X射线衍射原位追踪全固态电池离子动力学","[发现]: 复合正极中固态电解质非均匀扩散"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用衍射辅助的工况纳米尺度追踪技术，首次实现了全固态电池中固体电解质Li+离子动力学及复合正极内非均匀扩散的原位观测。传统锂离子扩散研究多集中于液态电池的正极活性材料，全固态体系中界面处和固体电解质内的离子传输行为仍不清楚。研究通过纳米衍射手段实时映射离子浓度分布，揭示了复合正极中颗粒间和界面处的扩散异质性，为全固态电池界面优化提供了直接证据。","dp":1,"ot":"Diffraction‐Enabled Operando Nanoscale Tracking of Li‐ion Dynamics of Solid Electrolyte and Inhomogeneous Diffusion in Composite Cathode","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion has mostly been studied in cathode active materials (CAMs) in liquid batteries, whereas it remains rarely explored in solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) and all‐solid‐state batteries. Herein, diffraction was established as an effective method for all‐solid‐state lithium batteries (ASSLBs) by focusing on SSE in composite cathodes. Operando synchrotron x‐ray diffraction presented diffraction angle shifts of certain Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    Bragg planes during the first ASSLB cycle due to lithiation/delithiation into its lattice, whose preferred Li\n                    +\n                    migration pathways were suggested by the partiality of these shifts, and the three‐phase evolution indicated the fundamental Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion kinetics factors. X‐ray nanodiffraction (XND) mapped nanoscale inhomogeneous Li\n                    +\n                    distributions and diffusion within individual Li\n                    3\n                    InCl\n                    6\n                    particles, revealing facilitated Li\n                    +\n                    conduction in high‐crystallinity regions and their role as pathways across SSE/CAM interfaces, and the most negatively strained regions were shown to be less susceptible to Li\n                    +\n                    insertion. XND from various electrochemical techniques inferred high transient charging rates to be the culprit of irreversible Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion instead of the overall charging depth. This study proved diffraction to be a potent tool to probe intricate Li\n                    +\n                    dynamics in ASSLBs and provide microscopic insights for optimal battery designs."},{"t":"差异Hes1激活定义了胚胎和成年小鼠皮质中神经干细胞谱系的定型和生态位维持","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511800123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mode of Hes1 activation and its differential expression are crucial for the maintenance of neural stem cells/progenitor cells (NSCs/NPCs) in the embryonic cortex. This differential mode of Hes1 activation has been translated into a heterogeneous population of NSCs comprising Notch-independent Hes1-expressing (NIHes1) NSCs and Notch-dependent Hes1-expressing (NDHes1) radial glial cells (RGCs). Using single-cell transcriptomics and a Nestin-CreERT2;NIHes1fl/fl conditional knock-out mouse model, we have characterized the NIHes1 NSCs. Our analyses show that NIHes1 NSCs are the ancestral precursor NSCs that generate RGCs and intermediate progenitor cells during development. Loss of NIHes1 expression significantly alters the NSC niche, leading to increased gliogenesis and aberrant migration of projection neurons. NIHes1 NSCs are set aside at embryonic stages as adult neural stem cells and are maintained by NIHes1 expression even at adult stage. Our findings suggest that NIHes1 NSCs are functionally distinct Hes1-expressing NSCs, which are critical for establishing both embryonic and adult NSC niches, thereby contributing to the overall cortical development."},{"t":"含混合抽水蓄能的梯级水电深度强化学习实时调度方法缓解光伏不确定性","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000553?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水电强化学习调度","kp":["[深度强化学习]: 梯级水电-混合抽蓄实时调度缓解光伏不确定性"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Deep reinforcement learning real-time dispatch approach for cascade hydropower with hybrid pumped-storage mitigating photovoltaic uncertainties"},{"t":"对 Abels 等人的修正，操纵蒽环类药物以实现更深的组织渗透以及对糖酵解组织的影响","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537044123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"面向配电网恢复的混合移动电源协调调度：一种嵌入动态梯度掩码的多智能体元深度强化学习方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","kp":["调度方法[配电网恢复]: 多智能体元深度强化学习"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking embedded multi-agent meta-deep reinforcement learning method"},{"t":"限域Kirkendall应变工程促进Co3O4析氧反应用于质子交换膜水电解槽","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM析氧催化剂","kp":["催化剂[PEMWE析氧]: Co3O4(IrO2替代)","晶格膨胀[柯肯达尔氧化]: >2.4%","[应变工程]: 约束柯肯达尔晶格膨胀"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用限制性Kirkendall应变工程调控Co3O4催化剂的析氧反应（OER）活性，并将其应用于质子交换膜水电解槽。传统Kirkendall氧化法虽可简便制备过渡金属氧化物，但对其应变的精确调控仍具挑战。研究通过限制Kirkendall效应引入可控晶格应变，优化Co3O4的电子结构和活性位点吸附能，显著提升OER催化活性，为PEM水电解制氢提供了低成本高效催化剂设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Confined Kirkendall Strain Engineering Promotes Oxygen Evolution on Co3O4 for Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyzer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    While Kirkendall oxidation (KO) facilely fabricates transition metal oxides for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) in proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs), it concomitantly triggers detrimental lattice expansion. For Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , an appealing IrO\n                    2\n                    ‐alternative catalyst, KO generates a free lattice expansion above 2.4%, resulting in suboptimal activity and stability. Here, we design a confined KO approach and coat the precursor Co nanoparticles with atomic carbon layers, enabling controllable lattice expansion of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    between 0.2% and 1.8%. For the first time, a strain‐dependent OER activity of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    is established in acidic media, with an expansion strain of 1.4% exhibiting the lowest overpotential of 377 mV at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Synchrotron X‐ray absorption spectroscopies and theoretical calculations unravel the adjustable lattice strain regulates the d‐band center of Co sites and further modifies the oxygenate adsorptions. When integrated into a PEMWE, the 1.4%‐strained Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    catalyst sustainably operates at 250 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    over 100 h. The reported confined KO provides a new means for strain engineering of transition metal oxides for energy electrocatalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"化学发光驱动的深部肿瘤免疫疗法：通过亚细胞运输和靶向促进 PD-L1 降解并引发焦亡","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519569?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organelle‐targeted therapy represents a promising strategy for cancer therapy and immune activation. Here, we present a novel Chemiluminescence‐Powered Immunotherapy (CPIT) platform designed to induce immunogenic pyroptosis and promote PD‐L1 degradation by exploiting two key subcellular organelles—lysosomes and the endoplasmic reticulum (ER). CPIT utilizes a PD‐L1‐targeted delivery vehicle (up to 10.8 %ID/g) to facilitate PD‐L1 degradation within lysosomes (&gt;55% efficiency) and concurrently delivers a dual‐locked chemiluminescence‐resonance energy transfer (CRET) system to the ER for localized pyroptosis. The dual‐locking mechanism ensures tumor‐selective and ER‐confined activation, maximizing oxidative damage and specifically inducing pyroptosis while minimizing off‐target toxicity. In vivo studies demonstrate remarkable tumor selectivity (due to tumor‐specific delivery plus tumor‐selective activation), robust regression of metastatic tumors, and the induction of a durable adaptive immune response. CPIT overcomes the limitation of conventional photodynamic therapy‐driven immunogenic cell death (ICD) strategies, being effective only for superficial tumors. Simultaneously, it lowers the immune activation threshold by promoting PD‐L1 degradation, addressing the challenge of T cell exhaustion common in ICD‐based cancer immunotherapies. This approach holds promise as a transformative approach to treating hard‐to‐reach malignancies and expanding the reach of immunotherapeutic strategies. The modular design of CPIT enables rapid substitution of protein‐specific ligands or alternative chemiluminescent donors, further expanding its potential for diverse cancer immunotherapy applications."},{"t":"双锚定功能化分子实现2D/3D异质结化学桥联用于高效稳定柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE03302K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿异质结","kp":["[界面工程]: 2D/3D钙钛矿双锚定分子桥联","[器件]: 柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过双锚定功能化分子在2D/3D钙钛矿异质结界面构建化学桥连，实现高效、稳定且柔性的钙钛矿太阳能电池。2D/3D异质结是钙钛矿界面工程的有效策略，但界面结合力和载流子传输效率仍有提升空间。双锚定功能分子同时在二维和三维钙钛矿层形成共价键合，增强界面粘附力和钝化界面缺陷，降低非辐射复合损失。该策略在保持高光电转换效率的同时显著提升了器件的机械柔性和长期稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Chemical Bridging in 2D/3D Heterojunction via Dual-Anchoring Functionalized Molecules for Efficient, Stable and Flexible Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"Constructing two-dimensional/three-dimensional (2D/3D) perovskite heterojunctions has emerged as an effective interfacial engineering strategy to passivate surface defects, optimize energy-level alignment, and suppress ion migration. However, conventional 2D layers are typically formed by surface stacking of bulky organic cations, which often result in weak interfacial coupling and hindered carrier transport, thereby limiting device performance. In this work, a single-molecule dual-functional surface-passivation strategy is proposed, in which 5-methyltryptamne hydrochloride (Me-TACl) treatment constructs a stable 2D perovskite passivation layer on top of 3D perovskite films and establishes a chemical bridge between them. This \"chemically bridged heterojunction passivation\" enhances interfacial coupling, suppresses surface defects, and optimizes energy level alignment. As a result, the Me-TACl treated devices exhibit remarkable enhancement in photovoltaic performance. The champion device achieves a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.35%, with a stabilized power output (SPO) of 26.20% over 300 s, outperforming the control device (24.67%). Moreover, the flexible device retains 92% of its initial efficiency (24.12%) after bending at a curvature radius of 5 mm for 5000 cycles, demonstrating outstanding mechanical durability. This post-treatment strategy simultaneously enhances efficiency, stability, and flexibility, offering insights for scalable high-efficiency perovskite photovoltaics and a viable interfacial design for next-generation devices."},{"t":"共价有机框架中电荷调控吡啶氮用于无金属多相光催化吡咯的C─H芳基化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523681?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化C-H芳基化","kp":["催化剂[光催化C-H芳化]: N-TFPPy-BD-COF","[活性位点]: 电荷调控吡啶氮(无金属)"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了基于共价有机框架（COF）的无金属非均相光催化体系，利用吡啶型氮的电荷调控实现吡咯的C-H芳基化反应。与传统依赖贵金属或有机染料的催化体系不同，该COF催化剂在可见光驱动下高效完成芳基化，避免了贵金属使用和化学计量氧化剂消耗，为绿色合成提供了新路径。研究通过调控吡啶氮的电荷分布优化催化活性位点，展示了COF在光催化有机合成中的潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Charge‐Regulated Pyridinic Nitrogen in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Metal‐Free Heterogeneous Photocatalytic C─H Arylation of Pyrroles","b":"Abstract\n                  Conventional catalytic systems for the C─H arylation of pyrrole predominantly rely on noble metals or organic dyes, which suffer from inherent limitations such as low sustainability, challenging recyclability, and high cost. To address these challenges, this study develops a metal‐free photocatalytic strategy employing a designed covalent organic framework, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF, as an efficient heterogeneous catalyst with a precisely tailored electronic structure. Site‐specific nitrogen doping within the pyrene‐based scaffold enables fine‐tuning of the electronic landscape. Spectroscopic characterization and theoretical computations reveal that nitrogen doping facilitates spatial separation of photogenerated electron–hole pairs, suppresses recombination, thereby improves visible‐light absorption, prolongs charge‐carrier lifetimes, and enhances charge‐separation efficiency. Under visible‐light irradiation, the catalyst delivers outstanding performance in the arylation of pyrroles, affording a yield of 79% with 98% selectivity, surpassing those achieved by noble metal and organic dye‐based systems. Furthermore, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF exhibits remarkable stability as a heterogeneous catalyst, maintaining its structural integrity over ten consecutive catalytic cycles. This work not only presents a sustainable and efficient pathway for C─H arylation but also establishes a general strategy for the rational design of COF‐based photocatalysts through electronic structure engineering."},{"t":"冠醚负载重碱金属增强二苯基磷阴离子的亲核性，促进高效催化烯烃异构化","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523460?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Caesium and rubidium have long experienced an interest drought in organoelement chemistry in comparison to the vast ocean of applications accomplished mainly by lithium and to a lesser extent, by sodium and potassium in this field. Here, we report a breakthrough study in catalytic alkene isomerisation using crown ether‐supported alkali metal phosphides in which the activity increases sequentially and significantly as Group One is descended with Cs(18‐crown‐6)PPh\n                    2\n                    performing best even at 1 mol% loadings with high turnover frequencies (TOFs) and good functional group tolerance. Elevating its profile further, Cs(18‐crown‐6)PPh\n                    2\n                    is also successful in a stepwise double catalysis on combining alkene isomerisation with its newly established hydrophosphination (HP) capacity to access challenging to make Markovnikov products. This remote functionalisation approach was also applied to alkynes with terminal alkynes preferentially producing allenes over internal alkynes in one‐pot reactions and then under HP, generating highly functionalised vinyl phosphines. Kinetic studies and DFT calculations have also been performed to shed light on mechanistic aspects of the Cs‐mediated isomerisation of model alkene allylbenzene.","tp":"碱金属催化","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在催化烯烃异构化领域取得突破，利用冠醚负载的碱金属磷化物作为催化剂。研究发现催化活性随第1族金属原子序数增大而显著增强，铯(Cs)活性最高。该工作打破了对铯和铷在有机元素化学中长期缺乏关注的局面，拓展了重碱金属在催化中的应用。"},{"t":"电子全息术成像电化学条件下动态Pt(111)界面液态水的原子尺度有序结构","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505756?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极界面水结构成像","kp":["[方法]: 电子全息术重构Pt(111)-水界面原子级电势","[对象]: 电极-水界面双电层原子结构"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用电子全息术首次在原子尺度上成像了电化学条件下Pt(111)-水界面处液态水的有序结构及电场分布。固液界面双电层的原子结构和电场对电催化反应至关重要，但实验观测极为困难。研究通过电子全息技术直接观测到电极表面水分子层的有序排列及其电场响应，为理解电化学界面的微观行为提供了前所未有的实验证据，对电催化机制研究有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Atomic Scale Ordering of Liquid Water at a Dynamic Pt(111) Interface Under Electrochemical Conditions Imaged by Electron Holography","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Imaging atomic structure and electric fields of the electric double layer at electrode‐water interfaces is essential for understanding electrochemical reactions. The wave properties of electrons in an environmental transmission electron microscope were used to reconstruct the atomic scale electric potentials of a platinum (111) interface in water by phase shifting electron holography. This progress allowed the observation of ordered water layers at the dynamic state of the platinum (111) surface and the water reorganization under applied electric potentials. The obtained projected electric potential of the Pt‐water interface is quantitatively compared to ab‐initio molecular dynamics simulations, revealing an extended ordered water region. We conclude that the potential drop at the Pt ‐H\n                    2\n                    O interface is mainly carried by the polarization field of the ordered water structure. The impact of different surface Pt configurations and the presence of adsorbates on the ordered structure are discussed."},{"t":"原子Eu介导的乙腈吸附构型切换驱动AEM电解池中乙胺的长期安培级电合成","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521105?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙腈电合成乙胺","kp":["[机制]: Eu介导乙腈吸附构型翻转调控质子可用性","[器件]: AEM电解槽","[电流密度]: 安培级","[产物]: 乙胺"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用原子级铕（Eu）催化剂调控乙腈在电极表面的吸附构型，在AEM电解槽中实现了安培级、长期稳定运行的乙胺电合成。乙腔电催化加氢是可持续合成乙胺的途径，但选择性和电流密度长期受限。Eu介导的吸附构型切换机制有效抑制副反应，提升了目标产物选择性和法拉第效率，为工业化有机电合成提供了重要技术突破。","dp":1,"ot":"Atomic Eu‐Mediated Acetonitrile Adsorption Configuration Switch Drives Long‐Term and Ampere‐Level Electrosynthesis of Ethylamine in AEM Electrolyzer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic hydrogenation of acetonitrile (AN‐ECH) offers a sustainable pathway for ethylamine (EA) synthesis. However, achieving high selectivity in AN‐ECH necessitates carefully balancing proton availability to suppress the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which often conflicts with the proton supply requirements under industrial‐grade current densities. Herein, we design and develop a novel and effective AN‐ECH catalyst consisting of rare‐earth Eu atoms modified on Cu\n                    2\n                    O nanoneedles to drive efficient and durable AN‐ECH at ampere‐level currents. The optimized Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a high EA Faradaic efficiency of 98.1 % and an exceptional production rate of 2253.2 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    compared with pure Cu\n                    2\n                    O. Notably, the Eu‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O can continuously operate 420 h at 2 A in an anion‐exchange membrane electrolyzer for AN‐ECH, representing the longest reported stability under the industrial‐current conditions to date. Operando characterization and theoretical calculations elucidate that the Eu incorporation tailors the electronic structure of Cu sites, thus switching the adsorption configuration of AN from the flat‐lying multi‐site π‐adsorption to vertical N‐end adsorption. This reconfiguration of the adsorption site lowers the energy barrier for the imine hydrogenation step, dictating the ideal proton addition pathway while enhancing the proton addition kinetics to suppress the HER. This work provides fundamental insights into rare‐earth tuning of AN hydrogenation mechanisms and represents a critical advancement toward ampere‐scale electrosynthesis of EA."},{"t":"相关不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多能系统优化","kp":["[社区多能系统]: 相关不确定性下多时间尺度风险规避框架"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated uncertainties"},{"t":"利用热可切换溶剂从卤水混合物碱金属阳离子中直接提取锂的新方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00446-5?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"卤水提锂","kp":["[技术]: S3E热响应胺溶剂选择性提锂","[选择性]: 1000倍过量Na/K下优先提锂","[驱动]: 温度切换调控溶剂亲水性"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种新型可切换溶剂选择性萃取（S3E）技术，利用热响应型胺类溶剂从卤水混合物中直接提取锂。该技术通过温度调控实现溶剂的相态切换，在碱金属阳离子共存的卤水中实现锂的高选择性分离，无需传统蒸发浓缩工艺。相比现有提锂方法，S3E技术有望大幅缩短工艺周期、降低能耗和水耗，为盐湖卤水提锂提供了一条高效、环境友好的新路线。","dp":1,"ot":"A novel approach for direct lithium extraction from alkali metal cations in brine mixtures using thermally switchable solvents","b":"A novel switchable solvent selective extraction (S3E) technology utilizes thermo-responsive amines for highly selective lithium recovery from complex brines. A modest temperature swing toggles solvent hydrophilicity, enabling preferential lithium extraction even with 1,000× more sodium or potassium. S3E maintains solvent stability and selectivity over repeated cycles for scalable lithium recovery."},{"t":"面向异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合的数据-模型混合驱动方法","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000383?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式能源聚合","kp":["[方法]: 数据-模型混合驱动","[应用]: 异构分布式能源时间解耦功率灵活性聚合"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid data-model driven approach for time-decoupled power flexibility aggregation of heterogeneous distributed energy resources"},{"t":"全基因组遗传筛选揭示 P2Y2 整合素轴作为非小细胞肺癌 (NSCLC) EGFR 突变体的稳定剂","d":"2026-01-22","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv3980?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Activating mutations in the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) gene drive non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC). Oncogenic EGFR mutants are ligand-independent and more stable, but the underlying mechanism remains unclear. We hypothesized that EGFR mutants selectively leverage cellular stabilizers to evade degradation. Genome-wide RNA interference screens identified genes (encoding for stabilizers) responsible for mutant EGFR stability, with P2Y2 receptor (P2Y2) emerging as a bona fide stabilizer. Mechanistically, high extracellular adenosine triphosphate (ATP) levels transactivate EGFR mutants via P2Y2 activation, previously shown to signal through Src kinase-dependent EGFR phosphorylation. Our study reveals that ATP-driven P2Y2 activation stabilizes EGFR mutants by forming a P2Y2-integrin β1-EGFR complex enriched in endosomes. Targeting this axis destabilizes EGFR mutants and offers a strategy against drug resistance. Elevated P2Y2 and integrin β1 expression in patients with NSCLC implies clinical relevance. Our results provide previously unidentified insight that EGFR mutants enhance extracellular ATP levels to activate P2Y2-integrin for enhanced stability of EGFR mutants to drive the oncogenic program.","tp":"肺癌新靶点","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"表皮生长因子受体（EGFR）基因的激活突变会驱动非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）。这些致癌EGFR突变体具有不依赖配体且稳定性更高的特点，但其潜在机制尚不明确。研究假设EGFR突变体选择性地利用细胞稳定剂来逃避降解。通过全基因组RNA干扰筛选，研究人员鉴定了负责突变体EGFR稳定性的基因，并发现P2Y2受体（P2Y2）是一种真正的稳定剂。这一发现揭示了EGFR突变体在细胞内维持稳定的新机制，为非小细胞肺癌的靶向治疗提供了潜在的新干预靶点。"},{"t":"集成高效光电化学储能与天然海水日光增强自供电H2O2生产的增值型太阳能可充电电池","d":"2026-01-22","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523063?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能H2O2电池","kp":["[电池化学]: 太阳光介导可充海水电池","[集成功能]: 光电储能耦合H2O2生产"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了一种增值型太阳能可充电电池，将光电化学储能与太阳光驱动的自供电过氧化氢（H2O2）生成功能集成于一体，并可直接利用天然海水。该电池在充电过程中利用光电极捕获太阳能储存电能，同时从海水中电催化产生H2O2这一高价值化学品。设计实现了能量存储与化学品合成的耦合，突破了传统电池单一储能功能的局限，为可持续能源利用和海水资源的增值转化提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"A Value‐Added Solar‐Mediated Rechargeable Battery Integrating Efficient Photoelectrochemical Energy Storage with Sunlight‐Boosted Self‐Powered H2O2 Production from Natural Seawater","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Developing sustainable functional batteries capable of generating valuable chemicals during electricity storage/release represents challenging frontiers. Here, we present a new battery chemistry that enables the first value‐added solar‐mediated rechargeable seawater battery integrating photoelectrochemical energy storage with sunlight‐boosted self‐powered H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production from seawater without external power/O\n                    2\n                    supply. This system is enabled by rationally‐designed bifunctional S‐scheme heterojunction photocathodes (MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    ) comprising A3‐(D‐core) polymer (MP‐COP) encapsulated TiO\n                    2\n                    . A3‐(D‐core) topology induces favorable electronic modulation that optimizes oxygen specie adsorption and steering oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) toward one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    pathway—while facilitating electronic coupling with oxygen evolution reaction (OER)‐active TiO\n                    2\n                    to establish S‐scheme charge transfer mechanism alongside strengthened built‐in electric field. These endow MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sunlight‐boosted 4e\n                    –\n                    OER for in situ O\n                    2\n                    ‐generation during photo‐charge and 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    synthesis during photo‐discharge, establishing solar‐mediated self‐sustaining value‐added reaction cycles. Integrating MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sodium anodes and seawater creates previously‐unexplored functional battery, yielding remarkable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    yield of 5.47 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during photo‐discharge—9.4 times those in dark and exceeding most reported seawater systems while delivering near‐zero charge/discharge voltage gap under illumination. Mechanistic studies reveal promoting effect of A3‐(D‐core) modulation and its synergistic role with S‐scheme charge transfer that promotes Yeager‐type O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and facilitates one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR toward H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ."},{"t":"“破碎”：美国科学家公开谈论特朗普政策如何扰乱他们的职业生涯","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00091-0","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"科研受冲击","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"[ASAP]揭示磷酸三烷基酯对溶剂化鞘层和固体电解质界面H的位阻效应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14645","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池溶剂化结构","kp":["库仑效率[Mg电池]: ~100%","电解质: Mg(OTf)2/磷酸三烷基酯"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究深入分析了三烷基磷酸酯溶剂分子对镁离子溶剂化鞘层的空间位阻效应，旨在设计与镁金属兼容且不含氯化物的电解液体系。高电压、长循环寿命的镁金属电池被视为后锂离子电池的重要候选，但电解液兼容性一直是核心瓶颈。传统含氯电解液腐蚀性强、电化学窗口窄，研究团队通过调控磷酸酯配体的分子结构，系统阐明位阻效应对溶剂化结构和界面化学的影响规律，为高性能镁电池电解液的理性设计提供了理论指导。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Steric Effect of Trialkyl Phosphates on the Solvation Sheath and Solid Electrolyte Interphase in H","b":"Designing Mg-compatible and chloride-free electrolytes is important to achieving high-voltage and long-life Mg metal batteries. In electrolytes based on Mg(OTf)2/diglyme: triethyl phosphate that exhibit near 100% Coulombic efficiency for Mg plating/stripping at high current densities and capacities, the TXP (X = alkyl group) plays a key role. Herein, we unveil steric hindrance as the fundamental origin of this role in optimizing the Mg2+ solvation structure and forming electrolyte-derived solid electrolyte interphases. The steric hindrance was tuned by systematically changing the alkyl chain length of the phosphate (TXP) from one to five. Its impact on altering bulk electrolyte solvation and interfacial SEI chemistry was studied by combining both spectroscopy techniques and theoretical modeling methods. We demonstrate that low steric hindrance leads to easy decomposition of phosphate solvents, whereas high steric hindrance fails to interrupt Mg2+-triflate/diglyme interactions. TEP with medium hindrance shows optimized behavior in both scenarios, which is the origin of its superior electrochemical performance. Our finding provides a new solvent design principle at the molecular level for chloride-free Mg2+ electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP]锆有机笼的均匀共价聚合用于高负载CO2分离膜","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22622","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2分离膜","kp":["策略[CO2分离膜]: MOC位点特异性共价聚合"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究实现了锆基有机分子笼（Zirconium-Organic Cages, MOCs）的均匀共价聚合，制备出高负载量的多孔材料。金属有机笼具有精确的分子级结构定义和均一的孔隙特性，在气体分离、催化和分子存储方面潜力巨大，但如何在保持笼结构完整性的同时实现宏观组装和高负载仍具挑战。研究团队通过共价聚合策略将离散的锆有机笼单元连接为连续框架网络，兼顾了分子笼的结构精确性与框架材料的高稳定性，为设计兼具分子识别能力和宏观机械性能的新型多孔材料开辟了路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Uniform Covalent Polymerization of Zirconium–Organic Cages for High-Loading CO2 Separation Membranes","b":"Metal-organic cages (MOCs), with their well-defined molecular structures and uniform porosity, hold great promise for application in gas separation membranes. However, the aggregation of MOCs in membranes at high loadings during conventional physical blending drastically deteriorates the separation performance. Herein, this study presents a strategy of MOC site-specific polymerization for fabricating uniform, high-loading, and selective membranes for CO2 separation. An amino-functionalized zirconium MOC (ZrTNH2) is synthesized as the building block and subsequently polymerized with poly(ethylene glycol)diisocyanate (NCO-PEG-NCO) through extensive nucleophilic addition reactions. The resulting ZrTNH2-PEG membrane exhibits a remarkable loading of up to 75 wt %, while preserving the discrete structural characteristics of ZrTNH2. It exhibits a high CO2 permeability of 577 Barrer and an exceptional CO2/N2 selectivity of 50 at 298 K and 2 bar, surpassing the latest upper bound and many previously reported MOC-based membranes. This membrane design greatly advances the mixed-matrix concept in membranes and serves as a new starting point for next-generation separation materials."},{"t":"[ASAP] 锂金属电池中的异相电荷转移机制：揭示异常亲锂性","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12858","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["[界面动力学]: MHC理论解释异常亲锂性","[机制]: 沉积动力学对基底亲锂性反常依赖"],"as":"该研究揭示了锂金属电池中异质电荷转移机制，这是导致锂电镀不均匀和枝晶生长的关键原因。锂金属电池虽具高能量密度，但枝晶问题严重制约其循环寿命与安全性。研究通过解析电极界面电荷转移的空间异质性，为理解锂沉积形貌演变提供了新视角，对开发无枝晶锂金属电池、提升高比能储能体系工程化可靠性具有重要指导意义。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] The Heterogeneous Charge Transfer Mechanism in Lithium Metal Batteries: Revealing Abnormal Lithiophilicity throug","b":"Li metal batteries offer a high energy density but suffer from nonuniform Li metal electroplating and dendrite formation, limiting practical use. These issues arise from complex interfacial charge transfer kinetics, which are still ambiguously defined. Here, we reveal an abnormal dependence of Li electrodeposition kinetics on substrate lithiophilicity, rationalized by the Marcus-Hush-Chidsey (MHC) theory. Contrary to conventional expectations, lithiophobic Cu enables faster electron transfer and more stable Li electroplating at high overpotentials, whereas lithiophilic Au performs better at low overpotentials. This crossover behavior establishes a current density-dependent framework that redefines the classical understanding of lithiophilicity. Electrochemical characterizations, MHC-based modeling, and crystal orbital Hamilton population analysis attribute the phenomenon to an interplay between reorganization energy and electronic coupling strength. The findings, validated across various substrates and electrolytes, provide general mechanistic insights into heterogeneous charge transfer during Li electroplating and suggest new strategies for interface design in anodeless Li metal batteries."},{"t":"[ASAP] 铁载体-Pt(IV) 缀合物作为探测细胞质货物向革兰氏阴性细菌传递的工具","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17001","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"Elucidating the uptake pathways and cellular localization of bacterial siderophores is important for establishing a fundamental understanding of Fe homeostasis and trafficking. Discerning the same for nonnative siderophores is a key consideration in the translational development of siderophore-antibiotic conjugates for \"Trojan-horse\" drug delivery. Here, we employ the native triscatecholate siderophore enterobactin (Ent) or its synthetic mimic TRENCAM (TC) conjugated to a Pt(IV) prodrug based on cisplatin to study the localization of these siderophores within various Gram-negative bacteria. The Pt(IV) warhead, which is reductively activated upon delivery to the cytoplasm, targets DNA and provides the readout of filamentous morphology, repurposing the anticancer drug as a probe for bacterial cytoplasmic delivery. By applying TC-Pt(IV) as a delivery probe, we establish that uropathogenic Escherichia coli and Salmonella enterica serovar Typhimurium transport TC to the cytoplasm via FepCDG, the inner membrane transport machinery for Ent. Furthermore, we use Ent-Pt(IV) and TC-Pt(IV) to study the cellular localization of triscatecholate siderophores in two ESKAPE pathogens, Pseudomonas aeruginosa and Acinetobacter baumannii, which use Ent as a xeno-siderophore. We uncover the ability of A. baumannii to transport Ent and TC to the cytoplasm and carry out bioinformatic analyses to identify a putative inner membrane transport system. Utilizing siderophore-Pt(IV) prodrug conjugates as probes for cellular localization, our findings provide insights into the location and specificity of siderophore transport machinery, particularly toward nonnative and xeno-siderophores, while illuminating the potential of siderophore-antibiotic conjugates based on Ent or TC for the delivery of cytoplasmic targeting antibiotics in multiple Gram-negative bacterial pathogens."},{"t":"[ASAP] 自由基电沉淀延长了 Tris(2,2'-联吡啶)钌(II) 和 Tris 的“电”化学发光","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16512","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","b":"The combination of tri-n-propylamine (TPrA) and tris(2,2'-bipyridyl)ruthenium(II) is one of the most historically relevant electrochemiluminescence (ECL) systems, as it is used in hospitals all over the world to test for myocardial infarction. In developing novel diagnostic tools or improving upon standard ones, it is important to investigate historic systems in new ways. We demonstrate the precipitation of an ECL-active solid by using this historic ECL system. Even after the potential is ended, an emission persists for 100s of seconds, corresponding to a million times increase in ECL lifetime through this afterglow chemiluminescence process. This fractures the dogma of ECL, where classically an applied electric potential is assumed to be a requirement for light emission. Beyond proof of concept, experimental parameters such as pH, potential waveform, applied potential, TPrA concentration, and supporting electrolyte were changed and showed the ability of this system to be tunable between two regimes: ECL intensity and afterglow chemiluminescence time. Additionally, we offer a probable mechanism for the formation of this precipitate that effectively extends the utility of ECL in space and time. When looking at the necessary technological advancements needed in bioanalysis, fundamental steps forward, such as those presented in this study, are required to enable leaps in applied knowledge."},{"t":"[ASAP] 水中变构控制下亚胺的近定量生成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20524","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"该研究展示了在生理条件下水中近定量形成亚胺键的新方法，并引入别构调控机制。亚胺键是有机合成和动态共价化学中的重要连接方式，但在水相中通常因水解而不稳定。该工作通过别构效应精确控制亚胺生成效率，实现了水相近定量转化，对药物递送、超分子自组装和生物正交化学等领域具有应用前景。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水相亚胺合成","kp":["产率[水中亚胺生成]: 近定量","[策略]: 金属配位键增强亚胺热力学稳定性","[条件]: 生理相关水相"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Near-Quantitative Formation of Imines in Water with Allosteric Control","b":"We demonstrate the near-quantitative formation of an imine bond in water under physiologically relevant conditions using a stoichiometric ratio of aldehyde and amine. To overcome the low hydrolytic stability of imines in water, a complementary metal coordination bond between the amine and aldehyde monomers is introduced to enhance the thermodynamic stability of the imine. Imine bond formation is substrate-selective, tolerates the presence of a variety of functional groups, and produces imines that are stable in a broad pH range. We also show that the presence of a second metal-ion complex in the building blocks provides a regulatory handle to 'switch on' imine-bond formation using ATP as an external allosteric effector."},{"t":"[ASAP] 使用方酰胺氢键供体调控四氢呋喃分子量的阳离子聚合","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18359","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阳离子聚合催化","kp":["分子量[PTHF]: 最高175kDa","催化剂: 方酰胺鎓氢键供体"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究实现了四氢呋喃(THF)阳离子开环聚合的分子量可控合成。聚四氢呋喃(PTHF)作为弹性纤维和热固性材料的软段，具有长期工业应用价值。传统THF阳离子聚合难以精确调控分子量，该工作通过新型催化或链转移策略突破了这一瓶颈，有望拓展PTHF在热塑性弹性体、聚氨酯和功能高分子领域的材料设计空间。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Molecular Weight-Controlled Cationic Polymerization of Tetrahydrofuran Using a Squaramidinium Hydrogen-Bond Donor","b":"Poly(tetrahydrofuran) (PTHF) has long-standing industrial relevance as the soft block of elastic fibers and thermosets. Despite its commercial importance, the synthesis of PTHF with molecular weight (MW) control beyond 20 kDa has proved challenging. In this work, we disclose a MW-controlled synthesis of PTHF up to 175 kDa by cationic ring-opening polymerization, using a cationic squaramidinium hydrogen-bond donor (HBD) catalyst in combination with an α-phosphonooxymethyl ether initiator at room temperature. Mechanistic studies support a reversible-deactivation polymerization pathway, wherein the HBD catalyst facilitates the anchimeric ionization of the primary alkyl phosphate chain end, generating the propagating oxonium species. The stability of the phosphate chain end was demonstrated by isolating PTHF with high chain-end fidelity and subsequently extending the PTHF macroinitiator to higher molecular weights. This system was further applied to the copolymerization of THF and 1,3-dioxolane (DXL), affording copolymers with tunable thermal properties. We demonstrate near-quantitative chemical recycling of both PTHF and PTHF-co-PDXL back to monomer, highlighting the potential of this strategy for the development of sustainable polymers."},{"t":"[ASAP] 铱催化α-羟基酮与低极化烯烃的立体选择性α-烷基化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19724","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱催化烷基化","kp":["催化剂[α-烷基化]: 阳离子Ir(I)-手性双膦"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究开发了铱催化的α-羟基酮与极性最小化烯烃的不对称α-烷基化反应。采用手性双膦配体修饰的阳离子Ir(I)配合物，实现了α-羟基酮的α-碳-氢键对苯乙烯等烯烃的加成反应，具有优异的立体选择性和区域选择性。该反应无需预先官能化底物，直接利用C-H键活化策略构建手性碳中心，为手性醇酮类化合物的合成提供了高效原子经济性新方法。","ot":"[ASAP] Iridium-Catalyzed Stereoselective α-Alkylation of α-Hydroxy Ketones with Minimally Polarized Alkenes","b":"Cationic Ir(I)-complexes modified with homochiral diphosphines promote the α-C-H addition of α-hydroxy ketones to styrenes or alkyl olefins. These processes are predicated on the hydroxyl-directed formation of an Ir-enolate. Inter- and intramolecular processes are feasible, with the latter offering stereocontrolled access to carbocycles bearing two new stereocenters. The intramolecular processes constitute rare examples of alkene-based Conia-ene reactions that are enantio- and diastereoselective."},{"t":"[ASAP] 界面工程赋能的高性能电化学门控单分子晶体管","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12256","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单分子晶体管","kp":["[材料]: DPP基窄带隙分子导线","[器件]: 电化学栅控单分子晶体管","[策略]: 分子-电极界面工程调控耦合"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过界面工程实现了高性能电化学门控单分子晶体管。分子尺度晶体管是纳米电子学发展的核心器件，但其性能受限于界面电荷传输效率。研究通过优化分子-电极界面结构，显著提升了门控效率和开关比，实现了在室温下稳定运行的高性能单分子器件。该成果对推进摩尔定律极限下的分子电子学和下一代超高密度集成电路具有重要意义。","ot":"[ASAP] High-Performance Electrochemically Gated Single-Molecule Transistor Enabled by Interfacial Engineering","b":"Molecular-scale transistors, particularly those with high performance, are critical for advancing nanoelectronics toward practical applications. However, developing high-performance single-molecule transistor materials remains a significant challenge. Here, we design and synthesize a series of diketopyrrolopyrrole (DPP)-based narrow bandgap molecular wires with tailored molecule-electrode coupling. The molecular wire DPP-C-SMe, featuring electronic decoupling at the molecule-electrode interface, exhibits remarkable electrochemical gated modulation (>200-fold) and a low subthreshold swing (105 mV dec-1) within a 1 V potential window─significantly surpassing its coupled counterpart and ranking among the highest-performing single-molecule electrochemical transistors reported to date. Through combined conductance measurements, transition voltage spectroscopy (TVS), and DFT calculations, we elucidate that the electronic decoupling in DPP-C-SMe reduces the off-state conductance by lowering the low-bias transmission coefficient, while the preserved favorable energy alignment enables efficient nonresonant/near-resonant switching under electrochemical gating. This cooperative design principle is the key to its superior transistor performance. These findings provide a new strategic design principle that synergistically integrates a narrow-band gap molecular core with tailored interfacial engineering for high-performance single-molecule electrochemical transistors and advances the molecular-scale control of charge transport in functional nanoelectronics."},{"t":"[ASAP] 双工作电极测量探究镀铂p-InP光阴极前表面电势","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04153","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"InP光电阴极","kp":["材料[光阴极]: 镀铂p-InP","方法: 双工作电极测前表面电势"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"[ASAP] Front-Surface Potential of Platinized p-InP Photocathodes Probed by Dual-Working-Electrode Measurements"},{"t":"[ASAP] 以形式Ni(IV)中心掺杂纳米石墨烯","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18919","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米石墨烯掺杂","kp":["[合成]: 介氧代碳卟啉嵌入HBC骨架","[氧化态]: 正式Ni⁴⁺物种","[确认]: XPS与X射线晶体学"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究合成了嵌入meso-氧代取代碳卟啉单元的新型纳米石墨烯配体，并通过该配体实现了具有正式Ni(IV)氧化态的纳米石墨烯掺杂。Ni(IV)是罕见的高氧化态镍中心，将其嵌入扩展π共轭体系可调控纳米石墨烯的电子结构和磁学性质。研究通过精确的配体设计稳定了高氧化态镍中心，为开发具有新奇电磁性能的掺杂纳米石墨烯材料提供了新策略，对分子自旋电子学有潜在意义。","ot":"[ASAP] Doping a Nanographene with a Formal NiIV Center","b":"A new nanographene ligand (2) was synthesized by incorporating a meso-oxo substituted carbaporphyrin(1.1.1.0) unit into the hexa-peri-hexabenzocoronene (HBC) backbone. Compound 2 features an adj-CCNN dianionic core and coordinates with a NiII cation to form organo-NiII complex 3. Notably, complex 3 was readily oxidized to formal NiIV species 4 after treating with CuCl2, as confirmed with X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) and theoretical calculations. Complex 4 showed substantial stability in the solid state but reacted rapidly with water at room temperature to yield inner oxygen-inserted complex 5. Demetalation of complex 5 with trifluoroacetic acid afforded an inner oxygen doped free base 6 containing a quinonoid-type ring. These new nanographene-containing compounds 2-6 were thoroughly characterized and studied using NMR spectroscopy, single-crystal X-ray diffraction analysis, UV-vis-NIR spectroscopy, and cyclic voltammetry as well as density functional theory (DFT) calculations. To the best of our knowledge, complex 4 represents the first example of a highly reactive NiIV nanographene complexes. The present work advances the development of metal doping chemistry of nanographenes, which in turn provide new access to postsynthetic heteroatom doping within the carbon networks of nanographenes."},{"t":"[ASAP] 多巴胺诱导的 Tau 修饰可防止病理性磷酸化并生成独特的原纤维多晶型","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22156","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Amyloid aggregation of tau is the key pathological event in various tauopathies including Alzheimer's and Pick's disease. Recently, dopamination was identified to modify tau on cysteine, which protects against tau pathology, yet its structural and functional consequences remain unclear. Here, we show that dopamination of the three-repeat (3R) tau fragment K19 alleviates disease-associated tau phosphorylation and alters the tau fibril structure. Solution NMR analysis reveals that dopamine modification at Cys322 of tau suppresses phosphorylation at several pathogenic sites across the microtubule-binding region. Dopaminated tau also exhibited greatly diminished fibrillization in vitro and reduced seeding activity in cells. Finally, we determined the cryo-EM structure of dopaminated tau fibrils at 3.55 Å resolution, revealing a unique fibril polymorph with the smallest core region reported to date for tau. The dopaminated fibril core comprises only 11 residues (centered on the VQIVYK motif) and is stabilized by a minimal hydrophobic interface, explaining its decreased stability compared to that of unmodified tau fibrils. Our results provide atomic-level insight into how dopamine modification imparts a protective effect on tau and underscore the profound influence of post-translational modifications in modulating amyloid protein structure and pathology.","tp":"神经退行病","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Tau蛋白的淀粉样聚集是包括阿尔茨海默病在内的多种Tau蛋白病的核心病理事件。近期研究发现，多巴胺化修饰能特异性作用于半胱氨酸，从而保护Tau蛋白免受病理影响。研究进一步表明，对三重重复（3R）Tau蛋白片段K19进行多巴胺化处理，不仅能显著减轻与疾病相关的Tau蛋白过度磷酸化，还能改变其原纤维的结构形态。核磁共振（NMR）分析揭示了多巴胺修饰的具体机制，为预防tau蛋白病变提供了新思路。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 光激发超分子聚集体中振动和环境紊乱下的离域与相干性","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20341","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Exciton and charge dynamics in photoexcited molecular materials depend critically on how delocalization competes with structural, vibrational, and environmental disorder. Yet, the origin and extent of coherent versus incoherent distribution of excitons and charges in such \"noisy\" supramolecular systems remain poorly understood. Here, we integrate all-atom classical dynamics with fully quantum vibronic dynamics to dissect these competing effects in aqueous self-assembled perylenediimide stacks. Our simulations quantitatively reproduce experimental absorption spectra and reveal that strong excitonic coupling and hybridization with charge-transfer states dictate the optical response. Following photoexcitation, the electronic populations rapidly spread across multiple molecules within tens of femtoseconds, yielding delocalized but largely incoherent exciton, hole, and electron wave function distributions. We find that high-frequency vibrational modes, and, to a lesser extent, the slow environmental and vibrational dynamics, intrinsic to the nature of such solvated supramolecular systems, set a fundamental limit to achieving fully coherent electronic delocalization. These results identify vibrational disorder as a universal constraint on coherent exciton dynamics and indicate that practical design principles for efficient organic optoelectronic and photocatalytic materials should focus on robust equi-distribution of the excited-state population.","tp":"激子相干性","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究将全原子经典动力学与全量子振子动力学相结合，剖析了光激发超分子聚集体中离域与结构/振动/环境无序之间的竞争。以水性自组装苝二酰亚胺堆积体为模型，研究揭示了'噪声'超分子体系中激子和电荷的相干与非相干分布的起源和范围，深化了对分子材料能量传递的理解。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 先进的分子镊子可有效靶向缺乏胆碱头基的膜以实现广谱抗病毒","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19450","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Broad-spectrum antivirals are urgently required to counter present and emerging viral threats. It has previously been shown that the parental molecular tweezers CLR01 and CLR05 disrupt viral envelopes by complexing choline headgroups and that ester-functionalized \"advanced\" tweezers display markedly enhanced antiviral potency. Here, we determine the molecular basis of this improved activity. Using liposome leakage assays, giant unilamellar vesicles, NMR, Langmuir film balance experiments, and atomistic simulations, we demonstrate that advanced tweezers not only encapsulate choline-containing lipids but also engage lipids lacking choline headgroups via transient and conserved hydrophobic insertion events. These interactions preferentially destabilize membranes enriched in sphingomyelin, unsaturated acyl chains, or inverted cone-shaped lipids and are especially effective against small, highly curved particles resembling viral particles, explaining their broad antiviral activity for enveloped viruses. Our findings reveal a dual mechanism of action, choline binding and hydrophobic insertion, that underpins the broad-spectrum antiviral activity of advanced molecular tweezers and establish them as a promising new class of membrane-targeting antivirals for prophylactic and therapeutic use.","tp":"广谱抗病毒","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"为应对当前及新发病毒威胁，亟需开发广谱抗病毒药物。前期研究表明，母体分子镊子CLR01和CLR05可通过结合磷脂胆碱头基来破坏病毒包膜，而经酯功能化修饰的“先进”分子镊子抗病毒效力显著提升。研究团队利用脂质体泄漏实验、巨型单层囊泡、核磁共振（NMR）及朗缪尔膜天平等多种技术，深入探讨了这种先进分子镊子增强效力的分子基础。该机制使其能更有效地靶向缺乏胆碱头基的细胞膜，展现出强大的广谱抗病毒潜力。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 集成分子马达的三维共价有机框架：双模式功能","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19507","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"as":"该研究将分子电机（molecular motor）集成到三维共价有机框架（COF）中，构建具有双重功能性的固态超分子机器体系。生物系统通过精确组织的分子机器网络实现宏观功能（如肌肉收缩、ATP合成），而人工分子机器长期面临在固态中保持运动性和有序排列的难题。本工作利用COF的晶态周期性骨架固定并定向排列分子电机，使其在固态框架内实现可控旋转或运动，同时赋予框架材料宏观响应能力。这为智能材料、分子级机械做功和纳米器件开辟了新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分子马达COF","kp":["[策略]: 拓扑网状策略嵌入旋转分子马达","[马达]: 过度拥挤烯烃旋转马达","[载体]: 3D共价有机框架"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] A Motor-Integrated Three-Dimensional Covalent Organic Framework with Dual-Mode Functionality","b":"Biological systems achieve macroscopic functionality through molecular machines operating within precisely organized scaffolds. Replicating this coordinated motion synthetically requires integrating high-performance molecular motors into structurally ordered, yet dynamically active, frameworks. We present a reticular design strategy for incorporating overcrowded alkene rotary motors into 3D covalent organic frameworks (COFs), creating JUC-666 as a prototype. This crystalline material maintains a unidirectional motor rotation in both solution and solid states, as confirmed by spectroscopic and kinetic analyses. The embedded motors enable dual-mode functionality: reversible CO2 uptake modulation (>83% capacity variation at 273 K) under light-dark cycling, and precisely controlled drug release with light-dosage-proportional kinetics, showing a ∼50-fold increase in cumulative release. These results demonstrate how COFs can bridge molecular-scale motion to macroscopic responses, establishing a platform for designing adaptive functional materials."},{"t":"[ASAP] 未取代的卡宾阳离子的无重氮当量：萘和吡啶的直接合成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21901","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Stable isotope labeling is a crucial technique in pharmaceutical research to understand the mode of action and metabolism of new drug candidates; however, its utility is often jeopardized by the synthetic challenges associated with the installation of the isotopic label into the core of the structures under study. Herein, we address this problem for the case of 13C-labeled naphthalene and pyridine building blocks. Our synthetic protocol utilizes the sulfonium sulfaneylidene salt 1, a benchtop stable reagent that does not incorporate diazo functionalities in its structure; yet, under Rh-catalysis, it efficiently acts as a synthetic equivalent of the simplest conceivable carbynyl cation, the [CH]+ fragment. Mechanistic experiments supported by DFT calculations suggest the initial formation of a sulfonio-substituted Rh(II)-carbene that reacts with indenes or pyrroles to initially form sulfonio-substituted cyclopropanes; the diastereoselectivity of this step being inconsequential because both isomers interconvert under the reaction conditions. Subsequent electrocyclic ring expansion with the concomitant elimination of dibenzothiophene delivers the desired naphthalenes or pyridines.","tp":"同位素标记","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种无需重氮前体的未取代卡宾阳离子合成方法，实现了13C标记萘和吡啶砌块的直接合成。利用稳定的锍锍亚基内鎓盐作为台面稳定试剂，该协议克服了稳定同位素标记在药物代谢和作用机制研究中的合成困难，为药物核心结构的同位素标记提供了实用新途径。"},{"t":"古新世-始新世最热期开始时陆地生态系统广泛破坏","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2509231122?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Paleocene-Eocene Thermal Maximum (PETM, ~56 Mya) interval was marked by massive 13C-depleted carbon emissions into the ocean/atmosphere system, manifested as a negative carbon isotope excursion (CIE) in sedimentary components, and ~5 °C global average warming. Episodes of hydrological perturbations and soil-erosion have been widely documented for the PETM but their link with vegetation- and carbon cycle changes remain poorly constrained. Here, we present organic microfossil evidence showing a strong increase in fern-dominated pioneer vegetation that replaced coniferous forests on the margin of the Norwegian Sea during the first millennia of the CIE. With the present stratigraphic constraints, the \"fern spike\" occurred simultaneously in terrestrial settings along the North Sea, Arctic Ocean, the US east coast and in southern Australia, indicating that pioneer vegetation persisted for several millennia following a partial collapse of previously stable terrestrial ecosystems. Both the ferns and influx of microcharcoal imply recurrent physical disturbance, including soil destabilization and erosion, potentially linked to droughts, wildfires, and strong hydrological forcing resulting from extreme climate change. Together with evidence for reworked clay minerals and ancient organic matter (kerogen), these findings show that highly disturbed terrestrial ecosystems were widespread across mid- and high-latitude regions globally. Carbon cycle model simulations suggest that a substantial loss of standing and buried biomass, along with oxidation of soil organic matter, acted as important positive feedbacks during the onset of the CIE. Additionally, enhanced kerogen weathering likely contributed as another major positive feedback throughout both the onset and main phase of the CIE.","tp":"古气候研究","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":1.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"约5600万年前的古新世-始新世最热期（PETM）伴随着巨量碳释放和全球平均气温上升约5℃。尽管该时期的水文异常和土壤侵蚀事件已有广泛记录，但其与植被及碳循环变化的联系尚不清晰。最新研究通过有机微体化石证据揭示，在这一极端气候变暖事件初期，陆地生态系统遭受了广泛且严重的破坏。该发现为了解全球迅速变暖如何引发环境剧变、影响陆地生态系统稳定性及碳循环动态提供了关键的历史地质视角。"},{"t":"城市回收为何比想象中更困难","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00890-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"城市回收体系","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Why urban recycling is harder than it seems"},{"t":"利用大规模生产碳酸钙进行中试规模CO2电解的水管理","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519757?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电解水管理","kp":["材料[CO2电解]: CaCO3构建供质子微环境","规模: 中试无阴极液MEA"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用大规模生产的碳酸钙进行水管理，以提升中试规模CO2电解的性能。在无阴极液的膜电极组件（MEA）中，水管理不足是限制性能和稳定性的关键瓶颈。研究引入廉价易得的碳酸钙材料作为水调节剂，有效控制电极润湿性和水传输，改善了CO2电还原为乙烯等产物的效率。该策略具有低成本、可规模化优势，为CO2电解技术的工程化放大提供了实用解决方案。","ot":"Water Management Using Massively Produced Calcium Carbonate for Pilot‐Scale CO2 Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of scalable, catholyte‐free membrane electrode assemblies (MEAs) is restricted by insufficient interfacial water and proton supply. Here, we present a general strategy for constructing an ideal proton‐feeding microenvironment based on calcium carbonate (CaCO\n                    3\n                    ), an earth‐abundant mineral. Using in situ spectroscopy and theoretical simulations, we reveal that the uniquely hydrophilic surface of CaCO\n                    3\n                    selectively enriches and stabilizes the more mobile and reactive liquid‐like water molecules (2‐HB·H\n                    2\n                    O), thereby establishing an efficient proton highway near the electrode. This enables metal‐loaded CaCO\n                    3\n                    (M/CaCO\n                    3\n                    , M = Zn, and Cu) catalysts to achieve exceptional performance at industrial‐relevant current densities. Crucially, we demonstrate that the catalyst can be synthesized on a kilogram scale directly from unpurified cement plant flue gas. This catalyst enables high‐rate CO\n                    2\n                    conversion to C\n                    2+\n                    (FE\n                    C2+\n                    77.97%) or syngas (19 L h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ; the CO/H\n                    2\n                    ratio ∼2) in a 100 cm\n                    2\n                    electrolyzer stack. This work establishes a general paradigm for using natural minerals to manipulate interfacial water dynamics for industrial electrocatalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"面向二维MoS2晶体管的晶圆级高κ HfO2介质薄膜（等效氧化层厚度<5Å）","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68584-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MoS2晶体管介质","kp":["EOT[HfO2栅介质]: <5Å","膜厚[HfO2]: 1.3nm","规模: 晶圆级","应用: 2D MoS2晶体管"],"dp":1,"sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":7.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究实现了晶圆级高κ HfO2栅介质薄膜的制备，等效氧化物厚度（EOT）低于5埃（0.5nm），用于二维MoS2晶体管。高κ栅介质是现代晶体管技术的核心，对于二维半导体器件的短沟道效应抑制和电流驱动能力至关重要。研究通过精确的界面工程和沉积工艺，在MoS2上实现了超薄无缺陷HfO2层，显著降低了界面陷阱密度，为二维材料在下一代亚纳米节点晶体管中的应用突破了关键瓶颈。","ot":"Wafer-scale high-κ HfO2 dielectric films with sub-5-Å equivalent oxide thickness for 2D MoS2 transistors","b":"High-κ gate dielectrics are indispensable in modern transistor technology and play a pivotal role in efficient capacitive gating and suppression of leakage currents. However, the realization of industry-compatible high-κ gate dielectrics at a sub-5-Å equivalent oxide thickness (EOT) remains challenging. Here we report the realization of 1.3-nm thick hafnium oxide (HfO2) dielectrics via an industry-compatible multiple oxidation atomic layer deposition process at 200 °C. A low EOT down to 2.5 Å is demonstrated for 1.3-nm thick HfO2 dielectrics on metal gates with a low leakage current of 10−6 A/cm2 and a robust breakdown electric field of ~22.3 MV/cm. Remarkably, such low EOT high-κ/metal gates can be directly implanted into emerging two-dimensional (2D) transistors and low-power logic circuits on 8-inch wafer scale to showcase their potentials. The as-fabricated molybdenum disulfide (MoS2) transistors exhibit a large on-state current density of 260 µA/µm at source-drain bias of 0.5 V, a high on/off ratio of 108, an average subthreshold slope (SS) of 75 mV/dec, and small capacitance equivalent thickness (CET) values of 0.34 nm for gate-first transistors and 0.50 nm for gate-last transistors. Our ultra-scaled dielectrics hold significant promise for advanced semiconductor fabrication processes towards the angstrom era."},{"t":"可视化与理解单晶有机电池中反应耦合的离子Grotthuss输运","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519541?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机电池离子输运","kp":["表征方法[有机电池]: 原位光电化学","机制: 反应耦合离子Grotthuss输运"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在单晶有机电池中可视化了反应耦合的离子Grotthuss传输机制，并深入理解其动力学过程。离子在电极材料中的扩散动力学一直是电池性能研究的核心难题。研究利用先进表征手段直接观测了有机单晶电极中质子/离子的Grotthuss跃迁传输——即离子通过氢键网络快速接力传递的机制，而非传统缓慢的间隙扩散。这一发现为设计高倍率有机电池材料提供了全新的离子传输设计范式。","ot":"Visualizing and Understanding the Reaction‐Coupled Ion Grotthuss Transport in Single‐Crystal Organic Battery","b":"Abstract\n                  Tracking dynamic ion diffusion in electrode materials has long posed a significant challenge in battery performance research. The development of facile visualization techniques to reveal ion transport dynamics enables more intuitive and in‐depth understanding of degradation mechanisms. In this study, we introduce an in situ optical electrochemical characterization method for organic single‐crystal electrode materials. By leveraging the electrochemical‐responsive optical properties of these materials, we successfully visualized the dynamic ion diffusion process within organic single‐crystal electrodes. Using this approach, we identified a reaction‐coupled ion diffusion mechanism governed by Fick's first law. Our results reveal strong crystal‐plane‐dependent diffusion characteristics and demonstrate that reaction‐induced conductivity enhancement is a key factor enabling high‐rate performance. Furthermore, the method vividly captures ion‐intercalation‐induced volume expansion and active material dissolution/shuttling phenomena. This methodology provides fundamental insights into the kinetic behavior and degradation mechanisms of organic electrode systems and demonstrates broad applicability to other material systems.","aip":1},{"t":"持久性污染物的升级回收：迈向电化学驱动的循环卤素经济","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00422-X?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电化学卤素回收","kp":["理念[卤素回收]: 电化学驱动循环卤素经济"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出以电化学驱动方式实现持久性卤代污染物的循环升级回收，构建循环卤素经济。卤代材料和废弃物流的回收意义重大，将卤化物重新引导回有价值的合成循环可减少环境危害和资源浪费。研究利用电催化方法选择性脱卤或将卤素官能团转化为有用的化学品，避免了传统焚烧处理导致的二次污染。该策略为持久性有机污染物的资源化处置提供了经济可行的电化学路线。","ot":"Upcycling of persistent pollutants: Toward an electrochemically driven circular halogen economy","b":"The recycling of halogenated materials and waste streams is of significant importance. Redirecting halides back into the value chain of chemical products is desirable and could be enabled with the help of electrosynthetic technology. Such electrical energy, when obtained from renewable resources, will allow for a sustainable and potentially closed-loop, circular halide economy. Recent developments and approaches are summarized and highlighted.","aip":1},{"t":"揭示混合硫-碳材料中硫限域与高硫利用率的奥秘","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513346?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫碳复合材料","kp":["合成方法[硫碳]: 反向硫化+热缩聚","机制: 硫限制分步演变"],"as":"该研究聚焦锂硫电池中硫-碳复合材料的硫限域效应与化学转化机制。锂硫电池理论比能量高，但多硫化锂穿梭效应和硫利用率低严重制约其商业化。研究团队通过深入分析混合硫-碳材料中硫的物理限域与化学锚定行为，揭示了硫在碳基体中的分布、转化路径及与碳结构的相互作用机制。理解这些基础过程有助于设计更高效的硫宿主材料，抑制多硫化物溶解扩散，提升硫的活性利用率和循环稳定性，为下一代高能量密度锂硫电池的工程化突破提供理论指导。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unravelling the Secret of Sulfur Confinement and High Sulfur Utilization in Hybrid Sulfur‐Carbons","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Understanding sulfur confinement and chemical transformation in hybrid sulfur‐carbon materials is critical for advancing metal‐sulfur batteries. Here, we investigate the structural evolution of a sulfur‐rich polymer into a hybrid sulfur‐carbon via inverse vulcanization and thermal condensation. Multiscale analyses reveal a stepwise transformation, beginning with the emergence of sulfur radicals at ∼175°C, followed by the progressive development of a carbon matrix above 300°C that stabilizes the radical species. Around 450°C, a transitional phase forms, consisting of conjugated carbon clusters covalently bonded to sulfur chains. This hybrid structure confines sulfur within pseudo‐graphitic nanodomains, effectively suppressing polysulfide dissolution and enhancing redox stability. DFT simulations show how sulfur confinement modulates Na‐S reaction energetics, while electrochemical testing confirms high sulfur utilization, delivering ∼1000 mAh  and 1200 Wh , setting a new performance benchmark for room‐temperature Na─S batteries. These findings provide critical insights into the correlation between structural evolution and electrochemical performance, offering design principles for next‐generation sulfur‐based electrodes."},{"t":"2025年增强型地热系统创新：解锁更大流量与更高温度","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00143-0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"增强地热系统","kp":["技术[地热]: 增强型地热系统EGS","方向: 更大流量+更高温度"],"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unlocking larger flow and higher temperature with enhanced geothermal systems innovation in 2025"},{"t":"通过协同质子-电子转移解锁多金属氧酸盐全荷电态用于高能量密度液流电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518906?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多金属氧酸盐液流","kp":["SoC[多金属氧酸盐]: 从≤33.3%扩展至满","机制: 协同质子-电子转移PCET"],"as":"多金属氧酸盐（POMs）因其独特的多电子转移能力，被视为下一代高能量密度氧化还原液流电池的关键活性材料。传统液流电池（如全钒体系）受限于单电子或双电子转移，能量密度提升遭遇瓶颈。该研究聚焦解锁POMs的全电荷状态利用，使其多个氧化还原中心均可参与储能反应，从而在相同活性物质用量下大幅提升储电容量。核心挑战在于POMs在电解液中的稳定性、氧化还原可逆性以及跨膜穿梭抑制。该方向若实现工程突破，有望显著降低大规模长时储能的成本并提升能量密度。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Unlocking Full State‐of‐Charge of Polyoxometalate for High‐Energy‐Density Redox Flow Batteries via Concerted Proton‐Elec","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Polyoxometalates (POMs) exhibit exceptional multi‐electron transfer capacity for next‐generation high‐energy‐density redox flow batteries (RFBs), while their operable state‐of‐charge (SoC, ≤33.3%) is commonly limited by universal highly reduced metastable states under proton‐starved conditions. Herein, by establishing a proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET) paradigm for [P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    62\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    ({P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }) cluster, we reveal that protonation at oxygen sites stabilizes reduced tungsten sites via concerted proton‐electron transfer (CPET). Marcus theory combined with DFT calculations quantifies the thermodynamic driving force and kinetic barrier for region‐selective CPET processes, and operando analyses by pH monitoring and Raman spectroscopy further confirm this proton‐coupled reversible redox mechanism. Guided by these findings, we engineer the high‐proton‐activity H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    } negolyte paired with a VOSO\n                    4\n                    ‐based posolyte and stepwise charging‐discharging protocol that enables stable full SoC operation. The resulting RFBs achieve unprecedented performance, which maintains 95.04 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    without decay over 600 cycles (over 1020 h) at 66.7% SoC of 0.3 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }, and 141.75 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    at 100% SoC of 0.3 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }, as well as delivers a record‐breaking 236.03 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    and 239.02 Wh L\n                    −1\n                    at 100% SoC of 0.5 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }. This work unlocks full SoC of {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    } by translating CPET mechanistic insights into actionable electrolyte design, establishing a generalizable pathway toward high‐energy‐density POM‐RFBs.","aip":1},{"t":"空穴掺杂MgTi₂O₄中超低电场诱导的易失性阻变开关","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518981?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究报道在空穴掺杂的MgTi基Mott绝缘体中实现了超低电场驱动的易失性电阻转变效应。Mott绝缘体的电场诱导电阻崩塌现象为新型忆阻器件提供了独特机遇，传统实现此类转变往往需要极高的临界电场。研究团队通过空穴掺杂策略有效降低了转变阈值电场，使器件在更低功耗条件下即可实现可逆的电阻态切换。易失性（volatile）特性意味着撤去电场后器件自动恢复高阻态，这一行为更接近神经突触的动态响应模式，在类脑计算、脉冲神经网络以及超低功耗存储器件领域具有潜在应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阻变存储器件","kp":["[材料]: 空穴掺杂MgTi₂O₄尖晶石","[阈值]: 超低电场","[类型]: 易失性阻变","[器件]: Mott忆阻器"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Ultra‐Low Electric Field Induced Volatile Resistive Switching in Hole‐Doped MgTi2O4","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The intriguing concept of electric‐field‐induced resistive breakdown in Mott insulators offers promising opportunities for Mottronics devices and memristors while serving as a unique platform to explore non‐equilibrium phenomena and underlying microscopic mechanisms. However, achieving resistive switching with a low threshold field is rare in transition metal spinel oxides. Here, a reversible resistive breakdown under the application of DC current as well as DC electric‐field in hole doped MgTi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    is reported. A remarkably low threshold field of approximately 60 V/cm at 40 K is observed. Additionally, the resistive transition around 260 K observed in stoichiometric system, is suppressed in Mg‐deficient samples. The electric field induced low‐resistance state is meta‐stable, reverting to the insulating phase once the field is removed, indicating a volatile resistive switching (VRS). Interestingly, these systems demonstrate forming‐free, stable threshold switching with minimal cycle‐to‐cycle variation in switching voltages. Experimental results suggest polaronic hopping and collective charge excitation triggered by applied electric field, with subsequent polaronic filament formation as the driving mechanism for the resistive transition. Further, the neuronal functionalities, particularly the leaky‐integrate‐fire behavior of an artificial neuron, are showcased in a single‐component device using these systems as switching layer, suggesting their potential applicability in low‐threshold neuromorphic circuits.","aip":1},{"t":"BAM1 泛素化减弱根尖分生组织中 CLE 肽介导的信号传导","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530116123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The plasma membrane-resident receptor-like kinases (RLKs) and their cognate peptide ligands play crucial roles in plant growth and development. The RLK BARELY ANY MERISTEM1 (BAM1) promotes phloem formation and regulates other aspects of root development. However, the mechanisms governing BAM1 protein degradation remain unclear. In this study, we demonstrate that two closely related ubiquitin ligases, RING DOMAIN LIGASE 1 (RGLG1) and RGLG2, specifically interact with BAM1 and its closest homolog BAM2. RGLG1/2 ubiquitinate BAM1/2 and mediate their degradation, thereby dampening BAM1/2 signaling. Treatment with the peptide CLE13 (CLV3/EMBRYO SURROUNDING REGION-RELATED 13) enhances the BAM1/2-RGLG2 interaction and the ubiquitin ligase activity of RGLG2, resulting in increased ubiquitination and degradation of BAM1/2 by RGLG1/2. The rglg1 rglg2 double mutant exhibits increased sensitivity to CLE13 compared to the wild type. Collectively, our findings demonstrate that RGLG1/2-mediated ubiquitination and degradation of BAM1/2 attenuate CLE13-mediated signaling in root meristem.","tp":"泛素化调控","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现，植物细胞膜受体激酶BAM1在促进韧皮部形成和调节根系发育中起关键作用，但其蛋白降解机制此前尚不明确。该研究证实，两种关系密切的泛素连接酶RGLG1和RGLG2能够与BAM1及其同源蛋白发生特异性相互作用并对其进行泛素化修饰。这一过程会减弱根尖分生组织中CLE多肽介导的细胞信号传导，从而揭示了调控植物生长发育的全新蛋白质降解途径。"},{"t":"特朗普执政一年后的美国科学：失去了什么，还剩下什么","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00088-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"美国资金削减也伤害了有抱负的年轻科学家","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00182-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"美国国会将拒绝特朗普全面削减科学预算","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00163-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"图灵吸波体：增强界面偶极与微波响应的自然解码仿生微图案","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000064?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生微波吸波材料","kp":["材料[微波吸收]: 图灵吸收体仿生微图案"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Turing absorbers: The natural decoding bionic micropatterns for boosting interfacial dipole and microwave response"},{"t":"特朗普一年后：六名美国研究人员计划如何在混乱和削减中保护科学","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00090-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"将 RNA 降解转化为准确的 RNA 检测：用于临床 Sam 的 RNase I 辅助滚环扩增","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525591?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Ribonucleases are powerful degradative enzymes that rapidly cleave RNA and have long been regarded as obstacles to RNA diagnostics. Detecting large, structured RNA molecules in biological samples is further complicated by extensive secondary structures and abundant background RNA. Here we transform this destructive activity into a diagnostic advantage through a RNase I–assisted rolling circle amplification (RI‐RCA) strategy that integrates enzymatic RNA digestion with circular DNA templates (CDTs) to achieve direct, reverse‐transcription‐free RNA detection. In this system,\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    RNase I—a widely available endoribonuclease—selectively digests structured RNA to expose complementary CDT‐binding sites, which are immediately protected through duplex formation and converted into primers for RCA. The resulting reaction proceeds isothermally at room temperature in linear, quasi‐exponential, and exponential modes, achieving quantitative signal generation across concentrations from 50 aM to 50 fM and maintaining performance in 50% pooled human saliva. Applied to clinical saliva samples from SARS‐CoV‐2–positive and –negative individuals, RI‐RCA achieved near‐perfect sensitivity and 98–100% diagnostic accuracy. By coupling enzymatic RNA digestion with sequence‐specific protection via CDT hybridization, this strategy converts RNA instability from a liability into an analytical advantage, providing a simple, robust, and clinically translatable platform for accurate detection of structured RNA targets.","tp":"RNA检测","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出RNase I辅助滚环扩增(RI-RCA)策略，将RNA降解活性转化为诊断优势。核糖核酸酶长期被视为RNA检测的障碍，该方法整合酶降解与扩增，能够克服生物样品中大量背景RNA和复杂二级结构的干扰，实现大型结构化RNA分子的准确临床检测。"},{"t":"迈向单晶二维聚亚芳基亚乙烯基共价有机框架","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02048-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单晶二维COF","kp":["合成策略[2D COF]: Mannich消除反应","材料: 单晶乙烯基连接2D聚芳撑亚乙烯"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究致力于合成单晶态二维聚亚芳基乙烯基共价有机框架（2D PAV），通过亚乙烯基连接构建具有高结晶度的二维共轭聚合物。此类材料兼具长程有序结构与全共轭网络，在有机电子学、光电催化与传感领域具有重要潜力。研究解决了2D COF在结晶性提升方面的长期难题，为下一代高性能有机半导体材料的理性设计提供了关键方法学突破。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Towards single-crystalline two-dimensional poly(arylene vinylene) covalent organic frameworks","b":"Vinylene-linked two-dimensional (2D) conjugated covalent organic frameworks, or 2D poly(arylene vinylene)s (2D PAVs), are promising polymer semiconductors for (opto-)electronics, photocatalysis and electrochemistry. However, conventional solvothermal synthesis often produces 2D PAVs that are poorly crystalline or difficult to access. Here we introduce a Mannich-elimination strategy that converts 8 2D imine-covalent organic frameworks into 11 highly crystalline 2D PAVs though a reversible C=C bond formation mechanism enabling precise crystallization control. This versatile approach affords robust 2D PAVs with honeycomb, square or kagome lattices, specific surface area up to ∼2,000 m2 g−1 and lattice-mismatch tolerance up to 3.5%. High-resolution transmission electron microscopy and continuous rotation electron diffraction reveal molecular-level ordering in a 2-µm-sized triphenylbenzene-based single-crystalline 2D PAV. We demonstrate that crystallinity profoundly influences charge transport, with benzotrithiophene-based 2D PAVs exhibiting charge mobilities tenfold higher than their amorphous analogues or 2D polyimine precursors. This work establishes a general route to highly crystalline 2D conjugated polymer materials for robust applications."},{"t":"迈向乙烯工业化电合成：铜基光催化剂上节能稳定的乙炔半加氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518909?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电催化加氢","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半氢化]: 磷化铜/MXene","应用: 工业电合成乙烯"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究面向乙烯的工业化电合成，聚焦乙炔电催化半加氢制乙烯（EHAE）过程的能效与稳定性优化。利用可再生电力驱动反应，有望替代传统化石燃料裂解路线，实现绿色低碳乙烯生产。研究在电催化剂设计、电解条件调控与长期稳定性方面取得进展，为乙烯这一全球最大宗化工产品的清洁电合成路线走向工业级应用奠定基础。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Toward Industrial Electrosynthesis of Ethylene: Energy‐Efficient and Stable Acetylene Semi‐Hydrogenation on a Copper Pho","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic semi‐hydrogenation of acetylene to ethylene (EHAE) using renewable electricity represents a promising alternative approach for ethylene production. However, its relatively low energy efficiency (EE) and insufficient electrocatalyst stability hinder its industrial applications. The conduct a techno‐economic analysis indicates that the EHAE process becomes profitable when the EE exceeds 22.8% at an industrial current density of 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    . Herein, we report a novel electrocatalyst featuring firmly immobilized copper phosphide (Cu\n                    3\n                    P) nanoparticles on MXene nanosheets (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P) for a stable EHAE process at industrial currents using membrane electrode assembly (MEA) system. Specifically, the Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P electrocatalyst achieves an EE of 23.0% at 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its potential for practical application and economic viability. The strong interactions between Cu\n                    3\n                    P and Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    MXene prevent the agglomeration and dissolution of Cu\n                    3\n                    P nanoparticles during long‐term EHAE process. Notably, in a 4 cm\n                    2\n                    MEA, Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P catalysts can sustain high performance for 100 h at 1.0 A with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency decay of only 0.051% per hour. Quasi in situ electron paramagnetic resonance spectroscopy and theoretical calculations indicate that Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P facilitates water dissociation and synergistically enhances the adsorption of acetylene and active hydrogen (H\n                    *\n                    ), thereby accelerating the kinetics of EHAE process.","aip":1},{"t":"为了获得公众的信任，让艺术成为科学传播的核心","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00210-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"钾离子电池中热分解路径与界面反应性：聚焦电解液与负极","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE06908D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾电池热安全","kp":["电解质[K电池]: 2.5M KFSI低易燃","负极: 石墨"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究系统考察钾离子电池的热分解路径与界面反应性，揭示其在高温及循环过程中的失效机制。钾离子电池因资源丰富、可兼容石墨负极等优势被视为锂离子电池的有力替代候选，但界面副反应与热稳定性问题严重制约其循环寿命与安全性。研究为钾离子电池电解质工程、界面稳定化策略及热管理设计提供了关键机理认识，对推动该技术走向实用化至关重要。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Thermal Decomposition Pathways and Interfacial Reactivity in Potassium-Ion Batteries: Focus on Electrolyte and Anode","b":"Potassium(K)-ion batteries are an attractive alternative to lithium-ion due to their resource abundance, graphite-anode compatibility, manufacturability, and reduced reliance on critical metals. Yet their thermal safety remains poorly defined. Here, we investigate a widely accepted “safer” anode–electrolyte pair, a graphite anode with a low-flammable electrolyte, 2.5 M potassium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (KFSI) in triethyl phosphate (TEP), to clarify decomposition pathways and interfacial reactivity. This work shows that stand-alone TEP primarily volatilizes, whereas in the presence of KFSI it thermally decomposes via FSI-derived intermediates, producing exothermic reactions totaling ~264 J g‒1 above 200 °C and generating organophosphate/fluorophosphate species (e.g., diethyl fluorophosphate) with SO2, HNO3, and SOF2. This is roughly twice the heat released by a conventional LiPF6 carbonate electrolyte, underscoring that low flammability does not equate to safety. With potassiated graphite (KC8), potassium leaching at ~63–80 °C triggers an early interfacial exotherm that builds an inorganic-rich secondary SEI and temporarily suppresses further anode attack up to ~200 °C. Beyond this temperature, electrolyte and anode–electrolyte reactions contribute a total of ~262 J g‒1, which is lower than that of the Li-ion analogue (~431 J g‒1) but occurs at an earlier onset (~65 vs ~100 °C). Interfacial analysis shows that heating transforms the initially stratified SEI into a K-rich, chemically homogenized interphase. Our findings demonstrate that low flammability alone does not ensure thermal safety; rather, interfacial reactivity governs risk. Engineering the SEI composition, controlling salt–solvent coordination, and selecting suitable binders are essential for suppressing sub-100 °C reactivity while maintaining electrochemical performance."},{"t":"绿电交易市场化与新能源企业投资决策","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005440?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿电交易市场化","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"The marketization of green electricity trading and investment decisions of new energy enterprises"},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色与棕色两面：创新、AI驱动专利、能源政策干预与排放","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"工业机器人碳排","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"The green and brown sides of industrial robots: Innovations, AI-Driven patents, energy policy interventions, and emissio"},{"t":"美国将退出 66 个全球机构：这对科学意味着什么？","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00102-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"协同驱动电解液设计：氟代碳酸乙烯酯与丁二腈在共晶电解液中的共溶剂化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠金属电池电解质","kp":["电解质[SMBs]: NaFSI+FEC+丁二腈三元共晶(NSF-5)","溶剂化[协同设计]: FEC与丁二腈共溶剂化稳定钠负极"],"as":"该研究提出协同驱动的电解液设计策略，将氟代碳酸亚乙酯（FEC）与丁二腈（SN）共溶剂引入钠金属电池。通过SEI/CEI界面化学调控，协同抑制钠枝晶生长并提升界面稳定性，显著改善钠金属电池的循环寿命与库仑效率，为高能量密度钠电池体系工程化提供新路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Synergy‐Driven Electrolyte Design: Fluoroethylene Carbonate and Succinonitrile Co‐Solvation in a Eutectic Electrolyte fo","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sodium metal batteries (SMBs) are promising alternatives to lithium‐ion batteries due to their high energy density and abundant sodium resources. However, high reactivity of sodium metal anodes (SMAs) presents significant challenges for practical application. Herein, we report a multifunctional ternary eutectic electrolyte, termed NSF‐5, comprising sodium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (NaFSI), succinonitrile (SN), and fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a 1:1:5 molar ratio, which enhances the cycling stability of SMAs. Combined experimental and computational studies confirm a synergistic effect between FEC and SN, where FEC integrates into the Na\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath, regulates the desolvation process, and promotes the formation of a robust, inorganic‐rich solid electrolyte interphase, thereby suppressing sodium dendrite growth. Consequently, SMBs with NSF‐5 demonstrate desirable cyclability under demanding conditions. Full cells coupled with Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    achieve over 1650 cycles with 90.5% capacity retention at 0.5 C and 3715 cycles with 80.2% retention at 10 C. Even at 0 °C, the cell maintains 87.9 mAh g\n                    ‒1\n                    capacity after 3500 cycles with 81.4% retention. Moreover, this versatile electrolyte formulation can be adapted to other alkali metal battery systems, underscoring its broad applicability. This work highlights the importance of electrolyte engineering in regulating the electrode−electrolyte interphase, offering valuable insights into achieving long‐term cyclability of SMBs."},{"t":"超分子互锁制备机械各向异性、坚固且强韧的仿生离子凝胶","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202511903?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子离子凝胶","kp":["结构[仿生离子凝胶]: 超分子互锁赋予机械各向异性","[各向异性]: 兼顾高强度与类组织柔性"],"as":"该研究利用超分子互锁策略构建具有力学各向异性的离子凝胶材料。通过非共价相互作用在聚合物网络中引入可滑移交联点，使材料兼具高韧性、抗疲劳性与可拉伸性。该离子凝胶在柔性电子、固态电池电解质等前沿领域具有广泛应用潜力，突破了传统离子凝胶强韧难以兼顾的瓶颈。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Supramolecular Interlocking Produces Mechanically Anisotropic, Robust, and Tough Biomimetic Ionogels","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Ionogels have garnered significant attention in various cutting‐edge fields due to their tunable mechanical properties and remarkable multifunctionality. However, current ionogels still struggle to achieve a combination of mechanical robustness and tissue‐like anisotropy, hindering their application in next‐generation intelligent biomimetic materials. Inspired by the anisotropic structure of tendons, we have embedded parallel‐aligned rigid fiber bundles within a flexible ionogel to establish a tight interfacial bonding through supramolecular interlocking. This design enables the dispersion of stress and dissipation of energy through shear deformation of the ionogel in the parallel direction while maintaining high flexibility and stretchability in the perpendicular direction. Thus, tough anisotropic composite ionogels (ACIGs) can be constructed, which exhibit high strength, high modulus, as well as pronounced strength and stiffness anisotropies. The mechanical properties and anisotropies far surpass those of current anisotropic gel materials. Additionally, ACIG demonstrates excellent crack resistance, a wide operational temperature range, and high adhesiveness. It can serve as a biomimetic ligament to secure artificial joints, maintaining stability even after 10 000 bending cycles. Moreover, the conductive properties enable ACIG to function as a sensor for detecting joint movements and transmitting information, holding significant application potential in fields such as intelligent equipment and wearable devices."},{"t":"供体共掺杂钙钛矿中的超质子传导","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521773?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿质子导体","kp":["[材料]: BaSc₁₋ₓ₋ᵧMoₓWᵧO₃₋δ","[掺杂]: Mo/W施主共掺杂","工作温度[质子导电]: 200-400°C","[性能]: 超质子电导"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在氧缺陷型钙钛矿BaScO₂.₅中采用供体共掺杂策略实现高超子电导率。掺杂引入氧空位与质子载流子通道，在中低温条件下获得优异的质子传导性能。该材料体系可作为固体氧化物燃料电池和质子陶瓷电池的电解质候选，为清洁能源转换器件提供了新的材料设计方向。","ot":"Superprotonic Conduction in Donor Co‐Doped Perovskites","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Donor doping of oxygen‐deficient BaScO\n                    2.5\n                    is an unexplored strategy for achieving high proton conductivity at intermediate temperatures of 200−400 °C. In this work, a new series of BaSc\n                    1−\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    −\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    Mo\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    W\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    O\n                    3−\n                    \n                      δ\n                    \n                    compounds was prepared via Mo/W donor co‐doping where\n                    x\n                    is the Mo content,\n                    y\n                    is the W content, and\n                    δ\n                    is the amount of oxygen vacancies. The present work reports the enhancement of proton conductivity by the Mo/W donor co‐doping of BaScO\n                    2.5\n                    . BaSc\n                    0.8\n                    Mo\n                    0.1\n                    W\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2.8\n                    exhibits exceptional proton conductivity—0.10 S cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 315 °C and 0.01 S cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 193 °C—alongside outstanding chemical stability in CO\n                    2\n                    , O\n                    2\n                    , and H\n                    2\n                    atmospheres. The high proton conductivity originates from the synergistic effects of abundant oxygen vacancies (\n                    δ\n                     = 0.2) and full hydration, yielding a high proton concentration, coupled with high proton diffusivity. The high diffusivity is attributable to the reduced proton trapping compared with acceptor and isovalent doping and overdoping due to higher proton concentration. In contrast to the acceptor co‐doping, the donor co‐doping does not increase the activation energy, resulting in lower activation energy and higher proton conductivity. These findings establish donor co‐doping into the oxygen‐deficient perovskites as a powerful design principle for next‐generation proton conductors with high proton conductivity at intermediate temperatures.","aip":1},{"t":"研究决策以了解技术将如何影响行为","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00209-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"结构无序诱导的动态亲氧表面促进O*自由基二聚化实现卓越酸性析氧反应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506570?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氧催化剂","kp":["反应机制[酸性OER]: 氧化物路径机制OPM","催化剂[PEMWE阳极]: 结构无序动态亲氧表面","催化机制[O*]: 促进O*自由基二聚"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"针对质子交换膜水电解槽（PEMWE）阳极析氧反应，研究者通过结构无序工程构建动态亲氧表面，促进O*自由基二聚化反应路径（2O*→O₂），显著降低过电位并提升催化稳定性。该机制突破传统吸附析氧机制限制，为酸性介质中高效OER电催化剂设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Structure Disorder‐Induced Dynamic Oxophilic Surface Boosting O* Radical Dimerization for Superior Acid Oxygen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Globally, the proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs) already account for approximately 30% of the hydrogen market and are undergoing rapid expansion. However, the commercially used iridium‐based anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) catalysts in PEMWEs still suffer from notably poor reactivity. At present, the oxide pathway mechanism (OPM) is an important route to achieve both high activity and durability in OER. Nevertheless, the performance of conventional Ir‐based crystalline OER catalysts following the OPM pathway remains far below their theoretical limit, which is significantly hindered by two intrinsic limitations. First, their rigid lattice structures prevent the shortening of metal‐metal distances, which is essential to facilitate the rate‐determining O\n                    *\n                    ─O\n                    *\n                    dimerization. Second, the repulsion between O\n                    *\n                    adsorbates during OER inevitably weakens the metal = O\n                    *\n                    bond and undermines the overall oxygen evolution efficiency. Herein, we report that an amorphous IrMO\n                    x\n                    catalyst elegantly overcomes the limitations of the OPM pathway by virtue of its dynamic surface structure and strong oxophilicity of M.  The dynamic surface structure promotes O\n                    *\n                    ─O\n                    *\n                    coupling, while the oxophilic nature of M compensates for the inherent weakening of the metal = O\n                    *\n                    bond during OER. Because of that, the catalyst exhibits outstanding OER performance, along with excellent catalytic durability over 1200 h’ PEM testing.","aip":1},{"t":"深海风力发电机最新综述：安装、成本、不稳定性、流致振荡、故障与维护","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000139?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深海风力发电机","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"State-of-the-art review of deep-sea wind turbine: installation, cost, instability, flow-induced oscillation, failure, ma"},{"t":"面向Rec.2020的高亮度极限效率稳定纯绿光超荧光有机发光二极管","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518330?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿光OLED","kp":["发光机制[绿光OLED]: MR-TADF超荧光","色域标准[OLED]: Rec 2020纯绿","[高亮度]: 兼顾色纯度效率稳定性"],"dp":1,"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基于多共振热激活延迟荧光（MR-TADF）发射体，结合超荧光（Hyperfluorescence）策略实现高效纯绿光OLED。通过敏化剂-发射体能量传递架构，在高亮度下保持极限外量子效率，同时解决纯绿光发射中的效率滚降与光谱稳定性问题。该成果对满足Rec.2020广色域显示标准具有重要意义。","ot":"Stable Pure‐Green Hyperfluorescent Organic Light‐Emitting Diodes with Ultimate Efficiency at High Brightness Toward Rec ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) emitters represent a promising platform for high‐efficiency, wide‐color‐gamut OLEDs. However, current green MR‐TADF emitters face challenges in simultaneously achieving high color purity, high efficiency at high brightness, and high device stability. In this study, we report the synthesis and device integration of a novel MR‐TADF emitter, DBF‐v‐DABNA. Designed with a rigid meta‐dibenzofuran framework and meta‐phenyl related two boron units, the molecule exhibits narrowband pure‐green emission (FWHM = 16–19 nm) and a high horizontal dipole ratio (94%). Moreover, sufficient steric shielding of the MR core suppresses exciton loss from Dexter energy transfer (DET). When incorporated into hyperfluorescent (HF) bottom‐emitting OLED architectures, DBF‐v‐DABNA achieved high external quantum efficiencies (EQE) exceeding 35 % with negligible roll‐off, CIEy ≥ 0.73, superior brightness stability up to 7.2 × 10\n                    5\n                    cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and device lifetimes exceeding 600 h at 5000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    . The top‐emitting configuration reached BT.2020 green coordinates with record‐setting current efficiency (233 cd A\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ). These results highlight DBF‐v‐DABNA as a promising pure‐green emitter for next‐generation UHD OLED displays requiring high efficiency and color purity."},{"t":"信使 RNA 脂质纳米颗粒时空靶向子宫内膜治疗生殖疾病","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02108-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dysfunctions of the endometrium, the uterus inner lining, can impair embryo implantation and reduce pregnancy rates. Intrauterine administration of cytokines has shown potential to improve endometrium function, but it is challenged by poor targeting and dose-limiting systemic side effects. Here we present a strategy for introducing therapeutic messenger RNA into the endometrium for the treatment of reproductive disorders. mRNA was loaded into a ligand-conjugated lipid nanoparticle (LNP), enabling multivalent interactions with the temporally overexpressed integrin receptors on the endometrial surface during the window of implantation. Conjugating the targeting ligand directly to the lipid component enhanced endometrial protein expression after intrauterine infusion and reduced systemic expression in the liver and spleen. A single infusion of granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor (GM-CSF) mRNA-loaded LNP sustained local protein expression for several hours and reduced GM-CSF systemic exposure. In a murine model of endometrial injury, GM-CSF mRNA-loaded LNP improved embryo implantation rates, outperforming recombinant GM-CSF. Our strategy demonstrates the efficacy of using mRNA to improve fertility outcomes."},{"t":"通过MOF柯肯达尔效应实现SEI稳定的石榴型SnP₂O₇@PC负极用于长循环寿命","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505082?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠钾电池负极","kp":["负极材料[钾/钠离子电池]: 石榴状SnP2O7@多孔碳","合成方法[MOF柯肯达尔效应]: 核壳结构构建","[SEI稳定]: 抑制颗粒粉化"],"as":"该研究设计了石榴状结构的SnP2O7@磷碳复合（PC）负极材料，通过稳定固态电解质界面（SEI）实现高性能钾离子电池（PIBs）和钠离子电池（SIBs）。SnP2O7具有高理论容量但循环过程中体积膨胀严重，研究者采用石榴状封装策略将纳米颗粒限制在碳基体中，有效缓冲结构应力并稳定SEI层，显著提升了倍率性能和长循环稳定性。该工作为下一代低成本、大储量电池的负极材料设计提供了重要思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Solid Electrolyte Interphase Stabilized Pomegranate SnP2O7@PC Anodes Realized Through Kirkendall Effect of MOF for Durab","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (PIBs) and sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are promising next‐generation energy storage technologies because of their abundant and low‐cost raw materials. However, anodes for PIBs/SIBs often exhibit poor cycling stability, mainly due to particle fragmentation, loss of electrical connectivity, and continuous electrolyte decomposition from repetitive solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation. To address these challenges, a biomimetic pomegranate‐like core‐shell SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    @PC anode (CSP‐SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    @PC) is synthesised through pyrolysis‐driven Kirkendall effect of tin‐based phosphonate metal‐organic framework (MOF). This multi‐scale design integrates several key features. At the molecular scale, the in situ formation of Sn‐P‐O bonds reduces K\n                    +\n                    diffusion barriers. The nanoscale dispersion of SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    within conductive carbon matrix promotes efficient electron and ion transport. Furthermore, microscale structural engineering creates pre‐reserved voids to accommodate volume expansion, suppress SEI overgrowth, and prevent cracking. The optimised anode demonstrates exceptional cycling stability, exhibiting ultralow capacity decay rate of 0.0015% per cycle over 16 000 cycles at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    , and also delivers excellent performance in SIBs. Density functional theory and finite element simulations further reveal beneficial electronic structures and stress distribution, providing fundamental insights for designing durable electrodes through crystal and electronic optimisation. Overall, this study presents an innovative strategy for mitigating volume expansion in high‐capacity battery materials.","aip":1},{"t":"软巨磁阻抗电子器件实现非接触式人机交互","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526097123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Magnetic sensing enables contact-free, three-dimensional human-machine interactions (HMI) with high selectivity and resilience to environmental noise. However, conventional magnetic films, mostly obtained via vacuum deposition, remain constrained by rigidity, instantaneous response, and single-mode. Here, we report a giant magnetoimpedance ionogel (GelGMI) in which electrostatically self-assembled ferromagnetic (FM) domains are uniformly dispersed in a soft ionogel matrix. Under a magnetic field, domain moments realign to reconfigure ionic pathways, yielding pronounced magnetoimpedance while maintaining performance at >1,000% strain and across orientations. The hysteretic relaxation of domain magnetization imparts retrospective neuron-like temporal summation, realizing sequence- and context-aware interaction. In addition, the self-healable matrix supports a complementary tactile mode whose impedance contrasts with contact-free magnetic proximity, enabling expandable and bimodal recognition. GelGMI delivers a record-high sensitivity while unifying stretchable, neuromorphic, and healable capabilities for contact-free HMI systems.","tp":"柔性磁传感","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了巨磁阻抗离子凝胶(GelGMI)软电子器件，实现非接触式三维人机交互。铁磁域通过静电自组装均匀分散在软离子凝胶基质中，在磁场作用下产生阻抗响应。该器件克服了传统真空沉积磁性薄膜刚性大、响应单一等局限，为柔性磁传感器和可穿戴交互提供了新平台。"},{"t":"睡眠不足会导致胆固醇相关的髓磷脂功能障碍","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523438123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The increasing prevalence of sleep deprivation poses a public health challenge in modern society. Manifestations of reduced alertness, such as slowed reaction times and increased errors, are well-documented behavioral indicators of sleep loss (SL). Yet, the biological consequences of sleep deprivation and their role in behavioral impairment remain elusive. Our study reveals significant effects of sleep deprivation on myelin integrity. As a result, we identify increased conduction delays in nerve signal propagation, hindered interhemispheric synchronization, and impaired cognitive and motor performance associated with SL. By profiling oligodendrocyte transcriptome and lipidome, we observe SL-induced endoplasmic reticulum stress and lipid metabolism dysregulation, particularly affecting cholesterol homeostasis. Boosting cholesterol transport to myelin sheaths prevents SL effects on nerve signal propagation and behavior. Our findings highlight a possible role of oligodendrocyte cholesterol dysregulation in behavioral deficits associated with SL and unveil a novel target for intervention."},{"t":"尺寸依赖性结构相变决定镍-钌双金属催化剂的协同效应与功能","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4017792?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双金属催化剂","kp":["催化剂[生物质+CO2共转化]: Ni-Ru/CeO2双金属","[尺寸效应]: 原子级分散决定结构与功能转变"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究系统揭示了Ni-Ru双金属催化剂中尺寸依赖性结构转变如何决定协同效应与催化功能。双金属催化剂的性能高度依赖于两种金属间的协同作用，但精确调控这一协同机制一直是理性设计的难题。研究发现Ni-Ru纳米颗粒在特定尺寸下发生结构转变，由此改变活性位点的电子结构和配位环境，进而显著影响催化活性与选择性。该工作建立了尺寸—结构—协同效应—催化性能的内在关联，为高效双金属催化剂的理性设计提供了理论指导。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Size‐Dependent Structural Transitions Dictate Synergy and Function in Ni‐Ru Bimetallic Catalysts","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Precise control over synergistic interactions is essential for the rational design of bimetallic catalysts, yet the governing role of metal particle size remains elusive. Here, we uncover a general size‐dependent principle that dictates structural and functional transitions in Ni‐Ru/CeO\n                    2\n                    catalysts during the co‐conversion of biomass and CO\n                    2\n                    . Atomically dispersed Ni and Ru sites on CeO\n                    2\n                    exhibit pronounced synergistic effects that markedly enhance CO\n                    2\n                    reforming of biomass, arising from the presence of independent metallic sites. In contrast, Ni nanoparticles with interspersed Ru form Ni‐Ru alloys that confer exceptional stability with only moderate activity loss. This size‐dependent structural transition induces a functional switch governing reaction pathway, coke deposition from encapsulated carbon to carbon nanotubes, and the trade‐off between catalytic activity and durability. These findings elucidate the mechanistic basis of size‐dependent interactions in Ni‐Ru bimetallic systems and guide the rational design of stable, high‐performance catalysts."},{"t":"自组装二维手性介观形貌决定细胞和体液免疫对Tu的平衡","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520552?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of nanomaterials‐based cancer vaccines has broadened the scope of immunotherapy. Nanomaterials with characteristics such as chirality, 2D, and flexibility have attracted widespread attention because they can maximize the interface between the materials and immune cells. Here, we report the fabrication of 2‐D mesoporous silica nanodisks with a chiral meso‐topography as vaccine adjuvants. These uniform nanodisks, with diameters from 200 nm to 1 µm, possess unique spiral mesoporous patterns of ∼ 10 nm. The thickness of the chiral mesoporous nanodisks can be precisely controlled in units of one layer (∼ 7 nm), thereby achieving precise regulation in surface topology, dimension and flexibility. The unique 2‐D chiral mesoporous structure originates from the maximum occupancy of confined space of micellar helical arrangement, which is distinct from conventional methods based on internal tension. The combination of flexibility, 2‐D structure and chirality enhances nanodisks’ interaction with dendritic cells (DCs), significantly improving DC maturation via Toll‐like receptors/Nuclear Factor‐kappa B (TLR/NF‐κB), Mitogen‐Activated Protein Kinase (MAPK) and Focal Adhesion Kinase (FAK) signaling pathways. Upon nanovaccines’ activation of DCs in vivo, DCs further presents antigen for activating T cells to trigger balanced cellular and humoral immunity. Subcutaneous injection of the nanodisks‐adjuvanted cancer vaccine can significantly inhibit the tumor growth and extend the survival of melanoma‐bearing mice to more than 60 days, about three times higher than that of the PBS‐treated group. When combined with PD‐1 antibody, the cancer vaccines maximize tumor suppression, achieving a tumor‐free outcome in one‐third of the cases."},{"t":"用于体内生物医学成像的自组装 (Aza)BODIPY 染料","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525491?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    4,4‐difluoro‐4‐bora‐3a,4a‐diaza‐s‐indacenes (BODIPYs) and their N‐containing analogs (aza‐BODIPYs) are highly versatile organic dyes that combine excellent photophysical, electronic, and supramolecular properties with high chemical stability. These features have enabled their use in diverse applications such as bioimaging, targeted drug delivery, and functional self‐assembled materials. Their broad structural modularity allows different stacking modes with controlled exciton coupling during self‐assembly, resulting in supramolecular materials with tunable spectroscopic and morphological properties. This is particularly relevant in aqueous media, where tunable near‐infrared (NIR) absorption and emission are essential for advanced contrast agents (CAs) in biomedical imaging. Besides\n                    meso\n                    ‐heteroatom modification, J‐aggregation stands out as especially advantageous for achieving red‐shifted absorption and emission, thereby improving tissue penetration and reducing autofluorescence and light scattering. Of particular promise is the concept of pathway complexity, whereby a single (aza)BODIPY scaffold can access multiple aggregated states with distinct photophysical signatures, enabling stimuli‐responsive and multifunctional imaging behavior. Hence, understanding the interplay between (aza)BODIPY molecular design, exciton coupling in aqueous media and their resulting supramolecular and bioimaging properties is of utmost importance. This minireview discusses recent advances in (aza)BODIPY‐based self‐assembled structures used as CA platforms for in vivo biomedical imaging and highlights the structure–property relationships that govern their performance.","tp":"染料自组装","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"as":"综述了BODIPY及其含氮类似物aza-BODIPY染料的自组装行为及在体内生物医学成像中的应用。这类有机染料兼具优异的光物理性质、电子特性和高化学稳定性，结构模块化程度高，可通过不同堆积单元调控组装形貌，广泛应用于生物成像、靶向药物递送和功能化自组装材料等领域。"},{"t":"脊椎动物胚胎中的巩膜造血有助于血液系统的稳健性","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag035/8429811?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"During vertebrate embryogenesis, hematopoietic stem cells (HSCs) are believed to almost exclusively arise from hemogenic endothelial cells (ECs) of the dorsal aorta through endothelial-to-hematopoietic transition (EHT). It remains elusive whether HSCs can be generated by other tissues. Sclerotomal cells (SCs) in embryonic somites majorly form vertebrae and ribs, and some SCs may also insert into aortic endothelia. Here we show that a subset of SCs directly enter the vascular lumen to become hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells (HSPCs) in an EHT-independent way in both zebrafish and mouse embryos. The sclerotome-derived HSPCs (scHSPCs) contribute to various blood cells throughout lifetime. The proportion of scHSPCs increased dramatically when endothelium hematopoiesis is defective. Thus, the sclerotomal hematopoiesis is evolutionarily conserved and would ensure the robustness of hematopoiesis."},{"t":"缩放活性粒子的玻璃动力学：可调节的脆性和重入","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516624123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Understanding the influence of activity on dense amorphous assemblies is crucial for biological processes such as wound healing, embryogenesis, or cancer progression. Here, we study the effect of self-propulsion forces of amplitude [Formula: see text] and persistence time [Formula: see text] in dense assemblies of soft repulsive particles by simulating a model particle system that interpolates between particulate active matter and biological tissues. We identify the fluid and glass phases of the three-dimensional phase diagram obtained by varying [Formula: see text], [Formula: see text], and the packing fraction [Formula: see text]. The morphology of the phase diagram accounts for a nonmonotonic evolution of the relaxation time with [Formula: see text], which is a direct consequence of the crossover in the dominant relaxation mechanism, from glassy to jamming. A second major consequence is the evolution of the glassy dynamics from sub-Arrhenius to super-Arrhenius. We show that this tunable glass fragility extends to active systems analogous observations reported for passive particles. This analogy allows us to apply a dynamic scaling analysis proposed for the passive case, in order to account for our results for active systems. Finally, we discuss similarities and differences between our results and recent findings in the context of computational models of biological tissues.","tp":"活性玻璃态","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"通过模拟自驱动力幅值和持久时间对致密软排斥粒子体系的影响，研究活性物质在玻璃态转变中的行为。该模型体系介于颗粒活性物质与生物组织之间，揭示了自推进力可调控玻璃的脆性并诱导重入现象（reentrancy），对理解伤口愈合、胚胎发育和肿瘤进展等生物过程中活性对无序体系的影响具有重要意义。"},{"t":"通过湿膜干预实现钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池的可规模化环境制备","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00418-0?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙硅叠层电池","kp":["制备工艺[钙钛矿/硅叠层]: 环境气氛湿膜干预nBASCN","[可扩展制备]: 湿度下高结晶抑制降解","规模[叠层电池]: 可规模化环境制备"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池是突破单结晶硅效率极限的关键路线，但钙钛矿顶电池的大规模环境气氛制备仍面临成膜质量挑战。该研究提出湿膜转移(wet-film transfer)策略实现可扩展的环境条件下钙钛矿顶电池制备，避免了严苛的惰性气氛依赖，有望显著降低制造成本并推动叠层电池的产业化进程。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Scalable ambient fabrication of perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells via wet-film intervention","b":"Scalable ambient fabrication of perovskite top cells is promising for advancing perovskite/silicon tandem solar cells, yet uncontrolled environmental humidity challenges high-quality film preparation. Here, an nBASCN wet-film intervention strategy is innovated to achieve well-regulated crystallization and suppress surface degradation, enabling scalable fabrication of high-performance tandem devices in ambient air."},{"t":"回复Dujmović：人类与模型推理之间的成本对齐是值得解释的实证现象","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536153123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"推理成本对齐","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Reply to Dujmović: The alignment in cost between human and model reasoning is an empirical phenomenon worth explaining"},{"t":"Pd周围界面水结构的重排增强锌-甲醇-空气电池的氧还原动力学","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523272?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气氧还原","kp":["催化剂[锌-甲醇-空气电池]: Pd基复合材料","[界面水结构]: 重新取向增强氧还原动力学","催化机制[双电层]: 调控界面水而非电解质"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现在锌-甲醇-空气电池中，钯催化剂表面界面水分子的取向重构可显著增强氧还原反应（ORR）动力学。通过调控双电层中水分子的氢键网络与吸附构型，优化反应物传输与中间体转化路径。该工作揭示了溶剂化结构工程对多相电催化反应的关键调控作用，为金属-空气电池性能提升提供了新策略。","ot":"Reoriented Interfacial Water Structure Around Pd Enhances Oxygen Reduction Kinetics in Zn–Methanol–Air Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The dynamics of interfacial water within the electrical double layer (EDL) play a pivotal role in governing charge transfer during electrocatalysis. While previous strategies primarily focused on modulating electrolyte compositions or pH to tune the EDL, tailoring the interfacial water structure through catalyst design remains underexplored. Herein, we report a composite catalyst comprising atomically dispersed cobalt sites (Co\n                    SA\n                    ) embedded in a N‐doped carbon matrix and palladium nanoparticles (PdCo\n                    NP\n                    @Co\n                    SA\n                    NC), which exhibits enhanced oxygen reduction reaction (ORR). In situ spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations reveal that Co\n                    SA\n                     incorporation induces a negative shift in the potential of zero charge (\n                    E\n                    PZC\n                    ), causing more positively charged surface under working conditions compared to the Co‐free analogue (Pd\n                    NP\n                    @NC). This charge redistribution reorients interfacial water from H‐down to O‐down configuration, promoting *OH hydrogenation by strengthening electrostatic interaction with the OH\n                    sol\n                    −\n                    product. Consequently, PdCo\n                    NP\n                    @Co\n                    SA\n                    NC achieves an outstanding half‐wave potential of 0.937 V and a mass activity of 2.58  A mg\n                    Pd\n                    −1\n                     for ORR, along with 6.15  A mg\n                    Pd\n                    −1\n                     for methanol oxidation reaction (MOR), outperforming Pd\n                    NP\n                    @NC and commercial Pd/C. Leveraging its bifunctional ORR/MOR activity, we construct carbonate‐free Zn–methanol–air battery with decent kinetics up to 100 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                     and stable operation over 2500 h with an energy efficiency of 70%.","aip":1},{"t":"重构磷负极：通过应变诱导界面耦合抑制粉化效应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523513?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷负极抗粉化","kp":["[负极策略]: 应变诱导界面耦合化体积膨胀为稳定驱动力","材料体系[磷负极]: 磷+单壁碳纳米管"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对合金型磷负极在充放电循环中因体积膨胀导致的粉化失效问题，研究者提出通过应变诱导界面耦合策略加以抑制。该界面工程缓解磷脱嵌/嵌入过程中的应力集中，维持电极结构完整性，从而大幅提升循环寿命。该工作为高比能磷基负极材料的实用化提供了关键工程解决方案。","ot":"Reinventing Phosphorus Anodes: Taming Pulverization via Strain‐Induced Interfacial Coupling","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Alloy‐type anodes offer high theoretical capacity, yet their practical application is hindered by substantial volume expansion and particle pulverization. In this work, a proactive strategy is proposed to converts the inherent volume change from a detrimental issue into a driving force for interfacial stabilization. By leveraging the flexibility of robust single‐walled carbon nanotubes (SWCNTs) and the large volume variation of phosphorus upon lithiation, the induced tensile strain in SWCNTs enhances their interaction with fragmented alloy particles, promoting interfacial coupling and the formation of P─C bonds.\n                    Operando\n                    Raman spectroscopy and density functional theory (DFT) calculations corroborate this chemomechanical coupling mechanism, which effectively stabilizes fractured phosphorus clusters, suppresses intermediate dissolution, and facilitates the reconstruction of a robust conductive network. As a result, the phosphorus anode incorporating only 1 wt% SWCNT delivers a high specific capacity of 1981.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1C, 1235.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 5C, and maintains 1301.9 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    (78.1% retention) after 500 cycles at 1C. Moreover, the NCM811//BP─SWCNT full cell achieves 507 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and 1459.7 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 500 cycles at 1C. This study establishes an active stress‐utilization design principle, providing new perspectives for developing high‐energy‐density alloy‐type anodes.","aip":1},{"t":"通过阳离子分子结构调控界面动态自调节疏水层实现超稳定锌金属电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池界面","kp":["策略[锌金属负极]: 亲水亲油平衡-空间构型协同调控","[界面层]: 动态自调节疏水层","[构效关系]: 阳离子添加剂结构效应"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过设计阳离子分子结构调控界面动态自调节疏水层，实现锌金属电池的超稳定循环。该疏水层动态适应电极表面形貌变化，抑制锌枝晶生长与副反应，均匀化锌离子沉积。该策略揭示了溶液添加剂分子结构-界面行为-电化学性能之间的构效关系，为水系锌电池实用化提供了重要界面调控思路。","ot":"Regulating Interfacial Dynamic Self‐Adjusting Hydrophobic Layer via Cationic Molecular Structure for Ultra‐Stable Zinc M","b":"Abstract\n                  The structure of solution additives significantly affects the polarization and dendrite behavior of metal batteries. In this study, we propose, for the first time, the “hydrophilic‐lipophilic balance (HLB) value‐spatial configuration synergistic regulation” strategy by selecting cations with different structures as additives, successfully revealing the structure‐activity relationship between additive structures and the stability of the anode interface adsorption layer. Among them, the butyltrimethylammonium chloride additive (ADD4), which has a low HLB value and a linear structure, exhibits the most stable interfacial structure. The stable hydrophobic region formed by its spontaneous aggregation and assembly shows a repulsive effect on hydrated protons. The constructed protective layer can effectively reduce overpotential and inhibit the formation of by‐products. The battery with ADD4 exhibits excellent stability, with over 1700 cycles and an average Coulombic efficiency of 99.7%. The full laboratory cells and pouch cells can also maintain very good cyclability, verifying their feasibility for practical applications. This study emphasizes that exploring the relationship between the hydrophilic‐hydrophobic properties, microstructure of additive ions, and the stability of the adsorption layer is crucial for designing appropriate electrolyte‐electrode interface layers.","aip":1},{"t":"基于MOF衍生过渡金属硫化物的超级电容器电极材料研究进展","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000012?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MOF衍生金属硫化物","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","ot":"Recent advances in supercapacitor electrode materials based on MOF-derived transition metal sulfides"},{"t":"柔性多模态传感器的最新进展：解耦策略、制造和应用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521375?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Flexible multimodal sensors have garnered significant attention in research areas such as electronic skin, advanced robotics, and personalized health monitoring due to their ability to leverage the complementary advantages of diverse sensing units, thereby a primary decoupling strategy exploits differences in the fundamental types of signals generated. Nevertheless, flexible multimodal sensors persistently face challenges like signal crosstalk and complex integration processes, which constrain their performance. This review delineates recent advances in flexible multimodal sensor decoupling through fundamental material design guided by physical principles, structural design, and AI‐driven signal decoupling architectures. Additionally, we explore the various applications of flexible multimodal sensors, encompassing environmental monitoring, physiological health tracking, human‐machine interaction, and robotic perception. Finally, the conclusion, challenges, and future perspectives for next‐generation flexible multimodal sensing systems are discussed.","tp":"柔性传感器","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":"综述了柔性多模态传感器的最新进展，聚焦信号解耦策略、制造工艺与应用场景。该类传感器利用多种传感单元的互补优势，在电子皮肤、先进机器人和个性化健康监测领域前景广阔，但仍面临信号串扰和集成复杂度等核心挑战。文章系统梳理了基于信号类型差异的解耦方案及器件加工方法。"},{"t":"使用基于宿主-病原体的系统实时时空跟踪密闭环境中的传染病爆发","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2422574123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Deadly infection outbreaks in confined spaces, whether it is a COVID-19 outbreak on a cruise ship or measles and stomach flu outbreaks in schools, can be characterized by their rapid spread due to the abundance of common spaces, shared airways, and high population density. Preventing future outbreaks and developing efficient mitigation protocols can benefit from advanced computational modeling approaches. Here, we developed an agent-based modeling approach to study the spatiotemporal dynamics of an infection outbreak in a confined environment caused by a specific pathogen, and to determine effective containment protocols. The approach integrates the 3D geographic information system of a confined environment, behavior of the hosts, key biological parameters about the pathogen obtained from the experimental data, and the general mechanics of host-pathogen and pathogen-fomite interactions. To assess our approach, we applied it to the historical data of infectious outbreaks caused by norovirus, H1N1 influenza A, and SARS-CoV-2 viruses. Our AI-GIS Infection Dynamics (AGID) model accurately predicted daily infection numbers, correctly identified the day when the CDC vessel sanitation protocol would be triggered, singled out key biological parameters affecting the infection spread, and propose pathogen-specific changes to existing containment protocols. Our work advances the understanding of infection spread on cruise ships while offering insights applicable to other similar confined settings, such as nursing homes, schools, and hospitals. By providing a robust framework for real-time outbreak modeling, this study proposes more effective containment protocols and enhances our preparedness for managing infectious diseases and emerging pathogens in confined environments."},{"t":"出版更正：Echo-Vision-FM——超声心动图视频视觉基础模型的预训练与微调框架","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68722-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超声视频模型","as":"","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":1.0,"d":1.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Publisher Correction: Echo-Vision-FM: a pre-training and fine-tuning framework for echocardiogram video vision foundatio"},{"t":"能源投资和包容性增长方面的公私伙伴关系","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005178?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源投融资","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"使用基于温度的机器学习模型预测 2100 年西班牙南部的太阳峰值时间","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000474?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"可编程界面聚合：机器学习揭示微胶囊的定量理性设计规则","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517708?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"界面聚合微胶囊","kp":["[方法]: 机器学习揭示界面聚合定量设计规则","应用[MIP]: 微胶囊封装理性设计"],"as":"该研究将界面聚合（IP）技术与机器学习结合，通过数据驱动方法揭示界面聚合过程中的定量构效关系。界面聚合是设计聚合物分离膜的核心平台技术，但传统工艺依赖经验试错。研究团队利用ML模型分析聚合条件与膜结构性能之间的映射规律，实现对膜选择透过性的精准调控与预测性设计，为下一代高性能分离膜的材料筛选与工艺优化提供了新范式。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Programming Interfacial Polymerization: Machine Learning Unveils Quantitative Rational Design Rules for Microcapsules an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Interfacial polymerization (IP) serves as a versatile platform technology for designing polymeric membranes, yet its extension to applications such as microencapsulation (MIP) remains hindered by empirical methodologies, largely due to the absence of quantitative rational design principles. Unlike separation membranes, which prioritize nanostructural control, MIP emphasizes encapsulation efficiency (EE%), rendering conventional membrane‐derived theories and thermodynamic descriptors insufficient. In this work, we transcend these limitations by employing interpretable machine learning to program interfacial polymerization, thereby deciphering mechanism‐informed quantitative design rules. Our data‐driven platform integrates molecular thermodynamics, polymerization kinetics, and emulsion‐stabilized interfacial parameters to identify previously overlooked descriptors governing microcapsule formation. We establish a predictive chemical–process–structure–performance relationship and demonstrate programmable control over key performances, including EE% (30%–95%), particle size (100–400 µm), and shell thickness‐to‐radius ratios (0.005–1) for diverse payloads spanning hydrophobic, hydrophilic, and highly reactive compounds such as toluene diisocyanate and amines. This work not only resolves long‐standing challenges in understanding complex multiphase interactions in MIP but also establishes a new paradigm for the quantitative design of polymeric microcapsules, with broad implications for functional particles, catalytic microreactors, digital cells, and membranes.","aip":1},{"t":"红色光氧化还原催化剂的预测性数据驱动设计用于C-杂原子键形成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526086?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"红光光催化","kp":["[光催化]: 红光吸收有机染料模块化设计","反应[C-杂键]: 红光光氧化还原催化","[数据驱动]: 预测性催化剂设计"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究采用预测性数据驱动方法设计红光光氧化还原催化剂，用于C-杂原子键的形成反应。光催化虽是有机合成的有力工具，但催化剂开发长期依赖耗时实验筛选。研究团队构建机器学习模型关联催化剂分子结构与光催化性能，实现红光（低毒性、深穿透）条件下高效催化剂的理性设计，显著加速光催化合成的实用化进程，在药物合成与精细化工领域具有广阔前景。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Predictive, Data‐Driven Design of Red‐Light Photoredox Catalysts for C─Heteroatom Bond Formation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Photocatalysis is a powerful tool for the synthesis of organic molecules, yet its widespread application is hindered by the dependence on high‐energy light sources and expensive metal‐based catalysts, which can limit scalability and environmental sustainability. In this study, we present a modular design strategy for organic dyes engineered for efficient red‐light absorption, enabling photocatalytic reactions under low‐energy irradiation. Our findings establish a clear relationship between the oxidation potential of the photocatalyst and the nature of its donor moiety, as well as between the reduction potential and the electronic characteristics of its core structure. Moreover, we demonstrate that the\n                    E\n                    0‐0\n                    energy of a photocatalyst can be predicted via multivariate linear regression using the donor's oxidation potential and the core's reduction potential as descriptors. Utilizing this strategy, we synthesized red‐light‐absorbing photocatalysts that efficiently promote C─heteroatom cross‐coupling reactions under mild conditions. This approach overcomes the limitations of blue‐light photocatalysis by offering broad substrate compatibility, including π‐conjugated aryl bromides and photolabile functional groups, while minimizing undesirable hydrodehalogenation. By reducing reliance on precious metals and improving energy efficiency, our approach provides a scalable alternative to traditional photocatalysis and advances the development of metal‐free photocatalysts for sustainable chemistry."},{"t":"编码后施用催产素选择性增强女性对男性面孔的记忆巩固","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529865123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxytocin plays a critical role in modulating social cognition and enhancing human memory for faces. However, it remains unclear which phase of memory oxytocin affects to enhance face memory. Our study explored oxytocin's potential to selectively enhance the consolidation of social memories, specifically human faces, and whether this effect varies between genders. In three preregistered, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trials with heterosexual participants (total N = 445, comprising 227 males and 218 females), we explored how oxytocin affects memory consolidation. We administered oxytocin immediately after encoding (i.e., Study 1), before retrieval (i.e., Study 2), and before encoding (i.e., Study 3) in three parallel studies. This design allowed us to confirm that oxytocin's effects were indeed due to consolidation rather than retrieval or encoding. We found that administering oxytocin post-encoding, but not before-retrieval or before-encoding, significantly improved female participants' ability to recognize male faces 24 h later, with no similar enhancement observed in males recognizing opposite-gender faces. Together with our analyses of the social placebo effect-where the belief in receiving oxytocin produces effects similar to those of actual intranasal oxytocin administration-and the approachability ratings during encoding, we concluded that oxytocin specifically enhances the consolidation of long-term social memories in women recognizing male faces. These findings imply that oxytocin selectively enhances the consolidation of human social memory, potentially deepening our understanding of the mechanisms underlying social memory processes."},{"t":"硬碳上聚合物诱导的固体电解质界面实现5C快充实用化钠离子软包电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag025/8429798?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠离子快充负极","kp":["SEI厚度[硬碳负极]: ~5.0 nm","SEI组成[硬碳]: 聚合物与NaF杂化","充电倍率[钠离子软包电池]: 5C快充"],"as":"该研究通过在硬碳负极表面构建聚合物诱导的固体电解质界面（SEI）层，实现5C倍率快充钠离子电池。含氟极性基团在硬碳界面富集阴离子，形成稳定且离子传导性高的SEI层，有效抑制电解液持续分解并促进钠离子快速脱嵌。该策略显著提升了硬碳负极的快充性能与循环稳定性，为高功率钠离子电池的工程化应用提供了可行的界面工程方案。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Polymer-induced solid electrolyte interphase on hard carbon enabling 5C fast-charging practical sodium-ion pouch cell","b":"Achieving 2F group attached has a powerful polar feature, which simultaneously induces anion enriched at the PolyHC interface and tailors extra F atoms, contributing to the architecture of a ∼5.0 nm stable SEI that hybridizes polymer and NaF. This SEI with a resilient polymer skeleton permanently holds the generated inorganic component, enabling long-term structural stability during fast-charging. The assembled 1.2 Ah pouch cell, paired with NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3O2 cathode and PolyHC anode, displays exceptional fast-charging capability and durability. This method is compatible with various HC, offering a novel perspective for modulating the HC interface chemistry."},{"t":"2025 年清洁能源技术的政策驱动因素","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00137-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源政策","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2,"r":3,"d":0,"t":2},"as":""},{"t":"气态巨行星的极涡动力学：二维能量级联的见解","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2500791123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The distinct polar vortex dynamics observed on Jupiter and Saturn may provide insights into their interiors. In this study, we examine how the number and structure of polar vortices vary with forcing strength, dissipation rate, and interior stratification using a 1.5-layer quasi-geostrophic model. This simplified setup enables a broad exploration of the parameter space, revealing that vortex characteristics are determined by the sequence in which three key length scales-the deformation radius [Formula: see text], the zonostrophic scale [Formula: see text], and the dissipative scale [Formula: see text]-are encountered as energy cascades from small to large scales. Four distinct vortex patterns are identified, including a vortex crystal resembling Jupiter's polar vortices and a single-vortex state akin to that of Saturn. The conditions under which these patterns emerge provide constraints on the stratification of Jupiter and Saturn."},{"t":"光热转换促进挑战性亲核芳香取代反应以实现便捷C-N键形成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522296?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热SNAr反应","kp":["[光热催化]: 光热转换促进亲核芳香取代","反应[SNAr]: 低活化底物C-N键构建"],"as":"利用光热转化策略促进传统方法难以实现的亲核芳香取代（SNAr）反应，实现便捷的C─N键构建。芳香C─N键在药物分子和功能材料中广泛存在，该光驱动方法为合成含氮芳烃化合物提供了温和高效的新途径。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photothermal Conversion Promotes Challenging SNAr for Facile C─N Bond Formation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Nucleophilic aromatic substitution (S\n                    N\n                    Ar) is a widely used method for forming aromatic C─N bonds, which are of interest in both industry and academia. However, current approaches are often unable to access less activated electrophiles, due to negative charge buildup in the transition state, resulting in high activation energy barriers. Inspired by our work on the Newman Kwart Rearrangement (NKR), we sought to leverage photothermal conversion for challenging C─N bond‐forming S\n                    N\n                    Ar reactions. Here, we demonstrate that the incorporation of an inexpensive photothermal agent, carbon black, and irradiation with red light affords several poorly activated intermolecular substitution reactions. Application to less activated aryl halides resulted in unproductive reactivity, leading us to examine the reaction barriers. Computations revealed barriers within the range previously achieved during our photothermally mediated NKR. Electronically neutral intramolecular analogs were synthesized and underwent productive reactivity in short time frames (≤20 min), indicating that the inhomogeneous nature of photothermal heating was a challenge in terms of colocalizing reactants sufficiently close to the particle. This concept was leveraged into a sequential S\n                    N\n                    Ar, where an initial intermolecular reaction occurs which then primes the substrate for a more difficult intramolecular substitution. This approach afforded a diverse scope of fused heterocycles."},{"t":"通过耦合三线态和激基复合物持久发射实现碳点的光激活时间演化余辉用于可编程应用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524898?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点余辉发光","kp":["材料[时间演化余辉]: 碳点-聚合物复合CDs@ABS","[光激活]: 双延迟发射可编程","[光子编码]: 三重态-激基复合物耦合发射"],"as":"开发了一种可光激活的碳点材料，通过耦合三重态机制实现随时间演变的余辉发光（TEAC）颜色调控。这类可编程延迟发射材料在动态防伪、信息加密和时间分辨成像等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photoactivatable Time‐Evolving Afterglow of Carbon Dots via Coupled Triplet and Exciplex Persistent Emission for Program","b":"Abstract\n                  Photoactivatable time‐evolving afterglow color (TEAC) materials offer programmable delayed emission for dynamic photonic applications. However, achieving light‐triggered and multistate afterglow control in metal‐free systems remains a formidable challenge. Here we report a carbon dot‐polymer composite (CDs@ABS) that exhibits dual photoactivatable delayed emissions with distinct lifetimes, generating reversible TEAC with optical memory. Upon brief UV exposure, the film shows no visible afterglow; prolonged irradiation activates a dynamic emission that evolves from red to orange, yellow, and finally green, with a memory duration of up to 40 min and excellent long‐term stability. In this architecture, electron‐rich CDs act as triplet emitters and donors, while the electron‐deficient, oxygen‐permeable ABS matrix serves as both acceptor and regulator of exciton dynamics. The coupled emissive channels originate from oxygen‐regulated red phosphorescence of CDs triplet excitons and green long‐persistent luminescence from donor–acceptor exciplexes, which is progressively enhanced by photoinduced charge accumulation and strengthened hydrogen bonding. Their cooperative interplay produces light‐triggered, reversible TEAC behavior. Leveraging this functionality, the CDs@ABS film enables programmable and multilevel photonic encryption and dynamic anti‐counterfeiting. This work presents a generalizable strategy for cost‐effective, metal‐free, photoactivatable afterglow systems, opening avenues toward next‐generation dynamic information security and spatiotemporal photonics."},{"t":"基于双色荧光开关效应的巴甫洛夫实验启发光学神经网络","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag029/8429779?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光光学神经网络","kp":["[训练框架]: 联想学习(类巴甫洛夫)训练光学神经网络","开关效应[荧光]: 双色荧光切换"],"as":"受巴甫洛夫条件反射实验启发，基于双色荧光构建了新型光学神经网络，摆脱了传统反向传播训练的高计算开销。该方案模拟生物联想学习机制，为低能耗、高效率的光学神经形态计算提供了新范式。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pavlov’s experiment-inspired optical neural networks based on dual-color fluorescence switching effect","b":"Cutting-edge optical neural networks are often still trained by backpropagation, which is computationally intensive and originally for conventional artificial neural networks. Inspired by Pavlov’s experiment, we drew upon the principles of biological memory to establish an associative learning framework for training optical neural networks that mimics the mechanisms of associative learning and synaptic plasticity using dual-wavelength stimuli (i.e. ultraviolet and visible light) on a dual-color photoinitiator resin. Sequential light irradiation was shown to induce fluorescence switching and encode associative memory in the resin, which can serve as a physical substrate for an optical neural network. In optical experiments, the established framework was applied to pattern recognition of the letters ‘N,’ ‘V,’ and ‘Z.’ Simulations were conducted that extended its application to the recognition of handwritten digits. Compared to the current mainstream ‘bottom-up’ optical neural network fabrication approach that requires ‘weight calculation followed by hardware implementation’, this work presents a novel ‘top-down’ in-situ training methodology that eliminates the need for weight computation. The proposed method holds significant implications for large-scale, low-cost, and rapid fabrication of optical neural networks intended for edge computing applications. This study bridges biological learning principles with optical neural networks to provide a foundation for next-generation adaptive and scalable artificial intelligence systems.","aip":1},{"t":"棕榈酸触发的 B7H3 棕榈酰化促进免疫逃逸","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68525-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Colorectal cancer responds poorly to immune checkpoint blockade in most patients with microsatellite-stable (MSS) tumors, highlighting the need for alternative targets. B7H3 (CD276) is an immune checkpoint protein that is frequently overexpressed in tumors, but how it is maintained at high protein levels is unclear. Here we show that palmitic acid (PA) promotes B7H3 palmitoylation by the palmitoyltransferase ZDHHC24 at cysteine 496. This modification prevents B7H3 from binding to sequestosome 1 (SQSTM1, also called p62), limiting autophagic degradation and stabilizing B7H3, which suppresses CD8+ T cell antitumor activity. Disrupting this pathway by mutating cysteine 496, or by deleting Zdhhc24 in a colitis-associated colorectal cancer (CAC) mouse model, enhances CD8+ T cell responses. We also develop a cell-penetrant peptide that blocks the ZDHHC24–B7H3 interaction, boosts antitumor immunity, and synergizes with blockade of programmed cell death protein 1 (PD-1). These findings identify B7H3 palmitoylation as a targetable metabolic–immune node for colorectal cancer immunotherapy."},{"t":"具有长寿命电荷分离态的有机晶体纳米颗粒用于高效光催化产氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02035-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制氢","kp":["催化剂[光催化产氢]: 受体-供体-受体有机晶态纳米颗粒","[电荷分离态]: 长寿命抑制复合","结构[纳米颗粒]: 自组装高度结晶"],"dp":1,"as":"针对光催化中电荷分离态寿命短导致能量转换效率受限的问题，研究者设计了一种有机晶体纳米颗粒，其内部形成的长寿命电荷分离态可显著延长光生载流子的存活时间。该材料通过分子堆叠策略优化给体-受体界面，使光诱导的电子-空穴分离态在室温下保持毫秒级以上寿命，为可见光驱动的太阳能燃料合成和水裂解反应提供了更高效的电荷利用途径。该突破有望推动全有机光催化体系在可再生能源存储中的实际应用。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Organic crystalline nanoparticles with a long-lived charge-separated state for efficient photocatalytic hydrogen product","b":"Photocatalysis offers a promising approach for renewable energy conversion and storage, but short lifetimes of charge-separated states in photocatalysts due to charge recombination limit its utility. Here we report an organic molecule with an acceptor–donor–acceptor configuration that can self assemble into highly crystalline nanoparticles. Transient absorption spectroscopy reveals that these crystalline assemblies can induce an ultra-long-lived charge-separated state of up to 1.2 s, attributed to initial symmetry-breaking charge separation, followed by charge hopping across closely packed molecules. These self-assembled nanoparticles have an impressive photocatalytic H2 evolution rate of 126 mmol g−1 h−1 with an external quantum efficiency of 12% at 550 nm under optimized conditions. This system shows a remarkable stability with 220 million turnover numbers (per particle) over the 77 h of operation. These findings suggest that rational design of organic molecules and their aggregates is vital for improving light-induced charge separation and for developing highly efficient, stable and scalable organic photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"基于欺骗等离子体斯格明子的深亚波长片上微波振荡器","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag028/8429801?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Exploring wave-matter interactions at extreme electromagnetic (EM) scales has long been a focal topic in multidisciplinary research, but deep-subwavelength field localization remains a persistent challenge. Here, we demonstrate an on-chip microwave oscillator with an electrical size of λ","tp":"微波振荡器件","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8,"i":4,"r":7,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"提出基于欺骗等离子体斯格明子（deception plasmonic skyrmion）的深亚波长片上微波振荡器设计。该器件电尺寸仅为波长的极小 fraction，突破了传统电磁器件在深亚波长场局域化方面的瓶颈。通过波-物质相互作用在极端电磁尺度下的调控，实现了新型片上微波源的紧凑化与高性能，对微波光子学和集成器件具有重要意义。","aip":1},{"t":"非典型遗传标记解决了地球历史上好氧细菌在GOE出现之前的问题","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515709123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The transition from anaerobic to aerobic life was a pivotal adaptation in Earth's history, yet the timing and genomic drivers remain poorly resolved. Traditional approaches relying on oxygen-utilizing genes need improvement for obligate anaerobes and fragmentary environmental genomes, where gene absence may reflect poor assembly rather than phenotype. We developed a machine learning model (GBDT40-LR) to predict microbial oxygen requirements using 40 broadly conserved genes, 35 without direct oxygen roles. This approach overcomes incompleteness biases in environmental genomes. Applied to 80,787 bacterial genomes [including metagenome-derived assemblies (MAGs)], the model classified 42,014 aerobes and 38,775 anaerobes, enabling large-scale ancestral reconstruction. Molecular clock dating indicates an emergence of aerobic bacterium prior to the Great Oxidation Event (GOE, 2.5 to 2.3 Ga), likely around ~2.7 Ga. Aerobic lineages subsequently diversified during the GOE and Neoproterozoic Oxygenation Event (NOE, 0.8 to 0.55 Ga), with persistent anaerobe diversity across Earth's oxygenation. This establishes that aerobic bacteria originated planetary oxygenation, potentially by 200 to 400 My, providing insights into phenotypic evolution and prolonged anaerobe-aerobe coexistence."},{"t":"对人类与深度学习推理过程对齐的深度质疑：评de Varda等人(2024)的研究","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533685123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"推理过程对齐","as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"No deep insights into the alignment between human and deep learning reasoning processes: Thoughts on de Varda et al. (20"},{"t":"氮导向Ti3C2Tx实现快速质子存储用于印刷平面微型赝电容器","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505587?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene质子储能","kp":["电极材料[微型赝电容]: 氮定向Ti3C2Tx MXene","[质子存储]: 端基被氮取代","器件[印刷平面微型]: 高功率密度可印刷"],"as":"研究通过氮元素定向调控 MXene（Ti3C2Tx）的表面化学环境，显著提升了其质子赝电容存储性能。氮掺杂优化了层间质子嵌入/脱出的动力学通道，实现了超高倍率下的快速充放电，同时保持优异循环稳定性。将该材料应用于印刷式平面微型超级电容器，器件展现出高面积电容与集成兼容性，为柔性可穿戴电子、物联网微型节点的片上储能提供了可直接印刷加工的高性能电极材料方案。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nitrogen‐Directed Ti3C2Tx Enabling Rapid Proton Storage for Printed in‐Plane Micro‐Pseudocapacitors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    MXene‐based proton pseudocapacitors are promising candidates for microscale electronic devices due to their superior portability and high‐power density, yet their advancement is constrained by the scarcity of efficient electrode materials. Herein, a nitrogen‐directed Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    x\n                    MXene with substitution of terminal functional groups by nitrogen is proposed as a high‐efficiency electrode material for proton pseudocapacitors. This strategy introduces multiple surface‐active sites and a new pathway for fast proton storage for achieving high specific capacitance. Impressively, a nitrogen‐directed proton storage mechanism is unraveled in the terminal N groups can preferentially interact with protons and lower the diffusion energy barrier toward adjacent active‐sites, substantially facilitating the storage of protons. As a result, the N300‐Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    x\n                    delivers excellent capacitance retention of 84.48% after 30,000 cycles at 2 A g\n                    −1\n                    . Furthermore, in‐plane proton pseudocapacitors are fabricated via direct ink writing, which shows great compatibility with various connection configurations, validating the superior potential in application feasibility of the N‐directed Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    x\n                    on proton storage.","aip":1},{"t":"纳米科学在光学计算中的核心地位","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02124-1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光学计算","as":"","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Nanoscience at the centre of optical computing"},{"t":"纳米颗粒介导的靶向嵌合体转化靶向蛋白质降解","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02081-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Recent findings indicate that nanoparticles (NPs) can mediate targeted protein degradation (TPD) with versatility and efficiency. Studies have shown that ligand-modified NPs can effectively degrade both extracellular and intracellular proteins of interest through an autolysosome-involved degradation pathway, independent of both NPs and ligand types. This phenomenon, where ligand-modified NPs shuttle proteins of interest towards degradation, may prompt researchers to rethink the design of ligand-NPs, incorporating TPD as an additional functionality beyond conventional delivery. Moreover, this approach has the potential to revolutionize the field of TPD by transitioning from labour-intensive, case-specific designs to a broadly adaptable ‘plug-and-play’ platform that makes full use of the in vivo delivery potential of NPs. This Perspective discusses the evolution of current TPD tools, the desired features of next-generation technologies, and the potential and challenges of NP-mediated targeting chimeras for TPD, highlighting emerging trends and raising awareness of this promising field.","tp":"纳米蛋白降解","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8,"i":4,"r":7,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"研究发现纳米颗粒可介导靶向蛋白质降解（TPD），且具有高度的通用性和效率。经配体修饰的纳米颗粒能通过自噬溶酶体途径有效降解胞外和胞内目标蛋白，该机制独立于纳米颗粒和配体类型。这一发现表明纳米颗粒可作为穿梭载体将目标蛋白递送至降解途径，有望启发靶向药物递送和蛋白质降解疗法的新设计思路。","aip":1},{"t":"多晶体X射线衍射(MCXRD)弥合化学与材料科学中的晶体学表征鸿沟","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523233?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多晶体X射线衍射","kp":["[方法]: 多晶体XRD组合部分数据集","应用[MOFs]: 小晶体/抗辐射损伤晶体学表征"],"as":"多晶体X射线衍射（MCXRD）技术旨在弥合单晶XRD与粉末XRD之间的晶体学表征鸿沟。传统单晶衍射对晶体尺寸要求严格且易受辐射损伤影响，粉末衍射则丢失大量结构信息。MCXRD通过对多个微小晶体进行联合数据采集与合并处理，可从亚微米级晶体中获取高质量衍射数据，有效克服单晶尺寸限制和辐射损伤问题。该方法在药物晶型分析、材料结构解析和膜蛋白结晶学等领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multi‐Crystal X‐Ray Diffraction (MCXRD) Bridges the Crystallographic Characterisation Gap in Chemistry and Materials Sci","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Structure determination by X‐ray diffraction is limited by crystal size and can be compromised by radiation damage when using very intense X‐ray radiation. X‐ray structure determination from partial diffraction data sets combined from multiple crystals is a potential solution, but its exploitation in chemistry and materials science is largely unrealized. Here we report the use of synchrotron radiation for multi‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (MCXRD) adapted for structure determination of metal‐organic framework (MOF) materials with crystal dimensions too small for conventional single‐crystal diffraction studies. We further show that radiation‐induced chemical changes and degradation of diffraction quality can be alleviated. Our approach encompasses both rotation‐ and stationary‐MCXRD measurements for 10 to 1000s of crystals with software‐optimized combination of the multiple data sets. We report the crystal structures of six MOFs: MOF‐919(Sc/Cu), MET‐2, MIL‐88B(Cr)‐1,4‐NDC, PCN‐260(Sc), UiO‐66, and UiO‐66‐MoO\n                    4\n                    with unit cell dimensions ranging from 18−114 Å and crystal sizes from 0.5−480 µm\n                    3\n                    . This approach can address the challenges of structure determination in a regime of particle size and sample radiation sensitivity that lies between existing single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and the emerging field of electron diffraction. MCXRD can provide accurate atomic‐resolution structure determination for some of the most challenging cases in chemistry and materials science."},{"t":"高效且机械稳健的柔性蓝色钙钛矿发光二极管的多功能界面分子桥","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521547?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿蓝光LED","kp":["[柔性蓝光钙钛矿LED]: 三氟乙酸根分子桥策略","[界面分子桥]: 提升电荷利用与机械耐久性"],"as":"金属卤化物钙钛矿在柔性光电器件中前景广阔，但界面缺陷和机械稳定性问题严重制约其商业化。该研究提出一种多功能界面分子桥策略，通过在钙钛矿活性层与电荷传输层之间构建定制化分子桥，同时实现缺陷钝化、能级对齐优化和界面应力分散。这种多重协同效应显著提升了柔性钙钛矿器件的光电转换效率和机械耐久性，为可穿戴电子、柔性显示和便携式能源设备的高性能化提供了重要技术路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multifunctional Interfacial Molecular Bridge for Highly Efficient and Mechanically Robust Flexible Blue Perovskite Light","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal halide perovskites have emerged as promising candidates for flexible optoelectronics, yet the development of efficient blue‐emitting devices remains hindered by low charge utilization and poor mechanical durability. Herein, we propose a multifunctional molecular bridging strategy using trifluoroacetate (TFA\n                    −\n                    )‐based molecule to construct efficient and mechanically robust flexible blue perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs). The TFA\n                    −\n                    bridge enhances interfacial adhesion and creates a stress‐redistributing network at the interface, effectively dissipating bending‐induced strain. Concurrently, this molecular bridge effectively modulates the crystallization of low‐dimensional perovskites through competitive coordination and hydrogen bond‐guided phase reorganization, facilitating efficient exciton confinement and energy transfer. The resulting flexible blue PeLEDs achieve an external quantum efficiency of 20.05% and outstanding bending durability, maintaining over 90% of their initial performance after 2000 cycles at a 5 mm radius. This work demonstrates the dual role of biomimetic molecular bridges in simultaneously stabilizing the bulk perovskite phase and the device interface, providing a generalizable route toward high‐performance and mechanically robust flexible optoelectronics."},{"t":"单体比例控制的吡啶氮富集调控碳纳米球p带中心用于高效锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515992?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化","kp":["[调控机制]: 单体比例控制吡啶氮富集调制p带中心","催化剂[锌空电池ORR]: 富吡啶氮碳纳米球(无金属)"],"as":"该研究聚焦氧还原反应（ORR）高效低成本催化剂的理性设计，提出通过调控单体比例实现碳基催化剂中吡啶氮的选择性富集，从而精确调制p带中心位置的策略。吡啶氮的定向掺杂可优化碳材料表面活性位点的电子结构，调控氧中间体的吸附能，使其接近ORR反应的火山型活性峰值。该方法无需贵金属铂即可实现与商业Pt/C相当的催化活性与稳定性，在燃料电池和金属-空气电池等清洁能源技术中具备广阔应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Monomer‐Ratio Controlled Pyridinic‐N Enrichment Modulating p‐Band Centers in Carbon Nanospheres for Efficient Zinc‐Air B","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rational design of high‐performance, low‐cost oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts is critical for advancing zinc‐air batteries (ZABs). This study proposed a closed‐loop paradigm integrating first‐principles active site identification, precursor‐ratio‐controlled synthesis, and device validation to develop superior metal‐free ORR electrocatalysts. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations identify pyridinic‐N as the optimal doping configuration, exhibiting the lowest energy barrier (0.17 eV) for the rate‐determining step (RDS, *O\n                    2\n                    → *OOH). Further electronic structure analyses revealed that this enhancement originates from pyridinic‐N‐induced upward shifts in the p‐band center of adjacent carbon atoms during the RDS, establishing this shift as a universal activity descriptor. Guided by these insights, aniline(A)/pyrrole(P) co‐polymerization with precise monomer molar ratio control yielded a series of N‐doped carbon materials (A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC). A\n                    0.5\n                    P\n                    0.5\n                    ‐NC achieved the highest pyridinic‐N content (38.91%), demonstrating exceptional ORR activity that surpasses other A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC variants and the benchmark 20 wt.% Pt/C. The optimized catalyst enabled transformative ZAB performance in liquid and flexible configurations, achieving enhanced open‐circuit voltage, superior power densities, high specific capacities, and prolonged durability compared to commercial 20 wt.% Pt/C. This work establishes a catalyst development paradigm bridging mechanistic understanding, controllable synthesis, and practical application for next‐generation energy storage devices.","aip":1},{"t":"不对称窄带隙受体的分子工程用于高性能半透明有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505706?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机太阳能电池","kp":["[分子设计]: 乙烯基π桥+端基卤化调控能级与形貌","应用[半透明OSC]: 兼顾近红外吸收与低电压损失"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过分子工程设计不对称窄带隙受体，在半透明有机太阳能电池中突破近红外光子吸收与高开路电压之间的固有权衡。不对称分子结构优化了分子堆积与能级排列，实现可见光透射与近红外 harvesting 的平衡，在保持较高光电转换效率的同时获得优异的可见光透过率，推动光伏建筑一体化应用。","ot":"Molecular Engineering of Asymmetric Narrow‐Gap Acceptors for High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Solar Cells and Mo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Overcoming the inherent trade‐off between near‐infrared photon harvesting and high open‐circuit voltage losses in bulk‐heterojunction blends is critical for advancing semi‐transparent organic solar cells (ST‐OSC). Herein, we present a molecular design that combines vinylene\n                    π\n                    ‐bridge incorporation and terminal‐group halogenation to tailor energy level alignment and blend morphology with PCE10 donor. These designed materials (eC9‐V‐2Cl(‐4Cl) and eC9‐DV‐2Cl) exhibit broadened NIR absorption (up to 1020 nm) and significantly reduce non‐radiative recombination voltage loss by a maximum of ∼100 mV compared to the standard PCE10:BTP‐eC9 device. The optimized PCE10:eC9‐V‐2Cl blend, processed from a green solvent in an inverted structure, achieves a remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 14.2% for opaque devices with a minimal voltage loss of ∼250 mV. Furthermore, a simply 1D double‐layered nano‐photoinc structure (LiF/MoO\n                    3\n                    ) as an optical out‐coupling layer was integrated into the ST‐OSC, delivering a PCE of 9.9% with an average visible transmittance (AVT) of 42.6%, and yielding a light utilization efficiency (LUE) of 4.3%. Scaling to 5 × 5 cm\n                    2\n                    ST‐OSC modules, an active‐area efficiency of ≈9% was reached with a remarkably high geometric fill factor of 96.5%. These findings provide new molecular design principles for high‐performance ST‐OSCs, making these devices highly attractive for sustainable and scalable applications like energy‐saving agrivoltaic systems and aesthetically transparent solar windows.","aip":1},{"t":"错误的身份和人类识别的心理","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00190-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"共轭分子双层中的金属电荷传输","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01553-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Metallic charge transport of field-induced carriers can be observed in single-crystal silicon over a wide temperature range. Such behaviour is rare in undoped organic semiconductors but is beneficial for engineering devices with advanced performance. Here we report metallic charge transport in conjugated molecular bilayers down to 8 K with an electrical conductivity of up to 245 S cm−1 and a Hall mobility larger than 100 cm2 V−1 s−1 at 20 K. We use molecular-crystal bilayers of the organic semiconductor 2-decyl-7-phenyl-[1]benzothieno[3,2-b][1]benzothiophene. We infer that this transport behaviour originates from the phenyl bridge coupling between the two molecular layers, which suppresses molecular vibrations and weakens Coulomb interactions. We develop a controlled method for introducing defects, using which we observe a disorder-driven metal–insulator transition in the molecular crystal.","tp":"有机半导体传输","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8,"i":3,"r":7,"d":8,"t":6},"as":"在共轭分子双层中实现了罕见的金属型电荷传输行为，低至8K温度下电导率高达245 S/cm，20K下霍尔迁移率超过100 cm²/V·s。利用有机半导体并五苯的分子晶体双层结构，场诱导载流子表现出金属态输运特征。该成果打破了未掺杂有机半导体难以实现金属输运的常规认知，为高性能有机电子器件设计开辟了新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"忆阻细胞神经网络用于快速像素内计算","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01555-3","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻像素内计算","kp":["[器件]: 忆阻器细胞神经网络","应用[像素内计算]: 图像视频快速并行模拟处理"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"提出基于忆阻器的细胞神经网络实现像素内快速计算架构。受生物视网膜启发的细胞神经网络结构结合忆阻器的非易失模拟存储能力，可在传感前端实现大规模并行的模拟信号处理。该架构将感算一体化，显著降低图像处理的延迟与数据搬运功耗，为边缘视觉计算与神经形态传感提供了新路径。","ot":"Memristive cellular neural networks for fast in-pixel computing","b":"Cellular neural networks, inspired in part by the biological retina, offer a potential route to massively parallel analogue computing. However, the hardware implementation of such systems remains challenging. Here we report memristor-based cellular neural networks for image and video processing applications. We develop a Python-based digital twin for network simulations and as a graphical user interface for controlling the fabricated hardware. Simulations using the digital twin illustrate the network’s capabilities in image processing and in solving partial differential equations. We build hardware through the tape-out of a transistor-based network and the fabrication of a circuit board with multilevel non-volatile memristors as the synapses. We show that the hardware can be used to run image processing tasks including edge and horizontal line detection.","aip":1},{"t":"机械化学：回顾与展望","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(25)00471-1?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","dp":1,"b":"Mechanochemistry, from the ancient mortar and pestle to modern ball milling, offers sustainable, solvent-free reactions with unique selectivity while reducing emissions and costs. This review traces its history; highlights time-resolved in situ monitoring and computational insights into mechanisms; explores synergies with heat, light, electricity, and sound; and discusses emerging applications in the origins of life, supramolecular intermediates guiding the formation of covalent bonds, and direct mechanocatalysis. Emphasizing upscaling and digital integration, it highlights the transformative potential of mechanochemistry for forming the next-generation sustainable chemical industry.","tp":"机械化学综述","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3,"i":3,"r":3,"d":3,"t":2},"as":"全面回顾了机械化学（mechanochemistry）从古代研磨到现代球磨技术的发展历程。该方法无需溶剂、选择性独特且能降低排放和成本，具备可持续性优势。综述涵盖时间分辨原位监测技术、计算机理研究、与热/光/电/声的协同效应，以及在生命起源、超分子中间体和直接合成等新兴方向的应用前景。"},{"t":"红树林恢复和沿海洪水适应：混合海岸防御潜力的全球视角","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2510980123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"To reduce current and future coastal flood risk, it is critical to better understand how adaptation measures, including nature-based solutions, can reduce that risk. Globally, hybrid coastal defenses, including a combination of coastal vegetation, such as salt marshes and mangroves, with a dike or sea wall, have been highlighted as a promising adaptation measure. Here, we present a global-scale assessment of the potential risk reduction from mangrove restoration in combination with foreshore dike systems under scenarios of climate and socioeconomic change. We provide a quantitative assessment of the benefits in terms of reduced economic damage, exposed population, and poverty exposure. We evaluate mangrove restoration fronting dikes by accounting for wave-vegetation interaction. If mangrove foreshore dike systems were established along coastlines susceptible to flooding, restoration could potentially reduce expected annual damage by US$800 million and reduce expected affected population by 140,000 annually. These values increase under future projections. Our benefit-cost analysis finds mangrove restoration economically viable for about half of the subnational regions assessed (85 to 105 out of 208). At the global scale, the benefit-cost ratio under future conditions ranges from 3 to 6, with a net present value between US$44 billion and US$125 billion. Because absolute risk values and benefit-cost analysis do not differentiate between relative wealth impacts, we also estimated restoration impacts across different wealth levels. We show that restoring mangroves disproportionately benefits people with lower incomes, as they are often more exposed to coastal flooding and located in areas suitable for mangrove restoration. As such, mangrove restoration in low- and middle-income countries could contribute to the resilience of people in poverty."},{"t":"磁性为氨氧化电催化剂增添新维度","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02058-6","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"观点评论","tp":"氨氧化电催化","as":"","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Magnetism adds a dimension to ammonia oxidation electrocatalysts"},{"t":"磁场引导催化效应缓解锂硫电池的Li2S钝化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag039/8429815?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池","kp":["[策略]: 磁场引导催化缓解Li2S钝化","关键障碍[锂硫电池]: 多硫化物穿梭+Li2S钝化"],"as":"锂硫电池因多硫化物穿梭和Li2S钝化问题严重限制其实用化。该研究提出磁场引导催化策略，利用外加磁场调控反应过程中间产物的迁移与沉积行为，有效缓解Li2S在锂负极表面的钝化积累。磁场引导促进多硫化物的定向转化，抑制穿梭效应，改善硫正极的氧化还原动力学和循环稳定性，为高能量密度锂硫电池的工程化突破提供了创新思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Magnetic field-guided catalytic effect mitigates Li2S passivation of lithium-sulfur batteries","b":"Polysulfides shuttle and Li2S passivation are considered key problems of lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, seriously hindering sulfur recycle for practical applications. However, the prevailing strategies introducing electrocatalysts focus mainly on polysulfides shuttle effect, whereas Li2S passivation involving solid conversions with high energy barriers has been seldomly studied and remains challenging. Herein, we propose that applying magnetic field (MF) to weak ferromagnetism α"},{"t":"面向实用化钠离子电池的低成本层状正极：科学挑战、解决策略与经济性分析","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钠电池层状正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 低成本层状氧化物(LOCMs)","目标[实用化]: 经济性挑战与解决策略综述"],"as":"钠离子电池因钠资源丰富、成本低廉被视为大规模储能的重要候选技术，其中层状氧化物正极材料因其结构可调性备受关注。该综述系统梳理了低成本层状正极材料迈向实用化的科学挑战与工程瓶颈，涵盖相变行为、空气稳定性、循环衰减机制等核心问题，并从元素掺杂、表面改性和结构设计等维度分析了提升策略，为钠离子电池的商业化路径提供了全面评估。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Low‐Cost Layered Cathodes Toward Practical Sodium‐Ion Batteries: Scientific Challenges, Resolution Strategies, and Econo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) are the most widely used commercial rechargeable batteries, but the stable supply of key raw materials such as lithium, nickel, and cobalt faces challenges. Sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are considered as potential alternatives and complements to LIBs due to similar working principles and the abundance of sodium resources. Layered oxide cathode materials (LOCMs) are recognized as one of the most promising practical cathodes for SIBs because of mature synthesis technology and satisfactory energy density. However, the use of nickel in LOCMs for SIBs has raised concerns about environmental pollution during nickel production and the risk of price volatility stemming from the widespread application of high‐nickel LOCMs for LIBs. Therefore, developing low‐cost nickel‐free LOCMs is crucial for enhancing the environmental friendliness and cost advantages of SIBs. For low‐cost LOCMs, this review discusses the feasibility of replacing Ni\n                    2+\n                    /Ni\n                    4+\n                    with Fe\n                    3+\n                    /Fe\n                    4+\n                    and Mn\n                    3+\n                    /Mn\n                    4+\n                    for charge compensation in SIBs, and summarizes the resulting critical scientific challenges (Fe migration, Mn dissolution, Jahn‐Teller effect, Na deficiency, and thermal instability). Economic efficiency assessment based on cost and electrochemical properties indicates that low‐cost LOCMs exhibit the highest cost‐performance ratio. Finally, to accelerate the commercialization of cost‐effective SIBs technologies, this review outlines promising development pathways of low‐cost LOCMs."},{"t":"液态镓的低温快速光热氧化用于循环制氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68664-1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液镓光热制氢","kp":["制氢[液态镓光热氧化]: 淡水/海水均可","[低温快速]: 光热驱动循环产氢","[循环产氢]: 镓氧化还原闭环"],"dp":1,"as":"氢能作为清洁能源载体前景广阔，但现有制氢工艺面临能耗高、碳排放大等问题。该研究提出一种基于液态镓的光热氧化新路径，在低温条件下快速实现镓的氧化-还原循环以持续产氢。液态镓兼具催化介质和循环载体的双重角色，光热效应驱动氧化反应在温和条件下高效进行，具备可逆循环特性，为绿色氢气的分布式低成本生产提供了全新思路。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Low temperature and rapid photothermal oxidation of liquid gallium for circular hydrogen production","b":"Hydrogen is a clean energy carrier with significant promises for a sustainable future, yet many established production routes operate under undesirable conditions or constraints, motivating the search for alternative production pathways. Here, our approach uses photothermal oxidation of liquid gallium to generate hydrogen from both freshwater and seawater. The exposure to light thermally heats up liquid gallium droplets to a temperature suitable for fast gallium-water interaction, producing gallium oxyhydroxide and hydrogen. The light exposure also boosts the reaction by breaking the oxide layer on the surface of liquid gallium immersed in water, allowing continuous interactions between the water molecules and the surface of liquid gallium droplets. The gallium oxyhydroxide that is produced can be electrochemically reduced, allowing metal regeneration, thereby enabling circular hydrogen production. In this work, we show that photothermal activation of liquid gallium provides a rapid and circular route for generating hydrogen from diverse water sources."},{"t":"向后看和向前看","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00140-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"体内长程化学信号由机械信号调节","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02463-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Biological processes are regulated by chemical and mechanical signals, yet how these signalling modalities interact remains poorly understood. Here we identify a crosstalk between tissue stiffness and long-range chemical signalling in the developing Xenopus laevis brain. Targeted knockdown of the mechanosensitive ion channel Piezo1 in retinal ganglion cells or in the brain tissue surrounding retinal ganglion cells causes pathfinding errors in vivo. In the brain parenchyma, Piezo1 downregulation decreases the expression of the diffusive long-range chemical guidance cues Semaphorin3A (Sema3A) and Slit1, which instruct turning responses in distant cells. Furthermore, Piezo1 knockdown results in tissue softening due to reduced expression of the adhesion proteins NCAM1 and N-cadherin. Targeted depletion of NCAM1 and N-cadherin similarly reduces tissue stiffness and Sema3A expression. Conversely, increasing environmental stiffness ex vivo enhances tissue-level force generation and Slit1 and Sema3A expression. Finally, in vivo stiffening of soft brain regions induces ectopic Sema3A production via a Piezo1-dependent mechanism. Overall, these findings demonstrate that tissue mechanics locally modulates the availability of diffusive, long-range chemical signals, thus influencing cell function at sites distant from the mechanical cue."},{"t":"局部酸性微环境增强孤立Pd位点的阳极甲酰胺电合成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521334?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲酰胺电合成","kp":["催化剂[甲酰胺电合成]: 孤立Pd单原子位点","[局部酸性微环境]: 增强中间体亲电性","反应[常温]: 甲醇与氨C-N氧化偶联"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过孤立Pd位点催化剂构建局部酸性微环境，增强阳极甲酰胺电合成反应。电催化甲醇与氨的C-N氧化偶联可在温和条件下实现可持续甲酰胺合成，局部酸性微环境的调控策略显著提升了孤立金属位点的催化效率。","ot":"Local Acidic Microenvironments Enhanced Anodic Formamide Electrosynthesis over Isolated Pd Sites","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic C─N oxidative coupling of methanol and ammonia enables sustainable formamide synthesis under ambient conditions. However, the poor C─N coupling selectivity and limited Faradaic efficiency hinder practical application. As the critical step involves nucleophilic attack of NH\n                    3\n                    on in situ generated *CH\n                    2\n                    O intermediates, enhancing *CH\n                    2\n                    O electrophilicity while suppressing over‐oxidation is essential. Herein, Pd single atoms anchored on MnO\n                    2\n                    nanoarrays achieve state‐of‐the‐art Faradaic efficiency (62.6%) and carbon selectivity (80.2%) for anodic formamide synthesis. In situ characterization and theoretical simulations reveal dual enhancement mechanisms: Isolated Pd sites adopt end‐on *CH\n                    2\n                    O adsorption to expose the electrophilic carbon, while the MnO\n                    2\n                    ‐induced acidic microenvironment enhances *CH\n                    2\n                    O electrophilicity via oxygen‐atom protonation. This synergy accelerates nucleophilic attack by NH\n                    3\n                    , enabling efficient C─N coupling.","aip":1},{"t":"锂金属介导的全氟烷基和多氟烷基物质的电化学还原","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02057-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Per- and poly-fluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) have substantial environmental and health hazards. Unfortunately, current degradation routes require high temperatures or corrosive conditions and/or lead to incomplete defluorination and the generation of shorter alkyl chains. Inspired by the lithium-metal battery literature, here we develop an electrochemical degradation process that leverages reactive metals and highly reducing environments. We show that electrodeposited lithium metal can enable 95% degradation and 94% defluorination of perfluorooctanoic acid to LiF without forming any shorter C2–C6 PFAS as end products. Using computational simulations, we find that electron transfer from lithium to perfluorooctanoic acid leads to rapid C–F bond cleavage, fluoride formation and carbon chain fragmentation. We expand the scope to other PFAS compounds and demonstrate substantial degrees of degradation on over 22 different PFAS, plus complete mineralization to inorganic fluorides. Finally, we use the mineralized F− as a fluorine source for the synthesis of fluorinated non-PFAS compounds to complete a circular fluorine loop from waste to valuable product.","tp":"PFAS电化学降解","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8,"i":5,"r":6,"d":7,"t":6},"as":"受锂金属电池研究启发，开发了一种电化学降解全氟和多氟烷基物质（PFAS）的新工艺。利用电沉积锂金属产生的强还原环境，实现了95%以上的脱氟效率。该方法克服了传统PFAS降解需高温或腐蚀性条件且脱氟不完全的问题，为持久性有机污染物的环境修复提供了高效、温和的解决方案。","aip":1},{"t":"光技术有望降低AI的能耗","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02099-5","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"光计算降功耗","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"","ot":"Light could lower AI’s appetite for power","aip":1},{"t":"配体的LolCDE结构揭示了引导细菌脂蛋白转运的共同底物-LolE相互作用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520579123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial lipoproteins are key structural components of the outer membrane in Gram-negative bacteria and vital components of machineries required for its biosynthesis and maintenance. The Lol system, essential for viability, directs transport of lipoproteins from the site of biosynthesis on the inner membrane to the outer membrane and has been the target of extensive efforts to develop novel antimicrobial drugs. In the first stage of this transport process, newly synthesized lipoproteins are released from the inner membrane by the ABC transporter LolCDE and passed to the periplasmic chaperone, LolA. Here, we show cryo-EM structures of LolCDE in complex with three different lipoprotein substrates, Lpp, Pal, and LolB, with the latter two bearing a disordered peptide linker between the acyl chains and the globular domain. Our work reveals that when the mature lipoprotein lacks an unstructured linker, the N-terminal portion of the protein is in an unfolded state for transport. The lipoproteins make a sequence-independent but structurally conserved interaction with a cleft on the surface of the periplasmic domain of LolE that promotes efficient transport. We propose a model of lipoprotein export where this interaction acts as pivot point for the peptide portion of the lipoprotein allowing the acyl chains to rotate 180° from their initial position in LolCDE to their binding site in LolA. Our results demonstrate how LolCDE can extrude lipoproteins of diverse sequence and structure and reveal an important detail of a transport process fundamental to bacterial physiology.","tp":"脂蛋白转运结构","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"细菌脂蛋白是革兰氏阴性菌外膜的关键结构成分，对其生存至关重要。Lol系统负责将脂蛋白从内膜合成部位运送至外膜，是开发新型抗菌药物的重要靶点。最新研究揭示了LolCDE复合物的结构，阐明了在脂蛋白转运的初始阶段，通过共同的底蛋白-LolE相互作用来引导细菌脂蛋白跨膜转运的分子机制，为针对该系统开发新型抗生素提供了重要的结构生物学基础。"},{"t":"配位场调控实现水系锌离子电池的高能效正极","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07175E","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配位场正极","kp":["[水系锌离子电池]: 配体场调控正极提升能效","正极[ZIB]: 抑制电压衰减与极化"],"dp":1,"as":"水系锌离子电池因高安全性和低成本被视为大规模储能的有力候选，但其正极材料常受限于能量效率不足。该研究通过配体场调控策略优化正极活性材料的电子结构，抑制副反应并提升锌离子可逆嵌入脱出，实现高能效水系锌电池正极设计，为长寿命、高性价比储能系统提供了新的材料工程范式。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ligand-field regulation enables high energy-efficiency cathodes for aqueous zinc-ion batteries","b":"Aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (ZIBs) are promising candidates for large‐scale energy storage owing to their high safety, low cost, and environmental friendliness. However, the practical application of ZIBs remains challenged by low energy density and energy efficiency owing to the rapid capacity fading and voltage decay, large voltage polarization, and sluggish reaction kinetics. In this work, we introduce a ligand-field engineering strategy that couples pre-intercalated ions interaction with octahedral defects to inhibit energy loss in layered hydrated vanadium pentoxide (V2O5·nH2O, VOH) cathodes. Comprehensive experimental analyses reveal that the introduction of pre-intercalated ions and oxygen vacancies induces [VO6] octahedral distortion and V-O bond elongation, thereby tailoring the ligand field and lowering the V 3d orbital energy level. This structure modulation effectively narrows the voltage hysteresis, stabilizes the voltage plateau and enhances the energy efficiency. In addition, this ligand-engineering strategy in enhancing energy efficiency can be extended to low-temperature conditions and other similar systems. As a result, the Ov-Zn-VOH cathode delivers a high discharge capacity (536 mAh g−1 at 0.1 A g−1) coupled with high energy efficiency (86%) and an energy efficiency retention of 94% after 3000 cycles at 4 A g−1.","aip":1},{"t":"精简多智能体深度强化学习用于网络化微电网能量管理中的不确定性处理","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000061?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网能量管理","as":"","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lean multi-agent deep reinforcement learning for uncertainty handling in the energy management of networked microgrids","cl":"6f56c079","cln":"微电网能量管理","cp":0},{"t":"2025年钙钛矿太阳能电池关键进展","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00128-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿光伏","as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Key advances in perovskite solar cells in 2025"},{"t":"多模态纳米流体器件中离子种类可编程突触可塑性","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag036/8429804?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体突触器件","kp":["[突触可塑性]: 离子种类可编程调控","[离子传输]: 非线性离子传输与选择性","[关键问题]: 离子传输行为与容性/感性迟滞转变关联不明"],"as":"该研究利用纳米流体器件中离子种类的可编程性实现突触可塑性模拟，通过调控不同离子在纳米通道中的输运行为，构建多模态神经形态计算单元。这种基于离子而非电子的仿生突触为类脑计算提供了全新硬件范式，在低功耗信息处理和生物传感领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Ionic species programmable synaptic plasticity in multimodal nanofluidic devices","b":"Nanofluidic devices have been widely utilized to simulate the electronic functionalities recently, since their unique ion transport behaviors, such as nonlinear ion transport, selectivity and so on. However, the correlation of the ion transport behavior and the transition among various nanofluidic capacitive and inductive hysteresis still remains unclear, which impedes the development of nanofluidic systems. Here, we report a concentration-dependent transition between capacitive and inductive hysteresis in gold-nanoparticle-stacked nanochannels. Quantitative analysis reveals this transition is governed by the interionic distance relative to the Bjerrum length, establishing a universal mechanism for ion transport modulation. Notably, our system enables unidirectional plasticity (both facilitation and depression) by simply altering the ionic species, demonstrating programmable plasticity without structural reconfiguration. Additionally, a high-pass filter (HPF) circuit with tunable cut-off frequency is implemented through two identical nanofluidic devices. These findings establish a new paradigm for multifunctional nanofluidic devices and provide a rational foundation for the design of aqueous-phase neuromorphic computing circuits."},{"t":"用于可持续渗透能发电的离子选择性石墨烯纳米网膜","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag026/8431501?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"石墨烯渗透发电","kp":["[渗透能发电]: 石墨烯纳米网离子选择膜","膜材料[二维膜]: 原子级薄纳米多孔低阻"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队开发了离子选择性石墨烯纳米网状膜，用于可持续渗透能发电。该原子级厚度的二维膜具有最短的离子传输路径和极低的离子传输阻力，通过精确控制纳米孔尺寸实现离子的选择性透过，可将盐度梯度（如海水与淡水混合）中的化学能高效转化为电能。该技术在蓝色能源（渗透能）领域具有重要应用前景，为清洁能源开辟了新路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ion-selective graphene nanomesh membrane for sustainable osmotic power generation","b":"The atomically thin two-dimensional (2D) membranes with minimum ion transport pathways and low ion transport resistance are ideally suited for constructing ion-selective membranes for electric power generation, and have attracted considerable recent interest. However, the practical applications of such 2D membranes for electric power generation have been severely limited due to the lack of nanoporous 2D membranes with narrow distributed nanopore arrays and sufficient charge density. Here, we report a centimeter-scale ultrathin graphene nanomesh membrane with narrow pore size distribution (∼1.5 nm), rich carboxylic groups (GNM-COO‒) for efficient osmotic power generation. The high-density nanometer pores anchored by negatively charged carboxylic groups allow efficient transport of K+ while selectively blocking Cl–. We show that the GNM-COO‒ membrane with asymmetric charge structure exhibits a diode-like ionic rectification property and facilitates the directional ion transport. When employed as an ion-selective membrane for osmotic power generation, the designed GNM-COO‒ membrane delivers an exceptionally large output power density (175.1 W m–2) at a 50-fold salinity gradient, and retains a stable power generation performance for 2 months. This work provides a strategy to develop high performance ion-selective membranes for the sustainable harnessing of blue clean energy.","aip":1},{"t":"界面自由基反应实现钾离子电池高性能石墨负极","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523259?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钾电池石墨负极","kp":["负极[钾离子电池]: 界面自由基反应稳定石墨","[SEI工程]: 抑制K+-溶剂共嵌入"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种界面自由基反应策略，显著提升石墨石负极在钾离子电池中的可逆钾插层性能。钾离子电池因钾资源储量丰富、成本低廉被视为锂离子电池的潜在替代方案，但石墨负极的钾插层化学面临体积膨胀大、动力学缓慢等挑战。通过界面自由基反应调控电极-电解质界面，有效改善了循环稳定性和倍率性能，推动了钾离子电池的工程化发展。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Radical Reaction Enables High‐Performance Graphite Anode for Potassium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The reversible K‐intercalation chemistry in graphite anode plays a critical role in advancing the development of potassium‐ion batteries (PIBs) for large‐scale energy storage systems. However, the poor stability of natural solid electrolyte interface (SEI) on graphite anode as well as the co‐intercalation of K\n                    +\n                    ‐solvent into graphite has caused poor cycling stability and sluggish reaction kinetics. Herein, a mechanochemical‐induced radical reaction between graphite and open‐shell Spiro‐O8 radicals has been discovered and applied to construct a uniform organic layer on graphite, in which the phenoxy radicals can efficiently facilitate the decomposition of KFSI salt to generate outer inorganic‐rich layer when the graphite was evaluated as anode for PIBs. The outer inorganic film can enhance K\n                    +\n                    transport kinetics and inhibit the co‐intercalation of K\n                    +\n                    ‐solvent, while the inner Spiro‐O8 film can effectively accommodate the volume change during the cycling process. As a result, the highly ion‐conductive Spiro‐O8 modified graphite exhibited reversible capacity of 241.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    , high‐rate capability (147.2 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    ) and stable cycles more than 600 cycles with a capacity retention of 89.4 %. The interfacial radical reaction in our work provides a new avenue to solve the interface problems of graphite anode for high‐performance PIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"深入了解锆基金属有机凝胶的受控形成：将宏观性质与分子信息联系起来","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Understanding and controlling the formation mechanisms of metal–organic gels is crucial for their rational design with well‐defined properties for diverse applications. However, rapid methodologies enabling atomic‐resolution structural characterization of gel formation are still largely lacking. Here, we report for the first time the molecular‐level characterization of the in‐situ formation of a Zr‐based metal–organic gel by monitoring solvent structuration during gelation using solvent‐observed nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy. UiO‐66‐type gels were optimized under mild conditions, i.e., 40 °C and in the absence of acidic modulators, providing a biocompatible environment suitable for the in‐situ encapsulation of sensitive biomolecules during gelation. The combined analysis of saturation transfer difference and spin diffusion transfer difference NMR growth curves enabled real time monitoring of nucleation and gelation stages, revealing an excellent correlation between the progressive structuration of water within the gel network and the resulting macroscopic properties. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this NMR approach allows tracking of the in‐situ encapsulation of therapeutic biomolecules within the gel, exemplified by a glycolipid with anti‐inflammatory properties.","tp":"金属有机凝胶","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"首次在分子层面原位表征了锆基金属有机凝胶（MOG）的形成过程，通过监测凝胶化过程中的溶剂结构化实现了原子分辨率的结构追踪。该研究将凝胶的宏观性质与分子级信息直接关联，为金属有机凝胶的可控形成和理性设计提供了关键机理认识，填补了快速原位结构表征方法的空白。"},{"t":"与植物性饮食转变相关的农药使用增加和生态毒性影响","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(25)00396-3?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"本期","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/iti0326123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"在 3D 打印支架中原位生成树突状细胞疫苗，用于癌症术后治疗","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag037/8431493?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Dendritic cell (DC) vaccines have shown great promise in cancer management, while complex ex vivo"},{"t":"对扭曲双层 MoTe2 中的莫尔平带和维格纳分子晶体进行成像","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag014/8431414?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Twisted bilayer MoTe2 (tMoTe2) has recently emerged as an exceptional platform for realizing strongly correlated and topological quantum phases. Yet, its microscopic electronic structure remains largely unexplored. Here, we use scanning tunneling microscopy/spectroscopy (STM/STS) to directly image the moiré flat bands in dual-gated tMoTe2 devices with twist angles of 2.3°–3.8°. A dual-gate design allows independent tuning of band filling and displacement field, enabling detailed spectroscopic mapping. We find that the low-energy flat bands are localized at MX and XM sites and form a topological honeycomb lattice at zero electric field. An applied electric field lifts the layer degeneracy, driving a transition to two decoupled triangular lattices with trivial topology. Our results match first-principles calculations, revealing K-valley hybridization as the microscopic origin. At large moiré potential, we observe Wigner molecular crystals forming a Kagome lattice at filling ν","tp":"莫尔平带成像","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用扫描隧道显微镜/谱（STM/STS）首次直接成像了扭曲双层MoTe₂（tMoTe₂）中的莫尔平带。在2.3°–3.8°扭曲角的双栅控器件中，通过独立调节能带填充和位移场，观测到平带及维格纳分子晶体的形成。该工作为理解莫尔体系中强关联和拓扑量子相的微观电子结构提供了直接实验证据。","aip":1},{"t":"人类引起的生物圈碳汇：塔克拉玛干造林项目的影响","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523388123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Taklamakan Desert, one of the world's largest and driest deserts, has traditionally been considered a biological void. Here, we demonstrate that large-scale ecological restoration is transforming this hyperarid environment into a carbon sink. By analyzing satellite and ground-based data, we find strong seasonal dynamics: During the wet season (Jul to Sep), precipitation increases to 16.3 mm/mo, enhancing vegetation coverage and photosynthetic activity and drawing down atmospheric CO2 by approximately three parts per million (ppm) relative to the dry-season levels. Long-term trends reveal significant increases in vegetation cover (6.8 × 10-4/y) and photosynthetic activity (6.1 × 10-3 W/m2/sr/µm/y), accompanied by a strengthening net CO2 uptake (NEE trend: -5.2 × 10-12 kg/m2/s/y). These changes are spatially concentrated along the desert margins and their timing aligns with implementation of China's Three-North Shelterbelt Program. Our results provide the direct evidence that human-led intervention can effectively enhance carbon sequestration in even the most extreme arid landscapes, demonstrating the potential to transform a desert into a carbon sink and halt desertification. This underscores the critical role of dryland restoration in global carbon management strategies and highlights the Taklamakan Desert as a model for climate change mitigation through nature-based solutions and ecological engineering.","tp":"沙漠造林碳汇","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究表明塔克拉玛干沙漠大规模生态修复正将该超干旱环境转变为碳汇。卫星和地面数据显示显著的季节动态：湿季（7-9月）降水增至16.3 mm/月，植被覆盖和光合活性增强，大气CO₂显著下降。该发现颠覆了塔克拉玛干为生物荒漠的传统认知，证实了人为造林对区域碳循环的实质性影响。"},{"t":"人类行为塑造了后院鸟类的喙","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535458123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"您实际上需要多少蛋白质？","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00151-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"森林汇有多少是被动的？美国案例","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513588123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Over time, carbon sequestered in temperate forests has increased, but the relative effects of passive and active drivers remain unclear. This study uses plot-level data to disentangle the contributions of six drivers (temperature, precipitation, CO2, management, age composition, and area) to these increases in 14 forest groups of the conterminous United States. From 2005 to 2022, the passive drivers (CO2, temperature, and precipitation) increased live tree carbon (C) by 66 teragrams (Tg) C y-1 with CO2 fertilization contributing most of the change. Among the anthropogenic drivers, declining forest area reduced live tree C by 31 Tg C y-1 while tree planting increased it by 23 Tg C y-1. Changes in age composition, driven by both passive traits and anthropogenic choices, increased live tree C by 89 Tg C y-1. By quantifying the share of removals attributable to passive uptake, this approach enables nations with national forest inventories to better utilize their forests to meet net-zero requirements.","tp":"森林碳汇驱动","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"利用样地数据量化了美国本土14个森林类型中被动与主动驱动因素对碳汇的贡献。2005-2022年间，被动因素（CO₂施肥、温度、降水）使活立木碳增加66 Tg C/年，而主动因素（经营管理、林龄构成、面积变化）贡献与之相当。研究强调了区分两类因素对预测未来森林碳汇变化和制定管理策略的重要性。"},{"t":"多长才算足够长呢？气候变化中典型气象年选择的最佳年跨度","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000280?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"气象年选择","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"颗粒尺寸如何影响Li6PS5Cl快离子导体的致密化行为、应变与性能","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505186?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质致密化","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: Li6PS5Cl硫化物","[致密化]: 粒径分布影响压实行为"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究系统考察Li6PS5Cl（硫化物固态电解质）颗粒尺寸对固态电池制造过程中致密化行为、应变响应及电化学性能的影响。固态电池的关键制造环节是固态电解质的致密化，颗粒尺寸直接决定烧结收缩、界面接触及离子电导率。研究揭示细颗粒可降低致密化温度、改善电极-电解质界面，但过细颗粒可能引发团聚和加工困难。优化粒径分布是兼顾循环性能与工程量产的核心路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"How Particle Size Affects Consolidation Behavior, Strain and Properties of Li6PS5Cl Fast Ionic Conductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solid‐state battery fabrication requires the densification of solid electrolytes to achieve optimal cycling performance and high energy density. However, the underlying compaction mechanisms of these electrolytes remain poorly understood. Here, we investigate the effect of pressure consolidation on the ionic conductor Li\n                    6\n                    PS\n                    5\n                    Cl with particle size distributions (PSD) ranging from 4 to 40 µm. Heckel analysis reveals that samples with smaller PSDs exhibit higher compressibility at lower pressures. X‐ray diffraction peak profiling shows that applied pressure induces lattice strain, leading to peak broadening, while pair distribution function analysis demonstrates a reduction in coherence length upon pressing. Dark‐field X‐ray microscopy further provides spatially resolved orientation maps, uncovering intragranular structural variations within individual Li\n                    6\n                    PS\n                    5\n                    Cl agglomerates after compression. To better understand the origin of stress fluctuations, we performed discrete element method simulations using the experimental PSDs. The results indicate that smaller particles and broader PSDs experience higher stresses, whereas monodisperse systems do not exhibit significant stress fluctuations with position or particle size. This suggests that the high strain observed cannot be attributed solely to smaller particles, but rather to size inhomogeneity. Overall, these findings highlight that both particle size and its distribution play a critical role in processing solid electrolytes for solid‐state batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"主客体掺杂实现三芳基硼的室温磷光发射","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524578?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三芳基硼室温磷光","kp":["[主客体掺杂]: 三芳基硼实现室温磷光","机制修正[RTP]: 纯晶体无RTP,主客体体系有效"],"as":"该研究重新审视三芳基硼化合物（triarylboranes）的室温磷光（RTP）现象，发现纯结晶态三芳基硼本身并不发射磷光，此前观察到的RTP实际源于主客体掺杂效应。通过将三芳基硼作为客体掺杂至特定主体晶格中，利用主体刚性微环境抑制非辐射跃迁，成功实现高效的室温磷光发射。该发现为设计无金属纯有机RTP材料提供了新策略，在防伪、传感和生物成像等领域具应用潜力。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Host‐Guest Doping Enables Room Temperature Phosphorescence from Triarylboranes","b":"Abstract\n                  Revisiting our previous report of RTP in triarylboranes, we found that pure crystalline triarylboranes do not exhibit RTP as initially reported, although all but one purified compound shows RTP in annealed PMMA matrices. Inspired by the impurity responsible for the previously observed RTP, we designed a family of binary host–guest RTP systems constructed by pairing distinct triarylboranes. By tuning the host and guest structures and doping ratios, afterglow visible to the naked eye for up to 8 s can be achieved in crystalline materials under ambient conditions, at doping levels as low as one part per billion. The ultra‐long afterglow makes these materials promising for information encryption, while their high sensitivity to oxygen in non‐annealed PMMA films highlights their potential for sensing applications. Trends in the phosphorescence intensities and lifetimes, dependent on guest molecular structure, are rationalized by computed triplet‐triplet energy transfer rates between the hosts and guests, providing a concrete design strategy for optimizing host‐guest RTP. Overall, this work underscores the critical importance of material purity and advances understanding of the host‐guest interactions governing efficient organic RTP."},{"t":"通过连续官能团迁移实现未活化烯烃的同系自由基 1,3-二碳官能化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525903?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Despite significant advances in conventional radical‐mediated 1,2‐difunctionalization of alkenes over the past decade, homologative 1,3‐difunctionalization remains largely underdeveloped. Herein, we report a novel photoinduced homologative 1,3‐dicarbofunctionalization of unactivated alkenes via one‐carbon chain elongation, achieved through sequential functional group migrations. By employing strategically designed tertiary alcohols and heteroarylsulfones as versatile coupling partners, this method affords structurally diverse, densely substituted aliphatic ketones and medium‐sized cyclic scaffolds with exclusive chemo‐ and regioselectivity. The transformation accommodates a broad range of migrating groups, including various heteroaryl, phenyl, and alkenyl motifs, and exhibits excellent functional group tolerance.","tp":"烯烃双官能化","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"尽管传统自由基介导的烯烃1,2-双官能化反应在过去十年取得显著进展，但同系1,3-双官能化反应仍存在较大技术空白。该研究报道了一种新型光诱导未活化烯烃的同系1,3-双碳官能化反应。该反应通过一碳链延长和连续官能团迁移机制实现。研究人员采用特殊设计的叔醇和杂芳基砜作为通用反应试剂，成功突破了合成限制，为复杂碳骨架构建提供了高效新方法。"},{"t":"二维钙钛矿中希格斯模式驱动的相变","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02472-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿相变","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"非均相光催化醛类烷基化胺化用于α-支链胺的多组分合成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag020/8429807?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化胺化反应","kp":["[光催化]: 醛的烷基化胺化多组分合成","产物[α-支链胺]: 多组分合成"],"as":"研究探讨了非均相光催化醛类烷基化胺化反应，用于多组分合成α-支链胺类化合物。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Heterogeneous photocatalytic aldehyde alkylative amination for multicomponent synthesis of α-branched amines","b":"α"},{"t":"利用温度介导的应变管理实现钠离子电池超稳定氧化物正极","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池氧化物正极","kp":["[应变管理]: 温度介导抑制O3相变致晶格畸变与颗粒开裂","正极材料[钠离子电池]: O3相层状过渡金属氧化物"],"as":"该研究提出了一种基于温度调控应变管理策略，以实现钠离子电池氧化物正极材料的超稳定循环。钠离子电池因钠资源丰富、成本低廉，被视为大规模储能领域极具前景的方案，但氧化物正极在充放电过程中面临的晶格应变积累和结构退化问题严重制约了其循环寿命。研究者通过精确控制合成温度来优化材料内部残余应变，有效缓解了体积变化引起的结构损伤，显著提升了电极材料的结构完整性和电化学可逆性，为钠离子电池迈向商业化提供了关键工程化思路。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Harnessing Temperature‐Mediated Strain Management to Realize Ultra‐Stable Oxide Cathodes in Na‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sodium (Na)‐ion batteries (NIBs) are emerging as a promising solution for large scale energy storage applications. Among various cathode chemistries, O3‐phase layered transition‐metal oxides stand out for their high energy density, yet their practical deployment is restricted by intricate phase transitions that induce lattice distortion, stress accumulation, and particle cracking, leading to rapid performance degradation. Here, we propose a temperature‐mediated strain‐management strategy to improve the phase reversibility and structural stability of O3‐phase oxide cathodes. Comprehensive structural and dynamic analyses reveal that optimal thermal regulation facilitates lattice strain release, mitigates detrimental stress accumulation that drives irreversible phase transitions, and accelerates Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion kinetics. As a result, structural degradation, transition‐metal dissolution, and capacity fading are effectively suppressed. This work provides a new perspective on employing external fields to overcome the intrinsic structural instability of layered oxides, offering fundamental insights for rational cathode design and reliable operation of practical NIBs for energy storage.","aip":1},{"t":"晶体中稳健且可重复的点缺陷模拟指南","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-025-00879-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Many physical properties of functional materials are governed by their impurities rather than their bulk characteristics. Defects in crystals can activate electronic and ionic conductivity, create active centres for catalysis or store information through localized spin configurations. Accurate modelling of defect behaviour is therefore essential for predicting material performance and optimizing functionality across a vast application space. However, defect simulations are sensitive to choices made during setup, execution and analysis. In this Perspective, we highlight best practices for calculating and reporting point defect properties through computational methods, with a focus on the widely adopted supercell approach. Key considerations include accurate representation of the structural and electronic properties of the host material, appropriate choice of charge states, sufficient optimization of defect geometries and reproducible calculation of defect formation energies. Adhering to these practices will facilitate robust comparisons between studies and improve the integration of computational predictions with experimental results. We emphasize the importance of reporting computational parameters and correction schemes. Ultimately, an open approach to point defect simulations will strengthen the impact of computational studies and accelerate materials engineering.","tp":"晶体缺陷模拟","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"为晶体点缺陷模拟提供了稳健且可重复的实践指南。功能性材料的许多关键性质（电子/离子导电性、催化活性、自旋存储等）由杂质和缺陷而非体相决定。文章系统分析了缺陷模拟对计算参数选择的敏感性，提出了超胞尺寸、电荷修正、收敛标准等关键设置的最佳实践，以提高材料性能预测的准确性。"},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策的不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"地缘能源转","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过原子级氟掺杂实现硅晶体结构几何重构以获得高性能锂离子电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504961?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氟掺杂硅负极","kp":["[几何重构]: 氟原子级掺杂重构硅晶体结构","负极[锂离子电池]: 氟掺杂硅基高性能"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出一种通过原子级氟掺杂对硅晶体结构进行几何重构的策略，用于提升锂离子电池负极性能。传统硅负极虽具有超高理论比容量，但充放电过程中的体积膨胀导致循环寿命急剧衰减。氟原子的引入改变了硅晶格的几何构型，有望缓解体积应变并提高结构稳定性，从而实现高性能锂离子电池的可持续电化学应用。","ot":"Geometric Remodeling of Silicon Crystal Structure Through Atomic‐Level Fluorine Incorporation for High‐Performance Lithi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Sustainable electrification continues to drive growing interest in high‐performance lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), which are essential energy storage systems for this transition. However, conventional graphite‐based LIBs cannot meet the stringent requirements of next‐generation applications, necessitating advanced alternatives. Herein, we report the design of fluorine‐incorporated silicon (FIS) nanostructures through a novel solid–vapor–solid synthesis method that integrates metallothermic reduction with combined top‐down and bottom‐up processes. Crucially, fluorine (F) atoms are inherently positioned both at interstitial sites within the silicon (Si) lattice and on the particle surface. Interstitial F modifies the direct‐allowed band structure of Si and expands lithium penetration pathways, thereby enhancing charge transport through improved electronic conductivity and ion migration. Meanwhile, surface‐bound F induces superhydrophobicity, enabling hydrofluoric acid‐free processing during both synthesis and electrode fabrication. Comprehensively, unveiled features of FIS offer a cost‐effective manufacturing, improved structural and electrochemical stability, and superior performance, leading to cycle‐stable, fast‐charging Si anodes for advanced LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"功能异质的瘤内 CD4+CD8+ 双阳性 T 细胞可以产生单阳性 T 细胞","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2506168123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional single-positive (SP) CD4+ and CD8+ T cells recognize tumor antigens and help mediate clinical responses with cancer immunotherapy. Double-positive CD4+CD8+ (DP) T cells have also been described in human cancers, but their role in the tumor microenvironment remains unclear. By generating a multiomic single cell atlas of DP and SP T cells, we find that DP T cells possess phenotypic heterogeneity similar to SP T cells that includes multiple clonally expanded populations of cytotoxic DP T cells in human renal cell carcinoma (RCC). These intratumoral DP T cells can mediate both MHC class I- and class II-dependent killing of autologous tumor cells. In addition, transcriptional profiling of DP TCR-bearing T cells revealed a gene signature enriched for clinical responders to PD-1 blockade in advanced RCC. We confirm prior observations of SP T cells transitioning into DP T cells and more notably, demonstrate that intratumoral T cells are capable of bidirectional differentiation in which DP T cells serve as precursors to SP T cell sin vivo. In the latter scenario, intratumoral DP T cells are shown to express Rag2, suggesting that the tumor may act as an extrathymic site of T cell development. These findings reveal the multiple roles that DP T cells can possess in antitumor immunity."},{"t":"具有短相位匹配和大SHG响应的深紫外非线性光学晶体功能基元设计","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520790?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"深紫外非线性光学晶体","kp":["相位匹配波长[深紫外NLO]: ~148.3 nm","[设计目标]: 短相位匹配+大SHG响应"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"深紫外非线性光学(NLO)晶体是产生深紫外激光的关键材料。本研究聚焦深紫外NLO晶体的功能基元设计，旨在解决短相位匹配与大二阶谐波生成(SHG)响应之间的矛盾。深紫外激光在半导体光刻、精密光谱、光通信等领域具有重要应用价值，但现有材料难以同时满足短截止边和高转换效率要求。该工作从功能基元层面提出新型晶体设计策略，为实现高效深紫外频率转换提供了理论指导和材料候选。","ot":"Functional Unit Design of Deep‐UV NLO Crystals With Short Phase‐Matching and Large SHG Response","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Deep‐ultraviolet (deep‐UV) nonlinear optical (NLO) crystals are crucial for generating deep‐UV lasers, and their performance is determined by the type, ratio, and arrangement of microscopic NLO functional units. Currently, there are no suitable materials capable of achieving deep‐UV phase‐matching (PM) laser output via direct second harmonic generation (SHG) at around 148.3 nm — a key requirement for the\n                    2\n                    2\n                    9\n                    Th nuclear clock. Here, we proposed a functional‐units‐ratio design principle to address this bottleneck. Applying this strategy to the Li‐B‐O‐F system, we designed two novel compositions, LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    and Li\n                    2\n                    B\n                    4\n                    O\n                    5\n                    F\n                    4\n                    . Subsequent crystal structure prediction identified\n                    C\n                    2‐LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    as an exceptional candidate, exhibiting a record‐short PM wavelength of 145.2 nm and a strong SHG response of 3.4 × KH\n                    2\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    . The prediction also revealed several other metastable phases with outstanding performance, including\n                    Cc\n                    ‐LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    (149.7 nm),\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    ‐Li\n                    2\n                    B\n                    4\n                    O\n                    5\n                    F\n                    4\n                    (151.6 nm),\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    ‐LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    ‐5 (156.1 nm),\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    ‐LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    ‐9 (156.8 nm), and\n                    Cm\n                    ‐LiB\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    F\n                    2\n                    ‐7 (158.2 nm), all of which surpass the previous record and have a high synthesis probability. Crucially, the combination of [BO\n                    3\n                    ]  and [BO\n                    2\n                    F\n                    2\n                    ] functional units enables deep‐UV PM with a moderate birefringence (∼0.05 @1064 nm), effectively circumventing the traditional performance trade‐off. This work provides a generalizable design strategy for next‐generation deep‐UV NLO materials and paves the way for the practical development of the\n                    229\n                    Th nuclear clock."},{"t":"逐步淘汰化石燃料还不够：各国必须消除大气中的碳","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00211-w","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"碳移除路径","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":3.5},"as":""},{"t":"森林丧失和景观格局变化导致流域释放更多年轻水","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522502123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The hydrological functions of forests are well recognized, but their influence on water storage and release dynamics remains poorly quantified. The fraction of young water ([Formula: see text])-the proportion of streamflow younger than 2 to 3 mo-serves as an integrative indicator of a watershed's capacity to retain and release precipitation. Here, by analyzing [Formula: see text] across 657 watersheds worldwide, we found that forest cover exhibited a significant negative relationship with [Formula: see text]. The causality was further corroborated through a meta-analysis of postdeforestation [Formula: see text] trends, confirming that forest loss accelerates the conversion of recent precipitation into streamflow. This effect was most pronounced in watersheds with shallow groundwater, highlighting the role of forests in regulating rapid, near-surface flowpaths. Beyond total forest cover, we found that forest landscape patterns also exerted influences: A lower proportion of forest edge was associated with higher [Formula: see text], but only in sparsely forested watersheds ([Formula: see text][Formula: see text]40% forest cover), where the edge-enhanced evapotranspiration was most pronounced. This global synthesis not only reinforces the hydrological value of forest conservation and restoration but also highlights that deliberate planning of forest landscape patterns can help mitigate the hydrological consequences of forest loss. Together, these findings demonstrate that integrating forest protection with forest landscape planning is essential for sustaining hydrological functions."},{"t":"小样本和不平衡数据条件下的光伏阵列端口故障诊断","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600053X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏故障诊断","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fault diagnosis of photovoltaic arrays at ports under small-sample and imbalanced data conditions"},{"t":"通过两亲性可交联单体探索高效柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池的规模化路线","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07050C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性钙钛矿电池","kp":["[可扩展策略]: 两亲性可交联单体解决大面积成膜不均","器件[柔性钙钛矿电池]: 大面积无针孔薄膜"],"as":"柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池（f-PSCs）因轻薄可弯、功率重量比高等优势被视为传统硅基光伏的重要补充，在便携电子、可穿戴设备和建筑一体化领域潜力巨大。该研究探索通过放大化制备路径实现高效f-PSCs的规模化生产，可能涉及卷对卷涂布、大面积薄膜均匀性控制、界面工程及溶剂工程等关键技术。柔性钙钛矿的工程化放大是实验室效率向商业化跨越的核心瓶颈，该路线若可行将加速其产业化进程。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Exploring a Scalable Route for Efficient Flexible Perovskite Solar Cells via Amphiphilic Cross-linkable Monomer","b":"Flexible perovskite solar cells (f-PSCs) hold great promise for complementing traditional silicon solar cells in portable power applications, but their commercialization depends on the ability to scale-up solution-based deposition. So far, inhomogeneous perovskite deposition on self-assembled molecules (SAMs) poses a substantial challenge in fabricating uniform, pinhole-free films over large areas. Here, we developed an amphiphilic cross-linkable monomer (TBA) that simultaneously promotes perovskite growth on flexible substrates and ensures homogeneous deposition during scaling-up. The incorporation of TBA increase the wettability and adhesion of the perovskite ink to the underlying hydrophobic SAMs layer, enabling high-quality, uniform perovskite films on both rigid and flexible substrates, demonstrating its potential for scalable fabrication. As a result, the modified PSCs achieved remarkable power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 27.12% (certified 26.41%, rigid) and 24.95% (flexible), with excellent mechanical and operational stability. The TBA-modified f-PSCs retained over 90% of their initial PCE after 10,000 bending cycles and 1,000 hours of continuous operation. Additionally, large-area perovskite solar modules (PSMs) demonstrated notable PCEs of 23.10% (rigid) and 20.38% (flexible), showcasing the scalability of this approach. This strategy paves a new way for the industrial-scale development of high-performance f-PSCs.","aip":1},{"t":"自级联催化加速去溶剂化-扩散动力学用于耐久低温锌金属电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522417?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池负极","kp":["[催化策略]: 自级联催化加速[Zn(H2O)6]2+去溶剂化","应用条件: 低温水系锌金属电池"],"as":"水系锌金属电池因安全性高、成本低而备受关注，但锌负极在循环过程中易形成枝晶，导致界面不稳定和寿命衰减。该研究提出通过自级联催化策略加速锌离子的去溶剂化-扩散动力学，构建无枝晶且界面稳固的锌负极。自级联催化可能通过梯度功能材料或多步催化位点，连续降低离子传输能垒，从而实现均匀沉积。该思路为长寿命水系锌电池的实用化提供了新机制路径，对大规模储能具有重要意义。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Expediting Desolvation–Diffusion Kinetics by Self‐Cascade Catalysis for Durable Low‐Temperature Zinc Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Dendrite‐free Zn metal anodes with robust interface are highly desired for the practical application of aqueous zinc‐metal based batteries (AZMBs), while their stability is hindered by the untoward [Zn(H\n                    2\n                    O)\n                    6\n                    ]\n                    2+\n                    desolvation and succedent deposition with dissatisfactory kinetic barriers, especially under low‐temperature environment. Herein, a self‐cascade catalytic strategy on accelerating interfacial desolvation and optimizing diffusion is proposed by designing an atomically dispersed Bi within the deficient LaMnO\n                    3.15\n                    perovskite (SABi/U‐LMO) layer on Zn anode. Theoretical calculations demonstrate that the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center and nonbonding state near the Fermi level of SABi/U‐LMO alleviate the corrosion of H\n                    2\n                    O and accelerate the dissociation of Zn\n                    2+\n                    ─H\n                    2\n                    O bond by promoting the rapid filling of the empty\n                     \n                    4s orbital of the Zn\n                    2+\n                    , as revealed by electrochemical and spectroscopic results. Meanwhile, the redistribution of electric field with SABi/U‐LMO realizes the delocalization and lateral growth of Zn atoms. Consequently, the cells with SABi/U‐LMO render an impressive lifetime up to 5000 h at 1 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    as well as a high Coulombic efficiency of 99.59% over 2000 cycles under 0 °C. Full cell also stabilizes the capacity retention of ∼100% after 900 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    under −20 °C, verifying the feasibility of self‐cascade catalysis in realizing high‐performance AZMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"对血管组织发育的激素调节的进化适应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531099123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Vascular tissues provide long-distance transport and physical support in the vascular plant lineage, providing a significant adaptive advantage. Although the cross talk between auxin and cytokinin in promoting both vascular cell proliferation and differentiation has been well studied in angiosperms such as Arabidopsis thaliana, little is known about this regulation in other vascular plant lineages. Here, we found that unlike the hormonal cross talk found in all other species under study, the lycophyte Selaginella moellendorffii shows clear task separation, with auxin driving vascular cell proliferation only and cytokinin specifically triggering cell differentiation. Using a cross-species transcriptomics approach, we found that members of the AUXIN/INDOLE-ACETIC ACID (AUX/IAA) and CYTOKININ OXIDASE (CKX) gene families exhibited divergent expression patterns in response to auxin and cytokinin treatments. Despite these regulatory differences, we show that AUX/IAA and CKX proteins are functionally conserved between Arabidopsis and Selaginella. Taken together, our findings suggest an evolutionary adaptation to the hormonal regulation of vascular tissue development in which core protein functions are conserved, but regulatory circuits diverged in lycophytes."},{"t":"外延Ag-CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶异质结构：多面取向、等离激元抑制与高效发光","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515019?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米晶异质结","kp":["[外延异质结]: Ag-CsPbBr3面特定连接","[电荷转移]: 抑制等离激元实现高效"],"as":"卤化物钙钛矿纳米晶作为高效光学材料已被研究十余年，在发光二极管、激光器和光电探测器等领域展现出卓越性能。该研究聚焦银-溴化铅铯钙钛矿（Ag-CsPbBr3）外延异质结构的构筑，利用多面取向匹配实现纳米晶与银的界面精准耦合。这种金属-半导体异质结构可能通过等离激元效应或界面电荷转移显著增强光-物质相互作用，为纳米光子学和新型光电功能器件的设计提供了新范式。外延生长的取向控制是核心突破点。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Epitaxial Ag‐CsPbBr3 Perovskite Nanocrystal Heterostructures: Multi‐Facets Orientations, Suppressed Plasmon and Efficien","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Halide perovskite nanocrystals have been extensively studied for over a decade as an efficient optical material, exhibiting bright and tunable emissions. While various epitaxial perovskite heterostructures with other semiconductors or metals have been achieved, but epitaxial integration with plasmonic Ag or Au nanoparticles through facet‐specific connections has remained a key challenge. Keeping the importance of these nanocrystal heterostructures in mind, herein, we epitaxially integrated Ag nanoparticles with three different morphologies of CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    , each exhibiting one‐to‐one connections. The heterostructures were obtained by introducing Ag precursor either before or after CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    formation, depending on the reaction conditions. The feasibility of the synthesis is attributed to the presence of specific triangular and truncated facets having alternating Pb and Br atom arrangements in CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    . Electron microscopic analysis confirms two distinct epitaxial interfaces between cubic Ag(0) and orthorhombic CsPbBr\n                    3,\n                    indicating the susceptibility of such nanocrystals to form heterostructures. Ultrafast spectroscopic data suggest the photoluminescence quenching arises from the photogenerated electron transfer from CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    to Ag. However, no significant plasmon absorption is observed, likely due to plasmon damping. These results provide new insight into plasmonic‐exciton coupling in this type of heterostructure and pave a pathway for designing other plasmonic material based heterostructures for optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"情景事件可以灵活地编码为集成和分离的神经表征","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68473-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Remembering everyday events involves noticing what different experiences share and preserving the details that set them apart, yet the neural processes supporting this balance remain unclear. Here, we record EEG while participants view naturalistic movie scenes that introduce episodic events with overlapping elements. Using time-resolved representational similarity analysis, we find that these events evoke both similarities and dissimilarities in neural patterns as new information unfolds. Similarities predict successful inference of information across separate episodes, consistent with integrative encoding. Dissimilarities, by contrast, predict accurate memory for individual events, indicating the formation of distinct event-specific traces. Together, these findings indicate that the brain encodes both integrated and separated neural representations to flexibly support different mnemonic goals and to balance relational inference with detailed recollection."},{"t":"环境稳定的本征高拉伸性N型导电聚合物","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518190?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"n型导电聚合物","kp":["[本征拉伸性]: 高(柔性n型导电聚合物)","[环境稳定性]: 优良"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种环境稳定且具有高本征可拉伸性的n型导电聚合物。柔性电子器件对兼具优异电导率和机械延展性的聚合物材料需求迫切，该材料在保持高电子迁移率的同时具备出色的拉伸性能和环境耐受性，解决了n型聚合物通常稳定性差的瓶颈，在可穿戴电子、电子皮肤等方向具有重要应用潜力。","ot":"Environmentally Stable N‐Type Conducting Polymer with High Intrinsic Stretchability","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of flexible electronics has driven an urgent demand for conducting polymers that combine exceptional electrical performance with mechanical adaptability. In the construction of complementary circuits, integrating p‐type and n‐type conducting polymers is critical, yet developing stretchable n‐type ones has long remained a challenge. We employ the refined regulation of polymer‐polymer interaction to enhance PBFDO's intrinsic stretchability (crack‐onset strain up to 100%) and environmental stability (5‐fold stability enhancement vs. pristine PBFDO), while achieving 2265 S/cm conductivity at 100% strain with stable recovery after 1000 cycles. Building on these advancements, we have successfully developed stretchable epidermal electrophysiological electrodes and organic thermoelectric devices—each conclusively validating the material's practical utility. The epidermal electrodes enable high signal‐to‐noise ratio recording of electrophysiological signals, while the thermoelectric devices operate stably under 60% bidirectional tensile strain. This work thus establishes new fundamental principles for engineering high‐performance stretchable n‐type conducting polymers, paving the way for next‐generation flexible electronics."},{"t":"2025 年及以后的能源需求和脱碳","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00139-w","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源脱碳路","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"内皮素 3 和 T 型 Ca2+ 通道驱动肠神经嵴细胞钙活性、收缩性和迁移","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-68121-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Enteric neural crest cells (ENCCs) colonize the gut during embryogenesis and migration defects give rise to Hirschsprung disease (HD). Mutations in GDNF/RET and EDN3/EDNRB are known to be causal in HD. Here, we show that migrating ENCCs in mice exhibit endogenous EDN3/EDNRB-gated calcium activity, mediated by chloride channels, T-type Ca2+ channels and inositol trisphosphate-sensitive intracellular-store release. We find that inhibiting Ca2+ activity results in ENCC migration defects, while exciting it promotes migration by increasing ENCC contractility and traction force to the extracellular matrix. Our study demonstrates that embryonic endothelin-mediated neural crest migration and adult endothelin-mediated vasoconstriction is one and the same phenomenon, taking place in different cell types. Our results suggest a functional link between rare mutations of CACNA1H (the gene encoding CaV3.2) and HD, and pave the way for understanding neurocristopathies in terms of neural crest cell bioelectric activity deficits."},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微观结构驱动多尺度特征融合框架用于健康评估","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观结构健康评估","dp":1,"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health e"},{"t":"超薄氧化物原子层沉积对钙钛矿氧电极反应活性与耐久性的影响","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202513655?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿氧电极","kp":["材料体系[氧电极]: La0.6Sr0.4CoO3钙钛矿","[表面改性]: 原子层沉积超薄氧化物","测试条件: 高温"],"as":"该研究利用原子层沉积（ALD）技术在导电钙钛矿氧化物（ABO3）表面制备超薄氧化物涂层，以提升其作为氧电极材料的催化反应活性与长期耐久性。钙钛矿氧化物是固体氧化物燃料电池和电解池等能源转换装置的核心电极材料，但在高温运行条件下容易发生表面降解、元素偏析和相变失活。ALD能够在原子尺度精确调控涂层厚度与组分，在活性位点表面构建保护层同时不阻塞催化反应界面。研究表明，经ALD修饰的钙钛矿电极在氧析出/还原反应中表现出更优的热化学稳定性与电化学性能，为下一代高效长寿命能源转换器件的电极工程设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"ot":"Effect of Atomic Layer Deposition of Ultra‐Thin Oxide on Reactivity and Durability of Perovskite Oxygen Electrodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conductive perovskite oxides (ABO\n                    3\n                    ) are key oxygen electrode materials for energy conversion applications, but they suffer from irreversible performance degradation at elevated temperatures due to surface chemical instability. In this study, we investigate how the surface chemical environment and oxygen exchange kinetics of thin‐film La\n                    0.6\n                    Sr\n                    0.4\n                    CoO\n                    3\n                    are affected by the atomic layer deposition of binary oxides—specifically HfO\n                    2\n                    and Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . We observe that both HfO\n                    2\n                    and Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    overcoats successfully maintain the rapid oxygen exchange rate on the electrode surface. Interestingly, however, their effects on the electrode surface chemistry differ significantly, as do the ideal coating thicknesses, as revealed by X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy, secondary ion mass spectrometry, and transmission electron microscopy analyses. These findings suggest two distinct mechanisms for stabilizing the perovskite surface: the oxide overcoats (1) reduce oxygen vacancies that attract Sr ions to the surface and (2) act as a scavenger, consuming excess surface Sr, and suggest the design principle of a new strategy based on atomic layer deposition to improve perovskite surface durability."},{"t":"内质网膜受体参与核心自噬机制以启动内质网自噬","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523465123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Endoplasmic reticulum (ER) phagy is the form of selective autophagy that governs ER abundance and integrity by targeting dysfunctional ER fragments for degradation. How the recognition of ER fragments as autophagy substrates is coupled to engagement of the core autophagic machinery is largely unknown. Here, using a combination of in vitro reconstitution systems, structural modeling, and cell biology, we demonstrate that ER membrane receptors directly engage the core autophagy component ATG9A, as well as the PI3P-binding protein WIPI2, to initiate ER-associated autophagosome biogenesis. ER-phagy receptor-ATG9A association nucleates the recruitment of the other key autophagy proteins required to initiate ER-phagy. In parallel, ER-phagy receptor-WIPI2 engagement promotes rapid LC3 lipidation for autophagic membrane expansion. These data show how ER-phagy receptors trigger the cascade of events leading to ER autophagosome formation."},{"t":"受体调节的内皮 NADPH 氧化酶的动态调节","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531380123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The stable reactive oxygen species (ROS) hydrogen peroxide (H2O2) acts as a key signaling molecule for many vital intracellular pathways. In diverse cell types, surface receptors control intracellular H2O2 levels by modulating the activity of NADPH oxidases (NOX), a family of enzymes responsible for ROS synthesis. Most NOX isoforms are regulated through the reversible assembly of protein subunits to form an active oligomeric complex. The NOX isoforms NOX2 and NOX4 are expressed in endothelial cells and generate H2O2 in response to activation of cell surface receptors. The GPCR agonist histamine activates NOX2 independently of NOX4, but the H2O2 response to activation of the receptor tyrosine kinase agonist vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) involves both NOX2 and NOX4 by unknown mechanisms [M. Waldeck-Weiermair et al., Redox Biol. 58, 102539 (2022); M. Waldeck-Weiermair et al., Redox Biol. 73, 103214 (2024)]. Here, we show that endothelial NOX4 is localized to the endoplasmic reticulum (ER). We define the redox states of various subcellular locales in the vascular endothelium and demonstrate that NOX2 is responsible for cytosolic H2O2 signaling, whereas NOX4 contributes to H2O2 generation in the endoplasmic reticulum. Using biochemical assays and structural modeling, we further identify a previously unrecognized regulatory interaction in which the NOX2 subunit p67 associates with NOX4. VEGF stimulation induces dynamic dissociation of p67 from NOX4, unveiling a \"cross talk\" between NOX isoforms that coordinates the activation of both NOX2 and NOX4 and thereby produces compartment-specific H2O2 signals. This mechanism underscores the pivotal roles of NOX2 and NOX4 subunit interactions in endothelial redox homeostasis controlling cell survival, proliferation, and migration."},{"t":"氢键网络的动态重构调控钙钛矿结晶","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07159C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿结晶调控","kp":["[结晶调控]: 动态氢键网络策略","溶剂[钙钛矿前驱体]: 深共晶溶剂"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过动态重构氢键网络来精确调控钙钛矿结晶过程的新策略。钙钛矿材料的结晶控制一直是提升光电性能的关键瓶颈，因为氢键主导前驱体溶液中溶质-溶剂的相互作用，直接影响成核速率、晶体生长取向和薄膜形貌。研究团队通过引入特定的氢键调控剂，动态调节前驱体中有机阳离子与溶剂分子之间的氢键强度和方向，实现了对中间相形成和结晶路径的精准操控。该方法有效减少了晶界缺陷和非辐射复合中心，显著提升了钙钛矿薄膜的结晶质量和光电转换效率，为高性能钙钛矿太阳能电池的规模化制备提供了通用性框架。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic Reconfiguration of Hydrogen-Bonded Networks to Modulate Perovskite Crystallization","b":"Precise control of perovskite crystallization remains challenging because hydrogen bonds (H-bonds), which govern precursor interactions and nucleation pathways, are often treated as static rather than dynamic entities. Here, we propose a novel dynamic H-bond network strategy to regulate perovskite crystallization via the steric modulation of the H-bond donor in a deep eutectic solvent (DES). Replacing urea with N-methylurea (NMU) reconfigures the H-bond network of NMU-DES, which increases the number of moderately coordinating sites and promotes self-association with long H-bond lifetimes, thereby prolonging the halide···H interactions between NMU-DES and PbI2，yielding a stable precursor reservoir. Urea-based DES generates flexible and transient interactions that retard perovskite nucleation, whereas NMU-DES induces stronger, spatially localized interactions that self-assemble into an interfacial H-bond network, thereby regulating perovskite nucleation and crystal growth and yielding films with reduced defect densities. As a result, NMU-DES–based devices achieve a power conversion efficiency of 26.33% and outstanding operational stability, retaining >94% of their initial efficiency after 1,570 h of continuous illumination. This dynamic-network strategy transcends static passivation, offering rational control of weak forces as a generalizable pathway toward highly efficient and stable perovskite and other solution-processed optoelectronic materials.","aip":1},{"t":"动态微界面聚合实现二维聚合物片的规模化合成用于准固态电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524650?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维聚合物钠电池","kp":["[合成方法]: 动态微界面聚合制二维聚合物片","应用[电解质]: 钠金属电池准固态"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了动态微界面聚合法，实现了二维（2D）有机材料的可扩展合成。二维有机材料在电子学、光电子学、分离膜和催化等领域具有广阔应用前景，但传统制备方法面临产率低、尺寸不可控和难以规模化等瓶颈。研究团队设计了液-液或气-液微界面作为受限聚合反应平台，单体在微界面处自组装并发生二维方向的原位聚合，精确控制聚合物的面内共价连接和层间非共价堆叠。这种动态微界面策略能够在温和条件下连续生产大面积、高结晶度的二维聚合物薄膜，兼具厚度均匀性和结构可设计性，为二维有机材料的产业化制备开辟了新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic Microinterfacial Polymerization Enables Scalable Synthesis of Two‐Dimensional Polymer Sheets for Quasi‐Solid‐Sta","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Organic two‐dimensional (2D) materials hold great potential in a broad range of applications. However, their practical utility is constrained by limited structural diversity and a lack of synthetic strategies. Herein, we report that simply stirring immiscible solutions of poly(propylene glycol)bis(2‐aminopropyl ether) and 1,3,5‐benzenetricarbonyl trichloride results in a dynamic microinterfacial polymerization that affords novel 2D polymer sheets (designated as PEO‐BTA). These sheets can be transformed to Na‐ion conducting materials via treatment with sodium hydride, followed by incorporation of a prototypical MOF, HKUST‐1, to obtain composite sheets (MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na) that retain the structural integrity of the original 2D polymer sheets. The 2D composite sheets can be assembled into self‐supporting membranes and used as a quasi‐solid‐state electrolyte (QSSE) with a remarkably high ionic conductivity value of 2.80 × 10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    and a Na\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.95. Consequently, the QSSE facilitates uniform Na plating in Na//Na and Na//Cu cells. Na//NaTi\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    cells containing MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na QSSE exhibit a high initial specific capacity (129.1 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C), superior rate capability (60.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 20 C), and high‐capacity retention (92% after 1000 cycles at 1 C). This work establishes a new, scalable approach for synthesizing 2D organic sheets with promising applications in energy‐related areas.","aip":1},{"t":"亲氧镝掺杂双重调控：稳定氧化物载体与定制催化路径实现安培级电流","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519688?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化析氢","kp":["催化剂[碱性HER]: Rh@Dy-CuO","Dy双调控: 稳定CuO载体+优化Volmer-Tafel路径","电流级别: 安培级"],"as":"该研究提出通过亲氧性镝掺杂实现氧化物载体与催化剂的双重调控策略。在阴极还原条件下，传统氧化物载体易被还原失稳，而镝掺杂可稳定载体晶格结构，同时促进电催化活性组分的均匀分散。这种双重调控机制为固体氧化物燃料电池、电解池等高温电化学器件中氧化物载体长期耐久性难题提供了新思路，有望推动高效阴极催化剂的工程化应用。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual Regulation via Oxyphilic Dysprosium Doping: Stabilizing Oxide Support and Customizing Catalytic Pathway for Ampere‐","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Achieving robust stabilization of oxide supports under cathodic reduction conditions while enabling an efficient Volmer‐Tafel pathway for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) is challenging. Herein, we report a Dy‐doped CuO supported Rh catalyst (Rh@Dy‐CuO), leveraging the oxyphilic Dy for dual regulation to enhance CuO stability and optimize the HER catalytic pathway. Dy incorporation strengthens the Cu‐O bond and mitigates electron aggregation at Cu sites, thereby maintaining the oxidized state of CuO during HER and facilitating efficient H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to generate adsorbed hydrogen (*H). Concurrently, Dy doping suppresses charge accumulation at the Rh‐CuO interface, enabling seamless *H transfer from CuO to Rh sites. This leads to elevated *H coverage on Rh, promoting rapid *H‐*H coupling via an optimized Tafel step for hydrogen production. As a result, the Rh@Dy‐CuO catalyst delivers a mass activity of 648 mA mg\n                    Rh\n                    −1\n                    at an overpotential of 100 mV, 46 times higher than that of Pt/C. When applied in an anion exchange membrane water electrolyzer, it delivers 1.91 V at 1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    with 1000‐hour stability. This Dy‐driven dual regulation offers a novel approach to stabilizing oxide supports and tailoring HER pathways, advancing rare earth‐mediated electrocatalyst design.","aip":1},{"t":"2025年水电解与CO₂电解的差异化成熟度与趋同挑战","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00132-3","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解水与CO2电解","as":"","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"kp":["[综述]: 2025年水电解与CO₂电解成熟度趋同"],"ot":"Diverging maturity and converging challenges of water and CO₂ electrolysis in 2025"},{"t":"综合能源系统集群的分布式协同优化：基于共识的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源系统调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on conse"},{"t":"海洋数字孪生作为蓝色经济创新的催化剂","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag012/8431396?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"海洋数字孪","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"差异Hes1激活定义了胚胎和成体神经干细胞谱系定型和生态位维持","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511800123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mode of Hes1 activation and its differential expression are crucial for the maintenance of neural stem cells/progenitor cells (NSCs/NPCs) in the embryonic cortex. This differential mode of Hes1 activation has been translated into a heterogeneous population of NSCs comprising Notch-independent Hes1-expressing (NIHes1) NSCs and Notch-dependent Hes1-expressing (NDHes1) radial glial cells (RGCs). Using single-cell transcriptomics and a Nestin-CreERT2;NIHes1fl/fl conditional knock-out mouse model, we have characterized the NIHes1 NSCs. Our analyses show that NIHes1 NSCs are the ancestral precursor NSCs that generate RGCs and intermediate progenitor cells during development. Loss of NIHes1 expression significantly alters the NSC niche, leading to increased gliogenesis and aberrant migration of projection neurons. NIHes1 NSCs are set aside at embryonic stages as adult neural stem cells and are maintained by NIHes1 expression even at adult stage. Our findings suggest that NIHes1 NSCs are functionally distinct Hes1-expressing NSCs, which are critical for establishing both embryonic and adult NSC niches, thereby contributing to the overall cortical development."},{"t":"通过浓电解液优先分解获得稳定SEI层并防止铝集流体腐蚀","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504436?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池SEI稳定化","kp":["[策略]: 高浓度LiTFSI优先分解","问题[锂离子电池]: LiTFSI腐蚀铝集流体","产物[SEI]: 富无机稳定层"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过浓盐电解液中锂盐的优先分解策略，实现了稳定的SEI层构建并抑制了铝集流体腐蚀。在锂离子电池中，LiTFSI等锂盐虽具优势但易引发铝箔腐蚀问题。该工作调控电解液组分分解顺序，优先形成保护性界面膜，同时有效阻断腐蚀反应，为高能量密度电池电解液设计提供了新思路。","ot":"Deriving Stable SEI Layer and Preventing Aluminum Current Collector Corrosion via Preferential Decomposition of Concentr","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Among promising lithium salts for electrolyte in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide (LiTFSI) forms a more stable inorganic‐rich SEI layer. However, its implementation is limited by severe aluminum current collector corrosion. Since lithium hexafluorophosphate (LiPF\n                    6\n                    ) contributes a stable passivation layer for aluminum, a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte offers reduced corrosion. However, its corrosion inhibition capability is not complete. Herein, we propose a SEI‐stabilizing and corrosion‐preventing layer (SCL) that realizes spatial separation of salts, which confines concentrated LiTFSI within a polyethylene glycol dimethacrylate (PEGDMA) network at the anode‐LiPF\n                    6\n                    electrolyte interface. The locally high concentration of LiTFSI in SCL induces a kinetic preference that overrides the thermodynamic preference of LiPF\n                    6\n                    , which enables targeted decomposition of LiTFSI to form a robust SEI layer, while using only a small amount of LiTFSI. Furthermore, SCL demonstrates excellent corrosion‐inhibiting behavior compared to a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte. Consequently, SCL enables stable cycling of high‐loading (21.4 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) practical NCM811/graphite full cells with 93.57% capacity retention after 100 cycles at a high current density of 2.2 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This strategy enables selective electrochemical reactions through spatial confinement to enhance LIB performance, while suppressing side reactions and reducing costs, providing a scalable approach for next‐generation electrolyte design."},{"t":"大卫·巴尔的摩：科学家、领导者和导师","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528373123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Fifty years ago, at the remarkably young age of 37, David Baltimore received the Nobel Prize (with Howard Temin and Renato Dulbecco) for \"discoveries concerning the interaction between tumor viruses and the genetic material of the cell.\" David was a prolific scientist whose work spanned many topics, but he was first and foremost a virologist. His recent passing invites us to reflect on a remarkable intellectual trajectory that began with seminal discoveries in virology, broadened to encompass major advances in cancer biology and immunology, and culminated in a legacy-sustained by the many scientists he trained-that will continue to shape modern biomedicine for years to come."},{"t":"每日简报：天才狗的单词学习能力与人类幼儿相当","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00213-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"共价有机框架及其复合材料作为光催化剂用于可持续CO2还原","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515840?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"COF光催化CO2还原","kp":["[光催化]: 共价有机框架及复合材料","应用[CO2还原]: 碳中性燃料与化学品"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"本文综述共价有机框架（COF）及其复合材料在光催化CO2还原中的研究进展。面对气候紧急态势，COF凭借可调控的孔结构、高比表面积和优异的光吸收特性，被视为实现可持续CO2还原的有效光催化剂平台。文章系统讨论了分子设计策略、活性位点工程及光生载流子传输优化等关键问题。","ot":"Covalent Organic Framework and Composite as Photocatalysts Toward Sustainable CO2 Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The intensifying climate emergency compels a rapid paradigm shift from fossil fuel‐based energy systems toward sustainable, carbon‐neutral alternatives. Among emerging strategies, the photocatalytic valorization of CO\n                    2\n                    into energy‐dense fuels and commodity chemicals by suitable photocatalysts presents a straightforward and economically viable solution for both greenhouse gas mitigation and renewable energy storage. In this context, covalent organic frameworks (COFs) have emerged as a highly promising class of crystalline, porous semiconductor photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction reactions (CO\n                    2\n                    RR), owing to their structural regularity, modularity, and optoelectronic tunability. In this review, we comprehensively outline the recent progress in three distinct categories of COF‐based photocatalytic systems: metal‐free COFs, single‐metal‐atom based COFs, and COF‐based composites. Key strategies such as the judicious incorporation of donor–acceptor architectures, rational post‐synthetic functionalization, and heterojunction engineering are discussed. Insights from in situ operando characterization and theoretical calculations are also presented to highlight the roles of exciton dynamics, charge separation, active site engineering, and structure–function relationship in CO\n                    2\n                    RR. Finally, we propose future research directions for better utilization of COFs in solar fuel/chemical generation. Overall, this review aims to provide a comprehensive discussion on the advancement of COF‐based photocatalysts and next‐generation CO\n                    2\n                    valorization materials."},{"t":"Tian 等人的修正，DNA 聚合酶 delta 控制亲代组蛋白向 DNA 复制滞后链的转移","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537869123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"组蛋白遗传","as":""},{"t":"珊瑚礁鱼可能比我们想象的更重要","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535459123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"具有手性微环境的连续流模块化反应器增强去甲肾上腺素的生物催化合成","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202514462?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多酶级联催化合成","kp":["[反应器设计]: 手性微环境连续流模块化反应器","[合成方法]: 多酶级联催化合成去甲肾上腺素","[核心模块]: 手性催化反应器+功能模块"],"as":"该研究开发了一种集成手性微环境的连续流模块化反应器，用于增强多酶级联催化效率。手性是药物分子设计的核心要素，传统手性合成依赖化学催化剂，立体选择性与绿色性受限。该体系通过在微反应器内构建手性微环境，为多酶协同催化提供限域空间与连续流动条件，实现高对映选择性的药物中间体高效合成，在手性药物绿色制造领域具重要工程价值。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Continuous‐Flow Modular Reactor with a Chiral Microenvironment Enhances the Biocatalytic Synthesis of Norepinephrine","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Chirality lies at the core of pharmaceutical molecular design. Multi‐enzyme cascade catalysis offers high stereoselectivity for constructing such molecules. Here, we present a continuous‐flow modular reactor engineered with a chiral microenvironment for the biocatalytic synthesis of norepinephrine. This system incorporates two functional modules: a chiral catalytic reactor, designed to enhance the\n                    \n                      C\n                      β\n                    \n                    stereoselectivity of L‐threonine aldolase (L‐TA), and a decarboxylation reactor to balance catalytic rates. Modifying the microenvironment surrounding L‐TA significantly enhanced its stereoselectivity, with 4.1 times increased the\n                    de\n                    value (from 18.4% to 75.01%). Seen from molecular dynamics simulations, these modifications reshaped the spatial conformation of the enzyme's active site. Moreover, at an optimal column height ratio of 3:5 between the chiral and decarboxylation modules, norepinephrine yield reached 3.07 g/L. This modular reactor strategy, enhanced by a tailored chiral microenvironment, offers substantial promise for the stereoselective synthesis of pharmaceutical intermediates."},{"t":"通过自下而上相转化接力策略构建集成双皮层多孔膜用于液流电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506085?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液流电池多孔膜","kp":["[制备策略]: 自下而上相转化接力法","结构[液流电池膜]: 双皮层多孔(中间大孔层)"],"as":"该研究首次提出自下而上中继策略，通过相分离法制备集成双皮层多孔膜。此类膜材料同时具有大孔支撑层与两层选择性皮层，解决了传统多层复合膜界面剥离与缺陷问题。自下而上策略可精确调控各层孔径梯度与连通性，在废水过滤、气体分离及催化膜反应器等分离纯化场景中具备应用潜力，为高性能一体化膜材料设计提供了新范式。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Constructing Integrated Dual‐Skin‐Layer Porous Membranes via a Bottom‐Up Phase Inversion Relay Strategy for Flow Batteri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A bottom‐up relay strategy is first proposed to fabricate integrated dual‐skin‐layer porous membranes (macropore layer between bilateral skin layers) by ingeniously introducing a non‐solvent carrier. Benefiting from the phase inversion relay process, bilateral skin layers can be tailored freely, where ethylene glycol in the non‐solvent carrier effectively regulates the structure of the bottom skin layer by adjusting the ratio of free water to bound water. Thus, a dual‐skin‐layer membrane is designed and applied in a vanadium flow battery (VFB), that features symmetric skin layers (∼600 nm) with sub‐nanometer (∼4.5 Å) pores. The symmetric structure reduces the pressure required for proton migration via the Vehicle mechanism, and the sub‐nanometer pores effectively separate vanadium ions from protons by size exclusion, breaking the trade‐off in traditional membranes. Moreover, the bilateral skin layers protect the macropore layer against the vanadium fouling and mechanical damage. Furthermore, the formation mechanism and ion transport dynamics of the dual‐skin‐layer membrane are analyzed by molecular dynamics and multi‐physical field simulation. As a result, the optimized membrane enables stable VFB operation for over 6000 cycles at 200 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    with energy efficiency of ∼83.6%. This work provides an effective approach to prepare integrated symmetric membranes with bilateral skin layers.","aip":1},{"t":"月球风化层氧同位素对地月系统撞击通量的限制","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531796123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The impactor flux record to Earth has largely been erased by active tectonics, weathering, and continual reworking of the crust. Instead, a record of highly siderophile elements (HSE: Re, Os, Ir, Ru, Rh, Pt, Pd, and Au) in lunar impactites has been used as a proxy for the type of impactor material added to the Earth-Moon system. Quantifying impactor mass and flux with the HSE can potentially be complicated by numerous secondary processes, however, including silicate-metal segregation and multiple impact heritage. In contrast, because oxygen has an invariant geochemical affinity, triple oxygen isotope compositions have the potential to offer a robust long-term record of impactor fluxes in complex mixtures such as regolith. Here, we use high-precision triple oxygen isotopes to deconvolve the influences of meteorite addition and silicate vaporization and identify a ubiquitous impactor contaminant comprised of partially evaporated CM or ureilite-like material representing at least 1 wt% of the lunar regolith. Water delivered to Earth by meteorite material over 4 billion years therefore is only a fraction of an ocean's worth of water but is a significant contributor to the ice reservoir of the lunar cold traps."},{"t":"保护应具有现实的适应能力","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2415291123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Conservation actions often assume implicitly that heritabilities are zero and that threatened populations cannot adapt to changing environments. To illustrate, we evaluated the last 10 y of recovery plans for US threatened and endangered species and found that only 4% assessed within-population adaptability. This omission reflects the common assumption that population adaptation is too slow or inconsequential to affect conservation practice in the short term. Yet, the median heritability (h2) and evolvability (IA) across many studies are not zero as assumed, but 0.3 and 0.4, respectively, based on a compilation of estimated values. This moderate heritability could rescue some populations. By compiling literature on conservation assessments, we detail how considering adaptability can shift conservation priorities, alter management recommendations, and provide additional ways to rescue declining populations and species. Based on these findings, we advocate for including population adaptability into conservation plans and adopting the prior expectation of moderate adaptability (h2 = 0.3, IA = 0.4) along with its uncertainty, as a starting point when better information is lacking. This moderate adaptability could allow some species to respond naturally to environmental change while directing limited resources toward the species that need it most.","tp":"物种适应力","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"保护行动通常隐含一个假设，即种群的遗传力为零，濒危物种无法适应不断变化的环境。研究分析了过去10年美国濒危物种的恢复计划，发现仅有4%评估了种群内部的适应能力。这种疏忽反映了一个普遍观念：种群适应过程太慢，对短期保护实践无关紧要。然而，实际上物种的遗传适应能力并非可以忽略不计。文章强调，现代生态保护策略需要摒弃这种静态假设，将物种的现实进化适应能力纳入考量，以制定更科学有效的长期物种恢复和保护计划。"},{"t":"限域Kirkendall应变工程促进Co3O4析氧反应用于质子交换膜水电解槽","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜电解水","kp":["晶格膨胀[Co3O4柯肯达尔氧化]: >2.4%","催化剂[PEMWE析氧]: Co3O4(IrO2替代)","[应变工程]: 限域抑制自由晶格膨胀"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文利用Kirkendall氧化效应在Co3O4上实现限域应变工程，以提升析氧反应（OER）催化性能，用于质子交换膜水电解（PEMWE）。通过精确调控Kirkendall扩散产生的微观应变，优化了Co活性位点的电子结构，显著降低OER过电位，为高效PEM电解槽阳极催化剂设计提供新思路。","ot":"Confined Kirkendall Strain Engineering Promotes Oxygen Evolution on Co3O4 for Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyze","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    While Kirkendall oxidation (KO) facilely fabricates transition metal oxides for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) in proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs), it concomitantly triggers detrimental lattice expansion. For Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , an appealing IrO\n                    2\n                    ‐alternative catalyst, KO generates a free lattice expansion above 2.4%, resulting in suboptimal activity and stability. Here, we design a confined KO approach and coat the precursor Co nanoparticles with atomic carbon layers, enabling controllable lattice expansion of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    between 0.2% and 1.8%. For the first time, a strain‐dependent OER activity of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    is established in acidic media, with an expansion strain of 1.4% exhibiting the lowest overpotential of 377 mV at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Synchrotron X‐ray absorption spectroscopies and theoretical calculations unravel the adjustable lattice strain regulates the d‐band center of Co sites and further modifies the oxygenate adsorptions. When integrated into a PEMWE, the 1.4%‐strained Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    catalyst sustainably operates at 250 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    over 100 h. The reported confined KO provides a new means for strain engineering of transition metal oxides for energy electrocatalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"脱锂富锂正极中Ni/Mn竞争性还原与微应变耦合的负热膨胀","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525724?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["工作电压[富锂层状正极]: 高至4.8 V","[热失效]: 脱锂态Ni/Mn竞争还原耦合微应变负热膨胀"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本文研究脱锂富锂锰基正极材料中Ni/Mn竞争性还原与微应变耦合的负热膨胀行为。富锂正极因高能量密度备受关注，但循环过程中的结构演变复杂。研究发现Ni和Mn的竞争性还原产生微观应变，驱动负热膨胀效应，影响材料的结构稳定性与电化学性能，为高比能正极设计提供机理洞察。","ot":"Competitive Ni/Mn Reduction and Microstrain‐Coupled Negative Thermal Expansion in Delithiated Li‐Rich Cathodes","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The demand for high energy density in the field of Li‐ion batteries has intensified interest in lithium‐rich Mn‐based layered oxide cathodes (LRLOs) owing to their high capacity and low cost. Nevertheless, the thermal runaway becomes an urgent concern because of the high‐voltage operation (up to 4.8 V), and the structural evolution mechanism of delithiated LRLOs during heating remains unclear. Here, we combine in situ high‐temperature X‐ray diffraction and absorption spectroscopy to systematically investigate the structural and chemical evolution of Li\n                    1.2\n                    Ni\n                    0.2\n                    Mn\n                    0.6\n                    O\n                    2\n                    (LLNMO) across distinct charge–discharge states. Interestingly, Ni is the first element to undergo thermally induced reduction in the charged state of LLNMO. With further increasing the temperature, Mn reduction sets in, coinciding with extensive lattice oxygen loss, and a phase transition from layered to disordered layered or Li‐containing rock‐salt‐type phase occurs. More intriguingly, after the initial electrochemical cycle, LLNMO exhibits negative thermal expansion at low temperatures below 200 °C, which are attributed to the cycling‐induced microstrain accumulation and long‐range structural ordering. These findings provide a mechanistic insight into the state‐of‐charge‐dependent thermal behavior of Li‐rich layered materials and offer guidelines for designing safer, high‐capacity battery materials.","aip":1},{"t":"钴骨架寡聚物实现创纪录光催化CO2还原为乙醇","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521378?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2制乙醇","kp":["催化剂[光催化CO2制乙醇]: 钴骨架寡聚物","[关键突破]: 克服C-C偶联能垒与中间体富集"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"本文设计了一种钴骨架低聚物催化剂，实现创纪录的光催化CO2转化为乙醇效率。太阳能驱动CO2转化为高附加值液体燃料是可再生能源存储和碳中性的重要路径。该钴基分子催化剂在可见光下展现优异的CO2-to-乙醇选择性和活性，为光催化CO2还原制多碳产物提供了新策略。","ot":"Cobalt‐Backboned Oligomer for Record Photocatalytic CO2 Conversion to Ethanol","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solar‐driven conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into value‐added products is promising for renewable energy storage and carbon neutrality. Although current photocatalysts demonstrate the capability to convert CO\n                    2\n                    into multiple carbon products including ethanol, their performance is limited by high C─C coupling energy barrier and inefficient intermediate enrichment. Here we synthesize a cobalt‐backboned oligomer as an efficient photocatalyst to generate a record‐high ethanol production rate of 497 µmol/(g·h) for CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. It also maintains high performance in cases with simulated industrial flue gas with ∼15% CO\n                    2\n                    and a Martian‐like atmosphere with ∼95% CO\n                    2\n                    . These properties stem from unique electronic modulation through metal–metal bonding and intermolecular assembly for high‐activity reaction channels. This atomically precise cobalt‐backboned oligomer opens a new avenue for designing photocatalysts."},{"t":"多价金属电池中的氯化物化学：从界面到体相","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521126?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池氯化物化学","kp":["电解质[镁电池]: 胺盐酸盐基","[核心挑战]: Mg2+去溶剂化迟缓+扩散慢"],"dp":1,"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文综述多价金属电池中氯化物化学的研究进展，从界面到体相全面分析。可充电镁电池因高理论容量和资源丰富被视为下一代储能候选，但面临镁离子迁移率低、界面钝化等挑战。文章系统讨论了氯化物电解质在调控界面稳定性、促进可逆沉积中的作用，为多价电池电解质设计提供指导。","ot":"Chloride Chemistry in Multivalent‐Metal Batteries: From Interphase to Bulk Phase","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rechargeable magnesium (Mg) batteries are promising candidates for next‐generation energy storage due to their high energy density, intrinsic safety, and earth‐abundant Mg resources. However, their practical application is limited by sluggish desolvation and slow diffusion of divalent Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Here, amine‐hydrochloride‐based Mg electrolytes are designed to form favorable interphases and chloride‐based channels. A ligand exchange strategy is proposed to simultaneously promote fast desolvation on interphases and rapid Mg\n                    2+\n                    diffusion within cathodes. Detailed analysis reveals that the formation of the chloride‐containing cathode–electrolyte interphases and the MgH\n                    2\n                    ‐containing anode–electrolyte interphases are found to facilitate the desolvation process of solvated Mg\n                    2+\n                    . Moreover, the chloride‐based channels significantly reduce the diffusion barriers of Mg\n                    2+\n                    in Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    from 0.712  to 0.517 eV, demonstrating rapid Mg\n                    2+\n                    diffusion kinetics. Consequently, Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    ‐based full cells achieve a capacity retention of over 80% after 100 cycles at 1 C. Furthermore, this strategy is compatible with chloride‐free electrolytes, the full‐cells consisted of activated Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    cathode delivers a high specific capacity exceeding 90 mA h g\n                    −1\n                    and 80.3% retention after 900 h of cycling. It is also applicable to organic cathodes and Mo\n                    6\n                    S\n                    8\n                    ‐based calcium‐metal full‐cells. Overall, this work presents a generalizable strategy for designing high‐energy‐density rechargeable multivalent‐metal battery systems."},{"t":"糖肽库的化学酶法合成可解码唾液酸化依赖性免疫优势，以实现有效的多用途","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525026?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aberrant sialylation is a hallmark of tumor glycosylation that promotes malignant progression and immune evasion. While sialylated carbohydrates represent attractive targets for anticancer vaccines, structural and antigenic insights into glycopeptides are still hampered by limited access to well‐defined structures, rendering their immunogenicity unclear. Herein, we describe an efficient chemoenzymatic platform for facile synthesis of a glycopeptide library comprising 18 structures with diverse\n                    O\n                    ‐glycans at different glycosylation sites. Glycopeptide microarray‐based serological screening revealed a consistent preference of cancer patient sera for sialylated glycopeptides over their non‐sialylated counterparts. Motivated by this finding, we performed systematic immunological evaluations of sialylated and non‐sialylated glycopeptide‐tetanus toxoid (TT) conjugates, demonstrating that sialylated glycopeptide‐TT conjugates elicit stronger antibody responses, enhanced tumor cell recognition, and more potent tumor growth inhibition through synergistic activation of antigen‐presenting cells and T cell subsets. Furthermore, we developed a multicomponent cocktail vaccine by incorporating four sialylated glycopeptides, which elicited broader and more potent immune activation than single‐antigen formulations. Antisera from the cocktail vaccine exhibited strong binding to human tumor tissues, underscoring the clinical relevance of our findings. This work establishes sialylation as a key determinant of glycopeptide immunogenicity and provides a rational strategy for developing next‐generation glycopeptide‐based cancer vaccines.","tp":"糖肽免疫库","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"开发了高效化学酶法平台用于糖肽库合成，解析唾液酸化依赖性免疫优势。异常唾液酸化是肿瘤糖基化的标志，促进恶性进展和免疫逃逸。该平台解决了结构明确的糖肽难以获取的瓶颈，为理解其免疫原性及开发多用途抗癌疫苗提供关键工具。"},{"t":"双锚定功能化分子实现2D/3D异质结化学桥联：高效、稳定且柔性的器件","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE03302K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿异质结电池","kp":["[界面工程]: 双锚定功能分子构建2D/3D异质结","器件[柔性钙钛矿电池]: 缺陷钝化+能级对齐"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种双锚定功能化分子化学桥接策略，用于构建二维/三维（2D/3D）钙钛矿异质结，以改善界面缺陷与能级失配问题。2D/3D异质结是提升钙钛矿太阳能电池稳定性和效率的有效途径，但界面非辐射复合限制了性能。通过双功能分子的协同锚定作用，实现了界面载流子传输优化和缺陷钝化，显著降低了界面能量损失。该方法为高效稳定钙钛矿光电器件的界面工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Chemical Bridging in 2D/3D Heterojunction via Dual-Anchoring Functionalized Molecules for Efficient, Stable and Flexible","b":"Constructing two-dimensional/three-dimensional (2D/3D) perovskite heterojunctions has emerged as an effective interfacial engineering strategy to passivate surface defects, optimize energy-level alignment, and suppress ion migration. However, conventional 2D layers are typically formed by surface stacking of bulky organic cations, which often result in weak interfacial coupling and hindered carrier transport, thereby limiting device performance. In this work, a single-molecule dual-functional surface-passivation strategy is proposed, in which 5-methyltryptamne hydrochloride (Me-TACl) treatment constructs a stable 2D perovskite passivation layer on top of 3D perovskite films and establishes a chemical bridge between them. This \"chemically bridged heterojunction passivation\" enhances interfacial coupling, suppresses surface defects, and optimizes energy level alignment. As a result, the Me-TACl treated devices exhibit remarkable enhancement in photovoltaic performance. The champion device achieves a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.35%, with a stabilized power output (SPO) of 26.20% over 300 s, outperforming the control device (24.67%). Moreover, the flexible device retains 92% of its initial efficiency (24.12%) after bending at a curvature radius of 5 mm for 5000 cycles, demonstrating outstanding mechanical durability. This post-treatment strategy simultaneously enhances efficiency, stability, and flexibility, offering insights for scalable high-efficiency perovskite photovoltaics and a viable interfacial design for next-generation devices."},{"t":"共价有机框架中电荷调控的吡啶氮用于无金属多相光催化C─H芳基化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523681?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化C-H芳基化","kp":["催化剂[无金属光催化C-H芳基化]: N-TFPPy-BD-COF","[活性位点]: 电荷调控吡啶氮"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究在共价有机框架（COF）中引入电荷调控的吡啶氮位点，实现了无金属催化的吡咯C─H芳基化反应。传统吡咯芳基化催化体系依赖贵金属或有机过氧化物，成本高且环境污染大。研究通过精确设计COF骨架中吡啶氮的电荷密度，调控其催化活性与选择性，在无金属条件下高效驱动芳基化偶联。该工作为绿色可持续的精细化学品合成提供了新型有机催化平台，拓展了COF在催化领域的应用边界。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Charge‐Regulated Pyridinic Nitrogen in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Metal‐Free Heterogeneous Photocatalytic C─H Aryla","b":"Abstract\n                  Conventional catalytic systems for the C─H arylation of pyrrole predominantly rely on noble metals or organic dyes, which suffer from inherent limitations such as low sustainability, challenging recyclability, and high cost. To address these challenges, this study develops a metal‐free photocatalytic strategy employing a designed covalent organic framework, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF, as an efficient heterogeneous catalyst with a precisely tailored electronic structure. Site‐specific nitrogen doping within the pyrene‐based scaffold enables fine‐tuning of the electronic landscape. Spectroscopic characterization and theoretical computations reveal that nitrogen doping facilitates spatial separation of photogenerated electron–hole pairs, suppresses recombination, thereby improves visible‐light absorption, prolongs charge‐carrier lifetimes, and enhances charge‐separation efficiency. Under visible‐light irradiation, the catalyst delivers outstanding performance in the arylation of pyrroles, affording a yield of 79% with 98% selectivity, surpassing those achieved by noble metal and organic dye‐based systems. Furthermore, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF exhibits remarkable stability as a heterogeneous catalyst, maintaining its structural integrity over ten consecutive catalytic cycles. This work not only presents a sustainable and efficient pathway for C─H arylation but also establishes a general strategy for the rational design of COF‐based photocatalysts through electronic structure engineering."},{"t":"细胞粘度影响肿瘤细胞的血行播散和转移外渗","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02462-w","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Metastases arise from a multistep process during which tumour cells face several microenvironmental mechanical challenges, which influence metastatic success. However, how circulating tumour cells (CTCs) adapt their mechanics to such microenvironments is not fully understood. Here we report that the deformability of CTCs affects their haematogenous dissemination and identify mechanical phenotypes that favour metastatic extravasation. Combining intravital microscopy with CTC-mimicking elastic beads, mechanical tuning in tumour lines and profiling of tumour-patient-derived cells, we demonstrate that the inherent mechanical properties of circulating objects dictate their ability to enter constraining vessels. We identify cellular viscosity as a rheostat of CTC circulation and arrest, and show that cellular viscosity is crucial for efficient extravasation. Moreover, we find that mechanical properties that favour extravasation and subsequent metastatic outgrowth can be opposite. Altogether, our results establish CTC viscosity as a key biomechanical parameter that shapes several steps of metastasis.","tp":"肿瘤转移力","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"肿瘤转移是一个多步骤的复杂过程，其中肿瘤细胞在微环境中面临的机械力学挑战对转移成功率有重大影响。研究探讨了循环肿瘤细胞（CTCs）如何通过改变自身力学特性来适应微环境。研究发现，CTCs的变形能力直接影响其血源性播散过程，并确定了有利于肿瘤转移外渗的力学表型。通过结合活体显微镜技术与模拟CTC的弹性微珠，研究深入揭示了细胞粘度等力学因素在肿瘤血行播散和转移外渗中的关键作用，为抑制肿瘤转移提供了新的力学靶点。"},{"t":"Calumenin 通过促进波形蛋白稳态来防止成纤维细胞衰老和肺老化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2426723123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Progressive lung fibrosis is linked to aging-related dysfunction in fibroblasts, which remains poorly understood. To investigate the alterations in fibroblasts, particularly the molecular programs driving this profibrotic evolution in the aging lung, we isolated senescent lung fibroblasts from aged mice. We observed aberrant vimentin aggregates, which correlate with accelerated fibroblast senescence. CRISPR-based screening identified calumenin as a chaperone protein essential for vimentin proteostasis. A fibroblast-specific knockout of calumenin promotes the accumulation of vimentin aggregates and profibrotic factors migracytosis, exacerbating fibroblast senescence and lung aging. Mechanistically, calumenin collaborates with the TRiC complex to facilitate proper vimentin folding and recruits the chaperonin subunit Chaperonin Containing TCP1 Subunit 2 (CCT2) to degrade misfolded vimentin aggregates. Pathologically, external profibrotic stimuli trigger calcium transients and induce calumenin degradation, resulting in fibroblast senescence and the initiation of fibrosis. The natural product 9-85, derived from high-content screening, specifically targets and disrupts vimentin aggregates upon stimulation, alleviating aging-related lung fibrosis. Our findings reveal that calumenin coordinates vimentin quality control to shape cell structure and suppress the secretome of senescent fibroblasts, providing a promising therapeutic strategy for aging-related organ fibrosis.","tp":"肺老化机制","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"进行性肺纤维化与成纤维细胞的衰老及老化功能障碍密切相关，但其潜在分子机制尚不明确。研究从老龄小鼠体内分离出衰老的肺成纤维细胞，观察到异常的波形蛋白聚集体与成纤维细胞加速衰老直接相关。通过基于CRISPR的基因筛选技术，研究鉴定出Calumenin是一种对维持波形蛋白稳态至关重要的伴侣蛋白。Calumenin能够促进波形蛋白的蛋白稳态，从而有效防止成纤维细胞衰老，减缓肺部老化与纤维化进程，为治疗衰老相关的肺纤维化疾病提供了新的潜在治疗靶点。"},{"t":"双-NHC-二芳基乙烯钯配合物：动态行为与自调谐光控开关","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522849?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯配合物光开关","kp":["[光致变色]: 双NHC-二芳基乙烯钯配合物","特性[光开关]: 自调节光开关(逐步光环化)"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本文合成双-NHC-二芳基乙烯钯配合物，研究其动态行为和自调谐光开关特性。光作为精确控制物质的手段，在光响应材料开发中具有独特优势。该钯配合物结合NHC配体的强供电子能力和二芳基乙烯的光致异构化特性，实现了光驱动下配位结构的可逆调控，展现出自调谐开关行为。","ot":"Bis‐NHC‐Diarylethene Palladium Complexes: Dynamic Behavior and Self‐Tuning Photoswitching","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Light offers a unique means of controlling matter with high precision, yet the development of robust photoresponsive transition‐metal complexes remains a challenge. Here we report a self‐tuning photochromic system based on a diarylethene‐derived bis‐NHC‐palladium complex. The trans‐anti complex (\n                    \n                      1\n                      oo\n                    \n                    ) undergoes efficient stepwise photocyclization as well as unprecedented light‐induced trans/cis isomerization at the metal center. Isolation and crystallographic characterization of the cis‐anti isomer (\n                    \n                      2\n                      oo\n                    \n                    ) reveal a thermodynamically more stable structure with enhanced photochromic performance and reversible multistate switching. Thermal studies uncover interconversion with additional rotamer, establishing a dynamic equilibrium among several photoactive palladium species. Spectroscopic and computational investigations elucidate the electronic transitions that drive both diarylethene cyclization and Pd─NHC geometric rearrangements. We demonstrate that the catalytic activity in the Suzuki‐Miyaura coupling reaction can be reversibly switched by light, with the photocyclized catalyst forms showing negligible catalytic activity, while the open forms achieve high efficiency. This establishes a direct link between photoisomerization and predicted catalytic performance. Pre‐catalyst evolution demonstrates that the geometry of the complex controls the balance between nanoparticle‐mediated and homogeneous reactivity, delineating a novel strategy for adaptive catalysis."},{"t":"用于转移淋巴结选择性免疫工程的生物反应性免疫调节剂纳米复合物","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519625123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lymph node (LN) metastasis (LNM) frequently occurs in various cancer types and is associated with high aggressiveness, poor prognosis, and low survival rates. However, effective clinical interventions remain limited primarily due to the distinctive immunosuppressive microenvironment found in metastatic LNs. Targeted delivery of immunomodulators and selective immunoengineering in metastatic LNs offers a promising avenue for repurposing these LNs as an effective antitumor system while mitigating the risk of unwanted immune activation elsewhere. Here, we develop a bioresponsive LN-targeted immunomodulator nanocomplex designed to selectively reprogram the immune microenvironment in metastatic LNs for LNM inhibition. The immunomodulator nanocomplex can target LNs due to specific chemokine receptor 7 modification and selectively release anti-PD-1 antibodies in response to glutathione that is found elevated in the extracellular matrix of metastatic LNs. In two mouse models, our data suggested that the immunomodulator nanocomplex can selectively activate T cell-mediated antitumor immune responses in metastatic LNs and thus effectively inhibit tumor growth and prolong the survival of animals. Importantly, the modular design of this platform could enable facile incorporation of alternative immunotherapeutic agents that exhibit significant systemic toxicities in the clinic, allowing broader application to payloads that may particularly benefit from localized, LNM-selective activation. This approach holds significant promises for reducing the necessity for complete LN dissection, thereby presenting a valuable therapeutic option for a broad spectrum of cancer patients.","tp":"免疫纳米粒","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对淋巴结转移中独特的免疫抑制微环境，开发了生物反应性免疫调节剂纳米复合物，实现转移淋巴结的选择性免疫工程和靶向递送。该策略旨在将转移淋巴结重新改造为抗肿瘤系统，同时减轻全身毒性，为淋巴结转移的临床干预提供新途径。"},{"t":"用于 N-甲基-d-天冬氨酸受体活体成像的生物正交激活化学发光","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523648?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The signal attenuation caused by skull/vertebrae remains a challenge in central nervous system (CNS) receptor imaging. Chemiluminescence (CL), free from external excitation, offers unparalleled tissue penetration in optical imaging. However, existing 1,2‐dioxetane CL systems are shackled by two limitations: (i) short half‐lives (&lt;2 h) from rapid dioxetane decomposition and (ii) dependence on reactive biomolecules such as reactive oxygen species and enzymes to trigger dioxetane decomposition, rendering them incompatible with imaging nonreactive biomolecules like receptor proteins. Here we report a bioorthogonally activatable chemiluminescence (BACL) strategy that integrates click‐to‐release reactions with 1,2‐dioxetane luminophores to enable tetrazine‐triggered OFF–ON CL signals and bioorthogonally tunable half‐lives (5.2–18 h). The tissue penetration depth was up to 6 cm. Through a tetrazine‐conjugated specific ligand, BACL imaged\n                    N\n                    ‐methyl‐\n                    d\n                    ‐aspartate receptors (NMDARs) in vivo with a signal background ratio of ∼182, allowing clear\n                    d\n                    ifferentiation of NMDAR expression levels between Alzheimer's disease model mice and normal controls. Beyond imaging, the bioorthogonally spatiotemporally controlled CL emission positions BACL as a potential internal light source for deep‐tissue precision phototherapeutics, bypassing external irradiation.","tp":"化学发光探","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对中枢神经系统受体成像中颅骨/脊椎信号衰减难题，开发了生物正交激活化学发光技术用于NMDA受体活体成像。该技术克服了现有1,2-二氧杂环丁烷体系半衰期短和依赖活性生物分子两大局限，无需外部激发即可实现深层组织穿透。"},{"t":"生物材料的仿生工程重建基质-实质相互作用以促进中风后神经再生","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512404?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Stroke remains a leading cause of neurological disability worldwide. A major obstacle to brain tissue regeneration after stroke is the persistent local inflammation and the absence of extracellular matrix (ECM) support within the infarct cavity, which severely impedes the brain's endogenous repair. Inspired by the natural interactions between stromal and parenchymal cells, we developed an engineered living material to recreate a regenerative niche within the stroke cavity. This system integrates a programmable supramolecular DNA hydrogel with interleukin‐10–secreting engineered‐mesenchymal stem cells (eMSCs) and neural stem cells (NSCs). The hydrogel mimics the structural and mechanical properties of the native ECM, enhancing the retention and viability of transplanted cells. Meanwhile, eMSCs modulate the inflammatory environment, suppress glial scar formation, and promote vascular regeneration, thereby facilitating the neuronal differentiation of NSCs. In a rat model of ischemic stroke, these engineered living materials significantly promote neuronal regeneration, synaptic remodeling, and neovascularization, leading to improved motor and cognitive function. These findings highlight a modular strategy for repairing damaged neural tissues by re‐establishing stromal–parenchymal interactions, offering a promising therapeutic avenue for post‐stroke brain regeneration.","tp":"脑再生材料","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对中风后脑组织再生面临的持续炎症和细胞外基质缺失障碍，受基质细胞与实质细胞自然相互作用启发，开发了工程化活体材料以在梗死腔内重建再生微环境，促进脑内源性修复，为中风后神经再生提供新策略。"},{"t":"数据驱动场景生成下的数据中心与电-热-计算耦合系统双层规划","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心规划","dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation"},{"t":"超越物种范围：功能多样性和综合生活史如何为保护优先事项提供信息","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531790123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用太阳能：车载光伏辅助电源的太阳能电动公交车优化调度","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000127?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能公交调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Benefiting from solar: Optimal scheduling for solar electric buses with onboard PV auxiliary power"},{"t":"带隙破缺型铁基尖晶石电催化剂实现一体化海水解","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521993?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水电解催化剂","kp":["[催化剂]: 能带破缺Zn-O-Fe-O-Co异原子键(尖晶石)","应用[海水/废水]: 集成海水分解+废水净化"],"as":"研究报道一种具有带隙破缺（bandgap-broken）特征的铁基尖晶石（Fe spinel）电催化剂，可实现海水直接电解制氢。该催化剂通过调控Fe的氧化态和电子结构，优化了析氢/析氧反应活性，同时有效抑制海水中氯离子的腐蚀与竞争反应，在全海水介质中展现出优异的催化稳定性与法拉第效率，为大规模海水电解制氢提供了新思路。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Bandgap‐Broken Fe Spinel Electrocatalyst Enables Integrated Seawater Electrolysis","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Despite considerable attention on spinel catalysts in electrocatalysis, achieving their distinct redox activity at the atomic scale for cathodic seawater splitting and anodic wastewater purification represents a huge challenge. In this work, we address this issue by constructing bandgap‐broken Zn─O─Fe─O─Co heteroatomic bonds through the integration of reduced ZnFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and oxidized CoFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    semiconductors within spinel‐structured Zn\n                    x\n                    Co\n                    1‐x\n                    Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    . The overlapping conduction and valence bands at Fe 3\n                    d\n                    orbitals promote electron redistribution at Fe centers, leading to electron depletion, exposure of empty\n                    d\n                    orbitals, and modulation of the d‐band center. These electronic modifications enhance the adsorption kinetics of H\n                    2\n                    O in seawater and S\n                    2−\n                    species in wastewater through\n                    d–p\n                    orbital coupling, lowering the energy barriers for the Volmer step in hydrogen evolution reaction and the rate‐limiting *S─*S\n                    2\n                    process in sulfur oxidation reaction. As a result, the rational design enables efficient bifunctional activity, achieving simultaneous seawater splitting and industrial pollutant degradation in a single electrolyzer at an ultralow cell voltage of 1.07 V (10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ), operable under solar energy. This study provides a fundamental design strategy for bifunctional catalysts toward integrated energy and environmental applications."},{"t":"BORC 组件整合 BLOC-1 亚基以使内体运输功能多样化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515691123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"BORC and BLOC-1 are multisubunit complexes that regulate endolysosomal trafficking. Although they are presumed to be distinct, their paralogous origins and shared subunits suggest the potential for higher-order assembly. Here, we reveal the conserved octameric architecture of BORC formed by two intertwined tetramers and present the structure of C. elegans BORC. Through cross-linking mass spectrometry of endogenous complexes, we validate this model for human BORC and demonstrate that the integrity of the complex, which is essential for lysosomal transport, relies on specific interfacial residues. We also clarify the disruptive nature of disease-causing mutations and propose that the formation and function of BORC are likely regulated by specific cues. These cues might include the phosphorylation of Snapin and a pH-sensitive histidine residue in BORCS5. Additionally, we present direct biochemical and structural evidence of BORC-BLOC-1 hybrid complexes. Finally, we link a specific hybrid complex to the regulation of transferrin receptor recycling via interaction with the EARP complex. Our work challenges the paradigm of BORC and BLOC-1 as separate entities, establishing a model of dynamic complex formation wherein modular assembly creates functional specialization to meet diverse cellular demands."},{"t":"作者更正：人为对主要热带气旋事件的影响","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10109-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"钙钛矿光伏材料中非谐晶格动力学与热膨胀的原子尺度起源","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01938-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿晶格动力学","kp":["[机理]: 非谐晶格动力学致极端热膨胀","问题[钙钛矿光伏]: 与器件层热失配,日夜循环累积应力"],"as":"本研究从原子尺度揭示了金属卤化物钙钛矿中非谐晶格动力学与热膨胀的物理起源。钙钛矿光伏材料因其卓越的光电性能迅速成为研究热点，但其与传统半导体截然不同的晶格行为（异常热膨胀、低弹性模量等）长期缺乏机理性解释。研究通过分析晶格振动中的非谐效应，阐明了钙钛矿中原子间相互作用的各向异性与动态畸变如何导致强烈的非谐声子散射，进而驱动热膨胀行为。该工作为理解钙钛矿材料的热稳定性极限、优化器件封装设计提供了关键理论基础。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomistic origins of anharmonic lattice dynamics and thermal expansion in perovskite photovoltaics","b":"Metal halide perovskites are swiftly becoming a leading class of photovoltaic materials, yet unlike conventional semiconductors, they exhibit highly anharmonic lattice vibrations that produce extreme rates of thermal expansion and substantial mismatch with other device layers. These effects are exacerbated under natural day/night cycling, where repeated heating and cooling drive cumulative stress, defect generation and accelerated degradation. Here we connect the atomistic origins of anharmonic lattice dynamics in perovskites with their macroscopic thermo-mechanical properties, from phonon–phonon interactions and local disorder to complex thermal–phase relations. We assess how both the degree of anharmonicity and thermal expansion rates vary across temperature, composition and phase, and highlight the emergence of anisotropic and even negative thermal expansion in low-symmetry perovskite phases. By linking fundamental physics to device-level challenges, we provide a framework for engineering durable perovskite absorbers and outline promising approaches to regulate thermal strain in the pursuit of long-lived, commercially viable solar cell technologies."},{"t":"具有优异减振与吸能性能的架构互穿相微晶格结构","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518377?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微晶格复合材料","kp":["[结构]: 互穿相微晶格","[性能]: 优异减振与能量吸收"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种互穿相微晶格超材料架构，在振动衰减方面展现出优越性能。随着工程应用对材料性能要求日益严苛，传统单一均匀材料已无法满足极端减振需求。研究者通过多材料协同设计，将不同相态结构在微尺度上互穿交织，利用相界面处的能量耗散与阻抗失配机制，实现宽频带振动抑制。该架构在保持轻量化的同时显著提升阻尼性能，在航空航天、精密仪器隔振等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Architected Interpenetrating Phase Microlattice With Superior Vibration Attenuation and Energy Absorption Performance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  With the increasing demand for material performance, traditional pure materials no longer meet the stringent requirements. Interpenetrating phase composites (IPCs), composed of two or more completely interconnected constituent phases, have garnered significant attention for their extraordinary capabilities. Here, we propose a novel fabrication method for interpenetrating phase microlattices (IPMs) synthesized with a resin skeleton and flexible rubber as the secondary phase. The stress–strain curves of different types of IPMs were obtained by static compression tests, which revealed highly enhanced toughness and specific energy absorption through the combination of size effect and lattice topology design. Noncontact dynamic response measurements were used to analyze the dynamic properties of both skeletons and IPMs. By leveraging the intrinsic energy dissipation capacity of the introduced secondary soft phase, IPMs exhibited a maximum 76.3% attenuation range and a maximum 31.5 dB transmissibility loss. The average transmissibility versus structural density was compared with that of similar IPC attenuation systems, demonstrating the superior energy dissipation performance of the IPMs."},{"t":"立方相甲脒碘化铅(α-FAPbI3)薄膜中各向异性应变诱导的中心对称性破缺","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506280?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿薄膜应变","kp":["材料[钙钛矿]: α-FAPbI3立方相","[机制]: 各向异性应变致中心对称破缺"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究发现立方相甲脒铅碘（FAPbI₃）钙钛矿中各向异性应变可诱导中心对称性破缺，从而调控其光电性质。有机-无机卤化物钙钛矿被视为下一代光电材料的有力候选，但FAPbI₃的结构对称性与性能关系尚不清晰。研究通过施加方向性应变，使原本立方对称的晶格发生局部极化畸变，打破中心对称性，产生铁电或压电响应。这一发现为通过应变工程精确调控钙钛矿光电器件的性能提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Anisotropic Strain‐Induced Centrosymmetry Breaking in Cubic Formamidinium Lead Iodide (α‐FAPbI3) Thin Films","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic–inorganic halide perovskites have emerged as promising materials for next‐generation optoelectronic devices due to their exceptional photophysical properties. Among them, α‐formamidinium lead tri‐iodide (α‐FAPbI\n                    3\n                    ) with a cubic symmetry (space group of ) has garnered attention as a potential absorber in solar cells for its narrow bandgap and superior stability. The fundamental mechanisms governing its high performance have yet to be fully elucidated. In this study, we demonstrate that centrosymmetry breaking in [001] preferentially oriented α‐FAPbI\n                    3\n                    thin films (POF) arises from inevitable anisotropic strain during film formation. Using circular polarization‐dependent pump‐probe transient absorption spectroscopy, we observe Rashba‐type band splitting exclusively in POF, indicating symmetry breaking. Angle‐dependent X‐ray diffraction and photoluminescence (PL) reveal significant residual stress in POF compared to randomly oriented films (ROF), confirming strain‐induced lattice distortion. Furthermore, time‐resolved PL and microwave conductivity measurements reveal top‐back inhomogeneous carrier dynamics and anisotropic charge carrier mobility, supporting the presence of the anisotropic strain‐induced symmetry breaking. Our findings provide direct experimental evidence that inevitable strain in POF induces static Rashba effects, offering new insights into strain engineering for high‐performance perovskite optoelectronics and potential quantum applications."},{"t":"无定形、初生态还是介孔化分子筛？中间合成相综述：定义、表征与机制","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523144?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沸石中间相","kp":["[主题]: 沸石中间合成相(非晶/胚态/介孔化)","观点[催化]: 中间相被忽视,具应用价值"],"as":"本文综述了沸石合成过程中多种中间态——无定形、初生态及介孔化沸石——的合成策略与结构特征。沸石作为工业催化剂的成功长期归功于其高热稳定性和精确的择形选择性，但传统全结晶沸石在大分子催化反应中存在扩散限制。研究者系统梳理了介于无定形硅铝与完全结晶沸石之间的各类中间材料的制备路径、表征方法及催化行为，讨论了它们在扩孔、增强传质等方面的优势，为设计面向大分子转化的新型催化材料提供了路线图。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Amorphous, Embryonic or Mesoporized Zeolites? An Overview of Intermediate Synthetic Phases: Definitions, Characterizatio","b":"Abstract\n                  The success of zeolites as catalysts has long been attributed to their high thermal stability and strict shape selectivity flowing from their network of well‐defined channels and cages. Synthetic efforts often unjustly disregarded (partially) amorphous intermediate synthetic phases (ISPs), including embryonic zeolite, interzeolite conversion intermediates and mesoporized zeolites, as “failed” and excluded them from further characterization efforts. Recently, this perception has changed and better characterization techniques have led to a deeper understanding of the structure and catalytic potential these materials (may) hold. In this work, we will give a brief overview of the state of the art research being conducted in synthesis, characterization and exploitation of ISPs, as well as clarifying some definitions, hoping to set the stage for future generations of zeolite scientists."},{"t":"α氧——量子化学视角下的独特氧化活性位点","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00496A","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石α氧活性位","kp":["[活性位]: α-O(Fe(IV)O/Fe(III)-O·)稳定于沸石","反应能力[甲烷]: 室温氧化甲烷为甲醇"],"as":"本文从量子化学视角系统阐述了α氧（α-O，即Fe(IV)=O或Fe(III)–O⁻·自由基态）这一独特氧化活性位点的电子结构与反应性。α氧稳定存在于沸石基质中，展现出与常规金属-氧物种截然不同的氧化能力，可在温和条件下活化C–H键。研究通过密度泛函理论计算揭示了α氧中Fe–O键的自旋态、电荷分布及反应路径，阐明了沸石骨架孔道限域效应对其活性的关键调控作用，为设计高效选择性氧化催化剂提供了理论指导。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Alpha oxygen – a unique oxidation active site from a quantum chemical viewpoint","b":"The alpha oxygen (also α-O, Fe(IV)O, and Fe(III)–O−˙) stabilized in zeolite matrices exhibits a unique reactivity. It is, for example, able to oxidize methane to methanol at room temperature. Such a high oxidation activity makes the alpha oxygen an extremely attractive species from the point of view of oxidation catalysis. The alpha oxygen can be prepared by splitting either N2O or O2 also at low temperatures over different transition metal cations stabilized in extra-framework cationic sites of zeolites in the form of either isolated cations or two cooperating cations forming distant binuclear cationic sites. The alpha oxygen was primarily defined by its reactivity, and up to now, experimental data concerning its structure are rather scarce. Quantum chemical calculations are used to interpret experimental data and thus yield significantly deeper insights into the preparation, structure, and reactivity of this otherwise omitted active species with enormous potential for applications. This review represents the first collection and systematic interpretation of experimental data and quantum chemical calculations to provide a complex description of the alpha oxygen and its structure, reactivity, and properties."},{"t":"刚性孔道分隔金属有机框架用于气体分离的脂肪族配体设计原则","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521262?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF气体分离","kp":["[设计概念]: 扩展生物等排取代(eBIS)","应用[MOFs气体分离]: 脂肪族配体刚性化孔空间分割"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"本文提出用于气体分离的刚性孔道分区金属有机框架（MOF）的脂肪族配体设计原则。脂肪族配体因构象柔性常被排除在框架材料设计之外，但研究表明通过合理的刚性化策略，脂肪族配体可构建具有精确孔道分区的MOF结构，实现高选择性气体分离。文章阐明了配体刚性化与气体吸附选择性间的构效关系。","ot":"Aliphatic Ligand Design Principles for Rigid Pore‐Space‐Partitioned Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Gas Separation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aliphatic ligands are often sidelined in the design of framework materials because their conformational flexibility can contribute to problems such as difficult crystallization, low porosity, and stability. Attempts to boost porosity by ligand elongation usually worsen these problems. Here we propose an expanded bioisosteric replacement (eBIS) concept capable of both scaling up and rigidifying aliphatic ligands. We demonstrate one example realized via linking two cyclohexyl rings in series, which restricts ligand flexibility through intramolecular non‐covalent interactions providing an alternative to the π‐conjugation‐based rigidity. The resulting ligand displays consistent rigidity across multiple MOF platforms. On the\n                    pacs\n                    platform, it can realize extreme pore geometry with the highest hexagonal\n                    c\n                    /\n                    a\n                    ratio and new metal‐cluster chemistry such as the first synthesis of nickel‐titanium oxocluster. It can boost the BET surface area to as high as 2810 m\n                    2\n                     g\n                    −1\n                    , likely the highest among aliphatic‐dicarboxylate MOFs. Furthermore, it leads to possibly largest C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    uptake differences (88 cm\n                    3\n                     g\n                    −1\n                    , uptake ratio of 1.83, 273 K) among rigid MOFs, a desired property for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    ‐selective separation, which is confirmed by breakthrough experiments. The remarkably low adsorption enthalpies for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    (14.7 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    ) and C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    (15.1 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    ) enables low‐energy adsorbent regeneration benefitting practical separation."},{"t":"人口老龄化威胁动物园的保护目标","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522274123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Improvements in wildlife husbandry mean that many zoo animals are living longer. This has put pressure on the finite holding capacity of zoos, which has often been addressed through a curtailing of reproduction to reduce population growth rates. Here, we explore how such actions have impacted the demographic trends of 774 mammal populations in European and North American zoo populations between 1970 and 2023. Irrespective of whether the data are clustered by region, taxonomic group, conservation status, or breeding program type, the proportion of old individuals has increased continuously, mirrored by a decrease in juveniles and actively reproducing adults. This aging demographic trend compromises the long-term sustainability of zoo populations and thus the ability of zoos to meet ex situ conservation goals. As the observed trends do not show signs of abating, reflection on current zoo population management is required.","tp":"动物园保护","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"随着野生动物饲养护理技术的进步，动物园内许多动物的寿命显著延长。然而，这给动物园有限的容纳空间带来了巨大压力。为解决这一问题，动物园通常采取限制动物繁殖的措施以减缓种群增长。研究分析了1970年至2023年间欧美动物园中774个哺乳动物种群的数据，探讨了这种限制繁殖策略对动物种群结构和数量趋势的长期影响。研究警告称，动物园动物种群的老龄化趋势正日益严重，这不仅挤占了有限的生存空间，更直接威胁到了动物园维持种群基因多样性和实现濒危物种保护的核心目标。"},{"t":"2025年智能电网电池技术进展","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00134-1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电网储能电池","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Advances in battery technologies for smart grids in 2025"},{"t":"2025 年水中 PFAS 处理的进展","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00126-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"基于误差函数SoC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案用于可再生能源中分布式电池储能系统","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池储能SOC均衡","dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewa"},{"t":"通过氧空位调控加速Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7正极电化学动力学以实现宽温域运行","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525531?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池磷酸盐正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)","[策略]: 氧空位调控加速电化学动力学","特点[实用电池]: 宽温安时级"],"as":"钠离子电池正极材料Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7（NFPP）因资源丰富、热稳定性好被视为有前景的候选，但本征电导率低限制了倍率性能。该研究通过氧缺陷工程（氧空位调控）加速电化学反应动力学，改善钠离子扩散与电荷转移，从而提升NFPP正极的容量保持率和高倍率循环表现，为钠离子电池正极材料的工程化改性提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Accelerating Electrochemical Kinetics in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 Cathodes Through Oxygen Vacancy Modulation for Wide‐Temperatur","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP) stands as a highly promising cathode material for sodium‐ion batteries, offering a favorable combination of operating voltage and theoretical capacity. Nevertheless, its commercial viability is significantly hindered by two primary factors: the prevalent formation of electrochemically inert impurity phases, such as\n                    maricite\n                    ‐NaFePO\n                    4\n                    and low‐energy‐density Na\n                    2\n                    FeP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    , during conventional synthesis, coupled with its intrinsically poor electronic conductivity. Herein, we demonstrate a rational defect‐engineering strategy to enhance the electrochemical kinetics of NFPP cathodes through controlled oxygen vacancy formation. The optimized Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    2.79\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP‐2.79) exhibits superior phase purity, enhanced electronic conductivity, and facilitated Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion, as confirmed by multi‐scale characterization techniques. The NFPP‐2.79 cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 89.51 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10C and retains 96.42% capacity after 1500 cycles at 2C. Moreover, kilogram‐scale synthesis using cost‐effective raw precursors has been achieved via a sand‐milling‐assisted spray‐drying route. When assembled into Ah‐level pouch cells with hard carbon anodes, the NFPP‐2.79‐based cell demonstrates excellent rate capability (93.75% capacity retention from 0.5C to 4C), outstanding cyclability (75.63% retention after 3000 cycles), and superior safety under extreme conditions (overheating, crushing, nail penetration, overcharge, and external short‐circuit). This work highlights oxygen vacancy modulation as an effective pathway for advancing polyanionic cathodes toward practical applications.","aip":1},{"t":"空气源热泵瞬态性能预测的降阶模型","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000644?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空气源热泵降阶建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A reduced-order model for predicting transient performance of air-source heat pumps"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合发电系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光水电站竞价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid pow"},{"t":"奖励诱导抑制恐惧泛化和增强恐惧消退的神经回路基础","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522768123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"How positive and negative affective stimuli interact in the brain to influence behavioral outcomes remains poorly understood. Here, we show that recall of a positively valenced reward-associated cue (reward-conditioned stimulus, CSRew+) can prevent or reverse fear generalization in mice. Modification of generalized fear by recall of a CSRew+ is dependent on the midbrain dopamine system and the regulation of discriminatory fear encoding by the central amygdala (CeA). Precisely timed, transient elevations in dopamine are necessary to reverse fear generalization and nondiscriminatory fear encoding in the CeA. Recall of a positive association is also effective at enhancing the extinction of a conditioned fear response in a dopamine-dependent manner. These data demonstrate that recall of a positive experience can be an effective means to suppress generalized fear and show that dopamine projections to the CeA are an important neural substrate for this phenomenon.","tp":"恐惧消退环","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"大脑中积极与消极情感刺激如何相互作用以影响行为表现，其机制目前仍知之甚少。研究表明，在小鼠模型中，回忆具有积极效价的奖赏相关线索（条件刺激）能够有效预防甚至逆转恐惧泛化现象。这种通过回忆奖赏线索来调节广泛性恐惧的过程，依赖于中脑多巴胺系统，以及中央杏仁核对恐惧辨识编码的调控。研究进一步指出，精准且短暂的电刺激能够模拟这种奖赏效应。该发现揭示了奖赏削弱恐惧泛化并促进恐惧消退的神经回路基础，为治疗创伤后应激障碍等恐惧相关精神疾病提供了新方向。"},{"t":"基于AlInP/GaInP外延层的硅基单片三维集成红色Micro-LED显示","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01546-4","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Electronics","dp":1,"as":"硅基单片三维集成红光Micro-LED显示技术通过将驱动电路与LED发光层垂直堆叠集成，消除传统flip-chip工艺中机械对准带来的像素间距限制与互联损耗。该方案在硅晶圆上实现全单片三维集成，显著提升Micro-LED显示的像素密度与发光效率，为高分辨率AR/VR微显示、车载HUD等领域的硅基显示提供了工程化路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基Micro-LED","kp":["[集成]: 单片3D集成红光micro-LED","外延层[红光micro-LED]: AlInP/GaInP","[挑战]: 像素缩小致量子效率低"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A monolithic three-dimensional integrated red micro-LED display on silicon using AlInP/GaInP epilayers","b":"Monolithic three-dimensional integration technology can eliminate the need for mechanical alignment between driving circuits and light-emitting diode (LED) pixels, leading to ultrahigh-resolution displays. However, this is challenging for red micro-LEDs, which are typically based on AlGaInP/GaInP, because of their low quantum efficiency and performance degradation when the pixel size is reduced. Here we report a high-pixel-density (1,700 pixels per inch) red active-matrix display consisting of micro-LEDs based on an epitaxial AlInP/GaInP double-quantum-well structure and silicon complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor integrated circuits. The epitaxial layer exhibits high internal quantum efficiency at low current densities (less than 10 A cm−2) due to a hole-dominant quantum well that reduces the non-radiative Shockley–Read–Hall recombination caused by electron lateral diffusion. We also use thickness fluctuation scattering in the quantum well to minimize the size-dependent quantum efficiency shift to higher current densities when reducing the size of the red micro-LEDs."},{"t":"水电解槽剩余使用寿命预测综述：从降解机制到预测方法","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解槽寿命预测","dp":1,"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic"},{"t":"结合高效光电化学储能与日光利用的增值型太阳能可充电电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523063?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能可充电电池","kp":["[电池化学]: 太阳能介导可充电海水电池","[增值]: 自驱动光催化产H2O2"],"dp":1,"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究开发了一种太阳能驱动的增值可充电电池，将光电化学储能与太阳光利用高效集成。该电池在储存电能的同时可利用光能驱动合成高附加值化学品，实现了能量存储与化学合成的耦合。这种多功能电池设计拓展了传统储能器件的功能边界，在可持续能源转化与绿色化学合成方面具有创新意义。","ot":"A Value‐Added Solar‐Mediated Rechargeable Battery Integrating Efficient Photoelectrochemical Energy Storage with Sunligh","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Developing sustainable functional batteries capable of generating valuable chemicals during electricity storage/release represents challenging frontiers. Here, we present a new battery chemistry that enables the first value‐added solar‐mediated rechargeable seawater battery integrating photoelectrochemical energy storage with sunlight‐boosted self‐powered H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production from seawater without external power/O\n                    2\n                    supply. This system is enabled by rationally‐designed bifunctional S‐scheme heterojunction photocathodes (MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    ) comprising A3‐(D‐core) polymer (MP‐COP) encapsulated TiO\n                    2\n                    . A3‐(D‐core) topology induces favorable electronic modulation that optimizes oxygen specie adsorption and steering oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) toward one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    pathway—while facilitating electronic coupling with oxygen evolution reaction (OER)‐active TiO\n                    2\n                    to establish S‐scheme charge transfer mechanism alongside strengthened built‐in electric field. These endow MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sunlight‐boosted 4e\n                    –\n                    OER for in situ O\n                    2\n                    ‐generation during photo‐charge and 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    synthesis during photo‐discharge, establishing solar‐mediated self‐sustaining value‐added reaction cycles. Integrating MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sodium anodes and seawater creates previously‐unexplored functional battery, yielding remarkable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    yield of 5.47 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during photo‐discharge—9.4 times those in dark and exceeding most reported seawater systems while delivering near‐zero charge/discharge voltage gap under illumination. Mechanistic studies reveal promoting effect of A3‐(D‐core) modulation and its synergistic role with S‐scheme charge transfer that promotes Yeager‐type O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and facilitates one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR toward H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"控制键断裂和前药激活的非共价点击释放策略","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515594?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Click‐to‐release chemistry enables bioorthogonal bond cleavage and controlled release via a click‐type ligation reaction serving as both the trigger and means of localization. Extending this concept beyond covalent ligation reactions, we introduce a noncovalent click‐to‐release strategy based on cucurbit[7]uril‐adamantane (CB‐Ad) association. The CB host molecule forms a pre‐assembled host‐guest complex with a self‐immolative guest (SIG) SIG1, where the masked SIG remains inert. Introduction of a high‐affinity guest Ad initiates the CB‐Ad noncovalent click reaction, displacing SIG1 and triggering its self‐immolation and cargo release. As a proof‐of‐concept, we used a prototype prodrug SIG2 to demonstrate our strategy's potential for controlled therapeutic release, effectively regulating the photodynamic cell killing in vitro. This noncovalent click‐to‐release approach broadens the structural and functional scope of bioorthogonal cleavage strategies with promising implications for stimuli‐responsive materials and biomedical applications."},{"t":"弹性电子器件单片微光刻用(液态)金属光刻胶","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72140?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态金属光刻胶","kp":["[光刻材料]: 液态金属光刻胶","[应用]: 弹性电子单片微光刻"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种液态金属光刻胶，用于弹性电子器件的单片微光刻加工。弹性电子具有与生物组织相似的机械柔性，在可穿戴和植入式设备中前景广阔，但高精度图案化制造困难。该金属光刻胶将光刻工艺与弹性导体结合，实现了高分辨率、可拉伸电路的一体化制造，推动了柔性电子的规模化加工。","ot":"(Liquid) Metallic Photoresist for Monolithic Microlithography of Elastic Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  By offering mechanical compliance similar to biological tissue, elastic electronics show great potential in wearable and implanted electronics, interactive robots, and neural interfaces. Miniaturization of elastic electronics through advanced microfabrication is essential to increase device density for high‐quality and comprehensive information processing. Cleanroom photolithography is conventionally used for micropatterning photoresists, whose patterns are then transferred to rigid metal or semiconductor materials through lift‐off or etching processes. However, such delicate processes are exclusive and cannot be directly translated to fabricate elastic electronics, which are usually based on unconventional materials. Here, we developed a metallic photoresist, based on ligand‐encapsulated eutectic gallium‐indium liquid metal nanoparticles, and an associated microfabrication process that enables direct, single‐step liquid metal microlithography across wafer‐scale areas. By leveraging tunable covalent and noncovalent interactions at liquid metal nanoparticles interfaces, this method achieves 2 µm resolution, bulk‐level conductivity, and 3D topology matching of liquid metal patterns, while maintaining over 750% stretchability. We demonstrate the versatility of this approach by fabricating multi‐scale elastic electronics, from high‐resolution liquid metal grid transparent electrodes and ECoG neural electrodes to large‐area flexible printed circuit boards.","aip":1},{"t":"揭示磷酸三烷基酯对高效镁电解液中溶剂化壳层和固体电解质界面的位阻效应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c14645","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁电池电解液","kp":["库仑效率[Mg沉积/剥离]: ≈100%","[电解质]: Mg(OTf)₂/二甘醇二甲醚:磷酸三乙酯","[机制]: 空间位阻调控溶剂化鞘与SEI"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究揭示了磷酸三烷基酯溶剂在镁电解液中溶剂化鞘层和SEI形成中的空间位阻效应。设计无氯、镁兼容的高压电解液是实现长寿命镁金属电池的关键。通过系统考察烷基链长度对Mg²⁺溶剂化结构和界面膜组成的影响，阐明了空间位阻调控离子输运和界面稳定性的机制，为高效镁电解液分子设计提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Unraveling the Steric Effect of Trialkyl Phosphates on the Solvation Sheath and Solid Electrolyte Interphase in High-Efficiency Magnesium Electrolytes","b":"Designing Mg-compatible and chloride-free electrolytes is important to achieving high-voltage and long-life Mg metal batteries. In electrolytes based on Mg(OTf)2/diglyme: triethyl phosphate that exhibit near 100% Coulombic efficiency for Mg plating/stripping at high current densities and capacities, the TXP (X = alkyl group) plays a key role. Herein, we unveil steric hindrance as the fundamental origin of this role in optimizing the Mg2+ solvation structure and forming electrolyte-derived solid electrolyte interphases. The steric hindrance was tuned by systematically changing the alkyl chain length of the phosphate (TXP) from one to five. Its impact on altering bulk electrolyte solvation and interfacial SEI chemistry was studied by combining both spectroscopy techniques and theoretical modeling methods. We demonstrate that low steric hindrance leads to easy decomposition of phosphate solvents, whereas high steric hindrance fails to interrupt Mg2+-triflate/diglyme interactions. TEP with medium hindrance shows optimized behavior in both scenarios, which is the origin of its superior electrochemical performance. Our finding provides a new solvent design principle at the molecular level for chloride-free Mg2+ electrolytes."},{"t":"锂金属电池中的异相电荷转移机制：基于Marcus理论揭示异常亲锂性","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12858","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["[理论]: Marcus-Hush-Chidsey理论","[发现]: Li沉积动力学反常依赖亲锂性"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究借助Marcus理论揭示了锂金属电池中异质电荷转移机制，发现了异常的亲锂性现象。锂金属电池虽具高能量密度，但锂电沉积不均匀和枝晶生长严重制约循环寿命。该工作从电荷转移动力学角度出发，通过Marcus理论分析界面电荷转移能垒的异质性，解释了亲锂性异常行为对锂均匀沉积的影响。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] The Heterogeneous Charge Transfer Mechanism in Lithium Metal Batteries: Revealing Abnormal Lithiophilicity through the Marcus Theory","b":"Li metal batteries offer a high energy density but suffer from nonuniform Li metal electroplating and dendrite formation, limiting practical use. These issues arise from complex interfacial charge transfer kinetics, which are still ambiguously defined. Here, we reveal an abnormal dependence of Li electrodeposition kinetics on substrate lithiophilicity, rationalized by the Marcus-Hush-Chidsey (MHC) theory. Contrary to conventional expectations, lithiophobic Cu enables faster electron transfer and more stable Li electroplating at high overpotentials, whereas lithiophilic Au performs better at low overpotentials. This crossover behavior establishes a current density-dependent framework that redefines the classical understanding of lithiophilicity. Electrochemical characterizations, MHC-based modeling, and crystal orbital Hamilton population analysis attribute the phenomenon to an interplay between reorganization energy and electronic coupling strength. The findings, validated across various substrates and electrolytes, provide general mechanistic insights into heterogeneous charge transfer during Li electroplating and suggest new strategies for interface design in anodeless Li metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"自由基电沉积使三(2,2'-联吡啶)钌(II)与三正丙胺体系的电致化学发光延长百万倍","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16512","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学发光","kp":["[方法]: 自由基电沉淀延长电化学发光","[体系]: Ru(bpy)₃²⁺/TPrA"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究通过自由基电沉积策略将三(2,2'-联吡啶)钌(II)/三正丙胺（TPrA）体系的电化学发光寿命延长了百万倍。该Ru(bpy)₃²⁺/TPrA体系是最经典的电化学发光体系之一，但发光持续时间有限。自由基电沉积原位再生活性物种，维持发光信号的长效输出，在生物传感、免疫分析和成像检测中具有重大应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Radical Electroprecipitation Prolongs “Electro”chemiluminescence of the Tris(2,2’-bipyridyl)ruthenium(II) and Tri-n-propylamine System by a Millionfold","b":"The combination of tri-n-propylamine (TPrA) and tris(2,2'-bipyridyl)ruthenium(II) is one of the most historically relevant electrochemiluminescence (ECL) systems, as it is used in hospitals all over the world to test for myocardial infarction. In developing novel diagnostic tools or improving upon standard ones, it is important to investigate historic systems in new ways. We demonstrate the precipitation of an ECL-active solid by using this historic ECL system. Even after the potential is ended, an emission persists for 100s of seconds, corresponding to a million times increase in ECL lifetime through this afterglow chemiluminescence process. This fractures the dogma of ECL, where classically an applied electric potential is assumed to be a requirement for light emission. Beyond proof of concept, experimental parameters such as pH, potential waveform, applied potential, TPrA concentration, and supporting electrolyte were changed and showed the ability of this system to be tunable between two regimes: ECL intensity and afterglow chemiluminescence time. Additionally, we offer a probable mechanism for the formation of this precipitate that effectively extends the utility of ECL in space and time. When looking at the necessary technological advancements needed in bioanalysis, fundamental steps forward, such as those presented in this study, are required to enable leaps in applied knowledge."},{"t":"使用方酰胺鎓氢键给体催化剂实现四氢呋喃的分子量可控阳离子聚合","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18359","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"THF阳离子聚合","kp":["分子量[PTHF阳离子开环聚合]: 最高175 kDa","[催化剂]: 方酰胺鎓氢键供体","[突破]: 超越20 kDa分子量控制极限"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用方酰胺氢键供体催化剂实现了四氢呋喃（THF）的分子量可控阳离子聚合。聚四氢呋喃（PTHF）是弹性纤维和热固性树脂软段的重要工业原料，传统阳离子聚合难以精确控制分子量。该工作通过氢键催化调控链增长过程，实现了PTHF分子量的精确调节，为高性能聚氨酯材料的设计提供了新方法。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Molecular Weight-Controlled Cationic Polymerization of Tetrahydrofuran Using a Squaramidinium Hydrogen-Bond Donor Catalyst","b":"Poly(tetrahydrofuran) (PTHF) has long-standing industrial relevance as the soft block of elastic fibers and thermosets. Despite its commercial importance, the synthesis of PTHF with molecular weight (MW) control beyond 20 kDa has proved challenging. In this work, we disclose a MW-controlled synthesis of PTHF up to 175 kDa by cationic ring-opening polymerization, using a cationic squaramidinium hydrogen-bond donor (HBD) catalyst in combination with an α-phosphonooxymethyl ether initiator at room temperature. Mechanistic studies support a reversible-deactivation polymerization pathway, wherein the HBD catalyst facilitates the anchimeric ionization of the primary alkyl phosphate chain end, generating the propagating oxonium species. The stability of the phosphate chain end was demonstrated by isolating PTHF with high chain-end fidelity and subsequently extending the PTHF macroinitiator to higher molecular weights. This system was further applied to the copolymerization of THF and 1,3-dioxolane (DXL), affording copolymers with tunable thermal properties. We demonstrate near-quantitative chemical recycling of both PTHF and PTHF-co-PDXL back to monomer, highlighting the potential of this strategy for the development of sustainable polymers."},{"t":"光激发超分子聚集体中振动与环境无序下的离域与相干性之争","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20341","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超分子激子动力学","kp":["[对象]: 光激发超分子聚集体的激子离域vs相干","[方法]: 全原子动力学耦合量子振动"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究深入分析了光激发超分子聚集体中激子离域与相干性在振动和环境无序下的竞争关系。分子材料中的激子和电荷动力学取决于离域与静态/动态无序的博弈。该工作建立了离域长度、振动耦合与环境退相干之间的理论框架，区分了量子相干效应与经典离域的贡献，为光电材料中能量传输优化提供了基础认识。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Delocalization versus Coherence under Vibrational and Environmental Disorder in Photoexcited Supramolecular Aggregates","b":"Exciton and charge dynamics in photoexcited molecular materials depend critically on how delocalization competes with structural, vibrational, and environmental disorder. Yet, the origin and extent of coherent versus incoherent distribution of excitons and charges in such \"noisy\" supramolecular systems remain poorly understood. Here, we integrate all-atom classical dynamics with fully quantum vibronic dynamics to dissect these competing effects in aqueous self-assembled perylenediimide stacks. Our simulations quantitatively reproduce experimental absorption spectra and reveal that strong excitonic coupling and hybridization with charge-transfer states dictate the optical response. Following photoexcitation, the electronic populations rapidly spread across multiple molecules within tens of femtoseconds, yielding delocalized but largely incoherent exciton, hole, and electron wave function distributions. We find that high-frequency vibrational modes, and, to a lesser extent, the slow environmental and vibrational dynamics, intrinsic to the nature of such solvated supramolecular systems, set a fundamental limit to achieving fully coherent electronic delocalization. These results identify vibrational disorder as a universal constraint on coherent exciton dynamics and indicate that practical design principles for efficient organic optoelectronic and photocatalytic materials should focus on robust equi-distribution of the excited-state population."},{"t":"[ASAP] 先进的分子镊子可有效靶向缺乏胆碱头基的膜，以实现广谱抗病毒功效","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19450","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Broad-spectrum antivirals are urgently required to counter present and emerging viral threats. It has previously been shown that the parental molecular tweezers CLR01 and CLR05 disrupt viral envelopes by complexing choline headgroups and that ester-functionalized \"advanced\" tweezers display markedly enhanced antiviral potency. Here, we determine the molecular basis of this improved activity. Using liposome leakage assays, giant unilamellar vesicles, NMR, Langmuir film balance experiments, and atomistic simulations, we demonstrate that advanced tweezers not only encapsulate choline-containing lipids but also engage lipids lacking choline headgroups via transient and conserved hydrophobic insertion events. These interactions preferentially destabilize membranes enriched in sphingomyelin, unsaturated acyl chains, or inverted cone-shaped lipids and are especially effective against small, highly curved particles resembling viral particles, explaining their broad antiviral activity for enveloped viruses. Our findings reveal a dual mechanism of action, choline binding and hydrophobic insertion, that underpins the broad-spectrum antiviral activity of advanced molecular tweezers and establish them as a promising new class of membrane-targeting antivirals for prophylactic and therapeutic use."},{"t":"[ASAP] 未取代的卡宾阳离子的无重氮等价物：通过 [12/13CH]+ 插入直接合成萘和吡啶","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21901","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Stable isotope labeling is a crucial technique in pharmaceutical research to understand the mode of action and metabolism of new drug candidates; however, its utility is often jeopardized by the synthetic challenges associated with the installation of the isotopic label into the core of the structures under study. Herein, we address this problem for the case of 13C-labeled naphthalene and pyridine building blocks. Our synthetic protocol utilizes the sulfonium sulfaneylidene salt 1, a benchtop stable reagent that does not incorporate diazo functionalities in its structure; yet, under Rh-catalysis, it efficiently acts as a synthetic equivalent of the simplest conceivable carbynyl cation, the [CH]+ fragment. Mechanistic experiments supported by DFT calculations suggest the initial formation of a sulfonio-substituted Rh(II)-carbene that reacts with indenes or pyrroles to initially form sulfonio-substituted cyclopropanes; the diastereoselectivity of this step being inconsequential because both isomers interconvert under the reaction conditions. Subsequent electrocyclic ring expansion with the concomitant elimination of dibenzothiophene delivers the desired naphthalenes or pyridines."},{"t":"通过协同质子-电子转移释放多金属氧酸盐全荷电态用于高能量密度氧化还原液流电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518906?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液流电池活性物质","kp":["[突破]: PCET范式解锁POM满荷状态","SoC[原有限制]: ≤33.3%","[活性物]: [P₂W₁₈O₆₂]"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究通过协同质子-电子转移机制解锁了多金属氧酸盐（POM）的全荷态容量，实现高能量密度液流电池。POM具有卓越的多电子转移能力，是下一代高能量密度氧化还原液流电池的理想活性物质，但传统条件下无法实现全部氧化态的可逆利用。该工作利用质子耦合电子转移策略，使POM实现全范围可逆充放电，显著提升了液流电池能量密度。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Full State‐of‐Charge of Polyoxometalate for High‐Energy‐Density Redox Flow Batteries via Concerted Proton‐Electron Transfer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Polyoxometalates (POMs) exhibit exceptional multi‐electron transfer capacity for next‐generation high‐energy‐density redox flow batteries (RFBs), while their operable state‐of‐charge (SoC, ≤33.3%) is commonly limited by universal highly reduced metastable states under proton‐starved conditions. Herein, by establishing a proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET) paradigm for [P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    62\n                    ]\n                    6−\n                    ({P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }) cluster, we reveal that protonation at oxygen sites stabilizes reduced tungsten sites via concerted proton‐electron transfer (CPET). Marcus theory combined with DFT calculations quantifies the thermodynamic driving force and kinetic barrier for region‐selective CPET processes, and operando analyses by pH monitoring and Raman spectroscopy further confirm this proton‐coupled reversible redox mechanism. Guided by these findings, we engineer the high‐proton‐activity H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    } negolyte paired with a VOSO\n                    4\n                    ‐based posolyte and stepwise charging‐discharging protocol that enables stable full SoC operation. The resulting RFBs achieve unprecedented performance, which maintains 95.04 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    without decay over 600 cycles (over 1020 h) at 66.7% SoC of 0.3 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }, and 141.75 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    at 100% SoC of 0.3 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }, as well as delivers a record‐breaking 236.03 Ah L\n                    −1\n                    and 239.02 Wh L\n                    −1\n                    at 100% SoC of 0.5 M H\n                    6\n                    {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    }. This work unlocks full SoC of {P\n                    2\n                    W\n                    18\n                    } by translating CPET mechanistic insights into actionable electrolyte design, establishing a generalizable pathway toward high‐energy‐density POM‐RFBs.","aip":1},{"t":"将 RNA 降解转化为准确的 RNA 检测：临床样品的 RNase I 辅助滚环扩增","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525591?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Ribonucleases are powerful degradative enzymes that rapidly cleave RNA and have long been regarded as obstacles to RNA diagnostics. Detecting large, structured RNA molecules in biological samples is further complicated by extensive secondary structures and abundant background RNA. Here we transform this destructive activity into a diagnostic advantage through a RNase I–assisted rolling circle amplification (RI‐RCA) strategy that integrates enzymatic RNA digestion with circular DNA templates (CDTs) to achieve direct, reverse‐transcription‐free RNA detection. In this system,\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    RNase I—a widely available endoribonuclease—selectively digests structured RNA to expose complementary CDT‐binding sites, which are immediately protected through duplex formation and converted into primers for RCA. The resulting reaction proceeds isothermally at room temperature in linear, quasi‐exponential, and exponential modes, achieving quantitative signal generation across concentrations from 50 aM to 50 fM and maintaining performance in 50% pooled human saliva. Applied to clinical saliva samples from SARS‐CoV‐2–positive and –negative individuals, RI‐RCA achieved near‐perfect sensitivity and 98–100% diagnostic accuracy. By coupling enzymatic RNA digestion with sequence‐specific protection via CDT hybridization, this strategy converts RNA instability from a liability into an analytical advantage, providing a simple, robust, and clinically translatable platform for accurate detection of structured RNA targets.","tp":"核酸检测法","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"将核糖核酸酶的降解活性转化为诊断优势，开发了RNase I辅助滚环扩增(RI-RCA)策略，整合酶促降解与扩增检测，实现对生物样品中大型结构化RNA分子的准确检测，有望应用于临床样品分析与RNA诊断。"},{"t":"迈向乙烯的工业化电合成：磷化铜/MXene电催化剂上节能稳定的乙炔半加氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518909?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化乙烯合成","kp":["[催化剂]: 磷化铜/MXene","[反应]: 乙炔半加氢制乙烯(EHAE)","[经济性]: 技经分析确定盈利阈值"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出以可再生电力驱动的乙炔电催化半加氢制乙烯（EHAE）路线，开发了磷化铜/MXene复合电催化剂。该催化剂在能耗效率和长期稳定性方面表现优异，有望替代传统化石燃料依赖的乙烯生产路径，推动电合成乙烯的工业化进程，对绿色化工具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward Industrial Electrosynthesis of Ethylene: Energy‐Efficient and Stable Acetylene Semi‐Hydrogenation on a Copper Phosphide/MXene Electrocatalyst","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic semi‐hydrogenation of acetylene to ethylene (EHAE) using renewable electricity represents a promising alternative approach for ethylene production. However, its relatively low energy efficiency (EE) and insufficient electrocatalyst stability hinder its industrial applications. The conduct a techno‐economic analysis indicates that the EHAE process becomes profitable when the EE exceeds 22.8% at an industrial current density of 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    . Herein, we report a novel electrocatalyst featuring firmly immobilized copper phosphide (Cu\n                    3\n                    P) nanoparticles on MXene nanosheets (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P) for a stable EHAE process at industrial currents using membrane electrode assembly (MEA) system. Specifically, the Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P electrocatalyst achieves an EE of 23.0% at 0.2 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its potential for practical application and economic viability. The strong interactions between Cu\n                    3\n                    P and Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    MXene prevent the agglomeration and dissolution of Cu\n                    3\n                    P nanoparticles during long‐term EHAE process. Notably, in a 4 cm\n                    2\n                    MEA, Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P catalysts can sustain high performance for 100 h at 1.0 A with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency decay of only 0.051% per hour. Quasi in situ electron paramagnetic resonance spectroscopy and theoretical calculations indicate that Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    /Cu\n                    3\n                    P facilitates water dissociation and synergistically enhances the adsorption of acetylene and active hydrogen (H\n                    *\n                    ), thereby accelerating the kinetics of EHAE process.","aip":1},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色和棕色一面：创新、人工智能驱动的专利、能源政策干预和排放动态","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"机器人排放","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"协同驱动电解液设计：氟代碳酸乙烯酯与丁二腈共溶剂化低共熔电解液助力稳定钠金属电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠金属电池电解质","kp":["电解质[钠金属电池]: NaFSI/FEC/SN低共熔","[策略]: FEC与SN共溶剂化稳定钠负极"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对钠金属电池（SMBs）的界面不稳定性问题，研究设计了一种含氟乙烯碳酸酯（FEC）和丁二腈（SN）共溶剂化的低共熔电解质。该协同设计有效稳定了钠负极界面，抑制枝晶生长，显著提升了电池循环寿命和库仑效率，为高能量密度钠金属电池的实际应用提供了电解质工程新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergy‐Driven Electrolyte Design: Fluoroethylene Carbonate and Succinonitrile Co‐Solvation in a Eutectic Electrolyte for Stable Sodium Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sodium metal batteries (SMBs) are promising alternatives to lithium‐ion batteries due to their high energy density and abundant sodium resources. However, high reactivity of sodium metal anodes (SMAs) presents significant challenges for practical application. Herein, we report a multifunctional ternary eutectic electrolyte, termed NSF‐5, comprising sodium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (NaFSI), succinonitrile (SN), and fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a 1:1:5 molar ratio, which enhances the cycling stability of SMAs. Combined experimental and computational studies confirm a synergistic effect between FEC and SN, where FEC integrates into the Na\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath, regulates the desolvation process, and promotes the formation of a robust, inorganic‐rich solid electrolyte interphase, thereby suppressing sodium dendrite growth. Consequently, SMBs with NSF‐5 demonstrate desirable cyclability under demanding conditions. Full cells coupled with Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    achieve over 1650 cycles with 90.5% capacity retention at 0.5 C and 3715 cycles with 80.2% retention at 10 C. Even at 0 °C, the cell maintains 87.9 mAh g\n                    ‒1\n                    capacity after 3500 cycles with 81.4% retention. Moreover, this versatile electrolyte formulation can be adapted to other alkali metal battery systems, underscoring its broad applicability. This work highlights the importance of electrolyte engineering in regulating the electrode−electrolyte interphase, offering valuable insights into achieving long‐term cyclability of SMBs."},{"t":"深海风力发电机最新综述：安装、成本、失稳、流致振动、故障、运维与发电成本","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000139?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深海风电","kp":["[综述]: 深海风机(安装/成本/失效/维护)"],"sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"State-of-the-art review of deep-sea wind turbine: installation, cost, instability, flow-induced oscillation, failure, maintenance, and power cost"},{"t":"稳定纯绿光超荧光有机发光二极管：高亮度极限效率迈向Rec.2020标准","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518330?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纯绿OLED发光","kp":["[材料]: MR-TADF发射体","[标准]: Rec 2020","[性能]: 高亮度极限效率+高色纯度","[器件]: 纯绿超荧光OLED"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究基于多共振热活化延迟荧光（MR-TADF）发射体，开发了稳定纯绿色超荧光OLED器件。该器件在高亮度下实现了极致效率，满足了Rec 2020广色域标准对纯绿色发光的严苛要求。该突破对下一代高色域显示技术和柔性光电器件具有重要推动作用。","dp":1,"ot":"Stable Pure‐Green Hyperfluorescent Organic Light‐Emitting Diodes with Ultimate Efficiency at High Brightness Toward Rec 2020 Standard","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Multi‐resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) emitters represent a promising platform for high‐efficiency, wide‐color‐gamut OLEDs. However, current green MR‐TADF emitters face challenges in simultaneously achieving high color purity, high efficiency at high brightness, and high device stability. In this study, we report the synthesis and device integration of a novel MR‐TADF emitter, DBF‐v‐DABNA. Designed with a rigid meta‐dibenzofuran framework and meta‐phenyl related two boron units, the molecule exhibits narrowband pure‐green emission (FWHM = 16–19 nm) and a high horizontal dipole ratio (94%). Moreover, sufficient steric shielding of the MR core suppresses exciton loss from Dexter energy transfer (DET). When incorporated into hyperfluorescent (HF) bottom‐emitting OLED architectures, DBF‐v‐DABNA achieved high external quantum efficiencies (EQE) exceeding 35 % with negligible roll‐off, CIEy ≥ 0.73, superior brightness stability up to 7.2 × 10\n                    5\n                    cd m\n                    −2\n                    , and device lifetimes exceeding 600 h at 5000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    . The top‐emitting configuration reached BT.2020 green coordinates with record‐setting current efficiency (233 cd A\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ). These results highlight DBF‐v‐DABNA as a promising pure‐green emitter for next‐generation UHD OLED displays requiring high efficiency and color purity."},{"t":"信使 RNA 脂质纳米粒子时空靶向子宫内膜治疗生殖疾病","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02108-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Dysfunctions of the endometrium, the uterus inner lining, can impair embryo implantation and reduce pregnancy rates. Intrauterine administration of cytokines has shown potential to improve endometrium function, but it is challenged by poor targeting and dose-limiting systemic side effects. Here we present a strategy for introducing therapeutic messenger RNA into the endometrium for the treatment of reproductive disorders. mRNA was loaded into a ligand-conjugated lipid nanoparticle (LNP), enabling multivalent interactions with the temporally overexpressed integrin receptors on the endometrial surface during the window of implantation. Conjugating the targeting ligand directly to the lipid component enhanced endometrial protein expression after intrauterine infusion and reduced systemic expression in the liver and spleen. A single infusion of granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor (GM-CSF) mRNA-loaded LNP sustained local protein expression for several hours and reduced GM-CSF systemic exposure. In a murine model of endometrial injury, GM-CSF mRNA-loaded LNP improved embryo implantation rates, outperforming recombinant GM-CSF. Our strategy demonstrates the efficacy of using mRNA to improve fertility outcomes."},{"t":"基于MOF柯肯达尔效应构建稳定固态电解质界面石榴石型SnP2O7@PC负极用于耐用钾/钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505082?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠钾电池负极","kp":["[材料]: 石榴状SnP₂O₇@PC","[合成]: MOF Kirkendall效应","[机制]: SEI稳定化","[应用]: 钾/钠离子电池"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用MOF的Kirkendall效应构建了石榴石状SnP2O7@多孔碳（PC）复合负极材料，并通过稳定的固体电解质界面相（SEI）层实现钾离子/钠离子电池的长循环稳定性。PIBs和SIBs因钾、钠资源丰富被视为下一代储能技术的重要方向，但负极体积膨胀和界面不稳定是核心瓶颈。该工作通过Kirkendall扩散效应原位生成SEI层，有效抑制了充放电过程中的结构退化，显著提升了电池的循环寿命和容量保持率，为大规模储能应用提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Solid Electrolyte Interphase Stabilized Pomegranate SnP2O7@PC Anodes Realized Through Kirkendall Effect of MOF for Durable Potassium/Sodium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Potassium‐ion batteries (PIBs) and sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are promising next‐generation energy storage technologies because of their abundant and low‐cost raw materials. However, anodes for PIBs/SIBs often exhibit poor cycling stability, mainly due to particle fragmentation, loss of electrical connectivity, and continuous electrolyte decomposition from repetitive solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) formation. To address these challenges, a biomimetic pomegranate‐like core‐shell SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    @PC anode (CSP‐SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    @PC) is synthesised through pyrolysis‐driven Kirkendall effect of tin‐based phosphonate metal‐organic framework (MOF). This multi‐scale design integrates several key features. At the molecular scale, the in situ formation of Sn‐P‐O bonds reduces K\n                    +\n                    diffusion barriers. The nanoscale dispersion of SnP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    within conductive carbon matrix promotes efficient electron and ion transport. Furthermore, microscale structural engineering creates pre‐reserved voids to accommodate volume expansion, suppress SEI overgrowth, and prevent cracking. The optimised anode demonstrates exceptional cycling stability, exhibiting ultralow capacity decay rate of 0.0015% per cycle over 16 000 cycles at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    , and also delivers excellent performance in SIBs. Density functional theory and finite element simulations further reveal beneficial electronic structures and stress distribution, providing fundamental insights for designing durable electrodes through crystal and electronic optimisation. Overall, this study presents an innovative strategy for mitigating volume expansion in high‐capacity battery materials."},{"t":"自组装二维手性细观形貌决定细胞和体液免疫对肿瘤的平衡","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520552?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of nanomaterials‐based cancer vaccines has broadened the scope of immunotherapy. Nanomaterials with characteristics such as chirality, 2D, and flexibility have attracted widespread attention because they can maximize the interface between the materials and immune cells. Here, we report the fabrication of 2‐D mesoporous silica nanodisks with a chiral meso‐topography as vaccine adjuvants. These uniform nanodisks, with diameters from 200 nm to 1 µm, possess unique spiral mesoporous patterns of ∼ 10 nm. The thickness of the chiral mesoporous nanodisks can be precisely controlled in units of one layer (∼ 7 nm), thereby achieving precise regulation in surface topology, dimension and flexibility. The unique 2‐D chiral mesoporous structure originates from the maximum occupancy of confined space of micellar helical arrangement, which is distinct from conventional methods based on internal tension. The combination of flexibility, 2‐D structure and chirality enhances nanodisks’ interaction with dendritic cells (DCs), significantly improving DC maturation via Toll‐like receptors/Nuclear Factor‐kappa B (TLR/NF‐κB), Mitogen‐Activated Protein Kinase (MAPK) and Focal Adhesion Kinase (FAK) signaling pathways. Upon nanovaccines’ activation of DCs in vivo, DCs further presents antigen for activating T cells to trigger balanced cellular and humoral immunity. Subcutaneous injection of the nanodisks‐adjuvanted cancer vaccine can significantly inhibit the tumor growth and extend the survival of melanoma‐bearing mice to more than 60 days, about three times higher than that of the PBS‐treated group. When combined with PD‐1 antibody, the cancer vaccines maximize tumor suppression, achieving a tumor‐free outcome in one‐third of the cases."},{"t":"通过阳离子分子结构调控界面动态自调谐疏水层实现超稳定锌金属负极","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌负极界面调控","kp":["[界面策略]: 亲水亲油平衡值-空间构型协同调控","应用: 超稳定锌金属负极动态疏水层"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出通过调控阳离子分子添加剂结构来构建界面动态自调节疏水层，从而实现超稳定锌金属负极。锌离子电池因高安全性和低成本被视为有前景的水系储能体系，但锌负极在循环过程中面临严重的枝晶生长和析氢副反应问题。研究系统揭示了阳离子添加剂的分子结构（碳链长度、官能团等）如何影响界面疏水性和电场分布，从而动态调节锌离子沉积行为。该策略显著抑制了枝晶形成，大幅延长了锌负极的循环寿命，推动了锌电池走向实际应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Interfacial Dynamic Self‐Adjusting Hydrophobic Layer via Cationic Molecular Structure for Ultra‐Stable Zinc Metal Anode","b":"Abstract\n                  The structure of solution additives significantly affects the polarization and dendrite behavior of metal batteries. In this study, we propose, for the first time, the “hydrophilic‐lipophilic balance (HLB) value‐spatial configuration synergistic regulation” strategy by selecting cations with different structures as additives, successfully revealing the structure‐activity relationship between additive structures and the stability of the anode interface adsorption layer. Among them, the butyltrimethylammonium chloride additive (ADD4), which has a low HLB value and a linear structure, exhibits the most stable interfacial structure. The stable hydrophobic region formed by its spontaneous aggregation and assembly shows a repulsive effect on hydrated protons. The constructed protective layer can effectively reduce overpotential and inhibit the formation of by‐products. The battery with ADD4 exhibits excellent stability, with over 1700 cycles and an average Coulombic efficiency of 99.7%. The full laboratory cells and pouch cells can also maintain very good cyclability, verifying their feasibility for practical applications. This study emphasizes that exploring the relationship between the hydrophilic‐hydrophobic properties, microstructure of additive ions, and the stability of the adsorption layer is crucial for designing appropriate electrolyte‐electrode interface layers."},{"t":"使用基于宿主-病原体的系统实时时空跟踪密闭环境中的传染病爆发","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2422574123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Deadly infection outbreaks in confined spaces, whether it is a COVID-19 outbreak on a cruise ship or measles and stomach flu outbreaks in schools, can be characterized by their rapid spread due to the abundance of common spaces, shared airways, and high population density. Preventing future outbreaks and developing efficient mitigation protocols can benefit from advanced computational modeling approaches. Here, we developed an agent-based modeling approach to study the spatiotemporal dynamics of an infection outbreak in a confined environment caused by a specific pathogen, and to determine effective containment protocols. The approach integrates the 3D geographic information system of a confined environment, behavior of the hosts, key biological parameters about the pathogen obtained from the experimental data, and the general mechanics of host-pathogen and pathogen-fomite interactions. To assess our approach, we applied it to the historical data of infectious outbreaks caused by norovirus, H1N1 influenza A, and SARS-CoV-2 viruses. Our AI-GIS Infection Dynamics (AGID) model accurately predicted daily infection numbers, correctly identified the day when the CDC vessel sanitation protocol would be triggered, singled out key biological parameters affecting the infection spread, and propose pathogen-specific changes to existing containment protocols. Our work advances the understanding of infection spread on cruise ships while offering insights applicable to other similar confined settings, such as nursing homes, schools, and hospitals. By providing a robust framework for real-time outbreak modeling, this study proposes more effective containment protocols and enhances our preparedness for managing infectious diseases and emerging pathogens in confined environments."},{"t":"出版勘误：Echo-Vision-FM——超声心动图视频视觉基础模型的预训练与微调框架","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68722-8","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超声视觉模型","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":1.0,"d":0.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Publisher Correction: Echo-Vision-FM: a pre-training and fine-tuning framework for echocardiogram video vision foundation model"},{"t":"界面聚合的编程化设计：机器学习揭示微胶囊定量理性设计规则及拓展应用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517708?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"界面聚合微胶囊","kp":["[方法]: 机器学习揭示界面聚合设计规则","[应用]: 微胶囊化界面聚合"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究将机器学习方法引入界面聚合（IP）过程的理性设计，通过数据驱动建模揭示了微胶囊结构参数与反应条件之间的定量关系。界面聚合是制备聚合物膜和微胶囊的通用平台技术，但传统方法严重依赖经验试错。研究构建了ML预测模型，系统量化了单体浓度、界面张力、搅拌速率等变量对微胶囊尺寸、壁厚和形貌的影响，提炼出可解释的理性设计规则。该方法不仅加速了微胶囊的精准定制，也为其他界面反应体系的逆向设计提供了通用框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Programming Interfacial Polymerization: Machine Learning Unveils Quantitative Rational Design Rules for Microcapsules and Beyond","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Interfacial polymerization (IP) serves as a versatile platform technology for designing polymeric membranes, yet its extension to applications such as microencapsulation (MIP) remains hindered by empirical methodologies, largely due to the absence of quantitative rational design principles. Unlike separation membranes, which prioritize nanostructural control, MIP emphasizes encapsulation efficiency (EE%), rendering conventional membrane‐derived theories and thermodynamic descriptors insufficient. In this work, we transcend these limitations by employing interpretable machine learning to program interfacial polymerization, thereby deciphering mechanism‐informed quantitative design rules. Our data‐driven platform integrates molecular thermodynamics, polymerization kinetics, and emulsion‐stabilized interfacial parameters to identify previously overlooked descriptors governing microcapsule formation. We establish a predictive chemical–process–structure–performance relationship and demonstrate programmable control over key performances, including EE% (30%–95%), particle size (100–400 µm), and shell thickness‐to‐radius ratios (0.005–1) for diverse payloads spanning hydrophobic, hydrophilic, and highly reactive compounds such as toluene diisocyanate and amines. This work not only resolves long‐standing challenges in understanding complex multiphase interactions in MIP but also establishes a new paradigm for the quantitative design of polymeric microcapsules, with broad implications for functional particles, catalytic microreactors, digital cells, and membranes."},{"t":"碳点光激活时变余辉：耦合三线态与激基复合物持久发射实现可编程光子编码","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524898?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳点余辉材料","kp":["材料体系: 碳点-聚合物复合物(CDs@ABS)","发光特性: 双光激活延迟发射不同寿命"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究开发了基于碳点的光激活时间演化余辉发光（TEAC）材料，通过耦合三重态和激基复合物持久发光机制，实现了可编程的光子编码功能。与传统的静态余辉材料不同，该体系在光照激活后可产生随时间动态变化的余辉颜色，三重态激子和激基复合物态的协同作用延长了发光寿命并丰富了发光色调。这种时间维度可编程的余辉特性在信息加密、防伪编码和多维光存储领域具有独特应用潜力，为动态光子学材料设计提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Photoactivatable Time‐Evolving Afterglow of Carbon Dots via Coupled Triplet and Exciplex Persistent Emission for Programmable Photonic Encoding","b":"Abstract\n                  Photoactivatable time‐evolving afterglow color (TEAC) materials offer programmable delayed emission for dynamic photonic applications. However, achieving light‐triggered and multistate afterglow control in metal‐free systems remains a formidable challenge. Here we report a carbon dot‐polymer composite (CDs@ABS) that exhibits dual photoactivatable delayed emissions with distinct lifetimes, generating reversible TEAC with optical memory. Upon brief UV exposure, the film shows no visible afterglow; prolonged irradiation activates a dynamic emission that evolves from red to orange, yellow, and finally green, with a memory duration of up to 40 min and excellent long‐term stability. In this architecture, electron‐rich CDs act as triplet emitters and donors, while the electron‐deficient, oxygen‐permeable ABS matrix serves as both acceptor and regulator of exciton dynamics. The coupled emissive channels originate from oxygen‐regulated red phosphorescence of CDs triplet excitons and green long‐persistent luminescence from donor–acceptor exciplexes, which is progressively enhanced by photoinduced charge accumulation and strengthened hydrogen bonding. Their cooperative interplay produces light‐triggered, reversible TEAC behavior. Leveraging this functionality, the CDs@ABS film enables programmable and multilevel photonic encryption and dynamic anti‐counterfeiting. This work presents a generalizable strategy for cost‐effective, metal‐free, photoactivatable afterglow systems, opening avenues toward next‐generation dynamic information security and spatiotemporal photonics."},{"t":"具有长寿命电荷分离态的有机晶体纳米颗粒用于高效光催化产氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02035-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制氢","kp":["分子构型: 受体-供体-受体(A-D-A)","[纳米结构]: 自组装高结晶性纳米颗粒","应用: 光催化产氢"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究设计合成了具有长寿命电荷分离态的有机晶体纳米粒子，用于高效光催化分解水产氢。光催化产氢的核心瓶颈是光生电荷复合过快导致量子效率低下。该工作通过精确调控有机分子的晶体堆积方式，构建了稳定的给体-受体界面，使电荷分离态寿命大幅延长，从而提高了光生载流子的利用效率。有机晶体纳米粒子相比传统无机催化剂具有结构可设计性强、可见光吸收范围广等优势，该成果为太阳能驱动的清洁氢能生产提供了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Organic crystalline nanoparticles with a long-lived charge-separated state for efficient photocatalytic hydrogen production","b":"Photocatalysis offers a promising approach for renewable energy conversion and storage, but short lifetimes of charge-separated states in photocatalysts due to charge recombination limit its utility. Here we report an organic molecule with an acceptor–donor–acceptor configuration that can self assemble into highly crystalline nanoparticles. Transient absorption spectroscopy reveals that these crystalline assemblies can induce an ultra-long-lived charge-separated state of up to 1.2 s, attributed to initial symmetry-breaking charge separation, followed by charge hopping across closely packed molecules. These self-assembled nanoparticles have an impressive photocatalytic H2 evolution rate of 126 mmol g−1 h−1 with an external quantum efficiency of 12% at 550 nm under optimized conditions. This system shows a remarkable stability with 220 million turnover numbers (per particle) over the 77 h of operation. These findings suggest that rational design of organic molecules and their aggregates is vital for improving light-induced charge separation and for developing highly efficient, stable and scalable organic photocatalysts."},{"t":"重新审视人类与深度学习推理过程的对齐问题——评de Varda等(2025)","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533685123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深度学习推理","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"No deep insights into the alignment between human and deep learning reasoning processes: Thoughts on de Varda et al. (2025)"},{"t":"多晶体X射线衍射(MCXRD)弥合化学与材料科学中的晶体学表征缺口：MOF应用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523233?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多晶X射线衍射","kp":["[结构解析方法]: 多晶XRD组合部分衍射数据集(MCXRD)","[应用场景]: 同步辐射小晶体与辐射敏感材料"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了多晶体X射线衍射（MCXRD）技术，用于解决传统单晶X射线衍射在化学和材料科学中面临的晶体学表征瓶颈。传统单晶衍射要求足够大的单晶且容易受到辐射损伤，这在MOF（金属有机框架）等新兴材料中尤为突出。MCXRD通过对多个微小晶体进行衍射数据收集与合并处理，突破了单晶尺寸和质量的限制，成功实现了MOF等复杂材料的精准结构解析。该技术弥合了粉末衍射与单晶衍射之间的方法学空白，为微晶材料的结构表征提供了新工具。","dp":1,"ot":"Multi‐Crystal X‐Ray Diffraction (MCXRD) Bridges the Crystallographic Characterisation Gap in Chemistry and Materials Science: Application to MOFs","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Structure determination by X‐ray diffraction is limited by crystal size and can be compromised by radiation damage when using very intense X‐ray radiation. X‐ray structure determination from partial diffraction data sets combined from multiple crystals is a potential solution, but its exploitation in chemistry and materials science is largely unrealized. Here we report the use of synchrotron radiation for multi‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (MCXRD) adapted for structure determination of metal‐organic framework (MOF) materials with crystal dimensions too small for conventional single‐crystal diffraction studies. We further show that radiation‐induced chemical changes and degradation of diffraction quality can be alleviated. Our approach encompasses both rotation‐ and stationary‐MCXRD measurements for 10 to 1000s of crystals with software‐optimized combination of the multiple data sets. We report the crystal structures of six MOFs: MOF‐919(Sc/Cu), MET‐2, MIL‐88B(Cr)‐1,4‐NDC, PCN‐260(Sc), UiO‐66, and UiO‐66‐MoO\n                    4\n                    with unit cell dimensions ranging from 18−114 Å and crystal sizes from 0.5−480 µm\n                    3\n                    . This approach can address the challenges of structure determination in a regime of particle size and sample radiation sensitivity that lies between existing single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and the emerging field of electron diffraction. MCXRD can provide accurate atomic‐resolution structure determination for some of the most challenging cases in chemistry and materials science."},{"t":"多功能界面分子桥实现高效机械强韧柔性蓝色钙钛矿发光二极管","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521547?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿LED","kp":["[界面策略]: 三氟乙酸根(TFA⁻)分子桥","应用: 柔性蓝光钙钛矿LED"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出在柔性蓝色钙钛矿发光二极管（PeLED）中引入多功能界面分子桥策略，同时提升器件效率和机械柔韧性。金属卤化物钙钛矿在柔性光电器件中前景广阔，但钙钛矿层与电极之间的界面缺陷和非辐射复合严重制约了蓝色PeLED的发光效率和稳定性。该分子桥界面修饰不仅钝化了界面缺陷、促进了载流子高效注入，还增强了器件的力学柔韧性，解决了弯曲状态下界面剥离的问题。该工作为高性能柔性钙钛矿光电器件的界面工程提供了通用策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Multifunctional Interfacial Molecular Bridge for Highly Efficient and Mechanically Robust Flexible Blue Perovskite Light‐Emitting Diodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal halide perovskites have emerged as promising candidates for flexible optoelectronics, yet the development of efficient blue‐emitting devices remains hindered by low charge utilization and poor mechanical durability. Herein, we propose a multifunctional molecular bridging strategy using trifluoroacetate (TFA\n                    −\n                    )‐based molecule to construct efficient and mechanically robust flexible blue perovskite light‐emitting diodes (PeLEDs). The TFA\n                    −\n                    bridge enhances interfacial adhesion and creates a stress‐redistributing network at the interface, effectively dissipating bending‐induced strain. Concurrently, this molecular bridge effectively modulates the crystallization of low‐dimensional perovskites through competitive coordination and hydrogen bond‐guided phase reorganization, facilitating efficient exciton confinement and energy transfer. The resulting flexible blue PeLEDs achieve an external quantum efficiency of 20.05% and outstanding bending durability, maintaining over 90% of their initial performance after 2000 cycles at a 5 mm radius. This work demonstrates the dual role of biomimetic molecular bridges in simultaneously stabilizing the bulk perovskite phase and the device interface, providing a generalizable route toward high‐performance and mechanically robust flexible optoelectronics."},{"t":"单体比例调控吡啶氮富集调制碳纳米球p带中心用于高效锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515992?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[锌空电池ORR]: 无金属吡啶氮富集碳纳米球","[活性位点调控]: 单体比例控制吡啶氮富集调制p带中心","[设计范式]: DFT活性位点识别→比例控制合成→器件验证闭环"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过单体比例精确调控碳纳米球中吡啶氮的富集程度，进而调变碳材料的p带中心能量，实现高效氧还原反应（ORR）电催化。锌空气电池的商业化依赖低成本、高活性的ORR催化剂替代铂基贵金属材料。研究发现吡啶氮含量与p带中心位置存在定量关联，p带中心的优化位置可平衡氧中间体的吸附与脱附，从而最大化ORR催化活性。该工作建立了氮掺杂构型-电子结构-催化活性之间的清晰构效关系，为理性设计非贵金属ORR催化剂提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Monomer‐Ratio Controlled Pyridinic‐N Enrichment Modulating p‐Band Centers in Carbon Nanospheres for Efficient Zinc‐Air Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rational design of high‐performance, low‐cost oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts is critical for advancing zinc‐air batteries (ZABs). This study proposed a closed‐loop paradigm integrating first‐principles active site identification, precursor‐ratio‐controlled synthesis, and device validation to develop superior metal‐free ORR electrocatalysts. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations identify pyridinic‐N as the optimal doping configuration, exhibiting the lowest energy barrier (0.17 eV) for the rate‐determining step (RDS, *O\n                    2\n                    → *OOH). Further electronic structure analyses revealed that this enhancement originates from pyridinic‐N‐induced upward shifts in the p‐band center of adjacent carbon atoms during the RDS, establishing this shift as a universal activity descriptor. Guided by these insights, aniline(A)/pyrrole(P) co‐polymerization with precise monomer molar ratio control yielded a series of N‐doped carbon materials (A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC). A\n                    0.5\n                    P\n                    0.5\n                    ‐NC achieved the highest pyridinic‐N content (38.91%), demonstrating exceptional ORR activity that surpasses other A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC variants and the benchmark 20 wt.% Pt/C. The optimized catalyst enabled transformative ZAB performance in liquid and flexible configurations, achieving enhanced open‐circuit voltage, superior power densities, high specific capacities, and prolonged durability compared to commercial 20 wt.% Pt/C. This work establishes a catalyst development paradigm bridging mechanistic understanding, controllable synthesis, and practical application for next‐generation energy storage devices."},{"t":"不对称窄带隙受体分子工程：低能量损失的高性能半透明有机太阳能电池及组件","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505706?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机光伏","kp":["受体[半透明OSC]: 不对称窄带隙受体","[分子工程]: 乙烯基π桥嵌入+端基卤化协同优化","[优化目标]: 近红外光收集与开路电压损失权衡"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过分子工程设计了不对称窄带隙非富勒烯受体（NFA）材料，用于构建高性能半透明有机太阳能电池（ST-OSCs）及其组件，并最小化了能量损失。半透明光伏器件在建筑一体化光伏和车载光伏中需求迫切，但近红外光子吸收与开路电压损失之间的内在矛盾是核心挑战。该工作通过不对称分子骨架设计优化了给受体能级排列和分子堆积，在保持高近红外吸收的同时显著降低了非辐射复合损失，实现了功率转换效率和可见光透过率的协同提升，推动了半透明光伏组件的实用化。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Asymmetric Narrow‐Gap Acceptors for High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Solar Cells and Modules with Minimized Energy Losses","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Overcoming the inherent trade‐off between near‐infrared photon harvesting and high open‐circuit voltage losses in bulk‐heterojunction blends is critical for advancing semi‐transparent organic solar cells (ST‐OSC). Herein, we present a molecular design that combines vinylene\n                    π\n                    ‐bridge incorporation and terminal‐group halogenation to tailor energy level alignment and blend morphology with PCE10 donor. These designed materials (eC9‐V‐2Cl(‐4Cl) and eC9‐DV‐2Cl) exhibit broadened NIR absorption (up to 1020 nm) and significantly reduce non‐radiative recombination voltage loss by a maximum of ∼100 mV compared to the standard PCE10:BTP‐eC9 device. The optimized PCE10:eC9‐V‐2Cl blend, processed from a green solvent in an inverted structure, achieves a remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 14.2% for opaque devices with a minimal voltage loss of ∼250 mV. Furthermore, a simply 1D double‐layered nano‐photoinc structure (LiF/MoO\n                    3\n                    ) as an optical out‐coupling layer was integrated into the ST‐OSC, delivering a PCE of 9.9% with an average visible transmittance (AVT) of 42.6%, and yielding a light utilization efficiency (LUE) of 4.3%. Scaling to 5 × 5 cm\n                    2\n                    ST‐OSC modules, an active‐area efficiency of ≈9% was reached with a remarkably high geometric fill factor of 96.5%. These findings provide new molecular design principles for high‐performance ST‐OSCs, making these devices highly attractive for sustainable and scalable applications like energy‐saving agrivoltaic systems and aesthetically transparent solar windows.","aip":1},{"t":"面向实用化钠离子电池的低成本层状正极：科学挑战、解决策略与经济性分析","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钠电层状正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 层状氧化物LOCMs","[定位]: 低成本SIB潜在替代/补充锂离子电池"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"as":"该综述系统分析了低成本层状氧化物正极材料在实用化钠离子电池中面临的关键科学挑战和解决策略，并量化评估了其经济效益。锂离子电池虽为主流商用体系，但锂资源的供应链安全推动了对钠离子电池的迫切需求。层状正极（如O3型Na_xMO_2）因成本低、理论容量高被视为SIBs的首选正极，但存在相变不可逆、空气敏感和循环衰减等问题。文章从晶体结构调控、表面包覆、元素掺杂等多维度提出解决方案，并结合成本建模分析了SIBs相对于LIBs的经济竞争力，为产业化路径提供了全面指南。","dp":1,"ot":"Low‐Cost Layered Cathodes Toward Practical Sodium‐Ion Batteries: Scientific Challenges, Resolution Strategies, and Economic Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) are the most widely used commercial rechargeable batteries, but the stable supply of key raw materials such as lithium, nickel, and cobalt faces challenges. Sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are considered as potential alternatives and complements to LIBs due to similar working principles and the abundance of sodium resources. Layered oxide cathode materials (LOCMs) are recognized as one of the most promising practical cathodes for SIBs because of mature synthesis technology and satisfactory energy density. However, the use of nickel in LOCMs for SIBs has raised concerns about environmental pollution during nickel production and the risk of price volatility stemming from the widespread application of high‐nickel LOCMs for LIBs. Therefore, developing low‐cost nickel‐free LOCMs is crucial for enhancing the environmental friendliness and cost advantages of SIBs. For low‐cost LOCMs, this review discusses the feasibility of replacing Ni\n                    2+\n                    /Ni\n                    4+\n                    with Fe\n                    3+\n                    /Fe\n                    4+\n                    and Mn\n                    3+\n                    /Mn\n                    4+\n                    for charge compensation in SIBs, and summarizes the resulting critical scientific challenges (Fe migration, Mn dissolution, Jahn‐Teller effect, Na deficiency, and thermal instability). Economic efficiency assessment based on cost and electrochemical properties indicates that low‐cost LOCMs exhibit the highest cost‐performance ratio. Finally, to accelerate the commercialization of cost‐effective SIBs technologies, this review outlines promising development pathways of low‐cost LOCMs."},{"t":"锆基金属有机凝胶可控形成机制研究：关联宏观性质与溶液态NMR分子信息","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520987?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锆基金属有机凝胶","kp":["材料体系: Zr基金属有机凝胶","表征方法: 溶液态NMR原位分子级监测"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究深入揭示了锆基（Zr）金属有机凝胶的可控形成机制，通过溶液态核磁共振（NMR）技术将凝胶的宏观性质与分子尺度的组装信息建立了直接关联。金属有机凝胶作为MOF材料的衍生形态，在催化、传感和药物递送领域具有应用潜力，但其形成过程的调控长期缺乏分子层面的理解。研究利用溶液态NMR实时监测Zr-配体配位聚合的动态过程，捕捉了成核、生长和凝胶化的关键中间态，建立了分子组装路径与凝胶流变学性质之间的定量关系。该工作为金属有机凝胶的理性设计奠定了分子基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Insights into the Controlled Formation of Zr‐Based Metal–Organic Gels: Linking Macroscopic Properties with Molecular Information from Solution State NMR","b":"Abstract\n                  Understanding and controlling the formation mechanisms of metal–organic gels is crucial for their rational design with well‐defined properties for diverse applications. However, rapid methodologies enabling atomic‐resolution structural characterization of gel formation are still largely lacking. Here, we report for the first time the molecular‐level characterization of the in‐situ formation of a Zr‐based metal–organic gel by monitoring solvent structuration during gelation using solvent‐observed nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy. UiO‐66‐type gels were optimized under mild conditions, i.e., 40 °C and in the absence of acidic modulators, providing a biocompatible environment suitable for the in‐situ encapsulation of sensitive biomolecules during gelation. The combined analysis of saturation transfer difference and spin diffusion transfer difference NMR growth curves enabled real time monitoring of nucleation and gelation stages, revealing an excellent correlation between the progressive structuration of water within the gel network and the resulting macroscopic properties. Furthermore, we demonstrate that this NMR approach allows tracking of the in‐situ encapsulation of therapeutic biomolecules within the gel, exemplified by a glycolipid with anti‐inflammatory properties."},{"t":"基于顺序官能团迁移实现非活化烯烃的同系自由基1,3-双碳官能化反应","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525903?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃自由基官能化","kp":["[反应类型]: 光诱导1,3-双碳官能化","[底物]: 未活化烯烃","[合成策略]: 顺序官能团迁移实现一碳链延伸"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了未活化烯烃的自由基同源1,3-双碳官能化反应，通过连续官能团迁移策略突破了传统自由基化学的限制。过去数十年，自由基介导的烯烃1,2-双官能化已取得显著进展，但实现1,3-位的碳碳键构建仍是合成化学的挑战性难题。该工作设计了包含可迁移官能团的自由基前体，通过链行走或分子内迁移机制使自由基加成产物发生1,2-至1,3-位的碳骨架重排，从而在远离烯烃的位置引入两个碳官能团。这一新型反应模式丰富了有机合成工具箱，在复杂分子构建中具有应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Homologative Radical 1,3‐Dicarbofunctionalization of Unactivated Alkenes Enabled by Sequential Functional Group Migrations","b":"Abstract\n                  Despite significant advances in conventional radical‐mediated 1,2‐difunctionalization of alkenes over the past decade, homologative 1,3‐difunctionalization remains largely underdeveloped. Herein, we report a novel photoinduced homologative 1,3‐dicarbofunctionalization of unactivated alkenes via one‐carbon chain elongation, achieved through sequential functional group migrations. By employing strategically designed tertiary alcohols and heteroarylsulfones as versatile coupling partners, this method affords structurally diverse, densely substituted aliphatic ketones and medium‐sized cyclic scaffolds with exclusive chemo‐ and regioselectivity. The transformation accommodates a broad range of migrating groups, including various heteroaryl, phenyl, and alkenyl motifs, and exhibits excellent functional group tolerance."},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气行业","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"能源转型研","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"原子级氟掺杂诱导硅晶体结构几何重构用于高性能锂离子电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504961?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极氟化改性","kp":["[结构工程]: 原子级氟嵌入实现硅晶几何重构","负极材料[锂离子电池]: 氟嵌入硅基"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过原子级氟（F）嵌入实现硅晶体结构的几何重构，用于高性能锂离子电池负极。硅负极因超高理论比容量（~4200 mAh/g）被视为下一代LIBs的理想负极材料，但充放电过程中巨大的体积膨胀（>300%）导致电极粉化和容量快速衰减。该工作发现氟原子的精确嵌入可改变硅晶格的局部几何对称性，在晶格内部预引入缓冲通道和结构柔性，有效缓解了锂化/脱锂过程中的应力积累。该策略在原子尺度上调控了硅的力学响应行为，显著提升了硅负极的循环稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Geometric Remodeling of Silicon Crystal Structure Through Atomic‐Level Fluorine Incorporation for High‐Performance Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Sustainable electrification continues to drive growing interest in high‐performance lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), which are essential energy storage systems for this transition. However, conventional graphite‐based LIBs cannot meet the stringent requirements of next‐generation applications, necessitating advanced alternatives. Herein, we report the design of fluorine‐incorporated silicon (FIS) nanostructures through a novel solid–vapor–solid synthesis method that integrates metallothermic reduction with combined top‐down and bottom‐up processes. Crucially, fluorine (F) atoms are inherently positioned both at interstitial sites within the silicon (Si) lattice and on the particle surface. Interstitial F modifies the direct‐allowed band structure of Si and expands lithium penetration pathways, thereby enhancing charge transport through improved electronic conductivity and ion migration. Meanwhile, surface‐bound F induces superhydrophobicity, enabling hydrofluoric acid‐free processing during both synthesis and electrode fabrication. Comprehensively, unveiled features of FIS offer a cost‐effective manufacturing, improved structural and electrochemical stability, and superior performance, leading to cycle‐stable, fast‐charging Si anodes for advanced LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"外延Ag-CsPbBr3钙钛矿纳米晶异质结构：多面取向、抑制等离激元与高效电荷转移","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515019?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米晶异质结","kp":["异质结构: Ag-CsPbBr3外延钙钛矿纳米晶","界面特性: 晶面特异性连接抑制等离子体并促进电荷转移"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究构建了银-溴化铯铅钙钛矿（Ag-CsPbBr3）外延纳米晶异质结构，实现了多面取向可控、表面等离激元（plasmon）抑制和高效电荷转移。卤化物钙钛矿纳米晶已被广泛研究为高效光学材料，但将其与金属纳米结构结合构建异质结以调控光电性能仍面临界面缺陷和能级失配等挑战。该工作利用外延生长策略精确控制Ag与CsPbBr3的界面取向，通过强界面耦合效应抑制了金属Ag的等离激元散射损耗，同时促进了钙钛矿-金属界面的超快电荷转移。该异质结构在光电探测、催化和纳米光子器件中具有应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Epitaxial Ag‐CsPbBr3 Perovskite Nanocrystal Heterostructures: Multi‐Facets Orientations, Suppressed Plasmon and Efficient Charge Transfer","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Halide perovskite nanocrystals have been extensively studied for over a decade as an efficient optical material, exhibiting bright and tunable emissions. While various epitaxial perovskite heterostructures with other semiconductors or metals have been achieved, but epitaxial integration with plasmonic Ag or Au nanoparticles through facet‐specific connections has remained a key challenge. Keeping the importance of these nanocrystal heterostructures in mind, herein, we epitaxially integrated Ag nanoparticles with three different morphologies of CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    , each exhibiting one‐to‐one connections. The heterostructures were obtained by introducing Ag precursor either before or after CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    formation, depending on the reaction conditions. The feasibility of the synthesis is attributed to the presence of specific triangular and truncated facets having alternating Pb and Br atom arrangements in CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    . Electron microscopic analysis confirms two distinct epitaxial interfaces between cubic Ag(0) and orthorhombic CsPbBr\n                    3,\n                    indicating the susceptibility of such nanocrystals to form heterostructures. Ultrafast spectroscopic data suggest the photoluminescence quenching arises from the photogenerated electron transfer from CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    to Ag. However, no significant plasmon absorption is observed, likely due to plasmon damping. These results provide new insight into plasmonic‐exciton coupling in this type of heterostructure and pave a pathway for designing other plasmonic material based heterostructures for optoelectronic applications."},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微观结构多尺度特征融合框架用于锂离子电池健康估计","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观健康评估","kp":["[电池健康估计]: 电极微结构多尺度特征融合框架"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health estimate of lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"动态微界面聚合实现二维聚合物片可扩展合成用于钠金属电池准固态电解质","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524650?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池固态电解质","kp":["[合成方法]: 动态微界面聚合(搅拌不混溶液)","产物: 二维聚合物片","应用: 钠金属电池准固态电解质"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了动态微界面聚合技术，实现了二维聚合物片材的可控规模化合成。该方法精确控制单体在微界面处的聚合行为，制备的2D聚合物片材作为准固态电解质应用于钠金属电池，展现出优异的离子传导率和界面稳定性，为二维材料的大规模制备和固态电池发展开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Dynamic Microinterfacial Polymerization Enables Scalable Synthesis of Two‐Dimensional Polymer Sheets for Quasi‐Solid‐State Electrolytes in Sodium‐Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Organic two‐dimensional (2D) materials hold great potential in a broad range of applications. However, their practical utility is constrained by limited structural diversity and a lack of synthetic strategies. Herein, we report that simply stirring immiscible solutions of poly(propylene glycol)bis(2‐aminopropyl ether) and 1,3,5‐benzenetricarbonyl trichloride results in a dynamic microinterfacial polymerization that affords novel 2D polymer sheets (designated as PEO‐BTA). These sheets can be transformed to Na‐ion conducting materials via treatment with sodium hydride, followed by incorporation of a prototypical MOF, HKUST‐1, to obtain composite sheets (MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na) that retain the structural integrity of the original 2D polymer sheets. The 2D composite sheets can be assembled into self‐supporting membranes and used as a quasi‐solid‐state electrolyte (QSSE) with a remarkably high ionic conductivity value of 2.80 × 10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    and a Na\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.95. Consequently, the QSSE facilitates uniform Na plating in Na//Na and Na//Cu cells. Na//NaTi\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    cells containing MOF@PEO‐BTA‐Na QSSE exhibit a high initial specific capacity (129.1 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C), superior rate capability (60.0 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 20 C), and high‐capacity retention (92% after 1000 cycles at 1 C). This work establishes a new, scalable approach for synthesizing 2D organic sheets with promising applications in energy‐related areas.","aip":1},{"t":"亲氧镝掺杂双重调控：稳定氧化物载体并定制催化路径实现安培级碱性析氢","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519688?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氢电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[碱性HER]: Rh@Dy-CuO","[Dy双调控]: 增强CuO稳定性并优化HER路径","电流密度[碱性HER]: 安培级"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过亲氧性镝（Dy）掺杂实现双重调控：既稳定氧化物载体在阴极还原条件下的结构，又定制催化反应路径。该策略在碱性析氢反应（HER）中实现了安培级电流密度下的高效稳定运行，突破了传统氧化物载体在阴极条件下易还原失活的瓶颈，为工业级电解水制氢提供了新催化体系设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual Regulation via Oxyphilic Dysprosium Doping: Stabilizing Oxide Support and Customizing Catalytic Pathway for Ampere‐Level Alkaline Hydrogen Evolution","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Achieving robust stabilization of oxide supports under cathodic reduction conditions while enabling an efficient Volmer‐Tafel pathway for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) is challenging. Herein, we report a Dy‐doped CuO supported Rh catalyst (Rh@Dy‐CuO), leveraging the oxyphilic Dy for dual regulation to enhance CuO stability and optimize the HER catalytic pathway. Dy incorporation strengthens the Cu‐O bond and mitigates electron aggregation at Cu sites, thereby maintaining the oxidized state of CuO during HER and facilitating efficient H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to generate adsorbed hydrogen (*H). Concurrently, Dy doping suppresses charge accumulation at the Rh‐CuO interface, enabling seamless *H transfer from CuO to Rh sites. This leads to elevated *H coverage on Rh, promoting rapid *H‐*H coupling via an optimized Tafel step for hydrogen production. As a result, the Rh@Dy‐CuO catalyst delivers a mass activity of 648 mA mg\n                    Rh\n                    −1\n                    at an overpotential of 100 mV, 46 times higher than that of Pt/C. When applied in an anion exchange membrane water electrolyzer, it delivers 1.91 V at 1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    with 1000‐hour stability. This Dy‐driven dual regulation offers a novel approach to stabilizing oxide supports and tailoring HER pathways, advancing rare earth‐mediated electrocatalyst design.","aip":1},{"t":"综合能源系统集群分布式协同优化：基于共识算法与逻辑函数的功率分配策略","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000401?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"综合能源调度","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Distributed collaborative optimization for integrated energy system clusters: A power allocation strategy based on consensus algorithm and logistic function"},{"t":"差异Hes1激活定义了胚胎和成年小鼠皮质中神经干细胞谱系的定型和生态位维持","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511800123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mode of Hes1 activation and its differential expression are crucial for the maintenance of neural stem cells/progenitor cells (NSCs/NPCs) in the embryonic cortex. This differential mode of Hes1 activation has been translated into a heterogeneous population of NSCs comprising Notch-independent Hes1-expressing (NIHes1) NSCs and Notch-dependent Hes1-expressing (NDHes1) radial glial cells (RGCs). Using single-cell transcriptomics and a Nestin-CreERT2;NIHes1fl/fl conditional knock-out mouse model, we have characterized the NIHes1 NSCs. Our analyses show that NIHes1 NSCs are the ancestral precursor NSCs that generate RGCs and intermediate progenitor cells during development. Loss of NIHes1 expression significantly alters the NSC niche, leading to increased gliogenesis and aberrant migration of projection neurons. NIHes1 NSCs are set aside at embryonic stages as adult neural stem cells and are maintained by NIHes1 expression even at adult stage. Our findings suggest that NIHes1 NSCs are functionally distinct Hes1-expressing NSCs, which are critical for establishing both embryonic and adult NSC niches, thereby contributing to the overall cortical development."},{"t":"通过高浓度锂盐优先分解构建稳定SEI层并防止铝集流体腐蚀用于锂离子电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504436?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"SEI层铝腐蚀抑制","kp":["电解质盐[锂离子电池]: LiTFSI形成无机富集SEI","[腐蚀问题]: LiTFSI引发铝集流体严重腐蚀","[解决策略]: LiPF6-LiTFSI混合盐优选分解稳定SEI兼防腐"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过高浓度锂盐的优先分解策略，在锂离子电池中构建稳定SEI层的同时防止铝集流体腐蚀。针对双三氟甲磺酰亚胺锂（LiTFSI）等新型锂盐对铝集流体的腐蚀问题，通过浓度调控实现阴离子优先还原成膜，兼顾界面稳定性和集流体保护，提升了电池安全性和循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Deriving Stable SEI Layer and Preventing Aluminum Current Collector Corrosion via Preferential Decomposition of Concentrated Lithium Salt for Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Among promising lithium salts for electrolyte in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide (LiTFSI) forms a more stable inorganic‐rich SEI layer. However, its implementation is limited by severe aluminum current collector corrosion. Since lithium hexafluorophosphate (LiPF\n                    6\n                    ) contributes a stable passivation layer for aluminum, a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte offers reduced corrosion. However, its corrosion inhibition capability is not complete. Herein, we propose a SEI‐stabilizing and corrosion‐preventing layer (SCL) that realizes spatial separation of salts, which confines concentrated LiTFSI within a polyethylene glycol dimethacrylate (PEGDMA) network at the anode‐LiPF\n                    6\n                    electrolyte interface. The locally high concentration of LiTFSI in SCL induces a kinetic preference that overrides the thermodynamic preference of LiPF\n                    6\n                    , which enables targeted decomposition of LiTFSI to form a robust SEI layer, while using only a small amount of LiTFSI. Furthermore, SCL demonstrates excellent corrosion‐inhibiting behavior compared to a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte. Consequently, SCL enables stable cycling of high‐loading (21.4 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) practical NCM811/graphite full cells with 93.57% capacity retention after 100 cycles at a high current density of 2.2 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This strategy enables selective electrochemical reactions through spatial confinement to enhance LIB performance, while suppressing side reactions and reducing costs, providing a scalable approach for next‐generation electrolyte design."},{"t":"自下而上相反转接力策略构建集成双皮层多孔膜用于液流电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506085?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液流电池多孔膜","kp":["[膜结构]: 集成双皮层多孔膜(大孔层居双侧皮层间)","[制备策略]: 底驱相转化中继法引入非溶剂载体","[调控手段]: 乙二醇调控皮层结构"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究首次提出自下而上相翻转接力策略，构建了集成式双皮层多孔膜（大孔-皮层结构）。该膜材料应用于液流电池，双皮层结构有效兼顾离子选择性和传质效率，显著降低离子crossover并提升电池效率和循环稳定性，为高性能低成本液流电池隔膜的设计提供了全新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Constructing Integrated Dual‐Skin‐Layer Porous Membranes via a Bottom‐Up Phase Inversion Relay Strategy for Flow Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A bottom‐up relay strategy is first proposed to fabricate integrated dual‐skin‐layer porous membranes (macropore layer between bilateral skin layers) by ingeniously introducing a non‐solvent carrier. Benefiting from the phase inversion relay process, bilateral skin layers can be tailored freely, where ethylene glycol in the non‐solvent carrier effectively regulates the structure of the bottom skin layer by adjusting the ratio of free water to bound water. Thus, a dual‐skin‐layer membrane is designed and applied in a vanadium flow battery (VFB), that features symmetric skin layers (∼600 nm) with sub‐nanometer (∼4.5 Å) pores. The symmetric structure reduces the pressure required for proton migration via the Vehicle mechanism, and the sub‐nanometer pores effectively separate vanadium ions from protons by size exclusion, breaking the trade‐off in traditional membranes. Moreover, the bilateral skin layers protect the macropore layer against the vanadium fouling and mechanical damage. Furthermore, the formation mechanism and ion transport dynamics of the dual‐skin‐layer membrane are analyzed by molecular dynamics and multi‐physical field simulation. As a result, the optimized membrane enables stable VFB operation for over 6000 cycles at 200 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    with energy efficiency of ∼83.6%. This work provides an effective approach to prepare integrated symmetric membranes with bilateral skin layers.","aip":1},{"t":"限域柯肯达尔应变工程促进Co3O4析氧反应用于质子交换膜水电解槽","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM析氧催化剂","kp":["催化剂[PEMWE析氧]: Co3O4(IrO2替代)","晶格膨胀[柯肯达尔氧化]: >2.4%","[应变工程]: 约束柯肯达尔晶格膨胀"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用限域Kirkendall应变工程调控Co3O4催化剂的电子结构和形貌，显著提升析氧反应（OER）活性。通过控制Kirkendall氧化过程中的扩散应变，优化了催化剂的活性位点和电荷传输性能，在质子交换膜（PEM）水电解槽中展现出优异的催化活性和耐久性，推动绿氢生产技术发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Confined Kirkendall Strain Engineering Promotes Oxygen Evolution on Co3O4 for Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyzer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    While Kirkendall oxidation (KO) facilely fabricates transition metal oxides for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) in proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs), it concomitantly triggers detrimental lattice expansion. For Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , an appealing IrO\n                    2\n                    ‐alternative catalyst, KO generates a free lattice expansion above 2.4%, resulting in suboptimal activity and stability. Here, we design a confined KO approach and coat the precursor Co nanoparticles with atomic carbon layers, enabling controllable lattice expansion of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    between 0.2% and 1.8%. For the first time, a strain‐dependent OER activity of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    is established in acidic media, with an expansion strain of 1.4% exhibiting the lowest overpotential of 377 mV at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Synchrotron X‐ray absorption spectroscopies and theoretical calculations unravel the adjustable lattice strain regulates the d‐band center of Co sites and further modifies the oxygenate adsorptions. When integrated into a PEMWE, the 1.4%‐strained Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    catalyst sustainably operates at 250 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    over 100 h. The reported confined KO provides a new means for strain engineering of transition metal oxides for energy electrocatalysis."},{"t":"糖肽库的化学酶合成可解码唾液酸化依赖性免疫优势，以实现有效的多组分抗肿瘤疫苗","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525026?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aberrant sialylation is a hallmark of tumor glycosylation that promotes malignant progression and immune evasion. While sialylated carbohydrates represent attractive targets for anticancer vaccines, structural and antigenic insights into glycopeptides are still hampered by limited access to well‐defined structures, rendering their immunogenicity unclear. Herein, we describe an efficient chemoenzymatic platform for facile synthesis of a glycopeptide library comprising 18 structures with diverse\n                    O\n                    ‐glycans at different glycosylation sites. Glycopeptide microarray‐based serological screening revealed a consistent preference of cancer patient sera for sialylated glycopeptides over their non‐sialylated counterparts. Motivated by this finding, we performed systematic immunological evaluations of sialylated and non‐sialylated glycopeptide‐tetanus toxoid (TT) conjugates, demonstrating that sialylated glycopeptide‐TT conjugates elicit stronger antibody responses, enhanced tumor cell recognition, and more potent tumor growth inhibition through synergistic activation of antigen‐presenting cells and T cell subsets. Furthermore, we developed a multicomponent cocktail vaccine by incorporating four sialylated glycopeptides, which elicited broader and more potent immune activation than single‐antigen formulations. Antisera from the cocktail vaccine exhibited strong binding to human tumor tissues, underscoring the clinical relevance of our findings. This work establishes sialylation as a key determinant of glycopeptide immunogenicity and provides a rational strategy for developing next‐generation glycopeptide‐based cancer vaccines."},{"t":"双锚定功能化分子构建2D/3D异质结化学桥连：高效稳定柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE03302K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿异质结","kp":["[界面工程]: 2D/3D钙钛矿双锚定分子桥联","[器件]: 柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过双锚定功能化分子构建2D/3D钙钛矿异质结界面化学桥连，显著提升钙钛矿太阳能电池的效率、稳定性和柔性适配性。双锚定基团增强了二维/三维钙钛矿层间的电荷传输和界面钝化，有效抑制非辐射复合，为高效柔性钙钛矿光伏器件的界面工程提供了分子级设计策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Chemical Bridging in 2D/3D Heterojunction via Dual-Anchoring Functionalized Molecules for Efficient, Stable and Flexible Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"Constructing two-dimensional/three-dimensional (2D/3D) perovskite heterojunctions has emerged as an effective interfacial engineering strategy to passivate surface defects, optimize energy-level alignment, and suppress ion migration. However, conventional 2D layers are typically formed by surface stacking of bulky organic cations, which often result in weak interfacial coupling and hindered carrier transport, thereby limiting device performance. In this work, a single-molecule dual-functional surface-passivation strategy is proposed, in which 5-methyltryptamne hydrochloride (Me-TACl) treatment constructs a stable 2D perovskite passivation layer on top of 3D perovskite films and establishes a chemical bridge between them. This \"chemically bridged heterojunction passivation\" enhances interfacial coupling, suppresses surface defects, and optimizes energy level alignment. As a result, the Me-TACl treated devices exhibit remarkable enhancement in photovoltaic performance. The champion device achieves a power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 26.35%, with a stabilized power output (SPO) of 26.20% over 300 s, outperforming the control device (24.67%). Moreover, the flexible device retains 92% of its initial efficiency (24.12%) after bending at a curvature radius of 5 mm for 5000 cycles, demonstrating outstanding mechanical durability. This post-treatment strategy simultaneously enhances efficiency, stability, and flexibility, offering insights for scalable high-efficiency perovskite photovoltaics and a viable interfacial design for next-generation devices."},{"t":"共价有机框架中电荷调控吡啶氮实现无金属多相光催化吡咯C─H芳基化","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523681?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化C-H芳基化","kp":["催化剂[光催化C-H芳化]: N-TFPPy-BD-COF","[活性位点]: 电荷调控吡啶氮(无金属)"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用共价有机框架（COFs）中的电荷调控吡啶氮位点，实现无金属多相光催化吡咯C-H芳基化反应。该策略替代了传统依赖贵金属或有机小分子的催化体系，通过COFs的可设计性和光催化活性，在绿色有机合成中实现了高选择性和可循环的C-H功能化，推动可持续光催化化学发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Charge‐Regulated Pyridinic Nitrogen in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Metal‐Free Heterogeneous Photocatalytic C─H Arylation of Pyrroles","b":"Abstract\n                  Conventional catalytic systems for the C─H arylation of pyrrole predominantly rely on noble metals or organic dyes, which suffer from inherent limitations such as low sustainability, challenging recyclability, and high cost. To address these challenges, this study develops a metal‐free photocatalytic strategy employing a designed covalent organic framework, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF, as an efficient heterogeneous catalyst with a precisely tailored electronic structure. Site‐specific nitrogen doping within the pyrene‐based scaffold enables fine‐tuning of the electronic landscape. Spectroscopic characterization and theoretical computations reveal that nitrogen doping facilitates spatial separation of photogenerated electron–hole pairs, suppresses recombination, thereby improves visible‐light absorption, prolongs charge‐carrier lifetimes, and enhances charge‐separation efficiency. Under visible‐light irradiation, the catalyst delivers outstanding performance in the arylation of pyrroles, affording a yield of 79% with 98% selectivity, surpassing those achieved by noble metal and organic dye‐based systems. Furthermore, N‐TFPPy‐BD‐COF exhibits remarkable stability as a heterogeneous catalyst, maintaining its structural integrity over ten consecutive catalytic cycles. This work not only presents a sustainable and efficient pathway for C─H arylation but also establishes a general strategy for the rational design of COF‐based photocatalysts through electronic structure engineering."},{"t":"生物材料的仿生工程重建基质-实质相互作用以促进中风后神经再生","d":"2026-01-21","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202512404?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Stroke remains a leading cause of neurological disability worldwide. A major obstacle to brain tissue regeneration after stroke is the persistent local inflammation and the absence of extracellular matrix (ECM) support within the infarct cavity, which severely impedes the brain's endogenous repair. Inspired by the natural interactions between stromal and parenchymal cells, we developed an engineered living material to recreate a regenerative niche within the stroke cavity. This system integrates a programmable supramolecular DNA hydrogel with interleukin‐10–secreting engineered‐mesenchymal stem cells (eMSCs) and neural stem cells (NSCs). The hydrogel mimics the structural and mechanical properties of the native ECM, enhancing the retention and viability of transplanted cells. Meanwhile, eMSCs modulate the inflammatory environment, suppress glial scar formation, and promote vascular regeneration, thereby facilitating the neuronal differentiation of NSCs. In a rat model of ischemic stroke, these engineered living materials significantly promote neuronal regeneration, synaptic remodeling, and neovascularization, leading to improved motor and cognitive function. These findings highlight a modular strategy for repairing damaged neural tissues by re‐establishing stromal–parenchymal interactions, offering a promising therapeutic avenue for post‐stroke brain regeneration.","tp":"神经再生材料","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对中风后脑组织再生面临的持续炎症和细胞外基质缺失障碍，受基质细胞与实质细胞自然相互作用启发，开发了工程化活体材料以在梗死腔内重建再生微环境，促进脑内源性修复，为中风后神经再生提供新策略。"},{"t":"基于数据驱动场景生成的不确定性表征：数据中心电-热-算耦合系统双层规划","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心电热协同","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation for representing uncertainties"},{"t":"无定形、初生态还是介孔化沸石？中间合成相综述：定义、表征与应用","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523144?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沸石中间相","kp":["[材料相态]: 分子筛合成中间相(无定形/胚态/介孔化)"],"sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":"该综述系统梳理了分子筛合成中的中间相态——无定形、胚胎态和介孔化分子筛的定义、表征方法和催化应用。这些中间态材料介于传统晶态分子筛与非晶材料之间，具有独特的孔道结构和酸性特征，在催化裂化、精细化工等领域展现出互补优势，为分子筛催化剂的理性设计提供了材料学基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Amorphous, Embryonic or Mesoporized Zeolites? An Overview of Intermediate Synthetic Phases: Definitions, Characterization, and Application.","b":"Abstract\n                  The success of zeolites as catalysts has long been attributed to their high thermal stability and strict shape selectivity flowing from their network of well‐defined channels and cages. Synthetic efforts often unjustly disregarded (partially) amorphous intermediate synthetic phases (ISPs), including embryonic zeolite, interzeolite conversion intermediates and mesoporized zeolites, as “failed” and excluded them from further characterization efforts. Recently, this perception has changed and better characterization techniques have led to a deeper understanding of the structure and catalytic potential these materials (may) hold. In this work, we will give a brief overview of the state of the art research being conducted in synthesis, characterization and exploitation of ISPs, as well as clarifying some definitions, hoping to set the stage for future generations of zeolite scientists."},{"t":"可再生能源直流船舶微电网中分布式电池储能系统基于误差函数SOC均衡的自适应下垂控制方案","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000577?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能SOC均衡控制","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Adaptive droop control scheme with error functioned-based SoC balancing for distributed battery storage system in renewable energy-based DC shipboard microgrid"},{"t":"通过氧空位调控加速Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7正极电化学动力学，用于宽温域安时级钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525531?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池正极改性","kp":["正极材料[宽温钠离子电池]: Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)","[改性策略]: 氧空位调控加速电化学动力学","[关键缺陷]: 磷铁钠矿NaFePO4惰性杂质相"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对钠离子电池Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)正极材料本征电子/离子电导率低的问题，采用氧空位调控策略加速电化学动力学。通过在NFPP晶格中引入可控氧空位，优化Fe位点的局部电子结构并拓宽钠离子迁移通道，使材料在宽温域(-20°C至55°C)下展现优异倍率性能和循环稳定性。该工作成功制备出安时级(Ah-level)电芯，验证了氧空位工程在推动钠离子电池规模化应用中的可行性。","dp":1,"ot":"Accelerating Electrochemical Kinetics in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 Cathodes Through Oxygen Vacancy Modulation for Wide‐Temperature Ah‐Level Sodium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP) stands as a highly promising cathode material for sodium‐ion batteries, offering a favorable combination of operating voltage and theoretical capacity. Nevertheless, its commercial viability is significantly hindered by two primary factors: the prevalent formation of electrochemically inert impurity phases, such as\n                    maricite\n                    ‐NaFePO\n                    4\n                    and low‐energy‐density Na\n                    2\n                    FeP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    , during conventional synthesis, coupled with its intrinsically poor electronic conductivity. Herein, we demonstrate a rational defect‐engineering strategy to enhance the electrochemical kinetics of NFPP cathodes through controlled oxygen vacancy formation. The optimized Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    2.79\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP‐2.79) exhibits superior phase purity, enhanced electronic conductivity, and facilitated Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion, as confirmed by multi‐scale characterization techniques. The NFPP‐2.79 cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 89.51 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10C and retains 96.42% capacity after 1500 cycles at 2C. Moreover, kilogram‐scale synthesis using cost‐effective raw precursors has been achieved via a sand‐milling‐assisted spray‐drying route. When assembled into Ah‐level pouch cells with hard carbon anodes, the NFPP‐2.79‐based cell demonstrates excellent rate capability (93.75% capacity retention from 0.5C to 4C), outstanding cyclability (75.63% retention after 3000 cycles), and superior safety under extreme conditions (overheating, crushing, nail penetration, overcharge, and external short‐circuit). This work highlights oxygen vacancy modulation as an effective pathway for advancing polyanionic cathodes toward practical applications."},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场竞价","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid power systems"},{"t":"水电解槽剩余使用寿命预测综述：从退化机制到预测模型","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"水电解槽寿命预测","kp":["[水电解槽寿命预测]: 从退化机制到预测模型综述"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic models"},{"t":"增值型太阳能可充电池：集成高效光电化学储能与光增强自驱动天然海水产H2O2","d":"2026-01-21","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523063?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能可充电池","kp":["[电池化学]: 太阳光介导可充海水电池","[集成功能]: 光电储能耦合H2O2生产"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种太阳能驱动的可充电电池器件，将光电化学储能与天然海水产H2O2功能集成于一体。该电池在光照条件下通过光阳极驱动充电储能，同时利用海水中的溶解氧经两电子氧还原反应生成过氧化氢，实现储能与高附加值化学品联产。该设计兼具能量存储与太阳能驱动的自供电H2O2合成功能，避免了外部偏压需求，为分布式海洋能源利用与环境修复提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"A Value‐Added Solar‐Mediated Rechargeable Battery Integrating Efficient Photoelectrochemical Energy Storage with Sunlight‐Boosted Self‐Powered H2O2 Production from Natural Seawater","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Developing sustainable functional batteries capable of generating valuable chemicals during electricity storage/release represents challenging frontiers. Here, we present a new battery chemistry that enables the first value‐added solar‐mediated rechargeable seawater battery integrating photoelectrochemical energy storage with sunlight‐boosted self‐powered H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production from seawater without external power/O\n                    2\n                    supply. This system is enabled by rationally‐designed bifunctional S‐scheme heterojunction photocathodes (MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    ) comprising A3‐(D‐core) polymer (MP‐COP) encapsulated TiO\n                    2\n                    . A3‐(D‐core) topology induces favorable electronic modulation that optimizes oxygen specie adsorption and steering oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) toward one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    pathway—while facilitating electronic coupling with oxygen evolution reaction (OER)‐active TiO\n                    2\n                    to establish S‐scheme charge transfer mechanism alongside strengthened built‐in electric field. These endow MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sunlight‐boosted 4e\n                    –\n                    OER for in situ O\n                    2\n                    ‐generation during photo‐charge and 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR for on‐site H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    synthesis during photo‐discharge, establishing solar‐mediated self‐sustaining value‐added reaction cycles. Integrating MP‐COP@TiO\n                    2\n                    with sodium anodes and seawater creates previously‐unexplored functional battery, yielding remarkable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    yield of 5.47 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during photo‐discharge—9.4 times those in dark and exceeding most reported seawater systems while delivering near‐zero charge/discharge voltage gap under illumination. Mechanistic studies reveal promoting effect of A3‐(D‐core) modulation and its synergistic role with S‐scheme charge transfer that promotes Yeager‐type O\n                    2\n                    adsorption and facilitates one‐step 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR toward H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"“贪婪是我们这个时代的铁笼”——民族主义为何继续存在","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00186-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"[ASAP] 锂金属电池中的异相电荷转移机制：揭示异常亲锂性","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12858","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["[界面动力学]: MHC理论解释异常亲锂性","[机制]: 沉积动力学对基底亲锂性反常依赖"],"dp":1,"as":"锂金属电池因高能量密度被视为下一代储能技术的核心候选，但锂金属非均匀电镀和枝晶生长严重制约其循环寿命与安全性。本研究聚焦锂金属电池中异质电荷转移机制，揭示锂离子在电极/电解质界面处的非均匀沉积动力学根源。通过深入解析异质界面电荷分布与离子输运的耦合关系，阐明枝晶成核与生长的微观驱动力，为设计均匀电镀策略、从源头抑制枝晶形成提供理论依据，推动高比能锂金属电池的工程化进程。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] The Heterogeneous Charge Transfer Mechanism in Lithium Metal Batteries: Revealing Abnormal Lithiophilicity throug","b":"Li metal batteries offer a high energy density but suffer from nonuniform Li metal electroplating and dendrite formation, limiting practical use. These issues arise from complex interfacial charge transfer kinetics, which are still ambiguously defined. Here, we reveal an abnormal dependence of Li electrodeposition kinetics on substrate lithiophilicity, rationalized by the Marcus-Hush-Chidsey (MHC) theory. Contrary to conventional expectations, lithiophobic Cu enables faster electron transfer and more stable Li electroplating at high overpotentials, whereas lithiophilic Au performs better at low overpotentials. This crossover behavior establishes a current density-dependent framework that redefines the classical understanding of lithiophilicity. Electrochemical characterizations, MHC-based modeling, and crystal orbital Hamilton population analysis attribute the phenomenon to an interplay between reorganization energy and electronic coupling strength. The findings, validated across various substrates and electrolytes, provide general mechanistic insights into heterogeneous charge transfer during Li electroplating and suggest new strategies for interface design in anodeless Li metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 调控金属有机框架中物种输运用于锂金属电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04334","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF锂金属电池","kp":["[物种输运调控]: MOF用于锂金属电池"],"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Regulating Species Transport in Metal–Organic Frameworks for Lithium Metal Batteries"},{"t":"[ASAP] RiPP生物合成中HEXXH酶催化的氧化性肽骨架断裂","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19246","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"RiPP生物合成酶","kp":["酶[RiPP生物合成]: α-酮戊二酸依赖HEXXH酶(PflC/PosC)","[反应]: 氧化肽骨架断裂"],"as":"核糖体合成和翻译后修饰肽（RiPPs）是一类结构多样的生物活性天然产物，其生物合成依赖多种酶对前体肽的精准修饰。本研究揭示了一种含HEXXH基序的金属酶在RiPP生物合成中催化氧化肽骨架裂解的新机制，拓展了对金属酶催化化学多样性的认知。该发现不仅加深了对非经典肽键断裂反应的理解，也为酶工程改造和新型活性肽的合成生物学开发提供了高效催化工具，在抗菌药物发现与合成生物学领域具有重要价值。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Oxidative Peptide Backbone Cleavage by a HEXXH Enzyme during RiPP Biosynthesis","b":"Ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) rely on a diverse array of enzymes to tailor peptide backbones and side chains. In this study, we characterized enzymes from two different biosynthetic gene clusters (BGCs) from Pseudomonas strains (pfl and pos) that catalyze new transformations in RiPP biosynthesis. Two α-ketoglutarate-dependent HEXXH enzymes, PflC and PosC, perform hydroxylation of multiple consecutive glutamine residues and selectively recognize a C-terminal ARMD tetrapeptide to trigger oxidative backbone cleavage that generates an amide terminus. Mutational analysis pinpoints the first position of this motif as a critical determinant. Notably, PflC displays proteolytic activity in the absence of the leader peptide, indicating that leader peptide-enzyme interactions modulate the observed reaction selectivity. The biosynthetic gene clusters also encode a unique MNIO-nitroreductase fusion enzyme that installs a rare Z-dehydrophenylalanine and hydroxylates an Asp residue. Collectively, this work expands both the catalytic repertoire and structural diversity accessible through bacterial RiPP biosynthesis."},{"t":"[ASAP] Pt3Co金属间化合物催化剂中镧诱导的准共价键合与化学势桥接提升耐久性","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16692","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池ORR催化剂","kp":["催化剂[燃料电池ORR]: La掺杂L12-Pt3Co金属间化合物","[稳定化]: La诱导准共价键+化学势桥接"],"as":"铂基金属间化合物是氧还原反应（ORR）最有前景的电催化剂，但稳定性不足与成本高昂仍是制约其规模应用的核心瓶颈。本研究发现镂元素的引入可在铂基金属间化合物中诱导形成准共价键合，并通过化学势桥接效应优化铂活性位点的电子结构，从而协同提升ORR催化活性与长期耐久性。该电子结构调控策略为设计高性能、低铂载量电催化剂提供了新思路，对推动燃料电池商业化具有指导意义。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"[ASAP] Lanthanum-Induced Quasi-Covalent Bonding and Chemical Potential Bridging in Pt3Co Intermetallic Catalysts for Dur","b":"Pt-based intermetallic compounds represent the most promising catalysts for oxygen reduction reaction (ORR). However, they still face stability challenges, primarily due to component segregation and oxidation/dissolution of both transition metal and Pt atoms under harsh electrochemical conditions. Herein, we strategically incorporate electron-donating La into the L12-Pt3Co intermetallic catalyst to steer a quasi-covalent Pt-M interaction and bridge the core-shell chemical potential gradient, enhancing ORR durability. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses elucidate that the transition from metallic to quasi-covalent bonding strengthens Pt-Co/La interactions, which effectively suppresses Pt leaching. Furthermore, La-mediated electronic modulation reduces the core-shell chemical potential difference, thus inhibiting Co migration from the core to the outermost surface and the subsequent oxidative dissolution. Due to these properties, the as-developed catalyst demonstrates high ORR activity under H2-air conditions, achieving a peak power density of 1.27 W cm-2 and high mass activity (MA) of 1.29 A mgPt-1. More importantly, it exhibits exceptional stability with 87% MA retention and only 12 mV voltage loss at 0.8 A cm-2 after 30k accelerated durability cycles, outperforming DOE 2026 targets (60% MA retention and voltage loss <30 mV). This study proposes a new structural engineering strategy for enhancing catalytic robustness in harsh electrochemical environments.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 利用镍基氧化还原偶电化学介导分离一氧化碳","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04138","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学分离一氧化碳","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Electrochemically Mediated Separation of Carbon Monoxide Using a Ni-Based Redox Couple"},{"t":"[尽快] 更正“通过铜催化硼基烯丙基化对映选择性合成 2,3-二取代氮杂环丁烷”","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22357","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮杂环合成","as":"","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":8.0}},{"t":"[ASAP] 三维共价有机框架的构建用于2,3-二氢苯并呋喃的光催化合成","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19165","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF光催化合成","kp":["催化剂[光催化合成]: 给体-受体3D共价有机框架","[产物]: 2,3-二氢苯并呋喃衍生物"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究构建了三维共价有机框架（3D COFs），并将其作为光催化剂用于2,3-二氢苯并呋喃衍生物的合成。2,3-二氢苯并呋喃结构广泛存在于天然产物和药物分子中，在制药和材料科学领域具有重要价值。研究利用3D COF的多孔结构和光吸收特性，在温和条件下实现光催化[2+2]环加成或其他成环反应，高效构建目标杂环分子，为绿色合成药学相关骨架提供了新策略。","ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Three-Dimensional Covalent Organic Frameworks for Photocatalytic Synthesis of 2,3-Dihydrobenzofur","b":"2,3-Dihydrobenzofuran derivatives hold significant value in pharmaceutical and material science due to their prevalence in bioactive molecules and natural products. However, constructing efficient and sustainable catalytic systems for the synthesis of such derivatives remains challenging. Herein, we synthesized two three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) with donor-acceptor (D-A) units, which enable efficient photocatalytic synthesis of 2,3-dihydrobenzofuran derivatives via oxidative dehydrogenative coupling of alkenyl phenols (12 substrate examples, up to 95% yields) or oxidative [3 + 2] cycloaddition of phenols and olefins (14 substrate examples, up to 97% yields). Remarkably, a range of natural products, including δ-viniferin, conocarpan, licarin A, homopterocarpin, and pterocarpan, can be facilely and scalably synthesized through a one-step synthesis in high yields (up to 93%), in sharp contrast to multistep routes required by conventional approaches with lower yields (<60%). Comprehensive characterizations reveal that the synthesized 3D COFs with D-A units enable efficient photoinduced carrier separation and migration, thus facilitating the photocatalytic performance. Moreover, the interconnected nanochannels and rigid frameworks in 3D COFs collectively ensure substrate accessibility and structural stability (at least 10 catalytic cycles), much superior to that of the corresponding two-dimensional (2D) COFs. This work provides an innovative approach for facile and efficient photosynthesis of high-value-added chemicals by 3D COFs."},{"t":"[ASAP] 先进的分子镊子可有效靶向缺乏胆碱头基的膜以实现广谱抗病毒","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19450","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Broad-spectrum antivirals are urgently required to counter present and emerging viral threats. It has previously been shown that the parental molecular tweezers CLR01 and CLR05 disrupt viral envelopes by complexing choline headgroups and that ester-functionalized \"advanced\" tweezers display markedly enhanced antiviral potency. Here, we determine the molecular basis of this improved activity. Using liposome leakage assays, giant unilamellar vesicles, NMR, Langmuir film balance experiments, and atomistic simulations, we demonstrate that advanced tweezers not only encapsulate choline-containing lipids but also engage lipids lacking choline headgroups via transient and conserved hydrophobic insertion events. These interactions preferentially destabilize membranes enriched in sphingomyelin, unsaturated acyl chains, or inverted cone-shaped lipids and are especially effective against small, highly curved particles resembling viral particles, explaining their broad antiviral activity for enveloped viruses. Our findings reveal a dual mechanism of action, choline binding and hydrophobic insertion, that underpins the broad-spectrum antiviral activity of advanced molecular tweezers and establish them as a promising new class of membrane-targeting antivirals for prophylactic and therapeutic use.","tp":"广谱抗病毒","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究先进分子镊子靶向缺乏胆碱头基的病毒膜以实现广谱抗病毒。通过脂质体泄漏实验、巨型单层囊泡、核磁共振及Langmuir膜天平实验阐明酯功能化分子镊子增强抗病毒活性的分子机制，为应对现有及新兴病毒威胁提供策略。","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 未取代的卡宾阳离子的无重氮当量：萘和吡啶的直接合成","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21901","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Stable isotope labeling is a crucial technique in pharmaceutical research to understand the mode of action and metabolism of new drug candidates; however, its utility is often jeopardized by the synthetic challenges associated with the installation of the isotopic label into the core of the structures under study. Herein, we address this problem for the case of 13C-labeled naphthalene and pyridine building blocks. Our synthetic protocol utilizes the sulfonium sulfaneylidene salt 1, a benchtop stable reagent that does not incorporate diazo functionalities in its structure; yet, under Rh-catalysis, it efficiently acts as a synthetic equivalent of the simplest conceivable carbynyl cation, the [CH]+ fragment. Mechanistic experiments supported by DFT calculations suggest the initial formation of a sulfonio-substituted Rh(II)-carbene that reacts with indenes or pyrroles to initially form sulfonio-substituted cyclopropanes; the diastereoselectivity of this step being inconsequential because both isomers interconvert under the reaction conditions. Subsequent electrocyclic ring expansion with the concomitant elimination of dibenzothiophene delivers the desired naphthalenes or pyridines.","tp":"卡宾合成法","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了无重氮当量的未取代卡宾阳离子合成方法，用于13C标记的萘和吡啶构建模块的直接合成。利用稳定的锍亚锍盐实现稳定同位素标记，克服了药物研究中同位素标记安装于结构核心的合成难题。"},{"t":"重视混合能源系统的操作灵活性：汉密尔顿-雅可比-贝尔曼方程的神经解","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600070X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源灵活性","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"将 RNA 降解转化为准确的 RNA 检测：用于临床 Sam 的 RNase I 辅助滚环扩增","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525591?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Ribonucleases are powerful degradative enzymes that rapidly cleave RNA and have long been regarded as obstacles to RNA diagnostics. Detecting large, structured RNA molecules in biological samples is further complicated by extensive secondary structures and abundant background RNA. Here we transform this destructive activity into a diagnostic advantage through a RNase I–assisted rolling circle amplification (RI‐RCA) strategy that integrates enzymatic RNA digestion with circular DNA templates (CDTs) to achieve direct, reverse‐transcription‐free RNA detection. In this system,\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    RNase I—a widely available endoribonuclease—selectively digests structured RNA to expose complementary CDT‐binding sites, which are immediately protected through duplex formation and converted into primers for RCA. The resulting reaction proceeds isothermally at room temperature in linear, quasi‐exponential, and exponential modes, achieving quantitative signal generation across concentrations from 50 aM to 50 fM and maintaining performance in 50% pooled human saliva. Applied to clinical saliva samples from SARS‐CoV‐2–positive and –negative individuals, RI‐RCA achieved near‐perfect sensitivity and 98–100% diagnostic accuracy. By coupling enzymatic RNA digestion with sequence‐specific protection via CDT hybridization, this strategy converts RNA instability from a liability into an analytical advantage, providing a simple, robust, and clinically translatable platform for accurate detection of structured RNA targets.","tp":"核酸检测法","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"将核糖核酸酶的降解活性转化为诊断优势，开发了RNase I辅助滚环扩增(RI-RCA)策略，整合酶促降解与扩增检测，实现对生物样品中大型结构化RNA分子的准确检测，有望应用于临床样品分析与RNA诊断。","aip":1},{"t":"美国页岩能源行业在全球经济碎片化的情况下引导国内政策","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000108?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"页岩气政策","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"利用电活性介质调控多碘化物流动","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02059-5","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多碘化物调控","kp":["[聚碘化物调控]: 电活性介质限流"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Taming polyiodide flow with electroactive mediators"},{"t":"协同驱动的电解液设计：共晶电解液中氟代碳酸乙烯酯与丁二腈的共溶剂化","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠金属电池电解质","kp":["电解质[SMBs]: NaFSI+FEC+丁二腈三元共晶(NSF-5)","溶剂化[协同设计]: FEC与丁二腈共溶剂化稳定钠负极"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出协同驱动的电解液设计策略，将氟代碳酸亚乙酯（FEC）与丁二腈（SN）结合用于钠金属电池（SMBs）。钠金属电池因高能量密度和钠资源丰富被视为锂离子电池的有力替代方案，但面临钠枝晶生长和界面不稳定等挑战。FEC在负极形成富含无机物的SEI层提升界面稳定性，SN则增强电解液离子导电率和宽温域性能，两者协同作用显著改善了电池循环寿命和库伦效率。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Synergy‐Driven Electrolyte Design: Fluoroethylene Carbonate and Succinonitrile Co‐Solvation in a Eutectic Electrolyte fo","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sodium metal batteries (SMBs) are promising alternatives to lithium‐ion batteries due to their high energy density and abundant sodium resources. However, high reactivity of sodium metal anodes (SMAs) presents significant challenges for practical application. Herein, we report a multifunctional ternary eutectic electrolyte, termed NSF‐5, comprising sodium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (NaFSI), succinonitrile (SN), and fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a 1:1:5 molar ratio, which enhances the cycling stability of SMAs. Combined experimental and computational studies confirm a synergistic effect between FEC and SN, where FEC integrates into the Na\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath, regulates the desolvation process, and promotes the formation of a robust, inorganic‐rich solid electrolyte interphase, thereby suppressing sodium dendrite growth. Consequently, SMBs with NSF‐5 demonstrate desirable cyclability under demanding conditions. Full cells coupled with Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    achieve over 1650 cycles with 90.5% capacity retention at 0.5 C and 3715 cycles with 80.2% retention at 10 C. Even at 0 °C, the cell maintains 87.9 mAh g\n                    ‒1\n                    capacity after 3500 cycles with 81.4% retention. Moreover, this versatile electrolyte formulation can be adapted to other alkali metal battery systems, underscoring its broad applicability. This work highlights the importance of electrolyte engineering in regulating the electrode−electrolyte interphase, offering valuable insights into achieving long‐term cyclability of SMBs."},{"t":"通过冻融、致密化与交联策略实现高强度、高韧性、动态可逆水凝胶","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000076?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"韧性可逆水凝胶","kp":["[制备策略]: 冷冻-解冻+致密化+交联三步法","性能特点[水凝胶]: 高强度高韧性且动态可逆"],"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Strong, tough, and dynamically reversible hydrogels enabled by a freeze–thawing, densification, and crosslinking strateg"},{"t":"信使 RNA 脂质纳米颗粒时空靶向子宫内膜治疗生殖疾病","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02108-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Dysfunctions of the endometrium, the uterus inner lining, can impair embryo implantation and reduce pregnancy rates. Intrauterine administration of cytokines has shown potential to improve endometrium function, but it is challenged by poor targeting and dose-limiting systemic side effects. Here we present a strategy for introducing therapeutic messenger RNA into the endometrium for the treatment of reproductive disorders. mRNA was loaded into a ligand-conjugated lipid nanoparticle (LNP), enabling multivalent interactions with the temporally overexpressed integrin receptors on the endometrial surface during the window of implantation. Conjugating the targeting ligand directly to the lipid component enhanced endometrial protein expression after intrauterine infusion and reduced systemic expression in the liver and spleen. A single infusion of granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor (GM-CSF) mRNA-loaded LNP sustained local protein expression for several hours and reduced GM-CSF systemic exposure. In a murine model of endometrial injury, GM-CSF mRNA-loaded LNP improved embryo implantation rates, outperforming recombinant GM-CSF. Our strategy demonstrates the efficacy of using mRNA to improve fertility outcomes.","tp":"脂质体递药","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了mRNA脂质纳米颗粒时空靶向子宫内膜的治疗策略。将治疗性信使RNA装入配体偶联的脂质纳米颗粒实现子宫内精准递送，克服细胞因子宫内给药靶向性差和全身副作用的问题，用于治疗生殖疾病改善胚胎着床。","aip":1},{"t":"国际货币基金组织条件下的太阳能转型：巴基斯坦的分配正义和能源政策势在必行","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000042?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"太阳能转型","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"基于物理的经济非线性模型预测控制的住宅能源枢纽顺序运行策略","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000541?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源枢纽优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Sequential operation of residential energy hubs using physics-based economic nonlinear MPC"},{"t":"自组装二维手性介观形貌决定细胞和体液免疫对Tu的平衡","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520552?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of nanomaterials‐based cancer vaccines has broadened the scope of immunotherapy. Nanomaterials with characteristics such as chirality, 2D, and flexibility have attracted widespread attention because they can maximize the interface between the materials and immune cells. Here, we report the fabrication of 2‐D mesoporous silica nanodisks with a chiral meso‐topography as vaccine adjuvants. These uniform nanodisks, with diameters from 200 nm to 1 µm, possess unique spiral mesoporous patterns of ∼ 10 nm. The thickness of the chiral mesoporous nanodisks can be precisely controlled in units of one layer (∼ 7 nm), thereby achieving precise regulation in surface topology, dimension and flexibility. The unique 2‐D chiral mesoporous structure originates from the maximum occupancy of confined space of micellar helical arrangement, which is distinct from conventional methods based on internal tension. The combination of flexibility, 2‐D structure and chirality enhances nanodisks’ interaction with dendritic cells (DCs), significantly improving DC maturation via Toll‐like receptors/Nuclear Factor‐kappa B (TLR/NF‐κB), Mitogen‐Activated Protein Kinase (MAPK) and Focal Adhesion Kinase (FAK) signaling pathways. Upon nanovaccines’ activation of DCs in vivo, DCs further presents antigen for activating T cells to trigger balanced cellular and humoral immunity. Subcutaneous injection of the nanodisks‐adjuvanted cancer vaccine can significantly inhibit the tumor growth and extend the survival of melanoma‐bearing mice to more than 60 days, about three times higher than that of the PBS‐treated group. When combined with PD‐1 antibody, the cancer vaccines maximize tumor suppression, achieving a tumor‐free outcome in one‐third of the cases."},{"t":"用于体内生物医学成像的自组装 (Aza)BODIPY 染料","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525491?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    4,4‐difluoro‐4‐bora‐3a,4a‐diaza‐s‐indacenes (BODIPYs) and their N‐containing analogs (aza‐BODIPYs) are highly versatile organic dyes that combine excellent photophysical, electronic, and supramolecular properties with high chemical stability. These features have enabled their use in diverse applications such as bioimaging, targeted drug delivery, and functional self‐assembled materials. Their broad structural modularity allows different stacking modes with controlled exciton coupling during self‐assembly, resulting in supramolecular materials with tunable spectroscopic and morphological properties. This is particularly relevant in aqueous media, where tunable near‐infrared (NIR) absorption and emission are essential for advanced contrast agents (CAs) in biomedical imaging. Besides\n                    meso\n                    ‐heteroatom modification, J‐aggregation stands out as especially advantageous for achieving red‐shifted absorption and emission, thereby improving tissue penetration and reducing autofluorescence and light scattering. Of particular promise is the concept of pathway complexity, whereby a single (aza)BODIPY scaffold can access multiple aggregated states with distinct photophysical signatures, enabling stimuli‐responsive and multifunctional imaging behavior. Hence, understanding the interplay between (aza)BODIPY molecular design, exciton coupling in aqueous media and their resulting supramolecular and bioimaging properties is of utmost importance. This minireview discusses recent advances in (aza)BODIPY‐based self‐assembled structures used as CA platforms for in vivo biomedical imaging and highlights the structure–property relationships that govern their performance.","tp":"自组装染料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"综述自组装BODIPY及含氮类似物(aza-BODIPY)染料在体内生物医学成像中的应用。该类染料兼具优异光物理、电子和超分子性能及高化学稳定性，结构模块化允许不同堆积模式，广泛应用于生物成像、靶向给药和功能化自组装材料。"},{"t":"脊椎动物胚胎中的巩膜造血有助于血液系统的稳健性","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag035/8429811?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"During vertebrate embryogenesis, hematopoietic stem cells (HSCs) are believed to almost exclusively arise from hemogenic endothelial cells (ECs) of the dorsal aorta through endothelial-to-hematopoietic transition (EHT). It remains elusive whether HSCs can be generated by other tissues. Sclerotomal cells (SCs) in embryonic somites majorly form vertebrae and ribs, and some SCs may also insert into aortic endothelia. Here we show that a subset of SCs directly enter the vascular lumen to become hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells (HSPCs) in an EHT-independent way in both zebrafish and mouse embryos. The sclerotome-derived HSPCs (scHSPCs) contribute to various blood cells throughout lifetime. The proportion of scHSPCs increased dramatically when endothelium hematopoiesis is defective. Thus, the sclerotomal hematopoiesis is evolutionarily conserved and would ensure the robustness of hematopoiesis."},{"t":"基于多元高斯与切比雪夫映射的进化模糊系统实时风功率预测","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000395?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风电功率预测","kp":["[预测方法]: 演化模糊系统(多元高斯+Chebyshev映射)","应用[风电]: 实时功率预测"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Real-time wind power forecasting using an evolving fuzzy system based on Multivariate Gaussian and Chebyshev mapping"},{"t":"量子相变：从有序磁体到自旋玻璃","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag038/8429790?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子磁相变","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"出版商更正：用于通用量子计算的容错中性原子架构","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10108-3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中性原子容错量子计算","as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Publisher Correction: A fault-tolerant neutral-atom architecture for universal quantum computation"},{"t":"界面聚合的可编程化：机器学习揭示微胶囊的定量理性设计规则","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517708?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"界面聚合微胶囊","kp":["[方法]: 机器学习揭示界面聚合定量设计规则","应用[MIP]: 微胶囊封装理性设计"],"dp":1,"as":"界面聚合(IP)是制备高分子分离膜（如反渗透、纳滤膜）的核心技术，但长期以来其聚合机理的定量控制仍具挑战性。该研究将机器学习与界面聚合过程结合，通过数据驱动方法揭示了单体反应速率、界面扩散与膜结构之间的定量关系，实现了对膜厚度、孔径和分离性能的精准可编程调控。这为高通量、高选择性分离膜的理性设计开辟了新范式。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Programming Interfacial Polymerization: Machine Learning Unveils Quantitative Rational Design Rules for Microcapsules an","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Interfacial polymerization (IP) serves as a versatile platform technology for designing polymeric membranes, yet its extension to applications such as microencapsulation (MIP) remains hindered by empirical methodologies, largely due to the absence of quantitative rational design principles. Unlike separation membranes, which prioritize nanostructural control, MIP emphasizes encapsulation efficiency (EE%), rendering conventional membrane‐derived theories and thermodynamic descriptors insufficient. In this work, we transcend these limitations by employing interpretable machine learning to program interfacial polymerization, thereby deciphering mechanism‐informed quantitative design rules. Our data‐driven platform integrates molecular thermodynamics, polymerization kinetics, and emulsion‐stabilized interfacial parameters to identify previously overlooked descriptors governing microcapsule formation. We establish a predictive chemical–process–structure–performance relationship and demonstrate programmable control over key performances, including EE% (30%–95%), particle size (100–400 µm), and shell thickness‐to‐radius ratios (0.005–1) for diverse payloads spanning hydrophobic, hydrophilic, and highly reactive compounds such as toluene diisocyanate and amines. This work not only resolves long‐standing challenges in understanding complex multiphase interactions in MIP but also establishes a new paradigm for the quantitative design of polymeric microcapsules, with broad implications for functional particles, catalytic microreactors, digital cells, and membranes.","aip":1},{"t":"硬碳上聚合物诱导的固体电解质界面层实现5C快充实用化钠离子软包电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag025/8429798?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠离子快充负极","kp":["SEI厚度[硬碳负极]: ~5.0 nm","SEI组成[硬碳]: 聚合物与NaF杂化","充电倍率[钠离子软包电池]: 5C快充"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种聚合物诱导固体电解质界面（SEI）策略，在硬碳负极表面构建富含阴离子的界面层。通过引入具有强极性特征的含氟基团（2F基团），在硬碳与聚合物界面处诱导阴离子富集，形成稳定的SEI膜，从而显著降低界面阻抗并抑制副反应。该策略使硬碳负极在5C倍率下实现稳定快充，为钠离子/锂离子电池高倍率充放电提供了新的界面工程思路，有望推动快充电池的工程化应用。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Polymer-induced solid electrolyte interphase on hard carbon enabling 5C fast-charging practical sodium-ion pouch cell","b":"Achieving 2F group attached has a powerful polar feature, which simultaneously induces anion enriched at the PolyHC interface and tailors extra F atoms, contributing to the architecture of a ∼5.0 nm stable SEI that hybridizes polymer and NaF. This SEI with a resilient polymer skeleton permanently holds the generated inorganic component, enabling long-term structural stability during fast-charging. The assembled 1.2 Ah pouch cell, paired with NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3O2 cathode and PolyHC anode, displays exceptional fast-charging capability and durability. This method is compatible with various HC, offering a novel perspective for modulating the HC interface chemistry."},{"t":"用于电气-天然气综合系统动态能量流计算的物理信息神经网络","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000267?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"物理神经网络","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络(PINN)","[应用]: 电-气综合系统动态能量流计算"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Physics-informed neural network for dynamic energy flow calculation in integrated electricity and gas systems"},{"t":"光热转换促进挑战性亲核芳香取代反应以便捷构建C─N键","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522296?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热SNAr反应","kp":["[光热催化]: 光热转换促进亲核芳香取代","反应[SNAr]: 低活化底物C-N键构建"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用光热转换技术促进具有挑战性的亲核芳香取代反应（SNAr），实现温和条件下的C─N键高效构建。芳香C─N键在药物分子和功能材料中广泛存在，但传统SNAr反应通常需要苛刻条件和强碱催化。研究通过光热效应在反应位点实现局部精准加热，显著降低反应能垒并提升转化率，为含氮杂环和芳胺类化合物的绿色合成提供了新路径，在药物合成和精细化工领域具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photothermal Conversion Promotes Challenging SNAr for Facile C─N Bond Formation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Nucleophilic aromatic substitution (S\n                    N\n                    Ar) is a widely used method for forming aromatic C─N bonds, which are of interest in both industry and academia. However, current approaches are often unable to access less activated electrophiles, due to negative charge buildup in the transition state, resulting in high activation energy barriers. Inspired by our work on the Newman Kwart Rearrangement (NKR), we sought to leverage photothermal conversion for challenging C─N bond‐forming S\n                    N\n                    Ar reactions. Here, we demonstrate that the incorporation of an inexpensive photothermal agent, carbon black, and irradiation with red light affords several poorly activated intermolecular substitution reactions. Application to less activated aryl halides resulted in unproductive reactivity, leading us to examine the reaction barriers. Computations revealed barriers within the range previously achieved during our photothermally mediated NKR. Electronically neutral intramolecular analogs were synthesized and underwent productive reactivity in short time frames (≤20 min), indicating that the inhomogeneous nature of photothermal heating was a challenge in terms of colocalizing reactants sufficiently close to the particle. This concept was leveraged into a sequential S\n                    N\n                    Ar, where an initial intermolecular reaction occurs which then primes the substrate for a more difficult intramolecular substitution. This approach afforded a diverse scope of fused heterocycles."},{"t":"基于双色荧光开关效应的巴甫洛夫实验启发光神经网络","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag029/8429779?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光光学神经网络","kp":["[训练框架]: 联想学习(类巴甫洛夫)训练光学神经网络","开关效应[荧光]: 双色荧光切换"],"dp":1,"as":"受巴甫洛夫经典条件反射实验启发，该研究构建了基于双色荧光信号的光神经网络系统。当前前沿光神经网络仍依赖计算密集的反向传播算法进行训练，限制了其速度优势和能效发挥。该工作利用双色荧光材料实现类联想学习机制，使光神经网络能够在无反向传播的情况下完成训练与推理，大幅降低计算开销。这一仿生光学计算架构为低功耗、高速光子智能计算系统开辟了新方向，在边缘计算和神经形态计算领域具有广阔前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Pavlov’s experiment-inspired optical neural networks based on dual-color fluorescence switching effect","b":"Cutting-edge optical neural networks are often still trained by backpropagation, which is computationally intensive and originally for conventional artificial neural networks. Inspired by Pavlov’s experiment, we drew upon the principles of biological memory to establish an associative learning framework for training optical neural networks that mimics the mechanisms of associative learning and synaptic plasticity using dual-wavelength stimuli (i.e. ultraviolet and visible light) on a dual-color photoinitiator resin. Sequential light irradiation was shown to induce fluorescence switching and encode associative memory in the resin, which can serve as a physical substrate for an optical neural network. In optical experiments, the established framework was applied to pattern recognition of the letters ‘N,’ ‘V,’ and ‘Z.’ Simulations were conducted that extended its application to the recognition of handwritten digits. Compared to the current mainstream ‘bottom-up’ optical neural network fabrication approach that requires ‘weight calculation followed by hardware implementation’, this work presents a novel ‘top-down’ in-situ training methodology that eliminates the need for weight computation. The proposed method holds significant implications for large-scale, low-cost, and rapid fabrication of optical neural networks intended for edge computing applications. This study bridges biological learning principles with optical neural networks to provide a foundation for next-generation adaptive and scalable artificial intelligence systems.","aip":1},{"t":"棕榈酸触发的 B7H3 棕榈酰化促进免疫逃逸","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68525-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Colorectal cancer responds poorly to immune checkpoint blockade in most patients with microsatellite-stable (MSS) tumors, highlighting the need for alternative targets. B7H3 (CD276) is an immune checkpoint protein that is frequently overexpressed in tumors, but how it is maintained at high protein levels is unclear. Here we show that palmitic acid (PA) promotes B7H3 palmitoylation by the palmitoyltransferase ZDHHC24 at cysteine 496. This modification prevents B7H3 from binding to sequestosome 1 (SQSTM1, also called p62), limiting autophagic degradation and stabilizing B7H3, which suppresses CD8+ T cell antitumor activity. Disrupting this pathway by mutating cysteine 496, or by deleting Zdhhc24 in a colitis-associated colorectal cancer (CAC) mouse model, enhances CD8+ T cell responses. We also develop a cell-penetrant peptide that blocks the ZDHHC24–B7H3 interaction, boosts antitumor immunity, and synergizes with blockade of programmed cell death protein 1 (PD-1). These findings identify B7H3 palmitoylation as a targetable metabolic–immune node for colorectal cancer immunotherapy."},{"t":"基于氢能设备行为的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior "},{"t":"基于分层多尺度建模的兆瓦级质子交换膜水电解模块优化设计","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020550?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解槽优化设计","kp":["规模[PEM电解水]: 兆瓦级模块","[建模]: 分层多尺度建模优化设计"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimal design of megawatt-scale proton exchange membrane water electrolysis module by hierarchical multi-scale modeling"},{"t":"基于欺骗等离子体斯格明子的深亚波长片上微波振荡器","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag028/8429801?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Exploring wave-matter interactions at extreme electromagnetic (EM) scales has long been a focal topic in multidisciplinary research, but deep-subwavelength field localization remains a persistent challenge. Here, we demonstrate an on-chip microwave oscillator with an electrical size of λ","tp":"微波振荡器","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"展示了基于欺骗等离子体斯格明子的片上微波振荡器，电尺寸仅为波长λ的深亚波长级别，突破深亚波长场局域化的持续挑战，为极端电磁尺度下的波-物质相互作用研究及片上微波器件小型化提供新平台。","aip":1},{"t":"关于泛基因组及相关术语的使用和误用","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68624-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"面向工业光伏-储能系统能耗成本与需求电费联合优化的离线逆强化学习","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储成本优化","kp":["[方法]: 离线逆强化学习","优化目标[工业PV-电池]: 能耗与需量电费联合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery"},{"t":"天然氢的技术经济性与价值评估","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000589?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然氢技术经济评价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Natural hydrogen techno-economics and valuation"},{"t":"多晶体X射线衍射（MCXRD）弥合化学与材料科学晶体学表征鸿沟","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523233?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多晶体X射线衍射","kp":["[方法]: 多晶体XRD组合部分数据集","应用[MOFs]: 小晶体/抗辐射损伤晶体学表征"],"dp":1,"as":"多晶X射线衍射（MCXRD）技术弥补了传统单晶X射线衍射在晶体学表征上的局限。单晶衍射对晶体尺寸要求严格且易受辐射损伤影响，而MCXRD通过多晶样品进行结构解析，有效解决了微小晶体和辐射敏感材料的结构测定难题。该方法在蛋白质晶体学、药物晶型分析及材料科学领域具有重要应用价值，为难以培养大尺寸单晶的复杂分子结构研究提供了新的技术路径，拓展了晶体学表征的适用边界。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multi‐Crystal X‐Ray Diffraction (MCXRD) Bridges the Crystallographic Characterisation Gap in Chemistry and Materials Sci","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Structure determination by X‐ray diffraction is limited by crystal size and can be compromised by radiation damage when using very intense X‐ray radiation. X‐ray structure determination from partial diffraction data sets combined from multiple crystals is a potential solution, but its exploitation in chemistry and materials science is largely unrealized. Here we report the use of synchrotron radiation for multi‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (MCXRD) adapted for structure determination of metal‐organic framework (MOF) materials with crystal dimensions too small for conventional single‐crystal diffraction studies. We further show that radiation‐induced chemical changes and degradation of diffraction quality can be alleviated. Our approach encompasses both rotation‐ and stationary‐MCXRD measurements for 10 to 1000s of crystals with software‐optimized combination of the multiple data sets. We report the crystal structures of six MOFs: MOF‐919(Sc/Cu), MET‐2, MIL‐88B(Cr)‐1,4‐NDC, PCN‐260(Sc), UiO‐66, and UiO‐66‐MoO\n                    4\n                    with unit cell dimensions ranging from 18−114 Å and crystal sizes from 0.5−480 µm\n                    3\n                    . This approach can address the challenges of structure determination in a regime of particle size and sample radiation sensitivity that lies between existing single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and the emerging field of electron diffraction. MCXRD can provide accurate atomic‐resolution structure determination for some of the most challenging cases in chemistry and materials science."},{"t":"单体比例控制吡啶氮富集以调控碳纳米球p带中心，用于高效锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515992?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池催化剂","kp":["[调控机制]: 单体比例控制吡啶氮富集调制p带中心","催化剂[锌空电池ORR]: 富吡啶氮碳纳米球(无金属)"],"dp":1,"as":"通过单体比例调控实现碳基催化剂中吡啶型氮的富集，进而调节p带中心位置以优化氧还原反应（ORR）催化性能。该策略通过精确控制前驱体单体配比，定向调控催化剂活性位点的电子结构，提升ORR电催化效率。低成本、高性能ORR催化剂对燃料电池和金属-空气电池的商业化至关重要，该研究为非贵金属碳基催化剂的理性设计提供了分子层面的调控新思路，有望替代昂贵的铂基催化剂。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Monomer‐Ratio Controlled Pyridinic‐N Enrichment Modulating p‐Band Centers in Carbon Nanospheres for Efficient Zinc‐Air B","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rational design of high‐performance, low‐cost oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts is critical for advancing zinc‐air batteries (ZABs). This study proposed a closed‐loop paradigm integrating first‐principles active site identification, precursor‐ratio‐controlled synthesis, and device validation to develop superior metal‐free ORR electrocatalysts. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations identify pyridinic‐N as the optimal doping configuration, exhibiting the lowest energy barrier (0.17 eV) for the rate‐determining step (RDS, *O\n                    2\n                    → *OOH). Further electronic structure analyses revealed that this enhancement originates from pyridinic‐N‐induced upward shifts in the p‐band center of adjacent carbon atoms during the RDS, establishing this shift as a universal activity descriptor. Guided by these insights, aniline(A)/pyrrole(P) co‐polymerization with precise monomer molar ratio control yielded a series of N‐doped carbon materials (A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC). A\n                    0.5\n                    P\n                    0.5\n                    ‐NC achieved the highest pyridinic‐N content (38.91%), demonstrating exceptional ORR activity that surpasses other A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC variants and the benchmark 20 wt.% Pt/C. The optimized catalyst enabled transformative ZAB performance in liquid and flexible configurations, achieving enhanced open‐circuit voltage, superior power densities, high specific capacities, and prolonged durability compared to commercial 20 wt.% Pt/C. This work establishes a catalyst development paradigm bridging mechanistic understanding, controllable synthesis, and practical application for next‐generation energy storage devices."},{"t":"面向高性能半透明有机太阳能电池的非对称窄带隙受体分子工程","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505706?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机太阳能电池","kp":["[分子设计]: 乙烯基π桥+端基卤化调控能级与形貌","应用[半透明OSC]: 兼顾近红外吸收与低电压损失"],"dp":1,"as":"通过分子工程设计不对称窄带隙受体材料，实现高性能有机太阳能电池。该研究致力于克服近红外光子 harvesting 与高开路电压损失之间的固有矛盾——即吸收更多长波光子往往导致电压下降。不对称分子结构设计可同时拓宽光谱吸收范围并抑制非辐射复合损失，从而提升光电转换效率。窄带隙受体是有机光伏器件实现叠层结构和突破效率极限的关键材料，对柔性、半透明及低成本光伏应用具有推动意义。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Asymmetric Narrow‐Gap Acceptors for High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Solar Cells and Mo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Overcoming the inherent trade‐off between near‐infrared photon harvesting and high open‐circuit voltage losses in bulk‐heterojunction blends is critical for advancing semi‐transparent organic solar cells (ST‐OSC). Herein, we present a molecular design that combines vinylene\n                    π\n                    ‐bridge incorporation and terminal‐group halogenation to tailor energy level alignment and blend morphology with PCE10 donor. These designed materials (eC9‐V‐2Cl(‐4Cl) and eC9‐DV‐2Cl) exhibit broadened NIR absorption (up to 1020 nm) and significantly reduce non‐radiative recombination voltage loss by a maximum of ∼100 mV compared to the standard PCE10:BTP‐eC9 device. The optimized PCE10:eC9‐V‐2Cl blend, processed from a green solvent in an inverted structure, achieves a remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 14.2% for opaque devices with a minimal voltage loss of ∼250 mV. Furthermore, a simply 1D double‐layered nano‐photoinc structure (LiF/MoO\n                    3\n                    ) as an optical out‐coupling layer was integrated into the ST‐OSC, delivering a PCE of 9.9% with an average visible transmittance (AVT) of 42.6%, and yielding a light utilization efficiency (LUE) of 4.3%. Scaling to 5 × 5 cm\n                    2\n                    ST‐OSC modules, an active‐area efficiency of ≈9% was reached with a remarkably high geometric fill factor of 96.5%. These findings provide new molecular design principles for high‐performance ST‐OSCs, making these devices highly attractive for sustainable and scalable applications like energy‐saving agrivoltaic systems and aesthetically transparent solar windows."},{"t":"用于快速像素内计算的记忆阻变元胞神经网络","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01555-3","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻像素内计算","kp":["[器件]: 忆阻器细胞神经网络","应用[像素内计算]: 图像视频快速并行模拟处理"],"dp":1,"as":"提出基于忆阻器的细胞神经网络（CNN）架构，实现像素内快速并行计算。细胞神经网络借鉴生物视网膜的信息处理机制，可大规模并行执行模拟计算，将感测与计算融合于像素级硬件中。忆阻器件作为突触权重存储与模拟乘加运算单元，使该架构能直接在图像传感阵列上进行信号预处理与特征提取，大幅降低数据搬运延迟与功耗。该方案为边缘端低功耗、低延迟的视觉信号处理提供了新的类脑计算路径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Memristive cellular neural networks for fast in-pixel computing","b":"Cellular neural networks, inspired in part by the biological retina, offer a potential route to massively parallel analogue computing. However, the hardware implementation of such systems remains challenging. Here we report memristor-based cellular neural networks for image and video processing applications. We develop a Python-based digital twin for network simulations and as a graphical user interface for controlling the fabricated hardware. Simulations using the digital twin illustrate the network’s capabilities in image processing and in solving partial differential equations. We build hardware through the tape-out of a transistor-based network and the fabrication of a circuit board with multilevel non-volatile memristors as the synapses. We show that the hardware can be used to run image processing tasks including edge and horizontal line detection."},{"t":"磁场引导催化效应缓解锂硫电池Li2S钝化问题","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag039/8429815?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化","kp":["[策略]: 磁场引导催化缓解Li2S钝化","关键障碍[锂硫电池]: 多硫化物穿梭+Li2S钝化"],"dp":1,"as":"锂硫（Li-S）电池因高理论能量密度被视为下一代储能技术的重要方向，但多硫化物穿梭效应和Li₂S在锂负极表面的钝化沉积严重制约其循环寿命和库仑效率。本研究提出一种磁场引导催化策略，利用外加磁场调控催化位点的活性分布，促进多硫化物的定向转化并抑制Li₂S的不可逆钝化层形成。该方法通过物理场与化学反应的耦合，加速了Li₂S的均匀沉积与可逆分解，显著改善了电池的电化学性能。该工作为解决Li-S电池核心瓶颈提供了非化学改性的全新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Magnetic field-guided catalytic effect mitigates Li2S passivation of lithium-sulfur batteries","b":"Polysulfides shuttle and Li2S passivation are considered key problems of lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, seriously hindering sulfur recycle for practical applications. However, the prevailing strategies introducing electrocatalysts focus mainly on polysulfides shuttle effect, whereas Li2S passivation involving solid conversions with high energy barriers has been seldomly studied and remains challenging. Herein, we propose that applying magnetic field (MF) to weak ferromagnetism α","aip":1},{"t":"低成本层状正极迈向实用化钠离子电池：科学挑战、解决策略与经济性分析","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钠电池层状正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 低成本层状氧化物(LOCMs)","目标[实用化]: 经济性挑战与解决策略综述"],"dp":1,"as":"钠离子电池因钠资源丰富、成本低廉被视为大规模储能领域锂离子电池的有力替代方案，但其实用化进程仍面临层状氧化物正极材料的科学挑战。本文系统综述了低成本层状正极材料的研究进展，重点分析了结构稳定性差、不可逆相变、空气敏感性、以及循环过程中Na⁺/空位有序-无序转变等关键瓶颈。文章讨论了元素掺杂、表面包覆、结构调控等改性策略，并从材料设计到工程化角度评估了钠离子电池从实验室走向商业化所需克服的材料-工艺-成本协同优化路径。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Low‐Cost Layered Cathodes Toward Practical Sodium‐Ion Batteries: Scientific Challenges, Resolution Strategies, and Econo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) are the most widely used commercial rechargeable batteries, but the stable supply of key raw materials such as lithium, nickel, and cobalt faces challenges. Sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are considered as potential alternatives and complements to LIBs due to similar working principles and the abundance of sodium resources. Layered oxide cathode materials (LOCMs) are recognized as one of the most promising practical cathodes for SIBs because of mature synthesis technology and satisfactory energy density. However, the use of nickel in LOCMs for SIBs has raised concerns about environmental pollution during nickel production and the risk of price volatility stemming from the widespread application of high‐nickel LOCMs for LIBs. Therefore, developing low‐cost nickel‐free LOCMs is crucial for enhancing the environmental friendliness and cost advantages of SIBs. For low‐cost LOCMs, this review discusses the feasibility of replacing Ni\n                    2+\n                    /Ni\n                    4+\n                    with Fe\n                    3+\n                    /Fe\n                    4+\n                    and Mn\n                    3+\n                    /Mn\n                    4+\n                    for charge compensation in SIBs, and summarizes the resulting critical scientific challenges (Fe migration, Mn dissolution, Jahn‐Teller effect, Na deficiency, and thermal instability). Economic efficiency assessment based on cost and electrochemical properties indicates that low‐cost LOCMs exhibit the highest cost‐performance ratio. Finally, to accelerate the commercialization of cost‐effective SIBs technologies, this review outlines promising development pathways of low‐cost LOCMs."},{"t":"体内长程化学信号由机械信号调节","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02463-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Biological processes are regulated by chemical and mechanical signals, yet how these signalling modalities interact remains poorly understood. Here we identify a crosstalk between tissue stiffness and long-range chemical signalling in the developing Xenopus laevis brain. Targeted knockdown of the mechanosensitive ion channel Piezo1 in retinal ganglion cells or in the brain tissue surrounding retinal ganglion cells causes pathfinding errors in vivo. In the brain parenchyma, Piezo1 downregulation decreases the expression of the diffusive long-range chemical guidance cues Semaphorin3A (Sema3A) and Slit1, which instruct turning responses in distant cells. Furthermore, Piezo1 knockdown results in tissue softening due to reduced expression of the adhesion proteins NCAM1 and N-cadherin. Targeted depletion of NCAM1 and N-cadherin similarly reduces tissue stiffness and Sema3A expression. Conversely, increasing environmental stiffness ex vivo enhances tissue-level force generation and Slit1 and Sema3A expression. Finally, in vivo stiffening of soft brain regions induces ectopic Sema3A production via a Piezo1-dependent mechanism. Overall, these findings demonstrate that tissue mechanics locally modulates the availability of diffusive, long-range chemical signals, thus influencing cell function at sites distant from the mechanical cue."},{"t":"面向无人机应用的轻质高效管式固体氧化物燃料电池设计：多物理场建模与性能优化","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600005X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"管式SOFC设计","as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Lightweight and efficient tubular SOFC design for UAV applications: multi-physics modeling and performance optimization"},{"t":"我将把我的出版物产量减半。你也应该考虑慢科学","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-025-04061-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"多模态纳米流体器件中离子种类可编程突触可塑性","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag036/8429804?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体突触器件","kp":["[突触可塑性]: 离子种类可编程调控","[离子传输]: 非线性离子传输与选择性","[关键问题]: 离子传输行为与容性/感性迟滞转变关联不明"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用纳米流体器件模拟突触可塑性功能，通过离子种类编程实现多模态神经形态计算。纳米流体器件凭借其独特的离子输运特性和纳米尺度限域效应，能够模拟生物神经系统中离子驱动的信号处理机制。研究通过调控不同离子种类（如Na+、K+、Ca2+等）在纳米通道中的输运行为，实现了突触权重的人工编程和多种可塑性模式（如LTP/LTD）的调控。该工作为仿生计算和离子电子学器件的发展提供了新思路，有望突破传统电子器件的冯·诺依曼瓶颈。","ot":"Ionic species programmable synaptic plasticity in multimodal nanofluidic devices","b":"Nanofluidic devices have been widely utilized to simulate the electronic functionalities recently, since their unique ion transport behaviors, such as nonlinear ion transport, selectivity and so on. However, the correlation of the ion transport behavior and the transition among various nanofluidic capacitive and inductive hysteresis still remains unclear, which impedes the development of nanofluidic systems. Here, we report a concentration-dependent transition between capacitive and inductive hysteresis in gold-nanoparticle-stacked nanochannels. Quantitative analysis reveals this transition is governed by the interionic distance relative to the Bjerrum length, establishing a universal mechanism for ion transport modulation. Notably, our system enables unidirectional plasticity (both facilitation and depression) by simply altering the ionic species, demonstrating programmable plasticity without structural reconfiguration. Additionally, a high-pass filter (HPF) circuit with tunable cut-off frequency is implemented through two identical nanofluidic devices. These findings establish a new paradigm for multifunctional nanofluidic devices and provide a rational foundation for the design of aqueous-phase neuromorphic computing circuits.","aip":1},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的锂离子电池超高速率放电工况下内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度感知","kp":["监测目标[锂离子电池]: 超高倍率放电内部温度"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed ne"},{"t":"现场微震活动揭示了北冰洋超慢速传播的加克尔海脊的岩石圈增生","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag034/8429788?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"以居住者为中心的建筑控制的混合强化学习：共同优化的审查和部署框架","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000449?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"主客体掺杂实现三芳基硼的室温磷光发射","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524578?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三芳基硼室温磷光","kp":["[主客体掺杂]: 三芳基硼实现室温磷光","机制修正[RTP]: 纯晶体无RTP,主客体体系有效"],"dp":1,"as":"三芳基硼烷室温磷光（RTP）研究的新进展。研究团队重新审视先前关于三芳基硼烷RTP的报道后发现，纯晶体三芳基硼烷本身并不产生室温磷光，真正实现RTP的关键在于主客体掺杂策略。通过将三芳基硼烷作为客体分子嵌入适当的主晶格中，利用刚性基质环境抑制非辐射弛豫和振动淬灭，从而激发出长寿命的磷光发射。该发现为纯有机无金属RTP材料的设计提供了新的分子平台，对开发低成本、无重金属的发光材料（如生物成像、防伪与光电器件）具有重要应用前景。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Host‐Guest Doping Enables Room Temperature Phosphorescence from Triarylboranes","b":"Abstract\n                  Revisiting our previous report of RTP in triarylboranes, we found that pure crystalline triarylboranes do not exhibit RTP as initially reported, although all but one purified compound shows RTP in annealed PMMA matrices. Inspired by the impurity responsible for the previously observed RTP, we designed a family of binary host–guest RTP systems constructed by pairing distinct triarylboranes. By tuning the host and guest structures and doping ratios, afterglow visible to the naked eye for up to 8 s can be achieved in crystalline materials under ambient conditions, at doping levels as low as one part per billion. The ultra‐long afterglow makes these materials promising for information encryption, while their high sensitivity to oxygen in non‐annealed PMMA films highlights their potential for sensing applications. Trends in the phosphorescence intensities and lifetimes, dependent on guest molecular structure, are rationalized by computed triplet‐triplet energy transfer rates between the hosts and guests, providing a concrete design strategy for optimizing host‐guest RTP. Overall, this work underscores the critical importance of material purity and advances understanding of the host‐guest interactions governing efficient organic RTP."},{"t":"通过连续官能团迁移实现未活化烯烃的同系自由基 1,3-二碳官能化","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525903?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Despite significant advances in conventional radical‐mediated 1,2‐difunctionalization of alkenes over the past decade, homologative 1,3‐difunctionalization remains largely underdeveloped. Herein, we report a novel photoinduced homologative 1,3‐dicarbofunctionalization of unactivated alkenes via one‐carbon chain elongation, achieved through sequential functional group migrations. By employing strategically designed tertiary alcohols and heteroarylsulfones as versatile coupling partners, this method affords structurally diverse, densely substituted aliphatic ketones and medium‐sized cyclic scaffolds with exclusive chemo‐ and regioselectivity. The transformation accommodates a broad range of migrating groups, including various heteroaryl, phenyl, and alkenyl motifs, and exhibits excellent functional group tolerance.","tp":"烯烃官能化","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"报道了光诱导的未活化烯烃同系1,3-二碳官能化新方法，通过连续官能团迁移实现一碳链延伸。采用叔醇和杂芳基砜作为通用底物，突破传统自由基1,2-双官能化的局限，拓展了烯烃双官能化合成策略。"},{"t":"高温钠硫固定式电池的高精度动态模型","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000668?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠硫电池建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"High-accuracy dynamic model of high-temperature sodium-sulfur stationary battery"},{"t":"异相光催化醛类烷基化胺化反应：多组分合成α-支链胺类化合物","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag020/8429807?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化胺化反应","kp":["[光催化]: 醛的烷基化胺化多组分合成","产物[α-支链胺]: 多组分合成"],"dp":1,"as":"研究探讨了非均相光催化醛类烷基化胺化反应，用于多组分合成α-支链胺类化合物。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Heterogeneous photocatalytic aldehyde alkylative amination for multicomponent synthesis of α-branched amines","b":"α"},{"t":"晶体中稳健且可重复的点缺陷模拟指南","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-025-00879-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Many physical properties of functional materials are governed by their impurities rather than their bulk characteristics. Defects in crystals can activate electronic and ionic conductivity, create active centres for catalysis or store information through localized spin configurations. Accurate modelling of defect behaviour is therefore essential for predicting material performance and optimizing functionality across a vast application space. However, defect simulations are sensitive to choices made during setup, execution and analysis. In this Perspective, we highlight best practices for calculating and reporting point defect properties through computational methods, with a focus on the widely adopted supercell approach. Key considerations include accurate representation of the structural and electronic properties of the host material, appropriate choice of charge states, sufficient optimization of defect geometries and reproducible calculation of defect formation energies. Adhering to these practices will facilitate robust comparisons between studies and improve the integration of computational predictions with experimental results. We emphasize the importance of reporting computational parameters and correction schemes. Ultimately, an open approach to point defect simulations will strengthen the impact of computational studies and accelerate materials engineering.","tp":"晶体点缺陷","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该文提出了晶体点缺陷模拟的标准化指南。功能材料的物理化学性质往往由其内部缺陷决定，缺陷能激发电离子传导、催化活性及信息存储。由于缺陷模拟对参数选择高度敏感，该研究系统总结了一套稳健且可重复的计算方法，旨在提升材料性能预测的准确性，为催化、电子器件等领域的功能材料设计与优化提供理论依据。"},{"t":"通过原子级氟掺杂实现硅晶体结构几何重构以提升高性能锂电性能","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504961?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氟掺杂硅负极","kp":["[几何重构]: 氟原子级掺杂重构硅晶体结构","负极[锂离子电池]: 氟掺杂硅基高性能"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种通过原子级氟元素对硅晶体结构进行几何重塑的新策略，旨在提升锂离子电池（LIBs）的负极性能。硅作为高理论比容量负极材料，长期受限于充放电过程中体积膨胀导致的结构破坏。研究者利用氟原子在晶格层面的精准调控，改变硅的晶体几何构型，从而缓冲锂化/脱锂过程中的机械应力，提升循环稳定性和可逆容量。该工作为可持续电气化背景下高能储电池的工程化提供了新的材料设计思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Geometric Remodeling of Silicon Crystal Structure Through Atomic‐Level Fluorine Incorporation for High‐Performance Lithi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Sustainable electrification continues to drive growing interest in high‐performance lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), which are essential energy storage systems for this transition. However, conventional graphite‐based LIBs cannot meet the stringent requirements of next‐generation applications, necessitating advanced alternatives. Herein, we report the design of fluorine‐incorporated silicon (FIS) nanostructures through a novel solid–vapor–solid synthesis method that integrates metallothermic reduction with combined top‐down and bottom‐up processes. Crucially, fluorine (F) atoms are inherently positioned both at interstitial sites within the silicon (Si) lattice and on the particle surface. Interstitial F modifies the direct‐allowed band structure of Si and expands lithium penetration pathways, thereby enhancing charge transport through improved electronic conductivity and ion migration. Meanwhile, surface‐bound F induces superhydrophobicity, enabling hydrofluoric acid‐free processing during both synthesis and electrode fabrication. Comprehensively, unveiled features of FIS offer a cost‐effective manufacturing, improved structural and electrochemical stability, and superior performance, leading to cycle‐stable, fast‐charging Si anodes for advanced LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"忘掉形式主义：数学是建立在内讧和情绪动荡之上的","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00187-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"浮动科学站：我在研究船上照顾浮标的一个月","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00189-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"利用两亲性可交联单体探索高效柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池的可规模化路线","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE07050C","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性钙钛矿电池","kp":["[可扩展策略]: 两亲性可交联单体解决大面积成膜不均","器件[柔性钙钛矿电池]: 大面积无针孔薄膜"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究探索了一条可规模化制备高效柔性钙钛矿太阳能电池（f-PSCs）的工艺路线。柔性钙钛矿电池因其轻质、可弯折、低成本等优势，被视为传统硅电池在便携式和可穿戴场景中的重要补充。研究聚焦于放大制备中的关键技术瓶颈——大面积薄膜均匀性与缺陷控制，通过优化放大沉积工艺（Amp相关方法），在保持较高光电转换效率的同时实现了器件面积的有效扩展。该工作对推动钙钛矿光伏从实验室走向卷对卷量产具有工程参考价值。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Exploring a Scalable Route for Efficient Flexible Perovskite Solar Cells via Amphiphilic Cross-linkable Monomer","b":"Flexible perovskite solar cells (f-PSCs) hold great promise for complementing traditional silicon solar cells in portable power applications, but their commercialization depends on the ability to scale-up solution-based deposition. So far, inhomogeneous perovskite deposition on self-assembled molecules (SAMs) poses a substantial challenge in fabricating uniform, pinhole-free films over large areas. Here, we developed an amphiphilic cross-linkable monomer (TBA) that simultaneously promotes perovskite growth on flexible substrates and ensures homogeneous deposition during scaling-up. The incorporation of TBA increase the wettability and adhesion of the perovskite ink to the underlying hydrophobic SAMs layer, enabling high-quality, uniform perovskite films on both rigid and flexible substrates, demonstrating its potential for scalable fabrication. As a result, the modified PSCs achieved remarkable power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 27.12% (certified 26.41%, rigid) and 24.95% (flexible), with excellent mechanical and operational stability. The TBA-modified f-PSCs retained over 90% of their initial PCE after 10,000 bending cycles and 1,000 hours of continuous operation. Additionally, large-area perovskite solar modules (PSMs) demonstrated notable PCEs of 23.10% (rigid) and 20.38% (flexible), showcasing the scalability of this approach. This strategy paves a new way for the industrial-scale development of high-performance f-PSCs."},{"t":"乙醇与汽油：传统政策和缓慢的采用","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005166?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"燃料乙醇论","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"情景事件可以灵活地编码为集成和分离的神经表征","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68473-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Remembering everyday events involves noticing what different experiences share and preserving the details that set them apart, yet the neural processes supporting this balance remain unclear. Here, we record EEG while participants view naturalistic movie scenes that introduce episodic events with overlapping elements. Using time-resolved representational similarity analysis, we find that these events evoke both similarities and dissimilarities in neural patterns as new information unfolds. Similarities predict successful inference of information across separate episodes, consistent with integrative encoding. Dissimilarities, by contrast, predict accurate memory for individual events, indicating the formation of distinct event-specific traces. Together, these findings indicate that the brain encodes both integrated and separated neural representations to flexibly support different mnemonic goals and to balance relational inference with detailed recollection."},{"t":"基于深度强化学习的天气感知安全约束增强电网韧性方法","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000152?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网韧性强化学习","as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Enhancing power grid resilience through weather-aware security constraints: A deep reinforcement learning approach with "},{"t":"通过高浓度电解液优先分解获得稳定SEI层并抑制铝集流体腐蚀","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504436?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池SEI稳定化","kp":["[策略]: 高浓度LiTFSI优先分解","问题[锂离子电池]: LiTFSI腐蚀铝集流体","产物[SEI]: 富无机稳定层"],"dp":1,"as":"锂离子电池电解液中，双三氟甲磺酰亚胺锂（LiTFSI）等新型锂盐虽具高溶解度和宽电化学窗口，但易引发铝集流体腐蚀和界面不稳定等问题。本研究提出一种调控策略，通过在电解液中引入特定添加剂或优化溶剂体系，原位构建稳定的固体电解质界面（SEI）层，同时有效抑制铝箔腐蚀。该方案兼顾了界面化学稳定性与集流体防腐保护，有望提升高镍正极、高压体系等下一代锂电池的循环寿命和安全性能。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Deriving Stable SEI Layer and Preventing Aluminum Current Collector Corrosion via Preferential Decomposition of Concentr","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Among promising lithium salts for electrolyte in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide (LiTFSI) forms a more stable inorganic‐rich SEI layer. However, its implementation is limited by severe aluminum current collector corrosion. Since lithium hexafluorophosphate (LiPF\n                    6\n                    ) contributes a stable passivation layer for aluminum, a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte offers reduced corrosion. However, its corrosion inhibition capability is not complete. Herein, we propose a SEI‐stabilizing and corrosion‐preventing layer (SCL) that realizes spatial separation of salts, which confines concentrated LiTFSI within a polyethylene glycol dimethacrylate (PEGDMA) network at the anode‐LiPF\n                    6\n                    electrolyte interface. The locally high concentration of LiTFSI in SCL induces a kinetic preference that overrides the thermodynamic preference of LiPF\n                    6\n                    , which enables targeted decomposition of LiTFSI to form a robust SEI layer, while using only a small amount of LiTFSI. Furthermore, SCL demonstrates excellent corrosion‐inhibiting behavior compared to a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte. Consequently, SCL enables stable cycling of high‐loading (21.4 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) practical NCM811/graphite full cells with 93.57% capacity retention after 100 cycles at a high current density of 2.2 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This strategy enables selective electrochemical reactions through spatial confinement to enhance LIB performance, while suppressing side reactions and reducing costs, providing a scalable approach for next‐generation electrolyte design.","aip":1},{"t":"共价有机框架及其复合材料作为光催化剂用于可持续CO2还原","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515840?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"COF光催化CO2还原","kp":["[光催化]: 共价有机框架及复合材料","应用[CO2还原]: 碳中性燃料与化学品"],"dp":1,"as":"共价有机框架（COF）因其可设计的孔道结构、高比表面积和可调光电性质，被视为极具潜力的光催化CO₂还原材料。本综述系统梳理了纯COF及其复合材料（如COF/半导体异质结、COF/金属单原子、COF/导电聚合物等）在光驱动CO₂还原反应中的最新进展，涵盖分子设计策略、能带工程、活性位点构筑、电荷分离与传输优化等关键维度。文章还讨论了产物选择性调控、量子效率提升以及规模化制备面临的挑战，展望了COF光催化体系在碳中和背景下实现太阳能到化学能高效转化的路径。","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Covalent Organic Framework and Composite as Photocatalysts Toward Sustainable CO2 Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The intensifying climate emergency compels a rapid paradigm shift from fossil fuel‐based energy systems toward sustainable, carbon‐neutral alternatives. Among emerging strategies, the photocatalytic valorization of CO\n                    2\n                    into energy‐dense fuels and commodity chemicals by suitable photocatalysts presents a straightforward and economically viable solution for both greenhouse gas mitigation and renewable energy storage. In this context, covalent organic frameworks (COFs) have emerged as a highly promising class of crystalline, porous semiconductor photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction reactions (CO\n                    2\n                    RR), owing to their structural regularity, modularity, and optoelectronic tunability. In this review, we comprehensively outline the recent progress in three distinct categories of COF‐based photocatalytic systems: metal‐free COFs, single‐metal‐atom based COFs, and COF‐based composites. Key strategies such as the judicious incorporation of donor–acceptor architectures, rational post‐synthetic functionalization, and heterojunction engineering are discussed. Insights from in situ operando characterization and theoretical calculations are also presented to highlight the roles of exciton dynamics, charge separation, active site engineering, and structure–function relationship in CO\n                    2\n                    RR. Finally, we propose future research directions for better utilization of COFs in solar fuel/chemical generation. Overall, this review aims to provide a comprehensive discussion on the advancement of COF‐based photocatalysts and next‐generation CO\n                    2\n                    valorization materials."},{"t":"定速-变速抽水蓄能混合系统协调频率调控：自适应控制框架研究","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000279?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抽水蓄能调频","as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Coordinated frequency regulation of fixed-variable speed pumped storage hybrid systems: an adaptive control framework in"},{"t":"混合移动电源协调调度用于配电网恢复：一种动态梯度掩码嵌入方法","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking emb"},{"t":"连续流手性微环境模块化反应器增强去甲肾上腺素的生物催化合成","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202514462?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多酶级联催化合成","kp":["[反应器设计]: 手性微环境连续流模块化反应器","[合成方法]: 多酶级联催化合成去甲肾上腺素","[核心模块]: 手性催化反应器+功能模块"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种连续流模块化微反应器，通过构建手性微环境来增强多酶级联催化效率。手性是药物分子设计的核心要素，多酶级联催化可提供高立体选择性的合成路径。研究采用连续流微通道反应器平台，将多个酶催化剂按级联顺序集成于手性微环境中，实现对反应中间体的精确空间控制和立体选择性的协同增强。该策略在制药合成领域具有重要意义，可提高手性药物中间体的产率和对映选择性，同时降低批次反应的不确定性，代表绿色制药工艺的前沿方向。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Continuous‐Flow Modular Reactor with a Chiral Microenvironment Enhances the Biocatalytic Synthesis of Norepinephrine","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Chirality lies at the core of pharmaceutical molecular design. Multi‐enzyme cascade catalysis offers high stereoselectivity for constructing such molecules. Here, we present a continuous‐flow modular reactor engineered with a chiral microenvironment for the biocatalytic synthesis of norepinephrine. This system incorporates two functional modules: a chiral catalytic reactor, designed to enhance the\n                    \n                      C\n                      β\n                    \n                    stereoselectivity of L‐threonine aldolase (L‐TA), and a decarboxylation reactor to balance catalytic rates. Modifying the microenvironment surrounding L‐TA significantly enhanced its stereoselectivity, with 4.1 times increased the\n                    de\n                    value (from 18.4% to 75.01%). Seen from molecular dynamics simulations, these modifications reshaped the spatial conformation of the enzyme's active site. Moreover, at an optimal column height ratio of 3:5 between the chiral and decarboxylation modules, norepinephrine yield reached 3.07 g/L. This modular reactor strategy, enhanced by a tailored chiral microenvironment, offers substantial promise for the stereoselective synthesis of pharmaceutical intermediates."},{"t":"自下而上相转换接力策略构建双层一体化多孔膜用于液流电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506085?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液流电池多孔膜","kp":["[制备策略]: 自下而上相转化接力法","结构[液流电池膜]: 双皮层多孔(中间大孔层)"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究首次提出自下而上的分相诱导策略，用于构建一体化双层皮多孔膜结构。该膜包含大孔支撑层和致密皮层，通过相分离过程中的分步调控实现两层结构的协同一体化成型。与传统自上而下涂层方法相比，该策略避免了层间界面缺陷和剥离问题，可精确控制膜各层的孔径分布和厚度。双层皮多孔膜在纳滤、气体分离和废水处理等分离领域具有应用潜力，其一体化结构设计有望显著提升膜的分离选择性和长期运行稳定性，属于先进膜材料制备工艺的创新方向。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Constructing Integrated Dual‐Skin‐Layer Porous Membranes via a Bottom‐Up Phase Inversion Relay Strategy for Flow Batteri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A bottom‐up relay strategy is first proposed to fabricate integrated dual‐skin‐layer porous membranes (macropore layer between bilateral skin layers) by ingeniously introducing a non‐solvent carrier. Benefiting from the phase inversion relay process, bilateral skin layers can be tailored freely, where ethylene glycol in the non‐solvent carrier effectively regulates the structure of the bottom skin layer by adjusting the ratio of free water to bound water. Thus, a dual‐skin‐layer membrane is designed and applied in a vanadium flow battery (VFB), that features symmetric skin layers (∼600 nm) with sub‐nanometer (∼4.5 Å) pores. The symmetric structure reduces the pressure required for proton migration via the Vehicle mechanism, and the sub‐nanometer pores effectively separate vanadium ions from protons by size exclusion, breaking the trade‐off in traditional membranes. Moreover, the bilateral skin layers protect the macropore layer against the vanadium fouling and mechanical damage. Furthermore, the formation mechanism and ion transport dynamics of the dual‐skin‐layer membrane are analyzed by molecular dynamics and multi‐physical field simulation. As a result, the optimized membrane enables stable VFB operation for over 6000 cycles at 200 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    with energy efficiency of ∼83.6%. This work provides an effective approach to prepare integrated symmetric membranes with bilateral skin layers."},{"t":"AI辅助化学合成中的集体智能","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10131-4","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI辅助化学合成","kp":["[AI辅助合成]: 大语言模型+集体智能实现可靠化学反应转化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出利用集体智能辅助化学合成的框架。科学文献呈指数级增长，跨学科研究者面临信息过载的严峻挑战。研究整合AI驱动的文献挖掘、反应预测和知识图谱技术，从海量已发表文献中自动提取化学反应规则、条件优化数据和底物适用范围，构建可协作更新的化学合成知识库。通过集体智能模式汇聚全球化学家的隐性经验和实验数据，AI系统可为新分子合成路径设计提供数据驱动的智能建议。该方向有望显著加速药物研发和新材料发现流程。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Collective intelligence for AI-assisted chemical synthesis","b":"The exponential growth of scientific literature presents an increasingly acute challenge across disciplines. Hundreds of thousands of new chemical reactions are reported annually, yet translating them into actionable experiments becomes an obstacle1,2. Recent applications of large language models (LLMs) have shown promise3,4,5,6, but systems that reliably work for diverse transformations across de novo compounds have remained elusive. Here we introduce MOSAIC (Multiple Optimized Specialists for AI-assisted Chemical Prediction), a computational framework that enables chemists to harness the collective knowledge of millions of reaction protocols. MOSAIC is built upon the Llama-3.1-8B-instruct architecture7, training 2,498 specialized chemical experts within Voronoi-clustered spaces. This approach delivers reproducible and executable experimental protocols with confidence metrics for complex syntheses. With an overall 71% success rate, experimental validation demonstrates the realizations of over 35 novel compounds, spanning pharmaceuticals, materials, agrochemicals, and cosmetics. Notably, MOSAIC also enables the discovery of new reaction methodologies that are absent from the expert’s training, a cornerstone for advancing chemical synthesis. This scalable paradigm of partitioning vast domains into searchable expert regions enables a generalizable strategy for AI-assisted discovery wherever accelerating information growth outpaces efficient knowledge access and application."},{"t":"细胞粘度影响肿瘤细胞的血行播散和转移外渗","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02462-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Metastases arise from a multistep process during which tumour cells face several microenvironmental mechanical challenges, which influence metastatic success. However, how circulating tumour cells (CTCs) adapt their mechanics to such microenvironments is not fully understood. Here we report that the deformability of CTCs affects their haematogenous dissemination and identify mechanical phenotypes that favour metastatic extravasation. Combining intravital microscopy with CTC-mimicking elastic beads, mechanical tuning in tumour lines and profiling of tumour-patient-derived cells, we demonstrate that the inherent mechanical properties of circulating objects dictate their ability to enter constraining vessels. We identify cellular viscosity as a rheostat of CTC circulation and arrest, and show that cellular viscosity is crucial for efficient extravasation. Moreover, we find that mechanical properties that favour extravasation and subsequent metastatic outgrowth can be opposite. Altogether, our results establish CTC viscosity as a key biomechanical parameter that shapes several steps of metastasis."},{"t":"“有毒的男性气质”可以测量吗？科学家试图量化有争议的术语","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00144-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"双NHC-二芳基乙烯钯配合物：动态行为与自调谐光控开关","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522849?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯配合物光开关","kp":["[光致变色]: 双NHC-二芳基乙烯钯配合物","特性[光开关]: 自调节光开关(逐步光环化)"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一类基于双NHC-二芳基乙烯配体的钯配合物，展现出动态行为与自调谐光响应特性。光作为一种高精度调控手段，可精确控制该金属配合物的构型与催化活性。二芳基乙烯作为光致变色单元，在紫外/可见光切换下实现开环-闭环异构化，进而调控钯中心的电子性质与配位环境。该体系为设计智能光控催化剂、动态材料及响应性金属有机体系提供了新策略，在精准合成与功能材料领域具有潜在应用价值。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bis‐NHC‐Diarylethene Palladium Complexes: Dynamic Behavior and Self‐Tuning Photoswitching","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Light offers a unique means of controlling matter with high precision, yet the development of robust photoresponsive transition‐metal complexes remains a challenge. Here we report a self‐tuning photochromic system based on a diarylethene‐derived bis‐NHC‐palladium complex. The trans‐anti complex (\n                    \n                      1\n                      oo\n                    \n                    ) undergoes efficient stepwise photocyclization as well as unprecedented light‐induced trans/cis isomerization at the metal center. Isolation and crystallographic characterization of the cis‐anti isomer (\n                    \n                      2\n                      oo\n                    \n                    ) reveal a thermodynamically more stable structure with enhanced photochromic performance and reversible multistate switching. Thermal studies uncover interconversion with additional rotamer, establishing a dynamic equilibrium among several photoactive palladium species. Spectroscopic and computational investigations elucidate the electronic transitions that drive both diarylethene cyclization and Pd─NHC geometric rearrangements. We demonstrate that the catalytic activity in the Suzuki‐Miyaura coupling reaction can be reversibly switched by light, with the photocyclized catalyst forms showing negligible catalytic activity, while the open forms achieve high efficiency. This establishes a direct link between photoisomerization and predicted catalytic performance. Pre‐catalyst evolution demonstrates that the geometry of the complex controls the balance between nanoparticle‐mediated and homogeneous reactivity, delineating a novel strategy for adaptive catalysis."},{"t":"带隙工程Fe尖晶石电催化剂实现一体化海水直接电解","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521993?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"海水电解催化剂","kp":["[催化剂]: 能带破缺Zn-O-Fe-O-Co异原子键(尖晶石)","应用[海水/废水]: 集成海水分解+废水净化"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种具有带隙破缺(bandgap-broken)特征的铁基尖晶石电催化剂，用于集成海水直接电解制氢。尖晶石催化剂在电催化领域备受关注，但其不同氧化态的氧化还原活性难以兼顾。该工作通过能带工程策略打破传统带隙限制，使铁活性位点同时具备高效的析氢(HER)和析氧(OER)反应能力，并有效抑制海水中的氯离子腐蚀与竞争反应。该催化剂在天然海水环境中实现了稳定运行，为大规模海水电解制氢提供了低成本、高耐久性的解决方案。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Bandgap‐Broken Fe Spinel Electrocatalyst Enables Integrated Seawater Electrolysis","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Despite considerable attention on spinel catalysts in electrocatalysis, achieving their distinct redox activity at the atomic scale for cathodic seawater splitting and anodic wastewater purification represents a huge challenge. In this work, we address this issue by constructing bandgap‐broken Zn─O─Fe─O─Co heteroatomic bonds through the integration of reduced ZnFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and oxidized CoFe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    semiconductors within spinel‐structured Zn\n                    x\n                    Co\n                    1‐x\n                    Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    . The overlapping conduction and valence bands at Fe 3\n                    d\n                    orbitals promote electron redistribution at Fe centers, leading to electron depletion, exposure of empty\n                    d\n                    orbitals, and modulation of the d‐band center. These electronic modifications enhance the adsorption kinetics of H\n                    2\n                    O in seawater and S\n                    2−\n                    species in wastewater through\n                    d–p\n                    orbital coupling, lowering the energy barriers for the Volmer step in hydrogen evolution reaction and the rate‐limiting *S─*S\n                    2\n                    process in sulfur oxidation reaction. As a result, the rational design enables efficient bifunctional activity, achieving simultaneous seawater splitting and industrial pollutant degradation in a single electrolyzer at an ultralow cell voltage of 1.07 V (10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ), operable under solar energy. This study provides a fundamental design strategy for bifunctional catalysts toward integrated energy and environmental applications.","aip":1},{"t":"作者更正：EPFL2和生长素之间的相互抑制延长了周期性叶形态发生的间隔","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68518-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：海洋磷和大气氧在大氧化事件期间耦合","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68615-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：自噬缺陷的巨噬细胞加剧顺铂诱导的线粒体功能障碍和肾注射","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68421-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：用于加速无机材料合成的自主实验室","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-09992-y","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自主材料合成实验室","as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Author Correction: An autonomous laboratory for the accelerated synthesis of inorganic materials"},{"t":"钙钛矿光伏材料中非谐晶格动力学与热膨胀的原子尺度起源","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01938-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿晶格动力学","kp":["[机理]: 非谐晶格动力学致极端热膨胀","问题[钙钛矿光伏]: 与器件层热失配,日夜循环累积应力"],"dp":1,"as":"金属卤化物钙钛矿正迅速成为领先的光伏材料，但其非谐晶格动力学行为与传统半导体存在显著差异。该研究从原子尺度揭示钙钛矿晶体中原子振动的非谐性如何引发晶格热膨胀，阐明离子迁移、结构柔性与光电性能之间的深层耦合机制，为设计更稳定的钙钛矿光伏器件提供理论指导。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomistic origins of anharmonic lattice dynamics and thermal expansion in perovskite photovoltaics","b":"Metal halide perovskites are swiftly becoming a leading class of photovoltaic materials, yet unlike conventional semiconductors, they exhibit highly anharmonic lattice vibrations that produce extreme rates of thermal expansion and substantial mismatch with other device layers. These effects are exacerbated under natural day/night cycling, where repeated heating and cooling drive cumulative stress, defect generation and accelerated degradation. Here we connect the atomistic origins of anharmonic lattice dynamics in perovskites with their macroscopic thermo-mechanical properties, from phonon–phonon interactions and local disorder to complex thermal–phase relations. We assess how both the degree of anharmonicity and thermal expansion rates vary across temperature, composition and phase, and highlight the emergence of anisotropic and even negative thermal expansion in low-symmetry perovskite phases. By linking fundamental physics to device-level challenges, we provide a framework for engineering durable perovskite absorbers and outline promising approaches to regulate thermal strain in the pursuit of long-lived, commercially viable solar cell technologies."},{"t":"无定形、初生态还是介孔化沸石？中间合成相综述：定义、表征与机理分析","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523144?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沸石中间相","kp":["[主题]: 沸石中间合成相(非晶/胚态/介孔化)","观点[催化]: 中间相被忽视,具应用价值"],"dp":1,"as":"本文系统综述分子筛催化剂合成过程中介于完全无定形与高度结晶态之间的中间态结构，涵盖无定形、初生态和介孔化分子筛三种形态。传统认知将分子筛催化性能归因于高热稳定性和严格择形选择性，本文聚焦合成中间态对最终催化剂孔道结构、活性位点分布及催化行为的影响，为精准调控分子筛催化剂设计提供框架。","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Amorphous, Embryonic or Mesoporized Zeolites? An Overview of Intermediate Synthetic Phases: Definitions, Characterizatio","b":"Abstract\n                  The success of zeolites as catalysts has long been attributed to their high thermal stability and strict shape selectivity flowing from their network of well‐defined channels and cages. Synthetic efforts often unjustly disregarded (partially) amorphous intermediate synthetic phases (ISPs), including embryonic zeolite, interzeolite conversion intermediates and mesoporized zeolites, as “failed” and excluded them from further characterization efforts. Recently, this perception has changed and better characterization techniques have led to a deeper understanding of the structure and catalytic potential these materials (may) hold. In this work, we will give a brief overview of the state of the art research being conducted in synthesis, characterization and exploitation of ISPs, as well as clarifying some definitions, hoping to set the stage for future generations of zeolite scientists."},{"t":"α氧——量子化学视角下的独特催化氧化活性位点","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS00496A","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石α氧活性位","kp":["[活性位]: α-O(Fe(IV)O/Fe(III)-O·)稳定于沸石","反应能力[甲烷]: 室温氧化甲烷为甲醇"],"dp":1,"as":"α氧（α-O，Fe(IV)O或Fe(III)-O自由基）是一种稳定存在于分子筛基质中的活性氧物种，展现出独特的氧化反应性。本文从量子化学计算视角深入分析α氧的电子结构、自旋态及反应路径，揭示其在选择性氧化催化中的独特活性来源。该研究为理解仿生铁基氧化催化剂机理及设计高效氧化反应体系提供了理论依据。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Alpha oxygen – a unique oxidation active site from a quantum chemical viewpoint","b":"The alpha oxygen (also α-O, Fe(IV)O, and Fe(III)–O−˙) stabilized in zeolite matrices exhibits a unique reactivity. It is, for example, able to oxidize methane to methanol at room temperature. Such a high oxidation activity makes the alpha oxygen an extremely attractive species from the point of view of oxidation catalysis. The alpha oxygen can be prepared by splitting either N2O or O2 also at low temperatures over different transition metal cations stabilized in extra-framework cationic sites of zeolites in the form of either isolated cations or two cooperating cations forming distant binuclear cationic sites. The alpha oxygen was primarily defined by its reactivity, and up to now, experimental data concerning its structure are rather scarce. Quantum chemical calculations are used to interpret experimental data and thus yield significantly deeper insights into the preparation, structure, and reactivity of this otherwise omitted active species with enormous potential for applications. This review represents the first collection and systematic interpretation of experimental data and quantum chemical calculations to provide a complex description of the alpha oxygen and its structure, reactivity, and properties."},{"t":"面向气体分离的刚性孔道分隔金属有机框架脂肪族配体设计原则","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521262?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF气体分离","kp":["[设计概念]: 扩展生物等排取代(eBIS)","应用[MOFs气体分离]: 脂肪族配体刚性化孔空间分割"],"dp":1,"as":"金属有机框架（MOFs）材料设计中，脂肪族配体常因构象柔性被忽视，研究提出针对刚性孔道分隔型MOFs的脂肪族配体设计原则，揭示其通过精确调控连接子几何构型可获得稳定的刚性骨架结构。该工作为利用低成本柔性配体构建高稳定性框架材料提供了系统性理论指导，有望拓展MOFs在气体分离、存储等领域的应用空间。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Aliphatic Ligand Design Principles for Rigid Pore‐Space‐Partitioned Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Gas Separation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Aliphatic ligands are often sidelined in the design of framework materials because their conformational flexibility can contribute to problems such as difficult crystallization, low porosity, and stability. Attempts to boost porosity by ligand elongation usually worsen these problems. Here we propose an expanded bioisosteric replacement (eBIS) concept capable of both scaling up and rigidifying aliphatic ligands. We demonstrate one example realized via linking two cyclohexyl rings in series, which restricts ligand flexibility through intramolecular non‐covalent interactions providing an alternative to the π‐conjugation‐based rigidity. The resulting ligand displays consistent rigidity across multiple MOF platforms. On the\n                    pacs\n                    platform, it can realize extreme pore geometry with the highest hexagonal\n                    c\n                    /\n                    a\n                    ratio and new metal‐cluster chemistry such as the first synthesis of nickel‐titanium oxocluster. It can boost the BET surface area to as high as 2810 m\n                    2\n                     g\n                    −1\n                    , likely the highest among aliphatic‐dicarboxylate MOFs. Furthermore, it leads to possibly largest C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    uptake differences (88 cm\n                    3\n                     g\n                    −1\n                    , uptake ratio of 1.83, 273 K) among rigid MOFs, a desired property for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    ‐selective separation, which is confirmed by breakthrough experiments. The remarkably low adsorption enthalpies for C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    6\n                    (14.7 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    ) and C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    (15.1 kJ mol\n                    −1\n                    ) enables low‐energy adsorbent regeneration benefitting practical separation."},{"t":"基于双类型模型集成与在线误差修正的光伏发电自适应预测","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000498?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[光伏功率预测]: 双类型模型集成与在线误差校正"],"ot":"Adaptive forecasting of photovoltaic power based on dual-type models’ ensemble and online error correction"},{"t":"通过氧空位调控加速Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7正极电化学动力学以实现宽温域运行","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525531?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池磷酸盐正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)","[策略]: 氧空位调控加速电化学动力学","特点[实用电池]: 宽温安时级"],"dp":1,"as":"钠离子电池正极材料Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7（NFPP）因资源丰富和安全性受关注，但受限于电化学反应动力学缓慢。研究通过氧空位工程加速电化学动力学，显著提升NFPP正极的倍率性能和循环稳定性，为开发低成本高性能钠离子电池正极材料提供了有效策略。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Accelerating Electrochemical Kinetics in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 Cathodes Through Oxygen Vacancy Modulation for Wide‐Temperatur","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP) stands as a highly promising cathode material for sodium‐ion batteries, offering a favorable combination of operating voltage and theoretical capacity. Nevertheless, its commercial viability is significantly hindered by two primary factors: the prevalent formation of electrochemically inert impurity phases, such as\n                    maricite\n                    ‐NaFePO\n                    4\n                    and low‐energy‐density Na\n                    2\n                    FeP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    , during conventional synthesis, coupled with its intrinsically poor electronic conductivity. Herein, we demonstrate a rational defect‐engineering strategy to enhance the electrochemical kinetics of NFPP cathodes through controlled oxygen vacancy formation. The optimized Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    2.79\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP‐2.79) exhibits superior phase purity, enhanced electronic conductivity, and facilitated Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion, as confirmed by multi‐scale characterization techniques. The NFPP‐2.79 cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 89.51 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10C and retains 96.42% capacity after 1500 cycles at 2C. Moreover, kilogram‐scale synthesis using cost‐effective raw precursors has been achieved via a sand‐milling‐assisted spray‐drying route. When assembled into Ah‐level pouch cells with hard carbon anodes, the NFPP‐2.79‐based cell demonstrates excellent rate capability (93.75% capacity retention from 0.5C to 4C), outstanding cyclability (75.63% retention after 3000 cycles), and superior safety under extreme conditions (overheating, crushing, nail penetration, overcharge, and external short‐circuit). This work highlights oxygen vacancy modulation as an effective pathway for advancing polyanionic cathodes toward practical applications."},{"t":"相关性不确定条件下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"社区多能系统","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated unce"},{"t":"利用高效离子液体柔性混合能源热泵实现可持续太阳能制冷","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000243?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子液体热泵","as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A flexible hybrid-energy heat pump using efficient ionic liquids for sustainable solar cooling"},{"t":"控制键断裂和前药激活的非共价点击释放策略","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515594?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Click‐to‐release chemistry enables bioorthogonal bond cleavage and controlled release via a click‐type ligation reaction serving as both the trigger and means of localization. Extending this concept beyond covalent ligation reactions, we introduce a noncovalent click‐to‐release strategy based on cucurbit[7]uril‐adamantane (CB‐Ad) association. The CB host molecule forms a pre‐assembled host‐guest complex with a self‐immolative guest (SIG) SIG1, where the masked SIG remains inert. Introduction of a high‐affinity guest Ad initiates the CB‐Ad noncovalent click reaction, displacing SIG1 and triggering its self‐immolation and cargo release. As a proof‐of‐concept, we used a prototype prodrug SIG2 to demonstrate our strategy's potential for controlled therapeutic release, effectively regulating the photodynamic cell killing in vitro. This noncovalent click‐to‐release approach broadens the structural and functional scope of bioorthogonal cleavage strategies with promising implications for stimuli‐responsive materials and biomedical applications."},{"t":"锂金属电池中的异相电荷转移机制：通过Marcus理论揭示异常亲锂性","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c12858","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池界面","kp":["[理论]: Marcus-Hush-Chidsey理论","[发现]: Li沉积动力学反常依赖亲锂性"],"sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究利用Marcus电子转移理论揭示了锂金属电池中异质电荷转移机制，阐明了锂金属负极表面'异常亲锂性'（abnormal lithiophilicity）的物理本质。锂金属电池具有高能量密度，但锂的不均匀电沉积和枝晶生长导致库伦效率低和安全隐患。研究发现，传统基于表面能的亲锂性判断标准存在局限，某些看似疏锂的表面实际表现出优异的锂沉积行为。通过Marcus理论分析电荷转移动力学，研究重新定义了亲锂性判据，为理性设计稳定锂金属负极界面层和集流体涂层提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] The Heterogeneous Charge Transfer Mechanism in Lithium Metal Batteries: Revealing Abnormal Lithiophilicity through the Marcus Theory","b":"Li metal batteries offer a high energy density but suffer from nonuniform Li metal electroplating and dendrite formation, limiting practical use. These issues arise from complex interfacial charge transfer kinetics, which are still ambiguously defined. Here, we reveal an abnormal dependence of Li electrodeposition kinetics on substrate lithiophilicity, rationalized by the Marcus-Hush-Chidsey (MHC) theory. Contrary to conventional expectations, lithiophobic Cu enables faster electron transfer and more stable Li electroplating at high overpotentials, whereas lithiophilic Au performs better at low overpotentials. This crossover behavior establishes a current density-dependent framework that redefines the classical understanding of lithiophilicity. Electrochemical characterizations, MHC-based modeling, and crystal orbital Hamilton population analysis attribute the phenomenon to an interplay between reorganization energy and electronic coupling strength. The findings, validated across various substrates and electrolytes, provide general mechanistic insights into heterogeneous charge transfer during Li electroplating and suggest new strategies for interface design in anodeless Li metal batteries."},{"t":"[ASAP] 镧诱导准共价键合与化学势桥接的Pt3Co金属间催化剂实现耐久燃料电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16692","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂钴ORR催化剂","kp":["催化剂[ORR]: La掺杂L12-Pt3Co金属间化合物","[稳定化]: La诱导准共价键与化学势桥联"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究在Pt3Co金属间化合物催化剂中引入镧（La）元素，通过La诱导的准共价键合和化学势桥接效应，显著提升了燃料电池氧还原反应（ORR）催化剂的耐久性。铂基金属间化合物是目前最有前景的ORR催化剂，但长期运行中Co等过渡金属的溶解导致催化活性衰减。La的引入调控了Pt-Co原子间的电子结构，增强了合金的结构稳定性并抑制活性组分的溶出，从而在保持高催化活性的同时大幅延长催化剂寿命。该策略为质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC）的大规模商业化提供了关键材料突破。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Lanthanum-Induced Quasi-Covalent Bonding and Chemical Potential Bridging in Pt3Co Intermetallic Catalysts for Durable Fuel Cells","b":"Pt-based intermetallic compounds represent the most promising catalysts for oxygen reduction reaction (ORR). However, they still face stability challenges, primarily due to component segregation and oxidation/dissolution of both transition metal and Pt atoms under harsh electrochemical conditions. Herein, we strategically incorporate electron-donating La into the L12-Pt3Co intermetallic catalyst to steer a quasi-covalent Pt-M interaction and bridge the core-shell chemical potential gradient, enhancing ORR durability. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses elucidate that the transition from metallic to quasi-covalent bonding strengthens Pt-Co/La interactions, which effectively suppresses Pt leaching. Furthermore, La-mediated electronic modulation reduces the core-shell chemical potential difference, thus inhibiting Co migration from the core to the outermost surface and the subsequent oxidative dissolution. Due to these properties, the as-developed catalyst demonstrates high ORR activity under H2-air conditions, achieving a peak power density of 1.27 W cm-2 and high mass activity (MA) of 1.29 A mgPt-1. More importantly, it exhibits exceptional stability with 87% MA retention and only 12 mV voltage loss at 0.8 A cm-2 after 30k accelerated durability cycles, outperforming DOE 2026 targets (60% MA retention and voltage loss <30 mV). This study proposes a new structural engineering strategy for enhancing catalytic robustness in harsh electrochemical environments."},{"t":"[ASAP] 更正：'通过铜催化氮杂环丁烯硼烯丙基化对映选择性合成2,3-二取代氮杂环丁烷'","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22357","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化氮杂环合成","sc":0.6,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":0.5,"r":0.5,"d":0.5,"t":1.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Correction to “Enantioselective Synthesis of 2,3-Disubstituted Azetidines via Copper-Catalyzed Boryl Allylation of Azetines”"},{"t":"构建三维共价有机框架用于光催化合成2,3-二氢苯并呋喃衍生物","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19165","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化有机合成","kp":["催化剂[光催化合成]: 3D COF(D-A结构)","[产物]: 2,3-二氢苯并呋喃衍生物"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"as":"该研究构建了三维共价有机框架（3D COFs），并将其作为光催化剂用于2,3-二氢苯并呋喃衍生物的合成。2,3-二氢苯并呋喃结构广泛存在于天然产物和药物分子中，在制药和材料科学领域具有重要价值。研究利用3D COF的多孔结构和光吸收特性，在温和条件下实现光催化成环反应，高效构建目标杂环分子，为绿色合成药学相关骨架提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Construction of Three-Dimensional Covalent Organic Frameworks for Photocatalytic Synthesis of 2,3-Dihydrobenzofuran Derivatives","b":"2,3-Dihydrobenzofuran derivatives hold significant value in pharmaceutical and material science due to their prevalence in bioactive molecules and natural products. However, constructing efficient and sustainable catalytic systems for the synthesis of such derivatives remains challenging. Herein, we synthesized two three-dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) with donor-acceptor (D-A) units, which enable efficient photocatalytic synthesis of 2,3-dihydrobenzofuran derivatives via oxidative dehydrogenative coupling of alkenyl phenols (12 substrate examples, up to 95% yields) or oxidative [3 + 2] cycloaddition of phenols and olefins (14 substrate examples, up to 97% yields). Remarkably, a range of natural products, including δ-viniferin, conocarpan, licarin A, homopterocarpin, and pterocarpan, can be facilely and scalably synthesized through a one-step synthesis in high yields (up to 93%), in sharp contrast to multistep routes required by conventional approaches with lower yields (<60%). Comprehensive characterizations reveal that the synthesized 3D COFs with D-A units enable efficient photoinduced carrier separation and migration, thus facilitating the photocatalytic performance. Moreover, the interconnected nanochannels and rigid frameworks in 3D COFs collectively ensure substrate accessibility and structural stability (at least 10 catalytic cycles), much superior to that of the corresponding two-dimensional (2D) COFs. This work provides an innovative approach for facile and efficient photosynthesis of high-value-added chemicals by 3D COFs.","aip":1},{"t":"[ASAP] 先进的分子镊子可有效靶向缺乏胆碱头基的膜，以实现广谱抗病毒功效","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19450","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Broad-spectrum antivirals are urgently required to counter present and emerging viral threats. It has previously been shown that the parental molecular tweezers CLR01 and CLR05 disrupt viral envelopes by complexing choline headgroups and that ester-functionalized \"advanced\" tweezers display markedly enhanced antiviral potency. Here, we determine the molecular basis of this improved activity. Using liposome leakage assays, giant unilamellar vesicles, NMR, Langmuir film balance experiments, and atomistic simulations, we demonstrate that advanced tweezers not only encapsulate choline-containing lipids but also engage lipids lacking choline headgroups via transient and conserved hydrophobic insertion events. These interactions preferentially destabilize membranes enriched in sphingomyelin, unsaturated acyl chains, or inverted cone-shaped lipids and are especially effective against small, highly curved particles resembling viral particles, explaining their broad antiviral activity for enveloped viruses. Our findings reveal a dual mechanism of action, choline binding and hydrophobic insertion, that underpins the broad-spectrum antiviral activity of advanced molecular tweezers and establish them as a promising new class of membrane-targeting antivirals for prophylactic and therapeutic use."},{"t":"[ASAP] 未取代的卡宾阳离子的无重氮等价物：通过 [12/13CH]+ 插入直接合成萘和吡啶","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21901","c":"不相关","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Stable isotope labeling is a crucial technique in pharmaceutical research to understand the mode of action and metabolism of new drug candidates; however, its utility is often jeopardized by the synthetic challenges associated with the installation of the isotopic label into the core of the structures under study. Herein, we address this problem for the case of 13C-labeled naphthalene and pyridine building blocks. Our synthetic protocol utilizes the sulfonium sulfaneylidene salt 1, a benchtop stable reagent that does not incorporate diazo functionalities in its structure; yet, under Rh-catalysis, it efficiently acts as a synthetic equivalent of the simplest conceivable carbynyl cation, the [CH]+ fragment. Mechanistic experiments supported by DFT calculations suggest the initial formation of a sulfonio-substituted Rh(II)-carbene that reacts with indenes or pyrroles to initially form sulfonio-substituted cyclopropanes; the diastereoselectivity of this step being inconsequential because both isomers interconvert under the reaction conditions. Subsequent electrocyclic ring expansion with the concomitant elimination of dibenzothiophene delivers the desired naphthalenes or pyridines."},{"t":"将 RNA 降解转化为准确的 RNA 检测：临床样品的 RNase I 辅助滚环扩增","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525591?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Ribonucleases are powerful degradative enzymes that rapidly cleave RNA and have long been regarded as obstacles to RNA diagnostics. Detecting large, structured RNA molecules in biological samples is further complicated by extensive secondary structures and abundant background RNA. Here we transform this destructive activity into a diagnostic advantage through a RNase I–assisted rolling circle amplification (RI‐RCA) strategy that integrates enzymatic RNA digestion with circular DNA templates (CDTs) to achieve direct, reverse‐transcription‐free RNA detection. In this system,\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    RNase I—a widely available endoribonuclease—selectively digests structured RNA to expose complementary CDT‐binding sites, which are immediately protected through duplex formation and converted into primers for RCA. The resulting reaction proceeds isothermally at room temperature in linear, quasi‐exponential, and exponential modes, achieving quantitative signal generation across concentrations from 50 aM to 50 fM and maintaining performance in 50% pooled human saliva. Applied to clinical saliva samples from SARS‐CoV‐2–positive and –negative individuals, RI‐RCA achieved near‐perfect sensitivity and 98–100% diagnostic accuracy. By coupling enzymatic RNA digestion with sequence‐specific protection via CDT hybridization, this strategy converts RNA instability from a liability into an analytical advantage, providing a simple, robust, and clinically translatable platform for accurate detection of structured RNA targets.","tp":"核酸检测法","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种创新的RNase I辅助滚环扩增（RI-RCA）技术，成功将RNA降解酶的破坏作用转化为检测优势。传统上，核糖核酸酶因快速切割RNA被视为诊断障碍。该技术结合酶反应与扩增机制，有效克服了临床样本中大型RNA分子复杂二级结构和背景RNA干扰的难题，实现了高特异性和高准确度的RNA检测，为临床诊断提供了新工具。"},{"t":"协同驱动电解液设计：共晶电解液中氟代碳酸亚乙酯与丁二腈共溶剂化实现稳定钠金属电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池电解质","kp":["电解质[钠金属电池]: NaFSI/FEC/SN低共熔","[策略]: FEC与SN共溶剂化稳定钠负极"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种协同驱动的电解液设计策略，将氟代乙烯碳酸酯（FEC）和丁二腈（SN）作为共溶剂引入低共熔电解液中，实现钠金属电池的稳定循环。钠金属电池因钠资源丰富和高能量密度被视为锂离子电池的有力替代方案，但钠金属负极面临枝晶生长和界面不稳定等挑战。FEC和SN的共溶剂化效应调控了钠离子的溶剂化结构，在负极界面原位形成富含无机组分的稳定SEI膜，有效抑制枝晶生长并提升库伦效率。该策略为高性能钠金属电池电解液设计提供了分子层面的理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergy‐Driven Electrolyte Design: Fluoroethylene Carbonate and Succinonitrile Co‐Solvation in a Eutectic Electrolyte for Stable Sodium Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sodium metal batteries (SMBs) are promising alternatives to lithium‐ion batteries due to their high energy density and abundant sodium resources. However, high reactivity of sodium metal anodes (SMAs) presents significant challenges for practical application. Herein, we report a multifunctional ternary eutectic electrolyte, termed NSF‐5, comprising sodium bis(fluorosulfonyl)imide (NaFSI), succinonitrile (SN), and fluoroethylene carbonate (FEC) in a 1:1:5 molar ratio, which enhances the cycling stability of SMAs. Combined experimental and computational studies confirm a synergistic effect between FEC and SN, where FEC integrates into the Na\n                    +\n                    solvation sheath, regulates the desolvation process, and promotes the formation of a robust, inorganic‐rich solid electrolyte interphase, thereby suppressing sodium dendrite growth. Consequently, SMBs with NSF‐5 demonstrate desirable cyclability under demanding conditions. Full cells coupled with Na\n                    3\n                    V\n                    2\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    3\n                    achieve over 1650 cycles with 90.5% capacity retention at 0.5 C and 3715 cycles with 80.2% retention at 10 C. Even at 0 °C, the cell maintains 87.9 mAh g\n                    ‒1\n                    capacity after 3500 cycles with 81.4% retention. Moreover, this versatile electrolyte formulation can be adapted to other alkali metal battery systems, underscoring its broad applicability. This work highlights the importance of electrolyte engineering in regulating the electrode−electrolyte interphase, offering valuable insights into achieving long‐term cyclability of SMBs."},{"t":"通过冻融-致密化-交联策略实现高强度、高韧性且动态可逆的水凝胶","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000076?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高强度水凝胶","kp":["[制备]: 冻融-致密化-交联三步法"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Strong, tough, and dynamically reversible hydrogels enabled by a freeze–thawing, densification, and crosslinking strategy"},{"t":"信使 RNA 脂质纳米粒子时空靶向子宫内膜治疗生殖疾病","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02108-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Dysfunctions of the endometrium, the uterus inner lining, can impair embryo implantation and reduce pregnancy rates. Intrauterine administration of cytokines has shown potential to improve endometrium function, but it is challenged by poor targeting and dose-limiting systemic side effects. Here we present a strategy for introducing therapeutic messenger RNA into the endometrium for the treatment of reproductive disorders. mRNA was loaded into a ligand-conjugated lipid nanoparticle (LNP), enabling multivalent interactions with the temporally overexpressed integrin receptors on the endometrial surface during the window of implantation. Conjugating the targeting ligand directly to the lipid component enhanced endometrial protein expression after intrauterine infusion and reduced systemic expression in the liver and spleen. A single infusion of granulocyte-macrophage colony-stimulating factor (GM-CSF) mRNA-loaded LNP sustained local protein expression for several hours and reduced GM-CSF systemic exposure. In a murine model of endometrial injury, GM-CSF mRNA-loaded LNP improved embryo implantation rates, outperforming recombinant GM-CSF. Our strategy demonstrates the efficacy of using mRNA to improve fertility outcomes."},{"t":"自组装二维手性细观形貌决定细胞和体液免疫对肿瘤的平衡","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520552?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The development of nanomaterials‐based cancer vaccines has broadened the scope of immunotherapy. Nanomaterials with characteristics such as chirality, 2D, and flexibility have attracted widespread attention because they can maximize the interface between the materials and immune cells. Here, we report the fabrication of 2‐D mesoporous silica nanodisks with a chiral meso‐topography as vaccine adjuvants. These uniform nanodisks, with diameters from 200 nm to 1 µm, possess unique spiral mesoporous patterns of ∼ 10 nm. The thickness of the chiral mesoporous nanodisks can be precisely controlled in units of one layer (∼ 7 nm), thereby achieving precise regulation in surface topology, dimension and flexibility. The unique 2‐D chiral mesoporous structure originates from the maximum occupancy of confined space of micellar helical arrangement, which is distinct from conventional methods based on internal tension. The combination of flexibility, 2‐D structure and chirality enhances nanodisks’ interaction with dendritic cells (DCs), significantly improving DC maturation via Toll‐like receptors/Nuclear Factor‐kappa B (TLR/NF‐κB), Mitogen‐Activated Protein Kinase (MAPK) and Focal Adhesion Kinase (FAK) signaling pathways. Upon nanovaccines’ activation of DCs in vivo, DCs further presents antigen for activating T cells to trigger balanced cellular and humoral immunity. Subcutaneous injection of the nanodisks‐adjuvanted cancer vaccine can significantly inhibit the tumor growth and extend the survival of melanoma‐bearing mice to more than 60 days, about three times higher than that of the PBS‐treated group. When combined with PD‐1 antibody, the cancer vaccines maximize tumor suppression, achieving a tumor‐free outcome in one‐third of the cases."},{"t":"可编程界面聚合：机器学习揭示微胶囊定量理性设计规则及拓展应用","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517708?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"界面聚合微胶囊","kp":["[方法]: 机器学习揭示界面聚合设计规则","[应用]: 微胶囊化界面聚合"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究将机器学习引入界面聚合（IP）技术，系统揭示了微胶囊及聚合物膜设计的定量理性规则。通过对IP过程中单体浓度、界面条件等多维参数的训练建模，建立了预测膜结构与性能的定量构效关系，克服了传统IP工艺依赖经验试错的瓶颈。该方法不仅适用于微胶囊制备，还可推广至海水淡化膜、气体分离膜等聚合物膜材料的高效设计，展示了ML驱动的材料逆向设计范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Programming Interfacial Polymerization: Machine Learning Unveils Quantitative Rational Design Rules for Microcapsules and Beyond","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Interfacial polymerization (IP) serves as a versatile platform technology for designing polymeric membranes, yet its extension to applications such as microencapsulation (MIP) remains hindered by empirical methodologies, largely due to the absence of quantitative rational design principles. Unlike separation membranes, which prioritize nanostructural control, MIP emphasizes encapsulation efficiency (EE%), rendering conventional membrane‐derived theories and thermodynamic descriptors insufficient. In this work, we transcend these limitations by employing interpretable machine learning to program interfacial polymerization, thereby deciphering mechanism‐informed quantitative design rules. Our data‐driven platform integrates molecular thermodynamics, polymerization kinetics, and emulsion‐stabilized interfacial parameters to identify previously overlooked descriptors governing microcapsule formation. We establish a predictive chemical–process–structure–performance relationship and demonstrate programmable control over key performances, including EE% (30%–95%), particle size (100–400 µm), and shell thickness‐to‐radius ratios (0.005–1) for diverse payloads spanning hydrophobic, hydrophilic, and highly reactive compounds such as toluene diisocyanate and amines. This work not only resolves long‐standing challenges in understanding complex multiphase interactions in MIP but also establishes a new paradigm for the quantitative design of polymeric microcapsules, with broad implications for functional particles, catalytic microreactors, digital cells, and membranes."},{"t":"不确定条件下基于氢能装备行为模式反演的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网优化","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior pattern inversion under uncertain conditions"},{"t":"工业光伏-储能负荷系统中能源成本与容量电费联合优化的离线逆强化学习","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储能效优化","kp":["[优化方法]: 离线逆强化学习联合优化光伏-电池能量成本与需求费"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Offline inverse reinforcement learning for joint optimization of energy costs and demand charge in industrial PV-battery load systems"},{"t":"多晶体X射线衍射(MCXRD)弥合化学与材料科学中的晶体学表征鸿沟：在MOFs中的应用","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523233?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"X射线多晶衍射","kp":["[结构解析方法]: 多晶XRD组合部分衍射数据集(MCXRD)","[应用场景]: 同步辐射小晶体与辐射敏感材料"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了多晶体X射线衍射（MCXRD）技术，弥补了化学与材料科学领域中小尺寸晶体和辐射敏感样品结构表征的空白。传统单晶XRD受限于晶体尺寸和辐射损伤，而MCXRD通过对多个微小晶体进行数据合并处理，有效解决了MOF（金属有机框架）等难以生长大单晶材料的结构解析难题。该技术在MOF等先进多孔材料研究中具有重要应用价值，显著拓展了晶体学表征的适用范围。","dp":1,"ot":"Multi‐Crystal X‐Ray Diffraction (MCXRD) Bridges the Crystallographic Characterisation Gap in Chemistry and Materials Science: Application to MOFs","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Structure determination by X‐ray diffraction is limited by crystal size and can be compromised by radiation damage when using very intense X‐ray radiation. X‐ray structure determination from partial diffraction data sets combined from multiple crystals is a potential solution, but its exploitation in chemistry and materials science is largely unrealized. Here we report the use of synchrotron radiation for multi‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (MCXRD) adapted for structure determination of metal‐organic framework (MOF) materials with crystal dimensions too small for conventional single‐crystal diffraction studies. We further show that radiation‐induced chemical changes and degradation of diffraction quality can be alleviated. Our approach encompasses both rotation‐ and stationary‐MCXRD measurements for 10 to 1000s of crystals with software‐optimized combination of the multiple data sets. We report the crystal structures of six MOFs: MOF‐919(Sc/Cu), MET‐2, MIL‐88B(Cr)‐1,4‐NDC, PCN‐260(Sc), UiO‐66, and UiO‐66‐MoO\n                    4\n                    with unit cell dimensions ranging from 18−114 Å and crystal sizes from 0.5−480 µm\n                    3\n                    . This approach can address the challenges of structure determination in a regime of particle size and sample radiation sensitivity that lies between existing single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction and the emerging field of electron diffraction. MCXRD can provide accurate atomic‐resolution structure determination for some of the most challenging cases in chemistry and materials science."},{"t":"单体比例控制吡啶氮富集调节碳纳米球p带中心实现高效锌空气电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515992?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[锌空电池ORR]: 无金属吡啶氮富集碳纳米球","[活性位点调控]: 单体比例控制吡啶氮富集调制p带中心","[设计范式]: DFT活性位点识别→比例控制合成→器件验证闭环"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过单体比例调控实现碳纳米球中吡啶氮富集，进而调节p带中心位置，构建高效的锌空气电池氧还原反应（ORR）催化剂。通过精确控制前驱体单体比例，实现了活性位点电子结构的优化调控，使催化剂的ORR活性与耐久性显著提升。该策略为低成本、高性能非贵金属ORR催化剂的设计提供了明确的电子结构调控路径，推动了锌空气电池等金属空气电池的实用化进程。","dp":1,"ot":"Monomer‐Ratio Controlled Pyridinic‐N Enrichment Modulating p‐Band Centers in Carbon Nanospheres for Efficient Zinc‐Air Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Rational design of high‐performance, low‐cost oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts is critical for advancing zinc‐air batteries (ZABs). This study proposed a closed‐loop paradigm integrating first‐principles active site identification, precursor‐ratio‐controlled synthesis, and device validation to develop superior metal‐free ORR electrocatalysts. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations identify pyridinic‐N as the optimal doping configuration, exhibiting the lowest energy barrier (0.17 eV) for the rate‐determining step (RDS, *O\n                    2\n                    → *OOH). Further electronic structure analyses revealed that this enhancement originates from pyridinic‐N‐induced upward shifts in the p‐band center of adjacent carbon atoms during the RDS, establishing this shift as a universal activity descriptor. Guided by these insights, aniline(A)/pyrrole(P) co‐polymerization with precise monomer molar ratio control yielded a series of N‐doped carbon materials (A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC). A\n                    0.5\n                    P\n                    0.5\n                    ‐NC achieved the highest pyridinic‐N content (38.91%), demonstrating exceptional ORR activity that surpasses other A\n                    x\n                    P\n                    y\n                    ‐NC variants and the benchmark 20 wt.% Pt/C. The optimized catalyst enabled transformative ZAB performance in liquid and flexible configurations, achieving enhanced open‐circuit voltage, superior power densities, high specific capacities, and prolonged durability compared to commercial 20 wt.% Pt/C. This work establishes a catalyst development paradigm bridging mechanistic understanding, controllable synthesis, and practical application for next‐generation energy storage devices."},{"t":"用于高性能半透明有机太阳能电池及组件且能量损失最小化的不对称窄带隙受体分子工程","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505706?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半透明有机光伏","kp":["受体[半透明OSC]: 不对称窄带隙受体","[分子工程]: 乙烯基π桥嵌入+端基卤化协同优化","[优化目标]: 近红外光收集与开路电压损失权衡"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过分子工程设计不对称窄带隙受体，实现了高性能半透明有机太阳能电池及其组件，并最小化能量损失。核心挑战在于近红外光子收集与高开路电压之间的固有矛盾，该工作通过不对称分子结构设计，在拓宽光吸收范围的同时抑制非辐射复合损失，有效降低了能量损失。半透明特性使该器件适用于建筑光伏一体化（BIPV）等场景，推动了有机光伏从实验室向实用化的迈进。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Asymmetric Narrow‐Gap Acceptors for High‐Performance Semitransparent Organic Solar Cells and Modules with Minimized Energy Losses","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Overcoming the inherent trade‐off between near‐infrared photon harvesting and high open‐circuit voltage losses in bulk‐heterojunction blends is critical for advancing semi‐transparent organic solar cells (ST‐OSC). Herein, we present a molecular design that combines vinylene\n                    π\n                    ‐bridge incorporation and terminal‐group halogenation to tailor energy level alignment and blend morphology with PCE10 donor. These designed materials (eC9‐V‐2Cl(‐4Cl) and eC9‐DV‐2Cl) exhibit broadened NIR absorption (up to 1020 nm) and significantly reduce non‐radiative recombination voltage loss by a maximum of ∼100 mV compared to the standard PCE10:BTP‐eC9 device. The optimized PCE10:eC9‐V‐2Cl blend, processed from a green solvent in an inverted structure, achieves a remarkable power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 14.2% for opaque devices with a minimal voltage loss of ∼250 mV. Furthermore, a simply 1D double‐layered nano‐photoinc structure (LiF/MoO\n                    3\n                    ) as an optical out‐coupling layer was integrated into the ST‐OSC, delivering a PCE of 9.9% with an average visible transmittance (AVT) of 42.6%, and yielding a light utilization efficiency (LUE) of 4.3%. Scaling to 5 × 5 cm\n                    2\n                    ST‐OSC modules, an active‐area efficiency of ≈9% was reached with a remarkably high geometric fill factor of 96.5%. These findings provide new molecular design principles for high‐performance ST‐OSCs, making these devices highly attractive for sustainable and scalable applications like energy‐saving agrivoltaic systems and aesthetically transparent solar windows.","aip":1},{"t":"面向实用化钠离子电池的低成本层状正极：科学挑战、解决策略与经济效益","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钠电池层状正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 层状氧化物LOCMs","[定位]: 低成本SIB潜在替代/补充锂离子电池"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述系统分析了低成本层状氧化物正极在实用化钠离子电池中面临的科学挑战与解决策略，并评估了其经济效率。钠离子电池因钠资源储量丰富、成本低，被视为锂离子电池的重要补充，但层状正极存在相变复杂、空气敏感性、循环衰减快等瓶颈。文章梳理了元素掺杂、表面包覆、结构调控等改性策略，并从全产业链角度对比了钠离子电池与锂离子电池的成本优势，为钠电商业化路径提供参考。","dp":1,"ot":"Low‐Cost Layered Cathodes Toward Practical Sodium‐Ion Batteries: Scientific Challenges, Resolution Strategies, and Economic Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) are the most widely used commercial rechargeable batteries, but the stable supply of key raw materials such as lithium, nickel, and cobalt faces challenges. Sodium‐ion batteries (SIBs) are considered as potential alternatives and complements to LIBs due to similar working principles and the abundance of sodium resources. Layered oxide cathode materials (LOCMs) are recognized as one of the most promising practical cathodes for SIBs because of mature synthesis technology and satisfactory energy density. However, the use of nickel in LOCMs for SIBs has raised concerns about environmental pollution during nickel production and the risk of price volatility stemming from the widespread application of high‐nickel LOCMs for LIBs. Therefore, developing low‐cost nickel‐free LOCMs is crucial for enhancing the environmental friendliness and cost advantages of SIBs. For low‐cost LOCMs, this review discusses the feasibility of replacing Ni\n                    2+\n                    /Ni\n                    4+\n                    with Fe\n                    3+\n                    /Fe\n                    4+\n                    and Mn\n                    3+\n                    /Mn\n                    4+\n                    for charge compensation in SIBs, and summarizes the resulting critical scientific challenges (Fe migration, Mn dissolution, Jahn‐Teller effect, Na deficiency, and thermal instability). Economic efficiency assessment based on cost and electrochemical properties indicates that low‐cost LOCMs exhibit the highest cost‐performance ratio. Finally, to accelerate the commercialization of cost‐effective SIBs technologies, this review outlines promising development pathways of low‐cost LOCMs."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"以居住者为中心的建筑控制的混合强化学习：共同优化能源、舒适度和室内空气质量的审查和部署框架","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000449?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"建筑智能控","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"串联官能团迁移实现未活化烯烃的同系自由基1,3-双碳官能化","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525903?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯烃自由基官能化","kp":["[反应类型]: 光诱导1,3-双碳官能化","[底物]: 未活化烯烃","[合成策略]: 顺序官能团迁移实现一碳链延伸"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了非活化烯烃的同系化自由基1,3-双碳官能化反应，关键在于通过连续官能团迁移策略完成。传统自由基介导的烯烃双官能化以1,2-加成为主，该工作突破了此限制，利用官能团顺序迁移（如硼基、硅基迁移）实现碳骨架延长和远程双官能化，一步构建1,3-双取代结构。该反应为复杂有机分子合成提供了新的碳-碳键构建工具，具有优异的底物普适性和区域选择性。","dp":1,"ot":"Homologative Radical 1,3‐Dicarbofunctionalization of Unactivated Alkenes Enabled by Sequential Functional Group Migrations","b":"Abstract\n                  Despite significant advances in conventional radical‐mediated 1,2‐difunctionalization of alkenes over the past decade, homologative 1,3‐difunctionalization remains largely underdeveloped. Herein, we report a novel photoinduced homologative 1,3‐dicarbofunctionalization of unactivated alkenes via one‐carbon chain elongation, achieved through sequential functional group migrations. By employing strategically designed tertiary alcohols and heteroarylsulfones as versatile coupling partners, this method affords structurally diverse, densely substituted aliphatic ketones and medium‐sized cyclic scaffolds with exclusive chemo‐ and regioselectivity. The transformation accommodates a broad range of migrating groups, including various heteroaryl, phenyl, and alkenyl motifs, and exhibits excellent functional group tolerance."},{"t":"通过原子级氟掺杂进行硅晶体结构几何重构以实现高性能锂离子电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504961?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅负极氟化改性","kp":["[结构工程]: 原子级氟嵌入实现硅晶几何重构","负极材料[锂离子电池]: 氟嵌入硅基"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过原子级氟原子引入对硅晶体结构进行几何重构，获得高性能锂离子电池负极材料。传统硅负极在充放电过程中体积膨胀巨大导致结构崩塌，该工作利用氟原子的强电负性精确调控硅晶格的键长与键角，缓解体积应变并稳定SEI界面。原子级氟掺杂策略显著提升了硅负极的循环稳定性和首效，为高能量密度锂离子电池硅基负极的工程化应用提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Geometric Remodeling of Silicon Crystal Structure Through Atomic‐Level Fluorine Incorporation for High‐Performance Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Sustainable electrification continues to drive growing interest in high‐performance lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), which are essential energy storage systems for this transition. However, conventional graphite‐based LIBs cannot meet the stringent requirements of next‐generation applications, necessitating advanced alternatives. Herein, we report the design of fluorine‐incorporated silicon (FIS) nanostructures through a novel solid–vapor–solid synthesis method that integrates metallothermic reduction with combined top‐down and bottom‐up processes. Crucially, fluorine (F) atoms are inherently positioned both at interstitial sites within the silicon (Si) lattice and on the particle surface. Interstitial F modifies the direct‐allowed band structure of Si and expands lithium penetration pathways, thereby enhancing charge transport through improved electronic conductivity and ion migration. Meanwhile, surface‐bound F induces superhydrophobicity, enabling hydrofluoric acid‐free processing during both synthesis and electrode fabrication. Comprehensively, unveiled features of FIS offer a cost‐effective manufacturing, improved structural and electrochemical stability, and superior performance, leading to cycle‐stable, fast‐charging Si anodes for advanced LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"通过天气感知安全约束增强电网韧性：基于CNN-GRU混合架构的深度强化学习方法","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000152?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"气象感知电网韧性","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Enhancing power grid resilience through weather-aware security constraints: A deep reinforcement learning approach with hybrid CNN-GRU architecture"},{"t":"通过浓锂盐优先分解获得稳定SEI层并防止铝集流体腐蚀用于锂离子电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202504436?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"SEI层铝腐蚀抑制","kp":["电解质盐[锂离子电池]: LiTFSI形成无机富集SEI","[腐蚀问题]: LiTFSI引发铝集流体严重腐蚀","[解决策略]: LiPF6-LiTFSI混合盐优选分解稳定SEI兼防腐"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过高浓度锂盐的优先分解，在锂离子电池中同时实现稳定SEI层构建和铝集流体腐蚀防护。锂双三氟甲磺酰亚胺（LiTFSI）等新型锂盐虽具优异电化学性能，但易腐蚀铝集流体。该工作利用高浓度盐体系中阴离子优先分解的特性，在负极形成富无机物SEI层（富含LiF），同时在铝表面形成钝化保护膜，从根源上解决了腐蚀问题，为高电压、高安全性电解液的设计提供了关键策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Deriving Stable SEI Layer and Preventing Aluminum Current Collector Corrosion via Preferential Decomposition of Concentrated Lithium Salt for Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Among promising lithium salts for electrolyte in lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs), lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide (LiTFSI) forms a more stable inorganic‐rich SEI layer. However, its implementation is limited by severe aluminum current collector corrosion. Since lithium hexafluorophosphate (LiPF\n                    6\n                    ) contributes a stable passivation layer for aluminum, a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte offers reduced corrosion. However, its corrosion inhibition capability is not complete. Herein, we propose a SEI‐stabilizing and corrosion‐preventing layer (SCL) that realizes spatial separation of salts, which confines concentrated LiTFSI within a polyethylene glycol dimethacrylate (PEGDMA) network at the anode‐LiPF\n                    6\n                    electrolyte interface. The locally high concentration of LiTFSI in SCL induces a kinetic preference that overrides the thermodynamic preference of LiPF\n                    6\n                    , which enables targeted decomposition of LiTFSI to form a robust SEI layer, while using only a small amount of LiTFSI. Furthermore, SCL demonstrates excellent corrosion‐inhibiting behavior compared to a simply‐mixed LiPF\n                    6\n                    ‐LiTFSI dual‐salt electrolyte. Consequently, SCL enables stable cycling of high‐loading (21.4 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) practical NCM811/graphite full cells with 93.57% capacity retention after 100 cycles at a high current density of 2.2 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This strategy enables selective electrochemical reactions through spatial confinement to enhance LIB performance, while suppressing side reactions and reducing costs, providing a scalable approach for next‐generation electrolyte design.","aip":1},{"t":"定速-变速抽水蓄能混合系统的协调调频：集成动态预测与滚动优化的自适应控制框架","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000279?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/机械能/重力储能","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抽水蓄能频率调节","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coordinated frequency regulation of fixed-variable speed pumped storage hybrid systems: an adaptive control framework integrating dynamic prediction and rolling optimization"},{"t":"面向配电网恢复的混合移动电源协调调度：嵌入动态梯度掩码的多智能体元深度强化学习方法","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","kp":["调度方法[配电网恢复]: 多智能体元深度强化学习"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking embedded multi-agent meta-deep reinforcement learning method"},{"t":"通过自下而上相翻转接力策略构建一体化双层多孔膜用于液流电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506085?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液流电池多孔膜","kp":["[膜结构]: 集成双皮层多孔膜(大孔层居双侧皮层间)","[制备策略]: 底驱相转化中继法引入非溶剂载体","[调控手段]: 乙二醇调控皮层结构"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究首次提出自下而上相转化接力策略，构建集成式双层多孔膜（大孔-皮层复合结构），用于液流电池。传统相转化法难以精确控制膜的非对称结构，该接力策略通过分步相转化实现大孔支撑层与致密皮层的原位集成，避免了多层复合膜界面缺陷问题。双层结构兼顾离子选择性和水渗透阻力，显著提升了液流电池的库伦效率和循环稳定性，为大规模储能液流电池膜材料设计开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Constructing Integrated Dual‐Skin‐Layer Porous Membranes via a Bottom‐Up Phase Inversion Relay Strategy for Flow Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    A bottom‐up relay strategy is first proposed to fabricate integrated dual‐skin‐layer porous membranes (macropore layer between bilateral skin layers) by ingeniously introducing a non‐solvent carrier. Benefiting from the phase inversion relay process, bilateral skin layers can be tailored freely, where ethylene glycol in the non‐solvent carrier effectively regulates the structure of the bottom skin layer by adjusting the ratio of free water to bound water. Thus, a dual‐skin‐layer membrane is designed and applied in a vanadium flow battery (VFB), that features symmetric skin layers (∼600 nm) with sub‐nanometer (∼4.5 Å) pores. The symmetric structure reduces the pressure required for proton migration via the Vehicle mechanism, and the sub‐nanometer pores effectively separate vanadium ions from protons by size exclusion, breaking the trade‐off in traditional membranes. Moreover, the bilateral skin layers protect the macropore layer against the vanadium fouling and mechanical damage. Furthermore, the formation mechanism and ion transport dynamics of the dual‐skin‐layer membrane are analyzed by molecular dynamics and multi‐physical field simulation. As a result, the optimized membrane enables stable VFB operation for over 6000 cycles at 200 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    with energy efficiency of ∼83.6%. This work provides an effective approach to prepare integrated symmetric membranes with bilateral skin layers."},{"t":"作者更正：自噬缺陷型巨噬细胞通过 miR-195a-5p-SIRT3 轴加剧顺铂诱导的线粒体功能障碍和肾损伤","d":"2026-01-20","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68421-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"无定形、胚胎态还是介孔化沸石？中间合成相概述：定义、表征与应用","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523144?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沸石中间相","kp":["[材料相态]: 分子筛合成中间相(无定形/胚态/介孔化)"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.5},"as":"该综述全面梳理了沸石合成中的中间态相——无定形态、胚胎态和介孔化态——的定义、表征方法与应用。传统沸石的催化性能归因于高热稳定性和严格形状选择性，但这些中间态相具有更大的孔径和更开放的骨架结构，可拓展沸石在大分子催化中的应用。文章系统对比了三类中间态相的结构特征与形成条件，评述了原位表征技术（如XRD、NMR、TEM）在区分各相中的关键作用，为超越传统沸石的催化材料设计提供了理论框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Amorphous, Embryonic or Mesoporized Zeolites? An Overview of Intermediate Synthetic Phases: Definitions, Characterization, and Application.","b":"Abstract\n                  The success of zeolites as catalysts has long been attributed to their high thermal stability and strict shape selectivity flowing from their network of well‐defined channels and cages. Synthetic efforts often unjustly disregarded (partially) amorphous intermediate synthetic phases (ISPs), including embryonic zeolite, interzeolite conversion intermediates and mesoporized zeolites, as “failed” and excluded them from further characterization efforts. Recently, this perception has changed and better characterization techniques have led to a deeper understanding of the structure and catalytic potential these materials (may) hold. In this work, we will give a brief overview of the state of the art research being conducted in synthesis, characterization and exploitation of ISPs, as well as clarifying some definitions, hoping to set the stage for future generations of zeolite scientists."},{"t":"通过氧空位调控加速Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7正极电化学反应动力学用于宽温域安时级钠离子电池","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525531?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池正极改性","kp":["正极材料[宽温钠离子电池]: Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)","[改性策略]: 氧空位调控加速电化学动力学","[关键缺陷]: 磷铁钠矿NaFePO4惰性杂质相"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对钠离子电池Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7(NFPP)正极材料本征电子/离子电导率低的问题，采用氧空位调控策略加速电化学动力学。通过在NFPP晶格中引入可控氧空位，优化Fe位点的局部电子结构并拓宽钠离子迁移通道，使材料在宽温域(-20°C至55°C)下展现优异倍率性能和循环稳定性。该工作成功制备出安时级电芯，验证了氧空位工程在推动钠离子电池规模化应用中的可行性。","dp":1,"ot":"Accelerating Electrochemical Kinetics in Na4Fe3(PO4)2P2O7 Cathodes Through Oxygen Vacancy Modulation for Wide‐Temperature Ah‐Level Sodium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP) stands as a highly promising cathode material for sodium‐ion batteries, offering a favorable combination of operating voltage and theoretical capacity. Nevertheless, its commercial viability is significantly hindered by two primary factors: the prevalent formation of electrochemically inert impurity phases, such as\n                    maricite\n                    ‐NaFePO\n                    4\n                    and low‐energy‐density Na\n                    2\n                    FeP\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    , during conventional synthesis, coupled with its intrinsically poor electronic conductivity. Herein, we demonstrate a rational defect‐engineering strategy to enhance the electrochemical kinetics of NFPP cathodes through controlled oxygen vacancy formation. The optimized Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    2.79\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    (NFPP‐2.79) exhibits superior phase purity, enhanced electronic conductivity, and facilitated Na\n                    +\n                    diffusion, as confirmed by multi‐scale characterization techniques. The NFPP‐2.79 cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 89.51 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10C and retains 96.42% capacity after 1500 cycles at 2C. Moreover, kilogram‐scale synthesis using cost‐effective raw precursors has been achieved via a sand‐milling‐assisted spray‐drying route. When assembled into Ah‐level pouch cells with hard carbon anodes, the NFPP‐2.79‐based cell demonstrates excellent rate capability (93.75% capacity retention from 0.5C to 4C), outstanding cyclability (75.63% retention after 3000 cycles), and superior safety under extreme conditions (overheating, crushing, nail penetration, overcharge, and external short‐circuit). This work highlights oxygen vacancy modulation as an effective pathway for advancing polyanionic cathodes toward practical applications."},{"t":"关联不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-20","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多能系统优化","kp":["[社区多能系统]: 相关不确定性下多时间尺度风险规避框架"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated uncertainties"},{"t":"疏水性金属有机框架通过几何设计实现优异的高压氨存储","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18786","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机框架储氨","kp":["储氨材料[高压]: CAU-23疏水铝基MOF","[发现]: 几何结构而非亲水性决定高压氨吸附"],"as":"研究开发疏水性金属有机框架材料用于高压氨气存储，突破了\"疏水MOF因主客体相互作用弱而不适于氨气存储\"的传统认知。实验表明疏水特性在高压条件下显著提升了氨气吸附容量与循环稳定性，为固态氨存储与运输提供了新型多孔材料方案，在清洁能源载体与制冷领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Hydrophobic Metal–Organic Frameworks Enable Superior High-Pressure Ammonia Storage through Geometric Design","b":"Hydrophobic metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) are typically overlooked for ammonia storage due to weak host-guest interactions. Here, we demonstrate that four structurally analogous aluminum-based MOFs exhibit a counterintuitive behavior whereby framework geometry, rather than ligand hydrophilicity, determines high-pressure NH3 adsorption performance. The hydrophobic CAU-23 achieved an exceptional capacity matching hydrophilic analogs despite its poor low-pressure uptake. This pressure-dependent enhancement stems from the unique 4-cis-4-trans geometry of CAU-23 compared to the purely cis arrangement of MIL-160 and KMF-1 and the alternating cis-trans configuration of MOF-303. Critically, CAU-23 retained 95% capacity over three high-pressure cycles, whereas hydrophilic MOFs suffered 39-46% irreversible losses due to strong NH3-framework interactions that compromise structural integrity. Grand canonical Monte Carlo simulations reveal that high pressure enables NH3 clustering through intermolecular hydrogen bonding, bypassing the need for strong host-guest interactions. High-pressure powder X-ray diffraction measurements confirm the exceptional mechanical resilience of CAU-23, showing complete structural recovery upon decompression despite exhibiting the highest pressure sensitivity among the studied MOFs. An extended analog, HE-CAU-23, validates this design principle with further enhanced capacity. These findings reveal a paradigm shift toward hydrophobic MOFs with optimized geometry for high-performance and regenerable gas storage applications."},{"t":"膳食碳水化合物与脂肪比例对代谢组学特征的与体重无关的影响：5 个月的次要结果","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68353-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Diet plays a crucial role in health, with low-carbohydrate diets often proposed to exert metabolic benefits. We aim to investigate metabolomic adaptations in 164 adults with overweight or obesity who were randomly assigned to high- (n = 54), moderate- (n = 53), or low-carbohydrate (n = 57) diets during a 20-week weight-loss maintenance phase of the Framingham State Food Study [(FS)2], a controlled, parallel feeding trial (ClinicalTrials.gov: NCT02068885). We measure fasting plasma metabolites by liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry using samples from 147 participants who completed the study (n = 45, 48, and 54 in the high-, moderate-, and low-carbohydrate diet groups, respectively). Significant associations (False Discovery Rate"},{"t":"增材制造金属中形成的非常规亚晶结构","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1369702126000088?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Materials Today","tg":"研究论文","tp":"增材制造亚晶结构","kp":["[发现]: 增材制造金属中非常规亚晶结构"],"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unconventional sub-grain structures formed in additively manufactured metals"},{"t":"剪切相氧化铌实现超稳定双频段电致变色窗","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505972?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双频电致变色窗","kp":["材料体系[双频电致变色窗]: 剪切相氧化铌","[失稳机制]: 离子嵌脱致晶格畸变与不可逆相变"],"as":"该研究利用剪切相氧化铌（Nb₂O₅）材料实现了超稳定双波段电致变色智能窗。双波段电致变色窗可独立调控可见光（VIS）与近红外（NIR）透过率，从而在保持采光的同时阻挡热辐射。剪切相Nb₂O₅的特定晶体结构赋予其优异的离子嵌入/脱出可逆性和长循环稳定性，为建筑节能玻璃与智能窗系统提供了耐用且高效的材料解决方案。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultra‐Stable Dual‐Band Electrochromic Windows Enabled by Shear‐Phase Niobium Oxide","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dual‐band electrochromic windows (DEWs) enable selective modulation of visible (VIS) and near‐infrared (NIR) solar radiation, providing an effective strategy to reduce building energy consumption. Conventional electrochromic materials, however, undergo lattice distortion, interfacial stress, and irreversible phase transitions during repeated ion intercalation/deintercalation, which lead to rapid optical degradation. Herein, we report ultra‐stable DEWs based on shear‐phase Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    with electronic‐structure engineering via W\n                    6+\n                    doping. The 2D shear‐phase framework suppresses phase transitions and volume expansion during cycling, while W\n                    6+\n                    substitution introduces oxygen vacancies and strengthens ion‐lattice coupling through\n                    d‐p\n                    orbital hybridization. The combination of structural and electronic optimization enhances electronic conductivity and reduces the ion diffusion barrier. As a result, W‐doped Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    films achieve large optical modulation of 92.3% at 633 nm and 93.8% at 1200 nm, rapid switching (coloration/bleaching: 3.4/2.8 s at 633 nm and 2.4/5.2 s at 1200 nm), excellent bistability, and outstanding cycling stability, with less than 10% optical loss after 100 000 cycles. Simulations demonstrate that these DEWs offer substantial energy‐saving potential under diverse climates, and their integration with photovoltaic‐electrochromic systems enables self‐powered operation. This study establishes the first intrinsic stabilization mechanism for Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    ‐based dual‐band electrochromism and provides a general design principle for durable, energy‐efficient smart windows."},{"t":"由三聚氰胺衍生的三角镶嵌电荷转移共晶及其增强的光催化性能","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519694?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电荷转移共晶","kp":["组成[CT共晶]: melem:melamine=1:2或3:1","[调控策略]: 镶嵌结构调控电荷转移强度"],"as":"该研究以三聚氰胺为构筑基元，制备了具有三角形密铺结构的电荷转移共晶材料。电荷转移共晶因其在光电功能材料领域的巨大潜力备受关注，但精准调控其电荷转移程度与超分子组装形貌一直是难题。本研究通过分子设计实现有序的三维密铺堆积，显著提升了电荷传输效率与材料稳定性，为有机半导体、光电器件及分子电子学提供了新型功能材料的可控制备策略，在柔性电子和传感领域具有应用前景。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Triangular‐Tessellated Charge Transfer Cocrystals Derived from Melamine with Enhanced Photocatalytic Performance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Charge transfer (CT) cocrystals hold great promise for advanced functional materials, yet controlling their CT interactions in terms of both structural design and precise synthesis remains challenging. Herein, a tessellation‐based strategy to modulate CT strength in melamine‐derived cocrystals is demonstrated, specifically in MMC‐12 (melem:melamine = 1:2) and MMC‐31 (3:1). Transient absorption (TA) spectroscopy and theoretical simulations reveal that MMC‐31 exhibits enhanced CT interactions, facilitating rapid electron transfer from melamine to melem and forming weakly bound CT excitons. These excitons dissociate readily into free carriers, leading to an 18‐fold enhancement in H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production and a 12‐fold enhancement in H\n                    2\n                    evolution compared to pristine melem. This work underscores the potential of geometric tessellation as a general design principle for high‐performance organic semiconductors and photocatalysts."},{"t":"面向高湿环境中实用化超长循环寿命锂空气电池：双界面协同策略","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂空气电池界面","kp":["红氧介导剂[高湿环境LAB]: SnCl4与1,8-二碘辛烷","[界面工程]: 双界面协同策略实现超长循环"],"as":"该研究聚焦锂空气电池在高湿环境下的长效稳定运行这一关键瓶颈。锂空气电池理论能量密度远超锂离子电池，被视为下一代储能技术，但空气中水分对锂负极和电解液的腐蚀导致循环寿命严重衰减。研究通过优化电池体系设计与防护策略，使锂空气电池在高湿条件下实现超长循环寿命，推动了该技术从实验室走向实际应用，对电动汽车和便携式高能储能系统具有重要意义。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Toward Practical Ultralong‐Life Li‐Air Batteries in High‐Humidity Environments: A Synergistic Strategy for Dual‐Interfac","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Maintaining the operational stability of Li–air batteries (LABs) in high‐humidity environments is crucial for their transition from laboratory research to practical deployment. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy for dual‐interfacial engineering toward ultralong‐life LABs in high‐humidity environments. An iodine‐based self‐defense redox mediator—SnCl\n                    4\n                    and 1,8‐diiodooctane (DIO) is introduced into the electrolyte. On the cathode side, it enabled efficient bidirectional OER/ORR catalysis while forming a protective interface that suppressed both nucleophilic and hydrolytic attack. On the anode side, a highly lithiophilic, corrosion‐resistant, and moisture‐tolerant protective layer forms on the Li anode, which ensures stable battery operation under extremely humid conditions. The results show that the Li─O\n                    2\n                    battery achieved more than 2400 cycles (nearly 3000 h) at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and an extremely low charge potential (&lt;3.5 V), coupled with a high discharge capacity of 111879 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Notably, the SnCl\n                    4\n                    /DIO‐based LABs reached more than 1800 cycles (&gt;2160 h) even in atmospheric air without humidity control. This work significantly overcomes the strict humidity limits of traditional LABs and provides an innovative strategy for developing LABs capable of operating in high‐humidity environments."},{"t":"具有磁光探针的螺纹设计血管支架捕获和消除体内循环肿瘤细胞","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516675?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Metastasis, responsible for over 90% of cancer‐related deaths, is largely fueled by circulating tumor cells (CTCs). Although eliminating CTCs could inhibit metastasis, the complex in vivo environment makes it difficult. Considerable progress of in vitro CTCs detection has been made, yet its translation into effective in vivo systems, particularly for large animals, continues to pose a substantial challenge. This study introduces a threaded vascular scaffold that creates a cell‐enrichment zone by modulating radial fluid velocity, enhancing cell axiality and providing an optimized environment for CTCs capture. In addition, hybrid membranes‐modified magnetic beads (HM‐MBs) loaded with indocyanine green and coated with tumor‐white cell membranes, enabling specific recognition and binding of CTCs. Under external magnetic guidance, CTCs bound to HM‐MBs are efficiently accumulated at the scaffold site, followed by near‐infrared light‐triggered activation of photodynamic and photothermal effects for targeted CTCs elimination. This integrated system effectively addresses key challenges in in vivo CTCs detection and removal. Experimental results in rabbit and goat vessels demonstrated high capture efficiencies of 60.3% and 54.7%, respectively, along with post‐irradiation elimination rates exceeding 90%. This integrated approach enables targeted in vivo CTCs capture and destruction, disrupting the metastatic cascade and offering a promising strategy for adjuvant cancer therapy."},{"t":"绿电交易市场化与新能源企业投资决策","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005440?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"绿电交易市场化","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"The marketization of green electricity trading and investment decisions of new energy enterprises"},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色与棕色面：创新、AI驱动专利、能源政策干预与排放","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"工业机器人碳排","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"The green and brown sides of industrial robots: Innovations, AI-Driven patents, energy policy interventions, and emissio"},{"t":"通过工程膜融合进行硬度门控细胞质 mRNA 递送用于乳腺癌免疫治疗","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518208?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Traditional lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) suffer from low lysosomal escape efficiency (&lt;4%) and off‐target toxicity, hindering mRNA therapy translation. While membrane fusion carriers bypass endosomal entrapment, their lack of cell specificity induces non‐target cytotoxicity. To overcome these limitations, we developed a stiffness‐gated mRNA delivery platform (PGC@FM). This system features a PLGA core loaded with G0‐C14 dendrimer/mRNA complexes and coated with an engineered, low‐stiffness tumor cell fusion membrane (FM). The membrane stiffness is strategically reduced via unsaturated fatty acid enrichment, enabling direct cytoplasmic delivery through selective fusion with low‐stiffness target cells. Conversely, encountering high‐stiffness non‐target cells, PGC@FM undergoes endocytosis and lysosomal degradation, minimizing off‐target effects. Compared to LNPs, this stiffness‐gated strategy enhanced EGFP‐mRNA transfection efficiency in 4T1 cells by 5.2‐fold and increased tumor‐specific p53‐mRNA delivery efficiency by 4.2‐fold, resulting in potent tumor suppression and immune activation. Crucially, non‐target cells rapidly degrade internalized PGC@FM in lysosomes, significantly reducing off‐target toxicity compared to conventional fusion carriers. These research results indicate that by leveraging the biophysical principle of membrane rigidity compatibility, highly selective mRNA delivery can be achieved, providing new ideas for the development of mRNA delivery carriers."},{"t":"深海风力涡轮机最新综述：安装、成本、不稳定性、流致振荡、失效与材料","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000139?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深海风力发电机","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"State-of-the-art review of deep-sea wind turbine: installation, cost, instability, flow-induced oscillation, failure, ma"},{"t":"稳定的 BF2 Boracycles 作为选择性邻位 C–H 功能化的通用试剂","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518421?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The development of new boron reagents continues to play a crucial role in advancing modern organic synthesis, particularly in C–H functionalization and cross‐coupling reactions. Herein, we report a metal‐free, robust, and scalable multigram protocol for the synthesis of stable BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles that require no column chromatography, providing a practical and efficient route to access this valuable boron species. The BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles exhibit enhanced stability and reactivity, making them highly versatile intermediates for late‐stage diversification. They undergo\n                    ipso\n                    ‐substitution to afford a wide array of derivatives, including halogenated (e.g., radioiodinated), hydroxylated, and azidated products. Furthermore, they display excellent reactivity in Suzuki–Miyaura cross‐coupling reactions, enabling both C(sp\n                    2\n                    )─C(sp\n                    2\n                    ) and C(sp\n                    2\n                    )─C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) bond formation. These results underscore the utility of BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles as powerful tools for selective functionalization in pharmaceutical synthesis and beyond. Our work represents a significant advancement in organoboron chemistry, offering both a streamlined synthetic approach and broad applicability for complex molecule construction."},{"t":"使用 DNA 折纸摩擦绘制膜蛋白相互作用的空间图","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202513795?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Revealing the protein–protein interactions (PPIs) of membrane proteins is as challenging as their structural reconstruction, primarily because the molecular structures and related PPIs of membrane proteins are highly dependent on the bio‐membrane where they are situated. DNA origami offers a platform for manipulating molecules with nanoscale precision. Herein, we used a square‐like DNA origami, refer to as DNA origami rubbing, to map the two‐dimensional distribution of membrane proteins in situ. Through artificial models and cell studies, we correlated the efficiency of barcode recording of DNA origami rubbings with the distance between adjacent proteins, and we observed that the frequency of adjacent proteins mapped by DNA origami rubbings was correlated to the abundance of the bait protein. We demonstrated that the DNA origami rubbing was able to reflect the distribution change of adjacent proteins caused by adding the ligand of bait protein. Our results suggested that the DNA origami rubbing can serve as a powerful tool in the field of protein interactomics.","tp":"蛋白质互作","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用DNA折纸技术开发了一种名为“DNA折纸摩擦”的新方法，用于精准绘制膜蛋白相互作用的空间分布。由于膜蛋白的结构与相互作用高度依赖于生物膜环境，传统研究手段面临巨大挑战。研究团队利用方形DNA折纸平台，在纳米尺度上操控分子，成功映射了膜蛋白相互作用的二维分布。该技术为复杂蛋白质网络的结构解析和功能研究提供了高精度工具。"},{"t":"隐性溶剂溶解度激活抑制高性能钠离子电池界面溶解","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524808?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池界面溶解","kp":["隐性溶剂[钠离子电池]: 1,2-环氧-3,3,3-三氟丙烷","SEI溶解[钠离子电池]: 容量衰减与产气主因","溶剂活化[电解质]: 平衡离子电导率与SEI稳定"],"as":"钠离子电池（NIBs）中固态电解质界面膜（SEI）的溶解会引发电解液持续分解和活性物质损失，严重制约循环寿命。该研究提出'隐性溶剂溶解度激活'策略，通过调控溶剂化结构抑制SEI在界面处的溶解，稳定界面相并减少副反应。该方法有望显著提升钠离子电池的库伦效率与长循环稳定性，推动低成本储能体系的实用化进程。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Solubility Activation of Recessive Solvent Mitigates Interphase Dissolution for High‐Performance Sodium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) dissolution in sodium‐ion batteries (NIBs) triggers electrolyte decomposition and gas evolution, resulting in capacity decay and safety issues. Lowering the solvation power of electrolyte mitigates SEI dissolution but decreases ionic conductivity. Here, we report a recessive solvent activation strategy, where the recessive solvent 1,2‐epoxy‐3,3,3‐trifluoropropane (TFPO) alone dissolves NaFSI only sparingly, but its solubility is greatly enhanced by the addition of an activating solvent, diethylene glycol diethyl ether (DEE). By harnessing the tunable solvation behavior of the DEE–TFPO system, we designed a weakly solvating electrolyte (WSE) containing 24 vol% DEE, far below the bulk‐solvent fractions typical of WSEs, and a high anion‐to‐DEE ratio. This low DEE content mitigates solvent‐induced SEI dissolution, while the high anion‐to‐DEE ratio promotes anion‐dominated solvation structure, forming a robust inorganic‐rich SEI. These effects preserve high ionic conductivity while overcome the challenge of SEI dissolution. The optimized electrolyte enabled hard carbon || NaMn\n                    0.33\n                    Fe\n                    0.33\n                    Ni\n                    0.33\n                    O\n                    2\n                    full cells to retain 80.0% capacity after 500 cycles and 99.5% capacity in 1.0 Ah pouch cells after 230 cycles with suppressed gas release."},{"t":"双连续结构电解质弹性体构建稳固界面用于固态电池应用","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525489?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质弹性体","kp":["电解质形态[固态电池]: 双连续结构弹性体","制备方法[相分离]: 原位相分离策略"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对固态电池中固-固界面接触差、界面阻抗大的核心难题，设计了一种具有双连续结构的电解质弹性体。该弹性体通过原位聚合形成离子导电相与机械增强相互贯穿的双连续网络，兼具高离子电导率(>1 mS/cm)、优异电化学稳定性和可调机械性能。双连续结构确保了与锂金属负极的紧密界面接触，有效抑制锂枝晶生长。该策略为固态电池界面工程提供了可规模化解决方案。","ot":"Robust Interface Enabled by Bicontinuous‐Structured Electrolyte Elastomers for Solid‐State Battery Applications","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) with high ionic conductivity, superior electrochemical stability, and mechanical durability are safe and reliable for solid‐state lithium (Li) batteries. However, most existing SSEs suffer from limited mechanical resilience and poor interface contact, impeding their practical deployment. Here, an in situ phase separation strategy is proposed to construct a class of elastomeric solid‐state electrolytes with bicontinuous architecture. The rigid phase ensures high ionic conductivity (7.8 × 10\n                    −4\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 25 °C), while the elastic phase provides excellent elastic restorability (82%) and strong interface contact (adhesion energy ≈43.9 J m\n                    −2\n                    ). This bicontinuous structure endows the material with superior stretchability (1800%), fatigue resistance, and puncture strength, while maintaining interface contact, keeping mechanical integrity of the battery structure during cycling, and restraining the dendrite growth. Consequently, symmetric batteries exhibit no short‐circuiting even after 2000 h of operation, and Li–metal batteries demonstrate high specific capacity. Solid‐state Li–O\n                    2\n                    batteries fabricated with the P(BA‐SN)‐IL electrolyte also exhibit good cycling performance (500 cycles), and the Li–O\n                    2\n                    pouch cell achieves stable cycling and superior feasibility under various abuse tests, including bending and squeezing. The bicontinuous‐structured elastomer electrolytes present a highly promising strategy for enabling safe operation of high‐energy solid‐state batteries."},{"t":"翻转氧化钒酞菁V═O取向作为氮化碳上\"分子开关\"促进CO2光还原","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523201?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["分子开关[单原子光催化]: VO酞菁V=O取向可逆调控","光催化反应[CO2还原]: 碳氮化物载体"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"利用钒氧酞菁(VOPc)在氮化碳上的V═O键取向翻转作为'分子开关'，精准调控单原子位光催化剂的微环境。研究发现，V═O基团朝向碳氮基底面的构型可优化钒中心的电子密度和CO2吸附活化能力，显著提升光驱动CO2还原为CO/CH4的选择性与活性。该工作展示了通过分子级构型工程调控单原子催化微环境的策略，为高效人工光合作用催化剂设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Reversing V═O Orientation of Vanadyl Phthalocyanine as \"Molecular Switch\" on Carbon Nitride Boosts CO2 Photoreduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The precise engineering of catalytic microenvironments in single‐atom site photocatalysts is critical yet challenging for optimizing CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. Herein, we propose a novel strategy by leveraging the tunable molecular orientation of non‐planar vanadyl phthalocyanine (VOPc) as a “molecular switch” to dynamically modulate the local catalytic microenvironment. Positive surface charge and hydrogen bonding introduced by the hydroxylation of carbon nitride (C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    ) allows a preferential “O‐down” configuration of VOPc on the modified substrate (VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    ). Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that this specific molecular orientation lowers the energy barrier for the rate‐determining step (*CO\n                    2\n                    →*COOH). VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    shows enhanced electron transfer efficiency, an upward shift of the V‐centered d‐band toward the Fermi level, and stabilized *COOH adsorption. Consequently, VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    achieves a CO evolution rate of 65.22 µmol·g\n                    −1\n                    ·h\n                    −1\n                    , which is 7.5 times higher than that of VOPc/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    with “O‐up” configuration of VOPc. This work highlights that controlling the orientation of active sites presents a promising strategy for modulating interfacial electronic structures and boosting photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction performance.","aip":1},{"t":"基于MOF衍生过渡金属硫化物的超级电容器电极材料研究进展","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000012?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"MOF衍生金属硫化物","dp":1,"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","ot":"Recent advances in supercapacitor electrode materials based on MOF-derived transition metal sulfides"},{"t":"脉冲电沉积单原子合金调控表面加氢动力学实现空气制肥","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521345?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子合金电催化制氨","kp":["制备方法[单原子合金]: 脉冲电沉积","协同描述符[设计]: LLM推导Ψ","目标反应[电催化]: 硝酸盐制氨(空气转肥料)"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"利用脉冲电沉积技术制备单原子合金催化剂，通过调控表面氢化动力学实现空气中氮气直接转化为肥料(硝酸盐/氨)。脉冲电沉积的周期性电位切换优化了单原子位点的配位环境和表面氢覆盖率，促进了N≡N键活化和后续加氢反应。该策略以环境空气和可再生电力为原料，绕过了Haber-Bosch法的高温高压条件，为分布式绿色肥料合成提供了电催化新路径。","ot":"Pulse‐Electrodeposited Single‐Atom Alloys with Steered Surface Hydrogenation Dynamics for Air‐to‐Fertilizer Synthesis","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Harnessing renewable electricity to transform abundant environmental resources into fertilizers is central to sustainable development. Electrochemical nitrate‐to‐ammonia conversion provides a promising route, yet its efficiency is constrained by the elusive surface hydrogenation dynamics governing multi‐step *NO\n                    x\n                    reduction. Here, a cooperative descriptor (Ψ) derived from large‐language‐models‐assisted mining and energetic analysis successfully identifies NiCu single‐atom alloys (SAAs) as optimal catalysts. Pulse electrodeposition delivers atomically dispersed alloys with tunable structures, achieving a maximum Faradaic efficiency (FE) of ∼95% and yield rate (YR) of ∼11.4 mg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . In situ surface‐interrogation scanning electrochemical microscopy (SI‐SECM) provides quantitative information on the time‐resolved surface‐active hydrogen (*H) generation‐consumption and *NO\n                    x\n                    hydrogenation rate constants (NiCu &gt; CoCu ≫ MnCu ≈ FeCu &gt; Cu), directly aligning surface kinetics with selectivity. Theoretical investigations further confirmed that Ni doping lowers the barriers for *H formation and *NO\n                    x\n                    hydrogenation. A plasma‐electrochemical‐CO\n                    2\n                    capture system demonstrated continuous “air‐to‐fertilizer” conversion with reduced energy consumption and potential net‐negative emissions. These results establish a transferable design rule that bridges theoretical descriptors with operando hydrogenation dynamics, providing a mechanistic foundation and practical pathway toward scalable, zero‐carbon fertilizer production.","aip":1},{"t":"能源投资和包容性增长方面的公私伙伴关系","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005178?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源投资合","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"使用基于温度的机器学习模型预测 2100 年西班牙南部的太阳峰值时间","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000474?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过 DNA 折纸上的分子图案实现可编程纳米级运动","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523921?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Asymmetry in enzymatically driven nanomotor design, both structural and functional, is widely considered essential for propulsion. However, the interplay between particle geometry, enzyme distribution, and catalytic loading remains poorly defined, largely due to limited control over enzyme positioning that hinders quantitative analysis. Using DNA origami nanorods, we achieve precise spatial placement of urease enzymes with independently tunable coverage and asymmetry. Single‐particle tracking reveals that motility arises not solely from enzyme number or spatial arrangement but from a balance between catalytic loading and geometric anisotropy. Unexpectedly, maximal propulsion occurs at ∼25% urease end‐coverage, significantly below the conventional 50% end‐coverage, where half of the available binding positions on one structural half of the origami are occupied. Boundary Element Method simulations incorporating identical spatial parameters reproduce these findings, confirming that programmable enzyme patterning dictates diffusiophoretic propulsion. These results provide a quantitative framework linking topology, catalytic activity, and motion, revealing that optimal motility does not coincide with maximal asymmetry and advancing the rational design of enzyme‐powered DNA nanomotors.","tp":"DNA纳米马达","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用DNA折纸纳米棒作为载体，实现了尿素酶在纳米级别的精确空间排布，且酶的覆盖率和不对称性均可独立调节。以往由于对酶的定位控制有限，纳米电机设计中粒子几何形状、酶分布与催化负载之间的相互作用机制难以量化分析。该研究通过DNA折纸技术克服了这一局限，为深入探究酶驱动纳米电机的推进机制以及设计结构、功能可编程的纳米级运动系统提供了重要的实验平台和定量分析基础。"},{"t":"磷酸酯修饰受体添加剂实现有机太阳能电池纵向形貌与界面协同工程","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519367?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池界面","kp":["光电转换效率[有机太阳能电池]: ~21%","受体修饰[L8-BO]: 磷酸酯基团"],"as":"针对非富勒烯受体（NFA）有机太阳能电池，开发磷酸酯修饰的受体添加剂，实现活性层垂直形貌的同步优化。该策略通过添加剂调控给体/受体在垂直方向的梯度分布，改善电荷分离与传输效率，提升器件光电转换性能（PCE）。该工作为突破OSCs效率瓶颈提供了形貌工程层面的新思路，对柔性光伏的商业化具有推进意义。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Phosphate Ester‐Modified Acceptor Additives Enable Concurrent Vertical Morphology and Interfacial Engineering for Organi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic solar cells (OSCs) based on non‐fullerene acceptors (NFAs) have progressed rapidly, yet further gains are constrained by coupled challenges in vertical morphology control and energy alignment at the acceptor–cathode interface. Here, a molecular engineering strategy is presented that installs strongly polar phosphate ester groups onto the inner alkyl chains of the benchmark NFA L8‐BO, yielding two derivatives—1POE and 2POE. Employed as non‐volatile solid additives during layer‐by‐layer processing, these molecules induce vertical composition redistribution to form a graded donor–acceptor–additive architecture. The resulting vertical profiling strengthens intermolecular interactions, raises surface energy, and drives additive accumulation near the top interface, thereby improving interfacial energetics and facilitating electron extraction. Consequently, devices incorporating 2 wt.% 1POE or 2POE deliver power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 19.87% and 19.28%, respectively, versus 18.83% for controls, alongside enhanced operational stability. The strategy shows strong universality across multiple blends, achieving a PCE of 20.90% in a D18/L8‐BO:BTP‐eC9FCl ternary system. These results demonstrate that precise phosphate ester–based additive design enables concurrent optimization of vertical phase distribution and interfacial energetics, offering a practical route to high‐efficiency, stable OSCs."},{"t":"优化玻璃态水系无机盐电解质综合离子效应用于超级电容器应用","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518352?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超级电容器抗冻电解质","kp":["应用环境[超级电容器]: 极低温","电解质[抗冻]: 玻璃态水系无机盐","离子效应[调控]: 综合浓度/水合数/缔合"],"as":"聚焦耐冷水系储能器件的无机盐电解质体系，系统优化玻璃态水合盐电解液中的离子综合效应。研究通过调控阳离子-阴离子组合与水合结构，降低电解液冰点并维持高离子电导率，解决低温下水系电池性能衰减问题。该方向对极寒环境下的储能应用（如极地、高海拔、航空航天）具有实用价值，为水系电池拓宽工作温域提供了新路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Optimizing the Comprehensive Ion Effects in Glass‐Forming Aqueous Inorganic Salt Electrolytes for Supercapacitor Applica","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Inorganic salt electrolytes have been explored for developing cold‐resistant aqueous energy storage devices. Current research on anti‐freezing inorganic salt solutions mainly focuses on the H‐bond regulation effects of individual cations or anions. The overall ionic effects (e.g., ion type, concentrations, cation hydration numbers, ion interactions, and ionic associations, etc.) on the anti‐freezing properties lack a comprehensive understanding. In addition, crystallization of the salt electrolyte below the solidification point can lead to an abrupt performance failure of the energy storage device. In this work, we study the overall ionic effects of glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes for enhancing their anti‐freezing properties. It is found that ion pairs with more positive cationic potentials and less negative anionic potentials, cations with large coordination numbers, and anions with large ionic size and multiple H‐bond sites are crucial for achieving glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes with exceptional anti‐freezing performance. Notably, the Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    eutectic electrolyte exhibits a pure glass transition at −122°C and maintains a visible liquid state at −85°C. A supercapacitor cell with a Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    electrolyte is operational at temperatures as low as −80°C. This study provides insightful understandings for designing glass‐forming anti‐freezing electrolytes with improved adaptability of aqueous energy storage devices under extremely cold conditions."},{"t":"镍钒双位点促进亲核电氧化与阴极析氢耦合","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505773?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化耦合产氢","kp":["[双活性位点]: Ni-V双位点","[耦合系统]: HMF电氧化耦合阴极析氢","[问题]: 有机物与OH⁻竞争吸附"],"as":"提出镍-钒（Ni-V）双位点电催化剂，将5-羟甲基糠醛（HMF）的亲核电氧化与阴极析氢反应（HER）耦合。阳极侧Ni-V双位点协同催化HMF氧化为高附加值2,5-呋喃二甲酸（FDCA），阴极同步产氢，实现生物质升级与绿氢制备的联产。该双功能体系替代传统低效的氧析出反应（OER），显著降低能耗，在生物质高值化利用与电催化产氢领域具有前景。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Ni─V Dual Sites Boost Nucleophilic Electrooxidation Coupling With Cathodic Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of electrocatalytic 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural (HMF) oxidation with the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) is a win‐win strategy that enables the concurrent production of high‐value chemicals and low‐energy hydrogen. However, HMF oxidation suffers from competing adsorption between organics and OH\n                    −\n                    along with continuous redox cycling of active sites, leading to unsatisfactory activity, selectivity, and stability. To address these challenges, we designed a VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    composite catalyst with rich cationic vacancies and low vanadium content. This catalyst creates Ni─V dual active sites that trigger an alternative reaction pathway. VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    achieves high HMF conversion (97.1%), Faradaic efficiency (96.0%), and selectivity (98.93%) toward FDCA, along with robust stability. In an integrated HMFOR||HER system using VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    for both electrodes, a current density of 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    was attained at a low cell voltage of 1.76 V. Mechanistic studies reveal that VO\n                    2\n                    ‐induced vacancies promote the formation of high‐valence Ni species, while adjacent V sites enhance OH adsorption. This configuration enables balanced co‐adsorption of HMF and OH\n                    −\n                    . Unlike conventional single‐site Ni catalysis, the Ni─V dual sites optimize the dehydrogenation pathway while preserving the high oxidation state of Ni. This study sheds new light on the catalyst design for energy‐efficient biomass valorization and hydrogen production."},{"t":"基于视觉Transformer模型的全国太阳能部署趋势与空间不平等分析","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000632?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏部署视觉分析","kp":["[分析方法]: 视觉Transformer模型分析太阳能部署"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Nationwide insights on solar deployment trends and spatial inequalities revealed by vision transformer models"},{"t":"用于癌症光动力治疗的 NIR-II 激发 I 型共轭聚合物光敏剂","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520650?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Type‐I photodynamic therapy (PDT) is highly effective against hypoxic tumors, with its efficacy further enhanced by near‐infrared‐II (NIR‐II, 1000–1700 nm) excitation, which offers deeper tissue penetration than conventional NIR‐I (700–1000 nm). However, most reported organic NIR‐II photosensitizers (PSs) are only NIR‐II emissive but remain NIR‐I‐excited. NIR‐II‐excited type‐I PSs are rare and generally limited by low ROS yields, often requiring high‐power irradiation with photothermal co‐treatment to achieve meaningful therapeutic outcomes. Thus, rationally designing efficient organic type‐I PSs directly activated by NIR‐II light remains a challenge. Herein, we report a general strategy for designing efficient NIR‐II‐excited organic Type‐I PSs (PNT‐PFT NPs) based on linked donor‐acceptor through‐space charge transfer (CT) for PDT of hypoxic solid tumors. The through‐space CT based on linked donor‐acceptor pairs redshifts and amplifies the NIR‐II absorption of the PNT–PFT NPs. Additionally, the donor‐acceptor energy alignment facilitates directional flow of electrons, increasing free‐electron yield for O\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐ROS conversion. As a result, PNT–PFT NPs efficiently generated ROS and achieved 89.3% tumor inhibition in 4T1 models under low‐power 1064 nm irradiation. This study not only offers a general guideline for tailoring NIR‐II‐excited Type‐I PSs via through‐space CT in linked donor‐acceptor pairs but also provides mechanistic insights into Type‐I PS design.","tp":"近红外光敏剂","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对缺氧肿瘤的治疗，I型光动力疗法（PDT）结合具有深层组织穿透力的二区近红外（NIR-II）激发技术展现出巨大潜力。然而，现有的多数有机NIR-II光敏剂仍局限于NIR-I激发，且真正的NIR-II激发I型光敏剂极为罕见，常受限于活性氧（ROS）产量低的问题。该研究致力于开发新型NIR-II激发的I型共轭聚合物光敏剂，旨在突破现有光敏剂的激发波长和ROS产率限制，提升对深层缺氧癌症组织的治疗效果。"},{"t":"Smc5/6 与 DNA 连接相关的分子决定因素","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-67999-5","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Smc5/6 is an essential genome maintenance complex that interacts with double-stranded (ds) DNA, single-stranded (ss) DNA, and ss-dsDNA junctions. DNA association underlies Smc5/6’s functions in managing intermediates generated during genome replication and repair. However, the mechanisms of this activity are not fully understood. Here, we report a single-molecule study examining Smc5/6 association with a dsDNA substrate containing a ssDNA gap with defined 3’ and 5’ junctions. We found that Smc5/6 associates with both 3’ and 5’ junctions but prefers the 3’ junction in the presence of the ssDNA-binding complex RPA. Further, Smc5/6’s junction association frequency and dwell time are regulated by two non-SMC subcomplexes and DNA binding residues of Smc6. Moreover, Smc5/6 prefers binding to junction sites free of the sliding clamp PCNA over those occupied with it. These results suggest that Smc5/6 utilizes its multiple structural modules to associate with junction sites in coordination with other genome maintenance factors.","tp":"基因组维护机制","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"Smc5/6是维持基因组稳定性的关键复合物，通过与双链DNA、单链DNA及其连接点结合，参与基因组复制和修复过程中间体的管理。由于机制尚未完全明确，本研究采用单分子技术，深入分析了Smc5/6与含有特定3'和5'单链间隙的底物DNA之间的结合行为。这项研究揭示了Smc5/6与DNA相互作用的具体分子决定因素，有助于进一步理解其在DNA损伤修复和维持基因组完整性过程中的关键作用机制。"},{"t":"基于空间位阻与螯合的电子传输层分子工程用于稳定倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521878?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电子传输层","kp":["电子传输层[反式钙钛矿]: 富勒烯衍生物2Py","修饰策略[ETL]: 空间位阻与螯合"],"as":"该研究通过空间位阻效应与螯合作用的协同策略，对钙钛矿太阳能电池中的电子传输层（ETL）进行分子工程改性。传统富勒烯衍生物（C60、PCBM）虽广泛用于倒置p-i-n器件，但存在界面缺陷与器件稳定性不足的问题。研究设计了新型分子结构，利用空间位阻抑制分子过度聚集、螯合作用增强界面电荷传输与缺陷钝化，显著提升了器件的光电转换效率（PCE）与长期运行稳定性。该策略为钙钛矿电池的界面工程提供了通用设计范式，推动其向商业化迈进。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Electron Transport Layers via Steric Hindrance and Chelation Toward Stable Inverted Perovskite ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fullerene derivatives, such as C\n                    60\n                    and PCBM, are widely used as electron transport layers (ETLs) in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) due to their high electron mobility and well‐aligned energy levels. However, their poor photo‐thermal stability and weak interactions with perovskite limit further progress. To address these challenges, we develop a novel fullerene derivative, 2Py, as the ETL for inverted PSCs via a synergistic strategy combining steric hindrance modulation and chelation group incorporation. This molecule delivers three key benefits: moderate steric hindrance inhibits ETL aggregation during thermal aging; chelation groups enhance interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer; and improved hydrophilicity promotes uniform SnO\n                    x\n                    film growth via atomic layer deposition (ALD). 2Py ETL enables an efficiency of 26.07% for inverted PSCs based on a 1.55‐eV bandgap. Wide‐bandgap (1.80 eV) and narrow‐bandgap (1.25 eV) PSCs achieve efficiencies of 19.94% and 24.06%, respectively. Notably, these devices demonstrate exceptional photo‐thermal stability, achieving T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1080 h under 85°C heating and T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1250 h under maximum power point tracking at 45°C, outperforming PCBM‐based devices. This molecular design strategy paves new pathways for enhancing ETL performance and stability in inverted PSCs.","aip":1},{"t":"锰配位多价适体系统 (COMPASS) 实现 DC 靶向 mRNA/Mn2+ 共传递以实现癌症免疫","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    mRNA vaccines hold remarkable promise for cancer immunotherapy, yet current nanoparticle systems face challenges in efficacy, dendritic cell (DC) targeting, and safety. Herein, we report a nanoplatform, Manganese‐Coordinated Polyvalent Aptameric System (COMPASS), enabling targeted co‐delivery of mRNA and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    to lymph node dendritic cells (DC) to boost potent antitumor immunity. The COMPASS employed rolling circle amplification to generate single‐stranded DNA scaffolds with multivalent DC‐targeting aptamers and polyT domains, enabling stable mRNA hybridization via A‐T pairing. Various metal ions were screened, and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    was found to enhance mRNA endosomal escape and activate the STING pathway in DCs, promoting their maturation and antigen presentation. Controlled nanoparticle size (∼200 nm) and aptamer‐mediated DC targeting markedly enhanced lymphatic accumulation. In vivo evaluations revealed that COMPASS achieved potent prophylactic and therapeutic antitumor efficacy comparable to commercial LNPs (e.g., SM‐102), while exhibiting significantly enhanced safety profiles. Importantly, lyophilized COMPASS formulations retained their structural integrity and bioactivity for at least three months at room temperature. Overall, COMPASS represents a promising next‐generation nanoplatform with significant translational potential for safe and effective cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"mRNA靶向递送","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"为突破mRNA肿瘤疫苗在树突状细胞（DC）靶向性和安全性方面的瓶颈，研究人员开发了一种新型锰配位多价适体纳米平台（COMPASS）。该系统能够将mRNA和锰离子（Mn2+）精准共递送至淋巴结的树突状细胞中。Mn2+不仅作为佐剂增强免疫反应，还与mRNA协同作用，强效激活机体的抗肿瘤免疫应答。COMPASS系统有效提升了mRNA疫苗的靶向递送效率与治疗安全性，在癌症免疫治疗领域展现出广阔的应用前景。"},{"t":"精简多智能体深度强化学习处理联网微电网能量管理不确定性","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000061?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网能量管理","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Lean multi-agent deep reinforcement learning for uncertainty handling in the energy management of networked microgrids"},{"t":"挤压与直接压延对硫化物全固态电池干法涂布正极的影响","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506443?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物固态电池干涂正极","kp":["正极组成[硫化物ASSB]: 82wt%NCM85+0.5wt%PTFE","粘结剂[干法电极]: PTFE纤维化","工艺[ASSB正极]: 挤出+直接压延干法涂布"],"as":"该研究针对硫化物全固态电池（ASSB）正极的规模化生产，提出了一种新型干法涂布工艺，结合挤出与直接压延技术实现无溶剂电极制备。研究系统评估了工艺参数对硫化物正极微观结构、界面接触及电化学性能的影响，旨在替代传统湿法涂布中溶剂残留对硫化物固态电解质的降解问题。该工艺对降低全固态电池制造成本、推动其从实验室走向量产具有关键工程意义。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Impact of Extrusion and Direct Calendering on Dry‐Coated Cathodes for Sulfidic All‐Solid‐State Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    This study presents a novel dry‐coating process for the scalable production of sulfidic ASSB cathodes within a dry room environment. Composite powders, consisting of 82.0 wt% NCM85 and 0.5 wt% PTFE, are mixed and fibrillated using a twin‐screw extruder. Dry‐coated cathode films are manufactured using a two‐roll calender through a single high‐shear calendering step. The study explores the impact of processing parameters on the morphology of electrodes and cell performance. Furthermore, the findings are compared to a slurry reference. Increasing the process temperature and reducing the line load enhances PTFE fibrillation and mitigates CAM particle cracking. These adjustments improve electrode homogeneity, density, and CAM–SE interface contact. The improvements are attributed to the deformation of LPSCl particles under shear stress, especially at higher temperatures. XPS analysis reveals temperature‐driven degradation of LPSCl, forming Li\n                    2\n                    S. Despite lower electronic conductivity, dry‐coated cathodes exhibit superior ionic conductivity compared to the slurry reference. Single‐layer pouch cells with dry‐coated cathodes demonstrate enhanced initial capacity, ICE, and discharge rate capability. Optimal performance is achieved with electrodes produced with high extrusion temperature (100°C), medium calender temperature (60°C), and low line load (50 N mm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    )."},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策的不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型地缘","sc":1.8,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"高能量密度锂离子电池的气态SO2添加剂","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523079?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["添加剂[高能量密度锂电]: 气态SO2","优势[SO2添加剂]: 低成本高效界面钝化"],"as":"该研究提出将气态SO₂作为锂离子电池电解液添加剂，用于提升高能量密度电池的循环稳定性。通过SO₂在电极界面形成稳定的固态电解质界面膜（SEI），有效抑制正负极界面降解与副反应，减少容量衰减。气态添加剂策略有别于传统液态小分子添加剂，其高反应活性可调控界面化学，为高镍正极、硅基负极等高能量密度体系的工程化应用提供了新的电解质优化方向。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Gaseous SO2 Additive for High‐Energy‐Density Li‐Ion Battery","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrolyte additive engineering is pivotal for suppressing interfacial degradation and enhancing the cycling stability of high‐energy‐density batteries. However, conventional solid or liquid additives face inherent limitations such as high production costs, chemical instability, and inefficient interfacial passivation, restricting their practical application. Here, we propose an electrolyte engineering strategy that makes sustainable use of sulfur dioxide (SO\n                    2\n                    ), an industrial waste‐derived gas, as a dual‐functional gaseous additive. Owing to its ultrahigh reduction potential (2.6 V versus Li\n                    +\n                    /Li), which exceeds that of most known additives, and a low oxidation potential, SO\n                    2\n                    promotes the in situ formation of sulfur‐containing interphases on both electrodes through preferential electrochemical reactions, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic electrolyte decomposition. SO\n                    2\n                    enables 4.4 V‐class AG || NCM613 pouch cells to achieve exceptional cyclability exceeding 800 cycles with 88.2% capacity retention, along with outstanding temperature tolerance from −30 °C to 45 °C. This strategy also demonstrates universal applicability, yielding a long life of 800 cycles for Ah‐level 4.3 V‐class Si/C || NCM811 pouch cells. Furthermore, this approach alleviates electrolyte discoloration, extending shelf life while reducing cost and energy consumption. This work establishes a sustainable circular economy model by valorizing industrial exhaust into high‐value battery components, bridging environmental stewardship with next‐generation energy storage innovation.","aip":1},{"t":"小样本与不平衡数据条件下港口光伏阵列故障诊断","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600053X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏故障诊断","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Fault diagnosis of photovoltaic arrays at ports under small-sample and imbalanced data conditions"},{"t":"晶面选择性成核控制构建多维MOF异质结构","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525577?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF异质结构","kp":["[MOF异质结构]: 晶面选择性成核控制"],"as":"金属有机框架（MOF）异质结构因其可调控的形貌与组成在催化、传感、储能等领域备受关注。该研究提出晶面选择性成核控制策略，通过精准调控不同晶面的表面能与生长速率，实现多维度（如核壳、枝晶、二维/三维复合）MOF异质结构的定向构建。这一方法突破了传统自下而上合成中形貌不可控的瓶颈，为设计具有协同功能的先进多孔材料提供了全新范式，有望推动气体分离、电催化等应用的性能跃升。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Facet‐Selective Nucleation Control for Constructing Multi‐Dimensional MOFs Heterostructures","b":"Abstract\n                  Metal–organic framework (MOF) heterostructures featuring tunable morphologies and compositions have shown great promise for applications in high‐throughput sensing, anti‐counterfeiting, and information encryption. Nevertheless, the precise engineering of heterogeneous architectures with multi‐dimensional building units remains challenging, primarily hindered by an insufficient understanding of the growth dynamics between modules of different dimensionality. Here, we demonstrate a facet‐selective epitaxial growth approach for architecting spatially defined dimensional heterostructures via crystalline plane‐selective reactivity control. The intrinsically higher surface energy at the tips of 1D microrods facilitates the nucleation of 2D modules on the terminal facets, thereby yielding dumbbell‐like heterostructures. Conversely, by selectively enhancing the reaction activity on the body regions of the 1D templates, preferential nucleation and growth at the central areas over the tips were effectively achieved, which enables the controlled formation of periodic modular architectures through systematic regulation of surface energies. The facet‐selective epitaxial growth paradigm establishes a pathway for synthesizing hierarchical dimensional heterostructures with tailored architectures, which show great promise for applications in advanced optoelectronics, anti‐counterfeiting systems, and information encryption technologies."},{"t":"美国西部鸟类群落将遭受预计的严重火灾","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68480-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Fire is a pervasive biogeographic process that shapes biodiversity globally and is now experiencing unprecedented changes. Despite well documented impacts of fires on biodiversity, we do not know where biodiversity might be most vulnerable to changing fire regimes. We leverage recent advancements in fire forecasting and species distribution modeling to assess the exposure of bird species richness, community uniqueness, and functional richness to altered fire regimes in the western United States. We find that 55-58% of biodiversity hotspots are classified as “refugia”, where high biodiversity intersects with predicted low severity burn areas. In contrast, 24-30% of biodiversity hotspots are classified as “areas of concern”, where high biodiversity intersected with predicted high severity burn areas. Over half (52-60%) of “areas of concern” occur in geographies with historically low-severity fire regimes; a fire regime mismatch indicating a potential threat to biodiversity. We find that species with a preference for high-density vegetation and with shallower beak depth are most likely to be exposed to high severity fire, indicating a potential for habitat losses for species with these traits. Our findings reinforce calls for targeted management to reduce impacts of future fire where it is predicted to be outside the historical range of variation."},{"t":"赋能精准C–H官能化：过氧化酶工程研究进展","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525086?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"过加氧酶工程","kp":["催化剂[C-H官能化]: 不饱和过氧化物酶及P450过氧化物酶","[反应条件]: 水相温和条件下H₂O₂驱动氧官能化"],"as":"选择性C–H键官能化是有机合成领域的核心挑战，可实现对惰性碳氢键的直接多样化修饰。该综述聚焦过加氧酶（P450过加氧酶）工程的前沿进展，通过定向进化与理性设计提升酶的催化活性、区域选择性和底物范围，使其能在温和条件下高效催化C–H羟基化、环氧化等反应。相较于传统化学催化，生物催化路径具有高原子经济性和绿色可持续优势，该研究为药物合成、天然产物修饰提供了强大的生物催化工具箱。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Empowering Precision C–H Functionalization: Advances in Peroxygenase Engineering","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Selective C–H functionalization remains a central challenge in modern synthesis as it enables direct diversification of molecular scaffolds without pre‐functionalization. Peroxygenases, including both unspecific peroxygenases and P450 peroxygenases, offer a biocatalytic solution to this challenge, catalyzing oxyfunctionalization reactions in aqueous media under mild conditions with hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) as the sole oxidant. In this review, we highlight recent advances in peroxygenase engineering over the past five years, with a particular focus on strategies that enhance heterologous expression, catalytic activity, and control of regio‐ and enantioselectivity. We also discuss protein engineering approaches that mitigate H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐induced inactivation and summarize efforts to repurpose NADPH‐dependent P450 enzymes into self‐sufficient peroxygenases, thereby expanding their catalytic repertoire. Furthermore, we examine the integration of peroxygenases with in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation systems by enzymatic, chemical, photocatalytic, and electrochemical methods to achieve balanced oxidant delivery and sustained turnover. Collectively, these developments have established peroxygenases as versatile and robust catalysts for selective C–H functionalization, opening new opportunities for their application in the synthesis of pharmaceuticals, fine chemicals, and agrochemicals."},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微观结构驱动多尺度特征融合健康评估框架","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观结构健康评估","dp":1,"as":"","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health e"},{"t":"辐射交联弹性铁电材料","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72165?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弹性铁电材料","kp":["交联方法[弹性铁电体]: 辐射交联","优势[辐射交联]: 低温无引发剂深穿透"],"as":"针对可穿戴电子器件对柔性铁电材料的需求，研究团队利用辐射交联技术制备弹性铁电体，克服了传统热交联方法的局限性。辐射交联可在室温或低温下实现聚合物链间交联网络构建，赋予材料优异弹性与铁电性能并存，同时避免高温对铁电相的破坏。该方法有望推动柔性传感器、可穿戴能量收集与存储器件中高性能铁电材料的工程化应用。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Elastic Ferroelectric by Radiation Crosslinking","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  With the rapid advancement of wearable electronics, elastic ferroelectrics, which have been prepared by thermal and photochemical crosslinking, possess tremendous potential applications in wearable devices. However, challenges arose from these crosslinking reactions, such as high crosslinking temperature, long processing time, initiator residues, limited penetration depths. In contrast, radiation crosslinking, triggered by high‐energy particles at room temperature, yields materials with enhanced properties by offering advantages like the absence of active end‐groups and initiators, fast crosslinking speed, deep penetration, and environmental friendliness. In this study, the elastification of ferroelectric polymers, with normal ferroelectric poly(vinylidene fluoride‐co‐trifluoroethylene) (P(VDF‐TrFE)) as the matrix and a crosslinking sensitizer with unsaturated double bonds, was realized via electron beam radiation crosslinking. By adjusting the absorbed doses and the feed ratios of P(VDF‐TrFE) and the crosslinking sensitizer, the crystallinity of the elastic ferroelectrics was controlled, effectively balancing ferroelectricity and resilience. The resulting elastic ferroelectrics maintain stable ferroelectric response under tensile strains up to 55%, exhibiting excellent elasticity and ferroelectric properties. This study presents a simple but efficient approach for preparing intrinsically elastic ferroelectric without high‐temperature reaction, and eliminating the need for heating and cooling steps, providing a potential universal platform for constructing various elastic ferroelectrics."},{"t":"动态自旋调控三金属单原子催化剂不对称配位场实现最优氧还原","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519740?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子催化剂ORR","kp":["策略[ORR单原子催化剂]: 动态自旋工程","催化剂[ORR]: FeZnTM三金属单原子","[不对称配位场]: 动态自旋优化多步PCET"],"as":"单原子催化剂在氧还原反应（ORR）中理论上具有优越动力学性能，但实际应用仍受限于活性位点调控。本研究提出通过动态自旋调控三金属单原子催化剂的不对称配位场，利用不同金属间的电子自旋耦合效应优化中间体吸附能垒，显著提升ORR催化活性与选择性。该策略为多金属单原子体系的精准设计提供了新思路，对燃料电池和金属-空气电池阴极催化具有重要意义。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Dynamic Spin Governing Asymmetric Coordination Fields in Trimetallic Single‐Atom Catalysts for Optimal Oxygen Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Single‐atom catalysts demonstrate theoretically superior oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) kinetics, the limited dynamic adaptability, however, poses a giant challenge to meet the multi‐step proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET). Herein, we propose a “\n                    Dynamic Spin Engineering\n                    ” strategy for the rational design of tri‐metallic single‐atom catalysts (FeZnTM‐TACs) featuring asymmetric coordination fields (FeN\n                    4\n                    ZnN\n                    3\n                    TMN\n                    4\n                    ). Leveraging electron synergy and spatial functional decoupling among heterometallic sites, the optimized FeZnMn‐TACs exhibit exceptional ORR performance (\n                    E\n                    1/2 \n                    = 0.93 V versus RHE) and ultra‐long stability (Δ\n                    E\n                    1/2\n                     = 24 mV after 90,000 cycles). Through operando X‐ray absorption fine structure and spin‐polarized density functional theory, we unveil the scalability of a ternary synergy encompassing dynamic reconstruction, charge compensation and spin‐state transition, clarifying the roles of electron donors at the ZnN\n                    3\n                    sites and proton supply at MnN\n                    4\n                    sites. Dynamic FeN\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    C\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    evolution triggers a spin‐state transition from medium spin (MS = 1.5) to low spin (LS = 1.0), accompanied by the\n                    \n                      d\n                      xz\n                    \n                    /\n                    \n                      d\n                      yz\n                    \n                    orbital occupancy degree from 50% to 100%. As a consequence, we synergize the dual optimization of *OOH formation and *OH desorption in PCET. Moreover, our work atomically deciphers the spin redistribution mechanism driven by dynamic reconstruction, establishing a new paradigm for designing self‐adaptive electrocatalysts that ultimately unify ultrahigh activity with operational stability."},{"t":"动态氢键介导多孔芳香笼刺激响应手性诱导与多色手性余辉","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519866?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔芳香笼手性","kp":["[手性多孔笼]: 动态氢键介导刺激响应手性诱导","特性[有机笼薄膜]: 多色手性余辉"],"as":"生物手性起源是基础科学长期未解之谜。本研究在多孔芳香框架材料中引入动态氢键相互作用，实现刺激响应型的手性诱导与调控。通过外部分子识别或环境刺激触发氢键网络重组，使非手性骨架自发形成手性螺旋或超结构。该体系为理解生物手性涌现机制提供了人工模型，同时在手性分离、不对称催化及手性传感领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic H‐Bonding Mediates Stimuli‐Responsive Chiral Induction in Porous Aromatic Cages with Multicolor Chiral Afterglow","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The origin of biological chirality remains a fundamental scientific mystery. Developing artificial systems with on‐off responsive chiral induction and transfer, and elucidating their mechanisms, is of paramount importance. Here, we report the first pair of chiral porous organic cage (\n                    R/S\n                    ‐\n                    BA‐PAC\n                    ) exhibiting unprecedented chiral afterglow in a film state, boosting a remarkable lifetime of 1.2 s and a dissymmetry factor (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of 0.001. Loading rhodamine B (RB) guest molecules enables multicolor afterglow ranging from green to red, achieving 88% energy transfer. Notably, the confined RB displays a pronounced mirror‐imaged circular dichroism signal, and the induced chirality of RB demonstrates completely reversible on‐off switching under water vapor/thermal stimulation, which is extremely rare in covalent porous materials. Experimental and theoretical studies have shown that the distortion of the benzoic acid moiety in RB is caused by hydrogen‐bonding interactions between benzoic acid group and the\n                    BA‐PAC\n                    . This distortion disrupts the electric‐magnetic dipole moment orthogonality of RB, inducing its chirality. Furthermore, the reversible disruption and reconstruction of the host–guest hydrogen‐bonding network induced by external stimuli is a key mechanism for dynamic chiral transfer. This study bridges chiral induction and stimuli response in porous cages, providing a versatile biomimetic platform for investigating molecular‐level dynamic chirality transfer."},{"t":"环状镓磷烯L(OCP)GaPGaL对氨和水的双重E─H键活化","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525581?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"环状镓磷烯L(PCO)GaPGaL（L为β-二亚胺配体）被证实可选择性活化氨和水分子中的E─H键（N─H和O─H）。该化合物利用环内Ga-P交替结构产生的极性键与路易斯酸碱协同作用，实现双重键断裂。这一发现拓展了主族元素化合物在小分子活化领域的应用范围，为合成氨替代路径及水裂解催化剂设计提供了新的分子策略参考。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"主族化合物键活化","kp":["[双E-H键活化]: 环状镓磷烯室温活化NH₃和H₂O的N-H/O-H键"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Double E─H Bond Activation of Ammonia and Water by Cyclic Gallaphosphene L(OCP)GaPGaL","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Cyclic gallaphosphene L(PCO)GaPGaL\n                    1\n                    (L = HC[C(Me)NAr]\n                    2\n                    ; Ar = 2,6‐\n                    i\n                    ‐Pr\n                    2\n                    ‐C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    3\n                    ) selectively reacts with NH\n                    3\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O at ambient temperature with twofold N─H and O─H bond activation and formation of compounds LGa(μ‐PH)(μ‐NHC(O)PH)GaL\n                    2\n                    and LGa(μ‐PH)(μ‐OC(O)PH)GaL\n                    3\n                    . Both nucleophilic P atoms of\n                    1\n                    are protonated in these reactions, while the electrophilic carbon atom of the bridging PCO unit binds to the remaining NH group / O atom. The formation of heterocycles\n                    2\n                    and\n                    3\n                    , which were characterized by heteronuclear NMR (\n                    1\n                    H,\n                    13\n                    C{\n                    1\n                    H},\n                    31\n                    P{\n                    1\n                    H}) and IR spectroscopy, elemental analysis, and single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (sc‐XRD), is only possible due to a beneficial interplay between the polar Ga─P double bond and the electrophilic nature of the C center in the bridging PCO unit. The reaction mechanism and energetics of the NH\n                    3\n                    reaction was investigated in detail by quantum chemical calculations, which also highlight the importance of bimolecular reaction processes with the involvement of an additional NH\n                    3\n                    molecule."},{"t":"拆除坏死性凋亡引擎：治疗溃疡性结肠炎的口腔治疗纳米海绵","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516297?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ulcerative Colitis (UC) treatments often lack target specificity and have significant side effects. A key pathological driver is the excessive necroptosis of intestinal epithelial cells (IECs), which disrupts the gut barrier. To address this, we designed an intelligent oral theranostic nanoplatform, CurN@I, to dismantle the necroptosis‐inflammation axis. CurN@I consists of a barium sulfate (BaSO\n                    4\n                    ) core for computed tomography (CT) imaging, encapsulated within a pH‐responsive silk protein nanosponge. This scaffold is co‐loaded with a necroptosis inhibitor (Necrostatin‐1s, Nec‐1s) and an antioxidant (demethoxycurcumin, DMC). The nanostructure is condensed in the acidic stomach but swells at the neutral pH of the inflamed intestine for localized drug release. Its negative surface charge facilitates durable electrostatic adhesion to the inflamed mucosa. In murine UC models, oral CurN@I significantly outperformed first‐line clinical drugs. Mechanistic analysis showed it inhibits IEC necroptosis, alleviates oxidative stress, promotes barrier regeneration, and reshapes the gut microbiome. This work presents a non‐invasive, targeted oral strategy that integrates diagnosis with multi‐faceted therapy to restore intestinal homeostasis, demonstrating strong potential for clinical translation.","tp":"纳米治疗海绵","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种针对溃疡性结肠炎（UC）的新型智能口服治疗纳米平台。传统疗法缺乏靶向性且副作用明显，而肠道上皮细胞过度坏死性凋亡是破坏肠道屏障的关键病理因素。研究设计了核心为硫酸钡的纳米海绵，旨在精准拆除坏死性凋亡与炎症轴。该平台有效提升了治疗的靶向特异性，为缓解肠道屏障受损和炎症反应提供了极具潜力的创新治疗策略。"},{"t":"面向决策的学习与数据驱动鲁棒优化集成用于能量管理","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020732?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源管理决策优化","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Decision-focused learning integrated with data-driven robust optimization for energy management"},{"t":"DNA折纸模板适体手性结构实现细胞对映选择性","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519007?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chirality refers to handedness as left‐ or right‐handed form of a molecule or molecular construct by synthesis or self‐assembly. In biology, chirality plays critical roles in determining the structures and functions of biomolecules such as proteins. In this study, we demonstrated that structural chirality generated by patterning multiple cell surface protein biomarker‐binding aptamers on a tubular‐shaped DNA origami (“DNA tube”) can realize differentness in cellular interaction, nanostructure uptake, cancer drug delivery, and consequent cell killing. Formation of the DNA tube and its ability to arrange external elements into left‐ or right‐handed form have been characterized by gel electrophoresis, atomic force microscopy, and transmission electron microscopy. Our fluorescence‐based cell experiments showed that the DNA tube‐templated aptamers of a left‐handed pattern can yield a higher cell uptake than those in a right‐form pattern. When loaded with an anticancer drug, Daunorubicin (Dau), the left‐handed tube‐aptamer‐Dau construct showed greater than double the cancer cell cytotoxicity than the construct in the right‐handed. Our study not only revealed that cell surface proteins interaction with the aptamers spatially organized into different chiral patterns can yield different cellular interaction and internalization efficiencies, but offered a new and versatile cancer drug delivery strategy for enhanced target cell treatment efficacy."},{"t":"卷曲螺旋异二聚体介导的分裂碱基编辑系统可实现灵活且稳健的核苷酸取代","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68469-2","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Base editors (BEs) enable precise base substitutions, but their size exceeds the packaging capacity of adeno-associated virus (AAV), impeding in vivo applications. Here we design a split BE system that recruits deaminases to Cas9 nickase via coiled-coil heterodimers, resulting in various coiled-coil heterodimers-mediated base editors (CC-BEs), including cytidine base editor (CC-CBE), adenine base editor (CC-ABE), and their derivatives. We reveal that CC-BEs maintain and even improve the editing efficiency of the original unsplit BEs across various cell types and editing scopes, achieving maximum enhancements of 9.6-fold in human immortalized cells and 12.4-fold in primary somatic cells for CC-CBE. Using CC-ABE, we validate in vivo editing efficiency and successfully achieve A-to-G conversion in the Pcsk9 and Dmd genes via dual-AAV vectors in mice. Altogether, we develop a simple and universal strategy to address the challenges posed by the large size of BEs without compromising editing efficiency for base substitutions in vivo.","tp":"碱基编辑系统","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究开发了一种基于卷曲螺旋异二聚体的分裂碱基编辑系统，旨在解决传统碱基编辑器尺寸过大、难以被腺相关病毒（AAV）有效包装的问题。研究通过卷曲螺旋异二聚体将脱氨酶招募至Cas9切口酶，成功构建了多种碱基编辑器及其衍生物。实验表明，该系统不仅解决了递送载体容量限制，还能在维持甚至提升基因编辑效率的同时，实现灵活且稳健的精准核苷酸替换。","aip":1},{"t":"化学蛋白质组学鉴定了生酮介导的半胱氨酸修饰调节氧化还原功能","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519830?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  All the studies of ketogenesis‐dependent post‐translational modifications (PTMs), notably those mediated by ketone bodies, β‐hydroxybutyrate (Bhb) and acetoacetate (Acac), have focused on lysine acylations. However, given the chemically diverse and reactive nature of metabolites generated, it remains unclear whether non‐lysine modifications can also happen. Here, we develop an acetoacetate‐alkyne (Acac‐alkyne) chemical probe that enables efficient metabolic labeling, robust fluorescent visualization, and site‐specific identification of Acac‐modified proteins. By combining chemical proteomics with open‐search strategy, we showed that Acac induces previously uncharacterized cysteine modifications in mammalian cells. Notably, cysteine crotonation (Ccr) is validated by employing both probe‐based and standard peptide‐based co‐elution assays. Metabolic pathway tracing further identifies BDH1 and ECHS1 as key enzymes that generate Ccr formation. We further demonstrate that Ccr at PRDX3 C229 site impairs dimerization and redox activity, linking this newly discovered modification to the regulation of cellular reactive oxygen species. Together, these findings establish ketone metabolism as a novel source of cysteine modifications and provide an alternative mechanistic pathway to explain the profound biological effects of ketone bodies.","tp":"化学蛋白质组学","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究开发了一种新型化学探针，用于探索生酮依赖的翻译后修饰机制。以往研究多聚焦于酮体介导的赖氨酸酰化修饰，而本研究突破了这一局限，利用乙酰乙酸炔烃探针实现了高效的代谢标记。该探针成功揭示了生酮代谢过程中由酮体介导的非赖氨酸修饰——特别是对半胱氨酸的修饰作用，并阐明了这种修饰在调节细胞氧化还原功能方面的重要角色，为代谢调控研究提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"双金属包覆构建界面微环境实现锌金属电池高可逆粉末负极","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518003?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池粉末负极","kp":["策略[锌粉负极]: 双金属包覆调控界面微环境","[锌粉负极]: 匹配Zn2+扩散与电子传输"],"as":"该研究针对水系锌电池中锌粉负极界面不稳定的问题，提出双金属包覆（bimetallic cladding）策略构建稳定的界面微环境。锌粉负极在充放电循环中面临枝晶生长、副反应及界面腐蚀等挑战，导致库仑效率低和循环寿命差。通过在锌粉表面构筑双金属合金包覆层，优化了界面离子分布与电场分布，抑制了不可逆的副反应并促进均匀的锌沉积/溶解。该策略显著提升了锌粉基水系电池的可逆性与长循环稳定性，为高安全、低成本储能电池的工程化提供了新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bimetallic Cladding‐Constructed Interfacial Microenvironment Enabled Highly Reversible Powder Anode for Zn Metal Batteri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The unstable interface of metal powder anode remains a challenge to achieve long‐life Zn powder‐based aqueous zinc metal batteries (AZMBs). However, most reported metal composite strategies still suffer from a mismatch between Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion and electron transfer behaviors. Here, a bimetallic cladding strategy with a specific displacement sequence was proposed. Except for inheriting intrinsic advantages of Sn and Cu, the opposite EDL charge distribution of Cu to Zn compensates for the anion adsorption, inhibiting the ZSH‐related side reactions. Moreover, abundant in situ constructed surface SnO\n                    2\n                    voids could accommodate stripped Zn\n                    2+\n                    to avoid disordered diffusion, providing a shorter diffusion distance for the electron acceptance by Zn\n                    2+\n                    instead of H\n                    +\n                    . Based on the matched electron and ion transport behaviors, the Zn@SC anode exhibited excellent cycle stability of over 2800 h in Zn||Zn cells at 1 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    –5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    , and achieved an areal capacity of 2 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    in Zn||NH\n                    4\n                    V\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    cells at 3 A g\n                    −1\n                    and 70% capacity retention after 1000 cycles. As a practical validation, the pouch cell based on Zn@SC anode and high mass‐loaded cathode (10.05 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) also exhibits satisfactory cycle stability. This work emphasized the importance of the interfacial microenvironment on the electrochemical performances and provided valuable direction of multi‐metal Zn powder anode.","aip":1},{"t":"基于数据驱动场景生成的数据中心电-热-算耦合系统双层规划","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心规划","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation"},{"t":"Af-CUT&Tag：一种使用基因编码标签和高亲和力双标记的灵敏且无抗体的染色质分析方法","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68454-9","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional chromatin profiling techniques are often limited by antibody availability and performance. Here, we introduce Af-CUT&Tag, a target antibody-free method that overcomes these limitations by using CRISPR-integrated peptide tags (HiBiT/ALFA-tag) recognized by engineered binders (LgBiT/NbALFA) fused to a Tn5 transposase. Af-CUT&Tag eliminates dependence on traditional target antibodies, achieving robust specificity and sensitivity with as few as 500 cells. It provides high-quality chromatin profiles, with improved signal-to-noise ratios and library quality compared with conventional antibody-based counterparts, while also enabling single-cell resolution (scAf-CUT&Tag). Applying Af-CUT&Tag to Hippo effectors (YAP1/TAZ) during liver regeneration reveals dynamic chromatin remodeling, including YAP1/TAZ-mediated control of lipid metabolism (e.g., Lpin1, Fasn) and heme clearance (Hpx, Trf). We further identify miR-122 as a critical regulator of these processes, impacting liver regeneration. The versatility of Af-CUT&Tag in cell lines, bulk tissues, and single nuclei establishes it as a powerful tool for studying gene regulation in development, disease, and regeneration.","tp":"无抗体染色质","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究提出了一种名为Af-CUT&Tag的创新染色质分析方法。传统染色质分析技术常受限于抗体的可用性与性能表现。新技术通过使用CRISPR整合的短肽标签，结合与Tn5转座酶融合的工程化结合蛋白，彻底摆脱了对传统目标抗体的依赖。该方法在仅需500个细胞的极低样本量下即可展现高特异性与灵敏度，能够提供高质量的染色质图谱，为表观遗传学研究提供了强大的工具。"},{"t":"质子交换膜电解槽析氧用耐酸钌基固溶体","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解水析氧","kp":["催化剂[PEM电解槽OER]: RuZrCoCrCeO2固溶体","优势[非铱OER]: 酸稳定+高活性","合成[Ru基固溶体]: 模板导向MOF衍生"],"as":"针对质子交换膜（PEM）水电解制氢中析氧反应（OER）催化剂在强酸性环境下易腐蚀失活的瓶颈，开发了一种新型钌基固溶体催化剂。该材料在保持高催化活性的同时显著提升了酸稳定性，有望延长PEM电解槽寿命，推动绿氢规模化生产成本下降。","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Acid‐Stable Ruthenium‐Based Solid Solution for Oxygen Evolution in Proton Exchange Membrane Electrolyzers","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Proton exchange membrane (PEM) water electrolysis offers a promising route for green hydrogen production, yet balancing catalytic activity and durability remains challenging for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) catalysts in acid, particularly for non‐Ir‐based catalysts. Herein, we develop a template‐guided strategy to synthesize the metal–organic framework (MOF)‐derived RuZrCoCrCeO\n                    2\n                    solid solution with tunable multi‐metal heteroatom regulation. The catalyst demonstrates outstanding acidic OER performance, requiring only 179 mV overpotential to achieve 10 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    and remarkable durability over 1500 h at 50 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    with a negligible decay of 30.67 µV h\n                    −1\n                    . An “electronic buffer” effect facilitates electron transfer from atomically dispersed Zr to Ru, forming asymmetric Ru─O─Zr bonds with enhanced metal–oxygen covalency, thereby preventing excessive oxidation of Ru species. A vicinal deprotonation mechanism was proposed, where lattice oxygen assists *OOH deprotonation with a lower energy barrier on Ru─O─M sites. A PEM electrolyzer with low Ru loading (0.37 mg\n                    Ru\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ) achieves an industrial‐level current density of 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.66 V, corresponding to a low hydrogen cost of US$0.89 kg\n                    −1\n                    below the US DOE target (US$2 per kg of H\n                    2\n                    ), and operates stably for 600 h at 200 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its practical potential for scalable, Ir‐free PEM electrolyzers."},{"t":"预测空气源热泵瞬态性能的降阶模型","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000644?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空气源热泵降阶建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A reduced-order model for predicting transient performance of air-source heat pumps"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风-水混合发电系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"风光水电站竞价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid pow"},{"t":"水电解槽剩余使用寿命预测综述：从退化机制到预测方法","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电解槽寿命预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic"},{"t":"具有高静态介电常数的固态两性离子塑性晶体","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517774?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"两性离子塑料晶体","kp":["材料[高介电常数]: 咪唑鎓基两性离子塑料晶体","结构[两性离子]: 长程有序+弱分子间力"],"as":"本研究开发了一种具有高静态介电常数的固态两性离子塑性晶体材料。高介电常数固态材料在储能领域具有广泛应用前景。该材料利用两性离子结构中正负电荷共存的特性，在晶格中形成强偶极矩，实现高介电响应。与传统液态电解质相比，该固态晶体兼具高介电性能与结构稳定性，有望在固态电容器、能量存储器件及柔性电子中获得应用。研究为设计新型高介电固态材料提供了分子层面的设计策略。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Solid State Zwitterionic Plastic Crystal With High Static Dielectric Constant","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solid materials with a high dielectric constant have a wide range of applications in the energy storage field. In this research, an imidazolium‐based zwitterion is designed, synthesized, and confirmed to have a plastic crystal phase based on the following experimental and computational evidence: (i) the presence of long‐range order with weak intermolecular forces and competing attractive‐repulsive interactions along different crystallographic directions; (ii) the observation of more than one endotherm on heating including a solid‐solid phase transition at T\n                    s‐s\n                    = −26 °C and melting of the plastic crystal at T\n                    m\n                    = 72°C; (iii) a low entropy of fusion at melting (2.1 JK\n                    −1\n                    mol\n                    −1\n                    ); (iv) a strongly anisotropic morphology; (v) relatively fast dynamics originating from short‐range degrees of freedom. Furthermore, it exhibits a very high dielectric constant in the plastic crystal solid state (147 at −10°C and 103 at 70°C) due to the rotational degrees of freedom of plastic crystals that arise from weak net intermolecular interactions of zwitterions due to only having two carbons between the anion and cation. This material conveniently remains in the plastic crystal phase within 50 K of ambient temperature. This discovery opens new opportunities in the search for solid‐state high dielectric constant materials."},{"t":"应变工程VO2中隐藏的光致相变路径","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517123?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二氧化钒相变","kp":["[应变工程VO2]: 发现光致隐藏相变路径","体系[光致相变]: VO2绝缘体-金属转变"],"as":"本研究在应变工程化的二氧化钒（VO₂）中发现了一条隐藏的光致相变路径。光激发可将量子材料驱动至非平衡态，为探索新物态提供了途径。通过施加应变调控VO₂的晶格自由度，研究人员利用超快光谱观测到不同于常规绝缘体-金属相变的新型动力学过程。该隐藏路径揭示了应变与光场协同作用下电子-晶格耦合的新机制，对开发超快光控开关、相变存储器及量子功能器件具有重要指导意义。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"A Hidden Photoinduced Phase‐Transition Pathway in Strain‐Engineered VO2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photoexcitation provides a versatile route to drive quantum materials into nonequilibrium states, opening opportunities for phase engineering beyond conventional tuning parameters such as temperature, magnetic field, pressure, or chemical doping/substitution. VO\n                    2\n                    , a prototypical correlated oxide, has long served as a model system for understanding photoinduced insulator–metal transitions, yet the sequence of structural and electronic transitions remains intensely debated. Here, we uncover a hidden photoinduced transition pathway in epitaxially strained VO\n                    2\n                    thin films, in which the structural transition precedes the electronic insulator–metal transition, reversing the canonical temporal order. Femtosecond X‐ray diffraction reveals a transient structural state characterized by the disappearance of vanadium dimers generating dynamic tensile strain, while time‐resolved terahertz spectroscopy shows that the electronic gap closes only after the strain relaxation. This lattice‐driven transition highlights the pivotal role of Mott correlations in dictating electronic properties under nonequilibrium conditions. Our findings establish strain–light coupling as a design principle for ultrafast control of phase transitions, offering new avenues for reconfigurable electronic and photonic devices based on correlated oxides.","aip":1},{"t":"用于免压固态锂电池的梯度纳米畴高熵聚合物电解质带","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵聚合物电解质","kp":["电解质[无压固态锂电]: 三相高熵聚合物电解质带","结构[HEPE]: 梯度纳米畴控制"],"as":"本研究提出一种梯度纳米畴高熵聚合物电解质带（Tape），用于无压固态电池。高熵聚合物电解质因其可调控的离子传输通道和优异界面兼容性备受关注。该设计通过构建梯度纳米畴结构，使锂离子在电解质内部实现高效定向传输，同时高熵组分赋予材料优异的机械柔韧性和界面接触性能，从而在无需外部堆叠压力的条件下实现稳定的固态电池循环。该策略为全固态电池的无压化运行和可规模化制造提供了新思路。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A Gradient Nanodomain High‐Entropy Polymer Electrolyte Tape for Pressure‐Free Solid‐State Lithium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy polymer electrolytes (HEPE) have attracted significant attention owing to their exceptional design flexibility in properties and thin‐film processability. However, building high‐performance HEPE with well controlled nanodomains of multi‐components remains a critical challenge due to serious microphase separation. Here, we report a tri‐phase high‐entropy polymer electrolyte (HEPE) tape featuring ultrafine soft‐rigid gradient nanodomains approaching the single‐chain length scale, to achieve notable simultaneous enhancements in mechanical, electrochemical, and interfacial properties. The HEPE is realized through Li\n                    +\n                    ‐bond‐regulated nanophase separation of polyethylene oxide (PEO), poly (methyl methacrylate) (PMMA), and polyvinylidene fluoride‐co‐hexafluoropropylene (PVFH), leading to high‐entropy microstructures at the levels of chain conformation and phase domains. Consequently, the HEPE exhibits a high room‐temperature ionic conductivity of 0.24 mS∙cm\n                    −1\n                    , exceptional mechanical properties (strength of 22.1 ± 2.3 MPa, toughness of 87.7 MJ∙m\n                    −3\n                    , elastic recovery of 66.7%), and interfacial adhesion toughness of 325 ± 15 N∙m\n                    −2\n                    . Benefitting from these properties, the HEPE can generate physico‐electrochemical synergistic effects on stabilizing the lithium metal anode with a long cycling life of 750 h at 0.1 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    . The resultant solid‐state Li|HEPE|NCM811 cell delivers a high capacity of 205.5 mAh∙g\n                    −1\n                    even without stack pressure. This study indicates a promising high‐entropy tri‐component mixing strategy for the design and fabrication of HEPEs."},{"t":"膳食碳水化合物与脂肪比例对代谢组学特征的与体重无关的影响：为期 5 个月的随机对照喂养试验的次要结果","d":"2026-01-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68353-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Diet plays a crucial role in health, with low-carbohydrate diets often proposed to exert metabolic benefits. We aim to investigate metabolomic adaptations in 164 adults with overweight or obesity who were randomly assigned to high- (n = 54), moderate- (n = 53), or low-carbohydrate (n = 57) diets during a 20-week weight-loss maintenance phase of the Framingham State Food Study [(FS)2], a controlled, parallel feeding trial (ClinicalTrials.gov: NCT02068885). We measure fasting plasma metabolites by liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry using samples from 147 participants who completed the study (n = 45, 48, and 54 in the high-, moderate-, and low-carbohydrate diet groups, respectively). Significant associations (False Discovery Rate"},{"t":"面向高湿环境实用化超长寿命锂空气电池：双界面工程协同策略","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂空气电池界面工程","kp":["应用[锂空气电池]: 高湿环境超长循环","[策略]: 双界面工程","介导剂[自防御]: SnCl₄+1,8-二碘辛烷"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"针对锂-空气电池在高湿环境下空气正极和锂负极双侧界面退化的问题，提出协同双界面工程策略。在空气正极侧构建疏水涂层抑制水分侵入同时保持氧扩散通道；在锂负极侧引入人工SEI层阻止水汽腐蚀和枝晶生长。该双界面协同策略使Li-air电池在相对湿度>60%的环境中实现超长循环寿命，显著提升了开放空气环境下Li-air电池的实用性。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward Practical Ultralong‐Life Li‐Air Batteries in High‐Humidity Environments: A Synergistic Strategy for Dual‐Interfacial Engineering","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Maintaining the operational stability of Li–air batteries (LABs) in high‐humidity environments is crucial for their transition from laboratory research to practical deployment. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy for dual‐interfacial engineering toward ultralong‐life LABs in high‐humidity environments. An iodine‐based self‐defense redox mediator—SnCl\n                    4\n                    and 1,8‐diiodooctane (DIO) is introduced into the electrolyte. On the cathode side, it enabled efficient bidirectional OER/ORR catalysis while forming a protective interface that suppressed both nucleophilic and hydrolytic attack. On the anode side, a highly lithiophilic, corrosion‐resistant, and moisture‐tolerant protective layer forms on the Li anode, which ensures stable battery operation under extremely humid conditions. The results show that the Li─O\n                    2\n                    battery achieved more than 2400 cycles (nearly 3000 h) at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and an extremely low charge potential (&lt;3.5 V), coupled with a high discharge capacity of 111879 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Notably, the SnCl\n                    4\n                    /DIO‐based LABs reached more than 1800 cycles (&gt;2160 h) even in atmospheric air without humidity control. This work significantly overcomes the strict humidity limits of traditional LABs and provides an innovative strategy for developing LABs capable of operating in high‐humidity environments."},{"t":"工业机器人的绿色和棕色一面：创新、人工智能驱动的专利、能源政策干预和排放动态","d":"2026-01-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600011X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"机器人碳排","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"深海风力发电机最新综述：安装、成本、不稳定性、流致振荡、失效、维护与电力成本","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000139?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"深海风电","kp":["[综述]: 深海风机(安装/成本/失效/维护)"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"State-of-the-art review of deep-sea wind turbine: installation, cost, instability, flow-induced oscillation, failure, maintenance, and power cost"},{"t":"磷酸酯修饰受体添加剂实现有机太阳能电池垂直形貌与界面工程协同调控，效率逼近21%","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519367?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["PCE[有机太阳能电池]: 接近21%","[分子工程]: L8-BO受体引入磷酸酯基团","[双重调控]: 垂直形貌与界面能级同步优化"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对非富勒烯受体(NFA)有机太阳能电池中垂直相分离形貌不均和界面非辐射复合损失的问题，开发磷酸酯修饰的受体添加剂。该添加剂通过表面能梯度驱动活性层内给体/受体分子的垂直梯度分布优化，同时在电极界面形成偶极层钝化缺陷。协同形貌与界面工程使器件效率逼近21%，同时显著提升光照和热稳定性，为OSC商业化提供了简单有效的添加剂策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Phosphate Ester‐Modified Acceptor Additives Enable Concurrent Vertical Morphology and Interfacial Engineering for Organic Solar Cells Approaching 21% Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic solar cells (OSCs) based on non‐fullerene acceptors (NFAs) have progressed rapidly, yet further gains are constrained by coupled challenges in vertical morphology control and energy alignment at the acceptor–cathode interface. Here, a molecular engineering strategy is presented that installs strongly polar phosphate ester groups onto the inner alkyl chains of the benchmark NFA L8‐BO, yielding two derivatives—1POE and 2POE. Employed as non‐volatile solid additives during layer‐by‐layer processing, these molecules induce vertical composition redistribution to form a graded donor–acceptor–additive architecture. The resulting vertical profiling strengthens intermolecular interactions, raises surface energy, and drives additive accumulation near the top interface, thereby improving interfacial energetics and facilitating electron extraction. Consequently, devices incorporating 2 wt.% 1POE or 2POE deliver power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 19.87% and 19.28%, respectively, versus 18.83% for controls, alongside enhanced operational stability. The strategy shows strong universality across multiple blends, achieving a PCE of 20.90% in a D18/L8‐BO:BTP‐eC9FCl ternary system. These results demonstrate that precise phosphate ester–based additive design enables concurrent optimization of vertical phase distribution and interfacial energetics, offering a practical route to high‐efficiency, stable OSCs."},{"t":"优化玻璃态水系无机盐电解质中综合离子效应用于极低温超级电容器","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518352?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗冻盐电解质","kp":["电解质[超低温超级电容器]: 玻璃形成型水系无机盐","[离子效应]: 综合考虑离子类型/浓度/水合数"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"系统研究了玻璃态水系无机盐电解质中多种离子的综合效应对超级电容器极端低温性能的影响。通过调控多组分无机盐(如LiCl/ZnCl2/Li acetate等)的混合比例，利用Hofmeister效应和玻璃化转变温度调控，构建了在-80°C以下仍保持液态和高离子电导率的电解液。研究揭示了阳离子-阴离子协同对水分子氢键网络的破坏机制，使超级电容器在极低温环境中保持高容量和长循环寿命。","dp":1,"ot":"Optimizing the Comprehensive Ion Effects in Glass‐Forming Aqueous Inorganic Salt Electrolytes for Supercapacitor Applications at Extremely Low Temperatures","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Inorganic salt electrolytes have been explored for developing cold‐resistant aqueous energy storage devices. Current research on anti‐freezing inorganic salt solutions mainly focuses on the H‐bond regulation effects of individual cations or anions. The overall ionic effects (e.g., ion type, concentrations, cation hydration numbers, ion interactions, and ionic associations, etc.) on the anti‐freezing properties lack a comprehensive understanding. In addition, crystallization of the salt electrolyte below the solidification point can lead to an abrupt performance failure of the energy storage device. In this work, we study the overall ionic effects of glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes for enhancing their anti‐freezing properties. It is found that ion pairs with more positive cationic potentials and less negative anionic potentials, cations with large coordination numbers, and anions with large ionic size and multiple H‐bond sites are crucial for achieving glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes with exceptional anti‐freezing performance. Notably, the Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    eutectic electrolyte exhibits a pure glass transition at −122°C and maintains a visible liquid state at −85°C. A supercapacitor cell with a Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    electrolyte is operational at temperatures as low as −80°C. This study provides insightful understandings for designing glass‐forming anti‐freezing electrolytes with improved adaptability of aqueous energy storage devices under extremely cold conditions."},{"t":"通过空间位阻与螯合作用对电子传输层进行分子工程以实现稳定反式钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521878?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面","kp":["[电子传输层]: 新型富勒烯衍生物2Py","[策略]: 空间位阻与螯合协同","[应用]: 倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"针对倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池中富勒烯(C60/PCBM)电子传输层的热稳定性和界面降解问题，通过分子工程策略引入空间位阻和螯合基团修饰ETL材料。位阻基团抑制了富勒烯分子聚集，螯合官能团与钙钛矿表面未配位Pb2+形成配位键钝化缺陷，协同提升了ETL薄膜形貌稳定性和界面电荷提取效率。修饰后的倒置器件在效率和运行稳定性方面均显著改善，为高稳定性钙钛矿光伏组件提供了可行路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Electron Transport Layers via Steric Hindrance and Chelation Toward Stable Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fullerene derivatives, such as C\n                    60\n                    and PCBM, are widely used as electron transport layers (ETLs) in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) due to their high electron mobility and well‐aligned energy levels. However, their poor photo‐thermal stability and weak interactions with perovskite limit further progress. To address these challenges, we develop a novel fullerene derivative, 2Py, as the ETL for inverted PSCs via a synergistic strategy combining steric hindrance modulation and chelation group incorporation. This molecule delivers three key benefits: moderate steric hindrance inhibits ETL aggregation during thermal aging; chelation groups enhance interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer; and improved hydrophilicity promotes uniform SnO\n                    x\n                    film growth via atomic layer deposition (ALD). 2Py ETL enables an efficiency of 26.07% for inverted PSCs based on a 1.55‐eV bandgap. Wide‐bandgap (1.80 eV) and narrow‐bandgap (1.25 eV) PSCs achieve efficiencies of 19.94% and 24.06%, respectively. Notably, these devices demonstrate exceptional photo‐thermal stability, achieving T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1080 h under 85°C heating and T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1250 h under maximum power point tracking at 45°C, outperforming PCBM‐based devices. This molecular design strategy paves new pathways for enhancing ETL performance and stability in inverted PSCs."},{"t":"锰配位多价适体系统 (COMPASS) 实现 DC 靶向 mRNA/Mn2+ 共递送用于癌症免疫治疗","d":"2026-01-19","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519216?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    mRNA vaccines hold remarkable promise for cancer immunotherapy, yet current nanoparticle systems face challenges in efficacy, dendritic cell (DC) targeting, and safety. Herein, we report a nanoplatform, Manganese‐Coordinated Polyvalent Aptameric System (COMPASS), enabling targeted co‐delivery of mRNA and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    to lymph node dendritic cells (DC) to boost potent antitumor immunity. The COMPASS employed rolling circle amplification to generate single‐stranded DNA scaffolds with multivalent DC‐targeting aptamers and polyT domains, enabling stable mRNA hybridization via A‐T pairing. Various metal ions were screened, and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    was found to enhance mRNA endosomal escape and activate the STING pathway in DCs, promoting their maturation and antigen presentation. Controlled nanoparticle size (∼200 nm) and aptamer‐mediated DC targeting markedly enhanced lymphatic accumulation. In vivo evaluations revealed that COMPASS achieved potent prophylactic and therapeutic antitumor efficacy comparable to commercial LNPs (e.g., SM‐102), while exhibiting significantly enhanced safety profiles. Importantly, lyophilized COMPASS formulations retained their structural integrity and bioactivity for at least three months at room temperature. Overall, COMPASS represents a promising next‐generation nanoplatform with significant translational potential for safe and effective cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"锰配位递送","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"针对mRNA癌症疫苗面临的靶向性和安全性挑战，研究人员开发了一种名为COMPASS的锰配位多价适体纳米平台。该系统能够将mRNA和锰离子精准共递送至淋巴结树突状细胞（DC），有效激发强效的抗肿瘤免疫反应。此项技术突破了现有纳米载体的效能瓶颈，展现出在癌症免疫治疗领域的巨大临床应用潜力。"},{"t":"地缘政治分裂和能源转型不平等：气候政策不确定性、制裁以及石油和天然气行业","d":"2026-01-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005555?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"基于显微成像技术的电极微观结构驱动多尺度特征融合框架用于锂离子电池健康估计","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000504?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电极微观健康评估","kp":["[电池健康估计]: 电极微结构多尺度特征融合框架"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Electrode microstructure-driven multi-scale feature fusion framework based on microscopic imaging technique for health estimate of lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"双金属包覆构建界面微环境实现锌金属电池高可逆粉末负极","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518003?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌金属电池粉末负极","kp":["[锌粉负极界面]: 双金属包覆构建特定置换序列界面微环境","[解决难题]: 匹配Zn²⁺扩散与电子转移行为实现高可逆"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"针对锌金属粉末负极界面不稳定、循环寿命短的问题，该研究构建双金属包覆结构调控界面微环境，实现锌粉末负极的高度可逆性。通过双金属层抑制枝晶生长与副反应，显著提升水系锌电池的库伦效率和循环稳定性，为可穿戴和储能用锌电池的粉末化电极设计提供可行路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Bimetallic Cladding‐Constructed Interfacial Microenvironment Enabled Highly Reversible Powder Anode for Zn Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The unstable interface of metal powder anode remains a challenge to achieve long‐life Zn powder‐based aqueous zinc metal batteries (AZMBs). However, most reported metal composite strategies still suffer from a mismatch between Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion and electron transfer behaviors. Here, a bimetallic cladding strategy with a specific displacement sequence was proposed. Except for inheriting intrinsic advantages of Sn and Cu, the opposite EDL charge distribution of Cu to Zn compensates for the anion adsorption, inhibiting the ZSH‐related side reactions. Moreover, abundant in situ constructed surface SnO\n                    2\n                    voids could accommodate stripped Zn\n                    2+\n                    to avoid disordered diffusion, providing a shorter diffusion distance for the electron acceptance by Zn\n                    2+\n                    instead of H\n                    +\n                    . Based on the matched electron and ion transport behaviors, the Zn@SC anode exhibited excellent cycle stability of over 2800 h in Zn||Zn cells at 1 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    –5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    , and achieved an areal capacity of 2 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    in Zn||NH\n                    4\n                    V\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    cells at 3 A g\n                    −1\n                    and 70% capacity retention after 1000 cycles. As a practical validation, the pouch cell based on Zn@SC anode and high mass‐loaded cathode (10.05 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) also exhibits satisfactory cycle stability. This work emphasized the importance of the interfacial microenvironment on the electrochemical performances and provided valuable direction of multi‐metal Zn powder anode."},{"t":"基于数据驱动场景生成表征不确定性的电热算耦合系统数据中心双层规划","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000218?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心电热协同","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bi-level planning of data centers with coupled electricity-heat-computation system using data-driven scenario generation for representing uncertainties"},{"t":"Af-CUT&Tag：一种灵敏且无抗体的染色质分析方法，使用基因编码标签和与 Tn5 融合的高亲和力结合物","d":"2026-01-19","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68454-9","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Conventional chromatin profiling techniques are often limited by antibody availability and performance. Here, we introduce Af-CUT&Tag, a target antibody-free method that overcomes these limitations by using CRISPR-integrated peptide tags (HiBiT/ALFA-tag) recognized by engineered binders (LgBiT/NbALFA) fused to a Tn5 transposase. Af-CUT&Tag eliminates dependence on traditional target antibodies, achieving robust specificity and sensitivity with as few as 500 cells. It provides high-quality chromatin profiles, with improved signal-to-noise ratios and library quality compared with conventional antibody-based counterparts, while also enabling single-cell resolution (scAf-CUT&Tag). Applying Af-CUT&Tag to Hippo effectors (YAP1/TAZ) during liver regeneration reveals dynamic chromatin remodeling, including YAP1/TAZ-mediated control of lipid metabolism (e.g., Lpin1, Fasn) and heme clearance (Hpx, Trf). We further identify miR-122 as a critical regulator of these processes, impacting liver regeneration. The versatility of Af-CUT&Tag in cell lines, bulk tissues, and single nuclei establishes it as a powerful tool for studying gene regulation in development, disease, and regeneration.","tp":"染色质分析","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"传统染色质分析技术高度依赖抗体，常受限于抗体的可用性与性能。为此，研究团队开发了Af-CUT&Tag技术，这是一种无需靶标抗体的新型染色质分析方法。该技术利用基因编码标签与Tn5转座酶融合的结合物，实现了极高的特异性和灵敏度，仅需500个细胞即可获取高质量染色质图谱，大幅降低了研究门槛。"},{"t":"考虑实时运行特性与策略的风水混合电力系统日前竞价新方法","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000024?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场竞价","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel day-ahead bidding method considering real-time operational characteristic and strategy for wind-hydro hybrid power systems"},{"t":"水电解槽剩余使用寿命预测综述：从退化机制到预测模型","d":"2026-01-19","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261925020331?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"水电解槽寿命预测","kp":["[水电解槽寿命预测]: 从退化机制到预测模型综述"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"dp":1,"as":"","ot":"A critical review of remaining useful life prediction for water Electrolyzers: From degradation mechanisms to prognostic models"},{"t":"“排除的表型”限制了适应人口减少的遗传途径","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2507223123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Evolutionary rescue is the process by which declining populations adapt to conditions that would otherwise cause their extinction. Considering the spectrum of mutant phenotypes that can arise within a declining population, there exists the interesting case of mutations which improve fitness relative to the wild-type, but do not restore population growth. Here, we hypothesize that mutations within this phenotype space are functionally inaccessible to populations in decline and term it an “evolutionary excluded zone.” We experimentally demonstrate that this excluded zone disallows certain mutational paths from causing evolutionary rescue in declining populations of M13 bacteriophage. We then integrate this observation into Fisher’s Geometric Model to extrapolate it to other evolutionary rescue scenarios. Our findings indicate that the excluded zone significantly reduces the likelihood of evolutionary rescue by de novo mutation and that evolution is fundamentally different in declining populations than in ones that are constant or growing."},{"t":"\"无活性材料\"设计克服高能量密度全固态锂硫电池传质限制","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00420-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全固态锂硫电池","kp":["[全固态锂硫电池]: 无活性物质预载设计","策略[ASS Li-S]: 隐形宿主实现高效硫利用"],"sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"提出'无活性材料'设计策略解决全固态锂硫电池中固-固界面的传质限制问题，指出预载活性材料无法保证离子导体、电子导体与活性物质间有效三相接触，提出替代构型提升高能量密度。","ot":"“Active material-free” design to overcome mass-transport limitations for high-energy-density all-solid-state Li-S batter","b":"Artificially preloading active materials cannot guarantee effective three-phase contact, where the ionic conductors, electronic conductors, and active materials meet, making it difficult to achieve efficient sulfur utilization. In our design, the cathode contains no preloaded active material. Instead, it provides abundant interfaces between ionic and electronic conductors, allowing an “invisible hand” to drive the in situ formation of active materials at these interfaces. This design inherently maintains both ionic and electronic pathways, enabling high performance."},{"t":"[ASAP] 空气稳定铼配合物催化的炔烃开环复分解聚合","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19886","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"炔烃复分解聚合","kp":["催化剂[ROAMP]: 空气稳定d2 Re(V)烷基亚基预催化剂"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"报道了一种由空气稳定铼络合物催化的开环炔烃复分解聚合反应，突破了传统烯烃复分解聚合的底物范围限制，为新型聚合物合成提供实用催化体系。","ot":"[ASAP] Ring-Opening Alkyne Metathesis Polymerization Catalyzed by a Bench-Stable Rhenium Complex","b":"In the last quarter of a century, ring-opening alkene metathesis polymerization has revolutionized the ability to synthesize functional polymers. In comparison, current methods for ring-opening alkyne metathesis polymerization (ROAMP) remain constrained by a narrow scope of monomers and catalysts that are not user-friendly. Herein, we report that an air-stable d2 Re(V) alkylidyne precatalyst complex mediates ROAMP in a controlled fashion, even tolerating free hydroxyl groups in the monomer. This polymerization exhibits excellent control, with up to 700 degrees of polymerization of nonyne monomers with a low to moderate molecular weight dispersity. The metal can be cleaved from the polymer chain by means of cross-metathesis with commercially available phenylacetylenes. Additionally, this polymerization shows living character, which enables the preparation of block copolymers. These results highlight the potential of Re(V)-mediated polymerizations to enable a broader use of ROAMP for the synthesis of functional macromolecules."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过氧化还原操纵末端氢氧化铁亲核性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20166","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report changes in the reactivity profile of a high-spin, terminal ferrous hydroxo complex (EmL)Fe(OH) as a function of oxidation states (i.e., FeII/FeIII). The terminal, high-spin Fe-OH adducts were isolated within a sterically hindered dipyrrin ligand scaffold. In the ferrous state, (EmL)Fe(OH) exhibits nucleophilic reactivity toward carbon-based electrophiles (e.g., CS2, CO2, nitrile, isocyanate), highlighted by the reversible capture of CO2 to generate (EmL)Fe(κ2-O,O-HCO3) (ΔG° = -2.0 kcal/mol) both in solution and solid state as characterized by single-crystal X-ray crystallography, 57Fe Mössbauer spectroscopy, and IR spectroscopy. We probed the nucleophilic character of ferrous analogues with different terminal ligand motifs (X: -CH3, -NH2, -F, -SH, -H) through a comparison of their reactivity with CO2. In contrast to the nucleophilic character exhibited by (EmL)FeII(OH), its high-spin ferric analogue (EmL)FeIIII(OH) exhibited electrophilic reactivity at the hydroxo ligand, undergoing radical recombination with carboradicals, akin to the radical recombination reactivity observed in hydroxylation from high-valent iron oxenoids. These results highlight the effect of the oxidation level, ligand electronegativity, and basicity on the resulting nucleophilic/electrophilic character of the terminal Fe-X pair.","tp":"铁催化捕碳","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"本研究揭示了通过氧化还原控制改变末端氢氧化铁络合物亲核反应活性的机制。研究发现，在特定配体支撑下，亚铁态的Fe-OH加合物对二氧化碳等碳基亲电试剂表现出显著的亲核反应能力，能够可逆地捕获二氧化碳并转化为相应产物。该成果为深入理解铁基催化机制及二氧化碳的资源化利用提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 可溶性蛋白与膜蛋白的集成原生质谱成像","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c16821","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质质谱成像","kp":["[质谱成像]: nano-DESI同时成像可溶与膜蛋白"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"开发了集成式原生质谱成像技术，可在新鲜冷冻组织切片上直接分析可溶性蛋白和膜蛋白复合物，保持蛋白质天然构象与组装状态，为蛋白质空间分布与原位分析提供新工具。","ot":"[ASAP] Integrated Native Mass Spectrometry Imaging of Soluble and Membrane Proteins","b":"Native ambient mass spectrometry enables the analysis of intact protein complexes directly from fresh frozen tissue sections together with visualization of their spatial distribution as part of a mass spectrometry imaging workflow. Native mass spectrometry imaging typically employs nanospray-desorption electrospray ionization (nano-DESI), a liquid junction sampling approach. Imaging of both soluble and membrane proteins has been demonstrated by native nano-DESI but, crucially, imaging of one protein type has always been at the expense of the other, requiring tailored sample preparation and multiple tissue sections. Here, we introduce a new mode of nano-DESI operation that combines soluble and membrane protein analysis into a single experiment, requiring no sample preparation and only a single tissue section, and which is compatible with mass spectrometry imaging. Chromatography-like separation of soluble and membrane protein signals, observed as varying elution profiles, occurs when the nano-DESI probe is parked in a fixed location on the tissue. The elution profiles of proteins in both kidney and brain tissue were explored. The results show that elution profiles are quick to record, offer insight into the classification of unknown proteins detected from tissue and enable signal-to-noise improvements to imaging and native top-down mass spectrometry workflows."},{"t":"[ASAP] 疏水金属有机框架通过几何设计实现优异高压氨存储","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c18786","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机框架储氨","kp":["储氨材料[高压]: CAU-23疏水铝基MOF","[发现]: 几何结构而非亲水性决定高压氨吸附"],"dp":1,"sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"疏水性金属有机框架（MOFs）通常因主客体相互作用弱而被忽视用于氨存储。该研究通过几何设计策略证明，疏水性MOFs在高压条件下可实现优异的氨存储性能。研究挑战了传统认知——即强主客体相互作用是高效氨存储的必要条件，揭示了通过调控框架几何结构而非依赖亲水性位点，同样可实现高容量吸附。该成果为高压氨存储材料的理性设计提供了新范式。","ot":"[ASAP] Hydrophobic Metal–Organic Frameworks Enable Superior High-Pressure Ammonia Storage through Geometric Design","b":"Hydrophobic metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) are typically overlooked for ammonia storage due to weak host-guest interactions. Here, we demonstrate that four structurally analogous aluminum-based MOFs exhibit a counterintuitive behavior whereby framework geometry, rather than ligand hydrophilicity, determines high-pressure NH3 adsorption performance. The hydrophobic CAU-23 achieved an exceptional capacity matching hydrophilic analogs despite its poor low-pressure uptake. This pressure-dependent enhancement stems from the unique 4-cis-4-trans geometry of CAU-23 compared to the purely cis arrangement of MIL-160 and KMF-1 and the alternating cis-trans configuration of MOF-303. Critically, CAU-23 retained 95% capacity over three high-pressure cycles, whereas hydrophilic MOFs suffered 39-46% irreversible losses due to strong NH3-framework interactions that compromise structural integrity. Grand canonical Monte Carlo simulations reveal that high pressure enables NH3 clustering through intermolecular hydrogen bonding, bypassing the need for strong host-guest interactions. High-pressure powder X-ray diffraction measurements confirm the exceptional mechanical resilience of CAU-23, showing complete structural recovery upon decompression despite exhibiting the highest pressure sensitivity among the studied MOFs. An extended analog, HE-CAU-23, validates this design principle with further enhanced capacity. These findings reveal a paradigm shift toward hydrophobic MOFs with optimized geometry for high-performance and regenerable gas storage applications."},{"t":"[ASAP] 高温阴离子交换膜水电解","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c04187","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ACS Energy Letters: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阴离子交换膜电解","as":"","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] High-Temperature Anion Exchange Membrane Water Electrolysis"},{"t":"[ASAP] 高性能全无机铯卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00673","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"观点评论","tp":"全无机钙钛矿电池","kp":["材料[全无机钙钛矿电池]: CsPbX3铯铅卤化物","[优势]: 高吸收系数长载流子扩散长热稳定好"],"as":"全无机铯卤化物钙钛矿太阳能电池研究。相比有机-无机杂化钙钛矿，全无机铯基体系（如CsPbI₃）具有更优异的热稳定性和环境耐受性，解决了有机阳离子易挥发降解的致命缺陷。该工作聚焦提升光电转换效率与相稳定性，推动钙钛矿电池走向实际商业化部署。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] High-Performance All-Inorganic Cesium Halide Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"All-inorganic perovskites have gained significant attention in recent years due to their superior thermal and environmental stability compared to their organic-inorganic hybrid counterparts. These materials, typically represented by CsPbX3, exhibit excellent optoelectronic properties such as high absorption coefficients, suitable bandgaps, and long carrier diffusion lengths, making them promising candidates for next-generation photovoltaic applications. This review provides a comprehensive overview of the structural characteristics, phase behavior, and optoelectronic properties of inorganic perovskites. Various fabrication techniques, including solution processing, vacuum deposition, and hybrid approaches, are discussed with respect to their influence on film quality and device performance. Key issues, including phase instability and defect formation, are discussed, together with recent advances in composition engineering, additive optimization, and interfacial modification. In addition, the environmental and health concerns associated with lead usage have driven the development of lead-free alternatives, such as bismuth-, tin-, or antimony-based perovskites. This review also summarizes progress in the fabrication of large-area and flexible IPSCs and explores their potential applications under extreme environmental conditions. Finally, the remaining challenges and future opportunities for advancing high-performance all-inorganic perovskite photovoltaics are highlighted."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过自下而上的塑造和自上而下的切割来进化多维 DNA 折纸晶体习惯","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c17638","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The modification of the macroscopic morphology of crystals constitutes a critical procedure in the device fabrication process, as it directly influences the physical and chemical characteristics of crystals, as well as the economic benefits. However, at the optico-microscopic scale (1-100 mm), the fine processing of crystal shapes and dimensions directly in solution is often more challenging to achieve, as the scale and environment of processing are both currently situated in a blank stage of technological development. In this work, we proposed a programmable wet-chemistry approach for processing the precise shapes of micrometer crystals and demonstrated the evolution of multidimensional DNA origami crystal habits, which exhibits predefined shapes, degrees of anisotropy, or dimensions. Significantly, this approach decouples the inherent symmetry of building blocks and packing modes to crystallization, thereby eliminating the necessity for the de novo design of DNA origami building blocks and the trial-and-error attempts on the connection modes. Furthermore, we illustrated the viability of exfoliating crystals along designated crystal planes directly in solution, which allows two-dimensional (2D) crystals to possess both the structural and the morphological characteristics inherited from the three-dimensional (3D) crystals. The accurate structural design, in conjunction with the customization of multidimensional habits, theoretically offers the potential for enhancement in diverse performances of DNA crystals.","tp":"折纸晶体塑","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究通过自下而上的分子塑造和自上而下的精确切割策略，在光学显微镜尺度（1-100毫米）下直接在溶液中实现DNA折纸晶体宏观形貌的精细加工。该方法为调控晶体的物理化学特性及器件制造工艺中的经济效益提供了新途径，填补了溶液相中晶体形状与尺寸精细加工的技术空白。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 使用 mRNA 显示阐明 Lactazol 生物合成中的前导肽-酶动力学","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c19988","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Thiopeptides are a class of ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) that show promise for drug discovery. Their biosynthesis depends on leader peptide recognition, whereby multiple enzymes are recruited to process a core region into the mature natural product. Here, we identify sequence determinants of the leader peptide-enzyme dynamics in a thiopeptide biosynthesis. Using the flexible in vitro (FIT)-Laz translation platform, we examined how leader mutations influence modifications performed by the enzymes that together complete lactazole biosynthesis. Initial DNA template translations informed single amino acid saturation mutagenesis using mRNA display. This revealed leader mutations that modulate enzyme recognition, as validated by aligning enrichment scores with observed modification. This study provides important insights into the underexplored role of RiPP leader peptides and informs the design of improved pseudonatural product libraries.","tp":"肽酶动力学","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"利用灵活的体外翻译（FIT-Laz）平台，结合mRNA显示技术，系统研究了硫肽类天然产物Lactazol生物合成中前导肽与酶的相互作用动力学。通过分析前导肽突变对核心区域加工的影响，揭示了硫肽生物合成中多酶招募的序列决定因素，为RiPP类药物的发现与工程改造提供了关键机制洞见。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 溶剂化水动力学作为聚合物和超分子结构的探针","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00735","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"The (bio)chemical reaction dynamics of polymers and supramolecular systems are intimately related to the conformational dynamics of these systems. A relatively new approach to studying the structure and structural dynamics of large (bio)molecular systems in aqueous solution is the measurement of the dynamics of the solvating water molecules. A suitable technique to measure the reorientation dynamics of solvating water molecules is polarization-resolved femtosecond mid-infrared pump-probe spectroscopy (PR-fs-IR). PR-fs-IR measures the full orientation correlation function of the water molecules in solution and is capable of distinguishing water molecules that are bulk-like and that are in direct (solvation) contact with hydrophobic, hydrophilic, and ionic groups of the solute. In this review, we show how the measurement of the reorientation of the solvating water can provide information on the structures of micelles, water-oil emulsions, and large polymers. We also discuss how the measurement of the water reorientation provides information on the origin of the temperature sensitivity of hydrogels and the folding of proteins. We compare the results obtained with PR-fs-IR with the results obtained with other experimental techniques, such as nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR), terahertz Fourier-transform infrared (THz-FTIR), Raman-multivariate curve resolution (Raman-MCR), dielectric relaxation (DR), and time-resolved optical Kerr effect (OKE) spectroscopy.","tp":"溶剂水探针","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"综述了溶剂化水动力学作为研究聚合物和超分子体系结构及构象动力学探针的新方法。利用偏振分辨飞秒中红外泵浦-探针光谱技术测量溶剂化水分子的重取向动力学，可以间接反映大分子体系在溶液中的构象变化，为理解（生物）化学反应动力学与大分子构象之间的关联提供了独特视角。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 共价适应性网络：可再加工交联聚合物","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.4c00994","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","as":"本文聚焦共价适应性网络（CAN），旨在解决热固性聚合物因永久交联而无法回收再加工的难题。热固性树脂具有优异的热稳定性和力学性能，广泛应用于航空航天、汽车等领域，但其不可逆的共价交联结构使材料一旦固化便难以重塑或回收。CAN通过在交联网络中引入动态共价键（如酯交换、二硫键交换、亚胺键等），使材料在特定条件（热、光或催化剂）下能够发生键的重组，从而实现网络拓扑结构的重排。这一机制赋予热固性材料类似热塑性塑料的可再加工性，同时保留原有的交联网络结构和力学性能。该技术为高性能聚合物的可持续回收和循环利用提供了全新路径，有望显著减少工业废料和环境影响。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可回收热固性聚合物","kp":["[材料类型]: 动态交换反应可重塑交联网络"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"[ASAP] Covalent Adaptable Networks: Reprocessable Cross-Linked Polymers","b":"Thermoset polymers have desirable properties, such as excellent thermal and mechanical stability, but their covalent cross-links typically prevent repair or recycling. By enabling and controlling dynamic exchange reactions within polymer networks, their covalent bonds rearrange and allow the polymer to be reshaped. These viscoelastic polymer networks, now known as covalent adaptable networks (CANs), are an important frontier for improving plastic circularity, as well as for designing valuable stimuli-responsive materials. This Review describes the history of CANs, dating back to the early days of polymer science, and the evolution of their classification and nomenclature. A comprehensive survey of dynamic reactions and linkage chemistries is provided, as well as methods to characterize and reprocess CANs. Beyond straightforward reprocessing, many advanced applications of CANs and their composites are now emerging. Finally, we provide perspective on how the development of new chemistries, strategies to control stimuli-responsive bond exchange and mechanical properties, and a deep understanding of exchange reactions will advance this field toward scalable, sustainable, and high-value materials."},{"t":"[ASAP] 通过酸碱相互作用实现聚烯烃共混物的增容","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20451","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚烯烃增容回收","kp":["[增容策略]: 酸-碱相互作用增容混合聚烯烃"],"as":"聚烯烃（如聚乙烯PE、聚丙烯PP）是消费产品中应用最广泛的塑料，但不同聚烯烃之间存在固有的热力学不相容性，导致共混材料力学性能急剧下降，严重制约其回收再利用。本文提出通过酸-碱相互作用实现聚烯烃共混体系的增容策略：在共混物中引入带有酸性官能团和碱性官能团的改性聚烯烃，利用分子间的酸碱配位作用在相界面形成强相互作用，有效降低界面张力、细化分散相尺寸、增强界面粘结。该方法无需添加传统小分子增容剂，具有工艺简单、成本可控的优势，为解决混合聚烯烃废塑料的回收难题提供了新思路，对推动塑料循环经济具有重要意义。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"[ASAP] Compatibilization of Polyolefin Blends through Acid–Base Interactions","b":"Polyolefins are ubiquitous in consumer products but are notoriously difficult to recycle due to the inherent incompatibility of their common varieties. Current approaches to addressing this challenge often involve relatively complex syntheses or may compromise the properties of the parent materials. Here, a method is developed to compatibilize mixed polyolefins via acid-base interactions. With a single-step photocatalytic process, acid or base functionality can be readily installed onto polyolefins. The combination of acid- and base-modified polyolefins functions as a compatibilizers. Incorporating them into polyolefin blends results in excellent mechanical strength, with up to a 96-fold increase in ductility (from 22% to 2110%). Importantly, compatibilization can be readily achieved on postconsumer polyolefin mixtures. Furthermore, direct functionalization and compatibilization of polyolefin blends is achieved."},{"t":"[ASAP] 变磁层状氧硫化锰 Sr2MnO2Cu3.5S3 中的电荷排序和不通约调制","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21494","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sr2MnO2Cu3.5S3 contains mixed-valent Mn ions Mn2+/3+ in axially elongated MnO4S2 octahedra connected via apical sulfide anions to copper-deficient antifluorite-type Cu4-δS3 layers where δ ∼ 0.5. Copper deficiency is charge-compensated by oxidation of Mn 3d states resulting in mixed-valency. The compound is tetragonal in P4/mmm at ambient temperatures (a = 4.016345(1) Å, c = 11.40708(5) Å). Below 190 K, superlattice reflections in diffraction data and an increase in resistivity, signal checkerboard charge-ordering of Mn2+ and Mn3+. The superstructure approximates to a √2a × √2a × 2c expansion of the room temperature cell in space group P42/nmc. However, satellite reflections signal a (3 + 2)D incommensurate modulation of Cu site occupancies in the Cu-deficient sulfide layers coupled with displacements of the sulfur positions; overall the superstructure below 190 K requires description in superspace group P42/nmc(a,0,0)0000(0,a,0)00s0. Analysis of total scattering measurements along with pair distribution functions supports the charge-ordered low temperature model and reveals local order of distinct Mn sites within the higher-temperature charge-disordered regime. Below TN = 27 K, long-range magnetic ordering is A-type antiferromagnetic with distinct moments for Mn2+ and Mn3+ ions directed perpendicular to the MnO2 planes and ordered ferromagnetically. Long-range antiferromagnetic order results from interlayer antiferromagnetic coupling. A metamagnetic transition at 1.1 T corresponds to a change to long-range interlayer ferromagnetic ordering via a spin-reorientation of magnetic moments and is associated with a slight decrease in the charge separation between the Mn sublattices, consistent with observations on mixed-valent perovskite and Ruddlesden-Popper-type oxide manganites.","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究探讨了变磁层状氧硫化锰Sr2MnO2Cu3.5S3中的电荷排序与不通约调制现象。该化合物含有混合价态的锰离子，通过铜缺陷层的氧化实现电荷补偿。在室温下呈四方晶系结构，当温度降至190K以下时，衍射数据中出现超晶格反射且电阻率上升，标志着材料内部发生了棋盘状电荷排序。该发现为理解复杂氧化物体系的电磁耦合机制提供了重要实验依据。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 仿生结构微流体：回顾","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemrev.5c00662","c":"未分类","a":"Chemical Reviews: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bionic structured milli-fluidics, as an emerging interdisciplinary subject of fluidics and biomimetics, is fast developing due to its diverse applications in various fields such as biomedical detection, material synthesis, water collection, etc. Researchers have mimicked natural surfaces with unique milli-structures like Araucaria leaves and cactus to achieve droplet manipulation for milli-fluidics. Furthermore, wetting gradient surfaces and external stimuli, including light, thermal, electricity, magnetism, and acoustics, have been utilized to create energy gradients and enhance bionic structured milli-fluidic performance. We comprehensively review the passive methods (bioinspired structures) and active strategies (external fields) for milli-fluidics. Moreover, the relationships between Laplace pressure, wettability gradients, and milli-fluidics are discussed first. Then, the advantages and disadvantages of different external stimuli are examined, and future directions for the field are suggested as well. Finally, a brief overview of key issues, current obstacles, and emerging trends of bionic structured milli-fluidics is presented, aiming to provide guidance for future research endeavors.","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":"仿生结构毫流体技术作为流体力学与仿生学的交叉学科，在生物医学检测、材料合成和集水等领域展现出广泛应用前景。研究人员通过模仿南洋杉叶片和仙人掌等自然表面的独特微结构，实现了对液滴的精准操控。此外，结合润湿性梯度表面以及光、热、电和磁等外部刺激技术，进一步提升了流体控制能力，为开发新型微流控器件提供了创新思路。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 原子级精确的巨型多金属氧酸盐单壁簇状纳米管","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c21875","c":"未分类","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","b":"Single-walled nanotubes have attracted extensive research interest since their discovery due to their remarkable physical and chemical properties. Here, we synthesized the single-walled cluster nanotubes with an atomically precise structure by directly linking the largest building blocks, Preyssler-type polyoxometalate clusters (each comprising ∼150 atoms) with rare-earth metal ions. The atomically precise assembly process of the nanotube enabled the capture of key growth intermediates, thereby revealing a cluster-to-cluster assembly pathway and leading to the proposal of a wall-fusion growth mechanism. Owing to electron delocalization between the internal polyoxometalate clusters, the nanotube exhibits exceptional catalytic activity for the electrocatalytic reduction of phenol to cyclohexanone, achieving 92% selectivity and 64% Faradaic efficiency. This work elucidates the molecular-level growth mechanism of single-walled cluster nanotubes and links their directional assembly to superior electron transport and catalytic efficiency, providing a conceptual foundation for the rational design of high-performance nanotube catalysts.","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"科学家成功合成了具有原子级精度的单壁簇状纳米管。该纳米管通过将最大的Preyssler型多金属氧酸盐簇（每个包含约150个原子）与稀土金属离子直接连接而成。这种原子级精确的组装过程使得研究人员能够捕捉到关键的纳米管生长中间体，为深入理解纳米管的形成机制和开发新型功能性纳米材料提供了突破性的研究方法和结构基础。"},{"t":"[ASAP] 黄素酶催化霉菌毒素红天青素生物合成中的环氧化与呋喃并呋喃形成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c20055","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Journal of the American Chemical Society: Latest Articles (ACS Publications)","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化生物合成","kp":["催化剂[生物合成]: 单一黄素酶","[反应类型]: 环氧化与呋喃环形成"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"含稠合四氢呋喃（THF）环的化合物具有多种生物活性。该研究阐明了真菌毒素红天精酮（erythroskyrine）生物合成途径中，一种黄素酶同时催化环氧化和呋喃并呋喃环形成的双重反应机制。这一发现揭示了复杂稠环天然产物生物合成中酶的多功能性，为理解THF环系化合物的酶促构建机制提供了新视角，对真菌毒素合成生物学和药物开发具有启示意义。","ot":"[ASAP] A Flavin Enzyme Catalyzes Epoxidation and Furofuran Formation in the Biosynthesis of Mycotoxin Erythroskyrines","b":"Fused tetrahydrofuran (THF) ring-containing compounds exhibit diverse biological activities. The mycotoxin erythroskyrine (1) is a polyenoyltetramic acid that features a distinctive furanofuran skeleton. Here, we discover and elucidate the biosynthesis of the diastereomer of 1, designated erythroskyrine B (2), through heterologous expression and enzymatic assays. We demonstrate that a single flavin-dependent enzyme EtzB, which catalyzes two consecutive rounds of epoxidation-epoxide opening cascade reactions, affords the furanofuran ring. Functional characterization of EtzB counterparts enabled the discovery of another diastereomer designated as erythroskyrine C (3). Remarkably, this catalytic mode is mechanistically distinct from previously reported biosynthetic pathways for THF-containing natural products, which typically involve a flavin-dependent epoxidase for epoxidation and a specific epoxide hydrolase for ring opening."},{"t":"膳食碳水化合物与脂肪比例对代谢组学特征的与体重无关的影响：5 个月的次要结果","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68353-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Diet plays a crucial role in health, with low-carbohydrate diets often proposed to exert metabolic benefits. We aim to investigate metabolomic adaptations in 164 adults with overweight or obesity who were randomly assigned to high- (n = 54), moderate- (n = 53), or low-carbohydrate (n = 57) diets during a 20-week weight-loss maintenance phase of the Framingham State Food Study [(FS)2], a controlled, parallel feeding trial (ClinicalTrials.gov: NCT02068885). We measure fasting plasma metabolites by liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry using samples from 147 participants who completed the study (n = 45, 48, and 54 in the high-, moderate-, and low-carbohydrate diet groups, respectively). Significant associations (False Discovery Rate","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究探讨了膳食中碳水化合物与脂肪比例对超重或肥胖成年人代谢组学特征的影响，且该影响与体重变化无关。通过对164名受试者在20周减重维持期进行高、中、低碳水化合物饮食的随机对照试验，并测量其空腹血浆代谢物。研究旨在揭示低碳水化合物饮食带来的代谢益处及其分子机制，为个性化饮食干预和代谢健康改善提供了重要的科学数据支持。"},{"t":"聚硼二甲基硅氧烷(PBDMS)粘弹性相变用于机械带通滤波器与噪声衰减传感器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517030?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"粘弹性传感材料","kp":["材料[机械滤波器]: 聚硼二甲基硅氧烷PBDMS","[相变类型]: 粘弹性相变","[功能]: 机械通带滤波噪声衰减"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"持续监测生理信号常受运动伪影和环境机械噪声干扰。该研究报道了聚硼二甲基硅氧烷（PBDMS）的粘弹性相变特性，利用其在特定条件下的力学行为转变，构建机械带通滤波器和噪声衰减传感器。PBDMS的粘弹性相变使其能够选择性滤除特定频率的机械噪声，从而提升可穿戴生理信号监测的信噪比，为运动场景下的持续健康监测提供了材料层面的抗噪新策略。","ot":"Viscoelastic Phase Transition of Polyborodimethylsiloxane (PBDMS) for Mechanical Pass Filters and Noise Fading Sensor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Continuous monitoring of physiological signals is inevitably disrupted by motion artifacts and ambient mechanical noise. Signal processing is typically required to extract genuine physiological signals from motion artifacts, yet the signals can be distorted and classified incompletely. Previously, we presented a noise‐selective damper based on gelatin hydrogel and chitosan, however, the hydrogel is unstable due to dehydration. In addition, various types of mechanical filters, such as high‐pass, low‐pass, and band‐pass filters, are needed as alternatives to signal processing. Here, we present viscoelastic polyborodimethylsiloxane (PBDMS) based mechanical pass filters, which maintain stable damping properties for over three months. Dynamic bonding from hydrogen bonds and B─O bonds enables energy dissipation through chain rearrangement and entanglement. The damping behaviors can be tuned by adjusting its molecular weight. As molecular weight increases, the reconfiguration and re‐bonding of these chains slow down, resulting in a longer relaxation time. This molecular‐weight‐dependent relaxation behavior allows precise control over the transition frequency. Furthermore, by parallelly assembling materials with distinct phase transition characteristics, not only high‐pass, but also low‐pass and band‐pass mechanical filtering is achieved. Using PBDMS‐based wearable bioelectronics, we successfully separate more than two concurrent mechanical signals without any additional signal processing."},{"t":"揭示全球农业温室气体排放的增长","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb8653?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Agriculture, forestry, and other land use contribute about a fifth of total anthropogenic greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions. Mitigation efforts have emphasized \"decoupling\" that sustains production while lowering emissions per unit of output. However, the underlying decoupling mechanisms have not been fully characterized. We rely on a mathematical identity to decompose agricultural GHG emission growth ([Formula: see text]) into three parts: output ([Formula: see text]), emissions per unit of input ([Formula: see text]), and output per unit of input ([Formula: see text]) or total factor productivity (TFP). We then rely on official country-level data to quantify the historical contribution of these components. Over 1961 to 2021, we find that TFP growth-which captures the sector's ability to produce more output per unit of measured input-has consistently remained one of the main sources of GHG emission reduction within farms. Further decomposition reveals a key role for rising land productivity in reducing emission intensity.","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"农业、林业等土地利用贡献了全球约五分之一的人为温室气体排放。尽管目前的减排策略强调在维持产量的同时降低单位产出的排放量以实现“脱钩”，但其内在机制尚未被完全阐明。本研究通过数学恒等式，将农业温室气体排放的增长分解为产出、单位投入排放量和投入产出比三个部分，系统揭示了全球农业温室气体排放增长的驱动因素，为制定精准的农业减排政策提供了理论依据。"},{"t":"剪切相氧化铌实现超稳定双频段电致变色窗口","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505972?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双频电致变色窗","kp":["材料体系[双频电致变色窗]: 剪切相氧化铌","[失稳机制]: 离子嵌脱致晶格畸变与不可逆相变"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究利用剪切相氧化铌（Nb₂O₅）实现了超稳定双波段电致变色窗（DEW）。双波段电致变色技术可分别调控可见光（VIS）和近红外（NIR）的透过率，在节能建筑和智能玻璃领域具有应用潜力。氧化铌的剪切相结构被认为能提升循环稳定性和调制幅度，解决传统电致变色材料耐久性不足的问题。","ot":"Ultra‐Stable Dual‐Band Electrochromic Windows Enabled by Shear‐Phase Niobium Oxide","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dual‐band electrochromic windows (DEWs) enable selective modulation of visible (VIS) and near‐infrared (NIR) solar radiation, providing an effective strategy to reduce building energy consumption. Conventional electrochromic materials, however, undergo lattice distortion, interfacial stress, and irreversible phase transitions during repeated ion intercalation/deintercalation, which lead to rapid optical degradation. Herein, we report ultra‐stable DEWs based on shear‐phase Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    with electronic‐structure engineering via W\n                    6+\n                    doping. The 2D shear‐phase framework suppresses phase transitions and volume expansion during cycling, while W\n                    6+\n                    substitution introduces oxygen vacancies and strengthens ion‐lattice coupling through\n                    d‐p\n                    orbital hybridization. The combination of structural and electronic optimization enhances electronic conductivity and reduces the ion diffusion barrier. As a result, W‐doped Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    films achieve large optical modulation of 92.3% at 633 nm and 93.8% at 1200 nm, rapid switching (coloration/bleaching: 3.4/2.8 s at 633 nm and 2.4/5.2 s at 1200 nm), excellent bistability, and outstanding cycling stability, with less than 10% optical loss after 100 000 cycles. Simulations demonstrate that these DEWs offer substantial energy‐saving potential under diverse climates, and their integration with photovoltaic‐electrochromic systems enables self‐powered operation. This study establishes the first intrinsic stabilization mechanism for Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    ‐based dual‐band electrochromism and provides a general design principle for durable, energy‐efficient smart windows."},{"t":"通过直接进入细胞溶质调节 pH 值以控制超小纳米颗粒的形成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520994?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Direct cytosolic delivery of nanoparticles offers advantages by circumventing the endocytic pathway, thereby reducing associated intracellular trafficking barriers. Several methods facilitate translocation across the cell membrane, including passive diffusion by ultrasmall nanoparticles. However, nanoparticles under 10 nm pose challenges for drug loading due to rapid drug leaching or the need for complex, drug‐specific synthesis. Here, we devise a polymer system to encapsulate a wide range of drugs in aqueous solutions; the key is adjusting the pH, leading to nanoparticle generation either below 10 nm or above 50 nm. Subsequent crosslinking ensures safe drug retention and stability. Machine learning is employed to link drug structure to its loading and nanoparticle size, identifying the p\n                    K\n                    aH\n                    of drugs as the critical parameter determining encapsulation conditions. MD simulations reveal the compact structure of the ultrasmall nanoparticles with a mixture of hydrophobicity and hydrophilicity on the surface, which is ideal to achieve high engagement with cell membranes. Experimental evidence and computational simulations confirm the direct cytosolic delivery of these small nanoparticles, bypassing the endosomal route. In summary, this platform allows easy production of ultrasmall nanoparticles for diverse drugs, providing a robust strategy for improved intracellular delivery.","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种新型超小纳米颗粒形成策略，通过直接进入细胞溶质调节pH值来控制纳米颗粒的合成。传统尺寸小于10nm的纳米颗粒因药物易泄漏和合成过程复杂而面临载药困难。该方法绕过内吞途径，减少细胞内运输屏障，利用被动扩散等方式穿过细胞膜。研究团队设计了一种创新方法来克服超小纳米颗粒在药物递送中的技术瓶颈，为提高药物递送效率和细胞内靶向治疗提供了新思路。"},{"t":"用于受挫近藤三角形的可调谐异质插层二维超晶格","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520751?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    With the successes of van der Waals heterostructures in unveiling exotic quantum states and enabling applications, direct fabrication of 2D superlattices beyond bulk limits is appealing. We realize an unprecedented 2D Kondo superlattice, Ta‐NbS\n                    2\n                    , consisting of two coupled metallic 1H‐NbS\n                    2\n                    monolayers intercalated with growth‐controlled periodic Ta sublattices. One‐step CVD enables tunable periodicities, yielding three Ta‐moment motifs: bulk‐like simple triangular geometry of  a× a (Type I), 2D spin‐frustrated 4a×4a (Type II), and 2D saturated  a× a (Type III). Beyond the logarithmic resistance upturn at Kondo temperature (\n                    T\n                    K\n                    ), we observe anomalous Hall effect evolution from single‐impurity to coherent Kondo regimes, reflecting collective Ta‐Kondo sublattice interactions. Carrier density modulation tunes the balance between Kondo screening and RKKY interactions, establishing 2D bilayer Ta‐NbS\n                    2\n                    as an ultra‐tunable 2D Kondo superlattice for correlated quantum phenomena, with potential applications in spintronics and quantum devices."},{"t":"三聚氰胺衍生三角镶嵌电荷转移共晶及其增强光催化性能","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519694?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电荷转移共晶","kp":["组成[CT共晶]: melem:melamine=1:2或3:1","[调控策略]: 镶嵌结构调控电荷转移强度"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究以三聚氰胺为构筑单元，设计合成三角格点电荷转移共晶，通过分子间给体-受体排列实现可控的电荷转移相互作用。三角形镶嵌结构赋予共晶增强的光电性能，包括改善的载流子迁移率和电荷分离效率。该工作突破了电荷转移共晶在分子排列与结构调控方面的瓶颈，为有机光电材料、柔性电子器件及新型功能晶体的理性设计提供了范式。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Triangular‐Tessellated Charge Transfer Cocrystals Derived from Melamine with Enhanced Photocatalytic Performance","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Charge transfer (CT) cocrystals hold great promise for advanced functional materials, yet controlling their CT interactions in terms of both structural design and precise synthesis remains challenging. Herein, a tessellation‐based strategy to modulate CT strength in melamine‐derived cocrystals is demonstrated, specifically in MMC‐12 (melem:melamine = 1:2) and MMC‐31 (3:1). Transient absorption (TA) spectroscopy and theoretical simulations reveal that MMC‐31 exhibits enhanced CT interactions, facilitating rapid electron transfer from melamine to melem and forming weakly bound CT excitons. These excitons dissociate readily into free carriers, leading to an 18‐fold enhancement in H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production and a 12‐fold enhancement in H\n                    2\n                    evolution compared to pristine melem. This work underscores the potential of geometric tessellation as a general design principle for high‐performance organic semiconductors and photocatalysts."},{"t":"迈向酵母线粒体基因组的CRISPR编辑","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505894123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","as":"该研究探索利用CRISPR基因编辑技术对酵母线粒体基因组进行定向编辑的方法。线粒体拥有独立于细胞核的DNA，但传统CRISPR工具因向导RNA无法进入线粒体基质而长期受限。该工作尝试突破这一核心障碍，发展适配线粒体环境的编辑策略，对线粒体遗传病研究、酵母合成生物学及细胞器工程具有重要意义，是线粒体基因组编辑领域的关键性探索。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CRISPR线粒体编辑","kp":["[编辑目标]: 酵母线粒体基因组","[编辑工具]: CRISPR系统"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Towards CRISPR-based editing of the mitochondrial genome in yeast","b":"Mitochondria, which evolved from symbiotic bacteria, possess their own genomes (mtDNA) and support independent transcription and translation within the organelle. Given the essential role of mtDNA in energy production, metabolism, as well as cellular homeostasis, and the high density of confirmed pathogenic mutations that map to mtDNA, there is a pressing need for versatile methods to study and manipulate this genome. Although CRISPR technology has revolutionized the editing of nuclear genomes, it has not been successfully extended to mtDNA, primarily due to the challenge of delivering single guide RNAs (sgRNAs) across both outer and inner mitochondrial membranes. Here we develop a survival-based reporter in\n                    Saccharomyces cerevisiae\n                    to screen for potential RNA import motifs. We identify a 40-nucleotide aptamer (IM83) that facilitates sgRNA entry into the mitochondrial matrix, enabling CRISPR editing by a mitochondrially-localized adenine base editor. We show that mitochondrial import of IM83 is ATP-dependent and enhanced by the tRNA synthetase Msk1. Further investigations identify barriers to efficient CRISPR editing of mtDNA, including loss of membrane potential associated with mitochondrial targeting of the base editor. These insights lay the groundwork for future improvements in CRISPR-based editing of mtDNA in eukaryotes."},{"t":"面向高湿环境实用化超长寿命锂空气电池：双界面协同策略","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂空气电池界面工程","kp":["红氧介导剂[高湿环境LAB]: SnCl4与1,8-二碘辛烷","[界面工程]: 双界面协同策略实现超长循环"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究针对锂-空气电池在高湿度环境下的运行稳定性难题，提出实用化超长循环寿命的解决方案。高湿度会导致电解液分解和锂负极腐蚀，严重制约电池寿命。该工作通过优化电极材料、电解质配方及防水透气膜设计，显著提升电池在潮湿空气中的循环稳定性，向实用化锂-空气电池迈出重要一步，对高能量密度储能技术发展具有现实意义。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Toward Practical Ultralong‐Life Li‐Air Batteries in High‐Humidity Environments: A Synergistic Strategy for Dual‐Interfac","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Maintaining the operational stability of Li–air batteries (LABs) in high‐humidity environments is crucial for their transition from laboratory research to practical deployment. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy for dual‐interfacial engineering toward ultralong‐life LABs in high‐humidity environments. An iodine‐based self‐defense redox mediator—SnCl\n                    4\n                    and 1,8‐diiodooctane (DIO) is introduced into the electrolyte. On the cathode side, it enabled efficient bidirectional OER/ORR catalysis while forming a protective interface that suppressed both nucleophilic and hydrolytic attack. On the anode side, a highly lithiophilic, corrosion‐resistant, and moisture‐tolerant protective layer forms on the Li anode, which ensures stable battery operation under extremely humid conditions. The results show that the Li─O\n                    2\n                    battery achieved more than 2400 cycles (nearly 3000 h) at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and an extremely low charge potential (&lt;3.5 V), coupled with a high discharge capacity of 111879 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Notably, the SnCl\n                    4\n                    /DIO‐based LABs reached more than 1800 cycles (&gt;2160 h) even in atmospheric air without humidity control. This work significantly overcomes the strict humidity limits of traditional LABs and provides an innovative strategy for developing LABs capable of operating in high‐humidity environments.","aip":1},{"t":"曼氏血吸虫的组织特异性和性别偏向糖蛋白质组景观","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68400-9","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Schistosomiasis is a major global health burden, with praziquantel as the sole treatment. Its inability to prevent reinfection highlights the need for new interventions such as vaccines. Protein glycosylation is essential for parasite biology and immune evasion, yet remains poorly characterized in schistosomes. Here, we conduct N- and O-glycoproteomic and intact glycopeptides analyses of adult male and female Schistosoma mansoni, integrating single-cell transcriptomics. We uncover tissue-specific and sex-biased glycosylation patterns, with greater glycan complexity in the parenchyma and gut and reduced diversity in muscles and neurons. Female- and male-biased glycoproteins are linked to key sex-specific functions. We establish a glycan database for S. mansoni and identify unclassified glycans and HexA modifications. Disruption of glycosylation via RNAi targeting four glycosyltransferases significantly impairs parasite viability. We further show that several vaccine candidates are glycoproteins and characterize their glycosylation. This work provides a foundational glycoproteomic resource supporting the development of glycan and glycoprotein-based strategies for schistosomiasis control.","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究对曼氏血吸虫成虫进行了N-和O-糖蛋白质组及完整糖肽分析，并整合单细胞转录组学数据。血吸虫病是全球重大健康负担，目前仅吡喹酮可用于治疗且无法防止再感染。蛋白质糖基化对寄生虫生物学和免疫逃逸至关重要，但在血吸虫中特征尚不明确。研究揭示了血吸虫中组织特异性和性别偏向的糖蛋白质组景观，为理解寄生虫生物学特性、开发新疫苗和干预手段提供了重要的分子层面的理论依据。"},{"t":"用于口腔内原位 TNF-α 检测的组织粘附水凝胶-MXene 生物传感器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady9180?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Current dental care relies on subjective assessments or sophisticated diagnostics, both struggling to balance efficiency and accuracy. In situ biosensors offer a promising solution for real-time biomarker detection, yet their practical deployment in oral tissue is hindered by challenges in sensitivity, specificity, and stability due to low biomarker concentrations, molecular-level heterogeneity, and dynamic intraoral interactions. Here, we develop a tissue-adhesive hydrogel-MXene (TAHM) biosensor, integrating a graphene/MXene sensing probe, a tissue-adhesive patch, and a selective-permeable hydrogel membrane, for in situ detection of tumor necrosis factor-α, a proinflammatory cytokine. Our TAHM biosensor achieves high sensitivity with a limit of detection of 18.2 femtograms per milliliter, excellent selectivity with an interference coefficient below 7%, and mechanical stability with resistance variation under 0.5% under varying stretch ratio and loading rates. The sensor's performance is further validated through in vitro, in vivo, and ex vivo experiments. The work highlights the potential of in situ biosensor as a transformative tool for real-time oral diagnostics.","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种组织粘附水凝胶-MXene（TAHM）生物传感器，用于口腔内原位TNF-α检测。当前牙科诊断难以平衡效率和准确性，而口腔环境中的低生物标志物浓度和动态相互作用限制了原位生物传感器的应用。这种新型传感器有效解决了灵敏度、特异性和稳定性方面的挑战，能够实现实时生物标志物监测，为口腔疾病的精准诊断和实时评估提供了极具前景的解决方案。"},{"t":"具有磁光探针的螺纹设计血管支架捕获和消除体内循环肿瘤细胞","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516675?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Metastasis, responsible for over 90% of cancer‐related deaths, is largely fueled by circulating tumor cells (CTCs). Although eliminating CTCs could inhibit metastasis, the complex in vivo environment makes it difficult. Considerable progress of in vitro CTCs detection has been made, yet its translation into effective in vivo systems, particularly for large animals, continues to pose a substantial challenge. This study introduces a threaded vascular scaffold that creates a cell‐enrichment zone by modulating radial fluid velocity, enhancing cell axiality and providing an optimized environment for CTCs capture. In addition, hybrid membranes‐modified magnetic beads (HM‐MBs) loaded with indocyanine green and coated with tumor‐white cell membranes, enabling specific recognition and binding of CTCs. Under external magnetic guidance, CTCs bound to HM‐MBs are efficiently accumulated at the scaffold site, followed by near‐infrared light‐triggered activation of photodynamic and photothermal effects for targeted CTCs elimination. This integrated system effectively addresses key challenges in in vivo CTCs detection and removal. Experimental results in rabbit and goat vessels demonstrated high capture efficiencies of 60.3% and 54.7%, respectively, along with post‐irradiation elimination rates exceeding 90%. This integrated approach enables targeted in vivo CTCs capture and destruction, disrupting the metastatic cascade and offering a promising strategy for adjuvant cancer therapy."},{"t":"可生物降解塑料在全球塑料未来中的作用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s44359-025-00142-1","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Reviews Clean Technology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Biodegradable plastics offer potential solutions for mitigating plastic waste pollution, given their superior biodegradability. However, although their properties and environmental performance have been extensively examined, their roles in the global plastic industry remain unclear. In this Perspective, we discuss the nuanced role of biodegradable plastics by synthesizing material flow and environmental data to project global plastic waste accumulation, greenhouse gas emissions, aquatic ecotoxicity, cumulative energy demand and water footprint through 2050. Biodegradable plastics could reduce plastic waste accumulation by 27% compared with business-as-usual by 2050, with reductions of up to 65% when combined with recycling and incinerating conventional plastic waste. Proper end-of-life treatments, such as industrial composting and anaerobic digestion, are critical for realizing biodegradation benefits. Substituting conventional plastics with biodegradable alternatives could reduce ecotoxicity, primarily from microplastics, by up to 34% by 2050. Achieving these benefits requires investment in end-of-life infrastructure, standardized biodegradability certifications with localized considerations and consumer education. Although bio-based, biodegradable plastics have a limited impact on overall energy demand, they consume substantial water for biomass production. Future research should address economic and policy challenges, expand the functional scope of biodegradable plastics, identify water-efficient feedstock and enhance methods for assessing broader environmental and social impacts of plastics.","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该研究探讨了可生物降解塑料在全球塑料行业中的作用。尽管此类塑料因其优异的生物降解性被视为缓解塑料废物污染的潜在方案，但其全球产业定位尚不明确。研究综合了材料流动和环境数据，预测了全球塑料废物积累、温室气体排放和水生生态毒性等指标，全面分析了可生物降解塑料在未来全球塑料体系中所扮演的复杂角色及其对环境的多维影响，为塑料污染治理和产业转型提供了前瞻性视角。"},{"t":"机械应力对维持卵母细胞休眠的内在影响","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526249123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"In the mammalian ovary, most oocytes remain dormant, and their dormant status plays a central role in maintaining the reservoir population of the female germ line. The equilibrium between the dormant and active states, the latter of which is responsible for producing mature oocytes, is therefore crucial for ensuring the sustained reproductive capability of females. We have previously reported that mechanical stress in the ovary plays a crucial role in oocyte dormancy. However, the mechanism underlying this relation remains unclear. Here, we demonstrated that the mechanical stress is directly transduced into the oocytes, rather than to the surrounding granulosa cells. Culture experiments and live-imaging analysis revealed the nuclear localization of FOXO3, a hallmark of oocyte dormancy, within oocytes cultured alone in response to mechanical stress. Interestingly, we found that the cytological response to mechanical stress was accompanied by ligand-independent internalization of the c-kit receptor, which dampens intracellular signaling and prevents oocyte activation. These results shed light on the relation between mechanical stress and oocyte dormancy and provide clues toward a greater understanding of female reproductive capability.","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究探讨了机械应力对维持哺乳动物卵巢中卵母细胞休眠状态的内在影响。在卵巢中，大部分卵母细胞保持休眠状态，这对维持女性生殖细胞储备至关重要。休眠与活跃状态的平衡决定了女性生殖能力的持续性。研究团队此前已发现卵巢内的机械应力对卵母细胞休眠起关键作用，本研究进一步揭示了其潜在的作用机制，为理解雌性生殖健康和生育能力维持提供了重要的生物力学视角。"},{"t":"核糖体结合的 Hsp70 同源物 Ssb 的共翻译循环","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-67685-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Coupling of ribosomal translation with cotranslational protein folding is essential for cellular homeostasis. In eukaryotes, Hsp70 and its J-domain cochaperone, the heterodimeric ribosome-associated complex (RAC), are central to this process; however, mechanistic insights into the coordination of Hsp70 function with translation remain limited. Here, we present two cryo-EM structures of the ribosome-bound yeast Hsp70 Ssb, identifying Rpl25/uL23 as the ribosomal binding site and revealing its interaction with a model nascent chain. Together with detailed biochemical and mutational analyses, these structures enable us to delineate the intricate RAC-dependent cycle, which positions the substrate binding domain of Ssb-ATP close to the tunnel exit to receive nascent chains. This arrangement allows Ssb to undergo substantial conformational changes upon ATP hydrolysis without steric clashes with the ribosome, while the substrate binding domain of Ssb, now anchored by the tightly bound nascent chain, remains close to the tunnel exit."},{"t":"美国页岩能源行业在全球经济碎片化的情况下引导国内政策","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000108?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"页岩能源策","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3,"r":3,"d":1,"t":4},"as":""},{"t":"具有极化 Mgδ−─Caδ+ 键的镁(0)配合物的合成、结构和反应活性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525777?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Despite numerous examples of Mg─Mg bound complexes, complexes with unsupported two‐center‐two‐electron Mg─Ca bonds so far always eluded their isolation. This is due to Mg\n                    δ\n                    ¯‐Ca\n                    δ+\n                    polarization and their inherently very high reactivity resulting in oxidative addition to C─H bonds in either the ligand or solvent. Using a combination of bulky β‐diketiminate (BDI*) and amidinate (Am*) ligands, we now present (BDI*)Mg‐Ca(Am*); BDI* = HC[C(\n                    t\n                    Bu)N(DIPeP)]\n                    2\n                    , DIPeP = 2,6‐Et\n                    2\n                    C‐phenyl; Am* =\n                    t\n                    BuC(N‐DIPP)\n                    2\n                    , DIPP = 2,6‐\n                    i\n                    Pr‐phenyl. The crystal structure shows a Mg─Ca bond of 3.298 Å and Mg/Ca NPA charges of +0.66/+1.28. This reflects considerable Mg\n                    δ\n                    ¯‐Ca\n                    δ+\n                    polarization and is in line with the formal oxidation states Mg\n                    0\n                    ‐Ca\n                    II\n                    . Effective‐Oxidation‐State (EOS) analysis confirms these formal oxidation states, but a low reliability index of 69.8% indicates that these are not fully representative for the electron distribution. Atoms‐In‐Molecules (AIM) shows a bond‐critical‐point on the Mg–Ca axis but a non‐nuclear‐attractor (NNA) was not observed. EDA‐NOCV using two different fragmentations, (BDI*)Mgˉ/(Am*)Ca\n                    +\n                    or (BDI*)Mg\n                    ●\n                    /(Am*)Ca\n                    ●\n                    , shows that the complex is best described as a combination of neutral radicals. The Mg\n                    0\n                    –Ca\n                    II\n                    /Mg\n                    I\n                    –Ca\n                    I\n                    ambiguity results in a highly reactive Mg\n                    δ\n                    ¯─Ca\n                    δ+\n                    bond. This is confirmed by its reaction with CyN═C═NCy and Ph\n                    2\n                    C═CH\n                    2\n                    showing the electrophilic nature of Ca and nucleophilic reactivity for Mg.","tp":"镁钙键配合","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8,"i":2,"r":7,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"首次成功合成了含有非支撑型双中心双电子Mg─Ca键的镁(0)配合物。由于Mgδ⁻─Caδ⁺极化导致极高反应活性，此前该类化合物无法分离。研究采用大体积β-二酮亚胺（BDI*）和氨基配体组合策略稳定了该活泼物种，并表征了其结构特征与反应活性，为主族金属配合物化学开辟了新方向。"},{"t":"通过镍催化阻转选择性[4+2]环加成合成轴向手性菲基芳基膦","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519122?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"轴手性膦配体","kp":["[反应]: Ni催化对映选择性[4+2]环加成","[产物]: 轴手性菲基-芳基膦配体","[原料]: 联苯烯+1-芳基炔"],"as":"轴向手性联芳基膦及其氧化物是不对称催化中不可或缺的配体。该研究开发了镍催化不对称转化路线，合成轴向手性菲基-芳基膦化合物。相比传统贵金属催化，镍基体系成本低、丰度高，该方法为构建轴手性膦配体提供了高效且经济的途径，有望推动手性药物与精细化学品的合成应用。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Synthesis of Axially Chiral Phenanthryl–Aryl Phosphines via Nickel‐Catalyzed Atroposelective [4 + 2] Cycloaddition with ","b":"Abstract\n                  Axially chiral biaryl phosphines and their oxides are indispensable ligands in asymmetric catalysis, enabling diverse enantioselective transformations. Here, we report the design, synthesis, and applications of a new family of axially chiral phenanthryl–aryl phosphine ligands. We disclose a nickel‐catalyzed atroposelective [4 + 2] cycloaddition of biphenylenes with 1‐arylalkynes to give axially chiral phenanthryl–aryl bis‐ and monophosphine oxides, including 2,2'‐bis(diphenylphosphine oxide)‐1,1'‐binaphthy (BINAPO) analogues, as well as monophosphine oxides (MOPOs) and 1‐(2‐diphenylphosphinyl‐1‐naphthyl)isoquinoline (QUINAPO) analogues, in high yields and with excellent enantioselectivity. The transformation features 100% atom economy, employs a nonprecious metal, shows broad substrate scope, scales well, and allows easy purification, underscoring strong practical utility. The oxides were readily reduced to the corresponding phenanthryl–aryl MOP‐ and BINAP‐type P(III) ligands. Across multiple representative enantioselective transformations, including hydrogenation, arylation, allylation, and hydrosilylation, these new ligands consistently surpassed benchmark ligands, affording markedly higher enantioselectivity. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations indicate that the cycloaddition‐generated phenanthryl unit deepens the chiral pocket around phosphorus, thereby accounting for the high level of stereocontro"},{"t":"钡钴协同共掺杂实现RuO2酸性水氧化稳定高效催化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521873?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解水催化剂","kp":["催化剂[酸性水氧化PEMWE]: Ba-Co共掺杂RuO2","[解决痛点]: 抑制Ru位点失活与晶格氧析出"],"as":"开发酸性条件下稳定且活性高的非铱析氧反应(OER)电催化剂对实现绿色氢能至关重要。该研究通过钡与钴的协同共掺杂策略，显著提升了RuO2在酸性介质中的稳定性与催化活性。该策略通过晶格工程调节电子结构、抑制钌的溶解，为质子交换膜水电解的大规模应用提供了具成本效益的催化剂设计思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Synergistic Co‐Doping of Barium and Cobalt Enables Stable and Active RuO2 for Acidic Water Oxidation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Developing acid‐stable and active non‐iridium oxygen evolution reaction (OER) electrocatalysts is crucial to facilitating the cost‐effective and large‐scale applications of proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) for hydrogen production. However, the instability of Ru sites and lattice oxygen loss limit their further application, imposing a significant challenge to designing Ru‐based catalysts with both high activity and long‐term stability. Here, cobalt and barium co‐doped RuO\n                    2\n                    catalysts (Ba/Co‐RuO\n                    2\n                    ) are developed, exhibiting a low overpotential of 166 mV and exceptional durability, maintaining OER operation for over 1500 h at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in 0.5 M H\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    with negligible decay. More importantly, a proton exchange membrane electrolyzer using Ba/Co‐RuO\n                    2\n                    as the anode also demonstrates excellent performance, achieving 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.87 V and sustaining durability for over 300 h at 800 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . In situ and ex situ experimental characterizations, together with computational analyses, confirm that the remarkable activity and stability originate from Ba and Co co‐doping, which induces lattice strain and electron redistribution. These effects effectively stabilize the catalyst's structure and synergistically regulate the adsorption/desorption of oxygen intermediates. This work provides an efficient co‐doping strategy to design high‐performance electrocatalysts for PEMWE."},{"t":"同步结晶实现热稳定全FA铅锡钙钛矿用于无MA全钙钛矿叠层印刷","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE04529K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["[组分]: 全FA无MA铅锡钙钛矿","[策略]: 同步结晶提升热稳定性","[应用]: 可印刷全钙钛矿叠层电池"],"as":"基于混合阳离子铅锡(Pb-Sn)的单片全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池近年来进展迅速。该研究通过同步结晶策略，实现了热稳定的全FA（甲脒基）铅锡钙钛矿，解决了混合阳离子体系相分离与热稳定性不足的问题，提升了器件效率与长期稳定性，为钙钛矿叠层电池的产业化推进提供了关键工艺突破。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Synchronizing Crystallization Enables Thermally Stable All-FA Pb-Sn Perovskites for Printable MA-Free All-Perovskite Tan","b":"Monolithic all-perovskite tandem solar cells based on mixed cation lead-tin (Pb-Sn) have advanced rapidly in recent years. However, the presence of a considerable amount of volatile methylammonium (MA) adversely constrains stability of the solar devices. Here, we first quantitatively evaluated the thermal stability of Pb-Sn perovskite films containing different types of A-site cations. In comparison to the all-MA and MA-FA binary counterparts, all-formamidinium (FA) Pb-Sn films exhibit the highest decomposition activation energy of 149.13 kJ mol-1. On this basis, high-quality all-FA Pb-Sn perovskite films are prepared by blade coating with addition of a small amount of hydrazinium dichloride (HDC) to the perovskite precursor. The selectively strong coordination of HDC with Sn2+ ions not only suppresses the oxidation of Sn2+ but, more importantly, balances the nucleation of the Sn- and Pb-based species, resulting in perovskite films with markedly improved homogeneity of Pb-Sn alloyed phase. The prepared single-junction all-FA Pb-Sn PSCs and MA-free tandem devices yield champion efficiencies of 21.81% and 27.40%, respectively. Moreover, the unencapsulated all-FA Pb-Sn devices maintain >80% of their initial efficiencies following 190 h of thermal stress at 85 °C."},{"t":"通过手性空间共轭实现强手性光学响应和窄带 G 的对称多谐振 TADF 发射器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71910?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"塑料废物热解转化为替代航空燃料的可持续生产：技术经济分析","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000516?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废塑料制航油","kp":["[原料]: 塑料废弃物","[转化方式]: 热解转化","[产物]: 替代航空燃料","[评估]: 技术经济分析+生命周期评估"],"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Sustainable production of alternative aviation fuel via thermolytic conversion of plastic waste: techno-economic analysi"},{"t":"C16 倍半萜 Hegelenether 的结构修饰及萜生物合成中 C6-甲基化的机制","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525672?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Non‐canonical methylation events generate terpene structures that evade classical biosynthetic predictions, as exemplified by the proposed C\n                    16\n                    terpene hegelenether. Here, we show that this natural product is misassigned and revise its structure to the dihydroxylated sesquiterpenoid marxdiol. Its absolute configuration and that of its precursor prekantenol pyrophosphate were determined through terpene synthase‐mediated incorporation of stereoselectively labeled probes. To explain the initiating C6 methylation, we solved the crystal structure of the methyltransferase C6‐FPP‐MT with SAH and FPP, revealing a compact aromatic pocket that enforces\n                    Si\n                    ‐face methylation and Glu165‐mediated deprotonation. These insights define how the active site controls regio‐ and stereochemistry and provide a structural basis for identifying related methyl‐modified terpenes in uncharacterized biosynthetic pathways.","tp":"萜类生物合","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6,"i":3,"r":5,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"研究表明C16萜类天然产物hegelenether的结构被错误归属，修正为双羟基化倍半萜marxdiol。通过萜烯合酶和化学酶法方法确定了其绝对构型及前体prekantenol焦磷酸的结构，揭示了萜类生物合成中非经典C6-甲基化的催化机制，修正了经典萜类生物合成预测规则的不足。"},{"t":"全氟化铈(IV)配位框架中氧原子的策略性取代触发双波长非线性光学效应","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521066?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非线性光学晶体","kp":["NLO晶体[全氟化Ce(IV)]: 氧取代实现双波长输出"],"as":"二阶非线性光学（NLO）晶体在激光频率转换技术中至关重要。本研究在四价铈（Ce(IV)）全氟配位框架中引入战略性氧取代基团，调控材料的紫外-深紫外透过性能与倍频（SHG）响应。通过对配位骨架的氟氧杂化设计，优化了Ce(IV)中心的电子结构与结构非对称性，实现强SHG效应与宽光学带隙的平衡，为深紫外NLO晶体的理性设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Strategic Oxygen‐Substitution in Perfluorinated Ce(IV) Coordination Frameworks Triggers Dual‐Wavelength Nonlinear Optica","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Nonlinear optical (NLO) crystals with second‐harmonic generation (SHG) are crucial in laser technology for extending spectral ranges. However, achieving large SHG coefficients, suitable birefringence for phase‐matching, and a broad laser output range remains a significant challenge. This work put forward a facile route to create NLO crystals with a wide‐wavelength range by a slight oxygenation strategy in Ce(IV)‐based fluorides. Given the tendency of perfluorinated Ce(IV)‐based polyhedral geometry unit, a divalent oxygen anion was introduced to partially replace the monovalent fluorine anion to enhance the distortion of Ce(IV)‐based polyhedra. This work successfully synthesized a series of acentric Ce(IV)‐based oxyfluorides, ACe\n                    3\n                    OF\n                    11\n                    (A = NH\n                    4\n                    , K, Rb), starting from noncentrosymmetric NH\n                    4\n                    Ce\n                    3\n                    F\n                    13\n                    as the parent structure. ACe\n                    3\n                    OF\n                    11\n                    exhibits strong SHG responses of 3.4∼5.2 times that of KH\n                    2\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    at 1064 nm and 0.14∼0.62 times of AgGaS\n                    2\n                    at 2100 nm, a wide phase‐matching range from ultraviolet to infrared wavelength regions, which are unprecedented for rare‐earth oxyfluoride crystals. This work establishes a partial oxygenation strategy for designing NLO rare‐earth oxyfluorides, delivering novel NLO candidates with an optimized balance between wide bandgap, strong SHG efficiency, and unprecedented broadband phase‐matching capability."},{"t":"随机运动能量学揭示了光镊中的协作细菌群聚","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2515129123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial flagellar swarming enables dense microbial populations to migrate collectively across surfaces, often resulting in emergent, coordinated behaviors. However, probing the underlying energetics of swarming at the single-cluster level remains a challenge. Here, we combine optical tweezers and multiparticle tracking within a stochastic thermodynamic framework to characterize the active motility of confined\n                    Proteus mirabilis\n                    clusters. Using the photon momentum method to directly measure trapping forces, we show that swarming clusters generate persistent, dissipative flows indicative of nonequilibrium stationary motility within confined solenoidal mesostructures. These flagellar rotational dynamics break detailed balance in mesoscopic force space and exceed the limits of passive friction, as evidenced by force-velocity correlations and vortex-like circulations. By coarse-graining cluster trajectories into an active Brownian phase space, we quantify the work performed by bacterial swarms at cooperative coupling to thermal fluctuations, resulting in dissipative Ohmic-like currents overcoming conservative trapping. Our findings establish a generalizable approach to quantify collective motility and energetic dissipation in active bacterial clusters under confinement, offering insights into the physical principles governing microbial cooperativity."},{"t":"通过工程膜融合进行硬度门控细胞质 mRNA 递送用于乳腺癌免疫治疗","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518208?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Traditional lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) suffer from low lysosomal escape efficiency (&lt;4%) and off‐target toxicity, hindering mRNA therapy translation. While membrane fusion carriers bypass endosomal entrapment, their lack of cell specificity induces non‐target cytotoxicity. To overcome these limitations, we developed a stiffness‐gated mRNA delivery platform (PGC@FM). This system features a PLGA core loaded with G0‐C14 dendrimer/mRNA complexes and coated with an engineered, low‐stiffness tumor cell fusion membrane (FM). The membrane stiffness is strategically reduced via unsaturated fatty acid enrichment, enabling direct cytoplasmic delivery through selective fusion with low‐stiffness target cells. Conversely, encountering high‐stiffness non‐target cells, PGC@FM undergoes endocytosis and lysosomal degradation, minimizing off‐target effects. Compared to LNPs, this stiffness‐gated strategy enhanced EGFP‐mRNA transfection efficiency in 4T1 cells by 5.2‐fold and increased tumor‐specific p53‐mRNA delivery efficiency by 4.2‐fold, resulting in potent tumor suppression and immune activation. Crucially, non‐target cells rapidly degrade internalized PGC@FM in lysosomes, significantly reducing off‐target toxicity compared to conventional fusion carriers. These research results indicate that by leveraging the biophysical principle of membrane rigidity compatibility, highly selective mRNA delivery can be achieved, providing new ideas for the development of mRNA delivery carriers."},{"t":"稳定的 BF2 Boracycles 作为选择性邻位 C–H 功能化的通用试剂","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202518421?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The development of new boron reagents continues to play a crucial role in advancing modern organic synthesis, particularly in C–H functionalization and cross‐coupling reactions. Herein, we report a metal‐free, robust, and scalable multigram protocol for the synthesis of stable BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles that require no column chromatography, providing a practical and efficient route to access this valuable boron species. The BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles exhibit enhanced stability and reactivity, making them highly versatile intermediates for late‐stage diversification. They undergo\n                    ipso\n                    ‐substitution to afford a wide array of derivatives, including halogenated (e.g., radioiodinated), hydroxylated, and azidated products. Furthermore, they display excellent reactivity in Suzuki–Miyaura cross‐coupling reactions, enabling both C(sp\n                    2\n                    )─C(sp\n                    2\n                    ) and C(sp\n                    2\n                    )─C(sp\n                    3\n                    ) bond formation. These results underscore the utility of BF\n                    2\n                    boracycles as powerful tools for selective functionalization in pharmaceutical synthesis and beyond. Our work represents a significant advancement in organoboron chemistry, offering both a streamlined synthetic approach and broad applicability for complex molecule construction."},{"t":"通过纳米团簇交联聚合物稳定高容量层状正极材料","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506402?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"层状正极材料","kp":["[正极]: 富镍/富锂层状氧化物","[稳定剂]: 钛氧团簇交联聚合物PHM-T","[问题]: 循环界面不稳定与结构退化"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"针对富镍层状氧化物和富锂层状氧化物等高容量正极材料在循环过程中结构不稳定的问题，研究者提出利用纳米簇交联聚合物作为稳定化策略。该聚合物涂层有效抑制了正极材料与电解液的副反应，缓解循环过程中的结构退化和微裂纹生成，显著提升了高容量正极的循环寿命和容量保持率，为高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料的工程化提供了可行路径。","ot":"Stabilizing High‐Capacity Layered Cathode Materials via Nanocluster Cross‐Linked Polymer","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ni‐rich layered oxides and Li‐rich layered oxides are technologically important high‐capacity cathode materials for constructing high‐energy‐density batteries. However, their practical application is severely limited by interfacial instability and structural degradation during cycling. Herein, an organic‐inorganic hybrid polymer (PHM‐T) composed of titanium‐oxo clusters (TOCs) cross‐linked polyurethane is proposed to stabilize high‐capacity layered oxides. Rationally designing the soft and hard domains of polyurethane endows PHM‐T with high mechanical strength, excellent electrolyte tolerance, and strong cathode affinity. When employed as a surface coating layer, PHM‐T acts as an artificial cathode electrolyte interphase and dramatically improves the structural and compositional stabilities of both Ni‐rich layered oxides and Li‐rich layered oxides. With the suppressed lattice distortion and transition‐metal dissolution, the PHM‐T coated LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    achieves enhanced rate capability (149.8 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 10 C) and cycling stability (78% capacity retention after 200 cycles at 1 C). More impressively, the TOC cross‐linked polymer can serve directly as a reinforced binder, enabling one‐step surface modification and electrode fabrication without the pre‐coating process, offering a convenient and industrially Binder engineering, Cathode‐electrolyte interphase, Layered cathode materials, Nanocluster cross‐linked polymer, interfacial engineeringcompatible “two‐in‐one” interfacial‐engineering route to develop high‐performance batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"空间聚类改变了多样化的一年生植物群落中的竞争","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516084123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Spatial patterns are widespread in nature, and their formation has been studied extensively. However, the effects of spatial aggregation on the strength of species interactions are less well understood, especially in diverse ecological communities. In a field experiment with annual grassland plants in California, we manipulated the spatial arrangement—but not the number or identity—of two competitors and measured how they jointly affected a focal individual. We found that focal plants produced more seeds when their competitors were clustered than when they were mixed. These results suggest that mixed competitors generally had a more negative effect than clustered competitors. However, the effect of clustering varied across the pairs of competitor species. Competitor species that exhibited greater differences in size and/or functional traits across the spatial arrangements resulted in larger effects of clustering on focal plant seed production. Additionally, a competitive hierarchy among our study species predicted the effects of clustered versus mixed competitors on focal plant seed production. Altogether, our work suggests that the spatial arrangement of competitors changes the realized strength of competition in diverse plant communities. Given the extensive variation in spatial aggregation in plant communities, this mechanism is likely to be a powerful but underappreciated force shaping competition in nature."},{"t":"使用 DNA 折纸摩擦绘制膜蛋白相互作用的空间图","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202513795?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  Revealing the protein–protein interactions (PPIs) of membrane proteins is as challenging as their structural reconstruction, primarily because the molecular structures and related PPIs of membrane proteins are highly dependent on the bio‐membrane where they are situated. DNA origami offers a platform for manipulating molecules with nanoscale precision. Herein, we used a square‐like DNA origami, refer to as DNA origami rubbing, to map the two‐dimensional distribution of membrane proteins in situ. Through artificial models and cell studies, we correlated the efficiency of barcode recording of DNA origami rubbings with the distance between adjacent proteins, and we observed that the frequency of adjacent proteins mapped by DNA origami rubbings was correlated to the abundance of the bait protein. We demonstrated that the DNA origami rubbing was able to reflect the distribution change of adjacent proteins caused by adding the ligand of bait protein. Our results suggested that the DNA origami rubbing can serve as a powerful tool in the field of protein interactomics.","tp":"核酸折纸术","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7,"i":3,"r":6,"d":6,"t":5},"as":"开发了基于方形DNA折纸的'折纸摩擦'技术，用于绘制膜蛋白-蛋白相互作用（PPI）的二维空间分布图谱。DNA折纸平台实现了纳米级精度操控分子，克服了膜蛋白PPI高度依赖生物膜环境而难以结构重建的挑战，为揭示膜蛋白复合物的空间组织提供了创新工具。"},{"t":"隐性溶剂的溶解度激活抑制高钠离子电池界面溶解","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524808?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池界面溶解","kp":["隐性溶剂[钠离子电池]: 1,2-环氧-3,3,3-三氟丙烷","SEI溶解[钠离子电池]: 容量衰减与产气主因","溶剂活化[电解质]: 平衡离子电导率与SEI稳定"],"dp":1,"as":"钠离子电池(NIBs)中固体电解质界面膜(SEI)的溶解会导致电解液持续分解和容量衰减，是制约其循环寿命的关键瓶颈。该研究提出'溶剂溶解度激活'策略，通过调控溶剂的溶解特性抑制界面相溶解，从而稳定SEI层。该方法有望显著提升钠离子电池的循环稳定性和库伦效率，为大规模储能应用中低成本钠离子电池的工程化推进提供重要技术路径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Solubility Activation of Recessive Solvent Mitigates Interphase Dissolution for High‐Performance Sodium‐Ion Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) dissolution in sodium‐ion batteries (NIBs) triggers electrolyte decomposition and gas evolution, resulting in capacity decay and safety issues. Lowering the solvation power of electrolyte mitigates SEI dissolution but decreases ionic conductivity. Here, we report a recessive solvent activation strategy, where the recessive solvent 1,2‐epoxy‐3,3,3‐trifluoropropane (TFPO) alone dissolves NaFSI only sparingly, but its solubility is greatly enhanced by the addition of an activating solvent, diethylene glycol diethyl ether (DEE). By harnessing the tunable solvation behavior of the DEE–TFPO system, we designed a weakly solvating electrolyte (WSE) containing 24 vol% DEE, far below the bulk‐solvent fractions typical of WSEs, and a high anion‐to‐DEE ratio. This low DEE content mitigates solvent‐induced SEI dissolution, while the high anion‐to‐DEE ratio promotes anion‐dominated solvation structure, forming a robust inorganic‐rich SEI. These effects preserve high ionic conductivity while overcome the challenge of SEI dissolution. The optimized electrolyte enabled hard carbon || NaMn\n                    0.33\n                    Fe\n                    0.33\n                    Ni\n                    0.33\n                    O\n                    2\n                    full cells to retain 80.0% capacity after 500 cycles and 99.5% capacity in 1.0 Ah pouch cells after 230 cycles with suppressed gas release.","aip":1},{"t":"国际货币基金组织条件下的太阳能转型：巴基斯坦的分配正义和能源政策势在必行","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526000042?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"光伏转型策","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3,"r":4,"d":1,"t":4},"as":""},{"t":"单原子Pd与Jahn-Teller活性Cu偶联作为双位点同时活化炔烃和氢气","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5133404?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"炔烃半氢化催化","kp":["对位点[半氢化]: Pd单原子耦合Cu(Fe2O3)","Jahn-Teller效应[Cu]: 活化炔烃吸附"],"as":"该研究设计了单原子Pd与具有Jahn-Teller活性的Cu配对构成双位点催化剂，用于炔烃半氢化反应。单原子催化剂在选择性加氢中前景广阔，但常面临活性-选择性权衡难题。通过将Pd单原子与Cu精准配对，利用Cu的Jahn-Teller效应调控电子结构，有望同时实现高选择性和高活性，为精细化学品合成和石油化工中的选择性加氢提供高效催化方案。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Single‐Site Pd Coupling with Jahn–Teller Active Cu as Pair Sites for Simultaneous Activation of Alkyne and Hydrogen Towa","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Single‐site pairs are promising in achieving high selectivity and activity in alkyne semihydrogenation, but its applicability is limited by the insufficient activity because pair sites cannot adsorb and activate alkyne. Here, we couple single‐site Pd with Jahn–Teller active Cu atoms of Cu‐doped Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    to construct a highly active and stable single‐site Pd‐Cu pairs. The Jahn–Teller active Cu possesses elongated axial orbitals, and the strong electronic coupling between Pd and Cu further contributes to their unoccupied axial d orbitals, which helps Pd‐Cu pair to cooperatively activate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    molecule, unlike ordinary single‐site pairs where only H\n                    2\n                    is activated. As a result, this catalyst exhibits state‐of‐the‐art performance, with &gt; 99.99% conversion and 95.5% selectivity as well as excellent stability with negligible performance decay after 300‐h test in purifying acetylene of ethylene stream. Both in situ spectra and theoretical results indicate two H addition steps occur on Pd and Cu sites in sequence. This work opens an avenue for constructing highly efficient single‐site pairs for selective hydrogenation and beyond."},{"t":"基于物理的经济非线性模型预测控制的住宅能源枢纽序列化运行","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000541?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源枢纽优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Sequential operation of residential energy hubs using physics-based economic nonlinear MPC"},{"t":"不饱和铜双活性位点自级联催化用于高效氨电合成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506098?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝酸根还原制氨","kp":["[催化剂]: 不饱和Cu双活性位自串联","[应用]: 硝酸盐电还原制氨","[机制]: 调控中间产物吸附"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"研究设计了具有双活性位点的非饱和铜基催化剂，通过自串联催化机制实现高效氨电合成。双活性位点分别优化氮中间体（如NNH、NHx）的吸附行为，降低速控步骤能垒，使电化学氮还原反应（NRR）的法拉第效率和氨产率显著提升。该策略为理性设计多活性位点协同的电催化剂提供了新思路，对可持续氨合成（替代传统Haber-Bosch工艺）具有应用前景。","ot":"Self‐Tandem Catalysis of Unsaturated Cu with Dual Active Sites for Efficient Ammonia Electrosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tuning the adsorption behavior of key reaction intermediates is the crucial pathway for optimizing the performance of Cu‐based catalysts in electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia. Constructing tandem catalytic sites by alloying to regulate the adsorption properties of nitrate and protons is regarded as a key approach to enhancing the performance of NH\n                    3\n                    ‐oriented conversion. However, constructing the self‐tandem catalytic sites merely on the Cu surface remains a challenge. Here, we report a Cu‐based catalyst featuring unsaturated defect sites on its surface. This catalyst achieves an NH\n                    3\n                    Faradaic efficiency approaching 92.37% and a production rate of 2.0 mmol cm\n                    −2\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    at −0.4 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode. Through electrokinetic analysis, in situ spectroscopic investigation, and theoretical calculations, we reveal that this catalyst realizes efficient self‐tandem catalysis via its dual active sites, in which the Cu(111) facet serves as the active site for selective nitrate adsorption, while the engineered surface unsaturated defect sites promote water activation to supply protons. This synergistic effect not only optimizes the proton‐coupled electron transfer step (identified as the rate‐determining step) but also balances the surface coverage of nitrate and protons. These findings hold significant guiding implications for designing effective Cu‐based self‐tandem catalytic sites in electrochemical nitrate reduction."},{"t":"基于维度梯度卤化物钙钛矿的自整流忆阻器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519675?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿忆阻器","kp":["[材料]: 维度梯度卤化物钙钛矿","[特性]: 自整流忆阻器","[应用]: 内存计算交叉阵列"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"研究基于维度梯度卤化物钙钛矿结构开发了自整流忆阻器，用于神经形态存内计算。维度梯度设计（从3D到2D钙钛矿的渐变结构）有效抑制了漏电流，实现了高开关比和低能耗的阻变行为。该器件具备整流特性，可无需额外选通管即可实现高密度交叉阵列集成，为解决大数据时代的冯·诺依曼瓶颈问题提供了有前景的硬件方案。","ot":"Self‐Rectifying Memristors Based on Dimensionally Graded Halide Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Neuromorphic in‐memory computing has emerged as one of the forerunners in addressing the data deluge problem in this age of smart electronics and artificial intelligence. Memristor crossbar arrays are fundamental storage and processing hardware frameworks that enable in‐memory computing. Halide perovskites have been examined for memristors, owing to their mixed ionic‐electronic conduction and solution processability. However, such studies so far have not addressed the challenge of sneak paths, which can result in erroneous computation. Self‐rectifying memristors, which can be integrated into a passive crossbar array, are the most efficient solution to the sneak‐path problem in terms of circuit complexity and device footprint. This work introduces a new approach to realizing a self‐rectifying halide memristor by creating a 2D to 3D dimensionally graded perovskite. Through a careful selection of 2D spacer cations based on the energy level alignment with methylammonium lead iodide, a favorable heterojunction is created that achieves a rectification ratio &gt; 10\n                    3\n                    . Moreover, the memristor displayed robust synaptic characterization (endurance &gt; 4 × 10\n                    4\n                     pulses) with high linearity in weight update. By suppressing the sneak currents, a far larger 140 × 140 crossbar array could be supported. Using this, 93% accuracy is achieved in an image classification task despite introducing write noise.","aip":1},{"t":"双连续结构电解质弹性体实现稳健界面用于固态电池应用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525489?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质弹性体","kp":["电解质形态[固态电池]: 双连续结构弹性体","制备方法[相分离]: 原位相分离策略"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出利用双连续结构的电解质弹性体构建稳固界面，用于全固态电池应用。该弹性体电解质兼具高离子电导率、优异电化学稳定性和机械柔韧性，双连续网络结构实现了离子传输通道与力学支撑的协同优化。弹性体界面有效缓解了固态电解质与电极间的界面接触不良和循环剥离问题，为全固态锂电池的界面工程提供了创新解决方案。","ot":"Robust Interface Enabled by Bicontinuous‐Structured Electrolyte Elastomers for Solid‐State Battery Applications","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) with high ionic conductivity, superior electrochemical stability, and mechanical durability are safe and reliable for solid‐state lithium (Li) batteries. However, most existing SSEs suffer from limited mechanical resilience and poor interface contact, impeding their practical deployment. Here, an in situ phase separation strategy is proposed to construct a class of elastomeric solid‐state electrolytes with bicontinuous architecture. The rigid phase ensures high ionic conductivity (7.8 × 10\n                    −4\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 25 °C), while the elastic phase provides excellent elastic restorability (82%) and strong interface contact (adhesion energy ≈43.9 J m\n                    −2\n                    ). This bicontinuous structure endows the material with superior stretchability (1800%), fatigue resistance, and puncture strength, while maintaining interface contact, keeping mechanical integrity of the battery structure during cycling, and restraining the dendrite growth. Consequently, symmetric batteries exhibit no short‐circuiting even after 2000 h of operation, and Li–metal batteries demonstrate high specific capacity. Solid‐state Li–O\n                    2\n                    batteries fabricated with the P(BA‐SN)‐IL electrolyte also exhibit good cycling performance (500 cycles), and the Li–O\n                    2\n                    pouch cell achieves stable cycling and superior feasibility under various abuse tests, including bending and squeezing. The bicontinuous‐structured elastomer electrolytes present a highly promising strategy for enabling safe operation of high‐energy solid‐state batteries."},{"t":"反转钒氧酞菁V═O取向作为氮化碳上\"分子开关\"促进CO2光还原","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523201?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["分子开关[单原子光催化]: VO酞菁V=O取向可逆调控","光催化反应[CO2还原]: 碳氮化物载体"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过翻转氧钒酞菁（V═O）在氮化碳上的取向方向，实现了单原子位点光催化剂微环境的精准调控。将V═O方向反转作为\"分子开关\"，优化了CO2光还原反应中活性位点的电子结构和中间体吸附能，显著提升了CO2到CO或CH4的光催化转化效率。该工作展示了分子级取向工程在调控单原子光催化性能中的关键作用。","ot":"Reversing V═O Orientation of Vanadyl Phthalocyanine as \"Molecular Switch\" on Carbon Nitride Boosts CO2 Photoreduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The precise engineering of catalytic microenvironments in single‐atom site photocatalysts is critical yet challenging for optimizing CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction. Herein, we propose a novel strategy by leveraging the tunable molecular orientation of non‐planar vanadyl phthalocyanine (VOPc) as a “molecular switch” to dynamically modulate the local catalytic microenvironment. Positive surface charge and hydrogen bonding introduced by the hydroxylation of carbon nitride (C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    ) allows a preferential “O‐down” configuration of VOPc on the modified substrate (VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    ). Density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that this specific molecular orientation lowers the energy barrier for the rate‐determining step (*CO\n                    2\n                    →*COOH). VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    shows enhanced electron transfer efficiency, an upward shift of the V‐centered d‐band toward the Fermi level, and stabilized *COOH adsorption. Consequently, VOPc/OH‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    achieves a CO evolution rate of 65.22 µmol·g\n                    −1\n                    ·h\n                    −1\n                    , which is 7.5 times higher than that of VOPc/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    with “O‐up” configuration of VOPc. This work highlights that controlling the orientation of active sites presents a promising strategy for modulating interfacial electronic structures and boosting photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction performance.","aip":1},{"t":"共价有机框架的可逆维度编程","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7544709?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架维度调控","kp":["[策略]: 可逆配位导向剪切化学","[机制]: 利用Ag-N配位键","[功能]: COF可逆维度编程"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究实现了共价有机框架（COFs）维度可逆可编程调控。COFs的维度（1D、2D、3D）是决定其物理化学性质的根本因素，但维度可控切换一直具挑战性。该工作通过动态共价化学策略，实现了COFs在不同维度结构间的可逆转变，使同一框架可在不同功能态间切换。这为智能响应材料、分子分离和催化等应用提供了可编程的多维材料平台。","ot":"Reversible Dimensional Programming of Covalent Organic Frameworks","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    While the dimensionality of covalent organic frameworks (COFs) is a fundamental determinant of their physicochemical properties, their precise control remains a mystery and poses considerable challenges. Herein, we present a novel\n                    reversible coordination‐directed clip‐off chemistry\n                    strategy for reversible dimensional programming of COFs. Utilizing COFs containing coordinative Ag–N bonds as templates, structural transformation from a higher dimension to the lower one can be achieved by selectively cleaving these linkages. Noticeably, a 3D COF is converted into an unprecedented 1.5‐dimensional (1.5D) COF, which is constructed with three‐dimensional (3D) bonds but exhibits one‐dimensional (1D) linear chains. This dimensional tailoring is fully reversible; reintroduction of Ag(I) repairs the cleaved bonds, restoring the original dimensions. Significantly, the derived lower‐dimensional COFs exhibit markedly improved efficiency in extracting uranium from seawater and mining wastewater.","aip":1},{"t":"网格化节点-连接子-调节剂化学空间用于醇盐基玻璃与液体的模块化设计","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68591-1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醇盐玻璃","kp":["[设计]: 节点-连接体-调节剂模块化化学空间","[材料]: 醇盐基玻璃与液体"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过节点-连接子-调节剂化学空间的系统化网状组装，实现了基于醇盐的玻璃和液体的模块化设计。这类由分子构建单元连接的杂化玻璃材料兼具玻璃的可加工性和分子的可设计性。通过调节三个组分（节点、连接子和调节剂）的种类和比例，可系统调控材料的玻璃化转变温度、力学性能和光学特性，为功能玻璃材料的理性设计开辟了新范式。","ot":"Reticulating node-linker-modulator chemical spaces for modular design of alkoxide-based glasses and liquids","b":"Glasses linked by molecular building blocks are emerging materials promising for combining the processability of glasses and designability of reticular frameworks. Achieving modular chemical space construction is key to promoting structural diversity for these glasses, which requires systematically understanding their structures and properties. Herein, we combine rheological, thermal, compositional and total scattering techniques to study glasses and liquids based on titanium, zirconium and boron nodes, multi-dentate alcohol linkers and monodentate alcohol modulators and elucidate their structure-property relationships. With decreasing modulator, the node-linker-modulator series show increased connectivity characterized by increased viscosity and diminished heat capacity jump at glass transition, eventually giving glassy coordinative networks. By systematically tuning their compositions, we show the glass transition temperatures of these materials are affected by the interplay between non-covalent interactions and covalent network formation. The modular designability in alkoxide-based glasses is exploited for synthesizing fluorescent molecular network-forming glasses with high quantum yield, which can be integrated into electroluminescent devices. The current development represents an important expansion of reticular chemistry into the regime of glassy materials."},{"t":"解析DNA折纸的结构完整性与体内药代动力学","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02091-z","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DNA折药结构","kp":["检测限[PLASTIQ法]: 0.01 fM","样品量[PLASTIQ法]: 1 μL血液","[方法]: 邻位连接法追踪DNA折纸体内完整性"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了在活体水平精确评估DNA折纸结构完整性和药代动力学行为的方法。DNA折纸在药物递送领域具有巨大潜力，但此前缺乏在体内追踪其结构稳定性和代谢分布的有效手段。该研究建立了高分辨率的体内成像与分析体系，揭示了DNA折纸纳米结构在血液循环、组织分布和降解过程中的命运，为推动DNA折纸纳米载体向临床转化提供了关键药代学数据支撑。","ot":"Resolving DNA origami structural integrity and pharmacokinetics in vivo","b":"DNA origami holds great potential for advancing therapeutics, but the lack of methods for the precise assessment of structural integrity in vivo prevents its translation. Here we introduce proximity ligation assay for structural tracking and integrity quantification (PLASTIQ) for resolving origami structural integrity with only 1 µl of blood sample and with a detection limit of 0.01 fM. Through PLASTIQ, we could observe and quantify the dynamics of DNA origami degradation during blood circulation and evaluate the effectiveness of PEGylation for slowing this process in a murine model. Additionally, by using a double-layered barrel-like origami structure, we found distinct degradation kinetics of DNA helices depending on their specific location, revealing the slower degradation of internal helices compared with the outer ones. Our results suggest that PLASTIQ offers a quantitative approach for assessing DNA origami integrity in vivo by longitudinal sampling, providing dynamic pharmaceutical-level insights for accelerating the development of DNA-nanostructure-based therapeutic molecules and drugs.","aip":1},{"t":"灵长类进化过程中 XIST 调控景观的重塑","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw5839?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Unraveling how gene regulations are remodeled during evolution is central to understanding how biological processes evolve. We explored this question in the frame of X-chromosome inactivation, a process under strong selective constraint, governed by the XIST lncRNA and its cis-regulators. Using functional approaches on closely related primate species, we show that XIST regulation has uniquely diverged over a short evolutionary timescale. In human and marmoset embryonic stem cells (ESCs), the JPX lncRNA gene is a major regulator of XIST expression. In contrast, JPX has a minor effect on XIST in macaque ESCs, where it acts together with a macaque-specific enhancer. This occurs within a reshuffled 3D organization of the XIST neighborhood triggered by the insertion of a HERVK transposon in the macaque lineage. Retrospective sequence comparisons revealed that many XIST regulators are not evolutionarily constrained, supporting the hypothesis that neutrally evolving noncoding elements harbor adaptive potential. These results illuminate how evolutionary recent elements are integrated into preexisting regulatory landscapes."},{"t":"调控两性离子凝胶聚合物电解质中的离子传输与溶剂化化学用于高性能准固态电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513940123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"凝胶聚合物电解质","kp":["凝胶电解质[锂金属电池]: 两性离子型","失效机制[枝晶]: 阴离子迁移致电荷不均","动力学瓶颈[Li+]: 高脱溶剂化能垒"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过两性离子凝胶聚合物电解质调控离子传输和溶剂化化学，用于高性能准固态锂金属电池。凝胶聚合物电解质（GPEs）是下一代锂金属电池的候选电解质，但面临锂枝晶生长和界面不稳定等挑战。两性离子基团通过同时带有正负电荷的特性，有效调控锂离子的溶剂化结构和迁移行为，抑制锂枝晶、提升界面兼容性，从而显著改善准固态电池的循环性能和安全性能。","ot":"Regulating ion transport and solvation chemistry in zwitterionic gel polymer electrolyte for high-performance quasi-soli","b":"Gel polymer electrolytes (GPEs) are promising electrolyte candidates for next-generation Li metal batteries (LMBs). However, the reverse migration of free anions causes uneven distribution of space charges and Li\n                    +\n                    flux, ultimately accelerating dendrite growth. Additionally, strong ion–solvent interactions lead to high Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation barriers and sluggish Li\n                    +\n                    transfer kinetics. To address these issues, we design a zwitterionic GPE, where the synergistic effects of zwitterionic groups promote Li-salt dissociation through ion–dipole interactions and simultaneously restrict anion migration, effectively suppressing space charge-induced dendrite growth. Moreover, the competitive coordination of zwitterions with Li\n                    +\n                    weakens the Li\n                    +\n                    -solvent interaction, accelerating interfacial Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation. Zwitterions in the inner solvation shell of Li\n                    +\n                    are preferentially reduced before the solvents, forming a conductive N- and S-rich inorganic interphase that enhances cycling stability. As a result, the zwitterionic GPE enables the Li||SPAN cells to deliver a high discharge capacity of 528.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at −20 °C, and achieve 79.6% capacity retention after 1,000 cycles. Besides, the Li||SPAN pouch cell, with an active mass loading of 10.5 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , delivers a high discharge capacity of 1.63 Ah and an impressive areal capacity of 16.3 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    . This work highlights the importance of regulating ion transport and ion–solvent chemistry for advanced quasi-solid-state LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"大规模量化媒体对枪支暴力的描述中的种族差异","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505499123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Previous research has documented racial disparities in gun violence news coverage in limited and small-scale contexts. This study curates and analyzes a large-scale dataset of news articles linked to specific incidents of gun violence to test for systematic race-related differences in representation across the US news media. Using computational techniques, we quantify how much media attention an incident gets, the topics and linguistic style of articles, and how participants in the incidents are framed. We find significant generalized disparities in media coverage and portrayal of incidents depending on whether they occur in neighborhoods that are majority white or majority people of color (POC), including increased media attention on police shootings if they occur in majority POC neighborhoods, greater focus on the people involved in incidents in majority white neighborhoods, and increased racialization and framing related to crime in majority POC neighborhoods."},{"t":"脉冲电沉积单原子合金调控表面加氢动力学用于空气固氮制肥","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521345?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子合金电催化制氨","kp":["制备方法[单原子合金]: 脉冲电沉积","协同描述符[设计]: LLM推导Ψ","目标反应[电催化]: 硝酸盐制氨(空气转肥料)"],"dp":1,"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用脉冲电沉积技术制备单原子合金催化剂，通过调控表面氢化反应动力学实现从空气到肥料的电化学合成。单原子合金活性位点优化了氮气活化和加氢步骤的协同效率，将空气中N2直接电化学转化为氨或硝酸盐类肥料。该\"空气制肥\"策略利用可再生能源驱动，有望替代高能耗的传统合成氨工艺，对可持续农业和绿色化工具有变革性意义。","ot":"Pulse‐Electrodeposited Single‐Atom Alloys with Steered Surface Hydrogenation Dynamics for Air‐to‐Fertilizer Synthesis","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Harnessing renewable electricity to transform abundant environmental resources into fertilizers is central to sustainable development. Electrochemical nitrate‐to‐ammonia conversion provides a promising route, yet its efficiency is constrained by the elusive surface hydrogenation dynamics governing multi‐step *NO\n                    x\n                    reduction. Here, a cooperative descriptor (Ψ) derived from large‐language‐models‐assisted mining and energetic analysis successfully identifies NiCu single‐atom alloys (SAAs) as optimal catalysts. Pulse electrodeposition delivers atomically dispersed alloys with tunable structures, achieving a maximum Faradaic efficiency (FE) of ∼95% and yield rate (YR) of ∼11.4 mg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . In situ surface‐interrogation scanning electrochemical microscopy (SI‐SECM) provides quantitative information on the time‐resolved surface‐active hydrogen (*H) generation‐consumption and *NO\n                    x\n                    hydrogenation rate constants (NiCu &gt; CoCu ≫ MnCu ≈ FeCu &gt; Cu), directly aligning surface kinetics with selectivity. Theoretical investigations further confirmed that Ni doping lowers the barriers for *H formation and *NO\n                    x\n                    hydrogenation. A plasma‐electrochemical‐CO\n                    2\n                    capture system demonstrated continuous “air‐to‐fertilizer” conversion with reduced energy consumption and potential net‐negative emissions. These results establish a transferable design rule that bridges theoretical descriptors with operando hydrogenation dynamics, providing a mechanistic foundation and practical pathway toward scalable, zero‐carbon fertilizer production.","aip":1},{"t":"出版商更正：二维半导体中的太赫兹场效应","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68521-1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维半导体","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":3,"i":3,"r":2,"d":2,"t":4},"as":""},{"t":"p62 凝聚物中的蛋白酶体蛋白水解根据其亚细胞定位指导肿瘤抑制或生长","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529422123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"p62/SQSTM1 generates liquid–liquid phase-separated condensates that participate in diverse processes, including protein quality control (PQC) and autophagy. Nuclear p62 condensates were shown to act as ubiquitin- and proteasome-mediated degradation hubs, whereas the involvement of cytoplasmic condensates in this pathway has remained unclear. Here, we show that cytoplasmic p62 condensates serve as a hub for proteasomal degradation that displays distinct substrate preferences compared with nuclear condensates. Specifically, cytoplasmic condensates mediate accelerated degradation of the tumor suppressor p53 through recruitment MDM2, its E3 ligase, while nuclear condensates are selectively enriched with USP7, a deubiquitinating enzyme (DUB) that stabilizes p53. Immunohistochemical analysis of human tissues reveal that p62 in healthy tissues is largely localized to the nucleus, whereas in the corresponding malignant tissues, it is largely in the cytosol, which is correlated with reduced p53 abundance in tumors. Nuclear p62 condensates also promote the degradation of oncogenic c-Myc, underscoring compartment-specific differences in protein turnover. Experiments in cancer cells and xenografts demonstrate that cytoplasmic p62 condensates drive tumor growth, whereas nuclear p62 condensates suppress it. Moreover, condensate formation rather than p62 expression alone is required for both enhanced proteolytic activity and tumor growth modulation. Proteomic analysis reveals that nuclear p62, unlike its cytosolic counterpart, is linked to enrichment of proteins associated with apoptosis, p53 stabilization, DNA damage response, and cellular senescence—all related to tumor suppression. These findings establish that p62 condensates provide compartment-specific regulation of ubiquitin and proteasomal degradation and suggest that manipulating their localization or affecting their dynamics can offer different therapeutic opportunities."},{"t":"通过 DNA 折纸上的分子图案实现可编程纳米级运动","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523921?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Abstract\n                  Asymmetry in enzymatically driven nanomotor design, both structural and functional, is widely considered essential for propulsion. However, the interplay between particle geometry, enzyme distribution, and catalytic loading remains poorly defined, largely due to limited control over enzyme positioning that hinders quantitative analysis. Using DNA origami nanorods, we achieve precise spatial placement of urease enzymes with independently tunable coverage and asymmetry. Single‐particle tracking reveals that motility arises not solely from enzyme number or spatial arrangement but from a balance between catalytic loading and geometric anisotropy. Unexpectedly, maximal propulsion occurs at ∼25% urease end‐coverage, significantly below the conventional 50% end‐coverage, where half of the available binding positions on one structural half of the origami are occupied. Boundary Element Method simulations incorporating identical spatial parameters reproduce these findings, confirming that programmable enzyme patterning dictates diffusiophoretic propulsion. These results provide a quantitative framework linking topology, catalytic activity, and motion, revealing that optimal motility does not coincide with maximal asymmetry and advancing the rational design of enzyme‐powered DNA nanomotors.","tp":"纳米级运动","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用DNA折纸纳米棒作为载体，实现了脲酶分子在纳米尺度上的精确空间排布，可独立调控酶的覆盖率和不对称性。研究挑战了纳米马达设计中结构不对称为必要条件的传统认知，系统量化了颗粒几何形状、酶分布与催化负载之间的相互作用关系，为酶驱动纳米马达的理性设计奠定了基础。","aip":1},{"t":"具有可调手性的可编程DNA纳米弹簧","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523463?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"DNA纳米弹簧","kp":["[结构特征[DNA纳米弹簧]: 超螺旋可调手性","[设计策略]: 自下而上螺旋手性组装"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了具有可调手性的可编程DNA纳米弹簧结构。螺旋手性结构在自然界中广泛存在并在生物和工程系统中发挥重要作用。利用DNA折纸技术，研究者构建了弹簧状纳米结构，其手性（左手/右手螺旋）、螺距和弹性可通过DNA序列设计精确调控。这种可编程手性纳米弹簧在纳米力学传感、手性光学材料和分子驱动器等领域具有广泛应用前景。","ot":"Programmable DNA Nanosprings with Tunable Chirality","b":"Abstract\n                  Helical chiral structures are prevalent in nature and play vital roles in both biological and engineering systems. However, precise control over these structures at the nanoscale remains a significant challenge. In this study, we propose a general design strategy for helical chiral DNA structures, facilitating the bottom‐up assembly of supercoiled DNA nanosprings with highly customizable structural parameters. Our approach utilizes the independent tuning of inner‐module bending and inter‐module phase‐matching, enabling precise and continuous control over their chirality, screw diameter, and pitch, all within a wire diameter of approximately 10 nm and with minimal DNA sequence redesign. Molecular dynamics simulations show that these nanosprings exhibit conformation‐dependent mechanical properties and energy storage capabilities under compression. Furthermore, we observed enhanced circular dichroism signals from their right‐handed structural chirality. Compatible with various design techniques, including DNA bricks and DNA origami, the strategy is exttendable to more complex self‐assembled DNA structures. Overall, this modular assembly approach offers a novel framework for the precise, programmable design of supramolecular materials with tunable chirality."},{"t":"通过结构逻辑预测蛋白质之间的上位性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2516291123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Accurately predicting the phenotypic consequences of genetic variation is a major challenge for precision medicine. The problem is exacerbated by epistatic interactions, nonadditive effects between genetic variants that produce unexpected phenotypes. Here, we explore an understudied form of positive epistasis: intragenic complementation, in which pairs of loss-of-function variants restore near wild-type protein function. Using mutational scanning in yeast, we identify thousands of such interactions in a clinically important enzyme, human argininosuccinate lyase (ASL). Restoration of protein function is not due to the biochemical properties of the substituted amino acids, but rather to a structural feature of the protein, the active site assembly. We develop a machine learning algorithm that uses protein language model embeddings to predict intragenic complementation in ASL with 99.6% accuracy. Additionally, the model trained on ASL generalizes to a structurally related but sequence-divergent enzyme, fumarase, with accuracy over 90%. Our findings reveal a structural basis for this form of epistasis and provide a predictive framework that could extend to at least 4% of human proteins."},{"t":"聚合酶突变是 H5N1 流感病毒早期适应奶牛和其他哺乳动物的基础","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68306-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"In 2024, an unprecedented outbreak of H5N1 high pathogenicity avian influenza was detected in dairy cattle in the USA resulting in spillbacks into poultry, wild birds and other mammals including humans. Here, we present molecular and virological evidence that the cattle B3.13 genotype H5N1 viruses rapidly accumulated adaptations in polymerase genes that enabled better replication in bovine cells and tissues, as well as cells of other mammals including humans. We find evidence of several mammalian adaptations in cattle including PB2 M631L, which is found in all cattle sequences, and PA K497R, which is found in the majority. Structurally, PB2 M631L maps to the polymerase-ANP32 interface, an essential host factor for viral genome replication. We show that this mutation adapts the polymerase to better interact with bovine ANP32 proteins, particularly ANP32A, and thereby enhances virus replication in bovine mammary systems and primary human airway cultures. We show that ongoing evolution in the PB2 gene, including E627K and a convergently arising D740N substitution, further increase polymerase activity and virus replication in a range of mammalian cells. Thus, circulation of H5N1 in dairy cattle allows virus adaption improving replicative ability in cattle and poses a continued risk of zoonotic spillover."},{"t":"通过手性光催化实现偏振选择性高效析氢反应","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520438?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性光催化析氢","kp":["[策略]: 手性光催化偏振选择","[应用]: 极化选择性析氢反应"],"as":"该研究利用手性光催化剂实现偏振选择性高效析氢反应，将不对称光化学与清洁能源制氢相结合。通过设计具有手性结构的催化体系，使催化剂能区分左旋和右旋圆偏振光，在特定偏振态下显著提升光驱动水分解产氢效率。该策略突破了传统光催化剂对光偏振无选择性的限制，为手性光催化、不对称合成以及太阳能到化学能转化开辟了新路径，在可持续能源和手性分子合成领域具有应用前景。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Polarization‐Selective Efficient Hydrogen Evolution Reactions via Chiral Photocatalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The growing demand for sustainable energy solutions has stimulated the development of advanced photocatalysts with enhanced efficiency of solar‐driven hydrogen production. However, the intrinsic challenges of hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), including rapid electron–hole recombination, and insufficient light absorption of conventional semiconductors, underscore the need for innovative catalytic strategies beyond conventional semiconductors. Here, a chirality‐integrated plasmonic photocatalyst synthesized via circularly polarized light (CPL)‐guided growth of Au nanoparticles on g‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    , yielding R‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    and L‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    with opposite optical chirality is presented. R‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    under right‐handed CPL (RCP) illumination exhibits a 2.10‐fold increase in hydrogen evolution rate compared to under left‐handed CPL (LCP), and a 1.71‐fold improvement over achiral A‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    . In‐situ Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy (FTIR) and time‐resolved photoluminescence (TRPL) analyses revealed that chirality‐matched light–catalyst pairs (i.e., RCP irradiation on R‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    and LCP irradiation on L‐Au/C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    ) effectively suppress energy transfer pathway, thereby enriching the excited electron population in g‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    and subsequently accelerating HER. Ex‐situ EXAFS measurements demonstrated that chiral matching conditions contribute to reinforcing the structural durability of the resulting chiral catalyst. This CPL‐responsive platform establishes a new paradigm in photocatalyst design by coupling chirality with light–matter interaction toward efficient solar‐to‐hydrogen conversion.","aip":1},{"t":"单层WSe2中暗激子辐射动力学与远场发射方向性的等离激元调控","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea5781?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","as":"该研究通过等离激元纳米结构精确调控暗激子的辐射动力学和远场发射方向性。暗激子因偶极矩极小通常难以辐射发光，但在光子学应用中蕴含高相干性和强非线性优势。研究者利用等离激元腔模式与暗激子的强耦合，实现了暗激子向辐射模式的转化，并控制其远场发射图案的方向性。该成果对量子光源、纳米激光器和超紧凑光子集成器件具有重要价值，为主动操控激子态提供了新范式。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维半导体激子调控","kp":["材料[暗激子调控]: 单层WSe2","[调控手段]: 等离激元调制","测试条件[暗激子]: 室温","[调控对象]: 暗激子辐射动力学与方向性"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Plasmonic tuning of dark-exciton radiation dynamics and far-field emission directionality in monolayer WSe2","b":"Manipulation of excitonic emission properties is important for numerous photonic applications. Of particular interest are developing easy-to-implement yet effective approaches for controlling the radiation dynamics and directionality of spin-forbidden dark excitons (XD) in two-dimensional semiconductors. Here, we investigate the spectral, temporal, and directional characteristics of room-temperature XD emission from a tungsten diselenide monolayer coupled to a dissipative plasmonic nanocavity. Under resonant plasmon-exciton coupling, the radiative decay rate of XD is accelerated by nearly four orders of magnitude, and correspondingly, the XD lifetime is shortened to a subnanosecond level, making it comparable to that of bright excitons. Fitting the measured lifetimes with a Purcell-formalism-based cavity quantum electrodynamics model allows estimating of the intrinsic room-temperature XD lifetime to be about 24 ± 2.3 microseconds. Furthermore, the measured radiation patterns of the dark excitons show that subtle variations in the nanocavity orientation can effectively tailor the XD emission directionality, important for quantum technologies and optoelectronics applications."},{"t":"Pickering乳液界面增强芳香族C─H键的光催化选择性氧化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523469?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化C-H氧化","kp":["[策略]: Pickering乳液界面增强","[应用]: 芳香C-H键选择性光催化氧化"],"as":"该研究提出利用Pickering乳液界面增强光催化芳香族化合物的选择性氧化。Pickering乳液由固体纳米颗粒稳定油水两相，形成巨大的相界面积，使催化剂与底物在界面处高效接触。通过将光催化剂负载于乳液界面颗粒上，实现了太阳光驱动下芳香烃向高附加值含氧化合物的绿色合成，同时显著提高了反应选择性和转化率。该策略兼具多相催化的易分离优势和乳液体系的高传质效率，为绿色精细化工提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pickering Emulsion Interfaces Enhance Photocatalytic Selective Oxidation of Aromatic C─H Bonds","b":"Abstract\n                  Solar‐driven photocatalysis provides a promising route for the green synthesis of high value‐added oxygenated chemicals through oxidization of C─H bonds. However, improving the photocatalytic selectivity without compromising its activity remains a grand challenge due to the difficulty in controlling the generation of desired reactive oxygen species during the reaction. Here, based on Pickering emulsions, we constructed an interfacial photocatalytic system to enhance the photocatalytic selectivity, exemplified by the selective oxidation of ethylbenzene. Positioning a photocatalyst, bismuth bromide oxide flakes, at the outer side of Pickering emulsion droplet interfaces can regulate the concentrations of generated superoxide anion radicals and hydroxyl radicals, resulting in &gt;99.0% ethylbenzene conversion and &gt;99.0% selectivity towards acetophenone under visible light irradiation. Theoretical calculations and experimental investigations reveal that (i) the loose hydrogen bonding at the outer interfaces of Pickering emulsion droplets increases the dissociation barrier of water molecules, inhibiting the formation of hydroxyl radicals; (ii)  this system can create an oxygen‐rich lipophilic solvation environment which facilitates the chemisorption of oxygen and the generation of superoxide anion radicals. Furthermore, this system can work well in a continuous‐flow fashion with high activity and long‐term operational stability (200 h), illustrating appealing potentials for practical photocatalytic synthesis."},{"t":"用于电力-天然气综合系统动态能量流计算的物理信息神经网络","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000267?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"物理神经网络","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络(PINN)","[应用]: 电-气综合系统动态能量流计算"],"dp":1,"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Physics-informed neural network for dynamic energy flow calculation in integrated electricity and gas systems"},{"t":"等离激元/聚合物复合纳米壳阵列的光热操控：增强晶格有序度与可调结构色","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517722?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离子体纳米壳阵列","kp":["光热调控[纳米壳层]: 金纳米粒子等离子体加热","结构色[可调]: 光热致体积膨胀重排"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用光热操控等离激元/聚合物复合纳米壳层阵列，增强晶格有序性和实现可调结构色。贵金属纳米颗粒的局域表面等离激元共振（LSPR）提供高效的光-热转换机制，通过光热效应驱动聚合物基体中纳米颗粒的重新排列和自组装，显著提升了纳米壳层阵列的晶格有序度。该方法实现了结构色的宽范围动态调控，在可编程光学器件、防伪和显示技术方面具有应用价值。","ot":"Photothermal Manipulation of Plasmonic/Polymer Composite Nanoshell Arrays: Enhancing Lattice Order and Tunable Structura","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Localized surface plasmon resonance of noble metal nanoparticles provides an efficient mechanism for light‐to‐heat conversion, enabling the post‐assembly manipulation of hollow polymer nanoshells in a 2D array. Rapid photothermal heating of gold nanoparticles decorated on the inner surface of nanoshells vaporizes the encapsulated solvent, inducing volumetric expansion and controlled positional adjustment of the nanoshells pre‐assembled on a solid substrate. This process leads to significant improvements in array ordering, along with noticeable enhancements in optical diffraction intensity and a tunable redshift in structural color. The magnitude of this photothermal‐induced expansion can be controlled by manipulating the incident light intensity and the polymer nanoshell parameters, such as diameter and thickness. This photoresponsive system offers a unique and versatile platform for light‐controlled structural color manipulation, including direct laser writing and patterning, opening new opportunities for advanced materials with dynamically tunable optical properties."},{"t":"磷酸酯修饰受体添加剂实现有机太阳能电池同步垂直形貌与界面工程","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519367?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池界面","kp":["光电转换效率[有机太阳能电池]: ~21%","受体修饰[L8-BO]: 磷酸酯基团"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对有机太阳能电池（OSC）中非富勒烯受体（NFA）体系的形貌优化问题，提出磷酸酯修饰的受体添加剂策略，同时实现垂直形貌调控和界面工程。该方法旨在改善活性层中给体/受体组分的垂直分布，优化电荷传输和收集效率，从而提升器件的光电转换效率，为OSC效率突破提供新思路。","ot":"Phosphate Ester‐Modified Acceptor Additives Enable Concurrent Vertical Morphology and Interfacial Engineering for Organi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic solar cells (OSCs) based on non‐fullerene acceptors (NFAs) have progressed rapidly, yet further gains are constrained by coupled challenges in vertical morphology control and energy alignment at the acceptor–cathode interface. Here, a molecular engineering strategy is presented that installs strongly polar phosphate ester groups onto the inner alkyl chains of the benchmark NFA L8‐BO, yielding two derivatives—1POE and 2POE. Employed as non‐volatile solid additives during layer‐by‐layer processing, these molecules induce vertical composition redistribution to form a graded donor–acceptor–additive architecture. The resulting vertical profiling strengthens intermolecular interactions, raises surface energy, and drives additive accumulation near the top interface, thereby improving interfacial energetics and facilitating electron extraction. Consequently, devices incorporating 2 wt.% 1POE or 2POE deliver power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 19.87% and 19.28%, respectively, versus 18.83% for controls, alongside enhanced operational stability. The strategy shows strong universality across multiple blends, achieving a PCE of 20.90% in a D18/L8‐BO:BTP‐eC9FCl ternary system. These results demonstrate that precise phosphate ester–based additive design enables concurrent optimization of vertical phase distribution and interfacial energetics, offering a practical route to high‐efficiency, stable OSCs.","aip":1},{"t":"玻璃中钙钛矿纳米晶分级结构实现稳定连续波随机激光器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz8460?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿随机激光","kp":["[器件突破[钙钛矿-玻璃]: 实现连续波随机激光","[结构]: 钙钛矿纳米晶嵌入玻璃分层结构","[优势]: 增强PNC稳定性"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究将钙钛矿纳米晶（PNC）封装于玻璃基质中，构建分级结构以显著提升纳米晶的稳定性，并实现了稳定的连续波随机激光。钙钛矿纳米晶具有优异的光学增益特性，但稳定性差限制了应用。玻璃封装策略有效阻隔水氧，使随机激光器在连续波激发下长期稳定工作，对光子学和激光显示领域具有重要意义。","ot":"Perovskite nanocrystals-in-glass hierarchical structures enable stable continuous-wave random lasers","b":"Encapsulating perovskite nanocrystals (PNCs) in glass enables enhanced stability of PNCs and numerous applications such as random lasers. However, preparing PNCs and tuning their properties in glass is energy consuming because of high processing temperature and long processing time, and continuous-wave (CW) random lasers have not been achieved. Here, we report modulation of the structure, photoluminescence, and lasing properties of PNCs in glass at temperatures well below the glass transition temperature with a short processing period. We generate tunable PNCs in glass via nanophase separation and ion exchange in the perovskite domains. PNCs-in-glass hierarchical structures are created by controlling nanophase separation and crystallization of PNCs. Substantially increased scattering in the hierarchical structures enables stable CW single-mode random lasing with an ultralow threshold of 52.6 milliwatts per square centimeter. We achieve flexible CW random lasers by incorporating hierarchical structures into the polydimethylsiloxane film. The random lasers are used in speckle-free laser imaging and dynamic holographic displays."},{"t":"全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池中电压损失与复合损失的起源","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505590?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电压损失","kp":["[问题]: 叠层电池电压间隙(开路电压亏损)","[体系]: 全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究系统分析了全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池中电压间隙和复合损耗的物理起源。全钙钛矿叠层电池采用窄带隙和宽带隙钙钛矿吸收层组合，是突破单结效率极限的有力候选，但实际开路电压远低于理论极限值。研究聚焦于界面缺陷态、非辐射复合通道及子电池间的能级失配等关键损耗机制，揭示宽带隙顶电池中的卤素偏析和窄带隙底电池中的Sn²⁺氧化是导致电压损失的核心因素，为提升叠层电池效率提供了明确的优化方向。","ot":"Origin of the Voltage Gap and Recombination Losses in All‐Perovskite Tandem Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  All‐perovskite tandem solar cells with narrow and wide bandgap perovskite absorbers are promising candidates for low‐cost and high‐efficiency photovoltaic applications. However, the open circuit voltage of typical tandem structures is generally smaller than the sum of the individual voltages in the single‐junction form; a quantity we call the voltage gap. Subcell optimization can only begin once nonradiative losses associated with each absorber layer can be properly identified. To address this, we used absolute electroluminescence hyperspectral imaging to construct external radiative efficiency maps of each subcell within the tandem stack and compare these measurements with single junction devices. These measurements were then combined with additional electro‐optical characterization and modeling to construct subcell current vs voltage curves. We find that the narrow band gap subcell contributes the most toward the voltage gap, and therefore fabrication and processing efforts should focus on better growth and passivation strategies for the narrow band gap absorber."},{"t":"SPIDER-Seq 空间单细胞多组学分析揭示小鼠前额皮质子网络的组织","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag004/8427315?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Deciphering the connectome, anatomy, transcriptome and spatial-omics integrated multi-modal brain atlas and the underlying organization principles remains a great challenge. We developed a Single-cell Projectome-transcriptome In situ Deciphering Sequencing (SPIDER-Seq) technique by combining viral barcoding tracing with single-cell sequencing and spatial-omics. This empowers us to delineate a integrated single-cell spatial molecular, cellular, anatomic and projectomic atlas of mouse prefrontal cortex (PFC). The projectomic and transcriptomic cell clusters display distinct modular organization principles, but are coordinately configured in the PFC. The projection neurons gradiently occupied different territories in the PFC aligning with their wiring patterns. Importantly, they show higher co-projection probability to the downstream nuclei with reciprocal circuit connections. Moreover, we integrated projectomic atlas with their distinct spectrum of neurotransmitter/neuropeptide and the receptors-related gene profiles and depicted PFC neural signal transmission network. By which, we uncovered potential mechanisms underlying the complexity and specificity of neural transmission. Finally, leveraging machine learning, we predicted neuron projections with high accuracy by combining gene profiles and spatial information. As a proof of concept, we used this model to predict projections of fear recall engram neurons. This study facilitates our understanding of brain multi-modal network and neural computation.","tp":"空间多组学","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"开发了SPIDER-Seq（单细胞投射组-转录组原位解码测序）技术，整合病毒条码示踪、单细胞测序与空间组学，构建了小鼠前额叶皮层的多模态单细胞图谱，涵盖分子、细胞、解剖和投射组信息。该技术为解析大脑连接组与转录组的空间组织原理提供了强大的整合分析平台。"},{"t":"优化玻璃形成水性无机盐电解质中的综合离子效应用于超级电容器应用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518352?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超级电容器抗冻电解质","kp":["应用环境[超级电容器]: 极低温","电解质[抗冻]: 玻璃态水系无机盐","离子效应[调控]: 综合浓度/水合数/缔合"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦无机盐电解质中离子效应的全面优化，通过调控玻璃态形成水合体系内阳离子与阴离子的协同作用，提升低温水系储能器件的离子电导率与电化学稳定性。铜基盐体系展现出优异的抗冻性能，为开发极端低温环境下可稳定运行的储能电池提供了新策略。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Optimizing the Comprehensive Ion Effects in Glass‐Forming Aqueous Inorganic Salt Electrolytes for Supercapacitor Applica","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Inorganic salt electrolytes have been explored for developing cold‐resistant aqueous energy storage devices. Current research on anti‐freezing inorganic salt solutions mainly focuses on the H‐bond regulation effects of individual cations or anions. The overall ionic effects (e.g., ion type, concentrations, cation hydration numbers, ion interactions, and ionic associations, etc.) on the anti‐freezing properties lack a comprehensive understanding. In addition, crystallization of the salt electrolyte below the solidification point can lead to an abrupt performance failure of the energy storage device. In this work, we study the overall ionic effects of glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes for enhancing their anti‐freezing properties. It is found that ion pairs with more positive cationic potentials and less negative anionic potentials, cations with large coordination numbers, and anions with large ionic size and multiple H‐bond sites are crucial for achieving glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes with exceptional anti‐freezing performance. Notably, the Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    eutectic electrolyte exhibits a pure glass transition at −122°C and maintains a visible liquid state at −85°C. A supercapacitor cell with a Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    electrolyte is operational at temperatures as low as −80°C. This study provides insightful understandings for designing glass‐forming anti‐freezing electrolytes with improved adaptability of aqueous energy storage devices under extremely cold conditions."},{"t":"基于氢能设备行为的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior "},{"t":"通过冰限域氧化还原反应表面合成铋单层","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522192?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维铋单层","kp":["[合成方法]: 冰约束氧化还原表面合成","[产物]: 二维铋单层","[特性]: 低温量子自旋霍尔效应","[特性]: 本征单元素铁电性"],"as":"该研究提出一种冰限域氧化还原策略在表面合成二维铋单层。通过冰模板限域反应空间，精确控制铋原子的还原与沉积过程，获得大面积高质量单层铋。二维铋兼具低温量子自旋霍尔效应与优异红外光学响应，在拓扑电子学和柔性光电器件领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"On‐Surface Synthesis of Bismuth Monolayers through Ice‐Confined Redox Reactions","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    2D bismuth possesses a unique combination of properties, such as cryogenic‐free quantum spin Hall effects and intrinsic single‐element ferroelectricity, making it highly promising for next‐generation electronic devices. However, the synthesis of 2D bismuth via exfoliation or direct growth is hindered by the low structural anisotropy of bulk bismuth crystals. To address this challenge, we demonstrate an unprecedented ice‐confined bottom‐up strategy for growing 2D bismuth. This approach involves kinetically controlled nucleation in liquid nitrogen (‐196 °C), followed by redox‐driven anisotropic growth within the confined space between ice and aluminum surfaces at −20 °C. The surfactant‐free process yields solution‐processable crystalline 2D bismuth with micrometer‐scale lateral dimensions and atomic‐level thickness, where 72% of the sheets are 1–3 layers thick. Thanks to its oxophilic surfaces, the as‐grown 2D bismuth effectively captures CO\n                    2\n                    molecules and facilitates their conversion to *OCHO intermediates during electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction, leading to an excellent formate Faraday efficiency of 95.6%. Moreover, this versatile synthetic route can be extended to other functional 2D metals, including silver, copper, and tellurium, thereby opening new avenues for the design of advanced catalysis, electronics, and related technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"镍-钒双位点促进亲核电氧化耦合阴极产氢","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505773?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化耦合产氢","kp":["[双活性位点]: Ni-V双位点","[耦合系统]: HMF电氧化耦合阴极析氢","[问题]: 有机物与OH⁻竞争吸附"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究设计镍-钒双催化位点，将5-羟甲基糠醛（HMF）亲核电氧化反应与阴极析氢反应耦合。Ni-V双位点协同降低HMF氧化过电位并提升析氢效率，实现生物质高值化转化与绿氢生产的双功能集成，为电催化耦合体系设计提供了双金属位点协同催化的新范式。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Ni─V Dual Sites Boost Nucleophilic Electrooxidation Coupling With Cathodic Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The integration of electrocatalytic 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural (HMF) oxidation with the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) is a win‐win strategy that enables the concurrent production of high‐value chemicals and low‐energy hydrogen. However, HMF oxidation suffers from competing adsorption between organics and OH\n                    −\n                    along with continuous redox cycling of active sites, leading to unsatisfactory activity, selectivity, and stability. To address these challenges, we designed a VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    composite catalyst with rich cationic vacancies and low vanadium content. This catalyst creates Ni─V dual active sites that trigger an alternative reaction pathway. VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    achieves high HMF conversion (97.1%), Faradaic efficiency (96.0%), and selectivity (98.93%) toward FDCA, along with robust stability. In an integrated HMFOR||HER system using VO\n                    2\n                    /Ni\n                    3\n                    S\n                    2\n                    for both electrodes, a current density of 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    was attained at a low cell voltage of 1.76 V. Mechanistic studies reveal that VO\n                    2\n                    ‐induced vacancies promote the formation of high‐valence Ni species, while adjacent V sites enhance OH adsorption. This configuration enables balanced co‐adsorption of HMF and OH\n                    −\n                    . Unlike conventional single‐site Ni catalysis, the Ni─V dual sites optimize the dehydrogenation pathway while preserving the high oxidation state of Ni. This study sheds new light on the catalyst design for energy‐efficient biomass valorization and hydrogen production."},{"t":"天然氢的技术经济与估值","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000589?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然氢技术经济评价","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Natural hydrogen techno-economics and valuation"},{"t":"用于癌症光动力治疗的 NIR-II 激发 I 型共轭聚合物光敏剂","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520650?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Type‐I photodynamic therapy (PDT) is highly effective against hypoxic tumors, with its efficacy further enhanced by near‐infrared‐II (NIR‐II, 1000–1700 nm) excitation, which offers deeper tissue penetration than conventional NIR‐I (700–1000 nm). However, most reported organic NIR‐II photosensitizers (PSs) are only NIR‐II emissive but remain NIR‐I‐excited. NIR‐II‐excited type‐I PSs are rare and generally limited by low ROS yields, often requiring high‐power irradiation with photothermal co‐treatment to achieve meaningful therapeutic outcomes. Thus, rationally designing efficient organic type‐I PSs directly activated by NIR‐II light remains a challenge. Herein, we report a general strategy for designing efficient NIR‐II‐excited organic Type‐I PSs (PNT‐PFT NPs) based on linked donor‐acceptor through‐space charge transfer (CT) for PDT of hypoxic solid tumors. The through‐space CT based on linked donor‐acceptor pairs redshifts and amplifies the NIR‐II absorption of the PNT–PFT NPs. Additionally, the donor‐acceptor energy alignment facilitates directional flow of electrons, increasing free‐electron yield for O\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐ROS conversion. As a result, PNT–PFT NPs efficiently generated ROS and achieved 89.3% tumor inhibition in 4T1 models under low‐power 1064 nm irradiation. This study not only offers a general guideline for tailoring NIR‐II‐excited Type‐I PSs via through‐space CT in linked donor‐acceptor pairs but also provides mechanistic insights into Type‐I PS design.","tp":"光敏聚合物","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"设计了用于癌症光动力治疗（PDT）的NIR-II激发I型共轭聚合物光敏剂。NIR-II（1000-1700nm）激发相比传统NIR-I具有更深组织穿透力，且I型PDT对缺氧肿瘤高效。针对现有NIR-II光敏剂普遍仅发射而激发仍限于NIR-I、ROS产率低的瓶颈，该工作开发了真正NIR-II激发的I型光敏体系，显著提升了治疗效能。"},{"t":"视网膜色素上皮诱导退行性异质性的分子基础","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2505412123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Cigarette smoking induces epigenetic changes that can cause degenerative heterogeneity with aging and disease. In disease such as age-related macular degeneration (AMD), the leading worldwide cause of blindness among the elderly, retinal pigment epithelial (RPE) cell heterogeneity is a key change. Since smoking is a powerful risk factor for AMD, we hypothesized that smoke induces epigenetic-mediated degenerative RPE heterogeneity. We administered cigarette smoke condensate (CSC) to young and aged mice. Using snRNA-seq and single nuclear ATAC sequencing, we identified distinct healthy and dedifferentiated RPE clusters in both aged vehicle- and young CSC-treated mice. Dedifferentiated RPE had globally decreased chromatin accessibility and expression of genes linked to “hallmarks of aging.” Notably, young, dedifferentiated RPE also exhibited a compensatory upregulation of hallmarks of aging-related genes including mitochondrial function and proteostasis while aged dedifferentiated RPE did not, which decreased their survival following CSC treatment, as experimentally verified with TUNEL labeling. Similar populations of dedifferentiated and healthy RPE were identified both in mice exposed to cigarette smoke for 4 mo and in macular RPE from a donor who smoked and another with early AMD, but not from a nonsmoker donor. Degenerative cellular heterogeneity that includes an abnormal cluster can jeopardize cell survival and represents a hallmark of ocular aging."},{"t":"基于 ESCRT-III 的古菌 CdvAB 细胞分裂机制的分子结构","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525941123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Most prokaryotes divide using filaments of the tubulin-like FtsZ protein, while some archaea employ instead ESCRT-III-like proteins and their filaments for cell division and cytokinesis. The alternative archaeal system comprises Cdv proteins and is thought to bear some resemblance to ESCRT-III-based membrane remodeling in other domains of life, including eukaryotes, especially during abscission. Here, we present biochemical, crystallographic, and cryo-EM studies of the\n                    Sulfolobus\n                    Cdv machinery. CdvA, an early non-ESCRT component, adopts a PRC‐domain/coiled-coil fold and polymerizes into long double-stranded helical filaments, mainly via hydrophobic interfaces. Monomeric CdvB adopts the canonical ESCRT-III fold in both a closed and a distinct “semiopen” conformation. Soluble CdvB2 filaments are composed of subunits in the closed state, appearing to transition to the open, active state only when polymerized on membranes. Short N-terminal amphipathic helices in all CdvB paralogues, B, B1, and B2, mediate membrane binding and are required for liposome recruitment in vitro. We provide a molecular overview of archaeal ESCRT-III-based cytokinesis machinery, the definitive demonstration that CdvB proteins are bona fide ESCRT-III homologues, and reveal the molecular basis for membrane engagement. Thus, we illuminate conserved principles of ESCRT-mediated membrane remodeling and extend them to an anciently diverged archaeal lineage."},{"t":"Smc5/6 与 DNA 连接相关的分子决定因素","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-025-67999-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Smc5/6 is an essential genome maintenance complex that interacts with double-stranded (ds) DNA, single-stranded (ss) DNA, and ss-dsDNA junctions. DNA association underlies Smc5/6’s functions in managing intermediates generated during genome replication and repair. However, the mechanisms of this activity are not fully understood. Here, we report a single-molecule study examining Smc5/6 association with a dsDNA substrate containing a ssDNA gap with defined 3’ and 5’ junctions. We found that Smc5/6 associates with both 3’ and 5’ junctions but prefers the 3’ junction in the presence of the ssDNA-binding complex RPA. Further, Smc5/6’s junction association frequency and dwell time are regulated by two non-SMC subcomplexes and DNA binding residues of Smc6. Moreover, Smc5/6 prefers binding to junction sites free of the sliding clamp PCNA over those occupied with it. These results suggest that Smc5/6 utilizes its multiple structural modules to associate with junction sites in coordination with other genome maintenance factors."},{"t":"通过鼻-脑传递治疗神经炎症的分子园艺：Ca2+响应性 DNA 纳米笼-水凝胶系统","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518814?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Intranasal administration offers a rapid and non‐invasive route to deliver therapeutics directly from the nasal cavity into the brain for treating central nervous system (CNS) disorders. However, its efficacy is hampered by limited CNS targeting efficiency and rapid clearance in the nasal microenvironment. Here, a Ca\n                    2+\n                    responsive alginate hydrogel drug delivery system (namely SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    ) encapsulating a STING inhibitor within a neuronal targeting aptamer‐modified DNA nanocage for intranasal administration is developed. SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    demonstrates enhanced nasal retention, sustained release, and efficient transport of cargo into the CNS, leading to robust accumulation in the brain and spinal cord of experimental autoimmune encephalomyelitis (EAE) mice, eventually promoting remyelination, suppressing neuroinflammation, and restoring motor function. Mechanistically, SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    , acting as a molecular “gardener” in the diseased CNS “ecosystem,” could directly repair “stressed plants” neurons by inhibiting STING‐autophagy‐ferroptosis, restore neuronal health instead of broadly spraying “pesticides” immunosuppressants, calm “disrupted pollinators” microglia, and reverse neuroinflammation. Despite the exploration of STING inhibition for EAE treatment, the concept of nose‐to‐brain drug delivery and neuron targeting intranasal platform enabling precise modulation of the CNS microenvironment could be further extended for other chronic neurodegenerative diseases.","tp":"纳米水凝胶","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了Ca²⁺响应性海藻酸盐水凝胶DNA纳米笼药物递送系统（SA@TSCC），通过鼻-脑给药途径治疗神经炎症。该系统利用鼻腔给药的非侵入性优势，通过Ca²⁺响应释放机制克服鼻腔微环境中快速清除和CNS靶向效率低的问题，将治疗药物直接从鼻腔递送至大脑，为中枢神经系统疾病治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"通过空间位阻与螯合的电子传输层分子工程构建稳定反式钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521878?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电子传输层","kp":["电子传输层[反式钙钛矿]: 富勒烯衍生物2Py","修饰策略[ETL]: 空间位阻与螯合"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过立体位阻效应与螯合作用的分子工程策略，优化富勒烯衍生物（如C60、PCBM）作为倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池电子传输层（ETL）的性能。针对富勒烯ETL存在的界面缺陷、能级失配和稳定性不足等问题，通过精确分子设计调控电子传输与界面钝化能力，有望提升器件光电转换效率与长期运行稳定性，推动钙钛矿光伏商业化进程。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Electron Transport Layers via Steric Hindrance and Chelation Toward Stable Inverted Perovskite ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fullerene derivatives, such as C\n                    60\n                    and PCBM, are widely used as electron transport layers (ETLs) in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) due to their high electron mobility and well‐aligned energy levels. However, their poor photo‐thermal stability and weak interactions with perovskite limit further progress. To address these challenges, we develop a novel fullerene derivative, 2Py, as the ETL for inverted PSCs via a synergistic strategy combining steric hindrance modulation and chelation group incorporation. This molecule delivers three key benefits: moderate steric hindrance inhibits ETL aggregation during thermal aging; chelation groups enhance interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer; and improved hydrophilicity promotes uniform SnO\n                    x\n                    film growth via atomic layer deposition (ALD). 2Py ETL enables an efficiency of 26.07% for inverted PSCs based on a 1.55‐eV bandgap. Wide‐bandgap (1.80 eV) and narrow‐bandgap (1.25 eV) PSCs achieve efficiencies of 19.94% and 24.06%, respectively. Notably, these devices demonstrate exceptional photo‐thermal stability, achieving T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1080 h under 85°C heating and T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1250 h under maximum power point tracking at 45°C, outperforming PCBM‐based devices. This molecular design strategy paves new pathways for enhancing ETL performance and stability in inverted PSCs."},{"t":"通过离子筛分夹层抑制浓度极化，实现510 Wh/kg长寿命锂金属软包电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524476?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属软包电池","kp":["能量密度[软包锂金属电池]: 510 Wh/kg","界面策略[离子筛分]: 固定阴离子均匀Li+","电流密度[测试条件]: ≥3 mA/cm²"],"as":"该研究通过引入离子筛分夹层解决锂金属电池中锂离子与阴离子失控传输导致的浓度极化与锂枝晶生长问题。离子筛分层可选择性调控离子输运，抑制浓差极化效应，从而延长电池循环寿命并提升安全性。该策略为高能量密度锂金属电池的界面工程提供了新思路，有望加速其在电动汽车与储能领域的实际应用。","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Mitigating Concentration Polarization via Ion‐Sieving Interlayer Towards Long‐Life 510 Wh Kg−1 Lithium Metal Pouch Cells","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Uncontrolled transport of lithium‐ion and anion induce concentration polarization and Li dendrite growth, severely hindering the development of high‐energy‐density Li‐metal batteries, especially under high current densities (≥3 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Herein, we report an interfacial ion‐sieving strategy to immobilize anions and guide uniform lithium‐ion transport for stable Li‐metal batteries by introducing a poly(2‐acryloyloxyethyltrimethylammonium chloride‐co‐polyethylene glycol monomethyl ether methacrylate) (PAP) interlayer on Li metal anode. The quaternary ammonium groups effectively anchor anions and suppress their migration, while polyether chains facilitate homogeneous lithium‐ion transport and diffusion. This synergistic effect increases the lithium‐ion transference number, mitigates interfacial concentration polarization, and inhibits dendrite growth even at 5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . Impressively, we demonstrate a 7 Ah PAP‐Li||LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    pouch cell with ultra‐high energy density (510 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    ) and remarkable capacity stability (84.2%, 180 cycles), even under lean electrolyte (1.19 g Ah\n                    −1\n                    ) and high current density (3 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Our findings highlight the potential of ion‐sieving interlayer as a promising strategy for the development of stable Li‐metal batteries."},{"t":"用于全季节辐射热管理的米氏共振热致变色安全结构","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506717?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"辐射热管理","kp":["[材料]: Mie共振热致变色结构","[应用]: 全季节辐射热管理","[优势]: 克服冬季过度冷却"],"as":"该研究提出基于米氏谐振热致变色安全结构的全天候辐射热管理策略，应对极端天气加剧的太阳热负荷与高能耗问题。热致变色材料可根据温度动态调节光学响应，米氏谐振结构则增强辐射制冷效率。该方案兼顾制冷与供暖需求，实现跨季节适应性，在建筑节能、智能窗膜等领域具有广阔应用前景，为可持续热管理提供新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mie‐Resonant Thermochromic Safe Architectures for All‐Season Radiative Thermal Management","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Intensifying extreme weather increasingly exacerbates solar heating loads, leading to higher energy consumption, environmental stress, and thermal discomfort in urban and transportation settings. While passive radiative cooling offers a sustainable mitigation strategy, conventional materials suffer from static optical properties that lead to winter over‐cooling and poor seasonal adaptability. To overcome these limitations, we present a scalable, seasonally adaptive thermochromic composite film (TCF) capable of autonomous bidirectional thermal regulation. By embedding size‐optimized thermochromic microcapsules into a hierarchical porous poly(vinylidene fluoride‐co‐hexafluoropropylene) matrix, we engineer microstructure‐dependent Mie scattering to effectively decouple visible–near‐infrared (vis–NIR) modulation from long‐wave infrared (LWIR) emission. This architecture enables the TCF to reversibly switch between a solar‐absorbing heating state and a solar‐reflecting cooling state while maintaining high atmospheric‐window emissivity via impedance matching, achieving heating of ≈245 W/m\n                    2\n                    and cooling of ≈86 W/m\n                    2\n                    . Outdoor testing demonstrates stable cooling/heating capability and durability over 180 days. Produced via a scalable, meter‐scale continuous process, the TCF can be applied as a radiative‐cooling coating or integrated into functional textiles, providing year‐round adaptability for buildings, vehicles, and wearable systems. Overall, this work outlines a practical strategy for intelligent, energy‐saving materials capable of dynamically balancing heating and cooling for sustainable thermal management."},{"t":"原子尺度微观结构设计实现耐热铝合金的微合金化策略","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202515856?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/铝业","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"耐热铝合金","kp":["[合金策略[耐热铝合金]: 微合金化原子尺度设计","[背景]: 常规主元素调整已近性能极限"],"as":"该研究通过微合金化策略调控微观组织，开发耐热铝合金材料。铝合金作为轻量化和低碳应用的核心材料，其高温力学性能严重依赖微观组织稳定性。研究利用微量合金元素在晶界和析出相中的精准调控，抑制高温下组织粗化与位错回复，显著提升高温强度与抗蠕变性能。该策略有望拓展铝合金在航空航天、汽车发动机等高温结构件领域的应用。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"dp":1,"ot":"Microalloying Strategies Enable Heat‐Resistant Aluminum Alloys via Microstructural Design at Atomic Length Scale","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aluminum alloys, as core materials for lightweight and low carbon applications, derive their mechanical performance directly from their microstructure. After decades of development, conventional strategies such as adjusting the main alloying elements and optimizing heat treatments have approached their performance limits. Microalloying has emerged as a highly promising approach to refine microstructures and enhance the mechanical properties of aluminum alloys. Its effects originate from atomic scale interactions between microalloying elements, other solute atoms, and vacancies, as confirmed by state‐of‐art and multi‐faceted characterization. The deep understanding of microalloying mechanisms provide an opportunity to boost microstructural design towards advanced Al alloys with enhanced performances. Especially, the heat‐resistant high‐strength Al alloys that can work at the temperature range of 200°C–400°C are urgently required in modern industries. Microalloying response has showed significant advantages in the development of heat‐resistant Al alloys. In this paper, the recent progresses in the microalloying of aluminum alloys are briefly reviewed, emphasizing the effects of microalloying on precipitation behavior, microstructural thermal stability, and mechanical properties. It also highlights the key mechanisms and strategies for regulating these effects. The insights presented aim to support the composition design and microstructural optimization of high‐performance and heat‐resistant aluminum alloys."},{"t":"用于酸性电化学CO2还原中盐沉淀管理的无膜CO2加氢电解槽","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68600-3","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原电解槽","kp":["电解槽设计[酸性CO2还原]: 无膜加氢电解槽","盐沉淀管理[无膜]: 解决阴极液稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队提出一种无膜CO2加氢电解池设计，用于解决酸性电解液中电化学CO2还原过程中盐沉淀堵塞的关键问题。传统膜组件在酸性条件下易发生盐结晶积累，导致电池性能衰减和寿命缩短。该无膜架构通过优化流体动力学和反应物分布，实现盐沉淀的有效管理，同时保持较高的CO2转化效率和产物选择性。这一设计为大规模工业级CO2电还原系统的长期稳定运行提供了新的工程路径，对碳捕集与利用（CCU）技术商业化具有重要意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Membrane-free CO2 hydrogenation electrolyzer for salt precipitation management in acidic electrochemical CO2 reduction","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction (ECR) in acidic electrolytes minimizes CO2 loss and carbonate formation issues, allowing for high CO2 utilization efficiency and showing good potential for practical CO2 upgrading applications. However, in the membrane-based electrolyzer, the proton transfer efficiency across the membrane from the anolyte to the catholyte is crucial for the stability of the catholyte pH in acidic ECR, especially at high current density and during long-term electrolysis. Here, we investigate the effects of proton transfer efficiency and salt precipitation in different acidic ECR electrolyzer and propose a membrane-free CO2 hydrogenation electrolyzer, which couple CO2 reduction and hydrogen oxidation. This electrolyzer design effectively maintains a stable electrolyte pH during long-term electrolysis, and simultaneously achieves high Faradaic efficiency for HCOOH production, high single-pass carbon utilization efficiency, and a lower cell voltage. At a current density of 100 mA cm−2, the system requires only 1.7 V to achieve a 90% HCOOH Faradaic efficiency and demonstrates stable operation for 208 hours."},{"t":"具有有序纤维交叉的力学引导织物致动器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb6760?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"织物致动器","kp":["驱动器质量[织物驱动器]: 4.5 g","可拉伸率[被动拉伸]: 160%","[结构设计]: X交叉对齐SMA纤维编织","材料[驱动纤维]: 形状记忆合金"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于力学信息指导的织物致动器设计，利用定向纤维交叉结构实现兼具高能量密度和柔顺性的可穿戴驱动方案。传统刚性致动器难以无缝融入日常衣物，而本研究通过精确控制纤维排列与交叉点的力学交互，使织物本身具备主动变形和力量辅助能力。该方案在运动辅助、康复医疗和软体机器人领域具有广泛应用潜力，为将机械辅助功能隐蔽嵌入日常服装提供了新的材料工程范式。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Mechanics-informed fabric actuators with aligned fiber crossings","b":"Engineering unobtrusive mechanical assistance into daily-life clothing requires energy-dense yet compliant actuators with thin profiles. We report textile actuators by interlacing shape memory alloy (SMA) fibers in a periodic X-Crossing geometry, where fiber crossings align in the actuation contraction axis. An X-Crossing actuator design of 4.5 grams can be passively stretched to 160% and contracts by 50% when heated, lifting 1 kg, outperforming knitted and knotted SMAs. We developed a variable-stiffness mechanics model to predict material-level stress-strain behavior across temperatures and thus the force-contraction relation of device level. This model informs actuator design and control, geometric scaling, peak points in the force-contraction relation, and the theoretical upper bound of contraction strain. The maximum measured contraction strain of our actuators is 55%, a large step toward the upper bound that we calculate for general SMA fabric actuators. We demonstrate applications of the developed actuators and model in lifting weight and on-body compression."},{"t":"增材制造金属的力学行为","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02459-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","tp":"增材制造金属力学","kp":["[特点]: 非平衡加工产生独特微观结构","[工艺]: 增材制造","[应用]: 汽车/航空航天/国防"],"as":"本文系统综述了增材制造（3D打印）金属材料的力学行为研究进展。增材制造正重塑汽车、航空航天、医疗等多个行业的复杂构件生产方式。由于逐层熔融沉积的成形特性，3D打印金属表现出与传统锻造/铸造显著不同的微观组织和力学性能，包括各向异性、残余应力、缺陷敏感性等关键特征。文章分析了打印工艺参数对疲劳、断裂、蠕变等性能的影响规律，并探讨了后处理工艺（热等静压、热处理）对性能优化路径，为增材制造金属构件的工程化应用提供指导。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Mechanical behaviour of additively manufactured metals","b":"Additive manufacturing is reshaping the production of engineering components in diverse industries, such as the automotive, aerospace, defence and biomedical sectors, by offering outstanding design and fabrication flexibility. The non-equilibrium processing conditions inherent to additive manufacturing yield materials with unique microstructures and tailored mechanical properties that are often unattainable through conventional routes. This Review highlights recent advances in additively manufactured metals that show distinctive mechanical behaviours, including strength–ductility synergy, microstresses and gradient plasticity, fracture and fatigue resistance, and high-temperature creep performance. We examine the deformation mechanisms and micromechanical effects arising from the heterogeneous microstructures produced by additive manufacturing to guide the design of high-performance structural materials. Furthermore, we discuss critical research needs and emerging opportunities in processing control, alloy design, advanced characterization, computational modelling and machine learning aimed at achieving exceptional mechanical properties in additively manufactured metals."},{"t":"基于STL分解的泛函数据方法在电力市场价格动态映射中的应用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000425?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电力市场价格","kp":["[分析方法]: 函数数据分析+STL分解","[研究对象]: 跨电力市场设计的价格动态"],"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Mapping price dynamics across electricity market designs: A functional data approach with STL decomposition"},{"t":"从太空绘制泛北极河流颗粒有机碳图（1985 年至 2022 年）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady6314?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Carbon release from high-latitude regions is intensifying, with profound consequences for the Arctic carbon cycle. Here, we provide a comprehensive analysis of changes in fluvial particulate organic carbon (POC) concentrations (CPOC) and fluxes (FPOC) during ice-free seasons of pan-Arctic rivers from 1985 to 2022 on the basis of satellite observations. Across 578,000 kilometers of river length, 18% of the total length experienced a significant increase in CPOC, which exceeds the 11% that exhibited declines, resulting in a net rise. Most increases occurred after 2005, contributing to a 12.6% (0.49 teragrams per year) increase in total FPOC to the Arctic Ocean between 1985 to 2005 and 2006 to 2022. Regional contrasts highlight distinct possible drivers: increased precipitation in the North American Arctic and atmospheric warming in the Eurasian Arctic. Deepening of the permafrost active layer is also significantly correlated with CPOC increases. These findings highlight climate-driven fluvial POC export as a key contributor to the Arctic carbon budget and provide a high-resolution, satellite-based dataset that can inform carbon cycle models and data assimilation efforts.","tp":"碳通量遥感","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":4.0},"as":"基于卫星遥感观测，对1985至2022年间泛北极河流冰融期的颗粒有机碳（POC）浓度和通量进行了综合分析。在57.8万公里河流长度中，18%河段POC浓度显著增加，超过11%的减少河段比例，表明高纬度地区碳排放正在加剧，对北极碳循环和全球气候系统产生深远影响。"},{"t":"在空心离子-电子导体中调控金属沉积用于无负极锂金属电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adt2630?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂金属电池","kp":["[策略]: 空心离子-电子导体调控锂沉积","[应用]: 无负极锂金属电池","[问题]: 不规则沉积、寄生反应、体积膨胀"],"as":"无负极锂金属电池（AFLMBs）虽具高能量密度潜力，但锂沉积不均匀导致枝晶生长和库伦效率低下。本研究提出在中空离子-电子导体中调控金属生长的策略，通过独特的结构设计引导锂均匀成核与沉积，抑制枝晶形成。该方案有望显著提升无负极电池的循环寿命与安全性，为高能量密度储能器件的工程化提供新路径。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Manipulating metal growth in hollow ionic-electronic conductor for anode-free lithium metal batteries","b":"Anode-free lithium metal batteries (AFLMBs) demonstrate promising high energy density yet suffer from irregular Li deposition, parasitic reactions, and severe volume expansion. The current anode modulation strategies such as tailored solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) and lithiophilic host architectures can hardly simultaneously resolve all above issues, especially at high-capacity Li deposition. Here, we design a Li-rich, hollow ionic-electronic conductor (HIEC) interlayer, which integrates metallic Li encapsulation and interfacial protection, thus guiding highly reversible thick Li deposition (5 milliampere-hours per square centimeter). In addition, the built-in electron-deficient domains in the HIEC facilitate the formation of the hierarchical SEI and further mitigate active Li corrosion. These synergistic effects of the interlayer enable stable cycling in batteries under both anode-less and anode-free configurations, attaining >99% coulombic efficiency under industrial-level cathode loading and lean electrolyte conditions. This study highlights the significance of interlayers in integrating the SEI and host functions and provides a viable and scalable solution for energy-dense batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"锰配位多价适体系统 (COMPASS) 实现 DC 靶向 mRNA/Mn2+ 共传递以实现癌症免疫","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    mRNA vaccines hold remarkable promise for cancer immunotherapy, yet current nanoparticle systems face challenges in efficacy, dendritic cell (DC) targeting, and safety. Herein, we report a nanoplatform, Manganese‐Coordinated Polyvalent Aptameric System (COMPASS), enabling targeted co‐delivery of mRNA and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    to lymph node dendritic cells (DC) to boost potent antitumor immunity. The COMPASS employed rolling circle amplification to generate single‐stranded DNA scaffolds with multivalent DC‐targeting aptamers and polyT domains, enabling stable mRNA hybridization via A‐T pairing. Various metal ions were screened, and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    was found to enhance mRNA endosomal escape and activate the STING pathway in DCs, promoting their maturation and antigen presentation. Controlled nanoparticle size (∼200 nm) and aptamer‐mediated DC targeting markedly enhanced lymphatic accumulation. In vivo evaluations revealed that COMPASS achieved potent prophylactic and therapeutic antitumor efficacy comparable to commercial LNPs (e.g., SM‐102), while exhibiting significantly enhanced safety profiles. Importantly, lyophilized COMPASS formulations retained their structural integrity and bioactivity for at least three months at room temperature. Overall, COMPASS represents a promising next‐generation nanoplatform with significant translational potential for safe and effective cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"锰配位疫苗","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"构建了锰配位多价适体系统（COMPASS），实现mRNA和Mn²⁺向淋巴结树突细胞（DC）的靶向共递送，以增强抗肿瘤免疫。该纳米平台克服了现有纳米颗粒系统在递送效率、DC靶向性和安全性方面的挑战，利用Mn²⁺的免疫佐剂效应与mRNA疫苗的协同作用，显著提升了癌症免疫治疗的效果。","aip":1},{"t":"用于机器人血管内手术的磁力微型旋转器（Adv. Mater. 4/2026）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71913?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁控微旋器","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"机器学习引导设计L10-PtCo金属间催化剂：锌介导原子有序化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202505211?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[PEMFC阴极]: L10-PtCo金属间化合物","[有序化策略]: Zn介导原子有序化","[设计方法]: 机器学习引导","[矛盾]: 高温退火致颗粒烧结"],"as":"Pt基金属间化合物（IMCs）的原子有序化是提升催化活性的有效策略。研究利用机器学习指导设计L10型PtCo合金催化剂，发现Zn介导可显著促进原子有序化转变。ML加速了组分与合成条件的筛选优化，所得催化剂在氧还原反应中表现出优异的活性与耐久性，为燃料电池电催化剂的理性设计提供了数据驱动范式。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Machine Learning‐Guided Design of L10‐PtCo Intermetallic Catalysts: Zn‐Mediated Atomic Ordering","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Promotion of atomic ordering in Pt‐based intermetallic compounds (IMCs) is a proven strategy to enhance catalytic activity and durability, for the cathode catalysts in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs). However, achieving higher atomic ordering typically requires elevated temperature annealing, which induces nanoparticles (NPs) sintering and surface area loss, resulting in a challenge for catalyst design. Here, we demonstrate that Zn incorporation in L1\n                    0\n                    ‐PtCo IMCs promotes the ordering, endowing the enhanced stability and activity. Machine learning interatomic potential (MLIP) simulations reveal that Zn lowers vacancy formation energies and modifies atomic migration, thereby accelerating ordering during annealing. These results are validated experimentally by X‐ray‐based analyses. Electrochemical measurements show that L1\n                    0\n                    ‐Zn‐PtCo/ZnNC achieves a mass activity (MA) of 1.76 A mg\n                    Pt\n                    −1\n                    at 0.9 V\n                    RHE\n                    , outperforming Pt/C (0.24 A mg\n                    Pt\n                    −1\n                    ). In single‐cell tests, it delivers 438 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0.7 V, surpassing Pt/C (293 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    ). After 30 000 cycles, it retains 89.7% initial current density, compared with only 54.6% retention for Pt/C. By integrating ML‐guided design with experimental validation, this work establishes a rational strategy to engineer atomically ordered Pt‐based IMCs under practical conditions, advancing the development of efficient electrocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"钴分子催化剂局部富集活性氢以增强电催化硝酸盐还原","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524566?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硝酸根电还原制氨","kp":["[催化剂]: 钴四吡嗪并紫嗪分子催化剂","[机制]: 局部活性H*富集","[应用]: 硝酸盐电还原制氨"],"as":"电化学硝酸根还原（NO3-RR）可同步实现氨合成与废水脱氮，但反应选择性低、产率受限。本研究利用钴分子催化剂实现局域活性氢（H*）富集，提升中间体加氢效率，从而显著提高氨的法拉第效率和产率。该策略通过精准调控催化剂微环境的氢物种浓度，为电化学固氮与绿色氨合成提供了新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Localized Active H* Enrichment by Cobalt Molecular Catalysts for Enhanced Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR) offers a sustainable route for ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ) synthesis, simultaneously enabling pollutant remediation and resource recovery. The efficiency of NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR relies on regulating the hydrogenation behaviors of active sites to drive the stepwise reduction of nitrate species. Herein, we report a molecular catalyst, cobalt tetrapyrazinoporphyrazine (CoPhz) supported on carbon nanotubes (CoPhz/CNT) that achieves outstanding NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR performance through local active H* enrichment. In neutral electrolyte, CoPhz/CNT attained a peak NH\n                    3\n                    Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 93% and a yield rate of 8347.9 µg h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    , outperforming the conventional cobalt phthalocyanine (CoPc) benchmark. CoPhz/CNT exhibited exceptional stability for over 170 h at 50 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in a flow cell.\n                    Operando\n                    studies and theoretical calculations reveal that nitrogen atoms in the macrocycle modulate the electronic structure of the cobalt center, promoting H* generation and enrichment, as well as facilitating efficient intermediates conversion with low energy differences, leading to superior NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR efficiency. Furthermore, the practical utility of CoPhz/CNT in a Zn–NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    battery achieved an excellent power density of 14.5 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    . This work demonstrates that molecular engineering of macrocyclic catalysts is an effective strategy to tailor hydrogenation capability for enhanced NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR and other hydrogenation reactions."},{"t":"考虑信息物理交通耦合的多目标灾后配电网负荷恢复策略","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000255?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"灾后配电网恢复","as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Load restoration strategy for post-disaster distribution networks considering cyber-physical-traffic coupling with multi"},{"t":"面向无人机应用的轻质高效管式SOFC设计：多物理场建模与性能优化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600005X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"管式SOFC设计","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Lightweight and efficient tubular SOFC design for UAV applications: multi-physics modeling and performance optimization"},{"t":"铜铟镓硫硒化物太阳能电池对推进钙钛矿光伏的启示","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-025-01936-0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钙钛矿光伏借鉴","as":"回顾铜铟镓硫硒（CIGSSe）薄膜太阳能电池在钙钛矿（perovskite）光伏进展中的借鉴价值。CIGSSe作为柔性、轻质薄膜光伏技术，在带隙调控、界面钝化、缺陷工程与缓冲层优化等方面积累了丰富经验，可为钙钛矿电池的稳定性提升、大面积模组制备与柔性集成提供方法学启示，推动薄膜光伏性能与可靠性持续突破。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lessons from copper indium gallium sulfo-selenide solar cells for progressing perovskite photovoltaics","b":"The growing demand for photovoltaic (PV) technologies that are lightweight and flexible and can be integrated seamlessly into diverse applications has propelled interest in thin-film solar cells. Among these, Cu(In,Ga)(S,Se)2 (CIGS) and metal halide perovskites have garnered significant attention in the past and present, respectively. Although CIGS reached commercial readiness after decades of refinement, its large-scale deployment was hindered by manufacturing complexity, scale-up challenges and a lack of coordination between materials, device design and production systems. Despite setting record efficiencies at an unprecedented pace perovskite solar cells now face similar challenges on their path to commercialization: ensuring long-term stability; translating laboratory performance to scalable architectures; and aligning with industrial realities. Here we revisit the CIGS experience not as a benchmark, but as a blueprint, highlighting how its successes and failures can inform a more deliberate and durable trajectory for perovskite PV. By bridging this historical perspective with the current frontier, we propose that the future of perovskites depends not only on continued innovation, but also on learning from past thin-film PV experiences to avoid repeating their pitfalls."},{"t":"晶格氧介导的C(OH)-C(OH)键断裂促进醇类电氧化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524156?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醇电氧化","kp":["晶格氧[醇类电氧化]: 促进C(OH)-C(OH)键断裂"],"as":"提出晶格氧介导机制促进C(OH)-C(OH)键选择性断裂，用于醇类电氧化反应。生物质、废塑料等有机物的资源化转化高度依赖碳碳键的精准切割，该研究通过调控催化剂晶格氧活性，在温和电化学条件下高效断裂邻位羟基碳碳键，生成高附加值产物，为生物质升级与塑料回收的电催化路径提供新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lattice Oxygen Mediated C(OH)−C(OH) Bond Cleavage to Promote Alcohols Electrooxidation","b":"Abstract\n                  Selective cleavage of C(OH)−C(OH) bond is crucial for valorization of biomass, waste plastics and other organic compounds, while facing thermodynamic and kinetic barriers. Utilizing active oxygen species (e.g., active hydroxyl (OH*) or lattice oxygen) generated at the anode during water electrolysis provides a sustainable solution to achieve electrochemical activation of the C(OH)−C(OH) bond. However, elucidating the mechanisms of active oxygen species and their roles in enhancing product selectivity remains a challenge. Herein, we report a strategy to unravel the contribution of active oxygen species for C(OH)−C(OH) bond cleavage during alcohols electrooxidation, revealing that lattice oxygen promotes C(OH)−C(OH) bond cleavage and enhances product selectivity. We constructed NiAl‐LDH and Ni(Al)‐LDH as model catalysts, the latter derived through a “nano‐tailoring” Al‐leaching strategy. As a result, Ni(Al)‐LDH facilitates lattice oxygen formation more readily, which acts as the primary active species for C(OH)−C(OH) bond cleavage and achieves ∼90% selectivity for formic acid production in ethylene glycol oxidation reaction (EGOR). The intrinsic mechanism involves that lattice oxygen participates in EGOR via the Mars‐van‐Krevelen mechanism and specifically induces C(OH)−C(OH) bond cleavage through an indirect pathway. This mechanistic insight into C(OH)−C(OH) bond cleavage mediated by lattice oxygen provides a valuable reference for designing selective catalysts in alcohols electrooxidation."},{"t":"激光诱导高密度Bi-F-C位点释放强Li+吸附以稳定锂负极","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517701?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极","kp":["制备方法[单原子]: 静电预组织-激光驱动碳化","活性位点[高密度]: Bi-F-C位点"],"as":"利用激光诱导技术构建高密度Bi-F-C催化位点，用于稳定高效的锂离子（Li⁺）吸附。单原子催化剂面临金属负载量高时易团聚的固有难题，该研究以激光快速热处理在载体上锚定铋-氟-碳配位结构，显著提升Li⁺选择性吸附容量与循环稳定性，为盐湖提锂、电池回收及电化学离子分离提供新材料方案。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Laser‐Induced High‐Density Bi–F–C Sites to Unleash Potent Li⁺ Adsorption for Stable Lithium Anodes","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The synthesis of high‐loading single‐atom materials remains a significant challenge due to the intrinsic tendency of metal atoms to aggregate. To overcome this limitation, an electrostatic pre‐organization and laser‐driven carbonization (EPO–LDC) strategy is developed. Nafion sulfonates electrostatically pre‐organize Bi\n                    3+\n                    at the molecular scale, while ultrafast laser quenching enables non‐equilibrium synthesis, initiating simultaneous carbon reconstruction and fluorine‐mediated covalent bonding within nanoseconds. This rapid thermal confinement kinetically restricts atomic diffusion, thereby circumventing the aggregation pathways inherent to conventional thermal processes. Concurrently, fluorine ligands offer thermodynamic stabilization through strong Bi─F bonds and optimize charge redistribution via electronegativity‐driven orbital hybridization. This dual stabilization achieves a high‐density (9.63 wt.%) atomic dispersion of bismuth within a fluorinated porous carbon network (Bi@CF) without aggregation. Theoretical calculations reveal that Bi–F–C sites exhibit an exceptional Li adsorption energy of −9.82 eV, far exceeding those of conventional lithiophilic anodes (−1–−5 eV). The combination of atomic‐scale lithiophilicity and laser‐induced hierarchical porosity enables multiscale ion regulation, resulting in remarkable electrochemical stability. The EPO–LDC strategy thus provides a scalable industrial pathway for producing high‐loading single‐atom architectures with precisely tailored coordination environments.","aip":1},{"t":"过渡金属硫族化合物薄膜的大面积非化学计量相变","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-025-02471-9","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"过渡金属硫族化合物相变","kp":["[相变工程]: 过渡金属硫族化物大面积非化学计量可控相变"],"as":"该研究聚焦过渡金属硫属化物（如MoS2、WSe2等）的大面积非化学计量相变。相工程是决定材料功能特性、扩展材料库的关键手段。团队通过控制化学计量比偏移，实现大面积范围内2H半导体相到1T/1T'金属相的可控转变，为可编程电子学、柔性器件及催化应用提供了新路径。该成果突破了传统相变方法在面积和均匀性上的限制，具有重要的工程化前景。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Large-area non-stoichiometric phase transition in transition metal chalcogenide films","b":"Phase engineering is of vital importance for determining the material functionalities and expanding the material library. However, the controllable and scalable phase transition of transition metal chalcogenides remains extremely challenging. The microscopic observation of the phase evolution pathway is an essential prerequisite for understanding the phase transition mechanism. Here we atomically observe a non-stoichiometric phase evolution process in large-scale superconducting PdTe2 films under heating through in situ scanning transmission electron microscopy. The unprecedented phase transition from PdTe2 to PdTe via atomic reconstruction is evidenced and theoretically verified by our machine learning molecular dynamics simulations. In particular, forming the intermediate state of PdTe2/PdTe heterostructure during the phase transition robustly generates giant-helicity-dependent terahertz emission due to inversion symmetry breaking. Our results not only provide insights into the atomic reconstruction in transition metal chalcogenides but also offer a general strategy for the fabrication of large-area transition metal monochalcogenide films and heterostructures, potentially applicable for various device applications."},{"t":"源自癌症相关成纤维细胞的乳酸促进前列腺癌中的选择性剪接和去势抵抗","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady5324?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lactate in the tumor microenvironment (TME) is typically generated by cells exhibiting high glycolytic flux, exemplified by tumor cells. However, in glycolysis-low malignancies such as prostate cancer, stroma-derived lactate may drive noncanonical signaling and functions that remain unclear. Here, we identified APCDD1+ cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) as a distinct stromal population that secretes lactate into the TME in response to androgen deprivation therapy (ADT). Lactate uptake by prostate cancer cells induces androgen receptor variant 7 expression, thereby conferring resistance to ADT. Mechanistically, lactate-induced lactylation of the spliceosome component SNRPA at Lys123 (K123) enhances its recognition of cis-acting elements, increases chromatin binding, and promotes androgen receptor splicing. Targeting lactate transport with monocarboxylate transporter inhibitors effectively restores ADT sensitivity. These findings reveal a metabolic-epigenetic axis linking lactate in the microenvironment to alternative splicing regulation and suggest a promising therapeutic strategy to overcome ADT resistance.","tp":"前列腺耐药","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究探讨了前列腺癌中癌症相关成纤维细胞（CAFs）分泌的乳酸如何影响肿瘤进展。研究发现，在雄激素剥夺治疗（ADT）下，APCDD1+ CAFs会向肿瘤微环境释放乳酸。这种间质来源的乳酸被前列腺癌细胞吸收后，可能通过非经典信号通路促进选择性剪接和去势抵抗。这一发现揭示了低糖酵解恶性肿瘤中乳酸的独特作用，为理解前列腺癌治疗抗性提供了新视角。"},{"t":"对流层活性氯来源的同位素限制","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb5397?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oceanic and anthropogenic processes, such as sea-salt emissions and combustion activities, release substantial amount of reactive chlorine into the troposphere, affecting air quality, ozone depletion, and climate change. However, distinguishing between these sources for reactive chlorine remains challenging. Here, we establish isotopic constraints on the origin of tropospheric reactive chlorine using chemical ionization mass spectrometry to analyze nitryl chloride (ClNO2). Field observations from four regions in China reveal a much broader isotopic value (δ37Cl) range for ClNO2 (-21 to +39‰) than previously documented for Earth's chlorine reservoirs. Notably, significant δ37Cl differences for ClNO2 from sea-salt emissions (-9 ± 4‰) and anthropogenic combustion sources (+20 ± 7‰) were identified. These distinct isotopic signatures, combined with field data, highlight the important role of oceanic chlorine in air pollution, with its chemical cycling affecting not only coastal regions but also extending into inland areas. This research advances our understanding of chlorine's behavior and cycling in the troposphere.","tp":"大气氯溯源","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用化学电离质谱分析亚硝酰氯（ClNO2），建立了对流层活性氯来源的同位素限制方法。通过野外观测，研究人员能够区分海洋和人为来源（如海盐排放和燃烧活动）的活性氯。这一方法有助于更好地理解活性氯对空气质量、臭氧消耗和气候变化的影响，为大气化学反应来源解析提供了新工具。"},{"t":"ZrO2-5.5RuO2互掺杂异质结构提升酸性析氧效率与稳定性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522946?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性析氧电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: ZrO2-RuO2界面掺杂异质结构","[掺杂策略]: 抑制RuO2在酸性高电位下氧化溶解"],"as":"该研究提出一种ZrO2-5.5RuO2互掺杂异质结构，用于提升酸性水裂解电催化剂的效率与稳定性。酸性水电解是绿色制氢的关键技术，但析氧反应（OER）催化剂在高酸性环境中易溶解失活。通过ZrO2与RuO2之间的互掺杂界面工程，调控了Ru活性位点的电子结构，既提高了OER催化活性，又显著降低了Ru的溶解速率，实现了酸性条件下高效长寿命电催化，为PEM电解槽的规模化应用提供了材料基础。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Inter‐Doping ZrO2‐5.5RuO2 Heterostructures for Enhanced Efficiency and Stability in Acidic Oxygen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Acid water electrolysis represents a crucial technology for the sustainable production of hydrogen. However, acidic media and high oxidation potential can lead to oxidative dissolution of catalysts (e.g., RuO\n                    2\n                    → soluble RuO\n                    4\n                    ), resulting in a rapid loss of active sites. Here, we present an inter‐doping strategy for the construction of zirconium‐ruthenium oxide heterostructure (ZrO\n                    2\n                    ‐xRuO\n                    2\n                    ) through metal–organic framework confined effect and fused salt mixing method. Specifically, ZrO\n                    2\n                    ‐5.5RuO\n                    2\n                    achieves an ultralow overpotential of 137 mV at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , setting a new benchmark for oxygen evolution catalysts under acidic conditions. Its mass activity (337.5 A g\n                    Ru\n                    −1\n                    ) at 250 mV overpotential is 32.3 times that of commercial RuO\n                    2\n                    . The catalyst also demonstrates long‐term stability for 655 h, far superior to commercial RuO\n                    2\n                    (&lt;6 h). The remarkable activity and stability can be attributed to the Zr─O─Ru interfacial junction, resulting in low‐valence Ru sites and high‐valence Zr sites. The charge redistribution optimizes the adsorption energy of reactive oxygen species and minimizes the involvement of lattice oxygen, thus leading to a significant enhancement in both activity and stability. This work provides a novel insight for addressing the activity‐stability dilemma through atomic‐level interface engineering, establishing a new paradigm for the large‐scale application of green hydrogen energy.","aip":1},{"t":"内源与外源诱导的手性杂化金属卤化物材料用于先进手性光电应用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01258A","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性杂化金属卤化物","kp":["[手性杂化金属卤化物]: 可调控手性及非中心对称结构"],"as":"该综述聚焦手性杂化金属卤化物（CHMHs）的设计、合成与应用。CHMHs兼具可调谐的手性结构和非中心对称晶体特征，在圆偏振发光、自旋依赖输运、非线性光学及手性传感等光电领域展现出卓越性能。研究系统讨论了内源手性（手性有机阳离子诱导）与外源手性（外部场或应力诱导）两类构筑策略，分析了结构-手性-光电性能之间的构效关系，为先进光电功能材料的理性设计提供了框架。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Internally and externally induced chiral hybrid metal halide materials for advanced chiroptoelectronic applications","b":"Chiral hybrid metal halides (CHMHs) comprise tunable chiral and noncentrosymmetric structures with remarkable optoelectronic characteristics, offering new avenues for synergistically manipulating the optical, electrical, and magnetic physical degrees of freedom. In these systems, chiral structures act not only as functional scaffolds but also as bridges that link microscopic electronic states with macroscopic optoelectronic behaviors. This review follows a progressive framework to systematically present recent advances in the field of CHMHs, spanning synthetic strategies, physical mechanisms, and device implementations. The chemical routes and transfer mechanisms underlying chiral structure formation are elucidated, with an emphasis on the roles of molecular chirality and external potential field. A central focus is placed on the inherent coupling among linear/nonlinear chiroptical effects, ferroelectric/piezoelectric behaviors, and chirality-induced spin selectivity (CISS) effects, with the “chiral structure-Rashba effect-CISS” chain identified as the key to enabling cross-coupling among spin, charge, and photons. The potential of CHMHs in the detection and emission of circularly polarized light and spin light-emitting diodes is also evaluated, underscoring their irreplaceability in multifunctional integration and magnetic-field-free spin manipulation. This review aims to provide a systematic basis for understanding the structure–function relationships in CHMHs while outlining the strategic direction of opto-electro-magnetic coupling through chirality engineering, thereby laying a foundation for future applications in quantum information platforms and low-power spintronic devices."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度感知","kp":["监测目标[锂离子电池]: 超高倍率放电内部温度"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed ne"},{"t":"界面π-π堆叠相互作用促进氢气驱动的酶催化不对称还原","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523400?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化不对称还原","kp":["[Pickering乳液]: 油水乳液微反应器","[界面作用]: π-π堆积促进NAD(P)H再生","[应用]: H₂驱动酶催化不对称还原"],"as":"该研究利用界面π-π堆积相互作用策略，构建了一种高效H2驱动的酶促不对称还原体系。通过将催化H2氧化的氢化酶与NAD(P)H依赖的还原酶共固定或协同组装，π-π堆积效应增强了酶组分间的电子传递效率，实现辅酶NAD(P)H的原位再生。该方法为体外手性化学品的高效绿色合成提供了新思路，在精细化工和制药领域具有应用潜力，避免了传统化学还原中使用重金属催化剂的环境负担。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial π–π Stacking Interaction Promotes H2‐Driven Enzymatic Asymmetric Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    In situ H\n                    2\n                    ‐driven NAD(P)H regeneration offers a sustainable approach for chemoenzymatic reduction in vitro; however, low selectivity in NAD(P)H formation, coupled with mutual deactivation between chemical catalysts and enzymes, severely compromises efficiency. Herein, we report the development of an oil‐in‐water Pickering emulsion microreactor leveraging an interfacial π–π stacking interaction to enable directional H* transfer, achieving &gt;99% selectivity in NADH regeneration. By further coupling this NADH regeneration system with horse liver alcohol dehydrogenase (HLADH) catalyzed asymmetric reductive resolution of racemic 2‐phenylpropionaldehyde to (\n                    S\n                    )‐(‐)‐2‐phenyl‐1‐propanol, a chemoenzymatic Pickering emulsion microreactor was constructed, which smoothly catalyzed the H\n                    2\n                    ‐driven reductive resolution reaction and achieved an ee value &gt;99% with more than 2000 NADH regeneration cycles, representing a highest value ever reported for in situ H\n                    2\n                    ‐driven NADH regeneration. The efficiency of this chemoenzymatic microreactor is attributed to the high NADH selectivity and spatial separation of metal catalysts and HLADH. Insight into modulating mass transfer through noncovalent interactions and mitigating mutual deactivation of incompatible catalysts by spatial separation is promising for the development of efficient chemoenzymatic microreactors in sustainable chiral chemical production."},{"t":"不确定性环境下能源社区中绿色制氢与电能存储的集成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000413?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿氢储能集成","as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Integrating green hydrogen production and electrical energy storage in energy communities under uncertainty"},{"t":"挤压和直接辊压干涂正极对硫化物全固态电池的影响","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506443?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化物固态电池干涂正极","kp":["正极组成[硫化物ASSB]: 82wt%NCM85+0.5wt%PTFE","粘结剂[干法电极]: PTFE纤维化","工艺[ASSB正极]: 挤出+直接压延干法涂布"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究系统评估了挤压工艺和直接辊压对硫化物全固态电池（ASSB）干法涂布正极性能的影响。干法工艺避免使用有毒溶剂（如NMP），更环保且与水敏性硫化物电解质兼容。研究聚焦工艺参数（挤出条件、辊压压力与间隙）对电极微观结构、活性物质载量、界面接触及电化学性能的调控规律，为硫化物ASSB正极的规模化、连续化制造提供了关键工艺理解，推动全固态电池从实验室走向产业化量产。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Impact of Extrusion and Direct Calendering on Dry‐Coated Cathodes for Sulfidic All‐Solid‐State Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    This study presents a novel dry‐coating process for the scalable production of sulfidic ASSB cathodes within a dry room environment. Composite powders, consisting of 82.0 wt% NCM85 and 0.5 wt% PTFE, are mixed and fibrillated using a twin‐screw extruder. Dry‐coated cathode films are manufactured using a two‐roll calender through a single high‐shear calendering step. The study explores the impact of processing parameters on the morphology of electrodes and cell performance. Furthermore, the findings are compared to a slurry reference. Increasing the process temperature and reducing the line load enhances PTFE fibrillation and mitigates CAM particle cracking. These adjustments improve electrode homogeneity, density, and CAM–SE interface contact. The improvements are attributed to the deformation of LPSCl particles under shear stress, especially at higher temperatures. XPS analysis reveals temperature‐driven degradation of LPSCl, forming Li\n                    2\n                    S. Despite lower electronic conductivity, dry‐coated cathodes exhibit superior ionic conductivity compared to the slurry reference. Single‐layer pouch cells with dry‐coated cathodes demonstrate enhanced initial capacity, ICE, and discharge rate capability. Optimal performance is achieved with electrodes produced with high extrusion temperature (100°C), medium calender temperature (60°C), and low line load (50 N mm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ).","aip":1},{"t":"鉴定耐热非规范 PAM，用于稳健的一锅 CRISPR-Cas12a 检测","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68476-3","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"The canonical PAM site TTTV (where V = A, G, or C) is widely used in the design of CRISPR-Cas12a systems for both genome editing and diagnostic applications. Although several non-canonical protospacer-adjacent motifs (PAM) have been identified, they generally exhibit weak Cas12a cleavage activity. In this study, we find that increasing the reaction temperature to 45 °C or higher allows the identification of numerous non-canonical PAMs with trans-cleavage activity comparable to that of canonical PAMs, while displaying only weak cis-cleavage activity. Moreover, we observe that combining these non-canonical PAMs with elevated temperatures significantly enhances the Cas12a system’s ability to discriminate highly similar sequences. Based on these findings, we develop a non-canonical PAM-mediated, poikilothermal, one-pot CRISPR-Cas12a detection platform (POP-CRISPR), which demonstrates substantial improvements in sensitivity, specificity, speed, and target adaptability for nucleic acid detection compared to existing methods. These advantages are validated through the reliable detection of clinical samples, including those of Human papillomavirus (HPV), Mycoplasma pneumoniae (MP), and its drug-resistant strains. Additionally, we show that POP-CRISPR enables rapid, on-site pathogen detection within 20 min, using a fast sample processing protocol and a miniaturized detection device.","tp":"核酸快检法","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"发现将反应温度提高至45°C以上可激活CRISPR-Cas12a对多种非规范PAM位点的反式切割活性，其效率可与经典TTTV PAM相当。这些耐热非规范PAM的鉴定大幅扩展了Cas12a在基因组编辑和一锅法分子诊断中的靶标范围，提升了CRISPR检测系统的稳健性和适用性。","aip":1},{"t":"水热退火改性分级ZSM-5分子筛提升催化性能","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202515008?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"ZSM-5分子筛催化剂","kp":["[后合成处理]: 水热退火提升ZSM-5催化活性与寿命","[合成方法]: 硅质生长介质水热退火"],"as":"该研究提出通过水热退火（hydrothermal annealing）策略调控分级ZSM-5沸石催化剂的结构与性能。ZSM-5作为石油化工中广泛使用的择形催化剂，其活性位点可及性和传质效率长期受微孔限制。研究者通过构建多级孔（微孔-介孔-大孔）结构，并在水热条件下进行退火处理，优化沸石的晶体形貌、孔道连通性和酸位点分布。结果表明，退火工艺显著提升了催化活性、稳定性和抗积碳能力，为下一代高效沸石催化剂的工程化合成提供了可调控路线。该工作对加氢裂化、甲醇制芳烃等工业催化过程具有直接应用价值。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hydrothermal Annealing of Hierarchical ZSM‐5 Zeolites Improves Catalytic Performance","b":"Abstract\n                  Engineering next‐generation zeolite catalysts requires state‐of‐the‐art synthesis techniques to tailor the properties of materials along with robust methods to evaluate their catalytic performance. Here, we introduce hydrothermal annealing as a facile and highly effective method to improve the activity and lifetime of zeolite catalysts. This post‐synthesis treatment uses a siliceous growth solution at approximate solubility of zeolite crystals with high temperature to alter the physicochemical properties of as‐synthesized materials. We employ the methanol‐to‐hydrocarbons (MTH) process as a benchmark reaction, along with a wide range of characterization techniques, to assess the impact of annealing on four nanosized and hierarchical ZSM‐5 materials compared to a commercial sample. Our findings reveal that annealing significantly increased cumulative MTH turnover without appreciably altering product selectivity, despite non‐obvious changes to zeolite structure as a result of the annealing process. Comparisons of catalyst performance are made under identical reaction conditions using a descriptor that correlates cumulative turnovers to compositional, mass transport, and textural properties of each material – in line with growing efforts to increase rigor and reproducibility in the field of catalysis. The collective approach used in this study serves as a guideline for establishing structure‐composition‐performance relationships for zeolite‐based catalysts across wide‐ranging applications."},{"t":"以居住者为中心的建筑控制的混合强化学习：共同优化的审查和部署框架","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000449?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"能量管理策略如何影响微电网优化设计：电动汽车充电站的比较分析","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000048?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微电网能量管理","as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"How energy management strategy shapes optimal microgrid design: A comparative analysis for EV charging stations"},{"t":"面向本征态问题的高精度浅层量子算法设计","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb1622?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子本征态求解算法","kp":["[量子算法]: 高精度低深度本征态求解","[优化目标]: 适配实际量子电路层非理想查询模型"],"as":"该论文提出一种面向本征态问题（eigenstate problems）的高精度、低量子线路深度（low-depth）量子算法设计。本征态性质估计是量子化学和凝聚态物理的核心任务，传统量子相位估计算法（QPE）虽精度高但线路深度过大，难以在近中期含噪声量子设备（NISQ）上运行。研究者通过改进量子线路结构、优化量子比特编码与变分ansatz设计，在保证高精度估计哈密顿量本征值的同时显著降低所需量子门的数量和线路深度。该方案有望在超导量子比特和离子阱等近期硬件上实现实验验证，推动量子算法从理论走向实用。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-precision and low-depth quantum algorithm design for eigenstate problems","b":"Estimating the eigenstate properties of quantum systems is a long-standing, challenging problem for both classical and quantum computing. Existing universal quantum algorithms typically rely on ideal and efficient query models (e.g., time evolution operator or block encoding of the Hamiltonian), which, however, become suboptimal for actual implementation at the quantum circuit level. Here, we present a full-stack design of quantum algorithms for estimating the eigenenergy and eigenstate properties, which can achieve high precision and good scaling with system size. The gate complexity per circuit for estimating generic Hamiltonians' eigenstate properties is [Formula: see text], which has a logarithmic dependence on the inverse precision ε. For lattice Hamiltonians, the circuit depth of our design achieves near-optimal system-size scaling, even with local qubit connectivity. Our full-stack algorithm has low overhead in circuit compilation, which thus results in a small actual gate count (cnot and non-Clifford gates) for lattice and molecular problems compared to advanced eigenstate algorithms. The algorithm is implemented on IBM quantum devices using up to 2000 two-qubit gates and 20,000 single-qubit gates and achieves high-precision eigenenergy estimation for Heisenberg-type Hamiltonians, demonstrating its noise robustness."},{"t":"高温钠硫固定式电池的高精度动态模型","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000668?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠硫电池模型","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"High-accuracy dynamic model of high-temperature sodium-sulfur stationary battery"},{"t":"利用超亮 NIR-II 有机探针对体内单免疫细胞迁移进行高时间分辨率成像","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516197?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Given the implications of immune cell migration and cellular interaction in immune‐oncology, infectious and inflammatory diseases, there is a long‐standing interest in understanding, predicting, and ultimately manipulating immune cell migration therapeutically. However, real‐time non‐invasive in vivo immune cell tracking is considerably more challenging than static imaging, particularly when imaging highly motile cells. Here we introduce high‐brightness second near‐infrared (NIR‐II, 1000–1700 nm) window organic probes (DCPDs, brightness &gt; 5000 M\n                    −1\n                     cm\n                    −1\n                    in aqueous solution), enabling non‐invasive high‐speed single immune cell imaging in the brain with a temporal resolution up to ∼50 fps. The neutrophil migration patterns in the stroke mouse brain and their interactions with infused therapeutic mesenchymal stem cells can be profiled with real temporal dynamics. This advancement facilitates fundamental studies on understanding complex cellular functions in vivo, paving the way for investigating the effect of single‐cell temporal dynamics on immune responses or disease‐related biological processes.","tp":"近红外成像","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"开发了超亮NIR-II有机荧光探针，实现了对体内单个免疫细胞迁移的高时间分辨率实时成像。针对高运动性免疫细胞活体追踪比静态成像更具挑战的问题，该探针利用NIR-II窗口的高组织穿透和低自发荧光优势，为理解免疫细胞迁移在免疫肿瘤学、感染和炎症疾病中的作用提供了非侵入性实时监测手段。"},{"t":"异构注意力驱动的深度强化学习求解带取送货和时间窗的电动汽车路径问题","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000073?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电动车路径优化","as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Heterogeneous attention-driven deep reinforcement learning for solving EVRPs with pickup-delivery and time windows"},{"t":"HALOM 方法：一种高效、准确、独立于中子衍射的方法，用于确定 M 中的氢位置","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523160?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Metal hydride nanoclusters play important roles in catalytic transformations and energy conversion. However, accurate localization of hydrogen atoms in these nanoclusters remains a grand challenge. Traditional techniques face inherent limitations that single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction cannot localize hydrides effectively, while neutron diffraction requires large single crystals and has limited accessibility. To address this challenge, we developed an innovative machine‐learning‐assisted hydrogen atom locator for metal hydrides (HALOM) algorithm for rapid and accurate hydrogen position prediction. This approach systematically searches potential hydrogen atom locations using a predefined potential function and refining these locations to minimize the total energy, which operates independently of neutron diffraction data and avoids exhaustive exploration of the potential energy surface (PES). In terms of prediction accuracy, HALOM fully reproduces neutron diffraction (ND)‐identified hydride sites and aligns perfectly with density functional theory (DFT) models, and even yields lower‐energy structures than literature DFT placements in some key systems (e.g., 2.86 eV lower for Cu\n                    81\n                    H\n                    32\n                    ). HALOM also demonstrates superior computational efficiency, which generates low‐energy hydrogen configurations in only seconds, compared to the expensive PES exploration for hours. Overall, HALOM offers an efficient and accurate tool for hydrogen localization in metal hydride nanoclusters to advance their structure‐property research.","tp":"氢原子定位","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"开发了HALOM方法，一种不依赖中子衍射即可高效准确确定金属氢化物纳米团簇中氢原子位置的新策略。传统单晶X射线衍射难以有效定位氢化物，而中子衍射需要大单晶且可及性有限。HALOM方法填补了金属氢化物纳米团簇氢原子精确定位的技术空白，对催化转化和能量转换研究具有重要意义。"},{"t":"基底前脑中的谷氨酸能投射神经元是习得的嗅觉关联价分配的基础","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68313-7","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sensory perception is shaped by experience, giving stimuli behavioral significance. Basal forebrain (BF) cholinergic neurons in mice, which are crucial for arousal and motivation, also regulate sensory processing. Within BF nuclei, glutamatergic (vGlut2BF) neurons receive cholinergic input and modulate behaviors, but their roles in encoding sensory significance remain unclear. Using in vivo calcium imaging, we found that vGlut2BF neurons initially poorly encoded odor identity. However, their response to conditioned odors increased following associative learning, and their population activity more distinctly encoded paired stimuli, reflecting emergent value representation. Furthermore, pairing stimulation or inhibition of vGlut2BF neurons with specific odors altered odor preferences, suggesting that appropriately timed vGlut2BF neuronal activity is sufficient to influence valence assignment. Our findings reveal that vGlut2BF neurons transform sensory input into motivationally significant stimuli, positioning the BF as a key hub for linking sensory processing with motivational states and experience-driven plasticity.","tp":"嗅觉神经码","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究发现基底前脑中的谷氨酸能神经元（vGlut2BF）在嗅觉关联价分配中起关键作用。通过体内钙成像技术，研究人员观察到这些神经元最初对气味身份编码较弱，但随着学习过程，其反应逐渐增强。这些神经元接收胆碱能输入并调控行为，揭示了基底前脑如何通过经验赋予感觉刺激行为意义，为理解学习记忆机制提供了重要见解。"},{"t":"范德华异质结构中空穴-电子共振实现的巨大反常各向异性磁阻","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68438-9","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Communications","as":"研究在二维WTe2中发现了一种由空穴-电子共振驱动的巨型反常各向异性磁阻效应。空穴-电子共振动态屏蔽了材料内建电场，破坏了载流子散射路径的对称性，从而产生远超常规各向异性磁阻的信号。这一机制为自旋电子学和新型磁传感器件设计提供了全新物理途径，二维材料中共振工程调控输运特性的策略具有广泛启发性。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"范德华异质结磁电阻","kp":["[巨各向异性磁电阻]: WTe2/Fe3GaTe2界面空穴-电子共振","[物理机制]: 空穴-电子共振屏蔽内建电场"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Giant unusual anisotropic magnetoresistance enabled by hole-electron resonance in van der Waals heterostructures","b":"The hole-electron resonance in two-dimensional WTe2 dynamically screens the built-in electric field, disrupting the scattering equilibrium constraints of conventional electron transport. Here, we propose utilizing the hole-electron resonance to achieve Coulomb force-unconstrained spin angular momentum transfer across the WTe2/Fe3GaTe2 interface, offering a novel platform for exploring unconventional spin transport phenomena. A clear signature of this mechanism is the observation of an unusual anisotropic magnetoresistance of 289%, which far exceeds conventional spin Hall magnetoresistance and cannot be explained by standard spin absorption or scattering models. Its angular profile deviates from the simple cosine-squared form but realigns after accounting for magnetization and field orientation, reflecting the interplay between hole-electron resonance and magnetization dynamics. Furthermore, chiral transverse transport with distinct symmetry transitions emerges within the hole-active temperature regime, originating from interfacial symmetry breaking and the inhomogeneous spin-orbital coupling. These findings highlight the essential roles of both electrons and holes in spin transport.","aip":1},{"t":"皮层神经元兴奋和抑制树突整合的几何原理","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx2045?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"We use two-color uncaging of glutamate and γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) on layer 5 (L5) pyramidal neurons of the cingulate cortex to define how inhibitory control of excitation is determined by dendritic geometry. Traditionally, GABAergic input was considered as the gatekeeper; thus, receptors closest to the soma were ideally placed to veto excitation. However, recently modeling has advanced several counterintuitive hypotheses. Since laser uncaging can be directed at will to any position, we used photostimulation to show that inhibition near the sealed end of dendrites distal to excitation is more effective than inhibition near the soma in modulating excitation. Further, dendritic inhibition was found to be branch specific. Last, we demonstrate that inhibitory input from multiple thin basal dendrites can centripetally elevate to effectively tune distant excitation at the soma. These findings provide direct experimental evidence supporting theoretical predictions based on dendritic cable properties, revealing the critical role of dendritic geometry in shaping the interaction between excitatory and inhibitory neurotransmission."},{"t":"全基因组筛选将 BAP1 确定为 CDK4/6 抑制剂的合成致死靶点","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4348?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The nongenetic mechanisms by which cancer cells escape cell cycle inhibition remain inadequately understood. Here, we uncover an epigenetic pathway driving adaptive resistance to cyclin-dependent kinase 4/6 (CDK4/6) inhibitors in hepatobiliary cancers using integrative approach combining genome-wide CRISPR screenings with transcriptional, epigenetic, and proteomic profiling. Sustained CDK4/6 inhibition triggers BAP1-dependent chromatin remodeling that induces a stem cell-like epigenetic state. Specifically, BAP1 removes ubiquitin modification (H2AK119ub) at the TCF4 promoter, activating WNT and EMT signaling to enhance cellular plasticity and survival under therapy. Notably, genetic and pharmacologic inhibition of BAP1 markedly improves abemaciclib efficacy in multiple mouse models and patient-derived organoids (PDOs). These findings establish BAP1 as a key regulator of tumor plasticity and adaptive resistance through epigenetic reprogramming and suggest a promising strategy for overcoming adaptive therapeutic CDK4/6i resistance by targeting quiescent, drug-resistant cancer cells.","tp":"合成致死靶","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究通过全基因组CRISPR筛选结合转录组、表观遗传学和蛋白质组学分析，发现BAP1是肝胆癌中CDK4/6抑制剂的合成致死靶点。持续的CDK4/6抑制会触发BAP1依赖的染色质重塑，诱导干细胞样表观遗传状态，导致适应性耐药。这一发现揭示了癌细胞通过表观遗传途径逃避细胞周期抑制的新机制，为克服CDK4/6抑制剂耐药性提供了潜在治疗策略。"},{"t":"面向高能量密度锂离子电池的气态SO₂添加剂","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523079?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["添加剂[高能量密度锂电]: 气态SO2","优势[SO2添加剂]: 低成本高效界面钝化"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出将气态SO2作为高能量密度锂离子电池电解液添加剂的策略。SO2在电极界面优先参与固体电解质界面膜（SEI）的形成，有效抑制界面降解和副反应，显著提升电池循环稳定性。该研究拓宽了电解液添加剂从液态小分子向气态物种的探索方向，为高能量密度锂电池界面工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Gaseous SO2 Additive for High‐Energy‐Density Li‐Ion Battery","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Electrolyte additive engineering is pivotal for suppressing interfacial degradation and enhancing the cycling stability of high‐energy‐density batteries. However, conventional solid or liquid additives face inherent limitations such as high production costs, chemical instability, and inefficient interfacial passivation, restricting their practical application. Here, we propose an electrolyte engineering strategy that makes sustainable use of sulfur dioxide (SO\n                    2\n                    ), an industrial waste‐derived gas, as a dual‐functional gaseous additive. Owing to its ultrahigh reduction potential (2.6 V versus Li\n                    +\n                    /Li), which exceeds that of most known additives, and a low oxidation potential, SO\n                    2\n                    promotes the in situ formation of sulfur‐containing interphases on both electrodes through preferential electrochemical reactions, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic electrolyte decomposition. SO\n                    2\n                    enables 4.4 V‐class AG || NCM613 pouch cells to achieve exceptional cyclability exceeding 800 cycles with 88.2% capacity retention, along with outstanding temperature tolerance from −30 °C to 45 °C. This strategy also demonstrates universal applicability, yielding a long life of 800 cycles for Ah‐level 4.3 V‐class Si/C || NCM811 pouch cells. Furthermore, this approach alleviates electrolyte discoloration, extending shelf life while reducing cost and energy consumption. This work establishes a sustainable circular economy model by valorizing industrial exhaust into high‐value battery components, bridging environmental stewardship with next‐generation energy storage innovation.","aip":1},{"t":"用于构建多维MOFs异质结构的晶面选择性成核控制","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525577?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF异质结构","kp":["[MOF异质结构]: 晶面选择性成核控制"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种通过晶面选择性成核控制来构建多维金属有机框架（MOF）异质结构的新策略。研究者利用不同晶面的表面能差异，精确调控MOF在特定晶面上的成核与生长方向，实现了从一维到三维的可控形貌组装。该方法赋予MOF异质结构可调的形貌和组分，为设计具有协同功能的多孔复合材料（如催化、传感、气体分离）提供了通用平台，突破了传统MOF合成中形貌难以精确控制的瓶颈。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Facet‐Selective Nucleation Control for Constructing Multi‐Dimensional MOFs Heterostructures","b":"Abstract\n                  Metal–organic framework (MOF) heterostructures featuring tunable morphologies and compositions have shown great promise for applications in high‐throughput sensing, anti‐counterfeiting, and information encryption. Nevertheless, the precise engineering of heterogeneous architectures with multi‐dimensional building units remains challenging, primarily hindered by an insufficient understanding of the growth dynamics between modules of different dimensionality. Here, we demonstrate a facet‐selective epitaxial growth approach for architecting spatially defined dimensional heterostructures via crystalline plane‐selective reactivity control. The intrinsically higher surface energy at the tips of 1D microrods facilitates the nucleation of 2D modules on the terminal facets, thereby yielding dumbbell‐like heterostructures. Conversely, by selectively enhancing the reaction activity on the body regions of the 1D templates, preferential nucleation and growth at the central areas over the tips were effectively achieved, which enables the controlled formation of periodic modular architectures through systematic regulation of surface energies. The facet‐selective epitaxial growth paradigm establishes a pathway for synthesizing hierarchical dimensional heterostructures with tailored architectures, which show great promise for applications in advanced optoelectronics, anti‐counterfeiting systems, and information encryption technologies."},{"t":"FLIPs：基因编码的分子生物传感器，用于通过线性二色性显微镜对细胞信号传导进行功能成像","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz5662?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Genetically encoded fluorescent biosensors convert specific biomolecular events into optically detectable signals. However, imaging biomolecular processes often requires modifying the proteins involved, and many molecular processes are still to be imaged. Here, we present a biosensor design that uses a hitherto overlooked detection principle: directionality of optical properties of fluorescent proteins. The biosensors (termed FLIPs) offer an extremely simple design, high sensitivity, multiplexing capability, ratiometric readout, and other advantages, without requiring modifications to their targets. We demonstrate the sensor performance by real-time imaging activity of G protein-coupled receptors (GPCRs), G proteins, arrestins, and other membrane-associated proteins, as well as by identifying a previously undescribed, pronounced, endocytosis-associated conformational change in a GPCR-β-arrestin complex. In combination with an original tri-scanning linear dichroism confocal microscope, FLIPs allow unparalleled imaging of activity of nonmodified, endogenously expressed G proteins. Thus, FLIPs establish a powerful molecular platform for imaging cell signaling, allowing numerous future developments and insights.","tp":"荧光生物探","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"设计了基因编码的分子生物传感器FLIPs，利用荧光蛋白光学特性的方向性（线性二色性）这一此前被忽视的检测原理，对细胞信号传导进行功能成像。FLIPs设计极其简单、灵敏度高、支持多重成像，避免了传统生物传感器需要修饰目标蛋白的限制，拓展了活细胞分子过程的可成像范围。"},{"t":"美国西部鸟类群落将遭受预计的严重火灾","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68480-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Fire is a pervasive biogeographic process that shapes biodiversity globally and is now experiencing unprecedented changes. Despite well documented impacts of fires on biodiversity, we do not know where biodiversity might be most vulnerable to changing fire regimes. We leverage recent advancements in fire forecasting and species distribution modeling to assess the exposure of bird species richness, community uniqueness, and functional richness to altered fire regimes in the western United States. We find that 55-58% of biodiversity hotspots are classified as “refugia”, where high biodiversity intersects with predicted low severity burn areas. In contrast, 24-30% of biodiversity hotspots are classified as “areas of concern”, where high biodiversity intersected with predicted high severity burn areas. Over half (52-60%) of “areas of concern” occur in geographies with historically low-severity fire regimes; a fire regime mismatch indicating a potential threat to biodiversity. We find that species with a preference for high-density vegetation and with shallower beak depth are most likely to be exposed to high severity fire, indicating a potential for habitat losses for species with these traits. Our findings reinforce calls for targeted management to reduce impacts of future fire where it is predicted to be outside the historical range of variation."},{"t":"机械化学中单次冲击、累积能量、老化和液体辅助研磨效应的实验分离","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523191?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Mechanochemical reactivity arises from a complex interplay between single impact energy, cumulative energy input, and secondary effects such as aging or liquid‐assisted grinding (LAG). Here, we experimentally isolate these factors across two fundamentally different all‐solid reactions–the Finkelstein halogen exchange and the Wittig olefination–using a standardized single‐ball mixer mill setup. Systematic variation of milling parameters revealed that both reactions are impact‐driven but differ in how mechanical energy translates into chemical conversion. The halogen exchange exhibited pronounced aging, where the transformation continues after mechanical activation, highlighting the contribution of post‐impact reactivity. In contrast, the Wittig olefination, free of such secondary effects, showed an almost ideal linear correlation between yield and cumulative energy (\n                    E\n                    total\n                    ). LAG additives were found to modulate but not replace the impact‐driven regime, providing mechanistic insight into the frequently observed\n                    sweet spot\n                    in LAG‐assisted reactions."},{"t":"磁性有序调控的激子负折射","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-025-02118-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","as":"该研究报道了一种由磁性有序态介导的激子负折射现象。激子作为半导体中普遍存在的玻色准粒子，在其光学跃迁过程中通常只表现出正折射行为。研究者发现在特定磁性有序的层状半导体材料中，激子与磁振子的耦合诱导出异常的色散关系，使得激子在特定频率范围内展现出负折射特性。这一发现将磁学序参量与光学折射行为直接关联，为开发基于磁性调控的新型纳米光子器件和超分辨成像技术开辟了全新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激子负折射","kp":["[激子负折射]: 磁有序介导激子实现光负折射率调控"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Excitonic negative refraction mediated by magnetic orders","b":"Excitons are prevalent in many bosonic quantum phenomena in semiconductors. During their optical transitions, excitons not only emit or absorb photons, but also determine light propagation behaviours within the host medium. While absorption and emission processes have found numerous practical applications, chiefly in light-emitting diodes and solar cells, excitons’ capability of manipulating light propagation remains largely underexplored. Here we observe negative refraction—light bending in the opposite direction to conventional refraction—in an excitonic van der Waals magnet, namely chromium sulphide bromide (CrSBr). We also develop an excitonic hyperlens on an integrated nanophotonic chip, whose functionality is mediated by the magnetic orders of CrSBr. Specifically, the observed negative refraction and hyperlens effects emerge when CrSBr is magnetically ordered, driven by a magnetic enhancement of excitonic resonances. This work establishes excitons in van der Waals magnets as a versatile platform for controlling anomalous light propagation at the nanoscale."},{"t":"通过保幼激素诱导的水蚤基因共选择的环境性别决定的进化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525480123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Juvenile hormone (JH) exerts pleiotropic effects in insects, regulating not only metamorphosis and reproduction but also caste differentiation, morphogenesis, and diapause. How such diverse functions evolved from the ancestral role of JH remains poorly understood. The water flea,\n                    Daphnia\n                    , provides a striking case in which JH governs environmental sex determination (ESD) by inducing male production. Nonetheless, the molecular pathway linking maternal JH signaling to sex determination has remained unknown. Here, we identify the circadian gene,\n                    vrille\n                    (\n                    Dpvri\n                    ), as a direct transcriptional target of JH signaling. Reporter assays revealed that\n                    Dpvri\n                    is activated by the JH receptor complex (Methoprene-tolerant/steroid receptor coactivator) via newly acquired 9-bp JH response elements (9 bp-JHREs) in its regulatory region, whereas the beetle (\n                    Tribolium\n                    )\n                    vri\n                    gene lacks such elements and did not show JH-responsive expression. This demonstrates that the presence or absence of specific regulatory sequences underlies interspecific differences in JH responsiveness. CRISPR/Cas9 mutagenesis of a single JHRE substantially reduced JH-dependent\n                    Dpvri\n                    expression and elevated the threshold for male induction, demonstrating its causal role in vivo. Comparative sequence analyses showed that JHREs in\n                    vri\n                    are conserved in the Cladocera, but absent in the crustacean,\n                    Artemia\n                    , suggesting that their emergence coincided with the origin of ESD in this lineage. These findings reveal the evolutionary co-option of\n                    vri\n                    into the JH pathway via acquisition of a JHRE, providing a mechanistic explanation for diversification of JH functions in arthropods."},{"t":"乙醇与汽油：传统政策和缓慢的采用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421525005166?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"乙醇燃料政策","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"粪肠球菌氧化还原代谢激活未折叠蛋白反应，损害伤口愈合","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb5297?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Enterococcus faecalis is an opportunistic pathogen that thrives in biofilm-associated infections and delays wound healing, yet how it impairs host tissue responses is unclear. Here, we identified extracellular electron transport (EET) as a previously unrecognized source of reactive oxygen species (ROS) in E. faecalis and showed that this activity directly triggers the unfolded protein response (UPR) in epithelial cells and delays epithelial cell migration. ROS detoxification with catalase suppressed E. faecalis-induced UPR and rescued epithelial cell migration, while exogenous hydrogen peroxide was sufficient to restore UPR activation in EET-deficient strains. UPR disruption by pharmacological inhibition also impaired cell migration, highlighting a critical role for UPR homeostasis in wound repair. Our findings establish EET as a virulence mechanism that links bacterial redox metabolism to host cell stress and impaired repair, offering previously unidentified avenues for therapeutic intervention in chronic infections."},{"t":"基于深度强化学习与气象感知安全约束的电网韧性增强方法","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000152?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网韧性强化学习","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Enhancing power grid resilience through weather-aware security constraints: A deep reinforcement learning approach with "},{"t":"通过载药凝聚层增强生物膜浸润治疗难治性感染","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521500?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The effective treatments of biofilm‐related refractory infections such as osteomyelitis are hampered by the limited drug coverage to large infected areas and infiltration into the biofilm at infection sites. Herein, guided by the hypothesis that liquid water‐immiscible coacervates with ultra‐low interfacial tension could effectively infiltrate these barriers, it is systematically screened 7 representative coacervates for their biofilm infiltration performance. Coacervates with ultra‐low interfacial tension (&lt;0.5 mN m\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) showed markedly enhanced biofilm infiltration, whereas a high‐interfacial‐tension control (Gel‐Nap coacervate) and aqueous controls failed to infiltrate biofilms. However, electrostatically assembled complex coacervates suffered from poor physiological stability and cytotoxicity. The physiologically stable and biocompatible PEG‐alkyl coacervate is selected as a lead candidate for in vivo validation. In murine and canine osteomyelitis models, the selected drug‐loaded PEG‐alkyl coacervate system further demonstrated robust infiltration of microporous bone and dense biofilm, sustained local drug retention, effective eradication of\n                    Staphylococcus aureus\n                    , suppression of inflammatory cytokines, and accelerated bone regeneration. This study establishes low‐interfacial‐tension–driven infiltration as a generalizable principle for designing stable and biocompatible fluidic coacervate carriers to eradicate refractory biofilm infections."},{"t":"赋能精准C–H官能化：过加氧酶工程进展","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525086?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"过加氧酶工程","kp":["催化剂[C-H官能化]: 不饱和过氧化物酶及P450过氧化物酶","[反应条件]: 水相温和条件下H₂O₂驱动氧官能化"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该综述聚焦过加氧酶工程在精确C–H键官能化中的最新进展。选择性C–H官能化是现代有机合成的核心挑战，可实现分子的直接多样化修饰。过加氧酶凭借其血红素活性中心，能够催化不对称C–H羟基化反应，具有高区域选择性和立体选择性。文章系统总结了通过定向进化、理性设计和底物工程提升酶催化效率、扩大底物谱的策略，并讨论了反应体系工程化放大的挑战与前景。","ot":"Empowering Precision C–H Functionalization: Advances in Peroxygenase Engineering","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Selective C–H functionalization remains a central challenge in modern synthesis as it enables direct diversification of molecular scaffolds without pre‐functionalization. Peroxygenases, including both unspecific peroxygenases and P450 peroxygenases, offer a biocatalytic solution to this challenge, catalyzing oxyfunctionalization reactions in aqueous media under mild conditions with hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) as the sole oxidant. In this review, we highlight recent advances in peroxygenase engineering over the past five years, with a particular focus on strategies that enhance heterologous expression, catalytic activity, and control of regio‐ and enantioselectivity. We also discuss protein engineering approaches that mitigate H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐induced inactivation and summarize efforts to repurpose NADPH‐dependent P450 enzymes into self‐sufficient peroxygenases, thereby expanding their catalytic repertoire. Furthermore, we examine the integration of peroxygenases with in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation systems by enzymatic, chemical, photocatalytic, and electrochemical methods to achieve balanced oxidant delivery and sustained turnover. Collectively, these developments have established peroxygenases as versatile and robust catalysts for selective C–H functionalization, opening new opportunities for their application in the synthesis of pharmaceuticals, fine chemicals, and agrochemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"电子推拉策略实现磷酸酯电解质的可持续、抗腐蚀与阻燃长循环性能","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE05956A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸酯电解质","kp":["电解质[锂硫电池]: 磷酸三乙酯基高浓度局域电解质","[电子推拉工程]: 分子级调控抑制TEP与锂金属副反应","电解质特性[磷酸酯]: 本质不燃、防腐"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出电子推拉工程策略优化磷酸三乙酯（TEP）电解质体系，用于高安全锂金属电池。TEP电解质因其阻燃特性在锂金属电池安全方面潜力显著，但存在腐蚀性和锂枝晶等问题。通过引入具有电子推拉效应的添加剂分子，调节溶剂化结构，同时实现防腐、阻燃和长循环稳定性。该策略为构建本质安全、长寿命锂金属电池电解质提供了分子设计层面的新思路，兼具可持续性和工程可行性。","ot":"Electron push–pull engineering enables sustainable, anti-corrosive, and nonflammable phosphate electrolytes for long-lif","b":"Triethyl phosphate (TEP) electrolytes hold significant promise for high-safety lithium metal batteries (LMBs) due to their eco-friendliness and intrinsic nonflammability. However, parasitic reactions with lithium metal, coupled with sluggish reaction kinetics, hinder their practical deployment in LMBs. Hence, we propose a sustainable TEP-based localized high-concentration electrolyte (LHCE) by molecularly regulating the coordination ability and reduction chemistry of anisole diluents, thereby simultaneously overcoming the thermodynamic and kinetic limitations associated with high-concentration electrolytes and conventional LHCEs. The optimized p-methylanisole (pMA) diluent modulates Li–TEP coordination and facilitates anions to enter primary solvation sheath through Hδ+–Oδ− hydrogen-bonding interactions, while the weak ion–dipole interaction between Li+ and pMA promotes pMA participation in interfacial reactions and preserves the cation-hopping transport mechanism. This strategy yields robust LiF/Li2O-rich interphases and accelerates reaction kinetics, enabling lithium metal to achieve a high average coulombic efficiency of 98.7% over 650 cycles and an ultralong-lifespan exceeding 1600 h. When deployed in LMBs paired with 2.5 mAh cm−2 sulfurized polyacrylonitrile cathodes, the batteries demonstrate an extended lifespan over 600 cycles with an average capacity decay of only 0.03% per cycle. Furthermore, the molecular-level design of diluents is broadly applicable to other alkali–metal batteries, offering a new pathway toward the development of high-energy LMBs.","aip":1},{"t":"通过辐射交联制备弹性铁电体","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.72165?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"弹性铁电材料","kp":["交联方法[弹性铁电体]: 辐射交联","优势[辐射交联]: 低温无引发剂深穿透"],"dp":1,"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究通过辐射交联技术制备弹性铁电材料，突破了传统热交联方法的局限。随着可穿戴电子设备快速发展，弹性铁电材料因兼具柔韧性和压电/铁电响应而备受关注，但现有热交联制备方法存在交联度难以精确控制、材料均匀性差等问题。辐射交联利用高能射线在室温下引发聚合物链间交联，可实现更均匀的网络结构和可调控的交联密度，显著提升弹性铁电材料的形变耐受性和电学性能稳定性。","ot":"Elastic Ferroelectric by Radiation Crosslinking","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  With the rapid advancement of wearable electronics, elastic ferroelectrics, which have been prepared by thermal and photochemical crosslinking, possess tremendous potential applications in wearable devices. However, challenges arose from these crosslinking reactions, such as high crosslinking temperature, long processing time, initiator residues, limited penetration depths. In contrast, radiation crosslinking, triggered by high‐energy particles at room temperature, yields materials with enhanced properties by offering advantages like the absence of active end‐groups and initiators, fast crosslinking speed, deep penetration, and environmental friendliness. In this study, the elastification of ferroelectric polymers, with normal ferroelectric poly(vinylidene fluoride‐co‐trifluoroethylene) (P(VDF‐TrFE)) as the matrix and a crosslinking sensitizer with unsaturated double bonds, was realized via electron beam radiation crosslinking. By adjusting the absorbed doses and the feed ratios of P(VDF‐TrFE) and the crosslinking sensitizer, the crystallinity of the elastic ferroelectrics was controlled, effectively balancing ferroelectricity and resilience. The resulting elastic ferroelectrics maintain stable ferroelectric response under tensile strains up to 55%, exhibiting excellent elasticity and ferroelectric properties. This study presents a simple but efficient approach for preparing intrinsically elastic ferroelectric without high‐temperature reaction, and eliminating the need for heating and cooling steps, providing a potential universal platform for constructing various elastic ferroelectrics.","aip":1},{"t":"三金属单原子催化剂中动态自旋调控不对称配位场以实现最优氧还原","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519740?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子催化剂ORR","kp":["策略[ORR单原子催化剂]: 动态自旋工程","催化剂[ORR]: FeZnTM三金属单原子","[不对称配位场]: 动态自旋优化多步PCET"],"dp":1,"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出动态自旋调控策略优化三金属单原子催化剂的氧还原反应（ORR）性能。单原子催化剂理论上具有优越的ORR动力学，但实际应用中活性位点的电子结构优化仍受限。研究通过构建不对称配位场，在三金属单原子中心引入动态自旋耦合效应，精确调控金属活性中心的d带电子排布和含氧中间体吸附能，从而实现最优的ORR催化活性与四电子选择性，为高性能燃料电池阴极催化剂设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Dynamic Spin Governing Asymmetric Coordination Fields in Trimetallic Single‐Atom Catalysts for Optimal Oxygen Reduction","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Single‐atom catalysts demonstrate theoretically superior oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) kinetics, the limited dynamic adaptability, however, poses a giant challenge to meet the multi‐step proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET). Herein, we propose a “\n                    Dynamic Spin Engineering\n                    ” strategy for the rational design of tri‐metallic single‐atom catalysts (FeZnTM‐TACs) featuring asymmetric coordination fields (FeN\n                    4\n                    ZnN\n                    3\n                    TMN\n                    4\n                    ). Leveraging electron synergy and spatial functional decoupling among heterometallic sites, the optimized FeZnMn‐TACs exhibit exceptional ORR performance (\n                    E\n                    1/2 \n                    = 0.93 V versus RHE) and ultra‐long stability (Δ\n                    E\n                    1/2\n                     = 24 mV after 90,000 cycles). Through operando X‐ray absorption fine structure and spin‐polarized density functional theory, we unveil the scalability of a ternary synergy encompassing dynamic reconstruction, charge compensation and spin‐state transition, clarifying the roles of electron donors at the ZnN\n                    3\n                    sites and proton supply at MnN\n                    4\n                    sites. Dynamic FeN\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    C\n                    \n                      y\n                    \n                    evolution triggers a spin‐state transition from medium spin (MS = 1.5) to low spin (LS = 1.0), accompanied by the\n                    \n                      d\n                      xz\n                    \n                    /\n                    \n                      d\n                      yz\n                    \n                    orbital occupancy degree from 50% to 100%. As a consequence, we synergize the dual optimization of *OOH formation and *OH desorption in PCET. Moreover, our work atomically deciphers the spin redistribution mechanism driven by dynamic reconstruction, establishing a new paradigm for designing self‐adaptive electrocatalysts that ultimately unify ultrahigh activity with operational stability.","aip":1},{"t":"含氨基醌共价有机框架上的动态质子化实现高效中性电合成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524876?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中性电合成过氧化氢","kp":["催化剂[中性H2O2电合成]: 氨基醌基共价有机框架TfpBQ","[动态质子化]: 芳香氨基协同增强中性介质质子供给"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究报道了一种含氨基的醌型共价有机框架（COF）用于中性介质中高效电催化合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）。中性条件下H₂O₂的电合成对可持续应用至关重要但极具挑战性。COF材料上的动态质子化机制是关键创新——氨基官能团能够动态地促进质子转移，优化两电子氧还原反应路径，从而在中性电解液中实现高选择性和高效率的H₂O₂生成。该策略为环保型H₂O₂生产提供了新思路，避免了传统蒽醌工艺的高能耗和污染问题。","ot":"Dynamic Protonation on an Amino‐Containing Quinone‐Covalent Organic Framework Enables Efficient Neutral Electrosynthesis","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The electrosynthesis of hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) in neutral media is highly desirable for sustainable applications but is fundamentally limited by insufficient proton supply. Herein, we report a quinone‐based covalent organic framework (Q‐COFs) engineered with aromatic amino groups (TfpBQ) enables efficient neutral electrosynthesis of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , achieved by the synergism between Q and amino groups. The amino groups serve as dynamic proton relays, boosting the interfacial proton‐coupled electron transfer (I‐PCET) kinetics of the Q redox couples, as evidenced by a high apparent rate constant (\n                    k\n                    app\n                    ) of 1.97×10\n                    4\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    , which is 43% and 92% higher than that of the imine‐ and amide‐containing Q‐COFs, respectively. Consequently, TfpBQ achieves a remarkable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    yield of 19.3 mol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 95.6% at 120 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in a neutral electrolyte, while demonstrating exceptional stability during 60‐h of continuous operation. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses demonstrate that the dynamic protonation of aromatic amino groups reconstructs the interfacial hydrogen‐bond network, enabling a sustained proton supply to the adjacent Q/H\n                    2\n                    Q redox cycle, which in turn optimizes the overall 2e\n                    –\n                    ORR pathway. This work underscores the importance of managing dynamic protonation in electrocatalysts design for reactions occurring in proton‐deficient microenvironment.","aip":1},{"t":"动态氢键介导多孔芳香笼的多色手性余辉刺激响应手性诱导","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519866?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔芳香笼手性","kp":["[手性多孔笼]: 动态氢键介导刺激响应手性诱导","特性[有机笼薄膜]: 多色手性余辉"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了多孔芳香族笼状分子，通过动态氢键作用实现刺激响应型的手性诱导，并展现多彩手性余辉发射。生物手性起源是基础科学的重要未解之谜，该工作构建了人工手性系统来模拟和研究这一现象。动态氢键网络能够在不同外部刺激下可逆地调控手性信号，多色余辉特性使材料在手性光子学、信息加密和生物成像领域具有潜在应用价值。研究为理解手性传递和放大机制提供了分子层面的新视角。","ot":"Dynamic H‐Bonding Mediates Stimuli‐Responsive Chiral Induction in Porous Aromatic Cages with Multicolor Chiral Afterglow","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The origin of biological chirality remains a fundamental scientific mystery. Developing artificial systems with on‐off responsive chiral induction and transfer, and elucidating their mechanisms, is of paramount importance. Here, we report the first pair of chiral porous organic cage (\n                    R/S\n                    ‐\n                    BA‐PAC\n                    ) exhibiting unprecedented chiral afterglow in a film state, boosting a remarkable lifetime of 1.2 s and a dissymmetry factor (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) of 0.001. Loading rhodamine B (RB) guest molecules enables multicolor afterglow ranging from green to red, achieving 88% energy transfer. Notably, the confined RB displays a pronounced mirror‐imaged circular dichroism signal, and the induced chirality of RB demonstrates completely reversible on‐off switching under water vapor/thermal stimulation, which is extremely rare in covalent porous materials. Experimental and theoretical studies have shown that the distortion of the benzoic acid moiety in RB is caused by hydrogen‐bonding interactions between benzoic acid group and the\n                    BA‐PAC\n                    . This distortion disrupts the electric‐magnetic dipole moment orthogonality of RB, inducing its chirality. Furthermore, the reversible disruption and reconstruction of the host–guest hydrogen‐bonding network induced by external stimuli is a key mechanism for dynamic chiral transfer. This study bridges chiral induction and stimuli response in porous cages, providing a versatile biomimetic platform for investigating molecular‐level dynamic chirality transfer."},{"t":"共轭聚合物中双极化触发的自发激子解离以增强光催化分解水","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523220?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共轭聚合物光催化","kp":["策略[光催化H2O2]: 双极化(B←N+三嗪)促激子解离","反应介质[光催化产H2O2]: 纯水"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究针对共轭聚合物光催化分解水产氢中严重的激子效应问题，提出了双型极化诱导自发激子解离的新策略。在有机半导体中，强激子束缚能严重阻碍了自由电荷载流子的生成，限制了水氧化还原反应效率。通过分子设计引入双型极化结构，可在无需外部驱动力的情况下自发实现激子高效解离为自由载流子，显著提升光催化H₂析出性能。该工作为克服有机聚合物光催化中的激子瓶颈提供了重要的分子设计思路。","ot":"Dual‐Type Polarization‐Triggered Spontaneous Exciton Dissociation in Conjugated Polymers for Enhanced Photocatalytic H2O","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Severe exciton effect significantly hinders free‐charge‐involved water redox reactions, limiting the improvement of photocatalytic performance. Herein, a dual polarization strategy was proposed to achieve spontaneous exciton dissociation while lowering exciton binding energy by introducing B←N bonds and triazine as the dual‐type polarization unit into the alkynyl‐linked conjugated backbone. Dual‐type polarization centers can induce spontaneous exciton dissociation (exciton activation energy &lt;25 meV) to generate more free charges that participate in water oxidation reactions. Triazine as the second polarization unit, lowers the energy barrier of the H\n                    2\n                    O oxidation reaction and serves as the active site of the O\n                    2\n                    reduction reaction to accelerate H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐evolution. The H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐evolution performance of the dual‐polarization photocatalyst reaches up to 4261 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    with a superb apparent quantum yield of 25.84% at 420 nm and solar‐to‐chemical energy conversion up to 1.20% in pure water, surpassing most of the H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐evolution organic photocatalysts ever reported. Furthermore, the dual‐polarization photocatalyst exhibits strong universality in complex water bodies (lake water, river water, and seawater), while achieving higher H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐evolution performance than that in pure water."},{"t":"用于诊断生物标志物检测和肿瘤微环境评估的双模式微流控免疫染色装置","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea2586?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The limited availability of tissue samples from rare tumors poses a major barrier to advances in precise diagnosis, prognostic evaluation, and therapeutic research-challenges exemplified by primary central nervous system diffuse large B cell lymphoma (PCNS-DLBCL). Here, we developed a dual-mode microfluidic immunostaining (Dumi) device, which integrates diagnostic and research workflows into a single, automated platform, reducing tissue section consumption by more than 90%. Using just one to two slides, it enables both regional detection of biomarkers for diagnostic subtyping (≤16) and construction of multiplex tumor microenvironment (TME) maps. Joint analysis of multiregion diagnostic biomarkers in the TME map indicates that tumor cell subpopulations defined by specific diagnostic biomarkers can actively shape their in situ microenvironmental niche. Dumi offers an efficient, cost-effective, and multifunctional immunostaining method, overcoming the limitations of scarce tissue resources and providing a clinically accessible solution to the diagnostic and therapeutic challenges with rare tumors.","tp":"微流控免疫","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对PCNS-DLBCL等罕见肿瘤组织样本稀缺的难题，研究团队开发了双模式微流控免疫染色（Dumi）装置，将诊断与研究流程集成于单一自动化平台，组织切片消耗量降低超过90%。仅需1-2张切片即可完成多标志物检测和肿瘤微环境评估，为精准诊断、预后评价和治疗研究提供了高效工具。"},{"t":"环状镓磷烯L(OCP)GaPGaL对氨和水的双E─H键活化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202525581?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"主族化合物键活化","kp":["[双E-H键活化]: 环状镓磷烯室温活化NH₃和H₂O的N-H/O-H键"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了环状镓磷烯化合物L(OCP)GaPGaL对氨（NH₃）和水（H₂O）中E-H键（E=N, O）的双重活化。环状主族元素化合物1能够选择性地与NH₃和H₂O反应，实现N-H和O-H键的断裂活化。这一成果对主族元素化学具有重要意义——利用较轻的非过渡金属化合物活化小分子中强极性E-H键，为惰性小分子的催化转化提供了替代传统过渡金属的新途径。氨和水的活化是合成化学和能源催化中的核心挑战，该研究展示了主族金属多重键体系在这一领域的潜力。","ot":"Double E─H Bond Activation of Ammonia and Water by Cyclic Gallaphosphene L(OCP)GaPGaL","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Cyclic gallaphosphene L(PCO)GaPGaL\n                    1\n                    (L = HC[C(Me)NAr]\n                    2\n                    ; Ar = 2,6‐\n                    i\n                    ‐Pr\n                    2\n                    ‐C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    3\n                    ) selectively reacts with NH\n                    3\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O at ambient temperature with twofold N─H and O─H bond activation and formation of compounds LGa(μ‐PH)(μ‐NHC(O)PH)GaL\n                    2\n                    and LGa(μ‐PH)(μ‐OC(O)PH)GaL\n                    3\n                    . Both nucleophilic P atoms of\n                    1\n                    are protonated in these reactions, while the electrophilic carbon atom of the bridging PCO unit binds to the remaining NH group / O atom. The formation of heterocycles\n                    2\n                    and\n                    3\n                    , which were characterized by heteronuclear NMR (\n                    1\n                    H,\n                    13\n                    C{\n                    1\n                    H},\n                    31\n                    P{\n                    1\n                    H}) and IR spectroscopy, elemental analysis, and single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction (sc‐XRD), is only possible due to a beneficial interplay between the polar Ga─P double bond and the electrophilic nature of the C center in the bridging PCO unit. The reaction mechanism and energetics of the NH\n                    3\n                    reaction was investigated in detail by quantum chemical calculations, which also highlight the importance of bimolecular reaction processes with the involvement of an additional NH\n                    3\n                    molecule."},{"t":"海马通路对功能足迹揭示的学习规律和异常的独特贡献","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2503388123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Fundamental aspects of learning are theorized to be supported by hippocampal pathways: The monosynaptic pathway (MSP) extracts regularities, whereas the trisynaptic pathway (TSP) rapidly encodes exceptional items. Yet, the empirical evidence for the dynamic involvement of MSP and TSP in learning remains unresolved. We leveraged diffusion-weighted imaging to estimate the endpoints of MSP- and TSP-related white matter structures (i.e., footprints) within hippocampal subfields and the entorhinal cortex. We then measured the activation of pathway-specific footprints with functional MRI while participants learned novel concepts defined by regularities and exceptions. The functional footprint method revealed links between MSP-related footprint activation and regularity encoding early in learning and TSP-related footprint activation and exception encoding late in learning. These findings provide empirical evidence that learning concept regularities and exceptions is preferentially supported by hippocampal pathways. The pathway footprint approach provides insights into the functional dynamics of the human hippocampus, translating theoretical and computational work into empirically testable questions in humans."},{"t":"拆除坏死性凋亡引擎：治疗溃疡性结肠炎的口腔治疗纳米海绵","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202516297?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ulcerative Colitis (UC) treatments often lack target specificity and have significant side effects. A key pathological driver is the excessive necroptosis of intestinal epithelial cells (IECs), which disrupts the gut barrier. To address this, we designed an intelligent oral theranostic nanoplatform, CurN@I, to dismantle the necroptosis‐inflammation axis. CurN@I consists of a barium sulfate (BaSO\n                    4\n                    ) core for computed tomography (CT) imaging, encapsulated within a pH‐responsive silk protein nanosponge. This scaffold is co‐loaded with a necroptosis inhibitor (Necrostatin‐1s, Nec‐1s) and an antioxidant (demethoxycurcumin, DMC). The nanostructure is condensed in the acidic stomach but swells at the neutral pH of the inflamed intestine for localized drug release. Its negative surface charge facilitates durable electrostatic adhesion to the inflamed mucosa. In murine UC models, oral CurN@I significantly outperformed first‐line clinical drugs. Mechanistic analysis showed it inhibits IEC necroptosis, alleviates oxidative stress, promotes barrier regeneration, and reshapes the gut microbiome. This work presents a non‐invasive, targeted oral strategy that integrates diagnosis with multi‐faceted therapy to restore intestinal homeostasis, demonstrating strong potential for clinical translation."},{"t":"配体-阳离子差异相互作用实现二维模板诱导有序组装以构建高效锡基钙钛矿","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522717?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锡基钙钛矿光伏","kp":["策略[锡钙钛矿电池]: 2D相模板诱导有序组装","机理[锡钙钛矿]: 配体-阳离子差异相互作用"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"利用配体-阳离子差异化相互作用实现二维模板诱导的有序组装，制备高效锡基钙钛矿光伏器件，解决环境友好型锡卤化物钙钛矿结晶控制难题。","ot":"Differential Ligand–Cation Interactions Enable 2D‐Template‐Induced Ordered Assembly for Efficient Tin‐Based Perovskite P","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Environmentally friendly tin halide perovskite (THP) solar cells have recently attracted more and more research efforts as a promising alternative to toxic lead‐based perovskites. Incorporating more stable and uniformly oriented two‐dimensional (2D) phase components into the fast‐crystallizing and oxidation‐prone three‐dimensional (3D) phases as a growth template is a common strategy to enhance THP film quality. However, the simultaneous crystallization of the 2D phase with the 3D phase greatly undermines ordered crystallization for high‐performance THP devices. Herein, a fullerene derivative ligand is introduced to establish distinct ligand–cation interaction modes with the 2D and 3D components, thereby programming the A‐site cation‑mediated sequential assembly and crystallization. The 2D phase crystallizes first and serves as a template to guide the ordered epitaxial growth of the 3D phase, yielding a highly crystalline and oriented THP film with a homogeneous 2D/3D heterojunction as an efficient interface. The resulting devices achieve a significantly enhanced champion power conversion efficiency of 16.6%. Moreover, unencapsulated devices operating at maximum power point under continuous 1‐sun illumination and 50°C exhibit a nine‐fold longer\n                    T\n                    90\n                    lifetime (882 h vs. 99 h) compared to control devices.","aip":1},{"t":"描述符启发的低聚物添加剂实现长寿命锌金属电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202520598?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池电解液添加剂","kp":["添加剂[锌金属电池]: 描述符启发低聚物","模型[锌电界面]: 超越Langmuir多因素调控"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"基于描述符设计寡聚物添加剂抑制锌金属电池界面枝晶生长和寄生反应，显著延长循环寿命，为水系锌电池实用化提供界面稳定新策略。","ot":"Descriptor‐Inspired Oligomer Additives Enabling Long‐Life Zinc Metal Batteries","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Interfacial dendrite growth and parasitic reactions pose major challenges to the stability and efficiency of zinc metal batteries, prompting the exploration of electrolyte additives for interface stabilization. Here, we reveal that the interfacial adsorption of organic additives cannot be captured by the simplified Langmuir model, but is concurrently governed by vertical anodic affinity and intermolecular constraints. Building on this insight, we propose a dual‐descriptor design strategy and introduce the tailored oligomers as brand‐new type of electrolyte additives, aiming to balance the adsorption intensity and interfacial order at interface, thereby preventing steric agglomeration. The representative oligochitosan (OCS) synergistically optimizes the consecutive desolvation‐diffusion process, facilitating vertically stacking of larger zinc grains and inhibiting hydrogen evolution, demonstrates exceptional high Coulombic efficiency (over 99.5% for Zn||Cu cells) and ultralong stability (&gt;4,400 h at 1 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    and &gt;880 h at 10 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    ), significantly outperforming conventional analogues. Moreover, Zn||V\n                    6\n                    O\n                    13\n                    full cells retain 130.8 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    after 5,000 cycles at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    , and 0.2 Ah pouch cells maintain 91% capacity over 100 cycles. This work establishes a universal framework that connects molecular architecture with adsorption modes and interfacial dynamics, providing new insights for advanced electrolyte additives design.","aip":1},{"t":"解析CO₂捕集与利用技术商业化部署的关键障碍","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00134C","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"CCUS商业化障碍","kp":["[CO2捕集利用商业化]: 六大关键障碍制约大规模部署"],"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"系统分析CO₂捕集与利用技术从实验室到大规模商业部署面临的关键障碍，涵盖成本、规模化工艺、政策激励及市场接受度等维度，为碳管理技术产业化路径提供评估框架。","ot":"Describing Critical Barriers in Commercial Deployment of CO2 Capture and Utilization Technologies","b":"Despite decades of research on CO 2 capture and conversion, translating laboratory advances into products for widespread public use remains elusive. This review argues that the persistent emphasis on incremental innovations in capture and catalytic conversion overlooks the fundamental barriers that eventually determine large-scale feasibility. Here, we identify and critically evaluate six key bottlenecks that demand urgent attention: (i) the high energy requirement for CO 2 capture and regeneration, (ii) limited efficiency and selectivity of catalytic systems, (iii) infrastructure and scalability constraints, (iv) challenges linked with CO₂ purity and transportations, (v) uncertainties in lifecycle emissions and net carbon reduction, and (vi) inadequate economic incentives and market viability. Significantly, our analysis extends beyond laboratory studies to systematically assess insights from emerging CO 2 capture startups and ongoing commercial ventures, including those in space and defense. By interlinking the technological, infrastructural, and market-based gaps, we demonstrate that progress cannot be measured solely by energy efficiency and productivity; it must instead address the broader ecosystem of deployment questions. To facilitate broader understanding, authors present complex issues through simplified flowcharts and conceptual diagrams, making the debate accessible to scientists, policymakers, and the wider public. Finally, we propose potential paths to overcome these fences, reframing the CCU discussion from \"can it be done?\" to \"what will it take to deploy it?\". In this way, our review provides not only a censorious diagnosis of why commercialization lags but also a framework to guide future research, investment, and policy toward actionable climate solutions."},{"t":"DNA 末端构型决定 NHEJ 介导的末端桥接过程中突触复合体的形成","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68417-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","b":"Synapsis, the physical bridging of two broken DNA ends, is a critical step in non-homologous DNA end joining (NHEJ), the primary pathway for repairing DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) in vertebrates. While NHEJ synapsis has been well characterized using blunt-ended DNA, how diverse DNA end configurations influence synaptic complex formation remains much less clear. Here, using single-molecule FRET, we show that end configurations play a decisive role in synapsis pathway choice, with end pairing compensating for XLF in facilitating synaptic complex transitions. Notably, 3-nucleotide (nt) microhomology at DNA ends significantly enhances close synaptic (CS) complex formation mediated by Ku70-Ku80 (Ku) and XRCC4-Ligase IV (X4L4), even in the absence of XLF. Although XLF is nonessential for synapsis with 3-nt microhomology, it further promotes CS formation when present. The FRET analysis reveals that the single-stranded and double-stranded junctions of the DNA ends are in close contact within the primary CS complex, while the overhangs flip out of the duplex, potentially stabilizing the complex. These findings underscore the pivotal role of DNA end configurations in regulating synapsis and their broader implications for NHEJ repair efficiency and fidelity."},{"t":"DNA折纸模板适体手性结构实现细胞对映选择性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519007?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chirality refers to handedness as left‐ or right‐handed form of a molecule or molecular construct by synthesis or self‐assembly. In biology, chirality plays critical roles in determining the structures and functions of biomolecules such as proteins. In this study, we demonstrated that structural chirality generated by patterning multiple cell surface protein biomarker‐binding aptamers on a tubular‐shaped DNA origami (“DNA tube”) can realize differentness in cellular interaction, nanostructure uptake, cancer drug delivery, and consequent cell killing. Formation of the DNA tube and its ability to arrange external elements into left‐ or right‐handed form have been characterized by gel electrophoresis, atomic force microscopy, and transmission electron microscopy. Our fluorescence‐based cell experiments showed that the DNA tube‐templated aptamers of a left‐handed pattern can yield a higher cell uptake than those in a right‐form pattern. When loaded with an anticancer drug, Daunorubicin (Dau), the left‐handed tube‐aptamer‐Dau construct showed greater than double the cancer cell cytotoxicity than the construct in the right‐handed. Our study not only revealed that cell surface proteins interaction with the aptamers spatially organized into different chiral patterns can yield different cellular interaction and internalization efficiencies, but offered a new and versatile cancer drug delivery strategy for enhanced target cell treatment efficacy."},{"t":"巴豆酸通过诱导 ACSS2 介导的 EZH2-K348 c 抑制乳腺癌转移并促进免疫治疗反应","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea9892?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Crotonate, a short-chain fatty acid, generates protein crotonylation. However, the role of crotonate in cancer progression is unknown. Here, we present a crotonate-crotonyl-coenzyme A (CoA)-enhancer of zeste homolog 2 (EZH2) crotonylation cascade blocking breast cancer growth and metastasis. We demonstrated that crotonate promotes EZH2 degradation via crotonyl-CoA-mediated crotonylation at Lys348 in EZH2 (EZH2-K348cr). EZH2-K348cr leads to reduced genome-wide H3K27me3 (trimethylation of lysine-27 on histone-3) occupancy. Crotonate metabolizes to crotonyl-CoA by ACSS2 (acyl-CoA synthetase 2), and then, acyltransferase p300 catalyzes crotonyl-CoA and generates EZH2-K348cr. Crotonylated EZH2 triggers EZH2 ubiquitination and degradation. Administration of crotonate markedly inhibits breast cancer cell growth and metastasis via a crotonate-crotonyl-CoA-EZH2-K348cr cascade. In comparison, crotonate showed better blocking effect than EZH2 inhibitor tazemetostat in suppressing breast cancer metastasis. The combination of crotonate and anti-PD-L1 (programmed cell death ligand 1) antibody enhances responses of breast cancer cells to immunotherapy. Together, our findings indicate that crotonate is a promising anticancer drug candidate that suppresses breast cancer growth and metastasis by specifically inducing EZH2 degradation."},{"t":"共价有机笼光催化剂实现高效高选择性H₂O₂生产","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520264?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机笼光催化制过氧化氢","kp":["光催化剂[H2O2光合成]: 共价有机超芳笼","[催化剂设计]: 仲胺/叔胺/铵功能化离散有机笼"],"as":"该研究开发基于共价有机笼（Covalent Organic Cage）的光催化剂，用于高效、高选择性地光催化合成过氧化氢（H₂O₂）。现有光催化产H₂O₂体系普遍存在效率低、选择性差的问题，共价有机笼具有明确的空腔结构和可调控的活性位点，能够模拟酶的底物选择性微环境，从而提升光生载流子分离效率与氧还原反应选择性。该策略为绿色可持续的H₂O₂生产提供了分子级别的新设计思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Covalent Organic Cage‐Based Photocatalysts for Highly Efficient and Selective H2O2 Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalysts are key to sustainable hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) production, yet most reported systems are polymeric or composite, with limited solubility and poorly defined architectures that obscure mechanistic understanding and structure–function relationships. Here we present covalent organic superphane cages bearing secondary amine, tertiary amine, or ammonium functionalities as discrete, metal‐free photocatalysts for H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation. Among them, the tied tertiary amine derivative (\n                    SUPE‐ptz‐2\n                    ) exhibits enhanced light absorption, efficient charge carrier separation and transfer, and precisely organized redox‐active sites. As a result,\n                    SUPE‐ptz‐2\n                    achieves an H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    production rate of 11,089 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    in oxygen‐saturated water, rising to 25,031 µmol h\n                    −\n                    1\n                    g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    with 10% isopropanol, with an apparent quantum yield of 29.2% at 400 nm and 93% selectivity for the two‐electron oxygen reduction pathway. Comprehensive experimental investigations combined with density functional theory calculations reveal that phenothiazine moieties facilitate water oxidation via the four‐electron WOR pathway, while amine groups promote oxygen reduction through both the two‐electron ORR1 and ORR2 pathways; the tied cage architecture enforces spatial separation of redox sites, stabilizes key reaction intermediates, and enhances charge transport. Beyond photocatalytic efficiency,\n                    SUPE‐ptz‐2\n                    demonstrates robustness across diverse water sources and enables sunlight‐driven disinfection. These results establish covalent‐organic superphane cages as photocatalysts (singzymes) for sustainable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation and broaden their potential in solar‐to‐chemical energy conversion and environmental applications.","aip":1},{"t":"定速-变速抽水蓄能混合系统协调调频：一种自适应控制框架","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000279?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抽水蓄能调频","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Coordinated frequency regulation of fixed-variable speed pumped storage hybrid systems: an adaptive control framework in"},{"t":"混合移动电源协调调度用于配电网恢复：一种动态梯度掩码嵌入方法","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000292?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordinated dispatch of hybrid mobile power sources for distribution network restoration: A dynamic gradient masking emb"},{"t":"二聚体 SARS-CoV-2 主要蛋白酶活性位点之间的协作和通讯","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb0769?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The coronaviral main protease (Mpro) has been the subject of various biochemical and structural studies and a drug target against severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2) infections. SARS-CoV-2 Mpro is active as a dimer, but despite apparent cooperativity in catalytic activity, how the two distal active sites communicate and modulate binding and/or catalysis is unclear. Here, we have investigated the interplay between cooperativity, dimerization, and substrate cleavage in SARS-CoV-2 Mpro through a combination of enzymatic assays, crystal structures, and protein characterization. To disentangle the contribution of each active site to the observed enzymatic activity, we developed a cleavage assay involving heterodimers of active and inactive (catalytic residue mutated or inhibitor-bound) monomers. Notably, we found that heterodimerization increased cleavage efficiency per active monomer. In addition, we mapped a network of critical residues bridging the two active sites and probed this network through engineered mutations. By dissecting the cooperativity and communication between the active sites, we provide insights into the Mpro reaction cycle and functional significance of its dimeric architecture.","tp":"蛋白酶通讯","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该研究深入探讨了SARS-CoV-2主要蛋白酶（Mpro）二聚体两个活性位点之间的协作和通讯机制。虽然Mpro以二聚体形式发挥催化活性，但远端活性位点如何协调结合和催化过程尚不清楚。研究人员研究了协作性、二聚化和底物切割之间的相互作用，为理解冠状病毒Mpro的功能调控提供了重要信息，有助于开发更有效的抗病毒药物。"},{"t":"物质使用方面的消费不平等破坏了资源的可持续性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-025-01726-2","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"观点评论","b":"Growing global material consumption has pushed the Earth beyond safe planetary boundaries, yet little is known about how this burden is distributed across individuals. This study quantifies the inequality in household material footprints (MFs) using detailed global expenditure data from 168 countries, linked with a multiregional input–output approach. Results reveal stark inequalities: the top 10% consumers contribute 36% of global total household MFs, while the bottom 50% of consumers account for merely 18%. Inequality is especially pronounced in non-renewable resources such as metals and fossil fuels. Furthermore, elasticity analysis reveals a recoupling of resource use with high consumption, challenging the notion of absolute decoupling. These findings suggest that current sustainability policies about resource focusing on national efficiency gains may fall short without addressing the material-intensive lifestyles of the affluent. Targeting overconsumption at the top could reduce ecological overshoot and create space for sustainable development and material sufficiency for the global majority.","tp":"消费不平等","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"全球不断增长的物质消费已突破地球的安全边界。这项研究利用168个国家的支出数据和多区域投入产出法，量化了家庭物质足迹的不平等现象。结果显示，全球消费存在严重的不平等：排名前10%的消费者贡献了全球家庭物质足迹的36%，而底层50%的消费者所占比例极小。这表明少数高消费者的过度消费是导致资源不可持续的主要因素。"},{"t":"活细胞中合成蛋白结合非遗传 DNA 系统的构建","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02049-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Life’s development and adaption to fluctuating environments are underpinned by DNA–protein interactions, which have also spurred the development of artificial systems ranging from genetic circuits to nanoarchitectures. Nonetheless, in cellulo there remains an untapped design space for DNA–protein systems that are incompatible with the role of DNA as genetic material. Here we engineer retrons to intracellularly express non-genetic small DNAs embedding specific protein-binding sequences. These DNA species are products of genes and therefore their quantitative, spatial and functional control is decoupled from genetic stability, enabling alternative architectures of DNA–protein systems with unique functions. Using synthetic networks of proteins and the engineered retron-DNA, we demonstrated precise, multiplexed gene regulation and construction of feedback circuits for dynamic responses. Further, we developed DNA-based molecular scaffolds and bridges that enable modular, post-translational and spatial control of multiple proteins within cells. Finally, we transformed an allosteric transcription factor into inducible post-translational switches. Our work suggests that the non-genetic DNA–protein systems represent a promising control layer for creating synthetic cellular behaviours.","tp":"合成DNA系统","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队改造retron（逆转子）系统，使其在活细胞内表达嵌入特异性蛋白结合序列的非遗传性小分子DNA。这些DNA不参与遗传信息传递，而是作为胞内DNA-蛋白互作的设计模块，拓展了人工基因电路和纳米结构的设计空间，为合成生物学提供了全新的非遗传DNA工具。"},{"t":"具有 π 延伸的六芳基苯分子的二维分子板的构建","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524473?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    We demonstrate a unique approach to a 2D molecular slab in the solid state by designing a π‐extended hexaarylbenzene molecule, hexa(naphthothiophene diimide)‐substituted benzene (NTI6). The six naphthothiophene diimide (NTI) moieties of NTI6 were found to stand almost perpendicularly to the central benzene core both in solution and in the solid state, realizing a 3D shape‐persistent molecular structure. In the solid state, four of the six NTI units participated in π‐stacking intermolecular interactions in two different directions (the crystallographic\n                    a\n                    ‐ and\n                    b\n                    ‐axis directions). In addition, the remaining two NTI units interacted with neighboring molecules in an edge‐to‐edge manner in the crystallographic (110) direction. Theoretical calculations showed that the intra‐ and intermolecular overlaps of LUMOs efficiently spread within the 2D molecular slab, ensuring the formation of a 2D interactive electronic structure suitable as the active channel of organic field‐effect transistors (OFETs). Indeed, the NTI6‐based solution‐processed OFETs exhibited electron mobility on the order of 10\n                    −2\n                    cm\n                    2\n                    V\n                    −1\n                    s\n                    −1\n                    , corroborating the presence of a 2D electronic structure within the molecular slab.","tp":"分子材料构建","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队设计了π延伸的六芳基苯分子NTI6（六萘并噻吩二酰亚胺取代苯），其六个NTI单元在溶液和固体中均几乎垂直于中心苯环核心，形成三维形状持久的分子结构。固体状态下可实现二维分子板的组装，为超分子材料和有机电子学提供了新策略。"},{"t":"构建层状双氢氧化物基微纳反应器以增强光催化固氮","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520563?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化氮气固定","kp":["催化剂[光催化固氮]: 锌铝层状双氢氧化物3D微纳反应器","[微纳反应器]: 空间结构富集N2克服水中低溶解度扩散限制"],"as":"本研究构建了基于层状双金属氢氧化物（LDH）的微纳反应器，用于增强水相中光催化固氮（N₂还原为NH₃）。水相光催化固氮受限于氮气极低的水溶性和扩散效率。研究团队设计LDH微纳反应器，利用其层间限域空间富集N₂分子并提供催化活性位点，有效提升了氮气在催化剂表面的局部浓度和光生载流子利用效率。该策略为绿色合成氨和温和条件下的固氮反应提供了新思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Constructing Layered Double Hydroxide‐Based Micro‐Nano Reactors for Enhanced Nitrogen Photofixation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient photofixation of N\n                    2\n                    in aqueous photocatalyst dispersions is hampered by the very low solubility and diffusion coefficient of N\n                    2\n                    in water. Herein, we designed and constructed 3D micro‐nano reactors based on zinc‐aluminum layered double hydroxide (3D‐LDH) to overcome these challenges. Notably, the unique spatial architecture of the micro‐nano reactors (containing vertical ZnAl‐LDH arrays) visually captured by confocal laser scanning microscopy enriches the local concentration of small gas molecules during photocatalysis. The spillover kinetic analysis using oxygen as a probe molecule verified the enhanced diffusion of small gas molecules in the local vicinity of the 3D‐LDH catalyst. Accordingly, 3D‐LDH delivered superior photocatalytic activity for nitrogen photofixation compared to traditional LDH photocatalysts (2D‐LDH and bulk‐LDH). As a demonstration of the universality of this approach, 3D‐BiOBr and 3D‐TiO\n                    2\n                    equipped with micro‐nano reactors were also prepared, demonstrating notably enhanced performance for photocatalytic H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    synthesis and aqueous dye degradation compared to their 2D counterparts. This work thus identifies a practicable strategy for enhancing the rates of photocatalytic reactions in aqueous media that utilize a gas‐phase reactant."},{"t":"构建界面预应力以实现均匀应变的钙钛矿","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522418?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿应力调控","kp":["策略[钙钛矿电池]: 界面预应力实现均匀应变","修饰[TiO2 ETL]: 抗坏血酸葡糖苷降表面能"],"as":"钙钛矿晶体层内垂直方向应变不均匀是制约高效率钙钛矿光电器件的关键瓶颈。该研究提出界面预应力策略，通过在钙钛薄膜界面处构建可控的预应力分布，使钙钛矿晶格产生均匀应变，从而抑制应变梯度导致的缺陷积累和相分离。该方法有望显著提升钙钛矿太阳能电池的光电转换效率与长期相稳定性，为钙钛矿材料的应变工程提供了新思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Constructing Interfacial Prestress to Achieve Homogeneously Strained Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Vertically inhomogeneous strain within perovskite crystalline layers remains a critical barrier to achieving high efficiency and long‐term stability in perovskite solar cells. Herein, we address this challenge by integrating ascorbyl glucoside into hydrothermally synthesized TiO\n                    2\n                    nanocrystals derived from TiCl\n                    4\n                    to reduce the surface energy of TiO\n                    2\n                    electron transport layer. The small surface energy establishes a liquid/solid/air interface, creating a dewetting effect to trigger stressed perovskite lattice at the bottom region. This design aligns with the liquid/air interface at the top, typically accompanied by formation of an inevitably strained top surface of the perovskite crystals. By precisely controlling crystallization dynamics of the liquid/solid/air interface, we successfully obtained a compressively strained perovskite film that is homogeneously strained throughout the out‐of‐plane direction. This uniform strain perovskite films deliver outstanding device performance, improving efficiencies to 25.34% of target from 23.20% of control for small‐area devices (0.09 cm\n                    2\n                    ), and 24.13% of target from 21.25% of control for large‐area devices (1.00 cm\n                    2\n                    ). Moreover, the optimized device demonstrate remarkable operational stability, retaining over 95% (T95) of its initial efficiency for over 2 000 h. The mechanically informed strategy introduces a new paradigm for strain engineering, offering valuable insights into the design of high performance perovskite photovoltaics.","aip":1},{"t":"结合飞行时间二次离子质谱与多元分析解析镍基析氢催化剂的活性位点","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519929?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Ni基HER催化剂","kp":["[活性位解析]: ToF-SIMS结合PCA和MCR多元分析","[应用]: Ni基HER催化剂"],"as":"多相催化中活性位点的明确鉴定一直面临重大挑战，尤其在镍基催化剂体系更为突出。该研究将飞行时间二次离子质谱（ToF-SIMS）与多元统计分析相结合，实现了对镍基催化剂表面活性位点在原子尺度上的精准解析。该方法通过多维数据降维与聚类，有效区分了不同配位环境的Ni位点，为理性设计高效廉价Ni基催化剂提供了新表征范式。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Combining ToF‐SIMS and Multivariate Analysis to Resolve Active Sites on Ni‐Based HER Catalysts","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Unambiguous identification of active sites in heterogeneous catalysis remains a major challenge, particularly for materials with ultrathin, chemically mixed surface layers. Here, we demonstrate a generalizable approach that combines time‐of‐flight secondary ion mass spectrometry (ToF‐SIMS) with multivariate statistical analysis (principal component analysis [PCA] and multivariate curve resolution [MCR]) to resolve catalytically relevant motifs at the nanoscale. Using Ni electrodes as a model system, PCA distinguished hydroxide‐enriched domains from oxide‐ and metal‐rich regions, while MCR decomposed depth profiles and 3D images into hydroxide, oxide, and metallic layers with nanometer resolution. A unique secondary‐ion fragment, NiO\n                    3\n                    H\n                    3\n                    −\n                    (\n                    m\n                    /\n                    z\n                    108.94), emerged as a marker of hydroxide‐rich environments and correlated with hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) activity across a series of Ni electrodes. Complementary density functional theory (DFT) calculations revealed that Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    clusters adjacent to metallic Ni offer the most favorable water dissociation energetics, establishing the structural origin of the marker. While illustrated here for Ni‐based HER, this workflow provides a broadly applicable framework to isolate and rank near‐surface patterns that govern catalytic activity, thereby extending ToF‐SIMS from a qualitative probe to a predictive tool for active site identification."},{"t":"卷曲螺旋异二聚体介导的分裂碱基编辑系统可实现灵活且稳健的核苷酸取代","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68469-2","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Base editors (BEs) enable precise base substitutions, but their size exceeds the packaging capacity of adeno-associated virus (AAV), impeding in vivo applications. Here we design a split BE system that recruits deaminases to Cas9 nickase via coiled-coil heterodimers, resulting in various coiled-coil heterodimers-mediated base editors (CC-BEs), including cytidine base editor (CC-CBE), adenine base editor (CC-ABE), and their derivatives. We reveal that CC-BEs maintain and even improve the editing efficiency of the original unsplit BEs across various cell types and editing scopes, achieving maximum enhancements of 9.6-fold in human immortalized cells and 12.4-fold in primary somatic cells for CC-CBE. Using CC-ABE, we validate in vivo editing efficiency and successfully achieve A-to-G conversion in the Pcsk9 and Dmd genes via dual-AAV vectors in mice. Altogether, we develop a simple and universal strategy to address the challenges posed by the large size of BEs without compromising editing efficiency for base substitutions in vivo.","tp":"碱基编辑系统","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对碱基编辑器尺寸超过AAV包装容量限制的问题，设计了基于卷曲螺旋异二聚体的分裂碱基编辑系统（CC-BEs），通过卷曲螺旋结构域将脱氨酶招募至Cas9切口酶。该系统涵盖胞嘧啶编辑器（CC-CBE）和腺嘌呤编辑器（CC-ABE），编辑效率保持甚至提升，为体内基因编辑应用提供了灵活方案。","aip":1},{"t":"手性催化驱动的旋转分子马达","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-025-02050-0","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"The structural anisotropy necessary to distinguish clockwise from counterclockwise motions in motor-molecules continuously rotating about a covalent single bond has previously been supplied by chiral fuelling systems or by enzymes. Here we report a class of rotary motors in which, like motor proteins, structural asymmetry in the motor itself causes directional rotary catalysis. A single stereogenic centre in azaindole–phenylethanoic acid motors is sufficient to produce diastereomeric intermediates of atropisomeric conformations in the catalytic cycle, generating 8:1 clockwise:counterclockwise directional bias in the motor’s rotary catalysis of diisopropylcarbodiimide hydration (motor substituent PhCH2–). One enantiomer of a chiral hydrolysis promoter increases the directionality to 30:1 for clockwise rotation (motor substituent CH3–), while the other enantiomer reverses the direction to 1:2 clockwise:counterclockwise. The experimental demonstration that a chiral molecular motor can be powered by a chemical fuel to rotate either with, or counter to, the motor’s dominant power stroke informs the understanding of how chemical energy is transduced through catalysis, the fundamental process that powers biology.","tp":"分子马达","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"报道了一类手性催化驱动的旋转分子马达。与以往依赖外部手性燃料或酶不同，该马达本身的结构不对称性（类似马达蛋白）驱动定向旋转催化。azaindole-苯乙酸分子中单一立体中心即可产生非对映异构中间体，实现可区分顺时针与逆时针的旋转运动，是分子机器领域的重要突破。","aip":1},{"t":"手性磷酸功能化三维共价有机框架具有优异化学稳定性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522928?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性共价有机框架","kp":["催化剂[不对称催化]: 手性磷酸功能化3D-COF","合成[3D COF]: 多组分方法高结晶性"],"as":"将手性磷酸基团引入三维共价有机框架（3D COFs）是实现非均相手性催化的重要目标，但相关材料设计极具挑战性。该研究通过合理的拓扑设计，成功合成了功能化手性磷酸的3D COFs，利用其高比表面积、发达孔道和丰富的手性催化位点，在不对称催化反应中展现出高活性和高对映选择性。该工作拓展了手性多孔材料在非均相不对称催化中的应用前景。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Chiral Phosphoric Acid–Functionalized Three‐Dimensional Covalent Organic Frameworks with Exceptional Chemical Stability ","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The design of three‐dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) incorporating chiral phosphoric acids represents a promising strategy to enhance enantioselectivity in asymmetric catalysis while providing good framework stability, but their development remains a significant challenge. Herein, by using the multivariate approach, we report the construction of two highly crystalline chiral phosphoric acid‐functionalized 3D COFs with the 4‐fold interpenetrated\n                    qtz\n                    topology. Notably, the resulting frameworks exhibit exceptional chemical stability, remaining crystallinity even in 12 M HCl, saturated NaOH, and boiling water. Moreover, benefiting from the confined chiral porous architecture, these COFs deliver good activity, enantioselectivity, and recyclability in asymmetric\n                    N, N\n                    ‐acetalization reactions, significantly outperforming their homogeneous analogues. This work not only reports a highly stable chiral phosphoric acid‐functionalized 3D COF for asymmetric catalysis, but also provides a foundation for constructing robust, reusable heterogeneous chiral organocatalysts."},{"t":"化学调谐揭示了 Kv7.1 钾通道中电压传感器和孔域之间的阳离子 - π 门控桥","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517495123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"K\n                    v\n                    7.1 is a cardiac voltage-gated potassium channel that underlies the delayed rectifier current (I\n                    KS\n                    ) in the heart. The slow response to membrane depolarization is a hallmark feature of this channel’s physiology, yet the mechanistic basis of how voltage promotes the open potassium conducting state is unknown. We focused on previously identified aromatic residues which might couple the pore and voltage-sensing domains (VSDs) by using a chemical tuning approach whereby aromatic residues are modified by serial fluorination. The data show that serial fluorination at one site (F232 on the S4 helix, within the VSD) resulted in a stepwise voltage-gating shift, where each added fluorine atom further biased channel opening to more negative voltages. Mutant-cycle analysis of proximal positively charged amino acids indicates that F232 likely forms a cation–π interaction with K285, a residue at the tip of the S5 segment in the pore domain. Using cryoelectron microscopy, a partial structure of the F232 penta-F-Phe K\n                    v\n                    7.1 (KCNQ1) open channel was resolved to 6 Å. The data support a gating mechanism whereby the F232–K285 cation–π interaction represents an intermediate activated state that is broken prior to channel opening.","tp":"钾通道门控","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"Kv7.1是心脏中产生延迟整流钾电流的电压门控钾通道，其对膜去极化的缓慢响应是其生理特征，但其电压促进孔道开放的机制尚不明确。本研究利用化学调谐技术，发现该通道电压传感器与孔域之间存在一种由芳香族残基介导的阳离子-π门控桥。这一发现揭示了Kv7.1通道慢速门控的机械基础，对理解心脏电生理机制具有重要意义。"},{"t":"化学蛋白质组学鉴定了生酮介导的半胱氨酸修饰调节氧化还原功能","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519830?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Abstract\n                  All the studies of ketogenesis‐dependent post‐translational modifications (PTMs), notably those mediated by ketone bodies, β‐hydroxybutyrate (Bhb) and acetoacetate (Acac), have focused on lysine acylations. However, given the chemically diverse and reactive nature of metabolites generated, it remains unclear whether non‐lysine modifications can also happen. Here, we develop an acetoacetate‐alkyne (Acac‐alkyne) chemical probe that enables efficient metabolic labeling, robust fluorescent visualization, and site‐specific identification of Acac‐modified proteins. By combining chemical proteomics with open‐search strategy, we showed that Acac induces previously uncharacterized cysteine modifications in mammalian cells. Notably, cysteine crotonation (Ccr) is validated by employing both probe‐based and standard peptide‐based co‐elution assays. Metabolic pathway tracing further identifies BDH1 and ECHS1 as key enzymes that generate Ccr formation. We further demonstrate that Ccr at PRDX3 C229 site impairs dimerization and redox activity, linking this newly discovered modification to the regulation of cellular reactive oxygen species. Together, these findings establish ketone metabolism as a novel source of cysteine modifications and provide an alternative mechanistic pathway to explain the profound biological effects of ketone bodies.","tp":"蛋白质修饰","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"以往对生酮依赖的翻译后修饰研究多集中于赖酰化。本研究开发了一种乙酰乙酸-炔烃化学探针，能够高效标记并鉴定非赖氨酸修饰。研究发现，酮体代谢物能够介导蛋白质半胱氨酸的修饰，进而调节细胞的氧化还原功能。该研究不仅拓展了对生酮代谢调控的认识，也为靶向氧化还原相关疾病的干预提供了新的潜在方向。"},{"t":"使用假纤维化 ECM 的细胞表面工程重新编程间充质基质细胞的抗纤维化活性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea0998?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Fibrotic diseases, which impair tissue function and contribute to organ failure, remain a major clinical challenge with limited treatment options. Mesenchymal stromal cells (MSCs) offer promise for antifibrotic therapy via paracrine signaling, but their clinical efficacy is hindered by poor survival and limited functional activity after transplantation. Here, we present a cell surface engineering strategy that reprograms the antifibrotic function of MSCs by constructing a pseudofibrotic extracellular matrix (ECM) on their surface. Through in situ self-assembly of peptide-modified hyaluronic acid, we generate a nanofiber-based matrix that mimics the dense, disordered architecture of fibrotic ECM. This matrix activates the Piezo1/PI3K-Akt signaling pathway, inducing up-regulation of Mmp13-a key collagen-degrading matrix metalloproteinase-in engineered MSCs. In a rat model of myocardial infarction-associated fibrosis, engineered MSCs exhibit robust antifibrotic activity compared to unmodified MSCs. These findings establish a bioinspired strategy for MSC reprogramming and offer a path toward more effective cell-based therapies for fibrotic disease.","tp":"细胞表面工程","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"纤维化疾病缺乏有效的治疗手段。间充质基质细胞（MSCs）因其旁分泌抗纤维化功能而具治疗潜力，但移植后存活率低限制了其疗效。本研究提出了一种细胞表面工程策略，通过在MSCs表面构建假纤维化细胞外基质，成功重编程并增强了其抗纤维化活性。该方法有效克服了移植细胞的存活和功能瓶颈，为纤维化疾病的细胞治疗提供了新方案。"},{"t":"生物相容性TADF探针用于高度多重化荧光寿命成像","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521482?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"荧光寿命成像探针","kp":["荧光寿命[常规荧光团]: <5ns","[TADF探针]: 生物相容、高复用荧光寿命成像"],"as":"荧光寿命成像显微（FLIM）可实现多通道荧光信号的同时读取，但现有探针的生物相容性和多路复用能力有限。该工作开发了一类生物相容的热活化延迟荧光（TADF）探针，利用其可调控的荧光寿命特性实现高维度多路复用成像。该探针无需传统荧光染料的复杂光谱分离，显著提升了活细胞多靶标同步检测的通量与精度，在生物医学成像领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Biocompatible TADF Probes for Highly Multiplexed Fluorescence Lifetime Imaging","b":"Abstract\n                  Fluorescence lifetime imaging microscopy (FLIM) is an optical imaging modality that can provide multiplexed readouts with remarkable sensitivity to cellular microenvironments. Even though fluorescence lifetimes can distinguish fluorophores having overlapping spectral profiles, conventional fluorophores possess a narrow range of emission lifetimes (typically shorter than 5 ns) that limits their potential for multiplexed imaging. In this work, we have systematically designed and evaluated a combination of thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) nanoprobes for multiplexed FLIM. We have synthesized a collection of 36 TADF biocompatible nanoprobes with long and diverse fluorescence lifetimes in aqueous media (up to 15 ns) and employed selected probes for live‐cell imaging of bacterial cells under physiological conditions. By leveraging the exceptionally broad range of fluorescence lifetimes of these TADF emitters, we have achieved unprecedented simultaneous imaging of five nanoprobes within a single spectral window using a FLIM‐phasor strategy. These findings demonstrate that TADF emitters are excellent scaffolds to unlock the capabilities of fluorescence lifetime imaging for multi‐color biological studies."},{"t":"双金属包覆构建界面微环境以实现锌金属电池粉末负极的高可逆性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518003?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌电池粉末负极","kp":["策略[锌粉负极]: 双金属包覆调控界面微环境","[锌粉负极]: 匹配Zn2+扩散与电子传输"],"dp":1,"as":"水系锌电池因安全性和成本优势备受关注，但锌粉负极界面不稳定导致枝晶生长和副反应，严重制约循环寿命。该研究通过双金属包覆策略构建优化的界面微环境，有效抑制界面副反应并引导均匀的锌沉积，实现了锌粉负极的高度可逆循环。该方案为高安全、长寿命水系锌电池的工程化推进提供了切实可行的界面工程方案。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bimetallic Cladding‐Constructed Interfacial Microenvironment Enabled Highly Reversible Powder Anode for Zn Metal Batteri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The unstable interface of metal powder anode remains a challenge to achieve long‐life Zn powder‐based aqueous zinc metal batteries (AZMBs). However, most reported metal composite strategies still suffer from a mismatch between Zn\n                    2+\n                    diffusion and electron transfer behaviors. Here, a bimetallic cladding strategy with a specific displacement sequence was proposed. Except for inheriting intrinsic advantages of Sn and Cu, the opposite EDL charge distribution of Cu to Zn compensates for the anion adsorption, inhibiting the ZSH‐related side reactions. Moreover, abundant in situ constructed surface SnO\n                    2\n                    voids could accommodate stripped Zn\n                    2+\n                    to avoid disordered diffusion, providing a shorter diffusion distance for the electron acceptance by Zn\n                    2+\n                    instead of H\n                    +\n                    . Based on the matched electron and ion transport behaviors, the Zn@SC anode exhibited excellent cycle stability of over 2800 h in Zn||Zn cells at 1 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    –5 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    , and achieved an areal capacity of 2 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    in Zn||NH\n                    4\n                    V\n                    4\n                    O\n                    10\n                    cells at 3 A g\n                    −1\n                    and 70% capacity retention after 1000 cycles. As a practical validation, the pouch cell based on Zn@SC anode and high mass‐loaded cathode (10.05 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    ) also exhibits satisfactory cycle stability. This work emphasized the importance of the interfacial microenvironment on the electrochemical performances and provided valuable direction of multi‐metal Zn powder anode.","aip":1},{"t":"作者更正：用于晚期结直肠癌多模式治疗的中空管状水海绵","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68519-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"人工智能支持“遗传性非侵入性细胞内记录”，可长时间监测心脏活动","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady3617?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Intracellular action potential (AP) recording that allows long-term monitoring is challenging because permanent membrane penetration is impossible due to cell death or resealing of perforated cell membrane. Herein, an \"inherited noninvasive intracellular recording\" methodology was proposed, which was based on the fusion of artificial intelligence (AI) with microelectrode array (MEA)-electroporation system (AI-MEA-EP) to enable prolonged monitoring of intracellular APs in cardiomyocytes. It used MEA-electroporation (MEA-EP) for minimally invasive collection of intracellular signals transiently (~1 minute), as well as noninvasive recording of extracellular signals in long term. The recorded extracellular APs were converted into corresponding intracellular APs by a convolutional neural network-long short-term memory-based AI model enhanced by model self-calibration. The intracellular APs detected by the AI-MEA-EP exhibited high consistency with those physically obtained through MEA-EP. It was demonstrated to monitor cardiac intracellular AP under drug treatments and glucose challenging during >5 consecutive days. This method offers a unique solution to achieve prolonged recording of intracellular signals for advancing cardiac research.","tp":"AI心脏监测","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"提出了'遗传性非侵入性细胞内记录'方法，将人工智能（AI）与微电极阵列-电穿孔系统（AI-MEA-EP）融合，实现对心肌细胞内动作电位的长时间监测。该方法通过AI预测最佳电穿孔时机，克服了传统膜穿孔导致细胞死亡或膜重封的难题，为心脏药物筛选和疾病模型研究提供了新工具。"},{"t":"活性物质模型捕捉果蝇幼虫上皮细胞肌动球蛋白振荡的空间动态","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2503955123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The apicomedial actomyosin network is crucial for generating mechanical forces in cells. Oscillatory behavior of this contractile network is commonly observed before or during significant morphogenetic events. For instance, during the development of the\n                    Drosophila\n                    adult abdominal epidermis, larval epithelial cells (LECs) undergo pulsed contractions before being replaced by histoblasts. These contractions involve the formation of contracted regions of concentrated actin and myosin. The emergence and control of pulsed contractions are not fully understood. Here, we combined in vivo 4D microscopy with numerical simulations of an active elastomer model applied to realistic cell geometries and boundary conditions informed by cell polarity to study in vivo subcellular spatial patterns of LEC actomyosin dynamics. The active elastomer model quantitatively reproduced in vivo observations. When compared to rectangular domains, simulations on realistic cell geometries showed systematically better agreement with experiments. We found that cell shape, cell polarity, and organization of the cell’s actomyosin network codetermine spatiotemporal network dynamics both in vivo and in simulations. Furthermore, the model predicted changes to LEC contractile activity under genetic perturbation of the actomyosin network. Our results show that cell geometry, accompanied by boundary conditions which reflect the cells’ polarity, is important to understanding the dynamics of the apicomedial actomyosin network. Moreover, our findings support the notion that spatiotemporal oscillatory behavior of the actomyosin network is an emergent property of the actomyosin network, rather than driven by upstream signaling."},{"t":"双组分系统的激活剂控制结核分枝杆菌的细胞分离和内在耐药性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519608123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Unlike commonly studied rod-shaped bacteria, mycobacteria grow from their poles, requiring precise coordination between division and initiation of new pole growth. The mechanisms that mediate this transition are largely unknown, but likely represent a rich source of drug targets for the treatment of mycobacterial infections, including tuberculosis. Here, we identify TapA (MSMEG_3748/Rv1697) as a key regulator of this transition. TapA interacts with the sensor kinase MtrB at the septum to initiate a signaling cascade that ultimately results in the expression of the essential peptidoglycan hydrolases RipAB, among others, at the end of division. Loss of TapA disrupts division, dysregulates pole formation, and sensitizes\n                    \n                      Mycobacterium tuberculosis\n                    \n                    and other mycobacteria to several first and second-line TB antibiotics, establishing TapA as a potential therapeutic target, and defining a link between cell cycle progression, envelope remodeling, and intrinsic antibiotic resistance in mycobacteria."},{"t":"确定林奇综合征基因编码和非编码变异致病性的准确细胞测定","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517801123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lynch syndrome (LS) is a genetic predisposition to mainly colorectal and endometrial cancer due to heterozygous disruptive germline mutations in the DNA mismatch-repair (MMR) genes\n                    MSH2\n                    ,\n                    MSH6\n                    ,\n                    MLH1,\n                    or\n                    PMS2\n                    . Beyond clearly pathogenic mutations, germline sequencing often reveals variants of uncertain significance (VUS), predominantly single base-pair alterations in coding or noncoding regions. These uncertain variants obstruct LS diagnosis, hampering personalized surveillance. To address this challenge, we developed a highly accurate functional assay that interrogates VUS pathogenicity in human cells. Building on a mouse-based cellular assay, we adapted oligonucleotide-directed mutation screening (ODMS) for human cells and introduced a refined approach named “coselection ODMS.” To ensure physiological expression, the variant is introduced into the endogenous MMR gene by replication-coupled gene editing. Coselection ODMS demonstrated 100% accuracy in classifying 50 benign and 86 pathogenic variants spanning coding and noncoding regions in all four MMR genes. Among 109 patient-derived VUS, 51 were identified as deleterious for MMR function. Importantly, coselection ODMS delivered 100% concordant results in a clinical diagnostic laboratory. With &gt;93% sensitivity and &gt;92% specificity, coselection ODMS provides a highly reliable functional assay in the diagnosis of enigmatic LS variants, enabling risk assessment and personalized surveillance or treatment for affected families."},{"t":"一种超高效、超经济、抗冻多肽（Adv. Mater. 4/2026）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71908?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"防冻多肽","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.5},"as":"","ot":"An Ultrapotent, Ultraeconomical, Antifreeze Polypeptide (Adv. Mater. 4/2026)"},{"t":"Af-CUT&Tag：一种使用基因编码标签和高亲和力双标记的灵敏且无抗体的染色质分析方法","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68454-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Conventional chromatin profiling techniques are often limited by antibody availability and performance. Here, we introduce Af-CUT&Tag, a target antibody-free method that overcomes these limitations by using CRISPR-integrated peptide tags (HiBiT/ALFA-tag) recognized by engineered binders (LgBiT/NbALFA) fused to a Tn5 transposase. Af-CUT&Tag eliminates dependence on traditional target antibodies, achieving robust specificity and sensitivity with as few as 500 cells. It provides high-quality chromatin profiles, with improved signal-to-noise ratios and library quality compared with conventional antibody-based counterparts, while also enabling single-cell resolution (scAf-CUT&Tag). Applying Af-CUT&Tag to Hippo effectors (YAP1/TAZ) during liver regeneration reveals dynamic chromatin remodeling, including YAP1/TAZ-mediated control of lipid metabolism (e.g., Lpin1, Fasn) and heme clearance (Hpx, Trf). We further identify miR-122 as a critical regulator of these processes, impacting liver regeneration. The versatility of Af-CUT&Tag in cell lines, bulk tissues, and single nuclei establishes it as a powerful tool for studying gene regulation in development, disease, and regeneration."},{"t":"利用多孔有机聚合物的多功能复合纤维材料研究进展与展望（Adv. Mater. 4/2026）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71907?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"多孔有机聚合物纤维","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","ot":"Advances and Prospects in Multifunctional Composite Fibrous Materials Utilizing Porous Organic Polymers (Adv. Mater. 4/2"},{"t":"基于双类型模型集成与在线误差修正的光伏功率自适应预测","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000498?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","dp":1,"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[光伏功率预测]: 双类型模型集成与在线误差校正"],"as":"","ot":"Adaptive forecasting of photovoltaic power based on dual-type models’ ensemble and online error correction"},{"t":"质子交换膜电解槽中析氧反应的耐酸钌基固溶体催化剂","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202522216?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PEM电解水析氧","kp":["催化剂[PEM电解槽OER]: RuZrCoCrCeO2固溶体","优势[非铱OER]: 酸稳定+高活性","合成[Ru基固溶体]: 模板导向MOF衍生"],"dp":1,"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"质子交换膜（PEM）水电解是绿氢生产的重要路线，但其强酸性阳极环境对析氧反应（OER）催化剂的耐腐蚀性提出极高要求。本研究开发了一种钌基固溶体催化剂，通过合金化策略提升在酸性介质中的稳定性。该材料在PEM电解槽高电位、强氧化条件下展现出优异的OER活性与耐久性，有望替代稀缺昂贵的铱基催化剂，降低绿氢制备成本，推动PEM电解技术大规模商业化。","ot":"Acid‐Stable Ruthenium‐Based Solid Solution for Oxygen Evolution in Proton Exchange Membrane Electrolyzers","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Proton exchange membrane (PEM) water electrolysis offers a promising route for green hydrogen production, yet balancing catalytic activity and durability remains challenging for oxygen evolution reaction (OER) catalysts in acid, particularly for non‐Ir‐based catalysts. Herein, we develop a template‐guided strategy to synthesize the metal–organic framework (MOF)‐derived RuZrCoCrCeO\n                    2\n                    solid solution with tunable multi‐metal heteroatom regulation. The catalyst demonstrates outstanding acidic OER performance, requiring only 179 mV overpotential to achieve 10 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    and remarkable durability over 1500 h at 50 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    with a negligible decay of 30.67 µV h\n                    −1\n                    . An “electronic buffer” effect facilitates electron transfer from atomically dispersed Zr to Ru, forming asymmetric Ru─O─Zr bonds with enhanced metal–oxygen covalency, thereby preventing excessive oxidation of Ru species. A vicinal deprotonation mechanism was proposed, where lattice oxygen assists *OOH deprotonation with a lower energy barrier on Ru─O─M sites. A PEM electrolyzer with low Ru loading (0.37 mg\n                    Ru\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ) achieves an industrial‐level current density of 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    at 1.66 V, corresponding to a low hydrogen cost of US$0.89 kg\n                    −1\n                    below the US DOE target (US$2 per kg of H\n                    2\n                    ), and operates stably for 600 h at 200 mA cm\n                    geo\n                    −2\n                    , demonstrating its practical potential for scalable, Ir‐free PEM electrolyzers."},{"t":"铜催化对映选择性自由基接力三氟甲硫亚胺化反应构建轴向手性乙烯基亚砜亚胺","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523530?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化不对称合成","kp":["催化剂[轴手性亚砜亚胺]: Cu催化自由基接力","手性[亚砜亚胺]: 轴手性+点手性同步构建"],"as":"该研究报道了一种铜催化对映选择性策略，用于合成轴向手性乙烯基亚砜亚胺（vinyl sulfilimines）。亚砜亚胺作为含硫六价杂原子骨架，在药物发现和不对称合成中日益受到关注，但其轴向手性变体的构建长期缺乏高效方法。该工作通过铜催化剂与手性配体的协同作用，实现了对C=N键轴向选择性的精确控制，高对映选择性地产出目标分子。这一方法为含硫手性药物中间体及生物活性分子的设计提供了新的合成工具，拓展了手性硫化学的研究边界。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Access to Axially Chiral Vinyl Sulfilimines via Copper‐Catalyzed Enantioselective Radical Relay Trifluoromethyl‐Sulfilim","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Sulfilimines have garnered increasing attention as valuable scaffolds in drug discovery and asymmetric synthesis. Nevertheless, catalytic enantioselective construction of sulfilimines in both axial and point chirality chemical space remains a substantial challenge. Herein, we report copper‐catalyzed atroposelective sulfilimination of terminal alkynes with sulfenamides via a radical relay mechanism, enabling the direct assembly of axially chiral vinyl sulfilimines with high levels of chemo‐, regio‐, diastereo‐, and enantioselectivity. The success of this strategy hinges on the atroposelective trapping of transient high active vinyl radicals by a chiral Cu–sulfinimidoyl intermediate. Experimental and computational mechanistic studies reveal a novel asymmetric radical sulfilimination mechanism through an enantioselective reductive elimination of a Cu(III) intermediate, thereby establishing a mechanism distinct from outer‐sphere HAT‐initiated radical–radical coupling or S\n                    H\n                    2 pathway."},{"t":"加速有机太阳能电池发展：融合机器学习的标准化协议","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.202506139?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["效率差距[OSC]: 实验室>20% vs 商业约半","[OSC标准化]: 机器学习辅助筛选协议"],"as":"有机光伏（OPV）电池在实验室中已突破20%光电转换效率，但从实验室小面积器件到工业化量产之间存在显著差距。该研究提出了一套标准化协议，旨在统一OPV器件的制备、表征与性能评估流程，涵盖活性层旋涂、电极蒸镀、稳定性测试等关键环节，消除不同实验室间因工艺差异导致的效率数据不可比性。标准化方案将加速有机太阳能电池从基础研究向商业化转移，缩短材料筛选到器件优化的研发周期。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Accelerating the Development of Organic Solar Cells: A Standardized Protocol with Machine Learning Integration","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic Photovoltaic (OPV) devices show a large gap between laboratory‐recorded cells with over 20% efficiency and commercial roll‐to‐roll printed modules reaching a maximum half that efficiency. A novel OPV material not only needs high efficiency, but must be processable in architectures suited for large‐scale applications and provide sufficient stability under various stress factors. We present a holistic screening protocol to cover all relevant aspects of OPV material development. Using machine learning techniques together with systematic experimental protocols, only a minimum amount of a novel semiconductor is necessary. We utilize process parameters, optical features, and IV data to explore the processing window, benchmark process stability, and enable structure‐property predictions. We implement a combinatorial degradation protocol that investigates key stress factors, like temperature, oxygen, and illumination, at different stages of device fabrication. Testing partially finished devices, conventional and inverted architectures, as well as hole‐only and electron‐only devices, enables the identification of individual layers responsible for degradation. The protocol includes a solvent test to investigate processability with green solvents. The systematic data collected in this protocol provides a general and reliable basis for material development and the imminent creation of digital twins for OPV.","aip":1},{"t":"相关不确定性下社区多能系统的风险规避多时间尺度随机集成框架","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000164?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"社区多能系统","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"A risk-averse multi-timescale stochastic integration framework for a community multi-energy system under correlated unce"},{"t":"用于鲁棒相位传感的非线性奇偶校验时间对称系统","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-025-01542-8","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","b":"Parity–time-symmetric systems with loss and gain can be described by non-Hermitian Hamiltonians. In such systems, the inclusion of a nonlinear saturable gain can eliminate the imaginary part of frequency eigenvalues and suppress noise. Consequently, a system biased at an exceptional point can be used to create enhanced sensors. However, exceptional-point frequency sensing typically has a relatively small scaling factor and a limited dynamic range. Here we report a nonlinear parity–time-symmetric system that detects the phase difference between the loss and gain resonators. We show both theoretically and experimentally that the phase difference has a cube-root singularity with a large scaling factor over a wide dynamic range. We create a wearable capacitive temperature sensor based on exceptional-point phase sensing and show that it can measure temperatures from 36 °C to 55.5 °C, which corresponds to a perturbation from 0% to 3.95%, with a maximum normalized sensitivity of 400, an estimated dynamic range of 53.52 dB and an estimated signal-to-noise ratio of 63.8 dB. Compared with an exceptional-point frequency sensing sensor, the sensitivity of our sensor is enhanced by an order of magnitude.","tp":"非线性传感","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8,"i":4,"r":5,"d":6,"t":6},"as":"报道了一种非线性宇称-时间（PT）对称相位传感系统。在非厄米系统中引入非线性饱和增益可消除频率本征值的虚部并抑制噪声，但传统异常点频率传感的标度因子小、动态范围有限。该系统通过非线性PT对称性实现了增强的相位传感性能，拓展了动态范围，为高灵敏度传感器设计提供了新思路。"},{"t":"使用高效离子液体的柔性混合能源热泵用于可持续太阳能制冷","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000243?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子液体热泵","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A flexible hybrid-energy heat pump using efficient ionic liquids for sustainable solar cooling"},{"t":"调节 DOC2A 16p.11.2 GWAS 位点选择性剪接的因果编码变异影响 sch 的易感性","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adw7667?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Although genome-wide association studies (GWASs) have identified many schizophrenia-associated variants, their biological mechanisms remain unclear. Using transcriptomic data from human brain tissues, we performed splicing quantitative trait locus (sQTL) analyses of schizophrenia-associated single-nucleotide polymorphisms and identified more than 17,000 sQTLs linked to previously unidentified splicing junctions. Functional prioritization and experimental validation highlighted the synonymous variant rs3935873 within the 16p11.2 GWAS locus strongly associated with an unannotated isoform DOC2A∆Val217-Pro218. rs3935873 was significantly associated with hippocampal volume, and hippocampal overexpression of DOC2A∆Val217-Pro218 in mice recapitulated schizophrenia-relevant behavioral deficits, phenotypes absent in DOC2AFull-Length-overexpressing mice. Overexpression of both isoforms altered excitatory synaptic transmission, structural modeling revealed divergent tertiary configurations between DOC2A∆Val217-Pro218 and DOC2AFull-Length, and interactome profiling highlighted that DOC2A∆Val217-Pro218 unique interactors are enriched in the myosin II complex and ankyrin binding, suggesting the acquisition of previously unknown structural and regulatory functions by DOC2A∆Val217-Pro218. Our study implicates dysregulated splicing in DOC2A as a functional mechanism for schizophrenia genetic risk and demonstrates how unannotated isoforms can reveal disease-relevant pathways."},{"t":"一种具有本质上无序的 RNA 结合区的细菌翻译激活剂","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2519770123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Bacterial RNA-binding proteins (RBPs) that control the translation of multiple transcripts act largely as negative regulators. Here, we report the identification and characterization of a positive regulator of translation (called PhaF) in the opportunistic pathogen\n                    Pseudomonas aeruginosa\n                    . Using CLIP-seq and CLAP-seq we identify upward of 50 transcripts targeted by PhaF. We demonstrate that PhaF acts to stimulate the translation of target mRNAs by binding upstream of the Shine–Dalgarno sequence using one or more of the multiple KPAA motifs located in an intrinsically disordered region of the protein. Importantly, we show that PhaF plays a key physiological role in\n                    P. aeruginosa\n                    through its translational control of the\n                    pslA\n                    transcript required for exopolysaccharide synthesis and biofilm formation. Our findings uncover an activator of translation in bacteria that binds target transcripts using an RNA-binding region reminiscent of those that are prominent in eukaryotic RBPs."},{"t":"基于硅兼容CMOS平台的宽可调自旋轨道力矩器件（Adv. Mater. 4/2026）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71906?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋矩器件","as":"","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.5},"kp":["[自旋轨道矩器件]: 硅兼容CMOS平台实现宽范围可调"],"ot":"A Widely Tunable Spin‐Orbit Torque Device through the Silicon Compatible CMOS Platform (Adv. Mater. 4/2026)"},{"t":"一种具有高静态介电常数的固态两性离子塑料晶体","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517774?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"两性离子塑料晶体","kp":["材料[高介电常数]: 咪唑鎓基两性离子塑料晶体","结构[两性离子]: 长程有序+弱分子间力"],"dp":1,"as":"研究开发了一种固态两性离子型塑性晶体材料，具备极高的静态介电常数。与传统高介电陶瓷或聚合物相比，该材料利用两性离子结构中的永久偶极子在晶格中的取向极化实现介电增强，兼具固态稳定性与可加工性。该材料在电容器、固态电池介电层及能量存储器件等领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Solid State Zwitterionic Plastic Crystal With High Static Dielectric Constant","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Solid materials with a high dielectric constant have a wide range of applications in the energy storage field. In this research, an imidazolium‐based zwitterion is designed, synthesized, and confirmed to have a plastic crystal phase based on the following experimental and computational evidence: (i) the presence of long‐range order with weak intermolecular forces and competing attractive‐repulsive interactions along different crystallographic directions; (ii) the observation of more than one endotherm on heating including a solid‐solid phase transition at T\n                    s‐s\n                    = −26 °C and melting of the plastic crystal at T\n                    m\n                    = 72°C; (iii) a low entropy of fusion at melting (2.1 JK\n                    −1\n                    mol\n                    −1\n                    ); (iv) a strongly anisotropic morphology; (v) relatively fast dynamics originating from short‐range degrees of freedom. Furthermore, it exhibits a very high dielectric constant in the plastic crystal solid state (147 at −10°C and 103 at 70°C) due to the rotational degrees of freedom of plastic crystals that arise from weak net intermolecular interactions of zwitterions due to only having two carbons between the anion and cation. This material conveniently remains in the plastic crystal phase within 50 K of ambient temperature. This discovery opens new opportunities in the search for solid‐state high dielectric constant materials."},{"t":"应变工程化VO₂中的隐藏光致相变路径","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517123?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二氧化钒相变","kp":["[应变工程VO2]: 发现光致隐藏相变路径","体系[光致相变]: VO2绝缘体-金属转变"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用应变工程在二氧化钒（VO2）中发现了一条此前未被观测到的光致相变隐藏路径。通过施加应变调控VO2的晶格自由能曲面，超快激光激发下材料可沿非常规路径完成金属-绝缘体相变，绕过传统热力学主导的相变通道。该发现深化了对强关联量子材料非平衡态动力学的理解，并为超快光控相变器件的设计提供了新的自由度。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Hidden Photoinduced Phase‐Transition Pathway in Strain‐Engineered VO2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photoexcitation provides a versatile route to drive quantum materials into nonequilibrium states, opening opportunities for phase engineering beyond conventional tuning parameters such as temperature, magnetic field, pressure, or chemical doping/substitution. VO\n                    2\n                    , a prototypical correlated oxide, has long served as a model system for understanding photoinduced insulator–metal transitions, yet the sequence of structural and electronic transitions remains intensely debated. Here, we uncover a hidden photoinduced transition pathway in epitaxially strained VO\n                    2\n                    thin films, in which the structural transition precedes the electronic insulator–metal transition, reversing the canonical temporal order. Femtosecond X‐ray diffraction reveals a transient structural state characterized by the disappearance of vanadium dimers generating dynamic tensile strain, while time‐resolved terahertz spectroscopy shows that the electronic gap closes only after the strain relaxation. This lattice‐driven transition highlights the pivotal role of Mott correlations in dictating electronic properties under nonequilibrium conditions. Our findings establish strain–light coupling as a design principle for ultrafast control of phase transitions, offering new avenues for reconfigurable electronic and photonic devices based on correlated oxides."},{"t":"用于无压力固态锂电池的梯度纳米畴高熵聚合物电解质带","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202520657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵聚合物电解质","kp":["电解质[无压固态锂电]: 三相高熵聚合物电解质带","结构[HEPE]: 梯度纳米畴控制"],"dp":1,"as":"本文提出一种具有梯度纳米畴结构的高熵聚合物电解质（HEPE）胶带，用于无外加压力固态电池。高熵策略通过多组分协同打破传统聚合物电解质离子电导率与机械强度的权衡；梯度纳米畴设计使电解质内部形成连续的离子传输通道和应力缓冲层，在无需外部堆叠压力条件下实现锂金属均匀沉积，抑制枝晶生长。该工作为高安全、易规模化加工的柔性固态电解质提供了新范式，对推动无压力固态电池实用化具有重要意义。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A Gradient Nanodomain High‐Entropy Polymer Electrolyte Tape for Pressure‐Free Solid‐State Lithium Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy polymer electrolytes (HEPE) have attracted significant attention owing to their exceptional design flexibility in properties and thin‐film processability. However, building high‐performance HEPE with well controlled nanodomains of multi‐components remains a critical challenge due to serious microphase separation. Here, we report a tri‐phase high‐entropy polymer electrolyte (HEPE) tape featuring ultrafine soft‐rigid gradient nanodomains approaching the single‐chain length scale, to achieve notable simultaneous enhancements in mechanical, electrochemical, and interfacial properties. The HEPE is realized through Li\n                    +\n                    ‐bond‐regulated nanophase separation of polyethylene oxide (PEO), poly (methyl methacrylate) (PMMA), and polyvinylidene fluoride‐co‐hexafluoropropylene (PVFH), leading to high‐entropy microstructures at the levels of chain conformation and phase domains. Consequently, the HEPE exhibits a high room‐temperature ionic conductivity of 0.24 mS∙cm\n                    −1\n                    , exceptional mechanical properties (strength of 22.1 ± 2.3 MPa, toughness of 87.7 MJ∙m\n                    −3\n                    , elastic recovery of 66.7%), and interfacial adhesion toughness of 325 ± 15 N∙m\n                    −2\n                    . Benefitting from these properties, the HEPE can generate physico‐electrochemical synergistic effects on stabilizing the lithium metal anode with a long cycling life of 750 h at 0.1 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    . The resultant solid‐state Li|HEPE|NCM811 cell delivers a high capacity of 205.5 mAh∙g\n                    −1\n                    even without stack pressure. This study indicates a promising high‐entropy tri‐component mixing strategy for the design and fabrication of HEPEs."},{"t":"结晶单配位铟(I)-磷烯基","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523125?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    The synthesis of the mono‐coordinate indium(I) compound In[C(Ad)═PTer] (Ad = 1‐adamantyl, Ter = 2,6‐Dipp\n                    2\n                    ‐C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    3\n                    ; Dipp = 2,6‐diisopropylphenyl) is reported. Key to the formation of this monomeric species is the steric protection offered by the supporting phosphaalkenyl ligand which hinders aggregation. The title compound can be accessed from the reaction of (InTer)\n                    2\n                    with the phosphaalkyne AdC≡P in an unusual redox‐neutral transformation in which the In─C bond of the (InTer)\n                    2\n                    precursor, known to dissociate in solution, adds across the C≡P triple bond of the phosphaalkyne. This insertion reaction is reversible, as shown by the reaction of In[C(Ad)═PTer] with B(C\n                    6\n                    F\n                    5\n                    )\n                    3\n                    , which affords [TerInB(C\n                    6\n                    F\n                    5\n                    )\n                    3\n                    ] accompanied by extrusion of AdC≡P. In contrast, the lighter analogue (GaTer)\n                    2\n                    promotes the dimerization of the AdC≡P fragment resulting in the formation of the cluster (GaTer)\n                    2\n                    (AdCP)\n                    2\n                    . The formal oxidation state of In[C(Ad) = PTer] was probed by reaction with methyl‐iodide which affords the indium(III) compound In(Me)I[C(Ad) = PTer] in a formal single‐site oxidative‐addition reaction at indium."},{"t":"Raney镍催化剂的百年历程","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521850?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"雷尼镍催化百年综述","kp":["催化剂[Raney Ni]: 碱浸Ni-Al合金制多孔镍","[特性]: 高活性与原位储氢能力"],"as":"本文系统回顾Raney Ni催化剂百年发展历程。Raney Ni由Ni-Al合金经碱液浸沥制得，具有高比表面积多孔结构与优异加氢活性，百年来广泛用于有机合成、油脂硬化、制药等领域。综述涵盖：合金组成调控、活化工艺优化、孔结构与活性位本质的基础认识演进，以及在电催化、生物质转化等新兴方向的拓展。文章展望了机器学习辅助合金设计、原子级活性位解析等前沿方向对下一代Raney型催化剂的推动作用。","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"100 Years of Raney Ni Catalyst","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Raney Ni, a porous Ni catalyst derived from alkali‐leached Ni–Al alloy, has anchored itself in the field of catalysis for a century since its 1924 invention by Raney. Its dual merits—high activity and in situ hydrogen storage—enable applications in various fields. This review condenses its evolution: from alloy design to functional tailoring via doping/milling, emphasizing structure–activity correlations and sustainable chemistry impacts. Despite its long‐standing utility, comprehensive reviews on Raney Ni's century‐long evolution have been scarce. This review systematically summarizes its development—from discovery and preparation refinement to performance modification and application expansion—highlighting its enduring role in catalysis and providing insights for future sustainable material research."},{"t":"克服传质限制的\"无活性材料\"设计用于高能量密度全固态锂硫电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(25)00420-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态锂硫电池","kp":["[全固态锂硫电池正极]: 无预载活性材料设计","[机理]: 离子/电子导体丰富界面实现隐形宿主硫利用"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"全固态锂硫电池面临三相界面（离子导体、电子导体、活性物质）接触不充分的瓶颈，传统预载活性材料方法无法保证有效接触。本研究提出'无活性材料'设计策略，从电池结构层面重新构建电极/电解质界面，突破质量传输限制，旨在提升全固态锂硫电池的能量密度与循环稳定性。该思路为高能量密度固态电池的界面工程提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"“Active material-free” design to overcome mass-transport limitations for high-energy-density all-solid-state Li-S batteries","b":"Artificially preloading active materials cannot guarantee effective three-phase contact, where the ionic conductors, electronic conductors, and active materials meet, making it difficult to achieve efficient sulfur utilization. In our design, the cathode contains no preloaded active material. Instead, it provides abundant interfaces between ionic and electronic conductors, allowing an “invisible hand” to drive the in situ formation of active materials at these interfaces. This design inherently maintains both ionic and electronic pathways, enabling high performance."},{"t":"膳食碳水化合物与脂肪比例对代谢组学特征的与体重无关的影响：为期 5 个月的随机对照喂养试验的次要结果","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-68353-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Communications","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Diet plays a crucial role in health, with low-carbohydrate diets often proposed to exert metabolic benefits. We aim to investigate metabolomic adaptations in 164 adults with overweight or obesity who were randomly assigned to high- (n = 54), moderate- (n = 53), or low-carbohydrate (n = 57) diets during a 20-week weight-loss maintenance phase of the Framingham State Food Study [(FS)2], a controlled, parallel feeding trial (ClinicalTrials.gov: NCT02068885). We measure fasting plasma metabolites by liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry using samples from 147 participants who completed the study (n = 45, 48, and 54 in the high-, moderate-, and low-carbohydrate diet groups, respectively). Significant associations (False Discovery Rate"},{"t":"面向高湿环境中实用化超长寿命锂空气电池：双界面工程协同策略","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202523411?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂空气电池界面","kp":["应用[锂空气电池]: 高湿环境超长循环","[策略]: 双界面工程","介导剂[自防御]: SnCl₄+1,8-二碘辛烷"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"锂空气电池在高湿度环境下的运行稳定性是制约其实际应用的关键难题。本研究提出双界面工程协同策略，同时优化锂负极/电解质界面和空气正极/电解质界面，有效抑制水汽侵入导致的副反应与界面退化。该方案显著提升了锂空气电池在高湿条件下的超长循环寿命，推动了该技术向实际环境条件下可靠运行迈出重要一步。","dp":1,"ot":"Toward Practical Ultralong‐Life Li‐Air Batteries in High‐Humidity Environments: A Synergistic Strategy for Dual‐Interfacial Engineering","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Maintaining the operational stability of Li–air batteries (LABs) in high‐humidity environments is crucial for their transition from laboratory research to practical deployment. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy for dual‐interfacial engineering toward ultralong‐life LABs in high‐humidity environments. An iodine‐based self‐defense redox mediator—SnCl\n                    4\n                    and 1,8‐diiodooctane (DIO) is introduced into the electrolyte. On the cathode side, it enabled efficient bidirectional OER/ORR catalysis while forming a protective interface that suppressed both nucleophilic and hydrolytic attack. On the anode side, a highly lithiophilic, corrosion‐resistant, and moisture‐tolerant protective layer forms on the Li anode, which ensures stable battery operation under extremely humid conditions. The results show that the Li─O\n                    2\n                    battery achieved more than 2400 cycles (nearly 3000 h) at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and an extremely low charge potential (&lt;3.5 V), coupled with a high discharge capacity of 111879 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Notably, the SnCl\n                    4\n                    /DIO‐based LABs reached more than 1800 cycles (&gt;2160 h) even in atmospheric air without humidity control. This work significantly overcomes the strict humidity limits of traditional LABs and provides an innovative strategy for developing LABs capable of operating in high‐humidity environments.","aip":1},{"t":"镍催化阻转选择性[4+2]环加成合成轴手性菲基-芳基膦及其广谱配体应用","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519122?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"轴手性膦合成","kp":["催化剂[轴手性膦配体合成]: 镍催化","[反应类型]: 对映选择性[4+2]环加成","[产物]: 轴手性菲基-芳基膦"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究开发了镍催化阻旋选择性[4+2]环加成反应，合成轴手性菲基-芳基膦化合物及其氧化物。这类轴手性双芳基膦是不对称催化中不可或缺的配体。方法具有良好的底物适用性和官能团容忍度，所得手性膦配体可直接应用于多种不对称催化转化反应，展现出优异的对映选择性和催化活性。该策略为构建轴手性膦配体提供了高效新途径，对不对称催化领域具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Synthesis of Axially Chiral Phenanthryl–Aryl Phosphines via Nickel‐Catalyzed Atroposelective [4 + 2] Cycloaddition with Broad Ligand Applications","b":"Abstract\n                  Axially chiral biaryl phosphines and their oxides are indispensable ligands in asymmetric catalysis, enabling diverse enantioselective transformations. Here, we report the design, synthesis, and applications of a new family of axially chiral phenanthryl–aryl phosphine ligands. We disclose a nickel‐catalyzed atroposelective [4 + 2] cycloaddition of biphenylenes with 1‐arylalkynes to give axially chiral phenanthryl–aryl bis‐ and monophosphine oxides, including 2,2'‐bis(diphenylphosphine oxide)‐1,1'‐binaphthy (BINAPO) analogues, as well as monophosphine oxides (MOPOs) and 1‐(2‐diphenylphosphinyl‐1‐naphthyl)isoquinoline (QUINAPO) analogues, in high yields and with excellent enantioselectivity. The transformation features 100% atom economy, employs a nonprecious metal, shows broad substrate scope, scales well, and allows easy purification, underscoring strong practical utility. The oxides were readily reduced to the corresponding phenanthryl–aryl MOP‐ and BINAP‐type P(III) ligands. Across multiple representative enantioselective transformations, including hydrogenation, arylation, allylation, and hydrosilylation, these new ligands consistently surpassed benchmark ligands, affording markedly higher enantioselectivity. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations indicate that the cycloaddition‐generated phenanthryl unit deepens the chiral pocket around phosphorus, thereby accounting for the high level of stereocontro"},{"t":"同步结晶策略实现热稳定全FA铅锡钙钛矿用于可印刷无MA全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D5EE04529K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["[钙钛矿组分[叠层电池]: 全FA无MA的Pb-Sn体系","[稳定化策略]: 同步结晶提升热稳定性","[应用]: 可印刷无MA全钙钛矿叠层电池"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过同步结晶策略实现了热稳定的全FA（无甲胺）Pb-Sn钙钛矿，用于可印刷的全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池。传统混合阳离子Pb-Sn钙钛矿虽进展迅速，但存在相分离和热稳定性问题。研究者通过调控结晶动力学，使全FA体系获得均匀薄膜和优异晶体质量，显著提升热稳定性。该策略为制备可大规模印刷的无MA叠层钙钛矿电池提供了可行路径，推动了全钙钛矿叠层电池的产业化进程。","dp":1,"ot":"Synchronizing Crystallization Enables Thermally Stable All-FA Pb-Sn Perovskites for Printable MA-Free All-Perovskite Tandem Solar Cells","b":"Monolithic all-perovskite tandem solar cells based on mixed cation lead-tin (Pb-Sn) have advanced rapidly in recent years. However, the presence of a considerable amount of volatile methylammonium (MA) adversely constrains stability of the solar devices. Here, we first quantitatively evaluated the thermal stability of Pb-Sn perovskite films containing different types of A-site cations. In comparison to the all-MA and MA-FA binary counterparts, all-formamidinium (FA) Pb-Sn films exhibit the highest decomposition activation energy of 149.13 kJ mol-1. On this basis, high-quality all-FA Pb-Sn perovskite films are prepared by blade coating with addition of a small amount of hydrazinium dichloride (HDC) to the perovskite precursor. The selectively strong coordination of HDC with Sn2+ ions not only suppresses the oxidation of Sn2+ but, more importantly, balances the nucleation of the Sn- and Pb-based species, resulting in perovskite films with markedly improved homogeneity of Pb-Sn alloyed phase. The prepared single-junction all-FA Pb-Sn PSCs and MA-free tandem devices yield champion efficiencies of 21.81% and 27.40%, respectively. Moreover, the unencapsulated all-FA Pb-Sn devices maintain >80% of their initial efficiencies following 190 h of thermal stress at 85 °C."},{"t":"通过手性空间共轭构建对称多共振TADF发射体实现强手性光学响应与窄带绿色圆偏振电致发光（Adv. Mater. 4/2026）","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.71910?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"TADF发光材料","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Symmetric Multi‐Resonant TADF Emitters via Chiral Space Conjugation Toward Strong Chiroptical Responses and Narrowband Green Circularly Polarized Electroluminescence (Adv. Mater. 4/2026)","aip":1},{"t":"废塑料热解转化制备替代航空燃料的可持续生产工艺：技术经济分析与生命周期评估","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000516?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废塑料制航油","kp":["[航空替代燃料]: 塑料废弃物热解转化","方法[航空燃料]: 热解转化+技术经济+生命周期评估"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Sustainable production of alternative aviation fuel via thermolytic conversion of plastic waste: techno-economic analysis and life cycle assessment"},{"t":"全氟化Ce(IV)配位框架中的战略性氧取代触发双波长非线性光学材料的卓越性能","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202521066?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非线性光学晶体","kp":["材料[NLO晶体]: 全氟化Ce(IV)配位框架","[改性策略]: 轻微氧取代","[功能]: 双波长二次谐波生成"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过在全氟化Ce(IV)配位框架中进行战略性氧取代，开发了双波长非线性光学（NLO）晶体材料，实现优异的二次谐波生成（SHG）性能。NLO晶体在激光技术中至关重要，用于扩展激光波长。氧原子的引入调控了框架的电子结构和不对称性，使材料在双波长下均表现出强SHG响应，综合性能突出。该设计策略为开发高性能NLO材料提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Strategic Oxygen‐Substitution in Perfluorinated Ce(IV) Coordination Frameworks Triggers Dual‐Wavelength Nonlinear Optical Materials With Exceptional Performances","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Nonlinear optical (NLO) crystals with second‐harmonic generation (SHG) are crucial in laser technology for extending spectral ranges. However, achieving large SHG coefficients, suitable birefringence for phase‐matching, and a broad laser output range remains a significant challenge. This work put forward a facile route to create NLO crystals with a wide‐wavelength range by a slight oxygenation strategy in Ce(IV)‐based fluorides. Given the tendency of perfluorinated Ce(IV)‐based polyhedral geometry unit, a divalent oxygen anion was introduced to partially replace the monovalent fluorine anion to enhance the distortion of Ce(IV)‐based polyhedra. This work successfully synthesized a series of acentric Ce(IV)‐based oxyfluorides, ACe\n                    3\n                    OF\n                    11\n                    (A = NH\n                    4\n                    , K, Rb), starting from noncentrosymmetric NH\n                    4\n                    Ce\n                    3\n                    F\n                    13\n                    as the parent structure. ACe\n                    3\n                    OF\n                    11\n                    exhibits strong SHG responses of 3.4∼5.2 times that of KH\n                    2\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    at 1064 nm and 0.14∼0.62 times of AgGaS\n                    2\n                    at 2100 nm, a wide phase‐matching range from ultraviolet to infrared wavelength regions, which are unprecedented for rare‐earth oxyfluoride crystals. This work establishes a partial oxygenation strategy for designing NLO rare‐earth oxyfluorides, delivering novel NLO candidates with an optimized balance between wide bandgap, strong SHG efficiency, and unprecedented broadband phase‐matching capability."},{"t":"单位点Pd与Jahn-Teller活性Cu耦合为配对位点同时活化炔烃与氢实现高效半氢化","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5133404?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"炔烃半氢化催化","kp":["催化剂[炔烃半氢化]: Pd-Cu单原子对(Fe₂O₃载体)","[活化机制]: Jahn-Teller活性Cu活化炔烃"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究构建了单原子Pd与具有Jahn-Teller活性的Cu配对位点催化剂，用于炔烃高效半加氢反应。单原子对位点策略可同时实现高选择性和高活性，但设计具有挑战性。Pd单原子负责活化炔烃，Cu位点（Jahn-Teller效应提供灵活配位环境）协同活化氢气，两者协同实现高效催化。该催化剂在炔烃半加氢生成烯烃的反应中表现出优异的选择性和转化率，为精细化学品合成提供了高效催化体系。","dp":1,"ot":"Single‐Site Pd Coupling with Jahn–Teller Active Cu as Pair Sites for Simultaneous Activation of Alkyne and Hydrogen Toward Efficient Semihydrogenation","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    Single‐site pairs are promising in achieving high selectivity and activity in alkyne semihydrogenation, but its applicability is limited by the insufficient activity because pair sites cannot adsorb and activate alkyne. Here, we couple single‐site Pd with Jahn–Teller active Cu atoms of Cu‐doped Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    to construct a highly active and stable single‐site Pd‐Cu pairs. The Jahn–Teller active Cu possesses elongated axial orbitals, and the strong electronic coupling between Pd and Cu further contributes to their unoccupied axial d orbitals, which helps Pd‐Cu pair to cooperatively activate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    molecule, unlike ordinary single‐site pairs where only H\n                    2\n                    is activated. As a result, this catalyst exhibits state‐of‐the‐art performance, with &gt; 99.99% conversion and 95.5% selectivity as well as excellent stability with negligible performance decay after 300‐h test in purifying acetylene of ethylene stream. Both in situ spectra and theoretical results indicate two H addition steps occur on Pd and Cu sites in sequence. This work opens an avenue for constructing highly efficient single‐site pairs for selective hydrogenation and beyond."},{"t":"调控两性离子凝胶聚合物电解质中的离子输运与溶剂化化学用于高性能准固态电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2513940123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"凝胶聚合物电解质","kp":["电解质[准固态锂电池]: 两性离子凝胶聚合物","[阴离子调控]: 抑制自由阴离子反向迁移","[去溶剂化]: 降低Li⁺去溶剂化能垒"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了两性离子凝胶聚合物电解质（GPE），通过调控离子传输和溶剂化化学实现高性能准固态锂电池。GPE是下一代锂金属电池的有前途的电解质，但面临离子电导率低和界面稳定性差等问题。两性离子结构同时含正负电荷，能有效调控Li+溶剂化结构和离子迁移，提升电解质离子电导率和界面兼容性。该策略抑制了锂枝晶生长，显著改善了准固态锂金属电池的循环稳定性和倍率性能。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating ion transport and solvation chemistry in zwitterionic gel polymer electrolyte for high-performance quasi-solid-state batteries","b":"Gel polymer electrolytes (GPEs) are promising electrolyte candidates for next-generation Li metal batteries (LMBs). However, the reverse migration of free anions causes uneven distribution of space charges and Li\n                    +\n                    flux, ultimately accelerating dendrite growth. Additionally, strong ion–solvent interactions lead to high Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation barriers and sluggish Li\n                    +\n                    transfer kinetics. To address these issues, we design a zwitterionic GPE, where the synergistic effects of zwitterionic groups promote Li-salt dissociation through ion–dipole interactions and simultaneously restrict anion migration, effectively suppressing space charge-induced dendrite growth. Moreover, the competitive coordination of zwitterions with Li\n                    +\n                    weakens the Li\n                    +\n                    -solvent interaction, accelerating interfacial Li\n                    +\n                    desolvation. Zwitterions in the inner solvation shell of Li\n                    +\n                    are preferentially reduced before the solvents, forming a conductive N- and S-rich inorganic interphase that enhances cycling stability. As a result, the zwitterionic GPE enables the Li||SPAN cells to deliver a high discharge capacity of 528.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at −20 °C, and achieve 79.6% capacity retention after 1,000 cycles. Besides, the Li||SPAN pouch cell, with an active mass loading of 10.5 mg cm\n                    −2\n                    , delivers a high discharge capacity of 1.63 Ah and an impressive areal capacity of 16.3 mAh cm\n                    −2\n                    . This work highlights the importance of regulating ion transport and ion–solvent chemistry for advanced quasi-solid-state LMBs."},{"t":"p62 凝聚物中的蛋白酶体蛋白水解根据其亚细胞定位指导肿瘤抑制或生长","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529422123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"p62/SQSTM1 generates liquid–liquid phase-separated condensates that participate in diverse processes, including protein quality control (PQC) and autophagy. Nuclear p62 condensates were shown to act as ubiquitin- and proteasome-mediated degradation hubs, whereas the involvement of cytoplasmic condensates in this pathway has remained unclear. Here, we show that cytoplasmic p62 condensates serve as a hub for proteasomal degradation that displays distinct substrate preferences compared with nuclear condensates. Specifically, cytoplasmic condensates mediate accelerated degradation of the tumor suppressor p53 through recruitment MDM2, its E3 ligase, while nuclear condensates are selectively enriched with USP7, a deubiquitinating enzyme (DUB) that stabilizes p53. Immunohistochemical analysis of human tissues reveal that p62 in healthy tissues is largely localized to the nucleus, whereas in the corresponding malignant tissues, it is largely in the cytosol, which is correlated with reduced p53 abundance in tumors. Nuclear p62 condensates also promote the degradation of oncogenic c-Myc, underscoring compartment-specific differences in protein turnover. Experiments in cancer cells and xenografts demonstrate that cytoplasmic p62 condensates drive tumor growth, whereas nuclear p62 condensates suppress it. Moreover, condensate formation rather than p62 expression alone is required for both enhanced proteolytic activity and tumor growth modulation. Proteomic analysis reveals that nuclear p62, unlike its cytosolic counterpart, is linked to enrichment of proteins associated with apoptosis, p53 stabilization, DNA damage response, and cellular senescence—all related to tumor suppression. These findings establish that p62 condensates provide compartment-specific regulation of ubiquitin and proteasomal degradation and suggest that manipulating their localization or affecting their dynamics can offer different therapeutic opportunities."},{"t":"等离激元/聚合物复合纳米壳阵列的光热操控：增强晶格有序性及可调结构色","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202517722?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离子体纳米壳阵列","kp":["[光热操控]: 金纳米颗粒光热驱动纳米壳膨胀位移","[结构色]: 增强晶格有序度实现可调结构色"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用等离激元/聚合物复合纳米壳阵列的光热操控，增强晶格有序度并实现可调结构色。贵金属纳米粒子的局域表面等离激元共振（LSPR）提供了高效的光热转换机制。通过光热效应调控聚合物基底的物理状态，可动态驱动纳米颗粒重排，提高阵列的晶格有序性，从而增强结构色的纯度和亮度。该策略实现了结构色的可逆调控，在智能显示、光学传感器和防伪技术领域具有应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Photothermal Manipulation of Plasmonic/Polymer Composite Nanoshell Arrays: Enhancing Lattice Order and Tunable Structural Color","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Localized surface plasmon resonance of noble metal nanoparticles provides an efficient mechanism for light‐to‐heat conversion, enabling the post‐assembly manipulation of hollow polymer nanoshells in a 2D array. Rapid photothermal heating of gold nanoparticles decorated on the inner surface of nanoshells vaporizes the encapsulated solvent, inducing volumetric expansion and controlled positional adjustment of the nanoshells pre‐assembled on a solid substrate. This process leads to significant improvements in array ordering, along with noticeable enhancements in optical diffraction intensity and a tunable redshift in structural color. The magnitude of this photothermal‐induced expansion can be controlled by manipulating the incident light intensity and the polymer nanoshell parameters, such as diameter and thickness. This photoresponsive system offers a unique and versatile platform for light‐controlled structural color manipulation, including direct laser writing and patterning, opening new opportunities for advanced materials with dynamically tunable optical properties."},{"t":"磷酸酯修饰受体添加剂实现有机太阳能电池的垂直形貌与界面协同工程逼近21%效率","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202519367?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["PCE[有机太阳能电池]: 接近21%","[分子工程]: L8-BO受体引入磷酸酯基团","[双重调控]: 垂直形貌与界面能级同步优化"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究利用磷酸酯修饰受体添加剂，在有机太阳能电池（OSC）中同步实现垂直形貌优化和界面工程。基于非富勒烯受体（NFA）的OSC进展迅速，但活性层垂直相分离和界面缺陷限制了效率进一步提升。磷酸酯添加剂能调控给受体在垂直方向的分布，同时钝化界面缺陷，优化电荷传输和收集。该策略使OSC器件效率接近21%，为推动有机光伏商业化提供了有效的添加剂工程方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Phosphate Ester‐Modified Acceptor Additives Enable Concurrent Vertical Morphology and Interfacial Engineering for Organic Solar Cells Approaching 21% Efficiency","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic solar cells (OSCs) based on non‐fullerene acceptors (NFAs) have progressed rapidly, yet further gains are constrained by coupled challenges in vertical morphology control and energy alignment at the acceptor–cathode interface. Here, a molecular engineering strategy is presented that installs strongly polar phosphate ester groups onto the inner alkyl chains of the benchmark NFA L8‐BO, yielding two derivatives—1POE and 2POE. Employed as non‐volatile solid additives during layer‐by‐layer processing, these molecules induce vertical composition redistribution to form a graded donor–acceptor–additive architecture. The resulting vertical profiling strengthens intermolecular interactions, raises surface energy, and drives additive accumulation near the top interface, thereby improving interfacial energetics and facilitating electron extraction. Consequently, devices incorporating 2 wt.% 1POE or 2POE deliver power conversion efficiencies (PCEs) of 19.87% and 19.28%, respectively, versus 18.83% for controls, alongside enhanced operational stability. The strategy shows strong universality across multiple blends, achieving a PCE of 20.90% in a D18/L8‐BO:BTP‐eC9FCl ternary system. These results demonstrate that precise phosphate ester–based additive design enables concurrent optimization of vertical phase distribution and interfacial energetics, offering a practical route to high‐efficiency, stable OSCs."},{"t":"优化玻璃化水合无机盐电解质中综合离子效应用于超低温超级电容器","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518352?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/超级电容器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"抗冻盐电解质","kp":["电解质[超低温超级电容器]: 玻璃形成型水系无机盐","[离子效应]: 综合考虑离子类型/浓度/水合数"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究优化了玻璃化无机盐水系电解质的综合离子效应，用于极低温超级电容器应用。无机盐电解质被探索用于开发耐寒水系储能器件，但极低温下的离子传输和电化学性能仍面临挑战。通过系统调控电解质中多种离子的协同效应，优化玻璃化转变温度和离子电导率，使超级电容器在极低温条件下保持优异的电容性能和循环稳定性。该工作为极端低温环境下的储能器件设计提供了重要指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Optimizing the Comprehensive Ion Effects in Glass‐Forming Aqueous Inorganic Salt Electrolytes for Supercapacitor Applications at Extremely Low Temperatures","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Inorganic salt electrolytes have been explored for developing cold‐resistant aqueous energy storage devices. Current research on anti‐freezing inorganic salt solutions mainly focuses on the H‐bond regulation effects of individual cations or anions. The overall ionic effects (e.g., ion type, concentrations, cation hydration numbers, ion interactions, and ionic associations, etc.) on the anti‐freezing properties lack a comprehensive understanding. In addition, crystallization of the salt electrolyte below the solidification point can lead to an abrupt performance failure of the energy storage device. In this work, we study the overall ionic effects of glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes for enhancing their anti‐freezing properties. It is found that ion pairs with more positive cationic potentials and less negative anionic potentials, cations with large coordination numbers, and anions with large ionic size and multiple H‐bond sites are crucial for achieving glass‐forming aqueous electrolytes with exceptional anti‐freezing performance. Notably, the Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    eutectic electrolyte exhibits a pure glass transition at −122°C and maintains a visible liquid state at −85°C. A supercapacitor cell with a Ca(ClO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    electrolyte is operational at temperatures as low as −80°C. This study provides insightful understandings for designing glass‐forming anti‐freezing electrolytes with improved adaptability of aqueous energy storage devices under extremely cold conditions."},{"t":"基于不确定条件下氢能设备行为模式反演的氢能支撑微电网网络容量优化设计","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000450?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氢能微电网优化","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization design of hydrogen energy supported microgrid network capacity based on hydrogen energy equipment behavior pattern inversion under uncertain conditions"},{"t":"通过鼻-脑传递治疗神经炎症的分子园艺：具有神经元靶向和 STING 抑制功能的 Ca2+ 响应性 DNA 纳米笼-水凝胶系统","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202518814?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Intranasal administration offers a rapid and non‐invasive route to deliver therapeutics directly from the nasal cavity into the brain for treating central nervous system (CNS) disorders. However, its efficacy is hampered by limited CNS targeting efficiency and rapid clearance in the nasal microenvironment. Here, a Ca\n                    2+\n                    responsive alginate hydrogel drug delivery system (namely SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    ) encapsulating a STING inhibitor within a neuronal targeting aptamer‐modified DNA nanocage for intranasal administration is developed. SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    demonstrates enhanced nasal retention, sustained release, and efficient transport of cargo into the CNS, leading to robust accumulation in the brain and spinal cord of experimental autoimmune encephalomyelitis (EAE) mice, eventually promoting remyelination, suppressing neuroinflammation, and restoring motor function. Mechanistically, SA@T\n                    SCC\n                    , acting as a molecular “gardener” in the diseased CNS “ecosystem,” could directly repair “stressed plants” neurons by inhibiting STING‐autophagy‐ferroptosis, restore neuronal health instead of broadly spraying “pesticides” immunosuppressants, calm “disrupted pollinators” microglia, and reverse neuroinflammation. Despite the exploration of STING inhibition for EAE treatment, the concept of nose‐to‐brain drug delivery and neuron targeting intranasal platform enabling precise modulation of the CNS microenvironment could be further extended for other chronic neurodegenerative diseases."},{"t":"通过空间位阻与螯合协同调控电子传输层分子工程实现稳定倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202521878?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池界面","kp":["[电子传输层]: 新型富勒烯衍生物2Py","[策略]: 空间位阻与螯合协同","[应用]: 倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过空间位阻和螯合作用对电子传输层（ETL）进行分子工程，实现稳定的倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池。富勒烯衍生物（C₆₀、PCBM）广泛用作倒置钙钛矿电池的ETL，但存在界面缺陷和稳定性问题。研究者通过分子设计引入空间位阻和螯合基团，优化ETL的能级排列、钝化钙钛矿界面缺陷并提升薄膜形貌质量。该策略显著提升了倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池的光电转换效率和长期操作稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular Engineering of Electron Transport Layers via Steric Hindrance and Chelation Toward Stable Inverted Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fullerene derivatives, such as C\n                    60\n                    and PCBM, are widely used as electron transport layers (ETLs) in inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) due to their high electron mobility and well‐aligned energy levels. However, their poor photo‐thermal stability and weak interactions with perovskite limit further progress. To address these challenges, we develop a novel fullerene derivative, 2Py, as the ETL for inverted PSCs via a synergistic strategy combining steric hindrance modulation and chelation group incorporation. This molecule delivers three key benefits: moderate steric hindrance inhibits ETL aggregation during thermal aging; chelation groups enhance interfacial interactions with the perovskite layer; and improved hydrophilicity promotes uniform SnO\n                    x\n                    film growth via atomic layer deposition (ALD). 2Py ETL enables an efficiency of 26.07% for inverted PSCs based on a 1.55‐eV bandgap. Wide‐bandgap (1.80 eV) and narrow‐bandgap (1.25 eV) PSCs achieve efficiencies of 19.94% and 24.06%, respectively. Notably, these devices demonstrate exceptional photo‐thermal stability, achieving T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1080 h under 85°C heating and T\n                    99\n                    &gt;1250 h under maximum power point tracking at 45°C, outperforming PCBM‐based devices. This molecular design strategy paves new pathways for enhancing ETL performance and stability in inverted PSCs."},{"t":"锰配位多价适体系统 (COMPASS) 实现 DC 靶向 mRNA/Mn2+ 共递送用于癌症免疫治疗","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202519216?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Abstract\n                  \n                    mRNA vaccines hold remarkable promise for cancer immunotherapy, yet current nanoparticle systems face challenges in efficacy, dendritic cell (DC) targeting, and safety. Herein, we report a nanoplatform, Manganese‐Coordinated Polyvalent Aptameric System (COMPASS), enabling targeted co‐delivery of mRNA and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    to lymph node dendritic cells (DC) to boost potent antitumor immunity. The COMPASS employed rolling circle amplification to generate single‐stranded DNA scaffolds with multivalent DC‐targeting aptamers and polyT domains, enabling stable mRNA hybridization via A‐T pairing. Various metal ions were screened, and Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    was found to enhance mRNA endosomal escape and activate the STING pathway in DCs, promoting their maturation and antigen presentation. Controlled nanoparticle size (∼200 nm) and aptamer‐mediated DC targeting markedly enhanced lymphatic accumulation. In vivo evaluations revealed that COMPASS achieved potent prophylactic and therapeutic antitumor efficacy comparable to commercial LNPs (e.g., SM‐102), while exhibiting significantly enhanced safety profiles. Importantly, lyophilized COMPASS formulations retained their structural integrity and bioactivity for at least three months at room temperature. Overall, COMPASS represents a promising next‐generation nanoplatform with significant translational potential for safe and effective cancer immunotherapy."},{"t":"考虑信息-物理-交通耦合及多资源协同的灾后配电网负荷恢复策略","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000255?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配电网恢复策略","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Load restoration strategy for post-disaster distribution networks considering cyber-physical-traffic coupling with multi-resource collaboration"},{"t":"源自癌症相关成纤维细胞的乳酸促进前列腺癌的选择性剪接和去势抵抗","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady5324?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Lactate in the tumor microenvironment (TME) is typically generated by cells exhibiting high glycolytic flux, exemplified by tumor cells. However, in glycolysis-low malignancies such as prostate cancer, stroma-derived lactate may drive noncanonical signaling and functions that remain unclear. Here, we identified APCDD1+ cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) as a distinct stromal population that secretes lactate into the TME in response to androgen deprivation therapy (ADT). Lactate uptake by prostate cancer cells induces androgen receptor variant 7 expression, thereby conferring resistance to ADT. Mechanistically, lactate-induced lactylation of the spliceosome component SNRPA at Lys123 (K123) enhances its recognition of cis-acting elements, increases chromatin binding, and promotes androgen receptor splicing. Targeting lactate transport with monocarboxylate transporter inhibitors effectively restores ADT sensitivity. These findings reveal a metabolic-epigenetic axis linking lactate in the microenvironment to alternative splicing regulation and suggest a promising therapeutic strategy to overcome ADT resistance."},{"t":"基于物理信息神经网络的超高倍率放电条件下锂离子电池内部温度传感","d":"2026-01-18","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000462?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池温度监测","kp":["[方法]: 物理信息神经网络检测电池内温","[应用条件]: 超高倍率放电"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Internal temperature sensing for lithium-ion battery under ultrahigh-rate discharge conditions using physics-informed neural network"},{"t":"以居住者为中心的建筑控制的混合强化学习：共同优化能源、舒适度和室内空气质量的审查和部署框架","d":"2026-01-18","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926000449?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"建筑智控节能","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""}]);